/* d51_std.js */
const STK_STD = {"大本钟":{"what":"伦敦国会大厦钟楼上那口大钟，塔本身叫伊丽莎白塔。","what_en":"The great bell in the clock tower of London's Houses of Parliament — the tower itself is called the Elizabeth Tower.","fame":"伦敦的象征，几乎每张伦敦明信片上都有它；BBC 新年倒数、电台整点新闻前响的就是它的钟声。","fame_en":"London's symbol: it's on almost every London postcard, and its bongs ring in the New Year and the BBC radio news.","fact":"2017 年起整修了 5 年，钟几乎不响；2022 年 11 月 13 日阵亡将士纪念日重新整点报时，修钟花了约 8000 万英镑。","fact_en":"It fell almost silent for five years of repairs from 2017, and went back to striking the hours on Remembrance Sunday, 13 November 2022. The work cost about £80 million.","src":"Londonist / AFP，2022 年 11 月","url":"https://londonist.com/london/news/big-ben-bong-chimes-back-remembrance-day-2022","say":{"en":"Excuse me, is this the way to Westminster station?","zh":"请问，威斯敏斯特地铁站是往这边走吗？"}},"伦敦眼":{"what":"泰晤士河边 135 米高的摩天轮，转一圈约 30 分钟。","what_en":"A 135-metre observation wheel on the Thames; one turn takes about 30 minutes.","fame":"建成时是世界上最高的观景摩天轮，晴天能看到 40 公里外；每年伦敦跨年烟花就从它身上放。","fame_en":"When it opened it was the world's tallest observation wheel — on a clear day you can see 40 km. London's New Year fireworks go off from it every year.","fact":"2000 年本来只打算放 5 年，结果留了下来；2025 年 3 月满 25 岁，已经载过 8500 多万人。","fact_en":"It was meant to stay for only five years after 2000. It turned 25 in March 2025 and has carried more than 85 million people.","src":"London Eye 官方，2025 年 3 月","url":"https://www.londoneye.com/archive3/25th-anniversary/","say":{"en":"Two adults for the next slot, please. Is it cheaper online?","zh":"两个大人，最近一场。网上买会便宜吗？"}},"大英博物馆":{"what":"世界上最大的博物馆之一，免费进，罗塞塔石碑在这里。","what_en":"One of the world's biggest museums, free to enter — home of the Rosetta Stone.","fame":"1753 年成立，是世界上最早向公众开放的国家博物馆，每年五六百万人去。","fame_en":"Founded in 1753, it was the world's first national museum open to the public, and five to six million people visit every year.","fact":"2023 年 8 月发现馆里的文物被自己的研究员偷偷拿走，最后核对出大约 1500 件；到 2026 年已经找回 600 多件。另一个一直在吵的话题：希腊要回帕特农神庙的石雕。","fact_en":"In August 2023 it found that one of its own curators had been taking objects — about 1,500 in the end; by 2026 more than 600 had been recovered. Another long-running row: Greece wants the Parthenon sculptures back.","src":"Express & Star / PA，2026","url":"https://www.expressandstar.com/uk-news/british-museum-recovers-268-more-missing-objects-after-thefts-6050914","say":{"en":"Is it free to get in, or do I need to book?","zh":"免费进吗，还是要预约？"}},"炸鱼薯条":{"what":"英国最日常的外卖：鳕鱼或黑线鳕裹面糊炸，配粗薯条。","what_en":"Britain's everyday takeaway: cod or haddock fried in batter, with thick-cut chips.","fame":"英国的「国菜」，二战时都没有被定量配给；英国人一年要吃掉三亿多份。","fame_en":"Britain's 'national dish' — it was never rationed in the Second World War, and Brits eat more than 300 million portions a year.","fact":"2022 年俄乌战争后，炸油和鳕鱼都涨价，英国炸鱼薯条店协会警告：全国约一万家店里，三分之一可能撑不下去。","fact_en":"After the war in Ukraine began in 2022, frying oil and cod prices jumped; the National Federation of Fish Friers warned a third of Britain's roughly 10,000 chippies could close.","src":"LBC / 英国炸鱼薯条店协会，2022","url":"https://www.lbc.co.uk/article/third-of-fish-and-chip-shops-could-face-closure-over-food-shortages-DWzDTy_2/","say":{"en":"Cod and chips, please. — Salt and vinegar? — Yes, please!","zh":"鳕鱼加薯条。——要盐和醋吗？——要！"}},"比萨斜塔":{"what":"比萨大教堂的钟楼，因为地基松软，盖到一半就歪了。","what_en":"The bell tower of Pisa Cathedral — it started leaning halfway through construction because the ground is soft.","fame":"世界上最有名的「歪」建筑，盖了将近 200 年，斜了 800 多年还没倒，是世界遗产。","fame_en":"The world's most famous leaning building: it took nearly 200 years to build, has leaned for 800 years without falling, and is a World Heritage Site.","fact":"1990 年关门抢修，用了 870 吨铅块压在一边、从另一边挖土，到 2001 年扶正了约 40 厘米，说至少能再站 300 年；之后它自己又直了 4 厘米。","fact_en":"It closed in 1990 for rescue work: 870 tonnes of lead on one side, soil removed from the other. By 2001 it had been straightened by about 40 cm — enough for another 300 years — and it has since straightened itself by another 4 cm.","src":"artnet News，2023","url":"https://news.artnet.com/art-world-archives/leaning-tower-of-pisa-reduced-tilt-2235641","say":{"en":"Could you take a photo of me ‘holding up’ the tower?","zh":"能帮我拍一张「扶住斜塔」的照片吗？"}},"大卫像":{"what":"米开朗基罗 26 岁时刻的大理石像，5 米多高，在佛罗伦萨学院美术馆。","what_en":"Michelangelo's marble statue, carved when he was 26 — over 5 metres tall, in Florence's Accademia Gallery.","fame":"文艺复兴最有名的雕像，被当成人体美的标准；广场上那尊是复制品，真的在美术馆里。","fame_en":"The most famous statue of the Renaissance, seen as the ideal of the human body. The one in the square is a copy; the original is in the gallery.","fact":"2023 年 3 月，美国佛罗里达一所学校的校长给六年级上美术课时放了大卫像，家长投诉「裸体」，校长被迫辞职；佛罗伦萨市长和美术馆馆长请她来看真的，4 月她真的来了。","fact_en":"In March 2023 a Florida school principal was forced to resign after a sixth-grade art class was shown David and parents complained about nudity. Florence's mayor and the gallery invited her to see the real thing — and in April she came.","src":"AP / Fox，2023 年 3–4 月","url":"https://www.fox29.com/news/florida-principal-forced-out-after-showing-david-statue-photo-visits-masterpiece-in-person","say":{"en":"Do I need to book tickets for the Accademia in advance?","zh":"学院美术馆要提前订票吗？"}},"坎登市场":{"what":"伦敦北边运河旁的市集，古着、街头小吃、手作摊，周末最挤。","what_en":"A canal-side market in north London — vintage clothes, street food and craft stalls, busiest at weekends.","fame":"伦敦最有名的另类文化市场，朋克、摇滚、古着都从这里流行开，一千多家摊位和小店挤在一起。","fame_en":"London's best-known alternative-culture market — punk, rock and vintage fashion spread from here, with over a thousand stalls and shops.","fact":"歌手艾米·怀恩豪斯生前住在坎登。2014 年 9 月 14 日，她本该过 31 岁生日那天，马厩市场里立起了她的真人大小铜像，有歌迷从欧洲大陆、甚至夏威夷赶来。","fact_en":"Singer Amy Winehouse lived in Camden. On 14 September 2014 — what would have been her 31st birthday — a life-size bronze of her was unveiled in Stables Market; fans came from mainland Europe and even Hawaii.","src":"South China Morning Post / AFP，2014 年 9 月","url":"https://scmp.com/news/world/article/1593233/statue-singer-amy-winehouse-unveiled-london-suburb-camden","say":{"en":"How much is this jacket? Could you do it for twenty?","zh":"这件夹克多少钱？二十镑可以吗？"}},"托斯卡纳葡萄酒":{"what":"基安蒂（Chianti）红酒的老家，丘陵上是葡萄园、橄榄树和柏树。","what_en":"Home of Chianti red wine — hills of vineyards, olive trees and cypresses.","fame":"基安蒂经典是意大利最有名的红酒之一，瓶口的黑公鸡标志来自佛罗伦萨和锡耶纳划界的传说。","fame_en":"Chianti Classico is one of Italy's best-known reds; the black rooster on the bottle comes from a legend about how Florence and Siena drew their border.","fact":"意大利几乎每年都是世界第一大葡萄酒产国，但 2023 年天气太坏（霉病、干旱），被法国超过；2024 年又拿了回来。","fact_en":"Italy is the world's biggest wine producer almost every year — but in 2023 mildew and drought let France overtake it. Italy took the top spot back in 2024.","src":"OIV 数据，The Local，2024 年 9 月","url":"https://www.thelocal.it/20240918/italy-seen-overtaking-france-as-worlds-largest-wine-producer","say":{"en":"Could we try a glass of the house red first?","zh":"我们能先尝一杯店里的红酒吗？"}},"达·芬奇":{"what":"《蒙娜丽莎》和《最后的晚餐》的作者，也画过飞行器和潜水服的草图。","what_en":"The painter of the Mona Lisa and The Last Supper, who also sketched flying machines and diving suits.","fame":"《蒙娜丽莎》可能是世界上最有名的画，现在挂在卢浮宫一层防弹玻璃后面。","fame_en":"The Mona Lisa may be the most famous painting in the world; it hangs in the Louvre behind bulletproof glass.","fact":"2017 年一幅据说是他画的《救世主》在佳士得拍出 4.5 亿美元，是史上最贵的画；但卢浮宫 2019 年办达·芬奇大展时没放它，很多专家怀疑不是他亲手画的。","fact_en":"In 2017 a painting said to be his, Salvator Mundi, sold at Christie's for $450.3 million — the most ever paid for a painting. But the Louvre left it out of its 2019 Leonardo show, and many experts doubt he painted it himself.","src":"Art & Object，2019；佳士得 2017","url":"https://artandobject.com/news/louvre-casts-further-doubt-authenticity-salvator-mundi","say":{"en":"Which museum has the most paintings by Leonardo?","zh":"哪个博物馆的达·芬奇最多？"}},"伽利略":{"what":"用望远镜看天空的意大利科学家，因为说地球绕着太阳转被教会审判。","what_en":"The Italian scientist who turned a telescope on the sky — and was tried by the Church for saying the Earth goes round the Sun.","fame":"第一批用望远镜认真看天空的人：木星的四颗大卫星到今天还叫「伽利略卫星」。","fame_en":"One of the first to study the sky through a telescope: Jupiter's four big moons are still called the 'Galilean moons'.","fact":"1633 年他被判有罪；359 年后的 1992 年 10 月 31 日，教皇约翰·保罗二世在讲话里承认当年审判他的人犯了错（不过没有重审，也不算正式平反）。","fact_en":"He was condemned in 1633. On 31 October 1992 — 359 years later — Pope John Paul II said his judges had made a mistake (though there was no retrial or formal pardon).","src":"Astronomy.com","url":"https://www.astronomy.com/today-in-the-history-of-astronomy/oct-31-1992-the-pope-addresses-the-galileo-affair/","say":{"en":"Is the Galileo Museum near the Uffizi?","zh":"伽利略博物馆在乌菲兹美术馆附近吗？"}},"万里长城":{"what":"中国北方一道又一道的城墙，从战国修到明朝，连起来两万多公里。","what_en":"Walls built across northern China from the Warring States to the Ming dynasty — over 20,000 km in all.","fame":"世界上最长的建筑，「不到长城非好汉」；北京的八达岭、慕田峪是最多人去的段。","fame_en":"The longest structure ever built — 'you're not a hero until you've climbed the Great Wall'. Badaling and Mutianyu near Beijing are the most visited sections.","fact":"「在太空用肉眼能看到长城」是个流传很久的说法，其实不对：2003 年中国第一位航天员杨利伟回来说，他在太空没看到。","fact_en":"The idea that you can see the Great Wall from space with the naked eye is a myth: in 2003 China's first astronaut, Yang Liwei, said he couldn't see it.","src":"Scientific American","url":"https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/is-chinas-great-wall-visible-from-space/","say":{"en":"Which section is less crowded, Mutianyu or Badaling?","zh":"慕田峪和八达岭，哪段人少一点？"}},"大熊猫":{"what":"只生活在中国四川、陕西、甘肃山里的熊，几乎只吃竹子。","what_en":"A bear that lives only in the mountains of Sichuan, Shaanxi and Gansu in China, and eats almost nothing but bamboo.","fame":"中国的「国宝」，也是世界自然基金会（WWF）的标志；全世界动物园里的大熊猫都是从中国租的。","fame_en":"China's 'national treasure' and the WWF's logo; every giant panda in a foreign zoo is on loan from China.","fact":"2016 年，世界自然保护联盟把大熊猫从「濒危」降到「易危」：野外的数量从 2004 年的 1596 只涨到了 1864 只。","fact_en":"In 2016 the IUCN moved the giant panda from 'endangered' to 'vulnerable': the wild population had grown from 1,596 in 2004 to 1,864.","src":"Discover Magazine，2016","url":"https://discovermagazine.com/planet-earth/giant-pandas-climb-from-endangered-to-vulnerable","say":{"en":"What time do the pandas usually eat?","zh":"熊猫一般几点吃东西？"}},"珠穆朗玛峰":{"what":"中国和尼泊尔边境上的世界最高峰。","what_en":"The world's highest mountain, on the border of China and Nepal.","fame":"地球上最高的地方，登山的人都想站上去；每年春天大本营都挤满了来自各国的登山队。","fame_en":"The highest point on Earth and every climber's dream; each spring its base camps fill with teams from all over the world.","fact":"它到底多高，中尼两国以前说法不一样；2020 年 12 月两国一起宣布：8848.86 米，比以前常用的数字高了 86 厘米。","fact_en":"China and Nepal used to disagree on its height. In December 2020 they announced a joint figure: 8,848.86 m — 86 cm more than the old number.","src":"CNN，2020 年 12 月","url":"https://amp.cnn.com/cnn/travel/article/mount-everest-height-intl-hnk-scli","say":{"en":"Is it possible to visit Everest Base Camp without climbing?","zh":"不登山，也能去珠峰大本营吗？"}},"富士山":{"what":"日本最高的山，3776 米，是一座还活着的火山。","what_en":"Japan's highest mountain at 3,776 m — and still an active volcano.","fame":"日本的象征，葛饰北斋画过几十次；2013 年成了世界文化遗产。","fame_en":"Japan's symbol, painted dozens of times by Hokusai, and a World Cultural Heritage Site since 2013.","fact":"爬的人太多，山梨县这一侧 2024 年开始限流收费；2025 年夏天起，走吉田口要交 4000 日元。","fact_en":"So many people climb it that the Yamanashi side started capping numbers and charging in 2024; from summer 2025 the Yoshida Trail costs ¥4,000.","src":"Malay Mail，2025 年 3 月","url":"https://malaymail.com/news/life/2025/03/17/overcrowding-fears-spur-japan-to-enforce-4000-fee-for-mount-fuji-hikes/169918","say":{"en":"Do I need to book before climbing Mount Fuji?","zh":"爬富士山要先预约吗？"}},"吴哥窟":{"what":"柬埔寨暹粒的石头寺庙，12 世纪修的。","what_en":"A 12th-century stone temple in Siem Reap, Cambodia.","fame":"世界上最大的宗教建筑，被画在柬埔寨的国旗上；看日出的人天不亮就去排位置。","fame_en":"The largest religious monument in the world — it's on Cambodia's national flag, and sunrise watchers queue in the dark.","fact":"它一开始是印度教的寺庙，供奉毗湿奴，后来才变成佛教寺庙，所以墙上的浮雕讲的多是印度史诗的故事。","fact_en":"It was built as a Hindu temple to Vishnu and only later became Buddhist — which is why its carvings tell stories from Indian epics.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/668/","say":{"en":"What time should we leave to see the sunrise?","zh":"几点出发能看到日出？"}},"泰姬陵":{"what":"印度阿格拉的白色大理石陵墓，莫卧儿皇帝沙贾汗为去世的妻子修的。","what_en":"A white-marble tomb in Agra, India, built by the Mughal emperor Shah Jahan for his late wife.","fame":"「世界上最美的建筑」之一，也是最有名的爱情故事建筑；每年几百万人来看。","fame_en":"Often called one of the most beautiful buildings in the world — a monument to love, seen by millions every year.","fact":"空气污染让白色大理石发黄、发绿；2018 年印度最高法院说「要么修好，要么拆掉」。工人用一种吸脏东西的泥巴（漂白土）一层层敷在墙上，像给它做面膜。","fact_en":"Pollution has been turning the white marble yellow and green. In 2018 India's Supreme Court told the government to 'restore it or demolish it'. Workers coat the walls in Fuller's earth, a clay that draws out dirt — a face mask for a building.","src":"CBS News，2018","url":"https://www.cbsnews.com/news/taj-mahal-turning-green-and-indias-supreme-court-warns-government-to-do-more","say":{"en":"Is it better to come at sunrise or sunset?","zh":"早上日出来好，还是傍晚来好？"}},"卡帕多奇亚热气球":{"what":"土耳其中部的怪石山谷，清早上百个热气球一起升起来。","what_en":"A valley of strange rock towers in central Turkey, where a hundred-plus hot-air balloons rise at dawn.","fame":"世界上最有名的热气球景点；那些「仙人烟囱」是几百万年前的火山灰被风雨慢慢吹出来的。","fame_en":"The world's most famous place for a balloon ride; its 'fairy chimneys' were carved from ancient volcanic ash by wind and rain.","fact":"地下也有城：1963 年一个人装修房子时砸开一面墙，发现了代林库尤地下城——往下有十几层、80 多米深，古时候能躲进去上万人。","fact_en":"There are cities underground too: in 1963 a man knocking through a wall in his house found Derinkuyu — over 80 m deep, with room to hide thousands of people.","src":"Wikipedia：Derinkuyu underground city","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Derinkuyu_underground_city","say":{"en":"If it's too windy, will the flight be cancelled?","zh":"风太大的话，会取消吗？"}},"哈利法塔":{"what":"迪拜的摩天大楼，828 米，2010 年开放。","what_en":"Dubai's skyscraper, 828 m tall, opened in 2010.","fame":"世界最高的楼，坐电梯一分钟就能到 124 层的观景台；每年跨年的烟花秀全球直播。","fame_en":"The world's tallest building — the lift reaches the 124th-floor viewing deck in about a minute, and its New Year fireworks are broadcast worldwide.","fact":"它可能要被超过了：沙特吉达塔停工多年后 2023 年复工，2025 年 1 月盖到第 64 层，目标是超过 1000 米。","fact_en":"It may soon be overtaken: Saudi Arabia's Jeddah Tower restarted in 2023 after years on hold, reached its 64th floor in January 2025, and aims to top 1,000 m.","src":"Dezeen，2023；2025 年进度报道","url":"https://www.dezeen.com/2023/09/22/construction-restarts-jeddah-tower/amp/","say":{"en":"Two tickets for level 124, please. Is sunset more expensive?","zh":"两张 124 层的票。日落那场更贵吗？"}},"埃菲尔铁塔":{"what":"巴黎的铁塔，330 米，为 1889 年世博会建的。","what_en":"Paris's iron tower, 330 m tall, built for the 1889 World's Fair.","fame":"法国和巴黎的象征，当年被骂「丑陋」，本来只打算放 20 年；后来因为能当无线电天线才留下来。","fame_en":"The symbol of France — once called ugly and meant to stand for only 20 years, it was saved because it was useful as a radio antenna.","fact":"2024 年巴黎奥运会的每一块奖牌里，都嵌着一块 18 克、从铁塔上换下来的原装铁。","fact_en":"Every Paris 2024 Olympic medal has an 18-gram piece of original iron taken from the tower during repairs.","src":"NBC / AP，2024 年 2 月","url":"https://www.nbcnewyork.com/news/national-international/paris-olympics-medals-made-metal-chunks-eiffel-tower/","say":{"en":"Are the stairs open, or only the lift?","zh":"可以走楼梯上去吗，还是只能坐电梯？"}},"罗马斗兽场":{"what":"古罗马的圆形剧场，公元 80 年建成，能坐五万人。","what_en":"An ancient Roman amphitheatre, opened in AD 80, with room for about 50,000 people.","fame":"世界上最有名的古罗马建筑，角斗士在这里打斗；也是「世界新七大奇迹」之一。","fame_en":"The most famous building of ancient Rome, where gladiators fought — and one of the New Seven Wonders of the World.","fact":"它的正式名字其实叫「弗拉维圆形剧场」；Colosseum 这个名字，很可能来自旁边一座三十多米高的尼禄巨像（Colossus）。","fact_en":"Its real name is the Flavian Amphitheatre; 'Colosseum' probably comes from a giant statue of Nero, the Colossus, that stood next to it.","src":"Britannica","url":"https://www.britannica.com/topic/Colosseum","say":{"en":"Is the ticket also valid for the Roman Forum?","zh":"这张票也能进古罗马广场吗？"}},"圣家堂":{"what":"巴塞罗那的大教堂，高迪设计，1882 年开工，到现在还在盖。","what_en":"Gaudí's basilica in Barcelona — started in 1882 and still being built.","fame":"世界上盖得最久的教堂之一，外面像融化的沙堡，里面的柱子像一片石头森林。","fame_en":"One of the longest-running building projects on Earth — outside like a melting sandcastle, inside a forest of stone columns.","fact":"2026 年 2 月 20 日，中间最高的「耶稣塔」装上十字架，外面完工：172.5 米，成了世界上最高的教堂；里面还要修到 2027、2028 年。","fact_en":"On 20 February 2026 the cross went onto the central Tower of Jesus Christ, finishing the outside at 172.5 m — the tallest church in the world. Work inside continues into 2027–28.","src":"Vatican News，2026 年 2 月","url":"https://www.vaticannews.va/en/church/news/2026-02/basilica-sagrada-familia-cross-completed-tower-of-jesus-christ.html","say":{"en":"Do I need to book the tower visit separately?","zh":"上塔要另外订票吗？"}},"新天鹅堡":{"what":"德国巴伐利亚山上的城堡，国王路德维希二世 1869 年开始修。","what_en":"A castle on a Bavarian hilltop, begun in 1869 by King Ludwig II.","fame":"童话城堡的样子就是照它来的——迪士尼睡美人城堡的灵感之一；每年一百四五十万人来。","fame_en":"The picture-book fairytale castle — one inspiration for Disney's Sleeping Beauty castle; about 1.4–1.5 million people visit a year.","fact":"国王死时它还没修完，他自己只住了一百多天。2025 年 7 月，它和路德维希二世的另外几座宫殿一起成了联合国世界遗产。","fact_en":"The king died before it was finished, having lived there only about 100 days. In July 2025 it joined UNESCO's World Heritage List with his other palaces.","src":"deutschland.de，2025 年 7 月","url":"https://www.deutschland.de/en/topic/culture/german-palaces-neuschwanstein-unesco-world-heritage","say":{"en":"Where's the best spot for a photo of the castle?","zh":"在哪儿拍城堡最好看？"}},"帕特农神庙":{"what":"雅典卫城山顶上的白色石头神庙，供奉雅典娜，公元前 438 年建成。","what_en":"The white marble temple to Athena on the Acropolis in Athens, finished in 438 BC.","fame":"古希腊和西方建筑的象征，联合国教科文组织的标志就是照它画的。","fame_en":"The symbol of ancient Greece and of Western architecture — UNESCO's own logo is based on it.","fact":"它屋顶没了不是因为年代久：1687 年威尼斯军队开炮，正好打中奥斯曼军存在里面的火药，一下子炸掉了。","fact_en":"It didn't lose its roof to old age: in 1687 a Venetian cannonball hit gunpowder the Ottomans had stored inside, and it exploded.","src":"Britannica","url":"https://www.britannica.com/topic/Parthenon","say":{"en":"How long does it take to walk up to the Acropolis?","zh":"走上卫城要多久？"}},"圣瓦西里大教堂":{"what":"莫斯科红场上那座有彩色洋葱顶的教堂，1561 年建成。","what_en":"The cathedral with colourful onion domes on Moscow's Red Square, completed in 1561.","fame":"俄罗斯最有名的建筑，看到它就知道是莫斯科。","fame_en":"Russia's best-known building — one look and you know it's Moscow.","fact":"它其实是九座小教堂拼在一起的；那些鲜艳的颜色也不是一开始就有，是后来一百多年里才慢慢涂上去的。","fact_en":"It's really nine small churches joined together, and the bright colours weren't original — they were added over the following century or so.","src":"Britannica","url":"https://www.britannica.com/topic/Saint-Basils-Cathedral","say":{"en":"Can we go inside, or only see it from the square?","zh":"能进去吗，还是只能在广场上看？"}},"北极光":{"what":"太阳吹来的带电粒子撞上地球大气，在极地夜空里发出绿色、粉色的光。","what_en":"Charged particles from the Sun hitting Earth's atmosphere and glowing green and pink in the polar night sky.","fame":"很多人一辈子想看一次的自然奇观；挪威、冰岛、芬兰的冬天是最常去看的地方。","fame_en":"A once-in-a-lifetime sight for many; winter in Norway, Iceland and Finland is the classic place to see it.","fact":"2024 年 5 月来了二十年来最强的一次地磁暴，平时只在北极附近看得到的极光，连很南边的地方都看到了。","fact_en":"In May 2024 the strongest geomagnetic storm in two decades pushed the aurora far south of where it's normally seen.","src":"NASA，2024","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/science-research/heliophysics/how-nasa-tracked-the-most-intense-solar-storm-in-decades/","say":{"en":"What's the aurora forecast for tonight?","zh":"今晚的极光预报怎么样？"}},"金字塔":{"what":"埃及吉萨的古代法老陵墓，最大的胡夫金字塔约 4500 年前建成。","what_en":"Ancient royal tombs at Giza, Egypt; the Great Pyramid of Khufu was built about 4,500 years ago.","fame":"古代世界七大奇迹里唯一还站着的一个。","fame_en":"The only one of the Seven Wonders of the Ancient World still standing.","fact":"胡夫金字塔当了世界最高的建筑将近 3800 年，直到 14 世纪才被英国的林肯大教堂超过。","fact_en":"The Great Pyramid was the tallest building in the world for almost 3,800 years, until England's Lincoln Cathedral passed it in the 14th century.","src":"Britannica","url":"https://www.britannica.com/topic/Pyramids-of-Giza","say":{"en":"How much is a camel ride, and how long is it?","zh":"骑骆驼多少钱，骑多久？"}},"撒哈拉沙漠":{"what":"北非的大沙漠，面积跟美国差不多。","what_en":"North Africa's great desert, about the size of the United States.","fame":"世界上最大的热沙漠；沙丘、骆驼队、星空营地是去摩洛哥、埃及的人最想体验的。","fame_en":"The largest hot desert in the world — dunes, camel treks and starry desert camps draw visitors to Morocco and Egypt.","fact":"2024 年 9 月摩洛哥东南部两天下了一年的雨，干了 50 年的伊里基湖重新有了水，卫星都拍到了。","fact_en":"In September 2024 south-east Morocco got a year's rain in two days, and Lake Iriqui, dry for 50 years, filled with water — visible from satellites.","src":"AP / Boston Globe，2024 年 10 月","url":"https://www.bostonglobe.com/2024/10/09/world/morocco-flood-sahara-desert-water/","say":{"en":"How cold does it get in the desert at night?","zh":"沙漠里晚上会有多冷？"}},"塞伦盖蒂狮子":{"what":"坦桑尼亚塞伦盖蒂草原上的非洲狮。","what_en":"African lions on Tanzania's Serengeti plains.","fame":"塞伦盖蒂是世界上最有名的野生动物草原，每年一百多万头角马大迁徙，狮子就跟在后面。","fame_en":"The Serengeti is the world's most famous wildlife plain: more than a million wildebeest migrate across it every year, with lions close behind.","fact":"狮子很懒：一天大约要睡 16 到 20 个小时，大部分打猎是母狮子干的。","fact_en":"Lions are lazy: they sleep about 16 to 20 hours a day, and the females do most of the hunting.","src":"National Geographic","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/mammals/facts/african-lion","say":{"en":"How close can the jeep get to the lions?","zh":"吉普车能离狮子多近？"}},"自由女神像":{"what":"纽约港口的铜像，1886 年法国送给美国的礼物。","what_en":"The copper statue in New York Harbor, a gift from France to the US in 1886.","fame":"美国和自由的象征，以前坐船移民来的人，第一眼看到的就是它。","fame_en":"A symbol of America and freedom — the first thing immigrants arriving by ship used to see.","fact":"它一开始是铜的红棕色，风吹雨打几十年才氧化成现在的青绿色；里面的铁架子是设计埃菲尔铁塔的埃菲尔做的。","fact_en":"It started out copper-brown and turned green over a few decades of weather; the iron frame inside was designed by Gustave Eiffel, of Eiffel Tower fame.","src":"美国国家公园管理局","url":"https://www.nps.gov/stli/index.htm","say":{"en":"Does the ferry stop at Ellis Island too?","zh":"渡轮也停埃利斯岛吗？"}},"好莱坞":{"what":"洛杉矶的一片区，美国电影业的中心。","what_en":"A district of Los Angeles — the heart of the American film industry.","fame":"山上那排白色大字是世界上最有名的招牌之一，星光大道上有两千多颗明星的星星。","fame_en":"The white letters on the hill are one of the world's most famous signs, and the Walk of Fame has over 2,000 stars.","fact":"那排字本来是 1923 年一个楼盘的广告，写的是 HOLLYWOODLAND；1949 年才去掉后面的 LAND。","fact_en":"The sign was a 1923 real-estate advert reading HOLLYWOODLAND — the 'LAND' only came off in 1949.","src":"Hollywood Sign Trust","url":"https://www.hollywoodsign.org/history","say":{"en":"Where's the best place to see the Hollywood Sign?","zh":"在哪儿看好莱坞招牌最清楚？"}},"枫糖浆":{"what":"枫树汁熬出来的甜糖浆，加拿大的特产。","what_en":"A sweet syrup boiled down from maple sap — Canada's speciality.","fame":"加拿大的象征之一（国旗上就是枫叶），魁北克一个省就产全世界大约七成的枫糖浆。","fame_en":"A Canadian icon — there's a maple leaf on the flag — and Quebec alone makes about 70% of the world's maple syrup.","fact":"魁北克有个「枫糖浆战略储备」。2011 到 2012 年，有人把仓库里的枫糖浆偷偷换成水，偷走了约 2700 吨，价值近 1800 万加元。","fact_en":"Quebec keeps a 'strategic reserve' of maple syrup. In 2011–12 thieves swapped barrels of it for water and stole about 2,700 tonnes, worth nearly C$18 million.","src":"加拿大百科全书","url":"https://thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/en/article/great-canadian-maple-syrup-heist","say":{"en":"Can I get extra maple syrup on my pancakes?","zh":"松饼上能多加点枫糖浆吗？"}},"奇琴伊察":{"what":"墨西哥尤卡坦半岛上的玛雅古城，中间是一座阶梯金字塔。","what_en":"A Maya city on Mexico's Yucatán Peninsula, centred on a stepped pyramid.","fame":"玛雅文明最有名的遗址，2007 年被选为「世界新七大奇迹」之一。","fame_en":"The most famous Maya site, voted one of the New Seven Wonders of the World in 2007.","fact":"每年春分和秋分的下午，阳光在金字塔台阶边上投出一串三角形的影子，看起来像一条蛇从上面爬下来。","fact_en":"On the spring and autumn equinoxes, afternoon sunlight casts triangles of shadow down the pyramid's stairs that look like a serpent crawling down.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/483/","say":{"en":"Is there a tour in English this morning?","zh":"今天上午有英语导览吗？"}},"马丘比丘":{"what":"秘鲁安第斯山上 2400 多米高的印加古城。","what_en":"An Inca citadel high in Peru's Andes, at over 2,400 m.","fame":"南美最有名的古迹，世界新七大奇迹之一；很多人走好几天印加古道去看它。","fame_en":"South America's most famous ancient site and one of the New Seven Wonders; many hike the Inca Trail for days to reach it.","fact":"1911 年美国探险家宾厄姆把它介绍给全世界，可当地农民一直知道它在那儿，带他上山的就是当地人。","fact_en":"American explorer Hiram Bingham made it world-famous in 1911 — but local farmers had always known it was there, and it was a local who led him up.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/274/","say":{"en":"Which bus goes up to Machu Picchu, and how early should we queue?","zh":"上马丘比丘坐哪趟车，要多早去排队？"}},"里约基督像":{"what":"里约热内卢科尔科瓦多山顶上张开双臂的耶稣像，30 米高。","what_en":"The 30-metre statue of Christ with open arms on top of Corcovado mountain in Rio de Janeiro.","fame":"巴西和里约的象征，世界新七大奇迹之一，从城里很多地方都能看到它。","fame_en":"The symbol of Brazil and Rio, one of the New Seven Wonders, visible from much of the city.","fact":"它站得太高，经常被雷劈：2014 年 1 月一次雷击把右手的大拇指劈掉了一块，修了好几个月。","fact_en":"It stands so high it's often struck by lightning — in January 2014 a strike chipped its right thumb, and repairs took months.","src":"ABC News，2014 年 1 月","url":"https://abcnews.go.com/blogs/headlines/2014/01/rios-christ-chips-finger-in-lightning-storm","say":{"en":"Is it better to take the train or a van up to the statue?","zh":"上山坐小火车好，还是坐小巴好？"}},"亚马逊雨林":{"what":"南美洲亚马逊河流域的热带雨林，大部分在巴西。","what_en":"The tropical rainforest of South America's Amazon basin, mostly in Brazil.","fame":"世界上最大的热带雨林，被叫做「地球之肺」，地球上大约十分之一的物种住在这里。","fame_en":"The largest rainforest on Earth, called 'the lungs of the planet' — home to about one in ten known species.","fact":"2024 年的大旱让马瑙斯的内格罗河降到 12.66 米，是 122 年有记录以来最低，前一年刚创下的纪录又被打破。","fact_en":"A huge drought in 2024 dropped the Rio Negro at Manaus to 12.66 m — the lowest in 122 years of records, breaking the record set just the year before.","src":"AP / Boston Globe，2024 年 10 月","url":"https://www.bostonglobe.com/2024/10/04/world/amazon-river-tributary-lowest-level-122-years","say":{"en":"Do I need a yellow fever vaccine for the Amazon?","zh":"去亚马逊要打黄热病疫苗吗？"}},"悉尼歌剧院":{"what":"悉尼港边像一片片白帆的歌剧院，1973 年开幕。","what_en":"Sydney's harbourside opera house with roofs like white sails, opened in 1973.","fame":"澳大利亚的象征，20 世纪最有名的建筑之一，2007 年成了世界遗产。","fame_en":"Australia's icon and one of the most famous buildings of the 20th century — a World Heritage Site since 2007.","fact":"丹麦建筑师伍重设计了它，但 1966 年跟政府吵翻离开，到死都没回来看过建好的样子；预算从 700 万澳元超到 1 亿多。","fact_en":"Danish architect Jørn Utzon designed it but quit in 1966 after rows with the government, and never came back to see it finished; the budget grew from A$7 million to over A$100 million.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/166/","say":{"en":"Is there a guided tour inside in English?","zh":"里面有英语导览吗？"}},"袋鼠":{"what":"澳大利亚的有袋动物，用两条后腿跳。","what_en":"Australia's marsupial that hops on its two back legs.","fame":"澳大利亚的象征，国徽上就有它；在澳洲乡下开车，路边常能看到。","fame_en":"Australia's symbol — it's on the coat of arms — and a common sight beside country roads.","fact":"袋鼠宝宝刚生下来只有两厘米左右，像一颗软糖，自己爬进妈妈的育儿袋里再长大几个月。","fact_en":"A newborn kangaroo is only about 2 cm long — the size of a jelly bean — and crawls into its mother's pouch to grow for months.","src":"Australian Museum","url":"https://australian.museum/learn/animals/mammals/red-kangaroo/","say":{"en":"Are we allowed to feed the kangaroos here?","zh":"这里可以喂袋鼠吗？"}},"故宫":{"what":"北京市中心明清两代的皇宫，现在是故宫博物院。","what_en":"The imperial palace of the Ming and Qing dynasties in the heart of Beijing — now the Palace Museum.","fame":"世界上最大、保存最完整的木结构宫殿群，24 位皇帝在这里住过。","fame_en":"The largest and best-preserved complex of wooden palace buildings in the world; 24 emperors lived here.","fact":"1420 年建成，2020 年刚好 600 岁。民间说它有「九千九百九十九间半」房，实际数下来大约八千七百多间。","fact_en":"Completed in 1420, it turned 600 in 2020. Legend says it has '9,999 and a half rooms'; the real count is a little over 8,700.","src":"Wikipedia：Forbidden City","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forbidden_City","say":{"en":"Do I need to book tickets online with my passport?","zh":"要用护照在网上预约门票吗？"}},"北京烤鸭":{"what":"挂炉或焖炉烤出来的鸭子，片成薄片，用薄饼卷葱丝、黄瓜和甜面酱吃。","what_en":"Roast duck, sliced thin and wrapped in pancakes with scallion, cucumber and sweet bean sauce.","fame":"北京最有名的菜，来北京的人几乎都要吃一次；师傅当着客人的面片鸭子。","fame_en":"Beijing's most famous dish — almost every visitor tries it, carved at the table by the chef.","fact":"老字号有两派：全聚德 1864 年开张，用「挂炉」明火烤；便宜坊更老，用不见明火的「焖炉」。","fact_en":"There are two old schools: Quanjude, founded in 1864, roasts duck over an open fire ('hung oven'); the even older Bianyifang uses a closed oven with no open flame.","src":"Wikipedia：Peking duck","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peking_duck","say":{"en":"Can we order half a duck?","zh":"可以点半只鸭子吗？"}},"京剧":{"what":"有唱、念、做、打的中国戏曲，脸谱和行头特别鲜艳。","what_en":"Chinese opera with singing, speech, acting and acrobatics — famous for painted faces and bright costumes.","fame":"被叫做中国的「国粹」，2010 年列入联合国非物质文化遗产。","fame_en":"Called China's 'national essence', it was added to UNESCO's intangible heritage list in 2010.","fact":"以前女角也由男演员演。最有名的男旦梅兰芳 1930 年去美国演出，在好莱坞还见了卓别林。","fact_en":"Female roles used to be played by men. The most famous of them, Mei Lanfang, toured the US in 1930 and met Charlie Chaplin in Hollywood.","src":"Wikipedia：Mei Lanfang","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mei_Lanfang","say":{"en":"Are there English subtitles during the show?","zh":"演出有英文字幕吗？"}},"东方明珠":{"what":"上海浦东黄浦江边的电视塔，468 米，1994 年建成。","what_en":"Shanghai's TV tower on the Huangpu River in Pudong, 468 m tall, completed in 1994.","fame":"上海天际线的标志，几个粉色的「珠子」从外滩一眼就能认出来。","fame_en":"The landmark of Shanghai's skyline — its pink 'pearls' are instantly recognisable from the Bund.","fact":"1994 到 2007 年，它一直是中国最高的建筑；现在旁边的上海中心大厦有 632 米，比它高了一大截。","fact_en":"From 1994 to 2007 it was the tallest building in China; today the Shanghai Tower next door, at 632 m, is far taller.","src":"Wikipedia：Oriental Pearl Tower","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oriental_Pearl_Tower","say":{"en":"Which floor has the glass floor?","zh":"玻璃地板在哪一层？"}},"外滩":{"what":"上海黄浦江西岸的一条江边大道，一排一百年前的老建筑。","what_en":"A riverside promenade on the west bank of the Huangpu, lined with buildings from a century ago.","fame":"被叫做「万国建筑博览群」，晚上对面陆家嘴亮灯，是上海最经典的夜景。","fame_en":"Called a 'museum of world architecture'; at night, with Lujiazui lit up across the river, it's Shanghai's classic view.","fact":"外滩 12 号原来的汇丰银行大楼，门厅穹顶上有 1923 年的马赛克壁画；1956 年一位建筑师为了保护它们，用灰泥和油漆盖住，1997 年装修时才重新露出来。","fact_en":"In No. 12, the old HSBC building, the entrance-hall dome has 1923 mosaics. In 1956 an architect covered them in plaster and paint to protect them, and they only reappeared during renovation in 1997.","src":"Wikipedia：HSBC Building, the Bund","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HSBC_Building,_the_Bund","say":{"en":"What time do the lights come on across the river?","zh":"对岸几点亮灯？"}},"小笼包":{"what":"皮薄、里面有汤汁的小包子，上海南翔是老家。","what_en":"Small, thin-skinned dumplings filled with soup — originally from Nanxiang in Shanghai.","fame":"上海最有名的点心；吃法有讲究：先咬个小口，吸了汤，再蘸醋吃。","fame_en":"Shanghai's most famous snack — bite a small hole, sip the soup, then dip in vinegar.","fact":"台湾的鼎泰丰把小笼包带到了全世界，讲究每个至少捏 18 个褶；2010 年它的香港分店拿了米其林一星。","fact_en":"Taiwan's Din Tai Fung took xiaolongbao worldwide — each one folded with at least 18 pleats — and its Hong Kong branch won a Michelin star in 2010.","src":"Wikipedia：Din Tai Fung","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Din_Tai_Fung","say":{"en":"One basket of pork soup dumplings, please. How many are in a basket?","zh":"一笼鲜肉小笼。一笼几个？"}},"寿司":{"what":"醋饭配上生鱼片或其他食材的日本料理。","what_en":"Japanese vinegared rice topped with raw fish or other ingredients.","fame":"日本最有名的菜，在全世界都能吃到；东京丰洲市场每天清早有金枪鱼拍卖。","fame_en":"Japan's best-known dish, eaten all over the world; Tokyo's Toyosu Market holds tuna auctions every morning.","fact":"每年第一场金枪鱼拍卖都很疯狂：2019 年一条 278 公斤的蓝鳍金枪鱼拍出 3.336 亿日元，是史上最贵。","fact_en":"The first tuna auction of each year is a frenzy: in 2019 a 278 kg bluefin sold for ¥333.6 million — a record.","src":"Wikipedia：Kiyoshi Kimura","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiyoshi_Kimura","say":{"en":"Could I have the chef's choice, without wasabi please?","zh":"我要主厨推荐，不要芥末，谢谢。"}},"东京塔":{"what":"东京港区的红白色铁塔，333 米，1958 年建成。","what_en":"Tokyo's red-and-white tower in Minato, 333 m tall, completed in 1958.","fame":"东京的象征，建成时比当年的埃菲尔铁塔还高；很多日本动漫和电影里都有它。","fame_en":"Tokyo's symbol — when it opened it was taller than the Eiffel Tower — and a regular in Japanese anime and films.","fact":"盖的时候钢材不够，大约三分之一的钢是从朝鲜战争后报废的美军坦克上回收的。","fact_en":"Steel was short when it was built, so about a third came from scrapped US tanks left over from the Korean War.","src":"Wikipedia：Tokyo Tower","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Tower","say":{"en":"Is it worth paying extra for the top deck?","zh":"多花钱上顶层值得吗？"}},"宫崎骏":{"what":"日本动画导演，吉卜力工作室的创办人之一。","what_en":"Japanese animation director and co-founder of Studio Ghibli.","fame":"《龙猫》《千与千寻》的导演，《千与千寻》2003 年拿了奥斯卡最佳动画长片；吉卜力美术馆在东京三鹰。","fame_en":"Director of My Neighbor Totoro and Spirited Away, which won the 2003 Oscar for Best Animated Feature; the Ghibli Museum is in Mitaka, Tokyo.","fact":"他好几次说要退休，又回来了：2024 年《你想活出怎样的人生》（The Boy and the Heron）让他拿了第二座奥斯卡。","fact_en":"He has announced his retirement several times and come back: in 2024 The Boy and the Heron won him a second Oscar.","src":"奥斯卡官方，2024","url":"https://www.oscars.org/oscars/ceremonies/2024","say":{"en":"How do I get tickets for the Ghibli Museum?","zh":"吉卜力美术馆的票怎么买？"}},"伏见稻荷大社":{"what":"京都南边供奉稻荷神（管五谷和生意）的神社。","what_en":"A shrine in south Kyoto to Inari, the god of rice and business.","fame":"上万座橙红色鸟居连成隧道一路上山，是京都最上镜的地方之一。","fame_en":"Thousands of orange torii gates form tunnels up the mountain — one of Kyoto's most photographed places.","fact":"每一座鸟居都是公司或个人捐的，背面刻着捐的人名字和日期；小的几十万日元，大的要一百多万。","fact_en":"Every gate is donated by a business or person — their name and the date are carved on the back. Small ones cost hundreds of thousands of yen, big ones over a million.","src":"japan-guide.com","url":"https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e3915.html","say":{"en":"How long does it take to walk to the top?","zh":"走到山顶要多久？"}},"章鱼烧":{"what":"面糊里包一小块章鱼，在半圆铁板上烤成的小球。","what_en":"Little balls of batter with a piece of octopus inside, cooked in a dimpled iron pan.","fame":"大阪最有名的街头小吃，道顿堀到处是排队的章鱼烧摊。","fame_en":"Osaka's most famous street food — Dōtonbori is full of takoyaki stands with queues.","fact":"1935 年大阪的「会津屋」第一个在里面放章鱼，就这样有了章鱼烧；这家店现在还开着。","fact_en":"In 1935 Osaka's Aizuya shop first put octopus inside — and takoyaki was born. The shop is still open.","src":"Wikipedia：Takoyaki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Takoyaki","say":{"en":"Careful, it's hot! Could I get one with less sauce?","zh":"小心烫！能少放点酱吗？"}},"神户牛肉":{"what":"兵库县的但马牛里，达到严格标准才能叫「神户牛肉」的和牛。","what_en":"Wagyu beef from Tajima cattle in Hyōgo that meet strict standards to be called 'Kobe beef'.","fame":"世界上最有名的牛肉之一，雪花一样的油花，被叫做「牛肉里的艺术品」。","fame_en":"One of the most famous beefs in the world, with snowflake-like marbling — 'a work of art'.","fact":"不是品种名，是一个认证：必须在兵库县出生长大，每一头都有自己的十位数编号，真的神户牛肉能查到是哪头牛。","fact_en":"It isn't a breed but a certification: the cow must be born and raised in Hyōgo, and each has a 10-digit ID — genuine Kobe beef can be traced to the individual animal.","src":"神户肉流通推进协议会","url":"https://www.kobe-niku.jp/en/","say":{"en":"Is this certified Kobe beef? Can I see the ID number?","zh":"这是认证的神户牛吗？能看编号吗？"}},"景福宫":{"what":"首尔市中心朝鲜王朝的正宫，1395 年建成。","what_en":"The main palace of the Joseon dynasty in central Seoul, built in 1395.","fame":"首尔最大的宫殿，门口的守门将换岗仪式很受欢迎；后面就是青瓦台。","fame_en":"Seoul's largest palace, with a popular changing-of-the-guard ceremony at the gate; the Blue House stands behind it.","fact":"穿韩服进宫免费，所以宫门口满是租韩服拍照的游客；但要上衣加裙子或裤子一整套，一件式的古装不算。","fact_en":"Wear hanbok and you get in free — so the gates are full of visitors in rented hanbok. But it has to be a full top-and-skirt or trousers set; one-piece costumes don't count.","src":"Korea Herald","url":"https://www.koreaherald.com/article/10726703","say":{"en":"Where can I rent a hanbok near the palace?","zh":"宫殿附近哪儿能租韩服？"}},"K-pop":{"what":"韩国流行音乐，唱跳整齐、造型讲究。","what_en":"Korean pop music — tightly choreographed, with carefully styled groups.","fame":"从 BTS、BLACKPINK 开始红遍全世界，首尔江南区是很多娱乐公司的所在地。","fame_en":"Global since BTS and BLACKPINK; many entertainment companies are based in Seoul's Gangnam.","fact":"2025 年 8 月，Netflix 动画《KPop 猎魔女团》里的歌《Golden》登上美国 Billboard 百强单曲榜第一，是第一首拿到冠军的 K-pop 女团歌——唱的还是动画角色。","fact_en":"In August 2025 'Golden', from Netflix's animated KPop Demon Hunters, hit No. 1 on the Billboard Hot 100 — the first K-pop song by female performers to top it, sung by cartoon characters.","src":"Billboard，2025","url":"https://www.billboard.com/lists/huntrx-golden-hot-100-number-one-fifth-week/","say":{"en":"Who's your favourite group? I've been listening to 'Golden' nonstop.","zh":"你最喜欢哪个组合？我最近一直在听《Golden》。"}},"卢浮宫":{"what":"巴黎的博物馆，原来是法国王宫。","what_en":"Paris's great museum — once a royal palace.","fame":"世界上参观人数最多的博物馆，有《蒙娜丽莎》；入口的玻璃金字塔是贝聿铭设计的。","fame_en":"The most visited museum in the world, home of the Mona Lisa; its glass pyramid entrance was designed by I. M. Pei.","fact":"2025 年 10 月 19 日，几个人用升降梯从窗户爬进阿波罗画廊，七分钟左右偷走 8 件法国王室珠宝，估价 8800 万欧元。","fact_en":"On 19 October 2025, thieves used a lift to climb in through a window of the Apollo Gallery and stole eight pieces of French crown jewels in about seven minutes — worth an estimated €88 million.","src":"PBS NewsHour / AP，2025 年 10 月","url":"https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/jewels-stolen-from-louvre-worth-an-estimated-102-million-paris-prosecutor-says","say":{"en":"Which entrance has the shortest queue?","zh":"哪个入口排队最短？"}},"凡尔赛宫":{"what":"巴黎西南边路易十四修的宫殿和花园。","what_en":"The palace and gardens Louis XIV built south-west of Paris.","fame":"欧洲最豪华的宫殿之一，镜厅里有 357 面镜子；很多国家的王宫都学它。","fame_en":"One of Europe's grandest palaces — the Hall of Mirrors has 357 mirrors, and royal palaces everywhere copied it.","fact":"第一次世界大战就是在镜厅结束的：1919 年《凡尔赛和约》在这里签字。","fact_en":"The First World War formally ended in the Hall of Mirrors, where the Treaty of Versailles was signed in 1919.","src":"凡尔赛宫官方","url":"https://en.chateauversailles.fr/discover/estate/palace/hall-mirrors","say":{"en":"Is the garden included in the palace ticket?","zh":"宫殿的票包括花园吗？"}},"法棍面包":{"what":"外脆里软的长条白面包，法国人每天都吃。","what_en":"A long white loaf, crisp outside and soft inside — eaten every day in France.","fame":"法国的象征之一，人们腋下夹着法棍走在街上是巴黎最常见的画面。","fame_en":"A symbol of France — someone walking home with a baguette under their arm is a classic Paris sight.","fact":"2022 年 11 月，「法棍的手艺和文化」被列入联合国非物质文化遗产；巴黎每年还有最佳法棍比赛，冠军给总统府供一年面包。","fact_en":"In November 2022 'the artisanal know-how and culture of baguette bread' was added to UNESCO's intangible heritage list; Paris's best-baguette contest winner supplies the Élysée Palace for a year.","src":"UNESCO 非物质文化遗产","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/artisanal-know-how-and-culture-of-baguette-bread-01883","say":{"en":"One baguette, please — well done, not too pale.","zh":"一根法棍，要烤得透一点的。"}},"伦敦塔桥":{"what":"伦敦塔旁边的开合桥，1894 年建成。","what_en":"The lifting bridge next to the Tower of London, opened in 1894.","fame":"伦敦最有名的桥，两座塔之间的桥面能升起来让大船过，现在每年还要开好几百次。","fame_en":"London's most famous bridge — the roadway between the towers lifts for tall ships, still hundreds of times a year.","fact":"1952 年 12 月 30 日，一辆 78 路双层巴士开到一半，桥开始升起来，司机来不及停，干脆加速「飞」了过去，只有司机自己受了伤。","fact_en":"On 30 December 1952 a No. 78 double-decker was halfway across when the bridge started to rise; the driver sped up and jumped the gap. Only he was injured.","src":"Tower Bridge 官方","url":"https://www.towerbridge.org.uk/stories/bus-jump","say":{"en":"What time does the bridge lift today?","zh":"桥今天几点升起来？"}},"威斯敏斯特教堂":{"what":"紧挨着议会大厦和大本钟的教堂。","what_en":"The abbey church right next to the Houses of Parliament and Big Ben.","fame":"从 1066 年起，英国的国王和女王几乎都在这里加冕，王室婚礼也在这里办。","fame_en":"Almost every English and British monarch since 1066 has been crowned here, and it hosts royal weddings.","fact":"最近一次加冕是 2023 年 5 月 6 日的查尔斯三世；牛顿、达尔文、霍金都葬在这里，「诗人角」纪念着乔叟、狄更斯。","fact_en":"The latest coronation was Charles III's on 6 May 2023. Newton, Darwin and Hawking are buried here, and Poets' Corner honours Chaucer and Dickens.","src":"威斯敏斯特教堂官方","url":"https://www.westminster-abbey.org/","say":{"en":"Is there a guided tour in English?","zh":"有英语导览吗？"}},"梵蒂冈":{"what":"罗马城里的一个国家，天主教会的中心。","what_en":"A country inside Rome — the centre of the Catholic Church.","fame":"世界上最小的国家，只有 0.44 平方公里；圣彼得大教堂和米开朗基罗画的西斯廷礼拜堂天顶都在这里。","fame_en":"The smallest country in the world, just 0.44 km², home to St Peter's Basilica and Michelangelo's Sistine Chapel ceiling.","fact":"2025 年 5 月 8 日，西斯廷礼拜堂的烟囱冒出白烟，美国出生的罗伯特·普雷沃斯特当选教皇良十四世，是第一位美国教皇。","fact_en":"On 8 May 2025 white smoke rose from the Sistine Chapel: American-born Robert Prevost was elected Pope Leo XIV, the first pope from the United States.","src":"Vatican News，2025 年 5 月","url":"https://www.vaticannews.va/en/pope.html","say":{"en":"Do I need to cover my shoulders to go into St Peter's?","zh":"进圣彼得大教堂要遮住肩膀吗？"}},"马德里皇宫":{"what":"马德里的西班牙王宫，18 世纪建成。","what_en":"Spain's royal palace in Madrid, completed in the 18th century.","fame":"西欧面积最大的王宫，有三千四百多个房间。","fame_en":"The largest royal palace in Western Europe by floor area, with over 3,400 rooms.","fact":"它是国王的官方住所，可国王一家其实不住这儿，住在城外的萨苏埃拉宫；这里只用来办国宴和仪式。","fact_en":"It's the king's official residence — but the royal family actually lives at the Zarzuela Palace outside the city; this one is used for state dinners and ceremonies.","src":"西班牙国家遗产局","url":"https://www.patrimonionacional.es/en/visita/palacio-real-de-madrid","say":{"en":"Is it free on certain days?","zh":"有哪几天是免费的吗？"}},"爱迪生":{"what":"美国发明家，在新泽西门洛帕克的实验室里做出了很多发明。","what_en":"American inventor whose lab in Menlo Park, New Jersey, turned out invention after invention.","fame":"做出了能用的电灯泡和留声机，一生拿了一千多项美国专利，被叫做「门洛帕克的魔术师」。","fame_en":"He made a practical light bulb and the phonograph and held over a thousand US patents — 'the Wizard of Menlo Park'.","fact":"1877 年他对着自己的留声机唱了一句《玛丽有只小羊羔》，这是第一次有人把人声录下来再放出来。","fact_en":"In 1877 he recited 'Mary had a little lamb' into his phonograph — the first time a human voice was recorded and played back.","src":"美国国家公园管理局：Thomas Edison National Historical Park","url":"https://www.nps.gov/edis/index.htm","say":{"en":"Can we visit Edison's lab in New Jersey from New York?","zh":"从纽约能去参观新泽西的爱迪生实验室吗？"}},"谷爱凌":{"what":"自由式滑雪运动员，在美国长大，代表中国参赛。","what_en":"A freestyle skier, raised in the US, who competes for China.","fame":"2022 年北京冬奥会拿了两枚金牌、一枚银牌，是那届冬奥会最出名的运动员之一。","fame_en":"At the Beijing 2022 Winter Olympics she won two golds and a silver — one of the biggest stars of the Games.","fact":"她一边比赛一边读书，考进了斯坦福大学，还是模特；中文和英文都说得很流利。","fact_en":"She studies while competing — she got into Stanford — and works as a model; she's fluent in both Chinese and English.","src":"Olympics.com","url":"https://olympics.com/en/athletes/eileen-gu","say":{"en":"Who's your favourite Winter Olympics athlete?","zh":"你最喜欢哪位冬奥会运动员？"}},"孔子":{"what":"约 2500 年前鲁国（今山东曲阜）的思想家，儒家的开创者；《论语》记的是他和学生说的话。","what_en":"A thinker from the state of Lu (today's Qufu, Shandong) about 2,500 years ago, founder of Confucianism; the Analects record what he and his students said.","fame":"两千多年里，中国、韩国、日本、越南的读书人都背他的话；「己所不欲，勿施于人」今天还常被引用。","fame_en":"For over 2,000 years, scholars in China, Korea, Japan and Vietnam learned his words by heart; \"Do not do to others what you would not want done to you\" is still quoted today.","fact":"孔家的家谱是世界上延续最久的家谱，登记在册的后代约两百万人。2009 年在曲阜发布的第五版，第一次把女儿也写了进去。","fact_en":"The Kong family tree is the longest recorded pedigree in the world, with about two million registered descendants. The 5th edition, unveiled in Qufu in 2009, included women for the first time.","src":"Wikipedia：Confucius","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Confucius","say":{"en":"One combined ticket for the Temple, the Mansion and the Cemetery, please.","zh":"一张三孔联票，谢谢。"}},"泰山":{"what":"山东泰安的一座山，主峰玉皇顶海拔约 1,545 米，古人叫它「五岳之首」。","what_en":"A mountain in Tai'an, Shandong; its highest peak is about 1,545 m, and it was called the first of China's Five Great Mountains.","fame":"古代皇帝到这儿祭天；杜甫写它「会当凌绝顶，一览众山小」。半夜爬山、山顶看日出，是很多中国大学生的毕业旅行。","fame_en":"Emperors came here to worship heaven, and Du Fu wrote about seeing all other mountains look small from its top. Climbing at night to watch the sunrise is a classic graduation trip for Chinese students.","fact":"1987 年，泰山成了中国第一个「文化和自然双遗产」——既因为风景，也因为山上两千多年的刻石和庙宇。","fact_en":"In 1987 Mount Tai became China's first mixed cultural and natural World Heritage site — for its scenery and for over 2,000 years of carved inscriptions and temples.","src":"People's Daily Online（新华社，2024）","url":"https://en.people.cn/n3/2024/0129/c90000-20127952.html","say":{"en":"Can I rent a warm coat at the top for the sunrise?","zh":"山顶能租件大衣等日出吗？"}},"孙子兵法":{"what":"春秋末年孙武写的兵书，一共十三篇，讲怎么打仗，更讲怎么不打仗就赢。","what_en":"A book on war written by Sun Wu over 2,000 years ago — 13 chapters on how to fight, and even more on how to win without fighting.","fame":"世界上最早、最有名的兵书之一，今天很多商学院和公司拿它讲竞争和谈判；「知己知彼，百战不殆」中国人人会说。","fame_en":"One of the oldest and most famous books on strategy; business schools and companies still use it to talk about competition and negotiation. \"Know your enemy and know yourself\" is a saying every Chinese person knows.","fact":"历史上还有一部《孙膑兵法》失传了一千多年，很多人怀疑它根本不存在。1972 年，山东临沂银雀山汉墓挖出竹简，两部兵法一起出土，这个谜才解开。","fact_en":"Another book, Sun Bin's Art of War, was lost for over 1,400 years, and many doubted it ever existed. In 1972 bamboo slips dug up from Han tombs at Yinqueshan, Linyi, contained both texts and solved the puzzle.","src":"Wikipedia：Yinqueshan Han Slips","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yinqueshan_Han_Slips","say":{"en":"Do you have an English version of The Art of War?","zh":"有英文版的《孙子兵法》吗？"}},"王羲之":{"what":"东晋书法家（约 303–361 年），生在今山东临沂，后来住在浙江绍兴。","what_en":"A calligrapher of the Eastern Jin dynasty (c. 303–361), born in today's Linyi, Shandong, who later lived in Shaoxing, Zhejiang.","fame":"被叫作「书圣」；他在兰亭写的《兰亭集序》被称为「天下第一行书」，一千多年来学写字的人都临它。","fame_en":"Known as the Sage of Calligraphy; his Preface to the Orchid Pavilion Poems is called the finest piece of running script, and learners have copied it for over a thousand years.","fact":"他的真迹一张都没留下来，今天看到的都是后人的摹本。可就算是摹本也贵得惊人：2010 年，一件《平安帖》摹本在北京拍出了 3.08 亿元。","fact_en":"None of his originals survive — only later copies. Even a copy is priceless: in 2010 a copy of his Ping'an Tie sold at auction in Beijing for 308 million yuan.","src":"Paul Fraser Collectibles（2010）","url":"https://www.paulfrasercollectibles.com/blogs/books-manuscripts/sage-of-calligraphys-46-3m-scroll-becomes-2nd-most-expensive-in-china","say":{"en":"Which way to the Goose Pond?","zh":"鹅池往哪边走？"}},"甲骨文":{"what":"三千多年前商朝人刻在龟甲和牛骨上的字，大多是占卜的记录，主要出土在河南安阳殷墟。","what_en":"Writing carved on turtle shells and ox bones by the Shang people over 3,000 years ago, mostly records of divination, found mainly at Yinxu in Anyang, Henan.","fame":"目前知道最早成体系的汉字，今天的「日、月、人、马」都能在里面找到祖先；它也证明了商朝真的存在过。","fame_en":"The earliest known system of Chinese writing — you can find the ancestors of today's 日, 月, 人, 马 in it. It also proved the Shang dynasty really existed.","fact":"甲骨上发现了四千多个不同的字，认出来的才一千多个。2016 年起，安阳的中国文字博物馆悬赏：谁能破解一个字，奖 10 万元。","fact_en":"About 4,000–5,000 different characters have been found, but only about 1,500–2,000 can be read. Since 2016 the National Museum of Chinese Writing in Anyang has offered 100,000 yuan for each one deciphered.","src":"Smithsonian Magazine（2017）","url":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/museum-offers-15000-letter-deciphering-oracle-bones-180964213/","say":{"en":"Can I see the oracle bones up close?","zh":"能近一点看甲骨吗？"}},"老子":{"what":"春秋时期的思想家，道家的开创者，传说他留下了五千多字的《道德经》。","what_en":"A thinker from about 2,500 years ago, founder of Taoism, said to have left behind the 5,000-character Tao Te Ching.","fame":"《道德经》是世界上翻译成外文最多的书之一；「上善若水」「千里之行，始于足下」都出自这里。","fame_en":"The Tao Te Ching is one of the most translated books in the world; \"The highest good is like water\" and \"A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step\" both come from it.","fact":"1993 年，湖北荆门郭店一座楚墓里挖出一批竹简，里面有约公元前 300 年抄的《老子》，是目前已知最早的版本——而且只有今天版本的一部分，说明这本书是慢慢长成的。","fact_en":"In 1993 bamboo slips from a Chu tomb at Guodian, Hubei, turned out to hold a copy of the Laozi from around 300 BC — the oldest known version, and only part of today's text, which suggests the book grew over time.","src":"Wikipedia：Guodian Chu Slips","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guodian_Chu_Slips","say":{"en":"How do you say 'shang shan ruo shui' in English?","zh":"「上善若水」用英语怎么说？"}},"太极拳":{"what":"一种慢慢打的中国传统拳法，动作圆、连着，跟着呼吸走。","what_en":"A traditional Chinese martial art done slowly, with round, flowing movements that follow the breath.","fame":"从北京的公园到纽约的中央公园，早上都能看到一群人在打太极；很多人练它是为了放松和保持平衡。","fame_en":"From Beijing's parks to New York's Central Park, you can see groups doing tai chi in the morning; many practise it to relax and keep their balance.","fact":"2020 年 12 月，太极拳列入联合国教科文组织人类非物质文化遗产代表作名录。","fact_en":"In December 2020 taijiquan was added to UNESCO's Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity.","src":"China Daily（2020）","url":"https://govt.chinadaily.com.cn/s/202012/22/WS5fe16136498eaba5051bde69/taijiquan-joins-unesco-heritage-list.html","say":{"en":"Can I join you? I'll just follow at the back.","zh":"我能跟着一起打吗？我就在后面跟着。"}},"少林寺":{"what":"河南登封嵩山脚下的一座寺院，建于北魏（公元 495 年）。","what_en":"A Buddhist temple at the foot of Mount Song in Dengfeng, Henan, founded in 495.","fame":"「天下功夫出少林」——1982 年的电影《少林寺》让少林功夫火遍全世界；寺外有很多武术学校。","fame_en":"\"All kung fu under heaven comes from Shaolin\" — the 1982 film Shaolin Temple made its martial arts famous worldwide, and many kung fu schools surround it.","fact":"寺西边的塔林有两百多座塔，是历代高僧的墓塔，前后造了一千多年；2010 年它和少林寺一起，作为「登封天地之中」历史建筑群成为世界遗产。","fact_en":"The Pagoda Forest west of the temple has over 200 memorial pagodas for eminent monks, built over more than a thousand years. In 2010 it became part of a World Heritage site with the temple.","src":"Wikipedia：Pagoda Forest at Shaolin Temple","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pagoda_Forest_at_Shaolin_Temple","say":{"en":"What time is the kung fu show today?","zh":"今天武术表演几点开始？"}},"龙门石窟":{"what":"河南洛阳伊河两岸山崖上凿出来的佛像群，从北魏到唐朝凿了四百多年。","what_en":"Thousands of Buddhist caves and statues carved into the cliffs on both sides of the Yi River in Luoyang, Henan, over about 400 years.","fame":"有约十万尊佛像，小的只有两厘米；最大的卢舍那大佛高 17 米，是唐代雕刻最有名的代表。","fame_en":"There are around 100,000 statues, some only 2 cm tall; the largest, the 17-metre Vairocana Buddha, is the best-known Tang sculpture in China.","fact":"卢舍那大佛旁的碑文记着，武则天为它捐了两万贯「脂粉钱」——就是她自己买化妆品的钱。","fact_en":"An inscription beside the Vairocana Buddha records that Empress Wu Zetian gave 20,000 strings of coins from her own cosmetics allowance to help build it.","src":"World History Encyclopedia","url":"https://www.worldhistory.org/Longmen_Grottoes/","say":{"en":"Is the night tour open today?","zh":"今天晚上开夜游吗？"}},"嘉峪关":{"what":"甘肃嘉峪关市的一座关城，明长城最西头的大关口，1372 年前后开始修。","what_en":"A fortress in Jiayuguan, Gansu — the great western gate of the Ming Great Wall, begun around 1372.","fame":"被叫作「天下第一雄关」：城楼立在戈壁上，背后是祁连山的雪峰；丝绸之路上的商队从这里出关往西走。","fame_en":"Called the \"First and Greatest Pass under Heaven\": its towers rise from the Gobi desert with the snowy Qilian Mountains behind, and Silk Road caravans left China through here.","fact":"关城上真的放着一块「定城砖」。传说修城前工匠算好要用多少块砖，监工不信，工匠说那就多加一块——城修好了，正好剩下这一块。故事是传说，砖今天还在。","fact_en":"A single \"leftover brick\" still sits on the fort. Legend says the builder calculated exactly how many bricks were needed, the official doubted him, so he added one more — and when the fort was done, exactly that one was left over.","src":"Wikipedia：Jiayu Pass","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jiayu_Pass","say":{"en":"Where's the famous leftover brick?","zh":"那块有名的定城砖在哪儿？"}},"敦煌莫高窟":{"what":"甘肃敦煌鸣沙山崖壁上的七百多个洞窟，从公元 366 年开始凿，里面是佛像和壁画。","what_en":"Over 700 caves cut into a cliff near Dunhuang, Gansu, starting in 366 AD, filled with Buddhist statues and murals.","fame":"一千年里画下的壁画有四万五千平方米：飞天、乐舞、丝路上的商人都在墙上，是世界上最大的佛教艺术宝库之一。","fame_en":"About 45,000 square metres of murals painted over a thousand years — flying apsaras, musicians, Silk Road merchants — one of the world's greatest treasuries of Buddhist art.","fact":"1900 年，人们在一个洞里发现了封了近千年的「藏经洞」。里面有一卷公元 868 年印的《金刚经》，是世界上有明确日期的最早印本书，今天收藏在伦敦的大英图书馆。","fact_en":"In 1900 a cave sealed for nearly a thousand years was found full of manuscripts. Among them was a Diamond Sutra printed in 868 AD — the world's earliest dated printed book, now at the British Library in London.","src":"British Library · IDP","url":"https://idp.bl.uk/blog/the-diamond-sutra/","say":{"en":"I booked a time slot online — where do I pick up my ticket?","zh":"我在网上约了场次，在哪儿取票？"}},"喀什古城":{"what":"新疆喀什市中心的老城区，土黄色的房子挨着窄巷子，住着很多维吾尔族人家。","what_en":"The old quarter in the centre of Kashgar, Xinjiang — earth-coloured houses along narrow lanes, home to many Uyghur families.","fame":"两千多年前就是丝绸之路上的大城，往西是中亚，往南是帕米尔高原；巷子里有打馕的、做铜器的、卖帽子的。","fame_en":"A major Silk Road city for over 2,000 years, with Central Asia to the west and the Pamirs to the south; its lanes are full of naan bakers, coppersmiths and hat sellers.","fact":"喀什官方用北京时间，可当地很多人日常用「新疆时间」，比北京晚两个小时。约人的时候最好问一句：北京时间还是新疆时间？","fact_en":"Kashgar officially runs on Beijing time, but many locals use unofficial \"Xinjiang time\", two hours behind. When you make plans, ask which one they mean.","src":"Wikipedia：Xinjiang Time","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xinjiang_Time","say":{"en":"Is that Beijing time or Xinjiang time?","zh":"是北京时间还是新疆时间？"}},"西湖":{"what":"杭州城西边的一个湖，三面是山，一面是城。","what_en":"A lake on the west side of Hangzhou, with hills on three sides and the city on the fourth.","fame":"一千多年来诗人一直在写它；2011 年成为世界文化遗产，断桥、雷峰塔、三潭印月都在这儿。","fame_en":"Poets have written about it for over a thousand years; it became a World Heritage site in 2011, home to Broken Bridge, Leifeng Pagoda and Three Pools Mirroring the Moon.","fact":"湖上那条近三公里长的苏堤，是苏轼在杭州当官时（1089 年前后）疏浚西湖，用挖出来的淤泥堆起来的——一位诗人修的路，今天每天都有人在上面跑步。","fact_en":"The nearly 3 km Su Causeway was built around 1089 by the poet Su Shi, then governor of Hangzhou, from mud dredged out of the lake — a poet's road that joggers still run along every morning.","src":"Wikipedia：West Lake","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Lake","say":{"en":"Where can I rent a bike to ride along the Su Causeway?","zh":"哪里能租自行车骑苏堤？"}},"龙井茶":{"what":"杭州西湖边山上产的绿茶，叶子扁平、颜色嫩绿，是中国最有名的绿茶之一。","what_en":"A green tea grown in the hills around West Lake in Hangzhou, with flat, bright-green leaves — one of China's most famous teas.","fame":"清朝乾隆皇帝很喜欢它，狮峰山下的「十八棵御茶」传说就是他封的；清明前采的「明前茶」最贵。","fame_en":"The Qianlong Emperor loved it — legend says he named the \"18 imperial tea bushes\" at Lion Peak. Leaves picked before the Qingming festival in early April are the most expensive.","fact":"2022 年 11 月，「中国传统制茶技艺及其相关习俗」列入联合国教科文组织人类非物质文化遗产名录，西湖龙井的手工炒茶就是其中一项。","fact_en":"In November 2022 China's traditional tea-processing techniques were added to UNESCO's intangible heritage list — and hand-roasting West Lake Longjing in a hot wok is one of them.","src":"eHangzhou（杭州市政府，2022）","url":"https://www.ehangzhou.gov.cn/2022-12/05/c_282619.htm","say":{"en":"Can I watch you roast the tea by hand?","zh":"能看看您手工炒茶吗？"}},"苏州园林":{"what":"苏州城里明清时候私人修的花园，比如拙政园、留园、网师园，在不大的地方造出山、水、亭子。","what_en":"Private gardens built in Suzhou during the Ming and Qing dynasties — like the Humble Administrator's Garden and the Master of the Nets Garden — fitting hills, water and pavilions into small spaces.","fame":"1997 年起陆续成为世界文化遗产；讲究「移步换景」：走一步，窗外就是另一幅画。","fame_en":"World Heritage since 1997; they are designed so that every step changes the view — each window frames a new picture.","fact":"1981 年，苏州的工匠到纽约，在大都会艺术博物馆里照着网师园的一个小院造了「明轩」（Astor Court），用的是传统材料和手工工具，是中美之间第一个长期的文化交流项目。","fact_en":"In 1981 craftsmen from Suzhou built Astor Court inside New York's Metropolitan Museum of Art, modelled on a courtyard of the Master of the Nets Garden and made with traditional materials and hand tools — the first permanent cultural exchange between the US and the PRC.","src":"Wikipedia：Astor Court","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astor_Court_(Metropolitan_Museum_of_Art)","say":{"en":"Is it less crowded if I come right at opening time?","zh":"一开门就来，人会少一点吗？"}},"昆曲":{"what":"起源于江苏昆山一带的戏曲，唱得慢、细，有「百戏之祖」的说法。","what_en":"A form of Chinese opera from the Kunshan area of Jiangsu, slow and delicate, often called the ancestor of many other Chinese operas.","fame":"16 到 18 世纪是中国最流行的戏；汤显祖的《牡丹亭》是它最有名的一出，到今天还在全世界巡演。","fame_en":"It dominated Chinese theatre from the 16th to the 18th century; Tang Xianzu's The Peony Pavilion is its most famous play and still tours the world.","fact":"2001 年，昆曲成了联合国教科文组织第一批「人类口头和非物质遗产代表作」之一。","fact_en":"In 2001 Kunqu was in UNESCO's very first group of Masterpieces of the Oral and Intangible Heritage of Humanity.","src":"Wikipedia：Kunqu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kunqu","say":{"en":"Are there English subtitles tonight?","zh":"今晚有英文字幕吗？"}},"景德镇瓷器":{"what":"江西景德镇烧的瓷器，这里烧瓷已经一千多年，被叫作「瓷都」。","what_en":"Porcelain from Jingdezhen in Jiangxi, which has been making porcelain for over a thousand years — China's \"Porcelain Capital\".","fame":"明清皇家用的瓷器大多在这里烧；青花瓷一船船运到欧洲和中东，英文里小写的 china 就是瓷器。","fame_en":"Most imperial porcelain of the Ming and Qing dynasties was fired here, and blue-and-white ware was shipped to Europe and the Middle East — which is why \"china\" in English also means porcelain.","fact":"做瓷器的白黏土英文叫 kaolin，这个词来自景德镇附近的高岭村。1712 年，法国传教士殷弘绪写信介绍景德镇怎么做瓷，这个词就跟着传到了欧洲。","fact_en":"The white clay for porcelain is called kaolin in English, from Gaoling, a village near Jingdezhen. The word reached Europe through French missionary d'Entrecolles' 1712 reports on how Jingdezhen made porcelain.","src":"Wikipedia：Kaolinite","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaolinite","say":{"en":"Is this hand-thrown or made in a mould?","zh":"这是手拉坯的还是模具做的？"}},"屈原":{"what":"战国时期楚国的诗人和大臣（约前 340–前 278 年），生在今湖北秭归。","what_en":"A poet and minister of the state of Chu (c. 340–278 BC), born in today's Zigui, Hubei.","fame":"中国第一位留下名字的大诗人，写了《离骚》；传说他投汨罗江后，人们划船去找、往江里扔米团，这是端午节划龙舟、吃粽子的来历之一。","fame_en":"The first great Chinese poet known by name, author of Li Sao. Legend says that after he drowned himself in the Miluo River, people raced boats to find him and threw rice into the water — one origin of dragon boats and zongzi.","fact":"2009 年，端午节成了第一个列入联合国教科文组织人类非物质文化遗产名录的中国节日。","fact_en":"In 2009 the Dragon Boat Festival became the first Chinese festival on UNESCO's intangible cultural heritage list.","src":"Wikipedia：Dragon Boat Festival","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Boat_Festival","say":{"en":"Sweet or savoury zongzi — which do you like?","zh":"粽子你喜欢甜的还是咸的？"}},"李白":{"what":"唐朝诗人（701–762 年），在四川江油长大，一辈子都在路上。","what_en":"A Tang dynasty poet (701–762) who grew up in Jiangyou, Sichuan, and spent his life travelling.","fame":"被叫作「诗仙」；「床前明月光，疑是地上霜」几乎每个中国孩子都会背。","fame_en":"Known as the Immortal Poet; almost every Chinese child can recite \"Moonlight before my bed — I wonder if it's frost on the ground\".","fact":"他可能不是在中国出生的：很多学者认为他生在丝绸之路上的碎叶城（今吉尔吉斯斯坦托克马克附近），五岁左右才随家搬到四川。这事到今天还有争论。","fact_en":"He may not have been born in China at all: many scholars think he was born in Suyab on the Silk Road (near Tokmok in today's Kyrgyzstan) and moved to Sichuan at about five. It is still debated.","src":"Wikipedia：Li Bai","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Li_Bai","say":{"en":"Which of his poems did he write here?","zh":"他哪首诗是在这儿写的？"}},"苏轼":{"what":"北宋文学家（1037–1101 年），号东坡居士，四川眉山人，诗、词、文章、书法、画样样都好。","what_en":"A Song dynasty writer (1037–1101), also called Su Dongpo, from Meishan, Sichuan — great at poetry, prose, calligraphy and painting.","fame":"「但愿人长久，千里共婵娟」每年中秋都有人引用；他一生几次被贬，却总能苦中找乐，所以很多中国人最喜欢他。","fame_en":"\"May we all live long, and share the same moon though a thousand miles apart\" is quoted every Mid-Autumn Festival. Exiled again and again, he always found joy anyway — many Chinese people's favourite poet.","fact":"1094 年起，他先后被贬到惠州和海南儋州，那时海南被看作天涯海角。1098 年，人们在他儋州住处的旧址上建了东坡书院，今天还在。","fact_en":"From 1094 he was banished to Huizhou and then Danzhou on Hainan island, then seen as the edge of the world. In 1098 the Dongpo Academy was built where he lived in Danzhou — it still stands today.","src":"Wikipedia：Su Shi","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Su_Shi","say":{"en":"Is this the house where Su Dongpo grew up?","zh":"这就是苏东坡长大的地方吗？"}},"天坛":{"what":"北京南边明清皇帝祭天、求好收成的地方，现在是个大公园。","what_en":"Where Ming and Qing emperors prayed to Heaven for good harvests, in the south of Beijing — now a huge public park.","fame":"圆形的祈年殿是北京最好认的建筑之一；早上公园里全是跳舞、打太极、踢毽子的北京人。","fame_en":"The round Hall of Prayer for Good Harvests is one of Beijing's most recognisable buildings, and every morning the park fills with locals dancing, doing tai chi and kicking shuttlecocks.","fact":"你看到的祈年殿不是明朝原来那座：1889 年它被雷击起火烧光了，现在这座是几年后照原样重建的。","fact_en":"The hall you see isn't the Ming original: lightning set it on fire in 1889 and it burned down. Today's hall was rebuilt to the same design a few years later.","src":"Wikipedia：Temple of Heaven","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temple_of_Heaven","say":{"en":"Is the Hall of Prayer included in the park ticket?","zh":"公园门票包括祈年殿吗？"}},"公园象棋":{"what":"中国象棋，北京公园和胡同口最常见的老人游戏，一张小桌、两个人、一圈人围着看。","what_en":"Xiangqi, Chinese chess — the classic game of Beijing parks and hutong corners: a little table, two players and a ring of people watching.","fame":"中国下的人最多的棋类游戏；在公园里，看的人往往比下的人还着急，「观棋不语」很难做到。","fame_en":"It's the most popular board game in China. In the park the watchers are often more worked up than the players — 'watch in silence' is easier said than done.","fact":"棋盘中间那条「河」上写着「楚河　汉界」，说的是两千多年前（公元前 206—前 202 年）楚和汉争天下——下象棋其实是在重打这一仗。","fact_en":"The 'river' across the middle of the board reads 'Chu River, Han Border' — a nod to the Chu–Han war of 206–202 BC. Every game replays that old fight.","src":"Wikipedia：Xiangqi","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xiangqi","say":{"en":"Can I watch? Whose turn is it?","zh":"我能看看吗？该谁走了？"}},"胡同":{"what":"北京老城里窄窄的小巷子，两边是四合院，很多人现在还住在里面。","what_en":"The narrow lanes of old Beijing, lined with courtyard homes — and lots of people still live in them.","fame":"要看北京人怎么过日子，就去胡同：修车摊、早点铺、晒太阳的大爷、骑三轮的快递，都在这几米宽的路上。","fame_en":"If you want to see everyday Beijing, walk a hutong: bike repair stalls, breakfast shops, grandpas in the sun and delivery tricycles, all on a lane a few metres wide.","fact":"「胡同」这个词很可能不是汉语，而是七百多年前元朝时从蒙古语借来的，最常见的说法是它原来的意思是「水井」（不过学者还在争论）。","fact_en":"The word 'hutong' probably isn't Chinese at all: it seems to have been borrowed from Mongolian during the Yuan dynasty, over 700 years ago. The usual explanation is that it meant 'water well' — though scholars still argue about it.","src":"Wikipedia：Hutong","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hutong","say":{"en":"Excuse me, is this lane a dead end?","zh":"请问，这条胡同是死胡同吗？"}},"老舍":{"what":"北京土生土长的作家，写《骆驼祥子》《茶馆》，把老北京人的话写进了书里。","what_en":"A writer born and raised in Beijing, author of Rickshaw Boy and Teahouse, who put the way old Beijingers talk into his books.","fame":"他的小说和话剧到现在还在演、还在读；北京人艺的《茶馆》演了几十年，一说「京味儿」就会想到他。","fame_en":"His novels and plays are still read and staged; Beijing People's Art Theatre has performed Teahouse for decades, and 'Beijing flavour' in writing means him.","fact":"老舍在伦敦住过：1925—1928 年他住在诺丁山，在伦敦大学东方学院（今天的 SOAS）教中文；2003 年英国在那栋房子上挂了蓝牌子。","fact_en":"Lao She once lived in London: from 1925 to 1928 he lodged in Notting Hill and taught Mandarin at the School of Oriental Studies (now SOAS). In 2003 a blue plaque went up on the house.","src":"English Heritage：Lao She blue plaque","url":"https://www.english-heritage.org.uk/visit/blue-plaques/lao-she/","say":{"en":"Are there any tickets left for Teahouse tonight?","zh":"今晚的《茶馆》还有票吗？"}},"西安城墙":{"what":"围着西安老城一整圈的明代城墙，可以爬上去走、骑车。","what_en":"The Ming-dynasty wall that runs all the way round Xi'an's old city — you can walk or cycle along the top.","fame":"中国保存最完整的古城墙之一，一圈 13.7 公里，上面很宽，能租自行车骑一整圈。","fame_en":"One of the best-preserved old city walls in China: a 13.7 km loop, wide enough on top to rent a bike and ride the whole way round.","fact":"城墙上每年还跑马拉松：从 1993 年起就有西安城墙国际马拉松，其中一项就是在墙顶上跑满一圈 13.7 公里。","fact_en":"There's a marathon on it: the Xi'an City Wall International Marathon has run since 1993, and one race is a full 13.7 km lap along the top of the wall.","src":"China Daily：Xi'an City Wall International Marathon","url":"https://govt.chinadaily.com.cn/s/201905/30/WS5cef4dda498e079e68022097/events-in-xian_4.html","say":{"en":"Can I return the bike at a different gate?","zh":"自行车可以在别的城门还吗？"}},"秦始皇":{"what":"两千两百多年前第一个统一中国的皇帝，「皇帝」这个称呼就是他起的。","what_en":"The first emperor to unify China, over 2,200 years ago — he even invented the title 'huangdi', emperor.","fame":"统一了文字、钱、车轮的宽度和度量衡，修了长城的一大段；兵马俑就是给他陪葬的。","fame_en":"He standardised writing, coins, axle widths and weights and measures, and joined up big stretches of the Great Wall. The Terracotta Army was made to guard his tomb.","fact":"他的陵墓主墓到现在都没打开。司马迁写过墓里有「水银做的江河」，后来测土壤，陵墓上面的汞含量真的比周围高很多。","fact_en":"His main tomb has still never been opened. The historian Sima Qian wrote that it held rivers of mercury — and soil tests on the mound did find mercury levels far above the surrounding area.","src":"Wikipedia：Mausoleum of the First Qin Emperor","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mausoleum_of_the_First_Qin_Emperor","say":{"en":"Why haven't they opened the tomb yet?","zh":"为什么还不打开秦始皇陵？"}},"兵马俑":{"what":"西安临潼秦始皇陵旁边埋着的几千个真人大小的陶土士兵和战马。","what_en":"Thousands of life-size clay soldiers and horses buried next to the First Emperor's tomb at Lintong, outside Xi'an.","fame":"每个兵俑的脸、发型、表情都不一样，排成军阵站了两千多年，被叫作「世界第八大奇迹」。","fame_en":"Every soldier has a different face, hairstyle and expression, and they've stood in battle formation for over 2,000 years — often called the eighth wonder of the world.","fact":"是农民打井打出来的：1974 年 3 月 29 日，杨志发几兄弟在地里挖井，挖到了陶片和一个陶俑的头。","fact_en":"It was found by farmers digging a well: on 29 March 1974, Yang Zhifa and his brothers hit pottery shards and a clay head.","src":"Wikipedia：Terracotta Army","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terracotta_Army","say":{"en":"Which pit should I see first?","zh":"应该先看几号坑？"}},"大雁塔":{"what":"西安城南的一座唐朝砖塔，玄奘从印度取经回来，就在这里存经、翻译。","what_en":"A Tang-dynasty brick pagoda in the south of Xi'an, built to hold the scriptures the monk Xuanzang brought back from India.","fame":"《西游记》里唐僧的原型就是玄奘；塔下的北广场晚上有很大的音乐喷泉，是西安人散步的地方。","fame_en":"Xuanzang is the real monk behind Journey to the West. In the evening the square north of the pagoda has a big musical fountain where locals go for a stroll.","fact":"大雁塔是斜的：它向西歪了好几度。652 年建的时候是五层，后来加到十层，1556 年大地震又震掉了三层，才成了今天的七层。","fact_en":"The pagoda leans — several degrees to the west. It had five storeys when built in 652, was raised to ten, and lost three in the great earthquake of 1556, leaving today's seven.","src":"Wikipedia：Giant Wild Goose Pagoda","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giant_Wild_Goose_Pagoda","say":{"en":"What time does the fountain show start tonight?","zh":"今晚喷泉几点开始？"}},"秦腔":{"what":"陕西的地方戏，唱起来声音又高又亮，当地人说是「吼」出来的。","what_en":"The local opera of Shaanxi, sung so loud and high that locals say it's 'roared' rather than sung.","fame":"西北最有代表性的戏，老人、年轻人都会哼几句；傍晚城墙根下常有人自己拉琴自己唱。","fame_en":"The signature opera of China's northwest — old and young can hum a few lines, and in the evening people play and sing it themselves at the foot of the city wall.","fact":"秦腔又叫「桄桄子」，就是伴奏用的枣木梆子敲出来「桄桄」的声音；2006 年它进了第一批国家级非物质文化遗产名录。","fact_en":"Qinqiang is nicknamed 'guangguangzi' after the 'guang guang' sound of its jujube-wood clappers. In 2006 it was on China's first national list of intangible cultural heritage.","src":"陕西省政府：Qinqiang Opera","url":"https://en.shaanxi.gov.cn/as/photos/201807/t20180720_1596348_wap.html","say":{"en":"That was loud! What's this song about?","zh":"好响啊！这段唱的是什么？"}},"羊肉泡馍":{"what":"西安的羊肉汤泡馍：把硬硬的饼掰碎，厨师加羊肉汤煮好端上来。","what_en":"Xi'an's mutton soup with bread: you break a hard flatbread into bits and the cook simmers it in mutton broth.","fame":"西安人心里第一的早饭和午饭，配糖蒜、辣酱吃；回民街一带的老店常常要排队。","fame_en":"Xi'an's favourite breakfast or lunch, eaten with sweet pickled garlic and chilli sauce; the old shops around the Muslim Quarter often have queues.","fact":"在传统老店里馍是你自己掰的：先掰成小块交给厨师，掰得越碎越入味，所以常看见一桌人边聊天边掰十几分钟。","fact_en":"In traditional places you break the bread yourself into small pieces before handing it to the cook — the finer the better, so you see whole tables chatting and tearing bread for ten minutes or more.","src":"Wikipedia：Paomo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paomo","say":{"en":"Is this small enough, or should I break it more?","zh":"掰这么大可以吗，还要再碎一点吗？"}},"杜甫":{"what":"唐朝诗人，被叫作「诗圣」，写战乱里普通人的日子。","what_en":"A Tang-dynasty poet known as the 'Sage of Poetry', who wrote about ordinary people's lives in a time of war.","fame":"中国人从小就背他的诗（「好雨知时节」「国破山河在」）；他在成都住过的地方现在是杜甫草堂。","fame_en":"Chinese children grow up reciting his lines ('Good rain knows its season', 'The country is broken, but mountains and rivers remain'); his home in Chengdu is now Du Fu Thatched Cottage.","fact":"他 759 年逃难到成都，在浣花溪边搭了间茅屋住了将近四年，写了 240 多首诗；原来的茅屋早就没了，现在的草堂是后来的朝代修的纪念园。","fact_en":"He fled to Chengdu in 759, built a thatched hut by Flower-Washing Creek and lived there almost four years, writing about 240 poems. The original hut is long gone — today's cottage is a memorial park built by later dynasties.","src":"Wikipedia：Du Fu Thatched Cottage","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Du_Fu_Thatched_Cottage","say":{"en":"Which poem did he write here?","zh":"他在这儿写了哪首诗？"}},"麻将":{"what":"四个人一桌、一百多张牌的中国游戏，过年和周末家里、茶馆里都在打。","what_en":"A Chinese tile game for four players with over a hundred tiles — played at home, at New Year and in teahouses every weekend.","fame":"成都人尤其爱打，茶馆里、街边、甚至公园里都能听到「哗啦啦」洗牌的声音；各地规矩都不一样。","fame_en":"Chengdu is famously mad about it — you hear the clatter of shuffling tiles in teahouses, on pavements, even in parks. Every region has its own rules.","fact":"麻将一百年前在美国火过一阵：1920 年起 Abercrombie & Fitch 开始卖麻将，一共卖了 12,000 副，还派人去中国乡下收购。","fact_en":"Mahjong had a craze in America a century ago: from 1920 Abercrombie & Fitch sold sets — 12,000 in all — and even sent buyers to Chinese villages to find more.","src":"Wikipedia：Mahjong","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahjong","say":{"en":"Sorry, I'm new — what are the rules here?","zh":"不好意思我刚学，这里怎么打？"}},"麻婆豆腐":{"what":"成都的家常菜：嫩豆腐加牛肉末、豆瓣酱、花椒，又麻又辣又烫。","what_en":"A Chengdu home-style dish: soft tofu with minced beef, chilli bean paste and Sichuan pepper — numbing, spicy and piping hot.","fame":"全世界最有名的川菜之一，「麻、辣、烫、香、酥、嫩」都在这一碗里，外国人学川菜几乎都从它开始。","fame_en":"One of the world's best-known Sichuan dishes, with that tingling-hot flavour in one bowl; almost everyone who learns Sichuan cooking starts here.","fact":"「麻婆」是一个真人：清朝 1862 年前后，成都万福桥边一家小饭馆的陈太太脸上有麻子，大家就把她做的豆腐叫「陈麻婆豆腐」。","fact_en":"'Mapo' was a real person: around 1862 Mrs Chen, who ran a little eatery by Wanfu Bridge in Chengdu, had a pockmarked face ('ma'), so her tofu became 'pockmarked old woman Chen's tofu'.","src":"Wikipedia：Mapo tofu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mapo_tofu","say":{"en":"Can you make it less spicy, but keep the numbing?","zh":"可以少辣一点，但还要麻吗？"}},"川剧变脸":{"what":"川剧里的绝活：演员一转头、一挥扇，脸谱一下子就换了颜色。","what_en":"The star trick of Sichuan opera: with a turn of the head or a flick of a fan, the performer's mask changes colour in an instant.","fame":"一场能变十几张脸，快到看不清；成都的茶馆和剧场几乎每晚都有表演，是游客必看的。","fame_en":"A performer can change a dozen faces so fast you can't see how; teahouses and theatres in Chengdu stage it almost every night.","fact":"变脸是家里一代代传的手艺，传统上只传男不传女，怕女儿嫁出去把秘密带走；2003 年刘德华跟变脸大师彭登怀学过。","fact_en":"The technique was handed down within families and traditionally taught only to sons, for fear a daughter would carry the secret into another family when she married. In 2003 Andy Lau studied with the master Peng Denghuai.","src":"Wikipedia：Bian lian","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bian_lian","say":{"en":"How did he do that? I was watching the whole time!","zh":"怎么变的？我一直盯着看呢！"}},"上海早饭":{"what":"上海人的早点：大饼、油条、粢饭团、豆浆，再加生煎和小馄饨。","what_en":"A Shanghai breakfast: flatbread, fried dough sticks, sticky-rice rolls and soy milk — plus pan-fried buns and little wontons.","fame":"大饼、油条、粢饭、豆浆被叫作「四大金刚」，弄堂口的早点摊一大早就排队；豆浆有甜的也有咸的。","fame_en":"Dabing, youtiao, cifan and doujiang are called the 'Four Heavenly Kings', and the stalls at lane entrances have queues at dawn. Soy milk comes sweet or savoury.","fact":"上海已知最早的大饼油条店 1912 年就开了；一百年前大饼还被叫作「塌饼」。","fact_en":"Shanghai's earliest known dabing-and-youtiao shop opened in 1912 — and a century ago dabing was still called 'tabing'.","src":"上海市政府：Classic local breakfast staples","url":"https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-GlobalTasteinShanghai2026-LocalFlavors/20260515/83c642503a5049a68673b4d85c677222.html","say":{"en":"One savoury soy milk and a youtiao, please.","zh":"一碗咸豆浆，一根油条。"}},"上海弄堂":{"what":"上海老城区里的里弄小巷，两边是石库门房子，一条弄堂就是一个小社区。","what_en":"The lanes of old Shanghai, lined with shikumen ('stone-gate') houses — each lane is a little neighbourhood of its own.","fame":"上海人小时候的记忆都在弄堂里：晾衣服、乘风凉、打招呼；新天地、田子坊就是老弄堂改出来的。","fame_en":"Shanghai childhoods happened in the lanes — laundry poles, cooling off on summer evenings, neighbours calling out. Xintiandi and Tianzifang are old lanes made over.","fact":"中国共产党第一次全国代表大会 1921 年 7 月就是在新天地一栋石库门房子里开的，那是代表李汉俊的家，现在是纪念馆。","fact_en":"The first congress of the Chinese Communist Party was held in July 1921 in a shikumen house in what is now Xintiandi — the home of delegate Li Hanjun. It's a memorial museum today.","src":"Wikipedia：Site of the First National Congress of the CCP","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Site_of_the_First_National_Congress_of_the_Chinese_Communist_Party","say":{"en":"Do people still live in this lane?","zh":"这条弄堂里还有人住吗？"}},"City Walk":{"what":"不赶景点、慢慢在城市街区里走走看看，2023 年在中国年轻人里火起来的玩法。","what_en":"Walking a city slowly instead of rushing between sights — the way of exploring that took off with young people in China in 2023.","fame":"上海是 City Walk 第一站：武康路、安福路、梧桐树下的老房子和咖啡店，走一下午也不累。","fame_en":"Shanghai is City Walk's home ground: Wukang Road, Anfu Road, old houses and cafés under the plane trees — you can wander all afternoon.","fact":"2023 年上半年，小红书上搜「citywalk」的次数比前一年多了 30 倍；最经典的一条路线是从武康路走到复兴公园。","fact_en":"In the first half of 2023, searches for 'citywalk' on Xiaohongshu rose 30-fold year on year. One classic route goes from Wukang Road to Fuxing Park.","src":"China Daily：Trending city-walk culture","url":"https://enapp.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202308/17/AP64ddbfd7a31003c0fbfbd8e7.html","say":{"en":"Which way to Fuxing Park if I keep walking?","zh":"一直走的话，复兴公园往哪边？"}},"夜校":{"what":"下了班去上的便宜兴趣课：上海话、咖啡、陶艺、舞蹈，几百块学一学期。","what_en":"Cheap evening classes after work — Shanghainese, coffee, pottery, dance — a few hundred yuan a term.","fame":"2023 年起成了年轻人的新爱好：不为文凭，就为下班后学点喜欢的东西、认识新朋友；热门课几秒就抢光。","fame_en":"Since 2023 it's become a new hobby for young people: not for a diploma, just to learn something they enjoy after work and meet people. Popular classes sell out in seconds.","fact":"2023 年秋天，上海市民艺术夜校 1 万个名额来了大约 65 万人报名，报名网站直接挤崩了。","fact_en":"In autumn 2023, about 650,000 people applied for 10,000 places at Shanghai's Citizen Night School for Arts — the sign-up site crashed.","src":"China Daily HK：night schools","url":"https://www.chinadailyhk.com/hk/article/380415","say":{"en":"Are there any places left in the evening class?","zh":"晚上的课还有名额吗？"}},"堂吉诃德":{"what":"塞万提斯小说里那位读骑士小说读入了迷、骑着瘦马出门「行侠仗义」的老乡绅，身边跟着胖侍从桑丘。","what_en":"The old country gentleman in Cervantes' novel who reads so many knight stories that he rides out on a skinny horse to 'right wrongs', with his plump squire Sancho Panza.","fame":"常被叫作第一部现代小说；「跟风车打仗」成了很多语言里的说法，意思是跟想象出来的敌人较劲。西班牙语也因此被叫作「塞万提斯的语言」。","fame_en":"It's often called the first modern novel. 'Tilting at windmills' became an idiom in many languages for fighting imaginary enemies, and Spanish is even nicknamed 'the language of Cervantes'.","fact":"塞万提斯 1616 年葬在马德里一座修道院，后来遗骨下落不明。2015 年 3 月，研究团队说在马德里文学区的三一会赤足修女院地下找到了他——可他的骨头和另外十几个人的混在一起，没法一块块分出来。","fact_en":"Cervantes was buried in a Madrid convent in 1616 and his bones were later lost. In March 2015 researchers said they had found him in the crypt of the Barefoot Trinitarians convent in Madrid's Literary Quarter — but mixed with the bones of more than a dozen other people, so they couldn't single his out.","src":"NPR，2015 年 3 月","url":"https://www.npr.org/sections/thetwo-way/2015/03/17/393662074/cervantes-remains-have-been-found-in-madrid-scientists-say","say":{"en":"Is there a bus from here to the windmills?","zh":"这儿有去风车那边的公交吗？"}},"伊比利亚火腿":{"what":"用伊比利亚黑猪的后腿腌好、再风干两三年做成的火腿，切成薄得透光的片吃。","what_en":"Ham made from the hind leg of a black Iberian pig, salted and then air-dried for two or three years, and eaten in slices so thin you can see light through them.","fame":"西班牙人眼里最好的火腿：最好的那种猪秋冬在橡树林里放养，吃掉在地上的橡果，所以肥肉入口就化，带一股坚果香。一整条能卖到几百欧。","fame_en":"Spaniards rate it the best ham there is. The top pigs roam oak woodland in autumn and winter eating fallen acorns, so the fat melts on your tongue with a nutty taste. A whole leg can cost several hundred euros.","fact":"2014 年西班牙出了新规定，每条伊比利亚火腿上都要挂颜色标签：黑色＝百分之百纯种、吃橡果长大；红色＝混血、吃橡果；绿色＝放养、吃饲料；白色＝圈养。从那以后，只有黑标的才能叫「pata negra（黑蹄）」。","fact_en":"Since a 2014 law, every Ibérico ham carries a coloured tag: black = 100% Iberian breed fed on acorns; red = cross-bred, acorn-fed; green = free-range on feed; white = raised in pens. Since then only black-label ham may be called 'pata negra'.","src":"Wikipedia「Jamón ibérico」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jam%C3%B3n_ib%C3%A9rico","say":{"en":"Could I have 100 grams of ibérico, sliced thin?","zh":"能给我切 100 克伊比利亚火腿吗？切薄一点。"}},"皇家马德里":{"what":"马德里的足球俱乐部，一身白球衣，主场是城里的伯纳乌球场。","what_en":"Madrid's football club, in all-white shirts, playing at the Santiago Bernabéu stadium in the middle of the city.","fame":"拿欧冠冠军最多的俱乐部；2000 年被国际足联评为「20 世纪最佳俱乐部」。全世界都有它的球迷，球星一个接一个来。","fame_en":"No club has won the European Cup / Champions League more often, and FIFA named it the best club of the 20th century in 2000. It has fans everywhere and a long line of star signings.","fact":"2025 年的德勤足球财富榜上，皇马成了第一家一个赛季收入超过 10 亿欧元的足球俱乐部（2023-24 赛季约 10.46 亿）；翻修后的伯纳乌让比赛日收入涨了一大截。","fact_en":"In Deloitte's 2025 Football Money League, Real Madrid became the first football club to earn more than €1 billion in a season (about €1.046 billion in 2023-24), with the rebuilt Bernabéu pushing matchday income way up.","src":"ESPN / Deloitte，2025 年 1 月","url":"https://www.espn.com/soccer/story/_/id/43516587/real-madrid-post-record-revenue-1-billion-deloitte","say":{"en":"Two tickets for the stadium tour, please.","zh":"请给我两张球场参观的票。"}},"阿尔罕布拉宫":{"what":"格拉纳达山上的宫殿和城堡，是摩尔人（穆斯林）在西班牙最后一个王朝——纳斯里德王朝建的。","what_en":"A palace and fortress on a hill above Granada, built by the Nasrids, the last Moorish (Muslim) dynasty in Spain.","fame":"墙上满是像花边一样的石膏雕花和阿拉伯文，院子里有水池和喷泉，光和水都被设计过；票常常提前好几周就卖光。","fame_en":"Its walls are covered in lace-like plaster carving and Arabic writing, and its courtyards are built around pools and fountains, with light and water carefully designed. Tickets often sell out weeks ahead.","fact":"美国作家华盛顿·欧文 1829 年在宫里住了大约三个月，1832 年出了《阿尔罕布拉的故事》，让这座当时快被人忘了的宫殿重新出名；他住过的房间现在挂着一块牌子。","fact_en":"American writer Washington Irving lived in the palace for about three months in 1829. His 'Tales of the Alhambra' (1832) brought the half-forgotten palace back to fame, and a plaque now marks the rooms where he stayed.","src":"Wikipedia「Tales of the Alhambra」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tales_of_the_Alhambra","say":{"en":"Our ticket is for the Nasrid Palaces at 2:30 — is this the right entrance?","zh":"我们的票是两点半进纳斯里德宫的，是从这个门进吗？"}},"弗拉明戈":{"what":"从安达卢西亚来的歌、吉他和舞：舞者跺脚、拍手，歌手唱得像在哭。","what_en":"Song, guitar and dance from Andalusia: dancers stamp and clap, and the singer sounds almost like crying.","fame":"吉卜赛人和安达卢西亚各种音乐混在一起长出来的，是西班牙最有名的艺术之一，全世界都有人学；好的弗拉明戈不在大舞台，在小酒馆（tablao）里。","fame_en":"It grew out of Gitano (Roma) and Andalusian music mixing together, and is one of Spain's best-known arts, learned all over the world. The best flamenco is in small tablaos, not on big stages.","fact":"2010 年 11 月 16 日，联合国教科文组织把弗拉明戈列入人类非物质文化遗产；第二年安达卢西亚就把每年的 11 月 16 日定为「弗拉明戈日」。","fact_en":"On 16 November 2010 UNESCO added flamenco to its list of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity. The next year Andalusia made every 16 November 'Flamenco Day'.","src":"Expoflamenco / UNESCO","url":"https://expoflamenco.com/archivo/en/actualidad-en/international-flamenco-day-the-year-when-the-soul-spoke/","say":{"en":"What time does the flamenco show start tonight?","zh":"今晚的弗拉明戈几点开始？"}},"西班牙海鲜饭":{"what":"一口大平底锅煮的米饭（paella），用藏红花染成金黄，锅底一层焦脆的锅巴叫 socarrat。","what_en":"Rice cooked in one big flat pan (paella), turned golden with saffron, with a crispy crust on the bottom called socarrat.","fame":"来自巴伦西亚的稻田边，是全世界最有名的西班牙菜；西班牙人常在周日中午一大家人围着一锅吃。","fame_en":"It comes from the rice fields around Valencia and is the world's best-known Spanish dish. Spaniards often eat it at Sunday lunch, the whole family around one pan.","fact":"正宗的「巴伦西亚 paella」其实没有海鲜。2022 年巴伦西亚天主教大学问了 266 个村子的 400 个厨师，大家公认能放的只有 10 样：米、水、橄榄油、盐、藏红花、番茄、扁豆角、利马豆、鸡肉和兔肉。","fact_en":"Real 'paella valenciana' has no seafood. In 2022 the Catholic University of Valencia asked 400 cooks from 266 villages, and only ten ingredients were widely accepted: rice, water, olive oil, salt, saffron, tomato, flat green beans, lima beans, chicken and rabbit.","src":"Time Out，2022 年","url":"https://www.timeout.com/news/this-poll-of-chefs-in-valencia-has-found-out-what-is-officially-allowed-in-paella-032222","say":{"en":"Is the paella for two? How long does it take?","zh":"这个海鲜饭是两人份的吗？要等多久？"}},"番茄节":{"what":"每年八月最后一个星期三，巴伦西亚附近的小镇布尼奥尔满街的人互扔熟透的番茄，扔一个小时。","what_en":"On the last Wednesday of August, the streets of Buñol, a small town near Valencia, fill with people throwing ripe tomatoes at each other for an hour.","fame":"世界上最出名的「食物大战」：上世纪四十年代小镇年轻人的玩闹，现在全世界的人都来，一个小时扔掉一百多吨番茄，扔完消防车冲街。","fame_en":"The world's most famous food fight. It began as local young people's fun in the 1940s; now people come from all over the world, throw more than a hundred tonnes of tomatoes in an hour, and fire trucks hose the streets afterwards.","fact":"小镇只住了约九千人，以前一来就是四五万人。2013 年起改成要买票，限 2 万人。","fact_en":"The town has only about 9,000 residents but used to get 40,000–50,000 visitors. Since 2013 it has been ticketed and capped at 20,000 people.","src":"Wikipedia「La Tomatina」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Tomatina","say":{"en":"Where can I buy goggles before it starts?","zh":"开始前哪里能买到护目镜？"}},"特奥蒂瓦坎":{"what":"墨西哥城东北约 50 公里的古城遗址，有太阳金字塔、月亮金字塔和一条两公里多长的「亡者大道」。","what_en":"The ruins of an ancient city about 50 km north-east of Mexico City, with the Pyramids of the Sun and Moon and an 'Avenue of the Dead' more than two kilometres long.","fame":"美洲最大的古城之一。阿兹特克人找到它的时候，它已经荒了好几百年，他们以为是神建的，起名叫「众神之城」。","fame_en":"One of the largest ancient cities in the Americas. By the time the Aztecs found it, it had been empty for centuries; they thought gods had built it and named it 'the place where the gods were born'.","fact":"2003 年一场大雨让羽蛇神庙前塌出一个洞，露出一条封了约 1800 年的地道；2015 年考古学家在地道尽头发现了大量液态水银，到现在也不知道为什么放在那儿。","fact_en":"In 2003 heavy rain opened a sinkhole in front of the Temple of the Feathered Serpent, revealing a tunnel sealed for about 1,800 years. In 2015 archaeologists found large amounts of liquid mercury at its end — and still don't know why it was put there.","src":"Archaeology 杂志，2015 年 4 月","url":"https://archaeology.org/news/2015/04/27/150427-mexico-teotihuacan-mercury/","say":{"en":"What time does the site open?","zh":"遗址几点开门？"}},"塔可":{"what":"小小的玉米饼包上肉、洋葱、香菜，挤点青柠、浇点辣酱，用手拿着吃。","what_en":"A small corn tortilla folded around meat, onion and coriander, with a squeeze of lime and some salsa, eaten by hand.","fame":"墨西哥人从早到晚都吃，路边小摊最好吃；最有名的「牧师塔可」（al pastor）用的是转着烤的猪肉，这个烤法是黎巴嫩移民带来的。","fame_en":"Mexicans eat them morning to night, and street stands do them best. The famous tacos al pastor use pork roasted on a spinning spit, a method brought by Lebanese immigrants.","fact":"2024 年 5 月第一本墨西哥米其林指南里，墨西哥城一个只有约 9 平米、只卖 4 种塔可的小摊 El Califa de León 拿到一颗星——世界上第一个得米其林星的塔可摊。","fact_en":"In the first Michelin Guide to Mexico, in May 2024, El Califa de León — a Mexico City stand of about 9 square metres selling just four tacos — got one star, the first taco stand ever to earn one.","src":"NBC News，2024 年 5 月","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/latino/first-mexican-taco-stand-michelin-star-says-simplicity-secret-success-rcna152649","say":{"en":"Two al pastor tacos with everything, please.","zh":"两个牧师塔可，什么都加。"}},"弗里达":{"what":"墨西哥女画家弗里达·卡罗，画了很多自画像：一字眉、头上戴花，身边常有猴子和鹦鹉。","what_en":"Frida Kahlo, the Mexican painter of many self-portraits: joined eyebrows, flowers in her hair, often with monkeys and parrots beside her.","fame":"年轻时一场车祸让她疼了一辈子，很多画是躺在床上画的；她把疼痛、身份和墨西哥的颜色画进画里，现在是全世界最有名的女画家之一，她在科约阿坎的「蓝房子」是博物馆。","fame_en":"A bus accident in her youth left her in pain for life, and she painted many works in bed. She put pain, identity and Mexico's colours into her art and is now one of the world's most famous women painters; her 'Blue House' in Coyoacán is a museum.","fact":"2025 年 11 月，她 1940 年画的《梦（床）》在纽约苏富比拍出约 5460 万美元，成了史上拍卖价最高的女艺术家作品。","fact_en":"In November 2025 her 1940 painting 'El sueño (La cama)' sold at Sotheby's New York for about $54.7 million — the highest price ever paid at auction for a work by a woman artist.","src":"NBC News，2025 年 11 月","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/latino/frida-kahlo-self-portrait-record-rcna245080","say":{"en":"Do I need to book tickets for the Blue House in advance?","zh":"去蓝房子要提前订票吗？"}},"墨西哥摔角":{"what":"墨西哥的职业摔角（lucha libre），选手戴彩色面具，在台上翻跟头、从绳上飞下来。","what_en":"Mexican pro wrestling (lucha libre): masked wrestlers flipping and flying off the ropes.","fame":"面具就是选手的身份，很多人一辈子不在公开场合摘下；输了「面具对决」就得当众摘面具，这是最大的耻辱。台下的人分成给「好人」和「坏人」喊加油两边。","fame_en":"The mask is the wrestler's identity, and many never take it off in public. Losing a 'mask match' means unmasking in front of everyone — the biggest shame there is. The crowd splits into fans of the good guys and the bad guys.","fact":"2018 年 7 月，墨西哥城政府把 lucha libre 宣布为这座城市的非物质文化遗产。","fact_en":"In July 2018 the Mexico City government declared lucha libre part of the city's intangible cultural heritage.","src":"Wikipedia「Lucha libre」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucha_libre","say":{"en":"Who's the good guy and who's the bad guy?","zh":"哪个是好人，哪个是坏人？"}},"流浪乐队":{"what":"马里亚奇（mariachi）：穿镶银扣的骑手装、戴宽边帽的乐队，有小提琴、小号和吉他，边走边唱。","what_en":"Mariachi: bands in silver-studded charro suits and wide sombreros, with violins, trumpets and guitars, singing as they stroll.","fame":"墨西哥的声音：生日、婚礼、表白都会请他们来唱。它来自哈利斯科州，瓜达拉哈拉被叫作马里亚奇的故乡。","fame_en":"It's the sound of Mexico — people hire mariachis for birthdays, weddings and serenades. It comes from Jalisco state, and Guadalajara is called its home.","fact":"2011 年联合国教科文组织把马里亚奇列入人类非物质文化遗产，那一年一共只有十几项入选。","fact_en":"In 2011 UNESCO added mariachi to its list of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity — one of only about nineteen new entries that year.","src":"UNESCO","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/mariachi-string-music-song-and-trumpet-00575","say":{"en":"How much for one song?","zh":"唱一首多少钱？"}},"秘鲁酸橘汁腌鱼":{"what":"Ceviche：生鱼块泡在青柠汁里几分钟，加红洋葱、辣椒和盐，旁边配红薯和大粒玉米。","what_en":"Ceviche: raw fish 'cooked' for a few minutes in lime juice with red onion, chilli and salt, served with sweet potato and big-kernel corn.","fame":"秘鲁的国菜，利马人一般中午吃，因为鱼要早上刚打上来的才新鲜。泡鱼剩下的汁叫「虎奶」，很多人当一小杯喝掉。","fame_en":"Peru's national dish. People in Lima usually eat it at lunch, because the fish should be from that morning. The leftover marinade is called 'tiger's milk', and many people drink it as a shot.","fact":"2023 年 12 月，联合国教科文组织把秘鲁做和吃 ceviche 的传统列入人类非物质文化遗产，这是秘鲁第一道入选的菜。","fact_en":"In December 2023 UNESCO added the making and eating of Peruvian ceviche to its Intangible Cultural Heritage list — the first Peruvian dish to be inscribed.","src":"UNESCO，2023 年","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/01952","say":{"en":"What's the catch of the day?","zh":"今天是什么鱼？"}},"库斯科古城":{"what":"秘鲁安第斯山里海拔约 3400 米的城市，曾经是印加帝国的首都，去马丘比丘一般从这儿出发。","what_en":"A city about 3,400 metres up in Peru's Andes, once the capital of the Inca Empire and the usual starting point for Machu Picchu.","fame":"西班牙人来了以后，在印加人的石墙上盖教堂和房子，所以走在街上能看到下半截是严丝合缝的印加大石块，上半截是西班牙白墙。","fame_en":"The Spanish built their churches and houses on top of Inca walls, so in the streets you see perfectly fitted Inca stones below and Spanish whitewashed walls above.","fact":"1950 年 5 月一场大地震损坏了城里三分之一以上的房子，西班牙人盖的比印加人的受损重得多；太阳神殿（科里坎查）原来被盖在教堂里的印加石墙，也是这次地震才露了出来。","fact_en":"A big earthquake in May 1950 damaged more than a third of the city's buildings, and Spanish-built ones fared much worse than Inca ones. It also exposed the Inca walls of the Coricancha sun temple, hidden for centuries inside a church.","src":"Wikipedia「Historic Centre of Cusco」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Historic_Centre_of_Cusco","say":{"en":"I feel a bit dizzy — do you have coca tea?","zh":"我有点头晕，有古柯茶吗？"}},"羊驼":{"what":"安第斯山里的毛绒动物（alpaca），比美洲驼（llama）小，养来剪毛，不是用来驮东西的。","what_en":"The fluffy Andean animal (alpaca), smaller than a llama, kept for its fleece rather than for carrying loads.","fame":"羊驼毛比羊毛轻、暖，不扎人，能织成很贵的毛衣和围巾；它那张呆萌的脸也让它在网上爆红。","fame_en":"Alpaca fibre is lighter and warmer than sheep's wool and doesn't itch, so it's made into expensive jumpers and scarves. Its goofy face also made it an internet star.","fact":"全世界大约 87% 的羊驼都在秘鲁，大多由安第斯高原上的小牧民家庭放养。","fact_en":"About 87% of the world's alpacas live in Peru, mostly raised by small herding families in the high Andes.","src":"Agraria.pe（秘鲁农业部数据），2022 年","url":"https://agraria.pe/noticias/peru-concentra-mas-del-87-de-la-poblacion-de-alpacas-en-el-m-28803","say":{"en":"Is this 100% alpaca or a blend?","zh":"这是百分之百羊驼毛，还是混纺的？"}},"秘鲁土豆":{"what":"秘鲁安第斯山里种的各种土豆：紫的、黄的、红的，有的像姜，有的像小石头。","what_en":"The many potatoes grown in Peru's Andes — purple, yellow, red, some shaped like ginger, some like pebbles.","fame":"土豆的老家就在秘鲁南部和玻利维亚交界的安第斯山，几千年前就开始种了；秘鲁有三千多个品种，后来土豆才传到欧洲和全世界。","fame_en":"The potato was first farmed thousands of years ago in the Andes of southern Peru and Bolivia. Peru has more than 3,000 varieties, and only later did the potato travel to Europe and the rest of the world.","fact":"在秘鲁的提议下，联合国大会 2023 年 12 月把每年 5 月 30 日定为「国际土豆日」，2024 年第一次过。","fact_en":"At Peru's proposal, the UN General Assembly made 30 May the International Day of Potato in December 2023; it was first celebrated in 2024.","src":"Andina（秘鲁通讯社），2023 年 12 月","url":"https://andina.pe/ingles/noticia-united-nations-declares-may-30-as-international-potato-day-966053.aspx","say":{"en":"Which potato is best for causa?","zh":"做 causa（秘鲁土豆泥冷盘）用哪种土豆最好？"}},"阿根廷探戈":{"what":"布宜诺斯艾利斯和蒙得维的亚港口边长出来的舞和音乐：两个人紧紧抱着，脚下忽慢忽快，配着班多钮琴（像手风琴）。","what_en":"The dance and music born around the ports of Buenos Aires and Montevideo: two people in a close embrace, steps slow then sudden, with the bandoneón (a kind of concertina).","fame":"十九世纪末移民和水手在港口一带跳出来，后来传到巴黎、风靡全世界；在布宜诺斯艾利斯，晚上去 milonga（跳舞的舞厅）是普通人的日常。","fame_en":"Immigrants and sailors created it around the docks in the late 1800s; it then took Paris and the world by storm. In Buenos Aires, going to a milonga (a dance night) is ordinary people's everyday life.","fact":"2009 年探戈被联合国教科文组织列入人类非物质文化遗产——是阿根廷和乌拉圭一起申报的，探戈是两个国家共有的。","fact_en":"UNESCO inscribed tango as Intangible Cultural Heritage in 2009 — nominated jointly by Argentina and Uruguay, because it belongs to both countries.","src":"UNESCO","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/tango-00258","say":{"en":"I'm a beginner — could you show me the basic step?","zh":"我是新手，能教我基本步吗？"}},"博卡区":{"what":"布宜诺斯艾利斯南边的老港区，房子刷得红黄蓝绿，是博卡青年足球队的家。","what_en":"The old port district in the south of Buenos Aires, with houses painted red, yellow, blue and green — and home of Boca Juniors football club.","fame":"早年意大利热那亚移民在这儿落脚，用铁皮和木板盖房子；最出名的小街 Caminito 是露天博物馆，有人在街上跳探戈、卖画。博卡青年的主场外号「糖果盒」。","fame_en":"Genoese immigrants settled here, building houses of corrugated iron and wood. Its most famous lane, Caminito, is an open-air museum with tango dancers and painters. Boca Juniors' stadium is nicknamed 'La Bombonera' (the chocolate box).","fact":"Caminito 原来是一条铁路，1954 年铁路停了就成了垃圾场；住在附近的画家金克拉·马丁花了三年把两边的墙刷上颜色，1960 年还在一头搭了个舞台。","fact_en":"Caminito used to be a railway line; after it closed in 1954 it became a rubbish dump. Painter Benito Quinquela Martín, who lived nearby, spent three years painting the walls in colour, and by 1960 had a stage built at one end.","src":"Wikipedia「Caminito」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caminito","say":{"en":"Is it safe to walk around here after dark?","zh":"天黑以后在这儿走安全吗？"}},"马拉多纳":{"what":"阿根廷足球运动员迭戈·马拉多纳（1960–2020），个子不高，带球像球粘在脚上。","what_en":"Diego Maradona (1960–2020), the Argentine footballer — not tall, with the ball seemingly glued to his feet.","fame":"1986 年带阿根廷拿了世界杯；同一场对英格兰，他进了用手打进的「上帝之手」和连过好几个人的「世纪进球」。在阿根廷和意大利那不勒斯，他被当成神。","fame_en":"He led Argentina to the 1986 World Cup. In the same match against England he scored the 'Hand of God' goal and the dribbling 'Goal of the Century'. In Argentina and in Naples he is treated like a god.","fact":"他在那场比赛穿的蓝色 10 号球衣，2022 年 5 月在苏富比拍出约 710 万英镑，是当时体育纪念品的最高拍卖价。","fact_en":"The blue No. 10 shirt he wore in that match sold at Sotheby's in May 2022 for about £7.1 million — at the time the highest auction price ever for sports memorabilia.","src":"AP，2022 年 5 月","url":"https://www.news4jax.com/news/world/2022/05/04/goal-maradonas-hand-of-god-shirt-sets-auction-record/","say":{"en":"Where's the Maradona mural?","zh":"马拉多纳的壁画在哪儿？"}},"博尔赫斯":{"what":"阿根廷作家豪尔赫·路易斯·博尔赫斯（1899–1986），写短篇小说和诗，故事里常有迷宫、镜子和无穷大的图书馆。","what_en":"Jorge Luis Borges (1899–1986), the Argentine writer of short stories and poems full of labyrinths, mirrors and endless libraries.","fame":"二十世纪最重要的作家之一，影响了后来很多小说家；名篇《巴别图书馆》写的是一座装着所有可能的书的图书馆。他没拿过诺贝尔奖，常被说成是最大的遗憾之一。","fame_en":"One of the 20th century's most important writers, influencing many later novelists. His story 'The Library of Babel' imagines a library holding every possible book. He never won the Nobel Prize, often called one of its great omissions.","fact":"1955 年他当上了阿根廷国家图书馆馆长，可那时他几乎已经全瞎了；他后来写了一首《关于天赐的诗》，说上天同时给了他书和黑夜。他在这个位置上一直干到 1973 年。","fact_en":"In 1955 he became director of Argentina's National Library — just as he had gone almost completely blind. He later wrote the 'Poem of the Gifts' about being given books and the night at the same time. He stayed in the post until 1973.","src":"布宜诺斯艾利斯市旅游局","url":"https://turismo.buenosaires.gob.ar/en/otros-establecimientos/former-national-library-building","say":{"en":"Is the old National Library building open to visitors?","zh":"老的国家图书馆能进去参观吗？"}},"可颂":{"what":"一层黄油一层面团、烤得酥到掉渣的弯月形面包，法国人早饭和咖啡一起吃。","what_en":"A crescent of pastry folded with layer after layer of butter, baked until it shatters — the French breakfast with coffee.","fame":"它是法式面包店的门面：一口咬下去外面碎、里面一圈圈软孔，全世界的咖啡馆都在学它。","fame_en":"It's the face of every French bakery: crisp flakes outside, soft honeycomb inside, and copied by cafés all over the world.","fact":"可颂其实是从维也纳来的：1838–1839 年，奥地利人奥古斯特·臧在巴黎开了一家「维也纳面包店」，卖奥地利的 kipferl，巴黎人照形状叫它「新月」（croissant）；今天这种酥皮做法，最早的食谱是 1905 年才出现的。","fact_en":"The croissant is really from Vienna: in 1838–39 an Austrian, August Zang, opened a 'Viennese bakery' in Paris selling kipferl, and Parisians named it after its crescent shape. The earliest known recipe for today's flaky version only dates from 1905.","src":"Wikipedia · Croissant","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Croissant","say":{"en":"Two croissants and a coffee, please.","zh":"两个可颂，一杯咖啡，谢谢。"}},"巴黎圣母院":{"what":"巴黎塞纳河西岱岛上的哥特式大教堂，已经站了八百多年。","what_en":"The Gothic cathedral on the Île de la Cité in the Seine, standing for more than 800 years.","fame":"雨果的小说《巴黎圣母院》让它闻名全世界；2019 年一场大火烧掉了尖塔，全世界一起捐钱重建，2024 年 12 月重新开门。","fame_en":"Victor Hugo's novel made it world-famous. A 2019 fire brought down its spire, people everywhere gave money to rebuild it, and it reopened in December 2024.","fact":"新尖塔顶上的铜公鸡 2023 年 12 月装上去，肚子里放着大火里救出来的圣物，还有一张写着参与重建的工人、捐款人名字的羊皮纸；建筑师说它是一只「浴火的凤凰」。","fact_en":"The new copper rooster put on top of the spire in December 2023 holds relics saved from the fire and a parchment listing the names of the workers and donors who rebuilt it. Its architect calls it a phoenix.","src":"Reuters / The Korea Times，2023 年 12 月","url":"https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/world/20231217/notre-dame-rooster-back-on-paris-cathedrals-spire-as-renovation-enters-final-stage","say":{"en":"Is there a queue to get inside?","zh":"进去要排队吗？"}},"居里夫人":{"what":"在巴黎做研究的波兰裔科学家，发现了钋和镭，研究放射性。","what_en":"The Polish-born scientist who worked in Paris, discovered polonium and radium, and studied radioactivity.","fame":"她是第一个拿诺贝尔奖的女性，也是唯一在物理和化学两个领域都拿过诺奖的人。","fame_en":"She was the first woman to win a Nobel Prize, and is still the only person to win it in both physics and chemistry.","fact":"她的实验笔记到今天还有放射性，主要是镭 226，半衰期约 1600 年；法国国家图书馆把它们放在铅盒里，想看的人要先签免责书、穿上防护装备。","fact_en":"Her lab notebooks are still radioactive — mostly radium-226, with a half-life of about 1,600 years. France's national library keeps them in lead-lined boxes, and readers must sign a waiver and wear protective gear.","src":"The Christian Science Monitor","url":"https://www.csmonitor.com/Innovation/Horizons/2011/1107/Marie-Curie-Why-her-papers-are-still-radioactive","say":{"en":"Is the Curie Museum open today?","zh":"居里博物馆今天开门吗？"}},"凯旋门":{"what":"巴黎香榭丽舍大街尽头的大石门，拿破仑下令修来纪念打胜仗。","what_en":"The huge stone arch at the top of the Champs-Élysées, ordered by Napoleon to honour France's victories.","fame":"它下面是无名烈士墓，长明火每天傍晚重新点燃；门外是十二条大路汇成的大转盘，开车绕一圈是巴黎人的考验。","fame_en":"Beneath it lies the Tomb of the Unknown Soldier, whose flame is rekindled every evening; around it, twelve avenues meet in a roundabout that tests every Paris driver.","fact":"2021 年 9 月，它被整个「包」了起来：艺术家克里斯托和让娜-克劳德的遗作，用了约 2.5 万平方米银蓝色布和 3000 米红绳，只展出 16 天，布料后来回收。","fact_en":"In September 2021 the whole arch was wrapped — a posthumous work by Christo and Jeanne-Claude using about 25,000 m² of silvery-blue fabric and 3,000 m of red rope. It stayed up for just 16 days, and the fabric was recycled.","src":"Dezeen，2021 年 9 月","url":"https://www.dezeen.com/2021/09/17/arc-de-triomphe-wrapped-christo-jeanne-claude-installation-paris/amp/","say":{"en":"How do I get up to the top of the Arc?","zh":"怎么上到凯旋门顶上？"}},"小王子":{"what":"法国飞行员作家圣埃克苏佩里写的童话：一个从小星球来的男孩和一朵玫瑰、一只狐狸。","what_en":"The fable by French pilot-writer Saint-Exupéry: a boy from a tiny planet, his rose and a fox.","fame":"「真正重要的东西，眼睛是看不见的」——很多人学法语读的第一本书就是它，大人读也会哭。","fame_en":"'What is essential is invisible to the eye' — for many people it's the first book they read in French, and adults cry over it too.","fact":"它是世界上翻译最多的书之一：到 2024 年 2 月，官方统计已经有 571 种语言和方言的版本。","fact_en":"It's one of the most translated books in the world: by February 2024 the official count was 571 languages and dialects.","src":"Le Petit Prince 官方网站，2024 年 2 月","url":"https://www.lepetitprince.com/en/events-around-the-world/world-mother-language-day-with-the-little-prince/","say":{"en":"Do you have The Little Prince in English?","zh":"你们有英文版的《小王子》吗？"}},"普罗旺斯薰衣草":{"what":"法国南部普罗旺斯高原上一行一行的紫色花田，夏天开花。","what_en":"Rows of purple flowers on the high plains of Provence in southern France, blooming in summer.","fame":"六月底到七月，瓦朗索勒高原整片变成紫色，香得整条路都是味道，是拍照的人排队来的地方。","fame_en":"From late June into July the Valensole plateau turns purple and the whole road smells of it — photographers come in crowds.","fact":"你拍到的那片紫，大多其实不是「真薰衣草」，而是杂交的醒目薰衣草（lavandin）：低海拔也好种、出油多得多，但香味没那么细；真薰衣草要种在更高的山上，比如索村一带。","fact_en":"Most of the purple you photograph isn't 'true' lavender but lavandin, a hybrid that grows well at lower altitudes and gives far more oil, though its scent is coarser. True lavender grows higher up, around Sault.","src":"Lonely Planet","url":"https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/lavender-fields-france","say":{"en":"Is it OK to take photos in this field?","zh":"可以在这片花田里拍照吗？"}},"马赛鱼汤":{"what":"马赛渔民的炖鱼汤，好几种地中海鱼加番茄、橄榄油、藏红花一起煮。","what_en":"The Marseille fishermen's stew: several Mediterranean fish simmered with tomato, olive oil and saffron.","fame":"原来是渔民把卖不掉的杂鱼一锅炖，现在成了马赛最贵、最讲究的招牌菜：先喝汤，再吃鱼，配蒜蓉酱（rouille）和烤面包片。","fame_en":"Once the fish the fishermen couldn't sell, it's now Marseille's grandest dish: soup first, then the fish, with rouille and toasted bread.","fact":"1980 年，马赛 11 家餐馆订了一份《马赛鱼汤宪章》，规定哪些鱼要放（一定要有鲉鱼 rascasse）、怎么做，还要当着客人的面把鱼切开——因为有些店把随便什么鱼汤都叫马赛鱼汤。","fact_en":"In 1980, eleven Marseille restaurants drew up a Bouillabaisse Charter fixing the fish (rascasse is a must) and the method — the fish must even be carved in front of diners — because some places were calling any fish soup bouillabaisse.","src":"Wikipedia · Bouillabaisse","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bouillabaisse","say":{"en":"Is the bouillabaisse for two people?","zh":"这份马赛鱼汤是两人份的吗？"}},"戛纳电影节":{"what":"每年五月在法国南部海边小城戛纳办的电影节。","what_en":"The film festival held every May in Cannes, a seaside town in the south of France.","fame":"世界三大电影节之一，最高奖是金棕榈；明星走红毯、全世界的电影公司都来这儿买卖电影。","fame_en":"One of the world's three great film festivals: the top prize is the Palme d'Or, stars walk the red carpet, and studios from everywhere come to buy and sell films.","fact":"2025 年开幕前一天，电影节在章程里写明：红毯上不许全裸，也不许穿太大、拖尾太长的礼服——说是会挡路、让大家没法入座；主办方说这些规矩早就有，只是写清楚了。","fact_en":"The day before the 2025 festival opened, Cannes wrote it into its charter: no full nudity on the red carpet, and no overly voluminous gowns with long trains, which it said block guests and make seating hard. Organisers said the rules weren't new, just spelled out.","src":"CTV News，2025 年 5 月","url":"https://www.ctvnews.ca/photos/2025/05/14/celebrities-on-the-red-carpet-at-cannes-film-festival/","say":{"en":"Where can I see the red carpet from?","zh":"在哪儿能看到红毯？"}},"尼斯海滨":{"what":"法国蔚蓝海岸上的海滨城市尼斯，一条长长的「英国人散步大道」沿着海湾。","what_en":"Nice, on the French Riviera, with the long Promenade des Anglais curving around its bay.","fame":"天蓝色的海、一年三百天的太阳；两百年前英国贵族来这儿过冬，散步大道就是他们出钱修的，所以叫「英国人」。","fame_en":"Sky-blue sea and around 300 days of sun. Two centuries ago English aristocrats came here for the winter and paid for the promenade — hence the 'English'.","fact":"2021 年 7 月，尼斯以「里维埃拉的冬季度假城」整体列入世界遗产，范围约 522 公顷，从散步大道一直到博龙山和港口。","fact_en":"In July 2021 Nice was added to the World Heritage List as the 'Winter Resort Town of the Riviera' — about 522 hectares, from the Promenade des Anglais to Mont Boron and the port.","src":"Explore Nice Côte d'Azur（尼斯旅游局）","url":"https://explorenicecotedazur.com/en/inspirations/experiences/nice-is-inscribed-on-unesco-world-heritage-list/","say":{"en":"Is this beach all pebbles, or is there sand somewhere?","zh":"这片海滩全是鹅卵石吗，哪儿有沙子？"}},"丁丁历险记":{"what":"比利时漫画家埃尔热画的漫画：小记者丁丁和他的白狗白雪满世界冒险。","what_en":"The comic by Belgian artist Hergé: young reporter Tintin and his white dog Snowy, adventuring around the world.","fame":"被翻译成几十种语言、卖了两亿多本，布鲁塞尔满街都是丁丁的漫画墙，这座城市因此被叫作「漫画之都」。","fame_en":"Translated into dozens of languages and sold in the hundreds of millions, it's why Brussels has comic murals on its streets and calls itself a comic-strip capital.","fact":"2025 年 1 月 1 日，丁丁最早的 1929 年版本（《丁丁在苏联》里的黑白丁丁和白雪）在美国进入了公有领域；后来的故事和样子还受版权保护，在欧洲也还没到期。","fact_en":"On 1 January 2025 the very first Tintin — the black-and-white 1929 Tintin and Snowy of Tintin in the Land of the Soviets — entered the public domain in the US. Later stories and looks are still protected, and in Europe copyright runs much longer.","src":"Duke 大学公有领域研究中心 · Public Domain Day 2025","url":"https://web.law.duke.edu/cspd/publicdomainday/2025/","say":{"en":"Where's the Tintin mural from here?","zh":"丁丁的漫画墙从这儿怎么走？"}},"比利时巧克力":{"what":"比利时手工做的巧克力，尤其是里面包着馅的夹心巧克力（praline）。","what_en":"Belgium's handmade chocolates — above all pralines, chocolate shells with a filling inside.","fame":"布鲁塞尔的巧克力店一家挨一家，比利时是世界上最会做夹心巧克力的地方之一，来这儿的人几乎都要带一盒回去。","fame_en":"Brussels has chocolate shops one after another; Belgium is one of the world's great praline makers, and almost every visitor takes a box home.","fact":"夹心巧克力就是在布鲁塞尔发明的：药剂师的孙子让·诺豪斯 1912 年做出第一颗；1915 年他妻子路易丝嫌纸袋把巧克力压碎了，又设计了那种方方的礼盒 ballotin。店就在圣于贝尔长廊里，从 1857 年开到现在。","fact_en":"The filled praline was invented in Brussels: Jean Neuhaus, a pharmacist's grandson, made the first in 1912, and in 1915 his wife Louise designed the ballotin box because paper bags crushed them. The shop in the Galerie de la Reine has been there since 1857.","src":"Wikipedia · Neuhaus (chocolatier)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neuhaus_(chocolatier)","say":{"en":"Can I make my own box of twelve?","zh":"我可以自己挑十二颗装一盒吗？"}},"红十字会":{"what":"1863 年在瑞士日内瓦成立的人道组织，战争和灾难里救护伤员、探望战俘。","what_en":"The humanitarian movement founded in Geneva, Switzerland in 1863 to care for the wounded and visit prisoners in wars and disasters.","fame":"白底红十字是战场上「不许开枪」的标志；红十字旗就是瑞士国旗的颜色反过来，纪念它出生在瑞士。","fame_en":"The red cross on white means 'do not shoot' on a battlefield — the Swiss flag with its colours reversed, in honour of where it was born.","fact":"红十字国际委员会拿过三次诺贝尔和平奖（1917、1944、1963），是拿这个奖次数最多的。","fact_en":"The International Committee of the Red Cross has won the Nobel Peace Prize three times — 1917, 1944 and 1963 — more than any other laureate.","src":"NobelPrize.org","url":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/peace/1963/red-cross/facts/","say":{"en":"Which tram goes to the Red Cross Museum?","zh":"哪路电车去红十字博物馆？"}},"奶酪火锅":{"what":"瑞士冬天的锅：白葡萄酒和融化的奶酪在小锅里冒泡，用长叉子叉面包块去蘸。","what_en":"Switzerland's winter pot: cheese melted with white wine, bubbling away, with cubes of bread dipped in on long forks.","fame":"它是瑞士的国菜，冬天滑完雪、朋友一起围着一锅吃，又暖又热闹。","fame_en":"It's Switzerland's national dish — after a day's skiing, friends gather round one pot to get warm.","fact":"它成为「国菜」，有一半是广告做出来的：1930 年代瑞士奶酪产太多卖不掉，瑞士奶酪联盟到处推广奶酪火锅，喊出「奶酪火锅让人心情好」的口号，还把火锅套装送进军队。","fact_en":"Its 'national dish' status was partly marketing: in the 1930s Switzerland made more cheese than it could sell, so the Swiss Cheese Union promoted fondue everywhere — with slogans like 'fondue creates a good mood' — and even sent fondue sets to the army.","src":"Wikipedia · Fondue","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fondue","say":{"en":"Fondue for two, please — moitié-moitié.","zh":"两人份的奶酪火锅，要「一半一半」的。"}},"魁北克老城":{"what":"加拿大魁北克城的老城区，石头房子、窄窄的坡道，满街说法语。","what_en":"The old quarter of Quebec City in Canada: stone houses, steep narrow streets and French everywhere.","fame":"北美墨西哥以北唯一还留着城墙的城市，1985 年列入世界遗产；山顶上像城堡一样的芳堤娜城堡酒店，是全城最显眼的地方。","fame_en":"The only city north of Mexico that still has its walls, a World Heritage site since 1985, crowned by the castle-like Château Frontenac hotel.","fact":"1943 年 8 月和 1944 年 9 月，丘吉尔和罗斯福两次在这儿开「魁北克会议」，商量二战怎么打；各国将领就住在芳堤娜城堡酒店里。","fact_en":"In August 1943 and September 1944, Churchill and Roosevelt met here for the Quebec Conferences to plan the Second World War, with the Allied chiefs of staff staying at the Château Frontenac.","src":"Wikipedia · First Quebec Conference","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_Quebec_Conference","say":{"en":"Sorry, my French isn't great — do you speak English?","zh":"不好意思，我法语不太好，您会说英语吗？"}},"魁北克冬季狂欢节":{"what":"每年二月在魁北克城办的冬季节日：冰雕、雪地游行、冰上划船比赛。","what_en":"Quebec City's February winter festival: ice sculptures, night parades in the snow and canoe races across the frozen river.","fame":"世界最大的冬季狂欢节之一，吉祥物是戴红帽、系彩色腰带的雪人博诺姆（Bonhomme），零下二十度大家照样在外面玩。","fame_en":"One of the world's biggest winter carnivals, hosted by Bonhomme, the snowman in a red cap and arrow sash — people party outdoors at minus 20.","fact":"第一届其实早在 1894 年就办了，后来被两次世界大战和大萧条打断；现在这种每年一办的狂欢节是 1955 年开始的，那年 1 月市长把城市的钥匙交给了第一次露面的博诺姆。","fact_en":"The first carnival was held back in 1894, then interrupted by two world wars and the Depression. Today's yearly carnival began in 1955, when the mayor handed the city's keys to Bonhomme on his first public appearance.","src":"Ville de Québec（魁北克市政府）","url":"https://www.ville.quebec.qc.ca/en/citoyens/patrimoine/quartiers/saint_jean_baptiste/interet/carnaval_hiver_quebec.aspx","say":{"en":"Where do I buy the Bonhomme effigy pass?","zh":"博诺姆通行徽章在哪儿买？"}},"普丁薯条":{"what":"魁北克的薯条：热薯条上撒新鲜奶酪粒，再浇一层热肉汁。","what_en":"Quebec's fries: hot chips topped with fresh cheese curds and smothered in gravy.","fame":"半夜饿了、冬天冷了，魁北克人就来一盒；现在全加拿大都有，连连锁快餐店都卖。","fame_en":"Late at night or in deep winter, Quebecers grab a box; now it's sold all over Canada, even in fast-food chains.","fact":"谁发明的到今天还在吵：沃里克的一家店说 1957 年就有了，德拉蒙维尔的 Le Roy Jucep 说是他们；好吃的标准是奶酪粒要新鲜到在牙齿间「吱吱」响。","fact_en":"Who invented it is still argued over: a café in Warwick says it was serving it in 1957, while Le Roy Jucep in Drummondville claims it too. The test of a good one: curds fresh enough to squeak against your teeth.","src":"The Canadian Encyclopedia","url":"https://thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/en/article/history-of-poutine","say":{"en":"A regular poutine, please — extra curds.","zh":"一份中份普丁，奶酪粒多放点。"}},"太阳马戏团":{"what":"从加拿大魁北克出来的马戏团，没有动物，用杂技、音乐和灯光讲一个故事。","what_en":"A circus born in Quebec, Canada, with no animals — just acrobats, music and light telling a story.","fame":"1984 年几个街头艺人办起来，后来变成全世界最大的演出公司之一，拉斯维加斯常驻好几台秀，世界各地巡演。","fame_en":"Started by street performers in 1984, it grew into one of the world's biggest live-show companies, with several resident shows in Las Vegas and tours everywhere.","fact":"2020 年疫情让所有演出停掉，6 月它申请破产保护，裁掉了大约 95% 的员工（约 3500 人）；后来换了老板，演出才一台台恢复。","fact_en":"In 2020 the pandemic stopped every show. That June it filed for creditor protection and laid off about 95% of its staff — around 3,500 people — before new owners brought the shows back one by one.","src":"CBC News，2020 年 6 月","url":"https://www.cbc.ca/lite/story/1.5631354","say":{"en":"Are there still tickets for tonight's show?","zh":"今晚的演出还有票吗？"}},"戈雷岛":{"what":"塞内加尔首都达喀尔外海的小岛，坐船二三十分钟，岛上是彩色的殖民时期老房子。","what_en":"A small island off Dakar, Senegal, 20–30 minutes by ferry, lined with colourful colonial-era houses.","fame":"它是大西洋奴隶贸易的纪念地，「奴隶之家」和那扇面朝大海的「不归之门」，让来的人安静下来。","fame_en":"It's a memorial to the Atlantic slave trade; the House of Slaves and its 'Door of No Return' facing the sea leave visitors silent.","fact":"岛上没有汽车，只能走路；1978 年它是第一批 12 个列入联合国世界遗产的地方之一。","fact_en":"There are no cars on the island — you walk everywhere. In 1978 it was one of the first 12 places ever put on the UNESCO World Heritage List.","src":"Wikipedia · Gorée","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gor%C3%A9e","say":{"en":"What time is the last ferry back to Dakar?","zh":"回达喀尔的最后一班船几点？"}},"塞内加尔鱼饭":{"what":"塞内加尔的国菜 thieboudienne：番茄汤汁煮的米饭，上面放整块的鱼和木薯、胡萝卜、卷心菜。","what_en":"Senegal's national dish, thieboudienne: rice cooked in tomato sauce, topped with whole fish, cassava, carrot and cabbage.","fame":"中午一家人围着一个大盘子，用勺子或手吃；锅底那层焦脆的米（xoon）最抢手。","fame_en":"At lunch the family shares one big platter, eating with spoons or hands — and everyone fights over the crispy rice from the bottom of the pot.","fact":"2021 年 12 月，联合国教科文组织把它列入人类非物质文化遗产——列进去的不只是菜谱，还有一家人怎么做、怎么一起吃的这些习惯。","fact_en":"In December 2021 UNESCO added it to the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity list — not just the recipe, but the way families make it and eat it together.","src":"Africanews，2021 年 12 月","url":"https://www.africanews.com/2021/12/16/senegal-national-dish-added-to-unesco-heritage-list//","say":{"en":"This is delicious — can I have a little more rice?","zh":"太好吃了，能再给我一点饭吗？"}},"塞内加尔摔跤":{"what":"塞内加尔的传统摔跤 laamb，在沙地上比，把对手摔倒就赢。","what_en":"Laamb, Senegal's traditional wrestling, fought on sand — throw your opponent down and you win.","fame":"它是塞内加尔最火的运动，大比赛能坐满体育场；上场前选手要跳舞、念咒、往身上抹护身的药水，鼓声一直不停。","fame_en":"It's Senegal's most popular sport, filling stadiums for big bouts; before the fight wrestlers dance, chant and pour protective potions on themselves to non-stop drumming.","fact":"它是西非唯一可以用拳头打的传统摔跤：从 1990 年代起分成「带击打」和「不带击打」两种比法，大体育场的比赛通常是能出拳的那种。","fact_en":"It's the only West African wrestling tradition that allows punches. Since the 1990s there have been two versions — with and without striking — and the big stadium bouts usually allow punches.","src":"Wikipedia · Senegalese wrestling","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Senegalese_wrestling","say":{"en":"Who are you cheering for tonight?","zh":"今晚你支持谁？"}},"粉红湖":{"what":"达喀尔东北边约 30 公里的雷特巴湖，湖水是粉红色的，湖里还在采盐。","what_en":"Lake Retba, about 30 km northeast of Dakar, with pink water and salt still harvested from it.","fame":"湖水比海水咸很多，一种叫杜氏盐藻的微生物让它变成粉红色，太阳大、风小的日子最粉。","fame_en":"It's far saltier than the sea, and a microalga called Dunaliella salina turns it pink — pinkest on sunny, still days.","fact":"2022 年大雨后，政府把洪水引进湖里，湖水变淡、粉色没了，采盐人一下子没了活；抽了几年水，到 2026 年 7 月粉色回来了，采盐也重新开始。采盐的人下水前会在身上抹乳木果油保护皮肤。","fact_en":"After the 2022 floods, floodwater was diverted into the lake; it lost its salt and its colour, and the salt harvesters lost their work. After years of pumping, the pink was back by July 2026 and salt harvesting reopened. Harvesters still rub shea butter on their skin before wading in.","src":"Reuters / Asharq Al-Awsat，2026 年 7 月","url":"https://english.aawsat.com/node/5298799","say":{"en":"Is the lake pink today, or is it better later?","zh":"今天湖是粉的吗，还是晚点来更好？"}},"彩色渔船":{"what":"塞内加尔海边一排排长长的木头独木舟（pirogue），船身画满彩色图案。","what_en":"Rows of long wooden pirogues on Senegal's beaches, every hull painted in bright patterns.","fame":"渔业养活了塞内加尔约 50 万人，小渔船打的鱼占全国渔获的约八成；傍晚船靠岸，整片沙滩就是鱼市。","fame_en":"Fishing supports about half a million people in Senegal, and small boats bring in about 80% of the catch; when they land in the evening, the whole beach becomes a fish market.","fact":"每条船的花样都不一样：船身写着家人的名字，船头会画美国国旗、巴萨队徽，甚至 C 罗；有一种说法，连「塞内加尔」这个名字都来自沃洛夫语 Sunu gaal——「我们的独木舟」。","fact_en":"No two boats are painted alike: hulls carry the names of loved ones, and bows might show a US flag, the Barcelona badge or even Cristiano Ronaldo. One account even says the name 'Senegal' comes from the Wolof Sunu gaal — 'our pirogue'.","src":"AramcoWorld，2022 年","url":"https://www.aramcoworld.com/articles/2022/going-pirogue-the-boats-feeding-a-nation","say":{"en":"What did you catch today?","zh":"今天打到什么鱼了？"}},"涩谷十字路口":{"what":"东京涩谷站前那个大路口，绿灯一亮，五个方向的人同时一起过马路。","what_en":"The big crossing outside Shibuya Station in Tokyo — when the lights turn green, people walk from every direction at once.","fame":"据说一次绿灯能有上千人同时过，却几乎没人撞到人；电影、广告里一拍东京就拍它，旁边还有忠犬八公像。","fame_en":"Up to a thousand or so people can cross on one green light, and almost nobody bumps into anyone. Films and ads use it as the picture of Tokyo, and the Hachiko statue is right next to it.","fact":"因为很多人在街上喝酒闹事，涩谷区从 2024 年 10 月 1 日起，车站一带每天晚上 6 点到早上 5 点都不许在路上喝酒；以前只有万圣节和新年才禁。","fact_en":"After complaints about street drinking, Shibuya made it a rule from 1 October 2024: no drinking on the streets around the station from 6pm to 5am, every day. Before, the ban was only for Halloween and New Year.","src":"Time Out Tokyo，2024 年 10 月","url":"https://www.timeout.com/tokyo/news/public-drinking-is-now-banned-at-shibuya-every-day-all-year-round-100424","say":{"en":"Excuse me, which exit is the Hachiko statue?","zh":"请问，八公像在哪个出口？"}},"秋叶原":{"what":"东京的电器街，现在也是动漫、游戏、手办和女仆咖啡店最集中的地方，大家叫它 Akiba。","what_en":"Tokyo's electronics district — now also the centre for anime, games, figures and maid cafés. Locals call it Akiba.","fame":"几十年前大家来这儿买收音机、电脑零件，后来变成全世界动漫迷的「圣地」，一条街上全是多层的游戏厅和周边店。","fame_en":"Decades ago people came here for radios and computer parts; now it's a pilgrimage spot for anime fans worldwide, with whole streets of multi-floor arcades and merch shops.","fact":"名字来自一座防火的神社：1869 年一场大火烧光了这片，政府在空地上建了镇火社，大家把它叫作 Akiba，这一带就成了「秋叶原」。","fact_en":"The name comes from a fire-prevention shrine. After a fire destroyed the area in 1869, a 'fire-extinguishing' shrine was built on the cleared land. People nicknamed it Akiba, and the area became Akihabara.","src":"Wikipedia：Akihabara","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Akihabara","say":{"en":"Do you have this figure in a smaller size?","zh":"这个手办有小一点的吗？"}},"相扑":{"what":"日本的传统摔跤：两个大力士在圆形土台上对推，谁先出圈或除了脚底以外碰到地就输。","what_en":"Japan's traditional wrestling: two huge wrestlers push each other in a round clay ring — step out, or touch the ground with anything but your feet, and you lose.","fame":"比赛往往几秒钟就结束，但前面的撒盐、对视、跺脚仪式很长；最高等级叫「横纲」，一年只在东京、大阪、名古屋、福冈打六场大赛。","fame_en":"Bouts often last just seconds, but the salt-throwing, stare-downs and stomping before them take much longer. The top rank is yokozuna, and there are only six big tournaments a year, in Tokyo, Osaka, Nagoya and Fukuoka.","fact":"2025 年 10 月，大相扑在伦敦皇家阿尔伯特音乐厅比了 5 天——这是 34 年来第一次回伦敦，上一次也是在这个音乐厅，1991 年。","fact_en":"In October 2025, Grand Sumo spent five days at London's Royal Albert Hall — its first London tournament in 34 years. The last one was in the same hall, in 1991.","src":"日本相扑协会官网","url":"https://www.sumo.or.jp/EnKyokai/information?id=672","say":{"en":"Which wrestler is the yokozuna?","zh":"哪一位是横纲？"}},"金阁寺":{"what":"京都的一座寺院，池子边那座外墙贴满金箔的三层楼阁最有名，正式名字叫鹿苑寺。","what_en":"A Kyoto temple famous for its three-storey pavilion covered in gold leaf by a pond. Its official name is Rokuon-ji.","fame":"金色楼阁倒映在池水里，一年四季都像明信片；它是「古都京都的文化财」世界遗产的一部分。","fame_en":"The gold pavilion reflected in the pond looks like a postcard in every season. It's part of the 'Historic Monuments of Ancient Kyoto' World Heritage Site.","fact":"现在看到的楼阁是 1955 年重建的：1950 年一个 22 岁的见习僧人放火把原来的烧掉了；三岛由纪夫的小说《金阁寺》就是写这件事。","fact_en":"The pavilion you see today was rebuilt in 1955. In 1950, a 22-year-old trainee monk burned the original down — the event behind Yukio Mishima's novel The Temple of the Golden Pavilion.","src":"Wikipedia：Kinkaku-ji","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kinkaku-ji","say":{"en":"Where's the best spot to take a photo of the pavilion?","zh":"在哪里拍金阁最好看？"}},"宇治抹茶":{"what":"京都南边宇治产的抹茶：茶叶采摘前先遮光，再磨成细粉，整片叶子一起喝下去。","what_en":"Matcha from Uji, just south of Kyoto: the tea plants are shaded before picking, then the leaves are ground into a fine powder you drink whole.","fame":"宇治做茶做了几百年，被当成日本抹茶的代表；现在抹茶拿铁、抹茶冰淇淋全世界都有，很多都写着「宇治」。","fame_en":"Uji has made tea for centuries and is seen as the home of Japanese matcha. Matcha lattes and ice cream are now everywhere, and many proudly say 'Uji'.","fact":"全世界都在喝抹茶，京都的老茶铺一保堂 2025 年 8 月公告：抹茶全行业缺货，每人限购；京都 2025 年 5 月的市场价差不多是前一年的 2.7 倍。","fact_en":"With the whole world drinking matcha, the old Kyoto tea house Ippodo announced in August 2025 that the industry was short of matcha and limited how much each customer could buy. Kyoto's market price in May 2025 was about 2.7 times the year before.","src":"一保堂官网公告，2025 年 8 月","url":"https://global.ippodo-tea.co.jp/blogs/news/20250801","say":{"en":"Is this matcha for drinking or for baking?","zh":"这款抹茶是直接喝的还是做点心用的？"}},"任天堂":{"what":"京都的游戏公司，做了马力欧、宝可梦（合作）、塞尔达，还有 Switch 游戏机。","what_en":"The Kyoto game company behind Mario and Zelda (and a partner on Pokémon), and the Switch consoles.","fame":"1889 年在京都开始做花札纸牌，后来做出红白机、Game Boy、Wii，很多人的童年都是它的游戏。","fame_en":"It started in Kyoto in 1889 making hanafuda playing cards, then made the NES, Game Boy and Wii — a childhood for millions of people.","fact":"Switch 2 在 2025 年 6 月 5 日上市，头 4 天就卖了 350 多万台，是任天堂卖得最快的机器，很可能也是史上最快的游戏机首发。","fact_en":"The Switch 2 went on sale on 5 June 2025 and sold over 3.5 million units in its first four days — Nintendo's fastest-selling hardware and likely the biggest console launch ever.","src":"Press Start / 任天堂公告，2025 年 6 月","url":"https://press-start.com.au/news/nintendo/2025/06/11/the-nintendo-switch-2-sold-3-5-million-units-in-first-four-days-making-it-fastest-selling-console-of-all-time/","say":{"en":"Is this game in English or only Japanese?","zh":"这个游戏有英文吗，还是只有日文？"}},"艺伎":{"what":"日本学了多年舞蹈、三味线、待客礼仪的艺人，在茶屋的宴席上表演；京都叫艺妓（geiko），学徒叫舞妓。","what_en":"Japanese entertainers trained for years in dance, shamisen and hosting, who perform at teahouse banquets. In Kyoto they're called geiko, and apprentices are maiko.","fame":"白脸、红唇、华丽和服，是很多人心里「传统日本」的样子；京都祇园的石板小路是看到她们的地方。","fame_en":"White makeup, red lips and elaborate kimono — for many, the image of traditional Japan. Kyoto's stone-paved Gion lanes are where you might see them.","fact":"游客追着舞妓拍照、扯和服太多，祇园的居民协会 2024 年 4 月起请游客别进花见小路一带的私人小巷；主街花见小路还能走。","fact_en":"After too many tourists chased maiko for photos and even tore a kimono, Gion's residents' council asked visitors to stay out of its private side alleys from April 2024. The main Hanamikoji street stays open.","src":"AFP / eNCA，2024 年 3 月","url":"https://www.enca.com/lifestyle/tourists-banned-private-alleys-kyotos-geisha-district","say":{"en":"Is it okay to take photos on this street?","zh":"这条街可以拍照吗？"}},"奈良小鹿":{"what":"奈良公园里自由走来走去的一千多头野生鹿，被当作神的使者保护着。","what_en":"More than a thousand wild deer that roam freely in Nara Park, protected as messengers of the gods.","fame":"你买一包鹿饼干，鹿会向你点头「鞠躬」再来要；它们就在东大寺、春日大社旁边和游客一起散步。","fame_en":"Buy a pack of deer crackers and the deer will 'bow' to you for one. They wander with tourists right beside Todai-ji and Kasuga Taisha.","fact":"2025 年 7 月的调查数到 1465 头，是 1953 年开始用现在的方法数以来最多的；游客被鹿顶伤、咬伤的事也在变多。","fact_en":"The July 2025 count found 1,465 deer — the most since the current survey method began in 1953. Injuries to visitors from deer are rising too.","src":"Nippon.com，2025 年 9 月","url":"https://www.nippon.com/en/japan-data/h02496/","say":{"en":"Where can I buy deer crackers?","zh":"在哪里买鹿饼干？"}},"姬路城":{"what":"兵库县姬路市的一座白色城堡，四百多年前的天守阁一直保存到今天。","what_en":"A white castle in Himeji, Hyogo, whose main keep has survived for over 400 years.","fame":"白墙像一只展翅的白鹭，所以叫「白鹭城」；它躲过了战火和地震，是日本第一批世界遗产之一。","fame_en":"Its white walls look like a heron taking flight, so it's nicknamed the White Heron Castle. It survived wars and earthquakes and was one of Japan's first World Heritage Sites.","fact":"从 2026 年 3 月 1 日起，不住在姬路的成年人门票涨到 2500 日元，姬路市民还是 1000 日元，18 岁以下免费。","fact_en":"From 1 March 2026, adults who don't live in Himeji pay ¥2,500 to enter, while city residents still pay ¥1,000. Under-18s go free.","src":"Unseen Japan，2026 年","url":"https://unseen-japan.com/tourism-agency-dual-pricing-guidelines/","say":{"en":"How long does it take to walk up to the top floor?","zh":"走到最上面一层要多久？"}},"广岛和平纪念公园":{"what":"1945 年原子弹落下的地方旁边建起的公园，有原爆圆顶、和平资料馆和纪念碑。","what_en":"A park built next to where the atomic bomb fell in 1945, with the A-Bomb Dome, the Peace Memorial Museum and memorials.","fame":"这里提醒全世界核武器有多可怕；每年 8 月 6 日上午 8 点 15 分全城默哀，原爆圆顶是世界遗产。","fame_en":"It reminds the world how terrible nuclear weapons are. Every 6 August at 8:15am the city stops in silence, and the A-Bomb Dome is a World Heritage Site.","fact":"广岛和长崎的原爆幸存者组织「日本被团协」2024 年获得诺贝尔和平奖，因为他们几十年来一直讲自己的亲身经历，呼吁再也不要用核武器。","fact_en":"Nihon Hidankyo, the group of Hiroshima and Nagasaki atomic bomb survivors, won the 2024 Nobel Peace Prize for decades of telling their own stories so nuclear weapons are never used again.","src":"NPR，2024 年 10 月","url":"https://www.npr.org/2024/10/11/nx-s1-5148728/2024-nobel-peace-prize","say":{"en":"Where can I leave these paper cranes?","zh":"这些纸鹤可以放在哪里？"}},"宫岛鸟居":{"what":"广岛附近宫岛上严岛神社的大红鸟居，涨潮时像漂在海上。","what_en":"The big red torii gate of Itsukushima Shrine on Miyajima near Hiroshima — at high tide it seems to float on the sea.","fame":"被叫作日本三景之一；涨潮时坐船从它前面经过，退潮时可以走到鸟居脚下。","fame_en":"It's one of Japan's 'three great views'. At high tide you can pass it by boat; at low tide you can walk right up to its base.","fact":"去宫岛要交「访问税」：2023 年 10 月起每人每次 100 日元，直接算在渡轮票里，用来维护岛上的厕所、文物和自然。","fact_en":"Visiting Miyajima comes with a tax: since October 2023, ¥100 per person per visit, built into the ferry ticket, to pay for toilets, heritage and nature on the island.","src":"Japan Travel，2023 年","url":"https://jal.japantravel.com/hiroshima/miyajima-implements-visitor-tax-to-tourists/70298","say":{"en":"What time is low tide today?","zh":"今天几点退潮？"}},"博多拉面":{"what":"福冈的猪骨拉面：奶白色的浓汤、很细的直面。","what_en":"Fukuoka's pork-bone ramen: creamy white tonkotsu broth with very thin, straight noodles.","fame":"面细，几十秒就煮好；吃完面汤还剩着，可以喊「替玉」再加一份面。一兰、一风堂都是从福冈开出去的。","fame_en":"The thin noodles cook in seconds, and when they're gone you can call 'kaedama' for a refill into the leftover soup. Ichiran and Ippudo both started in Fukuoka.","fact":"「替玉」据说是长浜鱼市旁的元祖长浜屋开始的：卖完鱼的渔夫要吃得快，就只加面不加汤。","fact_en":"The 'kaedama' refill is said to have started at Ganso Nagahamaya by the Nagahama fish market — fishermen wanted to eat fast, so they ordered more noodles instead of a new bowl.","src":"Tsunagu Japan","url":"https://www.tsunagujapan.com/hungry-in-hakata-here-are-8-recommended-ramen-places/","say":{"en":"Extra-firm noodles, please — and one kaedama later.","zh":"面要硬一点，等下再加一份面。"}},"熊本熊":{"what":"熊本县的吉祥物：一只黑熊，脸上两团红脸蛋，正式身份是县政府的「营业部长」。","what_en":"Kumamoto Prefecture's mascot: a black bear with two red cheeks, officially the prefecture's 'sales manager'.","fame":"2011 年在全国吉祥物人气投票里拿了第一，之后红遍日本和亚洲，表情包、零食包装上到处都是它。","fame_en":"It came first in a national mascot vote in 2011 and became a star across Japan and Asia — on memes and snack packets everywhere.","fact":"为什么到处都是它？熊本县只要你的东西是在帮熊本做宣传，就免费让你用熊本熊的形象；2018 年起外国公司也可以申请。","fact_en":"Why is it everywhere? Kumamoto lets people use Kumamon's image for free as long as the product promotes the prefecture — and since 2018 foreign companies can apply too.","src":"Wikipedia：Kumamon","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kumamon","say":{"en":"Where can I meet Kumamon in person?","zh":"在哪里能见到真的熊本熊？"}},"樱花":{"what":"日本春天开的樱花，最常见的品种叫染井吉野，三四月从南往北一路开过去。","what_en":"Japan's spring cherry blossoms. The most common kind is Somei-Yoshino, opening from south to north in March and April.","fame":"开花只有一个多星期，大家在树下铺布野餐喝酒叫「花见」；新闻天天播「樱花前线」开到哪了。","fame_en":"The blossoms last just over a week. People picnic and drink under the trees — hanami — and the news tracks the 'cherry blossom front' every day.","fact":"全日本的染井吉野几乎都是同一棵树嫁接出来的「克隆」；2024 年的研究测了各地 46 棵的基因，用小突变倒推出它们是怎么一路传开的。","fact_en":"Almost every Somei-Yoshino tree in Japan is a grafted clone of one original tree. A 2024 study sequenced 46 of them from around the country and used tiny mutations to trace how they spread.","src":"Shirasawa 等，2024 年论文（PMC）","url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11369696/","say":{"en":"Is this spot free for hanami, or do we need to book?","zh":"这里赏花是随便坐，还是要预约？"}},"地狱谷雪猴":{"what":"长野县山里一群野生猕猴，冬天下雪时会泡进温泉里取暖。","what_en":"A troop of wild Japanese macaques in the mountains of Nagano that soak in hot springs when it snows.","fame":"头上落着雪、闭着眼泡温泉的猴子照片传遍全世界，它们是住得最北的非人类灵长类。","fame_en":"Photos of monkeys bathing with snow on their heads went around the world. They're the most northerly living non-human primates.","fact":"京都大学 2018 年的研究：冬天泡温泉的母猴，体内的压力激素会降低——它们泡的不只是暖和，也是「放松」；游客多少对它们的压力没影响。","fact_en":"A 2018 Kyoto University study found that hot-spring bathing lowered stress hormones in female monkeys in winter — it's relaxation, not just warmth. Tourist numbers made no difference to their stress.","src":"京都大学，2018 年 4 月","url":"https://www.kyoto-u.ac.jp/en/research/research_results/2018/180404_1.html","say":{"en":"How long is the walk to the monkey park?","zh":"走到猴子公园要多久？"}},"白川乡":{"what":"岐阜县山里的小村子，留着几十栋茅草屋顶很陡的「合掌造」老房子。","what_en":"A mountain village in Gifu with dozens of old gassho-zukuri farmhouses under steep thatched roofs.","fame":"屋顶陡得像双手合十，雪才不会压垮；下雪的晚上亮灯像童话，是世界遗产。","fame_en":"The roofs are steep like hands pressed together in prayer so snow slides off. On snowy nights the lit-up village looks like a fairy tale, and it's a World Heritage Site.","fact":"冬天的夜晚亮灯太火，路都堵死；现在一年只亮几个晚上，全部要提前预约，2026 年是 1 月 12、18、25 日和 2 月 1 日，当天去不让进。","fact_en":"The winter light-up got so popular the roads jammed. Now it runs only a few nights a year and you must book ahead — in 2026 it was 12, 18 and 25 January and 1 February, with no same-day entry.","src":"Japaholic，2025 年","url":"https://en.japaholic.com/shirakawago-light-up-for-2026/","say":{"en":"Can we go inside one of the thatched houses?","zh":"可以进去看一栋茅草屋吗？"}},"白金汉宫":{"what":"英国国王在伦敦的办公和居住地，门口有卫兵换岗。","what_en":"The King's London home and office, with guards changing outside the gates.","fame":"王室的「大客厅」：国事访问、授勋、婚礼和庆典后王室成员站阳台挥手，都在这里；夏天游客还能进去参观国事厅。","fame_en":"It's the royal family's front room: state visits, honours ceremonies, and the famous balcony waves after weddings and celebrations all happen here. In summer, visitors can tour the State Rooms.","fact":"正对林荫路、有那个著名阳台的东翼，建成 175 年都没对外开放过，直到 2024 年夏天才第一次让游客进去，最后一站就是通往阳台的那间屋子。","fact_en":"The East Wing — the front with the famous balcony — stayed closed to the public for 175 years. Visitors went inside for the first time in summer 2024, and the tour ends in the room that opens onto the balcony.","src":"Royal Collection Trust 新闻稿","url":"https://www.rct.uk/about/press-office/press-releases/buckingham-palace-east-wing-tours-and-ps1-tickets","say":{"en":"What time is the Changing of the Guard today?","zh":"今天卫兵换岗是几点？"}},"英式下午茶":{"what":"下午三四点的一顿小点心：一壶茶，配三明治、司康饼和蛋糕。","what_en":"A small meal around 3 or 4pm: a pot of tea with sandwiches, scones and cakes.","fame":"英国人「喝茶文化」最隆重的样子，三层点心架一端上来就很英国；酒店、茶室都有，过生日、请妈妈吃饭常选它。","fame_en":"It's British tea culture at its fanciest — the three-tier stand says \"England\" the moment it arrives. Hotels and tearooms all serve it, and it's a classic for birthdays or treating your mum.","fact":"下午茶在英国其实也叫 low tea，因为是坐在客厅矮扶手椅、矮茶几旁吃的；而 high tea 原本是工人下班后在餐桌上吃的晚饭，有肉有菜，跟精致点心不是一回事。","fact_en":"Afternoon tea is also called \"low tea\", because it was taken in low armchairs by low side tables. \"High tea\" was originally a working family's evening meal at the dining table, with meat and vegetables — nothing like dainty cakes.","src":"Wikipedia：Tea (meal)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tea_(meal)","say":{"en":"Could we have some more hot water for the pot, please?","zh":"能再给我们的茶壶加点热水吗？"}},"福尔摩斯":{"what":"柯南·道尔笔下的侦探，住在伦敦贝克街 221B。","what_en":"Arthur Conan Doyle's detective, who lives at 221B Baker Street, London.","fame":"最有名的虚构侦探，「观察 + 推理」的代名词；一百多年来被拍成无数电影和剧，BBC 的《神探夏洛克》让他又火了一遍。","fame_en":"The world's most famous fictional detective — shorthand for observing and deducing. He's been filmed countless times in over a century, and the BBC's Sherlock made him a star all over again.","fact":"柯南·道尔写书的时候，贝克街门牌根本没到 221 号。今天的福尔摩斯博物馆其实夹在 237 号和 241 号之间，「221B」这个号是后来特批的；过去几十年寄给福尔摩斯的信，都送到了占着 219–229 号的一家银行。","fact_en":"When Conan Doyle wrote the stories, Baker Street's numbers didn't reach 221. Today's Sherlock Holmes Museum actually sits between numbers 237 and 241 — \"221B\" was granted specially. For decades, letters to Holmes went to a building society at 219–229.","src":"Wikipedia：221B Baker Street","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/221B_Baker_Street","say":{"en":"Is this the queue for the Sherlock Holmes Museum?","zh":"这是排福尔摩斯博物馆的队吗？"}},"巨石阵":{"what":"英格兰南部草原上一圈巨大的石头，大约 5000 年前开始建。","what_en":"A ring of giant stones on the plains of southern England, begun about 5,000 years ago.","fame":"史前人怎么把几十吨的石头运来、立起来，到现在还在争；夏至那天太阳正好从石阵对着的方向升起，每年有上万人来看日出。","fame_en":"How prehistoric people moved and raised stones weighing tonnes is still debated. On the summer solstice the sun rises in line with the stones, and thousands come to watch.","fact":"2024 年《自然》杂志的研究发现，石阵中间那块约 6 吨重的「祭坛石」不是来自威尔士，而是来自约 750 公里外的苏格兰东北部——怎么运过来的，还没人知道。","fact_en":"A 2024 study in Nature found the six-tonne Altar Stone at the centre came not from Wales but from north-east Scotland, about 750 km away. Nobody yet knows how it was moved.","src":"UCL 新闻，2024 年 8 月","url":"https://www.ucl.ac.uk/news/2024/aug/stonehenge-altar-stone-came-scotland-not-wales","say":{"en":"Which bus goes back to Salisbury?","zh":"哪班车回索尔兹伯里？"}},"牛津大学":{"what":"英国牛津城里的一所大学，由三十多个学院组成，是英语世界最老的大学。","what_en":"A university in the English city of Oxford, made up of over thirty colleges — the oldest in the English-speaking world.","fame":"1096 年就有人在这儿教书；出过几十位英国首相和许多诺奖得主，《哈利·波特》的大礼堂也照着这里的食堂拍。","fame_en":"Teaching was going on here by 1096. It has educated dozens of British prime ministers and many Nobel winners, and Harry Potter's Great Hall was modelled on a college dining hall here.","fact":"牛津的博德利图书馆从 1610 年起就有权要英国出版的每一本书各一本，到今天还是英国六个「法定送存图书馆」之一，书已经多到要放到城外的仓库里。","fact_en":"Since 1610, Oxford's Bodleian Library has had the right to a copy of every book published in England. It's still one of the UK's six legal deposit libraries — so many books arrive that many are stored in a warehouse outside the city.","src":"Wikipedia：Bodleian Library","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bodleian_Library","say":{"en":"Are visitors allowed into this college today?","zh":"这个学院今天让游客进吗？"}},"莎士比亚":{"what":"四百多年前的英国剧作家和诗人，写了《哈姆雷特》《罗密欧与朱丽叶》。","what_en":"The English playwright and poet of over 400 years ago who wrote Hamlet and Romeo and Juliet.","fame":"英语里最有名的作家，全世界的舞台都还在演他的戏；很多今天的常用说法，比如 break the ice、wild-goose chase，都出自他的剧本。","fame_en":"The most famous writer in English, still performed on stages worldwide. Everyday phrases like \"break the ice\" and \"wild-goose chase\" come from his plays.","fact":"他去世 7 年后，两位演员同事在 1623 年把他的剧本编成《第一对开本》。其中 18 部戏——包括《麦克白》《暴风雨》《第十二夜》——以前从没印过，没有这本书可能就失传了。","fact_en":"Seven years after his death, two actor friends collected his plays in the First Folio of 1623. Eighteen of them — including Macbeth, The Tempest and Twelfth Night — had never been printed, and might have been lost without it.","src":"Royal Shakespeare Company","url":"https://www.rsc.org.uk/news/celebrating-the-plays-that-might-have-been-lost","say":{"en":"Are there any standing tickets left for tonight?","zh":"今晚还有站票吗？"}},"牛顿":{"what":"十七世纪的英国科学家，提出了万有引力和三大运动定律。","what_en":"The 17th-century English scientist behind the law of gravity and the three laws of motion.","fame":"「苹果掉下来」的故事让人人都知道他；他还发明了微积分（和莱布尼茨同时）、发现白光能分成彩虹的颜色，物理课一半都在学他。","fame_en":"The falling-apple story made him a household name. He also developed calculus (alongside Leibniz) and showed white light splits into a rainbow — half of school physics is his.","fact":"传说里那棵苹果树还活着，在他林肯郡老家伍尔斯索普庄园。1816 年一场风暴把它吹倒，但树干又重新扎了根，现在每年春天照样开花结果。","fact_en":"The apple tree from the story is still alive at Woolsthorpe Manor, his family home in Lincolnshire. A storm blew it down in 1816, but it re-rooted and still blossoms and fruits every year.","src":"Snopes 核查","url":"https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/isaac-newtons-apple-tree/","say":{"en":"Is that the famous apple tree?","zh":"那就是那棵有名的苹果树吗？"}},"达尔文":{"what":"十九世纪的英国博物学家，提出了「自然选择」的进化论。","what_en":"The 19th-century English naturalist who proposed evolution by natural selection.","fame":"坐「小猎犬号」环游世界五年，回来写了《物种起源》，彻底改变了人们怎么看生命和人类自己。","fame_en":"He sailed round the world for five years on HMS Beagle, then wrote On the Origin of Species — changing how we see life and ourselves.","fact":"剑桥大学图书馆有两本达尔文笔记本（其中一本画着 1837 年那幅「生命之树」）丢了 20 多年；2022 年 3 月被人匿名送回，装在一个粉色礼品袋里，纸条上写着「图书馆员 复活节快乐 X」。","fact_en":"Two Darwin notebooks — one with his 1837 \"Tree of Life\" sketch — went missing from Cambridge University Library for over 20 years. In March 2022 they were anonymously returned in a pink gift bag with a note: \"Librarian, Happy Easter X\".","src":"剑桥大学新闻，2022 年 4 月","url":"https://www.cam.ac.uk/stories/darwins-tree-of-life","say":{"en":"Where can I find the Darwin statue?","zh":"达尔文的雕像在哪儿？"}},"披头士乐队":{"what":"1960 年代来自利物浦的四人乐队：列侬、麦卡特尼、哈里森、斯塔尔。","what_en":"The four-piece band from 1960s Liverpool: Lennon, McCartney, Harrison and Starr.","fame":"史上卖唱片最多的乐队，《Hey Jude》《Let It Be》到现在还到处在放；他们走过的艾比路斑马线天天有人排队拍照。","fame_en":"The best-selling band in history; Hey Jude and Let It Be still play everywhere, and people queue every day to photograph themselves on the Abbey Road zebra crossing.","fact":"2023 年发行的「最后一首披头士歌」《Now and Then》，用机器学习把列侬 70 年代录的小样里的人声分离出来，2025 年拿了格莱美最佳摇滚表演奖。","fact_en":"\"Now and Then\", released in 2023 as the last Beatles song, used machine learning to lift John Lennon's voice from a 1970s home demo. It won the Grammy for Best Rock Performance in 2025.","src":"Wikipedia：Now and Then (Beatles song)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Now_and_Then_(Beatles_song)","say":{"en":"Could you take a photo of us on the crossing?","zh":"能帮我们在斑马线上拍张照吗？"}},"曼彻斯特足球":{"what":"曼彻斯特的两支英超球队：红色的曼联和蓝色的曼城。","what_en":"Manchester's two Premier League clubs: red Manchester United and blue Manchester City.","fame":"曼联是全世界球迷最多的球队之一，主场老特拉福德叫「梦剧场」；曼城近几年拿冠军拿到手软，两队的「曼市德比」全城都会停下来看。","fame_en":"United have one of the biggest fanbases on Earth and play at Old Trafford, the \"Theatre of Dreams\"; City have won trophy after trophy lately. When they meet in the derby, the whole city stops.","fact":"2025 年 3 月，曼联宣布要在老特拉福德旁边新建一座 10 万座的球场，预计花约 20 亿英镑，建成后会是英国最大的体育场。","fact_en":"In March 2025, Manchester United announced plans for a new 100,000-seat stadium next to Old Trafford, costing about £2 billion — it would be the biggest in Britain.","src":"Eyewitness News / Reuters，2025 年 3 月","url":"https://www.ewn.co.za/2025/03/11/manchester-united-announce-plans-for-new-100-000-seat-stadium","say":{"en":"Which way to Old Trafford on match day?","zh":"比赛日去老特拉福德往哪走？"}},"哈利·波特":{"what":"J.K. 罗琳写的七本魔法学校小说，主角是巫师男孩哈利。","what_en":"J.K. Rowling's seven novels about Harry, a boy wizard at a school of magic.","fame":"全世界卖了五亿多本，拍成八部电影；伦敦国王十字车站的「9¾ 站台」、伦敦附近的华纳片场，天天挤满了粉丝。","fame_en":"Over 500 million copies sold and eight films. Platform 9¾ at King's Cross and the Warner Bros. studio near London are packed with fans every day.","fact":"1997 年第一本《哈利·波特与魔法石》精装只印了 500 本，其中约 300 本给了图书馆。现在偶尔有一本出现在拍卖会上，能卖到几万英镑。","fact_en":"The first hardback print run of Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone in 1997 was just 500 copies, about 300 of them sent to libraries. When one turns up at auction today it can fetch tens of thousands of pounds.","src":"Wikipedia：Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_Potter_and_the_Philosopher%27s_Stone","say":{"en":"How long is the wait for the Platform 9¾ photo?","zh":"排 9¾ 站台拍照要等多久？"}},"苏格兰风笛":{"what":"苏格兰的大风笛：一个皮袋子连着几根管子，吹起来声音特别响。","what_en":"The Great Highland bagpipe: a bag joined to several pipes, and very, very loud.","fame":"苏格兰的声音名片——婚礼、葬礼、足球赛、新年和爱丁堡军乐节上都少不了；穿苏格兰裙的风笛手是爱丁堡街头最常见的风景。","fame_en":"Scotland's signature sound — at weddings, funerals, football, Hogmanay and the Edinburgh Military Tattoo. A kilted piper is a classic Edinburgh street sight.","fact":"1972 年，苏格兰皇家龙骑兵卫队用风笛吹的《奇异恩典》拿下英国单曲榜冠军，连续五周第一，还是那一年英国卖得最好的单曲。","fact_en":"In 1972, the Royal Scots Dragoon Guards' bagpipe version of \"Amazing Grace\" went to number one in the UK, stayed there for five weeks, and was the year's best-selling single.","src":"Far Out Magazine","url":"https://faroutmagazine.co.uk/song-number-one-longest-1972/","say":{"en":"That was brilliant — can I put something in your case?","zh":"太好听了——我能放点钱在你的琴盒里吗？"}},"高地牛":{"what":"苏格兰高地的一种长毛牛，红棕色长刘海，长着长角。","what_en":"A long-haired cattle breed from the Scottish Highlands, with a shaggy russet fringe and long horns.","fame":"看起来像毛绒玩具，是苏格兰明信片、冰箱贴上的「顶流」；厚毛让它们在又冷又湿的高地户外过冬也不怕。","fame_en":"They look like soft toys and are the stars of Scottish postcards and fridge magnets. Their thick coats let them winter outdoors in the cold, wet Highlands.","fact":"一群高地牛在英语里不叫 herd，叫 fold——因为以前冬天夜里，人们把它们关在叫 fold 的露天石圈里挡风。养牛人的高地牛协会 1884 年就成立了。","fact_en":"A group of Highland cattle is called a \"fold\", not a herd — in winter they used to be kept at night in open stone shelters called folds. The breeders' Highland Cattle Society was founded back in 1884.","src":"Wikipedia：Highland cattle","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highland_cattle","say":{"en":"Is it OK to take a photo of the coos from here?","zh":"从这儿给这些高地牛拍照可以吗？"}},"苏格兰威士忌":{"what":"在苏格兰用麦芽或谷物酿、放进橡木桶陈年的烈酒。","what_en":"Spirit made in Scotland from malted barley or grain and aged in oak casks.","fame":"全世界最有名的威士忌，一百多家酒厂各有味道：艾雷岛的带烟熏味，斯佩塞的偏花果香；它也是英国最赚钱的出口食品饮料之一。","fame_en":"The world's best-known whisky, from well over a hundred distilleries — smoky on Islay, fruity on Speyside. It's one of the UK's biggest food and drink exports.","fact":"按 2009 年的法规，必须在苏格兰的橡木桶里放满至少 3 年才能叫 Scotch whisky；还有，苏格兰的 whisky 不带 e，爱尔兰和美国的才写成 whiskey。","fact_en":"Under the 2009 regulations, it must mature in oak casks in Scotland for at least three years before it can be called Scotch whisky. And Scotland spells it \"whisky\" — with no \"e\", unlike Irish and American \"whiskey\".","src":"英国法规 The Scotch Whisky Regulations 2009","url":"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2009/2890/regulation/3","say":{"en":"Could I try something not too smoky?","zh":"能试一款烟熏味不太重的吗？"}},"尼斯湖水怪":{"what":"传说住在苏格兰尼斯湖里的长脖子怪兽，昵称 Nessie。","what_en":"A long-necked monster said to live in Loch Ness in Scotland, nicknamed Nessie.","fame":"全世界最出名的「未解之谜」之一，几十年来不断有人说看见了；湖边的小镇靠它吸引了大批游客。","fame_en":"One of the world's most famous mysteries — people have claimed sightings for decades, and the lochside villages draw crowds of visitors thanks to her.","fact":"2023 年 8 月，尼斯湖搞了 50 年来规模最大的一次搜寻：约 200 人带着热成像无人机和水下听音器上阵，结果什么也没找到。","fact_en":"In August 2023, Loch Ness saw its biggest search in 50 years: about 200 volunteers with thermal drones and an underwater hydrophone. They found nothing.","src":"NPR，2023 年 8 月","url":"https://www.npr.org/2023/08/21/1195016459/monster-hunters-largest-search-for-the-loch-ness-monster-in-50-yearss","say":{"en":"What time does the next boat trip on the loch leave?","zh":"下一班游湖的船几点开？"}},"纽约贝果":{"what":"中间有个洞的圈圈面包，先在水里煮一下再烤，外皮有嚼劲，里面很紧实。","what_en":"A ring-shaped bread that's boiled before it's baked — chewy crust, dense inside.","fame":"纽约人的早饭：街角的贝果店切开一个，抹厚厚的奶油奶酪（schmear），再夹熏三文鱼。一百多年前犹太移民带来，后来成了全城的味道。","fame_en":"It's New York's breakfast: split, spread thick with cream cheese (a 'schmear'), maybe topped with lox. Jewish immigrants brought it over a century ago, and it became the whole city's taste.","fact":"以前纽约的贝果全靠手工，做贝果的师傅有自己的工会（Local 338），要一小时搓 832 个才能入会；1951 年 12 月他们罢工，全城 34 家贝果店关了 32 家，报纸叫它「贝果饥荒」。","fact_en":"New York bagels used to be all hand-rolled by a union, Local 338 — you had to roll 832 an hour to join. When they struck in December 1951, 32 of the city's 34 bagel bakeries shut, and papers called it a 'bagel famine'.","src":"Untapped New York，2020 年","url":"https://untappedcities.com/2020/11/24/notorious-bagel-famines-new-york-city/","say":{"en":"Can I get an everything bagel with cream cheese, toasted?","zh":"我要一个全料贝果，加奶油奶酪，烤一下。"}},"华尔街铜牛":{"what":"华尔街附近保龄球绿地上一头低头冲撞的大铜牛，三吨多重。","what_en":"A bronze bull charging head-down at Bowling Green, near Wall Street — it weighs over three tonnes.","fame":"铜牛代表「牛市」——股票一直涨。来纽约的人都要排队跟它合影，还有人去摸它的鼻子和……后面，说能带来好运。","fame_en":"The bull stands for a 'bull market' — stocks going up. Visitors queue to take photos, and some rub its nose (or the other end) for luck.","fact":"它最早是「非法」的：1987 年股灾后，意大利艺术家迪莫迪卡自己花了大约 36 万美元铸了它，1989 年 12 月半夜找朋友用卡车和吊车偷偷放在纽约证券交易所门前，当天就被警察拉走，几天后才挪到现在的地方。","fact_en":"It started out illegal: after the 1987 crash, Italian artist Arturo Di Modica paid about $360,000 to cast it, and one night in December 1989 he and friends used a truck and crane to drop it outside the New York Stock Exchange. Police removed it that day; days later it found its current home.","src":"Wikipedia：Charging Bull","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charging_Bull","say":{"en":"Could you take a photo of us with the bull?","zh":"能帮我们跟铜牛拍张照吗？"}},"中央公园":{"what":"曼哈顿正中间一块长方形的大公园，南北四公里，有湖、草坪、树林和动物园。","what_en":"A huge rectangle of green in the middle of Manhattan — four kilometres long, with lakes, lawns, woods and a zoo.","fame":"纽约人的后院：跑步、遛狗、野餐、冬天滑冰都在这儿；无数电影在这里拍。1858 年设计，每年有约四千万人次来。","fame_en":"It's New Yorkers' backyard: running, dog walks, picnics, ice-skating in winter — and the set of countless films. Designed in 1858, it gets around 40 million visits a year.","fact":"2018 年 6 月 27 日起，公园里的环路彻底不让汽车开了，只留给跑步、骑车和马车；只有横穿公园的四条下沉马路还走车。","fact_en":"Since 27 June 2018, the park's loop drives have been completely car-free — left to runners, cyclists and carriages. Only the four sunken crosstown roads still carry traffic.","src":"Central Park Conservancy，2018 年","url":"https://www.centralparknyc.org/press/car-free-park","say":{"en":"Which way to Bethesda Fountain?","zh":"请问贝塞斯达喷泉往哪边走？"}},"百老汇":{"what":"曼哈顿时代广场一带四十多家大剧院，专演音乐剧和话剧。","what_en":"Forty-odd big theatres around Times Square in Manhattan, putting on musicals and plays.","fame":"世界音乐剧的最高舞台，《狮子王》《汉密尔顿》都在这儿；拿托尼奖是演员的梦想。买不起正价票的人会抽「彩票」或去 TKTS 买当天的折扣票。","fame_en":"It's the world's top stage for musicals — The Lion King, Hamilton — and a Tony Award is every actor's dream. People without full-price money enter ticket lotteries or queue at TKTS for same-day discounts.","fact":"演出时间最长的《歌剧魅影》在 2023 年 4 月 16 日落幕，演了 35 年、13981 场；疫情后外国游客回来得慢，制作方说一直在亏钱。","fact_en":"The Phantom of the Opera, Broadway's longest-running show, closed on 16 April 2023 after 35 years and 13,981 performances; producers said it had been losing money as overseas visitors were slow to return after Covid.","src":"AP / WUSF，2023 年 4 月","url":"https://www.wusf.org/2023-04-15/phantom-of-the-opera-takes-a-final-broadway-bow-after-13-981-performances","say":{"en":"Are there any rush tickets left for tonight?","zh":"今晚还有当天的便宜票吗？"}},"波士顿倾茶事件":{"what":"1773 年 12 月 16 日晚上，波士顿人扮成印第安人，把东印度公司三条船上的茶叶全倒进了港口。","what_en":"On the night of 16 December 1773, Bostonians disguised as Native Americans dumped the East India Company's tea from three ships into the harbour.","fame":"他们喊的是「无代表，不纳税」——英国国会里没有他们的人，凭什么收他们的茶税。英国随后严厉惩罚波士顿，两年后独立战争打响。","fame_en":"Their cry was 'no taxation without representation' — they had no voice in Parliament, so why pay its tea tax? Britain punished Boston hard, and two years later the War of Independence began.","fact":"那晚倒进海里的 340 箱茶里，已知留下来的只有两箱。其中一箱是 15 岁的约翰·罗宾逊第二天早上在岸边捡到的，现在放在波士顿倾茶事件船舶博物馆。","fact_en":"Of the 340 chests thrown in that night, only two are known to survive. One was found on the shore the next morning by 15-year-old John Robinson — it's now in the Boston Tea Party Ships & Museum.","src":"Boston Tea Party Ships & Museum","url":"https://www.bostonteapartyship.com/partners/a-box-worth-keeping","say":{"en":"Do we get to throw the tea overboard on the tour?","zh":"参观的时候我们能自己把茶扔下船吗？"}},"哈佛大学":{"what":"在波士顿河对岸剑桥市的大学，1636 年建校，是美国最老的大学。","what_en":"A university in Cambridge, across the river from Boston — founded in 1636, the oldest in the US.","fame":"出过 8 位美国总统和一百多位诺贝尔奖得主，是世界上最有名的大学之一；红砖楼和老院子（Harvard Yard）一年四季都挤满游客。","fame_en":"It has produced eight US presidents and over a hundred Nobel laureates, one of the most famous universities on earth; its red-brick Harvard Yard is packed with visitors all year.","fact":"老院子里约翰·哈佛的铜像外号「三个谎言的雕像」：像上的人不是他（他的画像 1764 年全烧了，模特是个学生）；他不是创办人，只是捐赠人；底座刻的 1638 年也不对，学校 1636 年就建了。","fact_en":"The John Harvard statue is nicknamed 'the statue of three lies': it isn't him (all his portraits burned in 1764, so a student posed), he wasn't the founder but a donor, and the date carved on it, 1638, is wrong — the college dates to 1636.","src":"Harvard Gazette，2019 年","url":"https://news.harvard.edu/gazette/story/2019/09/iconic-john-harvard-statue-is-the-star-of-the-yard/","say":{"en":"Where does the campus tour start?","zh":"校园导览从哪里出发？"}},"波士顿马拉松":{"what":"每年四月第三个星期一（爱国者日）在波士顿跑的马拉松，从霍普金顿跑到市中心。","what_en":"A marathon held every April on the third Monday (Patriots' Day), running from Hopkinton into downtown Boston.","fame":"1897 年开始，是世界上最老的年度马拉松；大多数人要先在别的马拉松跑出「BQ」达标成绩才能报名，所以跑步的人都把它当梦想。","fame_en":"Started in 1897, it's the world's oldest annual marathon; most runners must first hit a qualifying time ('a BQ') elsewhere, which makes it every runner's dream race.","fact":"报名的人越来越多：2024 年 9 月，主办方把 2026 年（第 130 届）的达标时间收紧了约 5 分钟，18–34 岁男子要跑进 2 小时 55 分，女子 3 小时 25 分。","fact_en":"It keeps getting harder to get in: in September 2024 the B.A.A. tightened standards for the 2026 race — the 130th — by about five minutes; men 18–34 now need 2:55, women 3:25.","src":"WBUR，2024 年 9 月","url":"https://www.wbur.org/news/2024/09/17/boston-marathon-2026-qualifying-times-faster","say":{"en":"Where can I pick up my race number?","zh":"请问在哪里领号码布？"}},"感恩节火鸡":{"what":"美国十一月第四个星期四的感恩节，全家人一起吃的一整只烤火鸡。","what_en":"The whole roast turkey Americans share with family on Thanksgiving, the fourth Thursday of November.","fame":"感恩节是美国人一年里最要回家的日子，机场是一年里最挤的时候；桌上还有馅料、蔓越莓酱、南瓜派，吃完看橄榄球。","fame_en":"Thanksgiving is the holiday Americans most want to be home for, and the airports are at their busiest; the table also has stuffing, cranberry sauce and pumpkin pie, followed by football on TV.","fact":"很多人一年只烤一次火鸡，所以黄油球（Butterball）公司从 1981 年起开了一条「火鸡热线」：第一年 6 个人接了约 1.1 万个问题，现在 50 多个专家每年回答 10 万多个，问得最多的是：冻火鸡怎么化冻？","fact_en":"Most people roast a turkey once a year, so Butterball has run a Turkey Talk-Line since 1981: six home economists took about 11,000 questions that first year; now 50-plus experts answer over 100,000 — mostly 'how do I thaw it?'","src":"Butterball 官网","url":"https://butterball.com/about-us/turkey-talk-line","say":{"en":"Can you pass the cranberry sauce, please?","zh":"能把蔓越莓酱递给我吗？"}},"万圣节":{"what":"10 月 31 日的节日：孩子们扮成鬼怪、超级英雄，挨家挨户敲门喊「不给糖就捣蛋」。","what_en":"The 31 October festival when kids dress up as monsters and superheroes and go door to door shouting 'trick or treat'.","fame":"门口摆南瓜灯、院子里布置假墓碑，大人也穿奇装异服上班、开派对；马萨诸塞州的塞勒姆（1692 年女巫审判的地方）整个十月都挤满游客。","fame_en":"Front steps get jack-o'-lanterns, yards get fake gravestones, and adults wear costumes to work and parties; Salem, Massachusetts — site of the 1692 witch trials — is packed with visitors all October.","fact":"美国人在万圣节上花的钱越来越多：美国零售联合会预计 2025 年会创纪录花 131 亿美元，服装、装饰各四十多亿，糖果约 39 亿。","fact_en":"Americans keep spending more on it: the National Retail Federation expected a record $13.1 billion for Halloween 2025 — over $4 billion each on costumes and decorations, and about $3.9 billion on candy.","src":"美国零售联合会 NRF，2025 年 9 月","url":"https://nrf.com/media-center/press-releases/nrf-consumer-survey-finds-halloween-spending-to-reach-record-13-1-billion","say":{"en":"Trick or treat! I love your costume!","zh":"不给糖就捣蛋！你的装扮太棒了！"}},"芝加哥“豆子”":{"what":"芝加哥千禧公园里一个像水银滴一样的大不锈钢雕塑，正式名字叫「云门」（Cloud Gate）。","what_en":"A giant liquid-mercury-like steel sculpture in Chicago's Millennium Park; its real name is Cloud Gate.","fame":"英国艺术家阿尼什·卡普尔的作品，表面像镜子，能照出芝加哥的天际线和你自己；可以从下面的「肚脐」走过去，是全城最多人拍照的地方。","fame_en":"By British artist Anish Kapoor, its mirror skin reflects the Chicago skyline — and you. You can walk under its 'navel', and it's the most photographed spot in town.","fact":"它是 168 块不锈钢板焊起来的，却看不见一条缝。卡普尔一开始很讨厌「豆子」这个外号，2006 年还说它「蠢透了」，后来才认了，说自己现在也这么叫。","fact_en":"It's 168 steel plates welded together with no visible seams. Kapoor hated the nickname 'the Bean' at first — in 2006 he called it 'completely stupid' — but later gave in and says he calls it that too.","src":"Time Out Chicago，2024 年","url":"https://www.timeout.com/chicago/news/everything-you-need-to-know-about-the-bean-062524","say":{"en":"Can you get the whole Bean and the skyline in the picture?","zh":"能把整个豆子和后面的天际线都拍进去吗？"}},"圣路易斯拱门":{"what":"圣路易斯密西西比河边一座不锈钢大拱门，高 630 英尺（约 192 米），1965 年建成。","what_en":"A stainless-steel arch by the Mississippi in St. Louis, 630 feet (about 192 m) tall, finished in 1965.","fame":"它是「通往西部的大门」，纪念当年美国人从这儿出发往西开拓；是世界上最高的拱门，可以坐小小的胶囊缆车爬到顶上，从窗户往下看。","fame_en":"It's the 'Gateway to the West', marking where Americans set off westward. It's the world's tallest arch, and tiny pod trams carry you to the top to peer out of the windows.","fact":"它原来的名字很长，叫「杰斐逊国家扩张纪念地」，大家只叫它 the Arch；2018 年 2 月 22 日，美国正式把它改名为「门户拱门国家公园」，成了美国最小的国家公园之一。","fact_en":"Its official name used to be the long 'Jefferson National Expansion Memorial', though everyone just said 'the Arch'. On 22 February 2018 it was officially renamed Gateway Arch National Park — one of the smallest national parks in the US.","src":"Wikipedia：Gateway Arch National Park","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gateway_Arch_National_Park","say":{"en":"How long is the wait for the tram to the top?","zh":"去顶上的缆车要等多久？"}},"玉米带":{"what":"美国中西部艾奥瓦、伊利诺伊一带一望无际的玉米和大豆田。","what_en":"The endless corn and soybean fields of the US Midwest — Iowa, Illinois and their neighbours.","fame":"美国是世界上产玉米最多的国家，这里的玉米大部分不是给人直接吃的，而是喂猪牛、做乙醇汽油、做糖浆，再卖到全世界。","fame_en":"The US grows more corn than any other country, and most of it isn't eaten as corn: it feeds pigs and cattle, becomes ethanol fuel and syrup, and ships around the world.","fact":"2025 年美国玉米大丰收，产量创纪录到约 170 亿蒲式耳；光艾奥瓦一个州就有 27.7 亿蒲式耳，也是它的历史最高。","fact_en":"2025 brought a record US corn crop of about 17 billion bushels; Iowa alone grew 2.77 billion, its own all-time high.","src":"艾奥瓦州农业厅，2026 年 1 月","url":"https://iowaagriculture.gov/news/usda-crop-production-summary","say":{"en":"How tall does the corn get by August?","zh":"到八月玉米能长多高？"}},"一英里高的城市":{"what":"科罗拉多州首府丹佛的外号，因为它海拔正好一英里（约 1609 米）。","what_en":"Denver, Colorado's capital, nicknamed for sitting exactly one mile (about 1,609 m) above sea level.","fame":"落基山脚下的城市，空气薄，第一次来的人爬楼梯都会喘；高尔夫球在这里能飞得更远，橄榄球队主场就叫「一英里高球场」。","fame_en":"At the foot of the Rockies, the air is thin — newcomers puff on the stairs. Golf balls fly farther here, and the football stadium is called Mile High.","fact":"州议会大厦西边的台阶上有三个「一英里」标记：第 15 级刻着「海拔一英里」；1969 年学生重新测量，在第 18 级加了一个；2003 年用更准的方法再测，又在第 13 级放了一块铜牌。","fact_en":"The Capitol's west steps carry three 'one mile' markers: step 15 is engraved 'One Mile Above Sea Level'; students re-measured in 1969 and marked step 18; a more precise 2003 survey added a brass marker on step 13.","src":"科罗拉多州议会大厦官网","url":"https://capitol.colorado.gov/history-capitol","say":{"en":"Which step is actually one mile high?","zh":"到底哪一级台阶才是一英里高？"}},"拱门国家公园":{"what":"犹他州摩押旁边一片红色砂岩荒野，风和水把石头雕成了两千多座天然石拱。","what_en":"A red-sandstone wilderness near Moab, Utah, where wind and water have carved over 2,000 natural stone arches.","fame":"最有名的「精致拱门」印在犹他州的车牌上；日落时整片红石头发光，是美国西部自驾路线的必去点。","fame_en":"The most famous, Delicate Arch, is on Utah's licence plates. At sunset the whole red landscape glows — a must on any American West road trip.","fact":"因为人太多，旺季白天进公园要先在网上订时段票；2025 年起最早可以提前半年订，只收 2 美元手续费，门口不卖票。","fact_en":"Because it got so crowded, peak-season daytime entry now needs a timed ticket booked online; from 2025 you could book up to six months ahead for a $2 fee, and none are sold at the gate.","src":"美国国家公园管理局 NPS","url":"https://www.nps.gov/arch/learn/news/news12192025.htm","say":{"en":"How long is the hike to Delicate Arch?","zh":"去精致拱门要走多久？"}},"拉斯维加斯":{"what":"内华达沙漠里的一座城，赌场酒店一家挨一家，晚上整条大道灯火通明。","what_en":"A city in the Nevada desert where casino hotels stand side by side and the Strip blazes with light all night.","fame":"「罪恶之城」：赌场、大型秀、24 小时营业；现在更多人是来开会、看演唱会和体育比赛——世界最大的科技展 CES 每年一月在这里。","fame_en":"'Sin City': casinos, big shows, everything open 24 hours. These days more people come for conventions, concerts and sport — CES, the world's biggest tech show, is here every January.","fact":"2023 年 9 月 29 日，一个叫 Sphere（球幕）的巨大球形场馆在这里开幕，由 U2 首演；外面贴满约 120 万颗 LED，是世界上最大的球形建筑，造价约 23 亿美元。","fact_en":"On 29 September 2023 the Sphere opened here with U2. Its outside is covered in about 1.2 million LED pucks — the world's largest spherical building, built for about $2.3 billion.","src":"The Hollywood Reporter，2023 年","url":"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/sphere-u2-opens-las-vegas-1235598725/","say":{"en":"What time does the show start tonight?","zh":"今晚的演出几点开始？"}},"金门大桥":{"what":"旧金山湾口的一座橘红色悬索桥，1937 年通车，全长约 2.7 公里。","what_en":"An orange-red suspension bridge across the mouth of San Francisco Bay, opened in 1937, about 2.7 km long.","fame":"旧金山的名片：颜色叫「国际橘」，在浓雾里若隐若现；通车时是世界上最长的悬索桥，现在走路、骑车都能过桥。","fame_en":"San Francisco's calling card: its colour is 'International Orange', glowing through the fog. It was the world's longest suspension span when it opened, and you can walk or cycle across.","fact":"2024 年 1 月，桥两边装完了一整圈不锈钢防护网：挂在人行道下面 6 米、往外伸 6 米，全长 2.7 公里，花了 2.24 亿美元，用来防止有人跳桥。","fact_en":"In January 2024 a stainless-steel net was finished along both sides of the whole 1.7-mile span — hung 20 feet below the walkway, reaching 20 feet out — to stop suicides. It cost $224 million.","src":"金门大桥管理区官网","url":"https://www.goldengate.org/district/district-projects/suicide-deterrent-net/","say":{"en":"Is it better to walk across or rent a bike?","zh":"过桥是走路好还是租自行车好？"}},"叮当车":{"what":"旧金山的老式缆车：车底下夹着一根在地下一直转的钢缆，被拉着爬上陡坡，开车时会「叮当」打铃。","what_en":"San Francisco's old cable cars: they grip a steel cable running under the street and get pulled up the steep hills, ringing their bells as they go.","fame":"旧金山的象征，游客最爱站在踏板上、扶着杆子坐；车到线路尽头要靠人推着在转盘上掉头。","fame_en":"A San Francisco icon — visitors love riding on the running boards, holding the pole. At the end of the line, crews push the car around on a turntable by hand.","fact":"它是世界上最后一套还在街上跑的人工操作缆车系统；1873 年 8 月 2 日开始运营，2023 年旧金山办了 150 周年纪念。","fact_en":"It's the last manually operated street cable railway in the world; it began running on 2 August 1873, and San Francisco celebrated its 150th anniversary in 2023.","src":"旧金山交通局 SFMTA","url":"https://www.sfmta.com/node/28289","say":{"en":"Does this cable car go to Fisherman's Wharf?","zh":"这辆缆车去渔人码头吗？"}},"恶魔岛":{"what":"旧金山湾里的一座小岛，1934 到 1963 年是关重犯的联邦监狱，现在是国家公园。","what_en":"A small island in San Francisco Bay — a federal prison for the toughest inmates from 1934 to 1963, now a national park site.","fame":"黑帮老大阿尔·卡彭关过这里；四周海水又冷流又急，几乎逃不出去，1962 年三个人越狱后再也没找到，成了电影《逃出恶魔岛》的故事。","fame_en":"Gangster Al Capone was locked up here; cold, fast water all around made escape almost impossible. Three men who broke out in 1962 were never found — the story behind the film Escape from Alcatraz.","fact":"关了 60 多年以后，2025 年 5 月特朗普说要让政府把它重新改成监狱并扩建；可是岛由国家公园管理局管着，是很受欢迎的景点，很多人质疑能不能做到。","fact_en":"In May 2025, more than 60 years after it closed, President Trump said he'd directed the government to reopen and expand it as a prison — though the island is run by the National Park Service as a popular attraction, and many doubted it could happen.","src":"AP / ABC7，2025 年 5 月","url":"https://abc7news.com/post/donald-trump-says-he-will-reopen-notorious-alcatraz-island-prison-san-francisco/16324373/","say":{"en":"Do I need to book the ferry to Alcatraz in advance?","zh":"去恶魔岛的渡轮要提前订吗？"}},"硅谷":{"what":"旧金山南边圣克拉拉谷一带，苹果、谷歌、英伟达等科技公司都在这里。","what_en":"The Santa Clara Valley south of San Francisco, home to Apple, Google, Nvidia and countless other tech firms.","fame":"世界科技创业的中心：从车库里的小公司长成大公司，风险投资、工程师和斯坦福大学都聚在这里；「硅」来自做芯片的材料。","fame_en":"The world's tech-startup capital, where garage companies grow into giants, with venture money, engineers and Stanford all in one place. The 'silicon' is the material chips are made of.","fact":"「硅谷」这个名字第一次登上报纸是 1971 年 1 月 11 日：记者唐·霍夫勒在《电子新闻》上写了一组文章叫《美国硅谷》；据说这个名字是一位做设备的老板向他提议的。","fact_en":"The name first appeared in print on 11 January 1971, when reporter Don Hoefler titled a series in Electronic News 'Silicon Valley U.S.A.' — the name was reportedly suggested to him by an equipment-company founder.","src":"计算机历史博物馆","url":"https://computerhistory.org/blog/who-named-silicon-valley/","say":{"en":"Is the Computer History Museum near here?","zh":"计算机历史博物馆离这儿近吗？"}},"乔布斯":{"what":"史蒂夫·乔布斯（1955–2011），苹果公司的创始人之一。","what_en":"Steve Jobs (1955–2011), a co-founder of Apple.","fame":"他带出了 Mac、iPod、iPhone 和 iPad，2007 年发布的 iPhone 改变了全世界用手机的方式；黑色高领衫加牛仔裤的发布会也成了经典。","fame_en":"He led the Mac, iPod, iPhone and iPad; the iPhone he unveiled in 2007 changed how the whole world uses phones, and his black-turtleneck-and-jeans keynotes became legendary.","fact":"1976 年他和沃兹尼亚克在洛斯阿尔托斯他家的车库里装出了第一批 50 台 Apple I；2013 年这栋房子被当地定为「历史资源」，以后要改造得先经过市里审批。","fact_en":"In 1976 he and Steve Wozniak assembled the first 50 Apple I computers in the garage of his family home in Los Altos; in 2013 the city named the house a historic resource, so any renovation now needs city review.","src":"FOX13 / AP，2013 年","url":"https://www.fox13now.com/2013/10/30/steve-jobs-boyhood-home-becomes-historic-site","say":{"en":"Is this the garage where Apple started?","zh":"这就是苹果起步的那个车库吗？"}},"YouTube":{"what":"全世界最大的视频网站，总部在旧金山南边的圣布鲁诺，2005 年上线。","what_en":"The world's biggest video site, headquartered in San Bruno south of San Francisco, launched in 2005.","fame":"学做菜、修东西、学语言、听歌、看博主……很多人「不会就上 YouTube 搜」；2006 年谷歌花 16.5 亿美元把它买了下来。","fame_en":"Cooking, fixing things, learning a language, music, creators — for many people, 'if you don't know how, search YouTube'. Google bought it for $1.65 billion in 2006.","fact":"它一开始想做的是「视频相亲网站」，口号叫 Tune In, Hook Up，域名在 2005 年情人节注册；几个创始人在网上登广告，给上传自我介绍视频的女生 20 美元，结果没人来，几个月后才改成什么视频都能传。","fact_en":"It began as a video-dating site with the slogan 'Tune In, Hook Up', its domain registered on Valentine's Day 2005. The founders offered women $20 on Craigslist to upload videos — nobody did — so within months it opened up to any video.","src":"VICE，2015 年","url":"https://vice.com/en/article/10-years-ago-today-youtube-launched-as-a-dating-website","say":{"en":"Don't forget to like and subscribe!","zh":"别忘了点赞和订阅！"}},"爱因斯坦":{"kind":"person","what":"提出相对论的物理学家，1921 年得了诺贝尔奖。","what_en":"The physicist behind relativity, who won the 1921 Nobel Prize.","fame":"E=mc² 可能是世界上最有名的公式；「爱因斯坦」这个名字本身就成了「天才」的意思。","fame_en":"E=mc² may be the most famous equation in the world — his very name has come to mean 'genius'.","fact":"1955 年他去世后，做尸检的病理学家托马斯·哈维没经允许就把他的大脑取走了，切成 240 块，在自己家里放了二十多年，1978 年才被记者找到。","fact_en":"When he died in 1955, the pathologist Thomas Harvey removed his brain without permission, cut it into 240 blocks and kept it at home for over twenty years — a reporter only tracked it down in 1978.","src":"NPR，2005","url":"https://www.npr.org/2005/04/18/4602913/the-long-strange-journey-of-einsteins-brain","quote":{"en":"Imagination is more important than knowledge.","zh":"想象力比知识更重要。","where":"1929 年接受《星期六晚邮报》采访时说的","where_en":"Said in a 1929 interview with The Saturday Evening Post"},"say":{"en":"Did you know Einstein's brain was kept in a jar?","zh":"你知道爱因斯坦的大脑被泡在罐子里吗？"}},"梵高":{"kind":"person","what":"荷兰画家，画了《向日葵》《星月夜》，一生大多数时候很穷。","what_en":"The Dutch painter of Sunflowers and The Starry Night, who was poor for most of his life.","fame":"今天他的画是世界上最贵、最常被印在杯子和雨伞上的画之一；他只画了大约十年，却留下两千多件作品。","fame_en":"His paintings are now among the most expensive — and most printed on mugs and umbrellas — in the world; he painted for only about ten years but left over 2,000 works.","fact":"2022 年 10 月 14 日，两个气候活动人士在伦敦国家美术馆把番茄汤泼到《向日葵》上，喊着「要生命还是要艺术」；画有玻璃挡着，没坏，只伤了一点画框。","fact_en":"On 14 October 2022, two climate activists threw tomato soup over Sunflowers at London's National Gallery, shouting about 'life over art'. The glass protected it; only the frame was slightly damaged.","src":"NPR / MPR，2022 年 10 月","url":"https://www.mprnews.org/story/2022/10/14/npr-van-gogh-sunflowers-soup-climate-protest-london-gallery","say":{"en":"Which museum has the most Van Goghs — Amsterdam?","zh":"哪个博物馆的梵高最多？是阿姆斯特丹吗？"}},"李小龙":{"kind":"person","what":"在旧金山出生、香港长大的功夫明星，创了截拳道。","what_en":"The kung fu star born in San Francisco and raised in Hong Kong, who founded Jeet Kune Do.","fame":"他让全世界认识了中国功夫，也是最早在好莱坞当主角的华人之一；32 岁就去世了。","fame_en":"He introduced kung fu to the world and was one of the first Chinese actors to lead in Hollywood — and died at just 32.","fact":"他 1973 年去世，官方说是药物过敏引起脑水肿；2022 年一组西班牙肾科医生在《临床肾脏杂志》提出另一种可能：他喝水太多，肾排不出去。这只是推测，到今天也没有定论。","fact_en":"He died in 1973; the official cause was brain swelling from a reaction to a painkiller. In 2022 Spanish kidney doctors suggested in the Clinical Kidney Journal that he may have drunk more water than his kidneys could clear. It's only a hypothesis — there's still no final answer.","src":"Consequence / Clinical Kidney Journal，2022","url":"https://consequence.net/2022/11/bruce-lee-death-water-kidney","quote":{"en":"Be water, my friend.","zh":"像水一样吧，我的朋友。","where":"1971 年 12 月他唯一一次电视采访（加拿大《Pierre Berton Show》）里说的","where_en":"From his only TV interview, The Pierre Berton Show, December 1971"},"say":{"en":"Have you seen any Bruce Lee films?","zh":"你看过李小龙的电影吗？"}},"平遥古城":{"what":"山西中部一座整座保存下来的明清县城，城墙一圈、里面的街和院子都还在，人也还住在里面。","what_en":"A whole Ming–Qing county town in central Shanxi that survived intact — the full ring of walls, the streets and courtyards, and people still living inside.","fame":"1997 年进了世界遗产：中国保存得最完整的古城之一；晚上红灯笼一亮，街上全是开着门的票号、客栈和卖平遥牛肉的小店。","fame_en":"A UNESCO World Heritage Site since 1997 and one of the best-preserved old towns in China. At night the red lanterns come on over old banks, inns and shops selling Pingyao beef.","fact":"中国第一家「票号」（像今天的银行汇款）就开在平遥：日升昌，大约 1823 年由一家染料铺改成，凭一张汇票就能在别的城市取钱。老店现在是博物馆。","fact_en":"China's first 'piaohao' draft bank — an early way to send money across the country — opened here: Rishengchang, turned from a dye shop into a remittance firm around 1823. You could hand in cash in Pingyao and collect it with a paper draft in another city. The building is now a museum.","src":"Wikipedia：Rishengchang","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rishengchang","say":{"en":"Is one ticket good for the city wall and the old banks?","zh":"一张票能上城墙、也能进票号吗？"}},"呼伦贝尔草原":{"what":"内蒙古东北角的一大片草原，夏天绿到天边，冬天零下三四十度。","what_en":"A vast grassland in the far northeast of Inner Mongolia — green to the horizon in summer, minus 30 or 40 degrees in winter.","fame":"中国最大、保存最好的草原之一；夏天来的人骑马、住蒙古包、开车在弯弯曲曲的莫日格勒河边找牛羊。","fame_en":"One of China's largest and best-kept grasslands. Summer visitors ride horses, sleep in yurts and drive along the winding Morigele River looking for herds of cattle and sheep.","fact":"「呼伦贝尔」这个名字是两个湖拼起来的：呼伦湖和贝尔湖。呼伦湖整个在中国境内，贝尔湖大部分在蒙古国。","fact_en":"The name 'Hulunbuir' joins two lakes: Hulun Lake and Buir Lake. Hulun lies entirely in China, while most of Buir Lake is across the border in Mongolia.","src":"Wikipedia：Hulunbuir","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hulunbuir","say":{"en":"How much is an hour of horse riding?","zh":"骑马一个小时多少钱？"}},"黄山":{"what":"安徽南边的一座山，满山是奇怪的石峰、长在石头缝里的松树，常常泡在云里。","what_en":"A mountain range in southern Anhui full of strange granite peaks and pine trees growing out of the rock, often sitting in a sea of clouds.","fame":"中国山水画里的山就长这样；大家半夜爬上去等日出、看云海。有句老话：「黄山归来不看岳」。","fame_en":"It's the mountain from Chinese ink paintings come to life. People climb in the dark to catch the sunrise over the sea of clouds. An old saying goes: once you've seen Huangshan, you don't need to see any other mountain.","fact":"山上那棵最有名的迎客松，从 1981 年起就有专职的「守松人」一年到头守着它，现在是第 19 任。","fact_en":"The famous Welcoming-Guest Pine has had its own full-time guardian since 1981, watching over it all year round. The current one is the 19th.","src":"China Daily：Deputy safeguards treasured pine tree","url":"https://subsites.chinadaily.com.cn/npc/2025-03/06/c_1075587.htm","say":{"en":"What time is sunrise tomorrow, and where's the best place to watch it?","zh":"明天几点日出？在哪儿看最好？"}},"张家界":{"what":"湖南西北的山区，几千根石柱从森林里直直地立起来。","what_en":"A mountain area in northwest Hunan where thousands of stone pillars rise straight up out of the forest.","fame":"电影《阿凡达》里飘浮的山常被拿来跟这里比；现在还有玻璃桥、天门山的「通天大道」，来的人一半在拍照一半在发抖。","fame_en":"Its pillars are often compared to the floating mountains in Avatar. Add a glass bridge and the hairpin road up Tianmen Mountain, and half the visitors are taking photos while the other half are shaking.","fact":"悬崖上贴着一部户外电梯——百龙天梯，高 326 米，2015 年被吉尼斯认证为世界最高的户外电梯。","fact_en":"A lift is bolted onto one of the cliffs: the Bailong Elevator, 326 metres tall, certified by Guinness in 2015 as the world's tallest outdoor elevator.","src":"Guinness World Records：Tallest outdoor elevator","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/106876-tallest-outdoor-elevator","say":{"en":"Is the elevator queue long right now?","zh":"现在坐电梯要排很久吗？"}},"桂林山水":{"what":"广西桂林到阳朔的漓江两边，一座座圆圆的小山立在江边和稻田里。","what_en":"The stretch of the Li River from Guilin to Yangshuo, where rounded karst hills stand along the water and among the rice fields.","fame":"「桂林山水甲天下」：坐船或竹筏顺江漂下去，就像在一幅山水画里走；到了阳朔，大家骑车、吃啤酒鱼和桂林米粉。","fame_en":"'Guilin's scenery is the best under heaven,' goes the saying. Float down the river by boat or bamboo raft and you're inside an ink painting; in Yangshuo people cycle and eat beer fish and Guilin rice noodles.","fact":"你钱包里可能就有它：第五套人民币 20 元的背面印的就是漓江，地方在兴坪附近。","fact_en":"It might already be in your wallet: the back of the fifth-series 20-yuan note shows the Li River, near Xingping.","src":"Wikipedia：Li River","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Li_River","say":{"en":"How long is the bamboo raft ride to Xingping?","zh":"坐竹筏到兴坪要多久？"}},"三亚海滩":{"what":"海南岛最南端的海边城市，一年四季都能下海。","what_en":"A seaside city at the southern tip of Hainan Island where you can swim all year round.","fame":"中国人冬天去晒太阳的地方，被叫作「东方夏威夷」；亚龙湾、海棠湾的沙滩边一排排度假酒店，还有免税店。","fame_en":"It's where people in China go for winter sun — nicknamed 'the Hawaii of the East', with resort hotels lining Yalong Bay and Haitang Bay, plus big duty-free malls.","fact":"三亚办过 8 次世界小姐总决赛（2003 年起），除了这个比赛的老家英国，没有别的地方办得比它多。","fact_en":"Sanya has hosted the Miss World final eight times since 2003 — more than anywhere except the UK, where the contest began.","src":"China Daily：Sanya to host Miss World Asian headquarters","url":"https://subsites.chinadaily.com.cn/hainan/2019-03/27/c_351178.htm","say":{"en":"Is it safe to swim here today?","zh":"今天这里可以下水吗？"}},"九寨沟":{"what":"四川北边山里的一条山谷，一百多个湖，水是蓝绿色的，清到能看见湖底的树。","what_en":"A valley in the mountains of northern Sichuan with over a hundred lakes, turquoise and so clear you can see fallen trees on the bottom.","fame":"被叫作「童话世界」：湖水的颜色、秋天的红叶和瀑布，一年四季都不一样；也是藏族村寨住的地方。","fame_en":"Known as a 'fairytale world': the lake colours, autumn leaves and waterfalls change with every season. Tibetan villages still sit in the valley.","fact":"2017 年 8 月的地震把诺日朗瀑布弄得只剩细细一股水，景区关了两年多；2019 年 9 月修好的诺日朗才重新开放。","fact_en":"An earthquake in August 2017 left Nuorilang Waterfall as little more than a trickle, and much of the park closed for two years. The repaired falls reopened in September 2019.","src":"Wikipedia：Nuorilang Waterfall","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nuorilang_Waterfall","say":{"en":"Which bus stop is closest to Five Flower Lake?","zh":"哪一站离五花海最近？"}},"丽江古城":{"what":"云南西北的纳西族老城，石板路、小水渠、木头房子，背后是玉龙雪山。","what_en":"An old Naxi town in northwest Yunnan — stone lanes, little canals and wooden houses, with Jade Dragon Snow Mountain behind.","fame":"很多人心里「慢下来」的地方：客栈、酒吧、手鼓店挤在一起；城里的水从玉龙雪山流下来，穿过每条街。","fame_en":"For many people it's the place to slow down, packed with guesthouses, bars and drum shops. Water from the snow mountain runs through the canals past every street.","fact":"1996 年一场大地震毁了很多老房子，修复照着联合国教科文组织的标准来做，第二年（1997 年）丽江古城就进了世界遗产。","fact_en":"A big earthquake in 1996 destroyed many old houses. They were rebuilt to UNESCO's standards, and the very next year, 1997, the old town became a World Heritage Site.","src":"Wikipedia：Old Town of Lijiang","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Town_of_Lijiang","say":{"en":"Do I need to pay the old town maintenance fee here?","zh":"这里要交古城维护费吗？"}},"布达拉宫":{"what":"拉萨城中间小山上的一座白红两色的宫殿，以前是达赖喇嘛住和办公的地方，现在是博物馆。","what_en":"A white-and-red palace on a hill in the middle of Lhasa, once the Dalai Lamas' home and seat of government, now a museum.","fame":"海拔 3700 米、一千多个房间，世界上最高的古代宫殿之一；每天都有人绕着它转经，手里转着经筒。","fame_en":"At about 3,700 metres with over a thousand rooms, it's one of the highest ancient palaces in the world. Every day pilgrims walk the circuit around it, spinning prayer wheels.","fact":"「布达拉」这个名字来自佛经里的「普陀洛迦山」——传说中观音菩萨住的山；浙江的普陀山也是同一个名字来的。","fact_en":"The name comes from Mount Potalaka, the mythical home of the bodhisattva Avalokiteshvara (Guanyin) — the same name behind Putuo Shan island in Zhejiang.","src":"Wikipedia：Potala Palace","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Potala_Palace","say":{"en":"Which way do people walk around the palace?","zh":"大家绕着宫转是往哪个方向走？"}},"维多利亚港":{"what":"香港岛和九龙半岛之间的海港，两岸全是高楼。","what_en":"The harbour between Hong Kong Island and the Kowloon peninsula, lined with skyscrapers on both sides.","fame":"世界上最有名的夜景之一：坐几块钱的天星小轮过海，晚上八点看两岸大楼一起亮灯。","fame_en":"One of the world's most famous night views. Cross on the Star Ferry for a few dollars, then watch both shores light up together at 8 pm.","fact":"每晚八点的灯光秀「幻彩咏香江」2005 年拿了吉尼斯纪录：世界上最大的常设灯光音乐表演，几十栋大楼一起闪。","fact_en":"The 8 pm show, 'A Symphony of Lights', earned a Guinness World Record in 2005 as the world's largest permanent light and sound show, with dozens of buildings flashing in sync.","src":"Wikipedia：A Symphony of Lights","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Symphony_of_Lights","say":{"en":"Which pier is the Star Ferry to Tsim Sha Tsui?","zh":"去尖沙咀的天星小轮在哪个码头？"}},"台北101":{"what":"台北信义区的一栋 101 层高楼，样子像一节节竹子。","what_en":"A 101-storey tower in Taipei's Xinyi district, shaped like stacked sections of bamboo.","fame":"2004 年到 2010 年是世界最高楼；每年跨年夜整栋楼放烟火，全台湾都在看直播。","fame_en":"The world's tallest building from 2004 to 2010. Every New Year's Eve the whole tower shoots fireworks, and the whole island watches live.","fact":"楼里挂着一个 660 吨的大钢球（阻尼器），台风和地震时用它抵消大楼的摇晃；游客可以在楼上亲眼看到它。","fact_en":"A 660-tonne steel ball hangs inside the tower as a tuned mass damper, swaying to cancel out typhoon winds and earthquakes — and visitors can see it with their own eyes.","src":"Guinness World Records：Largest tuned mass damper","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/774616-largest-tuned-mass-damper","say":{"en":"Can I see the damper with the observatory ticket?","zh":"观景台的票能看到阻尼器吗？"}},"北海道滑雪":{"what":"日本最北的大岛北海道，冬天雪又多又轻，到处是滑雪场。","what_en":"Hokkaido, Japan's northern island, where the winter snow is deep and light and ski resorts are everywhere.","fame":"二世古（Niseko）的「粉雪」全世界滑雪的人都知道，外国人叫它「Japow」；滑完泡温泉、吃汤咖喱和拉面。","fame_en":"Skiers around the world know Niseko's powder snow — 'Japow'. After a day on the slopes it's hot springs, soup curry and ramen.","fact":"1972 年札幌冬奥会是亚洲第一次办冬奥会，也是第一次在欧洲和北美以外办。","fact_en":"The 1972 Sapporo Games were the first Winter Olympics ever held in Asia — and the first outside Europe and North America.","src":"Wikipedia：1972 Winter Olympics","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1972_Winter_Olympics","say":{"en":"Can I rent skis and boots for two days?","zh":"能租两天的雪板和雪鞋吗？"}},"撒马尔罕":{"what":"乌兹别克斯坦的古城，丝绸之路上最有名的一站，满城蓝色圆顶。","what_en":"An ancient city in Uzbekistan, the most famous stop on the Silk Road, full of turquoise domes.","fame":"雷吉斯坦广场三座贴满彩色瓷砖的学校面对面站着，帖木儿时代它是中亚的首都；今天街上还在卖大馕和抓饭。","fame_en":"On Registan Square three tiled madrasas face each other; under Timur it was the capital of Central Asia. Today the streets still sell big round bread and plov.","fact":"2025 年 10–11 月，联合国教科文组织大会在撒马尔罕开：这是 1985 年以来第一次离开巴黎总部开。","fact_en":"In October–November 2025 UNESCO held its General Conference in Samarkand — the first time since 1985 that it met outside its Paris headquarters.","src":"UK National Commission for UNESCO","url":"https://unesco.org.uk/news/uk-at-unescos-43rd-general-conference-samarkand","say":{"en":"What time does the Registan light show start tonight?","zh":"雷吉斯坦今晚的灯光秀几点开始？"}},"西伯利亚铁路":{"what":"从莫斯科一直开到太平洋边海参崴的铁路，九千多公里。","what_en":"The railway from Moscow all the way to Vladivostok on the Pacific — over 9,000 kilometres.","fame":"世界上最长的铁路线：坐一趟要六七天，过好几个时区；车上有热水炉，大家泡面、喝茶、跟陌生人聊一路。","fame_en":"The longest railway line in the world: a full trip takes six or seven days across several time zones. There's a hot-water boiler in every carriage, and people eat instant noodles, drink tea and talk to strangers all the way.","fact":"直到 2018 年 8 月 1 日，全俄罗斯的火车票和车站时刻表都用莫斯科时间——在海参崴上车也得自己加 7 个小时算。现在才改成当地时间。","fact_en":"Until 1 August 2018, every Russian train ticket and station timetable ran on Moscow time — even in Vladivostok, seven hours ahead, you had to do the maths. Now they use local time.","src":"Wikipedia：Moscow Time","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moscow_Time","say":{"en":"How long does the train stop at this station?","zh":"车在这一站停多久？"}},"贝加尔湖":{"what":"西伯利亚南边的一个大湖，又长又深，像一弯月亮。","what_en":"A huge lake in southern Siberia, long and deep, shaped like a crescent moon.","fame":"世界上最深的湖（1642 米），装着全世界大约五分之一的地表淡水；冬天冰透明得能看见下面的水，人在冰上开车、走路。","fame_en":"The deepest lake in the world (1,642 m), holding about a fifth of the world's fresh surface water. In winter the ice is so clear you can see the water below, and people drive and walk across it.","fact":"它也是世界上最老的湖，大约 2500–3000 万年；湖里住着一种只在这里有的淡水海豹——贝加尔海豹。","fact_en":"It's also the oldest lake on Earth, about 25–30 million years old, and home to a seal found nowhere else — the Baikal seal, living entirely in fresh water.","src":"Wikipedia：Lake Baikal","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Baikal","say":{"en":"Is the ice thick enough to walk on today?","zh":"今天冰够厚，可以走上去吗？"}},"堪察加火山":{"what":"俄罗斯最东边的堪察加半岛，上面有几十座活火山。","what_en":"The Kamchatka Peninsula in Russia's far east, home to dozens of active volcanoes.","fame":"地球上火山最密的地方之一，也是世界遗产；熊在河里抓三文鱼，人坐直升机去看间歇泉谷。","fame_en":"One of the densest volcano zones on Earth and a World Heritage Site — bears catch salmon in the rivers and visitors fly by helicopter to the Valley of Geysers.","fact":"2025 年 7 月，堪察加外海发生 8.8 级地震，是 2011 年以后世界上最强的一次；几乎同时，欧亚大陆最高的活火山克柳切夫火山喷发了。","fact_en":"In July 2025 an 8.8 earthquake struck off Kamchatka, the world's strongest since 2011. Around the same time Klyuchevskaya Sopka, the tallest active volcano in Eurasia, erupted.","src":"Wikipedia：2025 Kamchatka earthquake","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_Kamchatka_earthquake","say":{"en":"Is the helicopter to the Valley of Geysers flying today?","zh":"今天去间歇泉谷的直升机飞吗？"}},"蓝色清真寺":{"what":"伊斯坦布尔老城的苏丹艾哈迈德清真寺，到今天还是每天有人来礼拜的清真寺。","what_en":"The Sultan Ahmed Mosque in Istanbul's old town — still a working mosque where people come to pray every day.","fame":"1617 年建成，有六座宣礼塔，里面墙上贴满了蓝色的伊兹尼克瓷砖，所以叫「蓝色清真寺」；它和对面的圣索菲亚大教堂一起，就是伊斯坦布尔天际线的样子。","fame_en":"Finished in 1617, it has six minarets and walls covered in blue İznik tiles — hence the name. Together with Hagia Sophia across the square, it is Istanbul's skyline.","fact":"它大修了大约五年，2023 年 4 月开斋节那天才完整地重新开放；修的这些年里大部分时间照样能进去礼拜。","fact_en":"It went through about five years of restoration and only fully reopened on Eid al-Fitr in April 2023. For most of those years, people could still go in to pray.","src":"Wikipedia「Blue Mosque, Istanbul」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Mosque,_Istanbul","say":{"en":"Can we go in now, or is it prayer time?","zh":"现在能进去吗，还是礼拜时间？"}},"圣米歇尔山":{"what":"法国诺曼底海边海湾里的一座小岛，岛顶是一座中世纪修道院。","what_en":"A small island in a bay on the coast of Normandy, France, with a medieval abbey on top.","fame":"这片海湾的潮差是欧洲最大的之一，涨潮时海水灌满海湾，小山变成孤岛；一千多年来它是朝圣地，现在是法国最热门的景点之一。","fame_en":"The bay has some of the biggest tides in Europe: when the sea rushes in, the hill becomes an island. It has been a pilgrimage site for over a thousand years and is now one of France's most visited places.","fact":"以前有一条堤路把它连到岸上，泥沙越积越多，它差点不再是岛。法国拆了堤路和山脚的停车场，2014 年 7 月换成一座海水能从下面流过的轻桥，现在大潮时它又会变回孤岛。","fact_en":"An old causeway linked it to the shore, and silt piled up until it was almost no longer an island. France removed the causeway and the car park, and in July 2014 opened a light bridge that lets the sea flow underneath — so at big tides it is an island again.","src":"Wikipedia「Mont-Saint-Michel」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mont-Saint-Michel","say":{"en":"What time is high tide today?","zh":"今天几点涨潮？"}},"威尼斯贡多拉":{"what":"威尼斯运河上的黑色平底小船，船夫站在船尾，只用一支桨划。","what_en":"The black flat-bottomed boats of Venice's canals, rowed with a single oar by a gondolier standing at the back.","fame":"以前它是威尼斯人的「出租车」，现在大多载游客钻小运河、过桥洞；船身左右不一样长，这样一个人在一边划也能走直线。","fame_en":"Gondolas used to be Venice's taxis; now they mostly carry visitors through narrow canals and under bridges. The hull is slightly lopsided, so one rower on one side can still go straight.","fact":"贡多拉船夫几百年都是父传子的行当，2007 年才开了正式培训课；2010 年夏天，Giorgia Boscolo 成为威尼斯第一位通过考试、拿到执照的女船夫。","fact_en":"For centuries the job passed from father to son; a formal training course only started in 2007. In summer 2010, Giorgia Boscolo became the first woman to pass the exam and get a gondolier's licence.","src":"Al Jazeera","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2010/8/20/venices-first-female-gondolier","say":{"en":"How much is it for thirty minutes, and how many people can sit in it?","zh":"坐三十分钟多少钱？能坐几个人？"}},"勃兰登堡门":{"what":"柏林市中心的一座砂岩城门，门顶是胜利女神驾着四匹马的战车。","what_en":"A sandstone gate in central Berlin, topped by a goddess of victory driving a four-horse chariot.","fame":"1791 年建成。冷战时柏林墙就在门边，东西两边谁也过不去；1989 年墙倒了，人们在门前爬上墙庆祝，从那以后它就是德国统一的象征。","fame_en":"Built in 1791. During the Cold War the Berlin Wall ran right beside it and nobody could pass. When the Wall fell in 1989, people climbed onto it here to celebrate, and the Gate became the symbol of a united Germany.","fact":"2023 年 9 月，环保组织「最后一代」的人往门柱上喷了橙色的漆。漆渗进了砂岩，只能搭脚手架慢慢清，花了十万欧元以上。","fact_en":"In September 2023, activists from the climate group Last Generation sprayed orange paint on the columns. It soaked into the sandstone, so the clean-up needed scaffolding and cost more than €100,000.","src":"Bernama（转发德新社 dpa）","url":"https://www.bernama.com/en/news.php?id=2236209","say":{"en":"Which way is the Reichstag from here?","zh":"从这儿去国会大厦往哪边走？"}},"郁金香":{"what":"春天开花的球根植物，荷兰是全世界种郁金香最多的地方。","what_en":"A spring flower that grows from a bulb — and the Netherlands grows more tulips than anywhere else.","fame":"每年三四月，莱顿和哈勒姆之间的花田一条红一条黄；库肯霍夫公园只在春天开八个星期左右，全世界的人赶着这几周来。","fame_en":"Every March and April, the fields between Leiden and Haarlem turn into stripes of red and yellow. Keukenhof gardens open for only about eight weeks each spring, and people fly in from all over the world.","fact":"大家常说 1637 年的「郁金香狂热」让荷兰经济崩盘、很多人破产。可历史学家 Anne Goldgar 翻了当年的档案，说她「一个因此破产的人都没找到」——这个故事很多是后来写书的人夸张出来的。","fact_en":"People often say the 1637 'tulip mania' crashed the Dutch economy and ruined many. But historian Anne Goldgar went through the archives and said she couldn't find anybody who went bankrupt — much of the story was exaggerated by later writers.","src":"Smithsonian Magazine","url":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/history/there-never-was-real-tulip-fever-180964915/","say":{"en":"How much is a bunch of ten? Will they last a week?","zh":"十支一把多少钱？能放一个星期吗？"}},"马特洪峰":{"what":"瑞士和意大利边境上一座金字塔形的雪山，海拔 4478 米。","what_en":"A pyramid-shaped peak on the border of Switzerland and Italy, 4,478 m high.","fame":"它长得就像小孩画的「山」；1865 年第一次有人登顶，下山时七个人里摔死了四个，从此全世界都知道了它。山脚的采尔马特小镇不让普通汽车开进去。","fame_en":"It looks like a child's drawing of a mountain. The first ascent in 1865 ended with four of the seven climbers falling to their deaths on the way down, and the world never forgot it. Ordinary cars aren't allowed in Zermatt, the village at its foot.","fact":"冰川化得太快了：瑞士和意大利有一段国界是顺着冰川山脊画的，冰一化，山脊就挪了位置。两国 2023 年商量好新的边界，2024 年 9 月瑞士政府批准。","fact_en":"The glaciers are melting so fast that part of the Swiss–Italian border, drawn along a glacier ridge, has moved. The two countries agreed a new line in 2023, and the Swiss government approved it in September 2024.","src":"Al Jazeera","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/features/2024/10/3/why-are-italy-and-switzerland-redrawing-their-alpine-border","say":{"en":"Can we see the Matterhorn from the top today?","zh":"今天上去能看到马特洪峰吗？"}},"圣托里尼":{"what":"希腊爱琴海上的一座火山岛，白房子、蓝圆顶的小镇挂在悬崖上。","what_en":"A volcanic island in Greece's Aegean Sea, with white houses and blue domes clinging to the cliffs.","fame":"岛中间那片海，其实是大约 3600 年前一次超级火山喷发后塌下去的火山口；在伊亚小镇看日落，是很多人旅行清单上的一项。","fame_en":"The sea in the middle of the island is actually a caldera left by a huge eruption about 3,600 years ago. Watching the sunset in Oia is on many people's bucket list.","fact":"2025 年 1 月底到 2 月，岛附近海底不到一个月发生了两万多次地震，几千人坐船、坐飞机离开，学校关了好几个星期；科学家说这和岛上的火山没有关系。","fact_en":"From late January to February 2025, more than 20,000 earthquakes hit the seabed nearby in under a month. Thousands of people left by ferry and plane, and schools closed for weeks. Scientists said it wasn't linked to the island's volcano.","src":"英国皇家地理学会（RGS）","url":"https://www.rgs.org/schools/resources-for-schools/greek-earthquake-swarm/","say":{"en":"Which ferry goes back to Piraeus tonight?","zh":"今晚哪班船回比雷埃夫斯？"}},"挪威峡湾":{"what":"挪威西海岸被冰川切出来的深海湾，两边是几百米甚至上千米高的悬崖和瀑布。","what_en":"Deep sea inlets carved by glaciers along Norway's west coast, with cliffs and waterfalls hundreds of metres high.","fame":"盖朗厄尔峡湾和纳柔依峡湾 2005 年一起列入世界遗产；坐船进去，两边的瀑布从崖顶直接落进海里。","fame_en":"Geirangerfjord and Nærøyfjord became a World Heritage Site together in 2005. On a boat between the cliffs, you watch waterfalls drop straight into the sea.","fact":"挪威议会 2025 年定了规矩：从 2026 年 1 月 1 日起，小于一万总吨的客船进世界遗产峡湾必须零排放；大船到 2032 年也一样。","fact_en":"Norway's parliament decided in 2025: from 1 January 2026, passenger ships under 10,000 gross tons must be zero-emission to enter the World Heritage fjords. Bigger ships must follow by 2032.","src":"The Maritime Executive","url":"https://maritime-executive.com/article/norway-adopts-zero-emissions-requirements-for-fjords","say":{"en":"Where does the fjord boat leave from, and how long is the trip?","zh":"峡湾游船从哪儿出发，要坐多久？"}},"冰岛火山":{"what":"冰岛正好在大西洋中脊上，有三十来个活火山系统，隔几年就有一次喷发。","what_en":"Iceland sits right on the Mid-Atlantic Ridge, with around thirty active volcanic systems — something erupts every few years.","fame":"2010 年艾雅法拉火山喷发，火山灰让欧洲停飞了好几天；现在很多人专门飞来，就为了看一眼流动的熔岩。","fame_en":"In 2010, ash from Eyjafjallajökull grounded flights across Europe for days. Today many people fly in just to see flowing lava.","fact":"首都旁边的雷克雅内斯半岛睡了大约 800 年，2021 年起又开始喷发。2023 年 11 月，渔港小镇格林达维克的近 4000 人一夜之间全部撤走；2024 年 1 月，熔岩烧掉了镇边的三栋房子。","fact_en":"The Reykjanes peninsula near the capital slept for about 800 years, then started erupting again in 2021. In November 2023, the fishing town of Grindavík — almost 4,000 people — was evacuated overnight. In January 2024, lava destroyed three houses at the edge of town.","src":"Wikipedia「Grindavík」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grindav%C3%ADk","say":{"en":"Is it safe to walk to the eruption site today?","zh":"今天走去喷发点安全吗？"}},"芬兰千湖":{"what":"芬兰被叫做「千湖之国」，森林和湖泊占了这个国家的大半。","what_en":"Finland is called 'the land of a thousand lakes' — forests and lakes cover most of the country.","fame":"夏天芬兰人去湖边的小木屋（mökki）住，蒸完桑拿直接跳进湖里；最大的塞马湖里还住着世界上最稀有的海豹之一——塞马环斑海豹。","fame_en":"In summer, Finns head to lakeside cottages (mökki) and jump into the lake straight from the sauna. Lake Saimaa, the biggest, is home to one of the rarest seals on Earth, the Saimaa ringed seal.","fact":"按面积超过 500 平方米来数，芬兰有 187,888 个湖——「千湖」少说了将近两百倍。","fact_en":"Counting every lake bigger than 500 square metres, Finland has 187,888 of them — 'a thousand lakes' is short by almost 200 times.","src":"Wikipedia「List of lakes of Finland」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_lakes_of_Finland","say":{"en":"Can I jump in the lake right from the sauna?","zh":"蒸完桑拿可以直接跳进湖里吗？"}},"麦加":{"what":"沙特阿拉伯西部的城市，伊斯兰教最神圣的地方，克尔白（天房）就在禁寺的正中间。","what_en":"A city in western Saudi Arabia and Islam's holiest place, with the Kaaba at the centre of the Grand Mosque.","fame":"全世界的穆斯林每天礼拜都面朝这里；每年朝觐季，一百多万人从世界各地来。这座城只有穆斯林可以进入。","fame_en":"Muslims all over the world face this city when they pray every day, and more than a million pilgrims come each Hajj season. Only Muslims may enter the city.","fact":"克尔白外面那层绣金字的黑色丝绸罩子（基斯瓦）每年换一次。几十年来都是朝觐那天早上换，2022 年起改到伊斯兰新年的第一天。","fact_en":"The black silk cover of the Kaaba, embroidered in gold (the kiswa), is replaced every year. For decades it was changed on the morning of the Day of Arafah during Hajj; since 2022 it is changed on the first day of the Islamic new year.","src":"Arab News","url":"https://www.arabnews.com/node/2131556","say":{"en":"Welcome back! Hajj mabrur — may your Hajj be accepted.","zh":"欢迎回来！愿你的朝觐被接受。（对朝觐回来的朋友说）"}},"佩特拉古城":{"what":"约旦南部沙漠里，两千年前纳巴泰人在玫瑰色砂岩山上直接凿出来的城。","what_en":"A city carved straight into rose-pink sandstone cliffs by the Nabataeans about 2,000 years ago, in the desert of southern Jordan.","fame":"先穿过一条一公里多长的窄峡谷「西克」，走到尽头，崖壁上的「宝库」突然出现在眼前；电影《夺宝奇兵 3》在这里拍过，2007 年它被选为「世界新七大奇迹」之一。","fame_en":"You walk through the Siq, a narrow canyon over a kilometre long, and at the end the Treasury suddenly appears in the cliff. Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade was filmed here, and in 2007 it was voted one of the New Seven Wonders of the World.","fact":"2024 年，考古队用探地雷达在「宝库」正前方的地下找到一座墓，里面有 12 具完整的骸骨和陪葬品——就在每天游客站着拍照的地方下面。","fact_en":"In 2024, archaeologists used ground-penetrating radar and found a tomb right in front of the Treasury, with 12 intact skeletons and grave goods — just below where tourists stand for photos every day.","src":"NPR（KUNC 转载）","url":"https://www.kunc.org/npr-news/2024-10-16/archaeologists-discover-12-skeletons-at-a-buried-tomb-in-petra-jordan","say":{"en":"How long does it take to walk to the Monastery?","zh":"走到修道院要多久？"}},"尼罗河":{"what":"从东非高原一路往北流进地中海的大河，全长约 6650 公里，流经十一个国家。","what_en":"A great river flowing north from the East African highlands into the Mediterranean — about 6,650 km long, through eleven countries.","fame":"埃及九成以上的人住在尼罗河两岸，没有它就没有金字塔和古埃及；开罗人傍晚喜欢坐三角帆船（felucca）在河上吹风。","fame_en":"Over ninety per cent of Egyptians live along the Nile; without it there would be no pyramids. In Cairo, people love an evening felucca ride on the river to catch the breeze.","fact":"2025 年 9 月，埃塞俄比亚在青尼罗河上修的「复兴大坝」正式完工，是非洲最大的水电站。下游的埃及担心干旱年份水不够，两国为这座坝争了十几年。","fact_en":"In September 2025, Ethiopia officially inaugurated the Grand Ethiopian Renaissance Dam on the Blue Nile — Africa's biggest hydropower plant. Egypt, downstream, worries about water in dry years; the two countries have argued over it for more than a decade.","src":"Wikipedia「Grand Ethiopian Renaissance Dam」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Ethiopian_Renaissance_Dam","say":{"en":"How much is a felucca ride for one hour?","zh":"坐一小时三角帆船多少钱？"}},"乞力马扎罗山":{"what":"坦桑尼亚的一座火山，海拔 5895 米，非洲最高峰。","what_en":"A volcano in Tanzania, 5,895 m high — the highest mountain in Africa.","fame":"它是世界上最高的「独立的山」，不连着任何山脉；不用攀岩技术也能走上去，所以每年有几万人来爬，一路从热带雨林走到冰川脚下。","fame_en":"It's the world's highest free-standing mountain, not part of any range. You don't need climbing skills to reach the top, so tens of thousands of people try every year, walking from rainforest up to the glaciers.","fact":"山上有网了！2022 年 8 月坦桑尼亚先在海拔 3720 米的营地装了高速网络，到 12 月信号通到了 5895 米的乌呼鲁峰，站在山顶就能发视频。","fact_en":"There's internet up there! In August 2022 Tanzania installed fast internet at a camp at 3,720 m, and by December the signal reached Uhuru Peak at 5,895 m — you can post a video from the summit.","src":"Travel News（南非旅游业媒体）","url":"https://www.travelnews.co.za/article/wifi-reaches-roof-of-africa","say":{"en":"How many days does the Machame route take?","zh":"马切姆路线要走几天？"}},"维多利亚瀑布":{"what":"赞比亚和津巴布韦边界上，整条赞比西河一下子落进峡谷的大瀑布，宽约 1700 米，高 100 多米。","what_en":"A huge waterfall on the border of Zambia and Zimbabwe where the whole Zambezi River drops into a gorge — about 1,700 m wide and over 100 m high.","fame":"它不是最高的，也不是最宽的，但算起来是世界上最大的一整片落水；雨季过后水最多，水雾冲上几百米，很远就能看见。","fame_en":"It isn't the tallest or the widest, but it's the largest single sheet of falling water in the world. After the rainy season the spray rises hundreds of metres and can be seen from far away.","fact":"当地洛兹语叫它 Mosi-oa-Tunya，意思是「轰隆作响的烟」。1989 年列入世界遗产时，正式名字把当地名放在了前面：Mosi-oa-Tunya / Victoria Falls。","fact_en":"In the local Lozi language it's called Mosi-oa-Tunya, 'the smoke that thunders'. When it became a World Heritage Site in 1989, the official name put the local name first: Mosi-oa-Tunya / Victoria Falls.","src":"Wikipedia「Victoria Falls」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victoria_Falls","say":{"en":"Do I need a raincoat on the bridge?","zh":"在桥上要穿雨衣吗？"}},"红沙丘":{"what":"纳米比亚纳米布沙漠里的索苏斯盐沼一带，橘红色的大沙丘一座挨着一座。","what_en":"Around Sossusvlei in Namibia's Namib Desert, giant orange-red dunes stand one after another.","fame":"纳米布被认为是世界上最古老的沙漠之一，有的沙丘高过三百米；日出时「45 号沙丘」一半红一半在影子里，是摄影师最爱的地方。","fame_en":"The Namib is thought to be one of the oldest deserts on Earth, and some dunes rise over 300 m. At sunrise, Dune 45 is half red, half in shadow — a photographers' favourite.","fact":"旁边的「死亡谷」（Deadvlei）里站着一片黑色的骆驼刺树。大约六七百年前河道被沙丘挡住，树就死了；可这里实在太干，树到今天都没有烂掉。","fact_en":"Nearby in Deadvlei stand black camel thorn trees. They died some 600–700 years ago when dunes cut off the river, but the air is so dry that the wood still hasn't rotted.","src":"WorldAtlas","url":"https://www.worldatlas.com/articles/deadvlei-unique-places-of-namibia.html","say":{"en":"What time does the park gate open for sunrise?","zh":"看日出的话，公园大门几点开？"}},"苏伊士运河":{"what":"埃及境内连接地中海和红海的人工运河，全长约 193 公里。","what_en":"A man-made canal in Egypt joining the Mediterranean and the Red Sea, about 193 km long.","fame":"1869 年通航后，亚洲和欧洲之间的船不用再绕非洲南端的好望角；全世界大约一成的海上贸易都从这里过。","fame_en":"Since it opened in 1869, ships between Asia and Europe no longer have to sail around the southern tip of Africa. Roughly a tenth of the world's sea trade passes through it.","fact":"它一个船闸也没有：运河是在低平的沙地上挖出来的，两头的海面差不多一样高，船从头开到尾不用升降——巴拿马运河就得靠船闸把船抬起来。","fact_en":"It has no locks at all. It was dug through low, flat land, and the sea is about the same level at both ends, so ships sail straight through. The Panama Canal, by contrast, needs locks to lift ships up.","src":"Wikipedia「Suez Canal」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suez_Canal","say":{"en":"How long does it take a ship to get through the canal?","zh":"一条船穿过运河要多久？"}},"东非大裂谷":{"what":"非洲东部一条长达几千公里的大地裂缝，地壳在这里被慢慢拉开。","what_en":"A crack in the Earth thousands of kilometres long across East Africa, where the crust is slowly being pulled apart.","fame":"在肯尼亚，谷底有火山、温泉和站满火烈鸟的湖；很多早期人类的化石都是在裂谷里发现的，所以有人叫它「人类的摇篮」。","fame_en":"In Kenya the valley floor has volcanoes, hot springs and lakes full of flamingos. Many early human fossils were found in the Rift, so some call it 'the cradle of humankind'.","fact":"2018 年 3 月一场大雨后，肯尼亚 Mai Mahiu 到 Narok 的公路上突然露出一条大裂缝，最宽处约 20 米、深约 15 米，把公路截断了。地质学家说它不是一夜裂开的：是雨水冲走了盖在上面的火山灰，把底下的裂缝露了出来。","fact_en":"In March 2018, after heavy rain, a huge crack appeared across the Mai Mahiu–Narok road in Kenya — up to about 20 m wide and 15 m deep — and cut the road. Geologists said it didn't open overnight: the rain washed away volcanic ash and exposed a crack that was already there.","src":"National Geographic","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/news/2018/04/east-african-great-rift-valley-crack-spd/","say":{"en":"Can we stop at the viewpoint and look at the valley?","zh":"我们能在观景台停一下看看山谷吗？"}},"黄石公园":{"what":"美国西北部一大片火山高原，地下很热，到处是冒烟的温泉、喷泉和泥浆坑，还有野牛和狼。","what_en":"A huge volcanic plateau in the northwestern US — the ground is hot, full of steaming springs, geysers and mud pots, with bison and wolves roaming.","fame":"1872 年成为世界上第一个国家公园。世界上一半以上的间歇泉在这里，「老忠实泉」大约一个半小时喷一次，游客坐在木栈道边等着看。","fame_en":"In 1872 it became the world's first national park. More than half the world's geysers are here, and people sit along the boardwalks waiting for Old Faithful, which goes off roughly every hour and a half.","fact":"2024 年 7 月 23 日上午，老忠实泉附近的饼干盆地突然发生「热液爆炸」：地下的水一下子变成蒸汽，把热水、泥和石头喷到一百多米高，木栈道被砸坏，游客四散跑开，幸好没人受伤。地质学家说这不是火山爆发，事先仪器也没测到任何征兆。","fact_en":"On the morning of 23 July 2024, Biscuit Basin near Old Faithful had a sudden hydrothermal explosion: underground water flashed to steam and blasted hot water, mud and rock 120–180 m into the air, wrecking the boardwalk as visitors ran. Nobody was hurt. Geologists said it wasn't volcanic, and instruments had picked up no warning signs.","src":"美国地质调查局 USGS 黄石火山观测站，2024 年","url":"https://www.usgs.gov/observatories/yvo/news/july-23-2024-hydrothermal-explosion-biscuit-basin","say":{"en":"What time is Old Faithful supposed to go off next?","zh":"老忠实泉下一次大概几点喷？"}},"大峡谷":{"what":"美国亚利桑那州的一道大裂谷，科罗拉多河用几百万年在红色岩石里切出来，最深的地方一千八百米。","what_en":"A giant gorge in Arizona that the Colorado River cut into red rock over millions of years — up to 1.8 km deep.","fame":"站在边上往下看，一层一层的岩石像一本翻开的地球史书，最底下的石头将近二十亿年。每年有几百万人来看日出日落时岩壁变颜色。","fame_en":"Look over the edge and the rock layers read like an open book of Earth's history — the bottom ones are nearly two billion years old. Millions come every year to watch the walls change colour at sunrise and sunset.","fact":"大峡谷分南缘和北缘，北缘更高更安静。2025 年 7 月，一场叫「Dragon Bravo」的山火烧掉了北缘上将近百年的老旅馆 Grand Canyon Lodge，北缘那一季整个关闭；所有员工和客人都安全撤出了。","fact_en":"The canyon has a South Rim and a higher, quieter North Rim. In July 2025 the Dragon Bravo Fire destroyed the historic Grand Canyon Lodge on the North Rim, and the North Rim closed for the rest of the season. All staff and guests got out safely.","src":"美联社（KTVU 转载），2025 年 7 月","url":"https://www.ktvu.com/news/historic-lodge-grand-canyons-north-rim-has-been-destroyed-wildfire-park-official-says","say":{"en":"Which viewpoint is best for the sunset?","zh":"看日落去哪个观景点最好？"}},"尼亚加拉瀑布":{"what":"美国和加拿大交界的一组大瀑布，五大湖的水从这里往下冲，一边是美国瀑布，一边是加拿大的马蹄瀑布。","what_en":"A set of huge waterfalls on the US–Canada border, where water from the Great Lakes pours over — the American Falls on one side, Canada's Horseshoe Falls on the other.","fame":"水量大得惊人，站在边上衣服很快就湿了。游客穿上雨衣坐船开到瀑布底下，晚上瀑布还会打上彩色灯光。","fame_en":"The sheer volume of water is staggering — you're damp within minutes. Visitors put on ponchos and take a boat right up to the base, and at night the falls are lit up in colours.","fact":"1969 年，美国陆军工程兵团在上游倒了约 2.8 万吨石头筑临时坝，把美国瀑布「关掉」了五个多月，好研究岩石为什么会崩落。头一个星期就有将近十万人跑来看干掉的瀑布。","fact_en":"In 1969 the US Army Corps of Engineers dumped about 28,000 tons of rock to build a temporary dam and 'switched off' the American Falls for over five months to study why the rock was crumbling. Up to 100,000 people came to see the dry falls in the first week.","src":"Niagara Falls USA 官方旅游局","url":"https://www.niagarafallsusa.com/the-source/when-and-why-the-falls-stopped-flowing/","say":{"en":"Do we get the ponchos on the boat, or do we bring our own?","zh":"雨衣是船上发，还是要自己带？"}},"班夫国家公园":{"what":"加拿大落基山里的国家公园，雪山下面是一个个蓝绿色的冰川湖，比如路易斯湖和梦莲湖。","what_en":"A national park in the Canadian Rockies, where snowy peaks rise over turquoise glacier lakes like Lake Louise and Moraine Lake.","fame":"加拿大的第一个国家公园（1885 年）。湖水的蓝绿色来自冰川磨出来的细石粉，阳光一照就发光，很多人第一眼以为照片修过。","fame_en":"Canada's first national park (1885). The lakes get their turquoise glow from fine 'rock flour' ground up by glaciers — many people think the photos are edited until they see it.","fact":"梦莲湖以前天没亮停车场就满了。从 2023 年起，通往梦莲湖的路不再让私家车开进去，只能坐公园的班车、公交车或旅游大巴，要不就骑车、走路 10 公里。","fact_en":"Moraine Lake's car park used to fill up before dawn. Since 2023 the road has been closed to private cars — you go by Parks Canada shuttle, public transit or tour bus, or bike or walk the 10 km.","src":"CBC 加拿大广播公司，2023 年","url":"https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/calgary/moraine-lake-road-closes-to-personal-vehicles-1.6707026","say":{"en":"Is there still space on the early shuttle to Moraine Lake?","zh":"去梦莲湖的早班车还有位子吗？"}},"格陵兰冰盖":{"what":"盖在格陵兰岛上的一整块大冰，面积差不多是新疆那么大，最厚的地方三公里。","what_en":"The single giant sheet of ice covering Greenland — about the size of Mexico, up to three kilometres thick.","fame":"它是北半球最大的冰，如果全部化掉，全世界的海平面会升高七米左右，所以科学家一直盯着它每年化掉多少。","fame_en":"It's the biggest ice in the Northern Hemisphere — if it all melted, global sea level would rise by about seven metres, so scientists track closely how much it loses each year.","fact":"冰盖下面埋着一座冷战时的美军基地「世纪营」（1959 年建，1967 年放弃），表面上是科研站，其实还在试验在冰里藏导弹。2024 年 4 月，NASA 科学家开飞机测冰层时，雷达意外清清楚楚地照出了它的一条条隧道。","fact_en":"Buried in the ice is Camp Century, a Cold War US base built in 1959 and abandoned in 1967 — officially a research station, secretly a test for hiding missiles in ice tunnels. In April 2024 NASA scientists flying a radar survey caught its tunnels in sharper detail than ever, by accident.","src":"Popular Science，2024 年","url":"https://www.popsci.com/technology/nasa-camp-century/","say":{"en":"How thick is the ice right under us?","zh":"我们脚下的冰有多厚？"}},"五大湖":{"what":"美国和加拿大交界的五个大湖：苏必利尔、密歇根、休伦、伊利、安大略，连成一串，大得像海。","what_en":"Five huge lakes on the US–Canada border — Superior, Michigan, Huron, Erie and Ontario — linked in a chain and big enough to feel like the sea.","fame":"这里装着北美大部分的地表淡水，几千万人喝它的水。湖边有沙滩、灯塔、货轮，芝加哥、多伦多、底特律都在湖边。","fame_en":"They hold most of North America's surface fresh water and supply drinking water to tens of millions. There are beaches, lighthouses and freighters, and Chicago, Toronto and Detroit all sit on their shores.","fact":"密歇根湖和休伦湖其实可以算同一个湖：两边在麦基诺海峡连着，水位一样高，水两个方向都会流。如果算成一个「密歇根-休伦湖」，它就是世界上面积最大的淡水湖。","fact_en":"Lake Michigan and Lake Huron are hydrologically one lake: they join at the Straits of Mackinac, share the same water level, and water flows both ways. Counted as one 'Lake Michigan–Huron', it's the largest freshwater lake in the world by area.","src":"Wikipedia「Lake Michigan–Huron」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Michigan%E2%80%93Huron","say":{"en":"Is it safe to swim today, or are the waves too big?","zh":"今天能下水游泳吗，还是浪太大？"}},"密西西比河":{"what":"从美国北边一路往南流进墨西哥湾的大河，经过孟菲斯、新奥尔良这些城市。","what_en":"The great river that runs from the northern US all the way south into the Gulf of Mexico, past cities like Memphis and New Orleans.","fame":"美国的「母亲河」：马克·吐温在河上开过蒸汽船，布鲁斯和爵士乐沿着它长大；今天河上还是有很多驳船运粮食和货物。","fame_en":"It's America's 'mother river': Mark Twain piloted steamboats on it, blues and jazz grew up along its banks, and today barges still haul grain and cargo up and down.","fact":"河水少的年份，墨西哥湾的海水会从河底往上游爬，威胁新奥尔良一带的自来水。美国陆军工程兵团就在河底用泥沙堆一道「水下门槛」挡住咸水——1988、1999、2012、2022、2023 年都堆过。","fact_en":"In low-water years, seawater from the Gulf creeps upriver along the riverbed and threatens drinking water around New Orleans. The Army Corps of Engineers then piles up an underwater sand 'sill' to block it — they built one in 1988, 1999, 2012, 2022 and 2023.","src":"WWL-TV 新奥尔良，2023 年","url":"https://www.wwltv.com/article/news/local/construction-begins-on-mississippi-river-underwater-sill-as-saltwater-wedge-begins-to-creep-upriver-climate-change-saltwater-intrusion-water-river/289-7f4e5861-660d-4dca-89ae-8e5be1d5988f","say":{"en":"What time does the riverboat leave?","zh":"游船几点开？"}},"巴拿马运河":{"what":"挖穿巴拿马的一条运河，把大西洋和太平洋连起来，船从一边开到另一边大约要八到十个小时。","what_en":"A canal cut across Panama linking the Atlantic and the Pacific — a ship takes roughly eight to ten hours to cross.","fame":"船不用再绕过南美洲最南端，少走一万多公里。运河中间比海面高，船要靠船闸一级一级「坐电梯」升上去再降下来，游客可以在米拉弗洛雷斯船闸看大船慢慢升起。","fame_en":"Ships no longer have to go all the way round the tip of South America — saving over 10,000 km. The middle of the canal sits above sea level, so ships ride the locks up and down like a lift; visitors watch them rise at the Miraflores Locks.","fact":"船闸靠的是加通湖的淡水，每过一条船就有大量淡水流进大海。2023 年大旱，湖水降到很低，运河只好限船，最少的时候一天只放 24 条船过，全世界的货运都排起了长队。这个湖也是巴拿马一半人喝的水。","fact_en":"The locks run on fresh water from Gatun Lake, and every ship that passes sends a lot of it out to sea. In the 2023 drought the lake dropped so low that the canal cut traffic to as few as 24 ships a day, causing a global shipping backlog. The same lake supplies drinking water for about half of Panama.","src":"彭博社（AJOT 转载），2024 年","url":"https://www.ajot.com/news/panama-canal-eases-limits-that-caused-global-shipping-bottleneck","say":{"en":"When's the next big ship coming through the locks?","zh":"下一条大船什么时候过船闸？"}},"天使瀑布":{"what":"委内瑞拉雨林里，从一座平顶高山（特普伊）上落下来的瀑布，水落下来将近一公里。","what_en":"A waterfall in Venezuela's rainforest that drops from the top of a flat-topped mountain (a tepui) — a fall of nearly a kilometre.","fame":"世界上落差最高的瀑布，差不多是尼亚加拉瀑布的十五倍高。没有路通过去，只能坐小飞机再换独木舟进去，所以很多人一辈子只在照片里见过。","fame_en":"It's the world's tallest waterfall, about fifteen times the height of Niagara. There's no road — you fly in on a small plane and then go by dugout canoe — so most people only ever see it in photos.","fact":"它的英文名来自美国飞行员 Jimmie Angel：1937 年他把飞机降落在瀑布上面的山顶，轮子陷进沼泽，飞机再也飞不起来，他和妻子等四个人走了 11 天才下山。当地佩蒙人叫它 Kerepakupai Merú。","fact_en":"Its English name comes from US pilot Jimmie Angel, who landed on the tepui above it in 1937. His wheels sank into the bog and the plane never flew again — he, his wife and two others took 11 days to walk down. The local Pemon name is Kerepakupai Merú.","src":"Wikipedia「Angel Falls」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angel_Falls","say":{"en":"How long is the canoe ride to the falls?","zh":"坐独木舟到瀑布要多久？"}},"伊瓜苏瀑布":{"what":"阿根廷和巴西交界的一大片瀑布群，两百多道瀑布连成好几公里长的半圆。","what_en":"A vast chain of waterfalls on the Argentina–Brazil border — more than 200 falls in a horseshoe kilometres long.","fame":"最猛的一段叫「魔鬼咽喉」，走到栈道尽头，水声震耳，水雾扑脸。阿根廷那边走在瀑布上面，巴西那边看全景，很多人两边都去。","fame_en":"The fiercest stretch is the Devil's Throat — at the end of the walkway the roar is deafening and the spray hits your face. Argentina's side puts you right above the falls; Brazil's gives the panorama, so many people do both.","fact":"河水涨起来时栈道会被冲坏。2026 年 8 月，阿根廷国家公园因为厄尔尼诺可能带来大洪水，把「魔鬼咽喉」步道关了 40 天，还提前把一段段栈道和栏杆拆下来收好，等水退了再装回去。","fact_en":"When the river surges it can wreck the walkways. In August 2026 the Argentine park closed the Devil's Throat circuit for 40 days because El Niño rains threatened extreme floods — crews took sections of walkway and railing down in advance to reinstall later.","src":"Buenos Aires Herald，2026 年 8 月","url":"https://buenosairesherald.com/environment/iguazu-falls-devils-throat-to-close-for-40-days-amid-flood-risk","say":{"en":"Is the Devil's Throat walkway open today?","zh":"今天魔鬼咽喉的步道开吗？"}},"莫雷诺冰川":{"what":"阿根廷巴塔哥尼亚的一条大冰川，冰墙有六七十米高，一直伸进阿根廷湖。","what_en":"A great glacier in Argentine Patagonia whose ice wall, 60–70 m high, pushes right into Lago Argentino.","fame":"游客站在对面的木栈道上，就能听见冰「咔嚓」一声，大块冰掉进湖里溅起浪花。它还会堵住湖的一角，水压大了冲开冰坝，场面很壮观。","fame_en":"From the boardwalks across the water you hear the ice crack and watch huge chunks crash into the lake. It sometimes dams off an arm of the lake until the water bursts through — a spectacular rupture.","fact":"很多年来它都是少见的「不缩」的冰川，进进退退保持平衡。可是 2025 年的研究发现，2019 年以后它每年变薄五六米，2022 年起连续几年没再长回原来的位置，科学家担心它开始真正后退了。","fact_en":"For decades it was a rare glacier that held steady, advancing and retreating in balance. But 2025 studies found it has thinned by 5–6 m a year since 2019, and since 2022 it hasn't returned to its previous position — scientists fear it has started a real retreat.","src":"美联社（News4JAX 转载），2025 年 8 月","url":"https://www.news4jax.com/tech/2025/08/07/scientists-thought-this-argentine-glacier-was-stable-now-they-say-its-melting-fast/","say":{"en":"Which part of the walkway is best for seeing the ice fall?","zh":"栈道哪一段看冰掉下来最好？"}},"阿塔卡马星空":{"what":"智利北部的阿塔卡马沙漠，又高又干，天上几乎没有云，晚上的星星多得数不清。","what_en":"Chile's Atacama Desert — high, bone-dry and almost cloudless, with more stars at night than you can count.","fame":"世界上最干的沙漠之一，空气稀薄、没有光污染，所以很多大型天文台建在这里。游客在圣佩德罗镇报夜里的观星团，用望远镜看土星环。","fame_en":"One of the driest deserts on Earth, with thin air and no light pollution — which is why so many big observatories are here. Visitors book night stargazing tours in San Pedro and see Saturn's rings through a telescope.","fact":"阿塔卡马的 ALMA 射电望远镜阵列建在海拔 5000 米的查南托高原，空气太稀薄，人在上面干活很难受。所以工作人员大多在低两千一百米的基地（海拔 2900 米）里，远程操作山上的天线。","fact_en":"The ALMA radio telescope array sits on the Chajnantor plateau at 5,000 m, where the thin air makes work miserable for people. So most staff are based 2,100 m lower, at 2,900 m, and control the antennas remotely from there.","src":"欧洲南方天文台 ESO","url":"https://www.eso.org/public/images/potw1141a/","say":{"en":"Will the moon be up during tonight's stargazing tour?","zh":"今晚观星的时候月亮会出来吗？"}},"复活节岛石像":{"what":"太平洋中间一座孤岛上的大石像，当地叫「摩艾」，一共九百多座，大多背对大海、面朝村子。","what_en":"The giant stone statues, called moai, on a lone island in the middle of the Pacific — nearly a thousand of them, most facing inland with their backs to the sea.","fame":"拉帕努伊人几百年前用火山石雕出来，代表祖先，守护村子。离最近的有人住的地方两千多公里，大家一直好奇这么重的石像是怎么运过去、立起来的。","fame_en":"The Rapa Nui people carved them from volcanic rock centuries ago to represent ancestors watching over villages. The island is over 2,000 km from the nearest inhabited land, and people still wonder how such heavy statues were moved and raised.","fact":"岛上最壮观的汤加里基 15 尊石像，1960 年被智利大地震引起的海啸冲倒、冲到内陆。1990 年代，日本吊车公司多田野（Tadano）送来吊车，跟智利政府和智利大学合作五年才把它们一尊尊重新立起来，最重的一尊 86 吨。","fact_en":"The island's most famous row, the 15 moai of Ahu Tongariki, was swept inland by the tsunami from Chile's 1960 earthquake. In the 1990s Japanese crane maker Tadano donated a crane and worked with Chile's government and the University of Chile for five years to stand them back up — the heaviest weighs 86 tonnes.","src":"Wikipedia「Ahu Tongariki」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ahu_Tongariki","say":{"en":"What time should we get to Tongariki for the sunrise?","zh":"去汤加里基看日出要几点到？"}},"乌尤尼盐沼":{"what":"玻利维亚高原上一万平方公里的白色盐地，雨季铺一层薄水，天和地连成一面大镜子。","what_en":"Ten thousand square kilometres of white salt on Bolivia's high plateau — in the rainy season a thin film of water turns it into a giant mirror of the sky.","fame":"「天空之镜」：人走在上面像走在云里。旱季地面一片白，没有参照物，大家喜欢拍「错位照」，把人拍得站在恐龙玩具或酒瓶上。","fame_en":"The 'mirror of the sky': walking on it feels like walking on clouds. In the dry season it's pure white with nothing to judge distance by, so everyone takes trick-perspective photos — people standing on toy dinosaurs or bottles.","fact":"它平得惊人：一万平方公里上高低差不到一米。所以 NASA 拿它当「标尺」，校准从太空测地面高度的激光卫星 ICESat。科学家后来用 GPS 走遍盐沼，才发现上面其实有几厘米到半米的小起伏。","fact_en":"It's astonishingly flat — less than a metre of relief over some 10,000 km². NASA used it as a ruler to calibrate ICESat, a satellite that measures Earth's height by laser. Later GPS surveys found it does have gentle bumps of a few centimetres to half a metre.","src":"Science News","url":"https://www.sciencenews.org/article/salt-flat-isnt-flat-worlds-largest-playa-sports-ridges-valleys","say":{"en":"Is there water on the salt flat right now?","zh":"现在盐沼上有水吗？"}},"新加坡鱼尾狮":{"what":"新加坡滨海湾边上一座狮子头、鱼身子的白色雕像，嘴里一直往海湾里喷水。","what_en":"A white statue with a lion's head and a fish's body on the edge of Singapore's Marina Bay, always spouting water into the bay.","fame":"新加坡的标志：狮头来自「狮城」这个名字，鱼身代表它原来是个渔村。游客都要拍一张张嘴「接水」的照片，背后是金沙酒店。","fame_en":"It's Singapore's symbol — the lion head for the name 'Lion City', the fish body for its fishing-village past. Every visitor takes the photo where they 'catch' the water in their mouth, with Marina Bay Sands behind.","fact":"鱼尾狮其实搬过家。1997 年滨海艺术中心大桥修好后挡住了它面向海湾的视线，2002 年 4 月政府花了 750 万新元，把它往前挪了约 120 米；因为它比桥还高，过不了桥底，只好把它吊起来从桥上面运过去。","fact_en":"The Merlion has moved house. After the Esplanade Bridge opened in 1997 and blocked its view of the bay, in April 2002 the government spent S$7.5 million moving it about 120 m — too tall to pass under the bridge, it was lifted over it.","src":"Wikipedia「Merlion Park」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Merlion_Park","say":{"en":"Could you take a photo of us with the Merlion behind?","zh":"能帮我们拍一张背后有鱼尾狮的照片吗？"}},"巴厘岛":{"what":"印度尼西亚的一座岛，大部分人信印度教，家家门口都有小供品，岛上有梯田、寺庙和冲浪的海滩。","what_en":"An Indonesian island where most people are Hindu — every doorstep has small offerings — with rice terraces, temples and surf beaches.","fame":"叫「众神之岛」：每天早上路边都摆着花和米做的小供盘。冲浪、瑜伽、梯田、海边日落都有，是澳大利亚人最爱去的度假地，也是很多数字游民住的地方。","fame_en":"It's called the 'Island of the Gods' — every morning there are little trays of flowers and rice by the roadside. Surfing, yoga, rice terraces and sunsets make it Australians' favourite getaway and home to many digital nomads.","fact":"从 2024 年 2 月 14 日起，外国游客来巴厘岛要交 15 万印尼盾（约 65 元人民币）的旅游税，可以提前在网上交，也可以在机场和港口交，交完拿到一个二维码凭证。政府说这笔钱用来保护自然和文化。","fact_en":"Since 14 February 2024, foreign tourists pay a levy of 150,000 rupiah to visit Bali — online before you go or at the airport or seaport — and get a QR-code voucher as proof. The government says it funds protecting nature and culture.","src":"Canberra Times，2024 年","url":"https://www.canberratimes.com.au/story/8517970/australian-tourists-charged-bali-tourist-tax-from-february-2024/","say":{"en":"Do I need a sarong to go into the temple?","zh":"进寺庙要围纱笼吗？"}},"马尔代夫":{"what":"印度洋上一千多个小珊瑚岛组成的国家，海水是好几种蓝，很多酒店一个岛只有一家。","what_en":"A nation of over a thousand small coral islands in the Indian Ocean — the sea comes in many shades of blue, and many resorts have an island all to themselves.","fame":"水上屋、浮潜、鲸鲨和蝠鲼，是很多人心中的蜜月地。它也是世界上地势最低的国家，平均只比海面高一米多，海平面上升对它是生死问题。","fame_en":"Overwater villas, snorkelling, whale sharks and manta rays make it a honeymoon dream. It's also the world's lowest-lying country, on average just over a metre above sea level, so rising seas are a matter of survival.","fact":"从 2025 年 11 月 1 日起，马尔代夫成为世界上第一个按出生年份禁烟的国家：2007 年 1 月 1 日及以后出生的人，一辈子都不能在这里买烟、抽烟，游客也一样；电子烟则所有人都禁。","fact_en":"Since 1 November 2025 the Maldives has been the first country with a generational smoking ban: anyone born on or after 1 January 2007 can never buy or use tobacco there — tourists included — and vapes are banned for everyone.","src":"Time Out，2025 年","url":"https://www.timeout.com/asia/news/born-after-2007-its-illegal-for-you-to-smoke-or-vape-in-the-maldives-even-as-a-tourist-110525","say":{"en":"What time does the speedboat to the resort leave?","zh":"去度假岛的快艇几点开？"}},"大堡礁":{"what":"澳大利亚东北海边一条两千多公里长的珊瑚礁，由三千多片礁石组成。","what_en":"A coral reef stretching over 2,000 km along Australia's northeast coast, made up of nearly 3,000 separate reefs.","fame":"世界上最大的珊瑚礁群，住着上千种鱼、海龟和鲨鱼。从凯恩斯或艾尔利海滩坐船出海，戴上面罩就能看到。","fame_en":"It's the world's largest coral reef system, home to over a thousand fish species, turtles and sharks. Take a boat out from Cairns or Airlie Beach, put on a mask and you're in it.","fact":"2024 年海水太热，大堡礁发生大规模白化。澳大利亚海洋科学研究所 2025 年 8 月的报告说，三个区域里有两个出现了 39 年监测以来最大的一年珊瑚减少，北部的珊瑚覆盖率从约 40% 掉到 30%。","fact_en":"Record heat in 2024 caused mass bleaching. In August 2025 the Australian Institute of Marine Science reported that two of the reef's three regions saw their biggest one-year coral decline in 39 years of monitoring — northern coral cover fell from about 40% to 30%.","src":"澳大利亚海洋科学研究所 AIMS 年度报告（The Microbiologist 报道），2025 年 8 月","url":"https://www.the-microbiologist.com/news/great-barrier-reef-more-volatile-with-sharp-declines-in-coral-cover/6481.article","say":{"en":"Do I need a stinger suit to snorkel today?","zh":"今天浮潜要穿防水母服吗？"}},"乌鲁鲁":{"what":"澳大利亚正中间沙漠里的一块巨大红色独体岩，高 348 米，绕一圈要走将近十公里。","what_en":"A huge red sandstone monolith in the desert at the centre of Australia — 348 m high, almost 10 km to walk around.","fame":"它是阿南古原住民最神圣的地方，几万年来岩石上的每个洞和纹路都连着他们的故事。日出日落时岩石从橙色变成深红，游客坐在观景点静静看。","fame_en":"It's the most sacred place of the Anangu, the Aboriginal traditional owners — for tens of thousands of years every cave and mark on the rock has been tied to their stories. At sunrise and sunset it shifts from orange to deep red as visitors watch in silence.","fact":"2019 年 10 月 26 日起，乌鲁鲁永久禁止攀爬。日子是特意选的：1985 年的同一天，澳大利亚政府把这片土地交还给阿南古人。现在游客走环岩步道，跟着原住民讲解员听岩石的故事。","fact_en":"Climbing Uluru has been banned for good since 26 October 2019 — a date chosen on purpose: on the same day in 1985, the government handed the land back to the Anangu. Today visitors walk the base trail and hear the rock's stories from Aboriginal guides.","src":"澳大利亚国家公园管理局 Parks Australia","url":"https://parksaustralia.gov.au/uluru/discover/culture/uluru-climb","say":{"en":"Are we allowed to take photos along this part of the walk?","zh":"这一段步道可以拍照吗？"}},"狗不理包子":{"what":"天津最有名的老字号包子，一个包子捏十八个褶。","what_en":"Tianjin's most famous old-brand steamed bun, each one folded into eighteen pleats.","fame":"从 1858 年开到现在，是来天津的人几乎都会去吃一笼的「天津名片」；本地人倒更常去街边的小包子铺。","fame_en":"Open since 1858, it's the bun almost every visitor to Tianjin tries once — though locals usually eat at small neighbourhood bun shops.","fact":"名字来自创始人高贵友的小名「狗子」：传说他包子卖得太忙，顾不上跟客人说话，大家就说「狗子卖包子，不理人」。","fact_en":"The name comes from founder Gao Guiyou's childhood nickname, Gouzi ('little dog'). Legend says he got so busy selling buns that he ignored customers — 'Gouzi doesn't pay attention' stuck.","src":"Wikipedia：Goubuli","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goubuli","say":{"en":"One basket of pork buns, please. How many are in a basket?","zh":"来一笼猪肉包子。一笼几个？"}},"刀削面":{"what":"山西太原的面：师傅一手托面团，一手拿刀把面一片片削进锅里。","what_en":"A Shanxi noodle from Taiyuan: the cook holds a block of dough and shaves strips straight into the boiling pot.","fame":"面条中间厚、两边薄，又筋道又吸汤，配上山西老陈醋；看师傅削面本身就是一场表演。","fame_en":"Each strip is thick in the middle and thin at the edges — chewy and great at soaking up sauce, with a splash of Shanxi vinegar. Watching the cook shave it is half the fun.","fact":"有人发明了削面机器人：河北的崔润泉 2000 年代做出了「削面奥特曼」，一台大约 2000 美元，比请一个削面师傅一年的工资还便宜，几年就卖了几千台。","fact_en":"There's a noodle-shaving robot: Cui Runquan from Hebei built the 'Chef Cui' in the 2000s. At about US$2,000 it cost less than a year's wages for a human noodle shaver, and thousands were sold.","src":"NBC News：Noodle-slicing robots invade restaurants","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/tech/tech-news/noodle-slicing-robots-invade-restaurants-steal-jobs-flna956437","say":{"en":"A bowl of knife-cut noodles with braised pork, please — and some vinegar.","zh":"来一碗刀削面，加卤肉，再给点醋。"}},"阳澄湖大闸蟹":{"what":"苏州阳澄湖的毛蟹，秋天最肥，蒸熟了蘸姜醋吃。","what_en":"Hairy crabs from Yangcheng Lake near Suzhou — fattest in autumn, steamed and dipped in ginger vinegar.","fame":"上海、苏州人秋天的大事：「九月团脐十月尖」，九月吃母蟹的蟹黄，十月吃公蟹的蟹膏，一只能吃一个钟头。","fame_en":"Autumn's big event for Shanghai and Suzhou: females in the ninth lunar month for the roe, males in the tenth for the creamy 'paste'. Locals can spend an hour on one crab.","fact":"同一种蟹在欧洲是入侵物种：它们搭货船的压舱水到了德国、英国，在河岸打洞、钻进排水管，1995 年伦敦格林尼治还有人看见它们从泰晤士河爬上岸。","fact_en":"The same crab is an invasive species in Europe: it arrived in ship ballast water, burrows into riverbanks and clogs drains — in 1995 Greenwich residents saw them climbing out of the Thames.","src":"Wikipedia：Chinese mitten crab","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_mitten_crab","say":{"en":"How much is one crab? Is it male or female?","zh":"一只多少钱？是公的还是母的？"}},"武夷山大红袍":{"what":"福建武夷山岩缝里长的乌龙茶，叫「岩茶」，大红袍是里面最有名的。","what_en":"An oolong grown among the rocky cliffs of the Wuyi Mountains in Fujian — 'rock tea' — and Da Hong Pao ('Big Red Robe') is the most famous kind.","fame":"焙火香重，喝完嘴里有一股「岩韵」；福建、广东人用小壶小杯一泡一泡地喝，能泡七八次。","fame_en":"It's roasted, rich and leaves a mineral 'rock' aftertaste. In Fujian and Guangdong people brew it gongfu-style in tiny cups, seven or eight infusions per pot.","fact":"悬崖上只剩 6 棵「母树」：2005 年它们的 20 克茶叶拍出 20.8 万元；2006 年起武夷山政府不再让人采这几棵树，现在你喝到的都是扦插繁育出来的后代。","fact_en":"Only six 'mother trees' remain on the cliff. In 2005, 20g of their tea sold for ¥208,000; since 2006 the local government has banned picking them, so all Da Hong Pao you drink now comes from cuttings.","src":"Wikipedia：Da Hong Pao","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Da_Hong_Pao","say":{"en":"Can I taste it first? How much is it for 50 grams?","zh":"能先尝尝吗？五十克多少钱？"}},"青岛啤酒":{"what":"山东青岛产的啤酒，中国最有名的啤酒牌子之一。","what_en":"The beer brewed in Qingdao, Shandong — one of China's best-known beer brands.","fame":"在青岛，夏天街边用塑料袋打散装生啤是日常；每年 8 月的青岛国际啤酒节吸引几百万人。","fame_en":"In Qingdao, buying draught beer by the plastic bag from a street stall is a normal summer thing, and the August beer festival draws millions.","fact":"它是 1903 年德国和英国商人办的，原名「日耳曼啤酒公司青岛股份公司」；1916 年卖给了日本公司，后来才回到中国人手里。","fact_en":"It was founded in 1903 by German and British merchants as the Germania-Brauerei; in 1916 it was sold to a Japanese brewer and only later came under Chinese ownership.","src":"Wikipedia：Tsingtao Brewery","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsingtao_Brewery","say":{"en":"One bag of draught beer, please — is it fresh today?","zh":"打一袋扎啤，今天的新鲜吗？"}},"广州早茶":{"what":"广州人早上去茶楼「叹早茶」：一壶茶，几笼点心，一坐就是一上午。","what_en":"Morning 'yum cha' in Guangzhou: a pot of tea, a few baskets of dim sum, and a whole morning at the teahouse.","fame":"「一盅两件」——一盅茶两件点心，虾饺、烧卖、叉烧包、凤爪；周末茶楼里是一家三代人一起聊天的地方。","fame_en":"'One pot, two pieces' — tea with dumplings like har gow, siu mai, char siu bao and chicken feet. At weekends teahouses are full of three generations chatting together.","fact":"别人给你倒茶时，用两根手指轻敲桌面表示「谢谢」。传说乾隆微服下江南时给随从倒茶，随从不能当众磕头，就用手指在桌上「叩」了几下。","fact_en":"When someone pours you tea, you tap two fingers on the table to say thanks. Legend says the Qianlong Emperor, travelling in disguise, poured tea for his companions — they couldn't kowtow without blowing his cover, so they 'kowtowed' with their fingers.","src":"Wikipedia：Yum cha","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yum_cha","say":{"en":"A pot of pu'er, please — and could we have the dim sum order sheet?","zh":"一壶普洱，麻烦给张点心单。"}},"螺蛳粉":{"what":"广西柳州的米粉：螺蛳熬的汤，加酸笋、腐竹、花生，闻着臭吃着香。","what_en":"Rice noodles from Liuzhou, Guangxi: river-snail broth with sour bamboo shoots, fried tofu skin and peanuts — smells funky, tastes great.","fame":"那股「臭味」来自发酵的酸笋。袋装螺蛳粉这几年卖遍全国，是大学宿舍和加班夜里的常客。","fame_en":"The 'stink' comes from fermented bamboo shoots. Packet luosifen now sells all over China — a staple of student dorms and late-night overtime.","fact":"2021 年，「柳州螺蛳粉制作技艺」进了第五批国家级非物质文化遗产名录，跟沙县小吃、桂林米粉同一批。","fact_en":"In 2021 the craft of making Liuzhou luosifen was added to China's fifth national list of intangible cultural heritage — in the same batch as Shaxian snacks and Guilin rice noodles.","src":"中国日报双语新闻：螺蛳粉入选国家级非遗","url":"https://language.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202106/15/WS60c7ed84a31024ad0bac6ae9.html","say":{"en":"Less spicy, please, and add a fried egg. Can I have extra sour bamboo?","zh":"少辣，加个煎蛋。酸笋能多放点吗？"}},"重庆火锅":{"what":"重庆的麻辣火锅：一锅红油牛油汤，毛肚、鸭肠、黄喉自己涮。","what_en":"Chongqing's numbing-spicy hot pot: a pot of red beef-tallow broth where you cook your own tripe, duck intestine and aorta.","fame":"重庆人一年四季都吃，夏天也照吃；毛肚讲究「七上八下」，夹着在锅里提起放下十五次就熟了，蘸香油蒜泥。","fame_en":"Chongqing people eat it all year, even in summer. Tripe is dipped 'seven up, eight down' — about fifteen dunks — then dunked in sesame oil and garlic.","fact":"重庆火锅最早是长江边穷船工吃的：大家围着一口锅，把便宜的牛内脏丢进辣汤里煮，又顶饱又驱湿气。","fact_en":"Chongqing hot pot was first eaten by poor Yangtze boatmen: gathered around one pot, they cooked cheap beef offal in spicy broth — filling, and good against the damp.","src":"China Daily：Hotpot (火锅)","url":"https://govt.chinadaily.com.cn/s/201906/17/WS5d07318d498e12256565dc9b/hotpot-huo-guo-huo-guo.html","say":{"en":"Can we have a split pot — half spicy, half mild? And a plate of tripe.","zh":"要个鸳鸯锅，一半辣一半清汤。再来一份毛肚。"}},"茅台酒":{"what":"贵州茅台镇产的酱香型白酒，中国最贵、最有名的白酒。","what_en":"A sauce-aroma baijiu from Maotai town in Guizhou — China's most famous and most expensive liquor.","fame":"国宴、婚礼、生意饭局上的「硬通货」，很多人买来是送礼，不是自己喝；酒精度 53 度。","fame_en":"It's the 'hard currency' of state banquets, weddings and business dinners — often bought as a gift rather than to drink. It's 53% alcohol.","fact":"2023 年 9 月，瑞幸和茅台出了一款「酱香拿铁」，每杯含一点茅台，上市第一天卖了 542 万杯。","fact_en":"In September 2023, Luckin Coffee and Moutai launched a 'Moutai latte' with a dash of baijiu — it sold 5.42 million cups on its first day.","src":"World Coffee Portal","url":"https://www.worldcoffeeportal.com/news/luckin-coffees-moutai-alcohol-infused-latte-delivers-13-7m-in-first-day-sales/","say":{"en":"Just a small glass for me, please — I have to drive.","zh":"我就喝一小杯，我要开车。"}},"普洱茶":{"what":"云南产的茶，常压成圆圆的茶饼，可以放很多年。","what_en":"Tea from Yunnan, often pressed into round cakes that can be aged for years.","fame":"分生茶和熟茶，放得越久味道越醇；广东早茶最常点的就是普洱，喝着解腻。","fame_en":"There's raw (sheng) and ripe (shou) pu'er, and it mellows with age. It's the most-ordered tea at Cantonese dim sum because it cuts through the grease.","fact":"「普洱」本来是个茶叶集散的老地名。2007 年，云南的思茅市干脆改名叫「普洱市」，就是为了沾茶的名气。","fact_en":"Pu'er was an old tea-trading town. In 2007 the city of Simao in Yunnan officially renamed itself Pu'er City, to cash in on the tea's fame.","src":"Wikipedia：Pu'er City","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pu%27er_City","say":{"en":"Is this raw or ripe pu'er? What year is the cake from?","zh":"这是生普还是熟普？是哪一年的饼？"}},"兰州牛肉面":{"what":"甘肃兰州的清汤牛肉拉面，师傅当面把面拉出来。","what_en":"Clear-broth beef noodles from Lanzhou in Gansu, hand-pulled in front of you.","fame":"「一清二白三红四绿五黄」：汤清、萝卜白、辣油红、香菜蒜苗绿、面黄。兰州人早上就吃一碗，还能挑面的粗细：毛细、二细、韭叶、宽的……","fame_en":"'Clear soup, white radish, red chilli oil, green coriander, yellow noodles.' Lanzhou people eat it for breakfast and choose the thickness — hair-thin, thin, chive-leaf, wide…","fact":"全国各地挂着「兰州拉面」招牌的店，大多其实是青海化隆人开的，做法跟兰州本地的牛肉面不太一样。","fact_en":"Most shops outside Lanzhou with a 'Lanzhou Lamian' sign are actually run by people from Hualong County in Qinghai — and their noodles differ from Lanzhou's own beef noodles.","src":"Wikipedia：Lanzhou beef noodles","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lanzhou_beef_noodles","say":{"en":"One beef noodle, 'thin' please, extra chilli oil, no coriander.","zh":"一碗牛肉面，二细，多放辣子，不要香菜。"}},"吐鲁番葡萄":{"what":"新疆吐鲁番的葡萄和葡萄干，又甜又多汁。","what_en":"Grapes and raisins from Turpan in Xinjiang — very sweet and juicy.","fame":"吐鲁番夏天特别热、白天晚上温差大，葡萄糖分高；8 月有葡萄节，葡萄沟里葡萄架下面就能吃饭乘凉。","fame_en":"Turpan's scorching summers and big day–night temperature swings make the grapes very sugary. In August there's a grape festival, and in Grape Valley you can eat in the shade of the vines.","fact":"吐鲁番的绿葡萄干不是晒出来的，是在满墙是孔的土坯「晾房」里用热风吹大约 40 天吹干的；不见太阳，所以是绿的。","fact_en":"Turpan's green raisins aren't sun-dried: they hang for about 40 days in mud-brick drying houses full of holes, dried by hot wind. No direct sun is why they stay green.","src":"Wikipedia：Chunche","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chunche","say":{"en":"Can I try one? How much for half a kilo of green raisins?","zh":"能尝一个吗？绿葡萄干一斤多少钱？"}},"大盘鸡":{"what":"新疆的大盘鸡：鸡块、土豆、青椒炖得又辣又香，吃到最后拌一把宽皮带面。","what_en":"Xinjiang 'big plate chicken': chicken, potatoes and green peppers in a spicy stew, finished by mixing in wide belt noodles.","fame":"一盘够三四个人吃，是新疆人聚会、跑长途司机路边吃饭的常点菜，现在全国到处都有「新疆大盘鸡」馆子。","fame_en":"One plate feeds three or four — a go-to for Xinjiang get-togethers and long-haul drivers at roadside diners, and now there are 'Xinjiang dapanji' restaurants all over China.","fact":"大盘鸡不是老菜：1980 年代末才出现在新疆沙湾，据说是一位四川来的厨师想做出家乡的辣味，用辣椒、鸡和土豆炖出来的。","fact_en":"It's not an old dish: it appeared in Shawan, Xinjiang, in the late 1980s — reportedly invented by a chef from Sichuan trying to recreate the spicy taste of home with chilli, chicken and potatoes.","src":"Wikipedia：Dapanji","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dapanji","say":{"en":"A medium big-plate chicken for three, please, and add belt noodles.","zh":"来个中盘的大盘鸡，三个人吃，加皮带面。"}},"珍珠奶茶":{"what":"台湾的奶茶，里面加一颗颗有嚼劲的木薯粉圆「珍珠」，用粗吸管喝。","what_en":"Taiwanese milk tea with chewy tapioca 'pearls', drunk through a fat straw.","fame":"在台湾，手摇饮料店几乎每条街都有，点的时候要选甜度和冰块；现在从伦敦到洛杉矶都排得到长队。","fame_en":"In Taiwan there's a drinks shop on nearly every street, and you choose your sugar and ice level. Now there are queues for it from London to LA.","fact":"台中春水堂和台南翰林茶馆都说珍珠奶茶是自己发明的，打了十年官司；2019 年法院判：谁都可以做，没必要争谁是第一个。","fact_en":"Chun Shui Tang (Taichung) and Hanlin Tea Room (Tainan) both claimed to have invented it and fought a ten-year legal battle. In 2019 the court ruled anyone could make it, so there was no point arguing who was first.","src":"CNN（abc17news 转载）：The origins of bubble tea","url":"https://abc17news.com/entertainment/cnn-style/2024/10/20/the-origins-of-bubble-tea-one-of-taiwans-most-beloved-beverages/","say":{"en":"A large pearl milk tea, half sugar, less ice, please.","zh":"一杯大杯珍珠奶茶，半糖少冰。"}},"韩国泡菜":{"what":"白菜先用盐腌，再抹上辣椒粉、蒜和鱼露放着发酵，酸、辣，还带一点点气泡感；韩国人几乎每顿饭都有一碟。","what_en":"Napa cabbage salted, rubbed with chilli flakes, garlic and fish sauce, then left to ferment — sour, spicy, a little fizzy. Almost every Korean meal comes with a small dish of it.","fame":"在韩国餐馆，泡菜和别的小菜一般不要钱、吃完还能再要；每年入冬，一家人围在一起腌够一整个冬天的泡菜，叫「越冬泡菜」（김장），2013 年被列入联合国非遗。","fame_en":"In Korean restaurants kimchi and the other side dishes are usually free and refilled. Every early winter families get together to make a whole season's kimchi — kimjang — which UNESCO listed as intangible heritage in 2013.","fact":"韩国从 2020 年起有了「泡菜日」——每年 11 月 22 日；2021 年，美国加州议会也通过决议，把 11 月 22 日定为加州的泡菜日。","fact_en":"South Korea has marked Kimchi Day on 22 November since 2020. In 2021 the California State Assembly passed a resolution making 22 November Kimchi Day there too.","src":"The Korea Times，2021 年 8 月","url":"https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/lifestyle/travel-food/20210824/californias-assembly-passes-resolution-to-celebrate-kimchi-day","say":{"en":"Excuse me, could we have some more kimchi, please?","zh":"不好意思，能再给点泡菜吗？"}},"全州拌饭":{"what":"一碗热米饭上铺好几样蔬菜、肉和一个蛋，加一勺辣椒酱拌匀了吃；全州的拌饭是韩国最出名的。","what_en":"A bowl of hot rice topped with several kinds of vegetables, some meat and an egg — add a spoon of chilli paste and mix it all up. Jeonju's version is the most famous in Korea.","fame":"「비빔밥」就是「拌的饭」。全州是韩国出名的美食城，韩屋村一带满街都是拌饭店，常用滚烫的石锅装，锅底会烤出一层香脆的锅巴；从首尔坐 KTX 过去两个小时左右。","fame_en":"Bibimbap simply means \"mixed rice\". Jeonju is Korea's famous food city: the streets around its hanok village are full of bibimbap restaurants, often serving it in a sizzling stone pot that crisps the rice at the bottom. It's about two hours from Seoul by KTX.","fact":"2012 年 5 月，全州被联合国教科文组织选进「创意城市网络」，成了「美食之都」；理由之一是这里一代代传下来的家常做法。","fact_en":"In May 2012 UNESCO made Jeonju a Creative City of Gastronomy, partly for the home cooking that has been handed down there for generations.","src":"Wikipedia「Jeonju」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jeonju","say":{"en":"Not too spicy, please — can I add the chilli paste myself?","zh":"别太辣——辣酱我自己加可以吗？"}},"冬阴功汤":{"what":"泰国的酸辣虾汤：香茅、南姜、青柠叶和辣椒一起煮，又酸、又辣、又香。","what_en":"Thailand's hot and sour prawn soup, cooked with lemongrass, galangal, lime leaves and chillies — sour, spicy and fragrant all at once.","fame":"从曼谷的街边小店到酒店都有。分两种：清汤的（น้ำใส），和加了椰奶或淡奶、颜色发红的浓汤（น้ำข้น）；泰国人通常一大碗放桌子中间，大家配白饭一起吃。","fame_en":"You'll find it everywhere from Bangkok street stalls to hotels. There are two kinds: clear broth (nam sai) and the creamier, orange one with coconut or evaporated milk (nam khon). Thais usually put one big bowl in the middle and eat it with rice together.","fact":"2024 年 12 月，冬阴功汤被列入联合国教科文组织的人类非物质文化遗产代表作名录；泰国说，它体现的是泰国中部人家沿河而居的生活。","fact_en":"In December 2024 tom yum kung was added to UNESCO's list of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity. Thailand says it reflects the riverside way of life of central Thailand.","src":"泰国政府网站 thailand.go.th，2024 年 12 月","url":"https://thailand.go.th/issue-focus-detail/tom-yum-kung-inscribed-as-unescos-intangible-cultural-heritage-of-humanity","say":{"en":"One tom yum kung, clear broth, a little less spicy, please.","zh":"一份冬阴功，要清汤的，少辣一点。"}},"越南河粉":{"what":"扁扁的米粉泡在清亮的牛骨汤里，放上牛肉片、葱和香草——河内人常拿它当早饭。","what_en":"Flat rice noodles in a clear beef-bone broth with slices of beef, spring onion and herbs — a usual breakfast in Hanoi.","fame":"河内很多老店天不亮就开门，一家往往只做一两种：生牛肉（tái）、熟牛肉（chín）或者鸡肉（phở gà），坐小塑料凳上吃；南方胡志明市的吃法会配一大盘香草和豆芽，自己加酱。","fame_en":"Many old Hanoi shops open before dawn and make just one or two kinds — rare beef (tái), well-done beef (chín) or chicken (phở gà) — and you eat on a little plastic stool. In Ho Chi Minh City in the south it comes with a big plate of herbs and bean sprouts, and you add the sauces yourself.","fact":"2024 年，「河内河粉」被列为越南国家级非物质文化遗产，11 月 29 日在河内美食文化节上正式宣布。","fact_en":"In 2024 Hanoi phở was named part of Vietnam's National Intangible Cultural Heritage; it was officially announced on 29 November at the Hanoi Culinary Culture Festival.","src":"越南通讯社 VNA，2024 年 11 月","url":"https://vietnam.vnanet.vn/english/print/hanoi-culinary-culture-festival-2024-to-spotlight-hanoi-pho-382060.html","say":{"en":"One rare beef phở, please. How much is it?","zh":"一碗生牛肉河粉。多少钱？"}},"印度咖喱":{"what":"印度菜里用很多香料煮出来、带汤汁的菜——鸡、羊、鱼、豆子、蔬菜都能做，配米饭或饼吃。","what_en":"Indian dishes cooked in a spiced sauce — chicken, mutton, fish, lentils or vegetables — eaten with rice or flatbread.","fame":"印度没有「一种」咖喱：北方多放奶油、酸奶，配烤饼；南方多用椰子、罗望子，配米饭，常常盛在芭蕉叶上用右手抓着吃。英国人把它带到了世界各地，日本的咖喱饭也是这样来的。","fame_en":"There's no single Indian curry. In the north it's often rich with cream or yoghurt and eaten with naan; in the south it uses coconut and tamarind, with rice, often served on a banana leaf and eaten with the right hand. The British took it around the world — that's how Japan got its curry rice too.","fact":"英语的 curry 很可能来自泰米尔语的 kaṟi（கறி），意思是「配米饭吃、加了香料的鱼、肉或菜」，中间可能经过了葡萄牙语的 caril；17 世纪的一本葡萄牙菜谱里就写到了它。","fact_en":"The English word curry probably comes from Tamil kaṟi (கறி) — a spiced dish of fish, meat or vegetables eaten with rice — possibly by way of Portuguese caril. A 17th-century Portuguese cookbook already describes it.","src":"Wikipedia「Curry」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Curry","say":{"en":"Is this one spicy? Could I have it mild, with rice?","zh":"这道辣吗？能做不辣的、配米饭吗？"}},"大吉岭红茶":{"what":"种在喜马拉雅山脚下、印度大吉岭山坡上的红茶，颜色浅，有一股像麝香葡萄的香味。","what_en":"Black tea grown on the steep slopes of Darjeeling in the Himalayan foothills of India — light in colour, with a scent a bit like muscat grapes.","fame":"一年分几季采：春天的「头春」（first flush）清新，初夏的「二春」（second flush）就是那股出名的麝香葡萄味；英国人爱喝，常常什么都不加，所以叫「红茶中的香槟」。","fame_en":"It's picked in seasons: spring's first flush tastes fresh and light, and the early-summer second flush has the famous muscatel flavour. The British love it, usually without milk — hence \"the champagne of teas\".","fact":"2004 年，「大吉岭茶」成了印度第一个注册的地理标志，名字和标志分别是 1 号和 2 号；从那以后，只有大吉岭种的茶才能合法叫「Darjeeling Tea」。","fact_en":"In 2004 Darjeeling tea became India's very first registered geographical indication — the name and logo are registrations No. 1 and No. 2. Since then only tea grown in Darjeeling can legally be sold as \"Darjeeling Tea\".","src":"Wikipedia「Geographical indications in India」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geographical_indications_in_India","say":{"en":"Is this first flush or second flush? Could I taste it before I buy?","zh":"这是春摘还是夏摘的？买之前能尝一下吗？"}},"锡兰红茶":{"what":"斯里兰卡山区种的红茶（斯里兰卡以前叫锡兰），味道浓、颜色红亮，做奶茶、冰茶都合适。","what_en":"Black tea from the hills of Sri Lanka (once called Ceylon) — strong, bright red-brown, great for milk tea or iced tea.","fame":"斯里兰卡是世界上最大的红茶出口国之一。中部山城努沃勒埃利耶海拔将近 1900 米，山坡上一层层全是茶园，采茶工背着篓子一芽两叶地摘；斯里兰卡人自己喝茶，喜欢加很多糖和奶。","fame_en":"Sri Lanka is one of the world's biggest black-tea exporters. The hill town of Nuwara Eliya sits almost 1,900 metres up, with tea terraces on every slope and pluckers picking \"two leaves and a bud\" into baskets. Sri Lankans themselves like their tea with plenty of milk and sugar.","fact":"斯里兰卡的故事是从咖啡开始的：岛上原来到处是咖啡园。1867 年，17 岁就来到这里的苏格兰人 James Taylor 在康提附近的 Loolecondera 庄园开了第一片茶园；后来咖啡锈病毁了咖啡，种植园纷纷改种茶。","fact_en":"The story of Ceylon tea begins with coffee — the island was once covered in coffee estates. In 1867 James Taylor, a Scot who had arrived aged 17, started a tea plantation on the Loolecondera estate near Kandy; after coffee rust wiped out the coffee, planters switched to tea.","src":"斯里兰卡茶叶局 Sri Lanka Tea Board","url":"https://teasrilanka.org/history","say":{"en":"Milk tea, please — less sugar.","zh":"来一杯奶茶，少放糖。"}},"阿萨姆红茶":{"what":"印度东北阿萨姆平原上种的红茶，味道浓、有麦芽香，加了牛奶也压得住。","what_en":"Black tea from the plains of Assam in north-east India — strong and malty, bold enough to take milk.","fame":"很多「英式早餐茶」和印度街头的奶茶（chai）用的都是阿萨姆茶；阿萨姆是世界上最大的产茶区之一，茶园铺在布拉马普特拉河两岸的平地上，不在山上。","fame_en":"Lots of \"English Breakfast\" blends and India's street chai are made with Assam tea. Assam is one of the world's largest tea-growing regions, and its gardens spread over the flat land along the Brahmaputra River, not up in the hills.","fact":"阿萨姆的茶树不是从中国引来的：1823 年，苏格兰商人 Robert Bruce 在这里看到当地的景颇（Singpho）人拿一种野生的植物做饮料和吃的；后来它被认定是茶树的一个变种（var. assamica），和中国的小叶种不同。","fact_en":"Assam's tea plant didn't come from China. In 1823 the Scottish trader Robert Bruce saw the local Singpho people making drinks and food from a wild plant; it was later identified as its own variety of tea, var. assamica, different from the Chinese one.","src":"Wikipedia「Assam tea」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assam_tea","say":{"en":"One chai, less sugar, please.","zh":"一杯印度奶茶，少糖。"}},"比里亚尼":{"what":"长粒香米和腌好的肉一层层叠在锅里，加香料和炸洋葱一起焖，米粒一根根分开，香味很重。","what_en":"Long-grain rice layered with marinated meat, spices and fried onions, then slow-cooked in a sealed pot — every grain separate, full of aroma.","fame":"南亚和中东到处都有，各地都说自己的最正宗：巴基斯坦卡拉奇的信德比里亚尼放土豆和酸李子，很辣；印度海得拉巴的也很有名。婚礼、开斋节，总少不了一大锅。","fame_en":"It's everywhere in South Asia and the Middle East, and every city says its own is the real one: Karachi's Sindhi biryani has potatoes and sour plums and plenty of heat; Hyderabad's in India is just as famous. No wedding or Eid is complete without a giant pot.","fact":"印度外卖平台 Swiggy 统计：2024 年 1 月到 11 月，平台上一共点了 8300 万份比里亚尼——每分钟 158 份，差不多一秒两份。","fact_en":"Indian food-delivery app Swiggy counted 83 million biryani orders from January to November 2024 — 158 plates every minute, roughly two every second.","src":"The News Minute，2024 年 12 月","url":"https://www.thenewsminute.com/news/swiggy-dishes-out-the-truth-biriyani-is-indias-2024-obsession-again","say":{"en":"Is it chicken or mutton? Could I get some raita with it?","zh":"是鸡肉的还是羊肉的？能配一点酸奶酱吗？"}},"菲律宾烤乳猪":{"what":"一整只小猪穿在竹竿上，在炭火上慢慢转着烤好几个小时，皮又薄又脆。","what_en":"A whole young pig on a bamboo pole, turned slowly over charcoal for hours until the skin is thin and crackly.","fame":"菲律宾人过生日、办婚礼、过圣诞，桌子中间常摆一整只 lechon。宿务的最出名：肚子里塞满香茅、蒜和葱，烤好了不用蘸酱；马尼拉那边常配一种甜甜的猪肝酱。","fame_en":"At Filipino birthdays, weddings and Christmas, a whole lechon often sits in the middle of the table. Cebu's is the most famous — stuffed with lemongrass, garlic and spring onion, so it needs no sauce — while in Manila it usually comes with a sweet liver sauce.","fact":"美国名厨 Anthony Bourdain 带着节目《No Reservations》到宿务拍摄时，说自己找到了「有史以来最好吃的猪」（best pig ever）；《时代》杂志 2009 年写道，很多观众都很意外，菲律宾人却一点也不意外。","fact_en":"When TV chef Anthony Bourdain filmed No Reservations in Cebu, he declared he'd found the \"best pig ever\". Time magazine wrote in 2009 that many viewers were surprised — Filipinos weren't.","src":"TIME，2009 年 4 月","url":"https://content.time.com/time/specials/packages/article/0,28804,1893324_1893292_1893289,00.html","say":{"en":"Half a kilo, please — with lots of skin.","zh":"来半公斤，多要点皮。"}},"越光米":{"what":"日本种得最多的大米品种，煮出来软、黏、带甜味，凉了也好吃，饭团、便当都爱用它。","what_en":"Japan's most widely grown rice variety — soft, sticky and slightly sweet, still tasty when cold, so it's a favourite for onigiri and bento.","fame":"新潟鱼沼产的越光米最贵也最出名；日本超市里的米按产地和品种分得很细，常见 5 公斤一袋，袋子上写着「新潟県産コシヒカリ」。秋天刚收的叫「新米」，很多人专门等着买。","fame_en":"Koshihikari from Uonuma in Niigata is the priciest and most famous. Japanese supermarkets label rice carefully by region and variety, often in 5 kg bags reading \"Niigata-grown Koshihikari\". Freshly harvested autumn rice is called shinmai, and many people wait for it.","fact":"越光米其实不是在新潟培育出来的：1956 年，它在福井县的农业试验场诞生。名字里的「越」指古代的「越国」，从今天的福井一直延伸到山形，「越光」就是「越国之光」。","fact_en":"Koshihikari wasn't actually bred in Niigata: it was created in 1956 at Fukui Prefecture's agricultural research station. The koshi (越) in its name is the old Koshi Province, which stretched from today's Fukui to Yamagata — so the name means \"the light of Koshi\".","src":"Wikipedia「Koshihikari」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Koshihikari","say":{"en":"Is this this year's new rice?","zh":"这是今年的新米吗？"}},"赞岐乌冬":{"what":"四国香川县的乌冬面：粗、方、很有嚼劲，配小鱼干熬的清汤，或者只淋一点酱油。","what_en":"Udon from Kagawa on Shikoku — thick, square-edged and very chewy, served in a light dashi broth or with just a splash of soy sauce.","fame":"香川人早饭、午饭都吃乌冬；很多店是自助的：自己拿面、自己过热水、自己加葱和天妇罗，最后到收银台算钱，一碗很便宜。","fame_en":"People in Kagawa eat udon for breakfast and lunch. Many shops are self-service: you take your noodles, dip them in hot water yourself, add spring onion and tempura, and pay at the end — a bowl costs very little.","fact":"2011 年，香川县政府和县观光协会做了一个宣传活动，假装把县名改成「乌冬县」（うどん県）——只是玩笑，县的名字并没有改。","fact_en":"In 2011 Kagawa's prefectural government and tourism association launched a campaign that playfully \"renamed\" it Udon Prefecture — just a joke; the official name never changed.","src":"Wikipedia「Sanuki udon」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sanuki_udon","say":{"en":"One small kake udon, please. Do I take the tempura myself?","zh":"一碗小份清汤乌冬。天妇罗是自己拿吗？"}},"墨尔本咖啡":{"what":"墨尔本人一天的开始：钻进小巷里的咖啡馆，来一杯澳白（flat white）或拿铁，站着喝也行。","what_en":"How Melbourne starts its day: duck into a laneway café for a flat white or a latte — standing up is fine.","fame":"二战后意大利移民带来了意式咖啡机；现在像 Degraves Street 这样的小巷挤满了小咖啡馆。墨尔本人对豆子、奶泡都很讲究，咖啡师是一份被尊重的工作。","fame_en":"Italian migrants brought espresso machines after the Second World War, and today laneways like Degraves Street are packed with tiny cafés. Melburnians are fussy about beans and milk texture, and being a barista is a respected job.","fact":"星巴克进澳大利亚头七年亏了 1.05 亿，2008 年一下关掉 61 家店；CNBC 说，原因之一是它甜甜的饮料、偏贵的价格不对当地人的口味。","fact_en":"In its first seven years in Australia Starbucks lost $105 million and in 2008 closed 61 stores. CNBC says one reason was that its sweet drinks and higher prices didn't suit local coffee culture.","src":"CNBC，2018 年 7 月","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2018/07/20/starbucks-australia-coffee-failure.html","say":{"en":"Can I get a small flat white with oat milk, please?","zh":"一杯小杯澳白，换燕麦奶，谢谢。"}},"巴罗萨谷葡萄酒":{"what":"南澳阿德莱德往北一个小时车程的山谷，种满葡萄，出产浓郁的西拉（Shiraz）红酒。","what_en":"A valley about an hour's drive north of Adelaide in South Australia, covered in vineyards and known for rich, bold Shiraz.","fame":"19 世纪 40 年代，一批德国路德派移民在这里定居，现在还能看到德式教堂、面包店和香肠；几十家酒庄的品酒室（cellar door）对游客开放，一家挨一家。","fame_en":"German Lutheran settlers arrived in the 1840s, and you can still see their churches, bakeries and sausages. Dozens of wineries open their cellar doors to visitors, one after another.","fact":"Langmeil 酒庄有一块叫「The Freedom 1843」的西拉葡萄园，被认为可能是世界上现存最老的西拉葡萄园——据说是 1843 年种下的。","fact_en":"Langmeil winery's \"The Freedom 1843\" block may be the world's oldest surviving Shiraz vineyard — believed to have been planted in 1843.","src":"Halliday Wine Companion","url":"https://winecompanion.com.au/wineries/south-australia/barossa-valley/langmeil-winery","say":{"en":"Could we do a tasting? I'm driving, so just a small pour, please.","zh":"能品酒吗？我开车，只倒一点点就好。"}},"麦卢卡蜂蜜":{"what":"新西兰的蜜蜂采麦卢卡（一种开小白花的灌木）的花酿出来的蜂蜜，颜色深、很稠，有一点药味。","what_en":"Honey made by New Zealand bees from the flowers of mānuka, a shrub with small white blossoms — dark, thick, slightly medicinal-tasting.","fame":"罐子上印着 UMF 或 MGO 的数字，数字越高越贵，一小罐能卖到几百块；它出名是因为里面的甲基乙二醛（MGO），医院里也有用医用麦卢卡蜂蜜做的伤口敷料。","fame_en":"Jars carry a UMF or MGO number — the higher it is, the pricier, and a small jar can cost a lot. It's famous for its methylglyoxal (MGO), and hospitals even use medical-grade mānuka honey in wound dressings.","fact":"新西兰的蜂蜜商想把「Manuka Honey」注册成只有新西兰才能用的商标，2021 年 12 月被英国知识产权局拒绝了；这个申请在澳大利亚也没成功——澳大利亚自己也产麦卢卡蜂蜜。","fact_en":"New Zealand producers tried to register \"Manuka Honey\" as a trademark only they could use, but the UK Intellectual Property Office rejected it in December 2021. Their application failed in Australia too — Australia produces manuka honey of its own.","src":"Asia IP，2022 年 1 月","url":"https://asiaiplaw.com/section/news-analysis/new-zealand-group-loses-out-anew-in-manuka-honey-trademark-battle-after-rejection-by-uk-ip-office","say":{"en":"What does UMF 10+ mean? Is this one from New Zealand?","zh":"UMF 10+ 是什么意思？这罐是新西兰产的吗？"}},"马尔堡长相思":{"what":"新西兰南岛马尔堡产的长相思白葡萄酒：清爽、偏酸，闻起来有百香果、青草和青椒的味道。","what_en":"Sauvignon Blanc from Marlborough on New Zealand's South Island — crisp and zesty, smelling of passion fruit, cut grass and green pepper.","fame":"在英国、澳大利亚的超市和酒吧，它几乎成了「来杯白葡萄酒」的默认选项；马尔堡白天阳光足、夜里凉，葡萄的酸味就特别鲜明。","fame_en":"In UK and Australian supermarkets and pubs it's almost the default \"glass of white\". Marlborough's sunny days and cool nights give the grapes their sharp, fresh acidity.","fact":"马尔堡到 1973 年才开始成片种葡萄，在那之前这里主要种大麦和苜蓿；现在这里的酒大约占新西兰葡萄酒出口的八成。","fact_en":"Marlborough only began planting vineyards in 1973 — before that it was known for barley and lucerne. Today it's responsible for around 80% of New Zealand's wine exports.","src":"Wine Marlborough（马尔堡葡萄酒协会）","url":"https://marlboroughwinenz.com/history","say":{"en":"Could I have a large glass of the Marlborough Sauvignon Blanc, please?","zh":"请给我一大杯马尔堡长相思。"}},"卡瓦仪式":{"what":"斐济人把卡瓦（一种胡椒科植物）的根磨成粉、用水泡开，倒进大木碗，大家围坐着用椰壳碗轮流喝；看着像泥水，喝完舌头有点麻。","what_en":"Fijians pound the root of kava, a pepper plant, mix it with water in a big wooden bowl, and sit in a circle passing round a coconut-shell cup. It looks like muddy water and leaves your tongue a little numb.","fame":"去斐济村子做客，要先把带来的卡瓦根献给村长（这叫 sevusevu），被接受了才算客人；接过碗前拍一下手、说「Bula!」，一口喝完，再拍三下手。","fame_en":"Visiting a Fijian village, you first present kava root to the chief — the sevusevu — and only then are you a guest. Clap once and say \"Bula!\" before taking the cup, drink it in one go, then clap three times.","fact":"2021 年 12 月起，澳大利亚开始试点商业进口卡瓦（以前只能随身带一点自己喝），太平洋岛国的农民可以直接卖到澳大利亚市场了。","fact_en":"Since December 2021 Australia has been piloting commercial imports of kava (before, you could only bring a little for personal use), giving Pacific farmers direct access to the Australian market.","src":"PINA 太平洋岛国新闻协会，2021 年 12 月","url":"https://pina.com.fj/2021/12/01/australias-commercial-kava-importation-pilot-officially-launched/","say":{"en":"Low tide, please — just half a cup.","zh":"少倒一点，半碗就好。"}},"土耳其烤肉":{"what":"竖着转的一大串烤肉，削成薄片，夹进面饼里，配洋葱、生菜和酱。","what_en":"Meat roasting on a big turning spit, shaved into thin slices and stuffed into bread with onion, salad and sauce.","fame":"在土耳其，它是街角小店的家常午饭；在德国，它比汉堡还普遍，是夜里下班、看完球最常吃的一口。","fame_en":"In Turkey it's an everyday lunch from the corner shop; in Germany it's more common than burgers — the go-to bite after a late shift or a match.","fact":"把烤肉夹进面包、边走边吃的吃法，是在德国火起来的：1972 年在西柏林动物园站旁边摆摊的土耳其人 Kadir Nurman，常被说成「döner 三明治」的发明人——不过他自己也没说自己是第一个卖的。","fact_en":"Döner stuffed into bread to eat on the go took off in Germany: Kadir Nurman, a Turkish stall owner by West Berlin's Zoo station in 1972, is widely credited with the döner sandwich — though he never claimed to be the first to sell one.","src":"Wikipedia · Kadir Nurman","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kadir_Nurman","say":{"en":"One döner, please — everything on it, a little spicy.","zh":"一个烤肉夹饼，什么都加，稍微辣一点。"}},"卡门贝尔奶酪":{"what":"诺曼底的圆形软奶酪，外面一层白皮，里面熟透了会软得流出来。","what_en":"A round soft cheese from Normandy with a white rind; when it's ripe, the inside goes soft and runny.","fame":"它是法国人餐后奶酪盘上最常见的一块，抹在法棍上吃；超市里的它总装在一个小木盒里，全世界都认得。","fame_en":"It's the most familiar piece on a French after-dinner cheese board, spread on a baguette — and that little wooden box makes it recognisable anywhere.","fact":"那个小木盒是 1890 年一位叫 Ridel 的工程师想出来的：有了它，软奶酪才能经得起长途运输，卡门贝尔才一路卖到了美国。","fact_en":"The little wooden box was devised in 1890 by an engineer named Ridel. It let the soft cheese survive long journeys, which is how Camembert made it all the way to America.","src":"Wikipedia · Camembert","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Camembert","say":{"en":"Is this Camembert ripe enough to eat tonight?","zh":"这块卡门贝尔今晚吃，熟了吗？"}},"香槟":{"what":"法国香槟区按传统方法在瓶子里二次发酵的起泡酒，开瓶「砰」一声。","what_en":"Sparkling wine from France's Champagne region, fermented a second time in the bottle the traditional way — the one that goes 'pop'.","fame":"全世界庆祝都开它：婚礼、升职、新年、赛车领奖台。只有香槟区产的，才能叫这个名字。","fame_en":"It's what the whole world opens to celebrate — weddings, promotions, New Year, the podium. Only wine from Champagne may use the name.","fact":"2015 年，香槟区的葡萄园山坡、酒庄和地下酒窖一起被列为联合国世界遗产，包括兰斯的圣尼凯斯山和埃佩尔奈的香槟大道——地下的老酒窖今天还在用。","fact_en":"In 2015 Champagne's hillside vineyards, houses and cellars became a UNESCO World Heritage Site, including Saint-Nicaise Hill in Reims and the Avenue de Champagne in Épernay — and the old cellars underground are still in use.","src":"UNESCO World Heritage Centre · Champagne Hillsides, Houses and Cellars","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1465","say":{"en":"Could we have two glasses of the house champagne, please?","zh":"请来两杯店里的香槟。"}},"波尔多红酒":{"what":"法国西南部波尔多一带产的葡萄酒，多数是几种葡萄混在一起酿的红酒。","what_en":"Wine from around Bordeaux in south-west France — mostly reds blended from several grape varieties.","fame":"拉菲、拉图、玛歌这些名庄都在这儿，好年份的一瓶能拍出天价；可波尔多也有很多十几欧一瓶、法国人周日午饭就喝的普通酒。","fame_en":"Lafite, Latour and Margaux are all here, and a great vintage can sell for a fortune — but Bordeaux also makes plenty of ten-euro bottles that French families drink at Sunday lunch.","fact":"1855 年给梅多克名庄排的等级，一百多年几乎没改过；唯一升级的是木桐酒庄（Mouton Rothschild）——庄主菲利普男爵争了几十年，1973 年才从二级升成一级。","fact_en":"The 1855 ranking of the Médoc's top estates has barely changed in over a century. The only promotion: Château Mouton Rothschild, moved from second to first growth in 1973 after Baron Philippe de Rothschild lobbied for decades.","src":"Wikipedia · First Growth","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_Growth","say":{"en":"Do you have a Bordeaux by the glass that isn't too expensive?","zh":"有没有按杯卖、不太贵的波尔多？"}},"法式蜗牛":{"what":"蜗牛肉塞回壳里，盖上黄油、大蒜和香芹烤，用专门的夹子和小叉子吃。","what_en":"Snails tucked back into their shells under butter, garlic and parsley, baked, and eaten with special tongs and a tiny fork.","fame":"它是外国人眼里「最法国」的一道菜；法国人自己多在圣诞和过节的饭桌上吃，一份六个或十二个，最后用面包把壳里的蒜香黄油蘸干净。","fame_en":"To outsiders it's the most French dish of all; the French mostly eat it at Christmas and on special occasions, six or twelve at a time, mopping up the garlic butter with bread.","fact":"法国一年吃掉约三万吨蜗牛，是全世界吃得最多的国家，可法国自己只产其中 5%–10%，大部分是从东欧和北非进口的。","fact_en":"France gets through about 30,000 tonnes of snails a year, more than any other country — but produces only 5–10% of them itself. Most are imported from Eastern Europe and North Africa.","src":"The Local France · Why do the French eat snails?","url":"https://www.thelocal.fr/20211228/dont-ask-google-ask-us-why-do-the-french-eat-snails","say":{"en":"How do I eat these — with the tongs?","zh":"这个怎么吃？用这个夹子吗？"}},"健力士黑啤":{"what":"都柏林产的黑啤（stout），上面一层奶油一样的白泡沫，喝起来有烤麦子的苦香。","what_en":"A dark stout from Dublin with a creamy white head and a roasted, slightly bitter taste.","fame":"在爱尔兰和英国的酒吧里，它是最常点的一杯；酒保要分两次倒、等泡沫落下来，大家都愿意等这一两分钟。","fame_en":"It's the pint people order most in Irish and British pubs; the barman pours it in two goes and lets it settle, and everyone happily waits.","fact":"《吉尼斯世界纪录》就是这家啤酒厂搞出来的：1951 年厂长 Hugh Beaver 打猎时跟人争「欧洲飞得最快的猎鸟是哪种」却查不到答案，后来请麦克沃特兄弟编了一本纪录书，1955 年出版，本来是送给酒吧解决争论用的。","fact_en":"Guinness World Records came from the brewery: in 1951 its managing director Hugh Beaver argued on a shoot about Europe's fastest game bird and couldn't find the answer. He had the McWhirter twins compile a book of records, published in 1955 and first handed out to pubs to settle arguments.","src":"Guinness World Records · Why was the book first published?","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/news/2022/9/why-was-the-guinness-world-records-book-first-published-714607","say":{"en":"A pint of Guinness, please — I'll wait for it to settle.","zh":"一品脱健力士，谢谢——我等它沉淀好再拿。"}},"意大利面":{"what":"意大利人每天吃的面食，几百种形状，每种配它最合适的酱。","what_en":"The pasta Italians eat every day — hundreds of shapes, each matched with the sauce that suits it best.","fame":"在意大利，它通常是一顿饭的「第一道菜」，量不大；周日一家人吃的那锅肉酱，是很多意大利人心里家的味道。","fame_en":"In Italy it's usually the first course, and not a huge plate; the big pot of ragù at Sunday family lunch is what home tastes like for many Italians.","fact":"在博洛尼亚其实没有「肉酱意大利面（spaghetti bolognese）」：当地肉酱配的是宽面 tagliatelle。1982 年，意大利美食学会博洛尼亚分会还把一份「正宗肉酱」食谱存进了当地商会——里面有牛奶和白葡萄酒。","fact_en":"In Bologna there's no 'spaghetti bolognese': the local ragù goes with wide tagliatelle. In 1982 the Bologna branch of the Accademia Italiana della Cucina even deposited an 'official' ragù recipe — with milk and white wine — at the city's chamber of commerce.","src":"Wikipedia · Bolognese sauce","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bolognese_sauce","say":{"en":"Which pasta is homemade today?","zh":"今天哪种面是自己做的？"}},"葡式蛋挞":{"what":"一层层酥皮里装着烤焦了顶的蛋奶馅，热的时候撒上肉桂粉吃。","what_en":"Flaky pastry filled with egg custard, scorched on top, eaten warm with a dusting of cinnamon.","fame":"在葡萄牙，它是咖啡馆柜台上的日常点心，配一杯小小的浓缩咖啡站着吃；后来从里斯本传到澳门，又从澳门传遍亚洲。","fame_en":"In Portugal it's an everyday café snack, eaten standing at the counter with a tiny espresso; from Lisbon it went to Macau, and from Macau all over Asia.","fact":"里斯本贝伦区的 Pastéis de Belém 从 1837 年开始卖这种蛋挞，用的是旁边热罗尼莫斯修道院传下来的配方；店里说，配方到今天只有几位师傅知道，在一间「秘密房间」里做。","fact_en":"Pastéis de Belém in Lisbon has sold these tarts since 1837, using a recipe from the neighbouring Jerónimos Monastery. The bakery says only a few master pastry chefs know it, and they make it in a 'secret room'.","src":"Pastéis de Belém · History","url":"https://pasteisdebelem.pt/en/history/","say":{"en":"Two pastéis de nata and a bica, please.","zh":"两个蛋挞，一杯小浓缩咖啡，谢谢。"}},"波特酒":{"what":"葡萄牙杜罗河谷的甜葡萄酒，酿的时候加了一点白兰地，所以更甜、更烈。","what_en":"A sweet wine from Portugal's Douro Valley, with a little brandy added while it's made, so it's sweeter and stronger.","fame":"葡萄牙人饭后来一小杯；英国人圣诞节配奶酪喝。酒从河谷运到波尔图对岸的加亚新城，在那儿的老酒窖里慢慢变老。","fame_en":"The Portuguese sip a small glass after dinner; the British drink it with cheese at Christmas. It ages in the old lodges of Vila Nova de Gaia, across the river from Porto.","fact":"1756 年，葡萄牙首相庞巴尔侯爵给杜罗河的产区划了边界、定了规矩，用花岗岩界石标出来——这是世界上最早一批有法定边界、又有管理的葡萄酒产区。","fact_en":"In 1756 Portugal's chief minister, the Marquis of Pombal, drew legal boundaries around the Douro and set rules for its wine, marking the edges with granite stones — one of the world's first demarcated and regulated wine regions.","src":"Wikipedia · Douro Wine Company","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Douro_Wine_Company","say":{"en":"What's the difference between a ruby and a tawny?","zh":"宝石红和茶色波特酒有什么不一样？"}},"慕尼黑啤酒节":{"what":"慕尼黑每年九月底到十月初的大节日，十几个大帐篷里喝啤酒、吃烤鸡、跟着乐队唱。","what_en":"Munich's huge festival from late September into early October: a dozen giant tents of beer, roast chicken and singing along with the band.","fame":"它是世界上最大的民间节日，每年来好几百万人；慕尼黑人自己叫它 Wiesn，穿上皮短裤和传统长裙去，同事朋友一起订一张桌子。","fame_en":"It's the world's biggest folk festival, with millions of visitors every year; locals call it the Wiesn, wear lederhosen and dirndls, and book a table with colleagues and friends.","fact":"第一届啤酒节是一场婚礼：1810 年 10 月，巴伐利亚王储路德维希娶特蕾莎公主，城外草地上办了一场赛马庆祝；那片草地就以新娘命名，叫「特蕾莎草地」（Theresienwiese），所以今天大家叫它 Wiesn。","fact_en":"The first Oktoberfest was a wedding party: in October 1810 Crown Prince Ludwig of Bavaria married Princess Therese, and a horse race was held on a meadow outside town. The meadow was named after the bride — Theresienwiese — which is why locals call it the Wiesn.","src":"Wikipedia · Oktoberfest","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oktoberfest","say":{"en":"Are these seats free, or is this table reserved?","zh":"这几个位子有人吗？还是这桌订了？"}},"椒盐卷饼":{"what":"打了个结的面包，外皮在碱水里浸过，烤出来深棕发亮，撒着粗盐粒。","what_en":"A knotted bread dipped in lye before baking, so it comes out glossy dark brown, sprinkled with coarse salt.","fame":"在巴伐利亚，它是每天早上面包店里排队买的那一个，横切开抹黄油当早饭；晚上配白香肠和啤酒。","fame_en":"In Bavaria it's what people queue for at the bakery every morning, sliced and spread with butter for breakfast — and later eaten with white sausage and beer.","fact":"传说碱水卷饼是 1839 年在慕尼黑「意外」做出来的：面包师 Anton Pfannenbrenner 本来要刷糖水，却错刷了洗烤盘用的碱水，结果客人很喜欢。这个故事连奥地利农业部的传统食品介绍里都写了，但也只是传说。","fact_en":"Legend says the lye pretzel was invented by accident in Munich in 1839, when baker Anton Pfannenbrenner brushed the dough with the lye he used to clean baking trays instead of sugar water — and customers loved it. Even Austria's agriculture ministry tells the story, though it remains a legend.","src":"Österreichisches Bundesministerium für Land- und Forstwirtschaft · Laugenbrezel","url":"https://www.bmluk.gv.at/themen/lebensmittel/trad-lebensmittel/backerzeugnisse/laugenbrezel_gebaeck.html","say":{"en":"One pretzel with butter, please — to take away.","zh":"一个抹黄油的卷饼，带走，谢谢。"}},"德国香肠":{"what":"德国各地自己的香肠：烤的、煮的、白的、红的，配芥末、面包或酸菜。","what_en":"Each German region's own sausages — grilled, boiled, white, red — with mustard, a bread roll or sauerkraut.","fame":"足球场外、圣诞市场、火车站小摊，到处都是烤香肠的味道；柏林人最爱的是切成段、淋番茄咖喱酱的咖喱香肠。","fame_en":"Outside football grounds, at Christmas markets and station kiosks, there's always the smell of grilled sausage; Berliners' favourite is currywurst, sliced and covered in curry ketchup.","fact":"咖喱香肠的酱常被说是 1949 年 9 月 4 日在西柏林夏洛滕堡发明的：小吃摊老板 Herta Heuwer 用番茄酱、咖喱粉等调了一种酱浇在香肠上。2003 年那里挂了纪念牌——不过德国专利局自己也说，到底是谁发明的，没人能确定。","fact_en":"Currywurst sauce is often said to have been invented on 4 September 1949 in Charlottenburg, West Berlin, by snack-stand owner Herta Heuwer, who mixed tomato paste, curry powder and spices over sausage. A plaque went up there in 2003 — though even the German patent office says nobody knows for sure.","src":"Wikipedia · Herta Heuwer","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herta_Heuwer","say":{"en":"A currywurst with fries, please — with or without skin?","zh":"一份咖喱香肠加薯条——要带肠衣的还是不带的？"}},"华夫饼":{"what":"在格子铁模里烤的面饼，外面脆、里面软，比利时街头热着卖。","what_en":"Batter baked in a grid-patterned iron — crisp outside, soft inside, sold hot on Belgian streets.","fame":"在比利时有两种：长方形、轻轻的布鲁塞尔华夫饼，和小一点、带焦糖粒、拿着就吃的列日华夫饼；本地人多半只撒糖粉，不堆奶油。","fame_en":"Belgium has two kinds: the light, rectangular Brussels waffle and the smaller, chewy Liège waffle with caramelised sugar you eat in your hand. Locals mostly just add icing sugar, not a mountain of cream.","fact":"「比利时华夫饼」这个名字是在美国火起来的：1964 年纽约世博会上，布鲁塞尔来的 Maurice Vermersch 一家卖加奶油和草莓的华夫饼，因为很多美国人不知道布鲁塞尔在比利时，就改叫 Bel-Gem，后来成了 Belgian waffle。","fact_en":"The name 'Belgian waffle' took off in America: at the 1964 New York World's Fair, the Vermersch family from Brussels sold waffles with cream and strawberries, renamed 'Bel-Gem' because many Americans didn't know Brussels was in Belgium.","src":"Wikipedia · Belgian waffle","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Belgian_waffle","say":{"en":"One Liège waffle, just with sugar, please.","zh":"一个列日华夫饼，只要糖粉，谢谢。"}},"比尔森啤酒":{"what":"捷克比尔森城产的金黄色拉格啤酒，清爽、有啤酒花的苦味。","what_en":"A golden lager from the Czech city of Plzeň — crisp, with a bitter hop bite.","fame":"今天全世界大部分啤酒都是照着它的样子做的「皮尔森」；捷克人喝啤酒喝得比哪国都多，在酒馆里杯子一空，服务员就再端一杯来。","fame_en":"Most beer in the world today is a 'pilsner' made in its image; Czechs drink more beer per person than anyone, and in a pub a fresh glass appears the moment yours is empty.","fact":"第一批是 1842 年 10 月 5 日酿出来的，酿酒师是从巴伐利亚请来的 Josef Groll；同年 11 月 11 日的圣马丁节集市上第一次卖给大家喝。","fact_en":"The first batch was brewed on 5 October 1842 by Josef Groll, a brewer brought in from Bavaria, and first poured for the public at the St Martin's fair that 11 November.","src":"Pilsner Urquell · Our story","url":"https://www.prazdroj.cz/en/our-story","say":{"en":"A small one, please — and the bill when you can.","zh":"来一小杯，方便时结一下账。"}},"鱼子酱":{"what":"鲟鱼的鱼卵，用盐腌过，一小粒一小粒，放在嘴里轻轻破开，咸鲜。","what_en":"Sturgeon roe cured with salt — tiny beads that pop gently in your mouth, salty and briny.","fame":"它是世界上最贵的食物之一，常出现在高级餐厅、婚礼和新年聚会；俄罗斯人过节会把它放在小薄饼上配酸奶油吃。","fame_en":"It's one of the world's most expensive foods, served at fine restaurants, weddings and New Year parties; Russians put it on little blini with sour cream for celebrations.","fact":"里海的野生鲟鱼被捕得太多，俄罗斯 2007 年起禁止捕捞和销售野生黑鱼子酱；今天卖的大多是养殖的，产得最多的国家是中国。","fact_en":"Wild Caspian sturgeon were so overfished that Russia banned catching them and selling wild black caviar from 2007. Most caviar sold today is farmed — and the biggest producer is China.","src":"Wikipedia · Caviar","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caviar","say":{"en":"Is the caviar farmed? Where is it from?","zh":"这鱼子酱是养殖的吗？哪里产的？"}},"挪威三文鱼":{"what":"挪威峡湾里养的大西洋三文鱼，橙红色，可以生吃、烤、烟熏。","what_en":"Atlantic salmon raised in Norway's fjords — orange-pink, eaten raw, grilled or smoked.","fame":"挪威是世界最大的三文鱼出口国，你在超市、寿司店吃到的三文鱼很可能就从那儿来；挪威人自己早饭吃烟熏三文鱼配面包。","fame_en":"Norway is the world's biggest salmon exporter, so the salmon in your supermarket or sushi bar likely came from there; Norwegians themselves eat smoked salmon on bread for breakfast.","fact":"以前日本人不生吃三文鱼，三文鱼寿司是挪威推出来的：1980 年代挪威搞了一个「日本计划」，1985 年派团去东京，在使馆晚宴上请人吃三文鱼寿司。现在挪威三文鱼约三成被做成寿司生吃。","fact_en":"Japanese people didn't used to eat salmon raw — salmon sushi was Norway's idea. Its 1980s 'Project Japan' sent a delegation to Tokyo in 1985 and served salmon sushi at embassy dinners. Today about 30% of Norwegian salmon is eaten raw as sushi.","src":"The Fish Site · How the advent of salmon sushi in Japan created a global megatrend","url":"https://thefishsite.com/articles/raw-talent-how-the-advent-of-salmon-sushi-in-japan-created-a-global-megatrend","say":{"en":"Is this salmon fresh today? Can I eat it raw?","zh":"这三文鱼是今天的吗？能生吃吗？"}},"藏红花":{"what":"一种紫色番红花中间的三根红色花柱，晒干了当香料，一点点就能把饭染成金黄。","what_en":"The three red threads in the middle of a purple crocus, dried as a spice — a pinch turns rice golden.","fame":"伊朗菜的米饭、西班牙的海鲜饭、印度的奶茶和甜点都靠它上色添香；它是世界上最贵的香料，按克卖。","fame_en":"It colours and scents Persian rice, Spanish paella, and Indian tea and sweets; it's the world's most expensive spice, sold by the gram.","fact":"一公斤藏红花要手摘大约 15 万朵花、44 万根花柱；全世界约 90% 的藏红花产自伊朗。","fact_en":"One kilo of saffron takes about 150,000 flowers — some 440,000 stigmas, all picked by hand. Around 90% of the world's saffron comes from Iran.","src":"Wikipedia · Saffron","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saffron","say":{"en":"How much is one gram? Is it Iranian or Spanish?","zh":"一克多少钱？是伊朗的还是西班牙的？"}},"伊斯特拉松露":{"what":"克罗地亚伊斯特拉半岛橡树林地下长的松露，香味浓，刨几片在面或鸡蛋上。","what_en":"Truffles that grow underground in the oak forests of Croatia's Istrian peninsula — intensely fragrant, shaved over pasta or eggs.","fame":"松露长在地下看不见，要靠训练过的狗闻出来；秋天的白松露最贵，伊斯特拉的小山城一到季节就办松露节。","fame_en":"Truffles hide underground, so trained dogs sniff them out; the autumn white truffle is the priciest, and Istria's hill towns hold truffle festivals in season.","fact":"1999 年 11 月 2 日，伊斯特拉的松露猎人 Giancarlo Zigante 和他的狗 Diana 在布耶附近挖到一颗 1.31 公斤的白松露，进了吉尼斯纪录；他没卖，请了约一百位客人一起吃掉，又铸了一个铜的复制品。","fact_en":"On 2 November 1999, Istrian truffle hunter Giancarlo Zigante and his dog Diana dug up a 1.31 kg white truffle near Buje — a Guinness record. He didn't sell it: he shared it at a dinner for about a hundred guests and had a bronze replica cast.","src":"Istra.hr · Truffle for the Guinness World Record","url":"https://www.istra.hr/en/gourmet/truffles/istrian-truffle/truffle-for-the-guinness-world-record","say":{"en":"How much is it with fresh truffle shaved on top?","zh":"上面刨新鲜松露的话，多少钱？"}},"阿拉伯椰枣":{"what":"海湾地区沙漠里长的甜果子，软软的、黏黏的，像天然的糖。","what_en":"The sweet fruit of the Gulf desert — soft, sticky, and like natural candy.","fame":"海湾人家家户户的日常：客人进门先端上椰枣和阿拉伯咖啡；斋月里太阳一落山，很多人第一口吃的就是椰枣。阿联酋光椰枣树就有几千万棵。","fame_en":"It's everyday life in the Gulf: guests are greeted with dates and Arabic coffee, and during Ramadan many people break their fast at sunset with a date first.","fact":"种椰枣、爬树授粉、编椰叶这一整套手艺，2019 年由 14 个阿拉伯国家一起申报进了联合国教科文组织的非物质文化遗产名录，2022 年卡塔尔也加入，变成 15 国共有。","fact_en":"The whole craft of date palms — growing them, climbing up to pollinate, weaving the fronds — was added to UNESCO's intangible heritage list in 2019 by 14 Arab countries together. Qatar joined in 2022, making it shared by 15.","src":"UNESCO 非物质文化遗产委员会决定 17.COM 7.B.33","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/decisions/17.COM/7.B.33","say":{"en":"Which dates are the sweetest? Can I try one?","zh":"哪种椰枣最甜？我能尝一个吗？"}},"摩洛哥塔吉锅":{"what":"一口带尖顶盖子的陶锅，也是用它慢慢炖出来的肉和蔬菜。","what_en":"A clay pot with a pointed lid — and the slow-cooked meat and vegetables that come out of it.","fame":"摩洛哥人的家常饭：鸡肉配腌柠檬和橄榄、羊肉配西梅，一家人围着一锅，用面包蘸着吃。马拉喀什的不眠广场一到晚上，摊子上一排排塔吉锅冒着热气。","fame_en":"It's Moroccan home cooking: chicken with preserved lemon and olives, lamb with prunes, the family sharing one pot and scooping it up with bread. At night in Marrakech's Jemaa el-Fnaa, stalls line up rows of steaming tagines.","fact":"「塔吉」这个名字其实来自古希腊语 tágēnon，原意是一种平底陶煎锅；那个尖尖的盖子会让水汽凝结后流回锅里，所以几乎不用加水——在缺水的地方特别管用。","fact_en":"The word 'tagine' actually comes from the Ancient Greek tágēnon, a flat clay frying pan. The cone-shaped lid sends condensation back down into the pot, so it needs hardly any water — handy where water is scarce.","src":"Wikipedia · Tagine","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tagine","say":{"en":"What's in the chicken tagine? Is it spicy?","zh":"鸡肉塔吉锅里有什么？辣吗？"}},"埃塞俄比亚咖啡":{"what":"咖啡的老家：埃塞俄比亚的咖啡豆，还有当地人一天几次的咖啡仪式。","what_en":"Coffee's homeland: Ethiopian beans, and the coffee ceremony locals hold several times a day.","fame":"在埃塞俄比亚，喝咖啡是请人坐下聊天：女主人当场炒豆、捣碎、用陶壶（jebena）煮，满屋都是香味，一般要喝三轮。世界各地的精品咖啡店也都爱卖耶加雪菲这些埃塞俄比亚豆子。","fame_en":"In Ethiopia, coffee means 'sit down and talk': the host roasts the beans on the spot, grinds them, and brews them in a clay jebena pot, usually for three rounds. Speciality cafés worldwide love Ethiopian beans like Yirgacheffe.","fact":"埃塞俄比亚是非洲最大的咖啡生产国，但种出来的咖啡大约有一半是埃塞俄比亚人自己喝掉的——在产咖啡的国家里这很少见。","fact_en":"Ethiopia is Africa's biggest coffee producer, yet Ethiopians drink about half of what they grow themselves — rare among coffee-growing countries.","src":"Wikipedia · Coffee production in Ethiopia（引 USDA 报告）","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee_production_in_Ethiopia","say":{"en":"Could I have a macchiato, please? How much is it?","zh":"请给我一杯玛奇朵，多少钱？"}},"桑给巴尔香料":{"what":"坦桑尼亚外海桑给巴尔群岛种的丁香、肉桂、豆蔻、胡椒，这里被叫做「香料岛」。","what_en":"The cloves, cinnamon, nutmeg and pepper grown on Tanzania's Zanzibar islands — the 'Spice Islands'.","fame":"两百多年来丁香一直是桑给巴尔最重要的出口货；现在游客都爱去香料农场，闻闻刚剥开的肉豆蔻，再去石头城的达拉贾尼市场买一袋带回家。当地的香料茶和抓饭里也少不了它们。","fame_en":"For over two centuries cloves were Zanzibar's main export. Today visitors tour spice farms, sniff freshly cracked nutmeg, and buy bags at Stone Town's Darajani market. Local spiced tea and pilau rice are full of them.","fact":"游客去的多是主岛温古贾，可群岛的丁香树大多长在北边的奔巴岛上——那里大约有 350 万棵，因为奔巴的土和雨更适合丁香。","fact_en":"Most visitors stay on the main island, Unguja, but most of the archipelago's clove trees grow on Pemba to the north — about 3.5 million of them, because Pemba's soil and rain suit cloves better.","src":"Wikipedia · Pemba Island","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pemba_Island","say":{"en":"How much is a bag of cloves? Can I smell it first?","zh":"一袋丁香多少钱？我能先闻一下吗？"}},"加纳可可":{"what":"加纳种的可可豆，是全世界巧克力的主要原料之一。","what_en":"Cocoa beans grown in Ghana — one of the main raw materials for the world's chocolate.","fame":"加纳是世界第二大可可生产国，和隔壁科特迪瓦加起来种了全世界大约三分之二的可可豆。在库马西一带，可可是几十万小农家庭的收入来源；你吃的巧克力很可能就有加纳的豆子。","fame_en":"Ghana is the world's second-biggest cocoa grower; together with neighbouring Côte d'Ivoire it supplies about two-thirds of the world's beans. Around Kumasi, cocoa pays the bills for hundreds of thousands of small farming families.","fact":"2024 年 3 月 26 日，因为西非天气不好、可可树生病、加纳和科特迪瓦收成大跌，可可期货第一次涨破每吨 1 万美元——这就是那两年巧克力突然变贵的原因。","fact_en":"On 26 March 2024, after bad weather and disease hit harvests in Ghana and Côte d'Ivoire, cocoa futures topped $10,000 a tonne for the first time — the reason chocolate suddenly got pricier.","src":"CNBC，2024","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2024/03/26/cocoa-prices-hit-10000-per-metric-ton-for-the-first-time-ever.html","say":{"en":"Is this chocolate made in Ghana? How much is one bar?","zh":"这块巧克力是加纳做的吗？一块多少钱？"}},"英吉拉":{"what":"埃塞俄比亚的酸味大薄饼，上面有很多小孔，撕一块卷着菜吃，饼就是盘子。","what_en":"Ethiopia's spongy, sour flatbread full of tiny holes — you tear off a piece to scoop up the stews, and the bread is the plate.","fame":"埃塞俄比亚和厄立特里亚人几乎每顿都吃：一张大饼铺在盘子上，上面放几种炖菜，大家用右手围着同一盘吃。朋友之间还会互相喂一口，叫 gursha，表示亲近。","fame_en":"Ethiopians and Eritreans eat it at almost every meal: one big round spread on a tray, several stews on top, everyone eating from it with their right hand. Friends even feed each other a bite, called gursha, as a sign of closeness.","fact":"英吉拉用的是一种叫苔麸（teff）的超小粒谷子。2006 年埃塞俄比亚怕国内缺粮，禁止出口苔麸原粮，但做好的英吉拉照样能出口，主要卖给海外的埃塞俄比亚人；2015 年才部分放开。","fact_en":"Injera is made from teff, a tiny grain. In 2006 Ethiopia banned exports of raw teff, fearing shortages at home — but ready-made injera could still be exported, mostly to Ethiopians abroad. The ban was only partly lifted in 2015.","src":"Wikipedia · Teff","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teff","say":{"en":"Could we have the vegetarian platter with extra injera?","zh":"我们要一份素菜拼盘，多加点英吉拉可以吗？"}},"肯尼亚红茶":{"what":"肯尼亚高原上种的红茶，大部分做成碎茶，泡出来颜色浓、味道冲。","what_en":"Black tea from Kenya's highlands, mostly made into fine-cut CTC tea that brews dark and strong.","fame":"很多英国和中东的袋泡茶里都有肯尼亚的茶。肯尼亚人自己最爱喝 chai：茶叶、牛奶、糖一起煮，早上一杯、下午再一杯。凯里乔一带的茶园一眼望不到头。","fame_en":"Plenty of British and Middle Eastern teabags contain Kenyan tea. Kenyans themselves love chai — tea, milk and sugar boiled together, one cup in the morning and another in the afternoon. Around Kericho the tea fields stretch to the horizon.","fact":"肯尼亚还有一种「紫茶」：凯里乔的茶叶研究所花了大约 25 年培育，2011 年 7 月正式推广，叶子天然是紫色的，因为含花青素（就是蓝莓里那种）。","fact_en":"Kenya also grows 'purple tea': researchers at the tea institute in Kericho spent about 25 years breeding it and released it in July 2011. The leaves are naturally purple from anthocyanins — the same pigment as in blueberries.","src":"NPR，2015","url":"https://www.kpbs.org/news/2015/03/03/tea-tuesdays-kenyan-farmers-see-green-in-the","say":{"en":"One chai, please — not too sweet.","zh":"请来一杯奶茶，别太甜。"}},"路易波士茶":{"what":"南非塞德堡山区的一种灌木做的红色草本茶，不含咖啡因。","what_en":"A red herbal tea made from a shrub in South Africa's Cederberg mountains — naturally caffeine-free.","fame":"南非人从小喝到大：加牛奶加糖当早餐茶，晚上喝也不怕睡不着，还常给小孩喝。现在全世界超市都有卖，咖啡店里还有「红色拿铁」。","fame_en":"South Africans grow up on it: with milk and sugar at breakfast, at night without losing sleep, and often for kids too. Now it's in supermarkets worldwide, and cafés even serve 'red lattes'.","fact":"2021 年 5 月，欧盟把「Rooibos / Red Bush」登记为受保护的原产地名称，跟香槟、菲达奶酪一样——这是第一种得到这个身份的非洲食品，只有南非产区的才能这么叫。","fact_en":"In May 2021 the EU registered 'Rooibos / Red Bush' as a Protected Designation of Origin, like Champagne and feta — the first African food to get that status. Only rooibos from the South African region can use the name.","src":"南非政府新闻社 SAnews，2021","url":"https://www.sanews.gov.za/south-africa/south-african-rooibos-makes-list-eus-protected-designations","say":{"en":"Can I get a rooibos with milk? Is it caffeine-free?","zh":"能来一杯加奶的路易波士吗？是不含咖啡因的吧？"}},"德班兔子咖喱":{"what":"德班的街头吃法：把一条吐司挖空，里面灌满咖喱，叫「兔子」却没有兔肉。","what_en":"Durban's street food: a hollowed-out loaf of bread filled with curry. It's called 'bunny' but has no rabbit in it.","fame":"德班有很多印度裔南非人，这是他们的咖喱和面包碰在一起的产物。按大小点：quarter（四分之一条）、half、full；挖出来的那块面包叫 virgin，用来蘸汁。吃的时候用手，不用餐具。","fame_en":"Durban has a large Indian South African community, and this is where their curry met a loaf of bread. You order by size — quarter, half or full loaf — and the scooped-out piece, the 'virgin', is for mopping up gravy. Hands only, no cutlery.","fact":"名字里的「bunny」很可能跟兔子无关，而是来自 bania——当年德班格雷街一带印度商人店主的称呼；不过食物史学家也说，没人能百分之百确定。","fact_en":"The 'bunny' most likely has nothing to do with rabbits: it probably comes from 'bania', the word for the Indian merchant shopkeepers around Durban's Grey Street. Food historians admit no one can say for certain.","src":"AFAR 杂志","url":"https://www.afar.com/magazine/how-bunny-chow-became-south-africas-national-street-food","say":{"en":"Can I get a quarter mutton bunny? How hot is it?","zh":"来一个四分之一的羊肉 bunny chow（面包咖喱），辣不辣？"}},"阿拉伯咖啡":{"what":"加了豆蔻的浅色咖啡，用长嘴壶倒进没有把手的小杯里，配椰枣。","what_en":"Light-coloured coffee spiced with cardamom, poured from a long-spouted dallah into tiny handle-less cups and served with dates.","fame":"在沙特和海湾国家，倒咖啡就是待客：主人用左手拿壶、右手递杯，每次只倒一小口；你不想再喝了，就把杯子轻轻左右晃一晃。","fame_en":"In Saudi Arabia and the Gulf, pouring coffee is hospitality itself: the host holds the pot in the left hand and passes the cup with the right, a small splash at a time. When you've had enough, you gently shake your cup side to side.","fact":"沙特文化部把 2022 年定为「沙特咖啡年」，那一年年底，种植南部山区 Khawlani 咖啡豆的知识和手艺也进了联合国教科文组织的非物质文化遗产名录。","fact_en":"Saudi Arabia's Ministry of Culture named 2022 the 'Year of Saudi Coffee' — and by the end of that year, the know-how of growing Khawlani coffee in the southern mountains had joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list.","src":"Arab News，2023","url":"https://www.arabnews.com/saudi-arabia/culture-ministry-celebrates-success-of-year-of-saudi-coffee-and-honors-its-partners-2239096","say":{"en":"Thank you — that's enough for me.","zh":"谢谢，我喝够了。（同时轻轻晃晃杯子）"}},"曼萨夫":{"what":"约旦的国菜：羊肉用发酵干酸奶（jameed）煮，铺在米饭和薄饼上，撒杏仁和松子。","what_en":"Jordan's national dish: lamb cooked in a sauce of fermented dried yoghurt (jameed), served on rice and flatbread with almonds and pine nuts.","fame":"婚礼、葬礼、过节、迎客，约旦人都端出一大盘曼萨夫。传统吃法是大家站着围一盘，用右手把米饭和肉捏成小团吃；主人会把最好的肉放到客人面前。","fame_en":"Weddings, funerals, holidays, guests — Jordanians bring out a huge tray of mansaf. Traditionally everyone stands around one platter and rolls rice and meat into balls with the right hand; the host puts the best meat in front of the guest.","fact":"2022 年 12 月，曼萨夫进了联合国教科文组织的非物质文化遗产名录，这是约旦第一个单独申报成功的项目；登记的不只是一道菜，还有大家一起做饭、讲故事、唱歌的那一套习俗。","fact_en":"In December 2022, mansaf joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list — Jordan's first solo listing. What's recognised isn't just the dish but the custom around it: cooking together, telling stories and singing.","src":"UNESCO 非物质文化遗产名录","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/al-mansaf-in-jordan-a-festive-banquet-and-its-social-and-cultural-meanings-01849","say":{"en":"Could I have some more jameed sauce, please?","zh":"能再给我一点酸奶汁吗？"}},"卢旺达咖啡":{"what":"卢旺达山上种的阿拉比卡咖啡，喝起来常有红茶和水果的香味。","what_en":"Arabica coffee from Rwanda's hills, often with notes of black tea and red fruit.","fame":"卢旺达被称为「千丘之国」，咖啡长在海拔很高的山坡上，几十万小农把咖啡果送到附近的水洗站处理。现在很多国家的精品咖啡店都卖卢旺达豆，这也是当地重要的收入。","fame_en":"Rwanda, the 'land of a thousand hills', grows coffee on high slopes; hundreds of thousands of smallholders bring their cherries to nearby washing stations. Speciality cafés around the world now sell Rwandan beans, a key income for the country.","fact":"2008 年，非洲第一场「卓越杯」（Cup of Excellence）精品咖啡大赛就在卢旺达办，评审地点正是胡耶（布塔雷）——那时卢旺达的咖啡业刚从几乎垮掉中恢复过来。","fact_en":"In 2008 Africa's first Cup of Excellence speciality coffee competition was held in Rwanda, with judging in Huye (Butare) — just as Rwanda's coffee industry was recovering from near-collapse.","src":"Sweet Maria's Coffee Library，2008","url":"https://library.sweetmarias.com/the-first-rwanda-cup-of-excellence-coffee-competition-2008/","say":{"en":"Is the Rwandan on filter today? Is it fruity?","zh":"今天手冲有卢旺达豆吗？是果香型的吗？"}},"缅因龙虾":{"what":"美国东北角缅因州海里捞的龙虾，两只大钳子，煮熟了通红。","what_en":"Lobster from the cold sea off Maine, in America's far northeast — two big claws, bright red once it's cooked.","fame":"美国大部分龙虾来自缅因。夏天沿海公路边全是小木屋龙虾店，大家排队买龙虾卷：热狗面包夹满龙虾肉，拌一点蛋黄酱或者浇融化的黄油。","fame_en":"Most of America's lobster comes from Maine. In summer the coast road is lined with little lobster shacks, and people queue for lobster rolls — a hot-dog bun stuffed with lobster meat, with a bit of mayo or melted butter.","fact":"缅因的龙虾渔民有个一百多年的老规矩：抓到肚子下面带卵的母龙虾，要在尾巴上剪一个 V 字口再放回海里，以后谁抓到带 V 口的都不能留。这个做法从 1917 年就开始了，后来写进了法律。","fact_en":"Maine lobstermen have a rule that's over a century old: if they catch a female carrying eggs, they cut a small V-notch in her tail and throw her back — and nobody may keep a V-notched lobster after that. The practice dates to 1917 and later became law.","src":"Maine Lobstermen's Community Alliance","url":"https://www.mlcalliance.org/post/protecting-egged-females-is-a-centuries-old-maine-practice","say":{"en":"One lobster roll, please — is that with butter or mayo?","zh":"我要一个龙虾卷——是浇黄油的还是拌蛋黄酱的？"}},"芝加哥深盘披萨":{"what":"芝加哥的厚披萨：饼皮像派一样围成一个高边的盘子，里面先铺奶酪，最上面才是番茄酱。","what_en":"Chicago's thick pizza: the crust rises like a pie dish, cheese goes in first, and the tomato sauce sits on top.","fame":"一块就很顶饱，要用刀叉吃，奶酪一拉老长。来芝加哥的游客几乎都要吃一次；本地人平时更常吃切成小方块的薄饼，深盘留给请客和带朋友。","fame_en":"One slice fills you up, you eat it with a knife and fork, and the cheese stretches forever. Almost every visitor to Chicago tries it; locals eat thin, square-cut pizza more day to day and save deep dish for guests.","fact":"到底是谁发明的，到今天也没定论：Pizzeria Uno 说是 1943 年开店的老板 Ike Sewell 和 Ric Riccardo；可 1956 年的一篇报纸说是厨师 Rudy Malnati，研究披萨历史的人还提到一位叫 Alice May Redmond 的厨师。","fact_en":"Nobody can say for sure who invented it. Pizzeria Uno credits its founders Ike Sewell and Ric Riccardo, who opened in 1943; a 1956 newspaper credited the cook Rudy Malnati; and pizza historians also point to a cook named Alice May Redmond.","src":"Mental Floss","url":"https://www.mentalfloss.com/food/pizza/who-invented-deep-dish-pizza","say":{"en":"How long does a deep dish take? We'll share a medium.","zh":"深盘要等多久？我们几个分一个中号的。"}},"汉堡":{"what":"两片面包夹一块烤牛肉饼，加生菜、番茄、洋葱、芝士，配薯条和可乐。","what_en":"A grilled beef patty in a bun with lettuce, tomato, onion and cheese — usually with fries and a Coke.","fame":"美国人的日常饭：开车经过得来速、球场、路边小馆、高级餐厅都有。每家店都有自己的做法，点的时候还要说几分熟、加什么。","fame_en":"It's everyday American food — drive-throughs, ballparks, roadside diners and fancy restaurants all do one. Every place has its own style, and you say how you want it cooked and what goes on it.","fact":"美国国会图书馆曾认定，最早卖汉堡的是康涅狄格州纽黑文的 Louis' Lunch（1900 年）。这家小店到今天还用 1898 年造的铸铁立式烤炉，汉堡夹在两片方吐司里，不给番茄酱——据说有人要番茄酱会被请出去。","fact_en":"The Library of Congress once credited Louis' Lunch in New Haven, Connecticut, with selling America's first hamburger in 1900. It still cooks them in cast-iron vertical broilers made in 1898, serves them on two square slices of toast, and won't give you ketchup — people who ask have reportedly been shown the door.","src":"Wikipedia：Louis' Lunch","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis%27_Lunch","say":{"en":"Can I get a cheeseburger, medium, no onions — and a side of fries?","zh":"我要一个芝士汉堡，五分熟，不要洋葱，再来一份薯条。"}},"德州烤肉":{"what":"得克萨斯的烟熏烤肉：一大块牛胸肉抹盐和黑胡椒，用木头的烟慢慢熏十几个小时。","what_en":"Texas smoked barbecue: a whole beef brisket rubbed with salt and black pepper, smoked low and slow over wood for twelve-plus hours.","fame":"在奥斯汀，有名的烤肉店早上开门前就排长队，卖完就关门。肉按磅称，放在牛皮纸上，配白面包、腌黄瓜和洋葱，大家坐长桌一起吃。","fame_en":"In Austin, the famous joints have a line before they open and close when the meat runs out. Meat is sold by the pound on butcher paper with white bread, pickles and onions, eaten at long shared tables.","fact":"烤肉在得州重要到什么程度：2013 年，《得克萨斯月刊》（Texas Monthly）请了 Daniel Vaughn 当全职「烤肉编辑」，是这本杂志的第一个，也被说成是全美第一个。他本来是建筑师，写烤肉博客写出了名，那时已经吃过州里五百多家烤肉店。","fact_en":"That's how serious barbecue is in Texas: in 2013 Texas Monthly hired Daniel Vaughn as its first full-time barbecue editor — said to be the first in the country. He'd trained as an architect, got known for his barbecue blog, and had already eaten at more than five hundred joints across the state.","src":"WBUR Here & Now，2013 年","url":"https://www.wbur.org/hereandnow/2013/07/05/bbq-texas-vaughn","say":{"en":"Half a pound of brisket, fatty, and a sausage link, please.","zh":"要半磅牛胸肉，要肥一点的，再来一根香肠。"}},"玉米的故乡":{"what":"玉米是墨西哥人九千年前从一种叫大刍草的野草一点点培育出来的。","what_en":"Corn (maize) was bred by people in Mexico about 9,000 years ago from a wild grass called teosinte.","fame":"墨西哥人一天三顿都离不开玉米：玉米饼包塔可、玉米粥、玉米粽子（tamal）。玉米先用石灰水泡煮再磨成面团，这个老办法让它更好吃也更有营养。全世界的玉米都是从这里传出去的。","fame_en":"Mexicans eat corn at every meal: tortillas for tacos, atole, tamales. The kernels are first cooked in lime water and then ground into dough — an ancient method that makes it tastier and more nutritious. All the world's corn spread out from here.","fact":"2025 年 3 月，墨西哥把一条写进了宪法：禁止种转基因玉米，宪法里还把本地玉米叫作「国家认同的一部分」。在这之前，美国赢了一场贸易官司，墨西哥只好放开进口美国的转基因玉米当饲料。","fact_en":"In March 2025 Mexico wrote a ban on planting genetically modified corn into its constitution, calling native corn part of the national identity. It came after Mexico lost a trade dispute with the US and had to keep importing American GM corn, mostly for animal feed.","src":"Seed World，2025 年","url":"https://www.seedworld.com/latam/2025/03/24/mexico-approves-constitutional-ban-on-planting-genetically-modified-corn/","say":{"en":"Are these tortillas made fresh? Two tacos de pastor, please.","zh":"这些玉米饼是现做的吗？要两个牧师烤肉塔可。"}},"龙舌兰酒":{"what":"用蓝色龙舌兰的「心」蒸熟、榨汁、发酵、蒸馏出来的烈酒，名字来自哈利斯科州的小镇特基拉（Tequila）。","what_en":"A spirit made by cooking, crushing, fermenting and distilling the heart of the blue agave — named after the town of Tequila in Jalisco.","fame":"墨西哥人喝它不只是一口闷：好的龙舌兰会像威士忌那样慢慢品，配一杯辣辣的番茄橙汁（sangrita）。玛格丽特鸡尾酒也是用它调的。","fame_en":"Mexicans don't just shoot it: good tequila is sipped slowly like whisky, often with a glass of spicy tomato-orange sangrita. It's also the base of the margarita.","fact":"特基拉镇周围一片片蓝绿色的龙舌兰田和老酒厂，2006 年一起被列为世界遗产，保护面积三万五千公顷——是田地本身成了遗产，不只是一座老房子。","fact_en":"The blue-green agave fields and old distilleries around Tequila were listed together as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2006 — about 35,000 hectares. The fields themselves are the heritage, not just old buildings.","src":"Wikipedia：Agave Landscape of Tequila","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agave_Landscape_and_Ancient_Industrial_Facilities_of_Tequila","say":{"en":"What do you recommend for sipping — a reposado?","zh":"有什么适合慢慢喝的？微陈（reposado）的吗？"}},"牛油果":{"what":"外皮疙疙瘩瘩、里面绿色像黄油的果子，一大颗核。墨西哥是世界上种得最多的地方。","what_en":"A bumpy-skinned fruit with buttery green flesh and one big stone. Mexico grows more than anywhere else.","fame":"在墨西哥，牛油果碾碎加洋葱、番茄、辣椒、香菜和青柠，就是牛油果酱（guacamole），几乎什么都可以蘸。大部分出口去美国，超级碗那天美国人能吃掉一大堆。","fame_en":"In Mexico it's mashed with onion, tomato, chilli, coriander and lime into guacamole, which goes on almost everything. Most exports go to the US, where Super Bowl Sunday eats a mountain of it.","fact":"现在超市里最常见的哈斯（Hass）牛油果，都来自一棵树：1926 年，加州邮递员 Rudolph Hass 买了一颗种子种在自家院子里，后来申请了专利。这棵「母树」2002 年得根腐病死了。","fact_en":"The Hass avocado you see in every supermarket traces back to a single tree: in 1926 a California mail carrier, Rudolph Hass, planted a seedling in his yard and later patented it. The 'mother tree' died of root rot in 2002.","src":"Wikipedia：Hass avocado","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hass_avocado","say":{"en":"Is this one ripe? I want to eat it today.","zh":"这个熟了吗？我今天就想吃。"}},"哥伦比亚咖啡":{"what":"种在哥伦比亚安第斯山坡上的阿拉比卡咖啡，大多是小农户一颗颗手摘的。","what_en":"Arabica coffee grown on Andean slopes in Colombia, mostly hand-picked cherry by cherry by small family farms.","fame":"哥伦比亚是世界上数得着的咖啡大国。咖啡三角区的老庄园可以去参观，体验摘咖啡；当地人自己爱喝一种又淡又甜的小杯黑咖啡 tinto。","fame_en":"Colombia is one of the world's big coffee countries. You can visit old farms in the Coffee Triangle and try picking; locals themselves drink tinto, a small, weak, sweet black coffee.","fact":"广告里那个戴草帽、牵着骡子 Conchita 的咖啡农 Juan Valdez，不是真人：1958 年哥伦比亚咖啡种植者协会请纽约广告公司设计了他，好让美国人认出「百分之百哥伦比亚咖啡」。后来先后有三个人演过他，2006 年起由一位真的咖啡农来演。","fact_en":"Juan Valdez, the coffee farmer in a sombrero with his mule Conchita, isn't a real person: Colombia's coffee growers' federation had a New York ad agency create him in 1958 so Americans would recognise '100% Colombian coffee'. Three men have played him — since 2006, a real coffee grower.","src":"Wikipedia：Juan Valdez","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Valdez","say":{"en":"Which region is this coffee from? I'd like it as a pour-over.","zh":"这个咖啡是哪个产区的？我要手冲。"}},"巴西咖啡":{"what":"巴西种的咖啡，大多在东南部米纳斯吉拉斯州的大片高原咖啡园里。","what_en":"Coffee grown in Brazil, mostly on big upland farms in the southeastern state of Minas Gerais.","fame":"全世界大约三分之一的咖啡来自巴西，很多拼配咖啡的底子就是巴西豆，味道像坚果和巧克力。巴西人自己一天喝好多杯小小的甜咖啡 cafezinho，请客人喝一杯是礼貌。","fame_en":"About a third of the world's coffee comes from Brazil, and its nutty, chocolatey beans are the base of many blends. Brazilians drink lots of tiny sweet cafezinhos a day — offering one is basic hospitality.","fact":"巴西已经当了 150 年的世界第一咖啡大国。第一棵咖啡树是 1727 年 Francisco de Melo Palheta 在帕拉州种下的；传说种子是他出使法属圭亚那时，总督夫人藏在一束花里偷偷送给他的。","fact_en":"Brazil has been the world's biggest coffee producer for 150 years. Its first coffee bush was planted in Pará in 1727 by Francisco de Melo Palheta — and legend says the seeds were smuggled to him in a bouquet from the governor's wife in French Guiana.","src":"Wikipedia：Coffee production in Brazil","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee_production_in_Brazil","say":{"en":"A cafezinho, please — not too sweet.","zh":"来一杯小咖啡，别太甜。"}},"巴西烤肉":{"what":"巴西南部牛仔传下来的烤法：大块牛肉穿在长铁签上，只撒粗盐，在炭火上慢慢烤。","what_en":"A way of grilling from the gaúcho cowboys of southern Brazil: big cuts of beef on long skewers, just coarse salt, slow over charcoal.","fame":"在巴西，周末一家人、朋友在后院一起烤肉（churrasco）是大事。餐馆里是「轮着上」（rodízio）：服务员举着肉签到桌边现切，最受欢迎的是带一层肥边的牛臀肉 picanha。","fame_en":"In Brazil a weekend churrasco with family and friends is a big deal. At restaurants it's rodízio — waiters bring skewers to your table and carve on the spot, and the favourite is picanha, rump cap with its layer of fat.","fact":"picanha 在巴西是政治话题：卢拉 2022 年竞选时承诺，大家都能吃得起「picanha 配啤酒」的烤肉；到了 2026 年，这块肉反而贵了将近 10%，对手在竞选活动上请大家吃烤肉，说他没兑现。","fact_en":"Picanha is political in Brazil: running in 2022, Lula promised everyone could afford a 'picanha and beer' barbecue. By 2026 the cut cost nearly 10% more, and his rivals served grilled meat at rallies to say he hadn't delivered.","src":"AFP / Malay Mail，2026 年","url":"https://www.malaymail.com/news/world/2026/09/09/lulas-picanha-promise-comes-back-to-haunt-him-ahead-of-brazil-election/234418","say":{"en":"Can I have some more picanha — medium rare, please?","zh":"能再来点牛臀肉吗？三分熟，谢谢。"}},"马黛茶":{"what":"用马黛（yerba mate）叶子泡的草本茶，装在葫芦杯里，用一根金属吸管（bombilla）喝。","what_en":"A herbal drink of yerba mate leaves, steeped in a gourd and sipped through a metal straw called a bombilla.","fame":"在阿根廷、乌拉圭、巴拉圭，马黛茶不是饮料，是社交：一个人负责续热水，一杯轮着传给每个人。上班、上课、去公园，很多人随身带保温壶。","fame_en":"In Argentina, Uruguay and Paraguay, mate isn't just a drink, it's social: one person refills the hot water and the same gourd goes round the group. People carry a thermos to work, class and the park.","fact":"2013 年阿根廷专门立了法（第 26.871 号）：马黛茶是「国家饮品」，和葡萄酒成为「国酒」同一时间。法律还规定，官方的文化、社会和体育活动要放上「马黛茶 · 国家饮品」的字样和标志。","fact_en":"In 2013 Argentina passed a law (No. 26,871) declaring mate the 'national infusion' — at the same time wine became the national drink. The law says official cultural, social and sports events should display the words and logo 'Mate, National Infusion'.","src":"Diario Jornada，2013 年","url":"https://diariojornada.com.ar/75748/magazine/el_gobierno_declaro_al_vino_y_al_mate_como_bebidas_nacionales","say":{"en":"Thanks — that's enough for me.","zh":"谢谢，我喝够了。（说「谢谢」就是不要再续了）"}},"阿根廷烤肉":{"what":"阿根廷的 asado：在铁架子（parrilla）上用柴火或炭慢慢烤牛肉、香肠、血肠和内脏。","what_en":"Argentine asado: beef, chorizo, blood sausage and offal grilled slowly on a parrilla over wood or charcoal.","fame":"周日中午全家朋友聚在一起，一个人当烤肉师（asador），从香肠一路吃到大块牛肉，几个小时才结束。最后大家要一起鼓掌，喊「给烤肉师鼓掌！」","fame_en":"Sunday lunch with family and friends, one person as the asador, working from sausages to big cuts of beef over several hours. At the end everyone applauds the cook: '¡Un aplauso para el asador!'","fact":"阿根廷人一直是世界上最爱吃牛肉的人之一，可 2024 年通胀太厉害，每人一年只吃了大约 47 公斤牛肉，是有记录以来最低，跟邻国乌拉圭打平；很多人改吃更便宜的鸡肉和猪肉。","fact_en":"Argentines have long been among the world's biggest beef eaters, but with inflation in 2024 they ate only about 47 kg each — the lowest on record, level with Uruguay — as many switched to cheaper chicken and pork.","src":"Buenos Aires Times","url":"https://batimes.com.ar/news/economy/beef-consumption-in-argentina-plummets-to-historic-lows.phtml","say":{"en":"What cut do you recommend for two? We'd like it medium.","zh":"两个人吃，推荐哪块肉？要五分熟。"}},"智利红酒":{"what":"智利中部山谷里酿的葡萄酒，夹在安第斯山和太平洋中间，阳光足、晚上凉。","what_en":"Wine from the central valleys of Chile, squeezed between the Andes and the Pacific — sunny days, cool nights.","fame":"智利红酒在世界各地超市都很常见：价钱不贵、喝起来稳。它的招牌是佳美娜（Carménère），一种带点青椒和香料味的红葡萄。","fame_en":"Chilean wine is on supermarket shelves everywhere — good value and reliable. Its signature is Carménère, a red grape with a hint of green pepper and spice.","fact":"佳美娜本来是法国波尔多的老品种，19 世纪病虫害后在法国几乎消失了。智利人种了一百多年，一直以为它是梅洛（Merlot）；直到 1994 年，一位法国葡萄专家在智利的葡萄园里认出了它，1998 年智利才正式承认它是一个单独的品种。","fact_en":"Carménère was an old Bordeaux grape that all but vanished from France after the phylloxera plague. Chileans grew it for over a century thinking it was Merlot — until a French grape expert recognised it in a Chilean vineyard in 1994. Chile officially recognised it as its own variety in 1998.","src":"Wikipedia：Carménère","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carm%C3%A9n%C3%A8re","say":{"en":"Could you recommend a Chilean red under twenty dollars?","zh":"能推荐一瓶二十美元以内的智利红酒吗？"}},"门多萨红酒":{"what":"阿根廷门多萨在安第斯山脚下，高海拔的葡萄园用雪山融水浇灌，酿出浓郁的马尔贝克（Malbec）红酒。","what_en":"Mendoza sits at the foot of the Andes; its high vineyards are watered by snowmelt and make rich Malbec red wine.","fame":"阿根廷的葡萄酒大部分来自门多萨。马尔贝克本来是法国品种，在这里长得最好，配阿根廷烤牛肉正合适；游客可以骑自行车一家家逛酒庄。","fame_en":"Most Argentine wine comes from Mendoza. Malbec is originally French but thrives best here, and it's perfect with Argentine steak; visitors cycle from winery to winery.","fact":"每年 4 月 17 日是「世界马尔贝克日」，2011 年由阿根廷葡萄酒协会发起。选这一天，是因为 1853 年 4 月 17 日门多萨议会收到建立农业学校和试验园的提案——马尔贝克就是从那里在阿根廷扎下根的。","fact_en":"April 17 is World Malbec Day, started by Wines of Argentina in 2011. The date marks April 17, 1853, when Mendoza's legislature received the bill to create an agricultural school and experimental farm — where Malbec took root in Argentina.","src":"门多萨省政府","url":"https://www.mendoza.gov.ar/prensa/mendoza-celebra-el-dia-mundial-del-malbec/","say":{"en":"Could we have a glass of Malbec each with the steak?","zh":"配牛排，我们每人来一杯马尔贝克。"}},"厄瓜多尔香蕉":{"what":"厄瓜多尔海边低地种的香蕉，一串串绿着摘下来，装船运到世界各地，在路上慢慢变黄。","what_en":"Bananas grown in Ecuador's coastal lowlands, cut green in bunches and shipped worldwide, ripening on the way.","fame":"厄瓜多尔是世界上出口香蕉最多的国家，全世界买卖的香蕉超过四分之一从这里来。欧洲、美国、俄罗斯超市里的香蕉上，常常贴着厄瓜多尔的小标签。","fame_en":"Ecuador exports more bananas than any other country — over a quarter of the world's traded bananas. In supermarkets in Europe, the US and Russia, the little sticker often says Ecuador.","fact":"我们吃的香蕉几乎都是同一个品种「卡文迪什」，抵抗不了一种叫 TR4 的土壤真菌。2025 年 12 月，厄瓜多尔在靠近秘鲁边境的一个香蕉园第一次确认了 TR4，政府宣布进入植物检疫紧急状态。","fact_en":"Nearly every banana we eat is one variety, the Cavendish, which can't resist a soil fungus called TR4. In December 2025 Ecuador confirmed TR4 for the first time, on a farm near the Peruvian border, and declared a phytosanitary emergency.","src":"FreshPlaza，2026 年","url":"https://www.freshplaza.com/north-america/article/9810310/ecuador-confirms-tr4-on-banana-farm-in-el-oro/","say":{"en":"How much are the bananas — per pound or per bunch?","zh":"香蕉怎么卖——按磅还是按串？"}},"藜麦":{"what":"安第斯高原上种了几千年的小颗粒粮食，煮熟了一粒粒的，有点像小米。","what_en":"A tiny grain grown for thousands of years on the high Andean plateau — cooked, it's fluffy and a bit like millet.","fame":"以前是玻利维亚、秘鲁高原农民的家常饭；这二十年因为蛋白质多、不含麸质，成了欧美健康沙拉碗的常客，价钱一度涨了好几倍。","fame_en":"It was everyday food for highland farmers in Bolivia and Peru; over the last twenty years, because it's high in protein and gluten-free, it became a star of salad bowls in Europe and North America, and prices once jumped several times over.","fact":"2013 年被联合国定为「国际藜麦年」，是玻利维亚总统莫拉莱斯提议的，他和秘鲁第一夫人还当了联合国粮农组织的特别大使。粮农组织说，现在世界上七十多个国家都在种藜麦。","fact_en":"The UN declared 2013 the International Year of Quinoa, on a proposal from Bolivia's president Evo Morales, who served as an FAO special ambassador along with Peru's first lady. FAO says quinoa now grows in over seventy countries.","src":"联合国粮农组织（FAO），2013 年","url":"https://www.fao.org/newsroom/detail/Successful-International-Year-of-Quinoa-2013-winds-down/en","say":{"en":"Can I swap the rice for quinoa in this bowl?","zh":"这个碗里的米饭能换成藜麦吗？"}},"安提瓜咖啡":{"what":"危地马拉古城安提瓜周围山谷里种的咖啡，被阿瓜、富埃戈、阿卡特南戈三座火山围着。","what_en":"Coffee from the valley around the old city of Antigua, Guatemala, ringed by three volcanoes — Agua, Fuego and Acatenango.","fame":"火山灰土、高海拔、凉爽的夜晚，让安提瓜咖啡带着巧克力和香料的味道，在精品咖啡店里很有名。游客可以在古城附近的咖啡园里看摘豆、烘豆。","fame_en":"Volcanic soil, high altitude and cool nights give Antigua coffee chocolatey, spicy notes, and it's well known in specialty cafés. Visitors can tour farms near the old town and watch picking and roasting.","fact":"因为太有名，假货比真货还多：2006 年的报道说，前一年市场上卖出约 10 万袋「安提瓜咖啡」，可这个产区只产了约 5 万袋。所以当地农户在 2000 年成立了「正宗安提瓜咖啡」协会，划定能用这个名字的地方。","fact_en":"It's so famous that fakes outnumber the real thing: a 2006 report said about 100,000 bags were sold as 'Antigua' the year before, while the area produced only about 50,000. That's why local growers formed the Genuine Antigua Coffee association in 2000, to mark out where the name can be used.","src":"FoodIngredientsFirst，2006 年","url":"https://www.foodingredientsfirst.com/news/guatemala-coffee-atlas-fights-gourmet-beans-impostor.html","say":{"en":"Is this from Antigua? Can I smell the beans before you grind them?","zh":"这是安提瓜的吗？磨之前我能闻一下豆子吗？"}},"纳帕谷葡萄酒":{"what":"加州旧金山北边纳帕谷产的葡萄酒，最出名的是赤霞珠（Cabernet Sauvignon）红酒。","what_en":"Wine from Napa Valley, north of San Francisco, California — most famous for Cabernet Sauvignon.","fame":"纳帕谷是美国最有名的葡萄酒产区，山谷里几百家酒庄，周末湾区的人开车过去品酒、吃饭，酒庄一般要预约、按「一轮品酒」收费。","fame_en":"Napa is America's most famous wine region, with hundreds of wineries. Bay Area people drive up for weekend tastings and lunch; most wineries need a booking and charge per tasting flight.","fact":"1976 年在巴黎有一场盲品，法国评委给加州酒和法国名庄打分，结果纳帕的鹿跃酒窖赤霞珠和蒙特莱那酒庄的霞多丽都拿了第一，史称「巴黎审判」。这两瓶酒现在摆在华盛顿的史密森尼美国历史博物馆里。","fact_en":"At a 1976 blind tasting in Paris, French judges scored California wines against top French ones — and Napa's Stag's Leap Cabernet and Chateau Montelena Chardonnay both came first. Known as the 'Judgment of Paris', those two wines now sit in the Smithsonian's National Museum of American History.","src":"Smithsonian，2016 年","url":"https://dashboard.si.edu/newsdesk/releases/smithsonian-commemorates-40th-anniversary-judgment-paris","say":{"en":"We have a tasting booked for two at eleven. How many wines are in the flight?","zh":"我们约了十一点两个人品酒。这一轮有几款酒？"}},"爱达荷土豆":{"what":"美国西北部爱达荷州种的土豆，大多是长长的褐皮「赤褐土豆」（russet），粉粉的。","what_en":"Potatoes from Idaho in America's northwest — mostly long, brown-skinned russets that cook up fluffy.","fame":"爱达荷种的土豆在美国最多，很多薯条、烤土豆、土豆泥用的都是它。火山灰土、白天热晚上凉、雪山融水浇地，是它好吃的原因。","fame_en":"Idaho grows more potatoes than any other US state; lots of America's fries, baked potatoes and mash start here. Volcanic soil, hot days, cool nights and snowmelt water are the reason.","fact":"爱达荷的车牌上印着「著名的土豆」（Famous Potatoes），1957 年起就是这几个字；早在 1928 年土豆就上了车牌。2025 年州里还推出了复古的黑白车牌「世界著名的土豆」，多收的钱一部分给土豆委员会。","fact_en":"Idaho licence plates say 'Famous Potatoes' — the wording since 1957, and potatoes first appeared on the plates in 1928. In 2025 the state brought back a retro black-and-white 'World Famous Potatoes' plate, with part of the fee going to the Idaho Potato Commission.","src":"Wikipedia：Vehicle registration plates of Idaho","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vehicle_registration_plates_of_Idaho","say":{"en":"Can I get a baked potato with sour cream and chives?","zh":"要一个烤土豆，加酸奶油和细香葱。"}},"威斯康星奶酪":{"what":"美国中北部威斯康星州产的奶酪：切达、科尔比、还有新鲜的「奶酪豆」（cheese curds）。","what_en":"Cheese from Wisconsin in the Upper Midwest — cheddar, Colby, and fresh cheese curds.","fame":"威斯康星是美国的「奶牛州」，奶酪产量全国第一。当地人爱吃刚做好的奶酪豆，咬起来会吱吱响；炸奶酪豆是酒吧和球场的标配。","fame_en":"Wisconsin is 'America's Dairyland' and makes more cheese than any other state. Locals love fresh cheese curds that squeak when you bite them, and fried curds are standard at bars and ballparks.","fact":"绿湾包装工队球迷头上那顶三角形「奶酪帽」，是 1987 年密尔沃基人 Ralph Bruno 给妈妈换沙发垫时，拿海绵切出来、烧了些洞、涂成黄色做的。2023 年，包装工队把做奶酪帽的这家公司买了下来。","fact_en":"The wedge-shaped 'cheesehead' hat Packers fans wear was made in 1987 by Milwaukee's Ralph Bruno, who cut it from foam while reupholstering his mom's couch, burned in holes and painted it yellow. In 2023 the Green Bay Packers bought the company that makes them.","src":"CBS News Chicago","url":"https://www.cbsnews.com/chicago/news/man-created-cheese-hat-from-moms-couch/","say":{"en":"Are the cheese curds fresh today? Do they squeak?","zh":"今天的奶酪豆是新鲜的吗？会吱吱响吗？"}},"肯德基":{"what":"全世界都有的炸鸡连锁店，招牌是「上校」桑德斯和他的十一种香料配方。","what_en":"The fried-chicken chain found worldwide, known for Colonel Sanders and his recipe of eleven herbs and spices.","fame":"起点是肯塔基州科尔宾的一家路边加油站餐馆，桑德斯在那里卖炸鸡，后来开放加盟开遍全世界。在中国它是最早的西式快餐之一；在日本，很多家庭圣诞节要提前预订肯德基。","fame_en":"It started at a roadside service-station café in Corbin, Kentucky, where Harland Sanders sold fried chicken before franchising it worldwide. In China it was one of the first Western fast-food chains; in Japan, many families pre-order KFC for Christmas.","fact":"叫「肯塔基」炸鸡，总部却不在肯塔基了：2025 年 2 月，母公司百胜宣布把 KFC 的美国总部从肯塔基州路易斯维尔搬到得克萨斯州普莱诺，跟必胜客放在一起。肯塔基州长说他很失望。","fact_en":"Kentucky Fried Chicken no longer lives in Kentucky: in February 2025 parent company Yum! Brands announced it was moving KFC's US headquarters from Louisville to Plano, Texas, alongside Pizza Hut. Kentucky's governor said he was disappointed.","src":"CTV News，2025 年","url":"https://www.ctvnews.ca/business/article/kfc-shifts-us-headquarters-from-kentucky-to-texas/","say":{"en":"A two-piece meal, original recipe, with mashed potatoes, please.","zh":"要一个两块的套餐，原味，配土豆泥。"}},"佛罗里达橙子":{"what":"美国东南角佛罗里达州种的橙子，大部分不是拿来直接吃，而是榨成橙汁。","what_en":"Oranges grown in Florida, in America's southeast corner — most are squeezed into juice rather than eaten whole.","fame":"美国人早饭桌上那杯橙汁，很长时间都来自佛罗里达；州里的车牌、路边小店、旅游纪念品上到处是橙子。","fame_en":"For decades the glass of orange juice on America's breakfast table came from Florida; oranges are on its licence plates, roadside stands and souvenirs.","fact":"佛罗里达的橙子快种不下去了：1997–98 年一季产了 2.44 亿箱，2024–25 年只剩约 1215 万箱。一种叫「黄龙病」（柑橘绿化病）的虫传病害加上几场飓风，让全州柑橘产量跌到一百多年来最低。","fact_en":"Florida's oranges are in trouble: the 1997–98 season produced 244 million boxes; 2024–25 only about 12.15 million. Citrus greening, a disease spread by an insect, plus hurricanes pushed the state's citrus output to its lowest in over a century.","src":"CBS News Miami，2025 年","url":"https://www.cbsnews.com/miami/news/florida-citrus-production-lowest-in-century-usda-says/","say":{"en":"Is the orange juice fresh-squeezed? A large one, please.","zh":"橙汁是现榨的吗？要一大杯。"}},"切萨皮克蓝蟹":{"what":"美国东海岸切萨皮克湾里的蓝色螃蟹，蒸熟以后变成红色，撒满辣味调料。","what_en":"Blue crabs from Chesapeake Bay on America's East Coast — they turn red when steamed and come coated in spicy seasoning.","fame":"在马里兰，夏天的「吃螃蟹聚会」（crab feast）是大事：桌上铺报纸，一整筐蒸螃蟹倒上去，大家拿小木槌敲、用手掰，配玉米和啤酒，一吃一下午。","fame_en":"In Maryland a summer crab feast is a big deal: newspaper on the table, a whole bushel of steamed crabs poured out, everyone cracking them with wooden mallets and fingers, with corn and beer, all afternoon.","fact":"撒在螃蟹上的 Old Bay 调料，是德国犹太移民 Gustav Brunn 发明的：他被关进纳粹集中营，家人付钱把他赎出来，他带着孩子逃到巴尔的摩，1939 年开了香料公司，做出了这个配方。","fact_en":"The Old Bay seasoning on the crabs was created by Gustav Brunn, a German-Jewish immigrant: after his family paid for his release from a Nazi concentration camp, he fled to Baltimore with his children and in 1939 started the spice company that made the blend.","src":"Baltimore Heritage","url":"https://explore.baltimoreheritage.org/items/show/757","say":{"en":"How much for a dozen large crabs, steamed with Old Bay?","zh":"一打大螃蟹多少钱？要用 Old Bay 蒸的。"}},"长颈鹿":{"what":"世界上最高的动物，脖子长、腿长，舌头能卷树叶。","what_en":"The tallest animal on Earth — long neck, long legs, and a tongue that wraps around leaves.","fame":"站起来五米多高，专吃别人够不着的金合欢树顶；在肯尼亚马赛马拉、坦桑尼亚塞伦盖蒂开车就能看到一群群慢慢走过草原。","fame_en":"At over five metres tall, it eats acacia leaves no one else can reach. In Kenya's Maasai Mara or Tanzania's Serengeti you can watch herds stroll past your car.","fact":"一直以来都说「长颈鹿是一个物种」。2025 年 8 月，世界自然保护联盟（IUCN）正式承认长颈鹿其实是 4 个不同的物种：北方长颈鹿、网纹长颈鹿、马赛长颈鹿和南方长颈鹿。马赛马拉看到的就是马赛长颈鹿。","fact_en":"For a long time the giraffe was treated as one species. In August 2025 the IUCN officially recognised four separate species: northern, reticulated, Masai and southern giraffes. The ones in the Maasai Mara are Masai giraffes.","src":"IUCN 新闻稿，2025 年 8 月","url":"https://iucn.org/press-release/202508/four-giraffe-species-officially-recognised-major-conservation-reclassification","say":{"en":"Can we stop here for a minute? I want a photo of the giraffes.","zh":"能在这儿停一下吗？我想拍几张长颈鹿。"}},"角马大迁徙":{"what":"上百万只角马和斑马跟着雨水和青草，每年在坦桑尼亚和肯尼亚之间绕一大圈。","what_en":"Over a million wildebeest and zebras follow the rain and fresh grass in a huge loop between Tanzania and Kenya every year.","fame":"被叫作「地球上最壮观的动物大迁徙」。最有名的一幕是七到九月过马拉河：几千只角马一起往河里跳，鳄鱼在水里等着。","fame_en":"It's called the greatest wildlife show on Earth. The famous scene is the Mara River crossing from July to September: thousands of wildebeest jump in together while crocodiles wait in the water.","fact":"大家都看过河。其实每年 1 到 3 月在塞伦盖蒂南边的草原上，角马会在两三个星期里集中生下差不多 50 万只小角马，高峰期一天能生八千只。小角马生下来几分钟就能站起来跑。","fact_en":"Everyone knows the river crossing. But from January to March on the southern Serengeti plains, about 500,000 calves are born within two or three weeks — up to 8,000 a day at the peak. A calf can stand and run within minutes of birth.","src":"BBC Wildlife（Discover Wildlife）","url":"https://www.discoverwildlife.com/animal-facts/mammals/wildebeest-calving","say":{"en":"Do you think they'll cross the river today?","zh":"你觉得它们今天会过河吗？"}},"山地大猩猩":{"what":"住在卢旺达、乌干达、刚果（金）交界火山森林里的大猩猩。","what_en":"Gorillas living in the volcanic forests where Rwanda, Uganda and DR Congo meet.","fame":"全世界只有一千多只，没有一只在动物园里。在卢旺达火山国家公园，跟着向导爬山一两个小时，可以在大猩猩一家旁边安静地待一小时。","fame_en":"There are only about a thousand in the world, and none live in zoos. In Rwanda's Volcanoes National Park you hike with a guide for an hour or two, then spend one quiet hour next to a gorilla family.","fact":"它们是少数数量在变多的大猿：2018 年 IUCN 把山地大猩猩从「极危」降为「濒危」；2019 年公布的调查一共数到 1063 只。","fact_en":"They're one of the few great apes whose numbers are growing. In 2018 the IUCN moved mountain gorillas from Critically Endangered to Endangered, and a count published in 2019 found 1,063 of them.","src":"KT Press（卢旺达），2019 年 12 月；国际大猩猩保护计划 IGCP","url":"https://www.ktpress.rw/2019/12/gorilla-population-in-virunga-massifs-increases-to-1063/","say":{"en":"How far do we have to hike to find the family?","zh":"我们要走多远才能找到那一家？"}},"奥卡万戈大象":{"what":"博茨瓦纳奥卡万戈三角洲里的大象，在水道和小岛之间走来走去。","what_en":"The elephants of Botswana's Okavango Delta, wading between channels and little islands.","fame":"奥卡万戈是一条流进沙漠、没流到海里就消失的河，旱季反而涨水，引来大批动物。博茨瓦纳是非洲大象最多的国家，在这里坐独木舟就能看到大象过河。","fame_en":"The Okavango is a river that flows into the desert and disappears before reaching the sea. It floods in the dry season, drawing huge numbers of animals. Botswana has more elephants than any other country, and here you can watch them cross from a dugout canoe.","fact":"2014 年 6 月，奥卡万戈三角洲被列为世界遗产，正好是第 1000 个世界遗产。","fact_en":"In June 2014 the Okavango Delta was inscribed on the World Heritage List — the 1,000th site ever.","src":"联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心，2014 年","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/news/1159","say":{"en":"Is it safe to paddle this close to the elephants?","zh":"划得离大象这么近安全吗？"}},"克鲁格犀牛":{"what":"南非克鲁格国家公园里的白犀牛和黑犀牛。","what_en":"The white and black rhinos of South Africa's Kruger National Park.","fame":"克鲁格是非洲最有名的国家公园之一，自己开车就能找「五大兽」：狮、豹、象、犀牛和水牛。犀牛是大家最想看到、也最难看到的一个。","fame_en":"Kruger is one of Africa's best-known parks, and you can drive yourself in search of the Big Five: lion, leopard, elephant, rhino and buffalo. The rhino is the one everyone most wants to see — and the hardest to find.","fact":"因为偷猎角，SANParks 的报告说克鲁格的犀牛从 2013 年到 2019 年少了 59%，只剩大约 3529 头白犀牛和 268 头黑犀牛。现在公园会给犀牛锯掉角，让偷猎的人没有东西可抢。","fact_en":"Because of horn poaching, a SANParks report found Kruger's rhinos fell by 59% between 2013 and 2019, to about 3,529 white and 268 black rhinos. The park now dehorns rhinos so poachers have nothing to take.","src":"Save the Rhino，2021 年 1 月（引 SANParks 年报）","url":"https://www.savetherhino.org/poaching-crisis/rhino-numbers-plunge-in-kruger-national-park/","say":{"en":"Has anyone seen rhinos on this road today?","zh":"今天有人在这条路上看到犀牛吗？"}},"好望角企鹅":{"what":"非洲唯一的企鹅，又叫非洲企鹅，住在南非开普敦附近的海滩上。","what_en":"Africa's only penguin, also called the African penguin, living on beaches near Cape Town.","fame":"在开普敦西蒙镇的博尔德斯海滩，企鹅就在沙滩上、木栈道下面走来走去，游客隔着几米就能看，还能在旁边的海湾游泳。","fame_en":"At Boulders Beach in Simon's Town near Cape Town, penguins waddle across the sand and under the boardwalk. Visitors watch from a few metres away and can even swim in the next cove.","fact":"2024 年 10 月，非洲企鹅被 IUCN 列为「极危」，是 18 种企鹅里第一个到这一级的。2023 年全世界繁殖的不到 1 万对，一百年里少了 97% 以上，主要是没有足够的沙丁鱼吃。","fact_en":"In October 2024 the African penguin was listed as Critically Endangered — the first of the world's 18 penguin species to reach that level. Fewer than 10,000 breeding pairs were left in 2023, a loss of over 97% in a century, mainly because there aren't enough sardines to eat.","src":"Daily News（南非），2024 年 10 月 29 日","url":"https://dailynews.co.za/news/environment/2024-10-29-african-penguins-declared-as-officially-critically-endangered-this-is-why/","say":{"en":"Can I take photos from the boardwalk?","zh":"我可以在木栈道上拍照吗？"}},"狐猴":{"what":"马达加斯加特有的灵长类，大眼睛、长尾巴，跟猴子是远亲。","what_en":"Madagascar's own primates — big eyes, long tails, distant cousins of monkeys.","fame":"全世界的野生狐猴只住在马达加斯加，有一百多种：有的像小老鼠一样小，有的（大狐猴）叫起来几公里外都听得到。在安达西贝的森林里，早上就能听到大狐猴「唱歌」。","fame_en":"Wild lemurs live only in Madagascar, and there are over a hundred kinds — some as small as a mouse, while the indri's call carries for kilometres. In Andasibe's forest you can hear indris 'singing' in the morning.","fact":"2018 年 IUCN 的专家评估了全部 111 种和亚种的狐猴，发现 105 种（95%）都面临灭绝危险，让狐猴成了世界上最受威胁的哺乳动物之一，主要原因是砍树和打猎。","fact_en":"In 2018 IUCN experts assessed all 111 lemur species and subspecies and found 105 — 95% — threatened with extinction, making lemurs one of the most endangered groups of mammals on Earth, mainly because of forest loss and hunting.","src":"Mongabay，2018 年 8 月","url":"https://news.mongabay.com/2018/08/95-percent-of-all-lemur-species-face-high-risk-of-extinction/","say":{"en":"What time do the indri start calling?","zh":"大狐猴一般几点开始叫？"}},"狮尾狒":{"what":"埃塞俄比亚高原上的狒狒，胸口有一块红色的心形皮肤。","what_en":"A baboon-like monkey of the Ethiopian highlands, with a red heart-shaped patch of bare skin on its chest.","fame":"只住在埃塞俄比亚三四千米高的山上，经常几百只一起坐在悬崖边的草地上；在塞米恩山国家公园，人可以走到离它们几米的地方。","fame_en":"It lives only on Ethiopian mountains three to four thousand metres up, often in groups of hundreds sitting on clifftop meadows. In Simien Mountains National Park you can walk to within a few metres of them.","fact":"它几乎只吃草，是世界上唯一主要靠吃草活着的灵长类：雨季吃的东西 90% 以上是草叶，整天坐着用手一根根拔草。","fact_en":"It's the only primate that lives mainly on grass: in the wet season over 90% of its food is grass blades, which it plucks one by one while sitting all day.","src":"圣迭戈动物园 · 动物资料","url":"https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/gelada","say":{"en":"How close can we get without scaring them?","zh":"我们能走多近才不会吓到它们？"}},"纳库鲁湖火烈鸟":{"what":"肯尼亚纳库鲁湖边成群的火烈鸟，把湖岸染成粉红色。","what_en":"Flocks of flamingos turning the shores of Kenya's Lake Nakuru pink.","fame":"纳库鲁湖是东非大裂谷里的一个咸水湖，过去常常有一百多万只火烈鸟同时在这里吃藻类，远远看去湖边一圈都是粉色的。湖边还是犀牛保护区。","fame_en":"Lake Nakuru is a salty lake in the Great Rift Valley. It used to host over a million flamingos at once, feeding on algae, so the whole shoreline looked pink. The park around it is also a rhino sanctuary.","fact":"这几年湖水一直涨：2010 年到 2020 年湖面从约 40 平方公里扩大到 68 平方公里，水变淡了，火烈鸟吃的藻类变少，很多火烈鸟搬去了北边的博戈里亚湖。","fact_en":"The lake has been rising: between 2010 and 2020 its surface grew from about 40 to 68 square kilometres. The water became less salty, the flamingos' algae declined, and many birds moved north to Lake Bogoria.","src":"Wikipedia · Lake Nakuru","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Nakuru","say":{"en":"Where's the best spot to see the flamingos now?","zh":"现在在哪儿看火烈鸟最好？"}},"安博塞利大象":{"what":"肯尼亚安博塞利国家公园里的大象，背后就是乞力马扎罗山。","what_en":"The elephants of Kenya's Amboseli National Park, with Mount Kilimanjaro behind them.","fame":"最经典的非洲照片之一：一群大象走过草原，背景是坦桑尼亚那边乞力马扎罗的雪顶。这里的大象长着很大的象牙，也比较不怕人。","fame_en":"One of Africa's classic photos: a herd crossing the plains, with the snowy top of Kilimanjaro over the border in Tanzania. The elephants here have big tusks and are fairly relaxed around people.","fact":"这里的大象可能是世界上被研究得最久的：辛西娅·莫斯从 1972 年起就在这里一头一头地认大象、给它们起名字，安博塞利大象研究项目到现在已经记录了 2000 多头大象的一生。","fact_en":"These may be the most-studied elephants in the world. Cynthia Moss began identifying and naming them one by one in 1972, and the Amboseli Elephant Research Project has now recorded the life stories of more than 2,000 elephants.","src":"非洲野生动物基金会 AWF","url":"https://www.awf.org/news/understanding-and-safeguarding-africas-most-iconic-species-elephant","say":{"en":"Will the mountain be clear this morning?","zh":"今天早上能看清那座山吗？"}},"内罗毕斑马":{"what":"肯尼亚首都内罗毕城边国家公园里的斑马，背后就是高楼。","what_en":"Zebras in the national park right on the edge of Kenya's capital, Nairobi, with skyscrapers behind them.","fame":"世界上很少有首都旁边就有狮子、长颈鹿、犀牛和斑马的国家公园。从机场开出来，路边就可能看到斑马，背景是内罗毕的天际线。","fame_en":"Few capitals in the world have lions, giraffes, rhinos and zebras just outside the city. Driving from the airport you might spot zebras by the road, with Nairobi's skyline behind them.","fact":"内罗毕国家公园 1946 年 12 月成立，是肯尼亚的第一个国家公园；南边没有围栏，动物可以自己走到外面的草原上去。","fact_en":"Nairobi National Park was created in December 1946 — Kenya's first national park. Its southern side has no fence, so animals can wander out onto the plains beyond.","src":"Wikipedia · Nairobi National Park","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nairobi_National_Park","say":{"en":"How long is a game drive in the park?","zh":"在公园里开车看动物一圈要多久？"}},"贡贝黑猩猩":{"what":"坦桑尼亚坦噶尼喀湖边贡贝溪森林里的黑猩猩。","what_en":"The chimpanzees of Gombe Stream, a forest on the shore of Lake Tanganyika in Tanzania.","fame":"珍·古道尔 1960 年来到这里研究黑猩猩，之后这里成了世界上研究时间最长的野生黑猩猩基地。现在游客也可以跟着向导进森林看它们。","fame_en":"Jane Goodall came here in 1960 to study chimpanzees, and it became the longest-running wild chimpanzee research site in the world. Visitors can now follow a guide into the forest to see them.","fact":"古道尔在这里看到一只黑猩猩（她叫它「灰胡子大卫」）把草茎伸进白蚁洞里钓白蚁吃——那时人们认为只有人类会做和用工具，这个发现改变了科学界。古道尔 2025 年 10 月 1 日去世，享年 91 岁。","fact_en":"Here Goodall watched a chimpanzee she named David Greybeard poke grass stems into a termite mound to fish out termites. At the time people believed only humans made and used tools, so this changed science. Goodall died on 1 October 2025, aged 91.","src":"Wikipedia · Jane Goodall","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jane_Goodall","say":{"en":"Do we need a guide to see the chimps?","zh":"看黑猩猩需要请向导吗？"}},"奥茨胡恩鸵鸟":{"what":"南非小镇奥茨胡恩的鸵鸟，这里号称「世界鸵鸟之都」。","what_en":"The ostriches of Oudtshoorn, a South African town that calls itself the ostrich capital of the world.","fame":"鸵鸟是世界上最大、跑得最快的鸟，跑起来一小时能到七十公里。在奥茨胡恩的鸵鸟农场可以近距离看它们、喂它们，还能吃到鸵鸟蛋。","fame_en":"The ostrich is the world's biggest and fastest bird, reaching about 70 km/h. At Oudtshoorn's ostrich farms you can see and feed them up close, and try ostrich eggs.","fact":"一百多年前欧洲的女士流行戴鸵鸟毛帽子，奥茨胡恩因为卖羽毛发了大财，镇上的「羽毛大亨」盖了很多豪宅（叫「羽毛宫殿」），1913 年到最高峰。1914 年一战开始，加上敞篷汽车让大羽毛帽子戴不住了，市场突然崩了，大约八成鸵鸟农场主破产。","fact_en":"A century ago, ostrich-feather hats were the fashion in Europe and Oudtshoorn got rich. Its 'feather barons' built grand 'feather palaces', and the boom peaked in 1913. Then World War I — plus open-topped cars that made big feathered hats impractical — crashed the market in 1914, and about 80% of ostrich farmers went bankrupt.","src":"Wikipedia · Oudtshoorn","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oudtshoorn","say":{"en":"How much is the farm tour, and can we feed them?","zh":"农场参观多少钱？可以喂它们吗？"}},"变色龙":{"what":"会变颜色、两只眼睛能各看各的蜥蜴。","what_en":"Lizards that change colour and can move each eye in a different direction.","fame":"世界上一半左右的变色龙住在马达加斯加。在安达西贝的夜游里，向导会用手电在树叶上找到睡着的变色龙；它们的舌头弹出去能比身体还长。","fame_en":"About half of the world's chameleon species live in Madagascar. On night walks in Andasibe, guides find them asleep on leaves by torchlight. Their tongues shoot out longer than their bodies.","fact":"2021 年科学家在马达加斯加北部发现了一种迷你变色龙 Brookesia nana，公的身体只有 13.5 毫米（连尾巴 21.9 毫米），被吉尼斯认为是世界上最小的爬行动物，跟一颗葵花籽差不多大。","fact_en":"In 2021 scientists described a tiny chameleon from northern Madagascar, Brookesia nana. The male's body is just 13.5 mm (21.9 mm with its tail) — Guinness lists it as the world's smallest reptile, about the size of a sunflower seed.","src":"吉尼斯世界纪录 · 最小的爬行动物","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/498701-smallest-reptile","say":{"en":"Can I take a photo with the flash off?","zh":"我关掉闪光灯拍一张可以吗？"}},"圣玛丽岛座头鲸":{"what":"每年冬天游到马达加斯加东边圣玛丽岛海峡生宝宝的座头鲸。","what_en":"Humpback whales that swim to the channel by Île Sainte-Marie, off eastern Madagascar, each winter to give birth.","fame":"七到九月，座头鲸从南极的冷水游几千公里来到这片温暖平静的海峡交配、生小鲸。坐小船出海，常常能看到它们跃出水面、用尾巴拍水。","fame_en":"From July to September, humpbacks travel thousands of kilometres from Antarctic waters to this warm, calm channel to mate and calve. On a small boat you often see them breach and slap the water with their tails.","fact":"2013 年 7、8 月，科学家第一次在马达加斯加海域给座头鲸装上卫星追踪器，就在圣玛丽岛附近给 12 头成年鲸装了标签，用来弄清它们离开后去了哪里——它们往南回南极的路线以前几乎没人知道。","fact_en":"In July–August 2013, scientists satellite-tagged humpbacks in Madagascar's waters for the first time — 12 adult whales near Sainte-Marie — to learn where they go next. Their route back south to Antarctica was barely known.","src":"国际野生生物保护学会 WCS 马达加斯加，2013 年","url":"https://madagascar.wcs.org/About-Us/News/articleType/ArticleView/articleId/2537.aspx","say":{"en":"How close is the boat allowed to go to the whales?","zh":"船最多能开到离鲸多近？"}},"马岛獴":{"what":"马达加斯加最大的食肉动物，长得像猫，会爬树抓狐猴。","what_en":"Madagascar's largest predator — it looks like a cat and climbs trees to hunt lemurs.","fame":"身体像美洲狮的缩小版，尾巴跟身体一样长，在树上能头朝下往下爬。只住在马达加斯加，在西部的基林迪森林最容易看到。","fame_en":"It looks like a small puma, with a tail as long as its body, and can climb down trees head-first. It lives only in Madagascar and is easiest to see in the western Kirindy forest.","fact":"它长得像猫，但不是猫：基因研究发现它最近的亲戚是獴，马达加斯加所有的食肉动物来自同一个祖先，被分成单独一个科（马岛獴科）。像猫只是因为过着同样的生活，进化成了相似的样子。","fact_en":"It looks like a cat but isn't one. DNA studies show its closest relatives are mongooses: all of Madagascar's carnivores come from one ancestor and form their own family, Eupleridae. The cat look is convergent evolution — same lifestyle, similar shape.","src":"Wikipedia · Fossa (animal)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fossa_(animal)","say":{"en":"Are fossas dangerous to people?","zh":"马岛獴对人有危险吗？"}},"莫莱大象":{"what":"加纳莫莱国家公园里的大象，会走到游客旅馆下面的水塘喝水。","what_en":"The elephants of Ghana's Mole National Park, which come to drink at the waterhole below the visitors' lodge.","fame":"西非看大象最方便的地方之一：坐在旅馆的平台上就能看到大象洗澡；还可以跟着持枪护林员走路去看，比开车近得多。","fame_en":"One of the easiest places in West Africa to see elephants: you can watch them bathe from the lodge terrace, or walk with an armed ranger and get much closer than in a car.","fact":"莫莱是加纳最大的野生动物保护区（约 4840 平方公里）：1958 年先划为野生动物保护地，1971 年升级成国家公园，这块地上原来的村民也在那时被迁走了。","fact_en":"Mole is Ghana's largest wildlife area, about 4,840 km². It was set aside as a wildlife refuge in 1958 and became a national park in 1971, when the people living on the land were moved out.","src":"Wikipedia · Mole National Park","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mole_National_Park","say":{"en":"What time does the walking safari start?","zh":"徒步看动物几点出发？"}},"埃托沙盐沼":{"what":"纳米比亚埃托沙国家公园中间一大片白色的干盐湖，四周的水塘挤满动物。","what_en":"A huge white dry salt pan in the middle of Namibia's Etosha National Park, ringed by waterholes full of animals.","fame":"旱季几乎不下雨，动物只能到几个水塘喝水，坐在车里或水塘边就能看到大象、长颈鹿、斑马排队喝水；有的营地晚上有灯照着水塘，能看到犀牛。","fame_en":"In the dry season animals depend on a few waterholes, so from your car or a bench you can watch elephants, giraffes and zebras queue to drink. Some camps floodlight their waterholes at night, where rhinos come.","fact":"1907 年划定时，埃托沙有大约 10 万平方公里，是当时世界上最大的野生动物保护区；后来边界一再缩小，现在只剩原来的四分之一左右。那片盐沼大到从太空都能看到。","fact_en":"When it was proclaimed in 1907, Etosha covered about 100,000 km², the largest game reserve in the world at the time. Its borders were cut back again and again, and today it's roughly a quarter of the original size. The salt pan is big enough to see from space.","src":"NASA 地球观测站 · Etosha National Park","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/earth/earth-observatory/etosha-national-park-namibia-3941/","say":{"en":"Which waterhole has been busy today?","zh":"今天哪个水塘动物多？"}},"赛骆驼":{"what":"海湾国家的传统比赛：一群骆驼在沙漠跑道上比速度。","what_en":"A traditional Gulf sport: camels racing each other on desert tracks.","fame":"在阿布扎比、迪拜郊外的赛道上，冬天比赛季几乎每周都有。最好玩的是：骑在骆驼背上的不是人，是遥控的小机器人；主人开着越野车在跑道边一路追、一路喊。","fame_en":"On tracks outside Abu Dhabi and Dubai there are races almost every week in the winter season. The fun part: the riders aren't people but small remote-controlled robots, while owners chase alongside in SUVs, shouting.","fact":"以前骑骆驼的常常是从外国带来的小孩。2005 年阿联酋加紧禁止用未成年骑手，同年 7 月在阿布扎比第一次用遥控机器人骑手比赛，机器人只有十几公斤，还穿着骑手的衣服。","fact_en":"Camel jockeys used to be young children, often brought from abroad. In 2005 the UAE tightened its ban on child jockeys, and that July the first race with remote-controlled robot jockeys was held in Abu Dhabi. The robots weighed up to 15 kg and wore jockeys' silks.","src":"Al Jazeera，2005 年 7 月 18 日","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2005/7/18/robots-ride-camels-in-race","say":{"en":"Is it free to watch? Where's the best place to stand?","zh":"看比赛要钱吗？站在哪儿看最好？"}},"阿拉伯马":{"what":"阿拉伯半岛来的马，头小、眼睛大、尾巴翘，耐力特别好。","what_en":"The horse of the Arabian Peninsula — small head, big eyes, high tail and great stamina.","fame":"世界上最古老的马种之一，很多赛马和名马的血统里都有它。在沙特、阿联酋、约旦都有阿拉伯马选美和长距离耐力赛。","fame_en":"One of the oldest horse breeds in the world; many racehorses and famous breeds carry its blood. Saudi Arabia, the UAE and Jordan all hold Arabian horse shows and long-distance endurance races.","fact":"一般的马有 18 对肋骨、6 节腰椎；很多（但不是全部）阿拉伯马只有 17 对肋骨、5 节腰椎，背因此更短，这也是它看起来特别紧凑的原因之一。","fact_en":"Most horses have 18 pairs of ribs and 6 lumbar vertebrae. Many Arabians — though not all — have 17 pairs of ribs and 5 lumbar vertebrae, giving them a shorter back and that compact look.","src":"Wikipedia · Arabian horse","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arabian_horse","say":{"en":"Is she calm enough for a beginner?","zh":"它够温顺吗？新手能骑吗？"}},"阿拉伯羚羊":{"what":"阿拉伯沙漠里的白色大羚羊，两只角又长又直。","what_en":"A white antelope of the Arabian desert with two long, straight horns.","fame":"它从侧面看像只有一只角，有人说「独角兽」的传说就跟它有关。在约旦的沙乌马里保护区，可以看到它们在沙漠里吃草。","fame_en":"From the side it can look like it has a single horn — some say it's linked to unicorn legends. In Jordan's Shaumari reserve you can see them grazing in the desert.","fact":"野外最后一头据说 1972 年被打死，阿拉伯羚羊在野外灭绝了；后来靠动物园繁殖再放回沙漠，2011 年 IUCN 把它从「濒危」降到「易危」，是第一个从「野外灭绝」一路好转三级的物种。","fact_en":"The last wild one is believed to have been shot in 1972, and the species was extinct in the wild. Captive breeding and releases brought it back: in 2011 the IUCN moved it from Endangered to Vulnerable, the first species once extinct in the wild to improve by three categories.","src":"Wikipedia · Arabian oryx（引 IUCN 2011）","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arabian_oryx","say":{"en":"Can we see the oryx from the safari truck?","zh":"坐观光车能看到羚羊吗？"}},"卡塔尔大羚羊":{"what":"卡塔尔的国兽，也就是阿拉伯羚羊，白身子、长直角。","what_en":"Qatar's national animal — the Arabian oryx, with its white coat and long straight horns.","fame":"在卡塔尔到处能看到它：2006 年多哈亚运会的吉祥物「奥瑞」就是一只羚羊，保护区里也养着成群的羚羊。","fame_en":"You see it everywhere in Qatar: Orry, the mascot of the 2006 Doha Asian Games, was an oryx, and reserves keep herds of them.","fact":"卡塔尔航空飞机尾巴上的那个酒红色图案就是羚羊。2006 年换新标志时，羚羊被放大到几乎占满整个垂直尾翼，所以全世界机场都能看到它。","fact_en":"The burgundy emblem on Qatar Airways' tails is an oryx. In the 2006 redesign it was enlarged to cover almost the whole tail fin, so you can spot it at airports around the world.","src":"Fonts In Use · Qatar Airways","url":"https://fontsinuse.com/uses/24205/qatar-airways-2015","say":{"en":"Is the oryx reserve open to visitors today?","zh":"羚羊保护区今天对游客开放吗？"}},"尼罗鳄":{"what":"非洲最大的鳄鱼，住在尼罗河和非洲很多河湖里。","what_en":"Africa's biggest crocodile, living in the Nile and many other African rivers and lakes.","fame":"可以长到五米多长，过马拉河的角马就是被它们抓的。古埃及人把鳄鱼当成鳄鱼神索贝克来崇拜，阿斯旺附近的康翁布神庙就是给它修的。","fame_en":"It can grow over five metres long — it's the crocodile that grabs wildebeest in the Mara River. Ancient Egyptians worshipped crocodiles as the god Sobek, and the Kom Ombo temple near Aswan was partly built for him.","fact":"古埃及人还给鳄鱼做木乃伊。2012 年 1 月，康翁布神庙旁边开了埃及第一座鳄鱼博物馆，展出附近墓地挖出来的鳄鱼木乃伊，最长的有 4 米多。","fact_en":"Ancient Egyptians even mummified crocodiles. In January 2012 Egypt's first crocodile museum opened next to Kom Ombo temple, showing crocodile mummies dug up nearby — the longest over four metres.","src":"Ahram Online，2012 年 1 月","url":"https://english.ahram.org.eg/News/33460.aspx","say":{"en":"Is the crocodile museum included in the temple ticket?","zh":"鳄鱼博物馆包含在神庙门票里吗？"}},"树上的山羊":{"what":"摩洛哥西南部爬到阿甘树上吃果子的山羊。","what_en":"Goats in south-west Morocco that climb argan trees to eat the fruit.","fame":"在马拉喀什去索维拉的路上，常常能看到一棵树上站着七八只山羊，像树上结了羊。阿甘树的果核能榨出很贵的阿甘油。","fame_en":"On the road from Marrakech to Essaouira you often see seven or eight goats standing in one tree, like the tree grew goats. The argan nut is pressed into expensive argan oil.","fact":"2017 年西班牙科学家发现，山羊吃完阿甘果以后，反刍的时候会把干净的果核吐出来，吐到离树很远的地方——等于在帮阿甘树种树。","fact_en":"In 2017 Spanish scientists found that after eating argan fruit, goats spit out the clean seeds while chewing their cud — often far from the tree. In effect, they help plant new argan trees.","src":"美国生态学会博客（Frontiers in Ecology and the Environment），2017 年 5 月","url":"https://esa.org/esablog/2017/05/24/tree-climbing-goats-disperse-seeds-by-spitting/","say":{"en":"Is this argan oil for cooking or for skin?","zh":"这个阿甘油是吃的还是擦皮肤的？"}},"卢安瓜河马":{"what":"赞比亚南卢安瓜国家公园河里成群的河马。","what_en":"The crowded hippo pods of the Luangwa River in Zambia's South Luangwa National Park.","fame":"卢安瓜河是非洲河马最密集的地方之一，旱季河湾里一挤就是几十头。白天泡在水里，晚上上岸吃草，营地里整夜都能听到它们「哼哼」地叫。","fame_en":"The Luangwa River has one of Africa's highest densities of hippos — dozens crowd into each bend in the dry season. They soak by day and graze on land by night, grunting outside camp all night long.","fact":"南卢安瓜被叫作「徒步 Safari 的发源地」：20 世纪 50 年代，保护主义者诺曼·卡尔在这里带游客下车走路看动物，1950 年还建了这一带第一个观光营地。","fact_en":"South Luangwa is called the birthplace of the walking safari: in the 1950s conservationist Norman Carr started taking visitors out of the car to look for animals on foot, and in 1950 he built the valley's first tourist camp.","src":"National Geographic Travel","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/travel/article/walking-safari-south-luangwa-zambia-valley-of-the-leopard","say":{"en":"How close do we walk to the river on the walking safari?","zh":"徒步的时候我们会走到离河多近？"}},"沙漠大象":{"what":"马里古尔马地区的大象，生活在撒哈拉南边的萨赫勒半沙漠里。","what_en":"The elephants of the Gourma region in Mali, living in the semi-desert Sahel south of the Sahara.","fame":"它们是非洲最北边的一群大象，每年跟着水和草，在马里和布基纳法索边上走一个大圈，经过一处叫「大象之门」的山口。","fame_en":"They're Africa's northernmost elephants. Each year they follow water and grass in a great loop near the Mali–Burkina Faso border, squeezing through a gap called the 'Elephant Gateway'.","fact":"拯救大象组织用卫星项圈追踪发现，这群大象一年要用超过 3.2 万平方公里的地方，是有记录以来大象活动范围最大的，也是世界上已知最长的大象迁徙路线。","fact_en":"Satellite collars fitted by Save the Elephants showed these elephants use over 32,000 km² a year — the largest range ever recorded for the species, and the longest known elephant migration circuit in the world.","src":"拯救大象组织 Save the Elephants","url":"https://savetheelephants.org/news/the-desert-elephants-of-mali/","say":{"en":"Is it safe to travel to that area right now?","zh":"现在去那个地区安全吗？"}},"朱贾鹈鹕":{"what":"塞内加尔朱贾国家鸟类保护区里成群的白鹈鹕。","what_en":"The great white pelicans of Senegal's Djoudj National Bird Sanctuary.","fame":"在塞内加尔河三角洲，撒哈拉沙漠南边第一片大湿地。冬天有大约 150 万只鸟在这里，很多是从欧洲飞来过冬的；坐船能看到几千只鹈鹕一起捕鱼。","fame_en":"In the Senegal River delta, it's the first big wetland south of the Sahara. About 1.5 million birds gather here in winter, many flying in from Europe, and by boat you can watch thousands of pelicans fishing together.","fact":"1981 年被列为世界遗产。2000 年一种外来水草（槐叶萍）几乎盖满了水面，它被列入「濒危世界遗产」；后来放了专吃这种草的小象鼻虫，草被控制住，2006 年才摘掉这个牌子。","fact_en":"It became a World Heritage site in 1981. In 2000 an invasive water fern, Salvinia, nearly covered the open water and the site was put on the 'in Danger' list. Tiny weevils that eat the fern brought it under control, and the site came off the list in 2006.","src":"联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/25","say":{"en":"When is the best month to see the pelicans?","zh":"几月份来看鹈鹕最好？"}},"克罗斯河大猩猩":{"what":"尼日利亚和喀麦隆边境山林里的大猩猩，是世界上最稀少的大猩猩。","what_en":"Gorillas of the mountain forests on the Nigeria–Cameroon border — the rarest gorillas in the world.","fame":"只剩大约两三百只，分成十几个小群躲在陡峭的山林里，非常怕人，连研究它们的科学家都很少亲眼见到，大多只能看到它们搭的窝。","fame_en":"Only about 250–300 are left, in a dozen small groups hiding in steep forest. They're so shy that even the scientists who study them rarely see them — mostly they find their nests.","fact":"2012 年 5 月，科学家在喀麦隆一边的保护区第一次用红外相机拍到了克罗斯河大猩猩的视频：八只大猩猩走过林间小路，一只银背还冲着镜头捶胸。","fact_en":"In May 2012, scientists released the first camera-trap video of Cross River gorillas, from a sanctuary on the Cameroon side: eight gorillas walking along a forest path, and a silverback beating its chest at the camera.","src":"国际野生生物保护学会 WCS，2012 年 5 月","url":"https://newsroom.wcs.org/News-Releases/articleType/ArticleView/articleId/4829/Camera-Trap-Video-Offers-Rare-Glimpse-of-Worlds-Rarest-Gorilla.aspx","say":{"en":"Is there any chance we'll see the gorillas, or just their nests?","zh":"我们有可能看到大猩猩吗，还是只能看到窝？"}},"杜兹骆驼":{"what":"突尼斯沙漠小镇杜兹的骆驼，小镇被叫作「撒哈拉之门」。","what_en":"The camels of Douz, a Tunisian desert town known as the Gateway to the Sahara.","fame":"从杜兹往南就是大沙丘，游客骑骆驼进沙漠看日落。每年冬天的撒哈拉节上有骆驼赛跑、骆驼摔跤、骑马表演和贝都因婚礼。","fame_en":"South of Douz the big dunes begin, and visitors ride camels out to watch the sunset. Each winter the Sahara Festival brings camel races, camel wrestling, horse displays and a Bedouin wedding.","fact":"撒哈拉节最早 1910 年就开始了，当时突尼斯还在法国统治下，叫「骆驼节」；1967 年才变成现在这样的国际撒哈拉节，一般在 12 月底办四天。","fact_en":"The festival began back in 1910, under French rule, as the 'Camel Festival'. It became today's International Festival of the Sahara in 1967 and is usually held for four days at the end of December.","src":"Wikipedia · International Festival of the Sahara","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Festival_of_the_Sahara","say":{"en":"How much for a camel ride to the dunes at sunset?","zh":"日落时骑骆驼去沙丘多少钱？"}},"万基大象":{"what":"津巴布韦万基国家公园里的大象，是非洲大象最多的保护区之一。","what_en":"The elephants of Zimbabwe's Hwange National Park, one of Africa's biggest elephant strongholds.","fame":"万基有四万多头大象，旱季一到傍晚，一群群大象排着队来到水塘喝水、玩泥巴，离维多利亚瀑布开车只要几个小时。","fame_en":"Hwange has over 40,000 elephants. In the dry season, herds line up at waterholes every evening to drink and wallow in mud. It's a few hours' drive from Victoria Falls.","fact":"万基的水塘很多是靠水泵从地下抽水灌满的，公园里有 104 口太阳能水泵井。可是 2023 年旱季特别长、特别热，这些还是不够：到 12 月至少有 100 头大象因为缺水死去。","fact_en":"Many of Hwange's waterholes are filled by pumping groundwater — the park has 104 solar-powered boreholes. But the 2023 dry season was so long and hot that it wasn't enough: by December at least 100 elephants had died for lack of water.","src":"Africanews，2023 年 12 月","url":"https://www.africanews.com/2023/12/12/at-least-100-elephants-dead-from-drought-in-zimbabwe/","say":{"en":"Which waterhole is best for elephants at sunset?","zh":"日落时去哪个水塘看大象最好？"}},"爬树狮":{"what":"乌干达伊沙沙地区喜欢爬到无花果树上睡觉的狮子。","what_en":"The lions of Ishasha in Uganda that like to sleep up in fig trees.","fame":"一般的狮子很少爬树，伊沙沙（伊丽莎白女王国家公园南部）的狮子却常常整个下午趴在大无花果树的树枝上，四条腿垂下来，在车里一抬头就能看到。","fame_en":"Most lions rarely climb trees, but in Ishasha, in southern Queen Elizabeth National Park, they often spend the whole afternoon draped over fig branches, legs dangling — look up from your car and there they are.","fact":"2018 年 4 月，伊沙沙一个有名的爬树狮群——3 头母狮和 8 只小狮——被发现全部中毒死亡，一共 11 头，是当地牧民和狮子冲突的悲剧。国家地理的摄影师当时正在拍它们。","fact_en":"In April 2018, a famous tree-climbing pride in Ishasha — three lionesses and eight cubs, 11 lions in all — was found poisoned. A National Geographic filmmaker had been following them for months.","src":"National Geographic，2018 年 4 月","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/article/last-footage-tree-climbing-lions-killed-animals-spd","say":{"en":"Can you see any lions up in the trees today?","zh":"今天树上能看到狮子吗？"}},"非洲豹":{"what":"身上长满梅花斑的大猫，「五大兽」里最难找的一个。","what_en":"The big cat covered in rosettes — the hardest of the Big Five to find.","fame":"它独来独往，白天常趴在树上睡觉，还会把比自己还重的猎物叼到树上，免得被狮子和鬣狗抢走。在塞伦盖蒂，向导会专门找挂着尾巴的大树。","fame_en":"It lives alone, often sleeps in trees during the day, and hauls prey heavier than itself up the branches so lions and hyenas can't steal it. In the Serengeti guides scan big trees for a dangling tail.","fact":"2016 年研究发现，豹现在只住在历史分布范围的 25%–37%，北非的地盘少了 99%；同年 IUCN 把豹从「近危」改成「易危」。","fact_en":"A 2016 study found leopards now live in only 25–37% of their historic range, with 99% lost in North Africa. The same year the IUCN moved the leopard from Near Threatened to Vulnerable.","src":"National Geographic，2016 年 5 月","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/article/160504-leopard-range-shrinks-endangered-subspecies","say":{"en":"Is that a leopard's tail hanging from the tree?","zh":"树上垂下来的那个是豹子的尾巴吗？"}},"猎豹":{"what":"陆地上跑得最快的动物，身上是一个个实心黑点，脸上有两道「泪痕」。","what_en":"The fastest land animal, with solid black spots and two 'tear lines' down its face.","fame":"几秒钟就能加速到每小时一百公里，但只能冲刺几百米。跟别的大猫不同，它多在白天打猎，在马赛马拉常常爬到游客车的车顶上找猎物。","fame_en":"It can hit 100 km/h in a few seconds but only sprint a few hundred metres. Unlike other big cats it hunts mostly by day, and in the Maasai Mara it sometimes hops onto tourist vehicles to look for prey.","fact":"印度的猎豹 1952 年就宣布灭绝了。2022 年 9 月，8 只猎豹从纳米比亚坐专机飞到印度，放进库诺国家公园——这是 70 年来猎豹第一次回到印度。","fact_en":"Cheetahs were declared extinct in India in 1952. In September 2022, eight cheetahs were flown from Namibia to India and released into Kuno National Park — the first cheetahs back in India in 70 years.","src":"CNN，2022 年 9 月 17 日","url":"https://edition.cnn.com/2022/09/17/world/cheetahs-india-namibia-reintroduction-scn-trnd","say":{"en":"Should we close the roof if it jumps on the car?","zh":"如果它跳上车，我们要把车顶关上吗？"}},"非洲水牛":{"what":"非洲草原上头上长着一对大弯角的黑色野牛，「五大兽」之一。","what_en":"The black African buffalo with heavy curved horns — one of the Big Five.","fame":"成群的水牛会一起围攻狮子，连狮子都不敢随便招惹；猎人也说它是最危险的动物之一。在坦桑尼亚恩戈罗恩戈罗火山口底下，常能看到几百头一群。","fame_en":"Herds will gang up on lions, so even lions think twice. Hunters call it one of the most dangerous animals. On the floor of Tanzania's Ngorongoro Crater you often see herds of hundreds.","fact":"研究水牛的生态学家普林斯在坦桑尼亚观察到：水牛群休息完要往哪儿走，是成年母牛「投票」决定的——它们站起来朝自己想去的方向站一会儿，最后整群往多数母牛面对的方向走，公牛只管跟着。","fact_en":"Ecologist Herbert Prins observed in Tanzania that adult female buffalo 'vote' on where the herd goes next: after resting, they stand and face the direction they prefer, and the whole herd moves off the way most females are facing. The bulls just follow.","src":"Londolozi 博客，2020 年 12 月","url":"https://blog.londolozi.com/2020/12/16/the-buffalo-democracy/","say":{"en":"Are buffalo more dangerous than lions?","zh":"水牛比狮子还危险吗？"}},"黑犀牛":{"what":"非洲两种犀牛里比较小、脾气比较急的那种，上唇尖尖的，用来摘树叶。","what_en":"The smaller, more short-tempered of Africa's two rhinos, with a pointed upper lip for plucking leaves.","fame":"极度濒危，全非洲只剩几千头。在肯尼亚的奥佩杰塔保护区，护林员日夜守着它们，游客跟着向导开车就能看到。","fame_en":"Critically endangered, with only a few thousand left in Africa. In Kenya's Ol Pejeta Conservancy, rangers guard them day and night, and visitors can see them on guided drives.","fact":"奥佩杰塔是东非最大的黑犀牛保护区，2013 年迎来第 100 头黑犀牛出生，成了全非洲只有八个的「一级重点」黑犀牛种群之一。世界上最后两头北方白犀牛也住在这里。","fact_en":"Ol Pejeta is the largest black rhino sanctuary in East Africa. In 2013 it recorded the birth of its 100th black rhino, making it one of only eight 'Key 1' black rhino populations in Africa. The world's last two northern white rhinos live here too.","src":"Wikipedia · Ol Pejeta Conservancy","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ol_Pejeta_Conservancy","say":{"en":"How many rangers look after the rhinos here?","zh":"这里有多少护林员照顾犀牛？"}},"马拉河河马":{"what":"肯尼亚马赛马拉保护区里，马拉河中一群一群的河马。","what_en":"The hippo pods packed into the Mara River in Kenya's Maasai Mara.","fame":"白天泡在水里只露出眼睛和鼻孔，晚上上岸能走几公里去吃草。看起来又胖又懒，其实跑得很快、脾气很坏，是非洲最危险的动物之一。","fame_en":"By day they soak with only eyes and nostrils showing; at night they walk kilometres on land to graze. They look fat and lazy but are fast and bad-tempered — one of Africa's most dangerous animals.","fact":"河马会「流红色的汗」：皮肤分泌一种液体，慢慢变红再变褐。2004 年日本科学家在《自然》杂志上发表研究，发现里面的红色色素能吸收紫外线、还能抑制细菌，等于天然的防晒霜加消毒水。","fact_en":"Hippos 'sweat red': their skin oozes a fluid that slowly turns red, then brown. In 2004 Japanese scientists reported in Nature that its pigments absorb UV light and stop bacteria growing — a natural sunscreen and antiseptic in one.","src":"Nature 429, 363（2004）","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/429363a","say":{"en":"How far should we stay from the hippos?","zh":"我们应该离河马多远？"}},"火烈鸟湖":{"what":"坦桑尼亚北部的纳特龙湖，一个又咸又碱、水是红色的湖。","what_en":"Lake Natron in northern Tanzania — a salty, alkaline lake with red water.","fame":"湖水碱性很强，大部分动物没法靠近，正因为这样，小火烈鸟才敢在湖中间的泥地上安心下蛋。湖边就是还在喷发的伦盖伊火山。","fame_en":"The water is so alkaline that most animals stay away, which is exactly why lesser flamingos can nest safely on its mudflats. The still-active Ol Doinyo Lengai volcano rises beside it.","fact":"全世界大约 75% 的小火烈鸟都在纳特龙湖出生，这里是东非唯一一个它们经常繁殖的地方。几次有人计划在湖边开采纯碱，保护组织一直在反对。","fact_en":"About 75% of the world's lesser flamingos are born at Lake Natron — the only place in East Africa where they regularly breed. There have been several plans to mine soda ash at the lake, and conservation groups keep fighting them.","src":"Smithsonian Magazine","url":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/travel/flamingos-find-life-among-death-180959265/","say":{"en":"Can we walk to the flamingos, or is the mud too dangerous?","zh":"我们能走过去看火烈鸟吗？还是泥太危险？"}},"大沼泽鳄鱼":{"what":"佛罗里达南端一大片长满锯齿草的浅水沼泽，短吻鳄趴在水边晒太阳，游客坐气垫船从草上滑过去。","what_en":"A vast shallow sawgrass marsh at the southern tip of Florida, where alligators bask by the water and visitors skim across on airboats.","fame":"大沼泽地国家公园是世界上唯一一个短吻鳄和美洲鳄住在一起的地方：短吻鳄喜欢淡水，美洲鳄能待在咸水里，这里正好淡水、咸水混在一起。","fame_en":"Everglades National Park is the only place in the world where alligators and crocodiles live side by side — alligators like fresh water, crocodiles can handle salt water, and here the two mix.","fact":"美洲鳄在 1975 年被列为濒危，佛罗里达只剩两三百只。保护了三十年后，到 2007 年数量涨到一千四到两千只，美国鱼类及野生动物管理局把它从「濒危」降成「受威胁」。","fact_en":"American crocodiles were listed as endangered in 1975, when only 200–300 were left in Florida. After three decades of protection the population grew to about 1,400–2,000, and in 2007 the US Fish and Wildlife Service downlisted them from endangered to threatened.","src":"美国鱼类及野生动物管理局 USFWS，2007 年","url":"https://www.fws.gov/story/2007-03/recovering-american-crocodile-reclassified-endangered-threatened","say":{"en":"Is that an alligator or a crocodile?","zh":"那是短吻鳄还是鳄鱼？"}},"美洲野牛":{"what":"北美最大的陆地动物，一头公牛能有九百公斤，在黄石公园的山谷里成群吃草，常常慢悠悠地走上公路。","what_en":"North America's largest land animal — a bull can weigh 900 kg. Herds graze the valleys of Yellowstone and often stroll right onto the road.","fame":"19 世纪美国的野牛从几千万头被打到只剩几百头；黄石是唯一一个从史前一直有野牛住到今天的地方。在黄石，野牛伤人的次数比熊还多，公园要求离它至少 23 米。","fame_en":"In the 1800s American bison were hunted from tens of millions down to a few hundred. Yellowstone is the only place they have lived continuously since prehistoric times. Bison injure more visitors there than bears do, and the park asks you to stay at least 23 m (25 yards) away.","fact":"2016 年 5 月，奥巴马签了《国家野牛遗产法》，野牛成了美国的「国家哺乳动物」，和白头海雕一样是国家象征。","fact_en":"In May 2016 President Obama signed the National Bison Legacy Act, making the bison the official national mammal of the United States — a national symbol alongside the bald eagle.","src":"Wikipedia · National Bison Legacy Act","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Bison_Legacy_Act","say":{"en":"How close are we allowed to get to the bison?","zh":"我们可以离野牛多近？"}},"阿拉斯加棕熊":{"what":"阿拉斯加的大棕熊，夏天站在瀑布和河边，等逆流而上的三文鱼跳进嘴里。","what_en":"Alaska's big brown bears, which spend summer standing at waterfalls and riverbanks waiting for leaping salmon.","fame":"卡特迈国家公园的布鲁克斯瀑布最有名：七月鲑鱼往上跳，十几头熊排在瀑布上下抢位置。游客站在木平台上看，公园还有 24 小时直播。","fame_en":"Brooks Falls in Katmai National Park is the famous spot: in July salmon leap up the falls and a dozen bears jostle for position. Visitors watch from wooden platforms, and the park streams it live around the clock.","fact":"卡特迈每年秋天办「胖熊周」，全世界网友投票选最胖的熊。2025 年冠军是 32 号熊「Chunk」，体重超过 540 公斤，他前两年都是亚军。","fact_en":"Every autumn Katmai holds Fat Bear Week, when people around the world vote for the fattest bear. The 2025 champion was bear 32 'Chunk', over 1,200 lb (about 540 kg), after finishing runner-up the two years before.","src":"CBS News，2025 年","url":"https://www.cbsnews.com/news/fat-bear-week-2025-winner-32-chunk/","say":{"en":"Which bear is that on the falls?","zh":"瀑布上那头是几号熊？"}},"北极熊":{"what":"世界上最大的陆地食肉动物，靠在海冰上抓海豹过日子；加拿大小镇丘吉尔每年秋天被它们「包围」。","what_en":"The world's largest land carnivore, which lives by hunting seals on sea ice. Every autumn the small Canadian town of Churchill is surrounded by them.","fame":"哈德逊湾的海冰夏天化掉，北极熊就上岸等，十月、十一月聚在丘吉尔附近等海面重新结冰。游客坐大轮子的「冻原车」去看，镇上还有专门关闯进来的熊的「北极熊监狱」。","fame_en":"When Hudson Bay's ice melts in summer, the bears come ashore and wait; in October and November they gather near Churchill for the sea to freeze again. Visitors watch from big-wheeled 'tundra buggies', and the town even has a 'polar bear jail' for bears that wander in.","fact":"加拿大 2021 年从空中数了一遍：西哈德逊湾大约剩 618 头北极熊，2016 年还有 842 头，五年少了四分之一多；母熊和小熊减少得最厉害。研究者说跟海冰变少有关。","fact_en":"A 2021 aerial survey estimated about 618 polar bears in Western Hudson Bay, down from 842 in 2016 — more than a quarter gone in five years, with the steepest drops among females and young bears. Researchers link it to shrinking sea ice.","src":"NPR，2022 年","url":"https://www.npr.org/2022/12/23/1145327852/polar-bears-canada-hudson-bay-dropping","say":{"en":"Are we allowed to open the window on the buggy?","zh":"冻原车上可以开窗吗？"}},"驼鹿":{"what":"世界上最大的鹿，腿长、鼻子大，公鹿头上的角像两只摊开的手掌；夏天常站在湖里吃水草。","what_en":"The largest deer in the world — long legs, a big nose, and bulls with antlers like two open palms. In summer they often stand in lakes eating water plants.","fame":"一头公驼鹿能有两米高、六七百公斤，角每年冬天掉、春天重新长。在加拿大安大略开车，路边常有「小心驼鹿」的牌子，撞上一头比撞上一辆车还危险。","fame_en":"A bull moose can stand 2 m tall and weigh 600–700 kg, and it drops its antlers every winter and grows new ones in spring. Driving in Ontario you'll see 'moose crossing' signs everywhere — hitting one is like hitting another car.","fact":"安大略省的驼鹿没有大家想的那么多：2016 年省环境专员报告说，十年里全省驼鹿少了两成，雷湾一带少了一半。冬天的扁虱、栖息地变化、狩猎和天敌都被认为有关。","fact_en":"Ontario has fewer moose than people think: a 2016 report by the province's environmental commissioner said the moose population fell about 20% in a decade, and around Thunder Bay by half. Winter ticks, habitat change, hunting and predators are all suspected.","src":"CBC News，2016 年","url":"https://www.cbc.ca/lite/story/1.3823669","say":{"en":"Is it safe to paddle closer, or should we stay back?","zh":"可以再划近一点吗，还是待在这儿？"}},"帝王蝶":{"what":"橙黑相间的大蝴蝶，每年秋天从美国、加拿大飞几千公里，到墨西哥中部的冷杉林里挤成一团过冬。","what_en":"Big orange-and-black butterflies that fly thousands of kilometres every autumn from the US and Canada to huddle for the winter in the fir forests of central Mexico.","fame":"一只帝王蝶活不过一次往返，回北方的路要靠三四代接力，可每年秋天新一代还是能找到同一片山林。冬天在米却肯的保护区里，树枝被蝴蝶压弯，太阳一出来满天都是。","fame_en":"No single monarch lives long enough for the round trip — it takes three or four generations to get back north — yet every autumn the new generation finds the same mountain forests. In Michoacán's reserves, branches sag under the butterflies, and when the sun comes out the sky fills with them.","fact":"科学家不数蝴蝶，而是量它们占了多少公顷森林。2025–26 年冬天是 2.93 公顷，比上一年多了 64%；但 1996–97 年最多的时候有 18 公顷左右。","fact_en":"Scientists don't count the butterflies — they measure how many hectares of forest they cover. In winter 2025–26 it was 2.93 hectares, up 64% on the year before, but at the 1996–97 peak it was about 18 hectares.","src":"WTTW 新闻（世界自然基金会 WWF 数据），2026 年","url":"https://news.wttw.com/2026/03/18/monarch-winter-numbers-last-year-endangered-butterflies-begin-northern-migration","say":{"en":"How long is the walk up to the butterflies?","zh":"走上去看蝴蝶要多久？"}},"树懒":{"what":"挂在中南美洲雨林树上的慢动作动物，一天睡很久，动起来像在放慢镜头。","what_en":"Slow-motion animals hanging in the rainforest trees of Central and South America — they sleep a lot, and when they move it looks like a slowed-down video.","fame":"树懒吃的是没什么营养的树叶，所以把一切都放慢，连体温都低。它一周左右才爬下树一次上厕所。在哥斯达黎加，路边常有人停车围着一棵树抬头找它。","fame_en":"Sloths live on low-energy leaves, so they slow everything down, even their body temperature. They climb down only about once a week to go to the toilet. In Costa Rica people often pull over and crowd around a tree, looking up for one.","fact":"树懒毛里住着一整个小世界：有专门的蛾子，还长绿色的藻类。2014 年的研究发现，树懒下树上厕所时，蛾子会在粪便里产卵；蛾子让毛里的藻长得更好，树懒可能会舔藻吃，这些藻的脂肪比树叶多好几倍。","fact_en":"A sloth's fur is a little world of its own, with its own moths and green algae. A 2014 study found that when sloths climb down to poo, moths lay eggs in the dung; the moths help algae grow in the fur, and the sloths may eat that algae, which has several times more fat than leaves.","src":"National Geographic，2014 年","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/science/article/can-moths-explain-why-sloths-poo-on-the-ground","say":{"en":"Where is it? I can't see it at all.","zh":"在哪儿？我完全看不到。"}},"加拉帕戈斯象龟":{"what":"加拉帕戈斯群岛上的巨型陆龟，壳能有一米多长，在高地草地上慢慢吃草，能活一百多岁。","what_en":"Giant tortoises of the Galápagos, with shells over a metre long, slowly grazing the highland meadows and living past a hundred.","fame":"达尔文 1835 年来这里，发现不同岛上的象龟壳形状不一样，这成了他想进化论的线索之一。现在在圣克鲁斯岛的高地农场，可以看到它们在泥塘里泡澡。","fame_en":"When Darwin came here in 1835 he noticed that tortoises on different islands had differently shaped shells — one of the clues behind his theory of evolution. Today you can watch them wallowing in mud ponds on highland farms on Santa Cruz.","fact":"费尔南迪纳岛的象龟被认为已经灭绝了一百多年，只有 1906 年的一个标本。2019 年在岛上找到一只老母龟「Fernanda」，2022 年基因检测证实她就是这个「已灭绝」的物种。","fact_en":"The Fernandina Island tortoise was thought extinct for over a century, known only from one 1906 specimen. In 2019 an old female, 'Fernanda', was found on the island, and in 2022 genetic tests confirmed she belongs to that 'extinct' species.","src":"纽卡斯尔大学，2022 年","url":"https://www.ncl.ac.uk/press/articles/archive/2022/06/galapagosgianttortoise/","say":{"en":"How old do you think that one is?","zh":"你觉得那只有多大了？"}},"亚马逊粉海豚":{"what":"生活在亚马逊河里的海豚，越老颜色越粉，脖子能转、嘴很长，在浑浊的河水里靠声音找鱼。","what_en":"Dolphins living in the Amazon River that turn pinker with age, with flexible necks and long snouts, finding fish in murky water by sound.","fame":"当地传说粉海豚晚上会变成戴帽子的帅哥上岸跳舞。在马瑙斯附近可以坐船去看，有的地方还能下水跟它们一起游。","fame_en":"Local legend says the pink dolphin turns into a handsome man in a hat at night and comes ashore to dance. Near Manaus you can take a boat out to see them, and in some places even swim with them.","fact":"2023 年 9 月亚马逊大旱，泰菲湖的水温升到 39 度，一周里死了 153 头河豚，其中 130 头是粉海豚。湖里原来大约只有 1400 头。","fact_en":"In September 2023, during a severe Amazon drought, the water in Lake Tefé reached 39°C, and 153 river dolphins died in a single week — 130 of them pink dolphins — out of roughly 1,400 in the lake.","src":"CBS News，2023 年","url":"https://www.cbsnews.com/news/150-dolphins-die-amazon-lake-within-a-week-drought-water-temps-100-degrees/","say":{"en":"Can we swim here, or are there piranhas?","zh":"这里能游泳吗？有没有食人鱼？"}},"潘塔纳尔美洲豹":{"what":"美洲最大的猫科动物，在巴西潘塔纳尔湿地的河边捕鳄鱼、晒太阳，还很会游泳。","what_en":"The Americas' biggest cat, hunting caimans and sunning itself on the riverbanks of Brazil's Pantanal wetland — and a strong swimmer.","fame":"潘塔纳尔是世界上最大的热带湿地，河道开阔，坐小船沿河走，很容易看到在岸边睡觉的野生美洲豹。美洲豹的咬合力很大，能直接咬穿鳄鱼的头骨。","fame_en":"The Pantanal is the world's largest tropical wetland, and its open rivers make it the easiest place to see wild jaguars dozing on the banks from a small boat. A jaguar's bite is strong enough to crush a caiman's skull.","fact":"2020 年潘塔纳尔遇上几十年来最严重的旱灾和大火，大火烧进了以美洲豹出名的保护区。美联社引用豹类保护组织 Panthera 的估计，那一带大约 200 只美洲豹受伤、死亡或被赶出了自己的地盘。","fact_en":"In 2020 the Pantanal had its worst drought in decades and huge fires. The fires reached a park famous for its jaguars, and the AP, citing the big-cat group Panthera, reported that about 200 jaguars in the area were injured, killed or driven from their territories.","src":"美联社 AP（News4JAX 转载），2020 年","url":"https://www.news4jax.com/news/world/2020/09/13/battle-on-to-save-brazils-tropical-wetlands-from-flames/","say":{"en":"Can we turn the engine off so it doesn't run away?","zh":"能把发动机关了吗，别把它吓跑？"}},"巴塔哥尼亚企鹅":{"what":"南美洲最南端海边的麦哲伦企鹅，在草地和沙土里挖洞做窝，一对一对地守着自己的小洞。","what_en":"Magellanic penguins on the coasts at the bottom of South America, digging burrows in grass and sandy soil, each pair guarding its own little hole.","fame":"每年九月到次年三月，成千上万只麦哲伦企鹅回到巴塔哥尼亚海边生蛋，夫妻俩年年回同一个洞。在智利的马格达莱纳岛和阿根廷的通博角，游客走木栈道，企鹅就在脚边过马路。","fame_en":"From September to March, tens of thousands of Magellanic penguins return to Patagonian coasts to breed, and pairs come back to the same burrow every year. On Chile's Isla Magdalena and Argentina's Punta Tombo, visitors walk boardwalks while penguins cross right at their feet.","fact":"2019 年 1 月 19 日，阿根廷通博角气温到了 44 度，一天里至少 354 只麦哲伦企鹅死去，大多是成年企鹅，主要是脱水。研究者说这是那里第一次因为高温出现成批死亡。","fact_en":"On 19 January 2019 the temperature at Punta Tombo, Argentina, hit 44°C, and at least 354 Magellanic penguins died in a single day — mostly adults, mainly from dehydration. Researchers said it was the first mass die-off there linked to extreme heat.","src":"Futurity（华盛顿大学研究），2023 年","url":"https://www.futurity.org/magellanic-penguins-extreme-heat-argentina-2679122-2/","say":{"en":"Do we have to stay on the path?","zh":"我们一定要走在路上吗？"}},"南极帝企鹅":{"what":"世界上最大的企鹅，一米多高，冬天在南极零下几十度的海冰上生蛋，爸爸把蛋放在脚上孵两个月。","what_en":"The largest penguin, over a metre tall. It breeds on Antarctic sea ice in winter at tens of degrees below zero, and the father balances the egg on his feet for two months.","fame":"帝企鹅是唯一在南极冬天繁殖的企鹅：妈妈生完蛋去海里吃东西，爸爸们挤成一大团轮流站到中间取暖，两个月不吃东西。它们住得很远，一般游客坐船去南极半岛也看不到。","fame_en":"Emperors are the only penguins that breed through the Antarctic winter: the mother lays the egg and heads to sea to feed, while the fathers huddle, taking turns in the warm middle, eating nothing for two months. They live so far south that most cruise visitors to the Antarctic Peninsula never see one.","fact":"2022 年南极别林斯高晋海的海冰提前化掉，英国南极调查局用卫星发现，那里五个帝企鹅群里有四个的小企鹅可能全部没活下来——它们还没长出防水的羽毛，冰就碎了。","fact_en":"In 2022 sea ice in Antarctica's Bellingshausen Sea broke up early. Using satellites, the British Antarctic Survey found that four of the five emperor colonies there probably lost every chick — the ice broke before the chicks had grown waterproof feathers.","src":"Mongabay（英国南极调查局研究），2023 年","url":"https://news.mongabay.com/2023/08/catastrophic-breeding-failure-for-penguins-as-antarctic-sea-ice-vanishes/","say":{"en":"How far are we from the nearest emperor colony?","zh":"离最近的帝企鹅群有多远？"}},"伊基托斯雨林":{"what":"秘鲁亚马逊雨林里的大城市伊基托斯，周围全是河和森林，没有一条公路能从外面开进来。","what_en":"Iquitos, a big city in Peru's Amazon, ringed by rivers and forest — no road from the outside world leads in.","fame":"伊基托斯有四十多万人，是世界上最大的不通公路的城市（不算岛），只能坐飞机或坐几天的船来。城里满街是三轮摩的，贝伦区的房子建在会涨水的河边。","fame_en":"With over 400,000 people, Iquitos is the world's largest city that can't be reached by road (not counting islands) — you come by plane or by a days-long river boat. Its streets are full of motocarros, and in Belén houses are built where the river rises.","fact":"伊基托斯旁边的亚马逊救助中心专门救被猎杀、被卖的小海牛，喂大后放回野外。2023 年 6 月又放走了三头，其中一头 2020 年被渔叉刺伤；从 2007 年起一共放归了 31 头。","fact_en":"The Amazon Rescue Center near Iquitos rescues orphaned Amazonian manatees, raises them and returns them to the wild. In June 2023 it released three more — one had been speared by a harpoon in 2020 — bringing the total since 2007 to 31.","src":"达拉斯世界水族馆（与亚马逊救助中心 CREA 合作），2023 年","url":"https://dwazoo.com/conservation/peru/9th-manatee-release/","say":{"en":"How long does the boat take to the lodge?","zh":"坐船到雨林小屋要多久？"}},"蓝脚鲣鸟":{"what":"加拉帕戈斯群岛上的海鸟，脚是亮蓝色的，从高空一头扎进海里抓鱼。","what_en":"A seabird of the Galápagos with bright blue feet that dives headfirst into the sea from high up to catch fish.","fame":"雄鸟求偶时会抬起蓝脚，一只一只慢慢踩给雌鸟看，再张开翅膀、仰头吹口哨。脚越蓝说明越健康，雌鸟就越喜欢。它们一点也不怕人，常常在步道正中间跳舞。","fame_en":"To court a female, the male lifts his blue feet one at a time in a slow strut, then spreads his wings and points his beak to the sky with a whistle. Bluer feet mean a healthier bird, and females prefer them. They aren't afraid of people and often dance right in the middle of the trail.","fact":"2014 年的研究发现，加拉帕戈斯的蓝脚鲣鸟不到二十年少了一半多，2012 年只剩大约 6400 只。它们只有在吃得到很多沙丁鱼时才繁殖，而附近海里的沙丁鱼变少了。","fact_en":"A 2014 study found the Galápagos blue-footed booby population had more than halved in under 20 years, to about 6,400 birds in 2012. They breed only when they can eat mostly sardines, and sardines around the islands have declined.","src":"Live Science，2014 年","url":"https://www.livescience.com/45034-blue-footed-boobies-decline.html","say":{"en":"Are they doing the dance right now?","zh":"它们现在是在跳求偶舞吗？"}},"海鬣蜥":{"what":"加拉帕戈斯黑色礁石上一堆一堆晒太阳的黑蜥蜴，会潜到海里啃海藻，上岸再从鼻子里喷出盐水。","what_en":"Black lizards piled up sunbathing on Galápagos lava rocks. They dive into the sea to graze on seaweed, then come ashore and sneeze salt out of their noses.","fame":"海鬣蜥是世界上唯一会下海找吃的蜥蜴，能在冰凉的海水里潜好几分钟。上岸后得在黑石头上晒很久才能暖回来，所以常常几十只叠在一起。","fame_en":"Marine iguanas are the world's only lizards that forage in the sea, diving for several minutes in cold water. Back on land they must bask on black rocks for a long time to warm up, so dozens often pile on top of each other.","fact":"2000 年《自然》杂志的研究发现：厄尔尼诺来、海藻变少时，海鬣蜥会「缩小」——连骨头都会变短，身长最多能缩两成，食物回来了再长回去。","fact_en":"A 2000 study in Nature found that when El Niño hits and seaweed runs short, marine iguanas actually shrink — even their bones get shorter, by up to 20% of body length — and then grow back when food returns.","src":"ScienceDaily，2000 年","url":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2000/01/000110071021.htm","say":{"en":"Did that iguana just sneeze at me?","zh":"那只鬣蜥是不是冲我打了个喷嚏？"}},"红湖":{"what":"玻利维亚高原上一个红色的湖，海拔四千三百米，湖面上站满了粉红色的火烈鸟。","what_en":"A red lake high on the Bolivian altiplano, at 4,300 m, crowded with pink flamingos.","fame":"湖水是红的，是因为水里的藻类和矿物质；湖边还有白色的硼砂。三种安第斯火烈鸟在这里吃藻、过冬。游客一般从乌尤尼盐沼坐越野车，三天两夜才到。","fame_en":"The water is red because of algae and minerals, with white borax along the shore. Three kinds of Andean flamingo feed and spend the winter here. Most visitors arrive by 4x4 on a three-day trip from the Uyuni salt flat.","fact":"这里有一种火烈鸟——詹姆斯火烈鸟，二十世纪初以后几十年没人见过，大家以为它灭绝了。1956 年一支考察队在红湖重新找到它们，后来发现全世界大部分詹姆斯火烈鸟都在这一带繁殖。","fact_en":"One of its flamingos, the James's flamingo, wasn't seen for decades after the early 1900s and was thought extinct. In 1956 an expedition rediscovered it at Laguna Colorada, and it turned out most of the world's James's flamingos breed around here.","src":"Wikipedia · James's flamingo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James%27s_flamingo","say":{"en":"Do you have something for altitude sickness?","zh":"你有治高原反应的东西吗？"}},"奥里诺科鳄":{"what":"委内瑞拉和哥伦比亚奥里诺科河里的大鳄鱼，最长能到五米多，是美洲最大的鳄鱼之一。","what_en":"A huge crocodile of the Orinoco River in Venezuela and Colombia that can grow over 5 m long — one of the largest crocodiles in the Americas.","fame":"它是世界上最稀少的鳄鱼之一，被列为「极危」。委内瑞拉的保护组织在养殖场把小鳄鱼养大再放回河里，但野外的数量一直没回升。","fame_en":"It's one of the rarest crocodiles on Earth, listed as Critically Endangered. Conservation groups in Venezuela raise hatchlings and release them into rivers, but the wild population hasn't recovered.","fact":"二十世纪四十到六十年代，为了鳄鱼皮，奥里诺科河和平原湿地里有成千上万只被杀。1970 年代就开始保护了，可现在野外估计只剩 250 到 1500 只。","fact_en":"From the 1940s to the 1960s, thousands were killed for their skins in the Orinoco River and the llanos wetlands. Protection began in the 1970s, but today only an estimated 250 to 1,500 remain in the wild.","src":"Wikipedia · Orinoco crocodile","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orinoco_crocodile","say":{"en":"How many of them are left in the wild?","zh":"野外还剩多少只？"}},"汤加座头鲸":{"what":"每年冬天从南极游到汤加暖水里生宝宝的座头鲸，会跳出水面、拍尾巴，还会唱很长的歌。","what_en":"Humpback whales that swim from Antarctica to Tonga's warm waters every winter to give birth. They breach, slap their tails and sing long songs.","fame":"七月到十月，汤加瓦瓦乌群岛的海湾里有很多鲸鱼妈妈带着刚出生的小鲸。这里是世界上少数允许跟着向导下水、和座头鲸一起游泳的地方。","fame_en":"From July to October the bays of Vava'u in Tonga fill with mother whales and newborn calves. It's one of the few places in the world where you can legally get in the water, with a guide, and swim near humpbacks.","fact":"汤加以前也捕鲸，捕到座头鲸只剩两百多头。1978 年汤加成了世界上最早禁止商业捕鲸的国家之一，后来渔民把对鲸的了解变成了看鲸、跟鲸游泳的生意。","fact_en":"Tonga once hunted whales too, until its humpbacks were down to a few hundred. In 1978 it became one of the first countries in the world to ban commercial whaling, and Tongans turned their knowledge of whales into whale-watching and swimming tours.","src":"Oceanic Society（海洋协会）","url":"https://www.oceanicsociety.org/travel-ideas/a-travelers-view-swimming-with-humpbacks-in-tonga/","say":{"en":"How close can we get to the mother and calf?","zh":"我们能离鲸鱼妈妈和宝宝多近？"}},"吸蜜蜂鸟":{"what":"古巴特有的蜂鸟，是世界上最小的鸟，只有五六厘米长、不到两克重，飞起来像一只蜜蜂。","what_en":"A hummingbird found only in Cuba and the world's smallest bird — just 5–6 cm long and under 2 grams, buzzing around like a bee.","fame":"它的翅膀一秒钟扇大约 80 次，能停在空中、倒着飞。在古巴萨帕塔沼泽附近，有的人家在院子里种花、挂喂食器，观鸟的人去他们家里等它出现。","fame_en":"Its wings beat about 80 times a second, so it can hover and even fly backwards. Near Cuba's Zapata Swamp some families plant flowers and hang feeders in their yards, and birdwatchers wait in their gardens for it to show up.","fact":"雌鸟做的窝只有一厘米多宽，里面的蛋大约一粒咖啡豆那么大，一次只生两颗。","fact_en":"The female builds a nest barely an inch across, and her eggs are about the size of a coffee bean — just two at a time.","src":"BirdNote（康奈尔鸟类研究所录音）","url":"https://birdnote.org/podcasts/birdnote-daily/bee-hummingbird","say":{"en":"Is that a bee or the hummingbird?","zh":"那是蜜蜂还是蜂鸟？"}},"博士鸟":{"what":"牙买加的国鸟，一种红嘴长尾蜂鸟，雄鸟尾巴后面拖着两条长长的黑飘带。","what_en":"Jamaica's national bird, the red-billed streamertail hummingbird, whose males trail two long black streamers behind them.","fame":"它只生活在牙买加，别的地方都没有。1962 年牙买加独立时被选为国鸟，牙买加航空以前的飞机尾巴上画的就是它。","fame_en":"It lives only in Jamaica and nowhere else. It was chosen as the national bird when Jamaica became independent in 1962, and Air Jamaica's planes used to carry it on their tails.","fact":"为什么叫「博士鸟」？牙买加政府的说法是：它黑色的头冠和长尾巴，像以前医生戴的高礼帽和穿的燕尾服。也有人说是因为它的嘴像医生的柳叶刀。","fact_en":"Why 'doctor bird'? According to the Jamaican government, its black crest and long tail look like the top hat and tailcoat doctors used to wear. Others say its bill looks like a doctor's lancet.","src":"牙买加政府新闻处 JIS","url":"https://jis.gov.jm/information/symbols/jamaican-national-bird-the-doctor-bird/","say":{"en":"Where's the best place to see a doctor bird?","zh":"去哪儿最容易看到博士鸟？"}},"巴拿马金蛙":{"what":"巴拿马山溪边的亮黄色小蛙，身上有毒，会挥「手」打招呼，是巴拿马人眼里的幸运象征。","what_en":"A bright yellow little frog from Panama's mountain streams. It's poisonous, waves its 'hands' to signal, and Panamanians see it as a symbol of good luck.","fame":"巴拿马人把它印在彩票上、做成纪念品，还有全国金蛙日。它在溪水声里听不清叫声，所以会挥前爪「打招呼」。","fame_en":"Panamanians put it on lottery tickets and souvenirs, and there's a National Golden Frog Day. Because streams are too loud for calls to carry, it waves its front feet to signal.","fact":"一种叫壶菌的真菌让它在野外消失，2009 年以后再没人在野外见过它。好在 2000 年前就有一批被送到美国动物园繁殖。最近科学家把 100 只人工繁殖的金蛙放进野外的围栏试验，头 12 周大约七成还是死于壶菌，活下来的大多被放归。","fact_en":"A chytrid fungus wiped it out in the wild, and no one has seen one there since 2009. Luckily, in 2000 some were sent to US zoos to breed. Recently scientists put 100 captive-bred golden frogs into outdoor pens in the wild as a trial; about 70% still died of chytrid in the first 12 weeks, and most survivors were then fully released.","src":"Mongabay，2026 年","url":"https://news.mongabay.com/short-article/2026/03/captive-bred-panamanian-golden-frogs-released-to-the-wild/","say":{"en":"Are these golden frogs from the breeding program?","zh":"这些金蛙是人工繁殖计划里的吗？"}},"格查尔鸟":{"what":"中美洲云雾林里的绿色大鸟，胸口鲜红，雄鸟的尾羽能拖到一米长。","what_en":"A large green bird of Central America's cloud forests with a scarlet chest; the male's tail feathers can trail a metre long.","fame":"玛雅人把它当成神圣的鸟，羽毛只有王族能用。它是危地马拉的国鸟，危地马拉的钱就叫「格查尔」，国旗上也有它。","fame_en":"The Maya held it sacred and only royalty could wear its feathers. It's Guatemala's national bird — the currency is called the quetzal, and it's on the flag too.","fact":"格查尔鸟最爱吃野生的小鳄梨：它飞着把果子摘下来，整颗吞下去，过一阵再把大果核吐出来。这样野鳄梨的种子就被带到了离母树远的地方。","fact_en":"Quetzals love wild avocados: they pluck the fruit in flight, swallow it whole and later bring up the big stone — carrying the seeds away from the parent tree.","src":"牛津大学植物园标本馆 · Persea（鳄梨属）","url":"https://herbaria.plants.ox.ac.uk/bol/plants400/Profiles/OP/Persea","say":{"en":"Is this the tree where the quetzals come to feed?","zh":"格查尔鸟是来这棵树吃东西的吗？"}},"南露脊鲸":{"what":"身上长着白色硬疙瘩的大鲸鱼，每年冬天游到阿根廷瓦尔德斯半岛的海湾里生宝宝。","what_en":"Big whales with white crusty patches on their heads that swim into the bays of Argentina's Península Valdés every winter to give birth.","fame":"六月到十二月，瓦尔德斯半岛的海湾里有上千头露脊鲸，离岸很近，坐在海边的路上都能看到它们翻身、拍尾巴。英文叫 right whale，是因为以前捕鲸人觉得它游得慢、死了会浮起来，是「对的」鲸。","fame_en":"From June to December more than a thousand right whales gather in the bays of Península Valdés, so close that you can watch them roll and slap their tails from the coast road. Whalers called it the 'right' whale because it was slow and floated when killed.","fact":"瓦尔德斯的海鸥学会了一件可怕的事：落在浮出水面的鲸鱼背上，啄它的皮和脂肪吃。1970 年代才开始有，2015 年的研究发现，后来几乎每头小鲸身上都有海鸥啄的伤。","fact_en":"Gulls at Valdés learned something grim: landing on surfacing whales to peck at their skin and blubber. It began in the 1970s, and a 2015 study found that later almost every calf bore gull wounds.","src":"PLOS ONE 研究（美国国家医学图书馆 PMC），2015 年","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4619304/","say":{"en":"What time does the whale-watching boat leave?","zh":"看鲸的船几点开？"}},"鸟类王国":{"what":"哥伦比亚，世界上鸟的种类最多的国家，有一千九百多种，从加勒比海边到安第斯高山再到亚马逊。","what_en":"Colombia, the country with more bird species than any other — over 1,900, from the Caribbean coast to the high Andes and the Amazon.","fame":"哥伦比亚的地形什么都有：海岸、三条安第斯山脉、云雾林、草原、雨林，所以鸟特别多，光蜂鸟就有一百多种。圣玛尔塔附近的明卡和咖啡产区是观鸟的人最爱去的地方。","fame_en":"Colombia has every kind of landscape — coasts, three Andean ranges, cloud forest, grasslands and rainforest — so it has an extraordinary number of birds, including over a hundred kinds of hummingbird. Minca near Santa Marta and the coffee region are birdwatchers' favourites.","fact":"每年五月有一个全球观鸟日（Global Big Day），全世界的人在同一天记录看到的鸟。2025 年哥伦比亚一天记录了 1563 种，第九次拿第一，秘鲁第二。","fact_en":"Every May there's a Global Big Day, when people worldwide log every bird they see on one day. In 2025 Colombia recorded 1,563 species in a single day, taking first place for the ninth time, ahead of Peru.","src":"哥伦比亚商业、工业和旅游部，2025 年","url":"https://www.mincit.gov.co/prensa/noticias/turismo/colombia-sigue-siendo-primero-en-el-global-big-day","say":{"en":"What bird is that? Can I borrow your binoculars?","zh":"那是什么鸟？能借你的望远镜看看吗？"}},"美洲鸵":{"what":"南美洲最大的鸟，一米多高，不会飞但跑得很快，在乌拉圭和阿根廷的草原上成群走来走去。","what_en":"South America's largest bird — over a metre tall, flightless but very fast — wandering the grasslands of Uruguay and Argentina in groups.","fame":"它长得像小一号的鸵鸟，跑起来能到每小时六十公里，转弯时会张开一边翅膀当舵。在乌拉圭的牧场上，常和牛、羊一起吃草。","fame_en":"It looks like a smaller ostrich and can run about 60 km/h, opening one wing like a rudder to turn. On Uruguayan ranches it often grazes right alongside cattle and sheep.","fact":"美洲鸵是爸爸带孩子：几只雌鸟把蛋都生在同一只雄鸟挖的窝里，一窝能有五十多颗蛋。然后雌鸟走了，雄鸟自己孵六周左右，小鸟出来后还要带好几个月。","fact_en":"In rheas, the dad does the parenting: several females lay in one nest the male has dug — sometimes 50 or more eggs — then leave. The male incubates them alone for about six weeks and looks after the chicks for months.","src":"National Geographic · Greater rhea","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/animals/birds/facts/greater-rhea","say":{"en":"Can we stop the car for a minute? There are rheas!","zh":"能停一下车吗？有美洲鸵！"}},"齿鸽":{"what":"萨摩亚雨林里一种很少见的鸽子，嘴又厚又弯，下嘴上有像牙齿一样的齿，萨摩亚语叫 manumea。","what_en":"A very rare pigeon of Samoa's rainforest with a thick hooked bill and tooth-like notches on its lower jaw — called manumea in Samoan.","fame":"它是渡渡鸟现在活着的近亲之一，所以被叫做「小渡渡鸟」。它是萨摩亚的国鸟。它只吃几种树的果子，森林被砍、被野猫吃都让它越来越少。","fame_en":"It's one of the dodo's closest living relatives, hence the nickname 'little dodo'. It's Samoa's national bird. It eats the fruit of only a few trees, and logging and feral cats have made it ever rarer.","fact":"从 2013 年起就再没人拍到过齿鸽的照片。2025 年 10 月，萨摩亚保护协会的小队在乌波卢岛的瓦法托保护区找了六个星期，终于好几次看到它——可它太远太快，还是没拍下来。","fact_en":"No one has photographed a manumea since 2013. In October 2025 a small Samoa Conservation Society team spent six weeks searching Upolu's Uafato Conservation Area and finally saw it several times — but it was too far and too quick, and they still got no photo.","src":"ExplorersWeb，2025 年","url":"https://explorersweb.com/the-dodos-closest-cousin-the-manumea-is-not-extinct-after-all/","say":{"en":"Have you ever seen a manumea yourself?","zh":"你自己见过齿鸽吗？"}},"圣地亚哥动物园":{"what":"加州圣地亚哥巴尔博亚公园里的大动物园，有一万多只动物，很多住在没有笼子、像野外一样的大园区里。","what_en":"A huge zoo in San Diego's Balboa Park with over 10,000 animals, many living in open habitats that look like the wild instead of cages.","fame":"它是世界上最有名的动物园之一，很早就用壕沟代替铁笼，还帮加州神鹫从只剩二十几只的时候繁殖回来。园里很大，很多人坐双层观光巴士和空中缆车逛。","fame_en":"It's one of the world's most famous zoos, an early pioneer of moats instead of bars, and it helped breed the California condor back from just over twenty birds. The grounds are huge, so many people get around by double-decker bus and the Skyfari aerial tram.","fact":"2019 年大熊猫回中国后，圣地亚哥动物园好几年没有熊猫。2024 年 6 月，云川和鑫宝从中国来了，8 月正式和游客见面，是 21 年来第一批进美国的大熊猫，新的熊猫园比原来大四倍。","fact_en":"After its pandas went back to China in 2019, the zoo had none for years. In June 2024 Yun Chuan and Xin Bao arrived from China and met the public that August — the first giant pandas to enter the US in 21 years — in a new habitat four times bigger than the old one.","src":"ABC7，2024 年","url":"https://abc7.com/post/pandas-china-make-official-public-debut-san-diego-zoo/15159391/","say":{"en":"Do we need a timed ticket to see the pandas?","zh":"看熊猫要预约时间票吗？"}},"加拿大雁":{"what":"黑头白下巴的大雁，春秋排成 V 字飞过天空，城里的公园和草坪上也到处是它们。","what_en":"Big geese with black heads and white chinstraps that fly in V formations in spring and autumn — and fill city parks and lawns.","fame":"它们一边飞一边大声叫，排 V 字是为了省力，领头的累了就换下一只。加拿大一元硬币背面是潜鸟，可很多人一提加拿大的鸟先想到的是它。护崽时会追着人嘶叫。","fame_en":"They honk loudly as they fly, and the V formation saves energy — when the leader tires, another takes over. Canada's dollar coin shows a loon, but for many people this goose is the Canadian bird. Guarding goslings, they'll hiss and chase people.","fact":"最大的「巨型加拿大雁」二十世纪初被打猎打到几乎没了，被以为灭绝了将近三十年，1960 年代初才重新被找到。后来各地放养的雁没有爸妈教它们迁徙，所以现在很多加拿大雁一年四季都待在城里不走。","fact_en":"The largest subspecies, the giant Canada goose, was hunted nearly out of existence in the early 1900s and thought extinct for almost 30 years, until it was rediscovered in the early 1960s. Restocked birds had no parents to teach them to migrate, which is why many Canada geese now stay in cities all year.","src":"美国鸭子基金会 Ducks Unlimited","url":"https://www.ducks.org/conservation/waterfowl-research-science/new-breed-of-goose","say":{"en":"Watch out — there are goslings, don't get too close.","zh":"小心，有小雁，别靠太近。"}},"拉布拉多":{"what":"性格温和、爱吃又爱玩水的大狗，常做导盲犬、搜救犬，也是很多家庭的第一只狗。","what_en":"A gentle, food-loving, water-loving big dog — often a guide or search dog, and many families' first dog.","fame":"它其实来自加拿大纽芬兰，祖先是帮渔民从冷水里叼渔网和鱼的狗，所以毛防水、尾巴粗得像舵。养的人最常聊的是：它什么都想吃，一不小心就胖了。","fame_en":"It actually comes from Newfoundland in Canada, descended from dogs that helped fishermen haul nets and fish out of icy water — hence the waterproof coat and thick, rudder-like 'otter tail'. Owners' favourite topic: it wants to eat everything and gets fat easily.","fact":"拉布拉多爱吃不全是嘴馋：2016 年剑桥大学研究发现，大约四分之一（23%）的拉布拉多带着一个 POMC 基因突变，让它们吃完也觉得饿。每多一个突变拷贝，平均重 1.9 公斤；导盲犬里这个比例更高。","fact_en":"It's not just greed: a 2016 University of Cambridge study found that about a quarter (23%) of Labradors carry a POMC gene mutation that keeps them feeling hungry after eating. Each copy adds about 1.9 kg on average, and it's even more common among assistance dogs.","src":"剑桥大学，2016 年","url":"https://www.cam.ac.uk/research/news/genetic-mutation-in-a-quarter-of-all-labradors-hard-wires-them-for-obesity","say":{"en":"Sorry, can I give your dog a treat?","zh":"不好意思，我可以给你的狗吃个零食吗？"}},"吉娃娃":{"what":"世界上最小的狗之一，大眼睛、大耳朵，胆子却很大，常常冲着比它大十倍的狗叫。","what_en":"One of the world's smallest dogs — big eyes, big ears and a big attitude, often barking at dogs ten times its size.","fame":"名字来自墨西哥北部的奇瓦瓦州，十九世纪美国人从那里把它带回去。它认主人，常常只黏一个人；怕冷，冬天出门要穿衣服。","fame_en":"It's named after the state of Chihuahua in northern Mexico, where Americans picked it up in the 1800s. It bonds closely, often to just one person, and feels the cold, so it wears a jacket outside in winter.","fact":"2023 年吉尼斯认定世界上最矮的活着的狗是一只叫 Pearl 的吉娃娃：肩高只有 9.14 厘米，身长 12.7 厘米，跟一张美元差不多长。她住在美国佛罗里达。","fact_en":"In 2023 Guinness named a Chihuahua called Pearl the world's shortest living dog: just 9.14 cm tall and 12.7 cm long — about the length of a dollar bill. She lives in Florida.","src":"DOGOnews（吉尼斯世界纪录），2023 年","url":"https://services.dogonews.com/2023/4/18/a-tiny-chihuahua-name-pearl-is-officially-the-worlds-shortest-dog","say":{"en":"Is he friendly? Can I pet him?","zh":"它友好吗？我可以摸摸它吗？"}},"布偶猫":{"what":"蓝眼睛、长毛、个头大的猫，被抱起来会整个身子软下来，像一个布娃娃。","what_en":"A large, blue-eyed, long-haired cat that goes completely limp when you pick it up — like a rag doll.","fame":"布偶猫性格很温顺，喜欢跟着主人从一个房间走到另一个房间，有人叫它「狗狗猫」。养的人常聊：它掉毛多、长得慢，要三四岁才完全长大。","fame_en":"Ragdolls are very docile and like to follow their owners from room to room — some call them 'puppy cats'. Owners often talk about how much they shed and how slowly they grow: they aren't fully grown until three or four.","fact":"布偶猫来自 1960 年代加州里弗赛德一位叫 Ann Baker 的养猫人，最早是一只叫 Josephine 的白色流浪长毛猫生的小猫。她后来给「Ragdoll」这个名字注册了商标，还自己成立协会，要求别人照她的规矩养。","fact_en":"Ragdolls began in the 1960s with Ann Baker, a breeder in Riverside, California, starting from kittens of a white stray longhair named Josephine. She later trademarked the name 'Ragdoll' and founded her own association, making other breeders follow her rules.","src":"Wikipedia · Ragdoll","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ragdoll","say":{"en":"Is it okay to pick her up?","zh":"可以把它抱起来吗？"}},"美国短毛猫":{"what":"身体结实、圆脸的短毛猫，最常见的是银色带黑色花纹，性格稳、好养。","what_en":"A sturdy, round-faced shorthaired cat, most often silver with black tabby stripes — calm and easy to keep.","fame":"它的祖先是跟着欧洲移民坐船来北美、在船上和农场抓老鼠的猫，所以很健壮。养的人常说它「不黏也不冷」，自己玩得很好，适合上班的人。","fame_en":"Its ancestors came to North America on settlers' ships, catching mice on board and on farms, which is why it's so robust. Owners say it's 'not clingy, not cold' — happy to entertain itself, good for people who work.","fact":"它原来就叫「家养短毛猫」，1966 年才正式改名叫「美国短毛猫」，为的是强调它是有血统的品种，跟路边随便一只短毛猫区分开。","fact_en":"It used to be called the Domestic Shorthair and was only renamed American Shorthair in 1966, to stress that it's a pedigreed breed, distinct from any random shorthaired cat.","src":"Wikipedia · American Shorthair","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_Shorthair","say":{"en":"Is he more of a lap cat or does he like his space?","zh":"它喜欢被抱，还是喜欢自己待着？"}},"缅因猫":{"what":"最大的家猫品种之一，毛厚、尾巴蓬松、耳朵尖上有一撮毛，看起来像一只小狮子。","what_en":"One of the biggest domestic cat breeds — thick coat, bushy tail and tufts on its ear tips, like a small lion.","fame":"它来自美国东北的缅因州，是在冷天里长出来的猫：毛防水，脚掌大得像雪鞋。个头大但性格温柔，有人叫它「温柔的巨人」，还会发出像鸟一样的颤音。","fame_en":"It comes from Maine in the northeastern US, built for the cold — water-resistant fur and big snowshoe paws. Despite its size it's gentle, nicknamed the 'gentle giant', and it makes a bird-like chirping trill.","fact":"吉尼斯世界纪录里「最长的活着的家猫」是一只意大利的缅因猫 Barivel：2018 年量的时候从鼻子到尾巴 120 厘米，比一根棒球棒还长。","fact_en":"Guinness World Records' longest living domestic cat is Barivel, a Maine Coon in Italy, measured in 2018 at 120 cm from nose to tail — longer than a baseball bat.","src":"吉尼斯世界纪录","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/longest-cat-(domestic)","say":{"en":"Wow, how much does he weigh?","zh":"哇，它有多重？"}},"加菲猫（异国短毛猫）":{"what":"扁脸、大圆眼、短毛的猫，像短毛版的波斯猫；在中国常被叫做「加菲猫」。","what_en":"A flat-faced, round-eyed shorthaired cat, like a short-coated Persian — in China often called the 'Garfield cat'.","fame":"它性格懒洋洋、很亲人，又不用像波斯猫那样天天梳长毛，所以在城市里很受欢迎。养的人常聊的是它的扁脸：爱流眼泪，要每天擦，天热时呼吸也容易不顺。","fame_en":"It's laid-back and affectionate, and doesn't need daily grooming like a Persian, so it's popular with city dwellers. Owners often talk about its flat face: watery eyes that need wiping every day, and breathing trouble in hot weather.","fact":"异国短毛猫是 1950 年代末美国人偷偷「混」出来的：有些美国短毛猫的繁育者拿波斯猫来杂交，想让猫更壮实。1966 年有人向美国猫迷协会 CFA 提议把它定成新品种，最早差点叫「Sterling」。","fact_en":"The Exotic was born from a quiet experiment in the late 1950s: some American Shorthair breeders crossed in Persians to make their cats chunkier. In 1966 it was proposed to the Cat Fanciers' Association as a new breed — and nearly got the name 'Sterling'.","src":"美国猫迷协会 CFA","url":"https://cfa.org/exotic-article/","say":{"en":"Is it normal that her eyes are always a bit teary?","zh":"它眼睛老是有点流泪，这正常吗？"}},"无毛猫":{"what":"看起来没有毛的猫，皮肤皱皱的、大耳朵，摸起来像暖暖的桃子皮。","what_en":"A cat that looks hairless, with wrinkly skin and big ears — it feels like a warm peach.","fame":"它其实有一层很短的绒毛。没毛保暖，所以它特别爱钻被窝、贴着人睡；皮肤会出油，要定期洗澡，夏天还会晒伤。性格外向、爱黏人。","fame_en":"It actually has a fine layer of fuzz. With no fur to keep warm, it loves burrowing under blankets and sleeping against people; its skin gets oily, so it needs regular baths, and it can get sunburned. It's outgoing and very affectionate.","fact":"无毛猫的故事从多伦多开始：1966 年，一只普通的黑白家猫生下一只没毛的小公猫，取名 Prune（西梅干）。后来人们培育这一支，今天的无毛猫主要来自多伦多和美国明尼苏达后来又找到的几只无毛猫。","fact_en":"The Sphynx story starts in Toronto: in 1966 an ordinary black-and-white house cat gave birth to a hairless male kitten named Prune. Breeders worked with that line, and today's Sphynx descends mainly from hairless cats later found in Toronto and Minnesota.","src":"Wikipedia · Sphynx cat","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sphynx_cat","say":{"en":"Does she get cold? Does she need a sweater?","zh":"它会冷吗？要穿毛衣吗？"}},"孟加拉豹猫":{"what":"身上有豹子一样斑点和花纹的家猫，肌肉发达、精力旺盛，很多都喜欢玩水。","what_en":"A house cat with leopard-like spots and rosettes, muscular and full of energy — and many love playing with water.","fame":"它是家猫和野生的亚洲豹猫杂交培育出来的，所以长得「野」。养的人常说：它需要很多运动和玩具，不然会拆家；会开门、跳上冰箱，还会跟着你进浴室。","fame_en":"It was bred by crossing house cats with the wild Asian leopard cat, which is why it looks wild. Owners say it needs lots of exercise and toys or it will wreck the place — it opens doors, leaps onto the fridge and follows you into the shower.","fact":"孟加拉豹猫的「妈妈」是美国养猫人 Jean Mill：1963 年她第一次把家猫和亚洲豹猫配对。她说初衷是保护野生豹猫——如果有人能买到长得像豹猫的家猫，就不会再有人去野外抓。1986 年 TICA 接纳了这个新品种。","fact_en":"The Bengal's 'mother' is American breeder Jean Mill, who first crossed a house cat with an Asian leopard cat in 1963. She said she wanted to protect wild leopard cats — if people could buy a house cat that looked like one, fewer would be taken from the wild. TICA accepted the new breed in 1986.","src":"Wikipedia · Jean Mill","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean_Mill","say":{"en":"Does he need a lot of playtime every day?","zh":"它每天要玩很久吗？"}},"东北虎":{"what":"生活在中俄边境森林里的大老虎，也叫西伯利亚虎、阿穆尔虎。","what_en":"The big tiger of the forests on the China–Russia border, also called the Siberian or Amur tiger.","fame":"世界上体型最大的猫科动物之一，一身厚毛能扛零下三四十度。野外的在吉林、黑龙江的东北虎豹国家公园；想近一点看，哈尔滨的东北虎林园坐车就能进去。","fame_en":"One of the largest cats on Earth, with a thick coat for −30 °C winters. Wild ones live in the Northeast China Tiger and Leopard National Park in Jilin and Heilongjiang; to see one up close, Harbin's Siberian Tiger Park lets you drive through.","fact":"2021 年中国正式设立东北虎豹国家公园。到 2026 年，园里拍到的野生东北虎从 2017 年的 27 只涨到 72 只，东北豹从 42 只涨到 115 只。","fact_en":"China formally set up the Northeast Tiger and Leopard National Park in 2021. By 2026 its wild Amur tigers had risen from 27 in 2017 to 72, and Amur leopards from 42 to 115.","src":"China Daily（2026，全球老虎日）","url":"https://global.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202607/29/WS6a697356a310986e2b467ed8.html","say":{"en":"Can we feed the tigers from the bus?","zh":"坐在车里可以喂老虎吗？"}},"神农架金丝猴":{"what":"湖北神农架山林里的一种猴子，一身金黄长毛，脸是天蓝色的，鼻子朝天。","what_en":"A monkey from the mountain forests of Shennongjia, Hubei, with long golden fur, a sky-blue face and an upturned nose.","fame":"只生活在中国，是和大熊猫一样的国宝级动物。神农架 2016 年进了世界自然遗产，在大龙潭能看到半野生的猴群下山吃东西。","fame_en":"Found only in China and treated as a national treasure like the giant panda. Shennongjia became a UNESCO World Natural Heritage site in 2016, and at Dalongtan you can watch semi-wild troops come down to eat.","fact":"上世纪 80 年代神农架的金丝猴不到 500 只；2026 年第四次调查数到 1618 只，分成 11 个群，差不多翻了三倍。","fact_en":"In the 1980s Shennongjia had fewer than 500 golden snub-nosed monkeys. The fourth survey, reported in 2026, counted 1,618 in 11 groups — roughly three times as many.","src":"Hunan Today / 新华社（2026）","url":"https://www.hunantoday.cn/news/xhn/202605/32638980.html","say":{"en":"Are we allowed to take photos of the monkeys?","zh":"可以给猴子拍照吗？"}},"亚洲象":{"what":"云南西双版纳热带雨林里的野生大象，中国唯一有野象的地方。","what_en":"Wild Asian elephants in the rainforests of Xishuangbanna, Yunnan — the only place in China where elephants still live wild.","fame":"中国大约 300 头野象几乎都在这里。2021 年一群大象一路「北上」走到昆明郊外，全世界都在看直播；在野象谷可以从空中走廊上看它们洗澡。","fame_en":"Almost all of China's roughly 300 wild elephants live here. In 2021 a herd wandered north to the edge of Kunming while the world watched live; at Wild Elephant Valley you can see them bathe from an elevated walkway.","fact":"那群北上的大象在路上生了一头小象。它们大约向北走了 500 公里，前后一年半，2021 年 9 月过了把边江回到普洱，人和象都没受伤。","fact_en":"The herd that wandered north had a baby on the way. They walked about 500 km north over some 18 months, then crossed the Babian River back into Pu'er in September 2021 — with no harm to people or elephants.","src":"China Daily（2021）","url":"https://regional.chinadaily.com.cn/kunming/2021-09/11/c_661398.htm","say":{"en":"Which spot is best to see the elephants come down to the river?","zh":"哪个位置最容易看到大象下河？"}},"牦牛":{"what":"青藏高原上一身长毛的牛，藏族人家里的「全能帮手」。","what_en":"The long-haired ox of the Tibetan Plateau — the do-everything helper of Tibetan families.","fame":"被叫作「高原之舟」：在四五千米缺氧的地方还能驮东西，奶做酥油茶，毛织帐篷，粪晒干当柴烧。去川西、西藏的公路上，常常是牦牛让你等。","fame_en":"Called the 'boat of the plateau', it carries loads at 4,000–5,000 m. Its milk makes butter tea, its hair weaves tents and its dung is dried for fuel. On roads in western Sichuan and Tibet, it's usually the yaks that make you wait.","fact":"牦牛不会「哞哞」叫，只会呼噜呼噜地哼。1766 年林奈给它起的学名 Bos grunniens，意思就是「会哼哼的牛」。","fact_en":"Yaks don't moo — they grunt. Linnaeus named them Bos grunniens in 1766, which means 'grunting ox'.","src":"Wikipedia：Yak","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yak","say":{"en":"Is this yak meat or beef?","zh":"这是牦牛肉还是黄牛肉？"}},"藏羚羊":{"what":"青藏高原可可西里一带的羚羊，公羊头上一对又长又直的黑角。","what_en":"An antelope of the high Tibetan Plateau around Hoh Xil; males carry a pair of long, straight black horns.","fame":"能在海拔五千米上跑到每小时 80 公里，每年夏天母羊成群走几百公里去产仔。北京奥运会吉祥物「迎迎」就是照它画的。","fame_en":"It runs up to 80 km/h at 5,000 m, and every summer females migrate hundreds of kilometres in herds to give birth. Yingying, a Beijing Olympics mascot, was modelled on it.","fact":"因为偷猎做「沙图什」披肩，90 年代只剩不到 7.5 万只；后来数量回升，2016 年国际自然保护联盟把它从「濒危」一下降了两级到「近危」。青藏铁路还专门留了 33 个通道让它们从桥下过。","fact_en":"Poaching for shahtoosh shawls cut numbers to under 75,000 in the 1990s. After they recovered, the IUCN moved the species from Endangered to Near Threatened in 2016. The Qinghai–Tibet Railway left 33 passages so the herds can cross under the tracks.","src":"Wikipedia：Tibetan antelope","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tibetan_antelope","say":{"en":"Can we see the antelope from the train window?","zh":"在火车上能看到藏羚羊吗？"}},"泰国大象":{"what":"泰国的国家象征，清迈一带的大象保护营地很多。","what_en":"Thailand's national symbol; the hills around Chiang Mai are full of elephant sanctuaries.","fame":"大象以前帮人拉木头、打仗，白象是王权的象征。现在去清迈最受欢迎的是「不骑大象」的保护营：喂香蕉、看它们在河里洗澡。","fame_en":"Elephants once hauled timber and went to war, and white elephants stood for royal power. Today the most popular trips from Chiang Mai are 'no-riding' sanctuaries where you feed them bananas and watch them bathe in the river.","fact":"每年 3 月 13 日是泰国大象日：1998 年定下的，因为 1963 年的这一天，白象被定为泰国的国家动物。","fact_en":"13 March is Thai National Elephant Day. It was set in 1998 because on that date in 1963 the white elephant was named Thailand's national animal.","src":"Wikipedia：National Elephant Day (Thailand)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Elephant_Day_(Thailand)","say":{"en":"Is this a no-riding sanctuary?","zh":"这里是不骑大象的保护营吗？"}},"科莫多巨蜥":{"what":"印度尼西亚科莫多岛一带的巨型蜥蜴，长约 3 米。","what_en":"A giant lizard from Komodo and nearby islands in Indonesia, about 3 m long.","fame":"世界上最大的蜥蜴，能扑倒鹿和水牛。只生活在科莫多国家公园和弗洛勒斯岛的一小块地方，上岛必须跟着拿木叉的护林员走。","fame_en":"The world's largest lizard, strong enough to bring down deer and buffalo. It lives only in Komodo National Park and a corner of Flores, and on the islands you must walk with a ranger carrying a forked stick.","fact":"2021 年国际自然保护联盟把它从「易危」改成「濒危」，原因之一是气候变化：海平面上升，它们住的小岛未来几十年可能少掉三成的地。成年的大概不到 1400 只。","fact_en":"In 2021 the IUCN moved it from Vulnerable to Endangered, partly because of climate change: rising seas may take away about 30% of its island habitat in the coming decades. Fewer than 1,400 adults are thought to remain.","src":"Natural History Museum, London（2021）","url":"https://www.nhm.ac.uk/discover/news/2021/september/komodo-dragon-is-now-listed-as-endangered-from-rising-sea-levels.html","say":{"en":"How close can we get to the dragons?","zh":"我们能离巨蜥多近？"}},"红毛猩猩":{"what":"婆罗洲和苏门答腊雨林里的大型猿，一身橙红色长毛，大部分时间在树上。","what_en":"A great ape from the rainforests of Borneo and Sumatra, with long orange-red hair, living mostly in the trees.","fame":"名字是马来语「森林里的人」。它是唯一生活在亚洲的大猿，会用树叶当伞、用树枝当工具。沙巴的西必洛康复中心可以看到被救下的孤儿猩猩练爬树。","fame_en":"Its name means 'person of the forest' in Malay. It is Asia's only great ape and uses leaves as umbrellas and sticks as tools. At Sepilok in Sabah you can watch rescued orphans learning to climb.","fact":"2016 年国际自然保护联盟把婆罗洲猩猩改成「极危」：从 70 年代初到现在数量少了将近三分之二，主要因为森林被砍和被猎杀。","fact_en":"In 2016 the IUCN listed the Bornean orangutan as Critically Endangered: its numbers have fallen by nearly two-thirds since the early 1970s, mainly from forest loss and hunting.","src":"AP / The Columbian（2016）","url":"https://columbian.com/news/2016/jul/08/group-bornean-orangutan-now-critically-endangered","say":{"en":"What time is the feeding at the platform?","zh":"喂食台几点喂？"}},"孟加拉虎":{"what":"印度和孟加拉国交界的孙德尔本斯红树林里的老虎。","what_en":"Tigers of the Sundarbans mangroves on the border of India and Bangladesh.","fame":"孙德尔本斯是世界上最大的红树林，这里的老虎会游泳、在潮水里穿来穿去，还会吃鱼和螃蟹。游客只能坐船沿河道看，很少真看到老虎，看到脚印就算运气好。","fame_en":"The Sundarbans is the world's largest mangrove forest. Its tigers swim between islands through the tides and even eat fish and crabs. Visitors can only look from boats along the channels; most see paw prints rather than a tiger.","fact":"孟加拉国这边 2023–24 年用 1210 台相机拍了 318 天，数到 125 只老虎，比 2015 年的 106 只多；还拍到 21 只小老虎，以前几次只拍到 5 只。","fact_en":"On the Bangladesh side, a 2023–24 survey ran 1,210 cameras for 318 days and counted 125 tigers, up from 106 in 2015. It also photographed 21 cubs, compared with just five in earlier surveys.","src":"Dhaka Tribune（2024）","url":"https://www.dhakatribune.com/bangladesh/361154/tiger-population-in-sundarbans-rises-to-125","say":{"en":"Have you seen a tiger this week?","zh":"这周你们看到老虎了吗？"}},"珍岛犬":{"what":"韩国西南边珍岛上的本地狗，竖耳朵、卷尾巴，多是白色或黄色。","what_en":"A native dog from Jindo Island in south-west Korea, with pricked ears, a curled tail and usually a white or tan coat.","fame":"韩国的天然纪念物，出了名的忠心、聪明、认路。养的人会说它「只认一个主人」、很爱干净，但精力旺、要每天带出去跑，城里公寓不太好养。","fame_en":"A Korean Natural Monument famous for loyalty, brains and finding its way home. Owners say it bonds with one person and keeps itself very clean, but it has lots of energy and needs daily runs, so it isn't easy in a city flat.","fact":"1993 年，一只叫「白狗」（Baekgu）的珍岛犬被卖到 300 公里外的大田，七个月后自己跑回了珍岛的老主人家。后来岛上给它立了像。","fact_en":"In 1993 a Jindo named Baekgu was sold to a family in Daejeon, about 300 km away. Seven months later she turned up at her old owner's home on Jindo, exhausted. The island later put up a statue of her.","src":"Wikipedia：Korean Jindo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Korean_Jindo","say":{"en":"Is he friendly with strangers?","zh":"它对陌生人友好吗？"}},"普氏野马":{"what":"蒙古草原上的野马，个子矮、脖子粗，鬃毛像刷子一样竖着。","what_en":"The wild horse of the Mongolian steppe — short, thick-necked, with a mane that stands up like a brush.","fame":"世界上唯一真正的野马（不是家马跑野的）。上世纪 60 年代在野外消失，靠动物园里留下的几匹繁殖，1992 年起放回蒙古的胡斯坦国家公园，现在在那里能看到马群。","fame_en":"The only truly wild horse — not a feral domestic one. It vanished from the wild in the 1960s, was bred from a few zoo animals, and since 1992 has been returned to Hustai National Park in Mongolia, where herds now roam.","fact":"2024 年 6 月，捷克军机把 7 匹普氏野马从布拉格和柏林的动物园运到哈萨克斯坦草原——它们在那里消失了大约 200 年。","fact_en":"In June 2024 Czech military planes flew seven Przewalski's horses from the Prague and Berlin zoos to the Kazakh steppe, where the species had been gone for about 200 years.","src":"Al Jazeera（2024）","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/6/14/wild-przewalskis-horses-return-to-kazakhstan-after-200-years","say":{"en":"What time of day do the horses come down to drink?","zh":"野马一般几点下来喝水？"}},"中南大羚":{"what":"越南和老挝交界长山山脉里的一种牛科动物，两根又长又直的角。","what_en":"A forest bovine from the Annamite Mountains on the Vietnam–Laos border, with two long, straight horns.","fame":"1992 年才被科学家发现——最早是在猎人家里看到一个怪角头骨。它极少露面，被叫作「亚洲独角兽」，是 20 世纪发现的最大陆地哺乳动物之一。","fame_en":"Scientists only learned of it in 1992, from a strange-horned skull in a hunter's home. It is so rarely seen that it is called the 'Asian unicorn', and it was one of the largest land mammals discovered in the 20th century.","fact":"最后一张照片是 2013 年越南广南省的红外相机拍到的。过去 25 年它在野外只被拍到过 5 次，全是相机自动拍的。","fact_en":"The last photo of one was taken by a camera trap in Quảng Nam, Vietnam, in 2013. In 25 years it has been photographed in the wild only five times — all by camera traps.","src":"Viet Nam News（2025）","url":"https://vietnamnews.vn/sunday/features/1723730/tracking-down-the-elusive-sao-la.html","say":{"en":"Has anyone here ever seen a saola?","zh":"这里有人见过中南大羚吗？"}},"湄公河江豚":{"what":"柬埔寨桔井一段湄公河里的伊洛瓦底江豚，圆脑袋、没有尖嘴。","what_en":"Irrawaddy dolphins in the Mekong near Kratie, Cambodia — round heads, no beak.","fame":"它们住在淡水河里，每天在同一段深水潭附近出没。在桔井北边的 Kampi 坐小船，船夫会关掉马达，听它们出水换气「噗」的一声。","fame_en":"They live in fresh water and stay around the same deep pools. At Kampi, north of Kratie, boatmen cut the engine so you can hear the 'pfff' when they surface to breathe.","fact":"1997 年第一次普查时湄公河里大约有 200 头；2020 年的普查估计只剩 89 头，和 2017 年的 92 头差不多，总算没再往下掉。","fact_en":"The first census in 1997 found about 200. The 2020 census estimated just 89, close to the 92 in 2017 — the decline had at least levelled off.","src":"WWF（2020）","url":"https://www.worldwildlife.org/news/press-releases/numbers-of-critically-endangered-mekong-river-dolphin-stable/","say":{"en":"How long is the boat trip to see the dolphins?","zh":"看江豚的船要坐多久？"}},"万象之国":{"what":"老挝的古称「澜沧」，意思是「百万大象之国」。","what_en":"Lan Xang, the old name of Laos, meaning 'Land of a Million Elephants'.","fame":"从古代起大象就是老挝的象征，帮人拉木头、驮东西。沙耶武里每年有大象节；那里的大象保护中心教人怎么照顾大象、送它们回森林。","fame_en":"Elephants have been Laos's symbol since ancient times, hauling logs and carrying loads. Sayaboury holds an elephant festival, and its Elephant Conservation Center teaches how to care for elephants and return them to the forest.","fact":"「百万大象」现在只是名字了：2019 年老挝政府和保护组织估计全国只剩大约 800 头，野生和人养的各一半，而且都在减少。","fact_en":"The 'million elephants' are now just a name: in 2019 the government and conservationists estimated only about 800 were left in Laos, roughly half wild and half captive, and both groups were shrinking.","src":"NPR（2019）","url":"https://www.npr.org/2019/05/12/707525699/a-million-elephants-no-more-conservationists-in-laos-rush-to-save-an-icon","say":{"en":"Can I visit the elephant hospital?","zh":"我可以参观大象医院吗？"}},"缅甸猫":{"what":"一种短毛家猫，毛色像咖啡、摸起来像缎子，抱起来比看上去沉。","what_en":"A short-haired cat with a coffee-coloured, satin-smooth coat — heavier than it looks when you pick it up.","fame":"出了名的黏人：会跟着你满屋跑、在门口等你回家，有人说它「像狗一样」。养的人常说它爱说话、怕寂寞，最好别让它整天一个人在家。","fame_en":"Famously clingy: it follows you from room to room and waits by the door, and people call it 'dog-like'. Owners say it is chatty and hates being alone, so it shouldn't spend all day by itself.","fact":"美国的缅甸猫几乎都是一只母猫的后代：1930 年，约瑟夫·汤普森医生把一只叫 Wong Mau 的棕色猫从缅甸带到旧金山，再和暹罗猫配出了这个品种。","fact_en":"Nearly all American Burmese descend from one cat. In 1930 Dr Joseph Thompson brought a brown cat named Wong Mau from Burma to San Francisco and bred her with Siamese cats to create the breed.","src":"Wikipedia：Burmese cat","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burmese_cat","say":{"en":"Is she good with other cats?","zh":"它跟别的猫合得来吗？"}},"夜间动物园":{"what":"新加坡万礼的夜间野生动物园，天黑以后才开门。","what_en":"Night Safari in Mandai, Singapore — a wildlife park that opens only after dark.","fame":"1994 年开张，世界上第一个专门晚上开的动物园。可以坐游园车，也可以走步道看夜里才出来的动物：穿山甲、云豹、马来貘、懒猴……","fame_en":"Opened in 1994 as the world's first zoo built to be visited at night. You ride a tram or walk the trails to see animals that come out after dark: pangolins, clouded leopards, Malayan tapirs, slow lorises.","fact":"园里用的是仿月光的灯，比真的满月亮好几个数量级，但又暗到不会打扰夜行动物。这套灯光是伦敦的灯光设计师 Simon Corder 做的。","fact_en":"The park is lit with fake 'moonlight' — several orders of magnitude brighter than a real full moon, yet dim enough not to disturb nocturnal animals. The lighting was designed by London lighting designer Simon Corder.","src":"Wikipedia：Night Safari, Singapore","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Night_Safari,_Singapore","say":{"en":"When does the last tram leave?","zh":"最后一班游园车几点？"}},"犀鸟":{"what":"婆罗洲雨林里嘴上顶着一个大「头盔」的鸟，飞起来翅膀呼呼响。","what_en":"Big rainforest birds of Borneo with a large 'helmet' on the bill; their wings whoosh loudly in flight.","fame":"砂拉越被叫作「犀鸟之乡」，州鸟就是马来犀鸟，当地伊班族的节庆和木雕里到处都是它。在古晋的国家公园和动物园能看到。","fame_en":"Sarawak is called the 'Land of the Hornbills'; its state bird is the rhinoceros hornbill, which appears in Iban festivals and carvings. You can see them in national parks around Kuching.","fact":"犀鸟里有一种盔犀鸟，头盔几乎是实心的，被当成「鹤顶红」象牙偷猎。2015 年它从「近危」直接跳到「极危」。","fact_en":"One kind, the helmeted hornbill, has an almost solid casque that is poached as 'red ivory'. In 2015 it jumped straight from Near Threatened to Critically Endangered.","src":"Wikipedia：Helmeted hornbill","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helmeted_hornbill","say":{"en":"Which trail is best for seeing hornbills?","zh":"哪条步道最容易看到犀鸟？"}},"眼镜猴":{"what":"菲律宾薄荷岛上的小猴子，比手掌还小，两只大眼睛。","what_en":"A tiny primate from Bohol in the Philippines — smaller than your hand, with two enormous eyes.","fame":"世界上最小的灵长类之一，一只眼睛比它的脑子还大；脑袋能转差不多一圈。很怕吵，在薄荷岛的眼镜猴保护区里要小声、不能开闪光灯。","fame_en":"One of the world's smallest primates; each eye is bigger than its brain, and it can turn its head almost all the way round. It stresses easily, so at Bohol's tarsier sanctuary you must keep quiet and no flash.","fact":"它会用人耳听不到的超声波「说话」：2012 年研究人员发现菲律宾眼镜猴的叫声在 70 千赫左右，像蝙蝠一样，可能是躲开天敌的「密语」。","fact_en":"It 'talks' in ultrasound we can't hear: in 2012 researchers found Philippine tarsiers call at around 70 kHz, like bats — possibly a private channel that predators can't pick up.","src":"Mongabay（2012）","url":"https://news.mongabay.com/2012/02/tiny-tarsier-makes-big-ultrasonic-noise/","say":{"en":"Sorry — are we allowed to take photos without flash?","zh":"请问不开闪光灯可以拍照吗？"}},"独角犀":{"what":"尼泊尔奇特旺国家公园里的大独角犀，皮厚得像盔甲。","what_en":"Greater one-horned rhinos in Chitwan National Park, Nepal, with skin like armour plates.","fame":"亚洲最大的犀牛，只有一只角。奇特旺在喜马拉雅山脚的平原上，坐吉普车、独木舟或走路（跟着向导）都能看到犀牛在河边吃草、泡泥水。","fame_en":"Asia's largest rhino, with a single horn. Chitwan lies on the lowlands below the Himalayas, and by jeep, dugout canoe or guided walk you can see rhinos grazing and wallowing by the river.","fact":"2021 年尼泊尔全国数犀牛，一共 752 头，比 2015 年多了 107 头；其中 694 头在奇特旺一带。","fact_en":"Nepal's 2021 rhino count found 752, up 107 from 2015 — and 694 of them were in and around Chitwan.","src":"National Trust for Nature Conservation, Nepal（2021）","url":"https://www.ntnc.org.np/news/752-one-horned-rhinos-nepal-determined-national-rhino-count-2021","say":{"en":"Is it safe to walk here, or should we take the jeep?","zh":"这里走路安全吗，还是坐吉普车？"}},"米瑞莎蓝鲸":{"what":"斯里兰卡南岸米瑞莎外海的蓝鲸。","what_en":"Blue whales off Mirissa on Sri Lanka's south coast.","fame":"地球上最大的动物，比恐龙还大。米瑞莎离大陆架很近，坐船一两个小时就到深水区，每年 12 月到次年 4 月是看鲸的好季节。","fame_en":"The largest animal that has ever lived. Off Mirissa the continental shelf is close, so deep water is only an hour or two by boat; December to April is the best season.","fact":"斯里兰卡附近的蓝鲸很特别：它们好像不洄游，一年到头待在斯里兰卡、阿曼和马尔代夫之间的海里，吃的是小虾而不是磷虾。研究它们的是斯里兰卡海洋生物学家 Asha de Vos。","fact_en":"Sri Lanka's blue whales are unusual: they seem not to migrate, staying all year in the seas between Sri Lanka, Oman and the Maldives and eating shrimp rather than krill. They were brought to light by Sri Lankan marine biologist Asha de Vos.","src":"Science News","url":"https://www.sciencenews.org/article/asha-de-vos-sri-lanka-blue-whales","say":{"en":"What time does the whale-watching boat leave?","zh":"看鲸的船几点出发？"}},"鲸鲨":{"what":"马尔代夫南阿里环礁外海的鲸鲨，身上满是白色斑点。","what_en":"Whale sharks off South Ari Atoll in the Maldives, covered in white spots.","fame":"世界上最大的鱼，能长到十几米，却只吃浮游生物，对人很温和。南阿里环礁是全世界少数一年四季都能看到鲸鲨的地方，浮潜就能看。","fame_en":"The world's largest fish — it can grow beyond 12 m — yet it eats only plankton and is gentle with people. South Ari Atoll is one of the few places on Earth to see them year-round, just by snorkelling.","fact":"这里的鲸鲨大多是年轻的公鲨：研究人员一张张认斑点，到 2020 年初认出 472 条，知道性别的里面四分之三是公的。","fact_en":"Most of the whale sharks here are young males. Researchers identify each one by its spots; by early 2020 they had logged 472 individuals, and about three-quarters of those of known sex were male.","src":"Maldives Whale Shark Research Programme（2019 年报）","url":"https://maldiveswhalesharkresearch.org/download/2663/","say":{"en":"How far do we have to stay from the shark?","zh":"我们要离鲸鲨多远？"}},"捻角山羊":{"what":"巴基斯坦北部高山上的野山羊，公羊有一对螺旋形的长角。","what_en":"A wild goat of the high mountains of northern Pakistan; males have long corkscrew horns.","fame":"巴基斯坦的国兽。螺旋角能长到一米多，在吉德拉尔峡谷的陡坡上跳来跳去。冬天它们会下到低一点的山坡，那时最容易看到。","fame_en":"Pakistan's national animal. The spiral horns can grow over a metre long, and they leap across the cliffs of the Chitral valley. In winter they come down to lower slopes, the best time to see them.","fact":"2015 年国际自然保护联盟把它从「濒危」降到「近危」。一个原因是巴基斯坦让村里自己管：每年只卖少数几张打老公羊的许可证，大部分钱分给当地村子，村民就不再偷猎。","fact_en":"In 2015 the IUCN moved it from Endangered to Near Threatened. One reason: Pakistan let villages manage it, selling a few permits a year to hunt old males and passing most of the money to local communities, who stopped poaching.","src":"Wikipedia：Markhor","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Markhor","say":{"en":"Could I borrow your binoculars for a second?","zh":"能借你的望远镜看一下吗？"}},"布哈拉马鹿":{"what":"中亚阿姆河、锡尔河边的河岸林里的马鹿。","what_en":"A red deer of the riverside tugay forests along the Amu Darya and Syr Darya in Central Asia.","fame":"它只住在沙漠中间的河边树林里，林子没了它就没了。在乌兹别克斯坦卡拉卡尔帕克斯坦的巴代图盖保护区能看到。","fame_en":"It lives only in the riverside woods that run through the desert — lose the forest and you lose the deer. You can see it at the Badai-Tugai reserve in Karakalpakstan, Uzbekistan.","fact":"90 年代森林被砍、鹿被偷猎，1999 年估计只剩 350 到 500 头；后来世界自然基金会在中亚几国恢复河岸林、把鹿放回老地方，数量才慢慢回升。","fact_en":"Habitat loss and poaching in the 1990s left an estimated 350–500 in 1999. A WWF project restoring riverside forest and returning deer to old sites across Central Asia has since let numbers climb back.","src":"Minnesota Zoo","url":"https://mnzoo.org/?p=4223","say":{"en":"Is there a ranger who can take us to see the deer?","zh":"有护林员能带我们去看鹿吗？"}},"哈萨克猎鹰人":{"what":"哈萨克斯坦草原上骑马、带金雕打猎的人，叫「berkutchi」。","what_en":"Kazakh horsemen who hunt with golden eagles on the steppe — the berkutchi.","fame":"猎人从小把金雕养大、训练它抓狐狸和野兔，人和鹰要一起过好几年。在阿拉木图附近可以看猎鹰表演，秋冬还有猎鹰比赛。","fame_en":"A hunter raises a golden eagle and trains it to catch foxes and hares; the pair work together for years. Near Almaty you can watch eagle displays, and in autumn and winter there are hunting contests.","fact":"2016 年联合国教科文组织把「鹰猎」列为人类非物质文化遗产，哈萨克斯坦也在里面。2023 年 10 月阿拉木图州的 Salburyn 比赛上，来自哈萨克斯坦、中国和蒙古的 70 只金雕一起飞。","fact_en":"In 2016 UNESCO listed falconry as Intangible Cultural Heritage, with Kazakhstan among the countries. At the Salburyn tournament in Almaty Region in October 2023, 70 golden eagles flew, with hunters from Kazakhstan, China and Mongolia.","src":"RFE/RL（2023）","url":"https://www.rferl.org/a/kazakhstan-berkutchi-tournament-feature/32642267.html","say":{"en":"How long does it take to train an eagle?","zh":"训练一只金雕要多久？"}},"卡齐兰加独角犀":{"what":"印度阿萨姆邦卡齐兰加国家公园里的大独角犀。","what_en":"Greater one-horned rhinos in Kaziranga National Park, Assam, India.","fame":"世界上三分之二的大独角犀住在这里。公园在布拉马普特拉河边，高高的象草地里可以坐吉普车看犀牛、野水牛和大象，1985 年进了世界遗产。","fame_en":"Two-thirds of the world's greater one-horned rhinos live here. On the Brahmaputra floodplain, jeep safaris through tall elephant grass show you rhinos, wild buffalo and elephants. It became a World Heritage Site in 1985.","fact":"2022 年卡齐兰加数犀牛，一共 2613 头，比 2018 年多了 200 头，其中 146 头是小犀牛。","fact_en":"Kaziranga's 2022 count found 2,613 rhinos — 200 more than in 2018 — including 146 calves.","src":"The News Mill（2022）","url":"https://thenewsmill.com/2022/03/rhino-population-in-assams-kaziranga-national-park-increases-to-2613/","say":{"en":"Which zone is best for rhinos this morning?","zh":"今天上午哪个区最容易看到犀牛？"}},"坎哈老虎":{"what":"印度中部中央邦坎哈国家公园里的孟加拉虎。","what_en":"Bengal tigers in Kanha National Park, Madhya Pradesh, central India.","fame":"坎哈的娑罗树林和大草地被认为是吉卜林写《丛林之书》的灵感来源。这里是看野生老虎最好的地方之一，也是硬地沼鹿（巴拉辛格鹿）世界上唯一的家。","fame_en":"Kanha's sal forests and big meadows are said to have inspired Kipling's The Jungle Book. It is one of the best places to see wild tigers, and the only home in the world of the hard-ground barasingha deer.","fact":"坎哈是印度第一个有官方吉祥物的老虎保护区，而吉祥物不是老虎：是一头叫「Bhoorsingh」的巴拉辛格鹿，提醒大家这种鹿差点灭绝。","fact_en":"Kanha was the first tiger reserve in India to adopt an official mascot — and it isn't a tiger. It's Bhoorsingh the Barasingha, a swamp deer, to remind people how close that deer came to vanishing.","src":"Wikipedia：Kanha Tiger Reserve","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanha_Tiger_Reserve","say":{"en":"Did anyone see a tiger on the morning drive?","zh":"早上那一趟有人看到老虎吗？"}},"考拉":{"what":"澳大利亚东部的有袋动物，抱着桉树睡觉，一天能睡将近 20 个小时。","what_en":"A marsupial from eastern Australia that hugs eucalyptus trees and sleeps close to 20 hours a day.","fame":"几乎只吃桉树叶，桉树叶有毒、营养又少，所以它省着力气、整天睡。小考拉在妈妈的育儿袋里长大半年。在布里斯班、悉尼的动物园和野生动物园都能看到。","fame_en":"It eats almost nothing but eucalyptus leaves, which are toxic and low in energy, so it saves energy by sleeping. Joeys grow in their mother's pouch for about six months. You can see them in wildlife parks around Brisbane and Sydney.","fact":"2022 年 2 月，澳大利亚联邦政府把昆士兰、新南威尔士和首都领地的考拉从「易危」升级为「濒危」。干旱、2019–20 年的山火、疾病和栖息地被砍掉，都让它们越来越少。","fact_en":"In February 2022 the Australian government upgraded koalas in Queensland, New South Wales and the ACT from vulnerable to endangered, after drought, the 2019–20 bushfires, disease and habitat clearing.","src":"国际爱护动物基金会 IFAW，2022 年","url":"https://www.ifaw.org/international/press-releases/koalas-uplisted-endangered","say":{"en":"Is the koala awake at all today, or is it still sleeping?","zh":"这只考拉今天醒过吗，还是一直在睡？"}},"卡卡杜鳄鱼":{"what":"澳大利亚北领地卡卡杜国家公园里的湾鳄（咸水鳄），世界上最大的爬行动物。","what_en":"Saltwater crocodiles in Kakadu National Park in Australia's Northern Territory — the largest reptiles on Earth.","fame":"大公鳄能长到 6 米、一吨重，在河里、湿地和海边都能活。卡卡杜的黄水湿地（Yellow Water）坐游船就能看到它们晒太阳；河边到处立着「小心鳄鱼」的牌子，不能下水游泳。","fame_en":"Big males reach 6 m and around a tonne, living in rivers, wetlands and along the coast. On a Yellow Water boat cruise in Kakadu you can watch them basking; 'Beware of crocodiles' signs line the rivers and swimming is off-limits.","fact":"1971 年北领地开始保护湾鳄时，几十年的捕猎只剩下大约 3000 条；现在估计已经超过 10 万条，比从前多得多，鳄鱼进城、进河道的事也多了。","fact_en":"When the Northern Territory protected saltwater crocodiles in 1971, decades of hunting had left only about 3,000. Today the estimate is over 100,000 — and crocs turning up near towns has become common news.","src":"Katherine Times，2020 年","url":"https://www.katherinetimes.com.au/story/7023778/to-cull-or-not-to-cull-croc-research-into-population-boom","say":{"en":"Is it safe to swim anywhere around here?","zh":"这附近有能游泳的地方吗，安全吗？"}},"短尾矮袋鼠":{"what":"西澳罗特尼斯岛上的小袋鼠，猫那么大，嘴角天生往上翘，看着像在笑。","what_en":"A cat-sized wallaby on Rottnest Island off Perth, whose mouth curves up so it always looks like it's smiling.","fame":"被叫作「世界上最快乐的动物」，大家来罗特尼斯岛就是为了跟它合一张自拍。它不怕人，会在面包店和自行车道边走来走去。从珀斯坐渡轮半个多小时就到。","fame_en":"Called 'the happiest animal in the world', it's the reason people come to Rottnest for a selfie. It isn't shy and wanders past the bakery and bike paths. The ferry from Perth takes well under an hour.","fact":"岛名就是因为它起的：1696 年荷兰船长弗拉明登岛，把短尾矮袋鼠当成了大老鼠，就叫这里「老鼠窝岛」（Rottenest）。现在摸它、喂它都会被当场罚款。","fact_en":"The island is named after it by mistake: Dutch captain Willem de Vlamingh landed in 1696, took the quokkas for giant rats, and called it 'Rottenest' — rats' nest. Today touching or feeding one gets you an on-the-spot fine.","src":"Wikipedia · Rottnest Island","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rottnest_Island","say":{"en":"Can I take a selfie with it if I don't touch it?","zh":"我不碰它，可以跟它自拍吗？"}},"鲨鱼湾海豚":{"what":"西澳鲨鱼湾里的宽吻海豚，猴子米亚（Monkey Mia）海滩上，它们几乎每天早上都会游到浅水边。","what_en":"Bottlenose dolphins in Western Australia's Shark Bay, which swim into the shallows at Monkey Mia beach almost every morning.","fame":"这里是世界遗产，海豚是野生的，自己愿意来才来。游客站在齐膝的水里看，护林员会挑几只给一小点鱼。鲨鱼湾还有大片海草床和儒艮。","fame_en":"Shark Bay is World Heritage–listed; the dolphins are wild and come in only when they choose. Visitors stand knee-deep while rangers give a few of them a little fish. The bay also has huge seagrass meadows and dugongs.","fact":"鲨鱼湾的一小部分海豚会「戴海绵」：把海底的海绵掰下来套在嘴上，翻沙子找鱼时保护嘴巴。1984 年第一次被看到，这手艺几乎只由妈妈传给女儿，是野生海豚用工具最清楚的例子。","fact_en":"A small group of Shark Bay dolphins 'wear' sponges — they tear one off the seabed and put it over their beak to protect it while digging for fish. First seen in 1984, the trick passes mostly from mother to daughter, and it's the clearest case of tool use in wild dolphins.","src":"加拿大广播公司 CBC，2025 年","url":"https://www.cbc.ca/1.7587838","say":{"en":"What time do the dolphins usually come in?","zh":"海豚一般几点游过来？"}},"鸸鹋":{"what":"澳大利亚的大鸟，个子比人还高，不会飞，但能跑到每小时 50 公里左右。","what_en":"Australia's giant bird — taller than many people, flightless, but able to run at around 50 km/h.","fame":"它和袋鼠一起站在澳大利亚国徽上，据说因为两种动物都不太会往后退。公鸸鹋负责孵蛋、带孩子，在内陆公路边经常能看到一家子横穿马路。","fame_en":"It stands with the kangaroo on Australia's coat of arms — supposedly because neither moves backwards easily. The male sits on the eggs and raises the chicks, and in the outback you often see a whole family crossing the road.","fact":"1932 年西澳麦农抱怨两万只鸸鹋吃庄稼，政府派了士兵带两挺机关枪去「打仗」。打了一个多月、用了近万发子弹，鸸鹋没少多少，军队撤了，这件事被叫作「鸸鹋战争」。","fact_en":"In 1932, when Western Australian wheat farmers complained about some 20,000 emus, the government sent soldiers with two machine guns. After weeks and nearly 10,000 rounds the emus were barely dented and the army pulled out — the 'Great Emu War'.","src":"Wikipedia · Emu War","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emu_War","say":{"en":"Are they dangerous if they come close?","zh":"它们靠近的话危险吗？"}},"塔斯马尼亚恶魔":{"what":"只生活在澳大利亚塔斯马尼亚岛上的黑色有袋动物，小狗那么大，吃东西时会发出吓人的尖叫。","what_en":"A black marsupial the size of a small dog, found wild only in Tasmania, that screeches frighteningly at feeding time.","fame":"它是世界上现存最大的食肉有袋动物，咬合力特别强，连骨头都嚼碎吃掉。名字里的「恶魔」就是早期移民听到夜里的叫声起的。在塔斯马尼亚的野生动物保护区里能看喂食。","fame_en":"It's the largest surviving carnivorous marsupial, with a bite strong enough to crunch bones. Early settlers named it 'devil' after its night-time screams. Tasmanian sanctuaries let you watch it at feeding time.","fact":"一种会传染的「面部肿瘤病」让岛上的数量大跌。2020 年，保护组织把 26 只放进新南威尔士的巴林顿山保护区——这是它们约 3000 年来第一次回到澳大利亚大陆的野外。","fact_en":"A contagious facial tumour disease has devastated the Tasmanian population. In 2020 conservationists released 26 devils into a sanctuary in Barrington Tops, NSW — their first return to the wild on mainland Australia in about 3,000 years.","src":"Re:wild 新闻稿，2020 年","url":"https://www.rewild.org/press/tasmanian-devils-return-to-mainland-australia-for-first-time-in-3000-years","say":{"en":"Is it okay to watch the feeding, or is it too noisy for kids?","zh":"喂食可以看吗？会不会太吵，吓到小孩？"}},"几维鸟":{"what":"新西兰的国鸟，鸡那么大，不会飞，夜里出来用长嘴尖上的鼻孔闻着找虫子吃。","what_en":"New Zealand's national bird — chicken-sized, flightless, and out at night sniffing for worms with nostrils at the tip of its long beak.","fame":"新西兰人自称「Kiwi」，硬币、球队、空军的标志上都有它。野外很难见到，大多数人是在动物园的「夜间几维鸟馆」里，在暗红色的灯下看到它。","fame_en":"New Zealanders call themselves 'Kiwis', and the bird is on coins, sports teams and the air force roundel. It's hard to spot in the wild; most people see one under dim red light in a zoo's nocturnal kiwi house.","fact":"2022 年 11 月，惠灵顿的志愿者项目「Capital Kiwi」把第一批 11 只褐几维鸟放回首都周边的山里——这里已经一百多年没有野生几维鸟。2023 年初，山里就有了第一枚野生几维鸟蛋。","fact_en":"In November 2022 the volunteer-run Capital Kiwi project released its first 11 brown kiwi into the hills around Wellington, which hadn't had wild kiwi for over a century. By January 2023 the first wild kiwi egg had been laid there.","src":"新西兰 1News，2023 年","url":"https://www.1news.co.nz/2023/01/20/first-wild-kiwi-egg-laid-in-wellington-in-over-a-century","say":{"en":"Is it okay to take photos in the kiwi house?","zh":"几维鸟馆里能拍照吗？"}},"新西兰绵羊":{"what":"新西兰农场上的羊，山坡上一片白点，是这个国家最常见的风景。","what_en":"The sheep of New Zealand's farms — white dots across the hillsides, the country's most familiar view.","fame":"新西兰羊肉和羊毛卖到全世界，剪羊毛还是一项正经比赛，最快的人不到一分钟剪完一只。很多农场让游客看赶羊狗干活、看剪羊毛。","fame_en":"New Zealand lamb and wool are sold worldwide, and shearing is a real competitive sport — the fastest shearers finish a sheep in under a minute. Many farms let visitors watch sheepdogs at work and shearing shows.","fact":"1982 年新西兰有 7000 多万只羊，平均每人 22 只；到 2024 年只剩约 2360 万只，每人大约 4.5 只。羊毛越来越不值钱，很多农场改种树、养奶牛了。","fact_en":"In 1982 New Zealand had over 70 million sheep — 22 per person. By 2024 it was about 23.6 million, roughly 4.5 each, as falling wool prices pushed farmers into forestry and dairy.","src":"美联社 AP（CTV News 转载），2025 年","url":"https://www.ctvnews.ca/world/article/yes-new-zealand-still-has-more-sheep-than-people-but-humans-are-catching-up/","say":{"en":"How long does it take to shear one sheep?","zh":"剪一只羊要多长时间？"}},"天堂鸟":{"what":"巴布亚新几内亚森林里的极乐鸟，雄鸟羽毛颜色华丽，还会跳很复杂的求偶舞。","what_en":"Birds-of-paradise in Papua New Guinea's forests — males have dazzling plumes and perform elaborate courtship dances.","fame":"巴布亚新几内亚的国旗和国徽上都是它。每年的戈罗卡歌舞节上，部落的人会戴着用羽毛做的头饰跳舞。想看野生的，要清早跟当地向导进山。","fame_en":"It's on Papua New Guinea's flag and coat of arms. At the yearly Goroka Show, tribes dance in feathered headdresses. To see one in the wild you go into the hills at dawn with a local guide.","fact":"16 世纪传到欧洲的天堂鸟标本，脚和翅膀都在当地加工时去掉了，欧洲人就以为它们一辈子在天上飞、从不落地。1758 年林奈给大天堂鸟起的学名 apoda，意思就是「没有脚」。","fact_en":"The first bird-of-paradise skins that reached Europe had been prepared without feet or wings, so Europeans believed the birds flew forever and never landed. In 1758 Linnaeus named the greater bird-of-paradise apoda — 'footless'.","src":"Wikipedia · Greater bird-of-paradise","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greater_bird-of-paradise","say":{"en":"What time do we need to leave to see the birds displaying?","zh":"要几点出发才能看到它们跳舞？"}},"菲利普岛小企鹅":{"what":"墨尔本附近菲利普岛上的小蓝企鹅，世界上最小的企鹅，只有 30 多厘米高。","what_en":"Little blue penguins on Phillip Island near Melbourne — the world's smallest penguins, just over 30 cm tall.","fame":"白天在海里抓鱼，每天日落后成群地从海浪里走上沙滩、摇摇摆摆回窝，这就是有名的「企鹅归巢」。为了不吓到它们，看台上不许拍照。","fame_en":"They fish at sea all day, then after sunset waddle out of the surf in groups and up the beach to their burrows — the famous Penguin Parade. Photos are banned so the penguins aren't startled.","fact":"企鹅住的萨默兰半岛以前被规划成住宅区，有上百栋房子。维多利亚州政府从 1985 年开始一栋一栋买回来拆掉，到 2010 年才买完，把整片地还给了企鹅。","fact_en":"The Summerland Peninsula, where the penguins nest, was once a housing estate with hundreds of lots. From 1985 the Victorian government bought back and removed the houses one by one, finishing in 2010 and handing the land back to the penguins.","src":"菲利普岛自然公园官网","url":"https://www.penguins.org.au/about/about-us/our-history/","say":{"en":"What time do the penguins usually come up the beach?","zh":"企鹅一般几点上岸？"}},"袋熊":{"what":"澳大利亚的圆滚滚有袋动物，腿短、身子壮，会在地下挖很长的洞。","what_en":"A round, stocky Australian marsupial with short legs that digs long burrows underground.","fame":"它的育儿袋口朝后开，挖洞时土不会掉进去。看着慢吞吞，其实能跑到每小时 40 公里。新南威尔士雪山一带和塔斯马尼亚的国家公园里，傍晚常见它在草地上吃草。","fame_en":"Its pouch opens backwards so dirt doesn't get in while it digs. It looks slow but can sprint around 40 km/h. In the Snowy Mountains and Tasmania's parks you often see it grazing at dusk.","fact":"袋熊的便便是方块形的。2021 年塔斯马尼亚大学等团队发现，秘密在肠子：肠壁有的地方硬、有的地方软，粪便在最后一段慢慢变干时就被挤出了棱角。之前一篇相关研究还拿了 2019 年的搞笑诺贝尔奖。","fact_en":"Wombat poo comes out in cubes. In 2021 a team including the University of Tasmania showed why: the gut wall has stiffer and softer sections, which squeeze corners into the droppings as they dry near the end. Earlier work on it won a 2019 Ig Nobel Prize.","src":"塔斯马尼亚大学新闻，2021 年","url":"https://www.utas.edu.au/about/news-and-stories/articles/2021/1109-scientists-get-to-the-bottom-of-wombat-cubed-poo-mystery","say":{"en":"Is that really wombat poo? It's actually square!","zh":"那真是袋熊的便便吗？居然是方的！"}},"斐济鬣蜥":{"what":"斐济群岛特有的冠鬣蜥，全身翠绿、带白色条纹，生气时会变暗。","what_en":"The Fiji crested iguana, found only in Fiji — bright green with white stripes, turning darker when it's upset.","fame":"它是太平洋岛上少见的鬣蜥，大部分住在一座叫雅杜阿塔巴（Yadua Taba）的小岛上，那里整座岛是保护区。被国际自然保护联盟列为「极度濒危」。在斐济的生态公园里能近距离看到。","fame_en":"It's one of the Pacific's few iguanas, and most live on the tiny island of Yadua Taba, which is a sanctuary in its entirety. The IUCN lists it as Critically Endangered. Eco-parks in Fiji let you see one up close.","fact":"1981 年它才被正式命名。有人在 1980 年的电影《青春珊瑚岛》（The Blue Lagoon，部分在斐济拍）里看到了这种鬣蜥，帮科学家找到了它的更多分布地。","fact_en":"It was only formally named in 1981 — and spotting it in wildlife footage from the 1980 film The Blue Lagoon, partly shot in Fiji, helped scientists find more places where it lived.","src":"Wikipedia · Fiji crested iguana","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fiji_crested_iguana","say":{"en":"Where can we see the crested iguanas here?","zh":"这里哪儿能看到冠鬣蜥？"}},"树袋鼠":{"what":"住在巴布亚新几内亚和澳大利亚北部雨林里的袋鼠，在树上生活，尾巴长、毛色红棕。","what_en":"Kangaroos that live up in the rainforest trees of Papua New Guinea and northern Australia, with long tails and red-brown fur.","fame":"袋鼠的祖先是从树上下到地面的，它们又爬回了树上。前爪有力，能抱着树干爬，从高处往下跳十几米也不受伤。在野外很难见到，大多数人是在动物园看到。","fame_en":"Kangaroos' ancestors came down from the trees, and these ones climbed back up. Strong front paws let them grip trunks, and they can drop well over ten metres without injury. They're hard to find in the wild; most people see them in zoos.","fact":"2009 年，巴布亚新几内亚在莫罗贝省建立了全国第一个保护区 YUS，就是为了保护这里特有的马氏树袋鼠。三十多个村子的人一起承诺：在这片地上不打猎、不砍树、不开矿，土地还是村民自己的。","fact_en":"In 2009 Papua New Guinea set up its first national conservation area, YUS in Morobe Province, to protect the local Matschie's tree-kangaroo. Over 35 villages pledged no hunting, logging or mining on the land, which stays under their ownership.","src":"Wikipedia · YUS Conservation Area","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/YUS_Conservation_Area","say":{"en":"Is it usually up high, or does it come down to eat?","zh":"它一般待在高处，还是会下来吃东西？"}},"椰子蟹":{"what":"太平洋和印度洋小岛上的大陆地蟹，展开腿将近一米，能爬上椰子树。","what_en":"A giant land crab of Pacific and Indian Ocean islands — nearly a metre across with legs spread, able to climb coconut palms.","fame":"它是世界上最大的陆地节肢动物，钳子力气大得能把椰子剥开。小时候在海里长，长大就再也不会游泳了。在瓦努阿图的桑托岛，晚上跟导游拿手电去看。","fame_en":"It's the largest land-living arthropod in the world, with claws strong enough to tear open coconuts. It starts life in the sea, but as an adult it can't swim. On Vanuatu's Espiritu Santo you go out with a guide and a torch at night to see one.","fact":"2016 年日本冲绳的研究团队测了 29 只椰子蟹的夹力：最大的一只能夹出约 3300 牛顿，差不多是它自己体重的 90 倍，是测过的甲壳动物里最强的，跟狮子、老虎的咬力差不多。","fact_en":"In 2016 a team in Okinawa measured the pinch of 29 coconut crabs: the biggest reached about 3,300 newtons — roughly 90 times its body weight, the strongest of any crustacean tested and close to the bite of a lion or tiger.","src":"Smithsonian Magazine，2016 年","url":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/coconut-crab-among-strongest-pinch-world-180961215/","say":{"en":"How close can we get without it pinching us?","zh":"我们离多远，它才不会夹到我们？"}},"帕劳鲨鱼保护区":{"what":"西太平洋岛国帕劳的海域，2009 年成为世界上第一个鲨鱼保护区，全国海里都不许捕鲨鱼。","what_en":"The waters of Palau in the western Pacific, which became the world's first shark sanctuary in 2009 — no shark fishing anywhere in its seas.","fame":"这里是潜水的人心里的圣地：在「蓝角」（Blue Corner）这样的潜点，一次下水就能看到几十条灰礁鲨在面前巡游。帕劳人觉得鲨鱼活着比死了值钱。","fame_en":"It's a pilgrimage site for divers: at spots like Blue Corner, a single dive can show you dozens of grey reef sharks patrolling past. Palauans see sharks as worth more alive than dead.","fact":"2011 年澳大利亚海洋科学研究所算了一笔账：帕劳潜点的一条礁鲨，一辈子能带来大约 190 万美元的潜水旅游收入，而杀了卖掉只值 108 美元。","fact_en":"A 2011 study by the Australian Institute of Marine Science found that a single reef shark at Palau's dive sites brings in about US$1.9 million in diving tourism over its life — versus US$108 if killed and sold.","src":"Pew 慈善信托，2011 年","url":"https://www.pew.org/en/research-and-analysis/reports/2011/05/02/milliondollar-reef-sharks","say":{"en":"How many sharks do we usually see at Blue Corner?","zh":"在蓝角一般能看到多少条鲨鱼？"}},"雅浦蝠鲼":{"what":"密克罗尼西亚雅浦岛海峡里的蝠鲼，两翼展开好几米，常年住在这里。","what_en":"The manta rays of the channels around Yap in Micronesia — wings spanning several metres, living there year-round.","fame":"雅浦是少数一年四季都能看到蝠鲼的地方。蝠鲼会游到「清洁站」，停在珊瑚上方让小鱼帮它清理身体，潜水员就安静地趴在旁边看。","fame_en":"Yap is one of the few places you can see mantas all year. They glide into 'cleaning stations' and hover over the coral while small fish clean them, and divers lie quietly nearby to watch.","fact":"2008 年雅浦州立法建了蝠鲼保护区，范围是岛周围 12 海里、约 8243 平方英里的海域，包括蝠鲼被清洁、吃东西和可能生孩子的红树林和内湖。","fact_en":"In 2008 Yap State passed a law creating a manta ray sanctuary covering about 8,243 square miles out to 12 miles offshore — including the mangroves and lagoons where mantas are cleaned, feed and are believed to give birth.","src":"Hawaii News Now，2008 年","url":"https://www.hawaiinewsnow.com/story/8923905/the-manta-rays-of-micronesia-are-now-protected/","say":{"en":"Should we stay still on the bottom when the mantas come?","zh":"蝠鲼来的时候，我们要趴在底下不动吗？"}},"袋鼠岛":{"what":"南澳大利亚海外的一座大岛，岛上野生动物比人多：袋鼠、海狮、考拉、海豹都有。","what_en":"A large island off South Australia where wildlife outnumbers people — kangaroos, sea lions, koalas and fur seals.","fame":"被叫作「澳大利亚的加拉帕戈斯」。在海豹湾可以跟着护林员走到沙滩上，离躺着晒太阳的澳洲海狮只有几米。岛上还有自己的袋鼠亚种，个头小、毛色深。","fame_en":"It's called 'Australia's Galápagos'. At Seal Bay a ranger walks you onto the beach, a few metres from sunbathing Australian sea lions. The island even has its own smaller, darker kangaroo subspecies.","fact":"2019 年底到 2020 年初的山火烧掉了岛上差不多一半的土地。一项 2021 年的研究估计，岛上大约八成考拉死了——而这群考拉原本是澳洲少有的、没有衣原体病的大种群。","fact_en":"The bushfires of late 2019 and early 2020 burned roughly half the island. A 2021 study estimated that about 80% of its koalas died — one of Australia's last large koala populations free of chlamydia.","src":"Animals 期刊论文（PubMed），2021 年","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34827969/","say":{"en":"How close can we walk to the sea lions?","zh":"我们能走到离海狮多近？"}},"秋田犬":{"what":"日本东北秋田县的大型犬，耳朵竖、尾巴卷，性格沉稳，对主人特别忠心。","what_en":"A large dog from Akita in northern Japan — pricked ears, curled tail, calm, and famously loyal to its owner.","fame":"忠犬八公就是秋田犬：主人上野教授去世后，它每天去涩谷站等，等了将近十年。涩谷站前的八公像成了东京最有名的碰头地点。养的人说它不爱叫，但很护家。","fame_en":"Hachikō was an Akita: after his owner Professor Ueno died, he went to Shibuya Station to wait every day for nearly ten years. His statue there is Tokyo's best-known meeting spot. Owners say Akitas rarely bark but guard the home fiercely.","fact":"2015 年，八公去世 80 周年时，东京大学农学部校园里立了一座新铜像：八公扑上去迎接下班回来的上野教授。这是他们第一次在雕像里「重逢」。","fact_en":"In 2015, 80 years after Hachikō died, the University of Tokyo unveiled a new bronze on its agriculture campus showing Hachikō leaping up to greet Professor Ueno after work — the pair finally 'reunited' in a statue.","src":"Wikipedia · Hidesaburō Ueno","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hidesabur%C5%8D_Ueno","say":{"en":"Is the Akita okay with strangers, or should I ask before petting?","zh":"秋田犬对陌生人还好吗？摸之前要不要先问一下？"}},"美丽海水族馆":{"what":"冲绳本岛北部的水族馆，最有名的是一个巨大的水槽「黑潮之海」，里面游着鲸鲨和蝠鲼。","what_en":"An aquarium in northern Okinawa, famous for its giant 'Kuroshio Sea' tank where whale sharks and manta rays swim.","fame":"大水槽前面是一整面玻璃墙，人站在前面显得特别小。鲸鲨是世界上最大的鱼，喂食的时候它会竖起来张大嘴吸东西。水族馆在海洋博公园里，外面就是蓝色的海。","fame_en":"The big tank has a single huge acrylic wall that makes visitors look tiny. Whale sharks — the world's largest fish — go vertical and open wide to suck in food at feeding time. The aquarium sits in Ocean Expo Park right by the sea.","fact":"水族馆里的鲸鲨「甚太」从 1995 年就住在这里，是世界上人工饲养时间最长的鲸鲨，来时 4.6 米，现在长到 8 米多。2007 年，这里还第一次让礁蝠鲼在水族馆里生下了宝宝。","fact_en":"The whale shark Jinta has lived here since 1995 — the longest any whale shark has been kept in captivity — growing from 4.6 m to over 8 m. In 2007 the aquarium also had the first reef manta ray born in an aquarium.","src":"Wikipedia · Okinawa Churaumi Aquarium","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okinawa_Churaumi_Aquarium","say":{"en":"What time is the whale shark feeding?","zh":"鲸鲨几点喂食？"}},"吉尔亚洲狮":{"what":"印度古吉拉特邦吉尔森林里的亚洲狮，比非洲狮略小，公狮的鬃毛也短一些。","what_en":"Asiatic lions in the Gir forest of Gujarat, India — a little smaller than African lions, with shorter manes on the males.","fame":"全世界的野生亚洲狮只剩这里一处。一百多年前一度只剩几十只，当地王公和后来的印度政府一直保护。现在可以坐吉普车跟着向导进吉尔国家公园看狮子。","fame_en":"This is the only place left in the world where Asiatic lions live wild. A century ago they were down to a few dozen, and local rulers and then the Indian government protected them. Today you can enter Gir National Park on a guided jeep safari.","fact":"2025 年 5 月的普查数到 891 头亚洲狮，比 2020 年的 674 头多了两百多头。其中一半以上已经住到了保护区外面的村子和田野里，第一次在波尔本德尔、德瓦尔卡等地被正式记录到。","fact_en":"The May 2025 census counted 891 Asiatic lions, up from 674 in 2020. More than half now live outside the protected forest, in villages and farmland, and they were officially recorded in places like Porbandar and Dwarka for the first time.","src":"Down To Earth，2025 年","url":"https://www.downtoearth.org.in/wildlife-biodiversity/asiatic-lion-population-in-gujarat-rises-from-674-to-891-in-5-years-spreading-beyond-traditional-habitats","say":{"en":"Which safari route gives us the best chance to see lions?","zh":"哪条游猎路线最有机会看到狮子？"}},"柴犬":{"what":"日本本土最小的古老犬种，红褐色毛、卷尾巴、笑眯眯的脸。","what_en":"Japan's smallest native ancient breed — red-brown coat, curled tail and a smiley face.","fame":"养柴犬的人都说它「像猫」：独立、爱干净、不太黏人，不想走的时候会在路上耍赖不动，还会发出「柴犬尖叫」。网上的「doge」表情包就是一只叫 Kabosu 的柴犬。","fame_en":"Owners say Shibas are 'like cats': independent, clean and not clingy. When they don't want to walk they plant themselves on the pavement, and they're known for the 'Shiba scream'. The 'doge' meme is a Shiba named Kabosu.","fact":"Kabosu 在 2024 年 5 月去世，大约 18 岁。2023 年 11 月，网友众筹在它的家乡千叶县佐仓市立了一座它的铜像——就是那个歪头斜眼看镜头的表情包姿势。","fact_en":"Kabosu died in May 2024, at about 18. In November 2023 fans had crowdfunded a bronze statue of her in her hometown of Sakura, Chiba — in her famous sideways-glance meme pose.","src":"Hyperallergic，2024 年","url":"https://hyperallergic.com/such-sad-kabosu-dog-who-inspired-doge-meme-dies-at-18","say":{"en":"Is your Shiba friendly, or does it prefer its space?","zh":"你的柴犬亲人吗，还是喜欢自己待着？"}},"哈士奇":{"what":"西伯利亚雪橇犬，来自俄罗斯西伯利亚，毛厚、眼睛常常是蓝色的，天生能拉雪橇跑很远。","what_en":"The Siberian Husky, from Siberia in Russia — thick-coated, often blue-eyed, and bred to pull sleds over long distances.","fame":"楚科奇人养它在冰天雪地里拉雪橇跑远路。养哈士奇的人说它不爱汪汪叫，但特别爱「嚎」，精力旺、爱跑、会拆家，一天不遛够就闹。在芬兰拉普兰可以坐哈士奇拉的雪橇。","fame_en":"The Chukchi people bred it to pull sleds over long distances in deep cold. Owners say huskies rarely bark but love to howl — high-energy runners that wreck the house if they don't get enough exercise. In Finnish Lapland you can ride a husky sled.","fact":"1925 年冬天，阿拉斯加诺姆镇爆发白喉，血清只能靠狗拉雪橇送去：20 个雪橇手接力 5 天半跑了 1085 公里。跑最长最险一段的是哈士奇 Togo，最后进镇的是 Balto。","fact_en":"In the winter of 1925, diphtheria broke out in Nome, Alaska, and the serum could only arrive by dog sled: 20 mushers relayed it 1,085 km in five and a half days. Togo ran the longest, most dangerous leg; Balto led the team into town.","src":"Wikipedia · 1925 serum run to Nome","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1925_serum_run_to_Nome","say":{"en":"How many dogs pull one sled, and can I drive it myself?","zh":"一辆雪橇几只狗拉？我能自己驾吗？"}},"中华田园犬":{"what":"中国农村和城里到处都有的本地狗，大家叫它「土狗」，黄的、黑的、花的都有。","what_en":"China's local dogs, found in every village and town — people call them 'tugou', native dogs, in yellow, black or patched coats.","fame":"它不是注册过的品种，而是几千年在中国乡下自然留下来的狗：聪明、皮实、少生病、看家好。越来越多城里人去救助站领养「田园犬」，网上也有人专门晒自家的大黄。","fame_en":"It isn't a registered breed but the dogs that have lived in China's countryside for thousands of years — clever, tough, healthy and good guard dogs. More city people now adopt them from shelters, and plenty show off their own 'Da Huang' online.","fact":"2015 年一项全基因组研究比较了世界各地的狗，发现中国南方等地的本土狗遗传多样性最高、和狼最接近，认为狗可能大约 3.3 万年前起源于东亚南部。不过狗到底起源在哪，学界还在争论。","fact_en":"A 2015 whole-genome study comparing dogs worldwide found indigenous dogs from southern East Asia had the highest genetic diversity and sat closest to wolves, suggesting dogs may have originated there about 33,000 years ago — though where dogs first came from is still debated.","src":"Cell Research 论文（PMC），2015 年","url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4816135","say":{"en":"Is this dog up for adoption? Is it good with kids?","zh":"这只狗可以领养吗？跟小孩合得来吗？"}},"暹罗猫":{"what":"来自泰国（古称暹罗）的猫，身子浅色，脸、耳朵、脚和尾巴是深色，眼睛蓝蓝的。","what_en":"A cat from Thailand (old name Siam) — pale body, darker face, ears, paws and tail, and blue eyes.","fame":"养暹罗猫的人都说它特别爱「说话」，会跟着人一直叫，像在聊天；很黏人，不喜欢一个人待着。泰国古书《猫诗》里就画过这种猫，以前是王宫和寺庙里的猫。","fame_en":"Siamese owners say it 'talks' constantly, following you around meowing like it's chatting; it's clingy and hates being alone. It appears in the old Thai manuscript Tamra Maew (the Cat-Book Poems), and was once a cat of palaces and temples.","fact":"它的深色「重点色」是温度决定的：一种管色素的酶只在体温较低的地方工作，所以耳朵、鼻子、脚、尾巴这些凉的地方才变深。小猫刚出生是全白的，住在冷地方的暹罗猫颜色也会更深。","fact_en":"Its dark 'points' are set by temperature: the enzyme that makes pigment only works in cooler skin, so the ears, nose, paws and tail darken. Kittens are born all white, and Siamese living in colder places get darker.","src":"Wikipedia · Point coloration","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Point_coloration","say":{"en":"Is it always this chatty?","zh":"它一直都这么爱叫吗？"}},"橘猫":{"what":"橘黄色毛的猫，中国网友叫它「大橘」。橘猫是一种毛色，不是一个品种。","what_en":"Orange-coated cats, nicknamed 'Da Ju' (Big Orange) by Chinese netizens. Orange is a coat colour, not a breed.","fame":"网上有句话叫「十只橘猫九只胖，还有一只特别胖」，因为大家觉得橘猫特别能吃。它们在中国、日本、欧美的流浪猫里都很常见，大概八成是公猫。","fame_en":"Chinese internet slang says 'nine out of ten orange cats are fat — and the tenth is extra fat', because they're thought to be big eaters. They're common among street cats everywhere, and around 80% are male.","fact":"橘色基因在 X 染色体上，所以橘猫大多是公猫。2025 年，美国斯坦福大学和日本九州大学的团队各自发现了到底是哪个基因：ARHGAP36 旁边少了一小段 DNA，让色素细胞做出浅红的色素。","fact_en":"The orange gene sits on the X chromosome, which is why most orange cats are male. In 2025 teams at Stanford and Kyushu University independently pinned it down: a small deletion near the gene ARHGAP36 makes pigment cells produce light red pigment.","src":"New Atlas，2025 年","url":"https://newatlas.com/biology/orange-cats-gene","say":{"en":"How much should I feed him? He's always hungry.","zh":"该喂他多少？他总是饿。"}},"狸花猫":{"what":"中国本土的猫，身上是棕灰色的虎斑条纹，眼睛大，脸上有「M」形花纹。","what_en":"China's own native cat — brown-grey tabby stripes, big eyes and an 'M' marking on the forehead.","fame":"以前家家户户养来抓老鼠，身体结实、少生病、聪明，就是有点「高冷」、有主见。城里的小区、菜市场、茶馆里常能看到。养的人会说「狸花猫不认生，就认你」。","fame_en":"Families kept them for catching mice — tough, healthy and smart, if a bit aloof and strong-willed. You see them in housing compounds, markets and teahouses. Owners joke that a lihua 'doesn't trust everyone, only you'.","fact":"2010 年 2 月，美国的爱猫者协会（CFA）让「中国狸花」（Chinese Li Hua）进了展会的「待定」组。五年里一共只有大约 50 只参展，美国只有一家在繁育，2015 年 5 月就被撤掉了。","fact_en":"In February 2010 the US-based Cat Fanciers' Association (CFA) accepted the 'Chinese Li Hua' for showing in its Miscellaneous class. Over five years only about 50 were shown and just one US breeder was active, so it was dropped in May 2015.","src":"Wikipedia · Dragon Li","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Li","say":{"en":"Is she a street cat, or does she belong to someone?","zh":"她是流浪猫，还是有主人的？"}},"斑点狗":{"what":"白底黑点的大狗，名字来自克罗地亚的达尔马提亚。","what_en":"A big white dog with black spots, named after Dalmatia in Croatia.","fame":"以前跟着马车跑、守着马厩，所以在美国成了消防站的狗；电影《101 斑点狗》让全世界都认识了它。精力特别旺，一天要跑很久。","fame_en":"It used to run beside horse carriages and guard stables, which is how it became the fire-station dog in the US; the film 101 Dalmatians made it famous worldwide. It has huge energy and needs long runs every day.","fact":"斑点狗刚生下来是全白的，身上没有一个点——黑点要过一两个星期才慢慢长出来，之后还会一直变多变深。","fact_en":"Dalmatian puppies are born completely white, without a single spot — the spots start appearing after a week or two and keep filling in as they grow.","src":"Hill's Pet · Dalmatian","url":"https://www.hillspet.com/dog-care/dog-breeds/dalmatian","say":{"en":"Is he friendly? Can I say hello?","zh":"它友好吗？我能跟它打个招呼吗？"}},"安哥拉猫":{"what":"土耳其安卡拉的长毛白猫，常常一只眼睛蓝、一只眼睛黄。","what_en":"A long-haired white cat from Ankara, Turkey, often with one blue eye and one amber eye.","fame":"世界上最古老的长毛猫之一；身体细长、毛像丝一样，性格活泼爱玩，喜欢跟着人转。安卡拉的「Angora」就是安卡拉的旧名。","fame_en":"One of the oldest long-haired cat breeds — slim, silky and playful, it follows people around. 'Angora' is simply the old name of Ankara.","fact":"差点消失的时候，是安卡拉动物园把它救了回来：动物园专门繁育白色的安哥拉猫，最看重「鸳鸯眼」；1962 年前后美国人从这里带走一对，安哥拉猫才在外国重新有了血统登记。","fact_en":"When the breed was fading, Ankara Zoo kept it going with its own breeding programme for white Angoras, especially odd-eyed ones; around 1962 an American couple took a pair from the zoo, which restarted the breed abroad.","src":"Wikipedia · Turkish Angora","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turkish_Angora","say":{"en":"Is it true some of them can't hear on the blue-eyed side?","zh":"听说有的猫蓝眼睛那一侧的耳朵听不见，是真的吗？"}},"波斯猫":{"what":"扁脸、长毛、圆眼睛的猫，祖先来自古代波斯（伊朗）。","what_en":"A flat-faced, long-haired, round-eyed cat whose ancestors came from Persia (Iran).","fame":"世界上最有名的长毛猫，性子特别安静，喜欢躺着不动；但长毛每天要梳，扁脸的容易流眼泪、呼吸不顺，养的人最常聊的就是梳毛和看兽医。","fame_en":"The world's best-known long-haired cat, very calm and happy to lie still; but the coat needs daily brushing, and flat-faced ones often have runny eyes and breathing trouble — that's what owners talk about most.","fact":"常说意大利旅行家 Pietro della Valle 1620 年把长毛猫从波斯带回欧洲——不过这件事其实没坐实：他只在 1620 年的信里说过想带猫回去，后来的记录里再没提。","fact_en":"It's often said the Italian traveller Pietro della Valle brought long-haired cats from Persia to Europe in 1620 — but it's not proven: he only wrote in a 1620 letter that he intended to, and later records never mention the cats.","src":"Wikipedia · Persian cat","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Persian_cat","say":{"en":"How often do I need to brush her?","zh":"她多久要梳一次毛？"}},"高卢雄鸡":{"what":"一只公鸡，是法国的象征，法国国家足球队的队徽上就有它。","what_en":"A rooster — the symbol of France, right on the French national football team's badge.","fame":"法国人在球场、橄榄球赛、奥运会上都会举着公鸡；法国人说自己骄傲时还会喊「Cocorico！」（公鸡叫）。","fame_en":"French fans carry roosters at football, rugby and the Olympics; when the French feel proud they even shout 'Cocorico!' — the rooster's crow.","fact":"这个象征来自一个拉丁文双关：gallus 既是「公鸡」，也是「高卢人」。一开始是外国人拿来笑话法国人的；1909 年起，公鸡开始出现在法国队的蓝色球衣上。","fact_en":"It began as a Latin pun: gallus meant both 'rooster' and 'a Gaul'. At first France's enemies used it to mock the French; since 1909 the rooster has been on the French team's blue shirts.","src":"Wikipedia · Gallic rooster","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gallic_rooster","say":{"en":"Allez les Bleus! Where's the best place to watch the match?","zh":"法国队加油！哪里看球最好？"}},"康尼马拉小马":{"what":"爱尔兰西海岸康尼马拉的小马，爱尔兰唯一的本土马种。","what_en":"A pony from Connemara on Ireland's west coast — Ireland's only native horse breed.","fame":"在石头多、风大的海边长大，个子小却很结实、跳得高、脾气好，大人小孩都能骑，现在世界各地都有人养来跳障碍。","fame_en":"Raised on rocky, windy coastland, it's small but tough, a strong jumper and good-natured — fine for adults and children — and is now bred worldwide for show jumping.","fact":"康尼马拉小马育种协会 1923 年成立，第二年办了第一届小马展，只有 150 匹参加；现在每年夏天在克利夫登（Clifden）的小马展有七百多匹报名，2020 年是唯一一次停办。","fact_en":"The Connemara Pony Breeders' Society was founded in 1923 and held its first show the next year with 150 entries; today the summer show in Clifden draws over 700, and 2020 was the only year it was cancelled.","src":"Connemara Pony Breeders' Society · History","url":"https://cpbs.ie/history-1","say":{"en":"Can kids ride him, or is he only for jumping?","zh":"小孩能骑它吗，还是只用来跳障碍？"}},"罗马母狼":{"what":"一尊青铜母狼正给两个小男孩喂奶，是罗马城的标志。","what_en":"A bronze she-wolf feeding two baby boys — the emblem of Rome.","fame":"传说母狼救活了被扔进台伯河的双胞胎罗慕路斯和雷穆斯，后来罗慕路斯建立了罗马。真身在卡比托利欧博物馆，罗马的路牌、井盖、罗马队队徽上到处是它。","fame_en":"Legend says the wolf saved the twins Romulus and Remus, abandoned by the Tiber, and Romulus went on to found Rome. The original is in the Capitoline Museums, and copies are everywhere — on signs, manhole covers and the AS Roma badge.","fact":"下面那对双胞胎是 15 世纪才加上去的；2000 年代的放射性碳测年还说母狼本身可能是 11–12 世纪做的，不是古罗马——不过学者到现在还在争。","fact_en":"The twins were only added in the 15th century, and radiocarbon tests in the 2000s suggested the wolf itself may date from the 11th–12th century rather than ancient Rome — though scholars still argue about it.","src":"Wikipedia · Capitoline Wolf","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capitoline_Wolf","say":{"en":"Is this the original, or a copy?","zh":"这个是真品还是复制品？"}},"西斯廷海鸥":{"what":"2013 年选教宗时，站在西斯廷礼拜堂烟囱上的一只海鸥。","what_en":"The seagull that sat on the Sistine Chapel chimney during the 2013 papal election.","fame":"选教宗时全世界的镜头都盯着烟囱等白烟，结果这只海鸥在上面站了很久，成了那一天全网最红的「明星」。","fame_en":"The world's cameras were fixed on the chimney waiting for white smoke, and this gull stood on it for ages — becoming the internet's biggest star that day.","fact":"它当天就有了一个推特账号 @SistineSeagull，一天里涨了几千个粉丝；后来几次选教宗，海鸥又落到礼拜堂屋顶上，又火了一次。","fact_en":"Within the day it had its own parody Twitter account, @SistineSeagull, which gained thousands of followers; gulls have turned up on the chapel roof at later conclaves too, going viral again.","src":"ABC News · Seagull on Sistine Chapel chimney","url":"https://abcnews.go.com/blogs/technology/2013/03/seagull-perched-on-sistine-chapel-chimney-draws-twitter-meme-antics","say":{"en":"Is that smoke white or black?","zh":"那烟是白的还是黑的？"}},"伊比利亚猞猁":{"what":"西班牙和葡萄牙的野猫，耳尖上有黑色簇毛，脸边长着「胡子」。","what_en":"A wild cat of Spain and Portugal with black ear tufts and a bearded face.","fame":"世界上最濒危的猫科动物之一，几乎只吃野兔；在西班牙多尼亚纳国家公园和安达卢西亚的山里才能看到。","fame_en":"Once among the world's most endangered cats, it eats almost nothing but rabbits; you can see it in Doñana National Park and the hills of Andalusia.","fact":"2001 年野外的成年猞猁只有 62 只，2022 年涨到 648 只，算上小猞猁总数已经超过 2000 只；2024 年 6 月 IUCN 把它从「濒危」降为「易危」。现在最大的危险是公路和兔子的疫病。","fact_en":"In 2001 there were just 62 adult lynx in the wild; by 2022 there were 648, and over 2,000 counting young ones — so in June 2024 the IUCN moved it from Endangered to Vulnerable. Roads and rabbit diseases are now the biggest dangers.","src":"IUCN · Iberian lynx improves to Vulnerable (2024)","url":"https://iucn.org/press-release/202406/iberian-lynx-rebounding-thanks-conservation-action-iucn-red-list","say":{"en":"Is there any chance of seeing a lynx on this trail?","zh":"这条路上有机会看到猞猁吗？"}},"葡萄牙水犬":{"what":"葡萄牙渔民的狗，卷毛、脚趾间有蹼，很会游泳。","what_en":"The Portuguese fishermen's dog — curly-coated, web-footed and a strong swimmer.","fame":"以前在阿尔加维的渔船上跳进海里赶鱼进网、叼回掉下去的东西、在船和船之间送信；几乎不掉毛，所以对狗毛过敏的人也常选它。","fame_en":"In the Algarve it used to dive off boats to herd fish into nets, fetch lost gear and carry messages between boats; it barely sheds, so people with allergies often choose it.","fact":"美国前总统奥巴马家的两只狗 Bo（2009 年）和 Sunny（2013 年）都是葡萄牙水犬，选它就是因为女儿玛利亚对狗毛过敏。","fact_en":"The Obamas' two White House dogs, Bo (2009) and Sunny (2013), were both Portuguese water dogs — chosen because daughter Malia is allergic to dogs.","src":"Wikipedia · Bo (dog)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bo_(dog)","say":{"en":"Does he shed much? My daughter has allergies.","zh":"它掉毛多吗？我女儿过敏。"}},"德国牧羊犬":{"what":"立耳朵、黑背黄腿的大狗，中国人常叫它「黑背」。","what_en":"A big dog with upright ears, a black back and tan legs.","fame":"聪明、听话、胆子大，是世界上最常见的警犬、军犬和导盲犬之一；在家需要很多运动和训练，不然会无聊。","fame_en":"Smart, obedient and brave — one of the world's most common police, army and guide dogs; at home it needs lots of exercise and training or it gets bored.","fact":"整个品种都从一只狗开始：1899 年德国骑兵军官 Max von Stephanitz 在狗展上买下一只叫 Hektor 的狗，改名 Horand，登记成了德国牧羊犬的第 1 号。","fact_en":"The whole breed started with one dog: in 1899 cavalry officer Max von Stephanitz bought a dog called Hektor at a show, renamed him Horand, and registered him as German Shepherd No. 1.","src":"Wikipedia · Horand von Grafrath","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horand_von_Grafrath","say":{"en":"Is he a working dog? Am I allowed to pet him?","zh":"它是工作犬吗？我可以摸它吗？"}},"荷斯坦奶牛":{"what":"最常见的黑白花奶牛，祖先来自荷兰弗里斯兰和德国北部。","what_en":"The familiar black-and-white dairy cow, whose ancestors came from Friesland in the Netherlands and northern Germany.","fame":"产奶量是所有奶牛里最高的之一，超市里大部分牛奶都来自它；荷兰乡下平平的草地上到处是它。","fame_en":"It's one of the highest-yielding dairy breeds, so most supermarket milk comes from it; it dots the flat green fields of the Dutch countryside.","fact":"美国奶牛场里 90% 以上的牛是荷斯坦；纪录是威斯康星州一头牛 2016 年一年产了 77,480 磅（约 35 吨）牛奶。","fact_en":"Over 90% of the cows on US dairy farms are Holsteins; the record is a Wisconsin cow that gave 77,480 lb (about 35 tonnes) of milk in one year, in 2016.","src":"Holstein Association USA · Holstein 101","url":"https://www.holsteinusa.com/holstein_breed/holstein101.html","say":{"en":"Can we watch the cows being milked?","zh":"我们能看挤奶吗？"}},"比利时挽马":{"what":"比利时的大个子农用马，红棕色、腿粗、脾气温和。","what_en":"Belgium's giant farm horse — chestnut, thick-legged and gentle.","fame":"世界上最强壮的马种之一，以前拉犁、拉运河上的船、拉啤酒车；现在在比利时和法国北部的乡村节日上还能看到它们比赛拉重。","fame_en":"One of the strongest horse breeds — it once pulled ploughs, canal barges and brewery wagons; today you can still see them in pulling contests at village fairs in Belgium and northern France.","fact":"有记录最重的马之一 Brooklyn Supreme 就是比利时马：体重约 1450 公斤（3200 磅），胸围 3 米多，1948 年去世。","fact_en":"One of the heaviest horses on record, Brooklyn Supreme, was a Belgian: about 1,450 kg (3,200 lb) with a girth of over 3 m; he died in 1948.","src":"Wikipedia · Brooklyn Supreme","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brooklyn_Supreme","say":{"en":"How much does he weigh? Can I stroke his nose?","zh":"它有多重？我能摸摸它的鼻子吗？"}},"圣伯纳犬":{"what":"瑞士阿尔卑斯山上的大型救援犬，长得憨、个子大。","what_en":"The big, gentle rescue dog of the Swiss Alps.","fame":"大圣伯纳德山口的修道院从 1700 年前后就养它，帮修士在雪里找迷路的旅人；现在夏天还能去山口的狗舍和博物馆看它们。","fame_en":"Monks at the Great St Bernard Pass hospice kept them from around 1700 to find lost travellers in the snow; in summer you can still visit the dogs at the pass.","fact":"最有名的那只叫 Barry，传说救过 40 多个人，现在做成标本放在伯尔尼自然史博物馆；而脖子上挂小酒桶，修道院的记录里从来没有——是画家画出来的。","fact_en":"The most famous one, Barry, is said to have saved over 40 people and is now on display at the Natural History Museum in Bern; the little brandy barrel never appears in the hospice records — painters made it up.","src":"Swissinfo · Barry the St Bernard","url":"https://www.swissinfo.ch/eng/culture/four-legged-legend_barry-the-st-bernard--from-farm-dog-to-national-hero/40487994","say":{"en":"Where can we see the dogs at the pass?","zh":"在山口哪里能看到狗？"}},"利皮扎马":{"what":"维也纳西班牙骑术学校的白马，会跟着音乐跳「马术芭蕾」。","what_en":"The white horses of Vienna's Spanish Riding School, which perform 'horse ballet' to music.","fame":"哈布斯堡王朝用西班牙马培育出来的品种，在霍夫堡皇宫的冬季骑术厅表演，跳跃、原地小跑都是几百年传下来的动作；早上的训练也可以买票去看。","fame_en":"Bred by the Habsburgs from Spanish horses, they perform in the Winter Riding School at the Hofburg palace, with leaps and steps passed down for centuries; you can also buy tickets to watch morning training.","fact":"小马生下来是黑的或深棕色，要长到六七岁以后才慢慢变成白色；2015 年西班牙骑术学校的马术被列入联合国教科文组织的非物质文化遗产。","fact_en":"Foals are born black or dark brown and only turn white over six years or more; in 2015 the Spanish Riding School's horsemanship was added to UNESCO's intangible cultural heritage list.","src":"UNESCO · Classical horsemanship and the High School of the Spanish Riding School Vienna","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/classical-horsemanship-and-the-high-school-of-the-spanish-riding-school-vienna-01106","say":{"en":"Are there tickets left for the morning training?","zh":"早上训练的票还有吗？"}},"圣诞鲤鱼":{"what":"捷克人平安夜吃的炸鲤鱼，鲤鱼大多来自南波希米亚的鱼塘。","what_en":"The fried carp Czechs eat on Christmas Eve, mostly raised in South Bohemia's fishponds.","fame":"南波希米亚挖鱼塘养鲤鱼已经几百年，每年秋冬「捞塘」是大事；圣诞前，街头会摆出大水桶卖活鲤鱼，炸鲤鱼配土豆沙拉是平安夜的正餐。","fame_en":"South Bohemia has farmed carp in man-made ponds for centuries, and the autumn pond harvest is a big event; before Christmas, vats of live carp appear on the streets, and fried carp with potato salad is the Christmas Eve dinner.","fact":"很多人家把活鲤鱼带回家养在浴缸里，等到平安夜；有小孩的人家有时会在 12 月 24 日早上把它放回河里，再买另一条来吃。还有人把一片鱼鳞放进钱包，说一年都不缺钱。","fact_en":"Many families take a live carp home to the bathtub until Christmas Eve; some with small children release it into a river on the morning of 24 December and buy another to eat. Others keep a scale in their wallet for money all year.","src":"Radio Prague International · Carp, a traditional Czech Christmas meal","url":"https://english.radio.cz/node/8045489","say":{"en":"Can you kill and clean it for me, please?","zh":"能帮我把鱼杀好、收拾干净吗？"}},"欧洲野牛":{"what":"欧洲最大的陆地动物，生活在波兰和白俄罗斯边上的比亚沃维耶扎原始森林。","what_en":"Europe's largest land animal, living in the Białowieża primeval forest on the Poland–Belarus border.","fame":"一度在野外完全消失，靠动物园里剩下的几十头一点点繁育回来；比亚沃维耶扎国家公园是看它最好的地方，还是世界遗产。","fame_en":"It once vanished from the wild and was bred back from a few dozen animals in zoos; Białowieża National Park, a World Heritage site, is the best place to see it.","fact":"野外最后一头 1921 年在比亚沃维耶扎被打死，全世界只剩 54 头圈养的；1950 年代开始放归，到 2019 年野外已经超过 6200 头，IUCN 2020 年把它从「易危」降到「近危」。","fact_en":"The last wild one was shot in Białowieża in 1921, leaving just 54 in captivity; releases began in the 1950s, and by 2019 there were over 6,200 in the wild — in 2020 the IUCN moved it from Vulnerable to Near Threatened.","src":"Science in Poland · European bison less endangered, says IUCN Red List","url":"https://scienceinpoland.pl/en/news/news%2C85487%2Ceuropean-bison-less-endangered-says-iucn-red-list.html","say":{"en":"What time of day are we most likely to see bison?","zh":"一天里什么时候最可能看到野牛？"}},"卷毛猪":{"what":"匈牙利的曼加利察猪，身上长着像羊一样的卷毛。","what_en":"Hungary's Mangalica pig, covered in curly, sheep-like wool.","fame":"能在冬天的户外过日子，肥肉多、肉质有大理石纹，被叫做「猪里的神户牛」；在匈牙利大平原的农场和布达佩斯的肉铺里都能看到。","fame_en":"Hardy enough to live outdoors in winter, with rich, marbled fat — it's called 'the Kobe beef of pork'; you'll find it on farms on the Great Hungarian Plain and in Budapest butcher shops.","fact":"1991 年整个匈牙利只剩不到 200 头，差点灭绝；后来匈牙利学者和一家西班牙火腿公司一起把它救回来，现在每年能生几万头小猪。","fact_en":"By 1991 fewer than 200 were left in Hungary and the breed nearly died out; a Hungarian scientist and a Spanish ham company brought it back, and tens of thousands of piglets are now born each year.","src":"Wikipedia · Mangalica","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mangalica","say":{"en":"Is this Mangalica? How should I cook it?","zh":"这是曼加利察猪肉吗？应该怎么做？"}},"赞特海龟":{"what":"希腊扎金索斯岛（赞特岛）沙滩上产蛋的红海龟。","what_en":"The loggerhead sea turtles that nest on the beaches of Zakynthos (Zante), Greece.","fame":"每年夏天母海龟夜里爬上拉加纳斯湾的沙滩挖洞产蛋，是整个地中海最重要的红海龟产卵地；沙滩上插着小木框保护龟窝。","fame_en":"Every summer females crawl up the beaches of Laganas Bay at night to lay eggs — the most important loggerhead nesting site in the Mediterranean; little wooden frames protect the nests on the sand.","fact":"1999 年这里成立了扎金索斯国家海洋公园，是地中海第一个为保护海龟建的国家公园；夏天晚上沙滩不让人进，2024 年一季就记到了 2400 多个龟窝。","fact_en":"In 1999 the National Marine Park of Zakynthos was set up — the first national park in the Mediterranean created to protect sea turtles; beaches close to people at night in summer, and over 2,400 nests were recorded in the 2024 season.","src":"Wikipedia · National Marine Park of Zakynthos","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Marine_Park_of_Zakynthos","say":{"en":"Is the beach closed at night because of the turtles?","zh":"海滩晚上关闭是因为海龟吗？"}},"俄罗斯棕熊":{"what":"俄罗斯森林里的大棕熊，常被当作俄罗斯的象征。","what_en":"The big brown bear of Russia's forests, often used as a symbol of Russia.","fame":"俄罗斯是世界上棕熊最多的国家，从欧洲的森林到远东的堪察加都有；在堪察加还能看它们在河里抓三文鱼。","fame_en":"Russia has more brown bears than any other country, from its European forests to Kamchatka in the Far East, where you can watch them catch salmon in rivers.","fact":"1980 年莫斯科奥运会的吉祥物「米沙」就是一只小棕熊，故意画得圆滚滚的，好让人别再觉得「俄罗斯熊」凶；闭幕式上，大气球米沙流着一滴眼泪飞上了天。","fact_en":"Misha, the mascot of the 1980 Moscow Olympics, was a brown bear cub drawn round and cuddly on purpose, to soften the fierce 'Russian bear' image; at the closing ceremony a giant balloon Misha shed a tear and floated away.","src":"Wikipedia · Misha","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Misha","say":{"en":"What should we do if we see a bear on the trail?","zh":"在路上遇到熊应该怎么办？"}},"驯鹿":{"what":"北极圈附近的鹿，北欧萨米人放牧它，圣诞老人的雪橇也靠它拉。","what_en":"The Arctic deer herded by the Sámi people of northern Scandinavia — and Santa's sleigh team.","fame":"挪威、瑞典、芬兰北部的萨米人几百年来跟着驯鹿迁徙，吃肉、穿皮、拉雪橇；冬天在芬马克还能坐驯鹿雪橇。","fame_en":"The Sámi of northern Norway, Sweden and Finland have followed reindeer herds for centuries, using them for meat, hides and sledges; in winter you can take a reindeer sledge ride in Finnmark.","fact":"驯鹿是唯一一种母鹿也长角的鹿；公鹿秋天交配后就掉角，母鹿的角一直留到春天——所以圣诞节拉雪橇、头上还有角的，多半是母鹿。","fact_en":"Reindeer are the only deer whose females also grow antlers; males drop theirs after the autumn rut, while females keep them until spring — so the antlered reindeer pulling a sleigh at Christmas are probably female.","src":"Britannica · Reindeer","url":"https://www.britannica.com/animal/reindeer","say":{"en":"Can we feed the reindeer, or is that not allowed?","zh":"可以喂驯鹿吗，还是不允许？"}},"瑞典驼鹿":{"what":"世界上最大的鹿，瑞典森林里有几十万头，公路边常有「小心驼鹿」的三角牌。","what_en":"The world's largest deer — Sweden's forests hold hundreds of thousands, and roads are lined with triangular 'moose crossing' signs.","fame":"公驼鹿站起来比人高，夏天傍晚在森林边、湖边最容易看到；瑞典有专门的驼鹿公园，可以近距离喂它。","fame_en":"A bull moose stands taller than a person; summer evenings by forests and lakes are the best time to see one, and Sweden has moose parks where you can feed them up close.","fact":"瑞典汽车杂志的「驼鹿测试」就是急打方向躲一头突然出现的驼鹿：1997 年刚上市的奔驰 A 级在测试里翻了车，奔驰只好暂停销售三个月、给车加装电子稳定系统。","fact_en":"Swedish car magazines' 'moose test' is a sudden swerve around a moose on the road: in 1997 the brand-new Mercedes A-Class rolled over in it, and Mercedes halted sales for three months to add electronic stability control.","src":"Wikipedia · Moose test","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moose_test","say":{"en":"When is the best time to see moose around here?","zh":"这附近什么时候最容易看到驼鹿？"}},"丹麦猪":{"what":"丹麦日德兰半岛的猪，丹麦的猪比人还多。","what_en":"The pigs of Jutland — Denmark has more pigs than people.","fame":"丹麦是世界上最大的猪肉出口国之一，培根、香肠和烤猪肉（flæskesteg）是丹麦人的家常菜；丹麦长白猪的血统遍布全世界的养猪场。","fame_en":"Denmark is one of the world's biggest pork exporters; bacon, sausages and crackling roast pork (flæskesteg) are everyday Danish food, and Danish Landrace bloodlines are found on pig farms worldwide.","fact":"丹麦有大约 1200 万头猪、3000 个养猪场；2019 年为了挡住非洲猪瘟，丹麦在和德国的边境上修了一道约 70 公里长的「野猪围栏」。","fact_en":"Denmark has about 12 million pigs on some 3,000 farms; in 2019, to keep out African swine fever, it built a roughly 70 km 'wild boar fence' along its border with Germany.","src":"NBC News · Denmark is building a border fence — to keep out wild boars","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/denmark-building-border-fence-keep-out-wild-boars-n963801","say":{"en":"One roast pork sandwich, please — extra crackling.","zh":"一个烤猪肉三明治，脆皮多一点。"}},"环斑海豹":{"what":"芬兰塞马湖里的海豹，世界上极少数只生活在淡水里的海豹。","what_en":"The seal of Finland's Lake Saimaa — one of the very few seals that live only in fresh water.","fame":"冰河时期被困在湖里，慢慢变成了独立的亚种；全世界只有塞马湖有，是芬兰人最心疼的动物之一，可以坐船在国家公园里远远看它晒太阳。","fame_en":"Trapped in the lake after the Ice Age, it became its own subspecies found only in Saimaa; Finns adore it, and you can watch it sunbathing from a boat in the national parks.","fact":"它只在雪堆里挖洞生宝宝，暖冬雪不够，志愿者就在冰上堆人工雪堆——2014 到 2024 年堆了 2000 多个，帮 360 只小海豹出生；2025 年数量约 530 只。","fact_en":"It gives birth only in lairs dug in snowdrifts, so in mild winters volunteers pile up artificial ones on the ice — over 2,000 from 2014 to 2024, sheltering 360 pups; the population was about 530 in 2025.","src":"Metsähallitus · Saimaa ringed seal population","url":"https://www.metsa.fi/en/press-releases/saimaa-ringed-seal-population-continues-gradual-growth-majority-of-growth-observed-south-of-savonlinna","say":{"en":"How close can the boat get without disturbing them?","zh":"船能靠多近才不打扰它们？"}},"海鹦":{"what":"嘴巴五颜六色、像小丑一样的海鸟，世界上一半以上的大西洋海鹦在冰岛繁殖。","what_en":"A clown-faced seabird with a colourful beak — over half of the world's Atlantic puffins breed in Iceland.","fame":"每年 4 到 8 月回到悬崖上的草洞里养宝宝，嘴里一次能叼十几条小鱼；冰岛韦斯特曼纳群岛、英国约克郡和苏格兰的海边悬崖都能看到。","fame_en":"From April to August they return to burrows on clifftops to raise chicks, carrying a dozen small fish at once; you can see them in Iceland's Westman Islands and on the cliffs of Yorkshire and Scotland.","fact":"八月小海鹦第一次在夜里飞向大海，常被韦斯特曼纳群岛小镇的灯光骗到街上；岛上的孩子们每晚出门「巡逻」，把它们捡进纸箱，第二天称完体重放回海边。","fact_en":"In August young pufflings make their first night flight to sea, and the town lights of the Westman Islands lure many into the streets; island children go out on nightly 'puffling patrols', collecting them in boxes to weigh and release by the sea next day.","src":"Iceland Monitor · Puffling rescue time in the Westman Islands","url":"https://icelandmonitor.mbl.is/news/nature_and_travel/2017/08/24/puffling_rescue_time_in_the_westman_islands","say":{"en":"Where's the best viewpoint to see the puffins?","zh":"在哪个观景点看海鹦最好？"}},"金毛":{"what":"金毛寻回犬，19 世纪在苏格兰培育，特别爱叼东西、爱下水。","what_en":"The Golden Retriever, bred in 19th-century Scotland — it loves carrying things and jumping in water.","fame":"脾气好、对谁都友好，是世界上最受欢迎的家庭犬和导盲犬之一；养的人最常聊的是掉毛和它见谁都想去打招呼。","fame_en":"Good-natured and friendly to everyone, it's one of the world's favourite family and guide dogs; owners mostly talk about shedding and how it wants to greet every single person.","fact":"第一窝金毛 1868 年生在苏格兰高地的 Guisachan 庄园；2018 年 150 周年时，361 只金毛从世界各地被带回那片庄园聚会，创了纪录。","fact_en":"The first litter of goldens was born in 1868 at the Guisachan estate in the Scottish Highlands; for the 150th anniversary in 2018, 361 golden retrievers were brought back to the estate from around the world — a record.","src":"Euronews · Hundreds of golden retrievers meet in Scotland (2018)","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2018/07/22/hundreds-golden-retrievers-met-scotland-150th-anniversary-breed-t133915","say":{"en":"Sorry, he just wants to say hello — is that OK?","zh":"不好意思，它只是想打个招呼——可以吗？"}},"柯基":{"what":"短腿、大耳朵、屁股圆圆的威尔士牧牛犬。","what_en":"The short-legged, big-eared, round-bottomed herding dog from Wales.","fame":"腿短正好在牛蹄下穿来穿去、咬牛脚跟赶牛；聪明、爱叫、很会撒娇；因为英国女王，它几乎成了英国王室的象征。","fame_en":"Its short legs let it dart under cattle and nip their heels to herd them; it's clever, vocal and affectionate — and thanks to the Queen, almost a symbol of the British monarchy.","fact":"伊丽莎白二世 18 岁生日（1944 年）收到第一只柯基 Susan，之后一辈子养过 30 多只，很多都是 Susan 的后代，一共传了 14 代。","fact_en":"Elizabeth II got her first corgi, Susan, for her 18th birthday in 1944, and went on to own more than 30, many of them Susan's descendants — 14 generations in all.","src":"Business Insider · The Queen had more than 30 corgis","url":"https://www.businessinsider.nl/the-queen-had-more-than-30-corgis-over-her-70-year-reign-but-stopped-breeding-them-years-ago-so-they-wouldnt-outlive-her/","say":{"en":"How old is he? Those legs are adorable!","zh":"它几岁了？那小短腿太可爱了！"}},"泰迪（贵宾）":{"what":"「泰迪」其实是把贵宾犬剪成泰迪熊的样子；贵宾很聪明，几乎不掉毛。","what_en":"A 'Teddy' is really a poodle trimmed to look like a teddy bear; poodles are very clever and barely shed.","fame":"贵宾有标准、迷你、玩具三种大小，在中国、日本是最常见的宠物狗之一；聪明程度在狗里排前几名，学东西特别快。","fame_en":"Poodles come in standard, miniature and toy sizes and are among the most common pet dogs in China and Japan; they rank near the top for intelligence and learn very fast.","fact":"贵宾原本是德国、法国猎人在水里叼野鸭的猎犬；那种「身上剃光、关节留毛球」的老式剪法，就是为了让它游得快、又不让关节和内脏着凉。","fact_en":"Poodles were originally water retrievers for duck hunters in Germany and France; the classic clip — shaved body, pom-poms at the joints — let them swim fast while keeping joints and organs warm.","src":"Wikipedia · Poodle","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poodle","say":{"en":"Can you give him a teddy cut, not too short?","zh":"能给它剪个泰迪造型吗，别太短？"}},"边境牧羊犬":{"what":"英格兰和苏格兰交界的牧羊犬，常被说是最聪明的狗。","what_en":"The sheepdog from the English–Scottish border, often called the smartest dog.","fame":"一个眼神、一声口哨就能把一大群羊赶进圈；英国乡村的牧羊犬比赛很好看。在家没事做就容易拆家，养它要给它「找活干」。","fame_en":"With a stare and a whistle it can move a whole flock into a pen; sheepdog trials at British country shows are great to watch. At home, without a job, it gets destructive — owners have to keep it busy.","fact":"美国一只叫 Chaser 的边牧学会了 1022 个玩具的名字：2011 年发表的研究里，研究人员随便拿 20 个让它按名字去叼，它每次至少叼对 18 个。","fact_en":"A US border collie called Chaser learned the names of 1,022 toys: in a study published in 2011, when asked to fetch 20 random toys by name she never got fewer than 18 right.","src":"NPR · Border collie learns more than 1,000 words","url":"https://www.npr.org/sections/thetwo-way/2011/01/11/132839704/good-dog-border-collie-learns-more-than-1-000-words","say":{"en":"What time does the sheepdog demonstration start?","zh":"牧羊犬表演几点开始？"}},"法国斗牛犬":{"what":"扁脸、蝙蝠耳的小狗，大家叫它「法斗」。","what_en":"The flat-faced, bat-eared little dog everyone calls a 'Frenchie'.","fame":"安静、不太需要大运动量，适合住公寓，巴黎和纽约街上到处是；但扁脸怕热、容易喘，夏天出门、坐飞机都要特别小心。","fame_en":"Quiet and happy with short walks, it suits flat life and fills the streets of Paris and New York; but its flat face means it overheats and struggles to breathe, so summer walks and flights need care.","fact":"2022 年法斗取代拉布拉多，成了美国养犬俱乐部（AKC）登记最多的狗——拉布拉多在榜首坐了 31 年；兽医们为此反而担心，因为扁脸带来的呼吸病越来越多。","fact_en":"In 2022 the Frenchie overtook the Labrador as the American Kennel Club's most registered breed, ending the Lab's 31-year run — which worries vets, because flat faces bring breathing problems.","src":"AP via ClickOnDetroit · French bulldogs reign on as top US breed","url":"https://www.clickondetroit.com/news/national/2024/03/20/new-rankings-show-french-bulldogs-reign-on-as-top-us-breed-making-many-fans-shudder/","say":{"en":"It's very hot — can I get him some water?","zh":"太热了——我能给它点水喝吗？"}},"比格犬":{"what":"英国的小猎犬，耳朵长、鼻子灵、很爱叫，史努比就是比格。","what_en":"The small English hound with long ears, a great nose and a loud bark — Snoopy is a beagle.","fame":"以前成群地追野兔；鼻子太灵，所以很多国家的机场用它闻行李里的水果和肉。性格开朗，但闻到味道就听不见你叫它。","fame_en":"Bred to hunt hares in packs, its nose is so good that many airports use beagles to sniff luggage for fruit and meat. Cheerful — but once it catches a scent, it stops hearing you.","fact":"因为性格温顺，比格也是实验室里最常用的狗：2022 年美国弗吉尼亚州一家繁育实验犬的工厂因虐待被告，法院安排把约 4000 只比格送出去让人领养。","fact_en":"Because they're so gentle, beagles are also the most common lab dogs: in 2022 a Virginia facility breeding dogs for research was sued for animal cruelty, and a court-approved plan sent about 4,000 beagles out for adoption.","src":"dvm360 · 4,000 beagles rescued from Envigo facility","url":"https://www.dvm360.com/view/4-000-beagles-rescued-from-envigo-breeding-and-research-facility","say":{"en":"Sorry, I have an apple in my bag — do I need to declare it?","zh":"不好意思，我包里有个苹果——要申报吗？"}},"博美":{"what":"两三公斤重、像个毛球的小狗，来自波兰和德国交界的波美拉尼亚。","what_en":"A tiny dog of two or three kilos, like a ball of fluff, from Pomerania on the Polish–German border.","fame":"祖先其实是北方的大型尖嘴雪橇犬；现在是日本、中国、美国最受欢迎的小型犬之一，胆子大、爱叫，像只小狮子。","fame_en":"Its ancestors were big northern spitz sled dogs; today it's one of the most popular small dogs in Japan, China and the US — bold, yappy and lion-like.","fact":"博美变小要归功于维多利亚女王：她喜欢特别小的博美，一辈子里这个品种的个头缩小了一半。1912 年泰坦尼克号上只有三只狗活下来，其中两只是博美。","fact_en":"Queen Victoria made the Pomeranian small: she favoured tiny ones, and in her lifetime the breed shrank by half. Of the dogs aboard the Titanic in 1912, only three survived — two were Pomeranians.","src":"Wikipedia · Pomeranian dog","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pomeranian_dog","say":{"en":"Do you have a harness in extra small?","zh":"有超小号的胸背带吗？"}},"英国短毛猫":{"what":"圆脸、圆眼、短毛厚实的英国猫，灰蓝色的就是大家说的「蓝猫」。","what_en":"The round-faced, round-eyed, plush-coated British cat — the grey-blue ones are the classic 'British Blue'.","fame":"性子安静、不黏人也不闹，很适合上班族和住公寓的人；英国人说《爱丽丝梦游仙境》里咧嘴笑的柴郡猫就像它。","fame_en":"Calm, independent and undemanding — perfect for busy people in flats; Brits say the grinning Cheshire Cat in Alice in Wonderland looks just like one.","fact":"1871 年 7 月伦敦水晶宫办了英国第一场猫展，「英国短毛」就在里面；最佳奖给了组织者 Harrison Weir 自己的一只 14 岁蓝虎斑短毛母猫。","fact_en":"In July 1871 London's Crystal Palace held Britain's first cat show, and 'English Shorthairs' were among the entries; best in show went to organiser Harrison Weir's own 14-year-old blue tabby shorthair.","src":"GCCF · British Shorthair","url":"https://www.gccfcats.org/getting-a-cat/choosing/cat-breeds/british/","say":{"en":"Is she OK being picked up, or does she prefer not?","zh":"她喜欢被抱吗，还是不喜欢？"}},"苏格兰折耳猫":{"what":"耳朵向前折下来、脸圆得像猫头鹰的猫，来自苏格兰。","what_en":"A cat from Scotland whose ears fold forward, giving it an owl-like round face.","fame":"因为样子萌，在社交媒体上很红；但折耳是软骨的基因缺陷，同一个基因也会让关节、尾巴骨头出问题，很多兽医和国家都不建议、甚至禁止再繁殖。","fame_en":"Its cute look made it a social-media star, but the fold is a cartilage defect, and the same gene causes painful joint and tail problems — many vets advise against breeding it, and some countries ban it.","fact":"所有折耳猫都来自一只猫：1961 年苏格兰 Coupar Angus 附近农场谷仓里的一只白猫 Susie，被牧羊人 William Ross 发现，后来它的小猫成了这个品种的开始。","fact_en":"Every Scottish Fold traces back to one cat: Susie, a white barn cat found in 1961 on a farm near Coupar Angus, Scotland, by shepherd William Ross, whose kittens started the breed.","src":"Wikipedia · Scottish Fold","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scottish_Fold","say":{"en":"Does he have any joint problems? Can you check his legs?","zh":"它关节有问题吗？能帮忙看看它的腿吗？"}},"俄罗斯蓝猫":{"what":"灰蓝色短毛、绿眼睛的猫，传说来自俄罗斯北部的阿尔汉格尔斯克港。","what_en":"A short-haired grey-blue cat with green eyes, said to come from the port of Arkhangelsk in northern Russia.","fame":"毛又密又亮、摸起来像丝绒，性格害羞、认生，对家里人却很黏；掉毛相对少，安静，适合安静的家。","fame_en":"Its dense, shimmering coat feels like velvet; it's shy with strangers but devoted to its family, sheds relatively little and suits a quiet home.","fact":"19 世纪 70 年代它就以「阿尔汉格尔猫」的名字出现在伦敦水晶宫的猫展上，可组织者把所有短毛蓝猫放在一组比，它一个奖也没拿到；直到 1912 年英国猫协才承认它是一个单独的品种。","fact_en":"It was shown as the 'Archangel Cat' at Crystal Palace in London back in the 1870s, but the organiser lumped all short-haired blues together and it won nothing; Britain's cat fancy only recognised it as a separate breed in 1912.","src":"Mental Floss · 8 elegant facts about Russian Blue cats","url":"https://www.mentalfloss.com/animals/cats/8-elegant-facts-about-russian-blue-cats","say":{"en":"Is she shy? Should I let her come to me first?","zh":"她怕生吗？我是不是该等她自己过来？"}},"C罗":{"kind":"person","what":"葡萄牙足球运动员克里斯蒂亚诺·罗纳尔多，出生在马德拉岛，踢过曼联、皇马、尤文，现在在沙特踢球。","what_en":"Cristiano Ronaldo, the Portuguese footballer from Madeira who played for Manchester United, Real Madrid and Juventus, and now plays in Saudi Arabia.","fame":"拿过五次金球奖、五次欧冠，是国家队进球最多的男球员；他几乎把自律练成了招牌——吃得清淡、睡得规律，快四十岁还在踢。","fame_en":"Five Ballon d'Ors, five Champions Leagues and the most international goals of any man. Discipline is his trademark — clean eating, strict sleep, still playing near forty.","fact":"2024 年 9 月，他成了世界上第一个在各个社交平台加起来有 10 亿粉丝的人；那时他的 YouTube 频道才开了几个星期。","fact_en":"In September 2024 he became the first person with one billion followers across social media — his YouTube channel was only a few weeks old at the time.","src":"Al Jazeera，2024","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2024/9/13/ronaldo-becomes-first-individual-with-one-billion-social-media-followers","say":{"en":"Ronaldo or Messi — who's your pick?","zh":"C罗还是梅西，你选谁？"}},"埃及艳后":{"kind":"person","what":"克利奥帕特拉七世，古埃及托勒密王朝最后一位真正掌权的女王，公元前 30 年去世。","what_en":"Cleopatra VII, the last active ruler of Ptolemaic Egypt, who died in 30 BC.","fame":"她先后和罗马的恺撒、安东尼结盟，想保住埃及不被罗马吞掉；她死后埃及成了罗马的一个省。两千年来戏剧、电影一直在演她。","fame_en":"She allied first with Julius Caesar and then Mark Antony to keep Egypt out of Rome's hands; after her death Egypt became a Roman province. Plays and films have retold her story for two thousand years.","fact":"她的家族其实是希腊—马其顿人，在埃及统治了快三百年，宫里说希腊语；她是这个王朝里唯一一个已知学会了埃及语的统治者。","fact_en":"Her family was Greek-Macedonian and had ruled Egypt for almost three centuries speaking Greek at court — she is the only Ptolemaic ruler known to have learned Egyptian.","src":"Wikipedia「Cleopatra」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cleopatra","say":{"en":"Wait — Cleopatra wasn't actually Egyptian?","zh":"等等——埃及艳后其实不是埃及人？"}},"弗雷迪·墨丘利":{"kind":"person","what":"皇后乐队（Queen）的主唱，1946 年生在桑给巴尔，原名法鲁克·巴尔萨拉，1991 年去世。","what_en":"The lead singer of Queen, born Farrokh Bulsara in Zanzibar in 1946; he died in 1991.","fame":"《波西米亚狂想曲》《We Are the Champions》都是他写的；1985 年 Live Aid 上二十分钟的演出，常被叫作摇滚史上最好的现场。","fame_en":"He wrote 'Bohemian Rhapsody' and 'We Are the Champions', and Queen's twenty minutes at Live Aid in 1985 are often called the greatest live set in rock.","fact":"2016 年他七十岁冥诞时，一颗 1991 年发现的小行星被正式命名为「17473 Freddiemercury」，是乐队吉他手、也是天体物理学博士的布赖恩·梅宣布的。","fact_en":"For what would have been his 70th birthday in 2016, an asteroid discovered in 1991 was officially named 17473 Freddiemercury — announced by Queen guitarist and astrophysicist Brian May.","src":"Mental Floss，2016","url":"https://mentalfloss.com/article/85724/asteroid-named-after-freddie-mercury-honor-his-70th-birthday","say":{"en":"Every karaoke night ends with 'Bohemian Rhapsody'.","zh":"每次唱 K 最后都是《波西米亚狂想曲》。"}},"曼德拉":{"kind":"person","what":"南非反种族隔离的领袖，坐了 27 年牢，1994 年成为南非第一位黑人总统。","what_en":"The leader of South Africa's fight against apartheid, who spent 27 years in prison and became the country's first Black president in 1994.","fame":"他出狱后没有报复，而是和白人政府谈判，让南非没有打内战就结束了种族隔离；1993 年和德克勒克一起得了诺贝尔和平奖。","fame_en":"Out of prison, he chose negotiation over revenge and helped end apartheid without civil war; he shared the 1993 Nobel Peace Prize with F. W. de Klerk.","fact":"直到 2008 年，他还在美国的恐怖分子观察名单上（因为当年的种族隔离政府把非国大定为恐怖组织）；当时他已经当过总统、拿过诺贝尔奖，去美国还要国务卿特批，小布什在他 90 岁生日前才签字把他移出。","fact_en":"Until 2008 he was still on a US terror watch list, because the apartheid government had branded the ANC a terrorist group. A former president and Nobel laureate, he needed a special waiver to visit — George W. Bush signed him off the list just before his 90th birthday.","src":"Al Jazeera，2008","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2008/7/1/us-takes-mandela-off-terror-list","quote":{"en":"It is an ideal for which I am prepared to die.","zh":"为了这个理想，我准备好了去死。","where":"1964 年 4 月 20 日在里沃尼亚审判的被告席上的演讲（《我准备好了去死》）结尾，说的是「人人平等相处的民主自由社会」这个理想","where_en":"The closing line of his speech from the dock at the Rivonia Trial, 20 April 1964 ('I Am Prepared to Die'), about the ideal of a free, democratic society"},"say":{"en":"Have you been to Robben Island, where Mandela was held?","zh":"你去过关曼德拉的罗本岛吗？"}},"阿贝贝·比基拉":{"kind":"person","what":"埃塞俄比亚的马拉松运动员，原来是皇帝的卫兵，1960 年罗马奥运会光着脚跑赢了马拉松。","what_en":"The Ethiopian marathon runner — an imperial guardsman — who won the 1960 Rome Olympic marathon barefoot.","fame":"他是第一个拿奥运金牌的黑非洲运动员，也是第一个连续两届拿奥运马拉松金牌的人，两次都破了世界最好成绩；后来东非长跑的传奇从他开始。","fame_en":"He was the first Black African Olympic champion and the first to win the Olympic marathon twice in a row, both times in world-best time — East Africa's distance-running legend starts with him.","fact":"罗马那次光脚，是因为在罗马买的新跑鞋不合脚、磨出了水泡，他干脆像平时训练一样光脚跑，终点是夜里火把照着的君士坦丁凯旋门；四年后东京，他刚做完阑尾手术大约五个星期，这次穿着鞋，又赢了。","fact_en":"He ran barefoot in Rome because the new shoes he bought there didn't fit and gave him blisters — so he ran the way he trained, finishing at night by the Arch of Constantine. Four years later in Tokyo, about five weeks after an appendectomy, he won again — in shoes.","src":"Wikipedia「Abebe Bikila」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abebe_Bikila","say":{"en":"He won an Olympic marathon barefoot? No way.","zh":"他光着脚赢了奥运马拉松？不会吧。"}},"珍·古道尔":{"kind":"person","what":"英国动物学家，1960 年起在坦桑尼亚贡贝研究野生黑猩猩，2025 年 10 月在美国巡回演讲时去世，91 岁。","what_en":"The British primatologist who began studying wild chimpanzees at Gombe, Tanzania, in 1960; she died on a US speaking tour in October 2025, aged 91.","fame":"她第一个看到黑猩猩用草棍「钓」白蚁——证明不只人类会做工具；她给黑猩猩起名字、写它们的性格，改变了科学家看动物的方式。晚年一年三百天在路上讲保护。","fame_en":"She was the first to see chimps 'fishing' for termites with stems — proof that humans aren't the only toolmakers. By naming chimps and describing their personalities, she changed how scientists see animals, and spent her later years travelling 300 days a year for conservation.","fact":"她没有读过本科，1965 年却直接拿到了剑桥大学的博士学位——剑桥历史上这样的人屈指可数。","fact_en":"She never did an undergraduate degree, yet earned a Cambridge PhD in 1965 — one of very few people in the university's history to do so.","src":"Wikipedia「Jane Goodall」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jane_Goodall","say":{"en":"Jane Goodall is the reason I love chimps.","zh":"我喜欢黑猩猩，就是因为珍·古道尔。"}},"费拉·库蒂":{"kind":"person","what":"尼日利亚音乐人，Afrobeat 的开创者，1997 年在拉各斯去世。","what_en":"The Nigerian musician who created Afrobeat; he died in Lagos in 1997.","fame":"他把约鲁巴音乐、爵士和放克混在一起，一首歌常常十几二十分钟；歌词直接骂军政府和腐败，因此被抓、被打了很多次。今天的 Afrobeats 歌手都说他是源头。","fame_en":"He fused Yoruba music, jazz and funk into songs that often ran fifteen or twenty minutes, with lyrics attacking military rule and corruption — he was arrested and beaten many times. Today's Afrobeats stars call him the source.","fact":"他生前一次格莱美提名都没有；2026 年 1 月，格莱美给了他终身成就奖，他是第一个拿到这个奖的非洲人，由家人上台代领。","fact_en":"He was never nominated for a Grammy in his lifetime; in January 2026 he became the first African to receive the Grammy Lifetime Achievement Award, accepted by his family.","src":"Al Jazeera，2026","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/1/fela-kuti-becomes-first-african-to-get-grammys-lifetime-achievement-award","say":{"en":"If you like Afrobeats, you have to listen to Fela.","zh":"你喜欢 Afrobeats 的话，一定要听听费拉。"}},"阿契贝":{"kind":"person","what":"钦努阿·阿契贝，尼日利亚作家，1958 年写了《瓦解》（Things Fall Apart），2013 年去世。","what_en":"Chinua Achebe, the Nigerian writer of Things Fall Apart (1958), who died in 2013.","fame":"《瓦解》从一个伊博族村子的人的眼睛看殖民者到来，是读的人最多的非洲小说，译成五十多种语言，常被叫作「现代非洲文学之父」。","fame_en":"Things Fall Apart shows colonialism arriving through the eyes of an Igbo village — the most widely read African novel, translated into more than fifty languages. He's often called the father of modern African literature.","fact":"1957 年他把唯一一份手写稿寄给伦敦一家打字社，付钱打两份；打字社几个月没回音，最后是他的上司趁休假去伦敦，亲自上门才把稿子要回来。","fact_en":"In 1957 he posted his only handwritten manuscript to a London typing agency and paid for two copies. Months of silence followed — until his boss, on leave in London, went to the agency in person and got it back.","src":"OUP 博客，2013","url":"https://blog.oup.com/2013/03/chinua-achebe-1930/","quote":{"en":"Until the lions have their own historians, the history of the hunt will always glorify the hunter.","zh":"狮子没有自己的历史学家之前，打猎的历史永远只会歌颂猎人。","where":"1994 年接受《巴黎评论》采访时引的一句非洲谚语，用来说他为什么写作","where_en":"A proverb he cited in his 1994 Paris Review interview, explaining why he wrote"},"say":{"en":"Have you read Things Fall Apart?","zh":"你读过《瓦解》吗？"}},"恩克鲁玛":{"kind":"person","what":"夸梅·恩克鲁玛，带领加纳在 1957 年独立的领袖，加纳第一任总理和总统。","what_en":"Kwame Nkrumah, who led Ghana to independence in 1957 and became its first prime minister and president.","fame":"加纳是撒哈拉以南第一个摆脱殖民统治独立的非洲国家；他一直主张非洲联合起来，是非洲统一组织（今天非洲联盟的前身）的发起人之一。","fame_en":"Ghana was the first sub-Saharan African colony to win independence, and he championed African unity — one of the founders of the Organisation of African Unity, forerunner of today's African Union.","fact":"1966 年 2 月他出国去见胡志明，途经中国的时候，国内军队发动政变推翻了他；他再也没回过加纳，1972 年在罗马尼亚病逝。","fact_en":"In February 1966, while travelling to meet Ho Chi Minh, he was overthrown by a military coup during his stop in China. He never returned to Ghana and died in Romania in 1972.","src":"Wikipedia「1966 Ghanaian coup d'état」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1966_Ghanaian_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat","quote":{"en":"At long last the battle has ended! And thus Ghana, your beloved country, is free for ever.","zh":"这场战斗终于结束了！我们亲爱的加纳，从此永远自由了。","where":"1957 年 3 月 6 日零点，在阿克拉老马球场宣布独立时的演讲开头","where_en":"Opening of his midnight independence speech at the Old Polo Grounds, Accra, 6 March 1957"},"say":{"en":"Is this where Ghana's independence was declared?","zh":"加纳就是在这儿宣布独立的吗？"}},"曼萨·穆萨":{"kind":"person","what":"14 世纪马里帝国的国王，统治着西非产金子的大片土地。","what_en":"The 14th-century king of the Mali Empire, which ruled West Africa's great gold fields.","fame":"1324 年他去麦加朝圣，带着成千上万的随从和大量黄金，一路送人；这趟旅行让欧洲和中东第一次知道西非有多富，常被叫作「史上最富的人」。他还在廷巴克图修了清真寺和学校。","fame_en":"On his 1324 pilgrimage to Mecca he travelled with thousands of people and loads of gold, giving it away as he went — Europe and the Middle East suddenly learned how rich West Africa was. He's often called the richest person in history, and he built mosques and schools in Timbuktu.","fact":"他路过开罗时送出的金子太多，据当时的史学家乌马里记载，开罗的金价跌了下去，十二年都没回到原来的价钱。（也有历史学家觉得这个说法夸张了。）","fact_en":"He gave away so much gold in Cairo that, according to the historian al-Umari, its price fell and stayed lower for about twelve years. (Some historians think the story is exaggerated.)","src":"Wikipedia「Mansa Musa」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mansa_Musa","say":{"en":"Was Mansa Musa really the richest person ever?","zh":"曼萨·穆萨真的是史上最有钱的人吗？"}},"基普乔格":{"kind":"person","what":"埃利乌德·基普乔格，肯尼亚马拉松运动员，两届奥运马拉松冠军。","what_en":"Eliud Kipchoge, the Kenyan marathon runner and two-time Olympic marathon champion.","fame":"2019 年在维也纳，他用 1 小时 59 分 40 秒跑完了马拉松，是第一个跑进两小时的人（因为有轮换领跑员，不算正式纪录）；柏林马拉松他赢了五次。","fame_en":"In Vienna in 2019 he ran a marathon in 1:59:40, the first person under two hours (with rotating pacers, so not an official record). He has won the Berlin Marathon five times.","fact":"成了世界名人以后，他平时还住在肯尼亚卡普塔加特的训练营里，和别的队员一样按值日表轮流打扫厕所、洗碗、做饭。","fact_en":"Even as a global star, he lived at the Kaptagat training camp in Kenya and took his turn on the chore roster — cleaning toilets, washing up and cooking like everyone else.","src":"eNCA / AFP，2024","url":"https://www.enca.com/opinion/spartan-retreat-where-kenyas-star-athletes-train","quote":{"en":"No human is limited.","zh":"没有人是有极限的。","where":"2019 年 10 月 12 日在维也纳跑进两小时后对记者说的","where_en":"Said to reporters in Vienna on 12 October 2019, right after his sub-two-hour run"},"say":{"en":"Under two hours for a marathon? That's insane.","zh":"马拉松跑进两小时？太疯狂了。"}},"萨拉赫":{"kind":"person","what":"穆罕默德·萨拉赫，埃及足球运动员，2017 年起在利物浦踢右边锋。","what_en":"Mohamed Salah, the Egyptian winger who has played for Liverpool since 2017.","fame":"他帮利物浦拿了欧冠和英超冠军，多次拿英超金靴；在埃及他是全民偶像，利物浦球迷专门给他编了歌。","fame_en":"He helped Liverpool win the Champions League and the Premier League and has won several Golden Boots; in Egypt he's a national hero, and Liverpool fans have songs just for him.","fact":"2019 年斯坦福大学的一项研究发现，他加入利物浦以后，默西赛德郡的仇恨犯罪比预期少了大约 19%，利物浦球迷发的反穆斯林推文也少了大约一半。","fact_en":"A 2019 Stanford study found that after he joined Liverpool, hate crimes in Merseyside were about 19% lower than expected, and anti-Muslim tweets by Liverpool fans roughly halved.","src":"英超官网，2019","url":"https://www.premierleague.com/en/news/1236020","say":{"en":"Is Salah playing today?","zh":"今天萨拉赫上场吗？"}},"刘慈欣":{"kind":"person","what":"山西一家发电厂的工程师出身的科幻作家，写了《三体》。","what_en":"A sci-fi writer who started out as an engineer at a power plant in Shanxi — he wrote The Three-Body Problem.","fame":"《三体》2015 年拿了雨果奖最佳长篇，是第一部拿这个奖的亚洲作家作品；后来拍成了中国电视剧和 Netflix 剧，让全世界开始读中国科幻。","fame_en":"The Three-Body Problem won the 2015 Hugo Award for Best Novel — the first by an Asian author — and became a Chinese TV series and a Netflix show, getting the whole world to read Chinese sci-fi.","fact":"2017 年奥巴马卸任前接受《纽约时报》书评人角谷美智子采访，说他在白宫读《三体》，「规模大得惊人」，读完觉得跟国会吵的那些事都不算什么了。","fact_en":"In a 2017 interview with New York Times critic Michiko Kakutani, Barack Obama said he read The Three-Body Problem in the White House — 'the scope of it was immense' — and that it made his daily fights with Congress seem petty.","src":"Reactor（Tor.com），2017","url":"https://reactormag.com/barack-obama-books-the-three-body-problem/","say":{"en":"Have you read The Three-Body Problem, or just watched the show?","zh":"你读过《三体》，还是只看了剧？"}},"成龙":{"kind":"person","what":"香港功夫明星，自己做危险动作，把打戏拍成喜剧。","what_en":"The Hong Kong action star who does his own dangerous stunts and turns fight scenes into comedy.","fame":"从《警察故事》到《尖峰时刻》，他让功夫片在好莱坞变得好笑又好看；片尾的 NG 花絮成了他的招牌；2016 年拿了奥斯卡终身成就奖。","fame_en":"From Police Story to Rush Hour, he made kung fu films funny and hugely popular in Hollywood; the blooper reel over the end credits became his trademark, and he received an honorary Oscar in 2016.","fact":"2012 年拍《十二生肖》时，他一个人担任了 15 个职位（导演、编剧、主演、动作指导、作曲……），拿了吉尼斯「一部电影里担任最多职位」纪录，同时还拿了「在世演员做过最多特技」纪录。","fact_en":"On Chinese Zodiac (2012) he held 15 jobs at once — director, writer, star, fight choreographer, composer and more — earning a Guinness record for most credits in one film, alongside the record for most stunts by a living actor.","src":"吉尼斯世界纪录，2012","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/news/2012/12/jackie-chan-awarded-with-two-new-guinness-world-records-titles-46127","say":{"en":"Wait for the bloopers — they're the best part of a Jackie Chan film.","zh":"等一下片尾花絮——那是成龙电影最好看的部分。"}},"郎朗":{"kind":"person","what":"沈阳出生的钢琴家，在世界各大音乐厅演奏。","what_en":"A pianist from Shenyang who plays the world's biggest concert halls.","fame":"他是最早让全世界都认识的中国古典钢琴家之一，演奏很有表情、很有激情；还在北京奥运会开幕式上弹过琴，带动了很多中国孩子学钢琴。","fame_en":"He was one of the first Chinese classical pianists the whole world knew — famous for his expressive, passionate playing — and he played at the Beijing Olympics opening ceremony, inspiring countless Chinese kids to take up piano.","fact":"他说自己学琴是因为两岁时在家里的黑白电视上看了《猫和老鼠》的《猫咪音乐会》：汤姆穿着燕尾服弹李斯特的《匈牙利狂想曲第二号》，他就跟着在小钢琴上学汤姆。","fact_en":"He says he started piano at two after watching the Tom and Jerry cartoon 'The Cat Concerto' on the family's black-and-white TV — Tom, in white tie and tails, plays Liszt's Hungarian Rhapsody No. 2, and little Lang Lang copied him on his toy piano.","src":"CNBC，2013","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2013/12/10/how-tom-and-jerry-inspired-piano-master-lang-lang.html","say":{"en":"Did you know Lang Lang learned piano from Tom and Jerry?","zh":"你知道郎朗是看《猫和老鼠》开始学钢琴的吗？"}},"屠呦呦":{"kind":"person","what":"中国药学家，发现了治疟疾的青蒿素，2015 年得了诺贝尔生理学或医学奖。","what_en":"The Chinese pharmacologist who discovered artemisinin, a malaria drug, and won the 2015 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine.","fame":"她是第一位得诺贝尔科学奖的中国女性；以青蒿素为基础的联合疗法今天是世界卫生组织推荐的疟疾一线药，救了几百万人。","fame_en":"She was the first Chinese woman to win a Nobel science prize; artemisinin-based combination therapy is now the WHO's first-line malaria treatment and has saved millions of lives.","fact":"关键的灵感来自 1600 多年前东晋葛洪的《肘后备急方》：「青蒿一握，以水二升渍，绞取汁，尽服之」——是泡、是绞，不是煮。她由此想到高温会破坏有效成分，改用低温乙醚提取，才成功。","fact_en":"The key clue came from a 1,600-year-old handbook by Ge Hong: 'take a handful of qinghao, soak it in two litres of water, wring out the juice and drink it all' — soaked, not boiled. That made her suspect heat destroyed the active ingredient, so she switched to low-temperature ether extraction, and it worked.","src":"诺贝尔奖官网 · 屠呦呦诺贝尔演讲，2015","url":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/medicine/2015/tu/lecture/","say":{"en":"Artemisinin came from a 1,600-year-old Chinese recipe — isn't that amazing?","zh":"青蒿素是从一千六百多年前的中国药方里来的——厉害吧？"}},"袁隆平":{"kind":"person","what":"中国农学家，培育出杂交水稻，被叫作「杂交水稻之父」。","what_en":"The Chinese agronomist who bred hybrid rice — known as the 'father of hybrid rice'.","fame":"杂交水稻让同一块田多收两成左右的粮食，在中国和亚洲、非洲很多国家种，让很多人吃饱了饭。2021 年他去世时，长沙街头很多人自发送别。","fame_en":"Hybrid rice raised yields from the same fields by roughly a fifth and is grown across China, Asia and Africa, helping feed hundreds of millions. When he died in 2021, crowds lined the streets of Changsha to say goodbye.","fact":"最关键的一株稻子不是他本人找到的：1970 年 11 月 23 日，他的助手李必湖在海南三亚南红农场的水沟边发现了一株雄花不育的野生稻（「野败」），后来的三系杂交稻几乎都从这一株来。","fact_en":"The single most important plant wasn't found by Yuan himself: on 23 November 1970 his assistant Li Bihu spotted a male-sterile wild rice plant by a ditch at Nanhong Farm in Sanya, Hainan — the 'wild abortive' line behind almost all three-line hybrid rice.","src":"Wikipedia · Li Bihu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Li_Bihu","say":{"en":"Let's not waste any rice — Yuan Longping would be sad.","zh":"别浪费米饭——袁爷爷会难过的。"}},"莫言":{"kind":"person","what":"山东高密农村长大的作家，写《红高粱》《蛙》，2012 年得了诺贝尔文学奖。","what_en":"A writer who grew up in rural Gaomi, Shandong — author of Red Sorghum and Frog — and winner of the 2012 Nobel Prize in Literature.","fame":"他是第一位得诺贝尔文学奖的中国籍作家；他写家乡「高密东北乡」的人，又野又魔幻，《红高粱》被张艺谋拍成电影，在柏林得了金熊奖。","fame_en":"He was the first Chinese citizen to win the Nobel Prize in Literature. His wild, magical stories of his home village in Gaomi gave us Red Sorghum, which Zhang Yimou filmed and which won the Golden Bear in Berlin.","fact":"他本名管谟业，「莫言」的意思是「别说话」——小时候爸妈总叮嘱他在外面少说话。他在诺贝尔演讲里自嘲：这么爱说话的人偏偏叫「莫言」。","fact_en":"His real name is Guan Moye; 'Mo Yan' means 'don't speak' — as a boy his parents kept warning him not to talk too much outside. In his Nobel lecture he joked about how ironic the name is for someone so talkative.","src":"诺贝尔奖官网 · 莫言诺贝尔演讲，2012","url":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2012/yan/lecture/","quote":{"en":"I am a storyteller.","zh":"我是一个讲故事的人。","where":"2012 年 12 月 7 日在瑞典学院的诺贝尔演讲《讲故事的人》里说的","where_en":"From his Nobel lecture 'Storytellers' at the Swedish Academy, 7 December 2012"},"say":{"en":"Did you know Mo Yan's pen name means 'don't speak'?","zh":"你知道「莫言」这个笔名的意思是「别说话」吗？"}},"杨利伟":{"kind":"person","what":"中国第一位进入太空的航天员，2003 年坐神舟五号上天。","what_en":"China's first astronaut in space, who flew Shenzhou 5 in 2003.","fame":"2003 年 10 月 15 日他绕地球飞了 14 圈、21 个多小时，中国成了第三个能自己把人送上太空的国家。","fame_en":"On 15 October 2003 he circled the Earth 14 times in just over 21 hours, making China the third country able to launch people into space on its own.","fact":"回来第二天他在央视采访里说：「从太空看地球很美，但我没有看到我们的长城。」打破了「长城是太空里唯一能肉眼看到的人造建筑」这个流传了很多年的说法。","fact_en":"The day after landing he told CCTV: 'The Earth looked very beautiful from space, but I did not see our Great Wall' — busting the long-told myth that the Wall is the only man-made structure visible from orbit with the naked eye.","src":"Al Jazeera，2003","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2003/10/17/chinas-spaceman-shatters-a-myth","say":{"en":"So you can't actually see the Great Wall from space?","zh":"所以从太空其实看不到长城？"}},"世宗大王":{"kind":"person","what":"朝鲜王朝的第四位国王，1443 年创制了韩文（训民正音）。","what_en":"The fourth king of Korea's Joseon dynasty, who created Hangul, the Korean alphabet, in 1443.","fame":"以前韩国人只能用汉字写字，普通百姓学不会；他做了一套很好学的字母，今天韩国人每天写的就是它。韩国一万元纸币上是他，每年 10 月 9 日是「韩文日」。","fame_en":"Koreans once had to write in Chinese characters, which ordinary people couldn't learn; he designed an alphabet anyone could pick up, the one Koreans write every day. He's on the 10,000-won note, and 9 October is Hangul Day.","fact":"讲清楚韩文怎么造出来的原书《训民正音解例本》失传了几百年，1940 年才在安东被发现，收藏家全滢弼花了相当于很多栋瓦房的钱买下，在日本殖民时期偷偷藏起来；今天它是韩国国宝第 70 号，进了联合国教科文组织《世界记忆名录》。","fact_en":"The original book explaining how Hangul was designed, the Hunminjeongeum Haerye, was lost for centuries until it turned up in Andong in 1940. Collector Jeon Hyeong-pil paid the price of many houses for it and hid it during Japanese colonial rule; today it's National Treasure No. 70 and on UNESCO's Memory of the World register.","src":"Wikipedia · Hunminjeongeum Haerye","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunminjeongeum_Haerye","quote":{"en":"The sounds of our country's speech are different from those of China and do not match the written characters.","zh":"国之语音，异乎中国，与文字不相流通。","where":"1446 年颁布的《训民正音》开头，世宗亲自写的序","where_en":"The opening of King Sejong's own preface to the Hunminjeongeum, promulgated in 1446"},"say":{"en":"Hangul is so logical — you can learn to read it in a day.","zh":"韩文好有规律，一天就能学会认。"}},"成吉思汗铜像":{"what":"蒙古乌兰巴托东边草原上一座 40 米高的不锈钢成吉思汗骑马像。","what_en":"A 40-metre stainless-steel statue of Genghis Khan on horseback, on the steppe east of Ulaanbaatar, Mongolia.","fame":"它是世界上最高的骑马像，2008 年为纪念蒙古帝国建立 800 年建成；在一望无际的草原上，几公里外就能看见，是从乌兰巴托出发最常去的一日游。","fame_en":"It's the world's tallest equestrian statue, built in 2008 for the 800th anniversary of the Mongol Empire; you can spot it from kilometres away on the open steppe, and it's the classic day trip from Ulaanbaatar.","fact":"它建在宗金宝力道，传说成吉思汗在这里捡到过一根金马鞭；你可以坐电梯进马身，从马胸、马脖子走到马头上的观景台，往东看——铜像就朝着他出生的方向。","fact_en":"It stands at Tsonjin Boldog, where legend says Genghis Khan found a golden whip. You can ride a lift up inside and walk through the horse's chest and neck to a viewing deck on its head — facing east, towards his birthplace.","src":"Wikipedia · Equestrian statue of Genghis Khan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equestrian_statue_of_Genghis_Khan","say":{"en":"Can we go up to the horse's head?","zh":"可以上到马头上去吗？"}},"甘地":{"kind":"person","what":"带领印度用不暴力的办法争取独立的领袖，大家叫他「圣雄」。","what_en":"The leader of India's nonviolent independence movement, known as 'Mahatma' ('great soul').","fame":"他用绝食、游行、不买英国货这些不打仗的办法对抗英国统治，1930 年走了 380 多公里去海边自己煮盐；马丁·路德·金和曼德拉都学他。","fame_en":"He fought British rule without weapons — fasting, marches, boycotts — including the 1930 Salt March of nearly 400 km to make his own salt by the sea. Martin Luther King and Nelson Mandela both learned from him.","fact":"他五个年份被提名诺贝尔和平奖（1937、1938、1939、1947、1948），一次也没得；1948 年他遇刺时提名还没截止，那年委员会干脆没颁和平奖，说「没有合适的在世人选」。后来几任诺贝尔委员会成员都公开说这是遗憾。","fact_en":"He was nominated for the Nobel Peace Prize in five different years (1937, 1938, 1939, 1947, 1948) and never won. He was assassinated in 1948 before nominations closed, and that year the committee gave no peace prize at all, saying there was 'no suitable living candidate'. Later Nobel Committee members have publicly called the omission a regret.","src":"诺贝尔奖官网 · Mahatma Gandhi, the Missing Laureate","url":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/themes/mahatma-gandhi-the-missing-laureate/","quote":{"en":"Here is a mantra, a short one, that I give you… The mantra is: 'Do or Die'.","zh":"我给你们一句短短的咒语……这句咒语就是：「行动，否则就死」。","where":"1942 年 8 月 8 日在孟买的「退出印度」演讲里说的","where_en":"From his 'Quit India' speech in Bombay, 8 August 1942"},"say":{"en":"Is 2 October a holiday because of Gandhi?","zh":"10 月 2 日放假是因为甘地吗？"}},"泰戈尔":{"kind":"person","what":"印度孟加拉的诗人，写《飞鸟集》《吉檀迦利》，1913 年得了诺贝尔文学奖。","what_en":"The Bengali poet who wrote Stray Birds and Gitanjali, and won the 1913 Nobel Prize in Literature.","fame":"他是第一位得诺贝尔文学奖的非欧洲人；印度和孟加拉国两个国家的国歌都是他写的。中国很多人中学就读过他的短诗。","fame_en":"He was the first non-European to win the Nobel Prize in Literature, and he wrote the songs that became the national anthems of both India and Bangladesh. Many Chinese readers meet his short poems at school.","fact":"1924 年他访问中国，正好过 63 岁生日，梁启超在生日会上给他起了个中文名「竺震旦」——「竺」取自天竺（印度），「震旦」是古代印度对中国的叫法；胡适当场把梁启超的话翻成英文。","fact_en":"On his 1924 visit to China he celebrated his 63rd birthday there, and Liang Qichao gave him a Chinese name, Zhu Zhendan — 'Zhu' from the old Chinese name for India, 'Zhendan' from the old Indian name for China — with Hu Shi interpreting the speech into English.","src":"CESRAN · Interview with Prof. Liu Jian","url":"https://cesran.org/interview-with-prof-liu-jian.html","quote":{"en":"Let life be beautiful like summer flowers and death like autumn leaves.","zh":"生如夏花之绚烂，死如秋叶之静美。","where":"1916 年《飞鸟集》第 82 首，他自己用英文写的（中文是郑振铎的译文）","where_en":"Stray Birds, no. 82 (1916), written by Tagore in English"},"say":{"en":"Which Tagore poem did you learn at school?","zh":"你上学时学过泰戈尔的哪首诗？"}},"佛陀":{"kind":"person","what":"佛教的创立者，本名乔达摩·悉达多，大约 2500 年前生在今天尼泊尔的蓝毗尼。","what_en":"The founder of Buddhism, Siddhartha Gautama, born about 2,500 years ago in Lumbini, in today's Nepal.","fame":"他是王子，看到生老病死以后离开王宫去修行，后来在菩提树下觉悟，用一辈子教人怎么减少痛苦。今天全世界大约有 5 亿佛教徒，从泰国、日本到中国都能看到他的像。","fame_en":"A prince who left the palace after seeing old age, sickness and death, he found awakening under the Bodhi tree and spent his life teaching how to end suffering. Around half a billion Buddhists today follow him, from Thailand to Japan to China.","fact":"2013 年考古学家在蓝毗尼摩耶夫人庙的砖庙下面挖到一座更早的木结构神殿，中间空地还有古树根的痕迹，测年在公元前 6 世纪——这是到目前为止找到的最早的佛教神殿，也让佛陀生活的年代有了考古证据。","fact_en":"In 2013 archaeologists digging under the brick Maya Devi Temple at Lumbini found an older timber shrine with traces of ancient tree roots in its open centre, dated to the 6th century BC — the earliest Buddhist shrine yet found, and archaeological evidence for when the Buddha lived.","src":"Phys.org（杜伦大学），2013","url":"https://phys.org/news/2013-11-archaeological-discoveries-early-date-buddha.html","quote":{"en":"Hatred is never appeased by hatred in this world; by non-hatred alone is hatred appeased.","zh":"在这世上，怨恨从来不能用怨恨平息，只有不怨恨才能平息。","where":"《法句经》第 5 偈（巴利文，传统上记作佛陀的话；不少网上流传的「佛陀名言」其实是后人编的）","where_en":"Dhammapada, verse 5 (Pali canon, traditionally recorded as the Buddha's words)"},"say":{"en":"Should I take my shoes off before going into the temple?","zh":"进寺庙要脱鞋吗？"}},"门捷列夫":{"kind":"person","what":"俄国化学家，1869 年排出了元素周期表。","what_en":"The Russian chemist who laid out the periodic table of the elements in 1869.","fame":"他按原子量把元素排成表，还大胆留了空格，预言了几种当时没人见过的元素；后来镓、钪、锗真的被发现，性质跟他说的差不多。每个学化学的人墙上都挂着他的表。","fame_en":"He arranged the elements by atomic weight and boldly left gaps, predicting elements nobody had seen yet — and gallium, scandium and germanium later turned up with almost the properties he described. Every chemistry classroom has his table on the wall.","fact":"1906 年诺贝尔化学奖委员会本来推荐的是他，可在瑞典科学院全体会议上被推翻，奖给了分离出氟的莫瓦桑；据说是因为有影响力的阿伦尼乌斯记恨他批评过自己的理论。第二年他就去世了，一辈子没拿到诺贝尔奖。","fact_en":"In 1906 the Nobel chemistry committee actually recommended him, but the full Swedish Academy overruled it and gave the prize to Henri Moissan, who isolated fluorine — reportedly because the influential Svante Arrhenius held a grudge over Mendeleev's criticism of his theory. Mendeleev died the next year without a Nobel.","src":"Chemistry World · Nobel near miss","url":"https://www.chemistryworld.com/culture/nobel-near-miss/5843.article","say":{"en":"Element 101 is named after Mendeleev — mendelevium.","zh":"101 号元素就是用门捷列夫命名的——钔。"}},"埃德蒙·希拉里":{"kind":"person","what":"新西兰登山家，1953 年和夏尔巴人丹增·诺尔盖第一次登上珠穆朗玛峰顶。","what_en":"The New Zealand mountaineer who, with Sherpa Tenzing Norgay, first reached the summit of Everest in 1953.","fame":"1953 年 5 月 29 日两人站上世界最高峰；后来他成立喜马拉雅信托基金，在尼泊尔昆布地区盖学校、诊所和桥，一盖就是几十年。","fame_en":"On 29 May 1953 the two of them stood on top of the world. He then founded the Himalayan Trust, spending decades building schools, clinics and bridges in Nepal's Khumbu region.","fact":"1992 年他的头像就印上了新西兰 5 元纸币——那时他还活着，是唯一一个不是国家元首、在世时就上了新西兰钞票的人。","fact_en":"His face went onto New Zealand's $5 note in 1992 while he was still alive — the only living person other than a head of state to appear on New Zealand money.","src":"新西兰储备银行","url":"https://www.rbnz.govt.nz/money-and-cash/banknotes/banknotes-in-circulation/5-banknote","say":{"en":"Is that Edmund Hillary on the five-dollar note?","zh":"5 块钱纸币上那个是希拉里吗？"}},"伊本·西拿":{"kind":"person","what":"一千年前波斯（今天的伊朗、乌兹别克斯坦一带）的医生和哲学家，西方叫他阿维森纳。","what_en":"A Persian physician and philosopher of a thousand years ago, from today's Iran and Uzbekistan region — known in the West as Avicenna.","fame":"他写的《医典》把当时希腊、波斯、阿拉伯的医学整理成一套，传到欧洲后当了几百年的医学课本；伊朗把他的生日定为「医生节」。","fame_en":"His Canon of Medicine pulled together Greek, Persian and Arab medicine into one system and served as a textbook in Europe for centuries; Iran celebrates his birthday as National Doctors' Day.","fact":"《医典》12 世纪在西班牙托莱多被译成拉丁文，在比利时鲁汶、法国蒙彼利埃的大学一直用到 1650 年前后——比他去世晚了 600 多年。","fact_en":"The Canon was translated into Latin in Toledo in the 12th century, and the universities of Leuven and Montpellier were still teaching from it around 1650 — more than 600 years after his death.","src":"Jewish Encyclopedia · Avicenna","url":"https://jewishencyclopedia.com/articles/2168-avicenna-abu-ali-ibn-abdallah-ibn-sina","say":{"en":"Medical students in Europe were still reading Avicenna in the 1600s.","zh":"一六几几年欧洲的医学生还在读伊本·西拿的书。"}},"大谷翔平":{"kind":"person","what":"日本岩手出生的棒球选手，又能投又能打，现在在洛杉矶道奇队。","what_en":"The baseball star from Iwate, Japan, who both pitches and hits — now with the Los Angeles Dodgers.","fame":"一百年来大联盟几乎没人能同时当顶级投手和顶级打者，他做到了；2024 年成了第一个一季 50 支全垒打 + 50 次盗垒的人，拿了好几次 MVP。","fame_en":"Hardly anyone in a century of Major League Baseball has been both an elite pitcher and an elite hitter — he is. In 2024 he became the first player with 50 home runs and 50 stolen bases in one season, and he's a multiple MVP.","fact":"2023 年他跟道奇签了 10 年 7 亿美元的合同，却主动提出其中 6.8 亿延后到 2034–2043 年再领，十年里每年只拿 200 万，好让球队有钱签别的好球员。","fact_en":"His 2023 Dodgers deal was worth $700 million over 10 years, yet he proposed deferring $680 million of it until 2034–2043, taking just $2 million a year so the team could afford other stars.","src":"NBC / AP，2023","url":"https://www.nbcsandiego.com/news/sports/mlb/shohei-ohtani-to-defer-680-million-of-dodgers-contract-until-end-of-deal-reports-say","quote":{"en":"Let's stop admiring them.","zh":"我们不要再崇拜他们了。","where":"2023 年 3 月 21 日 WBC 决赛对美国队之前，在更衣室对队友说的（日语「憧れるのをやめましょう」）","where_en":"To his Team Japan teammates in the locker room before the 2023 World Baseball Classic final against the USA, 21 March 2023"},"say":{"en":"Is Ohtani pitching or just batting today?","zh":"大谷今天投球还是只打击？"}},"羽生结弦":{"kind":"person","what":"日本仙台出生的花样滑冰选手，连续两届冬奥会男单金牌。","what_en":"The figure skater from Sendai, Japan, who won men's singles gold at two Winter Olympics in a row.","fame":"2014 索契、2018 平昌连拿金牌，是 66 年来第一个卫冕的男单选手；滑得又美又难，粉丝每次都往冰上扔小熊维尼玩偶。","fame_en":"Gold in Sochi 2014 and PyeongChang 2018 made him the first man in 66 years to defend the Olympic title. His skating is both beautiful and difficult, and fans shower the ice with Winnie-the-Pooh toys after he skates.","fact":"2022 年北京冬奥会自由滑，他挑战了谁都没在比赛里成功过的四周半跳（4A），虽然摔倒、周数不足，但被国际滑联正式记为「4A 挑战」——这是奥运会这种大赛上第一次有人跳 4A。","fact_en":"In his Beijing 2022 free skate he attempted the quadruple Axel, which no one had ever landed in competition. He fell and it was under-rotated, but the ISU officially recorded it as a quad Axel attempt — the first ever at an Olympics or World Championships.","src":"Wikipedia · Quadruple jump","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quadruple_jump","say":{"en":"Why do fans throw Winnie-the-Pooh toys on the ice?","zh":"粉丝为什么往冰上扔小熊维尼？"}},"孙兴慜":{"kind":"person","what":"韩国足球队队长，在热刺踢了十年，2025 年去了洛杉矶 FC。","what_en":"South Korea's football captain, who spent ten years at Tottenham before joining Los Angeles FC in 2025.","fame":"他是英超最成功的亚洲球员：2021–22 赛季拿了英超金靴（23 球，没有一个点球），还拿过普斯卡什奖最佳进球。笑容和跑动在伦敦人缘极好。","fame_en":"He's the most successful Asian player in Premier League history: he shared the 2021–22 Golden Boot with 23 goals, none from penalties, and won the Puskás Award for goal of the year. Londoners love his smile and work rate.","fact":"2025 年 5 月他作为队长带热刺拿了欧联杯，结束了球队 17 年没拿奖杯的日子；三个月后转会洛杉矶 FC，转会费约 2650 万美元，是美职联历史最高。","fact_en":"In May 2025 he captained Spurs to the Europa League, ending the club's 17-year trophy drought; three months later he moved to LAFC for a reported $26.5 million — the biggest fee in MLS history.","src":"Sports Illustrated，2025","url":"https://www.si.com/soccer/lafc-smash-mls-transfer-record-sign-son-heung-min","say":{"en":"Did you see Sonny lift the Europa League trophy?","zh":"你看到孙兴慜举起欧联杯了吗？"}},"科利":{"kind":"person","what":"印度板球明星维拉特·科利，长年当印度队的主力击球手和队长。","what_en":"Virat Kohli, the Indian cricket superstar — a long-time star batter and former captain of India.","fame":"板球在印度像宗教，他是这一代最会得分的击球手；Instagram 上关注他的人比任何印度人都多。他一直效力班加罗尔皇家挑战者队，2025 年终于跟队拿了第一个 IPL 冠军。","fame_en":"Cricket is close to a religion in India, and he's the run machine of his generation, with more Instagram followers than any other Indian. He has played his whole IPL career for Royal Challengers Bengaluru, finally winning their first title in 2025.","fact":"2023 年 11 月 15 日世界杯半决赛，他在孟买打出个人第 50 个单日赛百分，超过了偶像坦杜尔卡的 49 个；坦杜尔卡本人就坐在看台上鼓掌，科利向他鞠躬。","fact_en":"In the World Cup semi-final in Mumbai on 15 November 2023 he scored his 50th ODI century, passing his childhood hero Sachin Tendulkar's 49 — with Tendulkar himself applauding in the stands as Kohli bowed to him.","src":"Al Jazeera，2023","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2023/11/15/india-vs-new-zealand-virat-kohli-breaks-sachin-tendulkars-odi-record-icc-cricket-world-cup-2023","say":{"en":"Is Kohli batting yet? I don't want to miss it.","zh":"科利上场打了吗？我不想错过。"}},"坂本龙马":{"kind":"person","what":"日本幕府末年土佐（今天的高知）出身的武士，推动日本走向明治维新。","what_en":"A samurai from Tosa (today's Kōchi) at the end of Japan's shogun era, who helped push Japan towards the Meiji Restoration.","fame":"他撮合了原本敌对的萨摩和长州结成同盟（1866），还办了日本最早的商社之一「龟山社中」；1867 年 31 岁在京都被刺杀。今天他是日本人最喜欢的历史人物之一，电视剧、漫画一拍再拍。","fame_en":"He brokered the 1866 alliance between the rival Satsuma and Chōshū domains and ran one of Japan's first trading companies, the Kameyama Shachū. He was assassinated in Kyoto in 1867 at 31, and remains one of Japan's best-loved historical figures, endlessly retold in dramas and manga.","fact":"1866 年他在京都伏见寺田屋被围攻受伤，后来跟妻子阿龙去鹿儿岛雾岛泡温泉养伤、爬高千穗峰——当地说这是「日本第一次蜜月旅行」。","fact_en":"After being wounded in an attack at the Teradaya inn in Fushimi in 1866, he and his wife Oryō went to Kirishima in Kagoshima to recover in the hot springs and climb Mount Takachiho — locally said to be Japan's first honeymoon.","src":"日本国家旅游局 Japan Travel · 雾岛温泉","url":"https://www.japan.travel/en/spot/598","quote":{"en":"I will wash Japan clean once more.","zh":"要把日本再洗一次。","where":"1863 年（文久三年）6 月 29 日写给姐姐乙女的信，原件在京都国立博物馆，是日本重要文化财","where_en":"Letter to his sister Otome, 29th day of the 6th month, 1863; the original, an Important Cultural Property, is at the Kyoto National Museum"},"say":{"en":"Is this where Sakamoto Ryōma is buried?","zh":"坂本龙马就葬在这儿吗？"}},"曹雪芹":{"kind":"person","what":"写《红楼梦》的清朝作家。家里原来在南京做大官，后来被抄家，他晚年在北京西郊过得很穷。","what_en":"The Qing-dynasty writer of Dream of the Red Chamber. His family were once powerful officials in Nanjing, then lost everything; he spent his last years poor in Beijing's western hills.","fame":"《红楼梦》常被看作中国最伟大的小说：写一个大家族从富到败，几百个人物，每个都活生生的。研究这一本书的学问，有个专门的名字叫「红学」。","fame_en":"Dream of the Red Chamber is often called China's greatest novel — the rise and fall of a great family, with hundreds of characters who all feel alive. Studying this one book even has its own name: 'Redology'.","fact":"我们读的一百二十回，后四十回不一定是他写的。2018 年人民文学出版社的新版，把作者从「曹雪芹、高鹗著」改成了「前八十回曹雪芹著，后四十回无名氏续，程伟元、高鹗整理」。","fact_en":"The last 40 of the 120 chapters may not be his. In 2018 China's People's Literature Publishing House changed the author line from 'Cao Xueqin and Gao E' to 'first 80 chapters by Cao Xueqin, last 40 by an unknown author, edited by Cheng Weiyuan and Gao E'.","src":"中国作家网，2018","url":"https://www.chinawriter.com.cn/n1/2018/0710/c404063-30136971.html","quote":{"en":"Pages full of absurd words, a handful of bitter tears. They all call the author mad — who understands the taste within?","zh":"满纸荒唐言，一把辛酸泪。都云作者痴，谁解其中味？","where":"他写在《红楼梦》第一回里的诗","where_en":"A poem he wrote into Chapter 1 of the novel"},"say":{"en":"Have you read Dream of the Red Chamber? Who's your favourite character?","zh":"你看过《红楼梦》吗？最喜欢哪个人物？"}},"关羽":{"kind":"person","what":"三国时蜀国的大将，就是那位红脸、长胡子、拿青龙偃月刀的「关公」。","what_en":"The Three Kingdoms general of Shu — 'Lord Guan', the red-faced, long-bearded warrior with the crescent-moon blade.","fame":"他因为讲义气，死后被越拜越高，成了「关帝」：既是武神，也是生意人的财神，很多店铺、餐馆里都供着他的像。","fame_en":"Famous for loyalty, he was worshipped more and more after his death until he became 'Emperor Guan' — a god of war and, for business people, a god of wealth. Many shops and restaurants keep his statue.","fact":"2016 年湖北荆州建了一座 58 米高的关公像，没几年就被认定违反城市规划、浪费钱，2022 年拆掉了，说是要搬到别处重建。","fact_en":"In 2016 Jingzhou in Hubei built a 58-metre Guan Yu statue. Within a few years it was ruled a planning violation and a waste of money, and in 2022 it was taken down, to be rebuilt somewhere else.","src":"Wikipedia：Statue of Guan Yu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Statue_of_Guan_Yu","say":{"en":"Why do so many shops have a little statue of Guan Yu?","zh":"为什么好多店里都摆着关公像？"}},"武则天":{"kind":"person","what":"唐朝时的皇帝，中国历史上唯一一位正式称帝的女人。","what_en":"A Tang-era ruler — the only woman in Chinese history to take the throne as emperor in her own name.","fame":"690 年她把国号改成「周」，自己当了皇帝，统治了十五年。她提拔了很多考科举上来的人，也因为手段狠，到今天还有人争论她是好是坏。","fame_en":"In 690 she renamed the dynasty 'Zhou' and made herself emperor, ruling for fifteen years. She promoted many officials who came up through the exams — and her ruthlessness means people still argue about her today.","fact":"她的名字「曌」（日月当空）是专门造的字：689 年一位官员献上十几个新字，朝廷推行了十几年，她去世后这些字很快就没人用了，「曌」却留了下来。","fact_en":"Her name character 曌 ('sun and moon over the sky') was invented: in 689 an official proposed a dozen-odd new characters, the court used them for about fifteen years, and after her death they quickly vanished — except 曌.","src":"Wikipedia：Chinese characters of Empress Wu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_characters_of_Empress_Wu","say":{"en":"Wu Zetian was the only woman to rule China as emperor.","zh":"武则天是中国唯一一位女皇帝。"}},"成吉思汗":{"kind":"person","what":"蒙古帝国的建立者，13 世纪把草原上的部落统一了起来。","what_en":"The founder of the Mongol Empire, who united the steppe tribes in the 13th century.","fame":"他和子孙打下的蒙古帝国，是历史上连成一片的最大的陆上帝国，从太平洋一直到东欧。","fame_en":"The empire he and his descendants built was the largest connected land empire in history, stretching from the Pacific to Eastern Europe.","fact":"2003 年一项基因研究发现：原来蒙古帝国范围里，大约 8% 的男人带着几乎一样的 Y 染色体，算下来全世界约 0.5%、大约 1600 万人。研究者认为很可能来自成吉思汗家族。","fact_en":"A 2003 genetic study found that about 8% of men across the old Mongol Empire share a nearly identical Y chromosome — roughly 0.5% of all men, about 16 million people. The researchers think it most likely comes from Genghis Khan's family line.","src":"National Geographic，2003","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/culture/article/mongolia-genghis-khan-dna","say":{"en":"Is it true that millions of people today may be related to Genghis Khan?","zh":"听说现在有上千万人可能是成吉思汗的后代，真的吗？"}},"张爱玲":{"kind":"person","what":"在上海长大的作家，写了《倾城之恋》《金锁记》，后来去了美国，1995 年在洛杉矶去世。","what_en":"A writer who grew up in Shanghai — Love in a Fallen City, The Golden Cangue — and later moved to the US, dying in Los Angeles in 1995.","fame":"她二十出头在上海写的小说一下子红了：写上海、香港的男女和家里的事，又冷又准。很多人觉得她是二十世纪最好的中文作家之一；《色，戒》被李安拍成了电影。","fame_en":"The stories she wrote in Shanghai in her early twenties made her famous overnight — cool, precise tales of love and family in Shanghai and Hong Kong. Many call her one of the finest Chinese writers of the 20th century; Ang Lee filmed her Lust, Caution.","fact":"她晚年写完自传味很重的小说《小团圆》，曾让好友宋淇夫妇把手稿毁掉。手稿没被毁，在她去世十四年后的 2009 年出版了。","fact_en":"Late in life she finished Little Reunions, a thinly veiled autobiography, and asked her friends the Soongs to destroy the manuscript. They didn't — it came out in 2009, fourteen years after her death.","src":"London Review of Books，2019","url":"https://lrb.co.uk/the-paper/v41/n15/sheng-yun/small-feet-were-an-advantage","quote":{"en":"Be famous early! If it comes too late, even the happiness isn't as sweet.","zh":"出名要趁早呀！来得太晚的话，快乐也不那么痛快。","where":"1944 年她小说集《传奇》再版的序里写的","where_en":"From her preface to the second edition of her story collection Romances (传奇), 1944"},"say":{"en":"Which Eileen Chang story should I read first?","zh":"张爱玲的小说，我先看哪一篇好？"}},"鲁迅":{"kind":"person","what":"本名周树人，浙江绍兴人，写《狂人日记》《阿Q正传》的作家。","what_en":"Real name Zhou Shuren, from Shaoxing — the writer of A Madman's Diary and The True Story of Ah Q.","fame":"他本来去日本学医，后来觉得治人心更要紧，改行写文章。几代中国学生的课本里都有他，「阿Q」「孔乙己」成了人人都懂的说法。","fame_en":"He went to Japan to study medicine, then decided that healing minds mattered more and turned to writing. Generations of Chinese pupils have read him at school, and 'Ah Q' and 'Kong Yiji' are names everyone understands.","fact":"网上很多「鲁迅说过」其实是编的。2019 年媒体报道北京鲁迅博物馆有个能查他原文的在线系统，大批网友跑去验证，网站一度崩溃。","fact_en":"Many lines online that 'Lu Xun said' are made up. In 2019, after the media reported that the Beijing Lu Xun Museum had an online search of his complete works, so many people rushed to check quotes that the site crashed.","src":"中国新闻网，2019","url":"https://www.chinanews.com/cul/2019/05-10/8833059.shtml","quote":{"en":"In fact, there were no roads on earth to begin with; when many people walk the same way, it becomes a road.","zh":"其实地上本没有路，走的人多了，也便成了路。","where":"1921 年小说《故乡》的最后一句","where_en":"The last line of his 1921 story My Old Home (故乡)"},"say":{"en":"Did Lu Xun really say that, or is it made up?","zh":"这句话真是鲁迅说的，还是编的？"}},"孙中山":{"kind":"person","what":"广东香山（今中山市）人，推翻清朝、建立中华民国的革命领袖，被称为「国父」。","what_en":"From Xiangshan (today's Zhongshan) in Guangdong — the revolutionary who helped bring down the Qing and founded the Republic of China, called the 'Father of the Nation'.","fame":"1911 年辛亥革命后，两千多年的皇帝制度结束了。海峡两岸都纪念他，很多城市都有「中山路」「中山公园」。","fame_en":"After the 1911 Revolution, more than two thousand years of emperors came to an end. He is honoured on both sides of the Taiwan Strait, and countless cities have a Zhongshan Road or Zhongshan Park.","fact":"1896 年他在伦敦被清政府驻英使馆骗进去关了 12 天，准备偷偷押回国。他的老师康德黎医生去找报纸曝光，英国政府出面才放人——这件事让他一下子在全世界出了名。","fact_en":"In 1896 he was lured into the Chinese Legation in London and held for 12 days, to be smuggled back to China. His old teacher Dr James Cantlie went to the newspapers, the British government stepped in, and he was freed — the story made him famous worldwide.","src":"Wikipedia：Kidnapped in London","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kidnapped_in_London","quote":{"en":"The revolution is not yet complete; comrades, you must keep striving.","zh":"革命尚未成功，同志仍须努力。","where":"1925 年他去世前签字的遗嘱里的话","where_en":"From the will he signed shortly before his death in 1925"},"say":{"en":"Why does almost every Chinese city have a Zhongshan Road?","zh":"为什么几乎每个中国城市都有中山路？"}},"郑和":{"kind":"person","what":"明朝的航海家，云南回族人，带着庞大的船队七次下西洋。","what_en":"A Ming-dynasty admiral, a Hui Muslim from Yunnan, who led a vast fleet on seven voyages to the 'Western Oceans'.","fame":"1405 到 1433 年，他的船队到过东南亚、印度、阿拉伯半岛，一直到非洲东岸，比哥伦布出发早了八十多年。","fame_en":"Between 1405 and 1433 his fleet reached Southeast Asia, India, Arabia and the coast of East Africa — more than eighty years before Columbus set sail.","fact":"1414 年他的船队在孟加拉遇到东非马林迪（在今天的肯尼亚）的使节，带回一头长颈鹿献给永乐皇帝。朝廷当它是传说里的麒麟，还专门画了下来。","fact_en":"In 1414 his fleet met envoys from Malindi (in today's Kenya) in Bengal and brought a giraffe back for the Yongle Emperor. The court took it for a qilin, the mythical beast, and had it painted.","src":"Science News","url":"https://www.sciencenews.org/blog/wild-things/giraffes-sailed-medieval-china","say":{"en":"Did Zheng He's ships really reach Africa?","zh":"郑和的船真的到过非洲吗？"}},"杨贵妃":{"kind":"person","what":"唐玄宗最宠的贵妃，中国古代「四大美人」之一。","what_en":"Emperor Xuanzong's favourite consort — one of the 'Four Beauties' of ancient China.","fame":"唐玄宗宠她宠到误了国事；安史之乱时，她在马嵬坡被逼死。白居易的《长恨歌》写的就是他们的故事。","fame_en":"The emperor doted on her so much that the state suffered; during the An Lushan Rebellion she was forced to die at Mawei. Bai Juyi's poem Song of Everlasting Sorrow tells their story.","fact":"杜牧那句「一骑红尘妃子笑，无人知是荔枝来」，被马伯庸写成小说《长安的荔枝》：一个小官要把新鲜荔枝几千里送到长安。2025 年它被拍成了电视剧、电影，还改成了话剧。","fact_en":"Du Mu's line about a galloping horse kicking up dust, the consort smiling — and no one knowing it's lychees — became Ma Boyong's novel The Lychee Road, about a minor clerk who must rush fresh lychees thousands of miles to Chang'an. In 2025 it became a TV series, a film and a stage play.","src":"封面新闻，2025","url":"https://cbgc.scol.com.cn/news/8043330","say":{"en":"Is it true they rushed fresh lychees to her on horseback?","zh":"听说她爱吃荔枝，要快马送过来，是真的吗？"}},"周杰伦":{"kind":"person","what":"台湾歌手、写歌的人，《七里香》《晴天》《稻香》都是他的。","what_en":"The Taiwanese singer-songwriter behind Common Jasmine Orange, Sunny Day and Rice Field.","fame":"他把 R&B、嘻哈和中国风混在一起，2000 年出道后改变了华语流行音乐；很多人的青春就是他的歌。","fame_en":"He blended R&B, hip-hop and Chinese-style melodies and changed Mandarin pop after his 2000 debut — for many people, his songs are the soundtrack of growing up.","fact":"他 2022 年的专辑《最伟大的作品》是国际唱片业协会（IFPI）那一年全球专辑销量第一，排在 BTS 和泰勒·斯威夫特前面——第一次有华语专辑拿到这个第一。","fact_en":"His 2022 album Greatest Works of Art topped IFPI's global album sales chart for that year, ahead of BTS and Taylor Swift — the first Mandarin album ever to do so.","src":"Asia News Network，2023","url":"https://asianews.network/jay-chou-is-first-mandopop-singer-to-top-ifpis-global-album-sales-chart/","say":{"en":"Which Jay Chou song do you always pick at KTV?","zh":"你去 KTV 必点周杰伦哪首？"}},"苏炳添":{"kind":"person","what":"广东中山人，中国短跑运动员。","what_en":"A Chinese sprinter from Zhongshan in Guangdong.","fame":"2021 年东京奥运会男子百米半决赛，他跑出 9 秒 83，破了亚洲纪录，成了第一个跑进奥运百米决赛的中国人。","fame_en":"In the 100 m semi-final at the Tokyo Olympics in 2021 he ran 9.83 seconds — an Asian record — and became the first Chinese man to reach an Olympic 100 m final.","fact":"他不只是运动员，还是暨南大学体育学院的副教授，有博士学位。","fact_en":"He isn't only an athlete — he's also an associate professor at Jinan University's School of Physical Education, with a PhD.","src":"China Daily，2021","url":"https://guangdong.chinadaily.com.cn/2021-10/21/c_670076.htm","say":{"en":"9.83 seconds — can you imagine running that fast?","zh":"9 秒 83，你能想象跑那么快吗？"}},"全红婵":{"kind":"person","what":"广东湛江农村长大的跳水运动员，2007 年出生。","what_en":"A diver born in 2007 who grew up in a farming village near Zhanjiang, Guangdong.","fame":"2021 年东京奥运会，14 岁的她在女子十米台好几跳拿到裁判全给的 10 分，以 466.20 分夺冠，「水花消失术」火遍全网；2024 年巴黎奥运会她又拿了这个项目的金牌。","fame_en":"At the Tokyo Olympics in 2021, aged 14, she scored perfect 10s from every judge on several dives and won the women's 10 m platform with 466.20 points — her 'vanishing splash' went viral. In Paris 2024 she won the event again.","fact":"2014 年她在学校操场上跳格子，被教练陈华明一眼看中，才开始学跳水。东京夺冠后她说最想去游乐园和动物园，后来真的去了长隆。","fact_en":"In 2014 coach Chen Huaming spotted her playing hopscotch in the school playground, and that's how she started diving. After her Tokyo win she said what she wanted most was a trip to an amusement park and a zoo — and she got one, at Chimelong.","src":"Wikipedia：Quan Hongchan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quan_Hongchan","say":{"en":"Her dives barely make a splash!","zh":"她入水几乎没有水花！"}},"郑钦文":{"kind":"person","what":"湖北十堰人，网球运动员，2002 年出生。","what_en":"A tennis player from Shiyan in Hubei, born in 2002.","fame":"2024 年巴黎奥运会，她在半决赛赢了世界第一斯瓦泰克，最后拿到女单金牌——第一个拿到奥运网球单打金牌的亚洲人。","fame_en":"At the 2024 Paris Olympics she beat world No. 1 Iga Świątek in the semi-final and went on to win gold — the first Asian player to win an Olympic tennis singles title.","fact":"她 2019 年底就去了西班牙，在巴塞罗那建了训练基地，现在常住那里，跟西班牙教练佩雷·里巴练球。","fact_en":"In late 2019 she moved to Spain and set up her training base in Barcelona, where she still lives, working with the Spanish coach Pere Riba.","src":"Wikipedia：Zheng Qinwen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zheng_Qinwen","say":{"en":"Did you watch Zheng Qinwen's Olympic final?","zh":"你看了郑钦文的奥运决赛吗？"}},"李娜":{"kind":"person","what":"湖北武汉人，已经退役的网球运动员。","what_en":"A retired tennis player from Wuhan.","fame":"2011 年她拿了法网冠军，是第一个拿到大满贯单打冠军的亚洲人；2014 年又拿了澳网。","fame_en":"In 2011 she won the French Open, the first Asian player to win a Grand Slam singles title; in 2014 she added the Australian Open.","fact":"2019 年她进了国际网球名人堂，是第一位入选的亚洲出生球员。","fact_en":"In 2019 she was inducted into the International Tennis Hall of Fame — the first Asian-born player to get in.","src":"Gulf News（美联社），2019","url":"https://gulfnews.com/sport/tennis/li-na-first-asian-born-player-in-tennis-hall-of-fame-1.65357431","quote":{"en":"Max, agent — make me rich. Thanks a lot.","zh":"马克斯，我的经纪人——让我发了财，多谢。","where":"2014 年澳网夺冠后的致辞，感谢经纪人时说的","where_en":"From her 2014 Australian Open winner's speech, thanking her agent"},"say":{"en":"Li Na's victory speeches were so funny!","zh":"李娜的夺冠致辞太好笑了！"}},"马龙":{"kind":"person","what":"辽宁鞍山人，乒乓球运动员。","what_en":"A table tennis player from Anshan in Liaoning.","fame":"他拿过奥运会、世锦赛、世界杯的单打冠军，而且这三样拿了两轮；2016 年和东京奥运会，他连续两届拿男单金牌。","fame_en":"He has won the Olympic, World Championship and World Cup singles titles — and done the full set twice — taking back-to-back Olympic singles golds at Rio 2016 and Tokyo.","fact":"2024 年巴黎奥运会男团夺冠后，他一共有 6 枚奥运金牌，成了拿奥运金牌最多的中国运动员，超过了吴敏霞、陈若琳和邹凯。","fact_en":"After China won the men's team event at Paris 2024 he had six Olympic golds, making him China's most decorated Olympic champion, ahead of Wu Minxia, Chen Ruolin and Zou Kai.","src":"亚奥理事会（OCA），2024","url":"https://oca.asia/news/5383-chinese-table-tennis-legend-ma-long-wins-sixth-olympic-gold-medal.html","say":{"en":"Do you play ping-pong? My serve is terrible.","zh":"你打乒乓球吗？我发球很烂。"}},"孙颖莎":{"kind":"person","what":"河北石家庄人，乒乓球运动员，2000 年出生。","what_en":"A table tennis player from Shijiazhuang in Hebei, born in 2000.","fame":"她长期是女单世界第一；2024 年巴黎奥运会和王楚钦拿了混双金牌，球迷管这对搭档叫「莎头」。","fame_en":"She has spent years as the women's world No. 1, and at Paris 2024 she won mixed doubles gold with Wang Chuqin — fans call the pair 'Sha-Tou'.","fact":"2025 年多哈世乒赛女单决赛，她和队友王曼昱打满七局，4 比 3 赢下来，卫冕了世界冠军。","fact_en":"In the women's singles final at the 2025 World Championships in Doha she beat teammate Wang Manyu 4–3 over the full seven games to keep her world title.","src":"Wikipedia：2025 世乒赛女单","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_World_Table_Tennis_Championships_%E2%80%93_Women%27s_singles","say":{"en":"Who's your favourite table tennis player?","zh":"你最喜欢哪个乒乓球运动员？"}},"刘翔":{"kind":"person","what":"上海人，110 米栏运动员，2015 年退役。","what_en":"A 110 m hurdler from Shanghai, retired in 2015.","fame":"2004 年雅典奥运会，他跑出 12 秒 91、平了世界纪录夺冠，拿到中国男子第一块奥运田径金牌。","fame_en":"At the 2004 Athens Olympics he won in 12.91 seconds, equalling the world record — China's first ever Olympic gold for a man in athletics.","fact":"2012 年伦敦奥运会，他跟腱断了，第一个栏就摔倒。他单脚跳到终点，还弯腰亲了一下最后一个栏。","fact_en":"At London 2012 his Achilles tendon tore and he crashed into the very first hurdle. He hopped the length of the track on one leg and bent down to kiss the final hurdle.","src":"ABC News，2012","url":"https://abcnews.go.com/blogs/headlines/2012/08/heartbreak-in-china-as-track-star-crashes-out-of-another-olympics/","say":{"en":"I still remember where I was when Liu Xiang won in Athens.","zh":"刘翔在雅典夺冠那天我在干什么，到现在还记得。"}},"潘展乐":{"kind":"person","what":"浙江温州人，游泳运动员，2004 年出生。","what_en":"A swimmer from Wenzhou in Zhejiang, born in 2004.","fame":"2024 年巴黎奥运会男子 100 米自由泳，他游出 46 秒 40 打破世界纪录夺冠——这个项目一直是欧美、澳洲选手的天下。","fame_en":"At the 2024 Paris Olympics he won the men's 100 m freestyle in a world-record 46.40 seconds — in an event long ruled by swimmers from Europe, the US and Australia.","fact":"他比第二名快了一秒多，是这个项目自 1928 年以来奥运会上最大的领先；被他打破的世界纪录，也是他自己几个月前在多哈创的。","fact_en":"He won by more than a second, the biggest Olympic winning margin in the event since 1928 — and the world record he broke was his own, set in Doha a few months earlier.","src":"Wikipedia：巴黎奥运会男子 100 米自由泳","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swimming_at_the_2024_Summer_Olympics_%E2%80%93_Men%27s_100-metre_freestyle","say":{"en":"How long does it take you to swim 100 metres?","zh":"你游 100 米要多久？"}},"张艺谋":{"kind":"person","what":"西安人，电影导演，拍了《红高粱》《英雄》《满江红》。","what_en":"A film director from Xi'an — Red Sorghum, Hero, Full River Red.","fame":"他导演了 2008 年北京奥运会和 2022 年北京冬奥会的开幕式，是第一个夏季、冬季奥运会开幕式都导过的人。","fame_en":"He directed the opening ceremonies of the 2008 Beijing Olympics and the 2022 Beijing Winter Olympics — the first person to direct both a Summer and a Winter Games.","fact":"年轻时他在纺织厂当工人，为了买第一台照相机去卖了血；后来北京电影学院恢复招生时他已经超龄，是靠一叠摄影作品被破格录取的。","fact_en":"As a young textile-mill worker he sold his blood to buy his first camera. When the Beijing Film Academy reopened he was over the age limit, and got in on the strength of his photography.","src":"Bostonia（波士顿大学），2018","url":"https://www.bu.edu/bostonia/2018/zhang-yimou/","say":{"en":"Did you watch the 2008 opening ceremony?","zh":"你看过 2008 年奥运会开幕式吗？"}},"饺子导演":{"kind":"person","what":"本名杨宇，四川泸州人，《哪吒之魔童降世》《哪吒之魔童闹海》的导演。","what_en":"Real name Yang Yu, from Luzhou in Sichuan — the director of the two Ne Zha animated films.","fame":"2025 年《哪吒之魔童闹海》全球票房超过 20 亿美元，成了全世界票房最高的动画电影；他也是第一个电影票房过 10 亿、20 亿美元的好莱坞以外的导演。","fame_en":"In 2025 Ne Zha 2 took more than US$2 billion worldwide, becoming the highest-grossing animated film ever — and he became the first director outside Hollywood with a film past both US$1 billion and US$2 billion.","fact":"他大学学的是药学，动画全靠自学；辞职做动画那几年没有收入，靠妈妈每月一千块左右的退休金过日子。","fact_en":"He studied pharmacy at university and taught himself animation; in the years after he quit his job he had no income and lived on his mother's pension of about 1,000 yuan a month.","src":"Wikipedia：Jiaozi (director)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jiaozi_(director)","say":{"en":"Have you seen Ne Zha 2? Is it worth it?","zh":"你看《哪吒2》了吗？值得看吗？"}},"维克多·雨果":{"kind":"person","what":"法国作家，写了《悲惨世界》和《巴黎圣母院》。","what_en":"The French writer of Les Misérables and The Hunchback of Notre-Dame.","fame":"他用小说替穷人、孤儿和囚犯说话；《悲惨世界》后来变成全世界演得最久的音乐剧之一。他还救了巴黎圣母院——当年这座教堂破得快被拆，他的小说让人们重新爱上它，才修了起来。","fame_en":"His novels spoke up for the poor, orphans and prisoners, and Les Misérables became one of the longest-running musicals in the world. He even helped save Notre-Dame: the cathedral was falling apart until his novel made people love it again and it was restored.","fact":"2019 年 4 月 15 日巴黎圣母院着火后，第二天他的《巴黎圣母院》就冲上了亚马逊法国畅销榜第一，前十名里同时有好几个版本——一本 1831 年的小说又被抢着买。","fact_en":"After Notre-Dame caught fire on 15 April 2019, his novel Notre-Dame de Paris shot to number one on Amazon France the very next day, with several editions in the top ten at once — an 1831 novel selling out all over again.","src":"NBC News，2019","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/europe/hunchback-notre-dame-book-sales-spike-wake-fire-n995071","quote":{"en":"So long as ignorance and misery remain on earth, books like this cannot be useless.","zh":"只要世上还有无知和苦难，这样的书就不会没有用。","where":"1862 年《悲惨世界》的序言里写的","where_en":"From his preface to Les Misérables, 1862"},"say":{"en":"Have you read Les Mis, or just seen the musical?","zh":"你读过《悲惨世界》，还是只看过音乐剧？"}},"可可·香奈儿":{"kind":"person","what":"法国时装设计师，香奈儿（Chanel）品牌的创始人。","what_en":"The French fashion designer who founded Chanel.","fame":"她让女人脱掉紧身胸衣，穿上舒服的针织套装、小黑裙和长裤；香奈儿 5 号香水到今天还是全世界最有名的香水之一。","fame_en":"She got women out of corsets and into comfortable jersey suits, the little black dress and trousers. Chanel No. 5 is still one of the most famous perfumes in the world.","fact":"「5 号」这个名字是随手挑的：调香师恩内斯特·博给她看了编着号的几小瓶样品，她选了第五瓶，说自己五月五号发布新衣服，就留着这个吉利数字。香水 1921 年 5 月 5 日开卖。","fact_en":"The name 'No. 5' was almost an accident: perfumer Ernest Beaux showed her a set of numbered sample vials, she picked the fifth, and since she showed her collections on 5 May she kept the lucky number. It went on sale on 5 May 1921.","src":"Wikipedia：Chanel No. 5","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chanel_No._5","say":{"en":"Is this the original Chanel shop on Rue Cambon?","zh":"这是康朋街上香奈儿的老店吗？"}},"齐达内":{"kind":"person","what":"法国足球运动员和教练，马赛长大的阿尔及利亚移民的孩子。","what_en":"The French footballer and coach, son of Algerian immigrants, who grew up in Marseille.","fame":"1998 年世界杯决赛他头球进了两个，法国第一次拿世界杯；后来当皇马教练，连拿三届欧冠（2016–2018），以前没人做到过。","fame_en":"He headed in two goals in the 1998 World Cup final to win France its first World Cup, then as Real Madrid coach won three Champions Leagues in a row (2016–18) — something nobody had done before.","fact":"他 2006 年世界杯决赛头顶马特拉齐的那一下，被艺术家做成了 5 米高的铜像《头槌》，先摆在巴黎蓬皮杜中心门口；2013 年卡塔尔买去放在多哈海边，结果不到一个月就因为有人反对被撤走了。","fact_en":"His headbutt on Materazzi in the 2006 World Cup final was turned into a 5-metre bronze, 'Coup de tête', first shown outside the Pompidou Centre in Paris. Qatar bought it and put it on Doha's waterfront in 2013 — and removed it within a month after protests.","src":"Al Jazeera，2013","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/amp/news/2013/10/31/qatar-removes-zidane-statue-after-outcry","say":{"en":"Can you do the Zidane roulette?","zh":"你会齐达内那个马赛回旋吗？"}},"拿破仑":{"kind":"person","what":"科西嘉岛出生的军人，后来当了法国皇帝。","what_en":"The soldier from Corsica who made himself Emperor of France.","fame":"他打下了半个欧洲，又在滑铁卢输掉一切；他留下的《拿破仑法典》到今天还是很多国家民法的底子，法国的省长制度、高中会考也是那时定下的。","fame_en":"He conquered half of Europe and lost it all at Waterloo, but his Napoleonic Code is still the basis of civil law in many countries, and much of how France is run dates from his time.","fact":"2023 年 11 月，他戴过的一顶双角帽在枫丹白露拍卖，卖了约 193 万欧元，是拿破仑帽子的最高价；他一生大概有 120 顶这样的帽子，今天真正留下来的只剩二十来顶。","fact_en":"In November 2023 one of his bicorne hats sold at auction in Fontainebleau for about €1.93 million, a record for a Napoleon hat. He reportedly owned around 120 of them; only about twenty genuine ones survive.","src":"The Connexion，2023","url":"https://connexionfrance.com/article/French-news/Napoleon-s-bicorne-hat-sells-for-1.9m-at-French-auction","say":{"en":"Is Napoleon buried here at Les Invalides?","zh":"拿破仑就葬在荣军院这儿吗？"}},"马可·波罗":{"kind":"person","what":"13 世纪的威尼斯商人，跟着父亲和叔叔去了元朝的中国。","what_en":"The 13th-century Venetian merchant who travelled with his father and uncle to Yuan-dynasty China.","fame":"他回来后在监狱里口述了一本《马可·波罗游记》，第一次让很多欧洲人知道东方有那么大、那么富的城市；后来哥伦布出海时还带着这本书。","fame_en":"Back home, while in prison, he dictated his Travels, which showed Europeans for the first time how big and rich the cities of the East were. Columbus later carried a copy on his voyages.","fact":"2024 年是他去世 700 年，威尼斯总督府办了一个大展，300 多件东西从亚美尼亚、中国、卡塔尔借来；可展里没有一张他本人的真像——他活着的时候没有留下任何可信的画像，我们见过的样子全是后人想象的。","fact_en":"2024 marked 700 years since his death, and Venice's Doge's Palace held a big show with over 300 objects on loan from Armenia, China, Qatar and more. Yet there's no true portrait of him: no reliable likeness survives from his lifetime, so every face you've seen is imagined.","src":"SCMP，2024","url":"https://scmp.com/lifestyle/travel-leisure/article/3258489/venice-opens-big-marco-polo-show-mark-700-years-death-merchant-who-travelled-china","say":{"en":"Do you think Marco Polo really went to China?","zh":"你觉得马可·波罗真的去过中国吗？"}},"达利":{"kind":"person","what":"西班牙超现实主义画家，留着两撇翘起来的小胡子。","what_en":"The Spanish surrealist painter with the upturned moustache.","fame":"《记忆的永恒》里软掉的钟表，可能是世界上最有名的「怪」画；他把自己也活成了作品，加泰罗尼亚的菲格雷斯有他亲手设计的剧院博物馆。","fame_en":"The melting clocks of The Persistence of Memory may be the world's most famous strange painting. He turned himself into an artwork too, and designed his own Theatre-Museum in Figueres, Catalonia.","fact":"2017 年一位算塔罗牌的女士说自己是他女儿，法院下令开棺取 DNA；打开后他的小胡子还保持着「十点十分」的样子。检测结果：她不是他女儿。","fact_en":"In 2017 a tarot reader claimed to be his daughter, and a court ordered his body exhumed for DNA. When they opened the tomb, his moustache was still in its 'ten past ten' position. The result: she wasn't his daughter.","src":"Catalan News，2017","url":"https://www.catalannews.com/culture/item/dali-s-body-back-in-place-after-paternity-test","quote":{"en":"Every morning upon awakening, I experience a supreme pleasure: that of being Salvador Dalí.","zh":"每天早上醒来，我都体会到一种至高的快乐：我是萨尔瓦多·达利。","where":"1964 年他的《一个天才的日记》里写的","where_en":"From his book Diary of a Genius, 1964"},"say":{"en":"Is the Dalí museum in Figueres worth a day trip from Barcelona?","zh":"从巴塞罗那去菲格雷斯看达利博物馆，值得跑一天吗？"}},"毕加索":{"kind":"person","what":"马拉加出生的西班牙画家，一辈子大多住在法国。","what_en":"The Spanish painter born in Málaga, who spent most of his life in France.","fame":"他和朋友一起发明了立体主义，把一张脸从好几个角度同时画出来；《格尔尼卡》画的是 1937 年小城被轰炸，成了全世界最有名的反战画。","fame_en":"With a friend he invented Cubism, painting a face from several angles at once. Guernica, about the 1937 bombing of a small Basque town, became the world's most famous anti-war painting.","fact":"他不许《格尔尼卡》在佛朗哥独裁时回西班牙，画在纽约现代艺术博物馆放了四十多年；直到 1981 年西班牙有了民主，它才「回家」——那时毕加索已经去世八年。","fact_en":"He refused to let Guernica go to Spain while Franco ruled, so it hung in New York's MoMA for over forty years. It only 'came home' in 1981, once Spain was a democracy — eight years after Picasso died.","src":"HISTORY","url":"https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/september-10/guernica-returned-to-spain","say":{"en":"Which room is Guernica in?","zh":"《格尔尼卡》在哪个展厅？"}},"大航海时代":{"what":"15–16 世纪葡萄牙、西班牙的船开出大西洋、找到新航路的那一百多年。","what_en":"The 15th–16th centuries, when Portuguese and Spanish ships sailed out into the Atlantic and opened new sea routes.","fame":"达·伽马从里斯本贝伦出发，绕过非洲到了印度；麦哲伦的船队第一次绕地球一圈。香料、白银、土豆、辣椒从此在全世界跑来跑去——也带来了殖民和奴隶贸易。","fame_en":"Vasco da Gama sailed from Belém in Lisbon around Africa to India, and Magellan's fleet first sailed around the world. Spices, silver, potatoes and chillies began moving around the globe — and so did colonialism and the slave trade.","fact":"贝伦河边那座大船形的「发现者纪念碑」，1940 年第一次搭起来时只是博览会的临时道具，用石膏和木头做的；1960 年为纪念恩里克王子去世 500 年，才用混凝土和石头重新建成现在这个样子。","fact_en":"The ship-shaped Monument to the Discoveries on the river at Belém started out in 1940 as a temporary exhibition piece made of plaster and wood. It was only rebuilt in concrete and stone in 1960, for the 500th anniversary of Prince Henry the Navigator's death.","src":"发现者纪念碑官网","url":"https://padraodosdescobrimentos.pt/en/monument-to-the-discoveries","say":{"en":"Can we go up to the top of the monument?","zh":"能上到纪念碑顶上去吗？"}},"贝多芬":{"kind":"person","what":"波恩出生、在维也纳成名的德国作曲家。","what_en":"The German composer born in Bonn who made his name in Vienna.","fame":"他后来几乎全聋，却写出了《第九交响曲》，最后一段《欢乐颂》现在是欧盟的盟歌；《命运》开头那四个音，几乎人人都能哼出来。","fame_en":"He went almost completely deaf yet wrote the Ninth Symphony, whose 'Ode to Joy' is now the EU's anthem; and almost anyone can hum the four opening notes of the Fifth.","fact":"2023 年科学家从他留下的几缕头发里测出完整的 DNA：他得过乙肝，基因里肝病风险也高，加上喝酒，可能是他的死因；还意外发现他家族的父系里有过一个「私生子」。","fact_en":"In 2023 scientists sequenced his genome from locks of his hair: he had hepatitis B and a high genetic risk of liver disease, which with his drinking may explain his death. They also stumbled on a secret — a child born outside marriage somewhere in his father's line.","src":"Smithsonian，2023","url":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/dna-from-beethovens-hair-reveals-clues-about-his-death-180981870/","quote":{"en":"It was only my art that held me back.","zh":"只有艺术把我拉了回来。","where":"1802 年 10 月他写给弟弟们、没有寄出的《海利根施塔特遗书》里","where_en":"From the Heiligenstadt Testament, an unsent letter to his brothers, October 1802"},"say":{"en":"Do you know which symphony 'Ode to Joy' comes from?","zh":"你知道《欢乐颂》是哪部交响曲里的吗？"}},"巴赫":{"kind":"person","what":"18 世纪德国作曲家，在莱比锡的圣托马斯教堂当了 27 年乐长。","what_en":"The 18th-century German composer who was cantor at St Thomas Church in Leipzig for 27 years.","fame":"学钢琴的人几乎都弹过他的曲子；《G 弦上的咏叹调》《马太受难曲》、大提琴组曲，到今天还在婚礼、电影和广告里出现。很多音乐家说他是「音乐之父」。","fame_en":"Nearly every piano student has played him; the Air on the G String, the St Matthew Passion and the Cello Suites still turn up at weddings, in films and in ads. Many musicians call him the father of music.","fact":"2025 年 11 月，莱比锡巴赫档案馆宣布认出两首「新」的巴赫管风琴曲：它们在比利时皇家图书馆放了几百年，署名不清；馆长三十多年前就见过，最后靠抄谱人的笔迹认定是巴赫年轻时写的，在圣托马斯教堂首演。","fact_en":"In November 2025 the Leipzig Bach Archive announced two 'new' Bach organ pieces. They had sat for centuries in the Royal Library of Belgium without a clear name; the director first saw them over 30 years ago and finally pinned them on the young Bach through the copyist's handwriting. They were premiered at St Thomas Church.","src":"The Local Germany，2025","url":"https://www.thelocal.de/20251118/two-newly-discovered-bach-organ-works-unveiled-in-germany","say":{"en":"Is there a Bach concert at St Thomas this weekend?","zh":"这周末圣托马斯教堂有巴赫的音乐会吗？"}},"歌德":{"kind":"person","what":"德国最有名的作家，写了《浮士德》和《少年维特之烦恼》。","what_en":"Germany's most famous writer, author of Faust and The Sorrows of Young Werther.","fame":"《少年维特之烦恼》1774 年出版后，全欧洲的年轻人学维特穿蓝外套黄背心；今天德国在全世界教德语的机构就叫「歌德学院」。","fame_en":"After Werther came out in 1774, young men all over Europe dressed in his blue coat and yellow waistcoat. Today Germany's language institutes around the world are called Goethe-Institut.","fact":"他不只写书，还认真搞科学：1784 年他在耶拿比较人和动物的头骨，找到人也有「颌间骨」——当时很多解剖学家以为只有动物才有，用它来区分人和猿。","fact_en":"He wasn't only a writer — he did serious science. In 1784 in Jena, comparing human and animal skulls, he traced the intermaxillary bone in humans, when many anatomists thought only animals had it and used it to separate people from apes.","src":"耶拿大学歌德展","url":"https://goethe.uni-jena.de/en/242/tour-of-the-exhibition","say":{"en":"Did you have to read Goethe at school?","zh":"你上学的时候要读歌德吗？"}},"伦勃朗":{"kind":"person","what":"17 世纪荷兰画家，「光影大师」。","what_en":"The 17th-century Dutch painter known as the master of light and shadow.","fame":"他画画像会让光只落在最重要的地方，其他沉进暗里；《夜巡》是阿姆斯特丹国家博物馆的镇馆之宝，他一辈子还画了八十多张自画像，从年轻画到老。","fame_en":"He let light fall only on what mattered and sank the rest into darkness. The Night Watch is the Rijksmuseum's star piece, and he painted around 80 self-portraits, from youth to old age.","fact":"《夜巡》1715 年搬进市政厅时太大进不了门，人们就把四边裁掉了；2021 年国家博物馆用人工智能照着一幅老复制品，把裁掉的部分「画」了回来，打印出来挂在原画旁边三个月。","fact_en":"When The Night Watch was moved to the town hall in 1715 it was too big for the doorway, so they cut strips off its edges. In 2021 the Rijksmuseum used AI, guided by an old copy, to 'repaint' the missing parts and hung them beside the original for three months.","src":"DutchReview，2021","url":"https://dutchreview.com/news/see-rembrandts-masterpiece-original-form","say":{"en":"Where's The Night Watch — is it always crowded?","zh":"《夜巡》在哪儿？一直这么多人吗？"}},"安妮日记":{"what":"犹太女孩安妮·弗兰克在阿姆斯特丹的密室里躲了两年时写的日记。","what_en":"The diary Anne Frank, a Jewish girl, kept while hiding for two years in a secret annexe in Amsterdam.","fame":"安妮一家被抓走后她死在集中营，只有爸爸活了下来，把日记出版了；它被翻成七十多种语言，让很多人第一次从一个十几岁女孩的眼睛里看到大屠杀。密室所在的房子现在是博物馆。","fame_en":"Anne died in a camp after the family was arrested; only her father survived and published the diary. Translated into more than 70 languages, it showed many people the Holocaust through a teenager's eyes for the first time. The house is now a museum.","fact":"她用棕色纸贴住过两页。2018 年研究人员用照片技术不碰原稿读出了下面的字：几个她自己写明是「黄段子」的笑话，还有她给自己讲的性知识——一个 13 岁女孩最普通的样子。","fact_en":"She had glued brown paper over two pages. In 2018 researchers used imaging to read them without touching the diary: a few jokes she herself labelled 'dirty' and her own notes on sex education — a very ordinary 13-year-old.","src":"Smithsonian，2018","url":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/researchers-decipher-two-hidden-pages-anne-franks-diary-180969107/","say":{"en":"Do I need to book Anne Frank House tickets online?","zh":"安妮之家的票要在网上提前订吗？"}},"莫扎特":{"kind":"person","what":"萨尔茨堡出生的奥地利作曲家，5 岁就开始写曲子。","what_en":"The Austrian composer from Salzburg who started composing at five.","fame":"他只活了 35 岁，却写了六百多部作品——《费加罗的婚礼》《魔笛》《小夜曲》；今天萨尔茨堡街上到处是印着他头像的巧克力球。","fame_en":"He lived only 35 years but wrote over 600 works — The Marriage of Figaro, The Magic Flute, Eine kleine Nachtmusik. Today Salzburg's streets are full of chocolate balls with his face on them.","fact":"2024 年 9 月，莱比锡市立图书馆宣布在一份老收藏里找到一首没人知道的莫扎特弦乐三重奏，大约是他十几岁时写的，被叫作「小小夜曲」；同月在萨尔茨堡第一次公开演奏。","fact_en":"In September 2024 the Leipzig city libraries announced they'd found an unknown Mozart string trio in an old collection, probably written when he was a teenager and nicknamed 'Ganz kleine Nachtmusik'. It had its first modern performance in Salzburg that month.","src":"Illinois Public Media，2024","url":"https://will.illinois.edu/clefnotes/entry/new-mozart-work-discovered","say":{"en":"Are these the original Mozartkugeln or the factory ones?","zh":"这是原版的莫扎特巧克力球，还是工厂做的？"}},"茜茜公主":{"kind":"person","what":"奥地利皇后伊丽莎白，巴伐利亚公主出身，16 岁嫁给皇帝弗朗茨·约瑟夫。","what_en":"Empress Elisabeth of Austria, a Bavarian princess who married Emperor Franz Joseph at 16.","fame":"她以美貌和长到脚跟的头发出名，却讨厌宫廷生活，一辈子到处旅行；1950 年代罗密·施奈德演的「茜茜」电影让她成了童话公主，近几年 Netflix 剧和电影又把她拍成一个不快乐的女人。","fame_en":"Famous for her beauty and floor-length hair, she hated court life and travelled constantly. The 1950s Sissi films with Romy Schneider made her a fairy-tale princess; recent Netflix and film versions show a far unhappier woman.","fact":"1898 年她在日内瓦湖边走向轮船时，被一个无政府主义者用磨尖的锉刀刺中胸口；伤口很小，她还自己走上了船，船开出去后才倒下，几小时后去世。","fact_en":"In 1898, walking to a lake steamer in Geneva, she was stabbed in the chest with a sharpened file by an anarchist. The wound was tiny and she walked onto the boat herself, collapsing only after it left; she died a few hours later.","src":"Swissinfo","url":"https://www.swissinfo.ch/eng/society/series-anarchists-in-switzerland-3_-empress-stabbed-in-the-heart/44844170","say":{"en":"Which rooms in Schönbrunn were Sisi's?","zh":"美泉宫里哪几间是茜茜的？"}},"卡夫卡":{"kind":"person","what":"布拉格的德语作家，白天在保险公司上班，晚上写小说。","what_en":"The German-speaking writer from Prague who worked at an insurance office by day and wrote at night.","fame":"《变形记》开头一个人早上醒来变成了大虫子；他写的那种被看不见的规则困住的感觉太准了，英语和德语里都有个词「卡夫卡式」（Kafkaesque）。","fame_en":"The Metamorphosis opens with a man waking up as a giant insect. He captured the feeling of being trapped by invisible rules so well that English and German have a word for it: Kafkaesque.","fact":"他临死前让好友布罗德把手稿全烧掉，布罗德没烧，还出版了；布罗德死后这些手稿在以色列打了几十年官司，2016 年以色列最高法院判给国家图书馆，现在任何人都能在网上看。","fact_en":"Dying, he asked his friend Max Brod to burn all his manuscripts. Brod published them instead. After Brod died, the papers were fought over in Israeli courts for decades until the Supreme Court gave them to the National Library in 2016; now anyone can view them online.","src":"Jewish Journal，2016","url":"https://jewishjournal.com/israel/188357/","quote":{"en":"A book must be the axe for the frozen sea within us.","zh":"一本书必须是劈开我们心中冰封大海的斧头。","where":"1904 年 1 月写给朋友奥斯卡·波拉克的信里","where_en":"From a letter to his friend Oskar Pollak, January 1904"},"say":{"en":"Have you ever had a really Kafkaesque day?","zh":"你有没有过特别「卡夫卡式」的一天？"}},"肖邦":{"kind":"person","what":"波兰钢琴家和作曲家，20 岁离开华沙，后来住在巴黎。","what_en":"The Polish pianist and composer who left Warsaw at 20 and lived in Paris.","fame":"他几乎只给钢琴写曲子，夜曲和圆舞曲是学琴的人都想弹的；华沙每五年办一次肖邦国际钢琴比赛，是全世界最难拿的钢琴大奖之一。","fame_en":"He wrote almost only for piano, and his nocturnes and waltzes are what every student dreams of playing. Warsaw's International Chopin Piano Competition, held every five years, is one of the hardest piano prizes to win.","fact":"他死在巴黎，但留下话要把心脏送回波兰；姐姐把心泡在一罐酒里（一般认为是白兰地）带回华沙，封在圣十字教堂的柱子里。2014 年科学家半夜取出来拍照，2017 年发表结论：他很可能死于肺结核引起的心包炎。","fact_en":"He died in Paris but asked for his heart to go home. His sister carried it to Warsaw in a jar of alcohol (thought to be cognac), and it was sealed in a pillar of Holy Cross Church. In 2014 scientists took it out at night to photograph it; in 2017 they concluded he probably died of pericarditis from tuberculosis.","src":"Smithsonian，2017","url":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/chopins-preserved-heart-may-offer-clues-about-his-death-180967168/","say":{"en":"Is there a free Chopin concert in the park on Sunday?","zh":"星期天公园里有免费的肖邦音乐会吗？"}},"哥白尼":{"kind":"person","what":"波兰天文学家，说地球绕着太阳转。","what_en":"The Polish astronomer who said the Earth goes around the Sun.","fame":"以前人们相信太阳绕着地球转；他 1543 年出版的书把太阳放在中间，改变了人们看宇宙的方法——英语里说「哥白尼式的转变」，就是指想法整个倒过来。","fame_en":"People used to believe the Sun went around the Earth. His 1543 book put the Sun at the centre and changed how we see the universe — a 'Copernican shift' now means turning an idea completely upside down.","fact":"他葬在弗龙堡大教堂，但几百年没人知道是哪一具。2005 年找到一个头骨，2008 年科学家拿他自己书里夹着的几根头发做 DNA 比对，才认出是他；2010 年重新隆重下葬。","fact_en":"He was buried in Frombork Cathedral, but for centuries nobody knew which remains were his. A skull was found in 2005, and in 2008 scientists matched its DNA to hairs found in one of his own books. He was reburied with honours in 2010.","src":"Christian Science Monitor，2010","url":"https://m.csmonitor.com/Science/Cool-Astronomy/2010/0524/Once-a-heretic-Copernicus-now-re-buried-with-Catholic-honors","say":{"en":"Wait — so Copernicus was Polish, not Italian?","zh":"等等，哥白尼是波兰人，不是意大利人？"}},"苏格拉底":{"kind":"person","what":"古希腊雅典的哲学家，整天在广场上拉着人问问题。","what_en":"The ancient Athenian philosopher who spent his days asking people questions in the marketplace.","fame":"他不给答案，只一直问「你说的『勇敢』到底是什么意思？」，让人发现自己其实不懂——这种追问到今天叫「苏格拉底式提问」，法学院和课堂上还在用。公元前 399 年他被判死刑，喝毒芹汁死去。","fame_en":"He didn't give answers; he kept asking 'what do you actually mean by courage?' until people realised they didn't know. This 'Socratic method' is still used in classrooms and law schools. In 399 BC he was sentenced to death and drank hemlock.","fact":"他自己一个字也没写下来。我们知道的苏格拉底，几乎都来自学生柏拉图、色诺芬和喜剧作家阿里斯托芬的书——所以哪句话真是他说的，学者到今天还在争。","fact_en":"He never wrote a single word. Almost everything we know about him comes from his student Plato, from Xenophon, and from the comic playwright Aristophanes — so scholars still argue over which words were really his.","src":"斯坦福哲学百科","url":"https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/socrates/","quote":{"en":"The unexamined life is not worth living.","zh":"不经过省察的人生不值得过。","where":"公元前 399 年受审时说的，柏拉图在《申辩篇》里记了下来","where_en":"Said at his trial in 399 BC, as recorded by Plato in the Apology"},"say":{"en":"Can you show me where Socrates used to talk to people?","zh":"能带我看看苏格拉底以前跟人聊天的地方吗？"}},"加加林":{"kind":"person","what":"苏联宇航员，世界上第一个飞上太空的人。","what_en":"The Soviet cosmonaut who was the first human in space.","fame":"1961 年 4 月 12 日，他坐「东方 1 号」绕地球飞了一圈，大约 108 分钟，回来后成了全世界的英雄；现在每年 4 月 12 日是「国际载人航天日」，很多地方开「尤里之夜」派对。","fame_en":"On 12 April 1961 he orbited the Earth once in Vostok 1, about 108 minutes, and came back a global hero. 12 April is now the International Day of Human Space Flight, and people hold 'Yuri's Night' parties.","fact":"他其实不是坐着飞船落地的：离地大约 7 公里时他弹射出来，自己打伞降落。因为当时的纪录规则要求人必须跟飞船一起着陆，苏联瞒了好多年，他还得在记者会上照官方说法讲。","fact_en":"He didn't actually land in his capsule: at about 7 km up he ejected and came down on his own parachute. Record rules then required the pilot to land inside the craft, so the Soviet Union hid it for years and he had to repeat the official story at press conferences.","src":"Wikipedia：Vostok 1","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vostok_1","quote":{"en":"Poyekhali! (Let's go!)","zh":"出发了！（Поехали!）","where":"1961 年 4 月 12 日火箭起飞时，在飞船里通过无线电说的","where_en":"Said over the radio from his capsule at lift-off, 12 April 1961"},"say":{"en":"Are you going to a Yuri's Night party on April 12?","zh":"4 月 12 号你去「尤里之夜」派对吗？"}},"托尔斯泰":{"kind":"person","what":"俄国作家，写了《战争与和平》和《安娜·卡列尼娜》。","what_en":"The Russian writer of War and Peace and Anna Karenina.","fame":"他的小说又长又好看，常常被评为世界最好的小说；他后来放弃贵族生活，穿农民衣服、吃素、反对暴力，影响了甘地。","fame_en":"His long novels are regularly voted among the greatest ever written. Later he gave up the life of a nobleman, dressed like a peasant, went vegetarian and preached non-violence — influencing Gandhi.","fact":"1910 年，82 岁的他半夜偷偷离家出走，上了火车就病倒，在一个叫阿斯塔波沃的小站站长家里去世；后来这个车站和村子都改名叫「列夫·托尔斯泰」。","fact_en":"In 1910, aged 82, he slipped away from home in the night, fell ill on the train, and died in the stationmaster's house at a small stop called Astapovo. The station and village were later renamed 'Lev Tolstoy'.","src":"Wikipedia：Lev Tolstoy（村）","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lev_Tolstoy_(rural_locality)","quote":{"en":"Happy families are all alike; every unhappy family is unhappy in its own way.","zh":"幸福的家庭都是相似的，不幸的家庭各有各的不幸。","where":"1878 年出版的《安娜·卡列尼娜》第一句","where_en":"The opening line of Anna Karenina, published 1878"},"say":{"en":"Have you actually finished War and Peace?","zh":"《战争与和平》你真的读完了吗？"}},"柴可夫斯基":{"kind":"person","what":"俄国作曲家，写了《天鹅湖》和《胡桃夹子》。","what_en":"The Russian composer of Swan Lake and The Nutcracker.","fame":"他的旋律一听就记得住：《天鹅湖》是芭蕾的代名词，每年圣诞全世界的剧院都在演《胡桃夹子》，《1812 序曲》里还真的放大炮。","fame_en":"His melodies stick instantly: Swan Lake is practically the word for ballet, theatres everywhere stage The Nutcracker every Christmas, and the 1812 Overture fires real cannons.","fact":"1891 年 5 月 5 日纽约卡内基音乐厅开幕，请来的客座指挥就是他——他是专门从俄国坐船过去的，在开幕夜指挥了自己的《加冕进行曲》。","fact_en":"When Carnegie Hall opened in New York on 5 May 1891, the guest conductor was Tchaikovsky himself — he crossed the Atlantic for it and conducted his own Coronation March on opening night.","src":"Sound & Vision","url":"https://www.soundandvision.com/content/may-5-1891-andrew-carnegie%E2%80%99s-music-hall-opens","say":{"en":"Are there still tickets for The Nutcracker this Christmas?","zh":"今年圣诞的《胡桃夹子》还有票吗？"}},"普希金":{"kind":"person","what":"俄国最有名的诗人，被叫作「俄国文学之父」。","what_en":"Russia's most famous poet, called the father of Russian literature.","fame":"他用老百姓说的俄语写诗和小说，《叶甫盖尼·奥涅金》改变了俄语文学的样子；俄国人从小背他的诗。他 37 岁死于一场决斗。","fame_en":"He wrote in the Russian people actually spoke, and Eugene Onegin reshaped Russian literature; Russians learn his poems by heart as children. He died in a duel at 37.","fact":"他的曾外祖父汉尼拔是非洲人，小时候被奥斯曼人掳走，后来被彼得大帝收为教子，做到俄军将军；普希金很骄傲，还专门写了一本没写完的小说《彼得大帝的黑人》。","fact_en":"His great-grandfather, Abram Gannibal, was African — kidnapped as a boy by the Ottomans, then taken in by Peter the Great as his godson, and later a Russian general. Pushkin was proud of him and began a novel about him, Peter the Great's African.","src":"Wikipedia：Alexander Pushkin","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alexander_Pushkin","say":{"en":"Do Russian kids really learn Pushkin by heart?","zh":"俄国小孩真的要背普希金的诗吗？"}},"安徒生":{"kind":"person","what":"丹麦作家，写了《海的女儿》《丑小鸭》《卖火柴的小女孩》。","what_en":"The Danish writer of The Little Mermaid, The Ugly Duckling and The Little Match Girl.","fame":"他的童话翻成了一百多种语言，很多故事不是快乐结局，写的是孤单、被看不起的人；哥本哈根海边的小美人鱼铜像是丹麦最有名的景点之一。","fame_en":"His fairy tales have been translated into over 100 languages, and many have no happy ending — they're about the lonely and looked-down-on. The Little Mermaid statue on Copenhagen's waterfront is one of Denmark's best-known sights.","fact":"2012 年一位丹麦地方史学者在菲英岛的档案里翻出一篇没人见过的安徒生童话《牛油蜡烛》，专家认为是他上中学时写的，可能是他写的第一篇童话。","fact_en":"In 2012 a local historian found an unknown Andersen tale, The Tallow Candle, in archives on the island of Funen. Experts think he wrote it as a schoolboy, which may make it his very first fairy tale.","src":"NPR / WUNC，2012","url":"https://www.wunc.org/2012-12-13/a-new-tale-by-hans-christian-andersen","quote":{"en":"My life is a lovely story, happy and full of incident.","zh":"我的一生是一个美丽的故事，幸福，又充满了事情。","where":"1855 年他的自传《我的童话人生》开头","where_en":"The opening of his autobiography, The Fairy Tale of My Life, 1855"},"say":{"en":"Is the Little Mermaid really that small?","zh":"小美人鱼真的这么小吗？"}},"李斯特":{"kind":"person","what":"匈牙利钢琴家和作曲家，19 世纪最红的钢琴明星。","what_en":"The Hungarian pianist and composer, the biggest piano star of the 19th century.","fame":"他弹琴快得像变魔术，是第一个一个人开整场独奏会的钢琴家，也是第一个侧坐、让观众看见他侧脸的人；《匈牙利狂想曲》到今天还在动画片里出现。","fame_en":"He played so fast it looked like magic. He was the first to give whole solo recitals and to sit side-on so the audience could see his profile, and his Hungarian Rhapsodies still turn up in cartoons.","fact":"他那时的粉丝跟今天追星一样疯：抢他的手帕和手套，把他喝剩的咖啡渣装进小瓶子；诗人海涅 1844 年给这种狂热起了个名字——「李斯特狂热」（Lisztomania）。","fact_en":"His fans were as wild as any today: they fought over his handkerchiefs and gloves and kept his coffee dregs in little vials. In 1844 the poet Heinrich Heine gave the craze a name — Lisztomania.","src":"Wikipedia：Lisztomania","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lisztomania","say":{"en":"Is there a concert at the Liszt Academy tonight?","zh":"今晚李斯特音乐学院有音乐会吗？"}},"特斯拉":{"kind":"person","what":"出生在今天克罗地亚的塞尔维亚族发明家，后来在美国工作。","what_en":"The Serbian-born inventor from what is now Croatia, who worked in the United States.","fame":"我们家里墙上插座的交流电，就是他和西屋公司推广开的；他还研究无线电和无线传电。电动车牌子「特斯拉」就是用他的名字起的。","fame_en":"The alternating current in your wall sockets is the system he and Westinghouse pushed into the world; he also worked on radio and wireless power. The electric-car brand Tesla is named after him.","fact":"1960 年国际计量大会把磁感应强度的单位定名为「特斯拉」（T）——你去医院做核磁共振，机器上写的 1.5T、3T，就是他的名字。","fact_en":"In 1960 the General Conference on Weights and Measures named the unit of magnetic flux density the 'tesla' (T). When a hospital MRI scanner says 1.5T or 3T, that's his name.","src":"Wikipedia：Tesla (unit)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tesla_(unit)","say":{"en":"Did you know the car is named after a real inventor?","zh":"你知道这个汽车牌子是用一个真发明家的名字起的吗？"}},"贝克汉姆":{"kind":"person","what":"英格兰足球运动员，以任意球和传中出名，娶了辣妹组合的维多利亚。","what_en":"The England footballer famous for his free kicks and crosses, married to Spice Girl Victoria.","fame":"他踢过曼联、皇马、洛杉矶银河，「像贝克汉姆一样弯曲」成了一句电影名；退役后在美国办了迈阿密国际队，2023 年把梅西请了过去。他换个发型，全世界的理发店都跟着变。","fame_en":"He played for Manchester United, Real Madrid and LA Galaxy, and 'Bend It Like Beckham' became a film title. After retiring he co-founded Inter Miami and brought Messi there in 2023. Every time he changed his haircut, barbershops everywhere followed.","fact":"2025 年 6 月英王生日授勋名单里，他被封为爵士，理由是「对体育和慈善的贡献」——从此可以叫 Sir David Beckham 了。","fact_en":"In the King's Birthday Honours of June 2025 he was knighted 'for services to sport and charity' — making him Sir David Beckham.","src":"Sky Sports，2025","url":"https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11095/13383159/kings-birthday-honours-list-2025-david-beckham-awarded-knighthood-while-luke-littler-receives-mbe","say":{"en":"Can I get a Beckham haircut?","zh":"能给我剪个贝克汉姆那样的头吗？"}},"汉密尔顿":{"kind":"person","what":"英国 F1 赛车手，七次世界冠军。","what_en":"The British Formula 1 driver and seven-time world champion.","fame":"他是 F1 第一个黑人车手，分站冠军、杆位次数都是历史最多；他也常在赛场上为多元和环保说话。2025 年他从梅赛德斯转到法拉利，开上了红车。","fame_en":"He is F1's first Black driver and holds the records for most race wins and pole positions, and he often speaks up for diversity and the environment. In 2025 he moved from Mercedes to Ferrari.","fact":"他去法拉利的第一年只拿了一个冲刺赛冠军，正赛一次领奖台都没上；直到 2026 年 6 月在巴塞罗那，他才第一次开着法拉利赢下大奖赛，意大利报纸全都头版庆祝。","fact_en":"His first year at Ferrari brought only a sprint win and no Grand Prix podium. Only in June 2026, in Barcelona, did he win his first Grand Prix in a Ferrari — and the Italian papers splashed it across their front pages.","src":"ANSA，2026","url":"https://www.ansa.it/amp/english/news/2026/06/15/italian-press-hail-hamilton-after-f1-greats-first-win-with-ferrari_6c362a78-561d-457e-ac57-b8a54a48f42e.html","say":{"en":"Did you watch the race last night?","zh":"昨晚的比赛你看了吗？"}},"艾德·希兰":{"kind":"person","what":"英国创作型歌手，红头发，常常一把吉他加一个循环踏板就上台。","what_en":"The red-haired British singer-songwriter who often plays alone with a guitar and a loop pedal.","fame":"《Shape of You》《Perfect》《Thinking Out Loud》都是全球大热歌；他一个人就能撑满整座体育场，他的「数学」巡演是史上观众最多的巡演之一。","fame_en":"Shape of You, Perfect and Thinking Out Loud were global hits. He can fill a stadium on his own, and his 'Mathematics' tour was one of the best-attended ever.","fact":"2023 年 5 月，有人告他的《Thinking Out Loud》抄了马文·盖伊的《Let's Get It On》；他在纽约法庭上拿起吉他现场弹给陪审团听，说这些和弦谁都能用。陪审团判他没有抄。","fact_en":"In May 2023 he was sued for allegedly copying Marvin Gaye's Let's Get It On in Thinking Out Loud. In a New York court he picked up his guitar and played for the jury to show the chords are common to everyone. The jury found he hadn't copied.","src":"NBC News，2023","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/pop-culture/pop-culture-news/jury-reaches-verdict-ed-sheeran-get-copyright-trial-rcna82885","say":{"en":"Did you get Ed Sheeran tickets?","zh":"你抢到艾德·希兰的票了吗？"}},"阿黛尔":{"kind":"person","what":"伦敦北部长大的英国歌手，嗓子又厚又有力。","what_en":"The British singer from north London with a huge, rich voice.","fame":"《Rolling in the Deep》《Someone Like You》《Hello》唱遍全世界；她的专辑用年龄命名（19、21、25、30），写的都是自己失恋、离婚、当妈妈的事。","fame_en":"Rolling in the Deep, Someone Like You and Hello were heard everywhere. Her albums are named after her age (19, 21, 25, 30) and are about her own heartbreak, divorce and motherhood.","fact":"2024 年 8 月她在慕尼黑办了 10 场演唱会，场地是专门为她临时搭的露天体育场，一晚能进七八万人；10 场一共卖了 73 万张票。","fact_en":"In August 2024 she played ten concerts in Munich in an open-air stadium built just for her, holding around 70–80,000 people a night. The ten shows sold 730,000 tickets.","src":"Pollstar，2024","url":"https://news.pollstar.com/2024/09/03/adele-in-munich-residency-sold-730000-tickets/","say":{"en":"Which Adele song always makes you cry?","zh":"阿黛尔哪首歌一听就让你哭？"}},"姆巴佩":{"kind":"person","what":"巴黎郊区邦迪长大的法国足球前锋，跑得飞快。","what_en":"The lightning-fast French striker who grew up in Bondy, outside Paris.","fame":"2018 年 19 岁的他在世界杯决赛进球，帮法国夺冠；2022 年决赛又上演帽子戏法。2024 年他从巴黎圣日耳曼转去皇马。","fame_en":"At 19 he scored in the 2018 World Cup final as France won it, then hit a hat-trick in the 2022 final. In 2024 he moved from Paris Saint-Germain to Real Madrid.","fact":"他在皇马第一个赛季联赛进了 31 球，拿了 2025 年欧洲金靴——皇马历史上第三个拿这个奖的人，前两个是乌戈·桑切斯和 C 罗。","fact_en":"In his first season at Real Madrid he scored 31 league goals and won the 2025 European Golden Shoe — only the third Real Madrid player to do it, after Hugo Sánchez and Cristiano Ronaldo.","src":"Al Jazeera，2025","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2025/5/26/kylian-mbappe-wins-european-golden-shoe-award-for-first-time","say":{"en":"How do I get to the Bernabéu from here?","zh":"从这儿去伯纳乌球场怎么走？"}},"纳达尔":{"kind":"person","what":"西班牙马略卡岛的网球运动员，左手打球。","what_en":"The left-handed tennis player from Mallorca, Spain.","fame":"他拿了 22 个大满贯，其中 14 个是法网——在红土上几乎打不败，被叫作「红土之王」；他和费德勒的对决是网球史上最有名的较量。2024 年 11 月退役。","fame_en":"He won 22 Grand Slams, 14 of them at the French Open, where on clay he was almost unbeatable — the 'King of Clay'. His rivalry with Federer is tennis's most famous. He retired in November 2024.","fact":"2021 年他还没退役，法网就在球场门口给他立了一座 3 米高的不锈钢雕像，做的是他正手挥拍的样子；当时有人觉得太早了——他后来又拿了两次法网冠军。","fact_en":"In 2021, while he was still playing, Roland-Garros unveiled a 3-metre stainless-steel statue of him mid-forehand at its entrance. Some said it was too soon — he went on to win the French Open twice more.","src":"Roland-Garros 官网，2021","url":"https://www.rolandgarros.com/en-us/article/rafael-nadal-statue-unveiled-at-roland-garros","say":{"en":"Nadal or Federer — who's your favourite?","zh":"纳达尔和费德勒，你更喜欢谁？"}},"费德勒":{"kind":"person","what":"瑞士巴塞尔的网球运动员，20 个大满贯冠军。","what_en":"The Swiss tennis player from Basel with 20 Grand Slam titles.","fame":"他打球优雅得像跳舞，在温网拿了 8 次冠军；2022 年退役那场双打，他和老对手纳达尔坐在一起哭的照片传遍全网。","fame_en":"He played so gracefully it looked like dancing and won Wimbledon eight times. At his last match in 2022, the photo of him and old rival Nadal crying side by side went around the world.","fact":"他小时候在家乡巴塞尔的瑞士室内赛当过球童，十几岁时还在那儿递过球；后来他自己在这个比赛拿了 10 次冠军。","fact_en":"As a boy he was a ball kid at the Swiss Indoors in his home town of Basel. He later won that same tournament ten times.","src":"Tennis Majors","url":"https://www.tennismajors.com/?p=301307","quote":{"en":"Effortless is a myth.","zh":"毫不费力，是个神话。","where":"2024 年 6 月在美国达特茅斯学院毕业典礼上的演讲","where_en":"From his commencement speech at Dartmouth College, June 2024"},"say":{"en":"Is it true you can queue for Wimbledon tickets on the day?","zh":"温网真的可以当天排队买票吗？"}},"林肯":{"kind":"person","what":"亚伯拉罕·林肯，美国第 16 任总统（1861–1865），从肯塔基小木屋长大、几乎全靠自学当上律师的人。","what_en":"Abraham Lincoln, the 16th US president (1861–1865), who grew up in a Kentucky log cabin and taught himself enough to become a lawyer.","fame":"他带着北方打完了南北战争，保住了国家没分裂；1863 年签了《解放奴隶宣言》，之后推动宪法第十三修正案废除奴隶制。战争刚结束他就遇刺身亡。五美元纸币和一美分硬币上都是他。","fame_en":"He led the Union through the Civil War and kept the country together, signed the Emancipation Proclamation in 1863 and pushed the 13th Amendment that ended slavery. He was assassinated just as the war ended. He's on the $5 bill and the penny.","fact":"他是唯一拿过专利的美国总统：1849 年他发明了一种给船两侧装充气浮箱、把搁浅的船抬过浅滩的装置，专利号 6469。东西没真造出来，模型现在在史密森尼博物馆。","fact_en":"He's the only US president to hold a patent: No. 6,469 from 1849, for inflatable chambers that would lift a boat over shoals. It was never built, but his model is at the Smithsonian.","src":"Smithsonian Magazine","url":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/history/abraham-lincoln-only-president-have-patent-131184751/","quote":{"en":"…government of the people, by the people, for the people…","zh":"……民有、民治、民享的政府……","where":"葛底斯堡演说，1863 年 11 月","where_en":"Gettysburg Address, November 1863"},"say":{"en":"Is that Lincoln on the five-dollar bill?","zh":"五美元上那个是林肯吗？"}},"马丁·路德·金":{"kind":"person","what":"小马丁·路德·金，美国浸信会牧师，20 世纪五六十年代民权运动最有名的领袖，亚特兰大人。","what_en":"Martin Luther King Jr., a Baptist minister from Atlanta and the best-known leader of the US civil rights movement in the 1950s and 60s.","fame":"1955 年他带领蒙哥马利公交抵制，坚持不用暴力；1963 年在华盛顿林肯纪念堂前对 25 万人演讲「我有一个梦想」；1964 年 35 岁拿诺贝尔和平奖。1968 年遇刺。现在每年一月第三个星期一是美国的「马丁·路德·金纪念日」。","fame_en":"He led the 1955 Montgomery bus boycott on strictly non-violent lines, gave the 'I Have a Dream' speech to some 250,000 people at the Lincoln Memorial in 1963, and won the Nobel Peace Prize at 35. He was assassinated in 1968. The third Monday of January is now Martin Luther King Jr. Day.","fact":"他出生时叫 Michael King（迈克尔·金）。1934 年他父亲去柏林开浸信会世界大会，回来后把自己和 5 岁儿子的名字都改成了马丁·路德，纪念宗教改革家马丁·路德；法律上的改名直到 1957 年才办完。","fact_en":"He was born Michael King. After his father went to a Baptist World Congress in Berlin in 1934, he renamed himself and his five-year-old son Martin Luther, after the Reformation leader. The legal change for the son wasn't completed until 1957.","src":"Atlanta Journal-Constitution","url":"https://www.ajc.com/news/atlanta-black-history/black-history-why-martin-luther-king-jrs-father-changed-their-names/PQSUL3LEJNEAVXBQXPNQU5YT6M/","say":{"en":"Do you get the day off for MLK Day?","zh":"马丁·路德·金纪念日你们放假吗？"}},"罗莎·帕克斯":{"kind":"person","what":"罗莎·帕克斯，阿拉巴马州蒙哥马利的一位裁缝，也是当地全国有色人种协进会（NAACP）的秘书。","what_en":"Rosa Parks, a seamstress in Montgomery, Alabama, and secretary of the local NAACP branch.","fame":"1955 年 12 月 1 日下班回家，司机让她把座位让给白人乘客，她不让，被捕了。这件事点燃了长达一年多的蒙哥马利公交抵制，最后法院判公交种族隔离违宪。她被叫作「民权运动之母」。","fame_en":"On 1 December 1955, riding home from work, she refused the driver's order to give up her seat to a white passenger and was arrested. It sparked the year-long Montgomery bus boycott, which ended with segregated buses ruled unconstitutional. She's called 'the mother of the civil rights movement'.","fact":"那天让她让座的司机 James Blake，她 12 年前就碰到过：1943 年他让她前门付钱、再从后门上车，她还没上车他就开走了。之后她一直躲着他开的车；1955 年那天她上车时没注意是谁在开。","fact_en":"The driver that day, James Blake, had crossed her before: in 1943 he made her pay at the front and re-board at the back, then drove off before she could. She avoided his bus for years — in 1955 she didn't notice who was driving.","src":"History.com","url":"https://www.history.com/news/10-things-you-may-not-know-about-rosa-parks","quote":{"en":"The only tired I was, was tired of giving in.","zh":"我唯一累的，是一直让步让累了。","where":"自传《罗莎·帕克斯：我的故事》，1992","where_en":"Rosa Parks: My Story (autobiography), 1992"},"say":{"en":"So this is the actual bus? Can we sit in her seat?","zh":"这就是那辆真的公交车？能坐她那个座位吗？"}},"海明威":{"kind":"person","what":"欧内斯特·海明威，美国小说家、记者，在巴黎、西班牙、佛罗里达基韦斯特住过，最后在古巴哈瓦那郊外住了二十来年。","what_en":"Ernest Hemingway, the American novelist and journalist who lived in Paris, Spain and Key West, then spent about twenty years outside Havana, Cuba.","fame":"他的句子短、干净、不说废话，改变了很多人写英语的方式。《太阳照常升起》《永别了，武器》《丧钟为谁而鸣》都是他写的；在古巴写的《老人与海》让他 1953 年拿普利策奖，1954 年拿诺贝尔文学奖。","fame_en":"His short, plain, no-nonsense sentences changed how many people write English. He wrote The Sun Also Rises, A Farewell to Arms and For Whom the Bell Tolls; The Old Man and the Sea, written in Cuba, won him the 1953 Pulitzer and helped win the 1954 Nobel Prize.","fact":"他把 1954 年的诺贝尔奖章送给了古巴东部埃尔科夫雷教堂里的「仁慈圣母」——《老人与海》里的老渔夫也向她许过愿。奖章 1986 年被偷过一次，几天后就被警察找回来了。","fact_en":"He gave his 1954 Nobel medal to the shrine of the Virgin of Charity at El Cobre in eastern Cuba — the old fisherman in The Old Man and the Sea makes a vow to her too. It was stolen in 1986 and recovered by police days later.","src":"CBS News / AP，2024","url":"https://www.cbsnews.com/miami/news/revered-by-hemingway-and-visited-by-popes-why-cubas-small-patron-saint-is-such-a-huge-symbol-2/","say":{"en":"Have you read The Old Man and the Sea? It's short.","zh":"你读过《老人与海》吗？很薄的。"}},"马尔克斯":{"kind":"person","what":"加夫列尔·加西亚·马尔克斯，哥伦比亚作家和记者，在加勒比海边的小镇阿拉卡塔卡长大，大家叫他 Gabo。","what_en":"Gabriel García Márquez, the Colombian novelist and journalist who grew up in the Caribbean town of Aracataca — everyone calls him Gabo.","fame":"1967 年出版的《百年孤独》写一个叫马孔多的小镇和布恩迪亚家族七代人，把鬼魂、怪事和日常写在一起，叫「魔幻现实主义」；他 1982 年拿诺贝尔文学奖。很多拉美人说，读他的书就像听外婆讲家里的事。","fame_en":"One Hundred Years of Solitude (1967) follows seven generations of the Buendía family in the town of Macondo, mixing ghosts and wonders with everyday life — 'magical realism'. He won the Nobel Prize in 1982. Many Latin Americans say reading him feels like hearing grandma talk about the family.","fact":"《百年孤独》卖了五千多万册、译成四十多种语言，却一直没被拍成剧。2024 年 Netflix 第一次把它拍成剧集：在马尔克斯家人支持下，全部用西班牙语、在哥伦比亚拍。","fact_en":"One Hundred Years of Solitude has sold over 50 million copies in 40-plus languages, yet it waited decades for the screen. Netflix's 2024 series was filmed entirely in Spanish and shot in Colombia, with the support of García Márquez's family.","src":"Netflix 官方新闻","url":"https://about.netflix.com/en/news/netflix-presents-a-first-look-at-scenes-from-one-hundred-years-of-solitude","say":{"en":"I keep mixing up all the Aurelianos in that book!","zh":"那本书里那么多个奥雷里亚诺，我老是分不清！"}},"聂鲁达":{"kind":"person","what":"巴勃罗·聂鲁达，智利诗人、外交官，1971 年诺贝尔文学奖得主；在智利有三座房子，瓦尔帕莱索那座叫 La Sebastiana。","what_en":"Pablo Neruda, the Chilean poet and diplomat who won the 1971 Nobel Prize; of his three houses in Chile, the one in Valparaíso is called La Sebastiana.","fame":"他 19 岁出版《二十首情诗和一首绝望的歌》，到今天还是西班牙语里卖得最多的诗集之一；后来又写了《漫歌》，写整个拉丁美洲的山、河和普通人。很多人第一次读西语诗就是读他。","fame_en":"At 19 he published Twenty Love Poems and a Song of Despair, still one of the best-selling poetry books in Spanish; later his Canto General sang of Latin America's mountains, rivers and ordinary people. For many, he's the first Spanish poet they ever read.","fact":"「聂鲁达」是笔名。他本名叫 Ricardo Eliécer Neftalí Reyes Basoalto，1920 年中、16 岁时开始用 Pablo Neruda 这个名字发表作品；一般认为这个姓是借了捷克诗人扬·聂鲁达的。","fact_en":"'Neruda' was a pen name. Born Ricardo Eliécer Neftalí Reyes Basoalto, he started publishing as Pablo Neruda in mid-1920, aged 16 — the surname is thought to come from the Czech poet Jan Neruda.","src":"Wikipedia「Pablo Neruda」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pablo_Neruda","say":{"en":"Which Neruda poem should I start with?","zh":"聂鲁达的诗，我该从哪首读起？"}},"米斯特拉尔":{"kind":"person","what":"加夫列拉·米斯特拉尔，智利诗人、乡村教师、外交官，本名卢西拉·戈多伊，在智利北部的埃尔基山谷长大。","what_en":"Gabriela Mistral, the Chilean poet, rural teacher and diplomat — born Lucila Godoy — who grew up in the Elqui Valley in northern Chile.","fame":"1945 年她成了第一个拿诺贝尔文学奖的拉丁美洲人。她十几岁就在乡下学校教书，后来去墨西哥帮着办乡村学校、编教材；诗里写得最多的是孩子、母亲和山谷。智利 5000 比索的纸币上就是她。","fame_en":"In 1945 she became the first Latin American to win the Nobel Prize in Literature. She taught in village schools from her teens and later helped Mexico set up rural schools; her poems are full of children, mothers and valleys. She's on Chile's 5,000-peso note.","fact":"1920 年她在南部城市特木科当女子中学校长，一个 16 岁的男孩拿诗给她看——就是后来的聂鲁达。她鼓励他接着写，还借给他契诃夫、陀思妥耶夫斯基、托尔斯泰的小说。智利两位诺贝尔文学奖得主就这样见过面。","fact_en":"In 1920, as head of a girls' school in Temuco, she was shown poems by a 16-year-old boy — the future Pablo Neruda. She encouraged him and lent him Chekhov, Dostoevsky and Tolstoy. Chile's two Nobel laureates in literature met that way.","src":"La Tercera，2024","url":"https://www.latercera.com/culto/2024/03/21/las-crecientes-tensiones-entre-gabriela-mistral-y-pablo-neruda-una-carta-filtrada-stalin-y-la-mentira-de-un-congreso/","say":{"en":"Wait, the woman on the 5,000-peso note was a teacher?","zh":"等等，5000 比索上那位女士是个老师？"}},"玻利瓦尔":{"kind":"person","what":"西蒙·玻利瓦尔，委内瑞拉加拉加斯人，19 世纪初带领南美几个国家脱离西班牙独立的军人和政治家，人称「解放者」。","what_en":"Simón Bolívar, the soldier and statesman from Caracas who led several South American countries to independence from Spain in the early 1800s — 'El Libertador'.","fame":"他带兵打了二十年，今天的委内瑞拉、哥伦比亚、厄瓜多尔、秘鲁、巴拿马和玻利维亚都跟他有关；玻利维亚这个国名就是照他的名字起的。他想把南美连成一个大国（大哥伦比亚），没成功，1830 年 47 岁病逝。委内瑞拉的钱也叫「玻利瓦尔」。","fame_en":"Over twenty years of fighting he helped free what are now Venezuela, Colombia, Ecuador, Peru, Panama and Bolivia — Bolivia is named after him. His dream of one big united state (Gran Colombia) fell apart, and he died of illness in 1830 at 47. Venezuela's currency is the bolívar.","fact":"1805 年他才 22 岁，在罗马城外的圣山（Monte Sacro）上对着老师发誓：不把西班牙人赶出美洲就不罢休。这座小山现在在罗马城里，那一片就叫 Monte Sacro 区。","fact_en":"In 1805, aged 22, he climbed the Monte Sacro outside Rome with his tutor and swore not to rest until Spanish rule in the Americas was over. The hill is now inside Rome, in a district still called Monte Sacro.","src":"Wikipedia「Mons Sacer」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mons_Sacer","say":{"en":"Is there a Plaza Bolívar in every town here?","zh":"这里是不是每个镇都有一个玻利瓦尔广场？"}},"马克·吐温":{"kind":"person","what":"马克·吐温，本名塞缪尔·克莱门斯，美国作家和幽默演说家，在密西西比河边的小镇汉尼拔长大，年轻时在河上开过蒸汽船。","what_en":"Mark Twain — real name Samuel Clemens — the American writer and humorist who grew up in Hannibal on the Mississippi and piloted steamboats as a young man.","fame":"《汤姆·索亚历险记》《哈克贝利·费恩历险记》用普通人的口语写美国，海明威说现代美国文学都是从《哈克贝利·费恩》来的。他的笔名就是河上的行话：mark twain 意思是「水深两英寻」，船可以安全通过。","fame_en":"Tom Sawyer and Huckleberry Finn put everyday American speech on the page — Hemingway said all modern American literature comes from Huck Finn. His pen name is river slang: 'mark twain' meant two fathoms deep, safe water for a steamboat.","fact":"他出生的 1835 年，哈雷彗星刚刚经过近日点；1909 年他说自己跟着彗星来，也打算跟着它走。第二年 4 月哈雷彗星再次经过近日点，第二天他就去世了。","fact_en":"He was born in 1835, just after Halley's Comet passed the Sun. In 1909 he said he came in with the comet and expected to go out with it — and in April 1910 he died the day after its next perihelion.","src":"Snopes","url":"https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/mark-twain-halleys-comet/","say":{"en":"Did you have to read Tom Sawyer in school too?","zh":"你上学时也得读《汤姆·索亚》吗？"}},"华特·迪士尼":{"kind":"person","what":"华特·迪士尼，美国动画师、电影制片人和企业家，在密苏里乡下长大，后来在洛杉矶创办了迪士尼公司。","what_en":"Walt Disney, the American animator, film producer and businessman who grew up in rural Missouri and founded the Disney company in Los Angeles.","fame":"1928 年他和同事做出米老鼠的有声动画《汽船威利》；1937 年的《白雪公主》是美国第一部长篇手绘动画电影；1955 年在加州阿纳海姆开了第一座迪士尼乐园。他一个人拿过 22 座奥斯卡，到今天还是纪录。","fame_en":"In 1928 he and his team made the Mickey Mouse sound cartoon Steamboat Willie; Snow White (1937) was America's first feature-length cel-animated film; and in 1955 he opened the first Disneyland in Anaheim, California. His 22 competitive Oscars are still a record for one person.","fact":"2024 年 1 月 1 日，《汽船威利》里最早的米老鼠和米妮在美国过了版权期，进入公有领域，谁都可以用这一版来创作；但后来的米老鼠形象和商标还是迪士尼的。","fact_en":"On 1 January 2024 the earliest Mickey and Minnie, from Steamboat Willie, entered the US public domain — anyone can now reuse that version. Later Mickeys and the trademarks still belong to Disney.","src":"NPR，2024","url":"https://www.kunc.org/npr-news/2024-01-01/steamboat-willie-is-now-in-the-public-domain-what-does-that-mean-for-mickey-mouse","say":{"en":"Which Disney movie did you grow up with?","zh":"你是看哪部迪士尼电影长大的？"}},"猫王":{"kind":"person","what":"埃尔维斯·普雷斯利，美国歌手和演员，大家叫他「猫王」，家在田纳西州孟菲斯。","what_en":"Elvis Presley, the American singer and actor known as 'the King of Rock and Roll', whose home was in Memphis, Tennessee.","fame":"上世纪 50 年代，他把黑人的节奏布鲁斯和白人的乡村音乐混在一起唱，加上扭胯的舞台动作，让摇滚乐一下子走进千家万户；他在孟菲斯的家「雅园」（Graceland）现在每年有很多人去参观。","fame_en":"In the 1950s he blended Black rhythm and blues with white country music, added his famous hip-shaking moves, and brought rock and roll into every living room. His Memphis home, Graceland, now draws visitors from all over the world.","fact":"他红遍全世界，却几乎没出过国开演唱会：一生只在美国以外唱过 5 场，都在 1957 年的加拿大——多伦多、渥太华和温哥华。","fact_en":"For all his worldwide fame, he barely toured abroad: he played only five concerts outside the US in his whole career, all in Canada in 1957 — Toronto, Ottawa and Vancouver.","src":"Graceland 官网博客","url":"https://www.graceland.com/blog/elvis-presley-in-canada/","say":{"en":"My grandparents still dance to Elvis at every family party.","zh":"我爷爷奶奶每次家里聚会还会跟着猫王的歌跳舞。"}},"迈克尔·杰克逊":{"kind":"person","what":"迈克尔·杰克逊，美国歌手和舞者，被叫作「流行之王」，小时候和哥哥们组成杰克逊五兄弟出道。","what_en":"Michael Jackson, the American singer and dancer called 'the King of Pop', who started out as a child with his brothers in the Jackson 5.","fame":"1982 年的专辑《Thriller》是史上卖得最多的专辑之一；他把音乐录影带拍成小电影，太空步更是全世界都在模仿的舞步。","fame_en":"His 1982 album Thriller is one of the best-selling albums ever. He turned music videos into short films, and his moonwalk became a dance move the whole world tried to copy.","fact":"1967 年 8 月，还是个孩子的他和哥哥们在纽约哈莱姆区的阿波罗剧院赢了「业余之夜」比赛，这次胜利帮他们引起了摩城唱片的注意。","fact_en":"In August 1967, when he was still a child, he and his brothers won Amateur Night at the Apollo Theater in Harlem, New York — a win that helped bring them to Motown's attention.","src":"The Ed Sullivan Show 官网","url":"https://edsullivan.com/?p=3005","say":{"en":"Can you do the moonwalk? I've been trying for years.","zh":"你会太空步吗？我练了好多年都不会。"}},"玛丽莲·梦露":{"kind":"person","what":"玛丽莲·梦露，美国电影演员，上世纪 50 年代好莱坞最有名的明星之一，2026 年是她诞辰 100 周年。","what_en":"Marilyn Monroe, the American actress who was one of Hollywood's biggest stars of the 1950s; 2026 marks 100 years since her birth.","fame":"她演的《绅士爱美人》《七年之痒》《热情似火》到现在还常被重映；那条在地铁通风口被风吹起的白裙子，成了电影史上最有名的画面之一。","fame_en":"Her films Gentlemen Prefer Blondes, The Seven Year Itch and Some Like It Hot are still screened today, and the white dress blowing up over a subway grate is one of the most famous images in film history.","fact":"1955 年，她不满电影公司总给她演同一种角色，搬去纽约上表演课，还和摄影师米尔顿·格林开了自己的制片公司，后来拍了《巴士站》。","fact_en":"In 1955, tired of the studio giving her the same kind of role, she moved to New York to study acting and set up her own production company with photographer Milton Greene, which went on to make Bus Stop.","src":"Wikipedia「Marilyn Monroe」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marilyn_Monroe","say":{"en":"Have you ever seen Some Like It Hot? It's still really funny.","zh":"你看过《热情似火》吗？现在看还是很好笑。"}},"鲍勃·马利":{"kind":"person","what":"鲍勃·马利，牙买加歌手和词曲作者，雷鬼音乐最有名的人，家在首都金斯敦。","what_en":"Bob Marley, the Jamaican singer-songwriter who is the most famous name in reggae, based in the capital, Kingston.","fame":"他把牙买加的雷鬼带到了全世界，歌里唱和平、团结和穷人的生活；在很多国家，一说起牙买加，人们首先想到的就是他。","fame_en":"He took Jamaican reggae to the whole world, singing about peace, unity and the lives of ordinary people. In many countries, he is the first thing people think of when they hear 'Jamaica'.","fact":"1999 年 12 月，美国《时代》杂志把他 1977 年的专辑《Exodus》选为「20 世纪最佳专辑」。他在金斯敦住过的房子现在是鲍勃·马利博物馆。","fact_en":"In December 1999, Time magazine named his 1977 album Exodus the best album of the 20th century. His former home in Kingston is now the Bob Marley Museum.","src":"Wikipedia「Exodus (Bob Marley and the Wailers album)」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exodus_(Bob_Marley_and_the_Wailers_album)","say":{"en":"Put some Bob Marley on — it's that kind of afternoon.","zh":"放点鲍勃·马利的歌吧，今天下午就适合听他。"}},"夏奇拉":{"kind":"person","what":"夏奇拉，哥伦比亚歌手，出生在加勒比海边的城市巴兰基亚，用西班牙语和英语唱歌。","what_en":"Shakira, the Colombian singer from the Caribbean city of Barranquilla, who sings in both Spanish and English.","fame":"她是最早一批红遍全世界的拉丁女歌手之一，肚皮舞一样的舞步是她的招牌；2010 年南非世界杯的主题曲《Waka Waka》让很多不听拉丁音乐的人也认识了她。","fame_en":"She was one of the first Latin female singers to become a global star, famous for her belly-dance-style moves. Her 2010 World Cup song 'Waka Waka' made her known even to people who never listened to Latin music.","fact":"1997 年她才 18 岁，就在家乡巴兰基亚办了「赤脚基金会」（Pies Descalzos），现在在哥伦比亚办了几所学校，几千个孩子在那儿上学、吃饭。","fact_en":"In 1997, when she was just 18, she started the Barefoot Foundation (Pies Descalzos) in her hometown of Barranquilla. It now runs schools in Colombia where thousands of children study and get meals.","src":"Wikipedia「Barefoot Foundation」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barefoot_Foundation","say":{"en":"Did you know Shakira is from Colombia, not Spain?","zh":"你知道夏奇拉是哥伦比亚人，不是西班牙人吗？"}},"泰勒·斯威夫特":{"kind":"person","what":"泰勒·斯威夫特，美国创作歌手，从乡村音乐起步，后来转唱流行，歌几乎都是自己写的。","what_en":"Taylor Swift, the American singer-songwriter who started in country music and moved to pop, writing almost all of her own songs.","fame":"她把自己的经历写成歌，歌迷（Swifties）跟着她一起长大；她还重新录制了自己早年的专辑，把作品的所有权拿回自己手里，这件事让很多人开始关心音乐人的版权。","fame_en":"She turns her own life into songs, and her fans — the Swifties — have grown up with her. She also re-recorded her early albums to own her work again, which made many people pay attention to musicians' rights.","fact":"她的 Eras 巡演 2024 年 12 月在温哥华唱完最后一场，两年 149 场，总票房估计约 22 亿美元，是史上票房最高的巡演，也是第一个超过 10 亿美元的。","fact_en":"Her Eras Tour ended in Vancouver in December 2024 after 149 shows in nearly two years, grossing an estimated $2.2 billion — the highest-grossing tour ever, and the first to pass $1 billion.","src":"AP / Pollstar，2024","url":"https://www.kctv5.com/2024/12/09/taylor-swifts-eras-tour-ends-by-shattering-own-record-grossing-an-estimated-22b-pollstar-says","say":{"en":"Which Taylor Swift era is your favourite?","zh":"泰勒·斯威夫特的哪个时期你最喜欢？"}},"碧昂丝":{"kind":"person","what":"碧昂丝，美国歌手、词曲作者，在得克萨斯州休斯敦长大，少女时期是天命真女组合的主唱。","what_en":"Beyoncé, the American singer-songwriter who grew up in Houston, Texas, and first became famous as the lead singer of Destiny's Child.","fame":"她唱跳俱佳，演唱会以排场大、编排细出名；她是格莱美历史上得奖最多的人，专辑常常一出就成为大家讨论的话题。","fame_en":"She is known for powerful vocals, sharp choreography and huge, carefully staged shows. She has won more Grammys than anyone in history, and each new album quickly becomes a talking point.","fact":"2025 年 2 月，她凭乡村专辑《Cowboy Carter》第一次拿到格莱美年度专辑，也成为第一位获得最佳乡村专辑奖的黑人女歌手。","fact_en":"In February 2025, her country album Cowboy Carter won her first Grammy for Album of the Year, and she became the first Black woman to win Best Country Album.","src":"NBC News，2025","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/pop-culture/music/beyonce-wins-album-year-grammy-cowboy-carter-rcna190356","say":{"en":"Did you know Beyoncé made a country album?","zh":"你知道碧昂丝出过一张乡村专辑吗？"}},"贾斯汀·比伯":{"kind":"person","what":"贾斯汀·比伯，加拿大歌手，在安大略省的小城斯特拉特福长大，十几岁在 YouTube 上被发现。","what_en":"Justin Bieber, the Canadian singer who grew up in the small town of Stratford, Ontario, and was discovered on YouTube as a young teenager.","fame":"他是最早靠网络视频走红的流行歌星之一，十五六岁就红遍全世界，后来慢慢从少年偶像变成唱 R&B 和流行的成熟歌手。","fame_en":"He was one of the first pop stars to be discovered through online videos, became a worldwide star at fifteen or sixteen, and later grew from a teen idol into an adult pop and R&B singer.","fact":"出名前，十二岁左右的他常在家乡雅芳剧院（Avon Theatre）门口的台阶上弹吉他卖唱；2011 年剧院门口给他放了一颗星，2018 年当地博物馆还办了以这几级台阶命名的展览。","fact_en":"Before he was famous, at about twelve, he busked with his guitar on the steps of the Avon Theatre in his hometown. In 2011 the town gave him a star outside the theatre, and in 2018 the local museum opened an exhibition named after those steps.","src":"Complex，2018","url":"https://www.complex.com/music/2018/01/justin-bieber-museum-exhibit","say":{"en":"Bieber's from a tiny town in Canada — he started out busking.","zh":"比伯来自加拿大一个小城——他是从街头卖唱开始的。"}},"MrBeast":{"kind":"person","what":"MrBeast，本名吉米·唐纳森，美国 YouTube 博主，来自北卡罗来纳州，以花大钱拍挑战视频和送钱送东西出名。","what_en":"MrBeast, real name Jimmy Donaldson, the American YouTuber from North Carolina known for big-budget challenge videos and giveaways.","fame":"他的视频节奏快、奖金大，比如「最后一个离开圈子的人赢钱」；他还把 YouTube 生意做成了公司，卖巧克力、拍综艺，也拍过种树、清理海洋垃圾的公益视频。","fame_en":"His videos are fast-paced with huge prizes, like 'last to leave the circle wins'. He has turned YouTube into a business — chocolate bars, a TV game show — and run charity projects like planting trees and cleaning up ocean rubbish.","fact":"2024 年 6 月，他的频道超过印度音乐公司 T-Series，成了 YouTube 上订阅数最多的频道，当时大约 2.7 亿订阅。","fact_en":"In June 2024 his channel overtook the Indian music label T-Series to become the most-subscribed channel on YouTube, with around 270 million subscribers at the time.","src":"Advanced Television，2024","url":"https://advanced-television.com/2024/06/04/mrbeast-now-youtubes-biggest-channel/","say":{"en":"Have you seen the new MrBeast video? The prize was crazy.","zh":"你看 MrBeast 新视频了吗？奖金太夸张了。"}},"迈克尔·乔丹":{"kind":"person","what":"美国篮球运动员，上世纪八九十年代在芝加哥公牛队打球，退役后做过夏洛特黄蜂队的老板。","what_en":"The American basketball player who starred for the Chicago Bulls in the 1980s and '90s, and after retiring owned the Charlotte Hornets for years.","fame":"带公牛队拿了六次 NBA 总冠军，六次都是总决赛最有价值球员；他和耐克合作的 Air Jordan 球鞋从 1985 年卖到今天，让「球星签名鞋」成了一门大生意。","fame_en":"He led the Bulls to six NBA titles and was Finals MVP all six times. His Air Jordan shoes with Nike, first sold in 1985, turned the star signature sneaker into a huge business.","fact":"2022 年 9 月，他在 1998 年总决赛第一场穿过的球衣在苏富比拍出约 1010 万美元，是比赛穿过的体育纪念品里最贵的一件——有意思的是，那场公牛队输了。","fact_en":"In September 2022, the jersey he wore in Game 1 of the 1998 Finals sold at Sotheby's for about $10.1 million, a record for game-worn sports memorabilia. The Bulls actually lost that game.","src":"ESPN，2022","url":"https://www.espn.com/nba/story/_/id/34598807","say":{"en":"Jordan or LeBron — who's the GOAT for you?","zh":"乔丹还是詹姆斯，你觉得谁是史上最佳？"}},"贝利":{"kind":"person","what":"巴西足球运动员，大部分时间在桑托斯队踢球，2022 年 12 月去世，享年 82 岁。","what_en":"The Brazilian footballer who spent most of his career at Santos. He died in December 2022, aged 82.","fame":"他是唯一一个拿过三次世界杯冠军的球员（1958、1962、1970），17 岁就在世界杯决赛进球；很多人第一次知道巴西，就是因为贝利。","fame_en":"He is the only player to win three World Cups (1958, 1962, 1970) and scored in a World Cup final at 17. For many people around the world, Pelé was how they first heard of Brazil.","fact":"2023 年 4 月，巴西的 Michaelis 葡萄牙语词典把「pelé」收成了形容词，意思是「无与伦比、独一无二」，比如「他是篮球界的贝利」。这是十几万人签名请愿的结果。","fact_en":"In April 2023, Brazil's Michaelis dictionary added \"pelé\" as an adjective meaning exceptional or unique — as in \"he's the Pelé of basketball\" — after a petition with over 125,000 signatures.","src":"CBS Sports，2023","url":"https://www.cbssports.com/soccer/news/brazilian-dictionary-adds-pele-as-adjective-used-to-describe-someone-as-exceptional-incomparable-unique/","say":{"en":"In Brazil, \"pelé\" is now a word for \"the best\".","zh":"在巴西，「pelé」现在就是「最棒」的意思。"}},"塞纳":{"kind":"person","what":"巴西一级方程式赛车手艾尔顿·塞纳，圣保罗人，1994 年在比赛中去世。","what_en":"Ayrton Senna, the Formula 1 driver from São Paulo, Brazil, who died during a race in 1994.","fame":"三次 F1 世界冠军（1988、1990、1991），下雨天开得尤其快，排位赛拿了 65 次杆位；在巴西，他是那个年代每个星期天早上大家守着电视看的人。","fame_en":"Three-time F1 world champion (1988, 1990, 1991), famous for his speed in the rain, with 65 pole positions. In Brazil, he was the man everyone woke up early on Sundays to watch.","fact":"2024 年 11 月，Netflix 上线了六集剧《塞纳》，由巴西演员加布里埃尔·莱昂内演他，是在他家人支持下拍的；同一年也是他去世三十周年。","fact_en":"In November 2024, Netflix released Senna, a six-part drama with Brazilian actor Gabriel Leone in the lead, made with his family's support — thirty years after his death.","src":"Wikipedia：Senna (miniseries)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Senna_(miniseries)","say":{"en":"Have you watched the Senna series on Netflix?","zh":"你看过 Netflix 上那部塞纳的剧吗？"}},"梅西":{"kind":"person","what":"阿根廷足球运动员利昂内尔·梅西，罗萨里奥人，13 岁去巴塞罗那，后来踢过巴黎圣日耳曼，现在在美国的迈阿密国际队。","what_en":"Lionel Messi, the Argentine footballer from Rosario who moved to Barcelona at 13, later played for Paris Saint-Germain, and now plays for Inter Miami in the US.","fame":"拿过八次金球奖，比谁都多；2022 年带阿根廷拿了世界杯冠军，补上了他最想要的那一块。个子不高，小时候还因为发育问题打过生长激素，后来成了很多人心里最好的球员。","fame_en":"He has won eight Ballon d'Ors, more than anyone, and in 2022 led Argentina to the World Cup — the one trophy he wanted most. Small as a boy and treated for a growth problem, he became many people's idea of the best ever.","fact":"2025 年 12 月，迈阿密国际 3 比 1 赢了温哥华白浪，拿到球队历史上第一个美职联总冠军；梅西两次助攻，被评为决赛最有价值球员。","fact_en":"In December 2025, Inter Miami beat the Vancouver Whitecaps 3–1 to win the club's first ever MLS Cup. Messi set up two goals and was named the final's MVP.","src":"Wikipedia：MLS Cup 2025","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MLS_Cup_2025","say":{"en":"Did you see Messi's assist last night?","zh":"你看到梅西昨晚那个助攻了吗？"}},"勒布朗·詹姆斯":{"kind":"person","what":"美国篮球运动员，俄亥俄州阿克伦人，高中毕业直接进 NBA，打过骑士、热火，现在在洛杉矶湖人队。","what_en":"The American basketball player from Akron, Ohio, who went straight from high school to the NBA and has played for Cleveland, Miami and now the Los Angeles Lakers.","fame":"2023 年超过贾巴尔成为 NBA 历史得分王，拿过四次总冠军；2016 年帮家乡克利夫兰拿到 52 年来第一个大联盟冠军。打了二十多个赛季还是顶级球员。","fame_en":"In 2023 he passed Kareem Abdul-Jabbar as the NBA's all-time top scorer. He has four titles, including Cleveland's first major championship in 52 years in 2016, and is still elite after more than twenty seasons.","fact":"2024 年 10 月 22 日，他和儿子布朗尼一起为湖人队上场，是 NBA 历史上第一对在正式比赛里同时打球的父子。","fact_en":"On 22 October 2024 he and his son Bronny played together for the Lakers — the first father and son ever to share the court in an official NBA game.","src":"NBC News，2024","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/sports/nba/lebron-james-bronny-nba-lakers-history-rcna176432","quote":{"en":"I'm going to take my talents to South Beach and join the Miami Heat.","zh":"我要把我的天赋带到南海滩，加盟迈阿密热火。","where":"2010 年 7 月，ESPN 直播节目《The Decision》里宣布离开骑士","where_en":"Announcing he was leaving Cleveland on ESPN's live special The Decision, July 2010"},"say":{"en":"How is LeBron still playing at his age?","zh":"詹姆斯这个年纪怎么还在打？"}},"斯蒂芬·库里":{"kind":"person","what":"美国篮球运动员，整个职业生涯都在旧金山湾区的金州勇士队。","what_en":"The American basketball player who has spent his whole career with the Golden State Warriors in the San Francisco Bay Area.","fame":"他把三分球投成了主要武器，离篮筐很远也敢出手，带勇士拿了四次总冠军；后来全世界的孩子都在学他的远投，篮球的打法也跟着变了。身材在 NBA 里不算高大，这让很多普通孩子觉得「我也可以」。","fame_en":"He made the three-pointer a main weapon, shooting from far beyond the line, and led the Warriors to four titles. Kids everywhere copy his long shots, and the way basketball is played changed with him.","fact":"2025 年 3 月 13 日，在旧金山大通中心对国王队的比赛里，他成了 NBA 历史上第一个投进 4000 个三分球的人——第二天就是他 37 岁生日。","fact_en":"On 13 March 2025, against the Kings at Chase Center, he became the first player in NBA history to make 4,000 three-pointers — the day before his 37th birthday.","src":"CBS Sports，2025","url":"https://www.cbssports.com/nba/news/warriors-stephen-curry-becomes-first-nba-player-to-make-4000-3-pointers-and-5000-is-within-his-reach/","say":{"en":"He's shooting from the logo again!","zh":"他又从中场附近投了！"}},"西蒙·拜尔斯":{"kind":"person","what":"美国体操运动员，住在得克萨斯州休斯敦附近，从小在那儿训练。","what_en":"The American gymnast who grew up and trains near Houston, Texas.","fame":"奥运会和世锦赛加起来拿了 30 枚金牌，有好几个动作用她的名字命名；2021 年东京奥运会上她为了心理健康退出了几项比赛，让很多运动员敢说「我需要停一下」，三年后又回到奥运赛场。","fame_en":"She has 30 Olympic and world gold medals and several skills named after her. At Tokyo 2021 she pulled out of events to protect her mental health, which helped other athletes say \"I need a break\" — and she came back three years later.","fact":"2024 年巴黎奥运会跳马决赛，她用「尤尔琴科屈体后空翻两周」拿了金牌——这个动作 2023 年起正式叫「Biles II」，以前从没人在奥运会上做过。","fact_en":"At Paris 2024 she won vault gold with the Yurchenko double pike — officially named the Biles II in 2023, and never done at an Olympics before.","src":"NPR，2024","url":"https://www.npr.org/2024/08/03/g-s1-15234/simone-biles-gold-vault-paris-olympics","quote":{"en":"At the end of the day we're human, too.","zh":"说到底，我们也是人。","where":"2021 年 7 月东京奥运会，退出团体决赛后对记者说（美联社报道）","where_en":"To reporters after withdrawing from the team final at the Tokyo Olympics, July 2021 (reported by AP)"},"say":{"en":"I can't believe that skill is named after her.","zh":"真不敢相信那个动作是用她的名字命名的。"}},"菲尔普斯":{"kind":"person","what":"美国游泳运动员迈克尔·菲尔普斯，巴尔的摩人，2016 年退役。","what_en":"Michael Phelps, the American swimmer from Baltimore who retired in 2016.","fame":"奥运会拿了 23 枚金牌、28 枚奖牌，都是历史最多；2008 年北京一届就拿了 8 枚金牌。退役后他常公开讲自己的抑郁，劝人去找心理帮助。","fame_en":"He won 23 Olympic golds and 28 medals in total, both records, including eight golds at Beijing 2008 alone. Since retiring he has spoken openly about depression and urged people to seek help.","fact":"他的 400 米个人混合泳世界纪录从 2008 年保持到 2023 年 7 月，才被法国的莱昂·马尔尚在福冈打破——这是他最后一个个人项目世界纪录，马尔尚的教练正是菲尔普斯当年的教练鲍勃·鲍曼。","fact_en":"His 400m individual medley world record stood from 2008 until July 2023, when France's Léon Marchand broke it in Fukuoka. It was Phelps's last individual world record — and Marchand's coach was Bob Bowman, Phelps's old coach.","src":"World Aquatics，2023","url":"https://www.worldaquatics.com/news/3601329/4-minutes-250-seconds-leon-marchand-breaks-the-oldest-world-record-in-the-books-phelps-400m-im","say":{"en":"Twenty-three golds — I can't even imagine that.","zh":"23 枚金牌，想都不敢想。"}},"小威廉姆斯":{"kind":"person","what":"美国网球运动员塞雷娜·威廉姆斯，在洛杉矶的康普顿长大，跟姐姐维纳斯一起在公共球场上练球，2022 年告别网坛。","what_en":"Serena Williams, the American tennis player who grew up in Compton, Los Angeles, practising on public courts with her sister Venus. She left the tour in 2022.","fame":"拿了 23 个大满贯女单冠军，是网球公开赛时代最多的；2017 年她怀孕时拿下澳网冠军。她还开了投资公司，专门投女性和少数族裔创办的公司。","fame_en":"She won 23 Grand Slam singles titles, the most in the Open Era, including the 2017 Australian Open while pregnant. She also runs an investment firm backing companies started by women and people of colour.","fact":"2025 年 2 月超级碗中场秀，同是康普顿出身的肯德里克·拉马尔表演时，她突然出现在台上跳了一段舞，后来她说那只是在庆祝。","fact_en":"At the Super Bowl halftime show in February 2025, she made a surprise appearance dancing on stage during fellow Compton native Kendrick Lamar's set — later saying it was purely a celebration.","src":"NBC News，2025","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/pop-culture/pop-culture-news/serena-williams-says-super-bowl-dance-kendrick-lamar-absolutely-not-di-rcna201563","quote":{"en":"I have never liked the word \"retirement\".","zh":"我从来不喜欢「退役」这个词。","where":"2022 年 8 月，她在《Vogue》上写的告别网坛的文章","where_en":"Her essay in Vogue announcing she was stepping away from tennis, August 2022"},"say":{"en":"Serena or Venus — who did you grow up watching?","zh":"小威还是大威，你是看谁长大的？"}},"内马尔":{"kind":"person","what":"巴西足球运动员，在桑托斯出道，踢过巴塞罗那、巴黎圣日耳曼和沙特的利雅得新月，2025 年回到了桑托斯。","what_en":"The Brazilian footballer who came through at Santos, played for Barcelona, Paris Saint-Germain and Saudi club Al-Hilal, and returned to Santos in 2025.","fame":"盘带和花样过人特别多，2017 年从巴萨转会巴黎，转会费约 2.22 亿欧元，到今天还是世界纪录；2016 年在里约奥运会决赛罚进最后一个点球，帮巴西拿到第一枚奥运足球金牌。","fame_en":"Famous for his dribbling and tricks, he moved from Barcelona to PSG in 2017 for about €222 million, still the world-record fee, and scored the winning penalty in the Rio 2016 final for Brazil's first Olympic football gold.","fact":"2023 年 9 月对玻利维亚的世界杯预选赛上，他梅开二度，按国际足联承认的正式比赛算，超过贝利成了巴西国家队进球最多的人；不过很多巴西人不同意——算上友谊赛，贝利有 95 球。","fact_en":"In a World Cup qualifier against Bolivia in September 2023 he scored twice and, counting FIFA-recognised matches, passed Pelé as Brazil's top scorer. Many Brazilians disagree: count friendlies and Pelé has 95.","src":"TSN（美联社），2023","url":"https://www.tsn.ca/soccer/neymar-breaks-pele-s-record-as-brazil-s-all-time-top-goal-scorer-1.2005360","say":{"en":"Is Neymar back at Santos for good?","zh":"内马尔这次是真的回桑托斯了吗？"}},"颐和园":{"what":"北京西北边清朝皇家的大园子，一大片昆明湖加一座万寿山。","what_en":"The Qing emperors' huge garden in northwest Beijing — one big lake (Kunming Lake) and one hill (Longevity Hill).","fame":"中国保存最完整的皇家园林，1998 年进了世界遗产；慈禧太后最爱在这儿过夏天。现在是北京人遛弯、划船、冬天在湖上滑冰的地方。","fame_en":"China's best-preserved imperial garden and a World Heritage Site since 1998 — Empress Dowager Cixi's favourite summer home. Today Beijingers come to stroll, row boats, and skate on the frozen lake in winter.","fact":"湖边的长廊有 728 米长，分成 273 间，梁上画了一万多幅画，1992 年被吉尼斯认定为世界上最长的画廊。现在这条长廊是 1860 年被英法联军烧掉后，1886 年重修的。","fact_en":"The lakeside Long Corridor is 728 metres long, split into 273 sections, with over 10,000 paintings on its beams — Guinness listed it in 1992 as the world's longest corridor. What you walk today was rebuilt in 1886 after Anglo-French troops burned it in 1860.","src":"Wikipedia：Long Corridor","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Long_Corridor","say":{"en":"Where can we rent a boat on Kunming Lake?","zh":"昆明湖在哪儿能租船？"}},"天安门":{"what":"北京市中心那座红墙黄瓦的城楼，是明清皇城的正门，前面就是天安门广场。","what_en":"The red-walled gate tower in the centre of Beijing — the front gate of the old imperial city, with Tiananmen Square in front of it.","fame":"印在国徽上、人民币上的那座门；1949 年开国大典在城楼上宣布。每天日出时广场上有升旗，很多人半夜就来排队。","fame_en":"It's the gate on China's national emblem and on banknotes; the founding of the People's Republic was announced from it in 1949. Every day at sunrise there's a flag-raising on the square, and people queue from the middle of the night.","fact":"城楼上那张毛主席像每年国庆前都会换一张新的：旧的白天风吹日晒会褪色，所以九月底趁晚上取下，换上新画的一模一样的一张。几十年里一直是画家王国栋在画。","fact_en":"The portrait of Mao on the gate is swapped for a fresh one every year before National Day — sun and weather fade it, so in late September the old one is taken down at night and an identical new one goes up. For decades the painter was Wang Guodong.","src":"Wikipedia：Portraits overlooking Tiananmen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portraits_overlooking_Tiananmen","say":{"en":"What time is the flag-raising tomorrow morning?","zh":"明天早上几点升旗？"}},"避暑山庄":{"what":"河北承德清朝皇帝夏天来住的行宫，有湖、有山、有草原。","what_en":"The Qing emperors' summer palace in Chengde, Hebei — lakes, hills and even a stretch of grassland inside the walls.","fame":"中国现存最大的皇家园林，比颐和园还大；康熙、乾隆每年夏天在这儿住好几个月、打猎、见各族首领。外面一圈「外八庙」，1994 年一起进了世界遗产。","fame_en":"China's largest surviving imperial garden — bigger than the Summer Palace in Beijing. Kangxi and Qianlong spent months here every summer, hunting and receiving leaders from across the empire. With the 'Eight Outer Temples' around it, it became a World Heritage Site in 1994.","fact":"1793 年 9 月 14 日，英国派来的马戛尔尼使团就是在这儿见到乾隆皇帝的：皇帝在关外打猎，使团只好从北京追到承德。英国人想通商，乾隆一口拒绝了。","fact_en":"On 14 September 1793 Britain's Macartney Embassy met the Qianlong Emperor here — he was away hunting beyond the Great Wall, so the British had to follow him from Beijing to Chengde. They asked for trade; Qianlong turned them down.","src":"Wikipedia：Macartney Embassy","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macartney_Embassy","say":{"en":"Is there a shuttle bus to the Outer Eight Temples?","zh":"有去外八庙的摆渡车吗？"}},"赵州桥":{"what":"河北赵县一座一千四百多年的石拱桥，隋朝工匠李春造的。","what_en":"A stone arch bridge in Zhao County, Hebei, built over 1,400 years ago by the Sui-dynasty craftsman Li Chun.","fame":"世界上现存最古老的「敞肩」石拱桥：大拱两头又开了四个小拱，省石头、减重量，发大水时水还能从小拱里过。中国小学课本里都有它。","fame_en":"The world's oldest surviving open-spandrel stone arch bridge: four small arches cut into the ends of the big one save stone and weight, and let floodwater pass through. It's in every Chinese primary-school textbook.","fact":"据记载它挺过了至少八次战争、十次大洪水和很多次地震，最近一次是 1966 年邢台大地震，震中离这儿大约 40 公里，桥的主体还是好好的。","fact_en":"It is said to have survived at least eight wars, ten major floods and many earthquakes — the latest being the 1966 Xingtai earthquake, about 40 km away — with its main structure intact.","src":"Wikipedia：Anji Bridge","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anji_Bridge","say":{"en":"Can we still walk across the bridge?","zh":"这座桥现在还能走上去吗？"}},"悬空寺":{"what":"山西浑源恒山脚下，贴在悬崖半腰上的一座寺庙。","what_en":"A temple clinging halfway up a cliff at the foot of Mount Heng in Hunyuan, Shanxi.","fame":"一千五百多年前的北魏就有了，几十间殿用木梁插在岩石里撑着，远看像挂在半空；里面佛、道、儒三家一起供。","fame_en":"Founded over 1,500 years ago in the Northern Wei, its halls sit on wooden beams driven into the rock, so from afar it looks hung in mid-air. Inside, Buddhism, Taoism and Confucianism are honoured together.","fact":"2010 年美国《时代》杂志把它列进「世界十大最危险（悬乎）的建筑」——不是说它不结实，而是看上去随时会掉下来，它已经这样站了一千多年。","fact_en":"In 2010 Time magazine put it on its list of the world's Top 10 Precarious Buildings — not because it is weak, but because it looks ready to fall. It has looked that way for well over a thousand years.","src":"Wikipedia：Hanging Temple","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanging_Temple","say":{"en":"Do I need to book a time slot to go up?","zh":"上去要提前预约时段吗？"}},"应县木塔":{"what":"山西应县佛宫寺里一座九百多年的木头塔，当地人叫它「应县木塔」。","what_en":"A wooden pagoda more than 900 years old in Fogong Temple, Ying County, Shanxi.","fame":"1056 年辽代建成，从头到尾是木头搭的，没用一颗钉子，靠榫卯一层层咬在一起；九百多年里挨过好几次大地震都没倒。","fame_en":"Finished in 1056 under the Liao dynasty, it's wood from top to bottom, held together by interlocking joints rather than nails — and has ridden out several big earthquakes in over 900 years.","fact":"2016 年 9 月，吉尼斯世界纪录正式认定它是世界上最高的木塔：67.31 米，差不多二十层楼高。","fact_en":"In September 2016 Guinness World Records certified it as the world's tallest wooden pagoda: 67.31 metres, roughly a 20-storey building.","src":"Guinness World Records，2016 年 9 月","url":"https://guinnessworldrecords.com/news/2016/9/guinness-world-records-awards-record-certificate-for-towering-wooden-pagoda-in-ch-445332","say":{"en":"Can visitors go inside the pagoda?","zh":"木塔里面还能进去吗？"}},"五台山":{"what":"山西忻州五座平顶山围成的佛教名山，山里山外有一百多座寺庙。","what_en":"A Buddhist mountain in Xinzhou, Shanxi — five flat-topped peaks with more than a hundred temples among them.","fame":"中国四大佛教名山之首，传说是文殊菩萨的道场；汉族和藏传佛教的寺庙都在这儿，2009 年进了世界遗产。","fame_en":"First of China's four sacred Buddhist mountains, said to be the home of Manjushri; Chinese and Tibetan Buddhist temples sit side by side. A World Heritage Site since 2009.","fact":"山里佛光寺的东大殿是 857 年唐朝盖的木头大殿。1937 年梁思成和林徽因按敦煌壁画上的一张「五台山图」找到了它，证明中国还留着唐代木建筑。","fact_en":"The East Hall of Foguang Temple here is a timber hall built in 857, in the Tang dynasty. In 1937 Liang Sicheng and Lin Huiyin tracked it down using a map of Mount Wutai painted in a Dunhuang cave — proof that Tang wooden buildings still survived in China.","src":"Wikipedia：Foguang Temple","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foguang_Temple","say":{"en":"Which bus goes to Foguang Temple?","zh":"去佛光寺坐哪路车？"}},"晋祠":{"what":"太原西南边一座三千年来祭祀晋国开国君主的祠堂园林。","what_en":"A shrine-and-garden complex southwest of Taiyuan honouring the founder of the ancient state of Jin.","fame":"山西「晋」字就从这儿来；园子里有古树、有泉水，难老泉流了几千年，还有一棵传说是西周时种的「周柏」。","fame_en":"Shanxi's short name, 'Jin', comes from here. Inside are ancient trees and springs — the Nanlao Spring has flowed for millennia, and one cypress is said to date back to the Western Zhou.","fact":"主殿圣母殿是宋朝 1023–1032 年修的，里面四十多尊真人大小的宋代彩塑侍女，一个人一个表情：有的在笑，有的像刚挨了骂。看得出是照着真人捏的。","fact_en":"The main Hall of the Holy Mother was built in 1023–1032 under the Song. Inside stand about forty life-size painted clay maids, each with her own face — one smiling, one looking like she's just been scolded. They were clearly modelled on real people.","src":"Wikipedia：Jinci","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jinci","say":{"en":"Where is the Hall of the Holy Mother?","zh":"圣母殿往哪边走？"}},"乔家大院":{"what":"山西祁县一座清朝晋商乔家的大宅子，六个大院套着二十个小院。","what_en":"The Qing-era mansion of the Qiao merchant family in Qi County, Shanxi — six big courtyards wrapped around twenty smaller ones.","fame":"晋商靠票号、做买卖富了几百年，这座院子就是他们的样子：高墙、砖雕、一排排红灯笼。现在是民俗博物馆。","fame_en":"Shanxi merchants grew rich for centuries on trade and draft banks, and this house shows how they lived: high walls, carved brick and rows of red lanterns. Today it's a folk museum.","fact":"张艺谋 1991 年的电影《大红灯笼高高挂》就是在这儿拍的，巩俐主演，拿了威尼斯银狮奖。院子因为这部电影一下子出了名。","fact_en":"Zhang Yimou shot Raise the Red Lantern (1991) here, starring Gong Li; it won the Silver Lion at Venice — and made the compound famous almost overnight.","src":"Wikipedia：Qiao Family Compound","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qiao_Family_Compound","say":{"en":"Which courtyard was used in the film?","zh":"电影是在哪个院子拍的？"}},"沈阳故宫":{"what":"辽宁沈阳市中心清朝入关前的皇宫，努尔哈赤和皇太极住过。","what_en":"The palace in central Shenyang, Liaoning, used by the Qing before they took Beijing — home to Nurhaci and Hong Taiji.","fame":"中国现在只有两座完整的皇宫：北京故宫和它。它比北京故宫小很多，可满族味道更重，2004 年也进了世界遗产。","fame_en":"China has only two complete imperial palaces left: the Forbidden City and this one. It's much smaller but far more Manchu in style, and joined the World Heritage list in 2004.","fact":"1636 年皇太极就在这儿把国号从「金」改成「大清」。东路的大政殿是八角形的，像一顶蒙古包，前面两排十座小亭子叫「十王亭」，八旗各有一座——一看就是马背上的规矩。","fact_en":"In 1636 Hong Taiji renamed his state from 'Jin' to 'Great Qing' right here. The octagonal Dazheng Hall is shaped like a nomad's tent, and the ten small pavilions in front — one for each of the Eight Banners plus two princes — show a government that came off horseback.","src":"Wikipedia：Mukden Palace","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mukden_Palace","say":{"en":"Is it closed on Mondays?","zh":"周一闭馆吗？"}},"上海中心大厦":{"what":"上海陆家嘴那座拧着往上长的银色大楼，632 米高。","what_en":"The silver, twisting skyscraper in Shanghai's Lujiazui, 632 metres tall.","fame":"中国最高、世界第三高的楼；跟金茂、环球金融中心站成一排，被上海人叫成「厨房三件套」（打蛋器、开瓶器、注射器……）。118 层有观光厅。","fame_en":"China's tallest building and the world's third tallest. Standing in a row with Jin Mao and the World Financial Center, locals joke they look like kitchen tools — whisk, bottle opener and so on. There's a viewing deck on floor 118.","fact":"楼里的观光电梯每秒跑 20.5 米，被吉尼斯认证为当时世界上最快的电梯，坐上去不到一分钟就到一百多层，耳朵会有点胀。","fact_en":"Its sightseeing lifts travel at 20.5 metres per second — certified by Guinness as the world's fastest at the time — reaching the top floors in under a minute. Your ears will pop.","src":"CNN：World's fastest elevator","url":"https://amp.cnn.com/cnn/style/article/worlds-fastest-tower","say":{"en":"Is it better to go up before sunset?","zh":"日落前上去比较好吗？"}},"豫园":{"what":"上海老城厢里一座四百多年的江南园林，外面是热闹的城隍庙商圈。","what_en":"A 400-year-old classical garden in Shanghai's old town, wrapped in the busy bazaar around the City God Temple.","fame":"1559 年一位姓潘的官员给父亲造的园子：假山、池塘、龙墙。园子外九曲桥、湖心亭、南翔小笼，过年还有灯会，是外地人来上海必到的地方。","fame_en":"Begun in 1559 by an official named Pan for his elderly father: rockeries, ponds, dragon-topped walls. Outside are the zigzag bridge, the lake-centre teahouse and Nanxiang soup dumplings, plus a lantern festival at New Year.","fact":"1986 年 10 月英国女王伊丽莎白二世访问上海，就走过九曲桥，在湖心亭喝了茶。茶楼 2025 年修好重开，女王坐过的那张桌子还留着。","fact_en":"In October 1986 Queen Elizabeth II crossed the zigzag bridge and had tea at the Huxinting teahouse. The teahouse reopened in 2025 after restoration, and the table she used is still kept.","src":"Wikipedia：State visit by Elizabeth II to China","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/State_visit_by_Elizabeth_II_to_China","say":{"en":"How long is the queue for xiaolongbao?","zh":"小笼包要排多久？"}},"周庄水乡":{"what":"江苏昆山一个九百多年的水乡古镇，河就是街，船就是车。","what_en":"A 900-year-old water town in Kunshan, Jiangsu, where canals are the streets and boats are the cars.","fame":"常被叫作「中国第一水乡」：小桥、流水、白墙黑瓦，坐摇橹船从石桥下穿过去，船娘会唱几句吴语小调。","fame_en":"Often called China's number-one water town: little bridges, flowing canals, white walls and black tiles. You ride a sculled boat under stone bridges while the boatwoman sings in the local Wu dialect.","fact":"它出名靠一幅画：画家陈逸飞画了镇上的「双桥」，1980 年代中期被美国石油大亨哈默买下，送给了邓小平，后来还上了联合国的邮票首日封，周庄从此游客不断。","fact_en":"It owes its fame to a painting: Chen Yifei's view of the town's Twin Bridges was bought in the mid-1980s by the American oil tycoon Armand Hammer and given to Deng Xiaoping. Tourists have flocked to Zhouzhuang ever since.","src":"Wikipedia：Chen Yifei","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chen_Yifei","say":{"en":"How much is a boat ride for two?","zh":"两个人坐船多少钱？"}},"中山陵":{"what":"南京紫金山上孙中山先生的陵墓。","what_en":"The mausoleum of Sun Yat-sen on Purple Mountain in Nanjing.","fame":"孙中山被称为「国父」，1925 年在北京去世，1929 年葬到这里。蓝色琉璃瓦、白墙，从山脚一层层台阶爬上去，是南京人秋天看梧桐、爬山的地方。","fame_en":"Sun Yat-sen, called the 'father of the nation', died in Beijing in 1925 and was buried here in 1929. Blue-glazed tiles, white walls and flight after flight of steps — Nanjingers come in autumn for the plane trees and the climb.","fact":"设计它的建筑师吕彦直只有 31 岁，1925 年在设计比赛里拿了第一；可他没等到完全完工就病逝了，1929 年才 35 岁。从下到上一共 392 级台阶。","fact_en":"Its architect, Lü Yanzhi, was just 31 when he won the 1925 design competition — and died in 1929, aged 35, as the work was being finished. From the bottom to the top there are 392 steps.","src":"Wikipedia：Lü Yanzhi","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/L%C3%BC_Yanzhi","say":{"en":"Do I need to reserve a ticket in advance?","zh":"需要提前预约吗？"}},"乌镇":{"what":"浙江桐乡一座水乡古镇，分东栅和西栅，晚上灯一亮特别好看。","what_en":"A canal town in Tongxiang, Zhejiang, split into East and West quarters — especially lovely when the lights come on at night.","fame":"老房子沿河一排排，过去是染布、酿酒的小镇；作家茅盾在这儿长大。每年秋天有乌镇戏剧节，街上到处是演出。","fame_en":"Old houses line the canals of what was once a town of dyers and distillers; the writer Mao Dun grew up here. Every autumn the Wuzhen Theatre Festival fills the streets with shows.","fact":"这个小古镇从 2014 年起是「世界互联网大会」的永久会址——每年全世界的科技公司老板都来这儿开会，开完会在石板路上散步。","fact_en":"Since 2014 this little old town has been the permanent home of the World Internet Conference — every year tech bosses from around the world meet here, then wander its stone lanes.","src":"Wikipedia：Wuzhen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wuzhen","say":{"en":"Is one ticket enough for the West Scenic Zone at night?","zh":"西栅一张票晚上也能进吗？"}},"普陀山":{"what":"浙江舟山海上的一座小岛，整座岛都是供观音菩萨的寺庙和海滩。","what_en":"A small island off Zhoushan, Zhejiang, covered in temples to Guanyin, the bodhisattva of compassion, and beaches.","fame":"中国四大佛教名山里唯一在海上的一座，传说是观音的道场；岛上一座 33 米高的南海观音铜像面朝大海，香客坐船来烧香、许愿。","fame_en":"The only one of China's four sacred Buddhist mountains that sits in the sea, said to be Guanyin's home. A 33-metre bronze Guanyin faces the ocean, and pilgrims arrive by ferry to pray.","fact":"岛上最早的寺叫「不肯去观音院」。传说唐朝时日本僧人慧锷想把一尊观音像带回日本，船到这儿怎么都开不走，他只好把像留下——一般说是 916 年。","fact_en":"The island's first shrine is the 'Guanyin Who Refused to Leave'. Legend says the Japanese monk Egaku tried to take a Guanyin statue home from Tang China, but his boat could not get past this island, so he left the statue here — the date usually given is 916.","src":"Wikipedia：Egaku","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egaku","say":{"en":"What time is the last ferry back to Zhujiajian?","zh":"回朱家尖的最后一班船几点？"}},"宏村":{"what":"安徽黟县黄山脚下一座徽派古村，白墙黑瓦倒映在月沼和南湖里。","what_en":"An old Huizhou-style village at the foot of Mount Huang in Yi County, Anhui — white walls and black roofs reflected in Moon Pond and South Lake.","fame":"村子按「牛」的样子规划：山是牛头，水渠是牛肠，池塘是牛胃，水从每家门口流过。2000 年跟西递一起进了世界遗产，美院学生成群来写生。","fame_en":"The village was laid out like an ox: the hill is its head, the channels its guts, the ponds its stomachs — water runs past every door. A World Heritage Site with Xidi since 2000, it's packed with art students sketching.","fact":"李安的《卧虎藏龙》（2000）有几场戏就在宏村拍，村口南湖上那座拱桥是片里的一个镜头，现在是游客排队拍照的地方。","fact_en":"Ang Lee filmed scenes of Crouching Tiger, Hidden Dragon (2000) in Hongcun; the arched bridge over South Lake at the village entrance appears in the film and is now a queue-for-photos spot.","src":"Wikipedia：Hongcun","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hongcun","say":{"en":"Is the ticket valid for two days?","zh":"门票两天内都能用吗？"}},"福建土楼":{"what":"福建西南山里客家人和闽南人盖的大圆楼、方楼，一座楼住一整个家族。","what_en":"Huge round and square earthen houses in the hills of southwest Fujian, built by Hakka and Minnan families — one building per clan.","fame":"外墙是夯土的，一两米厚，像城堡一样防土匪；里面一圈圈房间，几百人在同一个天井里做饭、晒衣服、过节。2008 年进了世界遗产。","fame_en":"Walls of rammed earth one to two metres thick kept out bandits like a castle; inside, rings of rooms let hundreds of relatives cook, dry laundry and celebrate around one courtyard. World Heritage since 2008.","fact":"永定的承启楼被叫作「土楼王」：江家三代人才盖完，1709 年完工，四圈环形楼一圈套一圈，大约 400 个房间。","fact_en":"Chengqilou in Yongding is called the 'King of Tulou': it took three generations of the Jiang family and was finished in 1709 — four concentric rings and about 400 rooms.","src":"Wikipedia：Fujian tulou","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fujian_tulou","say":{"en":"Do people still live in this tulou?","zh":"这座土楼里现在还住人吗？"}},"鼓浪屿":{"what":"厦门对面一座小岛，到处是百年前的老洋房，坐轮渡几分钟就到。","what_en":"A small island just across from Xiamen, full of century-old Western-style villas, a few minutes away by ferry.","fame":"清末到民国时这里有十几个国家的领事馆，闽南大厝、欧式别墅、南洋风的房子挤在一起；又被叫作「钢琴之岛」，岛上有中国唯一的钢琴博物馆。","fame_en":"From the late Qing on, more than a dozen countries had consulates here, so Minnan mansions, European villas and Southeast-Asian-style houses stand side by side. It's called 'Piano Island' and has China's only piano museum.","fact":"2017 年 7 月以「鼓浪屿：历史国际社区」进了世界遗产。岛上不准开汽车，连自行车也不能骑，所有东西都靠手推车运——快递小哥也是走路送。","fact_en":"In July 2017 it became a World Heritage Site as 'Kulangsu, a Historic International Settlement'. No cars are allowed — not even bicycles — so everything moves by handcart, and couriers deliver on foot.","src":"Wikipedia：Gulangyu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gulangyu","say":{"en":"Which pier does the ferry to Gulangyu leave from?","zh":"去鼓浪屿的轮渡从哪个码头走？"}},"滕王阁":{"what":"江西南昌赣江边一座高高的楼阁，唐朝就有了。","what_en":"A tall pavilion on the Gan River in Nanchang, Jiangxi, first built in the Tang dynasty.","fame":"跟黄鹤楼、岳阳楼并称「江南三大名楼」；它出名全靠王勃二十多岁时写的《滕王阁序》，「落霞与孤鹜齐飞，秋水共长天一色」中国学生都会背。","fame_en":"One of the 'Three Great Towers' of southern China with the Yellow Crane and Yueyang towers. Its fame comes from the preface the poet Wang Bo wrote here in his twenties — Chinese students still learn its lines about sunset clouds and a lone duck by heart.","fact":"它前后毁了又修了 29 次。现在这座是 1989 年 10 月建成的，按梁思成生前画的图纸修的，外面看是宋式木楼，其实是钢筋混凝土。","fact_en":"It has been destroyed and rebuilt 29 times. Today's tower, finished in October 1989 to plans drawn by Liang Sicheng, looks like a Song-dynasty timber pavilion but is actually reinforced concrete.","src":"Wikipedia：Pavilion of Prince Teng","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pavilion_of_Prince_Teng","say":{"en":"What time does the light show start?","zh":"灯光秀几点开始？"}},"黄鹤楼":{"what":"湖北武汉长江边蛇山上的一座五层楼阁。","what_en":"A five-storey tower on Snake Hill above the Yangtze in Wuhan, Hubei.","fame":"「江南三大名楼」之一；李白、崔颢都在这儿写过诗，「故人西辞黄鹤楼」中国人张口就来。站在楼上能看到长江大桥和对岸的汉口。","fame_en":"One of southern China's 'Three Great Towers'. Li Bai and Cui Hao wrote famous poems here that Chinese people can still recite. From the top you see the Yangtze bridge and Hankou across the river.","fact":"现在这座楼并不在原来的位置：1957 年修武汉长江大桥，桥墩正好落在老楼址上。新楼 1985 年才建成，离原址大约 1 公里。","fact_en":"Today's tower isn't on the original spot: when the Wuhan Yangtze River Bridge was built in 1957, one of its piers took the old site. The new tower was finished in 1985, about 1 km away.","src":"Wikipedia：Yellow Crane Tower","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yellow_Crane_Tower","say":{"en":"Is there an elevator to the top floor?","zh":"有电梯到顶层吗？"}},"三峡大坝":{"what":"湖北宜昌长江上的一座大坝，世界上发电量最大的水电站。","what_en":"A dam across the Yangtze at Yichang, Hubei — the world's largest hydropower station by capacity.","fame":"坝长 2.3 公里、高 185 米，2012 年 32 台机组全部发电；船过坝要走五级船闸，或者坐「电梯」一样的升船机。坐长江游轮的人都会停这一站。","fame_en":"It's 2.3 km long and 185 m high; all 32 main turbines were running by 2012. Ships pass via a five-step lock or a giant ship lift that works like an elevator. Yangtze cruises all stop here.","fact":"2005 年美国宇航局（NASA）的科学家算过：水库蓄满的这么多水，会让地球一天变长大约 0.06 微秒——小到感觉不到，但真的能算出来。","fact_en":"In 2005 NASA scientists calculated that shifting so much water into the reservoir lengthens Earth's day by about 0.06 microseconds — far too little to feel, but real enough to measure.","src":"Wikipedia：Three Gorges Dam","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three_Gorges_Dam","say":{"en":"How long does it take to pass through the ship lift?","zh":"坐升船机过坝要多久？"}},"凤凰古城":{"what":"湖南湘西沱江边的一座古城，吊脚楼一排排架在水上。","what_en":"An old town on the Tuo River in western Hunan, with stilt houses lined up over the water.","fame":"苗族、土家族住的地方；白天坐乌篷船，晚上沿河吊脚楼的灯全亮，河边一串酒吧。很多中国人知道它，是因为读过沈从文。","fame_en":"Home to Miao and Tujia people; by day you take a covered boat, by night the stilt houses light up and bars line the river. Many Chinese know it because they read Shen Congwen.","fact":"作家沈从文 1902 年就生在这儿（那时叫镇筸）。他 1934 年写的《边城》写的就是湘西的水边小城和摆渡的女孩翠翠，至今是中国人心里「最美的小镇」的样子。","fact_en":"The writer Shen Congwen was born here in 1902 (it was called Zhen'gan then). His 1934 novel Border Town, about a ferry girl named Cuicui in a West Hunan river town, still shapes how Chinese readers imagine the perfect small town.","src":"Wikipedia：Shen Congwen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shen_Congwen","say":{"en":"Can I rent Miao clothes for photos here?","zh":"这儿能租苗族衣服拍照吗？"}},"岳阳楼":{"what":"湖南岳阳洞庭湖边的一座三层木楼。","what_en":"A three-storey wooden tower on the shore of Dongting Lake in Yueyang, Hunan.","fame":"「江南三大名楼」里唯一保留着清朝原木结构的一座；范仲淹的《岳阳楼记》让它出名：「先天下之忧而忧，后天下之乐而乐」。","fame_en":"The only one of the 'Three Great Towers' that still keeps its original Qing-dynasty timber structure. Fan Zhongyan's essay made it famous with the line 'be first to worry about the world's troubles, last to enjoy its pleasures'.","fact":"1046 年范仲淹写《岳阳楼记》，是因为老朋友滕子京修好楼后给他寄了一幅《洞庭晚秋图》，请他写篇文章——这篇千古名文是看着画写出来的。","fact_en":"Fan Zhongyan wrote his famous essay in 1046 because his old friend Teng Zijing, having restored the tower, sent him a painting of Dongting Lake in late autumn and asked for a piece — the classic was written looking at a picture.","src":"Wikipedia：Memorial to Yueyang Tower","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Memorial_to_Yueyang_Tower","say":{"en":"Is there a boat to Junshan Island from here?","zh":"这儿有去君山岛的船吗？"}},"广州塔":{"what":"广州珠江边一座 600 米高、腰细细的电视塔，广州人叫它「小蛮腰」。","what_en":"A 600-metre TV tower on the Pearl River in Guangzhou with a narrow 'waist' — locals call it 'Little Slim Waist'.","fame":"中国最高的电视塔，晚上会变颜色；在珠江夜游船上看它最好。塔顶有绕着塔转的「摩天轮」，一圈二十分钟。","fame_en":"China's tallest TV tower, glowing in changing colours at night — best seen from a Pearl River night cruise. Near the top, glass pods circle the tower like a Ferris wheel, twenty minutes a lap.","fact":"塔上有两项吉尼斯纪录：488 米高的室外观景台是世界最高的观景台，塔顶的跳楼机「极速云霄」是世界最高的惊险游乐项目。","fact_en":"The tower holds two Guinness records: its 488-metre outdoor deck is the world's highest lookout, and the Sky Drop free-fall ride near the top is the world's highest thrill ride.","src":"Guinness World Records：Highest thrill ride","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/highest-thrill-ride","say":{"en":"Is the Bubble Tram included in this ticket?","zh":"这张票包括摩天轮吗？"}},"洪崖洞":{"what":"重庆嘉陵江边贴着悬崖盖的一大片吊脚楼，里面是吃的、喝的、小店。","what_en":"A huge cluster of stilt-house-style buildings stacked against a cliff on the Jialing River in Chongqing, filled with food stalls, bars and shops.","fame":"重庆最上镜的夜景：天一黑整片楼的灯全亮，江对面挤满拍照的人；从下往上走十几层，最上面一层直接通到城里的马路上——这就是「山城」。","fame_en":"Chongqing's most photographed night view: at dusk the whole stack lights up and crowds gather across the river to shoot it. Climb a dozen floors from the riverside and the top floor opens straight onto a city street — that's the 'Mountain City' for you.","fact":"网上都说它像宫崎骏《千与千寻》里的汤屋，所以被叫作「现实版千与千寻」。其实它跟这部 2001 年的电影没有关系，只是灯亮起来真的很像。","fact_en":"Online it's called the 'real-life Spirited Away', because the lit-up building looks like the bathhouse in Miyazaki's 2001 film. In fact there's no connection to the film — it just really does look the part at night.","src":"Wikipedia：Hongya Cave","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hongya_Cave","say":{"en":"Which floor comes out at street level?","zh":"哪一层能直接走到马路上？"}},"乐山大佛":{"what":"四川乐山三江交汇处，在整面红砂岩悬崖上凿出来的一尊坐佛，71 米高。","what_en":"A 71-metre seated Buddha carved out of a red sandstone cliff where three rivers meet in Leshan, Sichuan.","fame":"世界上最大的石刻坐佛，人站在它脚边还没有脚趾高；1996 年跟峨眉山一起进了世界遗产。可以坐船从江上看全身，也可以沿着九曲栈道从头走到脚。","fame_en":"The world's largest stone-carved seated Buddha — standing by its feet, you're shorter than its toes. A World Heritage Site with Mount Emei since 1996. See it whole from a boat, or walk the zigzag cliff stairs from head to toe.","fact":"唐朝和尚海通 713 年开始凿，想让佛像镇住常常翻船的急流；他去世时只凿了一半，前后花了 90 年，803 年才完工。佛像头发、衣领、耳朵后面藏着排水沟，帮它挡了一千多年的雨水。","fact_en":"The monk Haitong began carving in 713, hoping it would calm the deadly currents; he died with it half done, and it took 90 years in all, finished in 803. Drainage channels hidden in the hair, collar and behind the ears have kept rain off it for over a thousand years.","src":"Wikipedia：Leshan Giant Buddha","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leshan_Giant_Buddha","say":{"en":"How long is the queue for the cliff stairs?","zh":"九曲栈道要排多久？"}},"都江堰":{"what":"四川都江堰市岷江上两千多年前修的水利工程，到现在还在用。","what_en":"An irrigation system on the Min River in Dujiangyan, Sichuan, built over 2,000 years ago and still working today.","fame":"秦国李冰父子修的：鱼嘴把江水一分为二，飞沙堰排沙，宝瓶口把水送进成都平原。成都能成为「天府之国」，靠的就是它。2000 年进了世界遗产。","fame_en":"Built by Li Bing and his son for the state of Qin: the Fish Mouth splits the river in two, the Flying Sand Weir flushes out silt, and the Bottle-Neck sends water onto the Chengdu Plain — the reason Chengdu became the 'Land of Abundance'. World Heritage since 2000.","fact":"那时候没有炸药，宝瓶口是用「火烧水浇」凿开的：先用火把岩石烧烫，再泼冷水让它裂开，一点点挖。2008 年汶川大地震，鱼嘴只裂了缝，整个系统照样在送水。","fact_en":"With no explosives, the Bottle-Neck was cut through the mountain with fire and water — heating the rock, then dousing it with cold water so it cracked. In the 2008 Wenchuan earthquake the Fish Mouth levee only cracked, and the system kept delivering water.","src":"Wikipedia：Dujiangyan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dujiangyan","say":{"en":"Which way to the Fish Mouth levee?","zh":"鱼嘴往哪边走？"}},"西夏王陵":{"what":"宁夏银川贺兰山脚下西夏王朝的皇家陵墓群，一座座土黄色的大土堆。","what_en":"The royal tombs of the Western Xia dynasty at the foot of the Helan Mountains near Yinchuan, Ningxia — great mounds of yellow earth.","fame":"西夏（1038–1227）是党项人建的国家，有自己的文字，后来被蒙古灭了，史书没留下多少。九座帝陵立在戈壁上，被叫作「东方金字塔」。","fame_en":"Western Xia (1038–1227) was a state of the Tangut people with its own script, wiped out by the Mongols and barely recorded in the histories. Its nine imperial tombs rising from the gravel desert are called the 'Pyramids of the East'.","fact":"2025 年 7 月 11 日，西夏陵在巴黎的世界遗产大会上被列为世界遗产，是中国第 60 项世界遗产。申遗成功后，来看的人一下子多了很多。","fact_en":"On 11 July 2025 the Xixia Imperial Tombs were inscribed on the World Heritage List at the committee meeting in Paris — China's 60th World Heritage Site. Visitor numbers jumped right after.","src":"中国政府网（英文），2025 年 7 月","url":"https://english.www.gov.cn/news/202507/12/content_WS6871aca5c6d0868f4e8f41d3.html","say":{"en":"Is there a guided tour in English?","zh":"有英文讲解吗？"}},"大三巴牌坊":{"what":"澳门老城里一座天主教堂烧剩下的石头正面，前面一长串台阶。","what_en":"The stone front of a Catholic church in old Macau — all that's left after a fire — at the top of a long flight of steps.","fame":"澳门的标志，四百年前远东最大的天主教堂圣保禄教堂的前壁；牌坊上刻着圣母、船、龙、中文字，中西合在一起。2005 年作为澳门历史城区的一部分进了世界遗产。","fame_en":"Macau's symbol: the façade of St Paul's, once the largest Catholic church in the Far East. Its carvings mix the Virgin Mary, ships, a dragon and Chinese characters. Part of the Historic Centre of Macao, a World Heritage Site since 2005.","fact":"1835 年 1 月 26 日一场台风天里的大火把教堂烧了，只剩下这面墙和台阶。为了不倒，后面用钢架撑着——走到牌坊背面就能看见。","fact_en":"On 26 January 1835 a fire during a typhoon destroyed the church, leaving only this wall and the steps. A steel frame behind it keeps it standing — walk round the back and you'll see it.","src":"Wikipedia：Ruins of Saint Paul's","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ruins_of_Saint_Paul%27s","say":{"en":"Where can I buy almond cookies near here?","zh":"附近哪儿能买杏仁饼？"}},"澳门大三巴":{"what":"澳门人说的「大三巴」，就是圣保禄教堂烧剩的那面石头前壁，「三巴」是葡萄牙语 São Paulo 的粤语音。","what_en":"What Macau people call 'Dai Sam Ba' — the stone façade of the burnt St Paul's Church; 'Sam Ba' is the Cantonese sound of the Portuguese 'São Paulo'.","fame":"游客到澳门几乎都会来这儿拍一张：前面 68 级台阶，旁边是大炮台，台阶下面一路是手信店、猪扒包和葡式蛋挞。","fame_en":"Almost every visitor to Macau takes a photo here: 68 steps up to the façade, the old fortress next door, and below a street of souvenir-snack shops, pork chop buns and Portuguese egg tarts.","fact":"牌坊是 17 世纪初在意大利耶稣会士斯皮诺拉的设计下造的，动手雕石头的，有本地中国石匠，也有为了躲避迫害从日本逃过来的日本天主教徒。","fact_en":"The façade was built in the early 1600s to a design attributed to the Italian Jesuit Carlo Spinola; the stone was carved by local Chinese masons and by Japanese Christians who had fled persecution in Japan.","src":"Wikipedia：Ruins of Saint Paul's","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ruins_of_Saint_Paul%27s","say":{"en":"Could you take a photo of us with the steps in it?","zh":"能帮我们拍张照，把台阶也拍进去吗？"}},"壶口瀑布":{"what":"黄河在山西吉县和陕西宜川之间突然收窄、跌下去形成的大瀑布。","what_en":"A huge waterfall where the Yellow River suddenly narrows and plunges, between Ji County in Shanxi and Yichuan in Shaanxi.","fame":"黄河上最大的瀑布，几百米宽的河面一下子挤进几十米宽的石槽，像倒进一把壶里，所以叫「壶口」。水是黄的，声音几里外都听得见。","fame_en":"The largest waterfall on the Yellow River: a channel hundreds of metres wide squeezes suddenly into a rock trough a few dozen metres across — like pouring into the spout of a pot, hence 'Hukou', pot's mouth. The water is yellow-brown and you hear it from far away.","fact":"第四套人民币的 50 元纸币背面印的就是壶口瀑布。这套钱 2018 年 5 月 1 日起停止流通，现在成了收藏品。","fact_en":"The back of the fourth-series 50-yuan banknote shows Hukou Falls. That series stopped circulating on 1 May 2018, so the notes are now collectors' items.","src":"Wikipedia：Hukou Waterfalls","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hukou_Waterfalls","say":{"en":"Which side is better, Shanxi or Shaanxi?","zh":"山西那边好还是陕西这边好？"}},"长白山天池":{"what":"吉林长白山顶上一个火山口湖，一半在中国，一半在朝鲜。","what_en":"A crater lake on top of Changbai Mountain in Jilin — half in China, half in North Korea.","fame":"中国最深的湖；一年里大半时间结冰、被云雾遮住，爬上去能不能看清天池全靠运气。","fame_en":"China's deepest lake; it's frozen or wrapped in cloud much of the year, so whether you see it clearly from the top is down to luck.","fact":"天池是公元 946 年前后一次超级火山喷发留下的「千年大喷发」火山口，喷出的火山灰远远落到了日本北海道，连格陵兰的冰层里都找得到。","fact_en":"The lake fills the caldera of the 'Millennium Eruption' around 946 AD, one of history's biggest; its ash fell as far as Hokkaido in Japan and has even been found in Greenland's ice.","src":"Wikipedia：Paektu Mountain","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paektu_Mountain","say":{"en":"Is the north slope or west slope better today?","zh":"今天北坡好还是西坡好？"}},"吉林雾凇":{"what":"冬天吉林市松花江两岸的树挂满白色冰花，叫雾凇，也叫「树挂」。","what_en":"In winter the trees along the Songhua River in Jilin City are coated in white frost crystals — called rime, or 'tree hangings'.","fame":"跟桂林山水、云南石林、长江三峡并称「中国四大自然奇观」；零下二三十度的早上，江面冒白气，一夜之间整条江边的柳树变成白的。","fame_en":"Ranked with Guilin's hills, Yunnan's Stone Forest and the Three Gorges as one of China's 'four natural wonders'. On mornings of minus 20 to 30, steam rises off the river and the willows along it turn white overnight.","fact":"零下二三十度松花江却不结冰，是因为上游的丰满水电站发电放出来的水大约有 4 度；江面冒出的水汽一碰上冷空气，就冻在两岸的树枝上。一般从 11 月一直能看到第二年 3 月。","fact_en":"The Songhua doesn't freeze even at minus 20 or 30 because the Fengman hydropower station upstream releases water at about 4°C; the vapour rising off it freezes onto the riverside branches. The season usually runs from November to March.","src":"Eye Shenzhen，2024 年 3 月","url":"https://www.eyeshenzhen.com/content/2024-03/01/content_30774962.htm","say":{"en":"What time is best to see the rime tomorrow?","zh":"明天几点看雾凇最好？"}},"漠河北极村":{"what":"黑龙江漠河中国最北边的一个村子，对面就是俄罗斯。","what_en":"China's northernmost village, in Mohe, Heilongjiang, right across the river from Russia.","fame":"被叫作「中国北极」：夏至前后晚上十一点天还亮着，运气好能看到北极光；冬天来的人在雪地里泼热水，看它变成一片冰雾。","fame_en":"Called 'China's North Pole': around the summer solstice it's still light at 11 p.m., and with luck you'll see the northern lights. In winter visitors throw hot water into the air to watch it turn to ice mist.","fact":"2023 年 1 月 22 日大年初一早上，漠河测到零下 53 度，打破了自己 1969 年零下 52.3 度的老纪录。","fact_en":"On the morning of 22 January 2023 — Chinese New Year's Day — Mohe recorded minus 53°C, breaking its own 1969 record of minus 52.3°C.","src":"Gulf News，2023 年 1 月","url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/asia/-53c-in-mohe-chinese-city-experiences-coldest-temperature-in-nations-records-1.1674547769517","say":{"en":"Where can I buy thicker gloves?","zh":"哪儿能买到更厚的手套？"}},"庐山":{"what":"江西九江长江边、鄱阳湖旁的一座山，山上常年云雾。","what_en":"A mountain by the Yangtze and Poyang Lake near Jiujiang, Jiangxi, almost always wrapped in mist.","fame":"「不识庐山真面目，只缘身在此山中」说的就是它；山上有一百多年前外国传教士盖的别墅，夏天凉快，是有名的避暑地。1996 年作为文化景观进了世界遗产。","fame_en":"Su Shi's line about not seeing the mountain's true face because you're standing on it is about Lushan. The summit has villas built by foreign missionaries over a century ago and is a famous summer retreat. A World Heritage cultural landscape since 1996.","fact":"1980 年的电影《庐山恋》从 1980 年 7 月 12 日起就在山上一家小电影院天天放，几十年没停过，吉尼斯认定它是「在同一家影院首映连续放映时间最长的电影」。","fact_en":"The 1980 film Romance on Lushan Mountain has been shown every day at a small cinema on the mountain since 12 July 1980 — Guinness lists it as the longest first run of a film in one cinema.","src":"Guinness World Records","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/69759-longest-first-run-of-a-film-in-one-cinema","say":{"en":"What time is today's screening of the film?","zh":"今天电影几点放？"}},"趵突泉":{"what":"山东济南市中心一口一直往上冒水的泉，三股水翻腾着涌出来。","what_en":"A spring in the middle of Jinan, Shandong, where three jets of water bubble up out of a pool.","fame":"号称「天下第一泉」，济南因此叫「泉城」，城里有几百处泉；老济南人拿着桶来打泉水回家泡茶。","fame_en":"Called the 'Number One Spring Under Heaven' — Jinan is known as the 'City of Springs' and has hundreds of them. Old Jinan families still come with buckets to take spring water home for tea.","fact":"地下水抽得太多，它曾经停喷过：1999 年到 2001 年停了 900 多天。济南关了很多井、保护地下水，2003 年 9 月重新喷起来，到 2023 年已经连续喷了 20 年，创了纪录。","fact_en":"Over-pumping of groundwater once stopped it: from 1999 to 2001 it was dry for over 900 days. After Jinan closed wells and protected the aquifer it gushed again in September 2003, and by 2023 had flowed for a record 20 years straight.","src":"China Daily，2023 年 9 月","url":"https://govt.chinadaily.com.cn/s/202309/07/WS64f923c2498ed2d7b7e9a574/chinas-baotu-spring-flows-for-record-20-years.html","say":{"en":"Is the spring water here safe to drink?","zh":"这儿的泉水能直接喝吗？"}},"洛阳牡丹":{"what":"河南洛阳每年四月满城开的牡丹花。","what_en":"The peonies that fill the whole city of Luoyang, Henan, every April.","fame":"牡丹被叫作「花中之王」，「洛阳牡丹甲天下」从唐宋一直说到现在；四月城里公园、街边全是牡丹，很多人穿汉服来拍照。","fame_en":"The peony is the 'king of flowers', and 'Luoyang's peonies are the best under heaven' has been said since the Tang and Song. In April parks and roadsides burst with them, and many visitors come in Hanfu to take photos.","fact":"洛阳牡丹花会从 1983 年开始每年办一次，2010 年升格成国家级的「中国洛阳牡丹文化节」，2023 年已经是第 40 届。","fact_en":"The Luoyang peony fair has been held every year since 1983; in 2010 it became the national-level China Luoyang Peony Culture Festival, and 2023 was its 40th edition.","src":"河南省政府网（英文），2025 年 4 月","url":"https://english.henan.gov.cn/2025/04-28/3153157.html","say":{"en":"Which garden has the most peonies in bloom right now?","zh":"现在哪个园子牡丹开得最多？"}},"龙脊梯田":{"what":"广西桂林龙胜山里，从山脚一层层开到山顶的稻田。","what_en":"Rice terraces climbing from valley floor to summit in the mountains of Longsheng, near Guilin, Guangxi.","fame":"壮族、瑶族几百年一层层修出来的，春天灌水像镜子，秋天稻子黄了像金子；住在山上的吊脚楼里，早上看云从梯田里升起来。","fame_en":"Carved terrace by terrace over centuries by Zhuang and Yao villagers: mirrors of water in spring, gold with rice in autumn. Stay in a wooden house on the slope and watch the morning cloud rise out of the fields.","fact":"2018 年联合国粮农组织（FAO）把「中国南方稻作梯田」列为全球重要农业文化遗产，龙脊梯田是里面四处之一——是因为人还在这儿种稻子，不只是因为好看。","fact_en":"In 2018 the UN's Food and Agriculture Organization named the 'Rice Terraces in Southern Mountainous and Hilly Areas' of China a Globally Important Agricultural Heritage System; Longji is one of its four sites — recognised because people still farm here, not just because it's beautiful.","src":"FAO：GIAHS","url":"https://sfcs.fao.org/giahs/giahs-around-the-world/china-rice-terraces-mountainous/en","say":{"en":"Can someone carry our bags up to the guesthouse?","zh":"有人能帮我们把行李背上民宿吗？"}},"峨眉山":{"what":"四川峨眉山市的一座佛教名山，最高的金顶 3000 多米。","what_en":"A sacred Buddhist mountain in Emeishan City, Sichuan, its Golden Summit over 3,000 metres high.","fame":"四大佛教名山之一，普贤菩萨的道场；山路上的猴子会抢游客的吃的，金顶上看日出、云海，运气好有「佛光」——自己的影子被一圈彩虹围着。","fame_en":"One of China's four sacred Buddhist mountains, home of Samantabhadra. Monkeys on the trails snatch snacks; at the Golden Summit people watch sunrise over a sea of cloud and, with luck, the 'Buddha's halo' — your own shadow ringed by a rainbow.","fact":"金顶上那尊 48 米高的十方普贤金像是 2006 年 6 月才落成的：铜铸、外面贴金，有十个头分三层，代表普贤菩萨看着四面八方。","fact_en":"The 48-metre gilded 'Ten-Direction Samantabhadra' on the Golden Summit was only unveiled in June 2006 — cast in bronze and covered in gold, with ten heads in three tiers looking out in every direction.","src":"Lonely Planet：Jinding Temple","url":"https://www.lonelyplanet.com/china/sichuan/emei-shan/attractions/jinding-temple/a/poi-sig/1240955/356092","say":{"en":"Does the cable car to the Golden Summit run in the snow?","zh":"下雪天去金顶的索道开吗？"}},"黄果树瀑布":{"what":"贵州安顺白水河上的一道大瀑布，宽 100 多米。","what_en":"A big waterfall on the Baishui River near Anshun, Guizhou, more than 100 metres wide.","fame":"中国最有名的瀑布之一，夏天水最大，几百米外就能被水雾打湿；瀑布后面藏着一条水帘洞，可以从水后面走过去，伸手就能摸到瀑布。","fame_en":"One of China's best-known waterfalls; in summer the spray soaks you from hundreds of metres away. A Water Curtain Cave runs behind the falls — you walk behind the water and can reach out and touch it.","fact":"1638 年徐霞客来过这儿，在游记里写自己还没看见瀑布，就先听到了轰隆声。1986 年版电视剧《西游记》里孙悟空的「水帘洞」，就是在这条洞里拍的。","fact_en":"The travel writer Xu Xiake came in 1638 and wrote that he heard the falls before he saw them. The 1986 TV series Journey to the West filmed the Monkey King's Water Curtain Cave right here.","src":"Wikipedia：Huangguoshu Waterfall","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Huangguoshu_Waterfall","say":{"en":"Do I need a raincoat for the Water Curtain Cave?","zh":"进水帘洞要穿雨衣吗？"}},"洱海":{"what":"云南大理苍山脚下一个长长的高原湖，像一只耳朵。","what_en":"A long highland lake under the Cang Mountains in Dali, Yunnan, shaped like an ear.","fame":"白族人住在湖边，大理古城、双廊、喜洲都在这儿；骑电动车环湖、坐在湖边发呆，是很多年轻人「逃离城市」的梦想。","fame_en":"The Bai people live around it, and Dali old town, Shuanglang and Xizhou all sit on its shores. Riding an e-bike round the lake, or just sitting by the water, is many young city people's dream escape.","fact":"湖水一度被污染得很厉害。2017 年 4 月，大理让洱海核心保护区里约 2400 家餐馆和客栈全部停业整顿；到 2019 年 9 月，有 1791 家通过检查重新开门。","fact_en":"Pollution got so bad that in April 2017 Dali ordered about 2,400 restaurants and guesthouses in the lake's core protection zone to close for inspection; by September 2019, 1,791 had passed and reopened.","src":"China Daily，2019 年 9 月","url":"https://govt.chinadaily.com.cn/s/201909/05/WS5d707868498ebcb190579220/guesthouses-around-erhai-lake-reopen.html","say":{"en":"Can I rent an e-bike to ride around the lake?","zh":"能租电动车环湖吗？"}},"香格里拉":{"what":"云南迪庆藏族自治州的一座高原小城，海拔三千多米。","what_en":"A highland town in the Diqing Tibetan Prefecture of Yunnan, over 3,000 metres up.","fame":"有松赞林寺（被叫作「小布达拉宫」）、独克宗古城、草甸和雪山；是从云南进藏的必经之地，很多人第一次在这儿感到高原反应。","fame_en":"Home to Songzanlin Monastery (the 'Little Potala'), the old town of Dukezong, meadows and snow peaks — the gateway from Yunnan to Tibet, and where many people first feel the altitude.","fact":"它原来叫「中甸」。2001 年 12 月国务院批准改名「香格里拉」——这个名字来自英国作家希尔顿 1933 年的小说《消失的地平线》里一个虚构的世外桃源。","fact_en":"It used to be called Zhongdian. In December 2001 the State Council approved renaming it 'Shangri-La' — after the imaginary paradise in James Hilton's 1933 novel Lost Horizon.","src":"Wikipedia：Shangri-La City","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shangri-La_City","say":{"en":"Is there oxygen for sale nearby?","zh":"附近有卖氧气瓶的吗？"}},"石林":{"what":"云南昆明石林县一大片从地里长出来的灰色石柱，像一片石头森林。","what_en":"A vast field of grey limestone pillars rising out of the ground in Shilin County near Kunming, Yunnan — a forest made of stone.","fame":"两亿多年前这里是海底，石灰岩被雨水慢慢溶成一根根石柱，有的二三十米高；这是彝族撒尼人的家乡，景区里讲解员穿着撒尼衣服带路。","fame_en":"Over 200 million years ago this was seabed; rain slowly dissolved the limestone into pillars, some 20–30 metres tall. It's the homeland of the Sani branch of the Yi people, and guides in Sani dress lead you through.","fact":"2007 年石林作为「中国南方喀斯特」的一部分进了世界遗产。小石林里有块石头叫「阿诗玛」——撒尼人传说里那个不肯嫁给财主、最后变成石头的姑娘。","fact_en":"In 2007 the Stone Forest became a World Heritage Site as part of the South China Karst. In the Lesser Stone Forest one rock is called 'Ashima' — the Sani girl of legend who refused to marry a rich landlord and was turned to stone.","src":"Wikipedia：Stone Forest","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stone_Forest","say":{"en":"Which way to the Ashima rock?","zh":"阿诗玛石往哪边走？"}},"纳木错":{"what":"西藏当雄海拔 4718 米的一个大咸水湖，藏语意思是「天湖」。","what_en":"A great salt lake 4,718 metres up in Damxung, Tibet; its Tibetan name means 'Heavenly Lake'.","fame":"西藏最大的湖、藏传佛教和苯教的圣湖，转湖的人一走好几天；湖水蓝得发亮，对面是念青唐古拉雪山。","fame_en":"Tibet's largest lake and sacred to both Tibetan Buddhists and Bon followers; pilgrims take days to walk around it. The water is a glowing blue with the Nyenchen Tanglha snow peaks behind.","fact":"常有人说它是「世界上最高的咸水湖」，其实不对：喜马拉雅山和安第斯山里有不少更小的湖在海拔 5500 米以上。它真正的纪录是：西藏自治区最大的湖。","fact_en":"It's often called 'the world's highest salt lake', but that isn't right — plenty of smaller lakes in the Himalayas and Andes sit above 5,500 metres. Its real record: the largest lake in the Tibet Autonomous Region.","src":"Wikipedia：Namtso","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Namtso","say":{"en":"I feel dizzy — is there a clinic near the lake?","zh":"我有点头晕，湖边有诊所吗？"}},"华山":{"what":"陕西华阴的一座花岗岩大山，五座山峰几乎都是直上直下的悬崖。","what_en":"A granite mountain in Huayin, Shaanxi, whose five peaks are almost sheer cliffs.","fame":"「五岳」里的西岳，号称「奇险天下第一山」；很多人半夜开始爬，凌晨到东峰看日出。金庸小说里的「华山论剑」也让它在武侠迷心里特别有名。","fame_en":"The Western Peak of China's Five Great Mountains, billed as the most perilous of all. Many people climb through the night to catch sunrise from the East Peak, and martial-arts fans know it from Jin Yong's novels.","fact":"南峰上的「长空栈道」只有大约 30 厘米宽，是钉在垂直石壁上的几块木板，一般认为是 13 世纪元朝的道士修的。因为太窄两个人错不开，只能一直往前走，现在要系安全绳。","fact_en":"The 'Plank Walk in the Sky' on the South Peak is roughly 30 cm wide — a few boards pinned to a vertical cliff, thought to have been built by Taoist monks in the 13th century. It's too narrow for two people to pass, so you keep going one way, clipped into a safety harness.","src":"Wikipedia：Chang Kong Cliff Road","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chang_Kong_Cliff_Road","say":{"en":"Where do I rent a safety harness for the plank walk?","zh":"长空栈道的安全带在哪儿租？"}},"鸣沙山月牙泉":{"what":"甘肃敦煌城南，大沙山围着的一弯月牙形的小泉湖。","what_en":"A small crescent-shaped spring lake surrounded by tall sand dunes just south of Dunhuang, Gansu.","fame":"沙漠里两千年没被沙埋掉的泉水；风吹过沙山会发出嗡嗡的声音，所以叫「鸣沙山」。游客骑骆驼上沙山看日落，再滑沙下来。","fame_en":"A spring that the desert hasn't buried in two thousand years; wind over the dunes makes a humming sound, hence 'Singing Sand Mountain'. Visitors ride camels up for sunset and sand-sled back down.","fact":"它差点干掉：1960 年测的时候最深 7.5 米，后来敦煌抽地下水越来越多，到 1990 年代初平均只剩 1 米左右。之后政府往附近补水、限制抽水，湖才慢慢回来了。","fact_en":"It nearly dried up: in 1960 it was 7.5 metres at its deepest, but as Dunhuang pumped more groundwater, by the early 1990s the average depth was about a metre. Since then water has been fed back in nearby and pumping limited, and the lake has slowly recovered.","src":"Wikipedia：Crescent Lake (Dunhuang)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crescent_Lake_(Dunhuang)","say":{"en":"How much is a camel ride to the top of the dune?","zh":"骑骆驼上沙山多少钱？"}},"七彩丹霞":{"what":"甘肃张掖一片红、黄、橙、绿一条条叠起来的彩色山丘。","what_en":"Hills in Zhangye, Gansu, striped in red, yellow, orange and green like layers of a cake.","fame":"几千万年里一层层不同颜色的砂岩被挤得弯起来，再被风雨削开，像打翻了调色盘；日落前颜色最浓，景区里有好几个观景台。","fame_en":"Layers of different-coloured sandstone laid down over millions of years were folded, then carved open by wind and rain — like a spilled paint palette. The colours are richest just before sunset, seen from several viewing platforms.","fact":"2010 年它作为「中国丹霞」的一部分进了世界遗产；2020 年 7 月，联合国教科文组织又批准张掖地质公园成为世界地质公园。","fact_en":"In 2010 it joined the World Heritage List as part of 'China Danxia', and in July 2020 UNESCO also approved Zhangye as a UNESCO Global Geopark.","src":"中国政府网（英文），2020 年 7 月","url":"https://english.www.gov.cn/news/videos/202007/09/content_WS5f06b828c6d05a0f897070c9.html","say":{"en":"Which viewing platform is best for sunset?","zh":"哪个观景台看日落最好？"}},"青海湖":{"what":"青海省东北部中国最大的湖，咸水湖，海拔三千多米。","what_en":"China's largest lake, a saltwater lake over 3,000 metres up in northeastern Qinghai.","fame":"夏天湖边油菜花一片金黄，骑自行车环湖一圈三百多公里是很多年轻人的梦想；湖中鸟岛上每年来很多候鸟。","fame_en":"In summer the shore turns gold with rapeseed flowers, and cycling the 300-plus-kilometre loop round the lake is a bucket-list trip for young Chinese. Migratory birds flock to the islands every year.","fact":"湖里有一种几乎没有鳞的「湟鱼」（裸鲤），以前被捕得快没了：2002 年只剩约 2600 吨。禁捕加人工放鱼苗以后，2023 年恢复到约 12 万吨，涨了 40 多倍。现在的禁捕期到 2030 年底。","fact_en":"The lake's almost scaleless naked carp was nearly fished out — only about 2,600 tonnes were left in 2002. With fishing bans and hatchery-raised fry, the stock reached about 120,000 tonnes by 2023, over 40 times more. The current ban runs to the end of 2030.","src":"China Daily，2024 年 7 月","url":"https://www.chinaservicesinfo.com/s/202407/03/WS668519e4498ed2d7b7eb1e89/rare-fish-flourish-in-countrys-largest-lake.html","say":{"en":"Where can I rent a bike to ride around the lake?","zh":"在哪儿能租车环湖？"}},"茶卡盐湖":{"what":"青海乌兰县的一个盐湖，湖面一层薄薄的卤水，把天空照得像镜子。","what_en":"A salt lake in Ulan County, Qinghai, where a thin film of brine on the salt crust reflects the sky like a mirror.","fame":"被叫作「天空之镜」：无风的晴天，人站在湖上像走在云里；湖里还有当年运盐的小火车，现在载游客往湖心开。","fame_en":"Nicknamed the 'Mirror of the Sky': on a still, clear day, people standing on the lake look like they're walking in the clouds. Little trains that once hauled salt now carry visitors out into the lake.","fact":"出名太快也有代价：2018 年来了 300 多万游客，旺季时清洁工一天能从湖里捡出 12 吨垃圾，很多是游客丢下的塑料。","fact_en":"Fame came at a price: more than 3 million people visited in 2018, and in peak season cleaners were collecting up to 12 tonnes of rubbish a day — much of it plastic left by tourists.","src":"South China Morning Post，2018 年 7 月","url":"https://www.scmp.com/news/china/society/article/2157615/hordes-tourists-damaging-chinese-salt-lakes-pristine-environment","say":{"en":"Do I need to buy shoe covers to walk on the lake?","zh":"上湖要买鞋套吗？"}},"天山天池":{"what":"新疆昌吉阜康，天山博格达峰脚下的一个高山湖。","what_en":"A mountain lake below Bogda Peak in the Tianshan range, at Fukang in Changji, Xinjiang.","fame":"离乌鲁木齐一两个小时车程，湖水是雪山融水，四周是云杉林，抬头就是五千多米的博格达雪峰；传说这里是西王母的「瑶池」。","fame_en":"An hour or two's drive from Ürümqi: snowmelt water ringed by spruce forest, with the 5,000-metre snowcap of Bogda overhead. Legend says it was the jade pool of the Queen Mother of the West.","fact":"2013 年「新疆天山」进了世界自然遗产，一共四片，博格达（天池就在这片）是其中之一，四片加起来大约 60 万公顷，差不多有整个上海那么大。","fact_en":"In 2013 'Xinjiang Tianshan' became a natural World Heritage Site made up of four areas, Bogda — where the lake is — among them; together they cover about 600,000 hectares, almost the size of all of Shanghai.","src":"Wikipedia：Heavenly Lake of Tian Shan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heavenly_Lake_of_Tian_Shan","say":{"en":"How long does the shuttle bus take to the lake?","zh":"坐区间车到湖边要多久？"}},"喀纳斯湖":{"what":"新疆阿勒泰最北边、靠近哈萨克斯坦和俄罗斯的一个深山湖。","what_en":"A deep mountain lake in the far north of Altay, Xinjiang, near the borders with Kazakhstan and Russia.","fame":"湖水会随季节从蓝变绿；秋天白桦、落叶松一片金黄，湖边禾木村、喀纳斯村住着图瓦人，木屋冒着炊烟，被叫作「神的后花园」。","fame_en":"The water shifts from blue to green with the seasons; in autumn the birch and larch turn gold, and Tuvan villagers live in log cabins at Hemu and Kanas — it's nicknamed 'God's back garden'.","fact":"这里也有「湖怪」：1985 年新疆大学的研究人员在湖里看到好几条巨大的红色大鱼，后来科学家认为是大型的哲罗鲑（一种冷水大鱼），可到底有没有十几米长，到现在还在争。","fact_en":"It has its own 'lake monster': in 1985 researchers from Xinjiang University reported several enormous red fish. Scientists later concluded they were giant taimen, a cold-water salmonid — though whether any are really over ten metres long is still argued about.","src":"Wikipedia：Kanas Lake","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanas_Lake","say":{"en":"Which viewpoint is best for the autumn colours?","zh":"看秋色哪个观景台最好？"}},"日月潭":{"what":"台湾南投山里最大的湖，北边像太阳，南边像月亮。","what_en":"Taiwan's largest lake, in the mountains of Nantou — the north part round like a sun, the south a crescent moon.","fame":"环湖骑自行车、坐船到对岸吃邵族人的山猪肉和阿萨姆红茶；湖中间的小岛叫拉鲁岛，是邵族的圣地。","fame_en":"People cycle round it, take a boat across, and eat Thao-style wild boar and local Assam black tea. Lalu Island in the middle is sacred to the Thao people.","fact":"现在的日月潭其实是 1934 年日据时期为了发电修坝蓄水「涨」出来的：水位升高后，拉鲁岛大部分沉到水下，原来住在湖边的邵族人也被迁走了。","fact_en":"Today's lake was largely made in 1934, when Japanese-era dams raised it for hydropower: most of Lalu Island went under, and the Thao villagers on the old shore were moved away.","src":"Wikipedia：Lalu Island","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lalu_Island","say":{"en":"Is there a boat pass for all three piers?","zh":"有能坐三个码头的船票吗？"}},"阿里山":{"what":"台湾嘉义的一片高山森林，有神木、云海和高山茶。","what_en":"A mountain forest area in Chiayi, Taiwan, known for ancient giant trees, seas of cloud and high-mountain tea.","fame":"坐森林小火车上山、凌晨去祝山看日出和云海是台湾人从小听到的行程；山上的高山茶和千年红桧「神木」都很有名。","fame_en":"Riding the little forest train up and getting up before dawn to watch sunrise over the clouds from Zhushan is a classic Taiwanese trip; the high-mountain tea and thousand-year-old red cypress 'sacred trees' are famous too.","fact":"阿里山森林铁路 2009 年被莫拉克台风冲坏了四百多处，停了整整 15 年；2024 年 7 月才全线重新通车，又能从嘉义一路坐到阿里山。","fact_en":"Typhoon Morakot damaged the Alishan Forest Railway in more than 400 places in 2009, and the full line stayed shut for 15 years — it finally reopened all the way from Chiayi to Alishan in July 2024.","src":"Formosa News，2024 年 7 月","url":"https://english.ftvnews.com.tw/news/2024719W07EA","say":{"en":"What time does the train to the sunrise viewpoint leave?","zh":"去看日出的小火车几点开？"}},"内蒙古草原":{"what":"中国北边内蒙古一望无际的大草原，牛羊、马和蒙古包。","what_en":"The endless grasslands of Inner Mongolia in northern China — cattle, sheep, horses and yurts.","fame":"蒙古族的家乡：夏天草最绿时有那达慕大会，摔跤、赛马、射箭；游客住蒙古包、喝奶茶、吃手把肉。","fame_en":"Homeland of the Mongols: when the grass is greenest in summer there's the Naadam festival — wrestling, horse racing, archery — and visitors stay in yurts, drink milk tea and eat hand-held boiled mutton.","fact":"中国人喝的牛奶很大一部分来自这片草原：伊利和蒙牛两家大乳企总部都在呼和浩特，2023 年两家排进世界乳企前十；当地官员说「中国人每喝六杯奶，就有一杯来自内蒙古」。","fact_en":"A big share of China's milk comes from these grasslands: both dairy giants, Yili and Mengniu, are headquartered in Hohhot and ranked among the world's top ten dairy firms in 2023. A local official put it this way: of every six cups of milk drunk in China, one comes from Inner Mongolia.","src":"China Daily，2023 年 11 月","url":"https://regional.chinadaily.com.cn/hohhot/2023-11/16/c_939586.htm","say":{"en":"Can we try riding a horse here?","zh":"这儿能骑马吗？"}},"冰糖葫芦":{"what":"一串山楂裹上一层亮晶晶的冰糖，咬下去先脆后酸。","what_en":"A skewer of hawthorn berries coated in glassy rock sugar — crunchy first, then sour.","fame":"北京冬天街头最常见的零食，胡同口、庙会、景区门口都有人举着一大把卖；现在也有草莓、葡萄、橘子的。","fame_en":"It's Beijing's classic winter street snack, sold by the armful at hutong corners, temple fairs and tourist gates — now with strawberries, grapes and tangerines too.","fact":"2023 年它在韩国突然爆红：韩国最大的糖葫芦连锁店从 2 月的 50 家左右，到 8 月开到了 300 多家。","fact_en":"In 2023 it suddenly went viral in South Korea: the country's biggest tanghulu chain grew from about 50 shops in February to over 300 by August.","src":"The Korea Times","url":"https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/lifestyle/travel-food/20230925/tanghulu-captures-hearts-of-korean-millennials-and-gen-z","say":{"en":"One hawthorn skewer, please. Is it very sour?","zh":"来一串山楂的。酸不酸？"}},"铜锅涮肉":{"what":"老北京的火锅：炭火铜锅、清水汤底，涮切得很薄的羊肉，蘸芝麻酱吃。","what_en":"Old-Beijing hot pot: a charcoal-heated copper pot of plain broth, paper-thin lamb, and a sesame-paste dip.","fame":"汤底几乎不放调料，全靠羊肉本身的鲜和那碗麻酱；北京人冬天一到就约着去「涮一顿」。","fame_en":"The broth is almost unseasoned — it's all about fresh lamb and the sesame sauce. When winter comes, Beijingers say 'let's go have a dip'.","fact":"最有名的东来顺 1903 年开张，前身是丁德山在东安市场摆的粥摊；1912 年一场大火把摊子烧了，重建后才起名「东来顺」。","fact_en":"The most famous name, Donglaishun, dates to 1903 — it began as Ding Deshan's porridge stall in Dong'an Market; after a fire destroyed it in 1912, the rebuilt shop got the name Donglaishun.","src":"Wikipedia：Donglaishun","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Donglaishun","say":{"en":"Two plates of hand-cut lamb and a sesame dip, please.","zh":"来两盘手切羊肉，再要一碗麻酱。"}},"老陈醋":{"what":"山西清徐一带用高粱慢慢酿、再晒上好几年的黑醋，又酸又带点甜香。","what_en":"A dark vinegar brewed from sorghum around Qingxu, Shanxi, and aged for years — sour with a mellow sweetness.","fame":"中国四大名醋之一。山西人吃面、吃饺子都离不开它，外地人开玩笑说山西人「爱吃醋」。","fame_en":"One of China's four great vinegars. Shanxi people put it on noodles and dumplings, and the rest of China jokes that they 'love eating vinegar'.","fact":"颜色深、味道醇的秘诀是「熏醅」：把发酵的醋醅用火熏，据记载是 1368 年清徐的「美和居」醋坊想出来的。","fact_en":"Its dark colour and mellow taste come from 'smoking the mash' over fire — a method credited to the Meiheju vinegar workshop in Qingxu in 1368.","src":"Wikipedia：Shanxi mature vinegar","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shanxi_mature_vinegar","say":{"en":"How many years has this vinegar been aged?","zh":"这瓶醋放了几年？"}},"汾酒":{"what":"山西杏花村出的清香型白酒，颜色透明，闻起来很干净。","what_en":"A light-aroma baijiu from Xinghuacun in Shanxi — crystal clear and clean-smelling.","fame":"中国最老的白酒名牌之一，杜牧那句「借问酒家何处有，牧童遥指杏花村」让杏花村家喻户晓；北方人请客、过年常拿它。","fame_en":"One of China's oldest baijiu names. Du Mu's poem about a shepherd boy pointing to 'Apricot Blossom Village' made Xinghuacun famous, and northern families still bring it out for guests and New Year.","fact":"1915 年它被送到美国旧金山的巴拿马太平洋万国博览会，拿了一枚金奖，从那以后成了在国外最有名的中国白酒之一。","fact_en":"In 1915 it was sent to the Panama-Pacific International Exposition in San Francisco and won a gold medal — since then it has been one of China's best-known liquors abroad.","src":"China Daily","url":"https://shanxi.chinadaily.com.cn/2022-06/17/c_771443.htm","say":{"en":"Just a small glass for me — is this one very strong?","zh":"我就来一小杯——这个度数高吗？"}},"马奶酒":{"what":"用新鲜马奶在皮囊里反复搅拌、发酵出来的饮料，微酸，只有一点点酒精。","what_en":"Fresh mare's milk churned and fermented in a hide bag — slightly sour, with only a little alcohol.","fame":"内蒙古和蒙古国牧民夏天的日常饮料，有客人来，主人先端上一碗；那达慕大会上也少不了。","fame_en":"It's the everyday summer drink of herders in Inner Mongolia and Mongolia — hosts offer guests a bowl first, and it's everywhere at Naadam festivals.","fact":"2019 年，蒙古国「在牛皮囊里做马奶酒」的手艺进了联合国教科文组织的非遗名录：要用木杵搅 500 多下。","fact_en":"In 2019, Mongolia's technique of making airag in a cowhide vessel was added to UNESCO's intangible heritage list — it's churned with a paddle more than 500 times.","src":"UNESCO","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/traditional-technique-of-making-airag-in-khokhuur-and-its-associated-customs-01172","say":{"en":"Just a little, please — I've never tried it before.","zh":"少来一点，我第一次喝。"}},"锅包肉":{"what":"哈尔滨的炸猪肉片：裹淀粉炸得金黄酥脆，再挂一层酸甜汁。","what_en":"Harbin's fried pork slices — battered, fried crisp and golden, then tossed in a sweet-and-sour glaze.","fame":"东北菜馆的头号招牌，几乎桌桌都点；去哈尔滨看冰雪大世界的游客，第一顿多半就是它。","fame_en":"It's the number-one dish in any northeastern restaurant, on almost every table — and usually the first meal for tourists in Harbin for the Ice Festival.","fact":"据说 20 世纪初，哈尔滨官府的厨师郑兴文娶了一位俄罗斯妻子，她吃不惯原来咸口的炸肉片，他就专门给她改成了酸甜口——后来中外客人都爱上了。","fact_en":"The story goes that in the early 1900s Zheng Xingwen, chef for Harbin's local government, married a Russian woman who didn't like the salty fried pork — so he made a sweet-and-sour version just for her, and soon every guest loved it.","src":"China Daily","url":"https://global.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202110/16/WS616a621da310cdd39bc6f56e.html","say":{"en":"One guobaorou, please. Is a small plate enough for two?","zh":"来一个锅包肉。两个人小份够吗？"}},"生煎包":{"what":"上海的煎包子：底部煎得焦脆，上面撒芝麻和葱花，里面一包热汤。","what_en":"Shanghai's pan-fried buns — crispy on the bottom, sesame and scallion on top, hot soup inside.","fame":"上海人的早饭，四个一两，配一碗咖喱牛肉汤；第一口要先咬个小洞吸汤，不然会烫嘴。","fame_en":"A Shanghai breakfast: four to an order, often with curry beef soup. Bite a small hole and sip the soup first, or you'll burn your mouth.","fact":"上海话里它叫「生煎馒头」：江南一直保留着古时候的叫法，凡是有馅的包子都叫馒头。","fact_en":"In Shanghainese it's 'shengjian mantou': the Jiangnan region kept the old usage in which any filled bun is called a mantou.","src":"Wikipedia：Shengjian mantou","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shengjian_mantou","say":{"en":"One order of shengjian and a bowl of curry beef soup, please.","zh":"一两生煎，再来一碗咖喱牛肉汤。"}},"本帮菜馆":{"what":"做上海本地菜的老饭馆：浓油赤酱，红烧、油爆、糟货都有。","what_en":"An old restaurant serving Shanghai's own cooking — rich, dark, sweet soy sauces, braises, quick-fried shrimp and wine-marinated dishes.","fame":"福州路上的老正兴是上海最老的本帮菜馆之一，油爆虾、虾子大乌参、草头圈子是上海人请客的老味道。","fame_en":"Lao Zheng Xing on Fuzhou Road is one of the oldest Shanghainese restaurants; its quick-fried river shrimp, braised sea cucumber and pork intestines with clover are the taste of a proper Shanghai banquet.","fact":"老正兴开于 1862 年，店名是两位老板祝正本、蔡仁兴各取一个字；后来到处有人冒充「正兴」，他们才在前面加了个「老」字。","fact_en":"Lao Zheng Xing opened in 1862, its name taking one character each from owners Zhu Zhengben and Cai Renxing — copycat 'Zheng Xing' shops forced them to add 'Lao' (old) in front.","src":"澎湃新闻","url":"https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_9618554","say":{"en":"What do Shanghainese usually order here?","zh":"上海人来这儿一般点什么？"}},"安福路brunch":{"what":"上海徐汇区安福路一带的早午餐店：梧桐树下坐在外面吃班尼迪克蛋、喝咖啡。","what_en":"The brunch cafés on Anfu Road in Shanghai's Xuhui district — eggs Benedict and coffee at outdoor tables under plane trees.","fame":"这条 800 多米的老马路是上海年轻人周末 citywalk 的起点，跟武康路连在一起，拍照、逛店、排队吃早午餐。","fame_en":"This 800-metre old street, joined to Wukang Road, is where young Shanghainese start their weekend citywalk — photos, shops and queueing for brunch.","fact":"满街咖啡店中间，安福路 288 号是上海话剧艺术中心：1995 年成立，每年在这里办国际小剧场戏剧节。","fact_en":"Among all the cafés, 288 Anfu Road is the Shanghai Dramatic Arts Centre — founded in 1995, it hosts an international theatre festival every year.","src":"Wikipedia：Shanghai Dramatic Arts Centre","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shanghai_Dramatic_Arts_Centre","say":{"en":"Is there a wait for a table? We're two people.","zh":"要排队吗？我们两个人。"}},"黄河路美食街":{"what":"上海人民广场旁边一条短短的老马路，两边都是饭店和小吃店。","what_en":"A short old street beside People's Square in Shanghai, lined with restaurants and snack shops.","fame":"九十年代它是上海最热闹的「吃饭一条街」，生意人在这儿谈生意请客；2023 年底王家卫的电视剧《繁花》又让它火了一次。","fame_en":"In the 1990s it was Shanghai's busiest dining street, where businessmen hosted deals; Wong Kar-wai's 2023 TV series Blossoms Shanghai made it famous all over again.","fact":"剧里「至真园」的原型是黄河路上的苔圣园；剧播出后，据店员说网上销量比一周前涨了 170%。","fact_en":"The real model for the show's Zhi Zhen Yuan restaurant is Tai Sheng Yuan on Huanghe Road — staff said online sales jumped 170 percent within a week of the series airing.","src":"上海市政府英文网","url":"https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-Latest-WhatsNew/20240110/1ba02195e1ef4de49fabee498555c64d.html","say":{"en":"Which dish is the one from the TV show?","zh":"电视剧里那道菜是哪个？"}},"淄博烧烤":{"what":"山东淄博的小串烧烤：自己在小炉子上烤，再用小饼卷上大葱一起吃。","what_en":"Zibo-style barbecue from Shandong: you grill small skewers on a little stove at your table, then roll them in a thin pancake with scallions.","fame":"「小饼 + 小炉 + 蘸料」是淄博三件套；2023 年春天它突然全国爆红，周末全国各地的大学生坐火车去吃。","fame_en":"Pancake, mini stove and dipping powder are Zibo's trio. In spring 2023 it went viral nationwide, and students from all over took trains there at weekends.","fact":"最早是一群在淄博参加招聘会的大学生拍视频带火的；后来铁路局专门开了济南到淄博的周末「烧烤专列」。","fact_en":"It started with university students in town for a job fair posting videos — the railway bureau then added weekend 'barbecue trains' between Jinan and Zibo.","src":"China Daily","url":"https://www.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202304/17/WS64472f21a310b6054facf9ab.html","say":{"en":"Twenty lamb skewers and some pancakes, please. Do we grill them ourselves?","zh":"来二十串羊肉，再要点小饼。是我们自己烤吗？"}},"盐水鸭":{"what":"南京的白切咸水鸭：鸭子用盐腌过再煮，皮白肉嫩，冷着切片吃。","what_en":"Nanjing's salted duck — cured in salt, gently poached, and served cold in slices with pale skin and tender meat.","fame":"南京人几乎天天吃鸭子，下班路过卤菜店带半只回家是日常；秋天桂花开时做的叫「桂花鸭」。","fame_en":"Nanjing people eat duck almost daily — picking up half a duck from the deli on the way home is normal. Made in osmanthus season, it's called 'osmanthus duck'.","fact":"南京鸭业 2016 年说，这座 800 多万人的城市一年要吃掉 1 亿多只鸭子，其中约 4000 万只做成盐水鸭。","fact_en":"Nanjing's duck industry said in 2016 that this city of over 8 million eats more than 100 million ducks a year — about 40 million become salted duck.","src":"上海市政府信息服务（Shanghai Daily）","url":"https://touch.shio.gov.cn/jsp/jrsh_detail_en.jsp?id=2838","say":{"en":"Half a salted duck, please — and could you chop it for me?","zh":"要半只盐水鸭，帮我斩一下。"}},"扬州炒饭":{"what":"加了鸡蛋、虾仁、火腿、青豆等配料的炒饭，粒粒分开、金黄发亮。","what_en":"Fried rice with egg, shrimp, ham, peas and more — every grain separate and glossy gold.","fame":"世界各地中餐馆菜单上最常见的一道，很多外国人吃到的第一道中国菜就是它；在扬州本地反而是一道普通的家常主食。","fame_en":"It's on Chinese menus all over the world and is often the first Chinese dish foreigners try — though in Yangzhou itself it's just ordinary home cooking.","fact":"2002 年扬州烹饪协会出过一份「正宗扬州炒饭」的标准做法，可据报道，城里真正照着做的饭馆并不多。","fact_en":"In 2002 the Yangzhou Cuisine Association issued an official rubric for 'authentic' Yangzhou fried rice — reportedly, few restaurants in the city actually follow it.","src":"VICE","url":"https://www.vice.com/en/article/the-highs-and-lows-of-chinas-fried-rice-capital/","say":{"en":"One Yangzhou fried rice, please — less oil if possible.","zh":"来一份扬州炒饭，少放点油。"}},"东坡肉":{"what":"杭州的红烧五花肉：切成方块，用黄酒和酱油小火焖到软糯，肥而不腻。","what_en":"Hangzhou's braised pork belly — cut into squares and slow-cooked in Shaoxing wine and soy until meltingly soft.","fame":"杭帮菜的代表，西湖边的老字号几乎都有；一人一小罐，筷子一夹就散。","fame_en":"It's the signature of Hangzhou cooking, served by nearly every old restaurant by West Lake — one little pot each, and it falls apart at a touch.","fact":"名字来自苏东坡：传说他 1089 年前后在杭州组织民工疏浚西湖，百姓送来猪肉，他让人烧好分给民工吃，大家就叫它东坡肉。","fact_en":"It's named after Su Dongpo: legend says when he led workers to dredge West Lake around 1089, locals gave him pork, he had it braised for the workers, and they named it after him.","src":"China Daily","url":"https://zhejiang.chinadaily.com.cn/2016-08/01/c_54476.htm","say":{"en":"One Dongpo pork, please. Is one piece per person?","zh":"来一份东坡肉。是一人一块吗？"}},"绍兴黄酒":{"what":"浙江绍兴用糯米和麦曲酿的黄酒，琥珀色，温热了喝。","what_en":"Amber rice wine brewed in Shaoxing, Zhejiang, from glutinous rice and wheat yeast — usually drunk warm.","fame":"鲁迅小说里孔乙己喝的就是它；江南人吃大闸蟹一定配一壶温黄酒，全国做菜也拿它当料酒。","fame_en":"It's what Kong Yiji drinks in Lu Xun's story. In Jiangnan, hairy crab always comes with a pot of warm yellow wine, and kitchens across China cook with it.","fact":"「女儿红」来自绍兴的老习俗：家里生了女儿就酿一坛埋起来，等她出嫁那天再挖出来请客。","fact_en":"'Nü'er Hong' (daughter's red) comes from an old Shaoxing custom: when a daughter is born, a jar is brewed and buried, then dug up for her wedding.","src":"SCMP","url":"https://scmp.com/lifestyle/arts-culture/article/3283784/why-chinese-bride-wine-wedding-staple-its-origins-and-why-its-buried-18-years","say":{"en":"Could you warm it up for me? Just a small jug.","zh":"帮我温一下，来一小壶。"}},"佛跳墙":{"what":"福州的一道大菜：鲍鱼、海参、花胶、蹄筋等十几种料放进坛子里，用绍兴酒慢慢煨。","what_en":"Fuzhou's grand banquet soup — abalone, sea cucumber, fish maw, tendon and more, slow-simmered in a jar with Shaoxing wine.","fame":"闽菜里最有名、最贵的一道，年夜饭和婚宴上的压轴菜；名字说的是香到连和尚都跳墙来吃。","fame_en":"The most famous — and most expensive — dish in Fujian cuisine, the finale of New Year and wedding banquets. The name says it smells so good even a monk would jump the wall.","fact":"据说它原名「福寿全」，跟福州话「佛跳墙」读音相近；福州聚春园的做法 2008 年进了国家级非遗名录。","fact_en":"It was reportedly first called 'Fu Shou Quan' (fortune and longevity), which sounds like 'Buddha jumps the wall' in Fuzhou dialect — Juchunyuan's recipe became national intangible heritage in 2008.","src":"Wikipedia：Buddha Jumps Over the Wall","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buddha_Jumps_Over_the_Wall","say":{"en":"Do you have a single-person portion of Buddha Jumps Over the Wall?","zh":"佛跳墙有一人份的吗？"}},"胡辣汤":{"what":"河南人早上喝的一碗浓汤：胡椒和辣椒很冲，里面有面筋、粉条、木耳。","what_en":"The thick breakfast soup of Henan — fiery with pepper and chilli, full of gluten, glass noodles and wood-ear mushrooms.","fame":"郑州人一天从一碗胡辣汤开始，配油条或水煎包；街边早餐摊一大早就排队。","fame_en":"In Zhengzhou the day starts with a bowl of hulatang, with fried dough sticks or pan-fried buns — the street stalls have queues at dawn.","fact":"河南有两大流派：周口西华县的逍遥镇和漯河的北舞渡；2021 年，逍遥胡辣汤的做法进了国家级非遗名录。","fact_en":"Henan has two main schools, Xiaoyao town in Xihua county and Beiwudu — in 2021 the Xiaoyao technique was added to China's national intangible heritage list.","src":"Wikipedia：Hulatang","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hulatang","say":{"en":"A bowl of hulatang and one youtiao, please. Can I have it less spicy?","zh":"一碗胡辣汤一根油条，能少辣点吗？"}},"热干面":{"what":"武汉的早饭：碱水面先煮过拌油晾干，吃前一烫，拌上芝麻酱、萝卜丁、葱花。","what_en":"Wuhan's breakfast noodles — alkaline noodles pre-boiled and oiled, then flash-heated and tossed with sesame paste, pickled radish and scallions.","fame":"武汉人「过早」的头号选择，边走边吃；跟北京炸酱面、山西刀削面等一起被叫作中国「五大名面」。","fame_en":"It's Wuhan's top choice for guozao (breakfast out), often eaten on the move — and counted among China's 'five great noodles'.","fact":"流传最广的说法：1930 年代汉口长堤街一个叫李包的小贩，怕剩面坏掉，就把面煮熟拌油晾着，第二天再烫一下卖，客人问叫什么，他说「热干面」。","fact_en":"The best-known story: in the 1930s a Hankou vendor named Li Bao, worried leftover noodles would spoil, boiled and oiled them, reheated them next day — and when asked the name, said 'hot dry noodles'.","src":"Wikipedia：Hot dry noodles","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hot_dry_noodles","say":{"en":"One hot dry noodles, extra sesame paste, no chilli.","zh":"一碗热干面，多放芝麻酱，不要辣。"}},"剁椒鱼头":{"what":"湖南菜：一个大鱼头铺满红红的剁辣椒，上锅蒸熟，最后浇热油。","what_en":"A Hunan dish: a big fish head buried under bright red chopped pickled chillies, steamed, then finished with sizzling oil.","fame":"湘菜馆的招牌，红辣椒一半、黄辣椒一半的叫「鸿运当头」；鱼吃完了，剩下的汤汁拌面是很多人最爱的一口。","fame_en":"A Hunan restaurant signature — half red, half yellow chilli is called 'good luck on top'. When the fish is gone, mixing noodles into the sauce is many people's favourite bite.","fact":"常见的说法是清代文人黄宗宪躲难时借住农家，主人家穷，只能用盐和剁辣椒蒸了一条鱼招待他，这道菜就这么传开了（这是传说，没有史料）。","fact_en":"A popular story says the Qing scholar Huang Zongxian, hiding in a poor farmhouse, was served fish steamed with salt and chopped chillies — that's how the dish spread (it's legend, not documented history).","src":"CGTN","url":"https://news.cgtn.com/news/3d3d414d3049444e34457a6333566d54/share_amp.html","say":{"en":"Can we add a portion of noodles for the sauce?","zh":"能加一份面吗？拌着汤汁吃。"}},"潮汕牛肉火锅":{"what":"广东潮汕的清汤牛肉火锅：鲜牛肉按部位现切，涮几秒就吃，蘸沙茶酱。","what_en":"Chaoshan beef hot pot from Guangdong: fresh beef cut by part at the counter, dipped for seconds in clear broth, eaten with shacha sauce.","fame":"吊龙、匙柄、五花趾、嫩肉……每个部位涮的秒数不一样；最后还要来几颗手打牛肉丸。","fame_en":"Diaolong, chibing, wuhuazhi, tender rump — each cut needs a different number of seconds. Finish with a few hand-pounded beef balls.","fact":"讲究的店坚持用当天宰的牛，据说从宰牛到送进店不超过 4 个小时，不用冻肉，因为冰晶会破坏肉的纤维。","fact_en":"Serious shops only use beef slaughtered that day — reportedly delivered within four hours — never frozen, because ice crystals break down the meat fibres.","src":"上海市政府信息服务（Shanghai Daily）","url":"https://touch.shio.gov.cn/jsp/jrsh_detail_en.jsp?id=1505","say":{"en":"How many seconds should I cook this cut?","zh":"这个部位涮几秒？"}},"文昌鸡":{"what":"海南文昌的白切鸡：整只鸡用清水浸熟，皮黄肉嫩，蘸姜蒜酸桔酱吃。","what_en":"Wenchang chicken from Hainan — a whole bird poached until just cooked, golden-skinned and tender, dipped in ginger, garlic and calamansi.","fame":"海南「四大名菜」之首，海南人过年过节、拜神请客都要摆一只；鸡油煮的饭也是一绝。","fame_en":"First of Hainan's 'four famous dishes' — no festival, offering or family feast goes without one, and rice cooked in its fat is a treat on its own.","fact":"新加坡的海南鸡饭就是它的后代：19 世纪末下南洋的海南厨师带去了「文昌鸡饭」，到了那边慢慢改成了今天的样子。","fact_en":"Singapore's Hainanese chicken rice descends from it: Hainanese cooks who emigrated in the late 19th century brought Wenchang chicken rice with them, and it slowly changed there.","src":"新加坡国家文物局 SG101","url":"https://www.sg101.gov.sg/resources/archives/heritage-hainanese-chicken-rice-in-singapore/","say":{"en":"Half a Wenchang chicken and two bowls of chicken rice, please.","zh":"要半只文昌鸡，两碗鸡油饭。"}},"过桥米线":{"what":"云南的米线吃法：一大碗滚烫的鸡汤端上来，再把生肉片、鹌鹑蛋、菜和米线自己放进去烫熟。","what_en":"Yunnan's DIY rice noodles: a huge bowl of scalding chicken broth arrives, and you slide in raw meat slices, quail egg, vegetables and noodles to cook them yourself.","fame":"昆明、蒙自满街都是，桌上一摆就是十几个小碟子；汤面上一层油保温，看着不冒热气，其实特别烫。","fame_en":"Kunming and Mengzi are full of it, with a dozen little dishes on the table. A layer of oil keeps the broth so hot it doesn't even steam — careful.","fact":"名字来自一个传说：蒙自南湖的岛上有个书生读书，妻子每天过桥给他送饭，发现汤上有层油就不会凉。2008 年它被列为昆明的非遗。","fact_en":"The name comes from a legend: a scholar studied on an island in Mengzi's South Lake, and his wife, crossing the bridge with his lunch daily, found a layer of oil kept the soup hot. Kunming listed it as intangible heritage in 2008.","src":"Wikipedia：Crossing-the-bridge noodles","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crossing-the-bridge_noodles","say":{"en":"In what order should I put things in?","zh":"这些东西先放哪个？"}},"鲜花饼":{"what":"云南的酥皮小饼，里面是用食用玫瑰花瓣加糖腌成的馅，一口下去满嘴花香。","what_en":"A flaky little Yunnan pastry filled with sugared edible rose petals — every bite tastes of flowers.","fame":"昆明、大理、丽江满街都有现烤的，游客回家几乎人手一盒当伴手礼；云南人自己早饭也会吃。","fame_en":"Fresh from the oven on every street in Kunming, Dali and Lijiang, it's the box almost every visitor takes home — and Yunnanese eat it for breakfast too.","fact":"据昆明市政府 2013 年的报告，那一年昆明平均每天卖出 20 万个鲜花饼，其中六成被带出了云南。","fact_en":"A 2013 Kunming government report said the city sold an average of 200,000 flower cakes a day that year — 60 percent of them leaving the province.","src":"The World of Chinese","url":"https://www.theworldofchinese.com/2022/03/seven-famous-yunnan-flower-dishes","say":{"en":"Are these fresh today? How long do they keep?","zh":"这是今天烤的吗？能放几天？"}},"酥油茶":{"what":"西藏的咸茶：浓茶加酥油和盐，在长木桶里反复打匀，喝起来像热乎乎的咸奶油汤。","what_en":"Tibetan butter tea — strong tea churned with yak butter and salt in a tall wooden tube, tasting like a hot, salty, creamy broth.","fame":"藏族人一天里要喝好多碗，配糌粑当早饭；高原又冷又干，它能暖身子、补热量。到藏族人家做客，主人会不停给你添。","fame_en":"Tibetans drink many bowls a day, often with tsampa for breakfast — on the cold, dry plateau it warms you and gives energy. As a guest, your bowl will keep getting topped up.","fact":"西藏本地不产茶：几百年来，四川雅安等地压成砖的茶，沿着茶马古道运上高原，换回马匹。","fact_en":"Tibet doesn't grow its own tea: for centuries, brick tea pressed around Ya'an in Sichuan travelled up the Tea Horse Road to the plateau, often traded for horses.","src":"Wikipedia：Compressed tea","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Compressed_tea","say":{"en":"Thank you — just half a cup more, please.","zh":"谢谢，再添半碗就好。"}},"肉夹馍":{"what":"西安的白吉馍从中间切开，塞满切碎的腊汁肉，汁水浸进饼里。","what_en":"Xi'an's flatbread split open and stuffed with chopped, slow-stewed pork, its juices soaking into the bread.","fame":"常被叫作「中国汉堡」，西安人早饭午饭都能来一个；回民街的店多用腊牛肉，叫「牛肉夹馍」。","fame_en":"Often called the 'Chinese hamburger' — Xi'an people eat it for breakfast or lunch. In the Muslim Quarter it's usually made with cured beef instead.","fact":"它的饼不是软面包而是烤出来的「白吉馍」，肉多是炖了很久的五花肉，所以很多人说叫「汉堡」其实不太对。","fact_en":"The bread isn't a soft bun but a griddle-baked baiji mo, and the filling is long-stewed pork belly — which is why many say 'hamburger' isn't really the right word.","src":"Goldthread","url":"https://www.goldthread2.com/food/roujiamo-chinese-snack-worlds-first-hamburger/article/3093480","say":{"en":"One roujiamo, half lean half fatty, please.","zh":"一个肉夹馍，肥瘦的。"}},"宁夏枸杞":{"what":"宁夏黄河边种的红色小果子，晒干后泡水、煲汤、煮粥都用。","what_en":"Small red berries grown along the Yellow River in Ningxia, dried and added to tea, soups and porridge.","fame":"保温杯里泡枸杞，成了中国中年人的标配，年轻人也常拿来自嘲；夏天到秋天是采摘季，宁夏田里的人一整天都在摘。","fame_en":"Goji in a thermos has become the classic sign of Chinese middle age — young people joke about it themselves. From summer to autumn, pickers in Ningxia's fields work all day.","fact":"中宁从明朝起就大规模种枸杞，被国务院命名为「中国枸杞之乡」；那里还用枸杞酿枸杞酒。","fact_en":"Zhongning has grown goji on a large scale since the Ming dynasty and was named 'the hometown of Chinese goji' by the State Council — it even brews goji wine.","src":"China Daily","url":"https://regional.chinadaily.com.cn/ningxia/2022-08/24/c_804984.htm","say":{"en":"Are these from Zhongning? How much per jin?","zh":"这是中宁的吗？多少钱一斤？"}},"哈密瓜":{"what":"新疆哈密一带的甜瓜，椭圆形，网纹皮，果肉橙红又脆又甜。","what_en":"A sweet melon from around Hami in Xinjiang — oval, net-skinned, with crisp, orange flesh.","fame":"新疆日照长、昼夜温差大，瓜特别甜；夏天全国水果摊上切成一牙一牙卖。","fame_en":"Xinjiang's long sunny days and cold nights make the melons very sweet — in summer, fruit stalls everywhere sell them by the slice.","fact":"清朝康熙皇帝在一封信里夸过哈密进贡的瓜干，说那是当地唯一真正好吃的特产；「哈密瓜」这个名字据说就是那时叫开的。","fact_en":"The Kangxi Emperor, in a letter, praised the dried melon sent as tribute from Hami as the one local product with a truly fine taste — the name 'Hami melon' is said to date from then.","src":"Wikipedia：Hami melon","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hami_melon","say":{"en":"Can you cut it in half for me? Is it sweet?","zh":"能帮我切一半吗？甜不甜？"}},"菠萝包":{"what":"香港的甜面包，表面一层酥皮烤裂成格子，看起来像菠萝——里面其实没有菠萝。","what_en":"Hong Kong's sweet bun with a crackly, checkered crust that looks like a pineapple — though there's no pineapple in it.","fame":"茶餐厅的下午茶标配，配一杯丝袜奶茶；中间夹一块冻黄油的叫「菠萝油」，是香港人的心头好。","fame_en":"A cha chaan teng afternoon-tea staple with silky milk tea; split with a cold slab of butter it becomes the beloved 'bo lo yau'.","fact":"2014 年，香港政府把「菠萝包制作技艺」列进了香港非物质文化遗产清单。","fact_en":"In 2014 the Hong Kong government added the craft of making pineapple buns to its intangible cultural heritage inventory.","src":"Wikipedia：Pineapple bun","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pineapple_bun","say":{"en":"One bo lo yau and a hot milk tea, please.","zh":"一个菠萝油，一杯热奶茶。"}},"士林夜市":{"what":"台北士林的大夜市，几百个摊位卖小吃、衣服和小玩意，晚上才热闹起来。","what_en":"Taipei's huge night market in Shilin — hundreds of stalls of snacks, clothes and trinkets that only come alive after dark.","fame":"常被认为是台湾最大、最有名的夜市：大鸡排、蚵仔煎、珍珠奶茶、地下美食街，游客几乎必来。","fame_en":"Often called Taiwan's largest and most famous night market — giant fried chicken, oyster omelette, bubble tea and the basement food court make it a must for visitors.","fact":"它从一个白天的市场慢慢长成夜市，1913 年正式有了夜市；原来的老市场 2002 年关闭，现在的地下美食区是 2011 年才搬进去的。","fact_en":"It grew out of a daytime market, formally becoming a night market in 1913; the original site closed in 2002, and today's basement food area only opened in 2011.","src":"Wikipedia：Shilin Night Market","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shilin_Night_Market","say":{"en":"One fried chicken cutlet, not too spicy, and no need to cut it.","zh":"一份鸡排，小辣，不用切。"}},"山西老陈醋":{"what":"山西清徐出的陈醋，越陈越香，是山西人家里饭桌上永远在的那一瓶。","what_en":"Aged vinegar from Qingxu, Shanxi — the longer it ages the better, and it's the bottle that never leaves a Shanxi family's table.","fame":"清徐被叫作「中国醋都」，满街醋坊；山西人吃刀削面、饺子、凉菜都要倒，还有人每天喝一小口。","fame_en":"Qingxu is called China's 'vinegar capital', lined with vinegar workshops. Shanxi people pour it on knife-cut noodles, dumplings and cold dishes — some even sip a little every day.","fact":"这几年醋厂也在玩新花样：山西做出了醋冰淇淋、醋饮料，还建了醋文化园让游客参观。","fact_en":"Recently the vinegar makers have got creative: Shanxi now makes vinegar ice cream and vinegar drinks, and has vinegar theme parks for visitors.","src":"China Daily","url":"https://subsites.chinadaily.com.cn/shanxi/2023-08/10/c_912872.htm","say":{"en":"Could I taste the five-year one before I buy?","zh":"能先尝尝那个五年的再买吗？"}},"蒙古包子":{"what":"蒙古国的羊肉包子（buuz）：面皮包着剁碎的羊肉和洋葱，顶上留个小口，上锅蒸。","what_en":"Mongolian buuz — dough wrapped around minced mutton and onion, with a little opening on top, then steamed.","fame":"乌兰巴托饭馆里最常见的一道，一盘几个配奶茶；过白月（蒙古新年）时家家都要做，招待来拜年的客人。","fame_en":"The most common dish in Ulaanbaatar's canteens, a plateful with milk tea. At Tsagaan Sar (Lunar New Year) every family makes them for visiting guests.","fact":"白月前好几周，一家人就围坐流水线包包子，一次包上千个，直接放到屋外零下的天里冻起来。","fact_en":"Weeks before Tsagaan Sar, families sit in assembly lines making a thousand or more buuz, then freeze them outdoors in the sub-zero air.","src":"World Vision","url":"https://worldvision.org/blog/recipe-buuz-traditional-mongolian-dumplings","say":{"en":"Five buuz and a milk tea, please.","zh":"五个包子，一杯奶茶。"}},"阿莫克鱼":{"what":"柬埔寨的椰奶蒸鱼咖喱：鱼块拌香料酱和椰浆，放进香蕉叶做的小碗里蒸到像布丁一样嫩。","what_en":"Cambodia's coconut fish curry — fish in spice paste and coconut cream, steamed in a banana-leaf cup until soft as a mousse.","fame":"常被叫作柬埔寨的「国菜」，金边、暹粒的餐馆都有；香料酱叫 kroeung，有香茅、南姜、黄姜。","fame_en":"Often called Cambodia's national dish, on menus across Phnom Penh and Siem Reap; its paste, kroeung, is lemongrass, galangal and turmeric.","fact":"据说它是吴哥王朝时期的宫廷菜，但也有人怀疑：泰国也有很像的蒸鱼「hor mok」，泰语意思是「包起来埋」。","fact_en":"It's said to be a royal dish of the Khmer Empire — though some doubt that, since Thailand has a very similar steamed 'hor mok', meaning 'bury-wrap'.","src":"Wikipedia：Fish amok","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fish_amok","say":{"en":"One fish amok with rice, please. Is it spicy?","zh":"一份阿莫克鱼配米饭，辣吗？"}},"老挝糯米饭":{"what":"老挝人的主食：蒸好的糯米装在竹编的小篮子里，用手捏成小团蘸着菜吃。","what_en":"Laos's staple: steamed sticky rice kept in a little woven bamboo basket, pinched into balls by hand to scoop up food.","fame":"老挝人每顿饭都离不开，竹篮放在桌子中间大家一起抓；在老挝吃饭，用手才是正常的。","fame_en":"Lao people eat it at every meal, with the basket in the middle for everyone — eating with your hands is the normal way.","fact":"老挝人均吃的糯米是世界最多的，大约每人每年 171 公斤；全国吃的米里八九成都是糯米。","fact_en":"Laos eats the most sticky rice per person in the world — about 171 kg each a year — and it makes up most of the rice the country eats.","src":"Wikipedia：Lao cuisine","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lao_cuisine","say":{"en":"One basket of sticky rice, please. Do I eat it with my hand?","zh":"来一篮糯米饭。是用手吃吗？"}},"鱼汤米线":{"what":"缅甸的鱼汤米线（mohinga）：鲶鱼熬的浓汤加香茅、香蕉树心，配细米线、炸豆饼和水煮蛋。","what_en":"Myanmar's mohinga — a thick catfish broth with lemongrass and banana stem, over thin rice noodles with fritters and boiled egg.","fame":"被很多人看作缅甸的「国菜」，仰光街边一大早就有人蹲在小板凳上吃；不少城里全天都有卖，算「全天早餐」。","fame_en":"Widely seen as Myanmar's national dish — in Yangon people eat it on tiny stools at dawn, and in many towns it's sold all day as an 'all-day breakfast'.","fact":"各地口味不一样：曼德勒的放更多香蕉树心，若开邦的加很多辣椒更辣。","fact_en":"It changes by region: Mandalay versions use more banana stem, while Rakhine versions are much spicier with extra chilli.","src":"Wikipedia：Mohinga","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mohinga","say":{"en":"One mohinga with an egg and some fritters, please.","zh":"一碗鱼汤米线，加个蛋和炸豆饼。"}},"尼泊尔馍馍":{"what":"尼泊尔的蒸饺（momo），馅是鸡肉、水牛肉或蔬菜，蘸番茄芝麻辣酱吃。","what_en":"Nepal's momo dumplings, filled with chicken, buffalo or vegetables and dipped in a tomato-sesame chutney.","fame":"加德满都每条街都有小店蒸 momo，是尼泊尔人最爱的小吃；还有炸的、泡在汤里的「jhol momo」。","fame_en":"Every street in Kathmandu has a little shop steaming momos — Nepal's favourite snack. There are fried ones and 'jhol momo' swimming in soup too.","fact":"一般认为是加德满都谷地的尼瓦尔商人在西藏学会了它，再带回尼泊尔；也有人认为是反过来传过去的，至今还有争论。","fact_en":"The usual view is that Newar traders from the Kathmandu Valley learned it in Tibet and brought it home — though some argue it went the other way, and it's still debated.","src":"Wikipedia：Momo (food)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Momo_(food)","say":{"en":"One plate of steamed chicken momo, please — mild sauce.","zh":"一份蒸鸡肉 momo，酱要不辣的。"}},"马尔代夫金枪鱼咖喱":{"what":"马尔代夫的鲣鱼咖喱（mas riha）：新鲜金枪鱼块用椰奶和咖喱叶煮，配米饭或薄饼。","what_en":"Maldivian tuna curry (mas riha) — chunks of fresh skipjack tuna simmered with coconut milk and curry leaves, eaten with rice or roshi flatbread.","fame":"马尔代夫人几乎顿顿吃鱼，金枪鱼是全国的命根子；马累的小茶馆早上就有咖喱和炸鱼小吃。","fame_en":"Maldivians eat fish at almost every meal, and tuna is the country's lifeline — Malé's little tea shops serve curry and fish snacks from the morning.","fact":"马尔代夫一直用「一竿一条」的老办法钓鲣鱼，几乎不伤到别的鱼；2014 年这种钓法拿到了 MSC 可持续渔业认证。","fact_en":"The Maldives still catches skipjack the old way, one fish per pole and line, with almost no bycatch — in 2014 the fishery won MSC sustainable certification.","src":"MSC 海洋管理委员会","url":"https://www.msc.org/en-us/media-center/news-media/news/maldives-pole-and-line-skipjack-tuna-achieves-msc-certification","say":{"en":"Is the tuna caught today? I'd like the curry with roshi.","zh":"金枪鱼是今天钓的吗？咖喱要配薄饼。"}},"别什巴尔马克":{"what":"哈萨克斯坦的手抓肉面：大块煮马肉或羊肉，铺在宽面片上，浇上洋葱肉汤。","what_en":"Kazakhstan's beshbarmak — big pieces of boiled horse or mutton laid over wide sheets of noodle, topped with onion broth.","fame":"哈萨克人招待客人的头号大菜，婚礼、节日、家里来客人都要做；主人会把最好的部位分给最尊贵的客人。","fame_en":"Kazakhstan's top dish for guests — weddings, holidays and visitors all call for it, and the host hands the most honoured cuts to the most respected guests.","fact":"名字的意思是「五个手指」：传统上一家人和客人坐在矮桌（dastarkhan）周围的地上，从一个大盘子里用手抓着吃。","fact_en":"The name means 'five fingers': traditionally family and guests sit on the floor around a low table called a dastarkhan and eat by hand from one big platter.","src":"e-history.kz（哈萨克斯坦历史门户）","url":"https://e-history.kz/en/news/show/8274/","say":{"en":"Is this horse meat or lamb? Should I eat it with my hands?","zh":"这是马肉还是羊肉？要用手吃吗？"}},"拉普拉普":{"what":"瓦努阿图的国菜（laplap）：芋头、山药或木薯磨成泥，拌椰浆，用香蕉叶包好，放在热石头上烤。","what_en":"Vanuatu's national dish laplap — grated taro, yam or cassava mixed with coconut cream, wrapped in banana leaves and baked on hot stones.","fame":"村里过节、婚礼、教会聚会都会做一大块，切开分给大家；维拉港的市场里也能买到一小份。","fame_en":"Villages make a huge one for festivals, weddings and church gatherings and cut it for everyone — Port Vila's market sells small portions too.","fact":"传统上是在「地灶」里做：把食物包好放在烧热的石头上，再用叶子和土盖起来焖熟；各个岛的做法和用料都不太一样。","fact_en":"Traditionally it's cooked in an earth oven: the parcel goes on heated stones and is covered with leaves and earth — and each island has its own version.","src":"Wikipedia：Laplap","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laplap","say":{"en":"What's in this laplap — taro or yam?","zh":"这个 laplap 是芋头的还是山药的？"}},"帕劳芋头":{"what":"帕劳人的主食：种在湿地水田（mesei）里的大芋头，煮熟后又粉又糯。","what_en":"Palau's staple — giant taro grown in wetland patches called mesei, boiled until soft and starchy.","fame":"在帕劳传统里，大海是男人的，芋头田是女人的；家里办事，女人带来的芋头是最重要的礼物之一。","fame_en":"In Palauan tradition the sea belongs to men and the taro patch to women — at family events, the taro women bring is one of the most important gifts.","fact":"气候变暖让芋头田越来越难种，最近在卡扬埃尔环礁，有一群女农民用新的种法把大沼泽芋又种了回来。","fact_en":"Warming makes taro harder to grow — lately women farmers on Kayangel Atoll have been reviving giant swamp taro with climate-smart methods.","src":"Island Times（帕劳）","url":"https://islandtimes.org/women-lead-revival-of-giant-swamp-taro-in-palau-through-climate-smart-farming/","say":{"en":"Is this taro from Palau? How do you usually cook it?","zh":"这是帕劳本地的芋头吗？你们一般怎么做？"}},"面包果":{"what":"太平洋岛上的大绿果子，烤熟或煮熟后像土豆、又像面包，是很多岛民的主食。","what_en":"A big green Pacific fruit that, roasted or boiled, tastes like potato or fresh bread — a staple for many islanders.","fame":"密克罗尼西亚的波纳佩岛上到处是面包果树，一棵树一季能结很多果子；烤着吃、煮着吃、做成甜点都行。","fame_en":"Pohnpei in Micronesia is full of breadfruit trees, each bearing heavily in season — it's roasted, boiled, or turned into desserts.","fact":"吃不完的面包果会放进铺了叶子的坑里发酵成酸面团「mahr」，能放一年多；这种老办法在太平洋别处几乎消失了，在密克罗尼西亚还在用。","fact_en":"Surplus breadfruit is fermented in leaf-lined pits into a sour paste called mahr that keeps for over a year — a method that's nearly vanished elsewhere in the Pacific but lives on in Micronesia.","src":"美国国家热带植物园 NTBG","url":"https://ntbg.org/breadfruit/research/ethnobotany/","say":{"en":"Is this breadfruit ripe? How do I cook it?","zh":"这个面包果熟了吗？要怎么做？"}},"阿德莱德中央市场":{"what":"南澳首府阿德莱德市中心的室内大市场，几十个摊位卖蔬果、肉、奶酪、咖啡和小吃。","what_en":"The big covered market in central Adelaide — dozens of stalls selling fruit and veg, meat, cheese, coffee and snacks.","fame":"据说是南半球最大的室内生鲜市场之一；本地人周末来买菜、喝咖啡，旁边就是唐人街。","fame_en":"It bills itself as one of the largest undercover fresh produce markets in the Southern Hemisphere — locals shop and grab coffee there at weekends, with Chinatown next door.","fact":"1869 年 1 月它刚开张时连房子都没有，只是一块用栏杆围起来、点着几盏煤气灯的空地；第二年才正式开业。","fact_en":"When trading began in January 1869 there were no buildings — just a fenced-off patch lit by a few gas lamps. It officially opened a year later.","src":"Wikipedia：Adelaide Central Market","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adelaide_Central_Market","say":{"en":"Can I try a bit of this cheese before I buy?","zh":"这个奶酪能先尝一点再买吗？"}},"山形樱桃":{"what":"日本东北山形县的樱桃，最有名的品种叫「佐藤锦」，红黄相间，又甜又嫩。","what_en":"Cherries from Yamagata in northern Japan — the famous Satonishiki variety is red-and-yellow, sweet and delicate.","fame":"每年 6 月上市，一盒排得整整齐齐的高级樱桃是日本人中元节送礼的体面货；也能去果园自己摘。","fame_en":"In season each June, a neatly arranged box of premium cherries is a classy summer gift in Japan — and you can pick your own at the orchards.","fact":"山形是日本第一大樱桃产区；而佐藤锦一个品种就占了日本樱桃产量的大约三分之二。它个头小，所以几乎不出口。","fact_en":"Yamagata is Japan's leading cherry region, and the Satonishiki variety alone makes up roughly two-thirds of Japan's cherry crop — it's too small to export, so it rarely leaves Japan.","src":"美国农业部 USDA（日本核果年报）","url":"https://www.usdajapan.org/wpusda/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/Stone-Fruit-Annual_Tokyo_Japan_8-16-2018.pdf","say":{"en":"How much for cherry picking? Is it all you can eat?","zh":"摘樱桃多少钱？是随便吃吗？"}},"札幌拉面":{"what":"北海道札幌的味噌拉面：浓浓的味噌汤底，粗卷面，上面放炒过的豆芽和猪肉，常加一块黄油和玉米。","what_en":"Sapporo's miso ramen — rich miso broth, thick curly noodles, stir-fried bean sprouts and pork, often with butter and corn.","fame":"札幌冬天零下十几度，一碗热拉面是最好的取暖；薄野的「拉面横丁」小巷里挤着十几家小店。","fame_en":"Sapporo winters drop well below zero, and hot ramen is the best heater — Susukino's Ramen Yokocho alley packs in over a dozen tiny shops.","fact":"味噌拉面据说是 1950 年代札幌「味の三平」的老板大宫守人想出来的；这家店现在还在开。","fact_en":"Miso ramen is said to have been invented in the 1950s by Morito Omiya, owner of Aji no Sanpei in Sapporo — the shop is still open.","src":"Tokyo Weekender","url":"https://www.tokyoweekender.com/food-and-drink/sapporo-ganso-ramen-yokocho/","say":{"en":"One miso ramen, please — can I add butter and corn?","zh":"一碗味噌拉面，能加黄油和玉米吗？"}},"韩式烤肉":{"what":"韩国的烤肉：在桌上的烤盘上烤五花肉、牛肉，用生菜包着肉、蒜和酱一起吃。","what_en":"Korean barbecue — pork belly or beef grilled at the table, wrapped in lettuce with garlic and sauce.","fame":"首尔下班后的「会食」最常见的就是烤五花肉配烧酒；店员会帮你剪肉，小菜可以免费续。","fame_en":"Grilled pork belly with soju is the classic Seoul after-work team dinner; staff cut the meat with scissors, and side dishes are refilled for free.","fact":"3 月 3 日是韩国的「五花肉节」：韩语里「三」读 sam，正好是「五花肉」（samgyeopsal）的第一个音；这个节从 2003 年开始，这天大家都去吃烤五花肉。","fact_en":"March 3 is Korea's 'Samgyeopsal Day' — 'three' is 'sam', the first syllable of samgyeopsal. It started in 2003, and on that day people go out for grilled pork belly.","src":"Korea JoongAng Daily","url":"https://www.koreajoongangdaily.com/business/from-bra-day-to-kiss-day-korea-has-it-all/10903555","say":{"en":"Two portions of pork belly, please. Could we have more lettuce?","zh":"两人份五花肉，生菜能再给点吗？"}},"芒果糯米饭":{"what":"泰国甜点：熟透的芒果配椰奶浸过的糯米饭，再撒一点脆绿豆。","what_en":"A Thai dessert: ripe mango with sticky rice soaked in sweet coconut milk, sprinkled with crunchy mung beans.","fame":"每年三到五月芒果季最好吃，曼谷街边水果摊、夜市都有；游客回国前常常最后再吃一份。","fame_en":"Best in mango season, March to May, at Bangkok's fruit carts and night markets — visitors often have one last portion before flying home.","fact":"2022 年泰国歌手 Milli 在美国科切拉音乐节的舞台上吃了一份，之后泰国网上「芒果糯米饭」的搜索量涨了 20 倍，食谱和表情包刷屏。","fact_en":"In 2022 Thai rapper Milli ate a plate on stage at Coachella — afterwards, Thai online searches for 'mango sticky rice' jumped twentyfold, and recipes and memes flooded social media.","src":"NBC News","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/world/milli-coachella-mango-sticky-rice-rcna25124","say":{"en":"One mango sticky rice, please — can I have extra coconut milk?","zh":"一份芒果糯米饭，椰奶能多给点吗？"}},"越南法棍":{"what":"越南法棍三明治（bánh mì）：外脆里松的米面法棍，夹肉、肉酱、腌萝卜胡萝卜、香菜和辣椒。","what_en":"Vietnam's bánh mì — an airy, crackly rice-flour baguette stuffed with meats, pâté, pickled carrot and daikon, coriander and chilli.","fame":"法国殖民时期留下的面包，越南人改成了自己的口味；胡志明市街边推车一早就开卖，几万越南盾一个。","fame_en":"The baguette came with French colonial rule, but Vietnam made it its own — in Ho Chi Minh City, street carts sell them from dawn for a few tens of thousands of dong.","fact":"2011 年 3 月，「banh mi」这个词被收进了《牛津英语词典》；2020 年谷歌还为它做过一个首页涂鸦。","fact_en":"In March 2011 'banh mi' entered the Oxford English Dictionary — and in 2020 Google even made a homepage Doodle for it.","src":"Google Doodles","url":"https://doodles.google/doodle/celebrating-banh-mi/","say":{"en":"One bánh mì with everything, but no chilli, please.","zh":"一个法棍，什么都加，不要辣。"}},"越南滴漏咖啡":{"what":"越南的滴漏咖啡：小铝壶（phin）放在杯子上慢慢滴，底下是炼乳，加冰就是冰奶咖啡。","what_en":"Vietnamese drip coffee — a small metal phin filter dripping slowly onto condensed milk; add ice and it's cà phê sữa đá.","fame":"越南人坐在街边小板凳上，一杯咖啡能聊一上午；咖啡豆多是浓烈的罗布斯塔，产自中部高原的邦美蜀。","fame_en":"Vietnamese sit on street-side stools and make one coffee last all morning; the beans are mostly strong robusta from Buôn Ma Thuột in the Central Highlands.","fact":"邦美蜀被叫作「咖啡之都」，每年办咖啡节；2023 年那一届，全城 500 家咖啡店给客人免费送咖啡。","fact_en":"Buôn Ma Thuột calls itself the coffee capital and holds a coffee festival — at the 2023 edition, 500 cafés across the city gave away free coffee.","src":"Tuoi Tre News","url":"https://vietnamlife.tuoitrenews.vn/news/vietnamese-culture/20230310/500-shops-to-serve-free-coffee-at-festival-in-vietnams-central-highlands/72051.html","say":{"en":"One iced coffee with condensed milk, please — not too sweet.","zh":"一杯冰炼乳咖啡，不要太甜。"}},"海南鸡饭":{"what":"新加坡的国民午饭：白切鸡配鸡汤煮的饭，蘸辣椒酱、姜蓉和黑酱油。","what_en":"Singapore's everyday lunch — poached chicken with rice cooked in chicken stock, plus chilli, ginger and dark soy dips.","fame":"几乎每个小贩中心都有鸡饭摊，几块钱一盘；新加坡人出国最想念的就是它。","fame_en":"Almost every hawker centre has a chicken rice stall, a few dollars a plate — it's what Singaporeans miss most abroad.","fact":"2020 年 12 月，新加坡的「小贩文化」进了联合国教科文组织非遗名录，是新加坡第一个入选的项目。","fact_en":"In December 2020, Singapore's hawker culture was added to UNESCO's intangible heritage list — the country's first entry.","src":"新加坡国家环境局 NEA","url":"https://www.nea.gov.sg/media/news/news/index/hawker-culture-is-singapore-s-first-inscription-on-unesco-s-representative-list-of-the-intangible-cultural-heritage-of-humanity","say":{"en":"One chicken rice, breast meat, and extra chilli, please.","zh":"一份鸡饭，要鸡胸肉，辣椒多一点。"}},"榴莲":{"what":"「水果之王」：满身尖刺，打开是金黄软糯的果肉，味道很浓——喜欢的人爱死，不喜欢的人闻都不能闻。","what_en":"The 'king of fruits' — spiky outside, creamy gold flesh inside, with a smell people either love or can't stand.","fame":"马来西亚槟城的峇六拜一带果园出名，猫山王、黑刺、红虾都是招牌；季节到了，路边摊现开现吃。","fame_en":"Penang's Balik Pulau orchards are famous for Musang King, Black Thorn and Red Prawn — in season, roadside stalls crack them open on the spot.","fact":"2026 年槟城榴莲大丰收，价格比前一年跌了约四成；季末只剩「黑刺」还有，下一季要等到第二年四月。","fact_en":"Penang had a bumper durian harvest in 2026, with prices about 40% lower than the year before; by season's end only Black Thorn was left, and the next harvest won't come until April.","src":"The Star（马来西亚）","url":"https://www.thestar.com.my/metro/metro-news/2026/07/16/sweet-deals-on-penang-bumper-durian-harvest","say":{"en":"How much per kilo for Black Thorn? Can you open it for me?","zh":"黑刺一公斤多少钱？能帮我打开吗？"}},"印尼炒饭":{"what":"印尼炒饭（nasi goreng）：用甜酱油炒得黑亮的米饭，加虾酱、葱头、辣椒，上面放个煎蛋，旁边配虾片。","what_en":"Indonesia's nasi goreng — rice fried dark and glossy with sweet soy, shrimp paste, shallots and chilli, topped with a fried egg and prawn crackers.","fame":"雅加达从早到晚都有：早上用剩饭炒一盘，晚上路边推车「咚咚」敲着锅卖。","fame_en":"In Jakarta it's eaten from morning to night — leftover rice fried for breakfast, and street carts clanging their woks after dark.","fact":"2010 年奥巴马访问雅加达，在国宴上专门感谢主人准备了「bakso、nasi goreng」，说「都好吃」——他小时候在雅加达住过。","fact_en":"On his 2010 visit to Jakarta, Barack Obama thanked his hosts at the state dinner for the 'bakso, nasi goreng' and said it was all delicious — he lived in Jakarta as a child.","src":"白宫档案（奥巴马国宴致辞）","url":"https://obamawhitehouse.archives.gov/the-press-office/2010/11/09/remarks-president-a-toast-state-dinner-jakarta-indonesia","say":{"en":"One nasi goreng with a fried egg, medium spicy, please.","zh":"一份印尼炒饭加煎蛋，中辣。"}},"印度奶茶":{"what":"印度奶茶（masala chai）：红茶加牛奶、糖，和姜、豆蔻等香料一起煮。","what_en":"India's masala chai — black tea boiled with milk, sugar and spices such as ginger and cardamom.","fame":"德里街角的奶茶摊（chai wala）从早到晚冒着热气，小陶杯或小玻璃杯一杯只要十几二十卢比；印度人一天能喝好几杯。","fame_en":"Delhi's street-corner chai wallahs steam from dawn to night, serving tiny clay or glass cups for 10–20 rupees — Indians drink several a day.","fact":"印度人大量喝茶其实是 20 世纪初才开始的：英国人的印度茶叶协会在工厂、矿山和火车站大力推销，街边小贩又自己加了香料。","fact_en":"Mass tea drinking in India only took off in the early 20th century, when the British-run Indian Tea Association pushed it in factories, mines and railway stations — and street vendors added the spices themselves.","src":"Wikipedia：Masala chai","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masala_chai","say":{"en":"One chai, less sugar please.","zh":"一杯奶茶，少糖。"}},"中亚抓饭":{"what":"乌兹别克斯坦的抓饭（plov）：大铁锅里用羊肉、胡萝卜、洋葱和米饭焖出来，常加鹰嘴豆、葡萄干和整头大蒜。","what_en":"Uzbekistan's plov — rice slow-cooked in a huge cauldron with lamb, carrots and onion, often with chickpeas, raisins and whole garlic bulbs.","fame":"塔什干有专门的「抓饭中心」，中午一口大锅能做几百人份，卖完就关门；婚礼、节日更离不开它。","fame_en":"Tashkent has a dedicated Plov Centre where giant cauldrons feed hundreds at lunch and close when it's gone — and no wedding or holiday is without it.","fact":"2016 年，乌兹别克斯坦的「抓饭文化和传统」进了联合国非遗名录；当地有句话：客人没吃到抓饭，不能走。","fact_en":"In 2016 Uzbekistan's 'palov culture and tradition' joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list — and a local saying goes that guests can't leave until they've been served plov.","src":"UNESCO","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/palov-culture-and-tradition-01166","say":{"en":"One plate of plov, please. What time does it run out?","zh":"来一盘抓饭。一般几点卖完？"}},"维吉麦":{"what":"澳大利亚的黑色酵母酱，咸咸的，薄薄抹在涂了黄油的吐司上吃。","what_en":"Australia's dark, salty yeast spread, scraped thinly onto buttered toast.","fame":"澳洲人从小吃到大，出国都要带一罐；外国人第一次吃常常抹太厚，咸得皱眉——这是澳洲人最爱看的场面。","fame_en":"Australians grow up on it and pack a jar when travelling. First-timers usually spread it too thick and grimace — Aussies' favourite thing to watch.","fact":"它是 1922 年墨尔本化学家西里尔·卡利斯特用啤酒厂剩下的酵母做出来的，名字是全国征名比赛选的。","fact_en":"It was made in 1922 by Melbourne chemist Cyril Callister from leftover brewer's yeast, and its name was chosen through a national competition.","src":"Wikipedia：Vegemite","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vegemite","say":{"en":"How much Vegemite should I put on? Just a little?","zh":"维吉麦要抹多少？一点点就行？"}},"澳洲肉派":{"what":"一手能拿的小馅饼：酥皮里是浓肉汁炖的碎牛肉，上面挤番茄酱。","what_en":"A hand-sized pie of flaky pastry filled with minced beef in thick gravy, topped with tomato sauce.","fame":"澳洲人看橄榄球、板球时手里拿的就是它；面包店、加油站、球场都有卖，是澳洲最日常的快餐。","fame_en":"It's what Australians hold while watching footy or cricket — sold at bakeries, petrol stations and stadiums, the country's most everyday fast food.","fact":"据澳新食品标准局，澳大利亚人平均每人每年吃 12 个肉派，全国一年大约 2.7 亿个。","fact_en":"According to Food Standards Australia New Zealand, Australians eat about 12 meat pies each a year — around 270 million in total.","src":"澳新食品标准局 FSANZ","url":"https://www.foodstandards.gov.au/consumer/our-safe-food-supply/meat-pie","say":{"en":"One beef pie with sauce, please. Is it hot?","zh":"一个牛肉派加番茄酱。是热的吗？"}},"帕夫洛娃":{"what":"蛋白霜做的大蛋糕：外面脆、里面像棉花糖，上面铺奶油和草莓、百香果、猕猴桃。","what_en":"A big meringue cake — crisp outside, marshmallowy inside, topped with cream and strawberries, passionfruit and kiwi.","fame":"澳洲和新西兰圣诞节桌上的必备甜点（那边圣诞是夏天）；两国至今都说它是自己发明的。","fame_en":"It's on every Christmas table in Australia and New Zealand (where Christmas is summer) — and both countries still claim to have invented it.","fact":"名字来自俄罗斯芭蕾舞明星安娜·巴甫洛娃，她 1920 年代去两国巡演；珀斯的说法是 1935 年滨海酒店的厨师萨克斯做出来的。","fact_en":"It's named after Russian ballerina Anna Pavlova, who toured both countries in the 1920s — Perth's version credits chef Herbert Sachse at the Esplanade Hotel in 1935.","src":"Wikipedia：Pavlova","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pavlova","say":{"en":"Who made the pavlova? It looks amazing!","zh":"这个帕夫洛娃是谁做的？太好看了！"}},"洛沃地灶":{"what":"斐济的地灶宴（lovo）：在地上挖坑烧热石头，把用香蕉叶包好的肉、鱼、芋头放上去，盖住焖几个小时。","what_en":"Fiji's lovo — a pit of heated stones where meat, fish and taro wrapped in banana leaves are covered over and cooked for hours.","fame":"斐济人办婚礼、过节、家里有大事就做一次；度假村和村子里也常办 lovo 晚宴给客人。","fame_en":"Fijians make one for weddings, holidays and big family events — resorts and villages also host lovo dinners for visitors.","fact":"做 lovo 有分工：通常男人管生火、烧石头，女人准备要包的食物；很多度假村和村子每周都办一次 lovo 晚宴，有唱歌跳舞。","fact_en":"Making lovo has a division of labour: men usually tend the fire and stones while women prepare the food — and many resorts and villages host a weekly lovo night with singing and dancing.","src":"Outlook Traveller","url":"https://www.outlooktraveller.com/destinations/international/a-taste-of-tradition-discover-fijian-culture-through-food-village-life-and-local-experiences","say":{"en":"When will the lovo be ready? Can I watch you open it?","zh":"lovo 什么时候好？能看你们打开吗？"}},"高地咖啡":{"what":"巴布亚新几内亚高原上种的阿拉比卡咖啡，口感干净、带点水果酸。","what_en":"Arabica grown in Papua New Guinea's highlands — clean-tasting with a bright, fruity acidity.","fame":"西高地省的瓦吉山谷是主要产区；咖啡是很多高地家庭最重要的现金收入，在精品咖啡店里越来越常见。","fame_en":"The Wahgi Valley in Western Highlands is a key region; coffee is the main cash income for many highland families and is showing up more in specialty cafés.","fact":"全国 85% 的咖啡是小农户种的，散在交通不便的山里，所以收豆、运豆一直是最大的难题。","fact_en":"Smallholders grow 85% of the country's coffee, spread across remote mountains — so collecting and transporting the beans has always been the biggest challenge.","src":"Sucafina","url":"https://www.sucafina.com/na/origins/papua-new-guinea","say":{"en":"Is this a single-origin coffee from PNG? What does it taste like?","zh":"这是巴新的单一产地咖啡吗？是什么味道？"}},"恰林大峡谷":{"what":"哈萨克斯坦东南部、离阿拉木图大约三小时车程的一条红色大峡谷，恰林河在谷底流过。","what_en":"A red-rock canyon in southeastern Kazakhstan, about three hours' drive from Almaty, with the Charyn River running along the bottom.","fame":"常被叫作「中亚的大峡谷」。最有名的一段叫「城堡谷」，风把红色岩石削成一座座像城堡、塔楼的形状，走两公里多就能下到河边。","fame_en":"People call it Central Asia's Grand Canyon. The best-known stretch, the Valley of Castles, has red rock carved by wind into towers and castle shapes, and a walk of a couple of kilometres takes you down to the river.","fact":"峡谷附近的河谷里藏着一片很少见的「索格底亚纳白蜡树林」。这种树在冰河时期从大部分地方消失了，靠这条河谷温和的小气候才活下来，1964 年起就被保护起来，现在属于恰林国家公园。","fact_en":"Tucked in the river valley near the canyon is a rare grove of Sogdian ash trees. The species vanished from most places during the Ice Age but survived here thanks to the valley's mild microclimate; the grove has been protected since 1964 and is now part of Charyn National Park.","src":"Wikipedia：Charyn Canyon","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charyn_Canyon","say":{"en":"How long does it take to walk down to the river?","zh":"走到河边要多久？"}},"澳洲粉红湖":{"what":"西澳大利亚南岸外中岛上的希利尔湖，湖水是泡泡糖一样的粉红色，旁边就是深蓝的海。","what_en":"Lake Hillier on Middle Island, off the south coast of Western Australia — a bubble-gum pink lake sitting right next to the deep blue ocean.","fame":"粉色不是一会儿有一会儿没有，而是一直这么粉，装进瓶子里也还是粉的。岛上不能随便去，大多数人是从埃斯佩兰斯坐小飞机从天上看。","fame_en":"The pink doesn't come and go — it stays pink all year, even in a bottle. You can't just wander onto the island, so most people see it from a scenic flight out of Esperance.","fact":"以前大家以为是一种藻类把湖染粉的。2015 年「极端微生物组计划」采了湖水做基因测序，发现主要是一种叫 Salinibacter ruber 的嗜盐细菌，藻类反而不多。","fact_en":"People long thought an alga turned the lake pink. In 2015 the Extreme Microbiome Project sequenced the lake's water and found the main culprit is a salt-loving bacterium, Salinibacter ruber — the algae were only a small part of it.","src":"Australian Geographic，2016 年","url":"https://www.australiangeographic.com.au/news/2016/12/australias-pink-lakes/","say":{"en":"Which side of the plane will have the best view of the pink lake?","zh":"坐飞机哪一边看粉红湖最清楚？"}},"摇篮山":{"what":"澳大利亚塔斯马尼亚岛上一座形状像摇篮的山，山脚下是鸽子湖。","what_en":"A mountain shaped like a cradle on the Australian island of Tasmania, with Dove Lake at its foot.","fame":"这里是有名的「陆路步道」的起点，六天走六十多公里；不想走那么远的人绕鸽子湖走一圈，两小时就能看到湖边的旧船屋和摇篮山。路上常碰到袋熊。","fame_en":"It's the start of the famous Overland Track, about 65 km over six days. If that's too much, the two-hour loop around Dove Lake gives you the old boat shed with Cradle Mountain behind it — and wombats along the way.","fact":"1910 年 1 月 4 日，奥地利人古斯塔夫·魏因多费尔登上摇篮山顶时说：这里必须成为国家公园，永远属于人民。他为这件事奔走了十几年，1922 年这里真的成了保护区。直到今天，每年元旦还有人在他的小木屋前纪念他。","fact_en":"On 4 January 1910, the Austrian-born Gustav Weindorfer stood on the summit and declared that this must be a national park for the people for all time. He campaigned for years, and in 1922 it was proclaimed a reserve. Every New Year's Day, people still gather at his chalet, Waldheim, to remember him.","src":"Wikipedia：Gustav Weindorfer","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gustav_Weindorfer","say":{"en":"Is the Dove Lake loop OK in this weather?","zh":"这天气绕鸽子湖走一圈还行吗？"}},"富良野薰衣草":{"what":"日本北海道中部富良野一带的薰衣草田，七月整片山坡都是紫色。","what_en":"The lavender fields around Furano in central Hokkaido, Japan — whole hillsides turn purple in July.","fame":"最有名的是「富田农场」，紫色薰衣草旁边还有红、白、橙几种花排成彩虹一样的条纹。来的人都要吃一个薰衣草味的冰淇淋。","fame_en":"The best-known spot is Farm Tomita, where the lavender sits beside rainbow stripes of red, white and orange flowers. Everyone who visits eats a lavender soft-serve.","fact":"富田农场 1958 年开始种薰衣草是为了提炼香料。真正让全日本知道它的，是 1976 年国铁（今天的 JR）把它的薰衣草田印上了全国发行的挂历，之后游客才一批批找过来。","fact_en":"Farm Tomita started growing lavender in 1958 for perfume oil. What made all of Japan notice it was a 1976 national railway (today's JR) calendar that featured its fields — after that, visitors started arriving one group after another.","src":"Farm Tomita 官网：农场历史","url":"https://www.farm-tomita.co.jp/en/history","say":{"en":"One lavender soft-serve, please.","zh":"要一个薰衣草冰淇淋。"}},"松岛":{"what":"日本宫城县仙台附近的一片海湾，海上散落着两百多座长满松树的小岛。","what_en":"A bay near Sendai in Miyagi, Japan, dotted with more than 200 small islands covered in pine trees.","fame":"它是「日本三景」之一。坐观光船在小岛之间转一圈大约 50 分钟，船后面总跟着一群等人喂虾条的海鸥。","fame_en":"It's one of the Three Views of Japan. A sightseeing cruise between the islands takes about 50 minutes, followed the whole way by seagulls waiting for shrimp crackers.","fact":"那句最有名的「松岛啊，啊松岛啊，松岛啊」常被说成是俳句大师松尾芭蕉写的，其实不是他的；一般认为是后来一位叫田原坊的狂歌诗人写的。芭蕉在松岛真正写下的是另一句关于夏日海上群岛的。","fact_en":"The famous line \"Matsushima, ah! Matsushima, ah! Matsushima\" is usually credited to the haiku master Bashō, but it isn't his — it's generally attributed to a later comic poet, Tawara-bō. The verse Bashō actually wrote here is a different one, about the islands scattered on the summer sea.","src":"Wikipedia：Matsushima","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matsushima","say":{"en":"When does the next boat around the islands leave?","zh":"下一班绕岛的船几点开？"}},"草津温泉":{"what":"日本群马县山里的一个温泉小镇，镇中心有一大片冒着热气的「汤畑」。","what_en":"A hot-spring town in the mountains of Gunma, Japan, with a big steaming field of hot water, the Yubatake, right in the middle of town.","fame":"它常排在日本温泉第一名，出水量非常大。因为泉水太烫，当地人用长木板一边唱歌一边搅水降温，叫「汤揉」，现在每天都有表演。","fame_en":"It often tops lists of Japan's best onsen and pours out huge amounts of water. The water is so hot that locals cool it by stirring it with long wooden boards while singing — the yumomi, which is now performed for visitors every day.","fact":"让草津出名的是一位德国医生贝尔茨。他明治时代来东京教医学，觉得草津的火山泉能治病，推动它变成日本最成功的温泉地，还拿它跟欧洲的温泉小镇比。所以 1961 年，草津和他的家乡比蒂希海姆—比辛根结成了友好城市。","fact_en":"Kusatsu owes much of its fame to a German doctor, Erwin Bälz, who taught medicine in Meiji-era Tokyo. He believed in the healing power of its volcanic springs, pushed to turn it into Japan's most successful hot-spring resort and compared it to Europe's spa towns. That's why, in 1961, Kusatsu became a sister city of his hometown, Bietigheim-Bissingen.","src":"Wikipedia：Erwin Bälz","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erwin_B%C3%A4lz","say":{"en":"What time is the next yumomi show?","zh":"下一场汤揉表演几点？"}},"立山黑部雪墙":{"what":"日本富山县立山黑部阿尔卑斯路线上，春天开路时两边铲出来的高高雪墙，叫「雪之大谷」。","what_en":"The towering snow walls on the Tateyama Kurobe Alpine Route in Toyama, Japan, cut out when the road reopens each spring — known as Yuki-no-Otani.","fame":"每年四月中开放时，路两边的雪墙常有十几米、甚至快二十米高，人走在中间像走在雪做的峡谷里。整条路线要换缆车、巴士、索道好几种交通工具才能翻过山。","fame_en":"When the route opens in mid-April, the walls are often well over ten metres high, sometimes close to twenty, and you walk between them like in a canyon of snow. Crossing the whole route means switching between cable cars, buses and ropeways.","fact":"2024 年 11 月 30 日，立山隧道里的无轨电车跑完最后一天——那是日本最后一条无轨电车线，日本坐了大约一百年的无轨电车就此结束。从 2025 年起换成了电池电动巴士。","fact_en":"On 30 November 2024, the trolleybus inside the Tateyama Tunnel made its last run. It was Japan's last trolleybus line, ending about a century of trolleybuses in the country; from 2025 it was replaced by battery electric buses.","src":"Wikipedia：Tateyama Tunnel Electric Bus","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tateyama_Tunnel_Electric_Bus","say":{"en":"How tall is the snow wall this year?","zh":"今年雪墙有多高？"}},"琵琶湖":{"what":"日本滋贺县的琵琶湖，日本最大的湖，就在京都旁边。","what_en":"Lake Biwa in Shiga, Japan's largest lake, right next door to Kyoto.","fame":"它是世界上最古老的湖之一，京都、大阪一带上千万人喝的水都从这里来，所以关西人常开玩笑说「把琵琶湖的水关了」来吓唬别人。绕湖骑一圈大约两百公里，叫「琵琶一」。","fame_en":"It's one of the world's oldest lakes, and the tap water for millions of people around Kyoto and Osaka comes from here — Shiga people jokingly threaten to \"turn off the lake\". Cycling all the way round, about 200 km, is called the Biwaichi.","fact":"1890 年修好的琵琶湖疏水把湖水引到京都，顺路建了蹴上发电站，1891 年开始发电，是日本第一座商业用的水力发电站；1895 年日本第一条有轨电车就是靠它的电在京都跑起来的。","fact_en":"The Lake Biwa Canal, finished in 1890, carried lake water to Kyoto, and along it the Keage Power Station began generating in 1891 — Japan's first commercial hydroelectric plant. In 1895 its electricity ran Japan's first streetcar line in Kyoto.","src":"IEEE Milestone：蹴上发电站","url":"https://ethw.org/Milestones:Keage_Power_Station:_The_Japan%E2%80%99s_First_Commercial_Hydroelectric_Plant,_1890-1897","say":{"en":"Can I rent a bike here and drop it off somewhere else on the lake?","zh":"在这儿租车，能在湖边别的地方还吗？"}},"鸟取沙丘":{"what":"日本鸟取县海边一大片沙丘，东西十几公里长，最高的沙坡有四五十米。","what_en":"A huge area of sand dunes on the coast of Tottori, Japan, stretching for kilometres, with slopes rising around 40–50 metres.","fame":"在日本很少见到沙漠一样的风景，这里可以骑骆驼、滑沙、玩滑翔伞。旁边的「沙之美术馆」每年请世界各地的人用沙子雕一个国家的主题。","fame_en":"Desert-like landscapes are rare in Japan, so people come to ride camels, sandboard and paraglide. Next door, the Sand Museum invites sculptors from around the world to carve a different country's theme in sand each year.","fact":"鸟取是日本最后一个有星巴克的县，2015 年 5 月才开第一家。在那之前县知事开玩笑说：鸟取没有「Sutaba（星巴克）」，但有日本第一的「Sunaba（沙场）」。当地人干脆开了一家「沙场咖啡」，咖啡豆用沙丘的沙子来烘。","fact_en":"Tottori was the last prefecture in Japan to get a Starbucks — the first one opened in May 2015. Before that the governor joked that Tottori had no \"Sutaba\" (Starbucks) but did have Japan's No. 1 \"Sunaba\" (sandbox). Locals went ahead and opened Sunaba Coffee, roasting its beans with sand from the dunes.","src":"SoraNews24，2015 年","url":"https://soranews24.com/2015/05/19/starbucks-comes-to-tottori-local-coffee-chains-poster-compares-it-to-perry-arriving-in-japan/","say":{"en":"How much is a camel ride?","zh":"骑一次骆驼多少钱？"}},"道后温泉":{"what":"日本四国爱媛县松山市的道后温泉，被认为是日本最古老的温泉之一。","what_en":"Dōgo Onsen in Matsuyama, Ehime, on the island of Shikoku — said to be one of Japan's oldest hot springs.","fame":"1894 年建成的木造「道后温泉本馆」是国家重要文化财产，夏目漱石的小说《少爷》里写过它，很多人说《千与千寻》的汤屋也有它的影子。洗完在楼上穿着浴衣喝茶、吃团子。","fame_en":"The wooden Dōgo Onsen Honkan, built in 1894, is an Important Cultural Property. Natsume Sōseki wrote about it in Botchan, and many people see it in the bathhouse of Spirited Away. After bathing you sit upstairs in a yukata with tea and dango.","fact":"本馆从 2019 年起边营业边大修，2024 年 7 月 11 日才重新全面开放，是五年半来第一次全部开门；前一晚就有温泉迷在门口排队。修完还加了抗震和空调。","fact_en":"The Honkan underwent a long restoration from 2019 while partly staying open, and only fully reopened on 11 July 2024 — the first time in five and a half years. Onsen fans queued from the night before, and the work added earthquake proofing and air conditioning.","src":"nippon.com，2024 年","url":"https://www.nippon.com/en/guide-to-japan/gu900285/the-dogo-onsen-honkan-hot-spring-waters-and-literary-connections.html","say":{"en":"Does the ticket include the upstairs tea room?","zh":"这张票包括楼上喝茶的房间吗？"}},"别府温泉":{"what":"日本九州大分县海边的温泉城市别府，满城都是从地下冒出来的白色蒸汽。","what_en":"Beppu, a seaside hot-spring city in Ōita on Japan's island of Kyushu, where white steam rises out of the ground all over town.","fame":"这里的温泉出水量是日本第一。最有名的是「地狱巡游」：几个热得不能泡、只能看的泉，有钴蓝色的「海地狱」、红色的「血池地狱」。还能吃用温泉蒸汽蒸出来的鸡蛋和蔬菜。","fame_en":"Beppu pours out more hot-spring water than anywhere else in Japan. The famous \"hells\" tour visits springs too hot to bathe in — the cobalt-blue Sea Hell, the red Blood Pond Hell — and you can eat eggs and vegetables steamed in the spring vapour.","fact":"2016 年 11 月，别府市拍了一支「温泉游乐园」的搞笑视频：过山车、旋转木马上全是泡着温泉的人。市长说视频播放过一百万就真的建，结果几天就破了百万。2017 年 7 月，靠众筹在一个老游乐园里真的开了几天。","fact_en":"In November 2016, Beppu City released a joke video of a \"spamusement park\" — roller coasters and merry-go-rounds full of people soaking in hot-spring water. The mayor promised to build it if the video hit a million views; it did within days. In July 2017, after crowdfunding, it really opened for a few days at an old amusement park.","src":"SoraNews24，2017 年","url":"https://soranews24.com/2017/07/31/japans-hot-spring-amusement-park-opens-and-we-check-out-its-onsen-attractions/","say":{"en":"Can I buy a ticket for all the hells here?","zh":"这里能买所有地狱的通票吗？"}},"高千穗峡":{"what":"日本九州宫崎县高千穗町的一条深峡谷，两边是一根根石柱一样的悬崖，中间一条瀑布落进碧绿的河里。","what_en":"A deep gorge in Takachiho, Miyazaki, on Japan's island of Kyushu — cliffs of stone columns on both sides and a waterfall dropping into a green river.","fame":"最有名的画面是划着小船到 17 米高的「真名井瀑布」下面。高千穗也是日本神话的故乡，传说太阳女神躲进的天岩户就在附近，晚上还能看「夜神乐」舞。","fame_en":"The classic picture is rowing a little boat up to the 17-metre Manai Falls. Takachiho is also the home of Japanese myth — the cave where the sun goddess hid is said to be nearby — and you can watch the night-time kagura dances.","fact":"峡谷两边像一根根柱子的岩壁，是阿苏火山喷出的火山碎屑流急速冷却后裂成的「柱状节理」，再被河水慢慢切成 V 字形。悬崖平均 80 米、最高约 100 米，绵延约 7 公里；1934 年被定为国家名胜和天然纪念物。","fact_en":"The column-like walls are columnar jointing: volcanic flows from Mount Aso cooled fast and cracked into pillars, which the river then cut into a V-shaped gorge. The cliffs average 80 m and reach about 100 m, running for some 7 km; the gorge was named a national scenic spot and natural monument in 1934.","src":"日本观光厅多语言解说数据库","url":"https://www.mlit.go.jp/tagengo-db/en/H30-01356.html","say":{"en":"How long is the wait for a rowing boat?","zh":"租小船要等多久？"}},"樱岛火山":{"what":"日本鹿儿岛市对面海湾里的一座活火山，从市区坐渡轮十五分钟就到。","what_en":"An active volcano in the bay right across from Kagoshima city in Japan — a fifteen-minute ferry ride from downtown.","fame":"它是日本最活跃的火山之一，一年会喷发很多次，火山灰常常落到鹿儿岛市里，当地人出门看天气预报还要看「风往哪边吹」。山脚下有免费的足汤，可以边泡脚边看火山冒烟。","fame_en":"It's one of Japan's most active volcanoes and erupts many times a year; ash often falls on Kagoshima, so locals check which way the wind is blowing along with the weather. At the foot there's a free footbath where you can soak your feet and watch it smoke.","fact":"樱岛名字里有个「岛」，以前也真的是一座岛。1914 年 1 月那次大喷发是日本 20 世纪最强的一次，流出来的熔岩把它和对岸大隅半岛之间的海峡填平了，从那以后它就跟陆地连在一起了。","fact_en":"Sakurajima has \"island\" in its name, and it really was one. The great eruption of January 1914, the most powerful in 20th-century Japan, poured out lava that filled the strait to the Ōsumi Peninsula — since then it has been joined to the mainland.","src":"Wikipedia：Sakurajima","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakurajima","say":{"en":"Which way is the ash blowing today?","zh":"今天火山灰往哪边吹？"}},"果阿海滩":{"what":"印度西海岸果阿邦一长串的海滩，椰子树、渔船、海边小酒吧。","what_en":"The long string of beaches in Goa on India's west coast — palm trees, fishing boats and little beach shacks.","fame":"果阿是印度人最爱的度假地，北边热闹，有夜市和派对；南边像帕洛伦这样的海滩安静。老城里有白色的天主教堂和彩色的葡式老房子，跟印度别处很不一样。","fame_en":"Goa is India's favourite holiday spot: the north is busy with night markets and parties, while southern beaches like Palolem are quiet. Its old towns have white Catholic churches and colourful Portuguese-style houses that feel unlike the rest of India.","fact":"果阿被葡萄牙统治了大约 450 年，比印度独立还晚了 14 年才回来：1961 年 12 月，印度军队发动「维杰行动」，葡萄牙总督在 12 月 19 日签了投降书。现在每年 12 月 19 日是果阿的「解放日」。","fact_en":"Goa was ruled by Portugal for about 450 years and only joined India 14 years after independence: in December 1961 the Indian army launched Operation Vijay, and the Portuguese governor-general signed the surrender on 19 December. Goa now celebrates 19 December as Liberation Day.","src":"Wikipedia：Annexation of Goa","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Annexation_of_Goa","say":{"en":"How much for two sunbeds for the day?","zh":"两张躺椅一天多少钱？"}},"树根活桥":{"what":"印度东北梅加拉亚邦山里，用活着的橡胶榕的根一点点引过河、长成的桥。","what_en":"Bridges in the hills of Meghalaya, northeast India, made by guiding the roots of living rubber fig trees across streams until they grow into a crossing.","fame":"这里是世界上最多雨的地方之一，木桥很快就烂了，卡西族人就让树根自己长成桥，越老越结实，能用好几百年。最有名的是农里亚特村的「双层根桥」，要走三千多级台阶下山才能看到。","fame_en":"This is one of the rainiest places on earth, where wooden bridges rot fast, so Khasi villagers let tree roots grow into bridges that get stronger with age and last for centuries. The most famous is the double-decker bridge at Nongriat — down more than 3,000 steps.","fact":"2022 年 3 月，梅加拉亚的树根活桥被列入联合国教科文组织的《世界遗产预备名单》，名字叫「Jingkieng Jri：活根桥文化景观」。已知的大约有一百座，分布在七十多个村子里。","fact_en":"In March 2022, Meghalaya's living root bridges were added to UNESCO's World Heritage Tentative List as \"Jingkieng Jri: Living Root Bridge Cultural Landscapes\". Around a hundred are known, spread across more than seventy villages.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产中心","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/tentativelists/6606/","say":{"en":"How many steps is it down to the double-decker bridge?","zh":"下到双层根桥要走多少级台阶？"}},"干城章嘉峰":{"what":"喜马拉雅山上的干城章嘉峰，世界第三高峰，海拔 8586 米，在印度锡金和尼泊尔交界。","what_en":"Kangchenjunga in the Himalayas, the world's third-highest mountain at 8,586 m, on the border of Sikkim, India, and Nepal.","fame":"锡金人把它当作守护神山。从大吉岭的老虎山看日出，太阳一出来，整排雪峰先变成粉红色再变成金色，是印度最有名的日出之一。","fame_en":"In Sikkim it's revered as a guardian mountain. Watching sunrise from Tiger Hill in Darjeeling, the whole snowy ridge turns pink and then gold — one of India's most famous sunrises.","fact":"1955 年英国登山队第一次登上干城章嘉，可乔·布朗和乔治·班德在离最高点只差几步的地方停住了，因为答应过锡金的统治者不踩真正的峰顶。后来大多数登顶的人都照着这个传统，在峰顶下面停步。","fact_en":"When a British team made the first ascent in 1955, Joe Brown and George Band stopped a few steps below the true summit, keeping a promise to Sikkim's ruler that the top would not be trodden on. Most climbers since have followed the tradition and stopped just short.","src":"Wikipedia：1955 British Kangchenjunga expedition","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1955_British_Kangchenjunga_expedition","say":{"en":"What time do we need to leave for the Tiger Hill sunrise?","zh":"去老虎山看日出要几点出发？"}},"奇特拉科特瀑布":{"what":"印度中部恰蒂斯加尔邦巴斯塔尔地区的一道马蹄形大瀑布，因德拉瓦蒂河从这里落下。","what_en":"A huge horseshoe-shaped waterfall in the Bastar region of Chhattisgarh, central India, where the Indravati River drops over a cliff.","fame":"它是印度最宽的瀑布，雨季时宽近 300 米，被叫作「印度的尼亚加拉」。可以坐小船划到瀑布下面，雨季水是土黄色的，旱季变成好几股白色水帘。","fame_en":"It's India's widest waterfall — close to 300 m across in the monsoon — and is called the \"Niagara of India\". You can take a little boat toward the base; in the monsoon the water is muddy brown, and in the dry season it splits into several white curtains.","fact":"它不是一年四季都这么壮观。2026 年 4 月中，巴斯塔尔一带热浪不退，因德拉瓦蒂河水大减，奇特拉科特瀑布缩成了几条细流，游客也少了很多；也有人说上游被分走的河水是旱季断流的另一个原因。","fact_en":"It isn't always this mighty. In mid-April 2026, a lingering heatwave in Bastar cut the Indravati's flow so much that Chitrakote shrank to a few thin trickles and visitors dropped away; water diverted upstream is also blamed for the dry-season shortfall.","src":"Dainik Jagran，2026 年 4 月","url":"https://english.dainikjagranmpcg.com/states/chhattisgarh/-bastar-heatwave-dries-indravati-river-chitrakote-falls-hit/article-16977","say":{"en":"Is the boat to the falls running today?","zh":"今天去瀑布下面的船开吗？"}},"洛克塔克浮岛":{"what":"印度东北曼尼普尔邦的洛克塔克湖，湖面上漂着一块块圆形的「浮岛」，是植物、泥土和腐殖质缠在一起长成的。","what_en":"Loktak Lake in Manipur, northeast India, where round floating islands called phumdis — tangles of plants, soil and organic matter — drift on the water.","fame":"渔民住在浮岛上的小茅屋里，用浮岛围成圆圈养鱼。湖的南边是世界上唯一一座漂浮的国家公园——凯布尔拉姆贾奥国家公园。","fame_en":"Fishers live in small huts on the phumdis and use rings of them to farm fish. At the south end of the lake is Keibul Lamjao, the world's only floating national park.","fact":"这座浮在水上的国家公园，是濒危的「桑盖鹿」（眉角鹿）在野外唯一的家。1977 年第一次普查时只数到 14 头，2016 年 3 月的普查数到 260 头。","fact_en":"That floating national park is the only wild home of the endangered sangai, or brow-antlered deer. The first census in 1977 counted just 14; the March 2016 census counted 260.","src":"Assam Tribune","url":"https://assamtribune.com/sangai-population-on-the-rise","say":{"en":"Can we take a boat out to the floating islands?","zh":"能坐船去浮岛那边吗？"}},"冲绳":{"what":"日本最南边的冲绳县，一串亚热带的小岛，以前是独立的琉球王国。","what_en":"Okinawa, Japan's southernmost prefecture — a chain of subtropical islands that was once the independent Ryukyu Kingdom.","fame":"海水蓝得发亮，有自己的音乐（三线）、自己的菜（苦瓜炒蛋、冲绳面）和自己的话。这里也是世界有名的长寿之乡，老人家还常常下地干活。","fame_en":"The sea is a glowing blue, and Okinawa has its own music (the sanshin), its own food (goya champuru, Okinawa soba) and its own language. It's also famous worldwide for long life — many older people still work their gardens.","fact":"琉球王国的王宫首里城在 2019 年 10 月 31 日被一场大火烧掉了正殿。2022 年 11 月开始重建，新的正殿定在 2026 年 11 月 23 日重新对外开放，头几周要提前预约。","fact_en":"Shuri Castle, the Ryukyu kings' palace, lost its main hall to a fire on 31 October 2019. Rebuilding began in November 2022, and the new main hall is set to reopen on 23 November 2026, with advance booking needed at first.","src":"japan-guide.com，2026 年","url":"https://www.japan-guide.com/news/shuri-castle-reopening.html","say":{"en":"Do I need to book ahead to see the main hall?","zh":"看正殿要提前预约吗？"}},"釜山海云台":{"what":"韩国第二大城市釜山最有名的海滩，一边是沙滩，一边是高楼。","what_en":"The best-known beach in Busan, South Korea's second city — sand on one side, skyscrapers on the other.","fame":"夏天海滩上撑满了遮阳伞，是韩国人心中「去海边」的代名词。附近的冬柏岛、海边步道和釜山电影节的会场都在这儿，晚上去广安里看灯光大桥。","fame_en":"In summer the sand is covered in parasols — for Koreans it's what \"going to the beach\" means. Dongbaekseom island, the coastal boardwalk and the Busan film festival venues are all close by, and at night people head to Gwangalli to see the lit-up bridge.","fact":"海云台旁边的东海南部线老铁路 2013 年停运后，沿海边大约 5 公里的一段被改成了「海云台蓝线公园」：下面开海边小火车，上面挂着四人坐的彩色「天空胶囊」，沿着海岸慢慢开。","fact_en":"The old Donghae Nambu railway beside Haeundae was shut in 2013, and about 5 km of it along the shore became Haeundae Blueline Park: a little beach train runs below, and colourful four-person \"sky capsules\" creep along the coast above it.","src":"InCorea","url":"https://www.incorea.it/en/haeundae-blueline-park-busan-sky-capsule/","say":{"en":"Are there any sky capsule tickets left for this afternoon?","zh":"今天下午的天空胶囊还有票吗？"}},"济州岛":{"what":"韩国最南边的火山岛，岛中间是韩国最高的山——汉拿山。","what_en":"South Korea's southernmost island, a volcanic island with Hallasan, the country's highest mountain, in the middle.","fame":"济州是韩国人的度假岛和蜜月岛：黑色的火山石墙、橘子园、海边的城山日出峰，还有绕岛一圈的「偶来小路」。很多国家的人可以免签直接来。","fame_en":"Jeju is Korea's holiday and honeymoon island: black volcanic stone walls, tangerine orchards, Seongsan Sunrise Peak on the coast and the Olle trails that circle the island. Visitors from many countries can come visa-free.","fact":"济州的「海女」不用氧气瓶，憋一口气潜到海底采海螺、鲍鱼，2016 年被列入联合国非物质文化遗产。可她们越来越少了：2016 年还有四千多人，到 2025 年底只剩 2371 人，六成以上超过 70 岁。","fact_en":"Jeju's haenyeo dive without oxygen tanks, holding one breath to gather conch and abalone; their culture joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list in 2016. But they are disappearing: from over 4,000 in 2016 to just 2,371 at the end of 2025, more than six in ten of them over 70.","src":"Korea JoongAng Daily，2026 年","url":"https://www.koreajoongangdaily.com/lifestyle/take-a-deep-breath-jejus-haenyeo-festival-dives-into-10-years-of-unesco-heritage/12881337","say":{"en":"Is this abalone porridge made by the haenyeo?","zh":"这碗鲍鱼粥是海女做的吗？"}},"戈壁恐龙蛋":{"what":"蒙古南部戈壁沙漠里的「火焰崖」（巴彦扎格），世界上最早被科学家认出恐龙蛋的地方。","what_en":"The Flaming Cliffs (Bayanzag) in Mongolia's Gobi Desert, where scientists first recognised dinosaur eggs.","fame":"1923 年美国探险家安德鲁斯的车队在这里找到成窝的恐龙蛋，轰动全世界。傍晚的时候红色悬崖像着了火一样，所以叫火焰崖。","fame_en":"In 1923, the American explorer Roy Chapman Andrews's expedition found nests of dinosaur eggs here and amazed the world. At sunset the red cliffs look like they're burning — hence the name.","fact":"当年在蛋旁边找到一只恐龙，科学家以为它是来偷原角龙的蛋，就给它起名「窃蛋龙」。直到 1993 年，在同一种蛋里发现了窃蛋龙类的胚胎，才知道这些蛋就是它们自己的——它其实是在护蛋，名字却改不回来了。","fact_en":"A dinosaur found beside the eggs was assumed to be stealing Protoceratops eggs, so it was named Oviraptor, \"egg thief\". Only in 1993, when an oviraptorid embryo was found inside one of these eggs, did scientists realise the eggs were its own — it was guarding its nest. The name stuck anyway.","src":"Wikipedia：Oviraptoridae","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oviraptoridae","say":{"en":"Are we allowed to touch the rocks here?","zh":"这里的石头可以摸吗？"}},"普吉岛":{"what":"泰国南部安达曼海上最大的岛，海滩、小岛和夜生活都很有名。","what_en":"Thailand's biggest island, in the Andaman Sea in the south — famous for beaches, nearby islands and nightlife.","fame":"从这里坐船去皮皮岛、攀牙湾一日游。除了海滩，普吉老城有一排排彩色的中葡式骑楼，周日晚上的步行街夜市很热闹。","fame_en":"It's the base for boat trips to Phi Phi and Phang Nga Bay. Beyond the beaches, Phuket Old Town has rows of colourful Sino-Portuguese shophouses and a lively Sunday night walking-street market.","fact":"2015 年 12 月，普吉被联合国教科文组织评为「美食之都」，是东盟国家里第一个。原因是这里的菜混合了福建华人、娘惹（土生华人）、马来和泰南的口味，比如福建面、娘惹糕。","fact_en":"In December 2015, UNESCO named Phuket a Creative City of Gastronomy — the first in ASEAN. The reason is its mix of Hokkien Chinese, Peranakan, Malay and southern Thai cooking, from Hokkien noodles to Peranakan sweets.","src":"泰国国家旅游局 TAT News，2015 年","url":"https://www.tatnews.org/2015/12/phuket-gastronomic-delights-recognised-in-unesco-creative-city-listing","say":{"en":"Is this dish spicy? Just a little spicy for me, please.","zh":"这个辣吗？给我微辣就好。"}},"下龙湾":{"what":"越南北部广宁省海上一千多座石灰岩小岛和石柱组成的海湾。","what_en":"A bay in Quảng Ninh, northern Vietnam, with well over a thousand limestone islands and pillars rising from the sea.","fame":"坐木船在石头岛之间过一夜是最经典的玩法：划皮划艇钻溶洞，看渔村，早上在甲板上打太极。名字的意思是「龙降落的地方」。","fame_en":"The classic trip is a night on a wooden boat among the islands — kayaking into caves, passing fishing villages, tai chi on deck in the morning. The name means \"where the dragon descends\".","fact":"2023 年 9 月，联合国教科文组织把旁边海防市的吉婆群岛也并进来，世界遗产的名字改成「下龙湾—吉婆群岛」，成了越南第一个跨两个省市的世界遗产，多了三百多座岛。","fact_en":"In September 2023, UNESCO extended the site to take in the Cát Bà archipelago next door in Hải Phòng, renaming it \"Ha Long Bay – Cat Ba Archipelago\" — Vietnam's first World Heritage site spanning two provinces, with over 360 more islands.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产中心","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/672","say":{"en":"Does the overnight cruise include kayaking?","zh":"过夜的游船包括划皮划艇吗？"}},"巧克力山":{"what":"菲律宾薄荷岛中部一千多座圆圆的小山丘，像一颗颗倒扣的碗。","what_en":"More than a thousand rounded hills in the middle of Bohol in the Philippines, like upside-down bowls.","fame":"旱季时山上的草变成棕色，看起来像一颗颗巧克力，所以叫巧克力山。观景台要爬两百多级台阶，附近还能看眼镜猴、坐竹筏漂罗博克河。","fame_en":"In the dry season the grass turns brown and the hills look like chocolate drops — hence the name. The viewing deck is up 200-plus steps, and nearby you can see tarsiers and float down the Loboc River.","fact":"2024 年 3 月，一段在巧克力山中间建度假村、游泳池的视频在网上爆了，全国一片骂声。环保部门查出它没有环境许可，度假村 3 月 14 日停业，监察署和国会都去调查——因为这里 1997 年起就是保护区。","fact_en":"In March 2024, a video of a resort and swimming pool built right among the Chocolate Hills went viral and sparked national outrage. Regulators found it had no environmental clearance; it closed on 14 March, and the Ombudsman and Congress opened investigations — the hills have been a protected area since 1997.","src":"Wikipedia：Chocolate Hills resort controversy","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chocolate_Hills_resort_controversy","say":{"en":"How many steps up to the viewing deck?","zh":"上观景台要爬多少级？"}},"长滩岛":{"what":"菲律宾中部一座只有七公里长的小岛，西边四公里的白沙滩叫「白滩」。","what_en":"A small island in the central Philippines, just seven kilometres long, with a four-kilometre stretch of powdery sand called White Beach.","fame":"沙子细得像面粉，傍晚帆船出海看日落，被很多杂志评为世界最美海岛之一，也是菲律宾人最爱的度假地。","fame_en":"The sand is as fine as flour, and at sunset sailboats head out to sea — many magazines rank it among the world's best islands, and it's Filipinos' favourite holiday spot.","fact":"2018 年，菲律宾总统杜特尔特说长滩岛已经变成「污水坑」，下令全岛对游客关闭整整六个月（4 月 26 日到 10 月 25 日）整治排污和违建。重开后定了新规矩：海滩上不许喝酒、不许抽烟，每天限人数。","fact_en":"In 2018, President Duterte called Boracay a \"cesspool\" and closed the whole island to tourists for six months (26 April to 25 October) to fix sewage and illegal buildings. It reopened with new rules: no drinking or smoking on the beach, and a cap on daily visitors.","src":"Wikipedia：2018 Boracay closure and redevelopment","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2018_Boracay_closure_and_redevelopment","say":{"en":"What time does the sunset sailing trip leave?","zh":"看日落的帆船几点出发？"}},"喀拉拉回水":{"what":"印度西南喀拉拉邦海边一大片连在一起的湖、河和运河，叫「回水」。","what_en":"The backwaters of Kerala, southwest India — a huge network of lagoons, rivers and canals just behind the coast.","fame":"最经典的是坐改装的米船（船屋）在水上过一夜，船上的厨师做鱼咖喱，两岸是椰子树、稻田和小村子。每年八月还有几十米长的「蛇船」划船比赛。","fame_en":"The classic trip is a night on a converted rice barge (houseboat), with the cook making fish curry as palm trees, paddy fields and villages slide by. Every August there are races of snake boats dozens of metres long.","fact":"回水旁边的库塔纳德是世界上很少见的、在海平面以下种水稻的地方，田比海面低一两米，靠土堤围起来、再把水抽出去。2013 年联合国粮农组织把它评为「全球重要农业文化遗产」。","fact_en":"Next to the backwaters, Kuttanad is one of the few places in the world where rice is farmed below sea level — fields lie a metre or two under the sea, ringed by earthen dykes and pumped dry. In 2013 the FAO named it a Globally Important Agricultural Heritage System.","src":"联合国粮农组织 FAO GIAHS","url":"https://www.fao.org/giahs/giahs-around-the-world/india-kuttanad-farming-system/en","say":{"en":"Is dinner on the houseboat included?","zh":"船屋上的晚饭包括在价钱里吗？"}},"乔戈里峰":{"what":"巴基斯坦和中国交界的喀喇昆仑山上的乔戈里峰（K2），世界第二高峰，海拔 8611 米。","what_en":"K2 in the Karakoram on the Pakistan–China border, the world's second-highest mountain at 8,611 m.","fame":"它被叫作「野蛮巨峰」，比珠峰难爬得多，登顶的人少、遇难的比例高。普通人可以从巴基斯坦一侧徒步十几天到康考迪亚，远远看它的金字塔形山顶。","fame_en":"It's called the \"Savage Mountain\" — far harder than Everest, with fewer summits and a higher death rate. Ordinary trekkers can walk about two weeks on the Pakistani side to Concordia and see its pyramid peak from afar.","fact":"K2 是全世界 14 座八千米高峰里最后一座在冬天被登顶的。2021 年 1 月 16 日，十名尼泊尔登山者肩并肩一起走上峰顶，在山顶唱了尼泊尔国歌。","fact_en":"K2 was the last of the world's fourteen 8,000-metre peaks to be climbed in winter. On 16 January 2021, ten Nepali climbers walked to the summit shoulder to shoulder and sang Nepal's national anthem at the top.","src":"Guinness World Records","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/665319-first-winter-ascent-of-k2","say":{"en":"How many days is the trek to K2 base camp?","zh":"徒步到 K2 大本营要几天？"}},"邦迪海滩":{"what":"澳大利亚悉尼东边最有名的海滩，离市中心半小时车程。","what_en":"Sydney's most famous beach, on the city's east side, about half an hour from downtown.","fame":"一年四季都有人冲浪、晨跑，救生员的电视节目《邦迪救援》全世界播。从邦迪沿着悬崖走到库吉的海岸步道是悉尼人最爱的周末路线。","fame_en":"People surf and run here all year, and the lifeguard TV show Bondi Rescue airs around the world. The cliff-top coastal walk from Bondi to Coogee is Sydney's favourite weekend route.","fact":"海滩南头那个海浪会打进来的海水泳池属于「邦迪冰山俱乐部」，1929 年成立。俱乐部有一条到今天还在用的「15B 规则」：会员冬天（5 月到 9 月）每个月四个星期天至少要来游三次，连续五年，才能保住会员资格。","fact_en":"The ocean pool at the south end, where waves crash over the wall, belongs to the Bondi Icebergs Club, founded in 1929. Its Rule 15B still applies: in winter (May to September) members must swim on at least three Sundays out of four, for five years, to keep their membership.","src":"Bondi Icebergs Club","url":"https://icebergs.com.au/swimming-pool/swimming-members/","say":{"en":"Which part of the beach is between the flags today?","zh":"今天哪一段是插旗的安全区？"}},"蓝山":{"what":"悉尼西边约两小时车程的一片山地和峡谷，大部分被桉树林覆盖。","what_en":"A region of plateaus and canyons about two hours west of Sydney, mostly covered in eucalyptus forest.","fame":"远看山是蓝色的，因为桉树叶散发的油雾在阳光下会显出蓝色。最有名的是「三姐妹岩」，还能坐世界上很陡的观光小火车下到谷底。","fame_en":"From afar the hills look blue, because oil from eucalyptus leaves forms a haze that scatters sunlight. The most famous sight is the Three Sisters, and you can ride one of the world's steepest scenic railways down into the valley.","fact":"2019 到 2020 年夏天的大山火烧掉了大蓝山世界遗产区大约 79% 的面积，这样的规模以前从没有过。可桉树很耐火，很多被烧黑的树干几个月后就从树皮里冒出新芽来。","fact_en":"The 2019–20 megafires burned about 79% of the Greater Blue Mountains World Heritage Area — unprecedented in scale. But eucalypts are built for fire: within months many blackened trunks were sprouting new shoots straight from the bark.","src":"Linnean Society of NSW 论文，2021 年","url":"https://openjournals.library.sydney.edu.au/LIN/article/view/17079","say":{"en":"Which lookout is best for the Three Sisters?","zh":"看三姐妹岩哪个观景台最好？"}},"十二门徒岩":{"what":"澳大利亚维多利亚州「大洋路」海边，从海里竖起来的一排石灰岩石柱。","what_en":"A row of limestone stacks rising out of the sea along the Great Ocean Road in Victoria, Australia.","fame":"大洋路是世界有名的自驾海岸公路，十二门徒岩是路上最有名的一站。日落时石柱被照成金黄色，停车场挤满了等光的人。","fame_en":"The Great Ocean Road is one of the world's famous coastal drives, and the Twelve Apostles are its best-known stop. At sunset the stacks glow gold, and the car park fills with people waiting for the light.","fact":"名字叫「十二」，其实从来没有十二根，现在只剩七根。2005 年 7 月 3 日上午 9 点 18 分，一根石柱在游客眼前塌进海里；2009 年又塌了一根。海浪还在继续啃剩下的。","fact_en":"Despite the name, there were never twelve — and now only seven remain. At 9:18 a.m. on 3 July 2005, one stack collapsed into the sea in front of visitors, and another fell in 2009. The waves keep eating away at the rest.","src":"Parks Victoria 维多利亚州公园局","url":"https://www.parks.vic.gov.au/places-to-see/parks/port-campbell-national-park/things-to-do/twelve-apostles","say":{"en":"What time is sunset here today?","zh":"今天这里几点日落？"}},"萤火虫洞":{"what":"新西兰北岛怀托摩的地下溶洞，洞顶亮着成千上万只「萤火虫」。","what_en":"Limestone caves at Waitomo on New Zealand's North Island, where thousands of glowworms light up the ceiling.","fame":"游客坐小船在漆黑的地下河上慢慢漂，抬头一片蓝绿色的光点，像星空。洞里不许拍照、要小声，免得吓到它们。","fame_en":"Visitors drift on a small boat along a pitch-black underground river, looking up at blue-green points of light like a starry sky. No photos and no talking loudly, so the glowworms aren't disturbed.","fact":"1887 年，毛利酋长塔内·蒂诺劳和英国测绘员弗雷德·梅斯坐着亚麻扎的木筏、举着火把第一次漂进这个洞。1989 年，洞和土地归还给了原来的毛利地主，今天在洞里带团的很多人就是蒂诺劳的后代。","fact_en":"In 1887, the Māori chief Tāne Tinorau and English surveyor Fred Mace first floated into the cave on a flax raft, holding torches. In 1989 the cave and land were returned to the original Māori owners, and many of the guides today are Tinorau's descendants.","src":"Wikipedia：Waitomo Glowworm Cave","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waitomo_Glowworm_Cave","say":{"en":"Can I take photos inside the cave?","zh":"洞里能拍照吗？"}},"米尔福德峡湾":{"what":"新西兰南岛峡湾国家公园里一条深深插进陆地的海湾，两边是一千多米高的绝壁。","what_en":"A deep inlet in Fiordland National Park on New Zealand's South Island, walled in by cliffs over a thousand metres high.","fame":"作家吉卜林叫它「世界第八大奇迹」。坐船进去看主教冠峰、瀑布、海豹和海豚，再开出到塔斯曼海口。","fame_en":"Rudyard Kipling called it the eighth wonder of the world. Boats cruise past Mitre Peak, waterfalls, seals and dolphins out to the Tasman Sea.","fact":"它名字叫「Sound（海峡）」，其实是冰川挖出来的峡湾。这里一年下雨六千多毫米，是新西兰最湿的有人住的地方——所以下雨天反而最好看，悬崖上会冒出几百条临时瀑布。","fact_en":"It's called a sound, but it's really a fjord carved by glaciers. It gets over 6,000 mm of rain a year — the wettest inhabited place in New Zealand — so rainy days are actually the best, when hundreds of temporary waterfalls pour off the cliffs.","src":"Wikipedia：Milford Sound","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milford_Sound","say":{"en":"Will the cruise still go if it's raining?","zh":"下雨的话船还开吗？"}},"斐济":{"what":"南太平洋上由三百多个岛组成的国家，首都苏瓦。","what_en":"A South Pacific nation of more than 300 islands, with Suva as its capital.","fame":"白沙、珊瑚、椰子树，人见面就大声说「Bula！」（你好）。到村子里做客要先喝一碗卡瓦——一种用胡椒根泡的土色饮料，喝完嘴会有点麻。","fame_en":"White sand, coral and palms — and everyone greets you with a loud \"Bula!\" When you visit a village you're offered a bowl of kava, an earthy drink made from pepper root that leaves your lips slightly numb.","fact":"橄榄球七人制是斐济的国球。2016 年里约奥运会，斐济在决赛 43 比 7 大胜英国，拿到了国家历史上第一块奥运奖牌，而且是金牌；政府专门放了一天公共假日庆祝。","fact_en":"Rugby sevens is Fiji's national passion. At the 2016 Rio Olympics, Fiji crushed Great Britain 43–7 in the final to win the country's first Olympic medal ever — a gold — and the government declared a public holiday to celebrate.","src":"Al Jazeera，2016 年","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2016/8/12/rio-2016-wild-celebrations-mark-fijis-rugby-gold","say":{"en":"Bula! Is it OK if I join the kava?","zh":"Bula！我可以一起喝卡瓦吗？"}},"白天堂海滩":{"what":"澳大利亚昆士兰圣灵群岛里，圣灵岛东边一条七公里长的白沙滩。","what_en":"A seven-kilometre white-sand beach on the east side of Whitsunday Island in Queensland's Whitsunday Islands, Australia.","fame":"沙子几乎全是石英，白得晃眼，踩上去会「吱吱」响，大热天也不烫脚。北头的希尔湾退潮时，白沙和蓝绿色海水卷成漩涡，是澳洲被拍得最多的风景之一。","fame_en":"The sand is almost pure quartz — dazzling white, squeaky underfoot and cool even on hot days. At Hill Inlet on the north end, low tide swirls white sand and turquoise water together in one of Australia's most photographed views.","fact":"地质学家说这些白沙不是岛上产的：圣灵岛的岩石是火山岩，里面的石英颗粒小到看不见，磨不出这么细的白沙。这一带海底有大约 18.5 亿吨这种沙，都是最近一万年里被洋流从别处带来、在这个海湾里沉下来的。","fact_en":"Geologists say the sand didn't come from the island: Whitsunday Island is volcanic rock whose quartz grains are microscopic, so it couldn't make this sand. About 1.85 billion tonnes of it lie on the seabed in the area, carried in by currents from elsewhere and settled in the bay within the last 10,000 years.","src":"EARTH Magazine","url":"https://www.earthmagazine.org/article/travels-geology-australias-whitsunday-islands-sun-sand-and-silicic-volcanism/","say":{"en":"What time is low tide at Hill Inlet?","zh":"希尔湾几点退潮？"}},"邦格尔邦格尔":{"what":"西澳大利亚金伯利地区普努卢卢国家公园里，一片橙黑条纹的蜂窝形圆顶石山。","what_en":"A range of orange-and-black striped beehive domes in Purnululu National Park, in the Kimberley region of Western Australia.","fame":"这些圆顶是三亿多年前的砂岩，橙色是铁锈，黑色是一层蓝藻，像涂了条纹。路很难走，只能开四驱车进去，或者坐直升机从天上看。","fame_en":"The domes are sandstone over 300 million years old — the orange is iron oxide, the black a layer of cyanobacteria, like painted stripes. The road in is rough, so you need a 4WD or a helicopter flight to see them.","fact":"当地原住民在这里生活了几万年，可外面的世界几乎不知道它，直到 1980 年代初一支纪录片摄制组坐直升机拍下了空中画面。1987 年成为国家公园，2003 年列入世界自然遗产。","fact_en":"Aboriginal people have lived here for tens of thousands of years, yet the outside world barely knew it until a documentary crew filmed it from a helicopter in the early 1980s. It became a national park in 1987 and a World Heritage site in 2003.","src":"Wikipedia：Purnululu National Park","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purnululu_National_Park","say":{"en":"Do I need a 4WD to get into the park?","zh":"进公园一定要开四驱车吗？"}},"汤加里罗火山":{"what":"新西兰北岛中部的汤加里罗国家公园，里面有汤加里罗、瑙鲁赫伊和鲁阿佩胡三座活火山。","what_en":"Tongariro National Park in the middle of New Zealand's North Island, home to three active volcanoes: Tongariro, Ngāuruhoe and Ruapehu.","fame":"「汤加里罗高山穿越」一天走 19.4 公里，经过火山口和翡翠色的湖，被叫作世界最好的一日徒步之一。圆锥形的瑙鲁赫伊火山是电影《指环王》里「末日火山」的原型。","fame_en":"The Tongariro Alpine Crossing is a 19.4 km day hike past craters and emerald lakes, often called one of the world's best one-day walks. Cone-shaped Ngāuruhoe stood in for Mount Doom in The Lord of the Rings.","fact":"1887 年 9 月 23 日，毛利部落酋长特·赫乌赫乌·图基诺四世把这三座神山的山顶送给国家，条件是要保护它们。它因此成了新西兰第一座国家公园；1993 年又因为毛利文化意义，成为世界上第一个以「文化景观」身份列入的世界遗产。","fact_en":"On 23 September 1887, the Ngāti Tūwharetoa chief Te Heuheu Tukino IV gave the summits of these sacred mountains to the Crown so they would be protected. That made it New Zealand's first national park, and in 1993 it became the first site in the world inscribed as a World Heritage cultural landscape, for its Māori significance.","src":"NZ History 新西兰文化遗产部","url":"https://nzhistory.govt.nz/tongariro-mountains-gifted-to-crown","say":{"en":"Do I need to book the shuttle for the Alpine Crossing?","zh":"走高山穿越要提前订接驳车吗？"}},"福克斯冰川":{"what":"新西兰南岛西海岸的一条冰川，从南阿尔卑斯山一直流到靠近雨林的低处。","what_en":"A glacier on the West Coast of New Zealand's South Island, flowing from the Southern Alps down almost into the rainforest.","fame":"在世界上很少见：冰川的尽头离海只有十几公里，旁边就是蕨类和雨林。附近的马瑟森湖能拍到雪山倒影。","fame_en":"It's a rare sight: the glacier ends just a dozen or so kilometres from the sea, with ferns and rainforest right alongside. Nearby Lake Matheson reflects the snowy peaks like a mirror.","fact":"以前开车就能到冰川脚下走一走。2019 年几场暴雨引发大滑坡，冲毁了通往冰川的道路，工程师评估后认为没法再修，8 月宣布无限期关闭。现在想站到冰上，只能坐直升机。","fact_en":"You used to be able to drive close and walk up to the glacier. In 2019, storms set off a huge landslide that wrecked the access road; engineers concluded it couldn't practically be rebuilt, and in August it was closed indefinitely. Now the only way onto the ice is by helicopter.","src":"新西兰保护部 DOC，2019 年","url":"https://www.doc.govt.nz/news/media-releases/2019/fox-glacier-road-closed-for-indefinite-future/","say":{"en":"Is the heli-hike going today, or is it too cloudy?","zh":"今天直升机冰川徒步能去吗，还是云太多？"}},"软珊瑚之都":{"what":"斐济塔韦乌尼岛和瓦努阿岛之间索莫索莫海峡里的彩虹礁，被潜水的人叫作「世界软珊瑚之都」。","what_en":"The Rainbow Reef in the Somosomo Strait between Taveuni and Vanua Levu in Fiji, which divers call the soft coral capital of the world.","fame":"海峡里潮水很急，把养分不停地带过来，软珊瑚长得满墙都是，红、紫、黄、白。最有名的潜点「大白墙」整面墙都是白色和淡紫色的软珊瑚。","fame_en":"Strong tidal currents rush through the strait carrying food, so soft corals cover the walls in red, purple, yellow and white. The famous Great White Wall dive is one whole cliff of white and lavender soft coral.","fact":"塔韦乌尼是世界上少数几个被东经／西经 180 度线穿过陆地的地方，岛上有块牌子标着这条线，可以一只脚在「今天」、一只脚在「昨天」。不过国际日期变更线特地绕开了斐济，所以全岛其实过的是同一天。","fact_en":"Taveuni is one of the few places where the 180th meridian crosses land, and a sign marks the line so you can stand with one foot in \"today\" and one in \"yesterday\". But the International Date Line was bent around Fiji, so the whole island actually lives on the same day.","src":"Wikipedia：Taveuni","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taveuni","say":{"en":"How strong is the current at the Great White Wall today?","zh":"今天大白墙那里水流大吗？"}},"马马努卡群岛":{"what":"斐济主岛维提岛西边海上的一串小岛，从楠迪坐船一两个小时就到。","what_en":"A string of small islands off the west coast of Viti Levu, Fiji's main island, an hour or two by boat from Nadi.","fame":"这里是斐济最好去的海岛：一天来回的船、潜水、浮潜，岛上都是小度假村。很多人第一次来斐济就住在这里。","fame_en":"These are Fiji's easiest islands to reach — day boats, diving, snorkelling and small island resorts. For many people it's where their first Fiji trip happens.","fact":"汤姆·汉克斯的电影《荒岛余生》（Cast Away）就是在这里一座没人住的小岛莫努里基上拍的。可游客常常搞错：群岛里另有一座度假村叫「Castaway Island」，电影其实不是在那儿拍的。","fact_en":"Tom Hanks's film Cast Away was shot on Monuriki, an uninhabited little island in this group. Visitors often get confused, because another island here has a resort called Castaway Island — but the film wasn't shot there.","src":"Wikipedia：Mamanuca Islands","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mamanuca_Islands","say":{"en":"Which boat goes to the Cast Away island?","zh":"哪条船去拍《荒岛余生》的那个岛？"}},"拉包尔火山":{"what":"巴布亚新几内亚新不列颠岛东北角的拉包尔，城就建在一个巨大的火山口海湾边上。","what_en":"Rabaul, on the northeastern tip of New Britain in Papua New Guinea — a town built on the shore of a huge flooded volcanic caldera.","fame":"海湾边的塔乌鲁尔火山常常冒烟。这里以前是二战时日军的大基地，海底有很多沉船和飞机残骸，是潜水的人的目的地。当地人在火山边的热沙里挖冢雉鸟的蛋。","fame_en":"Tavurvur volcano on the bay still smokes often. In WWII this was a major Japanese base, and the harbour is full of shipwrecks and aircraft wrecks that draw divers. Locals dig megapode eggs out of the warm volcanic sand.","fact":"1994 年 9 月 19 日，塔乌鲁尔和瓦尔肯两座火山同时爆发，火山灰压塌了拉包尔城里大约八成的房子。因为事先有撤离计划，全城人都跑出来了，死亡的只有几个人。省会后来搬到了 20 公里外的科科波。","fact_en":"On 19 September 1994, Tavurvur and Vulcan erupted together, and the weight of ash collapsed about 80% of Rabaul's buildings. Thanks to evacuation plans the town got out in time and only a handful of people died. The provincial capital was then moved 20 km away to Kokopo.","src":"Wikipedia：Rabaul","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rabaul","say":{"en":"Is it safe to walk up to the volcano today?","zh":"今天走去火山那边安全吗？"}},"金贝湾珊瑚":{"what":"巴布亚新几内亚新不列颠岛北岸的金贝湾，一个水很深、珊瑚很多的海湾。","what_en":"Kimbe Bay on the north coast of New Britain in Papua New Guinea — a deep bay packed with coral reefs.","fame":"它在「珊瑚大三角」里，是世界上海洋生物最丰富的地方之一。海湾里有几百座从深海冒上来的珊瑚礁顶，潜水时常遇到海豚、鲸和大群的鱼。","fame_en":"It sits in the Coral Triangle, one of the richest marine areas on earth. Hundreds of reef tops rise from deep water in the bay, and divers often meet dolphins, whales and huge schools of fish.","fact":"在这片不到一万平方公里的海湾里，能找到整个印度—太平洋地区六成以上的珊瑚种类，还有 860 多种珊瑚礁鱼。","fact_en":"In a bay of under 10,000 square kilometres, you can find more than 60% of all the coral species of the entire Indo-Pacific, and over 860 species of reef fish.","src":"Wikipedia：Kimbe Bay","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kimbe_Bay","say":{"en":"What's the visibility like on the reef today?","zh":"今天礁石那边水能见度怎么样？"}},"亚苏尔火山":{"what":"瓦努阿图塔纳岛上的一座活火山，人可以走到火山口边上往下看。","what_en":"An active volcano on Tanna island in Vanuatu, where you can walk right up to the crater rim and look in.","fame":"它是世界上离人最近的活火山之一：傍晚坐四驱车上去，站在火山口边，下面的岩浆每隔几分钟「轰」地喷一次，红色的火团飞到天上。","fame_en":"It's one of the world's most accessible active volcanoes: drive up by 4WD at dusk, stand on the rim, and every few minutes the lava below booms and throws red fireballs into the sky.","fact":"1774 年，英国航海家库克船长在海上看到了它的红光，就是被这团光引到塔纳岛来的。它几百年来几乎一直在喷，所以被叫作「太平洋的灯塔」。","fact_en":"In 1774, Captain Cook saw its red glow from the sea, and it was that light that drew him to Tanna. It has been erupting almost continuously ever since, which is why it's called the \"Lighthouse of the Pacific\".","src":"Wikipedia：Mount Yasur","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Yasur","say":{"en":"What's the volcano alert level today?","zh":"今天火山的警戒级别是几级？"}},"水母湖":{"what":"帕劳洛克群岛里一个被岩石围起来的咸水湖，湖里住着成群的金色水母。","what_en":"A saltwater lake enclosed by rock in Palau's Rock Islands, home to swarms of golden jellyfish.","fame":"湖里的水母和外面海里的隔开了几千年，刺很弱，人可以戴着面镜在几十万只水母中间浮潜，像在金色的雪里游泳。不许潜水，也不许踢起湖底的水。","fame_en":"Cut off from the open sea for thousands of years, its jellyfish have only a weak sting, so you can snorkel among hundreds of thousands of them, like swimming through golden snow. Scuba diving and kicking up the bottom are not allowed.","fact":"2016 年大旱，湖水变热变咸，金色水母几乎全死光了，水母湖关闭了将近两年。到 2018 年 12 月数到大约 63 万只，2019 年才重新对游客开放。","fact_en":"In the 2016 drought, the lake got hotter and saltier and the golden jellyfish almost disappeared, so Jellyfish Lake closed for nearly two years. By December 2018 a survey counted about 630,000 again, and it reopened to visitors in 2019.","src":"CNN，2019 年","url":"https://edition.cnn.com/travel/article/palau-jellyfish-lake-reopens","say":{"en":"Do I need a special permit for Jellyfish Lake?","zh":"去水母湖要专门的许可证吗？"}},"塔斯马尼亚":{"what":"澳大利亚大陆南边的一个大岛，也是一个州，首府霍巴特。","what_en":"A large island south of mainland Australia, and a state of its own, with Hobart as its capital.","fame":"差不多一半的土地是国家公园和保护区，有摇篮山、酒杯湾，还有世界上只在这里有的塔斯马尼亚袋獾。霍巴特的 MONA 美术馆和周六萨拉曼卡市集也很有名。","fame_en":"Close to half the island is national parks and reserves — Cradle Mountain, Wineglass Bay — and it's the only home of the Tasmanian devil. Hobart's MONA museum and the Saturday Salamanca Market are famous too.","fact":"岛西北角的格里姆角有一个空气监测站，从 1976 年 4 月 1 日开始测从南大洋吹来、几千公里没碰过陆地的风，被叫作「世界上最干净的空气」。2026 年 4 月它正好测满 50 年，全世界都拿它的数据当作看大气变化的「基准线」。","fact_en":"At Cape Grim on the island's northwest tip, a station has been measuring wind straight off the Southern Ocean — air that hasn't touched land for thousands of kilometres — since 1 April 1976. It's called the cleanest air in the world. In April 2026 it marked 50 years, and scientists worldwide use its data as a baseline for how the atmosphere is changing.","src":"CSIRO 澳大利亚联邦科学与工业研究组织，2026 年","url":"https://www.csiro.au/en/news/All/News/2026/April/50-years-measuring-the-worlds-cleanest-air","say":{"en":"Is the Salamanca Market on this Saturday?","zh":"这个星期六萨拉曼卡市集开吗？"}},"生命之树塔":{"what":"哈萨克斯坦首都阿斯塔纳市中心的一座白色高塔，顶上托着一个金色玻璃球。","what_en":"A white tower in the centre of Astana, Kazakhstan's capital, holding up a golden glass ball.","fame":"它照着哈萨克传说里的「生命之树」造：神鸟把金蛋下在树顶。现在是这座新首都的标志，上到金球里能看整条中轴线。","fame_en":"It is built after the Kazakh legend of the tree of life, where a magic bird laid a golden egg at the top. It is now the symbol of the new capital; from inside the golden ball you see the whole central avenue.","fact":"金球里的观景台在 97 米高——就是 1997 年，首都从阿拉木图搬到阿斯塔纳的那一年。","fact_en":"The viewing deck inside the ball sits at 97 metres — for 1997, the year the capital moved from Almaty to Astana.","src":"Wikipedia：Baiterek (monument)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baiterek_(monument)","say":{"en":"Is it very windy up in the golden ball?","zh":"金球上面风大吗？"}},"南马都尔":{"what":"太平洋密克罗尼西亚波纳佩岛外，一片用黑色玄武岩柱子垒在珊瑚礁上的古城废墟。","what_en":"The ruins of an ancient city off Pohnpei in Micronesia, built from black basalt columns stacked on a coral reef.","fame":"将近一百个人工小岛，中间是水道，人称「太平洋上的威尼斯」；石柱一根几吨重，到现在也说不清当年怎么运来的。","fame_en":"Nearly a hundred artificial islets separated by canals — the 'Venice of the Pacific'. Each basalt column weighs tonnes, and how they were moved is still debated.","fact":"2016 年它一列进世界遗产，同一天就上了「濒危名单」：水道被淤泥堵住，红树林疯长，把石墙一点点撑垮。","fact_en":"In 2016 it was inscribed as a World Heritage Site and put on the 'in Danger' list the very same day: silted canals let mangroves spread and push the walls apart.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产中心","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/news/1899","say":{"en":"Can we only get there at high tide?","zh":"是不是只有涨潮的时候才能划进去？"}},"日光东照宫":{"what":"日本栃木县日光山里的神社，供着江户幕府的开创者德川家康。","what_en":"A shrine in the mountains of Nikko, Tochigi, dedicated to Tokugawa Ieyasu, founder of the Edo shogunate.","fame":"跟一般素净的神社不一样，它满身金漆和彩色雕刻；正门「阳明门」雕了五百多个人物花鸟，被叫作「看一天也看不腻的门」。","fame_en":"Unlike most plain shrines, it is covered in gold leaf and painted carvings. Its Yomeimon gate has over 500 carved figures and is nicknamed 'the gate you could stare at all day'.","fact":"大家熟悉的「不看、不听、不说」三只猴子就刻在这里的马厩上——其实一共八块板，讲一只猴子的一生，三只猴子只是第二块，说的是小时候别学坏。","fact_en":"The famous 'see no evil, hear no evil, speak no evil' monkeys are carved on the shrine's stable. There are actually eight panels telling a monkey's whole life; the three monkeys are only panel two — childhood, keep away from bad things.","src":"Wikipedia：Three wise monkeys","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three_wise_monkeys","say":{"en":"Where are the three monkeys carved?","zh":"那三只猴子刻在哪儿？"}},"兼六园":{"what":"日本石川县金泽市的一座大名庭园，以前是加贺藩主家的园子。","what_en":"A feudal lord's garden in Kanazawa, Ishikawa — once the private garden of the Maeda lords of Kaga.","fame":"日本「三大名园」之一；名字的意思是同时有「六种好」：宽、幽、人工、古朴、水多、视野好。冬天松树上拉起一圈圈绳子防雪压（雪吊），是金泽的冬天招牌。","fame_en":"One of Japan's 'three great gardens'; the name means it combines six qualities — spaciousness, seclusion, artifice, antiquity, water and views. In winter the pines are tied with cone-shaped ropes against snow (yukitsuri), Kanazawa's winter trademark.","fact":"园里有一座日本最古老的喷泉之一，不用电也不用泵：水从上面的霞池引下来，只靠高低差自己往上喷。","fact_en":"It has one of Japan's oldest fountains, with no pump and no electricity: water from Kasumigaike Pond above shoots up purely from the drop in height.","src":"japan-guide.com","url":"https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4200.html","say":{"en":"When do they put up the snow ropes on the pines?","zh":"松树上的雪吊什么时候开始拉？"}},"伊势神宫":{"what":"日本三重县伊势的神社，供奉太阳女神天照大神，是日本神社里地位最高的。","what_en":"A shrine complex in Ise, Mie, dedicated to the sun goddess Amaterasu — the most important shrine in Japan.","fame":"日本人一辈子想去一次的地方，江户时代就有人从全国走路来「伊势参拜」；门口的老街「托福横丁」卖赤福年糕。","fame_en":"A once-in-a-lifetime pilgrimage for many Japanese; people walked here from all over the country in the Edo period. The old street outside, Okage Yokocho, sells Akafuku rice cakes.","fact":"主殿每 20 年在旁边一块地上照原样重新盖一遍，神搬过去，旧的拆掉——上一次是 2013 年，下一次是 2033 年，2025 年已经开始准备。","fact_en":"Every 20 years the main halls are rebuilt, identical, on the plot next door; the gods move over and the old buildings come down. The last rebuild was 2013, the next is 2033, and preparations began in 2025.","src":"National Geographic","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/travel/article/this-japanese-shrine-is-torn-down-every-20-years","say":{"en":"Which one should we visit first, the Outer or the Inner Shrine?","zh":"先去外宫还是先去内宫？"}},"出云大社":{"what":"日本岛根县出云的古老神社，供奉主管「缘分」的大国主大神。","what_en":"An ancient shrine in Izumo, Shimane, dedicated to Okuninushi, the god of relationships and good matches.","fame":"求姻缘最有名的神社；神乐殿门口那根粗大的注连绳有十几米长、好几吨重，是很多人来拍照的地方。","fame_en":"Japan's best-known shrine for finding love. The giant straw rope over the Kaguraden hall is over ten metres long and weighs several tonnes — everyone takes a photo of it.","fact":"传说每年旧历十月，全日本的神都到出云开会，商量谁跟谁结缘。所以别的地方把十月叫「神无月」（神不在的月），出云叫「神在月」。","fact_en":"Legend says that every tenth lunar month all of Japan's gods gather in Izumo to decide who will be matched with whom. So the rest of Japan calls it Kannazuki, 'month without gods', while Izumo calls it Kamiarizuki, 'month with gods'.","src":"Wikipedia：Kannazuki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kannazuki","say":{"en":"Do we clap four times here instead of two?","zh":"这里是拍四下手，不是两下吗？"}},"军舰岛":{"what":"日本长崎外海的一座小岛（端岛），以前是海底煤矿，现在是没人住的废墟。","what_en":"Hashima, a tiny island off Nagasaki that was once an undersea coal mine and is now an abandoned ruin.","fame":"岛上挤满了水泥公寓，远看像一艘军舰；2015 年作为「明治工业革命遗产」的一部分列入世界遗产，电影《007：大破天幕杀机》也用它做了布景。","fame_en":"Packed with concrete apartment blocks, from a distance it looks like a battleship. In 2015 it became part of the 'Meiji Industrial Revolution' World Heritage Site, and it inspired a set in the Bond film Skyfall.","fact":"1959 年这座不到 500 米长的小岛上住了 5259 人，是当时世界上最挤的地方之一；1974 年煤矿关了，不到三个月全岛搬空。","fact_en":"In 1959 this island, less than 500 metres long, held 5,259 people — one of the most crowded places on Earth. The mine closed in January 1974 and the island was empty by April.","src":"Wikipedia：Hashima Island","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hashima_Island","say":{"en":"If the waves are too high, does the boat still go?","zh":"浪太大的话，船还开吗？"}},"镰仓大佛":{"what":"神奈川县镰仓高德院里一尊十几米高的青铜阿弥陀佛坐像。","what_en":"A bronze seated Amida Buddha over ten metres tall at Kotoku-in temple in Kamakura, Kanagawa.","fame":"七百多年前铸的，是日本最有名的露天大佛；花几十日元还能钻进佛像肚子里看铸造的接缝。","fame_en":"Cast more than 700 years ago, it is Japan's most famous open-air Buddha — and for a few dozen yen you can step inside and see the casting seams.","fact":"它原来是住在大殿里的。1498 年一场大地震引发海啸，把殿冲走了，从那以后大佛就一直坐在外面淋雨晒太阳。","fact_en":"It used to sit inside a great hall. In 1498 an earthquake's tsunami washed the hall away, and since then the Buddha has sat outdoors in the sun and rain.","src":"Wikipedia：Kōtoku-in","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C5%8Dtoku-in","say":{"en":"Can I go inside the Buddha today?","zh":"今天能进大佛里面看吗？"}},"阿姆利则金庙":{"what":"印度旁遮普邦阿姆利则的锡克教最神圣的寺庙，金色的殿立在一池水中央。","what_en":"The holiest shrine of Sikhism in Amritsar, Punjab — a golden temple standing in the middle of a pool.","fame":"四面都有门，表示对所有人敞开；不管什么宗教、什么身份，进去盖上头、光着脚，都可以坐下来。","fame_en":"It has doors on all four sides to show it is open to everyone. Whatever your religion, cover your head, take off your shoes and you are welcome to sit.","fact":"寺里的公共厨房（langar）24 小时不停，平均每天免费给大约 10 万人做饭，过节时更多；切菜、做饼、洗盘子的大多是志愿者。","fact_en":"Its community kitchen (langar) runs 24 hours a day and serves free meals to around 100,000 people on an average day, more on festivals; most of the chopping, roti-making and dish-washing is done by volunteers.","src":"Al Jazeera，2013","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/indepth/inpictures/2013/11/pictures-kitchen-feeds-100000-daily-20131117124238293396.html","say":{"en":"Where can I get a head scarf?","zh":"在哪儿可以拿一条包头的头巾？"}},"迈索尔宫":{"what":"印度卡纳塔克邦迈索尔城里的王宫，以前是迈索尔王国瓦迪亚尔家族住的地方。","what_en":"The royal palace of Mysore in Karnataka, India, once home to the Wadiyar kings of Mysore.","fame":"印度游客最多的景点之一；每年十月的十胜节（Dasara）大象游行就从这里出发。","fame_en":"One of India's most visited sights; every October the Dasara festival's elephant procession sets out from here.","fact":"十胜节（Navaratri）的九个晚上，王宫、城门和旁边的神庙会挂满大约 10 万个 15 瓦的老式灯泡，一起亮起来；平时周日晚上也会亮一会儿。","fact_en":"On each of the nine nights of the Dasara (Navaratri) festival, the palace, its gates and nearby temples light up with roughly 100,000 old-style 15-watt bulbs; they also come on for a while on Sunday evenings.","src":"Wikipedia：Mysore Palace","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mysore_Palace","say":{"en":"What time do the lights come on tonight?","zh":"今晚几点亮灯？"}},"查尔米纳塔":{"what":"印度海得拉巴老城中心的一座四塔方形拱门建筑，名字就是「四座尖塔」。","what_en":"A square arched monument with four minarets in the heart of old Hyderabad — its name means 'four minarets'.","fame":"海得拉巴的城市标志；脚下是卖手镯的拉德集市和卖海得拉巴比里亚尼、伊朗奶茶的老店。","fame_en":"The symbol of Hyderabad. At its feet are Laad Bazaar, famous for bangles, and old shops selling Hyderabadi biryani and Irani chai.","fact":"1591 年由古特卜·沙希王朝的国王修建，是新城海得拉巴的第一座建筑；常见的说法是为了纪念一场瘟疫结束，不过历史学家对此还有争论。","fact_en":"Built in 1591 by Muhammad Quli Qutb Shah as reportedly the first building of his new capital, Hyderabad. It is widely said to mark the end of a plague, though historians still debate that.","src":"Wikipedia：Charminar","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charminar","say":{"en":"How much for this set of bangles?","zh":"这一套手镯多少钱？"}},"米纳克希神庙":{"what":"印度泰米尔纳德邦马杜赖的一座印度教大神庙，供奉女神米纳克希和她的丈夫湿婆。","what_en":"A huge Hindu temple in Madurai, Tamil Nadu, dedicated to the goddess Meenakshi and her husband Shiva.","fame":"整座城是绕着神庙长出来的；每天都有上万人来拜，晚上还有把湿婆神像抬去女神寝宫的仪式。","fame_en":"The whole city grew up around it. Tens of thousands come every day, and each night Shiva's image is carried in procession to the goddess's chamber.","fact":"庙有 14 座彩色门塔，最高的南门塔约 52 米；塔上大约有 3 万 3 千尊彩绘神像，一层一层挤到顶。","fact_en":"It has 14 painted gateway towers; the tallest, the southern one, is about 52 metres. Roughly 33,000 painted figures crowd the towers layer upon layer.","src":"Wikipedia：Meenakshi Temple","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meenakshi_Temple","say":{"en":"Where do I leave my shoes?","zh":"鞋子放在哪儿？"}},"科纳克太阳神庙":{"what":"印度东海岸奥迪沙邦科纳克的一座 13 世纪太阳神庙，整座庙造成太阳神的战车。","what_en":"A 13th-century temple to the sun god at Konark, Odisha, on India's east coast — the whole temple is shaped like the sun god's chariot.","fame":"7 匹石马拉着 24 个雕满花纹的石轮；1984 年列入世界遗产，石雕跳舞的、打仗的、生活的都有。","fame_en":"Seven stone horses pull 24 intricately carved wheels. A World Heritage Site since 1984, its carvings show dancers, battles and everyday life.","fact":"其中两个石轮是日晷，看轴心的影子就能读出时间；2018 年起，印度 10 卢比新钞背面印的就是这个轮子。","fact_en":"Two of the wheels work as sundials — read the time from the axle's shadow. Since 2018 the wheel has been on the back of India's new 10-rupee note.","src":"Wikipedia：Konark Sun Temple","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Konark_Sun_Temple","say":{"en":"Can you show me how to read the time on the wheel?","zh":"你能教我怎么看轮子上的时间吗？"}},"菩提伽耶":{"what":"印度比哈尔邦的小城，传说佛陀在这里的菩提树下悟道。","what_en":"A small town in Bihar, India, where the Buddha is said to have attained enlightenment under the Bodhi tree.","fame":"全世界佛教徒最神圣的地方之一，大菩提寺 2002 年列入世界遗产；泰国、日本、不丹等国家都在这里盖了自己风格的寺院。","fame_en":"One of the holiest places for Buddhists worldwide; the Mahabodhi Temple became a World Heritage Site in 2002, and Thailand, Japan, Bhutan and others have built temples here in their own styles.","fact":"2013 年，泰国国王和泰国信众捐了约 289 公斤黄金，由泰国工匠贴在大菩提寺的塔顶上。","fact_en":"In 2013 Thailand's king and Thai devotees donated about 289 kg of gold, which Thai craftsmen applied to the top of the Mahabodhi Temple's spire.","src":"Gulf News，2013","url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/asia/india/thai-devotees-offer-300kg-gold-for-india-shrine-1.1255219","say":{"en":"Is it okay to sit and meditate under the tree?","zh":"可以在树下坐着冥想吗？"}},"卡久拉霍神庙":{"what":"印度中央邦卡久拉霍的一群千年前的印度教和耆那教神庙。","what_en":"A group of thousand-year-old Hindu and Jain temples at Khajuraho in Madhya Pradesh, India.","fame":"墙上的石雕又细又多，其中有一些大胆的爱情雕刻，让它在全世界出名；1986 年列入世界遗产。","fame_en":"Its walls are covered in fine carvings — including some frank erotic scenes that made it world-famous. A World Heritage Site since 1986.","fact":"当年这里有 85 座庙，现在只剩 25 座左右；而大家议论最多的爱情雕刻，其实只占全部雕像的一成不到——更多的是神、舞女、乐师和过日子的人。","fact_en":"There were once 85 temples; about 25 survive. And the famous erotic carvings are less than a tenth of the sculpture — far more show gods, dancers, musicians and daily life.","src":"Atlas Obscura","url":"https://www.atlasobscura.com/places/temples-of-kahurajo","say":{"en":"Is there a light show here in the evening?","zh":"这里晚上有灯光秀吗？"}},"西姆拉玩具火车":{"what":"从印度平原上的卡尔卡开到喜马拉雅山城西姆拉的窄轨小火车。","what_en":"A narrow-gauge mountain train from Kalka on the plains up to the Himalayan hill town of Shimla, India.","fame":"英国殖民时期为了让官员夏天上山避暑修的；96 公里慢慢爬五六个小时，一路钻山洞过石桥，2008 年列入世界遗产（印度山地铁路）。","fame_en":"Built in British colonial times so officials could escape the summer heat. It crawls 96 km in five to six hours through tunnels and over stone bridges; a World Heritage Site since 2008 as part of the Mountain Railways of India.","fact":"这么短的路上现在有 102 个隧道、八百多座桥；当初修的时候是 107 个隧道，后来有几个被山体滑坡毁了。","fact_en":"This short line now has 102 tunnels and over 800 bridges. It was built with 107 tunnels; several were later lost to landslides.","src":"UNESCO 申报文件","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/document/154654","say":{"en":"Which side has the better view, left or right?","zh":"坐哪边风景好，左边还是右边？"}},"德里红堡":{"what":"印度德里老城里用红砂岩修的莫卧儿皇宫城堡。","what_en":"The red sandstone fortress-palace of the Mughal emperors in Old Delhi, India.","fame":"17 世纪沙贾汗（就是修泰姬陵的那位）建的，是莫卧儿王朝两百年的皇宫，2007 年列入世界遗产。","fame_en":"Built in the 17th century by Shah Jahan — the emperor of the Taj Mahal — it was the Mughal palace for two centuries and became a World Heritage Site in 2007.","fact":"1947 年 8 月 15 日印度独立那天，尼赫鲁在红堡正门拉合尔门上升起国旗；从那以后每年独立日，总理都在这里升旗，再从城墙上对全国讲话。","fact_en":"On 15 August 1947, India's first independence day, Nehru raised the flag above the Lahori Gate. Ever since, every Independence Day the prime minister raises the flag here and addresses the nation from the ramparts.","src":"Wikipedia：Red Fort","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red_Fort","say":{"en":"Is the fort closed on Mondays?","zh":"红堡周一关门吗？"}},"本地治里法式小镇":{"what":"印度东南海边本地治里的老城区，以前是法国殖民地，黄墙白窗的房子沿海排开。","what_en":"The old quarter of Puducherry on India's southeast coast — a former French colony with yellow-walled houses along the sea.","fame":"街名还是法文（rue Suffren、rue Romain Rolland），有法式面包店和咖啡馆，法语在这里还能用上；1954 年才交还印度。","fame_en":"Street names are still French (rue Suffren, rue Romain Rolland), there are French bakeries and cafés, and French is still spoken. It only returned to India in 1954.","fact":"这里的警察到现在还戴法国式的红色高筒帽（kepi），全印度只有这里这样。","fact_en":"Local police still wear the red French-style kepi cap — the only police in India who do.","src":"Wikipedia：Puducherry Police","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puducherry_Police","say":{"en":"Do you have a croissant and a filter coffee?","zh":"有可颂和南印度滤泡咖啡吗？"}},"曼谷大皇宫":{"what":"泰国曼谷湄南河边的旧王宫，里面有供奉玉佛的玉佛寺。","what_en":"The old royal palace on the Chao Phraya river in Bangkok, with the Temple of the Emerald Buddha inside.","fame":"1782 年起是泰国国王住的地方，金色尖塔和彩色瓷片屋顶挤在一起；玉佛是泰国最神圣的佛像。","fame_en":"Home of Thailand's kings from 1782, packed with golden spires and roofs of coloured tiles. The Emerald Buddha is the country's most sacred image.","fact":"玉佛一年换三次「衣服」：热季、雨季、凉季各一套金衣，由泰国国王亲自来换。","fact_en":"The Emerald Buddha changes clothes three times a year — a gold costume for the hot, rainy and cool seasons — and the King of Thailand changes them himself.","src":"Nation Thailand","url":"https://www.nationthailand.com/thailand/general/40021893","say":{"en":"Are my shorts okay, or do I need to cover my knees?","zh":"我穿短裤可以吗，还是要遮住膝盖？"}},"会安古镇":{"what":"越南中部海边的老港口小镇，黄墙木屋和灯笼沿着秋盆河排开。","what_en":"An old port town on Vietnam's central coast, with yellow walls, wooden shophouses and lanterns along the Thu Bồn River.","fame":"四百年前日本、中国、荷兰商人都在这里做生意，老房子几乎原样保留，1999 年列入世界遗产；晚上放河灯、做裁缝定制衣服都很有名。","fame_en":"Four hundred years ago Japanese, Chinese and Dutch traders all did business here, and the old houses survive almost intact — a World Heritage Site since 1999. Floating lanterns and made-to-measure tailors are famous.","fact":"镇上那座日本廊桥印在越南 2 万盾纸币的背面；2024 年修好重开后，不少人嫌它「太新了」，在网上吵了一阵。","fact_en":"The town's Japanese Covered Bridge is on the back of Vietnam's 20,000-dong note. When it reopened after restoration in 2024, many people complained it looked 'too new'.","src":"Radio Free Asia，2024","url":"https://www.rfa.org/english/news/vietnam/hoi-an-covered-bridge-renovation-08022024094356.html","say":{"en":"How long does it take to make a dress here?","zh":"在这儿做一条裙子要几天？"}},"琅勃拉邦":{"what":"老挝北部湄公河和南康河交汇处的古都，满城寺庙和法式老房子。","what_en":"Laos's old royal capital where the Mekong meets the Nam Khan, full of temples and French colonial houses.","fame":"整座城 1995 年列入世界遗产；每天天刚亮，几百位穿橙袍的僧人赤脚走过街道，居民跪在路边布施糯米饭。","fame_en":"The whole town became a World Heritage Site in 1995. Every dawn hundreds of monks in orange robes walk barefoot through the streets while residents kneel to give sticky rice.","fact":"2021 年 12 月中老铁路通车后，从首都万象到这里坐火车只要两个小时左右，以前坐大巴要六七个小时山路。","fact_en":"Since the Laos–China Railway opened in December 2021, the train from Vientiane takes about two hours — the old mountain bus ride took six or seven.","src":"Traveller (Australia)","url":"https://www.traveller.com.au/luang-prabang-to-vientiane-by-train-new-railway-cuts-sixhour-journey-to-two-h29l9k","say":{"en":"Where can I buy sticky rice for the alms giving?","zh":"布施用的糯米饭在哪儿买？"}},"蒲甘万塔":{"what":"缅甸中部伊洛瓦底江边的古城，平原上散落着几千座佛塔和寺庙。","what_en":"An ancient city by the Irrawaddy in central Myanmar, its plain dotted with thousands of pagodas and temples.","fame":"11 到 13 世纪蒲甘王朝一口气修了上万座塔，现在还剩两三千座；日出时热气球飘过塔林，是缅甸最有名的画面。","fame_en":"The Bagan kingdom built over ten thousand pagodas between the 11th and 13th centuries; a few thousand remain. Hot-air balloons drifting over them at sunrise is Myanmar's best-known picture.","fact":"2016 年 8 月一场地震损坏了将近 400 座寺塔；三年后的 2019 年，蒲甘才终于列入世界遗产。","fact_en":"An earthquake in August 2016 damaged nearly 400 temples; three years later, in 2019, Bagan was finally inscribed as a World Heritage Site.","src":"Wikipedia：Bagan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bagan","say":{"en":"Which temple is good for watching the sunrise?","zh":"看日出去哪座塔好？"}},"滨海湾花园":{"what":"新加坡滨海湾填海地上的大花园，有发光的「超级树」和两个大玻璃温室。","what_en":"A huge garden on reclaimed land at Marina Bay, Singapore, with glowing 'Supertrees' and two giant glass conservatories.","fame":"2012 年开放；超级树有 25 到 50 米高，晚上有免费的灯光音乐秀；云雾林温室里有一面 30 多米高的室内瀑布。","fame_en":"Opened in 2012. The Supertrees stand 25–50 metres tall and host a free light-and-music show every night; the Cloud Forest dome has an indoor waterfall over 30 metres high.","fact":"「花穹」温室被吉尼斯世界纪录列为世界最大的玻璃温室，里面一根柱子都没有，常年保持地中海一样凉爽干燥的天气。","fact_en":"The Flower Dome is listed by Guinness World Records as the world's largest glass greenhouse — with no columns inside, kept cool and dry like the Mediterranean all year.","src":"Guinness World Records","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/113569-largest-glass-greenhouse","say":{"en":"What time is the Supertree light show tonight?","zh":"今晚超级树灯光秀几点开始？"}},"双子塔":{"what":"马来西亚吉隆坡市中心两栋一模一样、中间用天桥连起来的银色摩天大楼（国油双峰塔）。","what_en":"The Petronas Twin Towers — two identical silver skyscrapers joined by a skybridge in central Kuala Lumpur.","fame":"1998 到 2004 年是世界最高的大楼（452 米），现在仍是世界最高的双塔；外形用了伊斯兰的八角星图案。","fame_en":"The world's tallest buildings from 1998 to 2004 (452 m) and still the tallest twin towers. Their floor plan is based on an Islamic eight-pointed star.","fact":"两座塔是故意分给两家公司盖的：一号塔归日本的间组，二号塔归韩国三星，互相比赛——后开工的韩国队先封顶。","fact_en":"The towers were deliberately split between two builders: Tower 1 went to Japan's Hazama, Tower 2 to South Korea's Samsung, racing each other — and the Korean team, which started later, topped out first.","src":"Wikipedia：Petronas Towers","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Petronas_Towers","say":{"en":"Do I need to book the skybridge ticket in advance?","zh":"上天桥的票要提前订吗？"}},"婆罗浮屠":{"what":"印尼爪哇岛日惹附近的一座九世纪大佛塔，一层层往上像一座石头山。","what_en":"A ninth-century Buddhist monument near Yogyakarta in Java, Indonesia, rising in terraces like a stone mountain.","fame":"世界上最大的佛教建筑；墙上有两千多块浮雕，最上面有 72 座镂空小佛塔，每座里面坐着一尊佛。","fame_en":"The world's largest Buddhist monument, with more than 2,000 relief panels and 72 latticed stupas at the top, each with a Buddha inside.","fact":"为了保护石阶，现在爬上塔顶的人都要换上一种特制拖鞋「upanat」，用露兜树叶编成，样子照着墙上浮雕里的鞋做。","fact_en":"To protect the stone steps, everyone climbing to the top must now wear special 'upanat' sandals woven from pandan leaves, copied from shoes in the temple's own reliefs.","src":"Tempo，2022","url":"https://en.tempo.co/amp/1554560/upanat-sandals-special-footwear-to-visit-borobudur-temple","say":{"en":"Is the ticket to climb to the top sold separately?","zh":"上塔顶的票是另外买的吗？"}},"粉红城斋浦尔":{"what":"印度拉贾斯坦邦首府斋浦尔的老城，整片城墙和房子都刷成粉红色。","what_en":"The old walled city of Jaipur, capital of Rajasthan, where whole streets are painted pink.","fame":"18 世纪按棋盘格规划的城市，2019 年列入世界遗产；有风之宫殿、琥珀堡，还有卖手工印花布和宝石的老市场。","fame_en":"An 18th-century city planned on a grid and a World Heritage Site since 2019 — home to the Hawa Mahal, Amber Fort and old bazaars of block-print cloth and gems.","fact":"一般说 1876 年英国威尔士亲王来访，国王把城刷成了欢迎的粉色；第二年还立了规矩，老城的房子只能刷「斋浦尔粉」，到现在还有效。","fact_en":"The usual story is that the city was painted pink to welcome the Prince of Wales in 1876. A law the next year said old-city buildings must be 'Jaipur pink' — and it still applies.","src":"Mental Floss","url":"https://www.mentalfloss.com/article/542269/why-jaipurs-king-painted-his-city-pink-impress-prince-wales","say":{"en":"Is this block print done by hand?","zh":"这块印花布是手工印的吗？"}},"加德满都":{"what":"尼泊尔首都，喜马拉雅山脚下的谷地古城，满街是砖木寺庙和佛塔。","what_en":"Nepal's capital, an old city in a Himalayan valley crowded with brick-and-wood temples and stupas.","fame":"谷地里有七处世界遗产，杜巴广场的老王宫、猴庙和博达哈大佛塔都在城里；去珠峰徒步的人基本都从这里出发。","fame_en":"The valley holds seven World Heritage monument zones — Durbar Square's old palace, Swayambhu 'Monkey Temple' and Boudhanath stupa among them. Nearly every Everest trek starts here.","fact":"城名一般认为来自杜巴广场上一座木头亭子「卡斯塔曼达普」（意思是木亭）；它在 2015 年大地震中塌了，2021 年才用老办法重新盖好。","fact_en":"The city is commonly said to be named after Kasthamandap, a wooden pavilion on Durbar Square ('wooden shelter'). It collapsed in the 2015 earthquake and was rebuilt the traditional way in 2021.","src":"Nepali Times","url":"https://nepalitimes.com/resurrecting-kasthamandap-from-the-rubble","say":{"en":"How much is a taxi to Thamel?","zh":"打车到泰米尔区多少钱？"}},"狮子岩":{"what":"斯里兰卡中部平原上突然冒出来的一块两百米高巨岩，顶上有五世纪国王的宫殿遗址。","what_en":"A 200-metre rock rising suddenly from the plains of central Sri Lanka, topped by the ruins of a fifth-century king's palace.","fame":"爬到一半要从一对巨大的石刻狮爪中间穿过去；岩壁上还留着古代仕女壁画，1982 年列入世界遗产。","fame_en":"Halfway up you pass between a pair of giant carved lion's paws; frescoes of ancient women survive on the rock face. A World Heritage Site since 1982.","fact":"半山有一面以前磨得能照人的「镜墙」，八到十世纪的游客在上面刻了 685 首诗，大多是写给壁画上的美女的——一千多年前的「到此一游」。","fact_en":"Halfway up is a once-polished 'Mirror Wall' where visitors in the 8th–10th centuries scratched 685 poems, mostly addressed to the painted women — graffiti from over a thousand years ago.","src":"Wikipedia：Sigiriya","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sigiriya","say":{"en":"Is it better to start the climb early to avoid the heat?","zh":"是不是早点爬比较不热？"}},"悉尼海港大桥":{"what":"澳大利亚悉尼港上的一座钢拱大桥，跟悉尼歌剧院隔水相望。","what_en":"The steel arch bridge across Sydney Harbour, facing the Opera House across the water.","fame":"1932 年通车，悉尼人叫它「衣架」；可以走路、骑车过桥，也可以系安全绳爬到拱顶，跨年烟花就从桥上放。","fame_en":"Opened in 1932 and nicknamed 'the Coathanger'. You can walk or cycle across, or clip on a harness and climb the arch; New Year's Eve fireworks are fired from it.","fact":"演《鳄鱼邓迪》的保罗·霍根年轻时就是这座桥上的高空工人；1971 年工友们怂恿他去上电视选秀节目，他才走红。","fact_en":"Paul Hogan, star of Crocodile Dundee, was once a rigger on this bridge; in 1971 his workmates dared him to enter a TV talent show, and that was the start of his fame.","src":"Wikipedia：Paul Hogan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paul_Hogan","say":{"en":"Which side of the bridge is the walkway on?","zh":"人行道在桥的哪一边？"}},"堪培拉国会大厦":{"what":"澳大利亚首都堪培拉的国会大厦，造在一座小山里面，屋顶是草坡。","what_en":"Australia's Parliament House in Canberra, built into a hill with grass on its roof.","fame":"1988 年启用；意思是「人民在政府头顶上」。平时免费参观，开会的日子还能坐在旁听席上看议员辩论。","fame_en":"Opened in 1988, its grass roof symbolises the people standing above their government. Entry is free, and on sitting days you can watch debates from the gallery.","fact":"屋顶的旗杆高 81 米，是世界上最大的不锈钢结构之一；上面的国旗 24 小时飘着，差不多有一辆双层巴士的侧面那么大。","fact_en":"The flag mast on the roof is 81 metres tall, one of the largest stainless-steel structures in the world. The flag flies 24 hours a day and is about the size of the side of a double-decker bus.","src":"Parliamentary Education Office","url":"https://peo.gov.au/understand-our-parliament/parliament-house/parliament-house","say":{"en":"Can we watch Question Time today?","zh":"今天能去旁听质询时间吗？"}},"天空塔":{"what":"新西兰奥克兰市中心的一座 328 米高的观光电视塔。","what_en":"A 328-metre observation and broadcast tower in central Auckland, New Zealand.","fame":"1997 年建成；可以从 192 米高处系着钢索跳下来（SkyJump），也可以在外面一圈没有栏杆的走道上走；新年烟花从塔上放。","fame_en":"Completed in 1997. You can jump from 192 metres on a guide wire (SkyJump) or walk around a rail-less ledge outside, and New Year fireworks are launched from it.","fact":"从 1996 年封顶到 2022 年，它一直是南半球最高的独立建筑，直到被印尼雅加达的一栋新大楼超过。","fact_en":"From 1996 until 2022 it was the tallest freestanding structure in the Southern Hemisphere — until a new tower in Jakarta, Indonesia, overtook it.","src":"Wikipedia：Sky Tower (Auckland)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sky_Tower_(Auckland)","say":{"en":"Is the glass floor safe to stand on?","zh":"玻璃地板站上去安全吗？"}},"沙漠玫瑰博物馆":{"what":"卡塔尔多哈的国家博物馆，楼的样子像沙漠里长出来的「沙漠玫瑰」石头。","what_en":"The National Museum of Qatar in Doha, shaped like a 'desert rose' crystal.","fame":"法国建筑师让·努维尔设计，一片片弯弯的大圆盘互相插在一起；里面讲卡塔尔从采珍珠、游牧到石油的故事。","fame_en":"Designed by French architect Jean Nouvel as a cluster of huge curved discs slotted into each other; inside it tells Qatar's story from pearl-diving and desert life to oil.","fact":"2019 年 3 月开馆。这座新楼把一座 20 世纪初的老王宫整个围在中间——那是当年埃米尔住过的宫殿，也是原来的博物馆。","fact_en":"It opened in March 2019, wrapped around an early-20th-century palace — the old residence of the emir, which used to be the museum itself.","src":"Wikipedia：National Museum of Qatar","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Museum_of_Qatar","say":{"en":"Is there a free shuttle from the metro station?","zh":"地铁站有免费接驳车吗？"}},"耶路撒冷老城":{"what":"耶路撒冷城墙里的老城，不到一平方公里，分成穆斯林区、基督教区、犹太区和亚美尼亚区。","what_en":"The walled Old City of Jerusalem — under one square kilometre, divided into Muslim, Christian, Jewish and Armenian quarters.","fame":"犹太教、基督教、伊斯兰教都把它当圣地：西墙、圣墓教堂、圆顶清真寺都在这几条窄巷里。","fame_en":"Holy to Jews, Christians and Muslims alike: the Western Wall, the Church of the Holy Sepulchre and the Dome of the Rock are all within its narrow lanes.","fact":"老城和城墙 1981 年列入世界遗产，第二年就进了「濒危名单」，到现在还没出来。","fact_en":"The Old City and its walls were inscribed as a World Heritage Site in 1981 and put on the 'in Danger' list the following year — where they still are.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产中心","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/148","say":{"en":"Which gate is closest to the Christian Quarter?","zh":"离基督教区最近的是哪个门？"}},"波斯波利斯":{"what":"伊朗设拉子附近的古波斯帝国都城遗址，大流士一世在两千五百年前开始修建。","what_en":"The ruins of the ancient Persian imperial capital near Shiraz, Iran, begun by Darius I some 2,500 years ago.","fame":"台阶上刻着各国使节排队来送礼的浮雕；公元前 330 年被亚历山大大帝一把火烧了，1979 年列入世界遗产。","fame_en":"Its staircases are carved with envoys from every nation bringing gifts. Alexander the Great burned it in 330 BC; it became a World Heritage Site in 1979.","fact":"「万国之门」的石头上有很多近代游客刻的字，其中一个是 1870 年《纽约先驱报》记者斯坦利刻下的名字和报名——就是后来在非洲找到利文斯通的那个人。","fact_en":"The Gate of All Nations is covered in modern travellers' graffiti, including 'Stanley, New York Herald, 1870' — carved by the reporter who later found Livingstone in Africa.","src":"Atlas Obscura","url":"https://www.atlasobscura.com/places/grafitti-at-persepolis","say":{"en":"Is there shade anywhere, or should I bring a hat?","zh":"那里有阴凉吗，还是要带帽子？"}},"狮身人面像":{"what":"埃及吉萨金字塔旁边一座用整块岩石雕成的狮身人头像。","what_en":"The lion-bodied, human-headed statue carved from the bedrock beside the pyramids at Giza, Egypt.","fame":"四千五百年前雕的，是世界上最大的整石雕像之一；几乎每张金字塔的照片里都有它。","fame_en":"Carved around 4,500 years ago, it is one of the largest monolithic statues in the world and appears in nearly every photo of the pyramids.","fact":"常听说鼻子是拿破仑的士兵用大炮打掉的，其实不对：1738 年丹麦人诺登画的素描里它已经没有鼻子了，那是拿破仑到埃及之前 60 年。","fact_en":"You often hear Napoleon's soldiers shot its nose off. Not true: sketches by the Dane Frederic Norden in 1738 already show it noseless — 60 years before Napoleon reached Egypt.","src":"History Hit","url":"https://www.historyhit.com/who-broke-the-giant-sphinxs-nose/","say":{"en":"Where's the best spot for a photo with the Sphinx and a pyramid?","zh":"在哪儿能把狮身人面像和金字塔拍在一起？"}},"阿布辛贝神庙":{"what":"埃及南部纳赛尔湖边的两座在山崖里凿出来的神庙，门口坐着四尊 20 米高的拉美西斯二世像。","what_en":"Two temples cut into a cliff beside Lake Nasser in southern Egypt, guarded by four 20-metre statues of Ramesses II.","fame":"三千多年前拉美西斯二世修的；每年 2 月 22 日和 10 月 22 日前后，太阳会照进神庙最深处，照亮里面的神像。","fame_en":"Built by Ramesses II over 3,000 years ago. Around 22 February and 22 October each year the sunrise reaches the innermost sanctuary and lights up the statues there.","fact":"1960 年代修阿斯旺大坝，神庙要被淹掉，于是被切成大块，整个往内陆搬了 208 米、往上抬了 65 米，再照原来的方向拼回去——太阳照样能照进来。","fact_en":"In the 1960s the Aswan High Dam would have drowned it, so the temples were cut into huge blocks and moved 208 m inland and 65 m higher, then rebuilt facing the same way — so the sun still reaches inside.","src":"Wikipedia：Abu Simbel","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abu_Simbel","say":{"en":"What time does the bus leave Aswan in the morning?","zh":"早上从阿斯旺出发的车几点走？"}},"拉利贝拉岩石教堂":{"what":"埃塞俄比亚北部高原小镇拉利贝拉的 11 座教堂，每一座都是从地面往下、在整块岩石里凿出来的。","what_en":"Eleven churches in the highland town of Lalibela, northern Ethiopia — each carved downward out of solid rock.","fame":"八百多年前拉利贝拉国王想在这里造一座「新耶路撒冷」；十字形的圣乔治教堂从上往下看就是一个嵌在地里的大十字。现在仍是天天做礼拜的教堂。","fame_en":"Over 800 years ago King Lalibela set out to build a 'New Jerusalem' here. Cross-shaped St George's looks, from above, like a giant cross sunk into the ground. They are still working churches, with services every day.","fact":"1978 年联合国教科文组织公布的第一批 12 处世界遗产里，就有拉利贝拉岩石教堂。","fact_en":"The rock-hewn churches were among the very first 12 sites on UNESCO's World Heritage List in 1978.","src":"Wikipedia：Rock-Hewn Churches, Lalibela","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rock-Hewn_Churches,_Lalibela","say":{"en":"Do I have to take off my shoes in every church?","zh":"每座教堂都要脱鞋吗？"}},"杰内泥土清真寺":{"what":"西非马里杰内城里一座用泥砖和泥浆建的大清真寺，墙上插满木桩。","what_en":"The Great Mosque of Djenné in Mali, West Africa, built of mud brick and plaster, its walls bristling with wooden poles.","fame":"常被叫作世界上最大的泥砖建筑，是萨赫勒泥土建筑最有名的样子；杰内老城 1988 年列入世界遗产。","fame_en":"Often called the largest mud-brick building in the world and the best-known example of Sahel earthen architecture; Djenné's old town became a World Heritage Site in 1988.","fact":"泥墙怕雨，所以每年全城的人一起过节，给它重新抹一层泥；墙上那些伸出来 60 厘米的棕榈木桩，就是现成的脚手架。","fact_en":"Mud walls fear rain, so every year the whole town holds a festival to re-plaster it. The palm-wood sticks poking 60 cm out of the walls are ready-made scaffolding for the job.","src":"Wikipedia：Great Mosque of Djenné","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Mosque_of_Djenn%C3%A9","say":{"en":"When is the replastering festival this year?","zh":"今年的抹泥节是哪天？"}},"帝王谷":{"what":"埃及卢克索尼罗河西岸的一条山谷，古埃及新王国的法老都葬在这里。","what_en":"A valley on the west bank of the Nile at Luxor, Egypt, where the pharaohs of the New Kingdom were buried.","fame":"山里凿了六十多座墓，墙上画满彩色象形文字；1922 年霍华德·卡特在这里找到了几乎没被盗过的图坦卡蒙墓。","fame_en":"More than sixty tombs are cut into the hills, their walls covered in painted hieroglyphs. In 1922 Howard Carter found Tutankhamun's almost untouched tomb here.","fact":"图坦卡蒙的宝贝都运去了开罗，但他本人的木乃伊一直留在帝王谷的墓里；2007 年起躺在一个控温控湿的玻璃柜里，买票就能看到他的脸。","fact_en":"Tutankhamun's treasures went to Cairo, but his mummy never left his tomb. Since 2007 it has lain in a climate-controlled glass case — buy a ticket and you can see his face.","src":"Wikipedia：Tutankhamun's mummy","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tutankhamun%27s_mummy","say":{"en":"Is Tutankhamun's tomb included in the general ticket?","zh":"图坦卡蒙墓包含在普通门票里吗？"}},"哈桑二世清真寺":{"what":"摩洛哥卡萨布兰卡海边的大清真寺，一半建在大西洋的海面上。","what_en":"The great mosque on the seafront of Casablanca, Morocco, half built out over the Atlantic.","fame":"1993 年建成，能容纳十万人一起礼拜；是摩洛哥少数允许非穆斯林跟着导览进去参观的清真寺。","fame_en":"Completed in 1993, it can hold 100,000 worshippers, and it is one of the few mosques in Morocco that non-Muslims can enter on guided tours.","fact":"它的宣礼塔高 210 米，当了二十多年世界最高；2019 年被阿尔及尔大清真寺 265 米的塔超过，现在排第二。","fact_en":"Its 210-metre minaret was the world's tallest for over two decades, until the 265-metre minaret of the Great Mosque of Algiers overtook it in 2019. Now it is second.","src":"Wikipedia：List of tallest minarets","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_tallest_minarets","say":{"en":"What time is the next guided tour in English?","zh":"下一场英语导览几点？"}},"阿伊特本哈杜":{"what":"摩洛哥瓦尔扎扎特附近山坡上的一座泥土堡寨村落（ksar），在撒哈拉商路上。","what_en":"A fortified earthen village (ksar) on a hillside near Ouarzazate, Morocco, on the old Saharan caravan route.","fame":"红土墙和塔楼一层层叠上山顶，1987 年列入世界遗产；《角斗士》《权力的游戏》都在这里拍过。","fame_en":"Red-earth walls and towers stack up to the hilltop; a World Heritage Site since 1987, it has appeared in Gladiator and Game of Thrones.","fact":"老寨子里现在只剩几户人家住，大部分人搬到了河对面的新村；2011 年修了一座步行桥，希望有人搬回来。","fact_en":"Only a few families still live inside the old ksar; most people moved to the new village across the river. A footbridge was built in 2011, partly in the hope that some would move back.","src":"Wikipedia：Aït Benhaddou","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A%C3%AFt_Benhaddou","say":{"en":"Can we cross the river on foot, or do we need the bridge?","zh":"能直接走过河吗，还是要走桥？"}},"马约尔花园":{"what":"摩洛哥马拉喀什新城的一座花园，墙和房子刷成很亮的钴蓝色。","what_en":"A garden in Marrakech's new town, Morocco, with walls and buildings painted an intense cobalt blue.","fame":"法国画家马约尔从 1920 年代开始种了四十年，那种蓝后来就叫「马约尔蓝」；仙人掌、竹子和水池挤在一起，是马拉喀什人最多的花园。","fame_en":"French painter Jacques Majorelle planted it over four decades from the 1920s; the blue became known as 'Majorelle blue'. Cacti, bamboo and pools crowd together in Marrakech's busiest garden.","fact":"1980 年它快要被拆掉盖房子，设计师伊夫·圣罗兰和伴侣皮埃尔·贝尔热把它买了下来；2008 年圣罗兰去世，骨灰就撒在这座花园里。","fact_en":"In 1980, when it was about to be bulldozed for housing, designer Yves Saint Laurent and his partner Pierre Bergé bought it. When Saint Laurent died in 2008, his ashes were scattered in the garden.","src":"Wikipedia：Majorelle Garden","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Majorelle_Garden","say":{"en":"Do I have to book a time slot online?","zh":"要在网上预约时间段吗？"}},"阿克苏姆方尖碑":{"what":"埃塞俄比亚北部古城阿克苏姆一片一千七百年前的高大石碑，用整块花岗岩雕成。","what_en":"A field of 1,700-year-old towering stelae in Aksum, northern Ethiopia, each carved from a single block of granite.","fame":"阿克苏姆王国当年是跟罗马、波斯齐名的大国；石碑上雕着门窗，像一栋栋石头楼，1980 年列入世界遗产。","fame_en":"The Aksumite kingdom was once ranked alongside Rome and Persia. The stelae are carved with doors and windows like stone tower blocks; a World Heritage Site since 1980.","fact":"其中一座 24 米高的石碑 1937 年被墨索里尼的军队运到罗马立了 68 年；2005 年意大利把它切成三段，用安-124 运输机飞回来，2008 年在原地重新立起。","fact_en":"One 24-metre stele was taken to Rome by Mussolini's troops in 1937 and stood there for 68 years. In 2005 Italy cut it into three pieces and flew it back by Antonov; it was re-erected on its original spot in 2008.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产中心","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/news/456","say":{"en":"Which one is the obelisk that came back from Rome?","zh":"哪一座是从罗马运回来的那座？"}},"贡德尔城堡":{"what":"埃塞俄比亚北部贡德尔城里的一片 17 世纪石头城堡和宫殿群（法西尔城堡）。","what_en":"Fasil Ghebbi, a compound of 17th-century stone castles and palaces in Gondar, northern Ethiopia.","fame":"法西利达斯皇帝在这里定都，城堡有塔楼和城垛，被叫作「非洲的卡美洛」；1979 年列入世界遗产。","fame_en":"Emperor Fasilides made Gondar his capital; with towers and battlements it is nicknamed 'the Camelot of Africa'. A World Heritage Site since 1979.","fact":"城外的法西利达斯浴池平时是空的，每年一月主显节（Timkat）才从河里引水灌满，信徒们跳进去重温耶稣受洗，第二天再把水放掉。","fact_en":"Fasilides' Bath outside town is normally empty. Each January, for Timkat (Epiphany), it is filled from the river and believers jump in to re-enact Christ's baptism; then it is drained again.","src":"CNN Travel","url":"https://edition.cnn.com/travel/article/ethiopia-timket-holy-water","say":{"en":"Is the bath open to visitors during Timkat?","zh":"主显节的时候游客能进浴池那边吗？"}},"拉穆古城":{"what":"肯尼亚北部海岸拉穆岛上的斯瓦希里老城，窄巷、珊瑚石房子和木雕大门。","what_en":"A Swahili old town on Lamu Island off Kenya's north coast — narrow lanes, coral-stone houses and carved wooden doors.","fame":"东非保存最好的斯瓦希里城镇，七百多年一直有人住，2001 年列入世界遗产；人们坐传统的三角帆船（dhow）出海。","fame_en":"The best-preserved Swahili town in East Africa, lived in continuously for over 700 years and a World Heritage Site since 2001. People still sail traditional dhows.","fact":"老城没有汽车，运货、驮人靠的是驴，岛上大约有三千头；1987 年英国的驴保护组织还在这里开了一家免费给驴看病的诊所。","fact_en":"The island has no motor vehicles — goods and people go by donkey, and there are about 3,000 of them. In 1987 a British donkey charity even opened a sanctuary here that treats donkeys for free.","src":"Wikipedia：Lamu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lamu","say":{"en":"How much is a dhow trip at sunset?","zh":"傍晚坐三角帆船出海多少钱？"}},"桑给巴尔石头城":{"what":"坦桑尼亚桑给巴尔岛上的老城，阿拉伯、波斯、印度和非洲风格的石头房子挤在一起。","what_en":"The old town of Zanzibar, Tanzania, where Arab, Persian, Indian and African stone houses crowd together.","fame":"几百年来是印度洋上香料和奴隶贸易的中心，2000 年列入世界遗产；家家门口有雕花大木门，晚上福罗达尼花园有海边夜市。","fame_en":"For centuries the hub of Indian Ocean trade in spices — and enslaved people. A World Heritage Site since 2000, it is famous for carved wooden doors and the seafront night market in Forodhani Gardens.","fact":"城里最有名的老建筑「奇迹宫」是东非第一栋装电灯和电梯的房子；2020 年圣诞节修复期间塌了一大块，两名工人遇难。","fact_en":"Its most famous building, the House of Wonders, was the first in East Africa with electric light and a lift. On Christmas Day 2020, during restoration, a large part collapsed, killing two workers.","src":"Global Voices，2020","url":"https://globalvoices.org/2020/12/28/iconic-house-of-wonders-collapse-leaves-zanzibaris-wondering-about-fate-of-cultural-heritage/","say":{"en":"Is the night market at Forodhani open every evening?","zh":"福罗达尼夜市每天晚上都开吗？"}},"彩虹房子":{"what":"南非开普敦信号山脚下的老街区波卡普（Bo-Kaap），一排排房子刷成粉、黄、绿、蓝。","what_en":"Bo-Kaap, the old quarter at the foot of Signal Hill in Cape Town, where rows of houses are painted pink, yellow, green and blue.","fame":"这里是开普马来人的老家，祖先很多是当年从东南亚被带来的奴隶和工匠；有开普最老的清真寺，还有马来咖喱和甜甜圈 koeksister。","fame_en":"The historic home of the Cape Malay community, many descended from enslaved people and artisans brought from Southeast Asia. It has the oldest mosque in South Africa, Cape Malay curry and spiced koeksisters.","fact":"拍照的人越来越多，房价涨得太快，老住户住不起了；2019 年开普敦市把这里划成文物保护区，约 600 栋房子盖新楼要先过审。","fact_en":"With more and more visitors and soaring prices, long-time residents were being priced out. In 2019 Cape Town made it a heritage protection zone, so changes to its roughly 600 homes need extra approval.","src":"Tourism Update，2019","url":"https://www.tourismupdate.com/article/w-capes-bo-kaap-gets-go-ahead-for-inclusion-in-heritage-protection-zone","say":{"en":"Is it okay to take a photo of your house?","zh":"可以拍一下你家的房子吗？"}},"罗本岛":{"what":"南非开普敦外海的一座小岛，种族隔离时期关押政治犯的监狱。","what_en":"A small island off Cape Town, South Africa, used as a prison for political prisoners under apartheid.","fame":"曼德拉在这里关了 27 年里的 18 年；1999 年列入世界遗产，现在是博物馆，从曼德拉门码头坐船过去。","fame_en":"Nelson Mandela spent 18 of his 27 prison years here. A World Heritage Site since 1999, it is now a museum reached by ferry from the Nelson Mandela Gateway.","fact":"带你参观监狱的讲解员，很多就是当年关在这里的政治犯；他们年纪越来越大，博物馆现在正在把他们的故事一个个录下来保存。","fact_en":"Many of the guides who show you the prison were themselves political prisoners here. As they grow older, the museum is now recording each of their stories.","src":"Tourism Update","url":"https://www.tourismupdate.com/article/robben-island-museum-reassesses-guiding-service","say":{"en":"Will the boat still go if it's windy?","zh":"风大的话船还开吗？"}},"女王宫":{"what":"马达加斯加首都塔那那利佛最高的山顶上的王宫建筑群（Rova），以前是梅里纳王国的王宫。","what_en":"The Rova of Antananarivo, the royal compound on the highest hill of Madagascar's capital, once home to the Merina monarchs.","fame":"从城里哪儿抬头都能看到它；19 世纪拉娜瓦洛娜女王住过，所以当地人叫它「女王宫」。","fame_en":"You can see it from almost anywhere in the city. Queen Ranavalona lived there in the 19th century, so locals call it the Queen's Palace.","fact":"1995 年 11 月 6 日一场大火把宫里的木头全烧光了，只剩石头外壳；之后一点点修了三十年，到 2025 年底才全部修完。","fact_en":"On 6 November 1995 a fire burned away all the wood inside, leaving only the stone shell. Restoration went on for three decades and was only completed at the end of 2025.","src":"Wikipedia：Rova of Antananarivo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rova_of_Antananarivo","say":{"en":"How long does it take to walk up from the city centre?","zh":"从市中心走上去要多久？"}},"奥孙神林":{"what":"尼日利亚奥孙州奥绍博城外一片原始森林，是约鲁巴人河流女神奥孙的圣林。","what_en":"A primeval forest outside Osogbo, Osun State, Nigeria — the sacred grove of Osun, the Yoruba river goddess.","fame":"林子里有神殿、雕像和奥孙河；每年八月奥孙节，几万人从王宫游行到河边祈福，2005 年列入世界遗产。","fame_en":"The grove holds shrines, sculptures and the Osun River. Each August tens of thousands join the Osun-Osogbo festival procession from the palace to the river; a World Heritage Site since 2005.","fact":"保住这片林子的是一位奥地利女艺术家苏珊娜·温格：1950 年代她来到这里，成了约鲁巴女祭司，跟当地艺术家一起做雕塑、挡开砍树的人，2009 年去世后就葬在林中。","fact_en":"It was saved largely by an Austrian artist, Susanne Wenger. She arrived in the 1950s, became a Yoruba priestess, made sculptures with local artists and kept loggers out; she died in 2009 and is buried in the grove.","src":"Wikipedia：Osun-Osogbo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osun-Osogbo","say":{"en":"What day is the main procession this year?","zh":"今年的大游行是哪一天？"}},"海岸角城堡":{"what":"加纳海岸角海边的一座白色城堡，跨大西洋奴隶贸易时期关押被贩卖的非洲人的地方。","what_en":"A white fort on the shore at Cape Coast, Ghana, where enslaved Africans were held during the transatlantic slave trade.","fame":"地牢里曾挤着上千人等船；通往海边的那扇门叫「不归门」，1979 年列入世界遗产。很多非洲裔美国人来这里寻根。","fame_en":"Its dungeons once held hundreds of people at a time waiting for ships; the door to the sea is called the 'Door of No Return'. A World Heritage Site since 1979, it draws many African Americans tracing their roots.","fact":"2009 年 7 月奥巴马一家来参观，走过了「不归门」；奥巴马说，非洲裔美国人的历史就是从这扇门开始的。","fact_en":"In July 2009 the Obama family visited and walked through the Door of No Return; Obama said the African-American story begins at that door.","src":"CNN 访谈文字稿，2009","url":"https://transcripts.cnn.com/show/acd/date/2009-07-14/segment/01","say":{"en":"Is the guided tour included in the ticket?","zh":"门票里包含导览吗？"}},"独立广场":{"what":"加纳首都阿克拉海边的大广场（黑星广场），有独立拱门和黑星门。","what_en":"Black Star Square (Independence Square) on the seafront of Accra, Ghana, with the Independence Arch and the Black Star Gate.","fame":"纪念 1957 年加纳成为撒哈拉以南第一个独立的非洲殖民地；每年 3 月 6 日独立日阅兵就在这里，看台能坐 3 万人。","fame_en":"It celebrates Ghana's independence in 1957, the first in sub-Saharan Africa. The Independence Day parade is held here every 6 March, and the stands seat 30,000.","fact":"广场在 1961 年赶着英国女王伊丽莎白二世访问加纳时完工——那次访问的目的之一，是劝恩克鲁玛别让加纳退出英联邦。","fact_en":"The square was finished in 1961 just in time for Queen Elizabeth II's visit — a trip partly meant to persuade Nkrumah to keep Ghana in the Commonwealth.","src":"Wikipedia：Black Star Square","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Star_Square","say":{"en":"Are we allowed to walk up to the Black Star Gate?","zh":"可以走到黑星门跟前吗？"}},"大津巴布韦遗址":{"what":"津巴布韦东南部一座 11 到 15 世纪的石头古城，没用任何灰浆，石块一块块干垒起来。","what_en":"An 11th–15th-century stone city in southeastern Zimbabwe, its walls built from stones fitted together without any mortar.","fame":"撒哈拉以南最大的古代石头建筑，大围场的墙有 11 米高；曾经是跟印度洋做黄金生意的王国都城，1986 年列入世界遗产。","fame_en":"The largest ancient stone structure south of the Sahara; the Great Enclosure's wall is 11 metres high. It was the capital of a kingdom that traded gold across the Indian Ocean — a World Heritage Site since 1986.","fact":"国家的名字就来自它：名字里的 dzimba 是绍纳语的「房子」，一般解释成「石头房子」；国旗上那只鸟，就是在这里找到的皂石鸟雕。","fact_en":"The country is named after it — the name contains dzimba, Shona for 'houses', usually explained as 'houses of stone' — and the bird on the national flag is one of the soapstone birds found here.","src":"Wikipedia：Great Zimbabwe","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Zimbabwe","say":{"en":"Where can I see the original soapstone birds?","zh":"原来的皂石鸟在哪儿能看到？"}},"辛特拉佩纳宫":{"what":"辛特拉山顶上一座红黄两色的城堡，像童话书里走出来的。","what_en":"A red-and-yellow palace on a hilltop in Sintra that looks like it walked out of a fairy-tale book.","fame":"19 世纪国王费尔南多二世把山上的旧修道院改成了夏宫，把哥特、摩尔、文艺复兴的样子全混在一起；整个辛特拉文化景观 1995 年进了世界遗产，从里斯本坐火车 40 分钟就到。","fame_en":"In the 19th century King Ferdinand II turned an old hilltop monastery into a summer palace, mixing Gothic, Moorish and Renaissance styles; the Sintra cultural landscape became a World Heritage Site in 1995, and it's just 40 minutes by train from Lisbon.","fact":"它的颜色是「找回来」的：几十年里外墙褪成了灰色，辛特拉人都看惯了；1994 年前后修复时才把原来的红色和黄色刷回去，当时不少本地人还被吓了一跳。","fact_en":"Its colours were 'rediscovered': for decades the walls had faded to grey and locals were used to it; when restorers repainted the original red and yellow in the mid-1990s, many people in Sintra were shocked.","src":"Wikipedia · Pena Palace","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pena_Palace","say":{"en":"Is there a shuttle bus up to the palace from the station?","zh":"从车站有上山去宫殿的接驳车吗？"}},"布鲁日运河":{"what":"比利时布鲁日老城里一圈一圈的小运河，两边是砖墙老房子和石桥。","what_en":"The little canals looping through the old town of Bruges, lined with brick houses and stone bridges.","fame":"中世纪布鲁日靠这些水道做羊毛和布的生意，是北欧最富的城市之一；后来港口淤塞、城市睡了几百年，老样子反而原封不动地留下来，被叫作「北方威尼斯」。","fame_en":"In the Middle Ages Bruges grew rich on wool and cloth shipped along these waterways; when the harbour silted up the city 'fell asleep' for centuries, which is exactly why its old look survived — the 'Venice of the North'.","fact":"运河底下还藏着一条「啤酒管道」：2016 年，老城里的 De Halve Maan 酒厂铺了一条约 3.2 公里长的地下管子，把啤酒直接送到城外的装瓶厂，省得大卡车挤老街；一部分钱是众筹来的，出钱的人拿啤酒当回报。","fact_en":"There's a 'beer pipeline' under the old town: in 2016 the De Halve Maan brewery laid a roughly 3.2 km underground pipe to send beer straight to its bottling plant outside the city, keeping tankers off the cobbled streets — partly crowdfunded, with backers paid in beer.","src":"Wikipedia · De Halve Maan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/De_Halve_Maan","say":{"en":"Where do the canal boats leave from, and how long is the tour?","zh":"运河游船在哪儿上船？坐一圈要多久？"}},"冰旅馆":{"what":"瑞典北极圈里的一座旅馆，墙、床、灯全是冰和雪做的。","what_en":"A hotel above the Arctic Circle in Sweden where the walls, beds and lamps are all made of ice and snow.","fame":"1989 年开始，每年冬天用旁边托尔讷河的冰重新盖一次，每间房请不同的艺术家来雕；春天一到就化回河里。睡觉时房间零下五度，裹着睡袋躺在驯鹿皮上。","fame_en":"Since 1989 it has been rebuilt every winter from ice cut out of the Torne River next door, with artists carving each room; in spring it melts back into the river. Rooms stay around -5°C — you sleep in a thermal bag on reindeer skins.","fact":"现在夏天也能住冰房了：2016 年 11 月开了常年开放的 ICEHOTEL 365，夏天用太阳能板带动制冷，把里面一直保持在零下五度左右——北极圈的夏天太阳几乎不落山，正好用来「发冷」。","fact_en":"You can now sleep in ice in summer too: ICEHOTEL 365 opened in November 2016 and stays open all year, cooled by solar panels that keep it around -5°C — handy, since the Arctic summer sun barely sets.","src":"IIR · Permanent ice hotel thanks to solar cooling","url":"https://iifiir.org/en/news/permanent-ice-hotel-thanks-to-solar-cooling","say":{"en":"How cold is the room at night, and where do we keep our bags?","zh":"晚上房间多冷？行李放哪儿？"}},"哥本哈根新港":{"what":"哥本哈根一条短短的运河港，两岸是红黄蓝绿的老房子和停着的木帆船。","what_en":"A short canal harbour in Copenhagen lined with red, yellow and blue old houses and moored wooden sailing boats.","fame":"17 世纪挖出来让船开进城里卸货，以前是水手喝酒的地方；现在是哥本哈根明信片上最常见的一幕，夏天人们坐在岸边喝啤酒晒太阳。","fame_en":"Dug in the 17th century to bring ships into the city, it was once a rowdy sailors' quarter; now it's Copenhagen's postcard shot, where people sit on the quay with a beer in the summer sun.","fact":"安徒生在新港前后住过三栋房子：20 号、67 号和 18 号。他的第一批童话，包括《打火匣》，就是住在 20 号的时候写的。","fact_en":"Hans Christian Andersen lived in three houses on Nyhavn — Nos. 20, 67 and 18 — and wrote his first fairy tales, including 'The Tinderbox', while living at No. 20.","src":"Wikipedia · Nyhavn 20","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nyhavn_20","say":{"en":"Can we just sit on the quay, or do we have to order something here?","zh":"我们可以直接坐在岸边吗，还是在这儿得点东西？"}},"特洛伊木马":{"what":"土耳其恰纳卡莱海边的一匹巨大木马，就是《荷马史诗》里藏兵进城的那匹。","what_en":"A giant wooden horse on the seafront of Çanakkale, Turkey — the one from Homer's story about soldiers hidden inside.","fame":"希腊人假装撤退，留下一匹木马，特洛伊人把它拖进城，晚上藏在里面的士兵爬出来开了城门。真实的特洛伊古城遗址就在恰纳卡莱南边 30 公里，是世界遗产。","fame_en":"The Greeks pretended to sail away and left a wooden horse; the Trojans dragged it inside, and that night the soldiers hidden in it opened the gates. The real ruins of Troy, a World Heritage Site, are about 30 km south of Çanakkale.","fact":"城里海边这匹木马其实是电影道具：它是 2004 年布拉德·皮特主演的电影《特洛伊》里用的那匹，拍完后华纳兄弟在 2004 年 11 月送给了恰纳卡莱。古城遗址那边另有一匹可以爬进去的木马。","fact_en":"The horse on the town's seafront is a film prop: it starred in the 2004 Brad Pitt film 'Troy', and Warner Bros. gave it to Çanakkale in November 2004. The ancient site has a different horse you can climb inside.","src":"Guinness World Records · Largest land-based prop","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/69777-largest-land-based-prop","say":{"en":"Is this the horse from the film, or the one at the ancient site?","zh":"这是电影里那匹，还是古城那边那匹？"}},"卢瓦尔河城堡":{"what":"法国卢瓦尔河谷两岸几十座文艺复兴时期的城堡，香波堡、舍农索堡最有名。","what_en":"Dozens of Renaissance châteaux along France's Loire Valley — Chambord and Chenonceau are the best known.","fame":"16 世纪法国国王和贵族喜欢住在这里打猎，城堡一座比一座气派；整个河谷 2000 年进了世界遗产，现在很多人骑自行车一座一座地逛。","fame_en":"In the 16th century French kings and nobles came here to hunt and built ever grander castles; the valley became a World Heritage Site in 2000, and many visitors now cycle from one château to the next.","fact":"香波堡中间有一座「双螺旋楼梯」：两道楼梯缠在一起，一个人上楼、一个人下楼，能互相看见却碰不到面。很多人认为达·芬奇影响了它的设计——他晚年就住在附近的昂布瓦斯，1519 年去世，正是香波堡开工那一年。","fact_en":"Chambord has an open double-spiral staircase: two flights twist around each other, so one person going up and another coming down can see each other but never meet. Leonardo da Vinci, who lived nearby in Amboise and died in 1519 — the year work on Chambord began — may have influenced the design.","src":"Wikipedia · Château de Chambord","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ch%C3%A2teau_de_Chambord","say":{"en":"Can I rent a bike here and ride to the next château?","zh":"我能在这儿租辆自行车，骑到下一座城堡吗？"}},"许愿池":{"what":"罗马城中心的特雷维喷泉，海神站在中间，水哗哗地流进大池子里。","what_en":"Rome's Trevi Fountain, with Neptune in the middle and water pouring into a huge basin.","fame":"1762 年完工，是罗马最大的巴洛克喷泉；电影《罗马假日》《甜蜜的生活》都在这儿拍过。传说背对喷泉、右手从左肩扔一枚硬币，就一定会再回罗马。","fame_en":"Finished in 1762, it's Rome's biggest Baroque fountain and appears in films like 'Roman Holiday' and 'La Dolce Vita'. Legend says if you toss a coin over your left shoulder with your right hand, you'll return to Rome.","fact":"大家扔的硬币不会白扔：从 2005 年起，罗马市政府把池子里捞出来的钱交给天主教慈善机构 Caritas，用来给穷人买吃的；2022 年一年就捞出了大约 140 万欧元。","fact_en":"The coins don't go to waste: since 2005 the city has handed the money fished out of the basin to the Catholic charity Caritas, which uses it to feed people in need — about €1.4 million in 2022 alone.","src":"Al Jazeera · What happens to the coins tossed into Rome's Trevi Fountain?","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/gallery/2024/3/7/what-happens-to-the-coins-tossed-into-romes-trevi-fountain","say":{"en":"Could you take a photo of me throwing the coin?","zh":"能帮我拍一张扔硬币的照片吗？"}},"庞贝古城":{"what":"意大利那不勒斯旁边一座被火山灰埋了将近两千年的古罗马城市。","what_en":"An ancient Roman city near Naples that lay buried under volcanic ash for almost 2,000 years.","fame":"公元 79 年维苏威火山爆发，一夜之间把整座城埋了，房子、面包店、墙上的涂鸦都定格在那一刻；现在走在里面，就像走在两千年前的街上。","fame_en":"When Vesuvius erupted in AD 79 it buried the whole city overnight, freezing houses, bakeries and wall graffiti in that moment — walking its streets today feels like stepping back 2,000 years.","fact":"庞贝到现在还在挖、还在出新东西：2023 年考古学家在一户人家墙上发现一幅静物画，画着一块放了石榴等配料的扁面饼、旁边一杯酒，被说成是比萨的「远房祖先」——不过那时还没有番茄和马苏里拉。","fact_en":"Pompeii is still being dug and still surprising people: in 2023 archaeologists found a wall painting of a flatbread topped with fruit like pomegranate next to a cup of wine — dubbed a 'distant ancestor' of pizza, though without tomatoes or mozzarella.","src":"Sci.News · Pompeii Fresco Depicts 'Possible Ancestor' of Italian Pizza","url":"https://www.sci.news/archaeology/pompeii-pizza-12086.html","say":{"en":"Is there a map of the site? I don't want to miss the bakery.","zh":"有遗址地图吗？我不想错过那家面包店。"}},"米兰大教堂":{"what":"米兰市中心一座白色大理石的哥特式大教堂，屋顶上全是尖塔和雕像。","what_en":"A white-marble Gothic cathedral in the heart of Milan, its roof bristling with spires and statues.","fame":"从 1386 年开始盖，前后花了将近六百年才算完工，是世界上最大的教堂之一；可以坐电梯上屋顶，在尖塔中间散步，天气好能看到阿尔卑斯山。","fame_en":"Begun in 1386, it took almost six centuries to finish and is one of the largest churches in the world; you can take a lift up to the roof and walk among the spires — on clear days you can see the Alps.","fact":"最高的尖塔顶上站着一尊金色圣母像「Madonnina」，米兰有个老规矩：楼不能盖得比她高。1950 年代建的倍耐力大楼超过了她，于是在楼顶也放了一尊小一号的复制品——后来更高的新楼也照这么做。","fact_en":"The tallest spire is topped by a golden Virgin, the 'Madonnina', and Milan had a custom that no building should rise above her. When the Pirelli Tower outgrew her in the 1950s, a smaller copy was put on its roof — and later, taller towers did the same.","src":"Wikipedia · Madonnina (statue)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Madonnina_(statue)","say":{"en":"One ticket for the rooftop, by lift please.","zh":"一张上屋顶的票，坐电梯的。"}},"五渔村":{"what":"意大利利古里亚海边五个挂在悬崖上的彩色小渔村。","what_en":"Five colourful fishing villages clinging to the cliffs of Italy's Ligurian coast.","fame":"几百年来村民在陡坡上垒石墙种葡萄和柠檬，房子刷得五颜六色好让出海的人认出家；村子之间有小火车和徒步小路，是意大利最受欢迎的徒步地之一。","fame_en":"For centuries villagers built stone terraces on the steep slopes for vines and lemons, painting their houses bright colours; little trains and footpaths link the villages, making it one of Italy's best-loved hikes.","fact":"连着里奥马焦雷和马纳罗拉的「爱之路」（Via dell'Amore）2012 年因为山体滑坡关了，修了 12 年，花了约 2300 万欧元，2024 年 7 月才重新开放——现在要提前预约时段，只能单向走。","fact_en":"The 'Path of Love' (Via dell'Amore) between Riomaggiore and Manarola closed after a landslide in 2012 and only reopened in July 2024 after about €23 million of work — you now book a time slot and walk it one way.","src":"The Local Italy · Via dell'Amore to reopen after 12 years","url":"https://www.thelocal.it/20240725/via-dellamore-famous-cinque-terre-lovers-path-to-reopen-after-12-years","say":{"en":"Do I need to book a slot for the Via dell'Amore?","zh":"走爱之路需要预约时段吗？"}},"柏林墙":{"what":"1961 到 1989 年把柏林切成东西两半的那道墙，现在只剩几段。","what_en":"The wall that cut Berlin in two from 1961 to 1989 — only a few stretches are left today.","fame":"它是冷战最有名的象征：一家人、一条街被隔开，很多人为了翻过去丢了命。1989 年 11 月 9 日墙倒了，东西德第二年统一。现在可以去贝尔瑙尔街纪念馆或东边画廊看剩下的墙。","fame_en":"It was the Cold War's best-known symbol: families and streets were split, and many people died trying to cross. It fell on 9 November 1989, and Germany reunified the next year. You can see what's left at the Bernauer Strasse memorial or the East Side Gallery.","fact":"2018 年 2 月 5 日是个特别的日子：那天柏林墙「倒下的时间」第一次和它「立着的时间」一样长——各 10,316 天，德国人管这天叫「Zirkeltag」。从那以后，没有墙的柏林就比有墙的更久了。","fact_en":"5 February 2018 was a special day: the Wall had been gone for exactly as long as it had stood — 10,316 days each, a date Germans call the 'Zirkeltag'. Since then, Berlin has been without the Wall for longer than it had one.","src":"The New Daily · Berlin Wall now gone one day longer than it stood","url":"https://www.thenewdaily.com.au/news/world/2018/02/06/berlin-wall-now-gone-one-day-longer-10315-days-stood","say":{"en":"Which part of the Wall is still original here?","zh":"这儿哪一段墙是原来留下的？"}},"科隆大教堂":{"what":"德国科隆火车站一出门就能看到的那座黑色双塔哥特式大教堂。","what_en":"The dark twin-spired Gothic cathedral you see the moment you step out of Cologne's main station.","fame":"两座尖塔 157 米高，是德国最多人参观的地方之一；里面供着传说中「东方三博士」的遗骨金棺。二战时城市几乎被炸平，它挨了好多颗炸弹却没倒。","fame_en":"Its two spires reach 157 m and it's one of Germany's most visited sights; inside is a golden shrine said to hold the bones of the Three Kings. In WWII the city was almost flattened, and the cathedral took many bomb hits but stayed standing.","fact":"它 1248 年开工，中间停了几百年，1880 年才盖完，前后 632 年。完工那年它是世界上最高的建筑——只当了 4 年，1884 年就被华盛顿纪念碑超过了。","fact_en":"Begun in 1248 and stalled for centuries, it was only finished in 1880 — 632 years in all. That made it the tallest building in the world, but only for four years until the Washington Monument overtook it in 1884.","src":"Wikipedia · Cologne Cathedral","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cologne_Cathedral","say":{"en":"How many steps is it to the top of the tower?","zh":"爬到塔顶要走多少级台阶？"}},"哈尔施塔特":{"what":"奥地利阿尔卑斯山里一个贴着湖边的小镇，木房子一层层挂在山坡上。","what_en":"A tiny lakeside town in the Austrian Alps, its wooden houses stacked up the mountainside.","fame":"这里七千年前就开始挖盐，是世界上最老的盐矿之一，整个湖区是世界遗产；湖面倒映着房子和教堂尖顶的那个角度，被无数人当成手机壁纸。","fame_en":"Salt has been mined here for some 7,000 years — one of the oldest salt mines in the world — and the lake region is a World Heritage Site; the view of houses and a church spire reflected in the lake is on countless phone wallpapers.","fact":"2023 年 5 月，游客多到住户受不了，镇上在最热门的自拍点竖起一道木栅栏，想挡住拍照的人群——结果在网上被骂得很凶，没多久就拆了。镇长后来说，想在那儿挂一条横幅，提醒游客：这里有人住。","fact_en":"In May 2023, fed up with the crowds, the town put up a wooden fence at its most popular selfie spot — it was so widely criticised online that it was soon taken down. The mayor said he'd rather hang a banner reminding visitors that people actually live here.","src":"PetaPixel · Tourist town that inspired 'Frozen' erects fence to stop selfies","url":"https://petapixel.com/2023/05/22/tourist-town-that-inspired-frozen-erects-fence-in-bid-to-stop-selfies","say":{"en":"Sorry, do people live in this house? I'll keep my voice down.","zh":"不好意思，这栋房子有人住吗？我小声点。"}},"美泉宫":{"what":"维也纳城边一座黄色的大宫殿，哈布斯堡皇室的夏宫，后面是很大的花园。","what_en":"A huge yellow palace on the edge of Vienna — the Habsburgs' summer residence — with vast gardens behind it.","fame":"茜茜公主和玛丽亚·特蕾莎都在这里住过，6 岁的莫扎特在这儿给女皇弹过琴；宫殿和花园是世界遗产，爬上山坡的凯旋门能看到整个维也纳。","fame_en":"Empress Sisi and Maria Theresa lived here, and a six-year-old Mozart played for the empress in its rooms; the palace and gardens are a World Heritage Site, and from the Gloriette on the hill you can see all of Vienna.","fact":"宫殿花园里藏着世界上最老、到现在还开着的动物园：1752 年皇帝弗朗茨一世在这儿建了私人动物园，后来对公众开放，现在还能看到大熊猫。","fact_en":"The palace gardens hide the world's oldest zoo still in operation: Emperor Franz I set up a private menagerie here in 1752; it later opened to the public — and today it even has giant pandas.","src":"Wikipedia · Schönbrunn Zoo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sch%C3%B6nbrunn_Zoo","say":{"en":"Is the garden free, or do I need a ticket for that too?","zh":"花园是免费的吗，还是也要买票？"}},"布拉格城堡":{"what":"布拉格河边山坡上一大片城堡建筑群，中间是尖尖的圣维特大教堂。","what_en":"A vast castle complex on the hill above Prague's river, with the spiky St Vitus Cathedral in the middle.","fame":"一千多年来波希米亚国王、神圣罗马皇帝和捷克总统都在这里办公，现在也是总统府；里面有教堂、宫殿和小小的「黄金巷」，卡夫卡曾在巷子里的 22 号写作。","fame_en":"For over a thousand years Bohemian kings, Holy Roman emperors and Czech presidents have ruled from here — it's still the president's seat. Inside are churches, palaces and tiny 'Golden Lane', where Kafka once wrote at No. 22.","fact":"按吉尼斯世界纪录的说法，它是世界上最大的古城堡：差不多 7 万平方米，长约 570 米、平均宽约 130 米——逛一圈至少要半天。","fact_en":"According to Guinness World Records it's the largest ancient castle in the world: almost 70,000 m², about 570 m long and 130 m wide on average — allow at least half a day.","src":"Wikipedia · Prague Castle","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prague_Castle","say":{"en":"What time is the changing of the guard?","zh":"卫兵换岗是几点？"}},"查理大桥":{"what":"布拉格伏尔塔瓦河上的一座石桥，两边站着 30 尊雕像。","what_en":"A stone bridge across Prague's Vltava River, lined with 30 statues.","fame":"14 世纪查理四世下令建的，几百年里是老城通往城堡的唯一一座桥；现在白天挤满画家、乐手和游客，清晨没人的时候最美。","fame_en":"Ordered by Charles IV in the 14th century, for centuries it was the only bridge linking the Old Town to the castle; by day it's packed with painters, musicians and tourists — it's loveliest at dawn when it's empty.","fact":"传说它的奠基石是 1357 年 7 月 9 日 5 点 31 分放下的：写成 1357 9 7 5 31，正着读反着读都一样，据说是宫廷占星师挑的「护桥」时刻。不过这只是传说，没有确凿记录。","fact_en":"Legend says its foundation stone was laid on 9 July 1357 at 5:31 am — written 1357 9 7 5 31, it reads the same both ways, a time supposedly picked by court astrologers to protect the bridge. It's a legend, though, without firm records.","src":"Wikipedia · Charles Bridge","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_Bridge","say":{"en":"Which statue is the one people touch for luck?","zh":"大家摸了求好运的是哪一尊雕像？"}},"布拉格天文钟":{"what":"布拉格老城市政厅墙上的一座大钟，能看时间、太阳月亮的位置，整点有小人出来走一圈。","what_en":"A great clock on Prague's Old Town Hall that shows the time and the sun and moon's positions — on the hour, little figures come out and parade.","fame":"每到整点，钟下面挤满抬头的人：骷髅拉铃、十二使徒从小窗里一个个经过，最后公鸡一叫就结束——只有几十秒，所以有人说它是「欧洲最让人失望的景点」，可大家还是会去看。","fame_en":"Every hour crowds gather below: a skeleton rings a bell, the twelve apostles pass by the little windows, and a rooster crows to end it — it lasts under a minute, so some call it Europe's most underwhelming sight, yet everyone still goes.","fact":"它 1410 年就装上了，是世界上第三老的天文钟，也是最老的、到现在还在走的那一座；表演里的公鸡是 1865 年左右才加上去的。","fact_en":"It was installed in 1410, making it the world's third-oldest astronomical clock and the oldest one still working; the rooster in the show was only added around 1865.","src":"Linda Hall Library · Prague Astronomical Clock","url":"https://www.lindahall.org/about/news/scientist-of-the-day/prague-astronomical-clock/","say":{"en":"Is it worth going up the tower after the show?","zh":"看完表演值得上塔顶吗？"}},"克拉科夫老城":{"what":"波兰克拉科夫的老城，中间是欧洲最大的中世纪广场之一，两座尖塔的圣母教堂站在一边。","what_en":"Kraków's Old Town in Poland, built around one of Europe's largest medieval squares, with the two-towered St Mary's Basilica on one side.","fame":"它是波兰的老首都，二战时几乎没被炸，老房子、布料大厅和城墙都还在，1978 年成了世界上第一批世界遗产。","fame_en":"Poland's old royal capital came through WWII largely unbombed, so its old houses, Cloth Hall and walls survive; it was among the very first World Heritage Sites in 1978.","fact":"每个整点，圣母教堂高塔上都有消防员亲自吹一段小号「Hejnał」，朝四个方向各吹一次，每次都在半句突然停下——传说是纪念一个被箭射中喉咙的号手。中午那一遍从 1927 年起每天在波兰电台直播。","fact_en":"Every hour a firefighter plays the 'Hejnał' trumpet call from St Mary's tower, once towards each direction, always stopping abruptly mid-tune — said to honour a trumpeter shot in the throat by an arrow. The noon call has been broadcast live on Polish Radio every day since 1927.","src":"Wikipedia · St. Mary's Trumpet Call","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Mary%27s_Trumpet_Call","say":{"en":"When does the trumpeter play next — on the hour?","zh":"号手下一次什么时候吹——整点吗？"}},"布达佩斯国会大厦":{"what":"布达佩斯多瑙河边一座白墙红顶的哥特式大楼，晚上灯一亮倒映在河里。","what_en":"A white Gothic-style building with a red dome on the Danube in Budapest, mirrored in the river when it lights up at night.","fame":"1904 年建成，是匈牙利最大的建筑，现在国会还在里面开会；坐船沿多瑙河看它的夜景，是布达佩斯最经典的一幕。","fame_en":"Completed in 1904, it's Hungary's largest building and parliament still meets inside; seeing it lit up from a Danube boat at night is Budapest's classic moment.","fact":"穹顶正好 96 米高，跟匈牙利人的「千年」有关：896 年马扎尔人来到喀尔巴阡盆地，1896 年全国办千年庆典。另外，匈牙利的圣冠从 2000 年 1 月 1 日起就放在这栋楼里展出。","fact_en":"The dome is exactly 96 m high, a nod to the Hungarian millennium: the Magyars arrived in the Carpathian Basin in 896, and 1896 was the 1,000-year celebration. And since 1 January 2000, the Holy Crown of Hungary has been on display inside.","src":"Wikipedia · Hungarian Parliament Building","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hungarian_Parliament_Building","say":{"en":"Are there English tours inside today?","zh":"今天有英语的参观团吗？"}},"杜布罗夫尼克":{"what":"克罗地亚亚得里亚海边一座被厚城墙围着的橙红屋顶老城。","what_en":"A walled old town of orange roofs on Croatia's Adriatic coast.","fame":"中世纪它是独立的拉古萨共和国，靠航海贸易发家；城墙完整得能绕一圈走 2 公里。《权力的游戏》里的「君临城」大多在这里拍。","fame_en":"In the Middle Ages it was the independent Republic of Ragusa, rich from sea trade; its walls are complete enough to walk a 2 km loop. Most of 'King's Landing' in 'Game of Thrones' was filmed here.","fact":"游客多到连联合国教科文组织都警告过它可能保不住世界遗产。从 2019 年起，城里跟港口约好：一天最多只停两艘邮轮，以前有时一天能来五艘。","fact_en":"Crowds grew so big that UNESCO warned its World Heritage status was at risk. From 2019 the city agreed with the port to allow at most two cruise ships a day — there used to be as many as five.","src":"Maritime Executive · Dubrovnik puts cap on daily cruise ship arrivals","url":"https://maritime-executive.com/article/dubrovnik-puts-cap-on-daily-cruise-ship-arrivals","say":{"en":"What time do the city walls close? I want to go at sunset.","zh":"城墙几点关？我想日落的时候去。"}},"舍夫沙万蓝城":{"what":"摩洛哥北部里夫山里一座整个刷成蓝色的老城。","what_en":"An old town in the Rif Mountains of northern Morocco, painted almost entirely blue.","fame":"白墙、蓝墙、蓝台阶、蓝门，一条巷子一个蓝色，被叫作「蓝色珍珠」；巷子里卖羊毛毯、山羊奶酪和手织布，是摩洛哥最上镜的地方之一。","fame_en":"Blue walls, blue steps, blue doors — every alley a different shade, earning it the name 'Blue Pearl'; the lanes sell wool blankets, goat's cheese and hand-woven cloth, making it one of Morocco's most photographed places.","fact":"它为什么是蓝的，到现在都没有定论：有说是逃难来的犹太人带来的、代表天空和上帝，有说能赶蚊子，也有本地人说「蓝色让眼睛舒服，夏天太阳太晒」。城本身是 1471 年作为对抗葡萄牙人的山中要塞建起来的。","fact_en":"Nobody agrees why it's blue: some say Jewish refugees brought the colour to symbolise sky and God, some say it keeps mosquitoes away, and some locals say blue simply 'eases the eye' in the harsh summer sun. The town itself was founded in 1471 as a mountain fortress against the Portuguese.","src":"Wikipedia · Chefchaouen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chefchaouen","say":{"en":"Is it okay if I take a photo of your door?","zh":"我可以拍一下你家的门吗？"}},"蓝色小镇":{"what":"摩洛哥舍夫沙万老城的蓝色巷子，台阶、墙和门全是深深浅浅的蓝。","what_en":"The blue lanes of Chefchaouen's old town in Morocco — steps, walls and doors in every shade of blue.","fame":"游客为了拍照专门来，但它首先是人住的地方：巷子里有孩子上学、老人坐门口、小店织毯子；从城东的西班牙清真寺看日落，整个蓝城在脚下。","fame_en":"People come for the photos, but first of all it's a place people live: kids walk to school, elders sit by doorways, little shops weave rugs; from the Spanish Mosque on the hill you watch the sunset over the whole blue town.","fact":"它曾经几乎不让外人进：1920 年西班牙军队到来之前，有记录的西方访客只有三个——1883 年法国人夏尔·德·福柯乔装进城、1889 年记者沃尔特·哈里斯扮成商人进城，还有一个传教士据说在 1892 年被毒死。","fact_en":"It was once almost closed to outsiders: before Spanish troops arrived in 1920, only three Westerners are recorded as visiting — Charles de Foucauld in disguise in 1883, journalist Walter Harris dressed as a merchant in 1889, and a missionary said to have been poisoned in 1892.","src":"Rough Guides · Chefchaouen","url":"https://www.roughguides.com/destinations/africa/morocco/tangier-tetouan-northwest/chefchaouen/","say":{"en":"How do I get up to the Spanish Mosque from here?","zh":"从这儿怎么上去西班牙清真寺？"}},"蓝白小镇":{"what":"突尼斯海边山坡上一个白墙蓝门蓝窗的小镇，西迪布赛义德。","what_en":"Sidi Bou Said, a hilltop seaside village in Tunisia with white walls and blue doors and windows.","fame":"离首都突尼斯市只要半小时轻轨，俯瞰地中海；保罗·克利等画家都在这儿画过画，坐在台阶上的老咖啡馆里喝一杯松子薄荷茶是必做的事。","fame_en":"Just half an hour by light rail from Tunis and overlooking the Mediterranean, it drew painters like Paul Klee; sipping mint tea with pine nuts at the old café on the steps is a must.","fact":"这一身蓝白是「规定」出来的：住在这里的法国男爵、音乐学者罗多尔夫·德朗热推动当局在 1915 年下令保护小镇，要求房子只能刷白墙配蓝色，也不许乱盖。","fact_en":"The blue and white is by decree: Baron Rodolphe d'Erlanger, a French musicologist who lived here, pushed the authorities to protect the village by a 1915 decree requiring white walls with blue trim and banning haphazard building.","src":"Webdo · Comment est né le bleu de Sidi Bou Saïd","url":"https://www.webdo.tn/fr/actualite/chroniques/tunisie-comment-est-ne-le-bleu-de-sidi-bou-said/218128/","say":{"en":"One mint tea with pine nuts, please — can we sit on the terrace?","zh":"一杯松子薄荷茶——我们可以坐露台吗？"}},"迦太基遗址":{"what":"突尼斯海边一座古城的遗址，曾是罗马最大的对手迦太基。","what_en":"The seaside ruins of Carthage in Tunisia, once Rome's greatest rival.","fame":"腓尼基人建的这座城称霸地中海几百年，名将汉尼拔还带着大象翻过阿尔卑斯山打罗马；公元前 146 年被罗马攻破烧毁，后来罗马人又在原地建了新城，留下巨大的浴场。","fame_en":"Founded by the Phoenicians, it ruled the Mediterranean for centuries — its general Hannibal even crossed the Alps with elephants to attack Rome. Rome destroyed it in 146 BC, then built a new city on the spot, leaving huge baths behind.","fact":"很多书上说罗马人毁城后还在地上「撒盐」让它寸草不生——其实古代的史料里根本没有这回事，历史学家考证这是近代才编出来的说法。","fact_en":"Many books say the Romans 'sowed the ground with salt' so nothing would grow — but no ancient source says so; historians have shown it's a much later invention.","src":"Wikipedia · Salting the earth","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salting_the_earth","say":{"en":"Does one ticket cover all the Carthage sites?","zh":"一张票能看迦太基所有的遗址吗？"}},"杰姆斗兽场":{"what":"突尼斯杰姆小镇中间一座古罗马大斗兽场，几乎和罗马那座一样大。","what_en":"A giant Roman amphitheatre in the middle of the small Tunisian town of El Djem, almost as big as Rome's.","fame":"公元 3 世纪建的，能坐大约 3.5 万人，是罗马帝国最大的斗兽场之一，保存得比罗马斗兽场还完整；地下关野兽的通道现在还能走进去。","fame_en":"Built in the 3rd century AD to seat about 35,000, it's one of the Roman Empire's largest amphitheatres and better preserved than Rome's Colosseum — you can still walk the tunnels where animals were kept.","fact":"它西边缺了一大块，不是自然塌的：1695 年，有人躲进斗兽场对抗突尼斯的统治者，穆罕默德贝伊在墙上打开了一个缺口；1850 年前后又被扩大到大约 30 米宽。","fact_en":"The big gap in its western side isn't natural decay: in 1695, when rebels took refuge inside, Mohamed Bey opened a breach in the wall, and around 1850 it was widened to about 30 m.","src":"Wikipedia · Amphitheatre of El Jem","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amphitheatre_of_El_Jem","say":{"en":"Can we go down into the tunnels under the arena?","zh":"我们可以下到斗兽场下面的通道里吗？"}},"棉花堡":{"what":"土耳其代尼兹利山坡上一层层雪白的石灰华梯田，里面盛着浅蓝的温泉水。","what_en":"Snow-white travertine terraces on a hillside near Denizli, Turkey, filled with pale-blue thermal water.","fame":"温泉水里的碳酸钙几千年里一层层沉积成白色台阶，看起来像棉花；山顶是古罗马温泉城希拉波利斯，还能在「克娄巴特拉泳池」里泡在古柱子中间。","fame_en":"Calcium in the hot springs built up white terraces over thousands of years, like cotton; on top lies the Roman spa city of Hierapolis, where you can swim among fallen columns in 'Cleopatra's Pool'.","fact":"它差点被酒店毁了：1960 年代起山上盖了好几家酒店，把温泉水引进自己的泳池，白梯田慢慢干掉、变灰。1988 年成为世界遗产后，这些酒店都被拆掉了；为了保护梯田，现在游客也不能再泡在梯田的池子里。","fact_en":"Hotels nearly ruined it: from the 1960s several were built on top, draining the spring water into their pools, and the white terraces dried and greyed. After it became a World Heritage Site in 1988 the hotels were demolished — and to protect the terraces, visitors can no longer bathe in the travertine pools.","src":"Ochrana přírody · Pamukkale – the good end of one story","url":"https://www.casopis.ochranaprirody.cz/en/international-nature-conservation/pamukkale-the-good-end-of-one-story/","say":{"en":"Do I have to take my shoes off to walk on the terraces?","zh":"走梯田要脱鞋吗？"}},"勃朗峰":{"what":"法国和意大利交界的一座雪山，是阿尔卑斯山和西欧最高的山。","what_en":"The snow-capped mountain on the France–Italy border, the highest peak in the Alps and Western Europe.","fame":"1786 年第一次有人登顶，现代登山从这里开始；山脚的霞慕尼办过 1924 年第一届冬奥会。不登山的人也能坐南针峰缆车上到 3842 米，跟它面对面。","fame_en":"First climbed in 1786, it's where modern mountaineering began; Chamonix at its foot hosted the first Winter Olympics in 1924. Non-climbers can ride the Aiguille du Midi cable car to 3,842 m and look it in the face.","fact":"它的高度每两年量一次，而且一直在变：2023 年测得 4805.59 米，比两年前矮了两米多。山顶是冰雪盖的，高度主要跟着风和降雪变，所以没有一个永远不变的「标准答案」。","fact_en":"Its height is measured every two years and keeps changing: in 2023 it came out at 4,805.59 m — over two metres lower than two years before. The summit is an ice cap whose height shifts with wind and snowfall, so there's no fixed 'right answer'.","src":"RTÉ · Mont Blanc shrinks by over two metres in two years","url":"https://www.rte.ie/news/mont-blanc","say":{"en":"Is the Aiguille du Midi cable car running today, or is it too windy?","zh":"今天南针峰缆车开吗？还是风太大了？"}},"莫赫悬崖":{"what":"爱尔兰西海岸一排直上直下的海边悬崖，最高处 200 多米。","what_en":"A line of sheer sea cliffs on Ireland's west coast, over 200 m at their highest.","fame":"悬崖沿大西洋延伸约 14 公里，是爱尔兰最多人去的自然景点；风大、浪大、海鸟多，晴天能看到远处的阿兰群岛。","fame_en":"Stretching about 14 km along the Atlantic, they're Ireland's most visited natural sight — windy, wave-battered and full of seabirds, with the Aran Islands visible on a clear day.","fact":"《哈利·波特与混血王子》里，哈利和邓布利多去找魂器的那座海边悬崖就是莫赫悬崖——电影用电脑把附近一块叫 Lemon Rock 的礁石和悬崖拼在了一起，洞口是真的，洞里面是搭的景。","fact_en":"In 'Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince', the sea cliff where Harry and Dumbledore hunt for a Horcrux is the Cliffs of Moher — combined by computer with a nearby rock called Lemon Rock. The cave entrance is real; the inside was a set.","src":"Ireland.com · Harry Potter and the Cliffs of Moher","url":"https://www.ireland.com/en/magazine/ireland-on-screen/harry-potter-and-the-cliffs-of-moher/","say":{"en":"Is it safe to walk the cliff path today in this wind?","zh":"这么大的风，今天走悬崖步道安全吗？"}},"阿马尔菲海岸":{"what":"意大利南部一段 50 公里的海岸，彩色小镇挂在悬崖上，下面是蓝海。","what_en":"A 50 km stretch of southern Italian coast where colourful towns cling to cliffs above a deep-blue sea.","fame":"波西塔诺、阿马尔菲、拉韦洛一个个镇子顺着悬崖往下长，山坡上种满做柠檬酒的大柠檬；整段海岸是世界遗产，坐船或坐大巴沿着弯弯的海边公路走一趟最经典。","fame_en":"Positano, Amalfi and Ravello tumble down the cliffs, with hillside terraces of the big lemons used for limoncello; the whole coast is a World Heritage Site, best seen by boat or by bus along the twisting coast road.","fact":"那条海边公路窄到两辆大巴只能慢慢错车。从 2022 年夏天起，旺季白天开始按车牌单双号限行：单号日期只许尾号单数的车上路，双号反过来；本地居民、公交和出租车除外。","fact_en":"The coast road is so narrow that two buses can barely pass. Since summer 2022, peak-season daytime traffic follows an odd/even plate rule: cars with odd-ending plates drive on odd dates, even on even dates — residents, buses and taxis excepted.","src":"The Local Italy · How will Italy's Amalfi Coast traffic limit work","url":"https://www.thelocal.it/20220617/how-will-italys-amalfi-coast-traffic-limit-for-tourists-work-this-summer","say":{"en":"Is it faster to take the ferry to Positano or the bus?","zh":"去波西塔诺坐渡轮快还是坐大巴快？"}},"埃特纳火山":{"what":"意大利西西里岛东边的一座活火山，是欧洲最高的活火山。","what_en":"An active volcano on the east of Sicily, Italy — the tallest active volcano in Europe.","fame":"它几乎一直在冒烟、时不时喷发，山脚却住着几十万人，火山灰让土地特别肥，种出有名的葡萄酒和开心果；2013 年成为世界遗产。","fame_en":"It smokes almost constantly and erupts every so often, yet hundreds of thousands live at its foot, where volcanic soil grows famous wines and pistachios; it became a World Heritage Site in 2013.","fact":"它会「长个子」：2021 年上半年连续喷发后，意大利国家地球物理与火山研究所用卫星测出东南火山口长到了 3357 米，成了埃特纳的新最高点——取代了当了 40 年最高点的东北火山口。","fact_en":"It literally grows: after months of eruptions in 2021, Italy's INGV used satellite images to measure the Southeast Crater at 3,357 m, making it Etna's new summit and ending the Northeast Crater's 40-year reign.","src":"INGV · Etna breaks a new height record at 3,357 metres","url":"https://ingv.it/en/urp-press/Press-office/Press-releases/Etna-breaks-a-new-height-record-at-3357-metres","say":{"en":"Do we need a guide to go up to the summit craters?","zh":"上山顶火山口需要请向导吗？"}},"少女峰":{"what":"瑞士因特拉肯附近的一座雪山，和艾格峰、僧侣峰排成一排。","what_en":"A snow peak near Interlaken, Switzerland, standing in a row with the Eiger and the Mönch.","fame":"一条齿轮火车穿过艾格峰肚子里的隧道，一直开到少女峰山坳，下车就是阿尔卑斯最长的阿莱奇冰川；这一带是世界遗产，被叫作「欧洲之巅」。","fame_en":"A cog railway tunnels right through the Eiger up to the Jungfraujoch, where you step out above the Aletsch, the Alps' longest glacier; the area is a World Heritage Site, nicknamed the 'Top of Europe'.","fact":"终点少女峰站在海拔 3454 米，是欧洲最高的火车站。这条铁路 1896 年开工，挖了 16 年，1912 年 8 月 1 日——瑞士国庆那天——才通车。","fact_en":"The Jungfraujoch terminus sits at 3,454 m, the highest railway station in Europe. Work began in 1896 and took 16 years; it opened on 1 August 1912 — Swiss National Day.","src":"Wikipedia · Jungfraujoch railway station","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jungfraujoch_railway_station","say":{"en":"Is there a discount on the Jungfraujoch train with the Swiss Travel Pass?","zh":"有瑞士通票的话，少女峰火车有折扣吗？"}},"十六湖":{"what":"克罗地亚普利特维采国家公园里 16 个连在一起的湖，湖和湖之间是一道道瀑布。","what_en":"Sixteen linked lakes in Croatia's Plitvice Lakes National Park, joined by waterfall after waterfall.","fame":"湖水因为矿物和光线一会儿是蓝、一会儿是绿，人走在贴着水面的木栈道上，脚下就是鱼；1979 年成为世界遗产，是克罗地亚最老、最大的国家公园。","fame_en":"Minerals and light turn the water from blue to green; boardwalks run just above the surface so fish swim under your feet. It became a World Heritage Site in 1979 and is Croatia's oldest and largest national park.","fact":"1960 年代德国最火的西部片《温内图》（Winnetou）系列，很多场景是在这里拍的——第一部就叫《银湖宝藏》（1962）。好几代德国人是看着这些湖和瀑布长大的，有的就是为了电影才来克罗地亚。","fact_en":"Germany's hugely popular 1960s 'Winnetou' westerns were partly filmed here — starting with 'The Treasure of the Silver Lake' (1962). Generations of Germans grew up watching these lakes and waterfalls, and some come to Croatia just because of the films.","src":"3 Seas Europe · Did Winnetou live in Croatia?","url":"https://3seaseurope.com/winnetou-locations-movie-croatia/","say":{"en":"Which route is best if we only have four hours?","zh":"如果只有四个小时，走哪条路线最好？"}},"奥林匹斯山":{"what":"希腊北部的最高山，古希腊传说里众神住的地方。","what_en":"Greece's highest mountain in the north of the country — home of the gods in ancient Greek myth.","fame":"宙斯、雅典娜、阿波罗这些神话里的神都「住」在山顶；现在它是国家公园，从山脚的利托霍罗小镇出发，徒步两三天就能上主峰米蒂卡斯（2918 米）。","fame_en":"Zeus, Athena, Apollo — the gods of myth all 'lived' on its summit; today it's a national park, and from the town of Litochoro you can hike to the top, Mytikas (2,918 m), in two or three days.","fact":"神住的山，人到 1913 年 8 月 2 日才第一次登顶：两个瑞士人——摄影师布瓦松纳和作家博德-博维——请了当地伐木工 Christos Kakkalos 带路，他后来成了这座山的正式向导。","fact_en":"The gods' mountain wasn't climbed by humans until 2 August 1913: two Swiss men, photographer Frédéric Boissonnas and writer Daniel Baud-Bovy, were led to the top by local woodcutter Christos Kakkalos, who later became the mountain's official guide.","src":"Wikipedia · Christos Kakkalos","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christos_Kakkalos","say":{"en":"Is the refuge open, and do I need to book a bed?","zh":"山上的避难小屋开着吗？床位需要预订吗？"}},"蓝湖温泉":{"what":"冰岛黑色火山岩中间一片乳白泛蓝的温泉，离机场二十分钟。","what_en":"A milky-blue hot lagoon set in black lava fields in Iceland, twenty minutes from the airport.","fame":"水温 37–40 度，含硅和矿物，大家在冷风里泡着、往脸上抹白色的硅泥；很多人下飞机或上飞机前顺路来泡一次。","fame_en":"The water is 37–40°C and rich in silica and minerals; people soak in the cold wind with white silica mud on their faces, often on the way from or to the airport.","fact":"它不是天然的：1976 年旁边的斯瓦特森吉地热电站把用过的热盐水排到熔岩地上，以为会渗下去，结果水里的硅把地面封住，积成了一个湖。2023 年底起附近火山多次喷发，蓝湖几次临时关门。","fact_en":"It isn't natural: in 1976 the nearby Svartsengi geothermal plant began dumping used hot brine onto the lava field, expecting it to drain away, but silica sealed the ground and a lagoon formed. Since late 2023, repeated nearby eruptions have forced it to close several times.","src":"Wikipedia · Blue Lagoon (geothermal spa)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Lagoon_(geothermal_spa)","say":{"en":"Is the lagoon open today, with the eruption nearby?","zh":"附近有火山喷发，今天蓝湖开吗？"}},"郁金香与风车":{"what":"荷兰春天一望无际的彩色郁金香花田，和田边转着的老风车。","what_en":"Endless fields of colourful tulips in a Dutch spring, with old windmills turning beside them.","fame":"荷兰三分之一的土地低于海平面，几百年来靠风车把水抽出去才有了能种地的「圩田」；小孩堤防的 19 座风车大多建于 1738–1740 年，是世界遗产。四五月花田开满，是荷兰最有名的风景。","fame_en":"About a third of the Netherlands lies below sea level, and for centuries windmills pumped out water to make farmable polders; most of Kinderdijk's 19 mills date from 1738–1740 and are a World Heritage Site. In April and May the bulb fields bloom — the country's most famous view.","fact":"郁金香本来不是荷兰的：它从奥斯曼帝国传到欧洲，1593 年植物学家克卢修斯在莱顿种下了荷兰第一批。后来它火到一颗球茎能卖十个工匠的年薪，1637 年 2 月价格突然崩盘——常被叫作历史上第一个「泡沫」。","fact_en":"Tulips aren't originally Dutch: they came to Europe from the Ottoman Empire, and botanist Carolus Clusius planted the first Dutch ones in Leiden in 1593. They became so prized that one bulb could cost ten times a craftsman's yearly wage — until prices crashed in February 1637, often called history's first 'bubble'.","src":"Wikipedia · Tulip mania","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tulip_mania","say":{"en":"Can we walk into the tulip field, or only along the edge?","zh":"可以走进郁金香田里吗，还是只能在边上？"}},"梵蒂冈红酒":{"what":"世界上最小的国家梵蒂冈里，人们日常喝的红酒。","what_en":"The everyday red wine drunk in Vatican City, the world's smallest country.","fame":"梵蒂冈住着八百来人，大多是神父、修女和瑞士卫队；城里有一家几乎免税的超市，罗马人也想办法进去买酒。弥撒要用酒，午饭配一杯红酒在意大利更是平常事。","fame_en":"About 800 people live in the Vatican, mostly clergy, nuns and Swiss Guards; there's a near-tax-free supermarket inside that Romans try to get into for wine. Mass uses wine, and a glass of red at lunch is ordinary Italian life.","fact":"按美国葡萄酒学会 2012 年的数据，梵蒂冈是人均喝红酒最多的国家：每人一年约 74 升，差不多是意大利人的两倍。不过人太少、超市卖给外面的人、住的多是成年男性，人均数字被放大了不少。","fact_en":"By the Wine Institute's 2012 figures, Vatican City drinks the most wine per person in the world: about 74 litres a year — roughly double Italy. But its tiny population, a supermarket selling to outsiders and mostly adult male residents inflate that number a lot.","src":"National Catholic Reporter · Vatican City consumes more wine per capita than any other country","url":"https://ncronline.org/news/world/vatican-city-consumes-more-wine-capita-any-other-country","say":{"en":"A quarter litre of the house red, please.","zh":"来四分之一升的店酿红酒。"}},"芬兰咖啡":{"what":"芬兰人一天喝好几杯的过滤咖啡，大多是浅烘焙，配肉桂卷一起吃。","what_en":"The filter coffee Finns drink several cups of a day, mostly light-roasted, often with a cinnamon bun.","fame":"上班有咖啡休息，周末去别人家做客也是先煮一壶咖啡；漫长黑暗的冬天里，一杯热咖啡加一个 korvapuusti（肉桂卷）就是芬兰人的日常。","fame_en":"There are coffee breaks at work, and any home visit starts with a pot of coffee; through the long dark winter, a hot cup with a korvapuusti cinnamon bun is everyday Finnish life.","fact":"芬兰是全世界人均喝咖啡最多的国家：每人一年大约 12 公斤，是意大利人的两倍多。而且芬兰人传统上爱喝浅烘焙的过滤咖啡，跟意大利那种深烘的浓缩完全是两个味道。","fact_en":"Finland drinks more coffee per person than anywhere else — about 12 kg each a year, more than double the average Italian. And Finns traditionally prefer light-roast filter coffee, a world away from Italy's dark espresso.","src":"AFAR · This country drinks more coffee than any other","url":"https://www.afar.com/magazine/this-country-drinks-more-coffee-than-any-other","say":{"en":"A filter coffee and a cinnamon bun, please. Are refills free?","zh":"一杯过滤咖啡和一个肉桂卷。续杯免费吗？"}},"冰岛酸奶":{"what":"冰岛的 skyr，一种又浓又稠、蛋白质很高的乳制品，吃起来像特别厚的酸奶。","what_en":"Iceland's skyr — a thick, high-protein dairy food that eats like an extra-dense yogurt.","fame":"冰岛人吃了一千多年，早饭加蓝莓、做甜点、当零食；这几年在欧美超市大火，健身的人拿它当高蛋白早餐。","fame_en":"Icelanders have eaten it for over a thousand years — with blueberries at breakfast, in desserts, as a snack; in recent years it has taken off in supermarkets abroad as a gym-goer's high-protein breakfast.","fact":"严格说它不是酸奶，而是一种新鲜奶酪：做的时候要加凝乳酶。做法是早期定居者从挪威带来的，后来在挪威和别的北欧国家失传了，只在冰岛留了下来。","fact_en":"Strictly speaking it's not yogurt but a fresh cheese — it's set with rennet. Early settlers brought the method from Norway; it later died out in Norway and the rest of Scandinavia and survived only in Iceland.","src":"Wikipedia · Skyr","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skyr","say":{"en":"Which skyr is plain, without added sugar?","zh":"哪一款 skyr 是原味、不加糖的？"}},"哈里萨辣酱":{"what":"突尼斯的红辣椒酱，用晒干的辣椒、大蒜、香菜籽和橄榄油捣成。","what_en":"Tunisia's red chilli paste, pounded from sun-dried peppers, garlic, coriander seed and olive oil.","fame":"突尼斯人几乎每顿都有它：抹面包、拌古斯古斯、炖菜里放一勺，早饭桌上一小碟哈里萨加橄榄油就能开吃；夏天家家户户把辣椒晒在屋顶上。","fame_en":"Tunisians have it at almost every meal — spread on bread, stirred into couscous, a spoonful in stews; a small dish of harissa with olive oil can be breakfast. In summer, families dry peppers on their rooftops.","fact":"2022 年 12 月，突尼斯的哈里萨——包括做它的手艺和围绕它的生活习惯——被列入联合国教科文组织的人类非物质文化遗产名录。","fact_en":"In December 2022, Tunisian harissa — the know-how to make it and the social practices around it — was added to UNESCO's list of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity.","src":"Gulf News · Tunisia's spicy harissa gets UNESCO heritage status","url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/tunisias-spicy-harissa-gets-unesco-heritage-status-1.92439193","say":{"en":"Is this harissa very hot? Just a little on the side, please.","zh":"这个哈里萨很辣吗？请放一点在旁边就好。"}},"土耳其软糖":{"what":"土耳其的 lokum，用淀粉和糖煮成的软糯小方块，裹着糖粉，常加玫瑰、开心果。","what_en":"Turkish lokum — soft, chewy cubes of starch and sugar dusted with powdered sugar, often with rose or pistachio.","fame":"土耳其人请客喝咖啡时一定配一块，节日走亲戚也带一盒；在《纳尼亚传奇》里，它就是白女巫拿来诱惑小男孩的那种糖。","fame_en":"In Turkey it's served with coffee for guests and brought in boxes on holiday visits; in 'The Chronicles of Narnia', it's the sweet the White Witch uses to tempt Edmund.","fact":"伊斯坦布尔的 Hacı Bekir 糖果店 1777 年开张，开在 Bahçekapı 的第一家店到现在还在原地营业，常被说成是土耳其最老的公司之一；很多人认为就是它把今天这种淀粉做的软糖推广开的。","fact_en":"Istanbul's Hacı Bekir opened in 1777, and its first shop in Bahçekapı still trades on the same spot — often called one of Turkey's oldest companies, and widely credited with popularising the starch-based lokum we know today.","src":"National Geographic · Where to find the best Turkish delight in Istanbul","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/travel/article/where-to-find-the-best-turkish-delight-lokum-in-istanbul","say":{"en":"Can I try one before I buy? Half a kilo of the pistachio, please.","zh":"能先尝一块吗？开心果的来半公斤。"}},"土耳其咖啡":{"what":"用小铜壶把很细的咖啡粉连水一起煮出来的咖啡，不过滤，杯底留着一层渣。","what_en":"Coffee boiled with very finely ground beans in a small copper pot, unfiltered, with grounds left at the bottom of the cup.","fame":"要先说好放几分糖，因为糖是一起煮的；配一杯水和一块软糖慢慢喝。喝完把杯子倒扣，用咖啡渣「算命」，是朋友聊天时的乐子。","fame_en":"You order the sugar level up front because it's boiled in; it comes with a glass of water and a piece of lokum. Afterwards people flip the cup and 'read' the grounds — a fun ritual among friends.","fact":"2013 年，「土耳其咖啡文化与传统」被列入联合国教科文组织人类非物质文化遗产名录，是第一种进这份名录的饮料。不过希腊人会告诉你，这在他们那儿叫「希腊咖啡」。","fact_en":"In 2013, 'Turkish coffee culture and tradition' joined UNESCO's Intangible Cultural Heritage list — the first drink on it. Greeks will tell you, though, that back home it's 'Greek coffee'.","src":"UNESCO · Turkish coffee culture and tradition","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/turkish-coffee-culture-and-tradition-00645","say":{"en":"One Turkish coffee, medium sweet, please.","zh":"一杯土耳其咖啡，中等甜度。"}},"马卡龙":{"what":"两片杏仁蛋白小圆饼夹着奶油或甘纳许的法式甜点，颜色五花八门。","what_en":"A French sweet of two little almond-meringue shells sandwiching cream or ganache, in every colour.","fame":"巴黎甜品店的橱窗里一排排彩色马卡龙最上镜；一颗不大，价格不便宜，常被装进漂亮小盒子当伴手礼。","fame_en":"Rows of colourful macarons are the most photogenic thing in a Paris pastry window; small and not cheap, they're often boxed up as gifts.","fact":"单片的杏仁小饼几百年前就有了，但「两片夹馅」的样子常被认为是巴黎 Ladurée 甜品店的 Pierre Desfontaines 在 1930 年前后想出来的——也有别的店家说是自己先做的。","fact_en":"Single almond biscuits are centuries old, but the 'two shells with filling' version is often credited to Pierre Desfontaines of Paris's Ladurée around 1930 — though other pâtissiers have claimed it too.","src":"Wikipedia · Ladurée","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ladur%C3%A9e","say":{"en":"A box of six, please — can I pick the flavours?","zh":"要一盒六个的——口味可以我自己挑吗？"}},"意式浓缩咖啡":{"what":"一小杯用高压热水快速冲出来的浓咖啡，上面有一层金色的油脂。","what_en":"A small, strong coffee made by forcing hot water through grounds under pressure, topped with golden crema.","fame":"意大利人在吧台站着，两三口喝完一杯 caffè 就走，一天好几次；拿铁、卡布奇诺、美式都是在它的基础上做出来的。","fame_en":"Italians drink their 'caffè' standing at the bar in two or three sips, several times a day; lattes, cappuccinos and Americanos are all built on it.","fact":"最早有记录的浓缩咖啡机专利是 1884 年都灵的 Angelo Moriondo 申请的，还在当年都灵博览会拿了铜奖。不过他的机器一次煮一大批，没有拿去卖；后来米兰人 Bezzera 和 Pavoni 才把它改成一杯一杯做。","fact_en":"The earliest known espresso machine patent was filed by Angelo Moriondo in Turin in 1884, winning bronze at that year's Turin Expo. But his machine brewed in bulk and was never sold; Milanese Bezzera and Pavoni later turned the idea into single cups.","src":"Smithsonian · The long history of the espresso machine","url":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/arts-culture/the-long-history-of-the-espresso-machine-126012814/","say":{"en":"Un caffè, per favore — do I pay first at the till?","zh":"来一杯浓缩——是先在收银台付钱吗？"}},"那不勒斯披萨":{"what":"那不勒斯的柴火炉披萨，饼边鼓起、带焦点，中间软，经典的是番茄、马苏里拉和罗勒。","what_en":"Naples' wood-fired pizza — puffy, charred rim, soft centre; the classic is tomato, mozzarella and basil.","fame":"在那不勒斯它是平民食物，一人一整张，用刀叉切或者折起来吃；玛格丽特披萨据说是 1889 年为王后做的，红白绿正好是意大利国旗的颜色。","fame_en":"In Naples it's everyday food — one whole pizza each, eaten with knife and fork or folded; the Margherita is said to have been made for a queen in 1889, in the red, white and green of the Italian flag.","fact":"2017 年 12 月，「那不勒斯披萨师傅的手艺」被列入联合国教科文组织人类非物质文化遗产，从揉面到在柴火炉里转着烤都算在内；那不勒斯现在大约有 3000 名披萨师傅。","fact_en":"In December 2017, 'the art of the Neapolitan pizzaiuolo' — from kneading the dough to spinning it in the wood-fired oven — joined UNESCO's Intangible Cultural Heritage list; about 3,000 pizzaioli work in Naples today.","src":"UNESCO · Art of Neapolitan 'Pizzaiuolo'","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/art-of-neapolitan-pizzaiuolo-00722","say":{"en":"One margherita and one marinara, please — how long is the wait?","zh":"一个玛格丽特，一个水手披萨——要等多久？"}},"提拉米苏":{"what":"一层蘸了咖啡的手指饼干、一层马斯卡彭奶酪，最上面撒可可粉的意大利甜点。","what_en":"An Italian dessert of coffee-soaked ladyfingers layered with mascarpone cream and dusted with cocoa.","fame":"名字意思是「把我提起来」，咖啡加糖加蛋，像是给人提神的；现在几乎每家意大利餐厅的甜点单上都有它，各家都说自己的最正宗。","fame_en":"The name means 'pick me up' — coffee, sugar and eggs to lift your spirits; it's on nearly every Italian dessert menu, and every family swears theirs is the real one.","fact":"它比很多人以为的年轻：一般认为是 1960 年代末到 70 年代初，在特雷维索的 Le Beccherie 餐厅由甜点师 Roberto「Loli」Linguanotto 做出来的。他 2024 年 7 月去世，享年 81 岁，Le Beccherie 到现在还按原来的方子做。","fact_en":"It's younger than many think: it's generally credited to pastry chef Roberto 'Loli' Linguanotto at Le Beccherie in Treviso, around the late 1960s or early 1970s. He died in July 2024, aged 81, and Le Beccherie still makes it to the original recipe.","src":"Deccan Chronicle · Roberto Linguanotto, tiramisu's creator, passes away at 81","url":"https://deccanchronicle.com/lifestyle/roberto-linguanotto-tiramisus-creator-passes-away-at-81-1814064","say":{"en":"Is the tiramisu made here? Does it have alcohol in it?","zh":"提拉米苏是店里自己做的吗？里面有酒吗？"}},"帕玛森奶酪":{"what":"意大利帕尔马一带用牛奶做的硬奶酪，一个大轮子有 40 公斤左右，至少放 12 个月。","what_en":"A hard cow's-milk cheese from around Parma, Italy — each wheel weighs about 40 kg and ages at least 12 months.","fame":"意大利人把它刨在意面上、掰成小块配酒吃；只有在指定产区按老规矩做、检验合格的，轮子上才能打上「Parmigiano Reggiano」的字样。","fame_en":"Italians grate it over pasta or break it into chunks with wine; only wheels made in the designated area the traditional way, and passing inspection, can be branded 'Parmigiano Reggiano'.","fact":"它在意大利能当钱用：当地的 Credem 银行从 1953 年起接受奶酪轮子作贷款抵押，把它们放进恒温仓库里看着慢慢熟成；借钱的人还不上，银行就把熟好的奶酪卖掉。","fact_en":"In Italy it works almost like money: the local bank Credem has accepted cheese wheels as loan collateral since 1953, ageing them in climate-controlled warehouses — if a borrower defaults, the bank sells the matured cheese.","src":"Library of Congress · When loans become cheesy","url":"https://blogs.loc.gov/law/2024/10/when-loans-become-cheesy/","say":{"en":"Could I have 200 grams of the 24-month, please?","zh":"请给我 200 克熟成 24 个月的。"}},"西班牙桑格利亚":{"what":"西班牙的水果红酒：红酒里泡上橙子、苹果，加点糖、汽水，冰冰的一大壶。","what_en":"Spain's fruity wine punch: red wine with oranges and apples, a little sugar and soda, served in a big icy jug.","fame":"游客到西班牙几乎都会点一壶；本地人更常在家里聚会、夏天烧烤时一大壶分着喝，平时在酒吧反而爱点更简单的「夏日红酒」（tinto de verano）。","fame_en":"Almost every visitor to Spain orders a jug; locals tend to make it for parties and summer barbecues, and at a bar they often order the simpler 'tinto de verano' instead.","fact":"按欧盟 2014 年的规定，只有在西班牙和葡萄牙做的才能直接叫「Sangría」卖；别的国家做的只能叫「加香葡萄酒饮料」，或者标上「某国产的桑格利亚」。","fact_en":"Under 2014 EU rules, only drinks made in Spain or Portugal can be sold simply as 'Sangría'; elsewhere it has to be an 'aromatised wine-based drink', or carry 'produced in…' with the country's name.","src":"The Local Spain · EU bans non-Spanish sangria","url":"https://www.thelocal.es/20140114/off-limits-eu-bans-non-spanish-sangria","say":{"en":"Is the sangria by the glass or only by the jug?","zh":"桑格利亚能按杯点吗，还是只能点一壶？"}},"黑森林蛋糕":{"what":"德国的樱桃巧克力奶油蛋糕：巧克力蛋糕胚、奶油、酸樱桃，上面撒巧克力屑。","what_en":"Germany's cherry-chocolate cream cake: chocolate sponge, whipped cream and sour cherries, topped with chocolate shavings.","fame":"德国人周末下午「咖啡加蛋糕」时间的经典，一大块配一杯咖啡；它是德国最有名的蛋糕，传遍了全世界的面包房。","fame_en":"It's the classic of Germany's weekend 'Kaffee und Kuchen' — a big slice with coffee — and the country's most famous cake, found in bakeries around the world.","fact":"谁发明的有争议：常说是 1915 年波恩附近 Bad Godesberg 一家咖啡馆的甜点师 Josef Keller，但图宾根也有人拿出老照片说是他们那儿的师傅先做的。在欧盟，叫「黑森林蛋糕」的，里面的樱桃酒得用黑森林种的樱桃来酿。","fact_en":"Its inventor is disputed: often credited to pastry chef Josef Keller at a café in Bad Godesberg near Bonn in 1915, though Tübingen has produced old photos claiming one of its confectioners. In the EU, the kirsch in a cake called Black Forest gateau must come from cherries grown in the Black Forest.","src":"Wikipedia · Black Forest gateau","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Forest_gateau","say":{"en":"Does the Black Forest cake have alcohol in it? It's for a child.","zh":"黑森林蛋糕里有酒吗？是给小孩吃的。"}},"纽伦堡姜饼":{"what":"德国纽伦堡的圣诞姜饼 Lebkuchen，软软的，满是坚果、蜂蜜和香料，常装在漂亮铁盒里。","what_en":"Nuremberg's Christmas gingerbread, Lebkuchen — soft and packed with nuts, honey and spices, often sold in pretty tins.","fame":"纽伦堡在中世纪是香料贸易城市，姜饼做了几百年；每年冬天老城的圣诞市场上，到处是热红酒和刚出炉的姜饼味。","fame_en":"Nuremberg was a medieval spice-trading city and has baked Lebkuchen for centuries; every winter its Christmas market smells of mulled wine and fresh gingerbread.","fact":"从 1996 年 7 月 1 日起，「纽伦堡姜饼」成了欧盟保护的地理名称，只有在纽伦堡城里烤的才能这么叫。最高级的 Elisenlebkuchen 规定坚果至少占 25%、面粉不超过 10%。","fact_en":"Since 1 July 1996, 'Nürnberger Lebkuchen' has been an EU-protected name — only gingerbread baked inside Nuremberg qualifies. The top grade, Elisenlebkuchen, must be at least 25% nuts and no more than 10% flour.","src":"Nuremberg Tourism · Nuremberg Lebkuchen","url":"https://tourismus.nuernberg.de/en/food-drink/nurembergs-specialties/nuremberg-lebkuchen/","say":{"en":"Are these Elisen Lebkuchen? How long do they keep?","zh":"这些是 Elisen 姜饼吗？能放多久？"}},"高达奶酪":{"what":"荷兰最有名的黄色圆轮奶酪，年轻的软而奶香，放久了变硬、有焦糖味的小结晶。","what_en":"The Netherlands' most famous round yellow cheese — mild and creamy when young, hard with caramel-like crystals when aged.","fame":"荷兰人早饭午饭都离不开它：用奶酪刨刮薄片夹面包；全世界超市里的「Gouda」大多是工厂做的，但在荷兰会按熟成几个月分得很细。","fame_en":"The Dutch eat it at breakfast and lunch, shaving thin slices onto bread with a cheese slicer; most 'Gouda' in supermarkets worldwide is factory-made, but in the Netherlands it's sorted carefully by months of ageing.","fact":"它叫「高达」，不是因为在高达城做，而是因为在那儿「卖」：中世纪起周边农民把奶酪运到高达城的市场交易、过秤。现在夏天每个周四，高达市政厅前还有传统奶酪市集表演。","fact_en":"It's named after Gouda not because it was made there but because it was sold there: since the Middle Ages farmers brought their cheese to Gouda's market to be weighed and traded. Every Thursday in summer, a traditional cheese market still takes place by the town hall.","src":"Wikipedia · Gouda, South Holland","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gouda,_South_Holland","say":{"en":"Could I taste the young and the old one? Then I'll take a piece.","zh":"能尝一下年轻的和老的吗？然后我买一块。"}},"比利时啤酒":{"what":"比利时成百上千种啤酒：修道院啤酒、小麦白啤、酸啤、水果啤……每种都有自己的杯子。","what_en":"Belgium's hundreds upon hundreds of beers — Trappist, wheat, sour, fruit beers — each with its own glass.","fame":"在比利时的酒吧，每种酒都倒进它专属形状的杯子里；有的修道院至今还由修士自己酿酒，啤酒还会拿来做菜、洗奶酪。","fame_en":"In Belgian bars every beer is poured into its own shaped glass; some monasteries still have monks brewing, and beer goes into cooking and even washing cheese rinds.","fact":"2016 年 11 月 30 日，「比利时啤酒文化」被列入联合国教科文组织人类非物质文化遗产——不只是啤酒本身，还包括怎么酿、怎么端、怎么喝、怎么拿来做菜。","fact_en":"On 30 November 2016, 'Beer culture in Belgium' joined UNESCO's Intangible Cultural Heritage list — not just the beer, but how it's brewed, served, drunk and cooked with.","src":"BeverageDaily · Belgian beer added to UNESCO heritage list","url":"https://www.beveragedaily.com/Article/2016/12/05/Belgian-beer-added-to-UNESCO-heritage-list/","say":{"en":"What would you recommend that isn't too strong?","zh":"有什么推荐的、度数不太高的？"}},"萨赫蛋糕":{"what":"维也纳的巧克力蛋糕：巧克力蛋糕中间夹一层杏子酱，外面裹一层光亮的黑巧克力，配一大勺不甜的奶油。","what_en":"Vienna's chocolate cake: chocolate sponge with a layer of apricot jam, coated in glossy dark chocolate, served with unsweetened whipped cream.","fame":"1832 年一个 16 岁的学徒 Franz Sacher 为梅特涅亲王的宴会做出来；现在去维也纳的人都会在老咖啡馆点一块，配一杯 Melange 咖啡。","fame_en":"Created in 1832 by 16-year-old apprentice Franz Sacher for Prince Metternich's banquet, it's now what every Vienna visitor orders in an old café with a Melange coffee.","fact":"为了谁能叫「原版萨赫蛋糕」，萨赫酒店和老甜品店 Demel 打了很多年官司，被叫作「维也纳蛋糕战争」。1963 年两边庭外和解：酒店拿到「Original Sacher-Torte」这个名字，Demel 的蛋糕上用三角形的「Eduard-Sacher-Torte」印章。","fact_en":"Hotel Sacher and the old patisserie Demel fought for years over who could call theirs the 'original' — Vienna's 'cake war'. In 1963 they settled out of court: the hotel got 'Original Sacher-Torte', while Demel marks its cakes with a triangular 'Eduard-Sacher-Torte' seal.","src":"Wikipedia · Demel","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demel","say":{"en":"A slice of Sachertorte with cream, and a Melange, please.","zh":"一块萨赫蛋糕加奶油，再来一杯 Melange 咖啡。"}},"波兰饺子":{"what":"波兰的 pierogi，半月形的饺子，包土豆奶酪、酸菜蘑菇或肉，煮好后常用黄油和洋葱煎一下。","what_en":"Polish pierogi — half-moon dumplings filled with potato and cheese, sauerkraut and mushroom, or meat, often pan-fried in butter and onions after boiling.","fame":"在波兰，奶奶家的饺子是家的味道；平安夜的晚餐桌上一定有酸菜蘑菇馅的，大学食堂和小吃店「pierogarnia」里一份八个是最便宜实在的一餐。","fame_en":"In Poland, grandma's pierogi taste like home; sauerkraut-and-mushroom ones are a must on Christmas Eve, and a plate of eight at a 'pierogarnia' is the cheapest honest meal around.","fact":"波兰人有句惊叹语「Święty Jacku z pierogami!」（带着饺子的圣雅辛托啊！），因为传说 1241 年鞑靼人入侵后闹饥荒，圣雅辛托用饺子救了克拉科夫的饥民——他被叫作「饺子的主保圣人」，克拉科夫每年 8 月的饺子节就在他的纪念日前后。","fact_en":"Poles exclaim 'Święty Jacku z pierogami!' ('St Hyacinth with pierogi!') because legend says that after the Tatar invasion of 1241, St Hyacinth fed Kraków's starving people with pierogi — he's the 'patron saint of pierogi', and Kraków's August pierogi festival falls around his feast day.","src":"Aleteia · How St. Hyacinth miraculously fed a crowd with pierogi","url":"https://aleteia.org/2019/08/17/how-st-hyacinth-miraculously-fed-a-crowd-of-starving-people-with-pierogi","say":{"en":"Can I get a mixed plate — half ruskie, half meat?","zh":"能来一份拼盘吗——一半土豆奶酪馅，一半肉馅？"}},"匈牙利牛肉汤":{"what":"匈牙利的 gulyás，一锅用牛肉、土豆、洋葱和大量红椒粉炖出来的红色浓汤。","what_en":"Hungarian gulyás — a red soup stewed from beef, potatoes, onions and lots of paprika.","fame":"在匈牙利它是汤，配面包当一顿饭；在德国、奥地利等地变成了更稠的炖肉。夏天匈牙利人在院子里架起铁锅（bogrács）用柴火煮，一煮就是一下午。","fame_en":"In Hungary it's a soup eaten with bread as a meal; in Germany and Austria it became a thicker stew. In summer Hungarians cook it over a fire in a hanging kettle (bogrács) all afternoon.","fact":"「gulyás」在匈牙利语里本来是「放牛的人」：gulya 是牛群，gulyás 是赶牛的牧人，这道菜最早叫 gulyáshús——「牧牛人的肉」，就是他们在野外架锅煮的。红椒粉和土豆是 16 世纪以后才加进来的。","fact_en":"In Hungarian, 'gulyás' originally means a herdsman: 'gulya' is a herd of cattle, and the dish was first 'gulyáshús' — 'herdsman's meat', cooked over open fires on the plains. Paprika and potatoes only arrived after the 16th century.","src":"Wikipedia · Goulash","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goulash","say":{"en":"Is the gulyás a soup here, or a stew? One bowl with bread, please.","zh":"这儿的 gulyás 是汤还是炖菜？来一碗，配面包。"}},"希腊沙拉":{"what":"希腊的「乡村沙拉」：番茄、黄瓜、洋葱、青椒、橄榄，上面盖一整块菲达奶酪，淋橄榄油。","what_en":"Greece's 'village salad': tomato, cucumber, onion, green pepper and olives under a whole slab of feta, drizzled with olive oil.","fame":"夏天希腊每家小酒馆都有，大家用面包蘸碗底的番茄汁和橄榄油；在希腊它叫 horiatiki，几乎每顿夏天的饭都会点一份大家分着吃。","fame_en":"Every Greek taverna serves it in summer, and people mop up the tomato juice and oil with bread; in Greece it's called horiatiki and almost every summer meal includes one to share.","fact":"正宗的希腊沙拉里没有生菜——希腊的生菜冬天才长，这是一道夏天的菜。现在餐馆里这种样子，据说是 1960 年代雅典旅游热时才定型的，比很多人想的年轻。","fact_en":"A real Greek salad has no lettuce — in Greece lettuce grows in winter, and this is a summer dish. The version restaurants serve today is said to have taken shape during Athens' 1960s tourism boom — younger than most people think.","src":"Tasting Table · Why traditional Greek salad has no lettuce","url":"https://tastingtable.com/1822385/why-no-lettuce-greek-salad","say":{"en":"One horiatiki to share, and some bread, please.","zh":"来一份乡村沙拉大家分着吃，再要点面包。"}},"俄罗斯大列巴":{"what":"俄式大圆面包，又大又硬、外壳焦香；在中国最有名的是哈尔滨的「大列巴」。","what_en":"A big, round Russian-style loaf with a crusty, toasty shell — in China, best known as Harbin's 'dalieba'.","fame":"一个两三斤重，切片配红肠、黄油、汤吃；哈尔滨人出远门、过年送礼都带它，它和红肠一起成了哈尔滨的「城市特产」。","fame_en":"One loaf weighs a kilo or more, sliced to eat with red sausage, butter or soup; Harbin locals take it as a gift when travelling or at New Year — together with red sausage it's the city's signature souvenir.","fact":"「列巴」就是俄语 хлеб（面包）的音译，「大列巴」就是「大面包」。1900 年代初，俄国面包师跟着修中东铁路的人来到哈尔滨，把俄式面包的做法带了过来；现在秋林公司做的大列巴被当成最正宗的。","fact_en":"'Lieba' is simply the Russian word хлеб (bread), so 'dalieba' means 'big bread'. In the early 1900s Russian bakers came to Harbin with the workers building the Chinese Eastern Railway and brought their bread with them; today Qiulin's dalieba is considered the most authentic.","src":"Wikipedia · Dalieba","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dalieba","say":{"en":"Could you slice the loaf for me? It's too big to carry whole.","zh":"能帮我把面包切成片吗？整个太大不好拿。"}},"瑞典肉丸":{"what":"瑞典的 köttbullar，小小的肉丸配奶油肉汁、土豆泥和越橘酱。","what_en":"Sweden's köttbullar — little meatballs with cream gravy, mashed potatoes and lingonberry jam.","fame":"这是瑞典人从小吃到大的家常菜，节日自助餐上也少不了；全世界的人大多是在宜家餐厅第一次吃到的。","fame_en":"It's the home cooking Swedes grow up on and a fixture of holiday buffets; most people around the world first try it at an IKEA restaurant.","fact":"2018 年 4 月，瑞典官方推特账号发帖说：瑞典肉丸其实是根据卡尔十二世国王从土耳其带回来的食谱做的——他 1709 到 1714 年流亡在奥斯曼帝国。不过有历史学家觉得这个说法太简单了。","fact_en":"In April 2018 Sweden's official Twitter account said Swedish meatballs are actually based on a recipe King Charles XII brought back from Turkey, where he lived in exile in the Ottoman Empire from 1709 to 1714. Some historians think the story is too neat, though.","src":"The Local Sweden · Internet goes crazy over Swedish meatballs' Turkish origin","url":"https://www.thelocal.se/20180502/internet-goes-crazy-over-swedish-meatballs-turkish-origin","say":{"en":"Fifteen meatballs with mash, and extra lingonberries, please.","zh":"十五个肉丸配土豆泥，越橘酱多给一点。"}},"丹麦曲奇":{"what":"丹麦黄油曲奇，装在蓝色圆铁盒里，有圆圈、麻花、椒盐的，每个放在小纸托里。","what_en":"Danish butter cookies in a round blue tin — rings, pretzels and sugar-sprinkled ones, each in a paper cup.","fame":"过年过节送礼的「标配」，在很多国家的家里，吃完的蓝铁盒会被留下来装针线、纽扣——打开蓝罐发现是针线，成了好多人共同的童年笑话。","fame_en":"A go-to holiday gift, and in homes across many countries the empty blue tin ends up holding needles and buttons — opening it to find sewing kit instead of cookies is a shared childhood joke.","fact":"在香港，丹麦曲奇有个外号叫「蓝罐曲奇」，是过年送礼必备。丹麦的 Kjeldsens 公司说，1963 年香港商人 Roger Lobo 第一次给香港下了订单，从那以后香港一直是它最重要的市场之一。","fact_en":"In Hong Kong they're simply 'blue tin cookies', a must-have New Year gift. Denmark's Kjeldsens says Hong Kong businessman Roger Lobo placed the first order for the city in 1963 — and Hong Kong has been one of its biggest markets ever since.","src":"Atlas Obscura · How Danish cookies won over Hong Kong","url":"https://www.atlasobscura.com/articles/kjeldsens-danish-cookies-hong-kong","say":{"en":"Is this tin big enough as a gift, or should I get the larger one?","zh":"这盒当礼物够大吗，还是该买大一号的？"}},"法国红酒":{"what":"法国的葡萄酒，最有名的产区是波尔多和勃艮第；波尔多红酒多是几种葡萄混酿。","what_en":"French wine — Bordeaux and Burgundy are the best-known regions; Bordeaux reds are usually blends of several grapes.","fame":"法国人日常吃饭就配一杯，超市里几欧元一瓶的也能喝得很开心；波尔多吉伦特河两岸的酒庄（château）一座连一座，有的能开车进去参观品酒。","fame_en":"In France a glass goes with everyday meals, and a few-euro supermarket bottle is perfectly fine; Bordeaux's châteaux line both banks of the Gironde, and many welcome visitors for tastings.","fact":"波尔多最有名的「1855 年分级」是为了巴黎世博会，由酒商按酒价排出来的，一百多年几乎没改过：唯一一次进最高一级的变动，是 1973 年木桐酒庄从二级升为一级，它的标签上写着「如今第一，曾经第二，木桐不变」。","fact_en":"Bordeaux's famous 1855 Classification was drawn up by brokers by price for the Paris World's Fair and has barely changed since: the only change to the top tier came in 1973, when Mouton Rothschild rose from second to first growth — its label read 'First I am, second I was, Mouton does not change'.","src":"Wikipedia · Château Mouton Rothschild","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ch%C3%A2teau_Mouton_Rothschild","say":{"en":"Which wine from Bordeaux would you suggest under 20 euros?","zh":"20 欧元以内的波尔多，你推荐哪一瓶？"}},"意式冰淇淋":{"what":"意大利的 gelato，比一般冰淇淋奶油少、空气少，更密、更绵，用小铲子抹成一个个尖。","what_en":"Italian gelato — less cream and less air than ice cream, so it's denser and silkier, served with a flat spatula.","fame":"意大利人夏天晚饭后散步，手里一个蛋筒就是全部的夜生活；行家看冰淇淋店：堆得像小山、颜色鲜艳的可能不新鲜，盖着金属盖的往往是自己做的。","fame_en":"On summer evenings Italians stroll after dinner with a cone — that's the whole night out; insiders say mountains of brightly coloured gelato may not be fresh, while flavours kept in covered metal tubs are often made in-house.","fact":"佛罗伦萨人说 gelato 是他们发明的：传说 1559 年左右，美第奇家族的建筑师和宴会策划 Bernardo Buontalenti 为了招待西班牙使节，做出了加蛋黄和牛奶的冰品。现在佛罗伦萨的冰淇淋店里还有一个口味就叫「Buontalenti」。不过这更多是流传的故事，没有确凿记载。","fact_en":"Florentines say they invented gelato: legend has Medici architect and party-planner Bernardo Buontalenti creating a frozen treat with egg yolk and milk to impress Spanish envoys around 1559. Florence's gelaterie still sell a flavour called 'Buontalenti' — though it's more legend than documented history.","src":"Fantastic Florence · Bernardo Buontalenti, first inventor of the gelato","url":"https://fantasticflorence.com/bernardo-buontalenti-first-inventor-of-the-gelato/","say":{"en":"A small cone with two flavours — pistachio and Buontalenti, please.","zh":"一个小号蛋筒，两种口味——开心果和 Buontalenti。"}},"基伍湖":{"what":"卢旺达和刚果（金）交界的一大片高山湖，湖边的鲁巴武是卢旺达人周末去游泳、吃烤鱼的地方。","what_en":"A big highland lake on the border of Rwanda and DR Congo; Rubavu on its shore is where Rwandans go at weekends to swim and eat grilled fish.","fame":"它是非洲大湖之一，湖水很深，四周是绿色的山和小岛；卢旺达不靠海，基伍湖就是这个国家的「海边」，沙滩、划船、看日落都在这儿。","fame_en":"It's one of Africa's Great Lakes — deep water ringed by green hills and islands. Rwanda has no coast, so Lake Kivu is its seaside: beaches, boat trips and sunsets.","fact":"湖底溶着大量甲烷。卢旺达把它抽上来发电：2015 年 12 月起，KivuWatt 电站用湖底抽出的甲烷发出 26 兆瓦的电，2016 年 5 月由卡加梅总统正式剪彩。","fact_en":"The deep water holds huge amounts of dissolved methane. Rwanda now pumps it up for power: since December 2015 the KivuWatt plant has made 26 MW of electricity from the lake's methane, and President Kagame officially opened it in May 2016.","src":"Phys.org / AFP：Rwanda opens pioneering methane electricity plant（2016）","url":"https://phys.org/news/2016-05-rwanda-methane-electricity.html","say":{"en":"Is it safe to swim here? Where can we rent a boat?","zh":"这儿能游泳吗？在哪儿可以租船？"}},"马卡迪卡迪盐沼":{"what":"博茨瓦纳中部一片一眼望不到边的白色盐碱地，旱季像月球表面，雨季积水变成浅湖。","what_en":"A vast white salt pan in central Botswana — moon-like in the dry season, a shallow lake when the rains come.","fame":"它是世界上最大的盐沼之一，是一个远古大湖干掉后留下的。旱季可以在盐地上露营看满天星星、看狐獴；雨季来了，成千上万的火烈鸟和斑马跟着水和草赶过来。","fame_en":"It's one of the biggest salt pans on Earth, left behind by an ancient lake that dried up. In the dry season people camp on the salt under the stars and watch meerkats; in the rains, flamingos and zebras arrive by the thousands.","fact":"科学家 2007–2009 年给奥卡万戈三角洲的斑马戴上 GPS 项圈，发现被追踪的斑马里一半以上每年在三角洲和马卡迪卡迪之间来回走一趟，往返约 588 公里，是非洲很长的一条斑马迁徙路线。","fact_en":"Researchers fitted zebras in the Okavango Delta with GPS collars in 2007–2009 and found that more than half of the tracked animals walk to the Makgadikgadi and back every year — a round trip of about 588 km, one of Africa's longest zebra migrations.","src":"Bartlam-Brooks 等，Oryx 期刊（剑桥大学出版社）","url":"https://www.cambridge.org/core/product/6AB4B216E2B4CCC49F7CD3B990354DC1/core-reader","say":{"en":"How far out on the pan can we drive? Do we need a guide?","zh":"车能往盐沼里开多远？需要请向导吗？"}},"死海":{"what":"约旦和以色列之间的一个咸水湖，盐多到人躺在水上不会沉。","what_en":"A salt lake between Jordan and Israel, so salty that you float lying on the water.","fame":"湖面比海平面低 400 多米，是地球陆地上最低的地方；来的人都要拍一张「躺在水上看报纸」，再从头到脚抹一身黑泥。","fame_en":"Its surface is more than 400 m below sea level — the lowest land on Earth. Everyone takes the 'reading a newspaper while floating' photo and covers themselves in black mud.","fact":"死海在一年年变小：以色列环境部的数据是水面每年下降约 1.2 米，比上世纪七八十年代的每年 0.7 米还快。退下去的湖岸留下了几千个突然塌下去的地洞。","fact_en":"The Dead Sea is shrinking: Israel's Environment Ministry says the water level drops about 1.2 m a year, faster than the 0.7 m a year of the 1970s and 80s. The retreating shore is now pocked with thousands of sinkholes.","src":"Globes：Dead Sea level falling 1.2 meters per year","url":"https://en.globes.co.il/en/article-dead-sea-level-falling-12-meters-per-year-1001223618","say":{"en":"Can I shower here after I get out? Don't get water in your eyes!","zh":"出来以后这儿能冲澡吗？别让水进眼睛！"}},"桌山":{"what":"开普敦城市背后一座山顶平平的大山，像一张桌子。","what_en":"The flat-topped mountain behind Cape Town that looks like a giant table.","fame":"在开普敦哪儿都能看到它；可以走路爬上去，也可以坐缆车上去看大西洋和整座城。山顶常盖着一层白云，开普敦人叫它「桌布」。","fame_en":"You can see it from almost anywhere in Cape Town. Hike up or take the cable car for views over the Atlantic and the city. When a white cloud spills over the top, locals call it the 'tablecloth'.","fact":"1997 年换上的瑞士缆车车厢地板会转：一趟上山或下山，车厢地板慢慢转一整圈，每个人都能看到 360 度的风景，不用抢窗边。","fact_en":"Since 1997 the cable cars have rotating floors: on each trip up or down, the floor turns a full circle, so everyone gets the 360-degree view without fighting for the window.","src":"Wikipedia：Table Mountain Aerial Cableway","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Table_Mountain_Aerial_Cableway","say":{"en":"Is the cableway open today, or is it too windy?","zh":"今天缆车开吗？还是风太大停了？"}},"猴面包树":{"what":"马达加斯加西海岸穆龙达瓦附近的一条土路，两边站着二十多棵几百岁的巨大猴面包树。","what_en":"A dirt road near Morondava on Madagascar's west coast, lined with a couple of dozen giant baobabs hundreds of years old.","fame":"这些树树干又粗又直、树冠很小，像倒着种的树；日出和日落时整条路被染成橙红色，是马达加斯加最有名的照片。","fame_en":"Their thick straight trunks and tiny crowns make them look like trees planted upside down. At sunrise and sunset the whole road glows orange — Madagascar's most famous photo.","fact":"路边这些约 30 米高的树是马达加斯加特有的品种。这条大道 2007 年先拿到临时保护，2015 年成了马达加斯加第一个「自然纪念地」。","fact_en":"These trees, about 30 m tall, are a species found only in Madagascar. The avenue got temporary protection in 2007 and in 2015 became Madagascar's first natural monument.","src":"Wikipedia：Avenue of the Baobabs","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Avenue_of_the_Baobabs","say":{"en":"What time is sunset? Where's the best spot to stand?","zh":"几点日落？站在哪儿拍最好？"}},"红海潜水":{"what":"在埃及西奈半岛南端的沙姆沙伊赫下水，看红海的珊瑚礁和鱼。","what_en":"Diving into the Red Sea's coral reefs from Sharm el-Sheikh, at the southern tip of Egypt's Sinai.","fame":"这里水温暖、能见度高，离岸几步就是彩色珊瑚墙，是欧洲人最爱的潜水度假地；很多人在这儿考了人生第一张潜水证。","fame_en":"Warm, clear water and coral walls just off the beach make it Europe's favourite dive holiday — many people get their first diving licence here.","fact":"附近海底躺着英国货船「蓟花号」（SS Thistlegorm），1941 年被炸沉，船舱里还装着当年的摩托车、卡车和军靴。1950 年代初，法国潜水家库斯托靠当地渔民指路找到了它，还从船上捞起过一辆摩托车和船钟。","fact_en":"Nearby lies the British cargo ship SS Thistlegorm, sunk by bombs in 1941 with motorbikes, trucks and boots still in its holds. In the early 1950s Jacques Cousteau found it with tips from local fishermen, and raised a motorbike and the ship's bell.","src":"Wikipedia：SS Thistlegorm","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SS_Thistlegorm","say":{"en":"I've only done a few dives. Is this site OK for beginners?","zh":"我只潜过几次，这个点适合新手吗？"}},"梅尔祖卡沙丘":{"what":"摩洛哥东南部撒哈拉边上的一片橙红色大沙丘（Erg Chebbi），最高的有一百多米。","what_en":"A sea of orange sand dunes (Erg Chebbi) on the edge of the Sahara in south-eastern Morocco; the tallest rise over 100 m.","fame":"这里是最容易到的「撒哈拉」：骑骆驼进沙丘、在帐篷营地过夜、半夜看满天星星、早上爬上沙丘看日出。","fame_en":"It's the easiest Sahara to reach: ride a camel into the dunes, sleep in a desert camp, see the stars at midnight and climb a dune for sunrise.","fact":"2024 年 9 月，两天的暴雨比当地一年的雨还多，梅尔祖卡的沙丘之间积出了一个个蓝色的湖；气象学家说这么短时间下这么多雨，是三五十年来没见过的。","fact_en":"In September 2024, two days of storms dropped more than a year's rain, leaving blue lakes between Merzouga's dunes — the most rain in such a short time in 30 to 50 years, meteorologists said.","src":"AP / AccuWeather：The Sahara Desert flooded for the first time in decades（2024）","url":"https://www.accuweather.com/en/weather-news/the-sahara-desert-flooded-for-the-first-time-in-decades-heres-what-it-looks-like/1704017","say":{"en":"How long is the camel ride to the camp? Is dinner included?","zh":"骑骆驼到营地要多久？包晚饭吗？"}},"达纳基尔洼地":{"what":"埃塞俄比亚东北部阿法尔地区一片低于海平面的荒漠，有盐田、硫磺泉和冒烟的火山。","what_en":"A desert below sea level in Ethiopia's Afar region, full of salt flats, sulphur springs and smoking volcanoes.","fame":"这里像另一个星球：黄绿色的硫磺池、白色的盐山、晚上还能看到熔岩湖。阿法尔人至今用斧头砍盐砖，让骆驼队驮出去卖。","fame_en":"It looks like another planet: yellow-green sulphur pools, white salt hills, a glowing lava lake at night. Afar workers still cut salt blocks by hand and send them out by camel caravan.","fact":"洼地里的达洛尔（Dallol）1960–1966 年测到的年平均气温约 34.6°C，是有人住过的地方里记录到的最高年平均气温。","fact_en":"Dallol, in the depression, recorded an average yearly temperature of about 34.6°C in 1960–1966 — the highest annual average ever measured at an inhabited place.","src":"Wikipedia：Dallol (ghost town)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dallol_(ghost_town)","say":{"en":"How much water should I bring? When do we leave to avoid the heat?","zh":"要带多少水？几点出发能躲开最热的时候？"}},"青尼罗河瀑布":{"what":"埃塞俄比亚巴赫达尔附近的瀑布，当地叫 Tis Abay，意思是「大烟」。","what_en":"A waterfall near Bahir Dar in Ethiopia, called Tis Abay — 'great smoke' — in Amharic.","fame":"青尼罗河从塔纳湖流出来不远就在这儿跌下 40 多米，雨季时水雾像烟一样升起；尼罗河的大部分水其实来自青尼罗河。","fame_en":"Soon after leaving Lake Tana, the Blue Nile drops over 40 m here, sending up 'smoke' of spray in the rainy season. Most of the Nile's water actually comes from the Blue Nile.","fact":"从 2003 年起，旁边的水电站把大部分水引走发电，除了雨季，瀑布常常只剩几股细流。想看它最壮观的样子，要在 7 到 9 月的雨季来。","fact_en":"Since 2003 a hydroelectric station has taken most of the flow, so outside the rainy season the falls are often just a few thin streams. To see them at full power, come in the July–September rains.","src":"Wikipedia：Blue Nile Falls","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Nile_Falls","say":{"en":"Is there much water in the falls at the moment?","zh":"现在瀑布的水多吗？"}},"马赛马拉热气球":{"what":"天刚亮时坐热气球飘在肯尼亚马赛马拉草原上空，往下看动物。","what_en":"Floating over Kenya's Maasai Mara at dawn in a hot-air balloon, watching the animals below.","fame":"热气球不出声，可以慢慢飘过象群、长颈鹿和狮子；七到十月角马大迁徙时，从天上能看到一条长长的角马队伍。落地后在草原上吃香槟早餐。","fame_en":"The balloon is silent, so you drift slowly over elephants, giraffes and lions; during the July–October migration you can see long lines of wildebeest from above. Then breakfast with champagne on the grass.","fact":"马赛马拉的热气球游已经有几十年历史：老牌的 Governors' Balloon Safaris 2018 年庆祝在这片草原上飞满 40 年，四十年里载过的乘客超过 10 万人。","fact_en":"Balloon safaris in the Mara go back decades: in 2018 Governors' Balloon Safaris celebrated 40 years of flying over these plains, with well over 100,000 passengers in that time.","src":"ATTA：Governors' Balloon Safaris celebrates 40 years（2018）","url":"https://atta.travel/resource/governors-balloon-safaris-celebrates-40-years-of-hot-air-ballooning-in-the-masai-mara.html","say":{"en":"What time is the pick-up? How long are we in the air?","zh":"几点来接？在天上飞多久？"}},"恩戈罗恩戈罗火山口":{"what":"坦桑尼亚北部一个塌下去的巨大火山口，像一只大碗，碗底是草原和湖，住满了野生动物。","what_en":"A huge collapsed volcano in northern Tanzania, shaped like a giant bowl, with grassland and a lake on the floor full of wild animals.","fame":"火山口边缘有六百米高，大部分动物一辈子都住在碗里，所以一天之内就可能看到狮子、大象、河马，运气好还有很难见到的黑犀牛。马赛人在保护区里放牛，和野生动物住在一起。","fame_en":"The rim is about 600 m high and most animals spend their whole lives inside the bowl, so in one day you might see lions, elephants, hippos and, with luck, the rare black rhino. Maasai herders graze cattle in the conservation area alongside the wildlife.","fact":"它 1979 年作为自然遗产进了世界遗产名录，2010 年又加上了文化遗产的标准，变成「双重遗产」——因为保护区里的莱托利有 360 多万年前人类祖先直立行走留下的脚印。","fact_en":"It joined the World Heritage list as a natural site in 1979, and in 2010 a cultural criterion was added, making it a mixed site — because Laetoli, inside the area, preserves footprints of early humans walking upright more than 3.6 million years ago.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产中心：Ngorongoro Conservation Area","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/39","say":{"en":"Can we stop here for a minute? I think I see a rhino!","zh":"能在这儿停一下吗？我好像看到犀牛了！"}},"龙山":{"what":"南非夸祖鲁-纳塔尔省和莱索托交界的一长条高山（Drakensberg），绿色的山坡上面是一面面巨大的岩壁。","what_en":"The long mountain range (the Drakensberg) on the border of South Africa's KwaZulu-Natal and Lesotho — green slopes topped by enormous rock walls.","fame":"这里是南非人最爱的徒步地：「圆形剧场」岩壁有五公里长，图盖拉瀑布从上面跳下来；山洞里还留着桑人几千年来画的羚羊和猎人。","fame_en":"It's South Africans' favourite place to hike: the Amphitheatre wall is 5 km long, with Tugela Falls pouring off it, and caves still hold the eland and hunters painted by San people over thousands of years.","fact":"联合国教科文组织说，这里的岩画是撒哈拉以南非洲最大、最集中的一批，桑人在这片山里画了四千多年。2013 年，世界遗产又往山那边扩到了莱索托的塞拉巴特贝国家公园，变成两国共有的「马洛蒂-龙山公园」。","fact_en":"UNESCO calls its rock art the largest and most concentrated group of paintings in Africa south of the Sahara, made by San people over more than 4,000 years. In 2013 the World Heritage site was extended across the border to Lesotho's Sehlabathebe National Park, becoming the shared Maloti-Drakensberg Park.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产中心：Maloti-Drakensberg Park","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/985","say":{"en":"Which trail goes to the rock paintings? Do we need a guide?","zh":"哪条步道能去看岩画？要请向导吗？"}},"黥基石林":{"what":"马达加斯加西部贝马拉哈的一片石灰岩「刀山」，成千上万根尖石柱挤在一起。","what_en":"A 'forest' of razor-sharp limestone spikes at Bemaraha in western Madagascar.","fame":"石柱有的几十米高、边缘像刀一样锋利，游客要系安全绳、走吊桥穿过去；石缝里藏着只有这儿才有的狐猴、变色龙和植物。它是世界自然遗产。","fame_en":"Some spikes are tens of metres tall with knife-sharp edges; visitors clip onto safety ropes and cross hanging bridges between them. Lemurs, chameleons and plants found nowhere else hide in the gaps. It's a natural World Heritage Site.","fact":"「Tsingy」这个当地词，常被翻成「光着脚走不了的地方」——真的走一趟就知道，鞋底都可能被划破。","fact_en":"The local word 'tsingy' is usually translated as 'the place where one cannot walk barefoot' — after one walk there you'll see why; even shoe soles can get cut.","src":"Wikipedia：Tsingy de Bemaraha National Park","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsingy_de_Bemaraha_National_Park","say":{"en":"Is the harness included? How long is the Grand Tsingy circuit?","zh":"安全绳包含在里面吗？大石林那条路线要走多久？"}},"诺西贝香水岛":{"what":"马达加斯加西北海边的一座度假岛，空气里常有依兰花香，所以叫「香水岛」。","what_en":"A holiday island off Madagascar's north-west coast, nicknamed the 'Perfume Island' for the scent of ylang-ylang in the air.","fame":"岛上种满了依兰、香草和胡椒，依兰花蒸出来的精油卖给全世界的香水公司；海边是潜水、看鲸鲨和看日落的地方。","fame_en":"The island is planted with ylang-ylang, vanilla and pepper, and its distilled ylang-ylang oil goes to perfume houses around the world. On the coast, people dive, swim with whale sharks and watch sunsets.","fact":"「Nosy Be」在马达加斯加语里的意思是「大岛」。这里以前主要种甘蔗、做糖和朗姆酒，现在岛上最主要的两件事换成了种依兰做精油，和旅游。","fact_en":"'Nosy Be' means 'big island' in Malagasy. It used to be all about sugar cane, sugar and rum; today its two main businesses are ylang-ylang for essential oil, and tourism.","src":"Wikipedia：Nosy Be","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nosy_Be","say":{"en":"Can we visit the distillery? Can I buy a small bottle of ylang-ylang oil?","zh":"能参观蒸馏坊吗？我能买一小瓶依兰精油吗？"}},"祖玛岩":{"what":"尼日利亚首都阿布贾外面一块拔地而起的巨大单体花岗岩，岩面上的纹路像一张人脸。","what_en":"A giant lone rock rising beside the road outside Abuja, Nigeria, with markings that look like a human face.","fame":"它大约 725 米高（海拔），从阿布贾往北开车一定会经过，被叫作「阿布贾的大门」；当地的格巴吉人把它当作神圣的地方，以前打仗时还躲到岩上。","fame_en":"About 725 m above sea level, it stands beside the main road north of Abuja and is called the 'Gateway to Abuja'. The local Gbagyi people hold it sacred and once retreated onto it during wars.","fact":"它印在尼日利亚的 100 奈拉纸币上。虽然叫「阿布贾的大门」，它其实不在首都联邦区，而在旁边尼日尔州的马达拉。","fact_en":"It's printed on Nigeria's 100-naira note. Despite being called the Gateway to Abuja, it isn't in the Federal Capital Territory at all — it's in Madalla, in neighbouring Niger State.","src":"Wikipedia：Zuma Rock","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zuma_Rock","say":{"en":"Can we pull over here for a photo of Zuma Rock?","zh":"能在这儿靠边停一下拍祖玛岩吗？"}},"卡库姆吊桥":{"what":"加纳卡库姆国家公园里挂在大树之间的一串吊桥，人在雨林的树冠上走。","what_en":"A chain of rope bridges strung between giant trees in Ghana's Kakum National Park — you walk through the rainforest canopy.","fame":"七座吊桥连起来三百多米，最高处离地四十米左右，脚下是晃动的木板和绳网；去海岸角城堡的路上，加纳的学校和游客几乎都会来走一趟。","fame_en":"Seven bridges add up to over 300 m, as high as about 40 m above the forest floor, with swaying planks and rope nets underfoot. School groups and visitors on the way to Cape Coast almost always stop here.","fact":"这条树冠步道 1995 年在世界地球日那天开放，是两位加拿大工程师和五位加纳人一起设计的，七座吊桥挂在离地 130 多英尺（约 40 米）的树上。","fact_en":"The canopy walk opened on Earth Day in 1995, designed by two Canadian engineers and five Ghanaians, with seven bridges hanging from trees more than 130 feet (about 40 m) above the ground.","src":"Atlas Obscura：Kakum Canopy Walk","url":"https://www.atlasobscura.com/places/kakum-canopy-walk","say":{"en":"Is it OK if I go slowly? I'm a bit scared of heights.","zh":"我能慢慢走吗？我有点恐高。"}},"沃尔特湖":{"what":"加纳东部一个长长的大湖，是 1960 年代修阿科松博大坝时把沃尔特河拦起来形成的。","what_en":"A long lake in eastern Ghana, formed when the Akosombo Dam blocked the Volta River in the 1960s.","fame":"大坝发的电点亮了加纳的城市和铝厂；湖上有渡轮从南开到北，沿岸的人靠打鱼和船运过日子。周末阿克拉人去阿科松博坐船、吃烤罗非鱼。","fame_en":"The dam's electricity powered Ghana's cities and an aluminium smelter; ferries run the length of the lake, and lakeside towns live from fishing and boats. At weekends people from Accra go to Akosombo for boat rides and grilled tilapia.","fact":"按水面面积算，它是世界上最大的人工湖，大约占加纳国土的 3.6%。为了修它，约 8 万人——当时加纳人口的 1%——从 700 个村子搬进了 52 个新建的安置村。","fact_en":"By surface area it's the largest man-made lake in the world, covering about 3.6% of Ghana. About 80,000 people — 1% of the population at the time — were moved from 700 villages into 52 new resettlement villages.","src":"Wikipedia：Akosombo Dam","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Akosombo_Dam","say":{"en":"What time does the boat leave? Can we buy fish on board?","zh":"船几点开？船上能买鱼吃吗？"}},"尼罗河源头":{"what":"乌干达金贾，尼罗河从维多利亚湖流出来的地方，这条河从这里一路向北流到地中海。","what_en":"Jinja in Uganda, where the Nile flows out of Lake Victoria to begin its journey north to the Mediterranean.","fame":"游客坐小船到河口，看湖水变成河水；往下游不远就是白水漂流、蹦极和皮划艇的地方，金贾因此成了东非的「冒险之都」。","fame_en":"Visitors take a small boat to the spot where the lake becomes a river. Just downstream are white-water rafting, bungee jumping and kayaking, which make Jinja East Africa's adventure capital.","fact":"1862 年英国探险家斯皮克在这里看到一道瀑布，认定它就是尼罗河的源头，这就是里彭瀑布。1954 年建成的欧文瀑布大坝抬高了水位，里彭瀑布从此永远沉到了水下。","fact_en":"In 1862 the British explorer Speke saw a waterfall here and declared it the source of the Nile — Ripon Falls. The Owen Falls Dam, finished in 1954, raised the water and the falls disappeared underwater for good.","src":"Wikipedia：Ripon Falls","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ripon_Falls","say":{"en":"How much is the boat to the source? Is rafting OK for first-timers?","zh":"坐船去源头多少钱？第一次玩漂流可以吗？"}},"骷髅海岸":{"what":"纳米比亚北部大西洋边一条荒凉的海岸，沙漠直接碰到冰冷的海，岸上躺着沉船。","what_en":"A wild stretch of Namibia's northern Atlantic coast where desert meets a cold, foggy sea and shipwrecks rust on the sand.","fame":"浓雾、暗礁和巨浪让很多船在这里出事，生锈的船骨就留在沙滩上；岸边住着成千上万的海狗，沙漠里还有会找水的沙漠象和狮子。","fame_en":"Fog, reefs and big waves wrecked many ships here, and their rusting hulls lie on the beach. Thousands of fur seals crowd the shore, and desert elephants and lions roam the dunes inland.","fact":"「骷髅」最早指的是捕鲸时代留下满地的鲸骨和海豹骨，后来才加上了沉船。内陆的桑人叫这里「上帝生气时造的地方」，葡萄牙水手叫它「地狱之门」。","fact_en":"The 'skeletons' were first the whale and seal bones left from the whaling days; the shipwrecks came later. The San people inland called it 'the land God made in anger', and Portuguese sailors called it 'the Gates of Hell'.","src":"Wikipedia：Skeleton Coast","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skeleton_Coast","say":{"en":"Do we need a permit to drive up the coast? Where can we fill up?","zh":"沿海岸往北开需要许可证吗？在哪儿加油？"}},"恩希玛":{"what":"赞比亚人天天吃的白玉米面团，用玉米面加水在锅里搅到很硬，配一碗菜或肉吃。","what_en":"The stiff white maize porridge Zambians eat every day — maize meal stirred with water until firm, eaten with a bowl of vegetables or meat.","fame":"赞比亚人常说「没吃恩希玛就等于没吃饭」。用右手揪一小团，搓圆、按个小窝，蘸着配菜（当地叫 relish：炖牛肉、小鱼干、南瓜叶）送进嘴里。","fame_en":"Zambians say a meal without nshima isn't a meal. You pinch off a piece with your right hand, roll it, press a dip in it and scoop up the 'relish' — beef stew, dried fish or pumpkin leaves.","fact":"玉米是从美洲传来的。赞比亚人大量用玉米做恩希玛，其实是二十世纪下半叶的事；在那之前，比如本巴人吃的稠粥是用小米做的，叫 ubwali。","fact_en":"Maize came from the Americas. Zambians only switched to making nshima mainly from maize in the second half of the 20th century; before that, the Bemba, for example, ate a thick millet porridge called ubwali.","src":"Wikipedia：Zambian cuisine","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zambian_cuisine","say":{"en":"One nshima with beef relish, please. Where can I wash my hands?","zh":"一份恩希玛配炖牛肉，谢谢。在哪儿洗手？"}},"塞斯瓦":{"what":"博茨瓦纳的国菜：牛肉或羊肉只放盐和水煮到烂，再捣成一丝一丝的肉。","what_en":"Botswana's national dish: beef or goat boiled with only salt and water until tender, then pounded into shreds.","fame":"婚礼、葬礼、独立日这些大日子一定有它；常用三脚铁锅在柴火上慢慢煮，配玉米糊（pap）或高粱粥一起吃。","fame_en":"It's served at weddings, funerals and Independence Day; it's often slow-cooked in a three-legged iron pot over a fire and eaten with pap (maize porridge) or sorghum porridge.","fact":"调料只有「刚好够的盐」。它还有两个名字：博茨瓦纳北部叫 seswaa，南部和南非西部叫 loswao。","fact_en":"The only seasoning is 'just enough salt'. It also has two names: seswaa in the north of Botswana, loswao in the south and in western South Africa.","src":"Wikipedia：Seswaa","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seswaa","say":{"en":"Can I have seswaa with pap, please? Is it beef or goat today?","zh":"请给我一份塞斯瓦配玉米糊。今天是牛肉还是羊肉？"}},"纳米比亚啤酒":{"what":"纳米比亚产的啤酒，最有名的是首都温得和克酿的 Windhoek Lager。","what_en":"Beer brewed in Namibia, best known for Windhoek Lager from the capital.","fame":"纳米比亚曾是德国殖民地，啤酒也照德国的方法酿；在南部非洲的酒吧、野营地和 braai（烧烤）上，一冰箱的 Windhoek 很常见。","fame_en":"Namibia was once a German colony and its beer is brewed the German way; across southern Africa, a fridge full of Windhoek is a common sight at bars, campsites and braais.","fact":"纳米比亚酿酒厂说它所有的啤酒都按德国 1516 年的《啤酒纯净法》酿，只用麦芽、啤酒花和水，自称是撒哈拉以南非洲唯一这样做的大型啤酒厂。2023 年这家厂被喜力收购。","fact_en":"Namibia Breweries says all its beers follow Germany's 1516 Reinheitsgebot — only malt, hops and water — and calls itself the only large brewery in sub-Saharan Africa to do so. Heineken completed its purchase of the brewery in 2023.","src":"Wikipedia：Namibia Breweries Limited","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Namibia_Breweries_Limited","say":{"en":"Two cold Windhoeks, please. Do you have a draught?","zh":"两瓶冰的 Windhoek，谢谢。有生啤吗？"}},"马里花生炖菜":{"what":"西非的花生酱炖肉（mafé），用花生酱、番茄和肉一起炖得浓浓的，浇在米饭上吃。","what_en":"West Africa's peanut stew (mafé) — meat simmered with peanut butter and tomato into a thick sauce, served over rice.","fame":"在马里叫 tigadèguèna，塞内加尔、冈比亚也各有自己的版本，几个国家都说是自己的；在巴黎的马里、塞内加尔小饭馆，它是最常点的家常菜之一。","fame_en":"In Mali it's called tigadèguèna, and Senegal and The Gambia have their own versions — each country claims it. In Malian and Senegalese canteens in Paris, it's one of the most-ordered home dishes.","fact":"马里的叫法 tigadèguèna 拆开就是「花生-酱-汁」（tiga 花生、dɛgɛ 酱、na 汁）。塞内加尔版的一种变体还跟着被贩卖的非洲人去了北美，变成了「弗吉尼亚花生汤」。","fact_en":"Mali's name, tigadèguèna, breaks down as 'peanut-paste-sauce' (tiga, dɛgɛ, na). A version of Senegalese maafe even travelled with enslaved Africans to North America, becoming 'Virginia peanut soup'.","src":"Wikipedia：Peanut stew","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peanut_stew","say":{"en":"Is the mafé with chicken or beef? Not too spicy, please.","zh":"花生炖菜是鸡肉还是牛肉的？别太辣，谢谢。"}},"萨杂":{"what":"津巴布韦人每天吃的白玉米面团（sadza），配炖肉、青菜或小鱼干吃。","what_en":"The white maize-meal staple (sadza) Zimbabweans eat every day, with stew, greens or dried fish.","fame":"一顿饭有萨杂才算吃饱。津巴布韦人用手揪一团，搓成球，蘸着肉汤和蔬菜（muriwo）吃；家里来客人，主人一定先问「吃萨杂了吗」。","fame_en":"A meal isn't complete without sadza. Zimbabweans roll a ball with their hand and dip it in stew and greens (muriwo); when guests come, the first question is whether they've eaten.","fact":"在玉米传来之前，萨杂是用小米做的。津巴布韦人偏爱白玉米面；遇上饥荒只能吃黄玉米面时，大家把黄玉米面叫作「Kenya」，因为它曾经从肯尼亚进口。","fact_en":"Before maize arrived, sadza was made from millet. Zimbabweans prefer white maize meal; in hard times when only yellow meal was available, people called it 'Kenya', because it was once imported from there.","src":"Wikipedia：Ugali（Zimbabwe 一节）","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ugali","say":{"en":"Sadza with beef stew and greens, please. Can I have a little more sadza?","zh":"请给我萨杂配炖牛肉和青菜。能再多给一点萨杂吗？"}},"马托基":{"what":"乌干达人天天吃的绿色煮香蕉泥（matooke），用香蕉叶包着蒸，再配花生酱或肉汤。","what_en":"Uganda's everyday green cooking bananas (matooke), steamed in banana leaves and mashed, served with groundnut sauce or stew.","fame":"马托基是不甜的「做饭用的香蕉」，在乌干达中部和西部几乎顿顿都有；路边卡车上堆满一串串绿香蕉，是坎帕拉最常见的风景。","fame_en":"Matooke is a savoury cooking banana, eaten at almost every meal in central and western Uganda; trucks piled with green bunches are one of Kampala's most familiar sights.","fact":"乌干达人平均每人每年吃掉约 172 公斤这种煮香蕉，差不多占一家人每天热量的 18%，是世界上吃得最多的国家之一。","fact_en":"Ugandans eat about 172 kg of these cooking bananas per person a year — almost 18% of a household's daily calories, among the highest consumption in the world.","src":"Uganda food price study（AAMP 研讨会论文，AgEcon Search）","url":"https://ageconsearch.umn.edu/record/58553/files/AAMP_Maputo_25_Uganda_ppr.pdf","say":{"en":"How much for one bunch of matooke? Can you pick a good one for me?","zh":"一串马托基多少钱？能帮我挑一串好的吗？"}},"马赫布斯":{"what":"卡塔尔和海湾国家的家常香料肉饭（machboos），鸡肉或羊肉和米饭一起焖，带一点干柠檬的酸味。","what_en":"The Gulf's home-style spiced rice with chicken or lamb (machboos), cooked together with a sour hint of dried lime.","fame":"它被叫作卡塔尔的国菜，周五家里一大盘端上来，大家围坐着吃；巴林、科威特、阿联酋也都把它当自己的家常菜，各家香料不太一样。","fame_en":"It's called Qatar's national dish — a big platter on Fridays with the family sitting around it. Bahrain, Kuwait and the UAE also claim it as home food, each with its own spice mix.","fact":"锅里那颗黑黑的干柠檬（loomi）是海湾地区发明的：在伊拉克叫 noomi basra（「巴士拉柠檬」），在伊朗叫 limoo amani，在阿曼叫 loomi。","fact_en":"The little black dried lime (loomi) in the pot comes from the Persian Gulf: Iraqis call it noomi basra ('lemon from Basra'), Iranians limoo amani, and Omanis loomi.","src":"Wikipedia：Dried lime","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dried_lime","say":{"en":"One chicken machboos, please. Is it enough for two people?","zh":"一份鸡肉马赫布斯，谢谢。两个人吃够吗？"}},"南非葡萄酒":{"what":"南非开普一带产的葡萄酒，最出名的产区是开普敦东边的斯泰伦博斯。","what_en":"Wine from South Africa's Cape, with Stellenbosch, east of Cape Town, as its most famous region.","fame":"这里的酒庄有三百多年历史，山下一排排白色荷兰式老房子；开普敦人周末开车去酒庄品酒、吃一顿慢慢的午饭。","fame_en":"Wine farms here go back over 300 years, with white Cape Dutch houses below the mountains. Capetonians drive out at weekends for tastings and long lunches.","fact":"南非有一种自己的葡萄 Pinotage：1924 年斯泰伦博斯大学的佩罗德教授把黑皮诺和神索杂交，只得到四颗种子，种在自家花园后就忘了；后来花园大扫除时，一位年轻讲师把苗救了出来。","fact_en":"South Africa has its own grape, Pinotage. In 1924 Professor Perold of Stellenbosch University crossed Pinot Noir with Cinsaut, got just four seeds, planted them in his garden and forgot them — a young lecturer rescued the seedlings during a garden clean-up.","src":"Wikipedia：Pinotage","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinotage","say":{"en":"Could we try a Pinotage? How much is the tasting?","zh":"能尝一下 Pinotage 吗？品酒一次多少钱？"}},"马达加斯加香草":{"what":"马达加斯加东北部萨瓦地区种的香草（波旁香草），是做冰淇淋、蛋糕最常用的香草荚。","what_en":"Vanilla (Bourbon vanilla) grown in Madagascar's north-eastern SAVA region — the pods used in ice cream and cakes everywhere.","fame":"马达加斯加是世界上最大的天然香草产地；香草荚要经过烫、晒、发汗好几个月才变成黑亮有香味的样子，所以是世界上最贵的香料之一。","fame_en":"Madagascar is the world's biggest producer of natural vanilla. The pods are scalded, sun-dried and 'sweated' for months before they turn dark and fragrant — which is why vanilla is one of the most expensive spices.","fact":"香草花在原产地墨西哥以外没有虫子帮它授粉。1841 年，留尼汪岛上一个 12 岁的奴隶孩子埃德蒙·阿尔比乌斯想出用小棍子手工授粉的办法——今天几乎所有香草还是这样一朵一朵用手授粉的。","fact_en":"Outside Mexico, vanilla flowers have no insects to pollinate them. In 1841 Edmond Albius, a 12-year-old enslaved boy on Réunion, worked out how to pollinate them by hand with a thin stick — and almost all vanilla is still hand-pollinated, flower by flower, today.","src":"Wikipedia：Edmond Albius","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edmond_Albius","say":{"en":"How much is one vanilla pod? Are these from Madagascar?","zh":"一根香草荚多少钱？是马达加斯加产的吗？"}},"乔洛夫饭":{"what":"西非的番茄辣椒焖饭（jollof），米饭吸饱了番茄、洋葱和辣椒熬的酱，红红的一大锅。","what_en":"West Africa's jollof rice — rice cooked in a sauce of tomato, onion and chilli until it turns red and soaks up all the flavour.","fame":"尼日利亚、加纳、塞内加尔都有，派对上没有乔洛夫饭就不算派对；尼日利亚人和加纳人在网上为「谁家的乔洛夫最好吃」吵了很多年，叫「乔洛夫之战」。锅底烧焦的那一层（party jollof 的灵魂）最抢手。","fame_en":"Nigeria, Ghana and Senegal all make it, and a party without jollof isn't a party. Nigerians and Ghanaians have argued online for years about whose is best — the 'jollof wars'. The smoky bottom layer of a big party pot is the prize.","fact":"「jollof」这个名字来自塞内加尔一带的沃洛夫人（历史上的乔洛夫王国）。塞内加尔的原版叫 thieboudienne（鱼饭），已经被联合国教科文组织列为非物质文化遗产。","fact_en":"The name 'jollof' comes from the Wolof people of the Senegal region (the historical Jolof kingdom). Senegal's original version, thieboudienne (rice with fish), is recognised by UNESCO as intangible cultural heritage.","src":"Wikipedia：Jollof rice","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jollof_rice","say":{"en":"Jollof rice with chicken and plantain, please. Is it very spicy?","zh":"请给我乔洛夫饭配鸡肉和炸大蕉。很辣吗？"}},"库沙利":{"what":"埃及最常见的街头快餐（koshari）：米饭、小扁豆、通心粉、鹰嘴豆拌在一起，浇番茄酱和炸洋葱。","what_en":"Egypt's favourite street food (koshari): rice, lentils, macaroni and chickpeas, topped with tomato sauce and crispy fried onions.","fame":"开罗的学生、司机、上班族都吃它：便宜、管饱、素的。专门的库沙利店里，师傅几秒钟就舀好一碗，桌上放着醋蒜汁（da'a）和辣酱自己加。","fame_en":"Students, drivers and office workers in Cairo all eat it: cheap, filling and vegetarian. In koshari shops the server fills a bowl in seconds, with garlic-vinegar sauce (da'a) and chilli on the table to add yourself.","fact":"2025 年 12 月，「库沙利：日常菜和相关习俗」被联合国教科文组织列入人类非物质文化遗产代表作名录。这碗便宜的街头饭，从此成了联合国名录上要好好保护的遗产。","fact_en":"In December 2025, 'Koshari, everyday dish and associated practices' was added to UNESCO's Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity — a cheap street bowl, now officially heritage to be safeguarded.","src":"UNESCO 非物质文化遗产：Koshari, everyday dish and associated practices","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/koshari-everyday-dish-and-associated-practices-02278","say":{"en":"One medium koshari, please, with extra fried onions.","zh":"一份中碗库沙利，多加炸洋葱，谢谢。"}},"摩洛哥薄荷茶":{"what":"摩洛哥人一天喝好几次的甜薄荷绿茶，用中国珠茶、新鲜薄荷和很多糖煮出来。","what_en":"The sweet mint green tea Moroccans drink several times a day, made with Chinese gunpowder tea, fresh mint and plenty of sugar.","fame":"进店、做客、谈生意都先倒一杯；倒茶的人把茶壶举得高高的往小玻璃杯里冲，冲出一层泡沫才算倒得好。主人请你喝茶，就是欢迎你。","fame_en":"Shops, homes and business deals all start with a glass. The pourer lifts the teapot high above the little glass to make a layer of foam — that's a good pour. Being offered tea means you're welcome.","fact":"茶在摩洛哥普及其实不算太早：1856 年英摩条约之后，加上克里米亚战争时英国把原本运往波罗的海的茶转运到摩洛哥，二十年里茶叶进口翻了四倍——但那时喝茶还主要是城里人的习惯。","fact_en":"Tea became common in Morocco later than you might think: after the 1856 Anglo-Moroccan treaty, and with tea meant for the Baltic diverted to Morocco during the Crimean War, imports quadrupled in twenty years — though tea-drinking was still mostly a city habit then.","src":"Wikipedia：Maghrebi mint tea","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maghrebi_mint_tea","say":{"en":"Could I have mint tea with less sugar, please?","zh":"请给我一壶薄荷茶，少放点糖。"}},"库斯库斯":{"what":"北非人的「小米饭」（couscous）：粗麦粉搓成的小颗粒，蒸得松松的，上面铺炖肉和七种蔬菜。","what_en":"North Africa's couscous: tiny grains rolled from semolina, steamed until fluffy and topped with stew and vegetables.","fame":"在摩洛哥，周五中午做完礼拜，一家人围着一大盘库斯库斯吃，是固定的家庭时间；它也跟着北非移民到了法国，成了法国人很熟悉的家常菜。","fame_en":"In Morocco, Friday lunch after prayers means the whole family around a big plate of couscous. It also travelled to France with North African families and became an everyday dish there.","fact":"2020 年 12 月，阿尔及利亚、毛里塔尼亚、摩洛哥、突尼斯四个国家一起申报，让「库斯库斯的制作和食用」进了联合国教科文组织的非物质文化遗产名录。这几个邻居平时常为「库斯库斯是谁家的」争来争去。","fact_en":"In December 2020, Algeria, Mauritania, Morocco and Tunisia jointly got 'the knowledge, know-how and practices of couscous' onto UNESCO's intangible heritage list — neighbours who usually argue over whose couscous it is.","src":"Africanews：North African couscous becomes a UNESCO intangible cultural heritage（2020）","url":"https://www.africanews.com/2020/12/16/north-african-couscous-becomes-a-unesco-intangible-cultural-heritage/","say":{"en":"Is the couscous only on Fridays? One with seven vegetables, please.","zh":"库斯库斯只有周五有吗？来一份七种蔬菜的，谢谢。"}},"乌伽黎":{"what":"肯尼亚人天天吃的白玉米面团（ugali），配羽衣甘蓝（sukuma wiki）、烤肉或炸鱼。","what_en":"The white maize-meal staple Kenyans eat every day (ugali), with greens (sukuma wiki), grilled meat or fried fish.","fame":"从内罗毕的写字楼食堂到乡下的家里，晚饭桌上几乎都有一块乌伽黎；用手揪一团、按个窝，夹着菜吃。「sukuma wiki」字面意思是「撑过这一周」，因为便宜。","fame_en":"From Nairobi office canteens to village kitchens, there's ugali on almost every dinner table. You pinch a piece, press a dip and scoop up the greens. 'Sukuma wiki' literally means 'push the week' — because it's cheap.","fact":"玉米面价格在肯尼亚是大政治：2022 年 7 月大选前，政府出钱补贴，让一包 2 公斤的玉米面从 200 多先令降到 100 先令。","fact_en":"The price of maize flour is big politics in Kenya: in July 2022, just before the election, the government subsidised it so a 2 kg packet dropped from over 200 shillings to 100.","src":"Citizen Digital：Unga prices to drop from Ksh.230 to Ksh 100 after government subsidy（2022）","url":"https://citizen.digital/article/unga-prices-drop-to-ksh-100-after-government-subsidy-n302364","say":{"en":"Ugali, sukuma wiki and fried tilapia, please.","zh":"请给我乌伽黎、羽衣甘蓝和炸罗非鱼。"}},"博博提":{"what":"南非开普的烤肉末（bobotie）：咖喱调味的牛肉末加葡萄干，上面浇一层蛋奶烤出来，配黄米饭。","what_en":"Cape Town's bobotie: curry-spiced minced meat with raisins, baked under a golden egg-and-milk topping and served with yellow rice.","fame":"它是开普马来人家里的老菜，酸甜微辣，常被叫作南非的国菜；开普敦的家庭周日午饭、博卡普彩色房子区的小餐馆里都吃得到。","fame_en":"It's an old Cape Malay family dish — sweet, sour and gently spicy — and often called South Africa's national dish. You'll find it at Sunday lunches in Cape Town and in little restaurants in the Bo-Kaap.","fact":"名字从哪儿来说法不一：一种说法是来自印尼的一道菜 bobotok，可那道菜的材料跟今天的博博提完全不同。","fact_en":"Nobody agrees where the name comes from. One idea is the Indonesian dish bobotok — though that dish has completely different ingredients from today's bobotie.","src":"Wikipedia：Bobotie","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bobotie","say":{"en":"Does the bobotie come with yellow rice and chutney?","zh":"博博提配黄米饭和酸辣酱吗？"}},"罗马扎瓦":{"what":"马达加斯加的国菜（romazava）：瘤牛肉和几种绿叶菜一起炖的清汤，浇在米饭上吃。","what_en":"Madagascar's national dish (romazava): a light stew of zebu beef and leafy greens, eaten over rice.","fame":"马达加斯加人一天三顿都离不开米饭，罗马扎瓦就是最家常的「配饭汤」；在塔那那利佛的小饭馆（hotely）里，一碗米饭一碗汤，便宜又暖胃。","fame_en":"Malagasy people eat rice three times a day, and romazava is the classic broth to go with it. In Antananarivo's little 'hotely' diners, a bowl of rice and a bowl of romazava is cheap and warming.","fact":"汤里一定要放的一种叶子 brèdes mafana，花苞里有一种叫 spilanthol 的成分，吃了舌头会麻麻、刺刺的，还会一直流口水。","fact_en":"One must-have leaf, brèdes mafana, has buds containing spilanthol, which makes your tongue tingle and go numb — and makes your mouth water like crazy.","src":"Wikipedia：Romazava","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romazava","say":{"en":"One romazava with rice, please. Is there zebu in it?","zh":"一份罗马扎瓦配米饭，谢谢。里面有瘤牛肉吗？"}},"苏亚烤肉":{"what":"尼日利亚北方豪萨人的辣烤肉串（suya）：薄牛肉片裹上花生辣椒粉，在炭火上烤。","what_en":"Suya, the spicy grilled skewers of northern Nigeria's Hausa people — thin beef coated in peanut-chilli spice and grilled over charcoal.","fame":"天黑以后，尼日利亚每座城市的路口都有冒烟的苏亚摊；烤好的肉剪成小块，用报纸包着，配生洋葱和番茄，再撒一把辣粉。","fame_en":"After dark, every Nigerian city has smoky suya stands on its corners. The meat is snipped into bites, wrapped in newspaper with raw onion and tomato, and dusted with extra spice.","fact":"苏亚在豪萨语里也叫 tsire。那层辣粉叫 yaji，里面最关键的是 kuli-kuli——花生榨完油剩下的花生饼磨成的粉。","fact_en":"In Hausa, suya is also called tsire. Its spice coating, yaji, depends on kuli-kuli — ground peanut cake left over after the oil has been pressed out.","src":"Wikipedia：Suya","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suya","say":{"en":"Give me suya for a thousand naira, with onions — not too much pepper.","zh":"来一千奈拉的苏亚，多放洋葱，辣粉少一点。"}},"富富":{"what":"加纳的捣木薯大蕉团（fufu）：煮好的木薯和大蕉放进木臼里捣成又软又黏的面团，配汤吃。","what_en":"Ghana's fufu: boiled cassava and plantain pounded in a wooden mortar into a soft, stretchy dough, eaten with soup.","fame":"加纳人的周末午饭常是一碗富富配花生汤或轻汤（light soup）；捣富富要两个人配合，一个举杵，一个在杵落下的空当翻面团，咚咚声是加纳院子里最熟悉的声音。吃的时候不嚼，直接吞。","fame_en":"Weekend lunch in Ghana is often fufu with groundnut or light soup. Pounding it takes two people — one swings the pestle, the other turns the dough between strokes — and the thud is the sound of a Ghanaian compound. You swallow it, you don't chew.","fact":"第一台电动捣富富机是 2004 年加纳一位电器商 Fadegnom Charles 做出来的；机器一分钟左右就能捣好，手捣至少要半小时。到 2014 年，阿克拉很多家庭和小饭馆都用上了。","fact_en":"The first electric fufu machine was built in 2004 by Ghanaian electrical dealer Fadegnom Charles. A machine does in about a minute what takes at least half an hour by hand, and by 2014 it was common in Accra's homes and chop bars.","src":"Wikipedia：Fufu machine","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fufu_machine","say":{"en":"Fufu with light soup and goat meat, please. Do you have a bowl to wash my hands?","zh":"请给我富富配轻汤和羊肉。有洗手的碗吗？"}},"圣莫尼卡码头":{"what":"洛杉矶海边一座伸进太平洋的木头码头，上面有摩天轮和游乐场。","what_en":"A wooden pier sticking out into the Pacific in Los Angeles, with a Ferris wheel and a small fairground on it.","fame":"电影和广告里的「加州海滩」常常就是这里；码头上的太平洋公园摩天轮晚上亮灯，是洛杉矶最出名的海边画面。","fame_en":"When a film or ad shows 'a California beach', it's often here; the Pacific Park Ferris wheel lit up at night is LA's best-known seaside picture.","fact":"码头上那块「66 号公路终点」牌子 2009 年才挂上——66 号公路其实从没正式通到码头，是大家心里的终点，城市就干脆认了。","fact_en":"The 'Route 66 End of the Trail' sign only went up in 2009 — the highway never officially reached the pier, but everyone thought of it as the end, so the city made it official in spirit.","src":"Visit Santa Monica","url":"https://www.santamonica.com/media/route-66-rolls-on-in-santa-monica","say":{"en":"Where can I rent a bike to ride along the beach?","zh":"哪儿能租自行车沿着海边骑？"}},"太空针塔":{"what":"西雅图一座像飞碟顶在细腿上的观景塔，184 米高。","what_en":"A 184-metre observation tower in Seattle that looks like a flying saucer on thin legs.","fame":"为 1962 年世博会建的，是西雅图的标志；天气好时能同时看到雷尼尔山、海湾和市中心。","fame_en":"Built for the 1962 World's Fair, it's Seattle's symbol; on a clear day you see Mount Rainier, the bay and downtown at once.","fact":"2018 年整修后，原来会转的餐厅层换成了全玻璃的旋转地板「The Loupe」，站在上面能直接看到脚下 150 米的地面，塔方说这是世界上第一块会转的玻璃地板。","fact_en":"After a 2018 renovation, the old revolving restaurant level became 'The Loupe', an all-glass rotating floor — you look straight down about 150 metres. The Needle calls it the world's first revolving glass floor.","src":"GeekWire，2018 年 8 月","url":"https://www.geekwire.com/2018/space-needle-unveils-worlds-revolving-glass-floor-500-feet-air/","say":{"en":"Is it worth going up today, or is it too cloudy?","zh":"今天上去值吗，还是云太多了？"}},"胡佛水坝":{"what":"美国内华达和亚利桑那交界处、科罗拉多河上的大水坝，1936 年建成。","what_en":"A huge dam on the Colorado River on the Nevada–Arizona border, finished in 1936.","fame":"大萧条时期几千个工人在沙漠峡谷里建起来的，后面的米德湖给洛杉矶、拉斯维加斯、凤凰城几千万人供水供电。","fame_en":"Thousands of workers built it in a desert canyon during the Great Depression; Lake Mead behind it supplies water and power to tens of millions in LA, Las Vegas and Phoenix.","fact":"干旱让米德湖越来越浅：2022 年 7 月创下建湖以来最低水位，2026 年 8 月水位又跌破了这个纪录，湖边露出一圈白色的「浴缸环」。","fact_en":"Drought keeps draining Lake Mead: it hit its lowest level since filling in July 2022, and in August 2026 dropped below even that record, leaving a white 'bathtub ring' on the rocks.","src":"ABC15 / AP，2026 年 8 月","url":"https://www.abc15.com/news/state/lake-mead-nations-largest-reservoir-reaches-its-lowest-water-level-on-record","say":{"en":"Which tour goes inside the dam — the power plant one?","zh":"哪个参观团能进到坝里面——是电站那个吗？"}},"阿拉莫":{"what":"得克萨斯州圣安东尼奥市中心一座老传教站的石头教堂。","what_en":"The stone church of an old Spanish mission in downtown San Antonio, Texas.","fame":"1836 年得克萨斯独立战争里，守军在这里被墨西哥军队包围、全部战死，「记住阿拉莫」成了得州人最有名的一句口号。","fame_en":"In 1836, during the Texas Revolution, its defenders were besieged by the Mexican army and all killed; 'Remember the Alamo!' became Texas's most famous rallying cry.","fact":"英国歌手菲尔·柯林斯从小迷阿拉莫，收藏了几百件相关文物，2014 年全部捐给得州；2023 年 3 月教堂后面开了新的收藏馆专门展出。","fact_en":"British singer Phil Collins was obsessed with the Alamo since childhood, collected hundreds of artefacts and gave them all to Texas in 2014; a new collections centre behind the church opened in March 2023 to show them.","src":"The Alamo（官方）","url":"https://www.thealamo.org/alamo-trust/pressroom/ralston-family-collections-center-opens","say":{"en":"Do I need a timed ticket to go inside the church?","zh":"进教堂要预约时段票吗？"}},"弗农山庄":{"what":"华盛顿特区南边、波托马克河畔，美国第一任总统乔治·华盛顿的家和庄园。","what_en":"George Washington's home and estate on the Potomac River, just south of Washington, D.C.","fame":"美国人最常去的「总统故居」之一；白色的大宅、花园、农场和华盛顿的墓都在这里，也讲在这里干活的被奴役的人的故事。","fame_en":"One of America's most visited presidential homes: the white mansion, gardens, farm and Washington's tomb, plus the stories of the enslaved people who worked here.","fact":"2024 年考古队在大宅地窖里挖出 30 多个 18 世纪的玻璃瓶，里面泡着的樱桃和浆果居然还完整，是当年厨房里被奴役的厨师们做的。","fact_en":"In 2024 archaeologists dug up more than 30 18th-century glass bottles in the mansion's cellar, still holding intact cherries and berries — preserved by the enslaved cooks who ran the kitchen.","src":"Smithsonian Magazine，2024 年 6 月","url":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/stash-of-18th-century-cherries-discovered-beneath-george-washingtons-mount-vernon-180984213/","say":{"en":"What time is the next mansion tour?","zh":"下一场大宅参观是几点？"}},"国会山":{"what":"加拿大首都渥太华河边小山上的议会大楼，哥特式的尖塔和绿色铜顶。","what_en":"Canada's parliament buildings on a hill above the Ottawa River, with Gothic towers and green copper roofs.","fame":"加拿大政治的中心，也是 7 月 1 日国庆日全国最热闹的地方；夏天的早上在草坪上有卫兵换岗。","fame_en":"The centre of Canadian politics and the busiest place in the country on Canada Day, 1 July; on summer mornings there's a changing of the guard on the lawn.","fact":"中间那栋主楼 2019 年起关门大修，众议院搬到旁边的西楼开会；官方说要到 2030 年代初、大约 2032 年才重新开放，工程要四五十亿加元。","fact_en":"The main Centre Block closed for a huge renovation in 2019 and the House of Commons moved to the West Block; it's expected to reopen around 2032, at a cost of C$4.5–5 billion.","src":"加拿大公共服务和采购部，2025 年季度报告","url":"https://www.canada.ca/en/public-services-procurement/services/infrastructure-buildings/parliamentary-precinct/projects-in-parliamentary-precinct/centre-block-project/quarterly-reports/progress-december2025.html","say":{"en":"Are the free tours of Parliament in the West Block now?","zh":"议会的免费参观现在是在西楼吗？"}},"佩姬湾灯塔":{"what":"加拿大新斯科舍省一个小渔村海边大石头上的白色红顶灯塔。","what_en":"A white lighthouse with a red top, standing on huge granite rocks at a little fishing village in Nova Scotia.","fame":"加拿大被拍得最多的灯塔之一，大西洋的浪打在光秃秃的花岗岩上，渔村的彩色小屋和码头就在旁边。","fame_en":"One of the most photographed lighthouses in Canada: Atlantic waves crash on bare granite, with the village's coloured houses and wharf next door.","fact":"黑色的石头又湿又滑，常有游客被浪卷走；2021 年 10 月这里专门修了一个 1300 平方米的观景平台，让人不用爬到石头上也能看海。","fact_en":"The black rocks are wet and slippery and visitors have been swept away by waves; in October 2021 a 1,300 m² viewing deck opened so people can watch the sea without climbing out onto them.","src":"新斯科舍省政府新闻稿，2021 年 10 月","url":"https://news.novascotia.ca/en/2021/10/18/peggys-cove-viewing-deck-opens","say":{"en":"Is it safe to walk on the rocks today?","zh":"今天能走到石头上去吗，安全吗？"}},"育空淘金热":{"what":"1896 年加拿大育空的克朗代克河发现金子，十万人往北涌去的那场淘金热，中心是道森城。","what_en":"The rush after gold was found on the Klondike in Canada's Yukon in 1896, when about 100,000 people headed north; its centre was Dawson City.","fame":"杰克·伦敦的小说、卓别林的《淘金记》都写的是它；道森城现在还是木板人行道、老式门面和沙土路。","fame_en":"Jack London's stories and Chaplin's The Gold Rush are about it; Dawson City still has boardwalks, false-front buildings and dirt streets.","fact":"2023 年 9 月「Tr'ondëk-Klondike」被列入联合国世界遗产，讲的不只是淘金，更是当地原住民 Tr'ondëk Hwëch'in 人怎么经历这段历史。","fact_en":"In September 2023 'Tr'ondëk-Klondike' became a UNESCO World Heritage Site — telling not just the gold rush but how the local Tr'ondëk Hwëch'in First Nation lived through it.","src":"Tr'ondëk Hwëch'in 新闻稿，2023 年 9 月","url":"https://www.trondek.ca/2023/09/trondek-klondike-inscribed-on-world-heritage-list/","say":{"en":"Can I try panning for gold somewhere around here?","zh":"这附近哪儿能试试淘金？"}},"布查特花园":{"what":"加拿大温哥华岛维多利亚附近一座 20 多公顷的大花园。","what_en":"A huge garden of more than 20 hectares near Victoria on Vancouver Island, Canada.","fame":"一年四季都有花：春天几十万株郁金香，夏天晚上有烟花；最出名的「下沉花园」是从坑底往上看的一整片花海。","fame_en":"There's something blooming all year: hundreds of thousands of tulips in spring, fireworks on summer nights; the famous Sunken Garden is a sea of flowers you look down into.","fact":"「下沉花园」原来是布查特家水泥厂挖空的石灰石矿坑；20 世纪初珍妮·布查特让人用马车运来几吨几吨的土，把废坑变成了花园，2004 年被列为加拿大国家历史遗址。","fact_en":"The Sunken Garden was once the worked-out limestone quarry of the Butcharts' cement business; in the early 1900s Jennie Butchart had tonnes of topsoil carted in by horse to turn the pit into a garden. It became a National Historic Site in 2004.","src":"维基百科 Butchart Gardens","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Butchart_Gardens","say":{"en":"Which part of the garden is best this week?","zh":"这周花园哪一块最好看？"}},"帝国大厦":{"what":"纽约曼哈顿一栋 102 层的装饰艺术风格摩天楼。","what_en":"A 102-storey Art Deco skyscraper in Manhattan, New York.","fame":"建成后当了近 40 年世界最高楼，《金刚》爬的就是它；楼顶的灯每晚换颜色，配合节日和大事。","fame_en":"It was the world's tallest building for nearly 40 years and the one King Kong climbs; the lights on top change colour every night for holidays and big events.","fact":"它从 1930 年 3 月开工到 1931 年 5 月 1 日开门只用了 410 天，最快的时候一周往上盖四层半。","fact_en":"From the start of construction in March 1930 to opening on 1 May 1931 took just 410 days — at its fastest it rose about four and a half floors a week.","src":"Britannica","url":"https://www.britannica.com/topic/Empire-State-Building","say":{"en":"Is the 102nd floor worth the extra ticket?","zh":"102 层值得多花钱上去吗？"}},"自由钟":{"what":"费城独立国家历史公园里一口有裂缝的老铜钟。","what_en":"An old cracked bell in Independence National Historical Park, Philadelphia.","fame":"美国独立和自由的象征，钟上刻着《圣经》里的一句「向全地宣告自由」；每年几百万人排队来看那道裂缝。","fame_en":"A symbol of American independence and freedom, inscribed with the Bible verse 'Proclaim liberty throughout all the land'; millions queue each year to see the crack.","fact":"它一开始只叫「州议会大厦的钟」；「自由钟」这个名字是 1835 年前后废奴主义者起的，他们拿钟上那句「宣告自由」当反对奴隶制的口号。","fact_en":"It was first just 'the State House bell'; the name 'Liberty Bell' came from abolitionists around 1835, who used its 'proclaim liberty' inscription as an anti-slavery slogan.","src":"美国国家公园管理局（NPS）","url":"https://www.nps.gov/inde/historyculture/stories-libertybell.htm","say":{"en":"Do I need a ticket for the Liberty Bell, or can I just walk in?","zh":"看自由钟要票吗，还是直接进？"}},"白宫":{"what":"华盛顿特区宾夕法尼亚大道 1600 号，美国总统住和办公的白色大楼。","what_en":"The white building at 1600 Pennsylvania Avenue in Washington, D.C., where the US president lives and works.","fame":"美国权力的象征，新闻里「白宫说」就是总统那边的意思；外面的拉斐特广场常有游客拍照和人抗议。","fame_en":"The symbol of US power — 'the White House said' means the president's side; tourists take photos and people protest in Lafayette Square outside.","fact":"2025 年 10 月，白宫东翼整个被拆掉，要在原地建一个约 9 万平方英尺的大宴会厅；拆之前没走联邦建筑的审批，引起很大争议。","fact_en":"In October 2025 the whole East Wing was demolished to make way for a ballroom of about 90,000 square feet; it was knocked down before going through federal building reviews, which caused a big row.","src":"PBS NewsHour / AP，2025 年 10 月","url":"https://www.pbs.org/newshour/nation/entire-white-house-east-wing-demolished-as-trump-moves-forward-with-ballroom-construction","say":{"en":"Where's the best spot to take a photo of the White House?","zh":"在哪儿拍白宫最好？"}},"拉什莫尔山":{"what":"美国南达科他州黑山里，一座刻着四位总统巨大头像的花岗岩山。","what_en":"A granite mountain in South Dakota's Black Hills carved with the giant faces of four US presidents.","fame":"华盛顿、杰斐逊、西奥多·罗斯福和林肯，每张脸约 18 米高；1927 到 1941 年间几百个工人用炸药和钻子刻出来。","fame_en":"Washington, Jefferson, Theodore Roosevelt and Lincoln, each face about 18 metres tall, blasted and drilled out by hundreds of workers between 1927 and 1941.","fact":"林肯头像后面有一个没完成的「档案馆」山洞；1998 年 8 月，人们在里面封存了 16 块瓷釉板，写着美国的建国文件和雕刻的故事，游客不能上去看。","fact_en":"Behind Lincoln's head is an unfinished 'Hall of Records' cave; in August 1998, 16 porcelain-enamel panels with the founding documents and the story of the carving were sealed inside. Visitors can't go up to it.","src":"美国国家公园管理局（NPS）","url":"https://www.nps.gov/moru/learn/historyculture/hall-of-records.htm","say":{"en":"Is there a trail that gets you closer to the faces?","zh":"有没有步道能走得离头像近一点？"}},"CN塔":{"what":"多伦多湖边一座 553 米高的电视塔。","what_en":"A 553-metre communications tower on the lakeshore in Toronto.","fame":"1976 年建成后当了 30 多年世界最高的独立建筑，是多伦多天际线的中心；上面有玻璃地板和旋转餐厅。","fame_en":"After it opened in 1976 it was the world's tallest free-standing structure for over 30 years; it's the centre of Toronto's skyline, with a glass floor and a revolving restaurant.","fact":"2011 年开了「EdgeWalk」：人系着安全绳，在 356 米高、1.5 米宽的塔外沿走一圈，被吉尼斯认证为世界最高的建筑外部步行。","fact_en":"In 2011 it opened EdgeWalk: harnessed to a rail, you walk all the way round a 1.5-metre ledge outside the tower, 356 m up — certified by Guinness as the highest external walk on a building.","src":"吉尼斯世界纪录","url":"https://guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/97943-highest-external-walk-on-a-building","say":{"en":"Can we book the restaurant and skip the queue for the lift?","zh":"订了餐厅是不是就不用排电梯的队了？"}},"蒂卡尔":{"what":"危地马拉北部热带雨林里的古玛雅城市遗址，金字塔高出树冠。","what_en":"The ruins of an ancient Maya city in the rainforest of northern Guatemala, with pyramids rising above the trees.","fame":"玛雅文明最大的城市之一，最兴盛时在公元 200 到 900 年；清早站在神庙顶上听吼猴叫、看雾从森林里散开，是很多人最难忘的一刻。","fame_en":"One of the biggest Maya cities, at its height around AD 200–900; standing on a temple at dawn, hearing howler monkeys as mist lifts off the forest, is many people's most unforgettable moment.","fact":"2018 年科学家用飞机上的激光雷达扫描丛林，在这一带找到约 6 万处以前没发现的玛雅建筑；蒂卡尔附近一座原以为是小山的东西，原来是 30 米高的金字塔。","fact_en":"In 2018 scientists scanned the jungle with airborne lidar and found about 60,000 previously unknown Maya structures in the region; near Tikal, something thought to be a hill turned out to be a 30-metre pyramid.","src":"National Geographic，2018 年 2 月","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/news/2018/02/maya-laser-lidar-guatemala-pacunam/","say":{"en":"Can we book a sunrise tour to Temple IV?","zh":"能订去四号神庙看日出的团吗？"}},"赤道纪念碑":{"what":"厄瓜多尔首都基多北边，标着赤道线的一座 30 米高的石头纪念碑。","what_en":"A 30-metre stone monument north of Quito, Ecuador, marking the equator.","fame":"游客都来这儿一只脚踩南半球、一只脚踩北半球，沿着地上的黄线拍照；纪念的是 18 世纪法国科学家来这里测量地球形状。","fame_en":"Visitors come to stand with one foot in each hemisphere on the yellow line; it honours the 18th-century French expedition that came here to measure the shape of the Earth.","fact":"用今天的 GPS 一测，真正的赤道其实在那条黄线北边大约 240 米。","fact_en":"Measure it with modern GPS and the real equator is about 240 metres north of the yellow line.","src":"维基百科 Ciudad Mitad del Mundo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ciudad_Mitad_del_Mundo","say":{"en":"Can you take a photo of me standing on the line?","zh":"能帮我在线上拍张照吗？"}},"卡塔赫纳":{"what":"哥伦比亚加勒比海边的老港口城市，城墙围着一片彩色殖民老城。","what_en":"An old port city on Colombia's Caribbean coast, with a colourful colonial old town inside stone walls.","fame":"西班牙人建的城墙和堡垒是南美最完整的一套，1984 年成了世界遗产；老城里阳台挂满鲜花，晚上广场上有音乐和小吃摊。","fame_en":"Its Spanish walls and forts are the most complete set in South America and became World Heritage in 1984; in the old town, balconies overflow with flowers and squares fill with music and food stalls at night.","fact":"1708 年沉在城外海底的西班牙宝船「圣何塞号」，2015 年被水下机器人找到；2024 年哥伦比亚政府开始派机器人到约 600 米深处勘察，船上的金银归谁至今还在打官司。","fact_en":"The Spanish treasure galleon San José, sunk off the city in 1708, was found by an underwater robot in 2015; in 2024 Colombia began sending robots about 600 metres down to study it — and who owns its gold and silver is still being fought over in court.","src":"The Globe and Mail / AP，2024 年","url":"https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-colombia-will-send-deep-water-expedition-to-explore-300-year-old/","say":{"en":"How much is a horse-carriage ride around the old town?","zh":"坐马车绕老城一圈多少钱？"}},"巴西利亚":{"what":"巴西的首都，1950 年代在高原上从零规划建起来的新城。","what_en":"Brazil's capital, a city planned and built from scratch on a high plateau in the 1950s.","fame":"卢西奥·科斯塔规划、奥斯卡·尼迈耶设计建筑，从空中看像一架飞机；国会两只「碗」和双塔、白色曲线的大教堂都是现代建筑的经典。","fame_en":"Planned by Lúcio Costa with buildings by Oscar Niemeyer, it looks like an aeroplane from the air; Congress's two 'bowls' and twin towers and the curving white cathedral are modernist classics.","fact":"整座城 1956 年才开工，1960 年 4 月 21 日就正式启用，前后不到 4 年；1987 年它成了世界遗产，是少有的 20 世纪才建起来的世遗城市。","fact_en":"Work only began in 1956 and the city was inaugurated on 21 April 1960 — under four years later; in 1987 it became a World Heritage Site, a rare city built in the 20th century to get that title.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/445","say":{"en":"Which bus goes along the Esplanada to the cathedral?","zh":"哪路公交沿着部委大道到大教堂？"}},"世界尽头乌斯怀亚":{"what":"阿根廷火地岛上的小城，号称世界最南端的城市。","what_en":"A small city on Argentina's Tierra del Fuego, known as the southernmost city in the world.","fame":"背靠雪山、面向比格尔海峡，大多数去南极的游轮都从这里出发；邮局能盖「世界尽头」的邮戳。","fame_en":"With snowy mountains behind and the Beagle Channel in front, it's where most Antarctic cruises leave from; the post office stamps your cards 'end of the world'.","fact":"游客坐的「世界尽头小火车」原来是监狱的火车：20 世纪初，乌斯怀亚监狱的犯人坐着它进山砍木头、运石头；1947 年监狱关了，铁路后来废弃，1994 年重修成观光线。","fact_en":"The tourist 'End of the World Train' was once a prison train: in the early 1900s inmates of Ushuaia's jail rode it into the forest to cut timber and haul stone. The prison closed in 1947, the line fell into disuse, and it reopened for tourists in 1994.","src":"Amusing Planet","url":"https://www.amusingplanet.com/2020/09/the-train-of-end-of-world.html","say":{"en":"Are there still seats on the boat to the penguin island today?","zh":"今天去企鹅岛的船还有位子吗？"}},"面包山缆车":{"what":"里约热内卢海湾边两座小山之间、一直通到「面包山」顶上的缆车。","what_en":"The cable car in Rio de Janeiro that hops between two hills to the top of Sugarloaf Mountain by the bay.","fame":"从山顶能看到科帕卡巴纳海滩、基督像和整个瓜纳巴拉湾，傍晚看日落的人最多；007 电影《太空城》在缆车上打过架。","fame_en":"From the top you see Copacabana beach, Christ the Redeemer and the whole of Guanabara Bay — busiest at sunset; James Bond fought on it in Moonraker.","fact":"它 1912 年 10 月就开通了，是巴西第一条、世界上第三条客运缆车，第一天坐了约 577 人。","fact_en":"It opened in October 1912 — Brazil's first passenger cable car and the third in the world. About 577 people rode it on day one.","src":"维基百科 Sugarloaf Cable Car","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sugarloaf_Cable_Car","say":{"en":"Is it better to go up before sunset, or will it be packed?","zh":"日落前上去是不是最好，会不会人很多？"}},"瓦尔帕莱索":{"what":"智利中部太平洋边的港口城市，房子挤满四十几座小山坡。","what_en":"A Pacific port city in central Chile, its houses crowded over more than forty hills.","fame":"彩色的房子、到处是街头壁画，老城区是世界遗产；诗人聂鲁达在这儿有一座房子「La Sebastiana」。","fame_en":"Colourful houses and street murals everywhere; the old quarter is World Heritage, and the poet Pablo Neruda had a house here, La Sebastiana.","fact":"上山的老式升降缆车「ascensor」最老的一条 Concepción 是 1883 年开的，原来烧蒸汽；城里最多时有约 30 条，现在只剩不到一半还在跑。","fact_en":"The oldest of its hillside funiculars, the Ascensor Concepción, opened in 1883 and first ran on steam; the city once had about 30, and fewer than half still run today.","src":"维基百科 Ascensor Concepción","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ascensor_Concepci%C3%B3n","say":{"en":"Which ascensor takes me up to Cerro Alegre?","zh":"哪条升降缆车能上欢乐山？"}},"圣地亚哥":{"what":"智利的首都，背后就是安第斯山的雪峰。","what_en":"Chile's capital, with the snowy Andes right behind it.","fame":"南美最现代的城市之一，地铁新、街区干净；冬天从市中心就能看到雪山，一两个小时就能去滑雪场。","fame_en":"One of South America's most modern cities, with a new metro and tidy neighbourhoods; in winter you see snowy peaks from downtown and can reach ski slopes in an hour or two.","fact":"市里的「科斯塔内拉大塔」约 300 米高，是南美最高的楼；2010 年 8.8 级大地震时它还在建，结构一点没坏，现在 61、62 层是观景台 Sky Costanera。","fact_en":"The Gran Torre Costanera, about 300 m tall, is South America's tallest building; it was under construction during the 2010 magnitude-8.8 earthquake and came through undamaged. Floors 61–62 are now the Sky Costanera viewpoint.","src":"维基百科 Gran Torre Costanera","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gran_Torre_Costanera","say":{"en":"Is the funicular up San Cristóbal Hill running today?","zh":"上圣克里斯托瓦尔山的缆车今天开吗？"}},"盐教堂":{"what":"哥伦比亚波哥大北边锡帕基拉的盐矿里，在地下挖出来的一座天主教堂。","what_en":"A Catholic church carved inside a salt mine at Zipaquirá, north of Bogotá, Colombia.","fame":"墙、柱子和十字架全是岩盐凿的，蓝紫色灯光一打，像走进地下宫殿；被称作哥伦比亚的建筑奇迹之一。","fame_en":"Walls, pillars and crosses are all carved from rock salt, lit in blues and purples like an underground palace; it's often called one of Colombia's architectural wonders.","fact":"现在这座是第二座：矿工们早先挖的老教堂因为不安全，1990 年代初被关掉；新的在老教堂下面约 60 米，1995 年 12 月开放，离地面大约 180 米。","fact_en":"Today's church is the second one: the miners' original was closed as unsafe in the early 1990s, and the new one, about 60 m below it and roughly 180 m underground, opened in December 1995.","src":"维基百科 Salt Cathedral of Zipaquirá","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salt_Cathedral_of_Zipaquir%C3%A1","say":{"en":"Does the ticket include the guided tour in English?","zh":"门票包括英语讲解吗？"}},"失落之城":{"what":"哥伦比亚圣玛尔塔内华达山脉雨林深处的古城遗址，当地人叫它 Teyuna。","what_en":"An ancient city deep in the rainforest of Colombia's Sierra Nevada de Santa Marta, called Teyuna by local people.","fame":"没有路能开车到，要徒步四五天、蹚过河、爬 1200 级石阶才到山顶的圆形石台，比马丘比丘清静得多。","fame_en":"No road goes there: it's a four- or five-day hike, wading rivers and climbing about 1,200 stone steps to the round terraces on top — far quieter than Machu Picchu.","fact":"它大约建于公元 800 年，比马丘比丘早约 650 年；1972 年被盗墓的人找到才让外界知道，可住在山里的科吉人说，他们一直都知道这个地方。","fact_en":"It was built around AD 800, about 650 years before Machu Picchu; the outside world only learned of it when looters found it in 1972 — but the Kogi people of the mountains say they always knew it was there.","src":"维基百科 Ciudad Perdida","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ciudad_Perdida","say":{"en":"How many days is the trek, and do we carry our own stuff?","zh":"要徒步几天，东西要自己背吗？"}},"基多老城":{"what":"厄瓜多尔首都基多的殖民老城区，在海拔 2800 多米的山谷里。","what_en":"The colonial old town of Quito, Ecuador's capital, in a valley more than 2,800 m up.","fame":"拉丁美洲保存得最好、最大的殖民老城之一，几十座教堂，最出名的耶稣会教堂里面整面墙都贴着金箔。","fame_en":"One of the best-kept and largest colonial old towns in Latin America, with dozens of churches; the famous Jesuit church is covered inside in gold leaf.","fact":"1978 年联合国第一次公布世界遗产名单，一共只有 12 处，基多就和厄瓜多尔的加拉帕戈斯群岛一起排在最前面。","fact_en":"When UNESCO published its very first World Heritage list in 1978, with only 12 sites, Quito and Ecuador's Galápagos Islands were the first two on it.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产中心","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/events/1468/","say":{"en":"Is it okay to walk around the old town after dark?","zh":"天黑以后在老城走走安全吗？"}},"拉巴斯缆车":{"what":"玻利维亚拉巴斯和高原上的埃尔阿尔托之间，当公交用的城市缆车网「Mi Teleférico」。","what_en":"'Mi Teleférico', the city cable-car network used as public transport between La Paz and El Alto on the plateau, Bolivia.","fame":"一条条彩色的线挂在城市上空，每天几十万人坐着上下班，比在陡坡上堵车快多了；车厢里能俯瞰整个碗形的山城。","fame_en":"Colour-coded lines hang over the city and hundreds of thousands ride them to work each day — far faster than traffic on the steep hills — with views over the whole bowl-shaped city.","fact":"第一批三条线 2014 年开通，颜色是玻利维亚国旗的红黄绿；吉尼斯认证它是世界最大的公交缆车网，总长 30 多公里。","fact_en":"The first three lines opened in 2014, coloured red, yellow and green like the Bolivian flag; Guinness lists it as the world's largest public-transit cable-car network, over 30 km long.","src":"吉尼斯世界纪录","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/451860-largest-public-transit-cable-car-network","say":{"en":"Which line goes up to El Alto?","zh":"哪条线上埃尔阿尔托？"}},"波托西银山":{"what":"玻利维亚波托西城边上的「富山」Cerro Rico，挖了快五百年的银矿山。","what_en":"Cerro Rico, the 'rich mountain' beside Potosí, Bolivia, mined for silver for almost 500 years.","fame":"16 世纪这里的银子撑起了西班牙帝国，波托西一度是世界上最大的城市之一；今天还有上万矿工在里面干活，游客可以跟着进矿井。","fame_en":"In the 1500s its silver funded the Spanish Empire and Potosí was one of the world's biggest cities; thousands of miners still work inside today, and visitors can go into the shafts with a guide.","fact":"山被挖得像蜂窝，山顶已经塌过一部分；2014 年 UNESCO 因为「无节制的采矿」把波托西列入濒危世界遗产。","fact_en":"The mountain is honeycombed with tunnels and part of its summit has already collapsed; in 2014 UNESCO put Potosí on its World Heritage in Danger list because of uncontrolled mining.","src":"UNESCO 世界遗产中心","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/news/1148","say":{"en":"What should we bring as a gift for the miners?","zh":"给矿工带点什么当礼物好？"}},"埃斯特角之手":{"what":"乌拉圭海滨度假城埃斯特角的沙滩上，一只从沙里伸出来的巨大混凝土手指雕塑。","what_en":"A giant concrete sculpture of fingers poking out of the sand on the beach at Punta del Este, Uruguay.","fame":"埃斯特角的标志，夏天来这里度假的阿根廷人、巴西人几乎都会在手指间拍一张照。","fame_en":"Punta del Este's symbol — nearly every Argentine and Brazilian on summer holiday here takes a photo between the fingers.","fact":"智利雕塑家马里奥·伊拉拉萨瓦尔 1982 年来参加户外雕塑展，别人还在争展位时，他把作品搬到海滩上，只用 6 天就做完了。","fact_en":"Chilean sculptor Mario Irarrázabal came for an open-air sculpture meeting in 1982; while others argued over spots in the square, he took his work to the beach and finished it in just six days.","src":"维基百科 La Mano de Punta del Este","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Mano_de_Punta_del_Este","say":{"en":"Could you take one of us between the fingers?","zh":"能帮我们在手指中间拍一张吗？"}},"桑科乔汤":{"what":"巴拿马的鸡肉炖汤，里面有山药（ñame）、玉米，用刺芫荽（culantro）调味，汤是淡淡的绿色。","what_en":"Panama's chicken stew-soup with ñame yam and corn, flavoured with culantro, which gives the broth a light green colour.","fame":"巴拿马的国菜，几乎家家周末都煮一大锅；乡下用土鸡，配一小碗白米饭一起吃。","fame_en":"Panama's national dish — almost every family cooks a big pot at weekends, with free-range hen in the countryside and a little bowl of white rice on the side.","fact":"它的老家在巴拿马西南部的阿苏埃罗半岛；很多巴拿马人相信，前一晚喝多了，第二天一碗桑科乔就能「救回来」，天热的时候也说喝它能降温。","fact_en":"It comes from the Azuero Peninsula in south-western Panama; many Panamanians swear a bowl of sancocho is the best cure the morning after a big night — and some say it cools you down on hot days too.","src":"Smithsonian Magazine","url":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/travel/panamas-sancocho-is-a-soup-that-can-cure-it-all-180980283/","say":{"en":"One sancocho, please — does it come with rice?","zh":"来一碗桑科乔——配米饭吗？"}},"加洛平托":{"what":"哥斯达黎加的米饭炒黑豆，名字意思是「花斑公鸡」。","what_en":"Costa Rica's fried rice and black beans — the name means 'spotted rooster'.","fame":"哥斯达黎加人天天早上吃，配煎蛋、酸奶油、炸大蕉和一点 Lizano 酱；隔壁尼加拉瓜也吃，用的是红豆。","fame_en":"Costa Ricans eat it every morning with fried eggs, sour cream, fried plantain and a splash of Lizano sauce; neighbouring Nicaragua eats it too, with red beans.","fact":"两国一直争它是谁的国菜：2003 年哥斯达黎加煮了约 1000 磅创纪录，尼加拉瓜马上煮了 1200 磅回敬，2009 年哥斯达黎加又用更大的一锅「赢了回来」。","fact_en":"The two countries argue over whose national dish it is: in 2003 Costa Rica cooked about 1,000 lb for a record, Nicaragua answered with 1,200 lb, and in 2009 Costa Rica won it back with an even bigger pot.","src":"维基百科 Gallo pinto","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gallo_pinto","say":{"en":"Can I get the gallo pinto with eggs and plantain?","zh":"加洛平托能配鸡蛋和炸大蕉吗？"}},"奇维多":{"what":"乌拉圭的超级牛排三明治：薄牛排、火腿、芝士、培根、煎蛋、生菜番茄，一层层夹在面包里。","what_en":"Uruguay's giant steak sandwich: thin steak, ham, cheese, bacon, fried egg, lettuce and tomato stacked in a bun.","fame":"乌拉圭的国民三明治，蒙得维的亚的小馆子里配薯条和俄式沙拉一起上，一个人常常吃不完。","fame_en":"Uruguay's national sandwich — Montevideo diners serve it with chips and Russian salad, and one is often too much for one person.","fact":"「chivito」意思是「小山羊」，可里面根本没有羊肉：传说 1940 年代在埃斯特角的 El Mejillón 餐厅，一位阿根廷客人点山羊肉，老板没有，就用牛排加料做了一个，这道菜就这么来了。","fact_en":"'Chivito' means 'little goat', yet there's no goat in it: the story goes that in the 1940s at El Mejillón in Punta del Este, an Argentine customer asked for goat, the owner had none, and improvised with steak and toppings.","src":"维基百科 Chivito (sandwich)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chivito_(sandwich)","say":{"en":"One chivito al plato to share, please.","zh":"来一份盘装奇维多，我们分着吃。"}},"萨摩亚石灶":{"what":"萨摩亚的「umu」：把烧烫的火山石铺在地上，放上芋头、面包果、猪肉和鱼，再盖上香蕉叶焖熟。","what_en":"Samoa's umu: red-hot volcanic stones laid on the ground, topped with taro, breadfruit, pork and fish, then covered with banana leaves to steam.","fame":"周日做礼拜之后的家庭大餐「to'ona'i」就靠它，一周里最重要的一顿饭；用椰奶包的芋头叶「palusami」也在里面焖。","fame_en":"It's how the Sunday after-church family feast, to'ona'i — the most important meal of the week — gets cooked, including palusami, taro leaves wrapped around coconut cream.","fact":"按传统，周日的 umu 是男人做：天不亮就起来生火、刮芋头、挤椰奶；而且萨摩亚的 umu 是摆在地面上的石堆，不像夏威夷的 imu 要挖坑。","fact_en":"Traditionally the Sunday umu is men's work — up before dawn to light the fire, scrape taro and squeeze coconut cream; and a Samoan umu sits on top of the ground, unlike Hawaii's imu, which is dug into a pit.","src":"Polynesian Cultural Center","url":"https://www.polynesia.com/blog/polynesian-men-do-all-the-cooking","say":{"en":"What's cooking in the umu today?","zh":"今天石灶里焖的是什么？"}},"汤加烤乳猪":{"what":"汤加的「puaka tunu」：整只小猪在炭火上慢慢转着烤，皮又脆又亮。","what_en":"Tonga's puaka tunu: a whole piglet turned slowly over coals until the skin is crisp and shiny.","fame":"婚礼、葬礼、教会节日和国王的大典上都少不了它，宴席桌上一排排摆着烤猪、芋头和龙虾，人越重要猪越多。","fame_en":"No wedding, funeral, church festival or royal occasion is complete without it — feast tables are lined with roast pigs, taro and crayfish, and the bigger the occasion, the more pigs.","fact":"2008 年乔治·图普五世加冕时，汤加办了整整一周的庆典：两场王室仪式、三场加冕舞会，还有一场盛大的烤猪宴。","fact_en":"When King George Tupou V was crowned in 2008, Tonga celebrated for a whole week: two royal ceremonies, three coronation balls and a huge pig roast.","src":"NPR，2008 年 8 月","url":"https://www.npr.org/transcripts/93226282","say":{"en":"Which part of the pig is best — the crackling?","zh":"猪哪个部位最好吃——是脆皮吗？"}},"路易斯安那小龙虾":{"what":"美国路易斯安那州稻田和沼泽里养的淡水小龙虾，整锅加香料、玉米、土豆一起煮。","what_en":"Freshwater crawfish farmed in Louisiana's rice fields and swamps, boiled by the potful with spices, corn and potatoes.","fame":"每年春天的「crawfish boil」是南路易斯安那人的聚会：报纸铺桌，一倒一大堆，大家剥着吃、喝啤酒、听卡津音乐。","fame_en":"The spring crawfish boil is south Louisiana's party: newspaper on the table, a heap poured out, everyone peeling, drinking beer and listening to Cajun music.","fact":"2023 年的大旱加上 2024 年 1 月的寒潮，让 2024 年的小龙虾产量有的地方只剩正常的一成左右，州长宣布了灾难状态，价格涨得很厉害。","fact_en":"The 2023 drought followed by a January 2024 freeze left the 2024 crawfish harvest at roughly a tenth of normal in places; the governor declared a disaster and prices soared.","src":"FOX Weather，2024 年","url":"https://www.foxweather.com/lifestyle/louisiana-crawfish-shortage-continue-years","say":{"en":"How much is a pound of boiled crawfish today — and how spicy is it?","zh":"今天煮小龙虾一磅多少钱——有多辣？"}},"费城芝士牛排":{"what":"费城的长面包夹煎碎牛肉片、洋葱和融化的芝士。","what_en":"Philadelphia's long roll stuffed with chopped griddled steak, onions and melted cheese.","fame":"费城的城市名片；南费城 Pat's 和 Geno's 两家隔街对望，游客总要在两家之间选边站。","fame_en":"Philadelphia's calling card; in South Philly, Pat's and Geno's face each other across the street and visitors always pick a side.","fact":"它一开始根本没有芝士：1930 年左右卖热狗的帕特·奥利维耶里兄弟先做的是牛排三明治，芝士是 1940 年代才加的，现在最出名的 Cheez Whiz 罐装芝士酱要到 1950 年代才出现。","fact_en":"It started out with no cheese at all: around 1930 hot-dog sellers Pat and Harry Olivieri made a steak sandwich; cheese came in the 1940s, and the famous Cheez Whiz only appeared in the 1950s.","src":"National Geographic","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/travel/article/story-behind-the-philly-cheesesteak","say":{"en":"One Whiz wit, please.","zh":"一个加 Cheez Whiz、加洋葱的。（费城点法）"}},"冰酒":{"what":"用在藤上自然冻成冰的葡萄压出来的甜酒，加拿大安大略尼亚加拉产得最多。","what_en":"A sweet wine pressed from grapes frozen naturally on the vine; Canada's Niagara region in Ontario is the biggest producer.","fame":"冻住的葡萄里只挤得出一点点浓浓的糖汁，所以一小瓶就很贵；在亚洲尤其受欢迎，常被当作礼物。","fame_en":"Frozen grapes give only a few drops of concentrated sweet juice, so a small bottle is expensive; it's especially popular in Asia as a gift.","fact":"安大略规定：葡萄必须在藤上自然冻住，气温在零下 8 度或更低时才能摘、才能压，有监督员在场，一回暖就得停；1991 年 Inniskillin 的冰酒在法国 Vinexpo 拿了大奖，加拿大冰酒才被全世界知道。","fact_en":"Ontario's rules: grapes must freeze naturally on the vine and be picked and pressed at −8°C or colder, with an inspector present who stops the harvest if it warms up; Canadian icewine became world-famous after Inniskillin's won the top prize at Vinexpo in France in 1991.","src":"维基百科 Inniskillin","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inniskillin","say":{"en":"Could I taste the Vidal and the Cabernet Franc icewine?","zh":"能尝一下维达尔和品丽珠冰酒吗？"}},"莫吉托":{"what":"古巴的鸡尾酒：白朗姆酒、青柠、糖、薄荷叶加苏打水。","what_en":"Cuba's cocktail of white rum, lime, sugar, mint leaves and soda water.","fame":"全世界酒吧都会调；哈瓦那老城的小酒馆 La Bodeguita del Medio 号称是它的「家」，吧台上一排排一起捣薄荷。","fame_en":"Every bar in the world makes one; Havana's little La Bodeguita del Medio claims to be its home, muddling mint for rows of glasses at once.","fact":"那家酒馆墙上挂着据说是海明威写的「我的莫吉托在小酒馆，我的代基里在佛罗里迪塔」，可研究海明威的传记作者认为这多半不是他写的，也没找到他在那儿喝莫吉托的记录。","fact_en":"The bar displays a line supposedly written by Hemingway — 'My mojito in La Bodeguita, my daiquiri in El Floridita' — but his biographer Philip Greene thinks it's unlikely he wrote it, and found no record of him drinking mojitos there.","src":"维基百科 Bodeguita del medio","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bodeguita_del_medio","say":{"en":"One mojito, not too sweet, please.","zh":"一杯莫吉托，别太甜。"}},"蓝山咖啡":{"what":"牙买加东部蓝山山脉高海拔地区种出来的咖啡。","what_en":"Coffee grown high in the Blue Mountains of eastern Jamaica.","fame":"出名的顺滑、不苦、几乎没有酸涩，是世界上最贵的咖啡之一；正宗的要有牙买加官方认证，装在小木桶里出口。","fame_en":"Famous for being smooth, mild and barely bitter — one of the world's priciest coffees; the real thing carries official Jamaican certification and is shipped in small wooden barrels.","fact":"真正的大买家是日本：大约七成的蓝山咖啡出口到日本，日本还在 2019 年把 1 月 9 日定为「蓝山咖啡日」。","fact_en":"The real big buyer is Japan, which takes around 70% of Blue Mountain exports; in 2019 Japan made 9 January 'Blue Mountain Coffee Day'.","src":"Jamaica Gleaner，2019 年 1 月","url":"https://past.jamaica-gleaner.com/article/business/20190102/japan-proclaims-january-9-blue-mountain-coffee-day","say":{"en":"Is this 100% Blue Mountain, or a blend?","zh":"这是 100% 蓝山，还是拼配的？"}},"巴西莓":{"what":"亚马孙棕榈树上一串串紫黑色的小果子（açaí），打成浓浓的紫色果泥。","what_en":"Small purple-black berries from an Amazon palm (açaí), blended into a thick purple pulp.","fame":"在巴西北部帕拉州的贝伦，它是正餐：不加糖，配炸鱼和木薯粉一起吃；到了里约和国外，才变成加冰加香蕉格兰诺拉的「açaí 碗」。","fame_en":"In Belém, in northern Pará, it's a main meal — unsweetened, with fried fish and cassava flour; only in Rio and abroad does it become the frozen 'açaí bowl' with banana and granola.","fact":"巴西 90% 以上的 açaí 都是帕拉州产的，2022 年帕拉一个州就产了约 160 万吨。","fact_en":"Over 90% of Brazil's açaí comes from Pará — about 1.6 million tonnes from that one state in 2022.","src":"Correio da Manhã / IBGE 数据，2024 年 6 月","url":"https://www.correiodamanha.com.br/nacional/norte/2024/06/138072-estado-se-mantem-lider-em-producao-de-acai.html","say":{"en":"Do you have it plain, without sugar, the way they eat it here?","zh":"这儿的人一般怎么吃？有不加糖的吗？"}},"黑豆炖肉":{"what":"巴西的黑豆炖猪肉（feijoada）：黑豆和香肠、腊肉、猪排一起炖几个小时。","what_en":"Brazil's feijoada: black beans stewed for hours with sausage, salted pork and ribs.","fame":"里约人周六中午的大餐，配米饭、炒羽衣甘蓝、木薯粉和橙子片，一顿吃到下午，还要来一杯 caipirinha。","fame_en":"Rio's big Saturday lunch, served with rice, sautéed collard greens, cassava flour and orange slices — it lasts all afternoon, with a caipirinha.","fact":"常听说它是奴隶用主人不要的猪下水发明的，可不少巴西历史学家说这是后来的传说：它更像是从葡萄牙的炖菜 cozido 变过来的，和法国的 cassoulet 是亲戚。","fact_en":"You often hear it was invented by enslaved people from pork scraps their masters threw away, but many Brazilian historians call that a later legend — it's more likely a descendant of Portuguese cozido, a cousin of French cassoulet.","src":"维基百科 Feijoada","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Feijoada_(Brazilian_dish)","say":{"en":"Is the feijoada only on Saturdays here?","zh":"你们这儿黑豆炖肉是只有周六才有吗？"}},"恩潘纳达":{"what":"阿根廷的烤或炸馅饺：面皮包着肉、土豆、鸡蛋、橄榄，边上捏一圈花边。","what_en":"Argentina's baked or fried pastries, filled with meat, potato, egg and olives, with a pleated edge.","fame":"阿根廷人聚会、看球、打电话叫外卖都点它，一打一打地买；北部萨尔塔的个头小、带汁、加了土豆，有点辣。","fame_en":"Argentines order them by the dozen for parties, football and delivery; in the northern province of Salta they're small, juicy, with potato and a bit of heat.","fact":"萨尔塔和隔壁图库曼几十年来一直争谁的恩潘纳达是阿根廷第一，图库曼的法马亚每年 9 月还办「全国恩潘纳达节」；2026 年一个国际美食排名把图库曼的放在萨尔塔前面，又吵了一轮。","fact_en":"Salta and neighbouring Tucumán have argued for decades over whose empanada is Argentina's best; Famaillá in Tucumán holds a National Empanada Festival every September, and a 2026 international ranking putting Tucumán ahead of Salta reignited the fight.","src":"Canal 26，2026 年 1 月","url":"https://www.canal26.com/general/2026/01/27/orgullo-argentino-tucuman-gano-un-reconocimiento-gastronomico-a-nivel-mundial-gracias-a-su-empanada/","say":{"en":"A dozen empanadas — half beef, half chicken, please.","zh":"一打恩潘纳达——一半牛肉，一半鸡肉。"}},"皮斯科酸":{"what":"秘鲁的鸡尾酒：葡萄蒸馏酒皮斯科加青柠汁、糖浆和蛋白摇出一层白沫，上面滴几滴苦精。","what_en":"Peru's cocktail of pisco grape brandy, lime juice, syrup and egg white shaken to a white foam, with drops of bitters on top.","fame":"秘鲁的国酒，每家餐厅都有；智利也说它是自己的，两国为皮斯科和皮斯科酸争了很多年。","fame_en":"Peru's national drink, on every restaurant menu; Chile claims it too, and the two countries have argued over pisco and the pisco sour for years.","fact":"它是一个美国人在利马调出来的：维克多·莫里斯 1916 年在利马开了 Morris' Bar，1920 年代照着威士忌酸改出了皮斯科酸，后来他的调酒师加了蛋白和苦精，变成今天的样子。","fact_en":"An American invented it in Lima: Victor Morris opened Morris' Bar there in 1916 and, in the 1920s, adapted the whiskey sour to pisco; one of his bartenders later added egg white and bitters, giving today's version.","src":"维基百科 Pisco sour","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pisco_sour","say":{"en":"Two pisco sours, please — what pisco do you use?","zh":"两杯皮斯科酸——你们用的是哪种皮斯科？"}},"智利车厘子":{"what":"智利中部果园里种的大樱桃，11 月到 2 月是季节，正好是北半球的冬天。","what_en":"Big cherries from orchards in central Chile, in season from November to February — the northern hemisphere's winter.","fame":"中国人过年前在超市、水果店、网上抢的「车厘子」大多就是智利的，一箱箱空运或坐「车厘子快船」到中国。","fame_en":"Most of the 'chelizi' Chinese shoppers grab before Chinese New Year are Chilean, flown or shipped over on special 'cherry express' boats.","fact":"2024 年智利车厘子出口约 31 亿美元，比三文鱼还多，其中 93% 卖到了中国；货太多，那一季中国市场上的价格跌了大约一半。","fact_en":"In 2024 Chile exported about US$3.1 billion of cherries — more than its salmon — and 93% went to China; there were so many that prices there fell by about half that season.","src":"FreshPlaza","url":"https://www.freshplaza.com/north-america/article/9695490/chilean-cherry-exports-reach-3-1-billion-as-china-surplus-drives-prices-50-lower/","say":{"en":"What size are these — J or JJ? Can I taste one?","zh":"这是几 J 的——J 还是 JJ？能尝一个吗？"}},"阿雷帕":{"what":"玉米面做的圆饼，在铁板上烤，哥伦比亚人从早吃到晚。","what_en":"A round corn-dough cake cooked on a griddle, eaten all day long in Colombia.","fame":"在麦德林，早饭的 arepa 又薄又白，抹黄油、配一块白奶酪和一杯热巧克力；街边还有夹奶酪烤的、甜玉米做的 arepa de chócolo。","fame_en":"In Medellín the breakfast arepa is thin and plain, spread with butter, with a slice of white cheese and hot chocolate; street stalls sell cheese-stuffed ones and sweet-corn arepas de chócolo.","fact":"哥伦比亚各地加起来有 70 多种 arepa，不同地方的做法和吃法都不一样；它和委内瑞拉谁是「正宗」，两国一直在争。","fact_en":"Colombia has more than 70 kinds of arepa, made and eaten differently in each region — and Colombia and Venezuela still argue over whose is the 'real' one.","src":"Portafolio（哥伦比亚）","url":"https://www.portafolio.co/negocios/hay-mas-de-70-tipos-en-el-pais-dia-de-la-arepa-520894","say":{"en":"One arepa with cheese and a hot chocolate, please.","zh":"一个奶酪阿雷帕，再来一杯热巧克力。"}},"萨尔特尼亚":{"what":"玻利维亚的烤馅饺，皮微甜，里面是带汤汁的辣炖牛肉或鸡肉、土豆、豌豆、橄榄和鸡蛋。","what_en":"Bolivia's baked pastry with a slightly sweet crust, filled with a juicy, spicy stew of beef or chicken, potato, peas, olives and egg.","fame":"玻利维亚人上午十点左右的点心，只在早上卖，中午就卖光；吃的时候要竖着拿、先咬一小口把汤吸掉，不然会流一身。","fame_en":"Bolivia's mid-morning snack, sold only in the morning and gone by noon; you hold it upright and bite a small hole to sip the juice first, or it runs down your arm.","fact":"名字的意思是「萨尔塔来的」：传说 1830 年代，阿根廷萨尔塔的作家胡安娜·曼努埃拉·戈里蒂一家逃到玻利维亚，靠卖萨尔塔做法的馅饺过日子，大家就管它叫「萨尔塔女人的」。不过这个故事历史学家还有争议。","fact_en":"The name means 'from Salta': the story goes that in the 1830s writer Juana Manuela Gorriti's family fled Salta in Argentina for Bolivia and got by selling Salta-style empanadas, which people called 'salteñas'. Historians still debate the tale.","src":"维基百科 Salteña","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salte%C3%B1a","say":{"en":"Two beef salteñas, please — spicy or mild?","zh":"两个牛肉萨尔特尼亚——辣的还是不辣的？"}},"委内瑞拉可可":{"what":"委内瑞拉东北部苏克雷州一带种的可可豆，以 Carúpano、Río Caribe 这些产地名出名。","what_en":"Cacao beans grown around Sucre state in north-eastern Venezuela, known by origin names such as Carúpano and Río Caribe.","fame":"委内瑞拉可可被巧克力师傅当作世界上最香的一批「fine flavour」可可，欧洲的高端巧克力常在包装上写着它的产地。","fame_en":"Chocolatiers rank Venezuelan cacao among the world's most aromatic 'fine flavour' beans, and European premium bars often print its origin on the wrapper.","fact":"Carúpano 1647 年就是为了种可可、卖可可建起来的港口；到 1921 年，那里约八成的可可出口被五家科西嘉人开的贸易公司包了，他们还推动拉了一条从 Carúpano 直通法国马赛的电报线。","fact_en":"Carúpano was founded in 1647 as a cacao port; by 1921 about 80% of its cacao exports were handled by five Corsican trading houses, who even pushed for a telegraph cable straight to Marseille.","src":"维基百科 Corsican diaspora in Venezuela","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corsican_diaspora_in_Venezuela","say":{"en":"Can we see how the beans are fermented and dried here?","zh":"能看看你们这儿怎么发酵、晒可可豆吗？"}},"委内瑞拉阿雷帕":{"what":"委内瑞拉的厚玉米饼，烤好后从中间切开，像口袋一样塞满馅。","what_en":"Venezuela's thick corn cake, split open after cooking and stuffed like a pocket.","fame":"委内瑞拉人一日三餐都能吃；加拉加斯的 arepera 里馅有几十种，最出名的是鸡肉牛油果沙拉的「reina pepiada」和黑豆牛肉丝芝士的「pabellón」。","fame_en":"Venezuelans eat it at any meal; Caracas areperas offer dozens of fillings — most famously 'reina pepiada' (chicken-avocado salad) and 'pabellón' (black beans, shredded beef, cheese).","fact":"现在做 arepa 几乎都用预煮玉米粉，不用再泡玉米、磨面：1954 年工程师路易斯·卡瓦列罗·梅希亚斯申请了专利，1960 年 Polar 公司推出了「Harina P.A.N.」，今天跟着委内瑞拉移民卖到了全世界。","fact_en":"Today almost everyone makes arepas from pre-cooked corn flour instead of soaking and grinding corn: engineer Luis Caballero Mejías patented the process in 1954, and in 1960 Empresas Polar launched Harina P.A.N., now sold worldwide wherever Venezuelans have moved.","src":"维基百科 Harina P.A.N.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harina_P.A.N.","say":{"en":"One reina pepiada, please — can you add cheese?","zh":"来一个 reina pepiada，能加芝士吗？"}},"比尼亚莱斯山谷":{"what":"古巴西部的一片绿色山谷，平地上种烟草，中间冒出一座座圆顶的石灰岩小山。","what_en":"A green valley in western Cuba: tobacco fields on the flat land, with round-topped limestone hills popping up between them.","fame":"世界上最好的雪茄烟叶有不少就长在这一带。农民到今天还用牛犁地、在茅草顶的木屋里晾烟叶，1999 年整片山谷被列为世界遗产。游客骑马穿过烟田，去农家看人卷雪茄。","fame_en":"Some of the world's best cigar tobacco grows around here. Farmers still plough with oxen and dry the leaves in thatched wooden barns, and in 1999 the whole valley became a World Heritage site. Visitors ride horses through the fields to watch farmers roll cigars.","fact":"2022 年 9 月飓风「伊恩」正面扫过比尼亚莱斯所在的比那尔德里奥省，省里大约 1.2 万座晾烟房有九成被吹坏。五个月后才修好两千多座，很多农家因为没有晾烟房种不了烟，当地人说要八到十年才能恢复。","fact_en":"In September 2022 Hurricane Ian tore straight through Pinar del Río, Viñales's province, damaging about 90% of its roughly 12,000 tobacco-curing barns. Five months later only about 2,400 had been rebuilt, many families couldn't grow tobacco without a barn, and growers said it would take eight to ten years to get back to normal.","src":"OnCuba News，2023 年","url":"https://oncubanews.com/en/cuba/habanos-vs-ian-a-battle-five-months-after-the-hurricane","say":{"en":"Can we stop at a tobacco farm and see how they roll the cigars?","zh":"我们能去一家烟农那儿看看他们怎么卷雪茄吗？"}},"邓斯河瀑布":{"what":"牙买加北岸的一道阶梯状瀑布，水沿着一层层石台阶流下来，直接流进加勒比海。","what_en":"A stepped waterfall on Jamaica's north coast, where water tumbles down terrace after terrace of rock and runs straight into the Caribbean Sea.","fame":"它好玩在可以爬：游客穿着防滑鞋，跟着导游手拉手排成一串，从海滩边一路往上爬大约 180 米，边爬边被水冲。这是牙买加最有名的景点之一。","fame_en":"The fun is that you climb it: visitors in water shoes hold hands in a human chain behind a guide and scramble about 180 m up from the beach, getting soaked the whole way. It's one of Jamaica's best-known sights.","fact":"这道瀑布还在「长」：泉水里溶着很多碳酸钙，流过的时候不断沉积成新的石灰华，把台阶一点点重新垒起来，所以地质学家管它叫「活的瀑布」。世界上像这样直接流进大海的石灰华瀑布非常少。","fact_en":"The falls are still growing: the spring water is loaded with calcium carbonate, which keeps depositing fresh travertine and slowly rebuilding the terraces — geologists call it a 'living' waterfall. Very few travertine falls in the world empty straight into the sea like this.","src":"Wikipedia: Dunn's River Falls","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dunn%27s_River_Falls","say":{"en":"Do we need water shoes, or can we rent them here?","zh":"要穿防滑水鞋吗？这儿能租吗？"}},"阿雷纳尔火山":{"what":"哥斯达黎加北部一座尖尖的圆锥形火山，山脚下的小镇拉福尔图纳到处是温泉。","what_en":"A neat cone-shaped volcano in northern Costa Rica; La Fortuna, the town at its foot, is full of hot springs.","fame":"它几乎是「教科书里的火山」的样子。从 1968 年到 2010 年它一直在喷，晚上能看见红色的岩浆往下流，是哥斯达黎加最热门的地方之一；现在大家来泡温泉、走雨林步道、看火山。","fame_en":"It looks like a textbook volcano. From 1968 to 2010 it erupted almost non-stop, and at night you could see red lava running down its sides; it's one of Costa Rica's most popular spots, where people come for hot springs, rainforest trails and volcano views.","fact":"在 1968 年 7 月 29 日之前，大家都以为它只是一座普通的山。那天它突然大爆发，埋掉了塔巴孔等几个村子，八十多人遇难，是哥斯达黎加史上最惨的火山灾难。2010 年它又突然安静下来，专家说它没有死，只是在休息——而今天的塔巴孔是一家温泉度假村。","fact_en":"Until 29 July 1968 most people thought it was just an ordinary mountain. That day it suddenly blew, burying villages including Tabacón and killing about 87 people — Costa Rica's deadliest volcanic disaster. In 2010 it abruptly went quiet; experts say it isn't dead, just resting — and Tabacón today is a hot-spring resort.","src":"Wikipedia: Arenal Volcano","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arenal_Volcano","say":{"en":"Is there a hot spring here with a view of the volcano?","zh":"这儿有能看到火山的温泉吗？"}},"汤加喷水孔":{"what":"汤加主岛西南海边的一长条黑色火山岩，海浪一冲上来，石头上的几百个洞就一起往天上喷水。","what_en":"A long strip of black volcanic rock on the southwest coast of Tonga's main island; when waves roll in, hundreds of holes in the rock shoot water into the sky at once.","fame":"这片喷水孔沿海岸绵延大约 5 公里，有好几百个洞，浪大的时候水柱能喷到 30 米高，一排一排像烟花，还会发出呼呼的哨声。","fame_en":"The blowholes run for about 5 km along the shore — hundreds of them — and in big swells the spouts reach 30 m, going off in rows like fireworks with a whooshing whistle.","fact":"它的汤加名字「Mapu'a 'a Vaea」意思是「Vaea 贵族的口哨」。Vaea 是汤加一个世袭的贵族头衔，旁边的侯马村就是这位贵族的领地。2009 年老 Vaea 男爵安葬在侯马后不到 12 小时，他的长子就继承了头衔，成了第 16 代 Vaea。","fact_en":"Its Tongan name, Mapu'a 'a Vaea, means 'the whistles of Vaea' — Vaea is a hereditary noble title, and nearby Houma village is the noble's estate. In 2009, less than 12 hours after the old Baron Vaea of Houma was buried there, his eldest son was installed as the 16th holder of the title.","src":"Matangi Tonga，2009 年","url":"https://matangitonga.to/print/4787","say":{"en":"When's the best time to see the blowholes — high tide?","zh":"什么时候来看喷水孔最好？涨潮的时候吗？"}},"死亡谷":{"what":"美国加州东部的一片沙漠谷地，是北美最热、最干、最低的地方。","what_en":"A desert valley in eastern California — the hottest, driest and lowest place in North America.","fame":"1913 年这里测到 56.7°C，至今是地球上的最高气温纪录。谷底的恶水盆地比海平面低 86 米，白色盐壳一眼望不到边；夏天也有人专门来，就为了在温度计前拍张照。","fame_en":"In 1913 it recorded 56.7°C, still the hottest air temperature ever measured on Earth. Badwater Basin on the valley floor sits 86 m below sea level, a white salt crust as far as you can see; people even come in summer just for a photo next to the thermometer.","fact":"2023 年飓风「希拉里」和 2024 年 2 月的一场大雨之后，恶水盆地变成了一个约 10 公里长、30 厘米深的临时湖「曼利湖」，人们在地球上最干的地方之一划起了皮划艇。可惜不到一个月，大风把整湖水往北吹了 3 公里，湖变浅变泥，公园就禁止划船了。","fact_en":"After Hurricane Hilary in 2023 and a big storm in February 2024, Badwater Basin turned into a temporary lake, 'Lake Manly', about 10 km long and 30 cm deep — and people kayaked in one of the driest places on Earth. Within a month strong winds pushed the whole lake about 3 km north, it turned shallow and muddy, and the park banned boating.","src":"美国国家公园管理局 NPS 新闻稿，2024 年","url":"https://www.nps.gov/deva/learn/news/lake-manly.htm","say":{"en":"How much water should I bring for the hike?","zh":"走这条路我要带多少水？"}},"雷尼尔山":{"what":"西雅图东南边一座戴着冰雪帽子的大火山，海拔 4392 米，天晴的时候在城里抬头就能看见。","what_en":"A huge snow-capped volcano southeast of Seattle, 4,392 m high — on clear days you can see it from anywhere in the city.","fame":"它是美国本土冰川最多的山，夏天山腰的「天堂」草甸开满野花，是西雅图人最爱的周末去处。本地人天晴时会说「The mountain is out」（山出来了），因为一年里它常常躲在云里。","fame_en":"It's the most glaciated peak in the lower 48 states, and in summer the 'Paradise' meadows on its slopes fill with wildflowers — Seattle's favourite weekend escape. Locals say 'the mountain is out' on clear days, because it hides in cloud so much of the year.","fact":"2025 年 7 月 8 日凌晨开始，雷尼尔山底下出现了有记录以来最大的一次「地震群」：几天里记到三百多次小地震，最大的 2.4 级，规模、频率和释放的能量都超过了 2009 年那次。美国地质调查局说没有发现地面变形，警戒级别一直是绿色「正常」。","fact_en":"From the early hours of 8 July 2025, Mount Rainier had the largest earthquake swarm ever recorded there — more than 300 small quakes in a few days, the biggest a magnitude 2.4, beating the 2009 swarm in size, rate and energy. The USGS saw no ground deformation, and the alert level stayed at green, 'normal'.","src":"美国地质调查局 USGS 喀斯喀特火山观测站，2025 年","url":"https://www.usgs.gov/observatories/cvo/news/monitoring-stations-detect-small-magnitude-earthquakes-mount-rainier-during","say":{"en":"Is the road up to Paradise open today?","zh":"今天去「天堂」的那条路开着吗？"}},"火山口湖":{"what":"美国俄勒冈州一个火山塌掉以后积满雨雪水的湖，湖水蓝得像墨水。","what_en":"A lake in Oregon that filled with rain and snowmelt after a volcano collapsed — its water is an inky, unreal blue.","fame":"大约 7700 年前马扎马火山大爆发后塌成一个大坑，慢慢积水，成了美国最深的湖，深 594 米。没有河流进也没有河流出，水几乎只来自雨雪，所以特别清，那种蓝色照片都拍不出来。","fame_en":"About 7,700 years ago Mount Mazama erupted and collapsed into a giant bowl that slowly filled with water, making the deepest lake in the US at 594 m. No rivers flow in or out — the water comes almost only from rain and snow — so it's incredibly clear, a blue photos can't quite capture.","fact":"湖上漂着一根「老人」：一根大约 9 米长的铁杉树干，竖着浮在水里，露出水面约 1 米。1896 年就有地质学家记录过它，到今天还在漂，风一吹就到处走，有一年夏天到秋天它在湖上走了一百多公里。","fact_en":"An 'Old Man' floats on the lake: a mountain hemlock log about 9 m long, bobbing upright with roughly a metre above water. A geologist first recorded it in 1896 and it's still drifting today, pushed around by the wind — one summer-to-autumn it travelled over 100 km around the lake.","src":"美国国家公园管理局 NPS 火山口湖国家公园","url":"https://www.nps.gov/crla/learn/nature/theoldman.htm","say":{"en":"Is the Rim Drive open all the way around yet?","zh":"环湖公路现在整圈都通了吗？"}},"阿斯彭滑雪":{"what":"美国科罗拉多州落基山里的一个老矿镇，现在是全美最有名、也最贵的滑雪小镇之一。","what_en":"An old mining town in Colorado's Rocky Mountains, now one of America's most famous — and most expensive — ski towns.","fame":"四座雪山就在小镇边上，白天滑雪，晚上街上是名牌店和明星。每年一月的 X Games 极限运动会也在这里办，滑雪的和不滑雪的都知道这个名字。","fame_en":"Four ski mountains sit right by town: ski all day, then walk streets full of designer shops and celebrities. The X Games are held here every January, so even non-skiers know the name.","fact":"阿斯彭变成滑雪小镇，是从二战的山地部队开始的：在附近训练的奥地利滑雪教练弗里德尔·法伊弗 1943 年第一次看到这座山，战后说服芝加哥商人投钱建缆车。1947 年 1 月「1 号缆车」正式启用，号称当时世界上最长的吊椅缆车。","fact_en":"Aspen's ski story began with WWII mountain troops: Austrian ski instructor Friedl Pfeifer, training nearby with the 10th Mountain Division, first saw the mountain in 1943 and after the war persuaded a Chicago businessman to fund a lift. Lift 1 was dedicated in January 1947, billed as the longest chairlift in the world.","src":"Wikipedia: Ski Lift No. 1","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ski_Lift_No._1","say":{"en":"Can I get a two-day lift pass, and where do I rent skis?","zh":"我要一张两天的缆车票，在哪儿租雪板？"}},"马蹄湾":{"what":"美国亚利桑那州佩吉镇外，科罗拉多河在峡谷里拐了一个马蹄形的大弯。","what_en":"Just outside Page, Arizona, the Colorado River makes a giant horseshoe-shaped bend deep in a canyon.","fame":"站在悬崖边往下看，三百米下面是绿色的河绕着一块红色的岩石转了一圈，几乎每个人都会拍同一张照片。它就在公路边，走 1.2 公里就到，是美国西南部自驾最火的一站。","fame_en":"From the cliff edge you look 300 m down at a green river wrapping all the way around a red rock — almost everyone takes the same photo. It's a 1.2 km walk from the highway, and one of the most popular stops on any Southwest road trip.","fact":"来的人涨得太快：2017 年大约来了 150 万人。直到 2018 年，国家公园管理局才第一次装上带栏杆的观景台，不过栏杆只有一小段，其他悬崖边到今天还是可以随便走到边上，没有栏杆。","fact_en":"Crowds grew so fast that about 1.5 million people came in 2017. Only in 2018 did the Park Service add its first railed viewing platform — and the railing covers just a short stretch; elsewhere you can still walk right up to an unrailed edge.","src":"Deseret News，2018 年","url":"https://www.deseret.com/2018/8/11/20650996/horseshoe-bend-undergoes-changes-to-manage-growing-crowds","say":{"en":"How long is the walk to the overlook, and is there any shade?","zh":"走到观景台要多久？路上有阴凉吗？"}},"冰川国家公园":{"what":"美国蒙大拿州靠加拿大边境的一座国家公园，雪山、冰川、碧绿的湖，还有灰熊和山羊。","what_en":"A national park in Montana on the Canadian border: snowy peaks, glaciers, emerald lakes, grizzly bears and mountain goats.","fame":"园里最有名的是「向太阳之路」，一条贴着悬崖修的山路，翻过大陆分水岭，夏天才全线开放。因为来的人太多，旺季开车进去要提前预约。","fame_en":"Its star is the Going-to-the-Sun Road, carved into the cliffs and crossing the Continental Divide, fully open only in summer. It's so popular that in peak season you need a vehicle reservation to drive in.","fact":"公园里原来有几块牌子写着「冰川会在 2020 年全部消失」。2017 年美国地质调查局告诉公园，这个预测已经不准了——几年雪下得多，冰川缩得比模型慢。2019 到 2020 年公园悄悄把牌子换掉，新牌子写的是：冰川在变小，什么时候消失取决于人们怎么做。","fact_en":"Signs in the park once said the glaciers would all be gone by 2020. In 2017 the USGS told the park the forecast no longer held — several snowy winters had slowed the melting. Around 2019–20 the park quietly replaced them; the new signs say the glaciers are shrinking, and when they disappear depends on what people do.","src":"KPAX 新闻，2020 年","url":"https://www.kpax.com/news/local-news/flathead-county/glacier-national-park-to-remove-all-glaciers-will-be-gone-by-2020-signs","say":{"en":"Do I need a reservation to drive the Going-to-the-Sun Road today?","zh":"今天开「向太阳之路」要预约吗？"}},"龙卷风走廊":{"what":"美国中部大平原上龙卷风最多的一条带子，堪萨斯、俄克拉何马、内布拉斯加都在里面。","what_en":"The strip of America's Great Plains that gets the most tornadoes — Kansas, Oklahoma and Nebraska all sit inside it.","fame":"每年春天，从墨西哥湾来的暖湿空气和落基山下来的干冷空气在这片平地上撞在一起，生出巨大的雷暴和龙卷风。《绿野仙踪》里多萝西的房子就是在堪萨斯被龙卷风卷走的；现在还有专门的「追风之旅」，带游客开车追龙卷风。","fame_en":"Every spring, warm humid air from the Gulf of Mexico crashes into cold dry air off the Rockies over these flat plains, spawning huge thunderstorms and tornadoes. Dorothy's house in The Wizard of Oz was whisked away from Kansas; today there are 'storm-chasing tours' that drive tourists after twisters.","fact":"「龙卷风走廊」在往东挪。2018 年美国北伊利诺伊大学和国家海洋与大气管理局的研究者分析了 1979–2017 年的记录：传统的大平原走廊龙卷风变少了，密西西比、田纳西、肯塔基一带的「迪克西走廊」反而变多了。那边树多、夜里来的多，更难看见，也更危险。","fact_en":"Tornado Alley is moving east. In 2018 researchers from Northern Illinois University and NOAA analysed records from 1979–2017: the classic Plains alley saw fewer tornadoes, while 'Dixie Alley' — Mississippi, Tennessee, Kentucky — saw more. There, trees and night-time storms make tornadoes harder to see and more dangerous.","src":"EarthSky，2018 年","url":"https://earthsky.org/earth/tornado-alley-dixie-climate-change/","say":{"en":"If the sirens go off, where's the nearest storm shelter?","zh":"要是警报响了，最近的避难所在哪儿？"}},"万湖之州":{"what":"美国北部的明尼苏达州，车牌上就写着「万湖之地」（Land of 10,000 Lakes）。","what_en":"Minnesota, in the northern US — its licence plates literally say 'Land of 10,000 Lakes'.","fame":"冰川退走以后留下了数不清的湖，密西西比河也从这里的一个小湖发源。夏天全州的人去湖边的小木屋划船、钓鱼；冬天湖面冻住，大家在冰上搭小屋钓鱼。","fame_en":"Retreating glaciers left countless lakes behind, and the Mississippi starts from a small lake here. In summer everyone heads to lake cabins to boat and fish; in winter the lakes freeze and people put up little huts on the ice to fish through holes.","fact":"它其实不止一万个湖。明尼苏达州自然资源部从 1991 年左右开始用卫星图把全州的水体一个个量出来，数据库里有 11.7 万多个水体。明尼苏达大学的湖泊学家按「10 英亩以上才算湖」重新数了一遍，答案是 14,380 个。","fact_en":"It actually has way more than 10,000. Since around 1991 the state Department of Natural Resources has mapped every waterbody from satellite images — over 117,000 of them. A University of Minnesota limnologist recounted using '10 acres or more counts as a lake' and got 14,380.","src":"明尼苏达大学 Minnesota Sea Grant","url":"https://seagrant.umn.edu/news-info/directors-column/minnesota-land-how-many-lakes","say":{"en":"Can we rent a canoe here for the afternoon?","zh":"这儿能租一只独木舟玩一下午吗？"}},"阿肯色钻石坑":{"what":"美国阿肯色州的一个州立公园，一块翻松的泥土地，任何人买张门票就能进去挖钻石。","what_en":"A state park in Arkansas — a ploughed field where anyone with a ticket can dig for diamonds.","fame":"这是世界上少数几个对公众开放、可以自己找钻石的钻石产地，规矩是「谁找到归谁」。来的人带着铲子和筛子在泥里翻，公园每年登记好几百颗游客找到的钻石。","fame_en":"It's one of the very few diamond sites in the world open to the public, and the rule is finders keepers. People bring shovels and sieves to sift the mud, and the park registers hundreds of visitor-found diamonds every year.","fact":"2024 年 1 月，一位法国游客在这里挖到一颗 7.46 克拉的钻石；2025 年 4 月，一位明尼苏达游客又找到一颗 3.81 克拉的棕色钻石，用自家的狗给它起名。美国历史上最大的钻石「山姆大叔」（40.23 克拉）也是 1924 年在这块地上挖出来的，现在在史密森尼博物馆。","fact_en":"In January 2024 a French visitor dug up a 7.46-carat diamond here; in April 2025 a Minnesota visitor found a 3.81-carat brown one and named it after his dog. The largest diamond ever found in the US — the 40.23-carat 'Uncle Sam' — came out of this same ground in 1924 and is now at the Smithsonian.","src":"阿肯色州旅游局新闻稿，2025 年","url":"https://www.arkansas.com/media/press-releases/visitor-finds-381-carat-brown-diamond-at-crater-of-diamonds-state-park","say":{"en":"Can I rent a shovel and a sieve, and how do I know if it's a diamond?","zh":"能租铲子和筛子吗？我怎么知道挖到的是不是钻石？"}},"基韦斯特":{"what":"佛罗里达最南端的一个小岛城，离古巴只有 145 公里，比离迈阿密还近。","what_en":"A small island town at the very bottom of Florida — just 145 km from Cuba, closer than it is to Miami.","fame":"开车走一条跨海的长桥公路就能到，岛上是彩色木房子、满街跑的鸡和傍晚在码头看日落的人群。海明威在这里住过、写过书，「美国本土最南点」的那个大浮标前面永远在排队拍照。","fame_en":"You drive there along a highway of long sea bridges. The island is colourful wooden houses, chickens roaming the streets and crowds watching the sunset at the dock. Hemingway lived and wrote here, and there's always a queue for photos at the 'Southernmost Point' buoy.","fact":"1982 年 4 月 23 日，基韦斯特「宣布独立」。起因是联邦边境巡逻队在通往岛链的唯一公路上设了检查站，查毒品和偷渡，把当地交通堵死了。市长宣布成立「海螺共和国」，一分钟后就向美国投降，还要求 10 亿美元援助。检查站很快撤了，岛上每年四月还会过「独立节」。","fact_en":"On 23 April 1982 Key West 'declared independence'. The Border Patrol had set up a checkpoint on the only road into the Keys, hunting for drugs and migrants, and traffic ground to a halt. The mayor proclaimed the 'Conch Republic', surrendered to the US a minute later and asked for $1 billion in aid. The checkpoint soon vanished — and the island still throws an 'independence' party every April.","src":"Wikipedia: Conch Republic","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Conch_Republic","say":{"en":"What time is sunset at Mallory Square tonight?","zh":"今晚马洛里广场几点日落？"}},"新英格兰秋叶":{"what":"美国东北角的新英格兰地区，尤其是佛蒙特州，每年十月满山的枫树变红变黄。","what_en":"New England, America's northeast corner — Vermont above all — where every October whole hillsides of maple trees turn red and gold.","fame":"这里的糖枫是世界上秋色最艳的树之一，白色教堂、红色谷仓、廊桥配上满山红叶，就是美国人心里「秋天」的样子。每年上百万「看叶子的人」（leaf peepers）开车来，网上还有实时的「红叶地图」告诉你哪里最红。","fame_en":"Sugar maples here are among the most brilliant autumn trees on Earth; white churches, red barns and covered bridges set against blazing hills are what Americans picture as 'fall'. Every year huge numbers of 'leaf peepers' drive in, and live foliage maps online show where colours are peaking.","fact":"在佛蒙特开车看红叶，你一块大广告牌都看不到：1968 年佛蒙特成了美国第一个禁止路边广告牌的州。当时广告公司骂这是「共产主义」，把地租给广告牌的农民也反对，最后一块广告牌到 1974 年才拆掉。","fact_en":"Drive Vermont's foliage roads and you won't see a single billboard: in 1968 it became the first US state to ban them. Advertisers called the idea 'communist', farmers who rented out land for signs opposed it, and the last billboard didn't come down until 1974.","src":"VTDigger，2021 年","url":"https://vtdigger.org/2021/07/11/then-again-vermonts-billboard-ban-followed-a-winding-road-to-passage/","say":{"en":"Where's the best place around here to see the leaves this week?","zh":"这周附近哪里的红叶最好看？"}},"迪纳利山":{"what":"阿拉斯加中部的一座大雪山，海拔 6190 米，北美洲最高峰。","what_en":"A massive snowy mountain in central Alaska, 6,190 m high — the highest peak in North America.","fame":"从山脚的平原到山顶落差大约 5500 米，比珠峰从大本营往上看还高，所以站在远处看它像一堵白墙。它所在的国家公园只有一条土路进去，大部分人坐公园大巴，一路看灰熊、驯鹿和驼鹿。","fame_en":"It rises about 5,500 m from the lowlands to the summit — a bigger base-to-top rise than Everest — so from afar it looks like a white wall. Its national park has a single gravel road in, and most visitors ride park buses, spotting grizzlies, caribou and moose on the way.","fact":"这座山的名字一直在打架。当地原住民叫它「Denali」（高的那个），1917 年起官方名字是「麦金利山」，2015 年奥巴马政府改回了迪纳利；2025 年 1 月 20 日特朗普上任第一天又签令改回麦金利山，但国家公园的名字还叫迪纳利。阿拉斯加州议会通过决议反对，大多数阿拉斯加人到今天还叫它 Denali。","fact_en":"The mountain's name keeps flipping. Native Alaskans call it Denali, 'the tall one'; from 1917 the official name was Mount McKinley; in 2015 the Obama administration restored Denali; and on 20 January 2025, his first day back, Trump signed an order changing it back to Mount McKinley — though the national park keeps the name Denali. Alaska's legislature passed a resolution against it, and most Alaskans still call it Denali.","src":"Alaska's News Source，2025 年","url":"https://www.alaskasnewssource.com/2025/01/22/executive-order-rename-denali-signed-by-president-trump/","say":{"en":"Is the mountain out today? What are the chances we'll see it?","zh":"今天能看到山吗？看到的机会大吗？"}},"威基基海滩":{"what":"夏威夷檀香山市中心的一条海滩，一边是高楼酒店，一边是钻石头火山。","what_en":"A beach in the middle of Honolulu, Hawaii — high-rise hotels on one side, Diamond Head volcano on the other.","fame":"这里是现代冲浪的家乡之一，浪小又长，最适合第一次学冲浪的人。夏威夷「冲浪之父」杜克·卡哈那莫库就在这片海里长大，海滩上有他张开双臂的铜像，常常挂满花环。","fame_en":"It's one of the homes of modern surfing, with small, long waves perfect for first-timers. Duke Kahanamoku, the 'father of surfing', grew up in these waters, and his bronze statue with open arms stands on the beach, often draped in leis.","fact":"威基基的沙子会被海浪慢慢冲走，所以要定期「搬回来」。2021 年州政府从离岸约 300 米的浅海沙地里抽了约 1.66 万立方米的沙子铺回海滩，海滩宽度在大部分地段差不多翻了一倍。这样的维护每隔五到十年就要做一次。","fact_en":"Waikiki's sand slowly washes away, so it has to be put back regularly. In 2021 the state pumped about 16,600 m³ of sand from a shallow sand field roughly 300 m offshore back onto the beach, roughly doubling its width along most of the stretch. This upkeep is needed every five to ten years.","src":"夏威夷州土地和自然资源部 DLNR，2021 年","url":"https://dlnr.hawaii.gov/blog/2021/05/20/nr21-098/","say":{"en":"I've never surfed before — do you do beginner lessons?","zh":"我从没冲过浪，你们有给初学者的课吗？"}},"芬迪湾潮汐":{"what":"加拿大东部新不伦瑞克和新斯科舍之间的一个海湾，有世界上落差最大的潮水。","what_en":"A bay in eastern Canada between New Brunswick and Nova Scotia, with the biggest tides in the world.","fame":"一天两次，涨潮和落潮的水位差最多能到 16 米，差不多五层楼。在霍普韦尔岩，落潮时可以走在海底，在一根根「花盆石」中间散步，几个小时后再来，同一个地方只能划皮划艇了。","fame_en":"Twice a day the gap between high and low tide can reach 16 m — about five storeys. At Hopewell Rocks you can walk on the sea floor among the 'flowerpot' rock towers at low tide, and a few hours later kayak over the same spot.","fact":"潮水也在慢慢「吃掉」这些石头。2016 年 3 月，最有名的一根「大象石」突然裂成两半，大约 100 到 200 吨石头掉了下来。这块石头还印在新不伦瑞克省的医疗卡上，所以几乎每个当地人都认识它。","fact_en":"The tides are slowly eating the rocks, too. In March 2016 the most famous of them, Elephant Rock, suddenly split almost in half, dropping roughly 100–200 tonnes of rock. It was pictured on New Brunswick's Medicare card, so nearly everyone in the province knew it.","src":"CBC 新闻，2016 年","url":"https://www.cbc.ca/lite/story/1.3491431","say":{"en":"What time is low tide today — when can we walk on the ocean floor?","zh":"今天几点落潮？什么时候能下去走海底？"}},"冰山巷":{"what":"加拿大纽芬兰岛东岸的一段海，每年春天到初夏，从格陵兰漂来的冰山一座座从这里经过。","what_en":"A stretch of sea off Newfoundland's east coast where, every spring and early summer, icebergs from Greenland drift past one after another.","fame":"这些冰山从格陵兰的冰川上断下来，要漂两三年才到这里。站在圣约翰斯附近的海边就能看到，有的比房子还大，最后在更暖的海里慢慢化掉。当地人开着船带游客去看，运气好还能同时看到鲸鱼。","fame_en":"The icebergs break off Greenland's glaciers and take two or three years to drift here. You can see them from the shore near St. John's — some bigger than houses — before they slowly melt in warmer water. Locals run boat tours, and with luck you'll see whales too.","fact":"纽芬兰人会去「收」冰山：拿到特别的执照后，开船过去把冰山敲成小块捞上来。圣约翰斯的 Quidi Vidi 啤酒厂就用这种几万年前的雪压成的冰水酿「冰山啤酒」，以前收冰的人甚至用步枪打下冰块。","fact_en":"Newfoundlanders 'harvest' icebergs: with a special licence, they boat out, break off chunks and haul them aboard. St. John's Quidi Vidi Brewery makes 'Iceberg Beer' with this meltwater from snow compacted tens of thousands of years ago — harvesters have even used rifles to shoot off pieces.","src":"NPR，2012 年","url":"https://www.npr.org/sections/thesalt/2012/02/29/147581630/newfoundland-gives-whole-new-meaning-to-ice-cold-beer","say":{"en":"Have there been any icebergs near the harbour this week?","zh":"这周港口附近有冰山吗？"}},"耶洛奈夫极光":{"what":"加拿大西北地区的首府耶洛奈夫，冬天的夜里常常能看到绿色的极光在天上飘。","what_en":"Yellowknife, capital of Canada's Northwest Territories, where on winter nights green auroras often ripple across the sky.","fame":"它正好在「极光带」下面，地势平、天气干、晴天多，被认为是世界上看极光最好的地方之一。游客住在湖边的小木屋或印第安帐篷里，零下三十度守到半夜。","fame_en":"It sits right under the 'aurora oval', with flat land, dry air and lots of clear nights — one of the best places on Earth to see the northern lights. Visitors stay in lakeside cabins or teepees and wait up past midnight at minus 30.","fact":"耶洛奈夫的极光旅游是日本游客带起来的：1989 年一家本地旅行社带来了第一个日本旅行团，之后几十年日本人一直是最大的客人。直到 2017–18 年度，中国游客（约 1.9 万）才第一次超过日本游客（约 1.35 万）。","fact_en":"Yellowknife's aurora tourism was built by Japanese visitors: in 1989 a local operator brought the first Japanese tour group, and for decades they were the biggest market. Only in 2017–18 did Chinese visitors (about 19,000) overtake the Japanese (about 13,500) for the first time.","src":"Radio Canada International，2019 年","url":"https://www.rcinet.ca/eye-on-the-arctic/2019/11/28/tourism-nwt-china-japan-travel-visitors-aurora-arctic","say":{"en":"What's the aurora forecast for tonight, and where can I warm up?","zh":"今晚的极光预报怎么样？哪儿能取暖？"}},"迈阿密海滩":{"what":"佛罗里达迈阿密对面一条长长的沙洲岛，一边是大西洋的白沙滩，一边是粉色、薄荷绿的老房子。","what_en":"A long barrier island across the bay from Miami, Florida: white Atlantic beach on one side, pink and mint-green old buildings on the other.","fame":"南滩有世界上最集中的「装饰艺术」（Art Deco）老建筑，晚上霓虹灯一亮像回到 1930 年代。冬天北方人和拉美人都来这里晒太阳，海洋大道上一路是咖啡、古巴音乐和跑车。","fame_en":"South Beach has the world's densest collection of Art Deco buildings — at night the neon makes it feel like the 1930s. In winter, northerners and Latin Americans pour in for the sun, and Ocean Drive is all cafés, Cuban music and sports cars.","fact":"海滩上那些彩色的救生员小塔楼，是 1992 年安德鲁飓风把旧救生站几乎全吹毁之后才有的。城市请建筑师威廉·莱恩设计新塔楼，1995 年第一批建成，借了装饰艺术和加勒比的颜色，后来他又设计了新一批，现在差不多成了迈阿密海滩的标志。","fact_en":"Those colourful lifeguard towers only exist because Hurricane Andrew wrecked most of the old lifeguard stations in 1992. The city hired architect William Lane to design new ones; the first went up around 1995, borrowing Art Deco shapes and Caribbean colours, and he later designed a new generation — they're now almost the symbol of Miami Beach.","src":"大迈阿密旅游局官网","url":"https://www.miamiandbeaches.com/things-to-do/art-and-culture/william-lanes-iconic-lifeguard-towers","say":{"en":"Can we rent two chairs and an umbrella for the day?","zh":"我们能租两把躺椅和一把伞用一天吗？"}},"纪念碑谷":{"what":"美国亚利桑那和犹他交界的一片红色沙漠，平地上立着一座座几百米高的红色孤山。","what_en":"A red desert on the Arizona–Utah border where sandstone buttes hundreds of metres tall rise straight out of the flat ground.","fame":"它不是国家公园，而是纳瓦霍原住民自己管理的部落公园，谷里的路要跟纳瓦霍导游才能进去。几十部西部片在这里拍，「阿甘正传」里阿甘跑步突然停下的那条公路，也是在这儿。","fame_en":"It isn't a national park but a tribal park run by the Navajo Nation, and much of the valley can only be visited with a Navajo guide. Dozens of westerns were filmed here, and so was the highway where Forrest Gump suddenly stops running.","fact":"好莱坞是被一包照片带来的：大萧条时，在谷里开贸易站的哈里·古尔丁快撑不下去了，带着纪念碑谷的照片开车去好莱坞，找到导演约翰·福特。福特当场决定在这里拍《关山飞渡》（1939），之后又回来拍了好几部西部片，当地纳瓦霍人也因此有了工作。","fact_en":"Hollywood came because of a packet of photos. During the Depression, Harry Goulding, who ran a trading post in the valley and was struggling to survive, drove to Hollywood with pictures of Monument Valley and got in to see director John Ford. Ford decided on the spot to shoot Stagecoach (1939) here, came back for many more westerns, and local Navajo people got paid work.","src":"Wikipedia: Goulding's Lodge","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goulding%27s_Lodge","say":{"en":"Can we book a Navajo-guided tour of the valley this afternoon?","zh":"能约今天下午纳瓦霍导游带的谷里游吗？"}},"优胜美地":{"what":"美国加州内华达山脉里的一座国家公园，冰川切出来的大峡谷两边是几百米高的花岗岩大石壁和瀑布。","what_en":"A national park in California's Sierra Nevada: a glacier-carved valley walled by sheer granite cliffs hundreds of metres high, with waterfalls pouring off them.","fame":"「酋长岩」和「半圆顶」是全世界攀岩者心里的圣地，电影《徒手攀岩》就是在酋长岩上拍的。春天融雪时，优胜美地瀑布从 700 多米高的地方落下来，整个山谷都是水声。","fame_en":"El Capitan and Half Dome are holy ground for climbers worldwide — the film Free Solo was shot on El Capitan. In spring, snowmelt sends Yosemite Falls plunging more than 700 m, and the whole valley roars.","fact":"从 1870 年代开始，断断续续一直到 1968 年，公园夏天几乎每晚都有「火瀑布」：山顶冰川点的人把一大堆烧红的木炭从悬崖上推下去，谷底的游客看着火像瀑布一样落下来。1968 年 1 月 25 日国家公园管理局认为这不是自然景观，停掉了最后一次。现在每年二月，夕阳照在马尾瀑布上，会出现天然的「火瀑布」。","fact_en":"From the 1870s until 1968, Yosemite had a 'Firefall' most summer nights: staff at Glacier Point pushed a huge pile of glowing embers off the cliff while crowds below watched fire pour down like a waterfall. On 25 January 1968 the Park Service ended it as an unnatural spectacle. Today, every February, sunset lights up Horsetail Fall to make a natural 'firefall'.","src":"Wikipedia: Yosemite Firefall","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yosemite_Firefall","say":{"en":"Do I need a permit to hike Half Dome?","zh":"爬半圆顶需要许可证吗？"}},"红杉林":{"what":"美国加州北部海边的海岸红杉森林，世界上最高的树都长在这里。","what_en":"The coast redwood forests of northern California — home to the tallest trees on Earth.","fame":"海岸红杉能长到 100 多米高、活两千年，海上的雾是它们的水源。走在林子里抬头看不到树顶，阳光从高处一条条照下来，很多人说比教堂还安静。电影《星球大战》里森林月亮恩多也是在这里拍的。","fame_en":"Coast redwoods grow over 100 m tall and live 2,000 years, drinking from the sea fog. Walking among them you can't see the tops, light falls in long beams, and many say it's quieter than a cathedral. Return of the Jedi's forest moon of Endor was filmed here.","fact":"世界最高的树「亥伯龙」（约 116 米）2006 年才被发现，位置一直不公开。可网上还是传出了坐标，太多人钻进林子把树根周围踩坏、还留下垃圾，所以 2022 年起红杉国家公园把那一片封了：私自进去最高罚 5000 美元、坐 6 个月牢。","fact_en":"Hyperion, the world's tallest known tree (about 116 m), was only found in 2006 and its location was never published. But coordinates leaked online, so many people bushwhacked in — trampling its base and leaving trash — that from 2022 Redwood National Park closed the area: going in can cost a $5,000 fine and six months in jail.","src":"NPR，2022 年","url":"https://www.npr.org/2022/08/01/1114846960/hyperion-tree-off-limits-fine","say":{"en":"Which trail is best for seeing the really big trees?","zh":"看真正的大树走哪条步道最好？"}},"夏威夷火山":{"what":"夏威夷大岛上的火山国家公园，基拉韦厄火山是世界上最活跃的火山之一。","what_en":"The volcanoes national park on Hawaii's Big Island, where Kīlauea is one of the most active volcanoes on Earth.","fame":"这里的岩浆比较稀，很少大爆炸，常常是喷泉一样喷出来或者像河一样流，所以人可以比较安全地近看。夏威夷人相信火山女神佩蕾住在基拉韦厄的火山口里，到今天还有人带花和供品来。","fame_en":"Its lava is runny, so instead of big explosions it usually fountains or flows like a river — which means people can watch fairly safely up close. Hawaiians believe the volcano goddess Pele lives in Kīlauea's crater, and people still bring flowers and offerings.","fact":"2024 年 12 月 23 日开始，基拉韦厄进入一种「一集一集」的喷发：每隔一两个星期，火山口就喷一次几小时的岩浆喷泉，然后停下来。2025 年 10 月 17 日第 35 集的喷泉高到将近 460 米，是这次喷发以来最高的，比很多摩天大楼还高。","fact_en":"Since 23 December 2024 Kīlauea has been erupting in 'episodes': every week or two the crater shoots lava fountains for a few hours, then stops. On 17 October 2025, episode 35's fountains reached nearly 460 m — the highest of this eruption, taller than many skyscrapers.","src":"Hawaii News Now，2025 年","url":"https://www.hawaiinewsnow.com/2025/10/18/lava-fountains-kilaueas-episode-35-reach-over-1300-feet","say":{"en":"Is the eruption active right now? Where's the best place to see the glow?","zh":"现在还在喷发吗？在哪儿看火光最好？"}},"温哥华斯坦利公园":{"what":"加拿大温哥华市中心旁边伸进海里的一大片森林公园，比纽约中央公园还大。","what_en":"A huge forested park jutting into the sea right next to downtown Vancouver — bigger than New York's Central Park.","fame":"沿着海边有一条大约 9 公里的海堤步道，一边是海和雪山，一边是几百岁的大树，本地人在上面跑步、骑车、遛狗。公园里还有原住民的图腾柱，是卑诗省最多人看的景点之一。","fame_en":"A seawall path of about 9 km wraps the shore — sea and snowy mountains on one side, centuries-old trees on the other — and locals run, cycle and walk their dogs on it. The park's First Nations totem poles are among BC's most-visited sights.","fact":"这条海堤修了 63 年：1917 年开工，一段一段往前修，直到 1980 年 9 月才把整圈连起来。苏格兰来的石匠吉米·坎宁安负责它二十多年，1955 年退休以后还常常跑回工地看。","fact_en":"The seawall took 63 years: work began in 1917, inched forward section by section, and the full loop wasn't joined up until September 1980. Scottish stonemason Jimmy Cunningham oversaw it for more than two decades and kept dropping by the worksite after he retired in 1955.","src":"Wikipedia: Seawall (Vancouver)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seawall_(Vancouver)","say":{"en":"Where can I rent a bike to ride around the seawall?","zh":"在哪儿能租辆自行车绕海堤骑一圈？"}},"坎昆":{"what":"墨西哥尤卡坦半岛东北角的海滨城市，一条细长的沙洲上排满了度假酒店，面前是加勒比海。","what_en":"A beach city on the northeast tip of Mexico's Yucatán Peninsula, with a long thin sandbar lined with resort hotels facing the Caribbean.","fame":"这里的海水是好几种蓝色叠在一起，沙子白得发亮。它是墨西哥接待外国游客最多的地方之一，美国大学生春假、蜜月、全包度假都来这里，从这儿还能去玛雅古城奇琴伊察和天然井。","fame_en":"The sea comes in layers of blue over glowing white sand. It's one of Mexico's top destinations for foreign tourists — spring break, honeymoons, all-inclusives — and a base for Maya ruins like Chichén Itzá and cenotes.","fact":"坎昆是「电脑挑出来的」：1960 年代末，墨西哥政府想造一个新的旅游城，把天气、雨量、飓风记录、游客数量等数据输进电脑，电脑挑出几个候选地。官员一个个去看，选中了这片几乎没人住的沙洲。1970 年 1 月开工，1974 年第一家酒店开业。","fact_en":"Cancún was picked by a computer: in the late 1960s Mexico's government wanted to build a new resort town, fed weather, rainfall, hurricane records and tourist numbers into a computer, and got a shortlist. Officials inspected each site and chose this almost empty sandbar. Construction began in January 1970 and the first hotel opened in 1974.","src":"NASA 地球观测站","url":"https://earthobservatory.nasa.gov/images/146194/how-cancun-grew-into-a-major-resort","say":{"en":"How do I get the bus to the hotel zone from downtown?","zh":"从市中心坐哪路公交去酒店区？"}},"彩虹山":{"what":"秘鲁库斯科附近安第斯山里的一座山，山坡上一条条红、黄、绿、紫的颜色，像打翻了颜料。","what_en":"A mountain in the Andes near Cusco, Peru, striped with bands of red, yellow, green and purple, like spilled paint.","fame":"这些颜色来自不同的矿物沉积，比如铁让它变红、硫让它变黄。观景点海拔大约 5000 米，比欧洲最高峰还高，很多人凌晨三点从库斯科出发，走得上气不接下气，也有人骑马上去。","fame_en":"The colours come from different mineral layers — iron for red, sulphur-rich layers for yellow. The viewpoint is about 5,000 m up, higher than any peak in Europe, so people leave Cusco at 3am and gasp their way up; some ride horses.","fact":"十几年前几乎没有外人知道它：山一直被冰雪盖着，大约 2013 年冰雪化掉，颜色才露出来。照片在网上传开以后，来的人从几乎没有变成旺季每天几千人，当地村子靠收门票、牵马过上了新日子，也有人担心步道和草场被踩坏。","fact_en":"A decade or so ago almost no outsiders knew it: the mountain was covered in snow and ice until it melted around 2013, revealing the colours. Once photos spread online, visitors went from almost none to thousands a day in peak season; local villages now earn from tickets and horse rides, while some worry about the trails and pastures being trampled.","src":"Wikipedia: Vinicunca","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinicunca","say":{"en":"How much is a horse to the top, and can I pay in soles?","zh":"骑马到山顶多少钱？能付索尔吗？"}},"的的喀喀湖":{"what":"秘鲁和玻利维亚交界处的一个高原大湖，海拔约 3800 米，是世界上能通航的最高的大湖。","what_en":"A huge high-altitude lake on the Peru–Bolivia border, about 3,800 m up — the highest navigable large lake in the world.","fame":"在秘鲁普诺这边，乌鲁人住在用托托拉芦苇一层层铺出来的「浮岛」上，房子、船、地面全是芦苇做的，每过几个星期就要往上加新的一层。游客坐船上岛，看他们怎么做芦苇船。","fame_en":"On the Peruvian side near Puno, the Uros people live on 'floating islands' built from layer after layer of totora reeds — houses, boats and ground all made of reed, with fresh layers added every few weeks. Visitors boat out to see how reed boats are made.","fact":"2022–2023 年安第斯大旱，湖水降到几十年来最低。乌鲁人用来造岛的托托拉芦苇九成以上枯死，要去割新鲜的芦苇，得开船到湖的另一头，单程差不多三个小时。","fact_en":"In the 2022–2023 Andean drought the lake fell to its lowest in decades. More than 90% of the totora reeds the Uros build their islands with dried out, and to cut fresh ones they had to boat to the far end of the lake — nearly three hours each way.","src":"The Revelator，2024 年","url":"https://therevelator.org/titicaca-crisis-drought/","say":{"en":"How much is the boat to the Uros islands, and when does it leave?","zh":"去乌鲁斯浮岛的船多少钱？几点开？"}},"百内国家公园":{"what":"智利南端巴塔哥尼亚的一座国家公园，三根花岗岩尖塔直直插进天空，下面是冰川和蓝绿色的湖。","what_en":"A national park in Chilean Patagonia, where three granite towers spear into the sky above glaciers and turquoise lakes.","fame":"它的名字「百内之塔」就是那三根尖塔。徒步者从世界各地来走四五天的「W 线」，一路是冰川、原驼和大风，风大到能把人吹倒。最后天亮前爬上去，看第一缕阳光把塔照成红色。","fame_en":"Its name comes from those three towers. Hikers from around the world come to walk the four-to-five-day 'W Trek' past glaciers, guanacos and winds strong enough to knock you over — then climb in the dark to watch sunrise turn the towers red.","fact":"2011 年 12 月，一个 23 岁的外国游客在公园里烧用过的卫生纸，没有完全弄灭，引发大火，烧掉了一万一千多公顷。从那以后，公园对用火管得非常严，在这里点火可能被罚款、赶出公园。","fact_en":"In December 2011 a 23-year-old foreign tourist burned used toilet paper and didn't fully put it out — the resulting fire scorched more than 11,000 hectares. Since then the park has been extremely strict about fire, and lighting one can get you fined and thrown out.","src":"Al Jazeera，2012 年","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2012/1/1/chile-arrests-israeli-tourist-for-forest-fire","say":{"en":"Do I need to book the campsites on the W Trek in advance?","zh":"走 W 线要提前订营地吗？"}},"科帕卡巴纳海滩":{"what":"巴西里约热内卢一条 4 公里长的弯弯海滩，人行道铺着黑白相间的波浪花纹。","what_en":"A 4 km curve of beach in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil, with its famous black-and-white wave-patterned promenade.","fame":"这是里约人的客厅：早上跑步、下午踢沙滩足球和打脚排球、晚上在海边小亭子喝椰子水和啤酒。每年跨年夜，两百多万人穿着白衣服在这里看烟花，给海神扔花。","fame_en":"It's Rio's living room: jogging in the morning, beach football and footvolley in the afternoon, coconut water and beer at beach kiosks at night. Every New Year's Eve over two million people in white gather to watch fireworks and toss flowers to the sea goddess.","fact":"2024 年 5 月 4 日麦当娜在这片沙滩上开了一场免费演唱会，来了约 160 万人；一年后的 2025 年 5 月 3 日，Lady Gaga 的免费演唱会来了约 210 万人，被吉尼斯认证为「女歌手免费演唱会观众最多」。","fact_en":"On 4 May 2024 Madonna played a free concert on this beach to about 1.6 million people; a year later, on 3 May 2025, Lady Gaga's free show drew about 2.1 million, which Guinness certified as the largest attendance at a free concert by a female artist.","src":"吉尼斯世界纪录","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/770378-largest-attendance-of-a-free-concert-by-a-female-artist","say":{"en":"Two coconuts, please — and how much for a chair and umbrella?","zh":"两个椰子，谢谢——躺椅和伞多少钱？"}},"阿空加瓜山":{"what":"阿根廷门多萨省安第斯山里的一座大山，海拔 6961 米，是亚洲以外最高的山。","what_en":"A giant of the Andes in Argentina's Mendoza province, 6,961 m high — the highest mountain outside Asia.","fame":"它是「七大洲最高峰」之一，正常路线不需要攀冰技术，所以每年有几千人从世界各地来爬，但高海拔和大风让很多人半路回头。山脚下就是门多萨的葡萄酒产区，很多人登山前后去喝马尔贝克。","fame_en":"It's one of the Seven Summits, and its normal route needs no technical climbing, so thousands come every year — though altitude and wind turn many back. Mendoza's wine country is right below, and plenty of climbers celebrate with a Malbec before or after.","fact":"第一个登上山顶的人是独自上去的：1897 年 1 月 14 日，英国人菲茨杰拉德组织的登山队试了六个星期，他本人一到六千米就高原反应呕吐，最后是瑞士向导马蒂亚斯·祖布里根一个人登顶。他当年探出来的路线，今天还是大家走的标准路线。","fact_en":"The first person on top got there alone: on 14 January 1897, after six weeks of attempts by Edward FitzGerald's expedition — FitzGerald himself kept getting sick around 6,000 m — Swiss guide Matthias Zurbriggen reached the summit by himself. The route he scouted is still the standard route today.","src":"Wikipedia: Edward FitzGerald (mountaineer)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edward_FitzGerald_(mountaineer)","say":{"en":"Where do I get the climbing permit, and how many days should I plan to acclimatise?","zh":"登山许可证在哪儿办？要留几天适应高原？"}},"月亮谷":{"what":"智利阿塔卡马沙漠里，圣佩德罗镇旁边一片被风和水雕出来的盐和沙的山谷，看上去像月球表面。","what_en":"A valley of salt and sand carved by wind and water in Chile's Atacama Desert, next to the town of San Pedro — it really looks like the surface of the Moon.","fame":"阿塔卡马是地球上最干的沙漠之一，这里的石头、沙丘和白色盐壳在日落时从粉色变紫再变黑。游客骑自行车或坐小巴进去，爬上大沙丘等日落，晚上还有人专门来看星空。","fame_en":"The Atacama is one of the driest deserts on Earth, and at sunset these rocks, dunes and white salt crusts turn pink, then purple, then black. Visitors cycle or take minibuses in, climb the big dune for sunset, and some return at night for the stars.","fact":"月亮谷的门口是当地原住民社区和智利国家林业局一起管的，门票由他们卖，钱用来保护这片地方；阿塔卡马原住民出示身份证明可以免费进。为了不把这里踩坏，每个区都限人数，观景台上最多只能停 10 分钟。","fact_en":"Entry to the Valley of the Moon is run by local Indigenous communities together with Chile's forestry agency CONAF — they sell the tickets and the money goes into protecting it, and Atacameño people get in free with their certificate. To stop it being trampled, each sector has a visitor cap, and you can stay at a viewpoint for at most 10 minutes.","src":"月亮谷官方售票页 Puntoticket","url":"https://www.puntoticket.com/valle-de-la-luna","say":{"en":"Do I need to buy a ticket online, or can I pay at the entrance?","zh":"门票要在网上买，还是能在门口买？"}},"塔蒂奥间歇泉":{"what":"智利阿塔卡马高原上海拔约 4300 米的一片间歇泉，几十个泉眼在清晨一起冒白烟。","what_en":"A geyser field about 4,300 m up on Chile's Atacama plateau, where dozens of vents send up white steam together at dawn.","fame":"它是南半球最大的间歇泉区、世界第三大。要看就得凌晨四点从圣佩德罗出发，在零下十度里等太阳出来——冷空气让蒸汽柱最高最白。看完泡一下旁边的温泉池，喝一杯热咖啡。","fame_en":"It's the largest geyser field in the Southern Hemisphere and third largest in the world. You leave San Pedro at 4am and wait in minus 10°C for sunrise, when cold air makes the steam columns tallest and whitest — then warm up in the nearby hot pool with a coffee.","fact":"2009 年有公司在附近钻井想发地热电，一口井突然井喷，冒出几十米高的蒸汽柱，差不多一个月才控制住。这件事在智利闹得很大，当地阿塔卡马原住民社区组织起来反对，项目最后被停掉了。","fact_en":"In 2009 a company drilling nearby for geothermal power had a well blow out, sending up a steam column dozens of metres high that took nearly a month to control. It became a national controversy; local Atacameño communities organised against it, and the project was shut down.","src":"Wikipedia: El Tatio","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_Tatio","say":{"en":"What time does the bus pick us up, and how cold does it get up there?","zh":"车几点来接我们？上面会有多冷？"}},"彩虹河":{"what":"哥伦比亚梅塔省马卡雷纳山里的一条小河，每年有几个月河底变成红、黄、绿、蓝、黑五种颜色。","what_en":"A small river in Colombia's Serranía de la Macarena, Meta, whose bed turns red, yellow, green, blue and black for a few months each year.","fame":"红色来自长在河底石头上的一种水生植物（Macarenia clavigera），只有在雨季和旱季之间、水位刚好、阳光够的时候才会变得通红，大约六月到十一月最好看。去这里要先飞到小镇拉马卡雷纳，再跟当地导游走。","fame_en":"The red comes from a water plant, Macarenia clavigera, growing on the riverbed rocks; it only turns blazing red between the wet and dry seasons, when the water level and sunlight are just right — roughly June to November. You fly into the small town of La Macarena and go with a local guide.","fact":"十几年前这里还在哥伦比亚革命武装力量（FARC）游击队的地盘里，外人几乎去不了。和平以后才慢慢开放，现在去也必须跟当地导游走。为了保护河底那种植物，在公园里不许涂防晒霜和驱蚊水，所以游客顶着大太阳穿长袖长裤。","fact_en":"Until around a decade ago the river lay deep in FARC guerrilla territory and outsiders could barely get there. It opened up gradually, and even now you must go with a local guide. To protect the riverbed plant, sunscreen and insect repellent are banned in the park — so visitors wear long sleeves and trousers under the blazing sun.","src":"Lonely Planet","url":"https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/cano-cristales-colombia","say":{"en":"Is it a good month to see the red colour, and can we swim anywhere?","zh":"这个月河水是红的吗？有能游泳的地方吗？"}},"钦博拉索山":{"what":"厄瓜多尔中部一座戴着冰川的死火山，海拔 6263 米，是厄瓜多尔最高的山。","what_en":"An ice-capped dormant volcano in central Ecuador, 6,263 m high — the country's tallest mountain.","fame":"因为地球在赤道附近是鼓出来的，钦博拉索山顶是地球表面离地心最远的一点，比珠峰峰顶还远两公里左右。山坡上有野生的骆马（小羊驼），从城市里坐车就能到 4800 米的避难所。","fame_en":"Because the Earth bulges at the equator, Chimborazo's summit is the point on the planet's surface farthest from its centre — about 2 km farther than Everest's top. Wild vicuñas graze its slopes, and you can drive from town to a refuge at 4,800 m.","fact":"山上曾有一群「卖冰的人」：几百年来，当地人上冰川凿冰，用驴驮下山去市场卖。冰箱普及以后，最后只剩下巴尔塔萨·乌什卡一个人，他从 15 岁干到老，2012 年还被纪录片《最后的卖冰人》带去纽约首映。2024 年 10 月，他在放牛时被公牛撞倒，去世了。","fact_en":"The mountain once had its 'ice merchants': for centuries locals climbed to the glacier, cut ice blocks and carried them down by donkey to sell at market. Once fridges arrived, only Baltazar Ushca was left; he did it from age 15 into old age, and in 2012 the documentary The Last Ice Merchant flew him to New York for its premiere. In October 2024 he died after being knocked down by a bull while herding cattle.","src":"Boston Globe，2024 年","url":"https://www.bostonglobe.com/2024/10/31/metro/baltazar-ushca-last-iceman-ecuadors-highest-peak-dies-80","say":{"en":"How far can we drive up, and is it safe to walk to the second refuge?","zh":"车能开到多高？走到第二个避难所安全吗？"}},"科托帕希火山":{"what":"厄瓜多尔首都基多南边的一座圆锥形活火山，海拔 5897 米，山顶盖着冰川。","what_en":"A perfectly cone-shaped active volcano south of Quito, Ecuador, 5,897 m high and capped with glaciers.","fame":"它是世界上最高的活火山之一，天晴时从基多就能看到那顶白帽子。国家公园里可以骑山地车下坡、看野马，体力好的人半夜出发登顶。","fame_en":"It's one of the world's highest active volcanoes, and on clear days you can see its white cap from Quito. In the national park you can mountain-bike down, watch wild horses, and strong climbers set off at midnight for the summit.","fact":"它最可怕的不是岩浆，是融雪泥流：1877 年 6 月 26 日的喷发把整个冰盖化掉，泥流冲出一百多公里，把拉塔昆加城又一次夷平。安静了很多年后，2015 年 8 月 14 日它又开始喷气喷灰，附近村子提前疏散。","fact_en":"Its biggest danger isn't lava but mudflows from melting ice: the eruption of 26 June 1877 melted the entire ice cap, sending lahars more than 100 km and flattening the city of Latacunga yet again. After a long quiet spell it woke on 14 August 2015 with steam-and-ash explosions, and nearby villages were evacuated as a precaution.","src":"Wikipedia: Cotopaxi","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cotopaxi","say":{"en":"Is the summit open for climbing at the moment?","zh":"现在山顶开放攀登吗？"}},"太阳岛":{"what":"的的喀喀湖玻利维亚那边的一座小岛，岛上没有汽车，只有石头小路、梯田、驴和印加时代的遗址。","what_en":"A small island on the Bolivian side of Lake Titicaca with no cars — just stone paths, terraced fields, donkeys and Inca-era ruins.","fame":"印加神话里，太阳神就是从这座岛上升起来的，第一代印加王也出生在这里，所以它是安第斯人心里的圣地。游客从科帕卡巴纳镇坐船过去，爬印加台阶，在海拔近四千米的湖上看日落。","fame_en":"In Inca myth the sun god rose from this island and the first Inca king was born here, so it's sacred ground in the Andes. Visitors boat over from the town of Copacabana, climb the Inca stairs and watch the sunset over a lake nearly 4,000 m up.","fact":"这座「圣岛」曾经因为两个村子吵架，北半边很长一段时间不让游客进。2017 年北边的两个社区为了谁来经营奇卡纳遗址附近的旅游小屋闹翻，小屋被拆，船被扣，十来个村民受伤，镇长宣布北边是冲突区，游客只能去南边。","fact_en":"This 'sacred island' once had its northern half closed to tourists for a long time because two villages fell out. In 2017 two northern communities clashed over who ran tourist cabins near the Chinkana ruins: cabins were torn down, boats seized and around ten villagers hurt, and the mayor declared the north a conflict zone — visitors could only go to the south.","src":"EJU.tv，2017 年","url":"https://eju.tv/2017/07/dos-comunidades-en-pugna-por-turismo-toman-la-isla-del-sol/","say":{"en":"Can we walk from the south of the island to the north today?","zh":"今天能从岛的南边走到北边吗？"}},"恐龙脚印墙":{"what":"玻利维亚苏克雷城外一家水泥厂的采石场里，一面几乎垂直的石灰岩大墙，上面印满了恐龙脚印。","what_en":"A nearly vertical limestone wall in a cement company's quarry outside Sucre, Bolivia, covered in dinosaur footprints.","fame":"大约 6800 万年前这里是湖边的泥滩，恐龙一群群走过，留下脚印；后来地壳运动把这片地面整个立了起来，变成一面墙。现在旁边建了恐龙公园，游客可以戴上安全帽走到墙下面看。","fame_en":"About 68 million years ago this was a muddy lakeshore where herds of dinosaurs walked; later the Earth's crust tilted the whole surface upright into a wall. There's now a dinosaur park beside it, and visitors can put on hard hats and walk to the foot of the wall.","fact":"1998 到 2015 年，科学家把整面墙细细测绘了一遍，一共数出 12,092 个恐龙脚印、465 条行走路线，属于 9 种不同的恐龙，其中四分之一以上的路线是长脖子的蜥脚类恐龙留下的。主墙面积大约 6.5 万平方米。","fact_en":"Between 1998 and 2015 scientists mapped the whole wall in detail and counted 12,092 dinosaur footprints in 465 trackways from nine different kinds of dinosaur — over a quarter of the trackways left by long-necked sauropods. The main wall covers about 65,000 m².","src":"Wikipedia: Cal Orck'o","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cal_Orcko","say":{"en":"What time is the guided walk down to the wall?","zh":"走到墙下面的导览几点开始？"}},"罗赖马山":{"what":"委内瑞拉、巴西、圭亚那三国交界处的一座「桌山」，四面是几百米高的悬崖，山顶却是平的。","what_en":"A 'table mountain' where Venezuela, Brazil and Guyana meet — sheer cliffs hundreds of metres high on every side, and a flat top.","fame":"山顶常年泡在云和雨里，黑色的石头被冲成奇形怪状，水坑里长着别处没有的植物和小青蛙，像一座「天上的岛」。徒步上去要五六天，三国的界碑就立在山顶。","fame_en":"The summit sits in cloud and rain most of the year; black rocks are worn into strange shapes, and pools hold plants and tiny frogs found nowhere else — an 'island in the sky'. The trek takes five or six days, and the three countries' border marker stands on top.","fact":"1884 年 12 月，英国人埃弗拉德·伊姆·图恩带队第一次登上山顶。这类探险的报告被认为启发了柯南·道尔 1912 年的小说《失落的世界》——书里一群探险家在南美一座与世隔绝的高原上遇到了恐龙。","fact_en":"In December 1884 Englishman Everard im Thurn led the first ascent. Reports from expeditions like his are thought to have inspired Arthur Conan Doyle's 1912 novel The Lost World, in which explorers find dinosaurs on an isolated South American plateau.","src":"英国皇家植物园 Kew","url":"https://www.kew.org/read-and-watch/everard-im-thurn-lost-world","say":{"en":"How many days is the trek, and do we need a local guide and porters?","zh":"徒步要几天？需要请当地向导和背夫吗？"}},"马拉开波湖闪电":{"what":"委内瑞拉马拉开波湖西南角、卡塔通博河口上空，几乎每天夜里都会出现的一场不打雷声的闪电风暴。","what_en":"A lightning storm over the mouth of the Catatumbo River at the southwest corner of Venezuela's Lake Maracaibo that flares up almost every night.","fame":"这里是地球上闪电最密集的地方：一年里多达 300 个夜晚有闪电，一次能连续闪九个小时，每平方公里一年大约 250 次。以前的水手在海上就靠它认路，叫它「马拉开波灯塔」。游客住在湖上的高脚屋村，晚上坐船出去看。","fame_en":"It's the most lightning-dense place on Earth: storms on up to 300 nights a year, lasting up to nine hours, with about 250 flashes per km² annually. Sailors once navigated by it, calling it the 'Lighthouse of Maracaibo'. Visitors stay in stilt-house villages on the lake and boat out at night.","fact":"这盏「灯塔」也有灭的时候：2010 年 1 月到 4 月，闪电几乎完全停了，当地人吓坏了。科学家认为是那一年强厄尔尼诺带来的大旱，让湖面上的水汽不够了，雨水回来以后闪电也回来了。","fact_en":"This 'lighthouse' can go dark: from January to April 2010 the lightning almost completely stopped, alarming locals. Scientists think the strong El Niño drought that year left too little moisture over the lake; when the rains came back, so did the lightning.","src":"吉尼斯世界纪录","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/highest-concentration-of-lightning","say":{"en":"What time does the boat leave to see the lightning tonight?","zh":"今晚去看闪电的船几点出发？"}},"洛斯罗克斯群岛":{"what":"委内瑞拉北边加勒比海上的一片珊瑚岛群，几十个小岛围着一个浅浅的大潟湖。","what_en":"A coral archipelago in the Caribbean north of Venezuela — dozens of tiny islands ringing a vast shallow lagoon.","fame":"水浅得发白、透得能看见鱼，沙滩几乎没人，是加勒比最大的海洋公园之一，潜水、风筝冲浪、钓北梭鱼的人都爱来。只能坐小飞机从加拉加斯飞过去，住在主岛格兰罗克的彩色民宿里。","fame_en":"The water is so shallow it glows white, so clear you can watch the fish, and the beaches are nearly empty — one of the Caribbean's largest marine parks, loved by divers, kitesurfers and bonefish anglers. You can only fly in by small plane from Caracas and stay in colourful guesthouses on the main island, Gran Roque.","fact":"1836 年荷兰人的书里还把这些小岛写成「无人居住」。后来从玛格丽塔岛来的渔民一家家搬过来，1910 年左右主岛格兰罗克才慢慢有了村子，1941 年全岛也只有 484 人。1972 年委内瑞拉把整片群岛划成国家公园，鸟、海龟和珊瑚才保住了今天的样子。","fact_en":"An 1836 Dutch book still described these islets as 'uninhabited'. Fishing families from Margarita Island moved over one by one, and around 1910 a village took shape on Gran Roque — still only 484 people in 1941. In 1972 Venezuela made the whole archipelago a national park, which is why its birds, turtles and corals look as they do today.","src":"Wikipedia: Los Roques Archipelago","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Los_Roques_Archipelago","say":{"en":"Can you take us to one of the quiet cays for the day and pick us up later?","zh":"能送我们去一个安静的小岛玩一天，晚点再来接吗？"}},"萨摩亚海沟泳池":{"what":"萨摩亚乌波卢岛南岸熔岩地里的一个天然大深洞，洞底是一池碧绿的海水。","what_en":"A huge natural pit in a lava field on the south coast of Upolu, Samoa, with a pool of turquoise seawater at the bottom.","fame":"它的名字「To Sua」意思就是「大游泳洞」。四周是热带花园，要从一架长长的木梯爬下去，到小平台上再跳进水里，常被选进「世界最美泳池」的名单。","fame_en":"Its name, To Sua, literally means 'large swimming hole'. It's ringed by tropical gardens; you climb down a long wooden ladder to a little platform and jump in — it regularly appears on lists of the world's most beautiful swimming spots.","fact":"这个池子其实连着大海：水是通过水下的岩洞和一串隧道从海里流进来的，外面浪大的时候，池里也能感到一涨一落的力道。所以池子中间横着一根绳子，游泳的人可以抓住，免得被暗流拉向洞口。","fact_en":"The pool is actually connected to the ocean: seawater flows in through an underwater cave and a series of tunnels, and when the surf outside is big you can feel the surge inside. That's why a rope is strung across the middle — swimmers hold on so the current doesn't pull them toward the cave.","src":"Samoa Observer","url":"https://www.samoaobserver.ws/category/samoa/22604","say":{"en":"How much is entry, and is it a good time to swim with today's tide?","zh":"门票多少？今天这个潮水适合下去游吗？"}},"《装扮好了》":{"what":"奥地利 2025 年底上映的圣诞家庭喜剧，原名 Aufputzt is'，讲一家人过圣诞乱成一团；是奥地利卡巴莱演员 Gery Seidl 的第一部电影。","what_en":"An Austrian Christmas family comedy from late 2025 (original title Aufputzt is') about one family's chaotic Christmas — the first film by Austrian cabaret comedian Gery Seidl.","fame":"2025 年 11 月 20 日上映，是奥地利当年最卖座的本国电影，12 月就拿了「金票」奖——在奥地利要 30 万人次以上才发。","fame_en":"It opened on 20 November 2025 and became Austria's most successful home-grown film of the year, winning a Golden Ticket in December — awarded only for 300,000+ admissions in Austria.","fact":"到 2026 年 1 月中旬，约 45 万奥地利人看过，成了奥地利影史第二成功的本国片；可在德国几乎没人知道，所以德国要拍一部自己的翻拍版。","fact_en":"By mid-January 2026 about 450,000 Austrians had seen it, making it the second most successful local film in Austrian cinema history — yet in Germany it went almost unnoticed, so a German remake is planned.","src":"FILMSTARTS，2026","url":"https://www.filmstarts.de/nachrichten/1000198788.html","say":{"en":"Have you seen Aufputzt is'? My whole family went on Boxing Day.","zh":"你看《装扮好了》了吗？我们全家节礼日一起去看的。"}},"《曼尼图的独木舟》":{"what":"德国喜剧导演 Michael「Bully」Herbig 2025 年的西部恶搞喜剧，原名 Das Kanu des Manitu，是 2001 年《曼尼图的鞋》的续集。","what_en":"German comedy director Michael 'Bully' Herbig's 2025 Western spoof Das Kanu des Manitu — the sequel to his 2001 hit Der Schuh des Manitu.","fame":"奥地利和德国说同一种语言，德国喜剧在奥地利也很卖座；这部片在奥地利 2025 年票房排第一，比所有好莱坞大片都多。","fame_en":"Austria shares a language with Germany, so German comedies travel well there — this one topped Austria's 2025 box office, ahead of every Hollywood blockbuster.","fact":"德国、奥地利、瑞士加起来，看过的人超过 600 万。","fact_en":"Counting Germany, Austria and Switzerland together, more than 6 million people saw it in cinemas.","src":"Moviejones / Constantin Film，2025 年 11 月","url":"https://www.moviejones.de/news/news-meilenstein-erreicht-das-kanu-des-manituldquo-knackt-die-5-mio-besucher-grenze_50077.html","say":{"en":"Two tickets for Das Kanu des Manitu, please — the 8 o'clock one.","zh":"两张《曼尼图的独木舟》，八点那场，谢谢。"}},"《伊甸之东》":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年的七集美剧，改编自约翰·斯坦贝克 1952 年的小说，讲加州一家两代兄弟的恩怨；Florence Pugh 演让人害怕的 Cathy。","what_en":"A seven-episode 2026 Netflix series based on John Steinbeck's 1952 novel about two generations of brothers in California, with Florence Pugh as the frightening Cathy.","fame":"2026 年 10 月 1 日全球同时上线，10 月中旬在奥地利 Netflix 剧集周榜排第 2。","fame_en":"It launched worldwide on 1 October 2026, and by mid-October it was No. 2 on Netflix's weekly series chart in Austria.","fact":"编剧 Zoe Kazan 的祖父 Elia Kazan，1955 年就把这部小说拍成过电影——隔了七十年，孙女又改了一次。","fact_en":"Writer Zoe Kazan's grandfather, Elia Kazan, filmed the same novel in 1955 — seven decades later, his granddaughter adapted it again.","src":"Anchorage Daily News / 华盛顿邮报，2026 年 10 月","url":"https://www.adn.com/arts/film-tv/2026/10/01/east-of-eden-is-a-tale-of-familial-legacy-to-tell-it-zoe-kazan-confronted-her-own/","say":{"en":"Are you watching East of Eden? Don't tell me what Cathy does next!","zh":"你在看《伊甸之东》吗？别告诉我 Cathy 后面干了什么！"}},"JJ":{"what":"奥地利歌手 JJ（本名 Johannes Pietsch），唱假声男高音（countertenor），生在维也纳，在迪拜长大。","what_en":"Austrian singer JJ (Johannes Pietsch), a countertenor born in Vienna and raised in Dubai.","fame":"2025 年他用《Wasted Love》替奥地利拿下欧洲歌唱大赛冠军，436 分；这是奥地利第三次夺冠，上一次是 2014 年的 Conchita Wurst。","fame_en":"In 2025 his song Wasted Love won Eurovision for Austria with 436 points — Austria's third win, and its first since Conchita Wurst in 2014.","fact":"他不只是流行歌手：比赛之前就在维也纳国家歌剧院演歌剧，演过莫扎特的《魔笛》。","fact_en":"He's not just a pop singer: before Eurovision he was already performing opera at the Vienna State Opera, including Mozart's The Magic Flute.","src":"Classic FM，2025 年 5 月","url":"https://www.classicfm.com/music-news/eurovision-winner-countertenor-vienna-opera/","say":{"en":"Did you hear JJ hit that high note? I got chills.","zh":"你听到 JJ 飙的那个高音了吗？我起鸡皮疙瘩了。"}},"《星际宝贝史迪奇》·比利时":{"what":"迪士尼 2025 年的真人版《星际宝贝》，翻拍 2002 年的动画：夏威夷小女孩 Lilo 收养了一只其实是外星实验品 626 号的「狗」Stitch。","what_en":"Disney's 2025 live-action Lilo & Stitch, a remake of the 2002 cartoon: a little Hawaiian girl adopts a 'dog' called Stitch who is really alien Experiment 626.","fame":"在比利时是 2025 年票房第一的电影，5 月一上映就是比利时当月票房冠军，小孩和当年看动画长大的大人一起去看。","fame_en":"It was Belgium's No. 1 film of 2025 — top of the Belgian box office the month it opened in May, with kids going alongside adults who grew up on the cartoon.","fact":"2002 年原版动画的编剧兼导演 Chris Sanders，在真人版里接着给 Stitch 配音。","fact_en":"Chris Sanders, who co-wrote and co-directed the 2002 cartoon, came back to voice Stitch again in the live-action film.","src":"Wikipedia：Lilo & Stitch (2025 film)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lilo_%26_Stitch_(2025_film)","say":{"en":"One adult and two children for Lilo & Stitch — is it dubbed in French?","zh":"《星际宝贝》一张大人两张小孩——是法语配音的吗？"}},"《伊甸之东》·比利时":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年的七集美剧，改编自斯坦贝克的小说《伊甸之东》，Florence Pugh、Christopher Abbott 主演。","what_en":"Netflix's seven-episode 2026 adaptation of Steinbeck's novel East of Eden, starring Florence Pugh and Christopher Abbott.","fame":"10 月中旬在比利时 Netflix 剧集周榜排第 2；很多人看完剧又去找原著和老电影。","fame_en":"In mid-October it was No. 2 on Netflix's weekly series chart in Belgium, and plenty of viewers went looking for the novel and the old film afterwards.","fact":"1955 年的电影版是 James Dean 第一个真正的大角色，还拿了金球奖最佳剧情片。","fact_en":"The 1955 film version was James Dean's first significant role, and it won the Golden Globe for Best Motion Picture – Drama.","src":"Wikipedia：East of Eden (film)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_of_Eden_(film)","say":{"en":"Is the new East of Eden better than the James Dean film?","zh":"新的《伊甸之东》比 James Dean 那版电影好看吗？"}},"安杰尔":{"what":"比利时布鲁塞尔的法语流行歌手 Angèle（Angèle Van Laeken），1995 年生在布鲁塞尔的于克勒区。","what_en":"Brussels pop singer Angèle (Angèle Van Laeken), born in 1995 in Uccle, Brussels, who sings in French.","fame":"2018 年一出道就红遍比利时和法国；2024 年巴黎奥运会闭幕式上台；2026 年和法国电子组合 Justice 合作《What You Want》。","fame_en":"She broke through in Belgium and France in 2018, sang at the Paris 2024 Olympics closing ceremony, and in 2026 teamed up with French electronic duo Justice on What You Want.","fact":"她一家都是做音乐和表演的：爸爸是歌手 Marka，妈妈是演员 Laurence Bibot，哥哥是说唱歌手 Roméo Elvis——2018 年兄妹合唱的《Tout oublier》在比利时榜首待了好几周。","fact_en":"She comes from a family of performers: her father is singer Marka, her mother actress Laurence Bibot, and her brother rapper Roméo Elvis — their 2018 duet Tout oublier spent weeks at No. 1 in Belgium.","src":"Wikipedia：Angèle (singer)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ang%C3%A8le_(singer)","say":{"en":"Have you heard the new Angèle song with Justice? It's on every playlist.","zh":"你听过 Angèle 和 Justice 的新歌吗？每个歌单里都有。"}},"《女英雄》":{"what":"瑞士导演 Petra Volpe 2025 年的剧情片，原名 Heldin（英文名 Late Shift），德国演员 Leonie Benesch 演外科病房的护士，整部电影就是她的一个夜班。","what_en":"Swiss director Petra Volpe's 2025 drama Heldin (Late Shift): German actress Leonie Benesch plays a surgical-ward nurse, and the whole film follows one of her shifts.","fame":"瑞士 2025 年最卖座的本国电影，约 20 万人次；看完的人说终于知道护士一晚上要做多少事。2026 年 3 月还拿了瑞士电影奖（Quartz）的观众奖。","fame_en":"It was Switzerland's best-selling home-grown film of 2025, with around 200,000 admissions — viewers said it finally showed how much a nurse does in one night. In March 2026 it won an audience award at the Swiss Film Awards.","fact":"它代表瑞士去争奥斯卡最佳国际影片，2025 年 12 月进了 15 部的短名单，但 2026 年 1 月没进最后的提名。","fact_en":"It was Switzerland's Oscar entry: in December 2025 it made the 15-film shortlist for Best International Feature, but missed the final nominations in January 2026.","src":"blue News，2025 年 12 月","url":"https://www.bluewin.ch/en/entertainment/swiss-film-heldin-makes-it-onto-the-oscar-shortlist-3013158.html","say":{"en":"Heldin made me want to thank every nurse I know.","zh":"看完《女英雄》，我想去谢谢我认识的每一个护士。"}},"《星际宝贝史迪奇》·瑞士":{"what":"迪士尼 2025 年真人版《星际宝贝》，翻拍 2002 年动画，讲夏威夷姐妹俩和外星小怪物 Stitch。","what_en":"Disney's 2025 live-action remake of the 2002 cartoon Lilo & Stitch, about two Hawaiian sisters and a little alien called Stitch.","fame":"瑞士近一年票房第一的电影，暑假里很多瑞士家庭带着孩子去看。","fame_en":"It was Switzerland's top film of the year, with lots of Swiss families taking their kids during the summer.","fact":"它是 2025 年第一部全球票房破 10 亿美元的好莱坞电影。","fact_en":"It was the first Hollywood film of 2025 to pass $1 billion at the global box office.","src":"The Walt Disney Company，2025 年 7 月","url":"https://thewaltdisneycompany.com/lilo-stitch-1-billion-box-office/","say":{"en":"Is this screening in German or the original version?","zh":"这场是德语配音还是原声的？"}},"《伊甸之东》·瑞士":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年根据斯坦贝克小说拍的七集美剧，讲 Trask 家两代兄弟和一个让人不安的女人 Cathy。","what_en":"Netflix's seven-episode 2026 series from Steinbeck's novel, about two generations of Trask brothers and the unsettling Cathy.","fame":"10 月中旬在瑞士 Netflix 剧集周榜排第 2；剧里的加州山谷、农场和小镇，很多观众是第一次看到。","fame_en":"It was No. 2 on Netflix's weekly series chart in Switzerland in mid-October; for many viewers it was their first look at that California valley of farms and small towns.","fact":"小说写的是加州萨利纳斯山谷 1862 到 1918 年的事——斯坦贝克就是在萨利纳斯长大的；1962 年他得了诺贝尔文学奖。","fact_en":"The novel is set in California's Salinas Valley from 1862 to 1918 — the place Steinbeck grew up — and in 1962 he won the Nobel Prize in Literature.","src":"Wikipedia：East of Eden (novel)；诺贝尔奖官网","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_of_Eden_(novel)","say":{"en":"I'm reading the book after the series — it's huge, but I can't stop.","zh":"看完剧我在读原著——好厚，可是停不下来。"}},"赫希特乐队":{"what":"瑞士卢塞恩的流行摇滚乐队 Hecht，用瑞士德语方言（Mundart）唱歌。","what_en":"Hecht, a pop-rock band from Lucerne, Switzerland, who sing in Swiss German dialect (Mundart).","fame":"2026 年瑞士音乐奖上一晚拿了 4 个奖，《Mon Amour》拿了年度金曲；在苏黎世的演唱会上 1.5 万人一起合唱这首歌。","fame_en":"At the 2026 Swiss Music Awards they won four prizes in one night, including Best Hit for Mon Amour — and 15,000 fans sang it together at a concert in Zurich.","fact":"他们宣布 2027 年 6 月 12 日在苏黎世 Letzigrund 体育场开唱，那里能装约 5 万人，Metallica、Taylor Swift 都在那儿唱过——这是乐队最大的一场。","fact_en":"They've announced a show at Zurich's Letzigrund stadium on 12 June 2027 — a 50,000-capacity venue where Metallica and Taylor Swift have played, and the band's biggest gig ever.","src":"Südostschweiz / SDA，2026 年 6 月","url":"https://www.suedostschweiz.ch/schweiz-und-welt/hecht-kuendigen-groesstes-konzert-ihrer-karriere-an-2-1914314","say":{"en":"I don't understand Swiss German, but I can sing the chorus of Mon Amour.","zh":"我听不懂瑞士德语，可是《Mon Amour》的副歌我会唱。"}},"《浪潮》":{"what":"捷克导演 Jiří Mádl 2024 年的剧情片，原名 Vlny，讲 1968 年「布拉格之春」时捷克斯洛伐克电台国际部的一群记者。","what_en":"Czech director Jiří Mádl's 2024 drama Vlny (Waves), about the journalists of Czechoslovak Radio's international desk during the 1968 Prague Spring.","fame":"2024 年捷克电影院观影人数最多的电影，约 88.6 万人次；拿了捷克狮最佳影片，还代表捷克进了奥斯卡国际影片的短名单。","fame_en":"It was the most-watched film in Czech cinemas in 2024, with about 886,000 admissions; it won the Czech Lion for Best Film and made the Oscar shortlist for Best International Feature.","fact":"它在电影院一直放，到 2025 年 8 月 21 日，在捷克看过的人超过了 100 万。","fact_en":"It kept playing in cinemas, and by 21 August 2025 more than a million people had seen it in Czechia.","src":"Newstream.cz，2025 年 8 月","url":"https://www.newstream.cz/enjoy/historicke-drama-vlny-rezisera-jiriho-madla-videl-k-21-srpnu-milion-divaku","say":{"en":"Waves made me want to know more about 1968 — what happened to the reporters after?","zh":"看完《浪潮》我想多了解 1968 年——那些记者后来怎么样了？"}},"《我的世界大电影》·捷克":{"what":"华纳 2025 年根据游戏《我的世界》拍的真人电影，Jack Black 演游戏里的 Steve，四个普通人掉进了方块世界。","what_en":"Warner Bros.' 2025 live-action film of the game Minecraft: Jack Black plays Steve, and four ordinary people fall into the blocky world.","fame":"捷克 2025 年观影人数最多的电影：859,295 人次，比第二名《疯狂动物城2》多了 30 多万。","fame_en":"It was the most-watched film in Czech cinemas in 2025 — 859,295 admissions, over 300,000 more than runner-up Zootopia 2.","fact":"《我的世界》是史上卖得最多的电子游戏：到 2026 年 5 月，卖出超过 4 亿份。","fact_en":"Minecraft is the best-selling video game of all time — over 400 million copies sold as of May 2026.","src":"Wikipedia：Minecraft","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minecraft","say":{"en":"Did you grow up playing Minecraft? The film is full of in-jokes.","zh":"你小时候玩过《我的世界》吗？电影里全是只有玩家才懂的梗。"}},"《伊甸之东》·捷克":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年的七集美剧，改编自斯坦贝克的长篇小说《伊甸之东》，从 19 世纪末一直讲到第一次世界大战。","what_en":"Netflix's seven-episode 2026 series of Steinbeck's long novel East of Eden, running from the late 19th century to the First World War.","fame":"10 月中旬在捷克 Netflix 剧集周榜排第 2；Florence Pugh 演的 Cathy 让很多人看得发冷。","fame_en":"It was No. 2 on Netflix's weekly series chart in Czechia in mid-October, and Florence Pugh's Cathy gave plenty of viewers chills.","fact":"七集是一次全放出来的；前四集的导演是拍过电影《雄狮》的 Garth Davis，编剧 Zoe Kazan 和 Jeb Stuart 一起当节目统筹。","fact_en":"All seven episodes dropped at once; episodes 1–4 were directed by Garth Davis (Lion), with writer Zoe Kazan and Jeb Stuart as showrunners.","src":"What's on Netflix，2026","url":"https://www.whats-on-netflix.com/news/east-of-eden-netflix-release-date-florence-pugh-first-look/","say":{"en":"I binged all seven episodes this weekend. No regrets.","zh":"这个周末我一口气把七集全看完了。不后悔。"}},"埃娃·法尔娜":{"what":"波兰-捷克歌手 Ewa Farna，生在捷克东边特日涅茨（Třinec）的波兰族家庭，用捷克语和波兰语唱流行摇滚。","what_en":"Polish-Czech singer Ewa Farna, from a Polish-speaking family in Třinec in eastern Czechia, who sings pop-rock in both Czech and Polish.","fame":"十几岁就在捷克和波兰同时走红，后来还当了捷克选秀节目 SuperStar 的评委；《Neříkej, co má se stát》是她现在很火的歌。","fame_en":"She became a star in Czechia and Poland at the same time as a teenager, and later became a judge on the talent show SuperStar; Neříkej, co má se stát is one of her current hits.","fact":"2026 年 6 月她在布拉格的 Eden 体育场开了演唱会，约 2 万人到场。","fact_en":"In June 2026 she played Prague's Eden stadium to about 20,000 people.","src":"ESKA.pl，2026 年 6 月","url":"https://www.eska.pl/rozrywka/koncerty-i-wydarzenia/ewa-farna-dala-koncert-na-stadionie-20-tysiecy-osob-na-jej-show-w-pradze-aa-CWes-HXjX-gNwP.html","say":{"en":"Does she sing in Czech or Polish tonight? Both? Even better.","zh":"她今晚唱捷克语还是波兰语？两种都唱？那更好。"}},"《曼尼图的独木舟》·德国":{"what":"Michael「Bully」Herbig 2025 年的西部恶搞喜剧，原名 Das Kanu des Manitu：阿帕奇首领 Abahachi 和朋友 Ranger 又惹上了麻烦。","what_en":"Michael 'Bully' Herbig's 2025 Western spoof Das Kanu des Manitu, in which Apache chief Abahachi and his friend Ranger get into trouble again.","fame":"2025 年 8 月 14 日上映，卖了 500 多万张票，是德国 2025 年最卖座的电影，也是六年来第一部过 500 万的德国片。","fame_en":"It opened on 14 August 2025 and sold over 5 million tickets — Germany's biggest film of 2025 and the first German film in six years to pass 5 million.","fact":"它等了 24 年：第一部《曼尼图的鞋》2001 年有约 1170 万人次去看，是二战后最成功的德国电影之一。","fact_en":"It was 24 years in the making: the first film, Der Schuh des Manitu (2001), drew about 11.7 million cinemagoers — one of the most successful German films since the Second World War.","src":"Wikipedia：Der Schuh des Manitu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Der_Schuh_des_Manitu","say":{"en":"Have you seen the first one? You'll get more of the jokes if you have.","zh":"你看过第一部吗？看过的话笑点能懂更多。"}},"《伊甸之东》·德国":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年根据斯坦贝克 1952 年小说拍的七集美剧，讲加州两代兄弟、父亲的偏心和母亲留下的秘密。","what_en":"Netflix's seven-episode 2026 series from Steinbeck's 1952 novel — two generations of brothers in California, a father's favouritism and a mother's secret.","fame":"10 月中旬在德国 Netflix 剧集周榜排第 2；Florence Pugh、Christopher Abbott、Mike Faist 主演。","fame_en":"It was No. 2 on Netflix's weekly series chart in Germany in mid-October, starring Florence Pugh, Christopher Abbott and Mike Faist.","fact":"整个故事是在重讲该隐和亚伯；书里最出名的是一个希伯来词 timshel，意思是「你可以」——人不是注定好或坏，可以自己选。","fact_en":"The whole story retells Cain and Abel, and its most famous idea is one Hebrew word, timshel — 'thou mayest' — meaning people aren't fated to be good or bad; they can choose.","src":"Wikipedia：East of Eden (novel)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_of_Eden_(novel)","say":{"en":"What does 'timshel' mean? Everyone online is talking about it.","zh":"「timshel」是什么意思？网上大家都在说这个词。"}},"希琳·大卫":{"what":"德国汉堡的说唱歌手 Shirin David；她和柏林制作组 KitschKrieg、乐队 Blumengarten 合作的德语歌《Gut genug》。","what_en":"Hamburg rapper Shirin David, and Gut genug, the German-language song she made with Berlin producers KitschKrieg and the band Blumengarten.","fame":"2026 年 6 月《Gut genug》登上德国单曲榜第一，坐了两周；它先在 TikTok 上火到国外，听不懂德语的人也跟着唱。","fame_en":"In June 2026 Gut genug hit No. 1 on the German singles chart for two weeks — after going viral abroad on TikTok, where people who don't speak German sang along.","fact":"她小时候学过歌剧，在汉堡国家歌剧院的几部戏里当过儿童演员。","fact_en":"She trained in opera as a child and appeared as a child performer in productions at the Hamburg State Opera.","src":"Wikipedia（德语）：Shirin David","url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shirin_David","say":{"en":"Is that Gut genug playing again? It's literally everywhere this summer.","zh":"又在放《Gut genug》？今年夏天真的到处都是。"}},"《格子忍者3》":{"what":"丹麦喜剧演员 Anders Matthesen 编导、配音的动画喜剧第三部，原名 Ternet Ninja 3，2025 年 8 月 21 日上映：一个被施了魔法的格子布忍者娃娃又回来了。","what_en":"The third animated comedy from Danish comedian Anders Matthesen, who writes, co-directs and voices it: Ternet Ninja 3, released 21 August 2025, brings back the cursed checkered ninja doll.","fame":"丹麦 2025 年最卖座的电影，77 万多人次；丹麦小孩几乎都会学里面的台词，大人也是听着 Matthesen 的单口喜剧长大的。","fame_en":"It was Denmark's biggest film of 2025, with over 770,000 admissions; Danish kids quote it, and their parents grew up on Matthesen's stand-up.","fact":"2018 年的第一部打破了丹麦动画片的票房纪录——上一个纪录是 1986 年的《Valhalla》，610,840 人次。","fact_en":"The first film (2018) broke the Danish animation box-office record, previously held by the 1986 film Valhalla with 610,840 admissions.","src":"Nordisk Film & TV Fond","url":"https://nordiskfilmogtvfond.com/news/stories/checkered-ninja-breaks-danish-film-animation-b-o-record","say":{"en":"Two kids and one adult for Ternet Ninja 3, please — middle seats if you have them.","zh":"《格子忍者3》两个小孩一个大人，有中间的座位最好。"}},"《一见钟情就结婚（丹麦版）》":{"what":"丹麦 DR1 的婚恋真人秀，原名 Gift ved første blik：专家给素不相识的两个人配对，他们第一次见面就是在婚礼上。","what_en":"Gift ved første blik, a DR1 reality show in which experts match two strangers who meet for the first time at their own wedding.","fame":"2026 年秋天播第 12 季，10 月中旬第 7 集有约 89 万人看，排丹麦当周收视第一——丹麦一共才不到 600 万人。","fame_en":"Its 12th season aired in autumn 2026; episode 7 in mid-October drew about 894,000 viewers, the week's top show in Denmark — a country of under 6 million.","fact":"全世界的《一见钟情就结婚》都是从这儿来的：2013 年在丹麦 DR3 首播，2014 年到了美国，2015 年到了英国和澳大利亚。","fact_en":"Every Married at First Sight in the world started here: it premiered on Denmark's DR3 in 2013, reached the US in 2014, and the UK and Australia in 2015.","src":"Wikipedia：Married at First Sight","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Married_at_First_Sight","say":{"en":"Would you ever marry someone you'd never met? Honestly?","zh":"你会跟一个从没见过的人结婚吗？说实话？"}},"克里斯托弗":{"what":"丹麦流行歌手 Christopher（Christopher Lund Nissen），英语丹麦语都唱；《Elsker Dig Så Meget Jeg Ku' Gå I Stykker》是他现在很火的丹麦语歌。","what_en":"Danish pop singer Christopher (Christopher Lund Nissen), who sings in English and Danish; Elsker Dig Så Meget Jeg Ku' Gå I Stykker is one of his current Danish-language hits.","fame":"丹麦最红的流行歌手之一，2025 年还有一部纪录片拍他准备在哥本哈根皇家体育馆开职业生涯最大的一场演唱会。","fame_en":"He's one of Denmark's biggest pop stars, and a 2025 documentary follows him preparing for the biggest concert of his career at Copenhagen's Royal Arena.","fact":"2023 年他在 Netflix 电影《A Beautiful Life》里第一次当主角，演一个嗓子特别好的年轻渔民 Elliott，电影里的歌都是他的原创。","fact_en":"In 2023 he played his first lead role in Netflix's A Beautiful Life, as Elliott, a young fisherman with an extraordinary voice — singing his own original songs.","src":"Netflix 新闻稿，2023","url":"https://about.netflix.com/news/christopher-in-his-first-leading-role-a-beautiful-life-premiere-on-netflix","say":{"en":"Christopher is playing Royal Arena — want to come? I'll buy the tickets.","zh":"Christopher 要在皇家体育馆开唱——一起去吗？我来买票。"}},"《特伦特总统》":{"what":"Santiago Segura 自编自导自演的《Torrente》喜剧第六部，原名 Torrente, presidente，2026 年 3 月 13 日上映：又懒又粗俗的前警察 Torrente 这回要去竞选。","what_en":"Torrente, presidente, the sixth Torrente comedy written, directed by and starring Santiago Segura, released 13 March 2026: the lazy, crude ex-cop Torrente now runs for office.","fame":"西班牙 2026 年最卖座的本国电影，约 2800 万欧元、370 万人次，进了西班牙影史本国片前四；首个周末就有 690 万欧元。","fame_en":"It's Spain's biggest home-grown film of 2026 — about €28 million and 3.7 million admissions, in the top four Spanish films ever — with €6.9 million in its first weekend alone.","fact":"上映那几天，很多观众扮成 Torrente 的样子去电影院。","fact_en":"In its opening days, lots of fans went to the cinema dressed up as Torrente.","src":"Vandal，2026 年 3 月","url":"https://vandal.elespanol.com/noticia/r40870/ya-es-oficial-torrente-presidente-arrasa-en-cines-con-69-millones-en-taquilla-y-espectadores-acudiendo-disfrazados","say":{"en":"Is Torrente really that funny, or is it just a Spanish thing?","zh":"《特伦特》真的那么好笑吗，还是只有西班牙人懂？"}},"《星际宝贝》":{"what":"迪士尼 2025 年真人版《星际宝贝》，在西班牙叫 Lilo y Stitch：夏威夷小女孩 Lilo 和外星实验品 626 号 Stitch。","what_en":"Disney's 2025 live-action Lilo & Stitch — Lilo y Stitch in Spain — about Hawaiian girl Lilo and alien Experiment 626.","fame":"西班牙 2025 年最卖座的电影，约 2470 万欧元；上映才三周就超过《我的世界大电影》成了全年第一。","fame_en":"It was Spain's top film of 2025, with about €24.7 million — overtaking A Minecraft Movie as the year's No. 1 just three weeks after opening.","fact":"它在美国阵亡将士纪念日周末开画，四天 1.83 亿美元，是这个假期周末史上最高的开画。","fact_en":"It opened over the US Memorial Day weekend with $183 million in four days — the biggest Memorial Day opening ever.","src":"ABC7，2025 年 7 月","url":"https://abc7news.com/post/lilo-stitch-reaches-1-billion-global-box-office/17165780/","say":{"en":"Is it the dubbed version? My nephew doesn't read subtitles yet.","zh":"是配音版吗？我外甥还看不了字幕。"}},"《蚁丘》":{"what":"西班牙 Antena 3 工作日晚上的综艺访谈节目，原名 El hormiguero，主持人 Pablo Motos，旁边有两只会说话的木偶蚂蚁 Trancas 和 Barrancas。","what_en":"El hormiguero, Antena 3's weeknight talk-and-variety show hosted by Pablo Motos, with two talking puppet ants, Trancas and Barrancas.","fame":"明星来西班牙宣传几乎都要上；节目里有科学小实验、魔术和游戏。9 月一集约 150 万人看。","fame_en":"Almost every star promoting something in Spain goes on it; the show mixes science experiments, magic and games. In September an episode drew about 1.5 million viewers.","fact":"它 2006 年 9 月开播，2026 年 7 月刚结束第 20 季。","fact_en":"It began in September 2006, and in July 2026 it wrapped its 20th season.","src":"FormulaTV","url":"https://www.formulatv.com/programas/el-hormiguero/","say":{"en":"Who's on El hormiguero tonight?","zh":"今晚《蚁丘》请了谁？"}},"克韦多":{"what":"西班牙加那利群岛（大加那利岛）的说唱和雷鬼顿歌手 Quevedo；《La Graciosa》是他和波多黎各歌手 Elvis Crespo 的合作，名字是加那利群岛的一座小岛。","what_en":"Canary Islands rapper and reggaeton singer Quevedo; La Graciosa, his duet with Puerto Rican singer Elvis Crespo, is named after a small Canary island.","fame":"2026 年专辑《El Baifo》拿了西班牙专辑榜第一；《La Graciosa》在西班牙单曲榜第一待了一个多月。","fame_en":"His 2026 album El Baifo reached No. 1 on the Spanish albums chart, and La Graciosa spent more than a month at No. 1 on the Spanish singles chart.","fact":"《La Graciosa》成了 2026 年夏天西班牙 Spotify 播放最多的歌，有 1.48 亿多次。","fact_en":"La Graciosa became Spain's most-streamed song on Spotify in summer 2026, with more than 148 million plays.","src":"RTVC，2026 年 9 月","url":"https://rtvc.es/quevedo-pone-el-sello-canario-a-la-cancion-del-verano-mas-escuchada-en-spotify-12-de-septiembre-de-2026/","say":{"en":"This is the song of the summer, right? Can you turn it up?","zh":"这是今年的夏日金曲吧？能开大声点吗？"}},"《一百升萨赫蒂》":{"what":"芬兰导演 Teemu Nikki 2025 年的乡村喜剧，原名 100 litraa sahtia，讲乡下两姐妹酿芬兰传统啤酒萨赫蒂（sahti）的事，Elina Knihtilä 和 Pirjo Lonka 主演。","what_en":"Finnish director Teemu Nikki's 2025 rural comedy 100 litraa sahtia (100 Litres of Gold), about two country sisters brewing sahti, Finland's traditional farmhouse beer, starring Elina Knihtilä and Pirjo Lonka.","fame":"芬兰 2025 年最卖座的本国电影，235,060 人次，全年只输给《我的世界大电影》；还拿了六项芬兰电影奖 Jussi 的提名。","fame_en":"It was Finland's top home-grown film of 2025 with 235,060 admissions, beaten only by A Minecraft Movie, and earned six nominations at Finland's Jussi film awards.","fact":"导演 Teemu Nikki 家族里一直有人酿萨赫蒂，他说拍这部片是「回到自己的根」。","fact_en":"Sahti brewing runs in director Teemu Nikki's own family — he called the film a return to his roots.","src":"Yle，2025 年 4 月","url":"https://yle.fi/a/74-20155502","say":{"en":"Have you ever tried sahti? Is it really that strong?","zh":"你喝过萨赫蒂吗？真有那么烈吗？"}},"《我的世界大电影》·芬兰":{"what":"2025 年根据游戏《我的世界》拍的好莱坞真人电影，芬兰叫 Minecraft-elokuva，Jack Black 和 Jason Momoa 主演。","what_en":"The 2025 Hollywood live-action film of the game Minecraft — Minecraft-elokuva in Finland — starring Jack Black and Jason Momoa.","fame":"芬兰 2025 年观影人次第一的电影，35 万多人次，比芬兰自己的冠军《一百升萨赫蒂》多了 12 万。","fame_en":"It was Finland's most-watched film of 2025, with over 355,000 admissions — about 120,000 more than the top Finnish film, 100 litraa sahtia.","fact":"英国和美国很多影院出现了「chicken jockey」潮：一演到那个镜头，青少年就起哄、扔爆米花，有影院专门贴出警告。","fact_en":"In the UK and US it set off the 'chicken jockey' craze — teenagers erupting and throwing popcorn at one scene, until some cinemas posted warnings.","src":"Wikipedia：A Minecraft Movie（引自 The Guardian）","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Minecraft_Movie","say":{"en":"Is it OK for kids? My son is seven.","zh":"小孩能看吗？我儿子七岁。"}},"《只是生活》":{"what":"芬兰 Nelonen 台的歌手综艺，原名 Vain elämää：八位芬兰歌手一起住几周，每集轮流翻唱彼此的歌。","what_en":"Vain elämää, a Nelonen singer show in which eight Finnish artists live together for a few weeks and take turns covering each other's songs.","fame":"芬兰最受欢迎的音乐综艺之一，第 16 季秋季触达约 380 万人——芬兰一共才 560 万人。","fame_en":"It's one of Finland's most popular music shows: its 16th season reached about 3.8 million people — in a country of 5.6 million.","fact":"第 17 季 2026 年 9 月 4 日开播，第一集叫「Calliola kutsuu」；嘉宾里有 2006 年拿过欧洲歌唱大赛冠军的怪物乐队 Lordi。","fact_en":"Season 17 began on 4 September 2026 with an episode called 'Calliola kutsuu', and its special guests include Lordi, the monster-masked band who won Eurovision in 2006.","src":"Nelonen 新闻稿（STT Info），2026","url":"https://www.sttinfo.fi/tiedote/72015675/tassa-ovat-uudet-vain-elamaa-artistit-mukana-kahdeksan-huippunimea-ja-kolme-erikoisvierasta","say":{"en":"Who cried on Vain elämää this week?","zh":"这周《只是生活》谁哭了？"}},"伊萨克·艾略特":{"what":"芬兰流行歌手 Isac Elliot，2000 年生，十几岁就出道；《Kaiken varalta》是他的芬兰语歌。","what_en":"Finnish pop singer Isac Elliot, born in 2000, who started out as a young teenager; Kaiken varalta is one of his Finnish-language songs.","fame":"从童星变成了芬兰最红的年轻歌手之一；《Kaiken varalta》2026 年第 31 周登上芬兰单曲榜第一，同周专辑《Mansion Music》也是第一。","fame_en":"He went from child star to one of Finland's biggest young pop acts: Kaiken varalta hit No. 1 on the Finnish singles chart in week 31 of 2026, the same week his album Mansion Music topped the albums chart.","fact":"他在科特卡港口的 Satama-areena 开唱，2000 多张票 15 分钟就卖完了，速度破了纪录。","fact_en":"His show at Kotka's harbour venue Satama-areena sold out in record time — over 2,000 tickets gone in fifteen minutes.","src":"Yle","url":"https://yle.fi/a/74-20187055","say":{"en":"Did you get Isac Elliot tickets? They sold out in fifteen minutes!","zh":"你抢到 Isac Elliot 的票了吗？十五分钟就卖光了！"}},"《多一点点爱》":{"what":"法国喜剧演员 Artus 自编自导的第一部电影（2024），原名 Un p'tit truc en plus：一对父子劫匪逃跑时混进了一个残障青年的夏令营；里面很多演员本身就是残障人士。","what_en":"Un p'tit truc en plus (2024), the first film written and directed by French comedian Artus: a father-and-son pair of robbers on the run hide out at a summer camp for young disabled adults — played by many actors with disabilities.","fame":"法国 2024 年最卖座的电影，观影 1083 万人次；很多人说它好笑又不拿残障开玩笑。","fame_en":"It was France's biggest film of 2024, with 10.83 million admissions — praised for being funny without making disability the joke.","fact":"它是法国十年来最大的票房成功：上一部过 1000 万人次的法国片，是 2014 年的《岳父岳母真难当》。","fact_en":"It was France's biggest home-grown hit in a decade — the first French film past 10 million admissions since Serial (Bad) Weddings in 2014.","src":"Europe 1，2024","url":"https://www.europe1.fr/culture/un-ptit-truc-en-plus-devient-le-plus-gros-succes-francais-depuis-10-ans-4262706","say":{"en":"Everyone says Un p'tit truc en plus is a must-see. Shall we go Sunday?","zh":"大家都说《多一点点爱》一定要看。周日去吗？"}},"《疯狂动物城2》":{"what":"迪士尼 2025 年的动画片，原名 Zootopia 2（法国叫 Zootopie 2）：兔子警官朱迪和狐狸尼克又一起破案。","what_en":"Disney's 2025 animated film Zootopia 2 (Zootopie 2 in France), in which rabbit cop Judy Hopps and fox Nick Wilde team up for a new case.","fame":"法国 2025 年观影人次第一的电影，600 多万人次，开画也是当年法国最好的。","fame_en":"It was France's most-watched film of 2025, with over 6 million admissions, and had the year's best opening in France.","fact":"全球票房 17.03 亿美元，超过《头脑特工队2》，成了好莱坞最卖座的动画片。","fact_en":"It took $1.703 billion worldwide, passing Inside Out 2 to become Hollywood's highest-grossing animated film.","src":"Deadline / Yahoo，2026 年 1 月","url":"https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/movies/articles/zootopia-2-bests-inside-2-171430878.html","say":{"en":"Are there any seats left for Zootopie 2 this afternoon?","zh":"今天下午《疯狂动物城2》还有座位吗？"}},"《国家宪兵干预队》":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年的法国动作剧，原名 GIGN（国际名 Elite Force），6 集，Julien Leclercq 创作，Tomer Sisley 主演，讲法国宪兵特警队 GIGN。","what_en":"GIGN (Elite Force), a six-episode 2026 French Netflix action series created by Julien Leclercq and starring Tomer Sisley, about France's elite gendarmerie unit.","fame":"2026 年 7 月 22 日上线，几天就拿下 Netflix 法国剧集周榜第一，还在很多国家进了前十。","fame_en":"It launched on 22 July 2026 and within days was No. 1 on Netflix's weekly series chart in France, making the top 10 in many other countries.","fact":"GIGN 是真实存在的部队：1972 年慕尼黑奥运会人质事件之后，法国 1973 年在巴黎附近建了它，1974 年开始执行任务。","fact_en":"GIGN is a real unit: France set it up near Paris in 1973 after the 1972 Munich Olympics hostage crisis, and it became operational in 1974.","src":"Wikipedia：GIGN","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GIGN","say":{"en":"Is GIGN worth watching? I heard it's non-stop action.","zh":"《国家宪兵干预队》值得看吗？听说从头打到尾。"}},"迪西兹与西奥多拉":{"what":"法国说唱老将 Disiz 和年轻歌手 Theodora 合唱的《Melodrama》，2025 年 9 月 26 日发，收在 Disiz 的专辑《On s'en rappellera pas》里。","what_en":"Melodrama, a duet by veteran French rapper Disiz and young singer Theodora, released 26 September 2025 on Disiz's album On s'en rappellera pas.","fame":"在法国单曲榜冠军位置坐了好几个月，拿了钻石唱片认证，咖啡馆、商店、广播里到处都在放。","fame_en":"It sat at No. 1 on the French singles chart for months and went diamond — playing in cafés, shops and on every radio station.","fact":"它连续 22 周排法国单曲榜第一，到 2026 年 3 月才被挤下来。","fact_en":"It held No. 1 on the French singles chart for 22 consecutive weeks before finally being knocked off in March 2026.","src":"Chartsinfrance，2026 年 3 月","url":"https://www.chartsinfrance.net/actualite/news-135821.html","say":{"en":"Melodrama again? I swear I've heard it five times today.","zh":"又是《Melodrama》？我发誓今天已经听了五遍。"}},"《BJ单身日记：为男孩痴狂》":{"what":"《BJ单身日记》第四部（2025），改编自 Helen Fielding 的小说：布里吉特成了两个孩子的单亲妈妈，在伦敦重新开始约会。","what_en":"Bridget Jones: Mad About the Boy (2025), the fourth film, from Helen Fielding's novel: Bridget, now a widowed mum of two, starts dating again in London.","fame":"英国 2025 年票房 4640 万英镑，全年第三，在英国本土制作的电影里排第二。","fame_en":"It made £46.4 million at the UK box office in 2025 — third of the year, and second among British-made films.","fact":"它的开画周末打破了英国和爱尔兰浪漫喜剧的票房纪录。","fact_en":"Its opening weekend broke the UK and Ireland box-office record for a romantic comedy.","src":"LBC，2025 年 2 月","url":"https://lbc.co.uk/showbiz/bridget-jones-mad-about-the-box-box-office-latest","say":{"en":"Fancy Bridget Jones and a glass of wine on Friday?","zh":"周五去看《BJ单身日记》，再喝杯酒？"}},"《我的世界大电影》·英国":{"what":"2025 年根据游戏《我的世界》拍的好莱坞真人电影，Jack Black、Jason Momoa 主演。","what_en":"The 2025 Hollywood live-action film of the game Minecraft, starring Jack Black and Jason Momoa.","fame":"英国和爱尔兰 2025 年票房第一的电影，5690 万英镑，比《魔法坏女巫2》和《BJ单身日记4》都多。","fame_en":"It was the UK and Ireland's top film of 2025, with £56.9 million — ahead of Wicked: For Good and Bridget Jones: Mad About the Boy.","fact":"英国影院出了「chicken jockey」潮：一演到这个镜头，十几岁的男孩子就起哄、扔爆米花，有影院威胁要把捣乱的人请出去。","fact_en":"British cinemas were hit by the 'chicken jockey' craze — teenage boys cheering and throwing popcorn at one scene, until some cinemas threatened to throw them out.","src":"The Guardian，2025 年 4 月（见 Wikipedia：A Minecraft Movie）","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Minecraft_Movie","say":{"en":"Please don't throw popcorn at the chicken jockey scene!","zh":"演到「鸡骑士」那段请别扔爆米花！"}},"《叛徒》":{"what":"BBC One 的真人推理游戏秀，原名 The Traitors，Claudia Winkleman 主持：一群陌生人住进苏格兰城堡，里面藏着几个暗中「杀人」的叛徒，大家每晚投票赶人。","what_en":"The Traitors, BBC One's reality game show hosted by Claudia Winkleman: strangers in a Scottish castle try to vote out the secret 'traitors' among them.","fame":"英国现在最火的综艺之一：2026 年 1 月 23 日第 4 季决赛，过夜收视约 940 万人，是平民版历来最高。","fame_en":"It's one of Britain's biggest shows: the series 4 final on 23 January 2026 drew about 9.4 million overnight viewers, the highest yet for the civilian version.","fact":"第 4 季的冠军 Rachel Duffy 和 Stephen Libby 都是叛徒——英国版第一次由一对叛徒一起赢；拍摄地是苏格兰高地的 Ardross 城堡。","fact_en":"Series 4 winners Rachel Duffy and Stephen Libby were both traitors — the first traitor pair to win the UK version. It's filmed at Ardross Castle in the Scottish Highlands.","src":"Wikipedia：The Traitors series 4","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Traitors_(British_TV_series)_series_4","say":{"en":"No spoilers — I haven't watched last night's Traitors yet!","zh":"别剧透——昨晚的《叛徒》我还没看！"}},"萨姆·芬德与奥利维亚·迪恩":{"what":"英格兰东北部 North Shields 的摇滚歌手 Sam Fender 和伦敦歌手 Olivia Dean 合唱的《Rein Me In》。","what_en":"Rein Me In, a duet by Sam Fender, the rock singer from North Shields in north-east England, and London singer Olivia Dean.","fame":"2026 年拿了全英音乐奖年度歌曲，在英国单曲榜累计 19 周第一。","fame_en":"It won Song of the Year at the 2026 BRITs and spent 19 weeks in total at No. 1 on the UK singles chart.","fact":"它打破了 1953 年 Frankie Laine《I Believe》保持了 73 年的纪录，成了英国榜上当冠军时间最长的歌。","fact_en":"It broke a 73-year record set in 1953 by Frankie Laine's I Believe, becoming the longest-running No. 1 in UK chart history.","src":"NME / Official Charts，2026","url":"https://www.nme.com/?p=3956293","say":{"en":"Rein Me In is still number one? That's unreal.","zh":"《Rein Me In》还是第一？太离谱了。"}},"《卡波迪斯特里亚斯》":{"what":"希腊导演 Yannis Smaragdis 的历史传记片，讲希腊独立后的第一任国家元首 Ioannis Kapodistrias，2025 年 12 月上映。","what_en":"Greek director Yannis Smaragdis's historical biopic of Ioannis Kapodistrias, the first head of state of independent Greece, released December 2025.","fame":"头四天卖了 144,712 张票，是 2025 年希腊最好的开画，也是希腊电影史上第二高的开画；整个冬季约 85 万张票。","fame_en":"It sold 144,712 tickets in its first four days — the best opening of 2025 in Greece and the second-biggest ever for a Greek film — and about 850,000 over the winter.","fact":"影评人批评它改动了历史，票房却一路走高，希腊总理米佐塔基斯还带着儿子去电影院看了。","fact_en":"Critics attacked its take on history, but audiences kept coming — and Prime Minister Kyriakos Mitsotakis went to see it with his son.","src":"iefimerida.gr","url":"https://www.iefimerida.gr/politiki/o-kyriakos-mitsotakis-pige-dei-kapodistria-smaragdi","say":{"en":"I want to see Kapodistrias — is it in Greek with English subtitles?","zh":"我想看《卡波迪斯特里亚斯》——是希腊语配英文字幕吗？"}},"《深水之下》":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年的美国超自然惊悚剧，原名 Below，6 集：Josh Hartnett 演加拿大纽芬兰一个偏远小镇的渔民，海里冒出了可怕的东西。","what_en":"Below, a six-episode 2026 Netflix supernatural thriller: Josh Hartnett plays a fisherman in a remote Newfoundland town threatened by something from the sea.","fame":"2026 年 10 月 8 日上线，在希腊 Netflix 剧集周榜排第一。","fame_en":"It launched on 8 October 2026 and went to No. 1 on Netflix's weekly series chart in Greece.","fact":"整部剧在加拿大纽芬兰拍；演 Josh Hartnett 儿子的是《怪奇物语》的 Charlie Heaton，海洋生物学家由 Mackenzie Davis 演。","fact_en":"It was shot in Newfoundland, with Stranger Things' Charlie Heaton as Hartnett's son and Mackenzie Davis as a marine biologist.","src":"What's on Netflix，2026","url":"https://www.whats-on-netflix.com/news/below-netflix-josh-hartnett-release-date-first-look/","say":{"en":"Don't watch Below before a ferry trip. Trust me.","zh":"坐渡轮之前别看《深水之下》。相信我。"}},"莱特":{"what":"希腊塞萨洛尼基的说唱歌手 Light（本名 Christian Ioannidis），1995 年生；《Pablona》是他 2026 年的歌。","what_en":"Thessaloniki rapper Light (Christian Ioannidis), born in 1995; Pablona is one of his 2026 tracks.","fame":"希腊流媒体播放最多的说唱歌手之一，17 岁被发掘，从那以后一直和厂牌 Capital Music 合作。","fame_en":"He's one of Greece's most-streamed rappers — discovered at 17, he has worked with the label Capital Music ever since.","fact":"他 2021、2022、2023 连续三年是希腊 Spotify 年度艺人；讲他的纪录片《No Cap》一上映就进了希腊票房前三。","fact_en":"He was Spotify's artist of the year in Greece three years running (2021–2023), and the documentary about him, No Cap, went straight into the Greek box-office top three.","src":"LiFO","url":"https://www.lifo.gr/node/1376044","say":{"en":"Who's the rapper everyone in Greece listens to? Light?","zh":"希腊人都在听的那个说唱歌手是谁？Light？"}},"《婚礼》":{"what":"克罗地亚导演 Igor Šeregi 2026 年的喜剧，原名 Svadba：一个克罗地亚家庭和一个塞尔维亚家庭因为儿女结婚凑到一起，一场婚礼差点变成外交事件。","what_en":"Svadba (The Wedding), Croatian director Igor Šeregi's 2026 comedy: a Croatian family and a Serbian family are thrown together by their children's wedding, which nearly becomes an international incident.","fame":"2026 年 1 月上映，到 4 月 1 日有 780,779 人次，成了克罗地亚影史观影最多的电影。","fame_en":"Released in January 2026, it had drawn 780,779 cinemagoers by 1 April — the most-watched film in Croatian cinema history.","fact":"它是克罗地亚和塞尔维亚合拍的，已经卖到了 20 多个国家，各地加起来观影接近 220 万人次。","fact_en":"It's a Croatian–Serbian co-production that has been sold to more than 20 countries, with nearly 2.2 million admissions across all markets.","src":"FNE（Film New Europe），2026 年 3 月","url":"https://filmneweurope.com/news/croatia-news/item/127721-croatian-serbian-hit-the-wedding-sold-to-over-20-countries","say":{"en":"Is Svadba funny if you're not from the Balkans?","zh":"不是巴尔干人，看《婚礼》也会觉得好笑吗？"}},"《我的世界大电影》·克罗地亚":{"what":"根据电子游戏《我的世界》（Minecraft）改编的好莱坞真人电影，2025 年 4 月上映，杰克·布莱克演游戏里的 Steve。","what_en":"A Hollywood live-action film based on the video game Minecraft, released in April 2025, with Jack Black as Steve from the game.","fame":"在克罗地亚，它是近一年票房最高的电影。玩过 Minecraft 的人从小学生到三十多岁都有，所以常常是一家人一起去看；全球票房约 9.6 亿美元，是 2025 年第五卖座的电影。","fame_en":"In Croatia it was the top-grossing film of the past year. Minecraft players range from primary-school kids to people in their thirties, so whole families went together. Worldwide it took about $961 million — the fifth-biggest film of 2025.","fact":"它在北美首个周末拿下约 1.63 亿美元，打破了《超级马里奥兄弟大电影》保持的游戏改编电影开画纪录——巧的是，两部电影里都有杰克·布莱克。","fact_en":"Its first weekend in North America brought in about $163 million, beating The Super Mario Bros. Movie's record for a video-game film opening — and Jack Black is in both.","src":"Wikipedia「A Minecraft Movie」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Minecraft_Movie","say":{"en":"Have you seen the Minecraft movie? My little brother wants to go again.","zh":"你看《我的世界》电影了吗？我弟弟还想再去看一遍。"}},"《伊甸之东》·克罗地亚":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年 10 月 1 日上线的 7 集美剧，改编自约翰·斯坦贝克 1952 年的小说，弗洛伦斯·皮尤演凯茜。","what_en":"A seven-episode American Netflix series released on 1 October 2026, adapted from John Steinbeck's 1952 novel, with Florence Pugh as Cathy.","fame":"7 集一次全放出来，10 月中旬冲到克罗地亚 Netflix 剧集周榜第一；影评普遍说好，烂番茄好评率 87%。一家两代兄弟、一个让人看不透的女人，看完很想找人聊。","fame_en":"All seven episodes dropped at once, and by mid-October it was No. 1 on Netflix's weekly TV chart in Croatia. Critics liked it — 87% on Rotten Tomatoes. Two generations of brothers and a woman nobody can read: it's the kind of show you want to talk about after.","fact":"编剧佐伊·卡赞是伊利亚·卡赞的孙女——1955 年詹姆斯·迪恩主演的电影版《伊甸之东》，导演就是她爷爷。","fact_en":"The writer, Zoe Kazan, is Elia Kazan's granddaughter — her grandfather directed the 1955 film of East of Eden starring James Dean.","src":"Wikipedia「East of Eden (2026 miniseries)」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_of_Eden_(2026_miniseries)","say":{"en":"No spoilers — I'm only on episode three.","zh":"别剧透，我才看到第三集。"}},"雅科夫·约齐诺维奇":{"what":"克罗地亚流行歌手 Jakov Jozinović，2005 年生在东部小城温科夫齐，还在萨格勒布大学读政治学。","what_en":"Jakov Jozinović, a Croatian pop singer born in 2005 in the eastern town of Vinkovci, still studying political science at the University of Zagreb.","fame":"先靠在网上翻唱老歌火起来，2026 年自己的单曲《Ja volim》（我爱）冲上克罗地亚榜首；首张专辑出来后在萨格勒布体育馆开了两万人的演唱会，塞尔维亚、波黑、北马其顿的场子也一票难求。","fame_en":"He first went viral singing covers of old songs online; in 2026 his own single \"Ja volim\" (I love) hit No. 1 in Croatia. After his first album he sang to 20,000 people at Arena Zagreb, and his shows in Serbia, Bosnia and North Macedonia sell out too.","fact":"2021 年他 15 岁上电视选秀《Supertalent》，唱的是皇后乐队的《Bohemian Rhapsody》，献给妈妈；真正爆红是 2025 年翻唱南斯拉夫老歌手巴拉舍维奇 1985 年的老歌《Olivera》。2026 年他拿了克罗地亚波林奖的最佳新人。","fact_en":"In 2021, aged 15, he sang Queen's \"Bohemian Rhapsody\" on the TV talent show Supertalent and dedicated it to his mum. His real breakthrough was a 2025 cover of \"Olivera\", a 1985 song by the Yugoslav singer Đorđe Balašević. In 2026 he won the Porin award for Best New Performer.","src":"Wikipedia「Jakov Jozinović」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jakov_Jozinovi%C4%87","say":{"en":"Did you manage to get tickets for Jakov? Everyone I know is trying.","zh":"你抢到 Jakov 的票了吗？我认识的人都在抢。"}},"《没有你我怎么活》":{"what":"2024 年 12 月上映的匈牙利音乐爱情片，原名 Hogyan tudnék élni nélküled?，整部片用歌手德米安·费伦茨（Demjén Ferenc）几十年来的老歌串起来。","what_en":"Hogyan tudnék élni nélküled? (How Could I Live Without You?), a Hungarian musical romance released in December 2024, told through decades of songs by the singer Ferenc Demjén.","fame":"匈牙利几代人都会唱德米安的歌，这部片成了剧变以后最卖座的匈牙利电影，观众超过 100 万——匈牙利人口还不到 1000 万。","fame_en":"Several generations of Hungarians know Demjén's songs by heart, and the film became the most-watched Hungarian film since the end of communism, with over a million viewers — in a country of under 10 million.","fact":"上一部在匈牙利电影院过 100 万观众的本国片，是 1986 年的《Szerelem első vérig》（爱到第一滴血）——那部片里的插曲，歌词也是德米安写的。","fact_en":"The last Hungarian film to pass a million cinema viewers was Szerelem első vérig (Love Till First Blood), back in 1986 — and Demjén wrote the lyrics for that film's songs too.","src":"444.hu，2025 年 9 月 22 日；匈牙利语维基「Demjén Ferenc」","url":"https://444.hu/2025/09/22/atlepte-a-hogyan-tudnek-elni-nelkuled-nezoszama-az-egymilliot","say":{"en":"Have you seen the Demjén film? Even my grandparents went to the cinema for it.","zh":"你看了德米安那部电影吗？连我爷爷奶奶都去电影院看了。"}},"《蜘蛛侠：崭新之日》":{"what":"2026 年夏天上映的漫威电影，原名 Spider-Man: Brand New Day，汤姆·霍兰德主演的第四部蜘蛛侠。","what_en":"Spider-Man: Brand New Day, the Marvel film released in summer 2026 — Tom Holland's fourth Spider-Man film as the lead.","fame":"在匈牙利是近一年票房第一；全世界首个周末就收了约 9.27 亿美元，历史第二。","fame_en":"It was Hungary's top-grossing film of the past year, and worldwide it took about $927 million in its first weekend — the second-biggest global opening ever.","fact":"北美首个周末约 3.55 亿美元，只比 2019 年《复仇者联盟：终局之战》的 3.57 亿少了 200 万，排在历史第二。","fact_en":"Its North American opening weekend was about $355 million — just $2 million short of Avengers: Endgame's $357 million in 2019, making it the second-biggest ever.","src":"新华社 / The Star，2026 年 8 月 3 日（Comscore 数据）","url":"https://www.thestar.com.my/news/world/2026/08/03/spider-man-brand-new-day-tops-north-american-box-office-in-opening-weekend","say":{"en":"Do you want to see Spider-Man in IMAX or a normal screen?","zh":"蜘蛛侠你想看 IMAX 还是普通厅？"}},"《伊甸之东》·匈牙利":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年 10 月上线的 7 集美剧，改编自斯坦贝克的小说《伊甸之东》，弗洛伦斯·皮尤主演。","what_en":"A seven-episode American Netflix series from October 2026, adapted from Steinbeck's novel East of Eden, starring Florence Pugh.","fame":"10 月中旬在匈牙利 Netflix 剧集周榜排第二。皮尤演的凯茜是文学里有名的「坏女人」，这一版把她自己的故事讲得更多，影评人说是她最好的表演之一。","fame_en":"In mid-October it was No. 2 on Netflix's weekly TV chart in Hungary. Pugh's Cathy is one of literature's famous \"bad women\", and this version tells much more of her own story — critics called it one of her best performances.","fact":"故事发生在加州的萨利纳斯山谷，可整部剧是在新西兰拍的：2024 年 10 月到 2025 年 3 月，在奥克兰、但尼丁和奥马鲁取景。","fact_en":"The story is set in California's Salinas Valley, but the whole series was shot in New Zealand — in Auckland, Dunedin and Oamaru, from October 2024 to March 2025.","src":"Wikipedia「East of Eden (2026 miniseries)」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_of_Eden_(2026_miniseries)","say":{"en":"Is it worth reading the book first, or should I just watch it?","zh":"要先看原著，还是直接看剧就行？"}},"德什":{"what":"匈牙利说唱和流行歌手 DESH，本名 Molnár Attila，2000 年生在布达佩斯，来自罗姆人家庭。","what_en":"DESH, a Hungarian rapper and pop singer — real name Attila Molnár — born in Budapest in 2000 to a Roma family.","fame":"和搭档 Azahriah 写出一首首冠军歌，2024 年两人在布达佩斯普斯卡什体育场连开三场满座；《Tip tip》是他和 Young Fly、Azahriah 一起唱的。","fame_en":"With his partner Azahriah he has made hit after hit, and in 2024 the two sold out three nights at Budapest's Puskás Aréna. \"Tip tip\" is his track with Young Fly and Azahriah.","fact":"艺名来自他踢球时穿的 10 号球衣——在罗姆人的罗瓦里语里，desh 就是「十」。做音乐之前他是收垃圾的，后来真写了一首歌叫《Kukásautó》（垃圾车）。","fact_en":"His stage name comes from the No. 10 shirt he wore playing football — in the Lovari Romani language, desh means \"ten\". Before music he worked as a bin man, and later wrote a song called \"Kukásautó\" (Bin Lorry).","src":"匈牙利语维基「DESH」","url":"https://hu.wikipedia.org/wiki/DESH","say":{"en":"Are you going to the Desh concert? I heard it's sold out.","zh":"你去 Desh 的演唱会吗？听说票都卖光了。"}},"《膝盖骨》":{"what":"2024 年的爱尔兰电影，原名 Kneecap：贝尔法斯特一个用爱尔兰语说唱的组合，三个成员本色出演自己的故事。","what_en":"Kneecap, a 2024 Irish film about the Belfast rap trio who rap in Irish — the three members play themselves.","fame":"大部分对白是爱尔兰语，却在爱尔兰票房破了 100 万欧元，是爱尔兰语电影开画最好的一次；又好笑又闹，也在讲一门差点没人说的语言怎么重新酷起来。","fame_en":"Most of it is in Irish, yet it passed €1 million at the Irish box office and had the biggest opening ever for an Irish-language film. It's loud and funny, and it's also about how a nearly-lost language became cool again.","fact":"2024 年 1 月，它是第一部在圣丹斯电影节首映的爱尔兰语电影，还拿了观众奖；后来入围了奥斯卡国际影片和原创歌曲两项短名单，拿到 6 个英国电影学院奖提名。","fact_en":"In January 2024 it became the first Irish-language film to premiere at Sundance, and won an audience award there. It later made the Oscar shortlists for International Feature and Original Song, and got six BAFTA nominations.","src":"BreakingNews.ie，2024 年 1 月；Wikipedia「Kneecap (film)」","url":"https://www.breakingnews.ie/ireland/irish-film-about-rap-trio-kneecap-wins-audience-award-at-sundance-1580637.html","say":{"en":"Is it all in Irish? Are there English subtitles?","zh":"全是爱尔兰语吗？有英文字幕吗？"}},"《迈克尔》":{"what":"2026 年讲迈克尔·杰克逊的传记电影，原名 Michael，从杰克逊五兄弟讲到 1980 年代的 Bad 巡演；演迈克尔的是他的亲侄子贾法尔·杰克逊。","what_en":"Michael, the 2026 biopic of Michael Jackson, from the Jackson 5 to the Bad tour of the late 1980s. He's played by his own nephew, Jaafar Jackson.","fame":"在爱尔兰是近一年票房第一。影评人不太买账，说故事讲得太「干净」，可观众冲着那些歌和舞台去，一场接一场看。","fame_en":"It was Ireland's top-grossing film of the past year. Critics weren't keen and called the story \"sanitised\", but audiences went for the songs and the stage shows, again and again.","fact":"它全球票房约 10.29 亿美元，是第一部过 10 亿美元的传记片，也是狮门影业有史以来最卖座的电影。","fact_en":"It took about $1.029 billion worldwide — the first biopic ever to pass $1 billion, and Lionsgate's highest-grossing film.","src":"Wikipedia「Michael (2026 film)」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michael_(2026_film)","say":{"en":"I didn't expect to cry at the Michael film, but I did.","zh":"没想到看《迈克尔》会哭，结果还是哭了。"}},"《与星共舞（爱尔兰版）》":{"what":"爱尔兰国家电视台 RTÉ 的明星跳舞比赛，原名 Dancing with the Stars：名人跟专业舞者搭档，每周跳一支舞，评委打分加观众投票。","what_en":"Dancing with the Stars on Ireland's RTÉ: celebrities pair up with professional dancers, perform one dance a week, and face the judges' scores and the public vote.","fame":"每年一月到三月的周日晚上，是爱尔兰家里一起看的节目；2026 年 1 月 4 日新一季开播，平均 55 万人看，RTÉ One 那个时段将近一半的观众都在看它。","fame_en":"From January to March it's Ireland's Sunday-night family show. The 2026 series opened on 4 January with an average of 550,000 viewers — about 45% of everyone watching RTÉ One's slot.","fact":"RTÉ 在都柏林的演播室太小，装不下这么大的舞台，所以节目其实是在威克洛郡的 Ardmore 制片厂录的；2026 年这一季还请来了 1993 年欧洲歌唱大赛冠军 Niamh Kavanagh 下场跳舞。","fact_en":"RTÉ's Dublin studios were too small for the show, so it's made at Ardmore Studios in County Wicklow. The 2026 series even had 1993 Eurovision winner Niamh Kavanagh as a contestant.","src":"Wikipedia「Dancing with the Stars (Irish TV series)」；RTÉ 新闻稿，2026 年 1 月 5 日","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dancing_with_the_Stars_(Irish_TV_series)","say":{"en":"Who are you voting for this week?","zh":"这周你投谁？"}},"翠鸟乐队":{"what":"爱尔兰利默里克的独立民谣三人组 Kingfishr，2022 年成立，吉他、班卓琴、曼陀林、口琴一起上。","what_en":"Kingfishr, an indie-folk trio from Limerick, Ireland, formed in 2022 — guitar, banjo, mandolin and harmonica.","fame":"2025 年的《Killeagh》冲上爱尔兰单曲榜第一，首张专辑《Halcyon》一出就是爱尔兰专辑榜第一、英国第七；在爱尔兰的酒吧和婚礼上，几乎每晚都能听到有人一起唱。","fame_en":"\"Killeagh\" went to No. 1 on the Irish singles chart in 2025, and their first album Halcyon debuted at No. 1 in Ireland and No. 7 in the UK. In Irish pubs and at weddings you'll hear people singing along almost every night.","fact":"歌名 Killeagh 是一个真实的小村子，在科克郡东边，离科克市大约 32 公里。乐队三个人是 2017 年在大学里认识的，2026 年又拿了第二首爱尔兰冠军单曲。","fact_en":"Killeagh is a real village in east County Cork, about 32 km from Cork city. The three band members met at college in 2017, and in 2026 they scored a second Irish No. 1 single.","src":"Wikipedia「Kingfishr」「Killeagh」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kingfishr","say":{"en":"Is this Kingfishr? Turn it up — I love this one.","zh":"这是 Kingfishr 吗？开大声点，我超喜欢这首。"}},"《触碰》":{"what":"2024 年冰岛导演巴尔塔萨·科马库尔的爱情片，原名 Snerting（Touch）：一个冰岛老人在疫情里飞去伦敦、再到日本，找 50 年前在伦敦日本餐馆里爱过的女孩。","what_en":"Snerting (Touch), a 2024 love story by Icelandic director Baltasar Kormákur: during the pandemic, an old Icelandic man travels to London and then Japan to find the girl he loved in a London Japanese restaurant 50 years ago.","fame":"2024 年冰岛票房第一的本国片，冰岛语、英语、日语都有；故事跨了冰岛、伦敦和日本，影评人说它安静又动人。","fame_en":"It was Iceland's top-grossing home-grown film of 2024, in Icelandic, English and Japanese. The story crosses Iceland, London and Japan, and critics called it quiet and moving.","fact":"它被选为冰岛的奥斯卡国际影片参赛片，进了 15 部短名单（最后没提名）；2025 年 1 月还拿了挪威特罗姆瑟国际电影节的观众奖。","fact_en":"It was Iceland's Oscar entry for Best International Feature and made the 15-film shortlist (though not the final nominations). In January 2025 it also won the audience award at the Tromsø International Film Festival in Norway.","src":"Wikipedia「Touch (2024 film)」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Touch_(2024_film)","say":{"en":"It's a slow film, but the ending got me.","zh":"这片子节奏很慢，可结尾很打动我。"}},"《我的世界大电影》·冰岛":{"what":"好莱坞把电子游戏《我的世界》（Minecraft）拍成的真人电影，2025 年 4 月上映。","what_en":"Hollywood's live-action film of the video game Minecraft, released in April 2025.","fame":"在冰岛是近一年票房第一。冰岛人口不到 40 万，这种老少都能看的片子最容易一家子一起去电影院。","fame_en":"It was Iceland's top-grossing film of the past year. With under 400,000 people in the country, a film the whole family can watch is exactly what fills the cinemas.","fact":"片子里的小镇设定在美国爱达荷州，其实是在新西兰拍的：2024 年 1 月到 4 月在奥克兰附近，小镇的戏大多在一个叫亨特利（Huntly）的地方拍。","fact_en":"The town in the film is supposed to be in Idaho, but it was shot in New Zealand — around Auckland from January to April 2024, with most of the town scenes filmed in a place called Huntly.","src":"Wikipedia「A Minecraft Movie」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Minecraft_Movie","say":{"en":"Two tickets for Minecraft, please — one adult, one child.","zh":"两张《我的世界》，一张大人、一张儿童。"}},"《伊甸之东》·冰岛":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年 10 月上线的 7 集美剧，改编自斯坦贝克的同名小说，讲加州一家两代人和一个叫凯茜的女人。","what_en":"A seven-episode Netflix series from October 2026, adapted from Steinbeck's novel, about two generations of a California family and a woman called Cathy.","fame":"10 月上线后，冲到冰岛 Netflix 剧集周榜第一。秋天冰岛天黑得早，一口气追完 7 集的人很多。","fame_en":"After its October release it went to No. 1 on Netflix's TV chart in Iceland — autumn nights get dark early there, and plenty of people watched all seven episodes in one go.","fact":"演查尔斯的迈克·费斯特本来只签了前 3 集，Netflix 看了早期素材后觉得他太好，专门多加了一集让他演。","fact_en":"Mike Faist, who plays Charles, was originally signed for only the first three episodes — after Netflix saw early footage, it commissioned an extra episode to give him more.","src":"Wikipedia「East of Eden (2026 miniseries)」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_of_Eden_(2026_miniseries)","say":{"en":"I watched all seven episodes in one weekend. Don't judge me.","zh":"我一个周末把 7 集全看完了，别笑我。"}},"FM95BLÖ":{"what":"冰岛电台 FM957 每周五下午 4 点到 6 点的搞笑节目，三个主持人 Auðunn Blöndal、Egill Einarsson、Steinþór（Steindi）后来也一起出歌。","what_en":"FM95BLÖ, a comedy show on Iceland's FM957 radio every Friday from 4 to 6 pm. Its three hosts — Auðunn Blöndal, Egill Einarsson and Steinþór (Steindi) — also release songs together.","fame":"在冰岛几乎人人知道，周五下班路上开车听它是很多人的习惯；他们和 Saint Pete、DJ Muscleboy 合唱的《City Of Joy》成了冰岛最近很火的歌。","fame_en":"Almost everyone in Iceland knows it — listening on the Friday drive home is a habit for many. Their song \"City Of Joy\" with Saint Pete and DJ Muscleboy became one of Iceland's recent hits.","fact":"节目 2011 年 11 月开播，一开始周一到周五天天播，2013 年才改成只在周五；2022 年 5 月 13 日，三个人在雷克雅未克的 Laugardalshöll 体育馆办了十周年演出。","fact_en":"The show started in November 2011 and ran every weekday until 2013, when it moved to Fridays only. On 13 May 2022 the three celebrated ten years with a show at Laugardalshöll arena in Reykjavík.","src":"冰岛语维基「FM95BLÖ」","url":"https://is.wikipedia.org/wiki/FM95BL%C3%96","say":{"en":"Can you put the radio on? It's Friday — FM95BLÖ is on.","zh":"能开一下收音机吗？今天周五，有 FM95BLÖ。"}},"《一路顺风》":{"what":"意大利喜剧演员切科·扎洛内（Checco Zalone）2025 年的喜剧，原名 Buen Camino：一个被宠坏的有钱老爸，为了找离家出走的女儿，去走西班牙的圣地亚哥朝圣之路。","what_en":"Buen Camino, a 2025 comedy by Italian comedian Checco Zalone: a spoiled rich dad walks Spain's Camino de Santiago to find his runaway daughter.","fame":"扎洛内的片子在意大利几乎是「全家过节必看」。2025 年 12 月 25 日首映，圣诞节当天就卖了约 568 万欧元，占了那天意大利全部票房的近八成。","fame_en":"In Italy a Zalone film is practically a family holiday ritual. It opened on 25 December 2025 and took about €5.7 million on Christmas Day alone — almost 80% of all cinema takings in Italy that day.","fact":"上映不到一个月，它就收了 6880 万欧元，超过《阿凡达》（6860 万）成了意大利历史上票房最高的电影；几天前它已经先超过了扎洛内自己的《Quo Vado?》，成为最卖座的意大利本国片。","fact_en":"In under a month it took €68.8 million, overtaking Avatar (€68.6 million) as the highest-grossing film in Italian history — days after it had already beaten Zalone's own Quo Vado? as the biggest Italian-made film.","src":"Il Post，2026 年 1 月 18 日","url":"https://www.ilpost.it/2026/01/18/buen-camino-checco-zalone-record-incassi-italia/","say":{"en":"We're going to see the new Zalone film on Boxing Day — want to come?","zh":"我们圣诞节第二天去看扎洛内的新片，你来吗？"}},"《真男人》":{"what":"Netflix 的意大利喜剧剧集，原名 Maschi veri：四个四十多岁的男人发现，自己那套「男人就该这样」的想法在今天到处碰壁。","what_en":"Maschi veri (Real Men), an Italian Netflix comedy series: four men in their forties discover that their old ideas of \"how a man should be\" keep crashing into today's world.","fame":"第一季 2025 年 5 月上线，第二季 2026 年 10 月 7 日上线，一上来就进了意大利 Netflix 剧集榜第三。好笑，也让很多人在饭桌上吵起来：到底什么才算「真男人」。","fame_en":"Season one came out in May 2025, and season two on 7 October 2026 went straight to No. 3 on Netflix Italy's TV chart. It's funny, and it starts arguments at dinner tables about what a \"real man\" is.","fact":"它是翻拍的：原版是西班牙 Netflix 喜剧《Machos Alfa》（阿尔法男），因为在西班牙太成功，好几个国家都拍了自己的版本，意大利这版是其中之一。","fact_en":"It's a remake: the original is the Spanish Netflix comedy Machos Alfa (Alpha Males), which did so well that several countries made their own versions — the Italian one is one of them.","src":"Il Post，2025 年 5 月 21 日","url":"https://www.ilpost.it/2025/05/21/machos-alfa-italia/","say":{"en":"Have you watched Maschi veri? My dad is exactly like one of them.","zh":"你看《真男人》了吗？我爸跟里面一个人一模一样。"}},"杰奥利尔":{"what":"那不勒斯的说唱歌手 Geolier（本名 Emanuele Palumbo），2000 年生，用那不勒斯方言唱。","what_en":"Geolier (real name Emanuele Palumbo), a rapper from Naples born in 2000, who raps in Neapolitan dialect.","fame":"2024 年在圣雷莫音乐节唱方言歌拿了第二，2024 年 6 月在家乡的马拉多纳球场连开三场满座，是第一个做到的说唱歌手；《Per noi》是他和 Achille Lauro 的合作歌。","fame_en":"He came second at the 2024 Sanremo festival with a song in dialect, and in June 2024 sold out three nights at Naples' Maradona stadium — the first rapper to do it. \"Per noi\" is his song with Achille Lauro.","fact":"2024 年他是意大利 Spotify 上听得最多的歌手，一年播放超过 12 亿次——一个用方言唱歌的人，压过了所有唱标准意大利语的。","fact_en":"In 2024 he was the most-streamed artist on Spotify in Italy, with over 1.2 billion plays — a rapper singing in dialect beat everyone singing in standard Italian.","src":"ANSA / La Voce di New York，2024 年 12 月 4 日","url":"https://lavocedinewyork.com/ansa/2024/12/04/spotify-2024-in-italia-e-lanno-di-geolier-e-di-sanremo/","say":{"en":"I don't understand all the Neapolitan, but I can't stop listening to Geolier.","zh":"那不勒斯话我听不全懂，可 Geolier 的歌我停不下来。"}},"《情人男孩：情绪关闭》":{"what":"2024 年的荷兰犯罪片，原名 Loverboy: Emoties Uit，导演和主演是西里尔·古兹（Cyriel Guds）：单亲爸爸 Terrance 拼命想保住 9 岁的女儿，不让她被青少年保护机构带走。","what_en":"Loverboy: Emoties Uit (Emotions Off), a 2024 Dutch crime film written, directed by and starring Cyriel Guds: single father Terrance fights to stop youth services taking away his nine-year-old daughter.","fame":"没有大明星，主要靠年轻人口口相传，两周就过了 10 万观众，最后成了 2024 年荷兰观众最多的本国片，近 40 万人次。","fame_en":"No big stars — it spread by word of mouth among young people, passed 100,000 viewers in two weeks, and ended up the most-watched Dutch film of 2024, with nearly 400,000 admissions.","fact":"片方事先说好：观众到 35 万就拍续集。上映两个月后真的到了，续集就这样定了下来。","fact_en":"The producers had promised in advance: reach 350,000 viewers and there'll be a sequel. Two months after release it hit that number, and the sequel was on.","src":"FilmVandaag","url":"https://www.filmvandaag.nl/nieuws/22601-vervolg-aangekondigd-op-nederlandse-bioscoophit-loverboy-emoties-uit","say":{"en":"It's a heavy film — I needed a walk afterwards.","zh":"这片子很沉重，看完我得出去走走。"}},"《我的世界大电影》·荷兰":{"what":"好莱坞根据游戏《我的世界》（Minecraft）拍的真人电影，2025 年 4 月上映，杰森·莫玛和杰克·布莱克主演。","what_en":"Hollywood's live-action film of the game Minecraft, released in April 2025, starring Jason Momoa and Jack Black.","fame":"在荷兰是近一年票房第一。这一代荷兰年轻人几乎都在电脑上搭过方块房子，电影院里常常一边看一边笑一边喊。","fame_en":"It was the Netherlands' top-grossing film of the past year. Almost every young Dutch person has built a block house in the game, and screenings were full of laughing and shouting.","fact":"片里杰克·布莱克唱的一首小歌《Steve's Lava Chicken》在网上爆红，只有 30 多秒，成了史上最短进入英国单曲榜前 40 和美国公告牌百强单曲榜的歌。","fact_en":"A tiny song Jack Black sings in the film, \"Steve's Lava Chicken\", went viral. At just over 30 seconds, it became the shortest song ever to reach the UK Top 40 and the Billboard Hot 100.","src":"Wikipedia「A Minecraft Movie」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Minecraft_Movie","say":{"en":"Is there a Dutch-dubbed version, or just subtitles?","zh":"有荷兰语配音版吗，还是只有字幕？"}},"《爱情盲选：荷兰篇》":{"what":"Netflix 的荷兰恋爱真人秀，原名 Love is Blind: Netherlands：30 个单身的人隔着墙聊天，看不见对方就决定要不要订婚。","what_en":"Love is Blind: Netherlands, Netflix's Dutch dating reality show: 30 singles talk through a wall and decide whether to get engaged without ever seeing each other.","fame":"2026 年 9 月 30 日开播，10 月中旬冲上荷兰 Netflix 剧集周榜第一。主持人是荷兰观众很熟的 Nicolette van Dam 和 Bas Smit。","fame_en":"It premiered on 30 September 2026 and by mid-October was No. 1 on Netflix's weekly TV chart in the Netherlands. The hosts, Nicolette van Dam and Bas Smit, are familiar faces to Dutch viewers.","fact":"10 集不是一次放完，而是分三批：9 月 30 日第 1–5 集，10 月 7 日第 6–8 集，10 月 14 日第 9 集，团聚特辑另外再放——所以连着几个星期，大家每周都有新的可以聊。","fact_en":"The ten episodes weren't released all at once but in three batches: episodes 1–5 on 30 September, 6–8 on 7 October, and 9 on 14 October, with the reunion later — so for weeks, people had something new to talk about every week.","src":"Netflix 官方新闻，2026 年 9 月 15 日","url":"https://about.netflix.com/en/news/netflix-reveals-singles-of-dating-series-love-is-blind-netherlands","say":{"en":"Who do you think will say yes at the altar?","zh":"你觉得谁会在婚礼上说「我愿意」？"}},"苏珊与弗雷克":{"what":"荷兰东部的民谣流行二人组 Suzan & Freek：Suzan Stortelder 唱，Freek Rikkerink 唱和弹，用荷兰语写歌。","what_en":"Suzan & Freek, a folk-pop duo from the east of the Netherlands — Suzan Stortelder and Freek Rikkerink, who write and sing in Dutch.","fame":"2019 年《Als het avond is》拿下荷兰 Top 40 第一，之后几乎每首都是电台常客，阿姆斯特丹 Ziggo Dome 一开就满座；《Pijnstiller》（止痛药）是他们最近很火的歌。","fame_en":"\"Als het avond is\" hit No. 1 on the Dutch Top 40 in 2019; since then almost every song has been a radio staple, and their Ziggo Dome shows in Amsterdam sell out. \"Pijnstiller\" (Painkiller) is one of their recent hits.","fact":"他们宣布 2026 年 5 月在阿纳姆的 GelreDome 体育场开 10 场，一个星期全部卖光，加起来近 40 万张票；2026 年 1 月，他们还拿了荷兰流行音乐大奖 Popprijs。","fact_en":"They announced ten concerts at Arnhem's GelreDome for May 2026 and sold them all out within a week — nearly 400,000 tickets. In January 2026 they also won the Popprijs, the Dutch pop music prize.","src":"Hart van Nederland，2025 年 10 月 31 日；NOS，2026 年 1 月 17 日","url":"https://www.hartvannederland.nl/entertainment/muziek/artikelen/alle-tien-concerten-van-suzan-freek-in-gelredome-uitverkocht","say":{"en":"My Dutch friends know every Suzan & Freek song by heart.","zh":"我的荷兰朋友每首 Suzan & Freek 都会唱。"}},"《如果没人上钩》":{"what":"2025 年的挪威圣诞家庭片，原名 Hvis ingen går i fella（英文名 A Mouse Hunt for Christmas），导演是亨里克·马丁·达尔斯巴肯：平安夜，一家老鼠住在乡下的空房子里，突然来了人类——老鼠对人类，看谁赢得圣诞节。","what_en":"Hvis ingen går i fella (A Mouse Hunt for Christmas), a 2025 Norwegian Christmas family film directed by Henrik Martin Dahlsbakken: on Christmas Eve, a mouse family in an empty country house faces some human visitors — mice versus humans, and whoever wins gets Christmas.","fame":"又好笑又有动作戏，大人小孩都能看，11 月上映后一路演到圣诞节，成了挪威 2025 年观众最多的电影。","fame_en":"Funny and full of action, for kids and adults alike — it opened in November, played right through Christmas, and became the most-watched film in Norway in 2025.","fact":"它在挪威卖了 451,014 张票，比第二名《我的世界大电影》（431,904）多了将近两万；2025 年挪威观众最多的十部电影里，有六部是挪威本国片。","fact_en":"It sold 451,014 tickets in Norway — nearly 20,000 more than second-placed A Minecraft Movie (431,904). Six of Norway's ten most-watched films in 2025 were Norwegian.","src":"Film & Kino 年鉴 2025","url":"https://kino.no/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Arbok-2025-II-Film-Kino.pdf","say":{"en":"Is the mouse film OK for a five-year-old?","zh":"那部老鼠电影五岁小孩能看吗？"}},"《舞动奇迹（挪威版）》":{"what":"挪威 TV 2 的明星跳舞比赛，原名 Skal vi danse（我们跳舞吧），2006 年开播，照英国的《Strictly Come Dancing》做：名人搭专业舞者，评委打分加观众投票。","what_en":"Skal vi danse (Shall We Dance), Norway's celebrity dance contest on TV 2 since 2006, based on Britain's Strictly Come Dancing: stars pair with professional dancers and face the judges and the public vote.","fame":"2026 年是第 21 季，9 月 26 日起每周六晚上直播。周六一家人守着电视看谁跳得好、谁被淘汰，是很多挪威家庭的秋天习惯。","fame_en":"2026 is its 21st series, live every Saturday night from 26 September. Watching who dances best and who goes home is an autumn Saturday habit for many Norwegian families.","fact":"2026 年这一季的参赛者里有 21 岁的 Leah Behn——挪威国王哈拉尔五世的外孙女、王位第五顺位继承人；她说能上这个节目是个梦想，小时候的自己知道了一定会又惊又喜。","fact_en":"This year's contestants include 21-year-old Leah Behn — a granddaughter of King Harald V and fifth in line to the Norwegian throne. She called being on the show a dream, and said her younger self would have been shocked and thrilled.","src":"Dagbladet，2026 年 8 月 17 日；Wikipedia「Leah Isadora Behn」","url":"https://www.dagbladet.no/kjendis/disse-deltar/85022631","say":{"en":"Who got voted off last night?","zh":"昨晚谁被淘汰了？"}},"ULD":{"what":"挪威奥斯陆的女子民谣三人组：Une Lorentze Onarheim、Lucia Andreadatter Utnem、Dagny Braanen Lindgren，三个声音加钢琴和手风琴，用挪威语唱。","what_en":"ULD, a female folk trio from Oslo — Une Lorentze Onarheim, Lucia Andreadatter Utnem and Dagny Braanen Lindgren — three voices with piano and accordion, singing in Norwegian.","fame":"把北欧的老民谣唱成安静的流行歌，好几首同时在挪威 Top 50 上待了好几周；《Håper at du ser meg nå》（希望你现在能看见我）是她们最近很火的歌，演唱会常常办在教堂里。","fame_en":"They turn old Nordic folk into quiet pop — several songs sat in Norway's Top 50 at the same time for weeks. \"Håper at du ser meg nå\" (Hope you see me now) is a recent hit, and they often play in churches.","fact":"乐队名就是三个人名字的首字母 U、L、D。2024 年 10 月 18 日出的第一张专辑《From Another Reality》，第二年拿了挪威格莱美 Spellemann 奖三项提名，同一年还拿了 Edvard 奖和 Prøysen 奖。","fact_en":"The band name is simply their three initials: U, L, D. Their first album, From Another Reality (18 October 2024), earned three nominations at the 2025 Spellemann awards — Norway's Grammys — and the same year they won the Edvard Prize and the Prøysen Prize.","src":"Fjord Norway 活动介绍（ULD · St. Petri kirke）","url":"https://www.fjordnorway.com/en/events/uld--st-petri-kirke-jppwqm3th2bnkda4heha","say":{"en":"I don't understand the words, but their voices give me goosebumps.","zh":"歌词我听不懂，可她们的声音让我起鸡皮疙瘩。"}},"《克莱克斯学院》":{"what":"2024 年 1 月上映的波兰奇幻片，原名 Akademia pana Kleksa，导演马切伊·卡武尔斯基，托马什·科特演墨水点教授克莱克斯——改编自布热赫瓦写的波兰经典童话。","what_en":"Akademia pana Kleksa (Kleks Academy), a Polish fantasy film released in January 2024, directed by Maciej Kawulski, with Tomasz Kot as Professor Kleks — based on Jan Brzechwa's classic Polish children's story.","fame":"波兰几代人小时候都看过 1984 年的老版，这次爸妈带着孩子一起去，观众约 290 万人次，是疫情以后最卖座的波兰片之一。","fame_en":"Generations of Poles grew up with the 1984 version, so this time parents brought their kids — about 2.9 million admissions, one of the biggest Polish films since the pandemic.","fact":"正式上映前光是提前场就来了 43.8 万人，波兰票房史上没有哪部片子的提前场有这么多人。新版主角也换了：书里的男孩 Adaś，变成了女孩 Ada Niezgódka。","fact_en":"Before it officially opened, 438,000 people had already seen it at preview screenings — no film in Polish box-office history had drawn so many to previews. The hero changed too: the book's boy Adaś became a girl, Ada Niezgódka.","src":"ESKA.pl，2024 年 1 月 30 日","url":"https://www.eska.pl/cinema/news/pan-kleks-oczarowal-polskich-widzow-padl-absolutny-rekord-aa-LdHe-tTFt-pL7n.html","say":{"en":"I loved the old Kleks film as a kid — is the new one any good?","zh":"我小时候超爱老版的克莱克斯，新版好看吗？"}},"《我的世界大电影》·波兰":{"what":"好莱坞根据游戏《我的世界》（Minecraft）拍的真人电影，2025 年 4 月上映。","what_en":"Hollywood's live-action film of the game Minecraft, released in April 2025.","fame":"在波兰是近一年票房第一，总票房约 1650 万美元；爸妈陪孩子去，也有二十多岁的老玩家自己去。","fame_en":"It was Poland's top-grossing film of the past year, with about $16.5 million — parents went with their kids, and twenty-something gamers went on their own.","fact":"年轻观众把它变成了「一起喊」的电影：游戏里的梗一出现，全场欢呼、跳起来、扔爆米花。华纳干脆在 2025 年 5 月 2 日推出「Block Party」特别版，鼓励大家在电影院跟着唱、跟着玩梗。","fact_en":"Young audiences turned it into a shout-along film: whenever a famous game meme appeared, whole rooms cheered, jumped and threw popcorn. Warner Bros. leaned in with a special \"Block Party Edition\" on 2 May 2025, inviting fans to sing and meme along.","src":"Wikipedia「A Minecraft Movie」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Minecraft_Movie","say":{"en":"Fair warning: the Minecraft screening will be loud.","zh":"先说好：《我的世界》那场会很吵哦。"}},"《玩偶》":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年 9 月 16 日上线的 6 集波兰历史剧，原名 Lalka（The Doll），改编自博莱斯瓦夫·普鲁斯 1890 年出版的小说：商人沃库尔斯基爱上贵族小姐伊莎贝拉。","what_en":"Lalka (The Doll), a six-episode Polish historical drama released on Netflix on 16 September 2026, adapted from Bolesław Prus's 1890 novel: the merchant Wokulski falls for the aristocrat Izabela.","fame":"《玩偶》是波兰学生必读的经典，这一版服装布景很豪华，也改得很大胆，有人爱有人骂；在波兰连续好几周进榜。","fame_en":"The Doll is required reading for Polish students. This version is lavish and very free with the book — some love it, some hate it — and it stayed in Poland's charts for weeks.","fact":"两个星期里，波兰有了两部《玩偶》：9 月 16 日是 Netflix 剧集，9 月 30 日又有一部完全不同演员的电影版进了电影院。Netflix 这版最火的时候进了 60 多个国家的 Netflix 前十。","fact_en":"Poland got two Dolls in two weeks: the Netflix series on 16 September, and a completely different film version in cinemas on 30 September. At its peak, the Netflix series was in the Top 10 in more than 60 countries.","src":"Spider's Web，2026 年 9 月；Wikipedia「The Doll (TV series)」","url":"https://rozrywka.spidersweb.pl/lalka-netflix-premiera-nowosci-co-obejrzec-polski-serial","say":{"en":"Did you watch the series or the film version of Lalka?","zh":"《玩偶》你看的是剧集版还是电影版？"}},"男人之歌2026乐团":{"what":"波兰夏季巡回音乐节「Męskie Granie」（男人的演奏）每年组一支临时乐队，2026 年是 Igor Herbut、Zalia 和 Vito Bambino 三位歌手。","what_en":"Męskie Granie Orkiestra 2026 — every year the Polish summer concert tour Męskie Granie puts together a one-off band; in 2026 it's the singers Igor Herbut, Zalia and Vito Bambino.","fame":"每年乐队都会写一首「巡演主题曲」，在每场的最后大家一起唱；2026 年这首《Nareszcie》（终于）三个人一起写词，在波兰单曲榜拿了第一。","fame_en":"Each year the band writes the tour's anthem, sung by everyone at the end of every show. In 2026 it's \"Nareszcie\" (At Last), with words by all three, which went to No. 1 in Poland.","fact":"2026 年第一次在巡演开始前就出了两首歌：除了《Nareszcie》，还有《Tańczę》（我在跳舞），MV 是 Vito Bambino 自己导的，演员都是歌迷。","fact_en":"In 2026, for the first time, the band released two songs before the tour even began: besides \"Nareszcie\" there's \"Tańczę\" (I'm dancing), whose video was directed by Vito Bambino himself and stars fans.","src":"ESKA.pl，2026 年 5 月 27 日","url":"https://www.eska.pl/rozrywka/gwiazdy/meskie-granie-orkiestra-2026-niespodziewanie-z-drugim-singlem-tam-brzmi-tancze-aa-CaUi-F7nG-kDjZ.html","say":{"en":"Are you going to Męskie Granie this summer? Which city?","zh":"今年夏天你去男人之歌吗？哪个城市那场？"}},"《子弹与饼干：再来一件事》":{"what":"2024 年的葡萄牙喜剧，原名 Balas & Bolinhos: Só Mais Uma Coisa：几个老朋友人到中年，搬回爸妈家住，想再拼一次。导演、编剧、主演都是路易斯·伊斯梅尔（Luís Ismael）。","what_en":"Balas & Bolinhos: Só Mais Uma Coisa (Bullets & Cakes: Just One More Thing), a 2024 Portuguese comedy: a group of old friends, now middle-aged, move back in with their parents and try one more time. Luís Ismael writes, directs and stars.","fame":"2024 年 8 月 15 日上映，是葡萄牙这一年观众最多的本国片：约 24.9 万人次、157 万欧元，在全年所有电影里排第十。","fame_en":"Released on 15 August 2024, it was Portugal's most-watched home-grown film that year — about 249,000 admissions and €1.57 million, tenth among all films in the country.","fact":"这是一套从 2001 年就开始的系列：第一部《Balas & Bolinhos》就是路易斯·伊斯梅尔自编自导，他自己演 Tone。二十多年后，还是这帮「兄弟」回来了。","fact_en":"It's part of a series that started back in 2001: the first Balas & Bolinhos was also written and directed by Luís Ismael, who played Tone himself. More than twenty years later, the same gang is back.","src":"葡萄牙电影和视听研究所 ICA 2024 年统计；葡萄牙语维基「Balas & Bolinhos」","url":"https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Balas_%26_Bolinhos","say":{"en":"Is it funny if I haven't seen the first ones?","zh":"前几部没看过，这部也好笑吗？"}},"《星际宝贝》·葡萄牙":{"what":"迪士尼 2025 年把 2002 年动画《星际宝贝》（Lilo & Stitch）拍成的真人版：夏威夷小女孩莉罗收养了一只闯祸的蓝色外星「小狗」史迪奇。","what_en":"Disney's 2025 live-action remake of the 2002 cartoon Lilo & Stitch: a little Hawaiian girl, Lilo, adopts a chaotic blue alien \"dog\" called Stitch.","fame":"在葡萄牙是近一年票房第一；全世界票房过了 10 亿美元，是 2025 年第一部过 10 亿的好莱坞电影。看过 2002 年动画的爸妈，这回带着自己的孩子去看。","fame_en":"It was Portugal's top-grossing film of the past year, and worldwide it passed $1 billion — the first Hollywood film of 2025 to do so. Parents who grew up with the 2002 cartoon took their own kids this time.","fact":"它在美国阵亡将士纪念日那个四天长周末首映，收了约 1.83 亿美元，打破了这个周末的开画纪录；周一当天又卖了 3700 万美元，是美国电影史上第四高的周一。","fact_en":"It opened over America's four-day Memorial Day weekend with about $183 million, the biggest Memorial Day opening ever. On the Monday alone it took $37 million — the fourth-highest Monday in US box-office history.","src":"华特迪士尼公司新闻，2025 年 5 月 27 日","url":"https://thewaltdisneycompany.com/?p=31759","say":{"en":"Is it dubbed in Portuguese or with subtitles?","zh":"是葡萄牙语配音的，还是字幕版？"}},"希科·达蒂娜":{"what":"葡萄牙北部维亚纳堡的说唱歌手 Chico da Tina，本名 Francisco，以前是玩滑板的，自称「米尼奥的 trap 明星」。","what_en":"Chico da Tina, a rapper from Viana do Castelo in northern Portugal — real name Francisco, a former skater who calls himself the \"trap star of the Minho\".","fame":"他把美国的 trap 说唱，和葡萄牙北部乡下的手风琴、方言、庙会、马市混在一起，又土又酷，演唱会上年轻人跟着跳；《Pega ou Larga》是他最近很火的歌。","fame_en":"He mixes American trap with the accordion, dialect, village festivals and horse fairs of rural northern Portugal — rustic and cool at once — and young crowds dance along at his shows. \"Pega ou Larga\" is one of his recent hits.","fact":"名字里的「Tina」就是 concertina（手风琴）的简称——他一开始就背着手风琴在聚会上唱。2019 年 7 月他拿了第一届葡萄牙 Mimo 音乐奖，从这时开始出名。","fact_en":"The \"Tina\" in his name is short for concertina — he started out singing at parties with an accordion. In July 2019 he won the first Portuguese Mimo Music Prize, which is when people started to notice him.","src":"Observador；Sábado，2019 年 7 月 21 日","url":"https://observador.pt/especiais/chico-da-tina-quem-da-mais-por-este-relicario/","say":{"en":"Wait, is that an accordion in a rap song?","zh":"等等，说唱里怎么有手风琴？"}},"《最后的旅程》":{"what":"2024 年的瑞典纪录片，原名 Den sista resan：主持人菲利普·哈马尔和老搭档弗雷德里克·维金松，带着菲利普退休后变得消沉的爸爸 Lars，开车去法国，想让他重新开心起来。","what_en":"Den sista resan (The Last Journey), a 2024 Swedish documentary: TV duo Filip Hammar and Fredrik Wikingsson take Filip's father Lars, who has grown low and withdrawn since retiring, on a road trip to France to bring back his joy.","fame":"又好笑又让人哭，很多人带爸妈一起去看；观众超过 40 万人次，是瑞典的奥斯卡参赛片，还拿了瑞典金甲虫奖最佳纪录片。","fame_en":"Funny and tear-jerking — many people took their parents. It drew over 400,000 cinema-goers, was Sweden's Oscar entry, and won the Guldbagge award for best documentary.","fact":"上映不到两个月、观众到 315,440 人时，它就打破了斯特凡·雅尔的《Ett anständigt liv》保持的纪录，成了瑞典电影院里看的人最多的纪录片。","fact_en":"Less than two months after release, at 315,440 viewers, it broke the record held by Stefan Jarl's Ett anständigt liv, becoming the most-watched documentary ever in Swedish cinemas.","src":"MovieZine","url":"https://www.moviezine.se/nyheter/biorekord-den-sista-resan-storsta-dokumentaren-genom-tiderna","say":{"en":"Bring tissues — and maybe bring your dad.","zh":"带上纸巾——最好也带上你爸。"}},"《我的世界大电影》·瑞典":{"what":"好莱坞根据游戏《我的世界》（Minecraft）拍的真人电影，2025 年 4 月上映。","what_en":"Hollywood's live-action film of the game Minecraft, released in April 2025.","fame":"在瑞典是近一年票房第一，而且对瑞典人来说有点「主场」的意思：Minecraft 就是斯德哥尔摩的 Mojang 工作室做出来的，是史上卖得最多的电子游戏。","fame_en":"It was Sweden's top-grossing film of the past year — and for Swedes it felt like a home game: Minecraft was made by Mojang in Stockholm, and it's the best-selling video game of all time.","fact":"这部电影在美国和瑞典是同一天上映的（2025 年 4 月 4 日）；做游戏的公司 Mojang，名字来自瑞典语 mojäng，意思是「小玩意儿」。","fact_en":"The film opened in the US and Sweden on the same day, 4 April 2025. Mojang, the studio behind the game, takes its name from the Swedish word mojäng — \"gadget\".","src":"Wikipedia「A Minecraft Movie」「Mojang Studios」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mojang_Studios","say":{"en":"Did you know Minecraft was made here in Stockholm?","zh":"你知道 Minecraft 是斯德哥尔摩这儿做出来的吗？"}},"《瑞典歌唱大赛》":{"what":"瑞典电视台 SVT 每年的歌唱比赛 Melodifestivalen（大家叫它 Mello），用来选谁代表瑞典去欧洲歌唱大赛。","what_en":"Melodifestivalen — \"Mello\" to Swedes — the yearly song contest on SVT that picks Sweden's entry for the Eurovision Song Contest.","fame":"每年二三月的周六晚上，瑞典人开派对一起看、一起投票。2026 年决赛在斯德哥尔摩的 Strawberry Arena，约 278.5 万人收看——瑞典人口才 1000 多万；冠军 Felicia 去维也纳代表瑞典。","fame_en":"On Saturday nights in February and March, Swedes throw parties to watch and vote. The 2026 final at Stockholm's Strawberry Arena drew about 2.785 million viewers in a country of just over 10 million; the winner, Felicia, went to Vienna for Sweden.","fact":"比赛从 1959 年就开始办了。ABBA 就是从这里走出去的：1974 年的《Waterloo》先在 Mello 赢了，再拿下欧洲歌唱大赛冠军；2005 年它被票选为 Mello 有史以来最受欢迎的歌。","fact_en":"It has run since 1959. ABBA came out of it: \"Waterloo\" won Mello in 1974 before winning Eurovision, and in 2005 it was voted the most popular Melodifestivalen song of all time.","src":"Wikipedia「Melodifestivalen」；Eurovoix，2026 年 3 月","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melodifestivalen","say":{"en":"Are you having a Mello party on Saturday?","zh":"周六你家开 Mello 派对吗？"}},"维克多·莱克塞尔":{"what":"瑞典流行歌手 Victor Leksell，1997 年生在哥德堡旁边的 Torslanda，用瑞典语唱情歌。","what_en":"Victor Leksell, a Swedish pop singer born in 1997 in Torslanda near Gothenburg, who sings love songs in Swedish.","fame":"2020 年的《Svag》在瑞典单曲榜连续七周第一，拿了九白金；2026 年和 Molly Sandén 合唱的《Tänk om》（如果）一出来就冲到瑞典榜第一，同年 9 月在哥德堡 Azaleadalen 公园开了一场演唱会。","fame_en":"\"Svag\" (2020) spent seven straight weeks at No. 1 in Sweden and went nine times platinum. In 2026 his duet with Molly Sandén, \"Tänk om\" (What if), went straight to No. 1, and that September he played an open-air show at Azaleadalen park in Gothenburg.","fact":"他 2017 年参加瑞典《Idol》选秀，只进了前 21 名就被淘汰；三年后才凭《Svag》翻身。2020 年 5 月疫情期间，他还和挪威歌手 Astrid S 站在挪威和瑞典的国界线上合唱这首歌。","fact_en":"On Sweden's Idol in 2017 he only made the top 21 before being voted off; three years later \"Svag\" turned it around. In May 2020, during the pandemic, he sang it with Norwegian singer Astrid S standing right on the Norway–Sweden border.","src":"Wikipedia「Victor Leksell」","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victor_Leksell","say":{"en":"Is Victor Leksell playing in Stockholm this year?","zh":"Victor Leksell 今年来斯德哥尔摩开演唱会吗？"}},"《并肩》":{"what":"2025 年 11 月上映的土耳其喜剧，全名长得出名：Soyut Dışavurumcu Bir Dostluğun Anatomisi Veyahut Yan Yana（一段抽象表现主义友谊的解剖，或曰：并肩）；哈鲁克·比尔吉内尔和费亚兹·伊伊特主演。","what_en":"A Turkish comedy released in November 2025, with a famously long full title: Soyut Dışavurumcu Bir Dostluğun Anatomisi Veyahut Yan Yana (Anatomy of an Abstract Expressionist Friendship, or: Side by Side), starring Haluk Bilginer and Feyyaz Yiğit.","fame":"一个瘫痪的富翁和他请来的「不靠谱」护工成了朋友——老戏骨加喜剧明星，全家都能看；观众约 254 万人次，是土耳其近年最卖座的本国片。","fame_en":"A paralysed rich man and the unlikely carer he hires become friends — a veteran actor plus a comedy star, something the whole family can watch. It drew about 2.54 million viewers, the biggest Turkish film in recent years.","fact":"它是土耳其电影史上第一部在 IMAX 上映的本国片；首个周末 203,907 名观众，是 2025 年土耳其本国片最好的开画。","fact_en":"It was the first Turkish film ever released in IMAX, and its opening weekend of 203,907 viewers was the best for any Turkish film in 2025.","src":"Beyazperde，2025 年 11 月","url":"https://www.beyazperde.com/haberler/filmler/haberler-1000175922/","say":{"en":"Haluk Bilginer is brilliant in Yan Yana — you have to see it.","zh":"哈鲁克·比尔吉内尔在《并肩》里演得太好了，你一定要看。"}},"《并肩》·土耳其":{"what":"土耳其喜剧《Yan Yana》（并肩）：坐轮椅的富翁 Refik 和护工 Ferruh 之间的友情，2025 年 11 月上映。","what_en":"Yan Yana (Side by Side), a Turkish comedy about the friendship between Refik, a rich man in a wheelchair, and his carer Ferruh — released in November 2025.","fame":"在土耳其是近一年票房第一，压过了所有好莱坞大片；下片以后 2026 年 4 月上了 Netflix，又冲到土耳其 Netflix 第一。","fame_en":"It was Turkey's top-grossing film of the past year, beating every Hollywood blockbuster, and when it moved to Netflix in April 2026 it went straight to No. 1 there too.","fact":"它翻拍自 2011 年的法国电影《触不可及》（Intouchables）：Refik 是玩滑翔伞出事故后瘫痪的，在电影院一共卖了将近 300 万张票。","fact_en":"It's a remake of the 2011 French film Intouchables: Refik was paralysed in a paragliding accident. In cinemas it sold close to 3 million tickets.","src":"DonanımHaber，2026 年 4 月 20 日","url":"https://www.donanimhaber.com/haluk-bilginer-ve-feyyaz-yigit-li-yan-yana-netflix-te-yayinlandi--204683","say":{"en":"Have you seen the French original? Which one did you like more?","zh":"你看过法国原版吗？更喜欢哪一部？"}},"《墓地》":{"what":"Netflix 的土耳其犯罪剧，原名 Mezarlık（墓地）：伊斯坦布尔警局新成立一个专门查女性被害案的小组，由女警长 Önem（比尔杰·阿卡莱 Birce Akalay 演）带队。","what_en":"Mezarlık (Graveyard), a Turkish Netflix crime series: Istanbul police set up a new unit to investigate murders of women, led by Chief Inspector Önem (Birce Akalay).","fame":"节奏紧、题材沉重，说的是土耳其社会很在意的女性安全问题；2026 年 10 月在 JustWatch 土耳其剧集周榜排第四。","fame_en":"Tense and heavy, it deals with the safety of women — an issue many in Turkey care deeply about. In October 2026 it was No. 4 on JustWatch's weekly series chart in Turkey.","fact":"三季隔得很久：第一季 2022 年 6 月，第二季等到 2025 年 2 月，第三季 2026 年 8 月 28 日全世界同时上线——这一季的案子从寄给女性的神秘盒子开始。","fact_en":"The seasons came far apart: season one in June 2022, season two not until February 2025, and season three worldwide on 28 August 2026 — this time starting with mysterious boxes sent to women.","src":"Netflix 官方新闻，2026 年 8 月 18 日；土耳其语维基「Mezarlık」","url":"https://about.netflix.com/tr/news/netflix-releases-official-season-3-trailer-for-highly-anticipated-series-graveyard","say":{"en":"Is Mezarlık too dark to watch before bed?","zh":"《墓地》睡前看会不会太吓人？"}},"布洛克3":{"what":"土耳其说唱歌手 BLOK3（本名 Hakan Aydın），这几年在年轻人里火得很快。","what_en":"BLOK3 (real name Hakan Aydın), a Turkish rapper who has shot to fame among young people in the last few years.","fame":"三年前几乎没人知道他，2025 年却成了土耳其 Spotify 听得最多的歌手；《Sebebi Yar》是他最近很火的歌，伊斯坦布尔街上的车里、手机里到处在放。","fame_en":"Three years ago almost nobody knew him; in 2025 he was the most-streamed artist on Spotify in Turkey. \"Sebebi Yar\" is one of his recent hits, playing from cars and phones all over Istanbul.","fact":"2025 年土耳其 Spotify 年度榜上，歌手第一和歌曲第一都是他——听得最多的歌是他的《Sevmeyi Denemedin》（你没试过去爱）；第二名歌手是 Ati242。","fact_en":"On Spotify Turkey's 2025 Wrapped, he topped both the artist and the song charts — the year's most-streamed song was his \"Sevmeyi Denemedin\" (You never tried to love), with Ati242 the second most-streamed artist.","src":"Sözcü，2025 年 12 月 4 日","url":"https://www.sozcu.com.tr/3-yil-once-kimse-tanimiyordu-2025-in-en-cok-dinlenen-ismi-oldu-p266269","say":{"en":"Who's this? It's everywhere in Istanbul right now.","zh":"这是谁的歌？现在伊斯坦布尔到处在放。"}},"《有点不一样：燃起来吧！》":{"what":"印尼喜剧片《Agak Laen》的续集，还是那四个北苏门答腊出身的脱口秀演员，2025 年 11 月 27 日上映。","what_en":"The sequel to the Indonesian comedy Agak Laen, starring the same four stand-up comedians with North Sumatran roots; it opened on 27 November 2025.","fame":"在印尼电影院卖了约 1100 万张票，2026 年初超过《复仇者联盟4》，成了印尼影史观影人次最多的电影。","fame_en":"It sold about 11 million tickets in Indonesia and in early 2026 overtook Avengers: Endgame to become the most-watched film ever in Indonesian cinemas.","fact":"「Agak Laen」本来是这四个人一起录的搞笑播客，聊他们生活里「有点不一样」的事，后来才拍成了电影。","fact_en":"Agak Laen started life as a comedy podcast the four recorded together about the 'a bit different' things in their lives — the films came later.","src":"Wikipedia：Agak Laen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agak_Laen","say":{"en":"Have you seen Agak Laen 2 yet? Everyone at work keeps quoting it.","zh":"你看《Agak Laen 2》了吗？同事们天天在学里面的话。"}},"《大块头》":{"what":"印尼本国做的动画电影，讲一个被同学叫「大块头」的胖男孩 Don，想用爸妈留下的故事书去参加才艺表演。","what_en":"An Indonesian-made animated film about Don, a chubby boy nicknamed 'Jumbo', who wants to stage a show at a talent contest using the storybook his late parents left him.","fame":"2025 年 3 月底上映，观影人次超过 1000 万，打败《冰雪奇缘2》成为印尼最卖座的动画片，也是东南亚最卖座的动画片；年底上了 Netflix。","fame_en":"Released at the end of March 2025, it drew over 10 million viewers, beating Frozen II as Indonesia's biggest animated film and becoming Southeast Asia's highest-grossing animation; it reached Netflix at the end of the year.","fact":"这是导演 Ryan Adriandhy 的第一部长片，从 2019 年开始做，前后差不多五年才做完。","fact_en":"It was director Ryan Adriandhy's first feature, and took about five years to make, with work starting in 2019.","src":"Dafunda","url":"https://global.dafunda.com/movies/interesting-facts-about-jumbo","say":{"en":"My kid wants to watch Jumbo again. Is it still on in cinemas?","zh":"我家孩子还想再看一遍《Jumbo》，电影院还在放吗？"}},"《Doctor X：白色黑手党时代》":{"what":"韩国 SBS 的医疗黑色剧，金智媛演一个只靠手术刀说话的天才外科医生，跟医院里的权力斗。","what_en":"A Korean SBS medical noir in which Kim Ji-won plays a genius surgeon who lets her scalpel do the talking while fighting the power games inside a hospital.","fame":"2026 年 10 月 9 日开播，SBS 和 Netflix 同一天上线，印尼观众也在 Netflix 上跟着韩国同步追。","fame_en":"It premiered on 9 October 2026 on SBS and Netflix the same day, so viewers in Indonesia follow it on Netflix at the same pace as Korea.","fact":"它是翻拍日本朝日电视台的《X医生：外科医生大门未知子》——日本原版从 2012 年演到现在，主角那句「我不会失败」家喻户晓。","fact_en":"It is a remake of TV Asahi's Japanese hit Doctor-X, which has run since 2012 and made its heroine's line 'I never fail' famous across Japan.","src":"SBS Star","url":"https://sbsstar.net/article/N1008335077/sbs-assembles-alist-cast-for-2026-doctor-x-kim-jiwonlee-jungeunson-hyunjookim-wooseok","say":{"en":"Are you watching Doctor X? I can't believe she did that surgery!","zh":"你在追《Doctor X》吗？她居然做了那台手术！"}},"埃瑙":{"what":"印尼创作歌手 eńau，歌安静、贴着日常写。","what_en":"eńau is an Indonesian singer-songwriter whose quiet songs stick close to everyday life.","fame":"2026 年初和弟弟、独立乐队 Fourtwnty 的主唱 Ari Lesmana 合唱《Sesi Potret》（拍照时间），在印尼的流媒体上很多人听。","fame_en":"In early 2026 she released 'Sesi Potret' ('Photo Session') with her brother Ari Lesmana, frontman of the indie band Fourtwnty, and it caught on across Indonesian streaming.","fact":"《Sesi Potret》是姐弟俩第一次一起出歌，媒体说这首歌是在提醒人：趁还来得及，多陪陪身边的人。","fact_en":"'Sesi Potret' was the siblings' first song together; the press described it as a reminder to make time for the people around you before it's too late.","src":"KapanLagi，2026","url":"https://www.kapanlagi.com/ari-lesmana/berita/","say":{"en":"Do you know eńau? Her new song with her brother is so soft.","zh":"你知道 eńau 吗？她跟她弟弟的新歌好温柔。"}},"《杜兰达尔2：复仇》":{"what":"印度宝莱坞间谍动作片《Dhurandhar》的第二部，兰维尔·辛格主演，导演阿迪亚·达尔，2026 年 3 月 19 日上映。","what_en":"The second Dhurandhar film, a Bollywood spy-action movie starring Ranveer Singh and directed by Aditya Dhar, released on 19 March 2026.","fame":"上映 11 天全球票房就到约 136.5 亿卢比，超过了第一部的总票房，是印地语电影里赚得最快的之一。","fame_en":"Within 11 days it took about ₹1,365 crore worldwide, passing the first film's entire run — one of the fastest earners in Hindi cinema.","fact":"第一部 2025 年 12 月才上映，第二部只隔了三个半月就接着上了。","fact_en":"The first film only came out in December 2025; the sequel followed just three and a half months later.","src":"The Hollywood Reporter India","url":"https://www.hollywoodreporterindia.com/features/insight/dhurandhar-2-box-office-ranveer-singh-aditya-dhars-film-grosses-1365-crore-globally-breaks-part-ones-lifetime-collection-in-11-days","say":{"en":"Shall we book Dhurandhar 2 for Saturday? The evening shows sell out fast.","zh":"周六去看《杜兰达尔2》吗？晚场卖得很快。"}},"《杜兰达尔》":{"what":"印度宝莱坞间谍动作片，兰维尔·辛格演一个潜入巴基斯坦卡拉奇黑帮的印度特工，2025 年 12 月 5 日上映。","what_en":"A Bollywood spy-action film in which Ranveer Singh plays an Indian agent who infiltrates Karachi's gangs, released on 5 December 2025.","fame":"上映三周国内票房就超过《Chhaava》，成了 2025 年最卖座的印地语电影。","fame_en":"Within three weeks it overtook Chhaava as the biggest Hindi film of 2025 at home.","fact":"它的全球票房后来破了 100 亿卢比（1000 crore），是印度第 9 部做到这件事的电影。","fact_en":"Its worldwide gross later passed ₹10 billion (₹1,000 crore), making it only the ninth Indian film ever to do so.","src":"Gulf News","url":"https://gulfnews.com/entertainment/dhurandhar-breaks-rs-10-billion-worldwide-becomes-indias-9th-film-to-make-box-office-history-1.500390905","say":{"en":"Is Dhurandhar worth it? I heard it's really long.","zh":"《杜兰达尔》值得看吗？听说片子特别长。"}},"《印度大卡皮尔秀 第5季》":{"what":"印度喜剧演员卡皮尔·夏尔马在 Netflix 上主持的喜剧访谈节目，每期请明星来聊天、被逗笑。","what_en":"The comedy talk show Indian comedian Kapil Sharma hosts on Netflix, where celebrity guests come to chat and get roasted.","fame":"卡皮尔在印度电视上做喜剧访谈十几年，2024 年搬到 Netflix 后一季接一季地拍，每季都有大明星来。","fame_en":"Kapil spent over a decade doing comedy talk shows on Indian TV; since moving to Netflix in 2024 the show has rolled out season after season, each with big-name guests.","fact":"第二季（2024 年）的嘉宾里，除了宝莱坞明星，还有板球明星罗希特·夏尔马和英国歌手艾德·希兰。","fact_en":"Season 2 in 2024 brought in not just Bollywood stars but cricketer Rohit Sharma and British singer Ed Sheeran.","src":"Deccan Herald，2024","url":"https://deccanherald.com/entertainment/season-two-of-the-great-indian-kapil-show-to-premiere-on-september-21-3185739","say":{"en":"Did you watch this week's Kapil Show? Who was the guest?","zh":"你看这周的卡皮尔秀了吗？请的是谁？"}},"阿努夫·贾因":{"what":"印度创作歌手 Anuv Jain，抱着吉他唱很轻的印地语情歌。","what_en":"Anuv Jain is an Indian singer-songwriter who sings soft Hindi love songs with an acoustic guitar.","fame":"2023 年的《Husn》是 2024 年印度流媒体上听得最多的独立歌曲；2025 年 8 月在 Coke Studio Bharat 唱的《Arz Kiya Hai》冲上 Spotify 印度榜第一。","fame_en":"His 2023 single 'Husn' became India's most-streamed indie song of 2024, and 'Arz Kiya Hai', sung on Coke Studio Bharat in August 2025, went to No. 1 on Spotify India.","fact":"《Arz Kiya Hai》是 Coke Studio Bharat 第一首登上 Spotify 印度热歌榜第一的歌，过了一年还在榜首附近。","fact_en":"'Arz Kiya Hai' was the first Coke Studio Bharat song ever to top Spotify India's chart, and a year later it was still sitting near the top.","src":"Wikipedia：Anuv Jain","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anuv_Jain","say":{"en":"Put on some Anuv Jain — it's a rainy evening.","zh":"放点 Anuv Jain 吧，下雨的晚上正合适。"}},"《鬼灭之刃：无限城篇 第一章 猗窝座再袭》":{"what":"日本人气动画《鬼灭之刃》最终决战「无限城篇」三部剧场版的第一部，2025 年 7 月在日本上映。","what_en":"The first of three films covering the final 'Infinity Castle' battle of the hit anime Demon Slayer, released in Japan in July 2025.","fame":"头三天票房 55 亿日元，打破日本开画纪录；日本票房约 400 亿日元，在美国也连续两周拿下周末票房第一。","fame_en":"It took over ¥5.5 billion in its first three days, a Japanese opening record, earned around ¥40 billion in Japan, and topped the US box office two weekends running.","fact":"2025 年 11 月，它成了第一部全球票房超过 1000 亿日元的日本电影。","fact_en":"In November 2025 it became the first Japanese film ever to pass ¥100 billion at the global box office.","src":"nippon.com，2025","url":"https://www.nippon.com/en/news/l00372/","say":{"en":"Have you seen Infinity Castle yet? Which fight did you like best?","zh":"《无限城篇》你看了吗？最喜欢哪一场打斗？"}},"《爱之里 第三季》":{"what":"Netflix 日本的恋爱真人秀，三十多岁到六十多岁的单身男女住在乡下一起干活过日子，找「人生最后的恋爱」。","what_en":"A Netflix Japan dating reality show in which single men and women from their mid-30s to their 60s live and work together in the countryside, looking for 'the last love of their lives'.","fame":"大家的离婚、丧偶这些过去都慢慢说出来，比年轻人的恋爱综艺更真实；第三季 2026 年 10 月 6 日开播，每周二更新。","fame_en":"The cast slowly open up about divorce, losing a partner and other pasts, which makes it feel more real than youth dating shows; season 3 started on 6 October 2026 with new episodes every Tuesday.","fact":"第三季的舞台搬到了富士山脚下：住户们一边自己动手改造一栋红色的老房子，一边过半自给自足的共同生活。","fact_en":"Season 3 moved to the foot of Mount Fuji, where the residents renovate an old red house themselves while living together half self-sufficiently.","src":"Netflix Japan，2026","url":"https://about.netflix.com/ja/news/love-village-3-trailer","say":{"en":"Are you watching Ainosato? I'm rooting for the quiet guy.","zh":"你在看《爱之里》吗？我支持那个不爱说话的大叔。"}},"Mrs. GREEN APPLE（绿苹果夫人）":{"what":"日本三人乐队，主唱大森元贵写歌，歌又亮又快。","what_en":"A Japanese three-piece band whose frontman Motoki Omori writes bright, fast songs.","fame":"2025 年是他们的一年：《Lilac》是日本全年播放最多的歌，Billboard Japan 年度流媒体榜前五名全是他们。","fame_en":"2025 was their year: 'Lilac' was Japan's most-streamed song, and they filled the entire top five of Billboard Japan's year-end streaming chart.","fact":"2025 年 7 月，他们成了第一个在日本国内累计播放超过 100 亿次的 J-pop 艺人。","fact_en":"In July 2025 they became the first J-pop act to pass 10 billion cumulative streams in Japan.","src":"Billboard","url":"https://www.billboard.com/music/music-news/mrs-green-apple-first-jpop-act-10-billion-streams-1236013952","say":{"en":"Which Mrs. GREEN APPLE song is your favourite? I can't stop playing Lilac.","zh":"你最喜欢 Mrs. GREEN APPLE 哪首？我一直在放《Lilac》。"}},"《传统》":{"what":"哈萨克斯坦的恐怖片《Дәстүр》（传统），导演库阿内什·贝塞克，故事发生在草原上一个被人遗忘的村子里。","what_en":"Dästür ('Tradition') is a Kazakh horror film by director Kuanysh Beisek, set in a forgotten village out on the steppe.","fame":"它是 2024 年哈萨克斯坦最卖座的本国电影，票房约 17–20 亿坚戈；以前排第一的都是喜剧，这是第一次由恐怖片拿下。","fame_en":"It was Kazakhstan's biggest home-grown film of 2024, taking roughly 1.7–2 billion tenge — the first time a horror film rather than a comedy came out on top.","fact":"电影 2023 年 12 月 28 日上映，跨年那一周就成了全国票房第一，上映一周票房就超过 10 亿坚戈。","fact_en":"It opened on 28 December 2023, was the country's top film over New Year week, and passed 1 billion tenge within its first week.","src":"Kazinform","url":"https://www.inform.kz/ru/samiy-kassoviy-film-novogodney-nedeli-dastur-9d36f6","say":{"en":"Have you seen Dästür? I heard people were screaming in the cinema.","zh":"你看过《传统》吗？听说电影院里大家都在尖叫。"}},"萨德拉丁":{"what":"哈萨克斯坦奇姆肯特出身的歌手 Sadraddin（萨德拉丁·博拉特），用哈萨克语唱抒情流行歌。","what_en":"Sadraddin (Sadraddin Bolat) is a singer from Shymkent, Kazakhstan, who sings heartfelt pop in Kazakh.","fame":"2024 年拿了 Ticketon 年度哈萨克斯坦艺人和国家青年「Daryn」奖；2026 年的专辑《ZEIIN》里有和 Bakr 合唱的《Sagynysh》（想念）。","fame_en":"In 2024 he won Kazakhstan Artist of the Year at the Ticketon Awards and the state 'Daryn' youth prize; his 2026 album ZEIIN includes 'Sagynysh' ('Longing') with Bakr.","fact":"2024 年秋天他把阿拉木图中央体育场坐满了，在他之前只有迪玛希做到过。","fact_en":"In autumn 2024 he filled Almaty's Central Stadium — before him, only Dimash had done that.","src":"Forbes Kazakhstan","url":"https://forbes.kz/articles/zhurttyn-balasy-kazahstanskogo-shou-biznesa-355d3d","say":{"en":"Do you listen to Sadraddin? My Kazakh friends play him on every road trip.","zh":"你听 Sadraddin 吗？我的哈萨克朋友每次自驾都放他的歌。"}},"梵达":{"what":"柬埔寨说唱歌手 VannDa，把高棉传统乐器和唱腔放进嘻哈里。","what_en":"VannDa is a Cambodian rapper who weaves traditional Khmer instruments and singing into hip-hop.","fame":"2021 年跟高棉传统乐师 Kong Nay 大师合作的《Time to Rise》红遍东南亚；《Golden Land》出自他三部曲概念专辑《Treyvisai》，「金色土地」就是柬埔寨的高棉语名字 Sovannaphum。","fame_en":"His 2021 hit 'Time to Rise' with Khmer master musician Kong Nay swept Southeast Asia; 'Golden Land' comes from his three-part concept album Treyvisai — 'golden land', Sovannaphum, is a Khmer name for Cambodia.","fact":"2022 年 10 月，《Time to Rise》的 MV 在 YouTube 上破了 1 亿次播放，是第一个做到的柬埔寨艺人。","fact_en":"In October 2022 the 'Time to Rise' video passed 100 million YouTube views — the first Cambodian artist ever to do so.","src":"Wikipedia：Vannda","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vannda","say":{"en":"Have you heard VannDa? He mixes old Khmer music with rap.","zh":"你听过 VannDa 吗？他把高棉老音乐和说唱混在一起。"}},"《与王同住的男人》":{"what":"韩国古装片，讲朝鲜少年国王端宗被废、流放到宁越山村，和村长严兴道一起生活的故事；朴志训演端宗，柳海真演村长。","what_en":"A Korean period film about the deposed boy-king Danjong, exiled to a mountain village in Yeongwol, and the village head Eom Heung-do who lives alongside him; Park Ji-hoon plays Danjong and Yoo Hai-jin the village head.","fame":"2026 年 2 月上映，观影人次超过 1600 万，排在《鸣梁》《极限职业》之后，是韩国影史第三部破 1600 万的电影。","fame_en":"Released in February 2026, it passed 16 million admissions — only the third film in Korean history to do so, after The Admiral: Roaring Currents and Extreme Job.","fact":"CGV 统计，看这部电影的人里约有 8% 是「N 次观看」：5.2% 看了两次，3% 看了三次以上。","fact_en":"CGV found about 8% of its audience were repeat viewers: 5.2% saw it twice and 3% three times or more.","src":"体育京乡，2026","url":"https://sports.khan.co.kr/article/202604051107003","say":{"en":"I cried at the end of The King's Warden. Bring tissues.","zh":"《与王同住的男人》最后我哭了，记得带纸巾。"}},"《疯狂动物城2》·韩国":{"what":"迪士尼动画《疯狂动物城》第二部，兔子警官朱迪和狐狸尼克又要一起破案，2025 年 11 月底上映。","what_en":"Disney's Zootopia 2, in which rabbit cop Judy and fox Nick team up on a new case; it opened at the end of November 2025.","fame":"在韩国五天就到 200 万观影人次，上映 23 天成了 2025 年全年票房第一，最后超过 800 万，排到韩国动画片历史第四。","fame_en":"In Korea it reached 2 million admissions in five days, became 2025's top film on day 23, and went past 8 million — fourth among animated films ever released in Korea.","fact":"这是迪士尼动画第一次拿下韩国年度票房冠军。","fact_en":"It was the first time a Disney animation had ever been Korea's number one film of the year.","src":"Cine Play","url":"https://www.cineplay.co.kr/en-us/articles/24066","say":{"en":"Two tickets for Zootopia 2, please. Somewhere in the middle.","zh":"两张《疯狂动物城2》，要中间的位子。"}},"《Doctor X：白色黑手党时代》·韩国":{"what":"SBS 周五周六晚上的医疗黑色剧，金智媛演天才外科医生桂秀晶，李姃垠、孙贤周、金宇硕一起演，一共 12 集。","what_en":"SBS's Friday-Saturday medical noir: Kim Ji-won plays genius surgeon Gye Su-jeong, alongside Lee Jung-eun, Son Hyun-joo and Kim Woo-seok, over 12 episodes.","fame":"2026 年 10 月 9 日开播，SBS 和 Netflix 同步；开播后在韩国 Netflix 剧集榜连续两周第一，是现在大家最常聊的剧之一。","fame_en":"It premiered on 9 October 2026 on SBS and Netflix together, topped Netflix's Korea TV chart for two straight weeks, and is one of the most talked-about shows right now.","fact":"收视一集比一集高：首播全国收视率 11.4%，第二集 14.9%，第三集就超过了 15.1%；还拿下了 Netflix 全球非英语剧集周榜第一。","fact_en":"Its ratings climbed every week: 11.4% nationwide for the premiere, 14.9% for episode two and over 15.1% by episode three — and it took No. 1 on Netflix's global weekly Top 10 for non-English shows.","src":"体育京乡，2026","url":"https://sports.khan.co.kr/en/article/202610171015007","say":{"en":"Doctor X is on tonight at 9:50. Don't text me during it!","zh":"今晚 9 点 50 有《Doctor X》，看的时候别给我发消息！"}},"瑞森（RESCENE）":{"what":"韩国五人女团 RESCENE（리센느），The Muze 娱乐公司 2024 年推出。","what_en":"RESCENE (리센느) is a five-member Korean girl group launched by The Muze Entertainment in 2024.","fame":"2024 年 8 月发的《LOVE ATTACK》当时没大红，快两年后突然逆袭，2026 年 7 月冲上 Melon TOP100 第一，Melon 还把她们评为 2026 上半年最亮眼的艺人。","fame_en":"'LOVE ATTACK', released in August 2024, didn't take off at first — then nearly two years later it surged to No. 1 on Melon's TOP100 in July 2026, and Melon named them the standout act of the first half of 2026.","fact":"逆袭是从一个成员个人频道里的一句「巨济 Yaho」开始的，这句话变成网络梗，把两年前的老歌带回了榜首。","fact_en":"The comeback started with a single phrase, 'Geoje Yaho', on a member's personal channel; it became a meme and carried the two-year-old song back to the top.","src":"SBS Star","url":"https://sbsstar.net/article/N1008613912/a-single-phrase-geoje-yaho-sparks-a-chart-resurgence-for-a-twoyearold-song","say":{"en":"Did you see RESCENE's comeback? That song was out two years ago!","zh":"你看到 RESCENE 逆袭了吗？那首歌两年前就出了！"}},"婷拉":{"what":"老挝歌手 Thinla（以前叫 Thinlamphone），2021 年开始发歌。","what_en":"Thinla (formerly Thinlamphone) is a Lao singer who has been releasing music since 2021.","fame":"她的《BAE》在老挝的选拔节目《Sieng Lao: The One》里被观众网上投票选中，代表老挝去参加 2026 年 11 月在曼谷举行的第一届亚洲欧洲歌唱大赛（Eurovision Song Contest Asia）。","fame_en":"Her song 'BAE' won the online public vote on Laos's selection show 'Sieng Lao: The One', sending her to the first Eurovision Song Contest Asia in Bangkok in November 2026.","fact":"她会是第一个代表老挝站上欧洲歌唱大赛舞台的歌手；之前她还代表老挝去过韩国釜山的 Round 音乐节。","fact_en":"She will be the first artist ever to represent Laos at a Eurovision contest; before that she represented the country at the Round Festival in Busan, South Korea.","src":"Eurovision.com","url":"https://www.eurovision.com/stories/thinla-will-sing-bae-for-laos-in-bangkok/","say":{"en":"Are you voting for Thinla? She's the first singer from Laos at Eurovision!","zh":"你要投 Thinla 吗？她是第一个去欧洲歌唱大赛的老挝歌手！"}},"《正义之战2》":{"what":"斯里兰卡僧伽罗语悬疑片《Dharmayuddhaya 2》，翻拍自马拉雅拉姆语电影《误杀2》（Drishyam 2），2026 年 1 月上映。","what_en":"Dharmayuddhaya 2 is a Sinhala thriller remade from the Malayalam film Drishyam 2, released in January 2026.","fame":"首个周末就创下僧伽罗语电影开画纪录，放了 120 多天后票房超过 6.3 亿卢比，成了斯里兰卡影史票房最高的电影。","fame_en":"It set the record opening weekend for a Sinhala film and, after more than 120 days in cinemas, passed 630 million rupees to become the highest-grossing film in Sri Lankan history.","fact":"这个纪录完全是靠斯里兰卡国内卖票创下的；它 1 月 23 日在全岛上映，10 天就创下了票房纪录。","fact_en":"The record was set on domestic ticket sales alone; it opened island-wide on 23 January and was breaking records within 10 days.","src":"News 1st，2026","url":"https://english.newsfirst.lk/2026/03/15/sri-lanka-witnesses-record-breaking-blockbuster-with-dharmayuddhaya-2","say":{"en":"Have you seen Dharmayuddhaya 2? Don't tell me the ending!","zh":"你看《正义之战2》了吗？别告诉我结局！"}},"《疑心：谁都别信》":{"what":"印度 Netflix 的印地语悬疑剧，帕瑞尼蒂·乔普拉演一个婴儿在医院失踪、找了九年的妈妈，2026 年 9 月 24 日上线，一共 7 集。","what_en":"An Indian Hindi-language Netflix thriller: Parineeti Chopra plays a mother whose newborn vanished from a hospital and who has searched for nine years. It launched on 24 September 2026 with seven episodes.","fame":"上线后在斯里兰卡 Netflix 剧集榜连续两周第一，邻国观众跟着印度一起猜「到底谁是坏人」。","fame_en":"After launch it spent two weeks at No. 1 on Netflix's Sri Lanka TV chart, with viewers next door guessing along with India about who the villain is.","fact":"这部剧原来的名字叫《Talaash: A Mother's Search》（寻找：一个母亲的追寻），上线前才改成《Shaque》（怀疑）。","fact_en":"The series was originally called Talaash: A Mother's Search before it was renamed Shaque ('Suspicion').","src":"What's on Netflix","url":"https://www.whats-on-netflix.com/news/everything-you-need-to-know-about-shaque-trust-no-one-netflix-indias-new-thriller-series/","say":{"en":"I binged all of Shaque last night. I suspected everyone!","zh":"我昨晚一口气看完了《Shaque》，我谁都怀疑过！"}},"《疑心：谁都别信》·马尔代夫":{"what":"印度 Netflix 的印地语悬疑剧《Shaque》，一个妈妈找了九年在医院失踪的孩子，身边每个人都可能有问题。","what_en":"Shaque is an Indian Hindi-language Netflix thriller about a mother who spends nine years searching for the baby who vanished from a hospital — and anyone around her could be involved.","fame":"2026 年 9 月 24 日上线后，在马尔代夫 Netflix 剧集榜连续两周第一；马尔代夫很多人平时就看印地语影视。","fame_en":"After launching on 24 September 2026 it spent two weeks at No. 1 on Netflix's Maldives TV chart — Hindi film and TV have a big following in the Maldives.","fact":"这是宝莱坞女演员帕瑞尼蒂·乔普拉第一次演剧集，以前她只拍电影。","fact_en":"It is Bollywood actress Parineeti Chopra's first-ever series — until now she had only made films.","src":"Netflix","url":"https://about.netflix.com/en/news/everyones-a-suspect-no-ones-innocent-shaque-trust-no-one-premieres-september-24-on-netflix","say":{"en":"Is Shaque good? I need something for my long flight.","zh":"《Shaque》好看吗？我需要点东西打发长途飞行。"}},"《血兄弟：火龙》":{"what":"马来西亚马来语动作片《Blood Brothers: Bara Naga》，讲一群精英保镖兄弟反目，导演 Syafiq Yusof 和 Abhilash Chandra，2025 年上映。","what_en":"Blood Brothers: Bara Naga is a Malaysian Malay-language action film about a band of elite bodyguards who turn on each other, directed by Syafiq Yusof and Abhilash Chandra and released in 2025.","fame":"上映 33 天票房 7600 万令吉，在马来西亚本国片里排第二，仅次于 2022 年的《Mat Kilau》（9740 万令吉）。","fame_en":"It took RM76 million in 33 days, second only to 2022's Mat Kilau (RM97.4 million) among Malaysian films.","fact":"电影太火，后来还被改写成了小说，同一年 8 月也上了 Netflix。","fact_en":"It was such a hit that it was turned into a novel, and it arrived on Netflix that August.","src":"New Straits Times","url":"https://www.nst.com.my/amp/lifestyle/groove/2025/05/1222740/showbiz-blood-brothers-bara-naga-gets-novelised","say":{"en":"Blood Brothers is still showing? Let's go after dinner.","zh":"《血兄弟》还在放？吃完饭去看吧。"}},"《库德拉1968：高级议会》":{"what":"马来西亚 Astro 出品的校园剧，是 2023 年大热的《Projek: High Council》的前传，回到 1968 年一所寄宿学校的学生会。","what_en":"A Malaysian school drama from Astro and a prequel to 2023's hit Projek: High Council, going back to a boarding school's student council in 1968.","fame":"2026 年 9 月 11 日在 Astro 和 Netflix 同时上线，冲到马来西亚 Netflix 剧集榜第一。","fame_en":"It premiered on Astro and Netflix on 11 September 2026 and went to No. 1 on Netflix's Malaysia TV chart.","fact":"剧集只有 4 集，故事还没讲完——后半段会拍成电影在电影院放，上映日期还没公布。","fact_en":"The series is only four episodes long and the story isn't finished: it continues as a feature film in cinemas, with a release date still to be announced.","src":"Malay Mail，2026","url":"https://www.malaymail.com/news/showbiz/2026/09/04/astro-originals-netflix-announce-september-11-premiere-for-kudrat-1968-high-council-video/233942","say":{"en":"Did you go to boarding school? Kudrat 1968 brings back memories.","zh":"你上过寄宿学校吗？《库德拉1968》让人想起好多事。"}},"达扬·努尔费扎":{"what":"马来西亚沙捞越出身的女歌手 Dayang Nurfaizah，唱马来语情歌和带爵士味的流行歌。","what_en":"Dayang Nurfaizah is a singer from Sarawak, Malaysia, known for Malay ballads and jazz-tinged pop.","fame":"《Lelaki Teragung》（最伟大的男人）在 2017 年马来西亚的「年度金曲奖」（AJL31）拿下最佳歌曲，同年也拿了 Anugerah Planet Muzik 的最佳马来西亚歌曲。","fame_en":"'Lelaki Teragung' ('The Greatest Man') won Best Song at Malaysia's 31st Anugerah Juara Lagu in 2017 and Best Malaysian Song at Anugerah Planet Muzik the same year.","fact":"那一晚她一个人拿了两个奖：最佳歌曲的 5 万令吉奖金，再加最佳演唱奖。","fact_en":"She took home two awards that night: the RM50,000 Best Song prize, plus Best Vocal.","src":"New Straits Times","url":"https://www.nst.com.my/amp/news/2017/01/206487/showbiz-dayang-nurfaizahs-lelaki-teragung-best-song-ajl-31","say":{"en":"This song is Dayang Nurfaizah, right? My aunt loves this one.","zh":"这首是 Dayang Nurfaizah 的吧？我阿姨最爱这首。"}},"《普尔纳·巴哈杜尔的萨朗吉琴》":{"what":"尼泊尔电影，导演萨罗杰·波德尔，讲一个拉萨朗吉琴、四处卖唱的达利特父亲和他儿子的故事。","what_en":"A Nepali film directed by Saroj Poudel about a Dalit father who travels playing the sarangi, a bowed folk fiddle, and his son.","fame":"2024 年上映，尼泊尔国内票房约 4.69 亿卢比，是尼泊尔影史票房第一，也是第一部在尼泊尔卖到 4 亿卢比以上的电影。","fame_en":"Released in 2024, it took about Rs 469 million in Nepal — the country's highest-grossing film ever and the first to pass Rs 400 million at home.","fact":"上映 17 天就收了 3.436 亿卢比，已经超过之前的纪录保持者《Kabaddi 4》（2.35 亿卢比）。","fact_en":"It took Rs 343.6 million in just 17 days, already beating the previous record holder, Kabaddi 4 (Rs 235 million).","src":"Himal Press","url":"https://en.himalpress.com/purna-bahadur-ko-sarangi-grosses-record-rs-343-6-million-in-17-days/","say":{"en":"Everyone cried at Purna Bahadur Ko Sarangi. Did you?","zh":"看《普尔纳·巴哈杜尔的萨朗吉琴》大家都哭了，你呢？"}},"《帕兰》":{"what":"尼泊尔电影《Paran》，老演员尼尔·沙阿主演，马赫什·特里帕蒂一起演，2025 年 10 月 31 日上映。","what_en":"Paran is a Nepali film led by veteran actor Neer Shah with Mahesh Tripathi, released on 31 October 2025.","fame":"它是尼泊尔历 2082 年（大约 2025 年中到 2026 年中）票房最高的尼泊尔电影，收入约 1.78 亿卢比。","fame_en":"It was the highest-grossing Nepali film of the Nepali year 2082 (roughly mid-2025 to mid-2026), taking about Rs 178 million.","fact":"那一年大部分尼泊尔电影都没赚到钱，《Paran》却在电影院连放了 100 多天。","fact_en":"In a year when most Nepali films failed to make a profit, Paran kept playing in cinemas for more than 100 days.","src":"Ratopati","url":"https://english.ratopati.com/story/46764/paran-completes-100-days-of-performance","say":{"en":"Paran is still in cinemas after 100 days? I have to see it.","zh":"《Paran》放了 100 天还在电影院？我得去看看。"}},"普拉尚特·希瓦科蒂":{"what":"尼泊尔词曲作者、歌手 Prashant Shivakoti，给电影写歌也自己唱。","what_en":"Prashant Shivakoti is a Nepali songwriter, composer and singer who writes songs for films and sings them too.","fame":"2025 年 9 月他和民谣歌手 Shanti Shree Pariyar 合唱的《Nyauli Banaima》（森林里的拟啄木鸟）放出来后，在尼泊尔很多人听。","fame_en":"'Nyauli Banaima' ('The Barbet in the Forest'), his duet with folk singer Shanti Shree Pariyar released in September 2025, became widely played in Nepal.","fact":"这首歌是电影《Valishtha Balaram》的插曲，词和曲都是他写的，整部电影的配乐也是他做的。","fact_en":"The song comes from the film Valishtha Balaram — he wrote both its words and music, and composed the film's whole score.","src":"Ekantipur，2025","url":"https://ekantipur.com/entertainment/2025/09/25/en/vijay-baral-on-the-lyrics-of-valishta-balaram-20-18.html","say":{"en":"What's this song? It sounds like the hills in Nepal.","zh":"这是什么歌？听起来像尼泊尔的山里。"}},"《火烧小镇》":{"what":"巴基斯坦乌尔都语犯罪喜剧片，ARY Films 出品，2026 年开斋节上映。","what_en":"A Pakistani Urdu-language crime comedy from ARY Films, released over Eid al-Fitr 2026.","fame":"全球票房约 10.1 亿卢比，是 ARY Films 史上最卖座的电影，也排到巴基斯坦影史第二。","fame_en":"It grossed about Rs 101 crore worldwide — ARY Films' biggest ever and the second-highest-grossing Pakistani film of all time.","fact":"在北美，它的票房远远超过同一天上映的对手片《Bullah》。","fact_en":"In North America it massively outperformed Bullah, the rival film released the same Eid.","src":"Pakistani Cinema，2026","url":"https://pakistanicinema.net/2026/04/17/aag-lagay-basti-mein-worldwide-box-office-becomes-all-time-second-highest-grossing-film/","say":{"en":"Eid plans? Let's book Aag Lagay Basti Mein before it sells out.","zh":"开斋节有什么安排？赶紧订《火烧小镇》，不然要卖完了。"}},"《萨达尔吉3》":{"what":"印度旁遮普语恐怖喜剧，迪尔吉特·多桑杰主演，巴基斯坦女演员汉妮娅·阿米尔一起演，2025 年 6 月 27 日上映。","what_en":"An Indian Punjabi horror-comedy starring Diljit Dosanjh with Pakistani actress Hania Aamir, released on 27 June 2025.","fame":"在巴基斯坦成了票房最高的外国片之一，首日票房超过了萨尔曼·汗《苏丹》在巴基斯坦的开画纪录。","fame_en":"In Pakistan it became one of the biggest foreign releases ever, with an opening day that beat Salman Khan's Sultan there.","fact":"因为 2025 年 4 月的帕哈尔加姆袭击后印巴关系紧张，这部印度电影没有在印度上映，只在海外放。","fact_en":"After the April 2025 Pahalgam attack strained India–Pakistan relations, this Indian film was never released in Indian cinemas — only overseas.","src":"Gulf News","url":"https://gulfnews.com/entertainment/diljit-dosanjh-pakistani-star-hania-aamirs-sardaar-ji-3-to-release-overseas-but-not-in-india-amid-boycott-calls-1.500173676","say":{"en":"Is Sardaar Ji 3 showing here? I love Diljit's songs.","zh":"这儿放《萨达尔吉3》吗？我很喜欢迪尔吉特的歌。"}},"《医生儿媳》":{"what":"巴基斯坦 ARY Digital 的家庭剧《Dr Bahu》，导演梅赫琳·贾巴尔，库布拉·汗和舒贾·阿萨德主演，讲一个当医生的儿媳在婆家的故事。","what_en":"Dr Bahu is a Pakistani family drama on ARY Digital, directed by Mehreen Jabbar and starring Kubra Khan and Shuja Asad, about a daughter-in-law who is a doctor.","fame":"2026 年 3 月开播、7 月底结束，一共 35 集；播出时是巴基斯坦收视最高的剧之一，大结局被评论说「拉高了黄金档的标准」。","fame_en":"It ran from March to the end of July 2026 over 35 episodes, was among Pakistan's highest-rated dramas, and its finale was praised for 'raising the bar for primetime television'.","fact":"导演梅赫琳·贾巴尔有意把巴基斯坦电视剧里常见的「受气儿媳」反过来写。","fact_en":"Director Mehreen Jabbar set out to subvert the long-suffering daughter-in-law trope common in Pakistani TV dramas.","src":"Gulf News","url":"https://gulfnews.com/entertainment/mehreen-jabbar-subverts-the-typical-daughter-in-law-trope-in-new-show-dr-bahu-1.500487782","say":{"en":"Did you watch the last episode of Dr Bahu? My mum won't stop talking about it.","zh":"你看《医生儿媳》大结局了吗？我妈一直在说。"}},"阿卜杜勒·哈南":{"what":"巴基斯坦创作歌手 Abdul Hannan，抱着吉他唱乌尔都语情歌，2024 年和 Kaavish 在 Coke Studio 唱过《O Yaara》。","what_en":"Abdul Hannan is a Pakistani singer-songwriter who sings Urdu love songs on guitar; in 2024 he sang 'O Yaara' with Kaavish on Coke Studio.","fame":"成名曲《Iraaday》和《Bikhra》在排行榜上待了 100 多周；新歌《Khasara》写分手后的失落。","fame_en":"His breakout songs 'Iraaday' and 'Bikhra' stayed on the charts for more than 100 weeks; his newer 'Khasara' is about loss after a break-up.","fact":"他本来学的是工程，后来放弃了工程去做音乐，2026 年的采访里他讲过这个决定。","fact_en":"He originally studied engineering and turned it down for music — a decision he talked about in a 2026 interview.","src":"The Express Tribune，2026","url":"https://tribune.com.pk/story/2617992/abdul-hannan-reflects-on-turning-down-engineering-for-music","say":{"en":"Abdul Hannan is playing in London? Let's get tickets!","zh":"Abdul Hannan 要在伦敦开演唱会？我们去买票！"}},"《你好，再爱一次》":{"what":"菲律宾爱情片，2019 年《你好，爱，再见》的续集，凯瑟琳·贝尔纳多和奥尔登·理查兹再演 Joy 和 Ethan，这次故事搬到了加拿大。","what_en":"A Filipino romance and sequel to 2019's Hello, Love, Goodbye, with Kathryn Bernardo and Alden Richards back as Joy and Ethan — this time in Canada.","fame":"2024 年 11 月上映，全球票房约 16 亿比索，是菲律宾电影史上票房最高的电影；首日 8500 万比索也是本国片纪录。","fame_en":"Released in November 2024, it grossed about ₱1.6 billion worldwide — the highest-grossing Filipino film ever — and its ₱85 million first day was a record for a local film.","fact":"上映第 10 天左右它就超过了前纪录保持者《Rewind》，随后成了第一部全球票房破 10 亿比索的菲律宾电影。","fact_en":"Around its tenth day it overtook previous record holder Rewind, and it went on to become the first Filipino film to pass ₱1 billion worldwide.","src":"GMA Network","url":"https://gmanetwork.com/regionaltv/features/105267/hello-love-again-is-first-filipino-film-to-gross-p1-billion/story","say":{"en":"Team Joy or team Ethan? I cried so much at Hello, Love, Again.","zh":"你站 Joy 还是 Ethan？《你好，再爱一次》看得我哭死了。"}},"《招魂：最终仪式》":{"what":"好莱坞恐怖片「招魂」系列的最后一部，灵异调查夫妇华伦夫妇的最后一案，2025 年 9 月上映。","what_en":"The final film in Hollywood's Conjuring horror series — the last case for paranormal investigators Ed and Lorraine Warren — released in September 2025.","fame":"菲律宾人特别爱看恐怖片：它 9 月 3 日在菲律宾上映，是 2025 年菲律宾票房最高的好莱坞电影。","fame_en":"Filipinos love a horror film: it opened in the Philippines on 3 September and became the country's top Hollywood film of 2025.","fact":"它创下菲律宾恐怖片首日票房的历史纪录，还拿下菲律宾所有电影里午夜场票房最高的纪录。","fact_en":"It set the all-time Philippine record for a horror film's opening day, and the record for the highest-grossing midnight screenings of any film in the country.","src":"GMA Network，2025","url":"https://www.gmanetwork.com/news/lifestyle/hobbiesandactivities/958032/the-conjuring-last-rites-sets-ph-record-for-all-time-biggest-opening-day-for-horror-movie/story/","say":{"en":"Want to watch The Conjuring tonight? I'm not going alone.","zh":"今晚要不要去看《招魂》？我可不一个人去。"}},"《Doctor X：白色黑手党时代》·菲律宾":{"what":"韩国 SBS 的医疗黑色剧，金智媛演天才外科医生桂秀晶，跟医院里的腐败和权力斗，一共 12 集。","what_en":"A Korean SBS medical noir in which Kim Ji-won plays genius surgeon Gye Su-jeong, taking on corruption and power inside the hospital, over 12 episodes.","fame":"2026 年 10 月 9 日 SBS 和 Netflix 同一天上线，菲律宾观众在 Netflix 上跟韩国同步追，冲到了菲律宾 Netflix 剧集榜第一。","fame_en":"It launched on SBS and Netflix the same day, 9 October 2026, so viewers in the Philippines follow it in step with Korea — and it reached No. 1 on Netflix's Philippines TV chart.","fact":"演员张承祚在剧里特别出演，演跟金智媛针锋相对的死对头医生。","fact_en":"Actor Jang Seung-jo makes a special appearance as a rival surgeon squaring off against Kim Ji-won's character.","src":"体育京乡，2026","url":"https://sports.khan.co.kr/en/article/202610161428007","say":{"en":"No spoilers! I'm only on episode four of Doctor X.","zh":"别剧透！我《Doctor X》才看到第四集。"}},"《切布拉什卡2》":{"what":"俄罗斯真人加动画的家庭电影，主角是苏联老动画里大耳朵的小动物切布拉什卡，2026 年元旦上映。","what_en":"A Russian live-action family film with an animated hero — big-eared Cheburashka from the classic Soviet cartoon — released on New Year's Day 2026.","fame":"第一部 2023 年就创过俄罗斯票房纪录；第二部上映两周就成了俄罗斯影史票房最高的电影，后来票房约 60 亿卢布。","fame_en":"The first film set a Russian box-office record in 2023; the sequel became the highest-grossing film in Russian history within two weeks, eventually taking around 6 billion rubles.","fact":"它只用了两天就卖到 10 亿卢布，是 2026 年俄罗斯第一部票房过 10 亿的电影。","fact_en":"It took just two days to reach 1 billion rubles — the first Russian release of 2026 to do so.","src":"Expert.ru，2026","url":"https://expert.ru/news/cheburashka-2-za-dva-dnya-sobral-v-prokate-bolee-1-mlrd-rubley/","say":{"en":"Did you take the kids to Cheburashka 2 over the holidays?","zh":"放假带孩子去看《切布拉什卡2》了吗？"}},"《绿野仙踪：黄砖路》":{"what":"俄罗斯奇幻家庭片，改编自苏联作家沃尔科夫的童话《绿宝石城的魔法师》（俄罗斯版《绿野仙踪》），2025 年 1 月上映。","what_en":"A Russian family fantasy based on Alexander Volkov's Soviet-era tale The Wizard of the Emerald City — Russia's own version of The Wizard of Oz — released in January 2025.","fame":"它是 2025 年俄罗斯最卖座的电影，票房约 33.5 亿卢布，超过了第二名《菲尼斯特：第一个勇士》。","fame_en":"It was Russia's biggest film of 2025, taking about 3.35 billion rubles, ahead of runner-up Finist: The First Warrior.","fact":"电影预算约 9.78 亿卢布，其中 6.3 亿是俄罗斯国家电影基金出的。","fact_en":"Its budget was about 978 million rubles, of which 630 million came from Russia's state Cinema Fund.","src":"Snob，2025","url":"https://snob.ru/news/novyi-volshebnik-izumrudnogo-goroda-stal-samym-kassovym-filmom-2025-goda/","say":{"en":"Have you read The Wizard of the Emerald City? Everyone here grew up with it.","zh":"你读过《绿宝石城的魔法师》吗？这里的人都是看着它长大的。"}},"《铃兰》":{"what":"俄罗斯音乐爱情剧《Ландыши》（铃兰），讲一个被宠坏的女孩卡佳被「改造」的故事，剧里有很多歌和她的乐队。","what_en":"Landyshi ('Lilies of the Valley') is a Russian musical romance about Katya, a spoiled young woman who gets 'reformed' — full of songs and her band.","fame":"第一季 2025 年元旦在 Wink 上线；第二季《第二个春天》2026 年 1 月 1 日上线，卡佳要面对乐队散伙、争遗产和寻找失踪的丈夫，在 2026 年一季度剧集热度榜排第二。","fame_en":"Season 1 launched on Wink on New Year's Day 2025; season 2, 'Second Spring', arrived on 1 January 2026 — Katya faces her band splitting up, a fight over an inheritance and the search for her missing husband — and ranked second on the series popularity chart for Q1 2026.","fact":"第一季上线前不在任何「最受期待」名单里，结果一夜爆红，在 Kinopoisk 上连《男孩的话》和《双峰》都超过了。","fact_en":"Before launch, season 1 wasn't on a single 'most anticipated' list — then it became an overnight phenomenon, overtaking The Boy's Word and even Twin Peaks on Kinopoisk.","src":"Altapress，2025","url":"https://altapress.ru/khz/story/noviy-sezon-landishey-viydet-v-perviy-den-goda-378494","say":{"en":"Have you started the new season of Landyshi? The songs are stuck in my head.","zh":"《铃兰》新一季你开始看了吗？那些歌一直在我脑子里转。"}},"阿蒂克与阿斯蒂":{"what":"俄罗斯流行组合 Artik & Asti，由制作人阿蒂克（Artyom Umrikhin）和一位女主唱组成，唱舞曲味的情歌。","what_en":"Artik & Asti is a Russian pop duo of producer Artik (Artyom Umrikhin) and a female lead singer, known for dance-pop love songs.","fame":"十多年来在俄语区一直有热歌；和 Джиган、Niletto 合作的《Худи》（连帽衫）上了俄罗斯 Apple Music 榜。","fame_en":"They have had hits across the Russian-speaking world for more than a decade; 'Hudi' ('Hoodie'), with Dzhigan and Niletto, made Russia's Apple Music chart.","fact":"原来的女主唱安娜·秋巴（Asti）2021 年 11 月离开组合单飞，2022 年初《好声音》选手塞维尔接替了她，组合名字没改。","fact_en":"Original singer Anna Dzyuba (Asti) left in November 2021 to go solo; in early 2022 The Voice contestant Seville replaced her — and the duo kept its name.","src":"Wikipedia：Artik & Asti","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artik_%26_Asti","say":{"en":"Is this Artik & Asti? Is it the new singer or the old one?","zh":"这是 Artik & Asti 吗？是新主唱还是原来那个？"}},"《钱不够用3》":{"what":"新加坡导演梁智强的喜剧，1998 年经典《钱不够用》的第三部，还是讲新加坡普通人为钱发愁，2024 年农历新年上映。","what_en":"Jack Neo's Singapore comedy and the third Money No Enough film, after the 1998 classic, again about ordinary Singaporeans worrying over money; it opened over Chinese New Year 2024.","fame":"票房约 488 万新元，超过第二部，成了新加坡本地电影票房第六；在马来西亚也卖了 2000 多万令吉。","fame_en":"It took about S$4.88 million, beating the second film to become Singapore's sixth-highest-grossing local film, and made over RM20 million in Malaysia too.","fact":"第一部 1998 年上映，第三部隔了 15 年才回来——第二部是 2008 年的。","fact_en":"The first film came out in 1998, and the third arrived 15 years after the second, which was released in 2008.","src":"Mothership，2024","url":"https://mothership.sg/2024/04/money-no-enough-3-sixth-highest-grossing-singapore-movie/amp/","say":{"en":"Money No Enough 3 is so Singapore lah. The coffee shop scenes are exactly like my uncle's.","zh":"《钱不够用3》太新加坡了啦，咖啡店那几场跟我舅舅一模一样。"}},"《疯狂动物城2》·新加坡":{"what":"迪士尼动画《疯狂动物城》第二部，兔子朱迪和狐狸尼克再次搭档破案。","what_en":"Disney's Zootopia 2, with rabbit Judy and fox Nick teaming up again on a new case.","fame":"2025 年 11 月 27 日在新加坡上映，12 月是全新加坡票房第一，票房约 334 万美元；在马来西亚、泰国、越南也都首周第一。","fame_en":"It opened in Singapore on 27 November 2025, was the country's top film in December with about US$3.34 million, and also opened at No. 1 in Malaysia, Thailand and Vietnam.","fact":"2026 年 1 月它超过《头脑特工队2》，成了全球票房最高的好莱坞动画片。","fact_en":"In January 2026 it passed Inside Out 2 to become the highest-grossing Hollywood animated film of all time.","src":"Cartoon Brew，2026","url":"https://www.cartoonbrew.com/box-office-report/zootopia-2-highest-grossing-hollywood-animated-film-258294.html","say":{"en":"Any seats left for Zootopia 2 this weekend? The kids keep asking.","zh":"这周末《疯狂动物城2》还有位子吗？孩子们一直在问。"}},"《Doctor X：白色黑手党时代》·新加坡":{"what":"韩国 SBS 的医疗黑色剧，金智媛演天才外科医生桂秀晶，跟医院里的腐败和权力斗，一共 12 集。","what_en":"A Korean SBS medical noir in which Kim Ji-won plays genius surgeon Gye Su-jeong, taking on corruption and power inside the hospital, over 12 episodes.","fame":"2026 年 10 月 9 日 SBS 和 Netflix 同步上线，在新加坡 Netflix 剧集榜冲到第一，下班后的地铁上常看到有人在追。","fame_en":"It launched on SBS and Netflix together on 9 October 2026 and reached No. 1 on Netflix's Singapore TV chart — you see people watching it on the train after work.","fact":"剧里金宇硕演的「阳光实习生」很讨人喜欢，登上了韩国电视剧话题榜第一。","fact_en":"Kim Woo-seok's lovable 'sunshine intern' character went to the top of Korea's drama buzz rankings.","src":"体育京乡，2026","url":"https://sports.khan.co.kr/en/article/202610171015007","say":{"en":"Which episode of Doctor X are you on? Don't tell me what happens to the intern!","zh":"你《Doctor X》看到第几集了？别告诉我那个实习生怎么样了！"}},"蕾吉娜·宋":{"what":"新加坡创作歌手 Regina Song，写的歌很像少女日记。","what_en":"Regina Song is a Singaporean singer-songwriter whose songs read like a teenage diary.","fame":"2024 年专辑《fangirl》的同名主打歌《the cutest pair》在 TikTok 上爆红，冲上 Spotify 全球病毒榜第一，还入围了 2025 年日本音乐奖（MAJ）的最佳亚洲歌曲。","fame_en":"'the cutest pair', title track of her 2024 album fangirl, blew up on TikTok, hit No. 1 on Spotify's Viral 50 – Global and was nominated for Best Asian Song at the 2025 Music Awards Japan.","fact":"她说这首歌是写给当时暗恋的男生的「告白歌」——那时他正喜欢上另一个女生。","fact_en":"She has said the song was her 'confession song' to a crush who was falling for another girl at the time.","src":"Time Out Singapore","url":"https://www.timeout.com/singapore/music/meet-regina-song-the-singaporean-singer-with-over-34-million-streams-on-her-hit-the-cutest-pair","say":{"en":"Have you heard 'the cutest pair'? It's by a Singaporean singer!","zh":"你听过《the cutest pair》吗？是新加坡歌手唱的！"}},"《死亡低语2》":{"what":"泰国恐怖片《Tee Yod 2》（死亡低语2），讲一家兄弟追杀一个夜里低语、害死妹妹的恶灵。","what_en":"Death Whisperer 2 (Tee Yod 2) is a Thai horror film about brothers hunting the whispering spirit that killed their sister.","fame":"2024 年泰国票房总冠军，全国票房约 8 亿泰铢以上，是泰国电影史上最卖座的本国片；上映四天半就收了 3.5 亿泰铢。","fame_en":"It was Thailand's top film of 2024, taking over 800 million baht nationwide to become the biggest Thai film ever, with 350 million baht in its first four and a half days.","fact":"第三部《Death Whisperer 3》已经在柏林电影节的欧洲电影市场上推出，卖给海外片商。","fact_en":"A third film, Death Whisperer 3, has already been launched to international buyers at the European Film Market in Berlin.","src":"Screen Daily","url":"https://screendaily.com/news/thailands-m-studio-launches-horror-death-whisperer-3-at-efm-exclusive/5201993.article","say":{"en":"I can't sleep after Tee Yod 2. Can you walk me home?","zh":"看完《死亡低语2》我睡不着了。你能送我回家吗？"}},"《阿凡达：火与烬》":{"what":"詹姆斯·卡梅隆《阿凡达》系列第三部，潘多拉星球上出现了一个和火有关的纳美部落，2025 年 12 月上映。","what_en":"The third Avatar film from James Cameron, introducing a fire-linked Na'vi clan on Pandora, released in December 2025.","fame":"在泰国跨年那几周一直是票房第一，到 2026 年初累计约 1170 万美元，排在《疯狂动物城2》前面。","fame_en":"It held the No. 1 spot in Thailand through the New Year weeks, reaching about US$11.7 million by early 2026, ahead of Zootopia 2.","fact":"它全球首周末票房 3.471 亿美元，后来全球票房超过 10 亿美元。","fact_en":"It opened to US$347.1 million worldwide and went on to pass US$1 billion globally.","src":"The Walt Disney Company","url":"https://thewaltdisneycompany.com/?p=34647","say":{"en":"Should we watch Avatar in IMAX or 3D?","zh":"《阿凡达》看 IMAX 还是 3D？"}},"《地狱厨房泰国版 第3季》":{"what":"英国厨艺竞赛节目《地狱厨房》的泰国版，参赛者在高压厨房里每晚出菜，一个个被淘汰。","what_en":"The Thai version of the British cooking contest Hell's Kitchen, where contestants serve dinner every night in a pressure-cooker kitchen and are knocked out one by one.","fame":"2024 年 2 月在泰国第 7 台开播，每季都在 Netflix 上能追看；2026 年 10 月新进泰国 Netflix 前十。","fame_en":"It premiered on Thailand's Channel 7HD in February 2024, each season can be caught up on Netflix, and in October 2026 it entered Netflix Thailand's Top 10.","fact":"跟英美版只有一个主厨不同，泰国版有四位主厨轮流坐镇，每周换一位，菜单也跟着换。","fact_en":"Unlike the US and UK versions with one head chef, the Thai version has four head chefs who take turns running the kitchen, and the dishes change with each week's chef.","src":"Wikipedia：Hell's Kitchen Thailand","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hell%27s_Kitchen_Thailand","say":{"en":"Which chef on Hell's Kitchen Thailand would you want to cook for?","zh":"《地狱厨房泰国版》你最想给哪位主厨做菜？"}},"GAVIN:D":{"what":"泰英混血的说唱歌手、创作人 GAVIN:D（Gavin Duval），说唱和唱歌都来，还演戏。","what_en":"GAVIN:D (Gavin Duval) is a Thai-British rapper, singer and producer who also acts.","fame":"英语和泰语混着唱，说唱和情歌都写；和 Violette Wautier 合唱的《อย่ามากกว่าฉันก็พอ（Jealous）》是他现在在泰国很火的歌。","fame_en":"He mixes English and Thai and writes both rap and love songs; 'Yaa Maak Kwaa Chan Gor Por (Jealous)', featuring Violette Wautier, is his current hit in Thailand.","fact":"2021 年他和越南说唱女王 Suboi 合作了《Together》，MV 是赛博未来风，NME 专门报道过。","fact_en":"In 2021 he teamed up with Vietnamese rap star Suboi on 'Together', a song with a cyber-futuristic video covered by NME.","src":"NME，2021","url":"https://www.nme.com/news/watch-suboi-and-gavin-d-s-cyber-futuristic-music-video-for-together-2989378","say":{"en":"Who's that rapping in English and Thai? Oh, it's GAVIN:D!","zh":"谁在用英语和泰语混着唱？哦，是 GAVIN:D！"}},"《帖木儿》":{"what":"乌兹别克斯坦和美国合拍的历史片《Amir Temur》，讲帖木儿（跛子帖木儿）怎么一步步登上王位，美国导演雅各布·施瓦茨执导，2026 年 4 月 2 日上映。","what_en":"Amir Temur is an Uzbek–American historical film about Timur (Tamerlane) and his hard road to the throne, directed by American Jacob Schwartz and released on 2 April 2026.","fame":"它是 2026 年 1–9 月乌兹别克斯坦票房最高的本国片，约 18.7 亿苏姆；乌兹别克斯坦这一年的整体票房涨了 37%。","fame_en":"It was Uzbekistan's top home-grown film from January to September 2026, with about 1.87 billion som, in a year when the country's total box office grew 37%.","fact":"发行方说电影卖到了 120 个国家和地区，俄语配音是在莫斯科的「莫斯科电影制片厂」做的。","fact_en":"Its distributor said the film was sold to 120 countries, with the Russian dub recorded at Moscow's Mosfilm studios.","src":"Afisha.uz，2026","url":"https://www.afisha.uz/ru/cinema/2026/05/18/amir-timur","say":{"en":"Have you seen Amir Temur? I want to visit Samarkand after that.","zh":"你看过《帖木儿》吗？看完我好想去撒马尔罕。"}},"《蜘蛛侠：崭新之日》·乌兹别克斯坦":{"what":"漫威蜘蛛侠的新电影，汤姆·赫兰德主演，2026 年 7 月底全球上映。","what_en":"Marvel's new Spider-Man film starring Tom Holland, released worldwide at the end of July 2026.","fame":"全球票房很快超过 20 亿美元，是 2026 年最卖座的电影；在乌兹别克斯坦，它是这一年票房第一的好莱坞片。","fame_en":"It soon passed US$2 billion worldwide to become 2026's biggest film, and in Uzbekistan it was the year's top Hollywood release.","fact":"它打破了乌兹别克斯坦的首日票房纪录：第一天约 9 万美元、15838 人次，其中乌兹别克语配音场占了 11.5%。","fact_en":"It broke Uzbekistan's opening-day record with about US$90,000 and 15,838 admissions — 11.5% of it from Uzbek-dubbed screenings.","src":"Kursiv Uzbekistan，2026","url":"https://uz.kursiv.media/en/2026-08-11/spider-man-brand-new-day-shatters-opening-day-box-office-records-in-uzbekistan/","say":{"en":"Are you watching Spider-Man in Uzbek or in Russian?","zh":"你看《蜘蛛侠》是看乌兹别克语版还是俄语版？"}},"法鲁赫·法泽尔":{"what":"乌兹别克斯坦歌手 Farruh Fazel，唱乌兹别克语流行歌。","what_en":"Farruh Fazel is an Uzbek singer of Uzbek-language pop.","fame":"《Bor》（有）一度登上乌兹别克斯坦音乐榜第一，和《Rolex Gucci》的 MV 一起让他在乌兹别克娱乐圈「炸」了出来；2025 年 11 月又出了《Yo'q》（没有）。","fame_en":"'Bor' ('There is') topped Uzbekistan's music charts and, with the video for 'Rolex Gucci', made him explode onto the Uzbek pop scene; in November 2025 he followed it with 'Yo'q' ('There isn't').","fact":"他是被歌手达夫龙·卡布洛夫发掘的；成名前他不是富家子弟，还去俄罗斯打过工。","fact_en":"He was discovered by singer Davron Kabulov; before fame he wasn't from a rich family and had worked as a migrant labourer in Russia.","src":"Zamin.uz","url":"https://zamin.uz/uz/madaniyat/94068-davron-kabulov-kashf-jetgan-istedod-farru-fazel-bojning-bolasi-jemasligi-rossijada-muozhir-blgani-aida.html","say":{"en":"First 'Bor', now 'Yo'q' — Farruh Fazel is everywhere!","zh":"先是《Bor》，现在又是《Yo'q》——到处都是 Farruh Fazel！"}},"《红雨》":{"what":"越南战争片《Mưa đỏ》（红雨），讲 1972 年守卫广治古城的 81 个昼夜，女导演邓泰玄执导，2025 年 8 月上映。","what_en":"Red Rain (Mưa đỏ) is a Vietnamese war film about the 81 days and nights defending the Quảng Trị Citadel in 1972, directed by Đặng Thái Huyền and released in August 2025.","fame":"票房约 7140 亿越南盾，超过《Mai》成了越南影史最卖座的电影；9 月 1 日一天就收了 558 亿越南盾。","fame_en":"It took about 714 billion đồng, overtaking Mai as the highest-grossing film in Vietnamese history — including 55.8 billion đồng on 1 September alone.","fact":"它被越南选送去角逐 2026 年奥斯卡最佳国际影片。","fact_en":"Vietnam selected it as its submission for Best International Feature at the 2026 Oscars.","src":"Wikipedia：Red Rain (2025 film)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red_Rain_(2025_film)","say":{"en":"Have you seen Mưa đỏ? The whole cinema was crying.","zh":"你看《红雨》了吗？整个电影院都在哭。"}},"《星河Say Hi》":{"what":"越南的音乐真人秀《Tinh Hà Say Hi》，24 位年轻歌手组队比拼，是《Anh Trai Say Hi》（哥哥 Say Hi）、《Em Xinh Say Hi》之后「Say Hi 宇宙」的新节目。","what_en":"Tinh Hà Say Hi is a Vietnamese music reality show where 24 young artists team up and compete — the newest show in the 'Say Hi universe' after Anh Trai Say Hi and Em Xinh Say Hi.","fame":"2026 年 7 月 4 日开播，播了 14 集，10 月 2 日办颁奖夜收官；节目想把越南流行乐推到国外去。","fame_en":"It premiered on 4 July 2026 and wrapped after 14 episodes with an awards night on 2 October; the show aims to take Vietnamese pop abroad.","fact":"选手 Pháp Kiều 为了上这个舞台，从零开始学越南古筝（đàn tranh）。","fact_en":"Contestant Pháp Kiều learned the đàn tranh, the Vietnamese zither, from scratch for her performance on the show.","src":"VOV，2026","url":"https://vov.vn/giai-tri/phap-kieu-hoc-dan-tranh-tu-con-so-0-de-len-san-khau-tinh-ha-say-hi-post1318567.vov","say":{"en":"Who's your favourite on Tinh Hà Say Hi? I vote every week.","zh":"《星河Say Hi》你最喜欢谁？我每周都投票。"}},"Hngle":{"what":"越南年轻歌手 Hngle，2005 年出生，唱带 lo-fi 味的抒情 R&B。","what_en":"Hngle is a young Vietnamese singer, born in 2005, who sings lo-fi-flavoured R&B ballads.","fame":"和 Bảo Anh 合唱的《Tìm Em》（找你）三周就有 2400 万次播放，在越南各大榜单登顶，在热门榜第一待了约两周，才被山松（Sơn Tùng M-TP）的新歌挤下来。","fame_en":"'Tìm Em' ('Looking for You'), his duet with Bảo Anh, hit 24 million plays in three weeks and topped Vietnam's charts, holding the trending No. 1 for about two weeks until Sơn Tùng M-TP's new release knocked it off.","fact":"他是靠和 Ari 合作的《Không buông》（不放手）先红起来的。","fact_en":"He first broke through with 'Không buông' ('Won't Let Go'), a collaboration with Ari.","src":"Znews，2026","url":"https://znews.vn/nguoi-vuot-son-tung-m-tp-thong-tri-nhac-viet-la-ai-post1674748.html","say":{"en":"This is Hngle's new song, right? It's on every café speaker.","zh":"这是 Hngle 的新歌吧？每家咖啡店都在放。"}},"《哪吒之魔童闹海》":{"what":"中国动画片，2019 年《哪吒之魔童降世》的续集，导演饺子；哪吒和敖丙肉身被毁后要重塑身体，又卷进新的大战。","what_en":"A Chinese animated film by director Jiaozi and sequel to 2019's Ne Zha: Ne Zha and Ao Bing must rebuild their bodies after they are destroyed, and get pulled into a new war.","fame":"2025 年春节上映，中国票房约 154 亿元，是中国影史票房第一，也是全球票房最高的动画电影。","fame_en":"Released over Spring Festival 2025, it took around 15.4 billion yuan in China — the biggest film in Chinese history and the highest-grossing animated film in the world.","fact":"它打破了《星球大战：原力觉醒》保持的单一市场票房纪录（9.367 亿美元），成了在一个国家卖得最多的电影。","fact_en":"It broke the single-territory box-office record of US$936.7 million held by Star Wars: The Force Awakens, becoming the biggest film ever in any one country.","src":"Wikipedia：Ne Zha 2","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ne_Zha_2","say":{"en":"How many times have you seen Ne Zha 2? I've seen it twice and want to go again.","zh":"你看了几遍《哪吒2》？我看了两遍，还想再去。"}},"《九门》":{"what":"优酷的民国奇幻冒险剧，南派三叔编剧，是《老九门》的续作；陈伟霆演张启山、曾舜晞演吴老狗，1935 年长沙一百名士兵雨夜离奇失踪，九门当家一起追查。","what_en":"A Youku fantasy-adventure drama set in Republican-era China, written by Nanpai Sanshu as a follow-up to The Mystic Nine: in 1935 Changsha, a hundred soldiers vanish one rainy night, and the heads of the Nine Gates — William Chan as Zhang Qishan, Zeng Shunxi as Wu Laogou — set out to find out why.","fame":"2026 年 7 月 30 日开播，优酷独播；云合数据统计，它是 2026 年第三季度网播量第一的剧。","fame_en":"It premiered on 30 July 2026, exclusively on Youku, and Enlightent data ranked it the most-streamed drama of the third quarter of 2026.","fact":"第三季度它有 12.7 亿次正片有效播放，在热播日榜上登顶 21 天，天数全网第一。","fact_en":"In Q3 it logged 1.27 billion valid plays and topped the daily drama chart on 21 days — more than any other show.","src":"扬子晚报，2026","url":"https://www.yzwb.net/news/wy/202610/t20261011_401518.html","say":{"en":"Are you watching The Nine Gates? Which episode is it up to?","zh":"你在追《九门》吗？更新到第几集了？"}},"周杰伦·中国":{"what":"台湾歌手、创作人周杰伦，在华语世界几乎没人不知道。","what_en":"Jay Chou is a Taiwanese singer-songwriter known to almost everyone in the Chinese-speaking world.","fame":"2026 年 3 月 25 日发了出道 25 周年专辑《太阳之子》，13 首歌；很多乐迷说里面的《那天下雨了》最像早期的周杰伦。","fame_en":"On 25 March 2026 he released The Son of the Sun, a 13-track album marking 25 years since his debut; many fans say 'Nà Tiān Xià Yǔ Le' ('It Rained That Day') is the most like early Jay Chou.","fact":"同名主打歌《太阳之子》的 MV 花了约 2000 万元，由做过《阿凡达》特效的团队制作，里面藏着几十幅世界名画。","fact_en":"The video for the title track cost about 20 million yuan, was made by a VFX team that worked on Avatar, and hides dozens of famous paintings.","src":"新华网，2026","url":"https://www.news.cn/ent/20260327/127b7953cdb14b04bb282f96b0aa902f/c.html","say":{"en":"Which song on the new album is your favourite? I keep replaying 'It Rained That Day'.","zh":"新专辑你最喜欢哪首？我单曲循环《那天下雨了》。"}},"《阿根廷人》":{"what":"阿根廷 2025 年的喜剧电影（原名 Homo Argentum），导演是科恩和杜普拉特，老牌笑星弗兰塞拉一个人演了 16 个不同的阿根廷人。","what_en":"A 2025 Argentine comedy (Homo Argentum) by directors Cohn and Duprat, in which veteran comic Guillermo Francella plays 16 different Argentines.","fame":"2025 年最卖座的阿根廷本国电影：上映 11 天观众就过了一百万。片子拿阿根廷人的小毛病开玩笑，看完大家吵得很凶，连总统都公开叫好。","fame_en":"The top-selling Argentine film of 2025: it passed one million viewers in 11 days. It pokes fun at Argentine habits, and people argued about it for weeks — even the president praised it in public.","fact":"电影院一直满座，Disney+ 只好把上线日期从原定的 2025 年 12 月往后推，最后到 2026 年 1 月 16 日才能在网上看。","fact_en":"Cinemas kept filling up, so Disney+ pushed its streaming release back from December 2025; it only went online on 16 January 2026.","src":"Los Andes，2025 年 11 月","url":"https://www.losandes.com.ar/espectaculos/homo-argentum-llegara-disney-plus-recien-2026-que-se-retraso-el-estreno-streaming-n5970477","say":{"en":"Have you seen Homo Argentum yet? Which Francella was your favourite?","zh":"你看《阿根廷人》了吗？你最喜欢弗兰塞拉演的哪一个？"}},"《星际宝贝史迪奇》":{"what":"迪士尼 2025 年把 2002 年的动画拍成真人版（原名 Lilo & Stitch），讲夏威夷女孩莉萝和闯祸的外星小怪物史迪奇。","what_en":"Disney's 2025 live-action remake of its 2002 cartoon Lilo & Stitch: a Hawaiian girl and a trouble-making little alien.","fame":"在阿根廷是近一年票房第一：上映头 4 天就有约 86 万人去看，占了那几天全国电影观众的四分之三。","fame_en":"Argentina's biggest film of the past year: about 860,000 people saw it in its first four days — three out of every four cinema-goers in the country.","fact":"它把整个 2025 年 5 月的电影院都带火了，那个月阿根廷去电影院的人涨了约六成，当地媒体叫它「史迪奇效应」。","fact_en":"It lifted the whole month: cinema attendance in Argentina jumped by about 60% in May 2025, and local press called it the 'Stitch effect'.","src":"OtrosCines，2025 年 6 月","url":"https://otroscines.com/post/el-efecto-lilo-y-stich-impulso-un-aumento-del-60-en-la-concurrencia-de-mayo-en-los-cines-argentinos","say":{"en":"Two tickets for Lilo & Stitch, the dubbed version, please.","zh":"两张《星际宝贝史迪奇》，要配音版的。"}},"《美杜莎 第二季》":{"what":"哥伦比亚的 Netflix 悬疑剧（原名 Medusa），讲巴兰基亚一个几乎垄断北部海岸生意的富豪家族；第二季 2026 年 9 月上线。","what_en":"A Colombian Netflix thriller (Medusa) about a rich Barranquilla family whose company almost owns Colombia's northern coast; season 2 arrived in September 2026.","fame":"第一季 2025 年 3 月上线第一周，就是 Netflix 全球非英语剧第一；第二季在阿根廷的 Netflix 也进了前十。","fame_en":"Season 1 was Netflix's No. 1 non-English series worldwide in its first week (March 2025), and season 2 made Argentina's Netflix top 10.","fact":"第一季上线才两个星期，Netflix 就宣布续拍第二季，女主角胡安娜·阿科斯塔自己拍视频告诉观众。","fact_en":"Netflix renewed it just two weeks after season 1 launched, and lead actress Juana Acosta announced it herself in a video.","src":"What's on Netflix，2025 年 3 月","url":"https://www.whats-on-netflix.com/news/colombian-thriller-medusa-renewed-for-season-2-at-netflix/","say":{"en":"Are you watching the new season of Medusa? Don't tell me what happens!","zh":"你在追《美杜莎》新一季吗？别告诉我后面怎么了！"}},"瓦伊拉乐队":{"what":"来自阿根廷北部萨尔塔的民谣（folklore）乐队（原名 Los Huayra），几个人一起合唱，把萨姆巴这些老民谣唱得很年轻。","what_en":"A folklore band (Los Huayra) from Salta in northern Argentina, known for their group harmonies and for making old styles like the zamba sound young.","fame":"他们是阿根廷民谣圈最受欢迎的乐队之一，专辑拿过拉丁格莱美提名；全国各地的民谣节和「佩尼亚」（peña，边吃边唱的民谣夜）都请他们。","fame_en":"One of the most popular bands in Argentine folklore, with Latin Grammy nominations; they play folk festivals and peñas — nights of food and live folk music — all over the country.","fact":"现在又火起来的《La Noche Sin Ti》其实是老歌，收在他们 2007 年的第二张专辑《La Voz del Viento》里。","fact_en":"Their current hit 'La Noche Sin Ti' is actually an old song — it's on their second album, La Voz del Viento, from 2007.","src":"Deezer 乐队介绍","url":"https://www.deezer.com/artist/245233","say":{"en":"Is there a peña tonight? I'd love to hear some live folk music.","zh":"今晚有佩尼亚（民谣夜）吗？我很想听现场的民谣。"}},"《神鹰之女》":{"what":"玻利维亚导演阿尔瓦罗·奥尔莫斯·托里科 2026 年的电影（原名 La hija cóndor），用克丘亚语讲一个在安第斯山村帮人接生的女孩，心里想去城里当歌手。","what_en":"A 2026 film (La hija cóndor) by Bolivian director Álvaro Olmos Torrico, mostly in Quechua, about a girl who helps deliver babies in an Andean village but dreams of singing in the city.","fame":"2026 年 5 月在玻利维亚上映后，成了近十年最多人看的玻利维亚电影之一；克丘亚族的接生婆第一次成了大银幕的主角。","fame_en":"After opening in Bolivia in May 2026, it became one of the most-watched Bolivian films of the past ten years — and put Quechua midwives at the centre of the big screen.","fact":"在回家乡上映之前，它已经在国外电影节拿了 25 个奖，直到 2026 年 5 月 7 日才在玻利维亚的电影院上映。","fact_en":"It had already won 25 awards at festivals abroad before it finally opened in Bolivian cinemas on 7 May 2026.","src":"Los Tiempos，2026 年 5 月","url":"https://www.lostiempos.com/doble-click/cine/20260503/hija-condor-se-estrena-bolivia-cosechar-25-premios-internacionales","say":{"en":"Is it in Quechua with Spanish subtitles?","zh":"它是克丘亚语配西班牙语字幕的吗？"}},"《侏罗纪世界：重生》":{"what":"《侏罗纪》系列 2025 年的新片（原名 Jurassic World: Rebirth），斯嘉丽·约翰逊带一支小队去赤道附近的岛上，从恐龙身上取 DNA 做药。","what_en":"The 2025 Jurassic film (Jurassic World: Rebirth): Scarlett Johansson leads a team to an island near the equator to collect dinosaur DNA for a new medicine.","fame":"在玻利维亚是近一年票房第一的电影；恐龙、丛林、追逐，全家都能看。","fame_en":"Bolivia's top film of the past year — dinosaurs, jungle and chases that the whole family can watch.","fact":"它全球上映头 5 天约收 3.18 亿美元，在整个系列里只比 2015 年的第一部《侏罗纪世界》少。","fact_en":"It took about $318 million worldwide in its first five days — second only to the first Jurassic World (2015) in the whole series.","src":"Variety，2025 年 7 月","url":"https://au.variety.com/2025/film/global/box-office-jurassic-world-rebirth-global-opening-weekend-lilo-stitch-nears-1-billion-24634/","say":{"en":"Is there a 3D showing tonight, or only 2D?","zh":"今晚有 3D 场吗？还是只有 2D？"}},"《深海之下（暂无通行中译）》":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年的 6 集限定剧（原名 Below），乔什·哈奈特演加拿大纽芬兰小渔村的渔夫，海里出现了一个怪物，他要护住家人和整个村子。","what_en":"A six-episode 2026 Netflix limited series (Below): Josh Hartnett plays a fisherman in a small Newfoundland town who must protect his family and neighbours from a sea creature.","fame":"2026 年 10 月 8 日一次上线全部 6 集，很快冲到玻利维亚 Netflix 剧集周榜第一；一半是怪物惊悚，一半是小镇家庭剧。","fame_en":"All six episodes dropped on 8 October 2026 and it quickly hit No. 1 on Bolivia's weekly Netflix series chart — half creature horror, half small-town family drama.","fact":"上线头几天就有约 1700 万次观看，Netflix 说这是加拿大出品的剧在 Netflix 上开播成绩最好的一次。","fact_en":"It drew about 17 million views in its first days — Netflix says that's the biggest debut ever for a Canadian title on the service.","src":"Canadian Press / CP24，2026 年 10 月","url":"https://www.cp24.com/news/entertainment/2026/10/13/newfoundland-thriller-below-reels-in-record-audience-for-a-canadian-netflix-title/","say":{"en":"Don't spoil it — I'm only on episode two!","zh":"别剧透，我才看到第二集！"}},"路易斯·维加":{"what":"玻利维亚歌手（原名 Luis Vega），唱墨西哥地区音乐（música regional mexicana）那种风格，很多歌是他自己写的。","what_en":"A Bolivian singer-songwriter (Luis Vega) who sings in the style of regional Mexican music and writes many of his own songs.","fame":"2023 年他自己写的《Bailando Conmigo》在 YouTube 上很快过了一千万次播放，让他走出玻利维亚；他也连着两年拿了玻利维亚音乐奖的年度男歌手。","fame_en":"His self-penned 2023 song 'Bailando Conmigo' quickly passed ten million YouTube views and took him beyond Bolivia; he was also named male artist of the year at the Bolivia Music Awards two years running.","fact":"2023 年他被请去给美国得州的墨西哥地区音乐乐队 Grupo Frontera 在智利和阿根廷的演出做暖场。","fact_en":"In 2023 he was chosen as the opening act for Texas regional-Mexican band Grupo Frontera's shows in Chile and Argentina.","src":"Correo del Sur，2023 年 7 月","url":"https://correodelsur.com/genteflash/20230717/luis-vega-sera-telonero-de-grupo-frontera-en-chile-y-argentina.html","say":{"en":"Who's this singer? He's Bolivian? I thought he was Mexican!","zh":"这是谁唱的？玻利维亚人？我还以为是墨西哥人！"}},"《我仍在此》":{"what":"巴西导演沃尔特·塞勒斯 2024 年的电影（原名 Ainda Estou Aqui），讲 1970 年代军政府时期，里约一位母亲在丈夫被带走、从此失踪后，带着五个孩子撑下去。","what_en":"Walter Salles's 2024 film (Ainda Estou Aqui / I'm Still Here): during Brazil's military dictatorship in the 1970s, a Rio mother holds her five children together after her husband is taken away and disappears.","fame":"2025 年拿下奥斯卡最佳国际影片，是第一部拿这个奖的巴西电影；很多巴西家庭是全家一起去电影院看的。","fame_en":"In 2025 it became the first Brazilian film to win the Oscar for Best International Feature, and many Brazilian families went to see it together.","fact":"在巴西有超过 500 万人次去电影院看它，进了巴西电影史上观众最多的 20 部本国片。","fact_en":"More than five million people saw it in Brazilian cinemas, putting it among the 20 most-watched Brazilian films ever.","src":"Jovem Pan，2025 年 2 月","url":"https://jovempan.com.br/entretenimento/tv-e-cinema/ainda-estou-aqui-alcanca-5-milhoes-de-espectadores-no-brasil/","say":{"en":"I heard it's really moving. Should I bring tissues?","zh":"听说很感人，我要不要带纸巾？"}},"《星际宝贝史迪奇》·巴西":{"what":"迪士尼 2025 年的真人版《星际宝贝》（原名 Lilo & Stitch），夏威夷女孩和闯祸外星小怪物的故事。","what_en":"Disney's 2025 live-action Lilo & Stitch: a Hawaiian girl and a trouble-making little alien.","fame":"巴西 2025 年看的人最多的电影；首映 4 天就有约 270 万人次，是那年巴西最大的首映。","fame_en":"Brazil's most-watched film of 2025: about 2.7 million tickets in its first four days, the country's biggest opening that year.","fact":"它上映的那个周末，巴西全国电影院四天卖了 8100 多万雷亚尔的票，差不多是前一周的三倍。","fact_en":"On its opening weekend, Brazilian cinemas sold more than R$81 million in tickets in four days — roughly triple the week before.","src":"Bloomberg Línea，2025 年 5 月","url":"https://www.bloomberglinea.com.br/negocios/volta-ao-cinema-stitch-tom-cruise-e-ney-matogrosso-triplicam-bilheteria-no-brasil/","say":{"en":"Is this showing dubbed or subtitled?","zh":"这一场是配音的还是字幕的？"}},"《有爱就有守护》":{"what":"巴西环球电视台（TV Globo）2026 年的晚九点档电视小说（novela，原名 Quem Ama Cuida），编剧是瓦尔西尔·卡拉斯科，托尼·拉莫斯、安东尼奥·法贡德斯这些老演员都在里面。","what_en":"TV Globo's 2026 nine o'clock telenovela (Quem Ama Cuida), written by Walcyr Carrasco, with veteran actors such as Tony Ramos and Antônio Fagundes.","fame":"晚九点的 novela 是很多巴西家庭吃完晚饭一起看的节目，第二天大家在公司、群里接着聊剧情。","fame_en":"The nine o'clock novela is what many Brazilian families watch together after dinner — and the next day everyone discusses it at work and in group chats.","fact":"它开播第一周在大圣保罗平均只有约 21 点收视，被说成晚九点档最弱的开局之一，后来才慢慢涨上去。","fact_en":"Its first week averaged only about 21 rating points in Greater São Paulo, one of the weakest starts for a nine o'clock novela, before it slowly climbed.","src":"Portal Tela，2026 年 5 月","url":"https://www.portaltela.com/entretenimento/series-e-filmes/2026/05/25/audiencia-da-primeira-semana-de-quem-ama-cuida-e-divulgada/","say":{"en":"Did you see last night's episode of Quem Ama Cuida?","zh":"你看昨晚那集《有爱就有守护》了吗？"}},"泽·内托与克里斯蒂亚诺":{"what":"巴西的乡村音乐（sertanejo）二人组（原名 Zé Neto & Cristiano），2011 年组合；《Cadeira Cativa》出自他们庆祝出道 15 年的专辑《Vocês & Deus》。","what_en":"A Brazilian sertanejo (country) duo, Zé Neto & Cristiano, together since 2011; 'Cadeira Cativa' comes from Vocês & Deus, the project celebrating their 15 years.","fame":"sertanejo 是巴西最多人听的音乐之一，他们 2019 年拿过 Multishow 奖的年度组合；演唱会和牛仔节上，全场都会跟着唱。","fame_en":"Sertanejo is one of Brazil's most-listened genres, and they won Duo of the Year at the 2019 Multishow awards; at their concerts and rodeos the whole crowd sings along.","fact":"两个人第一次一起唱歌是在一场家庭烧烤（churrasco）上：克里斯蒂亚诺试着给泽·内托配了第二声部。","fact_en":"The first time they sang together was at a family barbecue (churrasco), when Cristiano tried singing the second voice to Zé Neto's lead.","src":"Billboard Brasil","url":"https://billboard.com.br/ze-neto-cristiano-revelam-primeira-vez-cantando-juntos/","say":{"en":"Who's playing at the rodeo this year?","zh":"今年牛仔节谁来唱？"}},"《我们的姑嫂们》":{"what":"魁北克 2024 年的法语歌舞喜剧电影（原名 Nos belles-sœurs），导演勒内·理查德·西尔，改编自米歇尔·特朗布莱的名剧：蒙特利尔一个主妇中了一百万张积分贴花，叫姐妹邻居来家里帮她贴。","what_en":"A 2024 Quebec French-language musical comedy (Nos belles-sœurs) by René Richard Cyr, based on Michel Tremblay's famous play: a Montreal housewife wins a million trading stamps and invites her sisters and neighbours over to stick them in books.","fame":"特朗布莱的原剧让魁北克人第一次在大舞台上听到自己街坊的说话方式；电影 2024 年夏天成了魁北克本地片里最卖座的之一，加拿大近年最卖座的本国片也有它。","fame_en":"Tremblay's play was the first time Quebecers heard their own street French on a big stage; the film became one of Quebec's biggest local hits in summer 2024 and one of Canada's top homegrown films in recent years.","fact":"它 2024 年 7 月 11 日上映，一周就过了一百万加元——在魁北克，这就算是大卖的门槛。","fact_en":"It opened on 11 July 2024 and passed one million Canadian dollars in a single week — the benchmark for a hit in the Quebec market.","src":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sisters_and_Neighbors!","say":{"en":"Is it in French with English subtitles?","zh":"是法语配英文字幕的吗？"}},"《我的世界大电影》":{"what":"2025 年根据游戏《我的世界》（Minecraft）拍的真人电影（原名 A Minecraft Movie），杰克·布莱克演史蒂夫，杰森·莫玛也在里面。","what_en":"The 2025 live-action film of the game Minecraft (A Minecraft Movie), with Jack Black as Steve and Jason Momoa.","fame":"在加拿大是近一年票房第一；玩过游戏的孩子和陪孩子长大的大人一起去看，全球首周末就收了约 3 亿美元。","fame_en":"Canada's top film of the past year: kids who play the game went with the adults who grew up watching them play, and it took about $300 million worldwide on its first weekend.","fact":"它大部分是在新西兰奥克兰的摄影棚里对着绿幕拍的；片里那个美国小镇的戏，是在新西兰的小镇亨特利拍的。","fact_en":"Most of it was shot in front of green screens at a studio in Auckland, New Zealand — and the small American town in the film is actually Huntly, New Zealand.","src":"Screen Auckland","url":"https://screenauckland.com/case-studies/minecraft-movie-bringing-the-blockbuster-world-to-life-in-auckland","say":{"en":"Can I get a large popcorn and two Cokes, please?","zh":"我要一份大桶爆米花和两杯可乐。"}},"《伊甸之东》·加拿大":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年的 7 集限定剧（原名 East of Eden），改编自斯坦贝克 1952 年的小说，佐伊·卡赞编剧，弗洛伦丝·皮尤演书里最狠的反派凯茜。","what_en":"A seven-episode 2026 Netflix limited series (East of Eden) based on Steinbeck's 1952 novel, written by Zoe Kazan, with Florence Pugh as the book's darkest villain, Cathy.","fame":"2026 年 10 月 1 日上线，影评几乎都说皮尤演得最好；在加拿大很多人追，看完又去找原著。","fame_en":"It launched on 1 October 2026, and nearly every review singled out Pugh; many Canadians binged it and then went looking for the novel.","fact":"编剧佐伊·卡赞的祖父就是伊利亚·卡赞——1955 年詹姆斯·迪恩主演的电影版《伊甸之东》就是他导的；Netflix 说这部剧也在向那部老电影致敬。","fact_en":"Writer Zoe Kazan's grandfather is Elia Kazan, who directed the 1955 film of East of Eden starring James Dean — and Netflix says the series pays homage to it.","src":"Netflix 官方新闻","url":"https://about.netflix.com/en/news/netflix-orders-limited-series-adaptation-of-john-steinbecks-classic-east-of","say":{"en":"Have you read the book, or are you just watching the show?","zh":"你读过原著，还是只看剧？"}},"德雷克":{"what":"多伦多长大的说唱歌手（原名 Drake），也唱 R&B，是这二十年最卖座的说唱歌手之一。","what_en":"A Toronto-raised rapper and R&B singer (Drake), one of the best-selling rap artists of the past twenty years.","fame":"2026 年 5 月他一次发了三张专辑，其中《Iceman》里的《Janice STFU》一出来就是美国 Billboard 百强单曲榜第一，在加拿大榜上也待了好几周冠军。","fame_en":"In May 2026 he released three albums at once; 'Janice STFU' from Iceman debuted at No. 1 on the US Billboard Hot 100 and held No. 1 in Canada for weeks.","fact":"那三张专辑同一周包揽了 Billboard 200 专辑榜前三名——这张榜 1956 年开始每周发布以来，第一次有歌手做到。","fact_en":"The three albums took the top three spots on the Billboard 200 in the same week — the first time any artist had done that since the chart began weekly publication in 1956.","src":"Billboard Canada，2026 年 5 月","url":"https://ca.billboard.com/music/chart-beat/drake-iceman-habibti-maid-of-honour-top-billboard-200-chart","say":{"en":"Have you heard the new Drake albums? Which one's your favourite?","zh":"你听德雷克的新专辑了吗？最喜欢哪一张？"}},"《星际宝贝史迪奇》·智利":{"what":"迪士尼 2025 年的真人版《星际宝贝》（原名 Lilo & Stitch），夏威夷女孩和闯祸外星小怪物的故事。","what_en":"Disney's 2025 live-action Lilo & Stitch: a Hawaiian girl and a trouble-making little alien.","fame":"智利近一年票房第一；2025 年 5 月底首映时，是那年智利最好的首映。","fame_en":"Chile's top film of the past year; when it opened in late May 2025 it was the country's best opening of the year so far.","fact":"智利媒体统计，它首映周末的观众人数排进了智利有史以来的第四名。","fact_en":"Chilean press reported that its opening-weekend audience ranked fourth among all films ever released in Chile.","src":"Emol，2025 年 5 月","url":"https://www.emol.com/noticias/Espectaculos/2025/05/26/1167416/furor-lilo--stich-chile.html","say":{"en":"Could we sit a bit further back? The front rows are too close.","zh":"能坐靠后一点吗？前排太近了。"}},"《重聚》":{"what":"智利 Mega 电视台的夜间档电视剧（原名 Reunión de superados），2025 年 9 月 23 日开播，讲几对男女和前任之间理不清的感情。","what_en":"A late-evening drama (Reunión de superados) on Chile's Mega channel, which began on 23 September 2025, about couples who can't quite get over their exes.","fame":"在智利是黄金档收视最好的剧之一：2026 年 8 月平均每分钟约 75 万人在看，那个月总共有约 488 万观众看过。","fame_en":"One of Chile's top prime-time shows: in August 2026 it averaged about 755,000 viewers a minute and reached about 4.9 million people that month.","fact":"它首播那晚，智利网友立刻刷起表情包，说它是「又一个 cuicos（有钱人家）的故事」。","fact_en":"The night it premiered, Chilean social media filled with memes calling it 'another story about cuicos' — Chilean slang for posh people.","src":"En Cancha，2025 年 9 月","url":"https://www.encancha.cl/tiempox/redes/2025/09/24/otra-historia-de-cuicos-los-mejores-memes-y-reacciones-que-dejo-el-estreno-de-reunion-de-superados/","say":{"en":"No spoilers! I'm saving last night's episode for the weekend.","zh":"别剧透！昨晚那集我要留到周末看。"}},"克里斯MJ":{"what":"智利的雷鬼顿（reggaeton）歌手（原名 Cris MJ），新歌《No Me Suman》现在在智利很火。","what_en":"A Chilean reggaeton singer (Cris MJ) whose new song 'No Me Suman' is big in Chile right now.","fame":"他 2023 年的《Una Noche en Medellín》红遍拉美，同年成了 Spotify 上听众最多的智利歌手。","fame_en":"His 2023 song 'Una Noche en Medellín' spread across Latin America, and that year he became the most-streamed Chilean artist on Spotify.","fact":"2023 年 2 月，哥伦比亚歌手卡罗尔 G 在维尼亚德尔马音乐节第一晚把他请上台，两人一起唱了《Una Noche en Medellín》。","fact_en":"In February 2023, Colombian star Karol G brought him on stage on the first night of the Viña del Mar festival to sing 'Una Noche en Medellín' together.","src":"Meganoticias，2023 年 2 月","url":"https://www.meganoticias.cl/tendencias/406047-cris-mj-karol-g-festival-de-vina-reacciones-publico-redes-sociales-19-02-2023.html","say":{"en":"Put on some Cris MJ — this party needs reggaeton!","zh":"放点克里斯MJ吧，这个派对需要雷鬼顿！"}},"《星际宝贝史迪奇》·哥伦比亚":{"what":"迪士尼 2025 年的真人版《星际宝贝》（原名 Lilo & Stitch），夏威夷女孩和闯祸外星小怪物的故事。","what_en":"Disney's 2025 live-action Lilo & Stitch: a Hawaiian girl and a trouble-making little alien.","fame":"哥伦比亚近一年票房第一；首映那个周末全国卖出约 122 万张票，是那年当时最好的首映。","fame_en":"Colombia's top film of the past year: about 1.22 million tickets on its opening weekend, the best opening of the year at that point.","fact":"它后来上了 Disney+，开播头几天就有超过 1400 万次观看。","fact_en":"When it later arrived on Disney+, it racked up more than 14 million views in its first days.","src":"Colombia.com","url":"https://www.colombia.com/cine/noticias/lilo-y-stitch-llego-rompiendo-records-a-disney-plus-con-mas-de-14-millones-de-visualizaciones-en-su-estreno-534494","say":{"en":"Is there a Spanish-dubbed showing for the kids?","zh":"有给孩子看的西语配音场吗？"}},"《美杜莎》":{"what":"哥伦比亚 Netflix 2025 年的 12 集悬疑剧（原名 Medusa），故事在加勒比海边的巴兰基亚：富豪 Hidalgo 家族的接班人 Bárbara，在接手家族公司 Medusa 那天出了事。","what_en":"A 12-episode 2025 Colombian Netflix thriller (Medusa) set in Caribbean Barranquilla: Bárbara, heir of the wealthy Hidalgo family, has an 'accident' on the day she takes over the family company.","fame":"本地城市、本地口音、本地演员，哥伦比亚人很爱看；在哥伦比亚 Netflix 前十待了很久，第二季也出了。","fame_en":"A local city, local accents and local actors — Colombians loved it; it stayed in Colombia's Netflix top 10 for a long time and got a second season.","fact":"它 2025 年 3 月上线第一周，就冲到 Netflix 全球非英语剧集榜第一。","fact_en":"In its first week in March 2025 it went straight to No. 1 on Netflix's global chart for non-English series.","src":"Forbes Colombia，2025 年 3 月","url":"https://forbes.co/2025/03/12/forbes-life/serie-colombiana-medusa-alcanzo-el-primer-puesto-en-el-ranking-global-de-las-mas-vistas-de-netflix","say":{"en":"Is Medusa really filmed in Barranquilla?","zh":"《美杜莎》真的是在巴兰基亚拍的吗？"}},"布莱斯德":{"what":"麦德林的雷鬼顿歌手（原名 Blessd），2019 年靠单曲《Una》在网上走红，2021 年出了首张专辑《Hecho en Medellín》（麦德林制造）。","what_en":"A reggaeton singer from Medellín (Blessd) who went viral with the single 'Una' in 2019 and released his debut album Hecho en Medellín ('Made in Medellín') in 2021.","fame":"他是麦德林新一代雷鬼顿的代表之一；2026 年的新歌《SUPERSTAR》在哥伦比亚到处都在放。","fame_en":"One of the faces of Medellín's new reggaeton generation; his 2026 song 'SUPERSTAR' is playing everywhere in Colombia.","fact":"2026 年 3 月 28 日，他在家乡的阿塔纳西奥·希拉尔多体育场开了自己在麦德林的第一场体育场演唱会，唱了约五个小时，请了 15 位以上的嘉宾。","fact_en":"On 28 March 2026 he played his first-ever stadium show in his hometown, at Medellín's Atanasio Girardot — about five hours long, with more than 15 guests.","src":"Noticias RCN，2026 年 3 月","url":"https://www.noticiasrcn.com/tendencias/blessd-en-medellin-asi-fue-el-concierto-con-mas-de-15-invitados-1006771","say":{"en":"This Blessd song is everywhere in Medellín right now!","zh":"布莱斯德这首歌现在麦德林到处都在放！"}},"《燃烧身体的记忆》":{"what":"哥斯达黎加导演安东内拉·苏达萨西 2024 年的电影（原名 Memorias de un cuerpo que arde），三位六十多岁的女人说起自己年轻时对身体、爱和性的事，大人从来不让她们问。","what_en":"Costa Rican director Antonella Sudasassi's 2024 film (Memorias de un cuerpo que arde / Memories of a Burning Body): three women in their sixties talk about the body, love and sex they were never allowed to ask about growing up.","fame":"哥斯达黎加近年最卖座的本国电影之一；被选去代表哥斯达黎加竞争第 97 届奥斯卡和西班牙戈雅奖，还拿到了戈雅奖提名。","fame_en":"One of Costa Rica's top-selling local films of recent years; it was the country's entry for the 97th Oscars and Spain's Goya Awards — and won a Goya nomination.","fact":"它 2024 年 2 月在柏林电影节「全景」单元首映，拿了这个单元的观众奖。","fact_en":"It premiered in the Panorama section of the Berlin Film Festival in February 2024 and won that section's Audience Award.","src":"BTA Films 影片资料","url":"https://btafilms.com/memories-of-a-burning-body/","say":{"en":"It's a quiet film, but my grandma would love it.","zh":"这是部很安静的电影，不过我奶奶一定会喜欢。"}},"《并非陌生人》":{"what":"土耳其的 Netflix 心理惊悚剧（原名 Not a Stranger，土耳其语 Seni Tanıyorum，意思是「我认识你」），一个画家生完孩子想回去工作，请了个保姆，家里开始出事。","what_en":"A Turkish Netflix psychological thriller (Not a Stranger; Turkish title Seni Tanıyorum, 'I know you'): a painter hires a nanny so she can go back to work after having a baby — and the family starts to unravel.","fame":"2026 年 9 月 17 日上线，在哥斯达黎加是很多人在追的剧；一共 8 集，周末一口气就能看完。","fame_en":"Released on 17 September 2026, it became a big talking point in Costa Rica; eight episodes, easy to finish in one weekend.","fact":"上线没几天，它就进了 62 个国家的 Netflix 前十，从法国、巴西到日本、韩国都有。","fact_en":"Within days it was in Netflix's top 10 in 62 countries, from France and Brazil to Japan and South Korea.","src":"TalkAndroid，2026 年 9 月","url":"https://www.talkandroid.com/532616-this-turkish-psychological-thriller-just-took-over-netflixs-global-top-10whats-behind-the-obsession-87321/","say":{"en":"Would you ever hire a nanny you found online?","zh":"你会请一个网上找的保姆吗？"}},"多里安·安皮耶":{"what":"哥斯达黎加的城市音乐（雷鬼顿、说唱一类）歌手（原名 Dorian Ampie），代表歌是《Voy pa' La calle》。","what_en":"A Costa Rican urban-music singer (Dorian Ampie) — reggaeton and rap — best known for 'Voy pa' La calle'.","fame":"他是哥斯达黎加本地榜上最常见的名字之一，歌在当地年轻人的派对和公交车上常常能听到。","fame_en":"He is one of the names you see most on Costa Rica's local charts, and his songs play at young people's parties and on buses.","fact":"2026 年 10 月底，他同时有好几首歌挂在哥斯达黎加的 Spotify 榜上：《Catalina Santana》排第 4，《Voy pa' La calle》排第 10。","fact_en":"At the end of October 2026 he had several songs on Costa Rica's Spotify chart at once: 'Catalina Santana' at No. 4 and 'Voy pa' La calle' at No. 10.","src":"Kworb 排行数据，2026 年 10 月","url":"https://kworb.net/itunes/artist/dorianampie.html","say":{"en":"Who's this? Is he from Costa Rica? Send me the song!","zh":"这是谁唱的？哥斯达黎加人吗？把歌发给我！"}},"《滨海大道》":{"what":"2025 年在古巴拍的电影（原名 Malecón），西班牙导演卡洛斯·拉拉萨瓦尔的第一部长片：一个坐了十年牢的年轻人回到哈瓦那老街区，要在出走和留下之间做选择。","what_en":"A 2025 film shot in Cuba (Malecón), the first feature by Spanish director Carlos Larrazábal: after ten years in prison, a young man returns to his Havana neighbourhood and must choose between leaving and staying.","fame":"2025 年在迈阿密电影节做了全球首映；古巴观众在里面看到了自己身边的事——要不要走，是很多古巴家庭的日常话题。","fame_en":"It had its world premiere at the 2025 Miami Film Festival; Cuban audiences saw their own lives in it — whether to leave is an everyday question for many Cuban families.","fact":"古巴电影学院（ICAIC）把它选为古巴竞争 2027 年奥斯卡最佳国际影片的候选片。","fact_en":"Cuba's film institute (ICAIC) chose it as the country's candidate for Best International Feature at the 2027 Oscars.","src":"Directorio Cubano，2026 年","url":"https://www.directoriocubano.info/?p=153235","say":{"en":"Shall we walk along the Malecón at sunset?","zh":"日落的时候我们去滨海大道走走好不好？"}},"《驯龙高手》":{"what":"2025 年的真人版《驯龙高手》（原名 How to Train Your Dragon），维京少年小嗝嗝和黑龙「没牙」的故事；导演就是当年动画版的导演迪恩·德布洛斯。","what_en":"The 2025 live-action How to Train Your Dragon — Viking boy Hiccup and his dragon Toothless — directed by Dean DeBlois, who also made the animated original.","fame":"在厄瓜多尔是近一年票房第一的电影；看过动画的大人带着孩子再看一遍。","fame_en":"Ecuador's top film of the past year; adults who loved the cartoon took their kids to see it all over again.","fact":"它在北美首映周末收了约 8370 万美元，把之前领跑的《星际宝贝史迪奇》挤了下去。","fact_en":"It opened with about $83.7 million in North America, knocking Lilo & Stitch off the top spot.","src":"Fortune，2025 年 6 月","url":"https://fortune.com/2025/06/16/how-to-train-your-dragon-83-million-box-office-disney-lilo-stitch-live-action-remakes","say":{"en":"Did you like the cartoon or the live-action version better?","zh":"你更喜欢动画版还是真人版？"}},"《美杜莎 第二季》·厄瓜多尔":{"what":"哥伦比亚 Netflix 悬疑剧《美杜莎》（原名 Medusa）的第二季，2026 年 9 月上线：女主角 Bárbara 回到巴兰基亚，正式接手家族公司。","what_en":"Season 2 of the Colombian Netflix thriller Medusa, released in September 2026: Bárbara returns to Barranquilla and takes over the family company for real.","fame":"在厄瓜多尔的 Netflix 也进了前十；邻国的家族悬疑剧，口音和生活都很熟悉。","fame_en":"It made Ecuador's Netflix top 10 — a family thriller from next door, with familiar accents and lives.","fact":"第二季的新线索指向一个叫「El Demonio Hidalgo」（Hidalgo 家的魔鬼）的人，他可能要了 Bárbara 的命。","fact_en":"Season 2's new trail leads to someone called 'El Demonio Hidalgo' (the Hidalgo Devil), who could put Bárbara's life at risk.","src":"Publimetro Colombia，2026 年 9 月","url":"https://www.publimetro.co/entretenimiento/2026/09/02/medusa-regresa-a-netflix-con-una-segunda-temporada-cargada-de-secretos-y-nuevas-amenazas/","say":{"en":"Who do you think the Hidalgo Devil is?","zh":"你觉得「Hidalgo 家的魔鬼」是谁？"}},"宗布里尔":{"what":"来自厄瓜多尔海边埃斯梅拉达斯省的雷鬼顿歌手（原名 Jombriel），代表歌是《Vitamina》。","what_en":"A reggaeton singer (Jombriel) from Esmeraldas on Ecuador's coast, best known for 'Vitamina'.","fame":"《Vitamina》成了厄瓜多尔 Spotify 史上播放最多的歌；2025 年他是厄瓜多尔 Spotify 上被听得最多的歌手。","fame_en":"'Vitamina' became the most-streamed song in the history of Spotify Ecuador, and in 2025 he was Ecuador's most-listened artist on Spotify.","fact":"2025 年春天，《Vitamina》冲进了 Spotify 全球 Top 50——厄瓜多尔歌手很少能做到。","fact_en":"In spring 2025 'Vitamina' broke into Spotify's Global Top 50 — something Ecuadorian artists rarely achieve.","src":"El Diario（厄瓜多尔），2025 年 4 月","url":"https://www.eldiario.ec/espectaculos/el-ecuatoriano-jombriel-alcanza-el-top-50-global-de-spotify-con-vitamina-04042025/","say":{"en":"Turn it up — this is the Ecuadorian song everyone's playing!","zh":"开大声点，这就是大家都在放的那首厄瓜多尔歌！"}},"《丽塔》":{"what":"危地马拉导演海罗·布斯塔曼特 2024 年的电影（原名 Rita），一个 13 岁女孩为了逃离家暴的父亲离开家，带一点奇幻色彩。","what_en":"Guatemalan director Jayro Bustamante's 2024 film (Rita), a story with touches of fantasy about a 13-year-old girl who leaves home to escape an abusive father.","fame":"危地马拉近年最卖座的本国电影之一；它被选去代表危地马拉竞争第 97 届奥斯卡——这已经是布斯塔曼特第三次代表国家去争奥斯卡。","fame_en":"One of Guatemala's top-selling local films of recent years; it was the country's entry for the 97th Oscars — the third time Bustamante has represented Guatemala.","fact":"它的故事和 2017 年「安全之家」（Hogar Seguro）少女收容所火灾有关；2024 年 8 月在首都首映时，全场为遇难的女孩们鼓掌一分钟。","fact_en":"The story is linked to the 2017 fire at the Hogar Seguro girls' shelter; at its premiere in Guatemala City in August 2024, the audience applauded for a full minute in memory of the girls who died.","src":"Emisoras Unidas，2024 年 8 月","url":"https://emisorasunidas.com/2024/08/08/estreno-rita-un-minuto-de-aplausos-para-victimas-hogar-seguro/","say":{"en":"It's a hard film, but I think everyone should see it.","zh":"这部电影看着很难受，但我觉得每个人都该看。"}},"《并非陌生人》·危地马拉":{"what":"土耳其的 Netflix 心理惊悚剧（原名 Not a Stranger，土耳其语 Seni Tanıyorum），一个新来的保姆慢慢打乱了一个家庭。","what_en":"A Turkish Netflix psychological thriller (Not a Stranger / Seni Tanıyorum) in which a new nanny slowly turns a family upside down.","fame":"在危地马拉也是很多人在追的剧；土耳其剧在拉美一直很受欢迎，这部是 Netflix 自己出品的。","fame_en":"A big hit in Guatemala too — Turkish dramas have long been popular in Latin America, and this one is a Netflix original.","fact":"剧本是土耳其编剧图巴·多安写的，导演是梅尔特·拜卡尔，女主角是土耳其观众很熟悉的埃尔钦·桑古。","fact_en":"It was written by Turkish screenwriter Tuğba Doğan and directed by Mert Baykal, and stars Elçin Sangu, well known to Turkish audiences.","src":"Netflix Tudum","url":"https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/not-a-stranger-release-date-news","say":{"en":"I can't stop watching — just one more episode!","zh":"我停不下来了，就再看一集！"}},"里卡多·阿霍纳":{"what":"危地马拉的创作歌手（原名 Ricardo Arjona），唱了三十多年，歌词像讲故事；《Gritas》出自他 2025 年的专辑《Seco》。","what_en":"A Guatemalan singer-songwriter (Ricardo Arjona) with over thirty years of story-like songs; 'Gritas' is from his 2025 album Seco.","fame":"他是拉美最有名的危地马拉人之一，很多家庭从父母到孩子都会唱他的歌；新巡演叫「Lo que el Seco no dijo」。","fame_en":"One of the best-known Guatemalans in Latin America — parents and children alike sing his songs; his new tour is called 'Lo que el Seco no dijo'.","fact":"2026 年他在布宜诺斯艾利斯的 Movistar Arena 一共宣布了 12 场演唱会，门票一场接一场卖光。","fact_en":"In 2026 he announced a total of 12 shows at Buenos Aires's Movistar Arena, selling them out one after another.","src":"Cadena 3","url":"https://www.cadena3.com/noticia/espectaculos/ricardo-arjona-anuncia-12-shows-en-el-movistar-arena-de-buenos-aires-en-2026_487593","say":{"en":"My parents love Arjona. Shall we get them tickets?","zh":"我爸妈很爱阿霍纳。要不要给他们买票？"}},"《炖豌豆》":{"what":"牙买加 2026 年的本土心理惊悚片（原名 Stew Peas，就是牙买加家常菜「炖豌豆」），编剧兼导演是索西西亚·尼克森-凯利，融合了西非的灵性传统和牙买加民间传说。","what_en":"A 2026 Jamaican psychological thriller (Stew Peas — named after the home-style dish), written and directed by Sosiessia Nixon-Kelly, blending West African spiritual traditions with Jamaican folklore.","fame":"牙买加近年最卖座的本国电影；2026 年 7 月 22 日在全岛上映，首周末排票房第二，只输给好莱坞大片《奥德赛》。","fame_en":"Jamaica's top-selling homegrown film of recent years: it opened island-wide on 22 July 2026 and finished its first weekend second, behind only the Hollywood blockbuster The Odyssey.","fact":"在牙买加大卖之后，它又在 7 个加勒比国家和地区的电影院上映，然后才去美国。","fact_en":"After its success at home, it rolled out to cinemas in seven other Caribbean territories before heading to the United States.","src":"Jamaica Gleaner，2026 年 10 月","url":"https://jamaica-gleaner.com/article/entertainment/20261012/regional-theatrical-release-stew-peas","say":{"en":"Have you seen Stew Peas? Is it really that scary?","zh":"你看《炖豌豆》了吗？真有那么吓人吗？"}},"《不同的世界》":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年的情景喜剧（原名 A Different World），是 1987 年同名美剧的续集：老剧主角德韦恩和惠特利的女儿进了虚构的黑人大学希尔曼学院，开始大学新生活。","what_en":"Netflix's 2026 sitcom (A Different World), a sequel to the 1987 show: Dwayne and Whitley's daughter starts her own life at fictional Hillman College, a historically Black university.","fame":"在牙买加是很多人在追的剧；新版一共 10 集、每集半小时，老版的几位演员也回来了，很多人是和爸妈一起看的。","fame_en":"A show many Jamaicans are following: ten half-hour episodes, with several original cast members returning — many people watch it with their parents.","fact":"新版的外景是在美国亚特兰大拍的——那里正好聚集着好几所真实的传统黑人大学。","fact_en":"The new series was filmed in Atlanta, home to a cluster of real historically Black colleges.","src":"WABE（亚特兰大公共电台）","url":"https://www.wabe.org/?p=883732","say":{"en":"My mum watched the original — now we're watching the new one together.","zh":"我妈看过老版，现在我们一起看新版。"}},"斯基帕":{"what":"牙买加的舞厅雷鬼（dancehall）歌手（原名 Skippa），生在圣安区，现在住在纽约布鲁克林，风格混了 trap。","what_en":"A Jamaican dancehall artist (Skippa), born in St Ann and now living in Brooklyn, with a trap-influenced sound.","fame":"2025 年他在牙买加 YouTube 上的播放量只排在 Chronic Law 和 Vybz Kartel 后面；代表歌《WYFL》上过牙买加 YouTube 和 Apple Music 的第一。","fame_en":"In 2025 only Chronic Law and Vybz Kartel out-streamed him on YouTube in Jamaica; his anthem 'WYFL' topped Jamaica's YouTube and Apple Music charts.","fact":"《WYFL》是在 DJ Mac 和 CrashDummy 做的一段 trap 风伴奏（riddim）上录的，官方点播已经超过 580 万次；2026 年 Billboard 给了他「加勒比新星」奖。","fact_en":"'WYFL' was recorded on a trap-infused riddim by DJ Mac and CrashDummy and has passed 5.8 million official on-demand streams; in 2026 Billboard gave him its Caribbean Rising Star award.","src":"Caribbean National Weekly，2026 年","url":"https://www.caribbeannationalweekly.com/posts/dancehall-star-skippa-receives-billboard-caribbean-rising-star-award","say":{"en":"What riddim is this? It's so catchy!","zh":"这是哪个 riddim？太上头了！"}},"《婚礼礼物台》":{"what":"墨西哥 2025 年的爱情喜剧（原名 Mesa de regalos，就是婚礼上的礼物登记单），何塞·爱德华多·德尔贝斯和卡桑德拉·桑切斯-纳瓦罗主演，一场婚礼牵出一串乌龙。","what_en":"A 2025 Mexican romantic comedy (Mesa de regalos — the wedding gift registry), starring José Eduardo Derbez and Cassandra Sánchez-Navarro, where one wedding sets off a chain of mix-ups.","fame":"2025 年墨西哥票房第一的本国电影，墨西哥电影院协会统计约 1.37 亿比索；后来在 Disney+ 上也很受欢迎。","fame_en":"Mexico's top-grossing homegrown film of 2025 — about 136.6 million pesos according to the national cinema chamber — and later a hit on Disney+.","fact":"它 2025 年 1 月 16 日上映，首周末约 2200 万比索、29.6 万人次，是墨西哥电影六年来最好的开画。","fact_en":"It opened on 16 January 2025 with about 22 million pesos and 296,000 admissions — the best debut for a Mexican film in six years.","src":"Paloma & Nacho，2025 年 1 月","url":"https://palomaynacho.com/blog/el-cine-mexicano-hace-su-mejor-debut-en-6-anos/","say":{"en":"Have you checked the gift registry? What are you buying them?","zh":"你看礼物登记单了吗？你打算送他们什么？"}},"《星际宝贝史迪奇》·墨西哥":{"what":"迪士尼 2025 年的真人版《星际宝贝》（原名 Lilo & Stitch），夏威夷女孩和闯祸外星小怪物的故事。","what_en":"Disney's 2025 live-action Lilo & Stitch: a Hawaiian girl and a trouble-making little alien.","fame":"墨西哥近一年票房第一，在墨西哥收了超过 11 亿比索；史迪奇在墨西哥一直特别受欢迎，周边卖得到处都是。","fame_en":"Mexico's top film of the past year, earning over 1.1 billion pesos there; Stitch has always been hugely popular in Mexico, and the merchandise is everywhere.","fact":"除了美国本土，墨西哥是这部电影全世界最大的市场。","fact_en":"Outside the United States, Mexico was the film's biggest market in the world.","src":"SDP Noticias，2025 年","url":"https://www.sdpnoticias.com/espectaculos/cine/lilo-stitch-live-action-entra-al-top-10-de-las-peliculas-mas-taquilleras-de-mexico/","say":{"en":"Two adults and two kids, please. Is there a combo with the Stitch cup?","zh":"两个大人两个小孩。有带史迪奇杯子的套餐吗？"}},"《体能之巅：百人挑战 墨西哥版》":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年的墨西哥本土体能竞技真人秀（原名 Physical 100: México），100 个身材和职业都不一样的人比体能，看谁是最后的冠军。","what_en":"Netflix's 2026 Mexican physical-competition reality show (Physical 100: México): 100 people of every body type and job battle through physical challenges to find one champion.","fame":"一共 9 集，是韩国原版节目的墨西哥本土版；参赛的有运动员、健身教练，也有普通上班族，大家边看边猜谁能赢。","fame_en":"Nine episodes, adapted from the Korean original; contestants include athletes, trainers and ordinary office workers, and viewers love guessing who'll win.","fact":"韩国原版《体能之巅：百人挑战》2023 年是第一个登上 Netflix 全球电视节目榜第一的韩国综艺。","fact_en":"The Korean original, Physical: 100, became the first Korean entertainment show to top Netflix's global TV chart, in 2023.","src":"Korea.net，2023 年 2 月","url":"https://www.korea.net/NewsFocus/Culture/view?articleId=228629","say":{"en":"Who do you think will win — the boxer or the firefighter?","zh":"你觉得谁会赢，拳击手还是消防员？"}},"纳塔纳埃尔·卡诺":{"what":"墨西哥索诺拉州的歌手（原名 Natanael Cano），把传统民谣「科里多」（corrido）和说唱、trap 混在一起，被叫作「corridos tumbados」的开创者之一。","what_en":"A singer from Sonora, Mexico (Natanael Cano) who mixed the traditional corrido ballad with rap and trap — seen as one of the creators of 'corridos tumbados'.","fame":"corridos tumbados 是这几年墨西哥年轻人最爱听的音乐之一；2026 年他出了专辑《Natanael Cano, Vol. 1》，新歌《OLIVIA LA FLAKA》是和几位歌手一起唱的。","fame_en":"Corridos tumbados is one of the most popular sounds among young Mexicans; in 2026 he released the album Natanael Cano, Vol. 1, and 'OLIVIA LA FLAKA' is a collaboration with several other singers.","fact":"2026 年他在墨西哥城的 GNP 保险体育场开演唱会，第一场卖完后又加开了第二场。","fact_en":"In 2026 he played Mexico City's Estadio GNP Seguros — and after the first date sold out, a second one was added.","src":"Infobae，2026 年 8 月","url":"https://www.infobae.com/mexico/2026/08/06/natanael-cano-abre-segunda-fecha-en-el-estadio-gnp/","say":{"en":"Are you going to the concert at the Estadio GNP?","zh":"你去 GNP 体育场的演唱会吗？"}},"《亲爱的热带》":{"what":"巴拿马导演安娜·恩达拉的剧情片（原名 Querido trópico）：一个在巴拿马城打工的哥伦比亚移民女人，去照顾一位开始失智的上流社会老太太，两个孤独的人慢慢靠近。","what_en":"Panamanian director Ana Endara's drama (Querido trópico): a Colombian migrant working in Panama City becomes the carer of a wealthy older woman with early dementia, and two lonely people slowly grow close.","fame":"巴拿马近年最卖座的本国电影之一；2024 年在多伦多和圣塞巴斯蒂安电影节放映，后来被选去代表巴拿马竞争第 98 届奥斯卡。","fame_en":"One of Panama's top-selling local films of recent years; it screened at Toronto and San Sebastián in 2024 and was later chosen as Panama's entry for the 98th Oscars.","fact":"2025 年 4 月，巴拿马国际电影节（IFF Panamá）第 13 届用它做了开幕片。","fact_en":"In April 2025 it opened the 13th International Film Festival of Panama (IFF Panamá).","src":"La Prensa（巴拿马），2025 年","url":"https://www.prensa.com/status-k/querido-tropico-sera-la-pelicula-inaugural-del-iff-panama-2025/","say":{"en":"It's about a carer and the old lady she looks after — very gentle, very sad.","zh":"讲的是一个护工和她照顾的老太太——很温柔，也很伤感。"}},"《并非陌生人》·巴拿马":{"what":"土耳其的 Netflix 心理惊悚剧（原名 Not a Stranger，土耳其语 Seni Tanıyorum），一个新来的保姆慢慢打乱了一个家庭。","what_en":"A Turkish Netflix psychological thriller (Not a Stranger / Seni Tanıyorum) in which a new nanny slowly turns a family upside down.","fame":"在巴拿马也是很多人在追的剧；8 集，悬念一集接一集。","fame_en":"Lots of people in Panama are hooked too — eight episodes, each ending on a cliffhanger.","fact":"它第二周的观看量比第一周多了一倍多，冲到 Netflix 全球非英语剧第一；上线十天就有约 1430 万次观看。","fact_en":"Its viewing more than doubled in week two, taking it to No. 1 on Netflix's global non-English chart; it reached about 14.3 million views in ten days.","src":"What's on Netflix，2026 年 9 月","url":"https://www.whats-on-netflix.com/news/not-a-stranger-netflix-top-10-stats/","say":{"en":"Okay, I trust nobody in this show anymore.","zh":"好了，这部剧里我谁都不信了。"}},"博萨":{"what":"巴拿马歌手（原名 Boza，本名 Humberto Ceballos），1997 年生在巴拿马城，唱的是城市流行加一点非洲节拍（afrobeat）。","what_en":"A Panamanian singer (Boza, real name Humberto Ceballos), born in Panama City in 1997, who mixes urban pop with afrobeat.","fame":"他和委内瑞拉歌手 Elena Rose 合唱的《orióN》红遍拉美，还拿过 Premios Tu Música Urbano 奖；他也上了《福布斯》中美洲 30 岁以下精英榜。","fame_en":"His duet with Venezuelan singer Elena Rose, 'orióN', spread across Latin America and won at the Premios Tu Música Urbano; he was also named to Forbes Central America's 30 Under 30.","fact":"2026 年 6 月，他和巴拿马民俗舞蹈团 Aires Panameños 一起，在 Telemundo 的世界杯开幕游行上代表巴拿马表演。","fact_en":"In June 2026 he represented Panama at Telemundo's World Cup opening parade, performing with the folk dance group Aires Panameños.","src":"La Estrella de Panamá，2026 年 6 月","url":"https://www.laestrella.com.pa/entretenimiento/boza-representa-a-panama-en-desfile-inaugural-mundialista-de-telemundo-NJ23197138","say":{"en":"Who sings this? Can you write the name down for me?","zh":"这是谁唱的？能把名字写给我吗？"}},"《查文德万塔尔：世纪营救》":{"what":"秘鲁 2025 年的电影（原名 Chavín de Huántar, el rescate del siglo），重现 1997 年秘鲁特种部队营救被扣在利马日本大使官邸里的人质的行动。","what_en":"A 2025 Peruvian film (Chavín de Huántar, el rescate del siglo) recreating the 1997 special-forces rescue of hostages held at the Japanese ambassador's residence in Lima.","fame":"秘鲁 2025 年最卖座的本国电影，2025 年 10 月 30 日上映后观众超过 150 万人次；2026 年 4 月上了 Netflix。","fame_en":"Peru's top-selling homegrown film of 2025: it opened on 30 October 2025, drew more than 1.5 million viewers, and reached Netflix in April 2026.","fact":"它挤进了秘鲁电影史上观众最多的前五名，把老牌喜剧《Locos de amor》挤了下去。","fact_en":"It entered the top five most-watched Peruvian films of all time, pushing out the popular comedy Locos de amor.","src":"RPP","url":"https://rpp.pe/cine/peru/chavin-de-huantar-se-posiciona-en-top-5-de-peliculas-peruanas-mas-vistas-de-la-historia-y-desplaza-locos-de-amor-noticia-1665283","say":{"en":"Is it based on a true story? I didn't know about it.","zh":"这是真事改编的吗？我以前不知道。"}},"《迈克尔》·秘鲁":{"what":"2026 年的迈克尔·杰克逊传记片（原名 Michael），由他的侄子贾法尔·杰克逊第一次演电影就演主角，导演是安托万·福奎阿。","what_en":"The 2026 Michael Jackson biopic (Michael), starring his nephew Jaafar Jackson in his first film role, directed by Antoine Fuqua.","fame":"秘鲁近一年票房第一，在秘鲁看过的人超过一百万；很多父母带着孩子去，一边看一边跟着哼。","fame_en":"Peru's top film of the past year, with more than a million viewers there; many parents took their kids and hummed along.","fact":"它是电影史上第一部全球票房超过 10 亿美元的传记片。","fact_en":"It became the first biopic in film history to cross $1 billion at the global box office.","src":"Khaleej Times，2026 年 7 月","url":"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/entertainment/michael-first-biopic-1-billion-global-box-office","say":{"en":"Did they really sound like Michael? I want to see it again.","zh":"他唱得真的像迈克尔吗？我想再看一遍。"}},"《别有洞天》":{"what":"秘鲁美洲电视台（América TV）的家庭喜剧（原名 Al Fondo Hay Sitio，意思是「后面还有位子」），讲一户普通人家搬进利马的富人区，和隔壁有钱邻居之间的笑料。","what_en":"A family comedy on Peru's América TV (Al Fondo Hay Sitio — 'there's room at the back'), about an ordinary family living in a rich Lima neighbourhood and their clashes with wealthy neighbours.","fame":"秘鲁最长寿、最多人看的电视剧之一，好几代人一起追；新一季开播时又回到了收视第一。","fame_en":"One of Peru's longest-running and most-watched shows, followed by several generations; when the new season began it went back to No. 1 in the ratings.","fact":"它 2009 年开播，2026 年 3 月开始的已经是第 13 季。","fact_en":"It started in 2009, and the season that began in March 2026 is its 13th.","src":"Expreso（秘鲁），2026 年","url":"https://www.expreso.com.pe/entretenimiento/vuelve-teleserie-al-fondo-hay-sitio-en-su-decima-tercera-temporada-todos-los-detalles-gustavo-bueno-esto-es-guerra-marco-zunino-america-television-noticia/1269686/","say":{"en":"Is there room at the back?","zh":"后面还有位子吗？"}},"五人组":{"what":"秘鲁最有名的昆比亚（cumbia）乐队之一（原名 Grupo 5），1973 年由亚伊彭家的兄弟在北部奇克拉约附近的蒙塞弗镇组建。","what_en":"One of Peru's most famous cumbia bands (Grupo 5), founded in 1973 by the Yaipén brothers in Monsefú, near Chiclayo in the north.","fame":"秘鲁的婚礼、生日和公司聚会都少不了他们的歌；他们的《Cambio mi corazón》是 YouTube 上播放最多的秘鲁昆比亚。","fame_en":"No Peruvian wedding, birthday or office party is complete without them; their 'Cambio mi corazón' is the most-played Peruvian cumbia on YouTube.","fact":"2024 年，为了庆祝成立 51 年，这支小镇出身的乐队登上了利马的国家体育场开演唱会。","fact_en":"In 2024, to celebrate 51 years together, the small-town band played Lima's National Stadium.","src":"América TV，2024 年","url":"https://www.americatv.com.pe/noticias/espectaculos/grupo-5-estadio-nacional-horarios-y-rutas-acceso-n490121","say":{"en":"Can you teach me to dance cumbia? Just the basic step!","zh":"你能教我跳昆比亚吗？就教基本步！"}},"《驯龙高手》·乌拉圭":{"what":"2025 年的真人版《驯龙高手》（原名 How to Train Your Dragon），维京少年小嗝嗝和黑龙「没牙」的故事。","what_en":"The 2025 live-action How to Train Your Dragon: Viking boy Hiccup and his dragon Toothless.","fame":"乌拉圭近一年票房第一的电影；全球票房约 6.37 亿美元，续集也已经在拍。","fame_en":"Uruguay's top film of the past year; it earned about $637 million worldwide, and a sequel is on the way.","fact":"片里维京人的岛，外景是在北爱尔兰的贝尔法斯特一带和北大西洋的法罗群岛拍的。","fact_en":"The Vikings' island was filmed around Belfast in Northern Ireland and in the Faroe Islands in the North Atlantic.","src":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/How_to_Train_Your_Dragon_(2025_film)","say":{"en":"Shall we go to the cinema? It's raining anyway.","zh":"去看电影吧？反正在下雨。"}},"《老大哥：黄金一代》":{"what":"阿根廷 Telefe 台 2026 年这一季的真人秀《老大哥》（原名 Gran Hermano Generación Dorada）：一群人住进装满摄像头的房子，观众每周投票把人送走。","what_en":"The 2026 season of Big Brother on Argentina's Telefe (Gran Hermano Generación Dorada): housemates live under cameras and viewers vote one out every week.","fame":"在乌拉圭也能看到，很多乌拉圭人跟着追，第二天在公司、群里吵谁该走；决赛在 2026 年 9 月 16 日。","fame_en":"It's watched across the river in Uruguay too, where people argue at work and in group chats about who should go; the final was on 16 September 2026.","fact":"2026 年 3 月，它在乌拉圭的收视有 11.9 点，排当天第二，只输给乌拉圭的新闻节目 Subrayado。","fact_en":"In March 2026 it scored 11.9 rating points in Uruguay, second only to the Uruguayan news show Subrayado that day.","src":"Montevideo Portal，2026 年 3 月","url":"https://www.montevideo.com.uy/Pantallazo/Rating-Uruguay-GH-Generacion-Dorada-estuvo-dentro-de-los-mas-vistos-con-el-cara-a-cara-uc955597","say":{"en":"Who do you want to win Gran Hermano?","zh":"你希望谁赢《老大哥》？"}},"《蜘蛛侠：崭新之日》·美国":{"what":"2026 年漫威和索尼的蜘蛛侠新片（原名 Spider-Man: Brand New Day），汤姆·赫兰德第四次主演蜘蛛侠的独立电影。","what_en":"Marvel and Sony's 2026 Spider-Man film (Spider-Man: Brand New Day), Tom Holland's fourth solo outing as the hero.","fame":"2026 年北美票房第一；它也是最快在北美收到 7 亿美元的电影。","fame_en":"North America's No. 1 film of 2026 — and the fastest film ever to reach $700 million at the domestic box office.","fact":"它的北美首周末收了 3.6 亿美元，打破了《复仇者联盟 4：终局之战》保持的 3.57 亿美元纪录（没算通胀）。","fact_en":"Its North American opening weekend of $360 million beat Avengers: Endgame's $357 million record (not adjusted for inflation).","src":"KATV / Sinclair，2026 年","url":"https://katv.com/news/entertainment/spider-man-brand-new-day-sets-new-box-office-record-for-biggest-opening-weekend","say":{"en":"Have you seen the new Spider-Man yet? No spoilers, please!","zh":"你看新的蜘蛛侠了吗？千万别剧透！"}},"《我的世界大电影》·美国":{"what":"2025 年根据游戏《我的世界》拍的真人电影（原名 A Minecraft Movie），杰克·布莱克演史蒂夫，杰森·莫玛也在里面。","what_en":"The 2025 live-action film of the game Minecraft (A Minecraft Movie), with Jack Black as Steve and Jason Momoa.","fame":"美国近一年票房第一的电影之一；北美首周末就收了约 1.6 亿美元，续集定在 2027 年。","fame_en":"One of America's biggest films of the past year: about $160 million in North America on its first weekend, with a sequel set for 2027.","fact":"片里有一句「chicken jockey!」（骑鸡的小僵尸），年轻观众每次看到都在电影院里大喊、扔爆米花，有的影院只好出新规矩，吵闹的直接请出去。","fact_en":"Every time the 'chicken jockey!' scene came on, young audiences screamed and threw popcorn — some cinemas had to bring in new rules and remove rowdy viewers.","src":"NBC News，2025 年 4 月","url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/pop-culture/pop-culture-news/chicken-jockey-minecraft-movie-rcna200274","say":{"en":"Please don't shout in the cinema — people are trying to watch!","zh":"电影院里别喊了，别人还要看呢！"}},"《不同的世界》·美国":{"what":"Netflix 2026 年的情景喜剧（原名 A Different World），是 1987 年同名美剧的续集：老剧主角的女儿进了虚构的黑人大学希尔曼学院。","what_en":"Netflix's 2026 sitcom (A Different World), a sequel to the 1987 show: the original couple's daughter starts at fictional Hillman College, a historically Black university.","fame":"老版是很多美国家庭的回忆，让很多年轻人第一次认识传统黑人大学；新版的导演之一黛比·艾伦就是当年老版的导演和制片。","fame_en":"The original is a family memory for many Americans and introduced a generation to historically Black colleges; Debbie Allen, who directed and produced the original, is back to direct.","fact":"新版 2026 年 9 月 24 日上线——正好是老版 1987 年在 NBC 首播之后整整 39 年的同一天。","fact_en":"The new series premiered on 24 September 2026 — exactly 39 years to the day after the original debuted on NBC in 1987.","src":"October Gallery / Bossip，2026 年 5 月","url":"https://octobergallery.com/a-different-world-sequel-series-will-hit-netflix-exactly-39-years-after-the-original-shows-debut/","say":{"en":"My mom used to watch the original — now we're watching the new one together.","zh":"我妈以前看老版，现在我们一起看新版。"}},"泰勒·斯威夫特·美国":{"what":"美国创作歌手（原名 Taylor Swift）；《Patient Zero》是她 2025 年专辑《The Life of a Showgirl》豪华版《The Encore》里新加的四首歌之一。","what_en":"The American singer-songwriter Taylor Swift; 'Patient Zero' is one of four new songs on The Encore, the deluxe edition of her 2025 album The Life of a Showgirl.","fame":"2026 年 10 月，《Patient Zero》登上 Billboard 百强单曲榜第一，把连续 24 周第一的《Choosin' Texas》挤了下来；在 Spotify 全球榜也是第一。","fame_en":"In October 2026 'Patient Zero' hit No. 1 on the Billboard Hot 100, ending the 24-week run of 'Choosin' Texas'; it also debuted at No. 1 on Spotify's global chart.","fact":"在英国，它连续三周排在官方单曲榜第一。","fact_en":"In the UK it spent three consecutive weeks at No. 1 on the Official Singles Chart.","src":"Official Charts，2026 年 10 月","url":"https://www.officialcharts.com/chart-news/taylor-swift-patient-zero-three-weeks-number-1-single-uk/","say":{"en":"Have you heard Patient Zero? It's been stuck in my head all week.","zh":"你听《Patient Zero》了吗？我整个星期脑子里都是它。"}},"《侏罗纪世界：重生》·委内瑞拉":{"what":"《侏罗纪》系列 2025 年的新片（原名 Jurassic World: Rebirth），斯嘉丽·约翰逊带一支小队去赤道附近的岛上，从恐龙身上取 DNA 做药。","what_en":"The 2025 Jurassic film (Jurassic World: Rebirth): Scarlett Johansson leads a team to an island near the equator to collect dinosaur DNA for a new medicine.","fame":"在委内瑞拉是近一年票房第一的电影；全家一起去看恐龙，是很多委内瑞拉家庭的周末。","fame_en":"Venezuela's top film of the past year — a family dinosaur outing was many Venezuelan households' weekend plan.","fact":"片里那座热带恐龙岛，外景主要是在泰国拍的：甲米的帕农本查国家公园、攀牙湾和董里的岛上都有取景。","fact_en":"The tropical dinosaur island was mostly filmed in Thailand — in Krabi's Khao Phanom Bencha National Park, Phang Nga Bay and islands off Trang.","src":"BBC Wildlife (Discover Wildlife)","url":"https://www.discoverwildlife.com/tv/jurassic-world-rebirth-filming-locations","say":{"en":"Is this where they filmed Jurassic World? It looks exactly the same!","zh":"《侏罗纪世界》是在这儿拍的吗？跟电影里一模一样！"}},"《美杜莎 第二季》·委内瑞拉":{"what":"哥伦比亚 Netflix 悬疑剧《美杜莎》（原名 Medusa）的第二季，2026 年 9 月上线，巴兰基亚富豪家族的秘密还在一个个冒出来。","what_en":"Season 2 of the Colombian Netflix thriller Medusa, released in September 2026, as more secrets of a rich Barranquilla family come out.","fame":"在委内瑞拉的 Netflix 进了前十；加勒比海边的口音和生活，委内瑞拉观众很熟悉。","fame_en":"It made Venezuela's Netflix top 10 — the Caribbean accents and lifestyle feel familiar to Venezuelan viewers.","fact":"第一季刚上线时，不少观众批评演员的「海边口音」（costeño）学得不像，可它照样冲到了 Netflix 最多人看的剧。","fact_en":"When season 1 came out, many viewers criticised the actors' imitation of the Caribbean 'costeño' accent — and it still became the most-watched series on Netflix.","src":"El Universal（哥伦比亚），2025 年 3 月","url":"https://www.eluniversal.com.co/farandula/2025/03/12/medusa-la-serie-mas-vista-en-netflix-pese-a-las-criticas/","say":{"en":"Do they really talk like that in Barranquilla?","zh":"巴兰基亚人真的这么说话吗？"}},"丹尼·奥欣":{"what":"委内瑞拉歌手（原名 Danny Ocean），2016 年一个人写、制作、演唱了《Me Rehúso》，一下子红遍世界。","what_en":"A Venezuelan singer (Danny Ocean) who wrote, produced and sang 'Me Rehúso' himself in 2016 — and it went global.","fame":"很多离开委内瑞拉的年轻人把《Me Rehúso》当成自己的歌；它是第一首在 Spotify 上播放超过 10 亿次的拉美独唱歌手作品。","fame_en":"Many young Venezuelans who left the country took 'Me Rehúso' as their own song; it was the first track by a Latin solo artist to pass one billion Spotify streams.","fact":"2026 年 7 月，它成了 Spotify 史上播放第三多的西班牙语歌，约 25.4 亿次。","fact_en":"In July 2026 it became the third most-streamed Spanish-language song in Spotify history, at about 2.54 billion plays.","src":"El Diario，2026 年 7 月","url":"https://eldiario.com/2026/07/29/me-reuso-danny-ocean/","say":{"en":"This song always makes my Venezuelan friends a bit emotional.","zh":"每次放这首歌，我的委内瑞拉朋友都会有点感动。"}},"《七犬》":{"what":"埃及 2026 年上映的动作大片，卡里姆·阿卜杜勒-阿齐兹和艾哈迈德·埃兹主演：国际刑警追查一个叫「7Dogs」的贩毒网，跟其中一个成员被迫合作。","what_en":"A 2026 Egyptian action blockbuster starring Karim Abdel Aziz and Ahmed Ezz: an Interpol officer chasing a drug network called “7Dogs” is forced to team up with one of its members.","fame":"两位主演是埃及最卖座的男星，第一次搭档就打破埃及电影首周末票房纪录；沙特方面也参与制作，是埃及和沙特合作的大制作。","fame_en":"Its two leads are Egypt's biggest box-office stars, and their first film together broke Egypt's opening-weekend record. It's a big Egyptian-Saudi co-production.","fact":"它在埃及的首个周末卖出约 91 万张票，票房 1.314 亿埃镑，是埃及电影史上最高的首周末。","fact_en":"Its opening weekend in Egypt sold about 912,000 tickets for EGP 131.4 million — the biggest opening weekend in Egyptian cinema history.","src":"Egypt Independent，2026 年","url":"https://www.egyptindependent.com/action-blockbuster-film-7dogs-achieves-new-egyptian-box-office-record/","say":{"en":"Have you seen 7Dogs yet? The car chases are unreal.","zh":"你看《七犬》了吗？那几场飙车太夸张了。"}},"《锡科锡科》":{"what":"埃及 2025 年的喜剧片，导演奥马尔·穆汉迪斯，两个年轻人意外继承了一笔惹麻烦的遗产，手忙脚乱想把它处理掉。","what_en":"A 2025 Egyptian comedy by director Omar El Mohandes: two young men unexpectedly inherit a very troublesome legacy and scramble to deal with it.","fame":"主演是两个年轻演员，没有大明星，却在 2025 年开斋节档期一路卖到埃及近一年票房第一，年轻人结伴去电影院看。","fame_en":"Its two leads are young actors, not big stars — yet from Eid 2025 it became Egypt's top film of the year, with young fans going in groups.","fact":"它不只在埃及火：2025 年 5 月，它成了沙特当月票房最高的电影，压过了漫威的《雷霆特攻队*》。","fact_en":"It wasn't just an Egyptian hit: in May 2025 it was the top-grossing film in Saudi Arabia, ahead of Marvel's Thunderbolts*.","src":"CairoScene，2025 年 5 月","url":"https://cairoscene.com/ArtsAndCulture/Egyptian-Comedy-Siko-Siko-is-the-Top-Grossing-Film-in-Saudi-This-May","say":{"en":"Siko Siko is so silly, but I couldn't stop laughing.","zh":"《锡科锡科》很无厘头，可我一直笑停不下来。"}},"《阿里·克莱》":{"what":"埃及 2026 年斋月剧，艾哈迈德·阿瓦迪演一个想重新站起来的拳击手阿里，30 集。","what_en":"An Egyptian Ramadan 2026 series: Ahmed El Awady plays Ali, a boxer trying to rebuild his career and his name. 30 episodes.","fame":"斋月是阿拉伯世界看剧的旺季，晚上开斋饭后全家一起追。这部是 2026 年斋月最受关注的剧之一，预告片一出来就上了热搜。","fame_en":"Ramadan is the Arab world's peak TV season — families watch together after the evening iftar meal. This was one of the most talked-about shows of Ramadan 2026; its trailer trended as soon as it dropped.","fact":"剧名「阿里·克莱」是在致敬拳王穆罕默德·阿里——他改名以前叫卡修斯·克莱，剧里的拳击手故事就是受他启发的。","fact_en":"The title “Ali Clay” nods to Muhammad Ali, who was born Cassius Clay — the boxer's story in the show is inspired by his legacy.","src":"Gulf News，2026 年斋月剧指南","url":"https://gulfnews.com/entertainment/ramadan-2026-tv-guide-the-must-watch-series-across-mena-1.500445832","say":{"en":"What are you watching this Ramadan? Everyone at work talks about Ali Clay.","zh":"今年斋月你在追什么？公司里大家都在聊《阿里·克莱》。"}},"哈穆·穆尔希迪":{"kind":"person","what":"埃及歌手，唱的是 mahraganat（「节庆歌」）：开罗街区婚礼上长出来的电子街头音乐，鼓机加自动修音，节奏又快又吵。","what_en":"An Egyptian singer of mahraganat (“festival songs”): electronic street music born at Cairo neighbourhood weddings — drum machines, autotune, fast and loud.","fame":"他做了什么：一年里接连发歌，2026 年夏天成了埃及流媒体榜上最火的 mahraganat 新人之一，《اخوك جايبها م الصفر》（你兄弟白手起家）这类歌在出租车和婚礼上到处放。","fame_en":"What he did: released track after track, becoming one of 2026's breakout mahraganat names on Egypt's streaming charts — songs like “Akhouk Gaybha Mn El Sefr” (your brother made it from zero) blast from taxis and weddings.","fact":"他唱的这种音乐 2020 年 2 月曾被埃及音乐家工会禁止在游船、俱乐部和音乐节上演出；六年后，mahraganat 和埃及嘻哈反而占着埃及流媒体榜的前头。","fact_en":"In February 2020 Egypt's Musicians Syndicate banned mahraganat from Nile cruises, clubs and festivals. Six years on, mahraganat and Egyptian hip-hop sit at the top of the country's streaming charts.","src":"InterSpace Music，2026 年 7 月","url":"https://interspacemusic.com/blog/egypt-banned-mahraganat-from-its-stages-it-owns-the-streaming-charts-and-80-of-the-money-is-foreign/","say":{"en":"Is this mahraganat? It sounds like a whole wedding party!","zh":"这是 mahraganat 吗？听起来像一整场婚礼派对！"}},"泰迪·阿夫罗":{"kind":"person","what":"埃塞俄比亚最有名的歌手（本名特沃德罗斯·卡萨洪），用阿姆哈拉语唱，把埃塞俄比亚传统音乐和雷鬼混在一起。","what_en":"Ethiopia's most famous singer (born Tewodros Kassahun), singing in Amharic and mixing Ethiopian music with reggae.","fame":"他做了什么：二十多年里每张专辑都是全国大事，歌里唱团结和历史；2026 年 4 月的新专辑《Etorika》一发布，从亚的斯亚贝巴到海外的埃塞俄比亚人都在转。","fame_en":"What he did: for over twenty years each of his albums has been a national event, with songs about unity and history. His April 2026 album Etorika spread instantly, from Addis Ababa to Ethiopians abroad.","fact":"《Etorika》2026 年 4 月 16 日发布，里面的《Jember》24 小时内在 YouTube 上就有 800 万到 1000 万次观看，被称为埃塞俄比亚史上最大的一次数字音乐发布。","fact_en":"Etorika came out on 16 April 2026, and its track “Jember” got 8–10 million YouTube views within 24 hours — called one of the largest digital music launches in Ethiopian history.","src":"Wikipedia：Etorika","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Etorika","say":{"en":"Can you play some Teddy Afro? I love his new album.","zh":"能放点泰迪·阿夫罗吗？我很喜欢他的新专辑。"}},"《七十三十》":{"what":"伊朗 2024 年的喜剧片，演员巴赫拉姆·阿夫沙里第一次当导演，自己也主演，讲两个人想尽办法看住一个惹麻烦的人。","what_en":"A 2024 Iranian comedy — actor Bahram Afshari's directing debut, in which he also stars — about two men trying everything to keep a troublemaker in check.","fame":"伊朗电影院里喜剧最卖座，这部更是一路卖到伊朗历 1403 年（2024–25）票房第一，五百多万人次走进电影院。","fame_en":"Comedies rule Iran's box office, and this one topped the Iranian year 1403 (2024–25), with more than five million admissions.","fact":"2024 年 11 月 27 日上映后，它卖了 3600 多亿土曼，成了伊朗电影史上票房最高的电影（没算通胀）。","fact_en":"Released on 27 November 2024, it grossed over 360 billion tomans, becoming the highest-grossing film in Iranian cinema history (not adjusted for inflation).","src":"Wikipedia：Seventy Thirty","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seventy_Thirty","say":{"en":"Is Seventy Thirty still on? I need a good laugh.","zh":"《七十三十》还在上映吗？我想好好笑一场。"}},"《戴眼镜的男人》":{"what":"伊朗 2025 年夏天上映的喜剧片，导演卡里姆·阿米尼，《七十三十》的巴赫拉姆·阿夫沙里戴上眼镜演主角。","what_en":"An Iranian comedy released in summer 2025, directed by Karim Amini, with Bahram Afshari of Seventy Thirty starring in glasses.","fame":"观众是冲着阿夫沙里去的：他前一部自导自演的喜剧刚刚刷新伊朗票房纪录，大家都想看他下一部能不能再笑翻全场。","fame_en":"Audiences went for Afshari: his previous comedy had just broken Iran's box-office record, and everyone wanted to see if he could do it again.","fact":"它 2025 年 7 月 23 日（伊朗历 1404 年 5 月 1 日）上映；主演阿夫沙里的上一部《七十三十》是伊朗史上票房最高的电影，卖了 3600 多亿土曼。","fact_en":"It opened on 23 July 2025. Its star's previous film, Seventy Thirty, is the highest-grossing film in Iranian history, at over 360 billion tomans.","src":"Wikipedia：List of highest-grossing Iranian films","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_highest-grossing_Iranian_films","say":{"en":"Is it as funny as his last film?","zh":"它跟他上一部一样好笑吗？"}},"《侏罗纪世界：重生》·肯尼亚":{"what":"2025 年好莱坞《侏罗纪世界》系列的新一部，斯嘉丽·约翰逊主演，一支小队去恐龙出没的赤道岛屿取 DNA。","what_en":"The 2025 entry in Hollywood's Jurassic World series, starring Scarlett Johansson: a team heads to dinosaur-filled equatorial islands to collect DNA.","fame":"肯尼亚的电影院不多，好莱坞大片是一家人周末去商场看电影的首选；这部 2025 年 7 月在肯尼亚连着几个周末排第一。","fame_en":"Kenya doesn't have many cinemas, and Hollywood blockbusters are the family weekend trip to the mall. This one led Kenya's box office for several weekends in July 2025.","fact":"Box Office Mojo 的肯尼亚榜单上，它 2025 年 7 月排第一，当月票房约 7.8 万美元，而且只在两家影院放映——肯尼亚的电影市场就是这么小。","fact_en":"On Box Office Mojo's Kenya chart it was No. 1 for July 2025 with about $78,000 from just two cinemas — Kenya's film market is that small.","src":"Box Office Mojo：Kenyan Box Office, July 2025","url":"https://www.boxofficemojo.com/month/july/2025/?area=KE","say":{"en":"Two tickets for Jurassic World, please — the 3D one.","zh":"两张《侏罗纪世界》的票，要 3D 的。"}},"《伊甸园之东》":{"what":"2026 年 Netflix 的美剧，根据斯坦贝克的小说《伊甸园之东》改编，弗洛伦丝·皮尤演女主角凯茜，一共 7 集。","what_en":"Netflix's 2026 limited series adapting John Steinbeck's novel East of Eden, with Florence Pugh as Cathy, in seven episodes.","fame":"一上线就冲到 Netflix 全球英语剧第一，在肯尼亚也是 2026 年 10 月大家下班就追的剧。","fame_en":"It went straight to No. 1 on Netflix's global English TV list, and in Kenya it was the show people binged after work in October 2026.","fact":"上线第一个周末就有 650 万次观看，拿下 Netflix 全球英语剧第一；这本 1952 年的老小说也因此重新卖火。","fact_en":"It pulled 6.5 million views in its opening weekend to take No. 1 on Netflix's global English TV list — and sent the 1952 novel back up the sales charts.","src":"What's on Netflix，2026 年 10 月","url":"https://www.whats-on-netflix.com/news/east-of-eden-netflix-opening-weekend-views-analysis/","say":{"en":"No spoilers! I'm only on episode three of East of Eden.","zh":"别剧透！《伊甸园之东》我才看到第三集。"}},"亚瓦·塔吉里":{"kind":"person","what":"肯尼亚内罗毕的歌手、说唱歌手，做非洲融合（Afro-fusion）音乐，也是二人组 Watendawili 的一半。","what_en":"A Nairobi singer-songwriter and rapper making Afro-fusion music, and one half of the duo Watendawili.","fame":"他做了什么：2026 年的《Chai ya saa kumi》（四点钟的茶）唱的是每个肯尼亚人都熟悉的下午茶时光，成了内罗毕人人会哼的歌。","fame_en":"What he did: his 2026 song “Chai ya saa kumi” (four o'clock tea) is about the afternoon tea break every Kenyan knows, and became the song all of Nairobi was humming.","fact":"Spotify 的数据显示，《Chai ya saa kumi》成了内罗毕播放量最高的歌；歌名里的「saa kumi」是斯瓦希里语计时的「第十个钟头」，就是下午四点。","fact_en":"Spotify figures crowned “Chai ya saa kumi” Nairobi's most-streamed song. “Saa kumi” — the tenth hour in Swahili time — means 4 pm.","src":"Pulse Kenya，2026 年 7 月","url":"https://www.pulse.co.ke/story/ywaya-tajiri-how-did-chai-ya-saa-kumi-become-nairobis-most-streamed-song-2026072319571981676","say":{"en":"Is it four o'clock already? Time for chai!","zh":"已经四点了？该喝茶了！"}},"《幕后》":{"what":"尼日利亚 2025 年 12 月上映的电影，冯克·阿金德勒编导主演：女主角罗恩克在片场打拼，一个人撑起一大家子。","what_en":"A Nigerian film released in December 2025, written, directed by and starring Funke Akindele: Ronke hustles on film sets to hold up her whole family.","fame":"阿金德勒是尼莱坞的「票房女王」，这几年圣诞档都有她的片；这部讲养家的辛苦，又好笑又扎心，全家一起去看。","fame_en":"Akindele is Nollywood's box-office queen, with a film in each recent Christmas season. This one, about the grind of supporting a family, is funny and painful at once — families went together.","fact":"2026 年 1 月，它成了第一部票房过 20 亿奈拉的尼莱坞电影，超过了她自己上一部的纪录。","fact_en":"In January 2026 it became the first Nollywood film to cross ₦2 billion at the box office, beating her own previous record.","src":"BusinessDay（尼日利亚），2026 年 1 月","url":"https://businessday.ng/news/article/behind-the-scenes-becomes-nollywoods-first-n2bn-film/","say":{"en":"Let's go see the new Funke Akindele film this weekend.","zh":"这周末去看冯克·阿金德勒的新片吧。"}},"《普通人》":{"what":"尼日利亚 2026 年的 Netflix 惊悚剧，导演摩西·因旺，8 集，几个普通人被卷进一桩大案。","what_en":"A 2026 Nigerian Netflix thriller from director Moses Inwang: eight episodes in which ordinary people get pulled into a big crime.","fame":"尼莱坞以前多是电影，这几年 Netflix 上的尼日利亚剧越来越能打；这部上线后连续好几周留在 Netflix 尼日利亚前十，大家边看边猜谁是坏人。","fame_en":"Nollywood used to be mostly films; Nigerian series on Netflix have been getting stronger. This one stayed in Netflix Nigeria's Top 10 for weeks, with viewers guessing who the villain was.","fact":"它 2026 年 9 月 4 日上线，到 10 月 5–11 日那一周已经连续 6 周进 Netflix 尼日利亚剧集前十；拍摄地有拉各斯、巴耶尔萨和德国柏林。","fact_en":"It launched on 4 September 2026, and by the week of 5–11 October had spent six weeks in Netflix Nigeria's TV Top 10. It was shot in Lagos, Bayelsa and Berlin.","src":"NaijaSabi，2026 年 10 月","url":"https://naijasabi.com.ng/ordinary-people-netflix-nigeria-cast-plot-2026/","say":{"en":"Who do you think is behind it all in Ordinary People?","zh":"你觉得《普通人》里幕后黑手是谁？"}},"阿萨克":{"kind":"person","what":"尼日利亚拉各斯的歌手，把非洲节拍（Afrobeats）、约鲁巴语的街头说唱和南非 amapiano 混在一起，带合唱团一样的和声。","what_en":"A Lagos singer who blends Afrobeats, Yoruba street rap and South African amapiano, with choir-like backing vocals.","fame":"他做了什么：2022 年起张张专辑上榜；2026 年 1 月跟 Wizkid 合作的《Jogodo》在尼日利亚连续好几周排第一。","fame_en":"What he did: every album since 2022 has charted big, and his January 2026 collaboration with Wizkid, “Jogodo”, sat at No. 1 in Nigeria for weeks.","fact":"《Jogodo》在 Spotify 尼日利亚第一天就有 138.8 万次播放，第一周 663.2 万次，创下 Spotify 尼日利亚有史以来的首周纪录。","fact_en":"“Jogodo” got 1.388 million Spotify Nigeria streams on day one and 6.632 million in its first week — an all-time first-week record for Spotify Nigeria.","src":"The Source，2026 年 1 月","url":"https://thesource.com/2026/01/27/asake-wizkid-jogodo-streaming-records/","say":{"en":"Turn it up — it's the new Asake!","zh":"开大声点，是阿萨克的新歌！"}},"阿里基巴、姆博索":{"kind":"person","what":"坦桑尼亚两位邦戈弗拉瓦（Bongo Flava，坦桑尼亚流行乐）歌手：老牌歌王阿里基巴和以深情唱腔出名的姆博索。","what_en":"Two Tanzanian Bongo Flava (Tanzanian pop) singers: veteran star Alikiba and Mbosso, known for his soulful voice.","fame":"他们做了什么：2026 年 5 月合唱情歌《Bhuju》，用斯瓦希里语唱一心一意的爱，很快成了坦桑尼亚和肯尼亚最火的音乐视频之一。","fame_en":"What they did: in May 2026 they released the love song “Bhuju”, about devotion, sung in Swahili — it quickly became one of the hottest music videos in Tanzania and Kenya.","fact":"《Bhuju》上线第一天在 YouTube 上就超过 50 万次观看。","fact_en":"“Bhuju” passed 500,000 YouTube views within its first day.","src":"K24 Digital，2026 年 5 月","url":"https://k24.digital/entertainment/bhuju-review-alikiba-and-mbosso-team-up-on-a-romantic-bongo-flava-track","say":{"en":"Do you know any good Bongo Flava songs? I'd love some new music.","zh":"你知道好听的邦戈弗拉瓦歌吗？我想听点新歌。"}},"约书亚·巴拉卡":{"kind":"person","what":"乌干达坎帕拉的歌手、创作人，唱带灵魂乐味道的非洲流行。","what_en":"A Kampala singer-songwriter making soulful African pop.","fame":"他做了什么：2023 年的《Nana》让他红出乌干达；2025 年跟英国加纳裔制作人 JAE5 合作的《Wrong Places》让东非音乐也能在整个非洲大陆跟尼日利亚歌手比一比。","fame_en":"What he did: 2023's “Nana” made him known beyond Uganda, and 2025's “Wrong Places” with British-Ghanaian producer JAE5 showed East African music could compete across the continent with Nigeria's stars.","fact":"《Wrong Places》是 2025 年乌干达 Spotify 播放量第一的歌，前面挤满尼日利亚歌手的榜上，第一名是乌干达人。","fact_en":"“Wrong Places” was Uganda's most-streamed song on Spotify in 2025 — a Ugandan at No. 1 on a list otherwise full of Nigerian artists.","src":"Uganda Business News，2025 年 12 月","url":"https://ugbusiness.com/2025/12/art-culture/joshua-baraka-tops-spotify-charts-in-uganda-as-nigerian-artists-dominate","say":{"en":"Joshua Baraka is from Uganda? I thought he was Nigerian!","zh":"约书亚·巴拉卡是乌干达人？我还以为他是尼日利亚的！"}},"《我的天，玛蕾莉兹！》":{"what":"南非 2025 年的南非荷兰语（Afrikaans）喜剧，从一段网红短视频改编，讲一家人吵吵闹闹又相亲相爱。","what_en":"A 2025 Afrikaans comedy from South Africa, spun out of a viral video clip — a noisy, loving family story.","fame":"片名就是那段短视频里妈妈喊的一句话，在南非和纳米比亚很多人都会学；电影一上映就冲到南非票房第一。","fame_en":"The title is the line the mum shouts in the viral clip, which loads of people in South Africa and Namibia can imitate. The film went straight to No. 1 at the South African box office.","fact":"那段视频里，妈妈拍女儿玛蕾莉兹骑车，结果女儿一头撞上橄榄球门柱。电影首映周末拿下南非票房第一，是 2014 年以来第一部首周夺冠的南非荷兰语电影。","fact_en":"In the clip, a mum films her daughter Marelize cycling straight into a rugby goal post. The film opened at No. 1 in South Africa — the first Afrikaans film to do so since 2014.","src":"New Era（纳米比亚），2025 年","url":"https://neweralive.na/?p=356626","say":{"en":"Wait, this film is based on that viral bike video?","zh":"等等，这部电影就是那个骑车的网红视频拍的？"}},"《鬼灭之刃：无限城篇》":{"what":"日本动画《鬼灭之刃》的剧场版，2025 年上映，炭治郎他们闯进鬼的大本营「无限城」，是最终决战三部曲的第一部。","what_en":"The 2025 film of the Japanese anime Demon Slayer: Tanjiro and the Demon Slayer Corps are pulled into the demons' fortress, the Infinity Castle — part one of the final trilogy.","fame":"动画在南非年轻人里越来越火，这部 2025 年在南非也上了大银幕，朋友们结伴去电影院看那些打斗场面。","fame_en":"Anime keeps growing with young South Africans, and in 2025 this one hit South African cinemas too — friends went together to see the fights on the big screen.","fact":"它全球票房约 8.2 亿美元，成了全世界票房最高的日本电影，也是 2025 年全球票房第七名。","fact_en":"It grossed about $820 million worldwide, becoming the highest-grossing Japanese film ever and the seventh-highest-grossing film of 2025.","src":"Wikipedia：Demon Slayer – Infinity Castle","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_%E2%80%93_The_Movie:_Infinity_Castle","say":{"en":"Are you watching it subbed or dubbed?","zh":"你看的是字幕版还是配音版？"}},"《血之遗产 第二季》":{"what":"南非 Netflix 的祖鲁语家族剧：家里的甘蔗公司 Spear Industries 陷进丑闻，女儿被父亲叫回来收拾局面，家人各怀心思。","what_en":"A South African Netflix family drama in Zulu: the family sugarcane firm, Spear Industries, is mired in scandal, and the daughter is called home to clean it up while relatives scheme.","fame":"南非人爱看家族恩怨剧，这部有财产、背叛、老一辈的规矩；第二季 2026 年 9 月一口气上线 20 集，又是全家一起追。","fame_en":"South Africans love a family-feud drama, and this one has money, betrayal and old-school family rules. Season 2 dropped all 20 episodes at once in September 2026, and families binged it together again.","fact":"第一季里演奶奶 Madlamini 的南非老戏骨康妮·奇乌梅 2024 年去世，第二季由塔比·尼亚德尼接演这个角色。","fact_en":"Veteran actress Connie Chiume, who played the matriarch Madlamini in season 1, died in 2024; Thembi Nyandeni took over the role for season 2.","src":"Briefly News（南非）","url":"https://briefly.co.za/entertainment/celebrities/251730-thembi-nyandeni-replace-late-connie-chiume-blood-legacy-season-2-netflix/","say":{"en":"Have you started season two of Blood Legacy? I'm hooked.","zh":"《血之遗产》第二季你开始看了吗？我停不下来了。"}},"特曼·艾克斯普雷斯、梅洛与斯利兹":{"kind":"person","what":"南非 amapiano（阿马皮亚诺，南非的电子舞曲）圈的三个人：歌手特曼·艾克斯普雷斯，和制作人二人组梅洛与斯利兹。","what_en":"Three names in South African amapiano (the country's piano-house dance music): vocalist Tman Xpress and the producer duo Mellow & Sleazy.","fame":"他们做了什么：梅洛与斯利兹做打击乐很重的「bacardi 风」amapiano，特曼的嗓子一加进来就是派对神曲；他们合作了一首又一首，《Remember》就是其中一首。","fame_en":"What they did: Mellow & Sleazy make percussion-heavy, “bacardi”-style amapiano, and Tman's voice turns it into a party anthem. They've teamed up again and again — “Remember” is one of those tracks.","fact":"2025 年 2 月，梅洛与斯利兹正式宣布和特曼合出一整张专辑，不再只是一首一首地合作。","fact_en":"In February 2025 Mellow & Sleazy officially announced a full joint album with Tman Xpress — not just one-off tracks any more.","src":"The Yanos Mag，2025 年 2 月","url":"https://theyanos.co.za/2025/02/mellow-sleazy-announce-joint-album-with-tman-xpress","say":{"en":"This amapiano track is fire — who's the DJ?","zh":"这首 amapiano 太炸了，DJ 是谁？"}},"纽约客":{"what":"纽约的周刊杂志，1925 年创刊，登长篇报道、短篇小说、影评书评，还有一格就讲完一个笑话的漫画。","what_en":"A New York weekly founded in 1925, known for long-form reporting, short stories, reviews and its one-panel cartoons.","fame":"很多作家以在它上面发一篇小说为荣；它的单格漫画和封面画常被全世界转发，「纽约客风格」几乎成了一种文风的名字。","fame_en":"Getting a story into it is a dream for many writers; its single-panel cartoons and cover art are shared worldwide, and “New Yorker style” has become a byword for a way of writing.","fact":"创刊号封面上戴单片眼镜的绅士尤斯塔斯·蒂利，此后几乎每年周年刊都会回到封面；2017 年为抗议美国的「旅行禁令」行政令，那期第一次没让他出现。","fact_en":"Eustace Tilley, the monocled dandy on the first cover, returned on nearly every anniversary issue — until 2017, when he was left off in protest at the US travel-ban executive order.","src":"Wikipedia：The New Yorker","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_New_Yorker","say":{"en":"Did you see this week's New Yorker cartoon? It's so true.","zh":"你看这周《纽约客》的漫画了吗？太真实了。"}},"纽约时报":{"what":"1851 年在纽约创办的日报，现在大多数人是在手机上订阅看。","what_en":"A daily newspaper founded in New York in 1851 — these days most readers subscribe on their phones.","fame":"美国最有影响力的报纸之一，拿过的普利策奖比任何报纸都多；口号是「所有适合刊登的新闻」。除了新闻，它的菜谱和填字游戏也有一大批人每天打开。","fame_en":"One of America's most influential papers, with more Pulitzer Prizes than any other; its motto is “All the News That's Fit to Print”. Beyond news, huge numbers open its recipes and crosswords every day.","fact":"2022 年 1 月，它花了「七位数低段」的价钱买下了猜词小游戏 Wordle——当时这游戏是一个程序员给女朋友做的。","fact_en":"In January 2022 it bought the word game Wordle for a price “in the low seven figures” — a game a software engineer, Josh Wardle, had made for his partner.","src":"Wikipedia：The New York Times","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_New_York_Times","say":{"en":"Did you get today's Wordle? I got it in three.","zh":"今天的 Wordle 你猜出来了吗？我猜了三次就对了。"}},"时代周刊":{"what":"美国的新闻周刊，1923 年创刊，红色边框的封面一眼就能认出来。","what_en":"An American news magazine founded in 1923, with an instantly recognisable red-bordered cover.","fame":"每年年底评选「年度人物」，上不上它的封面常被当成一年里谁最有影响的标志；「时代百大人物」榜也每年被全世界讨论。","fame_en":"Its year-end “Person of the Year” is treated as a verdict on who shaped the year, and the annual TIME100 list gets debated worldwide.","fact":"那道红框从 1927 年起只换过 8 次，比如 9·11 之后那期特刊改成了黑框表示哀悼；2006 年的年度人物干脆是「你」（You）。","fact_en":"The red border has changed only eight times since 1927 — the special issue after 9/11 had a black border for mourning. And in 2006 the Person of the Year was simply “You”.","src":"Wikipedia：Time (magazine)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time_(magazine)","say":{"en":"Who do you think will be Time's Person of the Year?","zh":"你觉得今年《时代》的年度人物会是谁？"}},"华尔街日报":{"what":"1889 年在纽约创刊的财经日报，专写股票、公司和经济。","what_en":"A business daily founded in New York in 1889, covering stocks, companies and the economy.","fame":"华尔街上的人每天早上必看；著名的「道琼斯指数」就是它的创办人查尔斯·道搞出来的，报纸到现在也归道琼斯公司。","fame_en":"Required morning reading on Wall Street. Its founder Charles Dow created the famous Dow Jones index, and the paper still belongs to Dow Jones & Company.","fact":"2007 年，传媒大亨默多克出价约 50 亿美元买下它的母公司道琼斯，现在归他的新闻集团。","fact_en":"In 2007 media mogul Rupert Murdoch offered about $5 billion for its parent company, Dow Jones; it now belongs to his News Corp.","src":"Wikipedia：The Wall Street Journal","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Wall_Street_Journal","say":{"en":"Can I get a copy of the Journal, please?","zh":"请给我一份《华尔街日报》。"}},"Vogue":{"what":"1892 年在纽约创刊的时尚杂志，现在全世界有二十多个版本。","what_en":"A fashion magazine founded in New York in 1892, now published in over twenty countries.","fame":"时装界的风向标；每年九月刊厚得像一本书，大牌广告和新一季的潮流都在里面，还有一部纪录片专门拍过它。","fame_en":"Fashion's barometer. Its September issue is as thick as a book, packed with designer ads and the new season's trends — there's even a documentary about it.","fact":"安娜·温图尔 1988 年起当了 37 年美国版主编，2025 年把这个位置交给了克洛伊·马勒，自己转去管全球。","fact_en":"Anna Wintour edited American Vogue for 37 years from 1988; in 2025 she handed the job to Chloe Malle and moved on to run the brand globally.","src":"Wikipedia：Vogue (magazine)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vogue_(magazine)","say":{"en":"Is the September issue of Vogue out yet?","zh":"《Vogue》九月刊出了吗？"}},"芝麻街":{"what":"1969 年开播的美国儿童节目，木偶和真人一起住在纽约的一条街上。","what_en":"An American children's show that started in 1969, where puppets and people live together on a New York street.","fame":"饼干怪兽、大鸟、艾摩陪几代孩子学字母、数数，也学怎么跟不一样的人相处；全世界一百多个国家播过它的各种版本。","fame_en":"Cookie Monster, Big Bird and Elmo have helped generations learn letters, numbers and how to get along with people who are different; versions have aired in over a hundred countries.","fact":"它从公共电视台 PBS 起家，后来去了 HBO Max；2025 年 11 月 10 日起，新一季在 Netflix 上播。","fact_en":"It began on public broadcaster PBS, later moved to HBO Max, and from 10 November 2025 its new episodes stream on Netflix.","src":"Wikipedia：Sesame Street","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sesame_Street","say":{"en":"I grew up watching Sesame Street! Who was your favourite?","zh":"我是看《芝麻街》长大的！你最喜欢谁？"}},"华盛顿邮报":{"what":"1877 年在美国首都华盛顿创办的日报，专跑政治新闻。","what_en":"A daily founded in 1877 in Washington, D.C., the US capital, known for political reporting.","fame":"1970 年代两个年轻记者伍德沃德和伯恩斯坦一路追「水门事件」，最后尼克松总统辞职，这段故事还拍成了电影《总统班底》。","fame_en":"In the 1970s two young reporters, Woodward and Bernstein, kept digging into Watergate until President Nixon resigned — the story became the film All the President's Men.","fact":"2013 年 10 月，经营它八十年的格雷厄姆家族把报纸卖给了亚马逊创始人贝索斯，价钱是 2.5 亿美元。","fact_en":"In October 2013 the Graham family, which had run it for eighty years, sold the paper to Amazon founder Jeff Bezos for $250 million.","src":"Wikipedia：The Washington Post","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Washington_Post","say":{"en":"Is that the Watergate building? I've read so much about it.","zh":"那就是水门大厦吗？我读过好多关于它的事。"}},"国家地理":{"what":"美国国家地理学会的杂志，1888 年创刊，封面一圈黄色边框。","what_en":"The magazine of the US National Geographic Society, founded in 1888, with its yellow-bordered cover.","fame":"野生动物、探险、世界各地的人，照片拍得让人一看就想出发；很多人家里都有一摞舍不得扔的黄框杂志。","fame_en":"Wildlife, expeditions and people around the world, in photos that make you want to go; many homes have a stack of yellow-bordered issues nobody can throw away.","fact":"第一期 1888 年 9 月出版；现在它由学会和迪士尼合资的公司出版，那个黄框就是学会的标志。","fact_en":"The first issue came out in September 1888. Today it's published by a joint venture between the Society and Disney — and the yellow frame is the Society's logo.","src":"Wikipedia：National Geographic","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Geographic","say":{"en":"My grandparents kept every issue of National Geographic.","zh":"我爷爷奶奶把每一期《国家地理》都留着。"}},"CNN":{"what":"美国的有线新闻台，1980 年在亚特兰大开播，24 小时只播新闻。","what_en":"A US cable news channel launched in Atlanta in 1980, broadcasting news 24 hours a day.","fame":"世界上第一个全天播新闻的电视台；大事一发生，很多人第一反应就是打开 CNN 看直播。","fame_en":"The world's first all-news TV channel; when something big happens, many people's first instinct is to put CNN on.","fact":"它 1980 年 6 月 1 日美国东部时间晚上 6 点开播，创办人特德·特纳讲完开场白，第一档新闻由一对夫妻主播戴维·沃克和洛伊丝·哈特播出。","fact_en":"It went on air at 6 pm Eastern on 1 June 1980. After an introduction by founder Ted Turner, husband-and-wife anchors David Walker and Lois Hart read the first newscast.","src":"Wikipedia：CNN","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CNN","say":{"en":"Can you put CNN on? I want to see what's happening.","zh":"能开一下 CNN 吗？我想看看出什么事了。"}},"奈飞":{"what":"美国的流媒体平台，总部在加州洛斯加托斯，一开始是邮寄 DVD 租片的。","what_en":"A US streaming service based in Los Gatos, California, which started out renting DVDs by mail.","fame":"把「一口气刷完一整季」变成了全世界的习惯；它自己拍的剧和电影来自几十个国家，韩剧、西班牙剧都是在它上面火遍全球的。","fame_en":"It made bingeing a whole season a global habit; its originals come from dozens of countries, and Korean and Spanish shows went global on it.","fact":"2023 年 9 月 29 日，它寄出了最后一批 DVD，结束了做了 25 年的租碟生意；前后一共寄出过 50 多亿次。","fact_en":"On 29 September 2023 it mailed its last DVDs, ending a 25-year disc-rental business that had shipped over 5 billion times.","src":"Wikipedia：Netflix","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Netflix","say":{"en":"What should we watch on Netflix tonight?","zh":"今晚在 Netflix 上看什么？"}},"加拿大广播公司":{"what":"加拿大的公共广播公司，英语叫 CBC，法语叫 Radio-Canada，两种语言各有一套电台和电视台。","what_en":"Canada's public broadcaster — CBC in English and Radio-Canada in French, each with its own radio and TV networks.","fame":"从大城市到北方小镇，加拿大人靠它听新闻、天气和冰球比赛；很多加拿大人开车时总开着 CBC 电台。","fame_en":"From big cities to small northern towns, Canadians rely on it for news, weather and hockey; many keep CBC Radio on whenever they drive.","fact":"它的电台 1936 年 11 月 2 日成立，电视要到 1952 年 9 月 6 日才开播。","fact_en":"Its radio service began on 2 November 1936; television didn't start until 6 September 1952.","src":"Wikipedia：Canadian Broadcasting Corporation","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canadian_Broadcasting_Corporation","say":{"en":"I heard it on CBC this morning.","zh":"我今天早上在 CBC 电台听到的。"}},"环球电视网":{"what":"巴西最大的电视网，总部在里约热内卢，1965 年开播。","what_en":"Brazil's biggest TV network, based in Rio de Janeiro, launched in 1965.","fame":"晚上八九点的「诺维拉」（长篇电视剧）是巴西全家的固定节目，第二天公司里、公交上都在聊剧情；巴西电视史上收视最高的 20 个节目全是它的。","fame_en":"The evening novela (long-running drama) is a Brazilian family ritual, and the next day everyone discusses the plot at work and on the bus. All of Brazil's 20 most-watched TV programmes were on Globo.","fact":"2012 年的诺维拉《巴西大道》有 5000 万观众，后来卖到了 130 个国家。","fact_en":"Its 2012 novela Avenida Brasil reached 50 million viewers and was later sold to 130 countries.","src":"Wikipedia：TV Globo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TV_Globo","say":{"en":"Shh, the novela is starting!","zh":"嘘，诺维拉开始了！"}},"墨西哥电视剧":{"what":"墨西哥拍的「特莱诺维拉」（telenovela）：每天播一集的长篇言情剧，几个月讲完一个故事。","what_en":"Mexican telenovelas: daily romantic dramas that tell one story over several months.","fame":"穷女孩和富家少爷、失散的亲人、坏心眼的继母……这些故事配上好几种语言的配音，卖到了一百多个国家。","fame_en":"Poor girl meets rich heir, long-lost relatives, scheming stepmothers — dubbed into many languages, these stories have sold to more than a hundred countries.","fact":"1979 年的墨西哥剧《富人也哭泣》，十几年后在俄罗斯大火，主演贝罗妮卡·卡斯特罗因此成了俄罗斯观众都认识的明星。","fact_en":"The 1979 Mexican telenovela Los ricos también lloran became a huge hit in Russia years later, making its star Verónica Castro famous with Russian viewers.","src":"Wikipedia：Telenovela","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telenovela","say":{"en":"Which telenovela are you watching now?","zh":"你现在在追哪部墨西哥电视剧？"}},"BBC":{"what":"英国的公共广播公司，1922 年成立，在伦敦，有电视、电台和网站。","what_en":"The UK's public broadcaster, founded in 1922 in London, with TV, radio and websites.","fame":"《地球脉动》《神秘博士》这些节目全世界都在看；BBC 新闻、BBC 国际频道很多人拿来练英语听力。","fame_en":"Shows like Planet Earth and Doctor Who are watched worldwide, and BBC News and the World Service are many learners' go-to English listening practice.","fact":"1936 年 11 月 2 日下午 3 点，BBC 电视从伦敦亚历山德拉宫正式开播，被认为是世界上第一个定期播出的高清晰度电视服务。","fact_en":"BBC Television officially launched at 3 pm on 2 November 1936 from Alexandra Palace in London — considered the world's first regular high-definition TV service.","src":"Wikipedia：BBC Television","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BBC_Television","say":{"en":"I practise my listening with BBC news every morning.","zh":"我每天早上听 BBC 新闻练听力。"}},"经济学人":{"what":"1843 年在伦敦创刊的周刊，讲经济、政治、科技，全世界都有读者。","what_en":"A weekly founded in London in 1843, covering economics, politics and technology, read around the world.","fame":"文章短而密，观点鲜明，很多学英语、考研、做生意的人拿它当范文；它自己叫自己「报纸」，虽然看起来是本杂志。","fame_en":"Its articles are dense and opinionated, used as models by English learners and businesspeople alike; it calls itself a newspaper, though it looks like a magazine.","fact":"它的创办人詹姆斯·威尔逊办这份刊物，最初是为了号召废除英国的《谷物法》；文章到现在都不署名，好让全刊用一个声音说话。","fact_en":"Founder James Wilson started it to campaign against Britain's Corn Laws. Its articles still carry no bylines, so the paper speaks with one voice.","src":"Wikipedia：The Economist","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Economist","say":{"en":"Have you read this week's Economist? The cover story is interesting.","zh":"你看这期《经济学人》了吗？封面文章挺有意思。"}},"卫报":{"what":"英国的日报，1821 年在曼彻斯特创刊，现在总部在伦敦。","what_en":"A British daily founded in Manchester in 1821, now based in London.","fame":"网站全部免费看，靠读者自愿捐钱撑着，全世界读者很多；它和其他媒体一起报道过斯诺登泄露的文件。","fame_en":"Its website is free to read, funded by readers' voluntary contributions, with a huge global readership; it was among the outlets that reported the Snowden files.","fact":"它原名《曼彻斯特卫报》，1959 年才改名叫《卫报》，1964 年搬到了伦敦。","fact_en":"It was The Manchester Guardian until 1959, when it became The Guardian, and it moved to London in 1964.","src":"Wikipedia：The Guardian","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Guardian","say":{"en":"I read it in the Guardian — it's free online.","zh":"我是在《卫报》上看到的，网上免费。"}},"金融时报":{"what":"1888 年在伦敦创刊的财经报纸，印在粉红色的纸上。","what_en":"A business newspaper founded in London in 1888, printed on pink paper.","fame":"全世界做金融、做生意的人都看它；周末版有旅行、美食和一个常被模仿的「跟 FT 吃午饭」采访栏目。","fame_en":"Read by people in finance and business everywhere; its weekend edition has travel, food and the much-copied “Lunch with the FT” interviews.","fact":"1893 年 1 月 2 日它开始用浅粉色的纸，好跟名字很像的对手《金融新闻》区分；2015 年 7 月，日本经济新闻社花 8.44 亿英镑把它买了下来。","fact_en":"It switched to light pink paper on 2 January 1893 to stand out from its similarly named rival, the Financial News. In July 2015 Japan's Nikkei bought it for £844 million.","src":"Wikipedia：Financial Times","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Financial_Times","say":{"en":"Is that the FT? Why is it pink?","zh":"那是《金融时报》吗？为什么是粉红色的？"}},"路透社":{"what":"1851 年在伦敦创立的通讯社，给全世界的报纸、电视台和银行发新闻。","what_en":"A news agency founded in London in 1851, supplying news to papers, broadcasters and banks worldwide.","fame":"你在别的媒体上看到的国际新闻，很多后面都写着「据路透社报道」；它的快讯对金融市场特别重要。","fame_en":"A lot of the international news you read elsewhere says “Reuters reported”; its flash headlines matter hugely to financial markets.","fact":"创办人路透早期用信鸽在亚琛和布鲁塞尔之间传股价；1865 年林肯遇刺，路透社是第一个在欧洲报出这条消息的。","fact_en":"Founder Paul Julius Reuter once used homing pigeons between Aachen and Brussels to carry stock prices — and in 1865 Reuters was first in Europe with the news of Lincoln's assassination.","src":"Wikipedia：Reuters","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reuters","say":{"en":"According to Reuters, the talks have been delayed.","zh":"据路透社报道，会谈推迟了。"}},"法新社":{"what":"法国的国际通讯社，总部在巴黎，用法、英、西、阿拉伯等多种语言发稿。","what_en":"France's international news agency, based in Paris, filing in French, English, Spanish, Arabic and more.","fame":"和路透社、美联社并称三大通讯社；世界各地很多新闻照片下面的署名都是「AFP」。","fame_en":"One of the big three news agencies with Reuters and AP; countless news photos worldwide are credited “AFP”.","fact":"它的前身哈瓦斯通讯社 1835 年成立，是世界上最早的通讯社；1944 年 8 月巴黎解放后，才改组成法新社。","fact_en":"Its predecessor, Havas, founded in 1835, was the world's first news agency; it was reorganised as Agence France-Presse after the Liberation of Paris in August 1944.","src":"Wikipedia：Agence France-Presse","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agence_France-Presse","say":{"en":"The photo credit says AFP — that's the French news agency.","zh":"照片署名写着 AFP，就是法新社。"}},"世界报":{"what":"法国的大报，1944 年在巴黎创刊，平时下午出版、印第二天的日期。","what_en":"A major French daily founded in Paris in 1944, printed in the afternoon and dated the next day.","fame":"法国人眼里最「正经」的报纸之一，国际新闻和深度评论很强；从 2022 年起也有英文网站版。","fame_en":"Seen by the French as one of the most serious papers, strong on world news and analysis; since 2022 it also has an English-language website.","fact":"它 1944 年 12 月 19 日创刊，是戴高乐将军想让法国有一份面向国际的「有分量的报纸」，由于贝尔·伯夫-梅里创办。","fact_en":"It launched on 19 December 1944 because General de Gaulle wanted France to have a prestigious, internationally minded paper; Hubert Beuve-Méry founded it.","src":"Wikipedia：Le Monde","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Le_Monde","say":{"en":"Do you have today's Le Monde?","zh":"有今天的《世界报》吗？"}},"明镜周刊":{"what":"德国的新闻周刊，1947 年创刊，总部在汉堡。","what_en":"A German weekly news magazine founded in 1947, based in Hamburg.","fame":"以调查报道出名，揭过不少政界、商界的丑闻，德国人说起「调查报道」常先想到它。","fame_en":"Famous for investigative reporting that has exposed many political and business scandals — to Germans, it's the name that comes to mind for investigative journalism.","fact":"2018 年它自己揭出一桩丑闻：明星记者克拉斯·雷洛蒂乌斯「大规模编造」报道，好几篇获奖文章都是假的。","fact_en":"In 2018 it exposed a scandal of its own: star reporter Claas Relotius had “falsified his articles on a grand scale”, including prize-winning pieces.","src":"Wikipedia：Der Spiegel","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Der_Spiegel","say":{"en":"Der Spiegel has a big story on it this week.","zh":"这周《明镜》有篇大报道写这件事。"}},"德国之声":{"what":"德国的国际广播电视台，1953 年开播，总部在波恩，用三十多种语言向全世界播新闻。","what_en":"Germany's international broadcaster, on air since 1953, headquartered in Bonn and broadcasting in over thirty languages.","fame":"除了新闻，它的免费德语课在学德语的人里特别有名；很多人第一次听德语，就是在 DW 的课里。","fame_en":"Besides news, its free German courses are famous among learners — many people hear German for the first time in a DW lesson.","fact":"它 1953 年 5 月 3 日开播；现在电台节目在波恩做，电视节目几乎都在柏林做。","fact_en":"It launched on 3 May 1953; today its radio programmes are made in Bonn, while TV is produced almost entirely in Berlin.","src":"Wikipedia：Deutsche Welle","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deutsche_Welle","say":{"en":"I learn German with DW's free lessons.","zh":"我用德国之声的免费课学德语。"}},"意大利广播电视":{"what":"意大利的公共广播电视公司，总部在罗马。","what_en":"Italy's public broadcaster, based in Rome.","fame":"每年二月转播圣雷莫音乐节，那一周全意大利都在聊谁唱得好；冠军还会代表意大利去欧洲歌唱大赛。","fame_en":"Every February it broadcasts the Sanremo Music Festival, and for that week all of Italy argues about who sang best — the winner often goes on to represent Italy at Eurovision.","fact":"意大利人交的电视费（Canone Rai）从 2016 年起直接加在电费账单里收。","fact_en":"Since 2016 Italy's TV licence fee — the “Canone Rai” — has been collected through household electricity bills.","src":"Wikipedia：RAI","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RAI","say":{"en":"Are you watching Sanremo tonight?","zh":"今晚你看圣雷莫吗？"}},"国家报":{"what":"西班牙的大报，1976 年在马德里创刊。","what_en":"A major Spanish daily founded in Madrid in 1976.","fame":"是西班牙语世界读者最多的报纸之一，在拉丁美洲也有版本；学西班牙语的人常拿它的文章做阅读练习。","fame_en":"One of the most-read papers in the Spanish-speaking world, with editions for Latin America; learners of Spanish often use it for reading practice.","fact":"它 1976 年 5 月 4 日出第一期，离独裁者佛朗哥去世刚好半年，正赶上西班牙向民主过渡。","fact_en":"Its first issue came out on 4 May 1976, six months after the death of dictator Francisco Franco, just as Spain began its transition to democracy.","src":"Wikipedia：El País","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_Pa%C3%ADs","say":{"en":"Could I have El País and a coffee, please?","zh":"请给我一份《国家报》和一杯咖啡。"}},"塔斯社":{"what":"俄罗斯的国家通讯社，总部在莫斯科。","what_en":"Russia's state news agency, based in Moscow.","fame":"苏联时期，它是官方消息的出口，世界各地的报纸都从它那里知道莫斯科在说什么；现在还是俄罗斯官方说法最重要的来源之一。","fame_en":"In Soviet times it was the official voice, and papers around the world learned what Moscow was saying from it; it's still one of the main sources of Russia's official line.","fact":"它的前身 1904 年在圣彼得堡成立；1925 年 7 月 10 日才改名叫「苏联电报通讯社」，简称 TASS。","fact_en":"Its predecessor was founded in St Petersburg in 1904; it became the Telegraph Agency of the Soviet Union — TASS — on 10 July 1925.","src":"Wikipedia：TASS","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TASS","say":{"en":"That's the Russian official view, according to TASS.","zh":"据塔斯社说，这是俄方的官方说法。"}},"NHK":{"what":"日本放送协会，日本的公共广播电视台，总部在东京涩谷。","what_en":"Japan Broadcasting Corporation, Japan's public broadcaster, headquartered in Shibuya, Tokyo.","fame":"地震、台风时日本人第一时间看 NHK；它的晨间剧、大河剧和除夕夜的《红白歌会》都是日本家庭的固定节目。","fame_en":"When there's an earthquake or typhoon, Japan turns to NHK first; its morning dramas, historical “taiga” dramas and New Year's Eve Kōhaku are fixtures in Japanese homes.","fact":"《红白歌会》1951 年 1 月 3 日第一次播出时只是电台节目，1953 年起才上电视，后来固定在除夕夜。","fact_en":"Kōhaku Uta Gassen first aired on 3 January 1951 as a radio show; it moved to TV in 1953 and later settled on New Year's Eve.","src":"Wikipedia：Kōhaku Uta Gassen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C5%8Dhaku_Uta_Gassen","say":{"en":"Are you watching Kōhaku on New Year's Eve?","zh":"除夕你看《红白歌会》吗？"}},"读卖新闻":{"what":"日本的大报，1874 年在东京创刊。","what_en":"A major Japanese daily founded in Tokyo in 1874.","fame":"日本人习惯订报纸送到家门口，它是全世界发行量最大的报纸之一，每天早上数百万份由送报员骑车送到。","fame_en":"Japanese households still get papers delivered, and it's one of the biggest-circulation newspapers in the world — millions of copies dropped at doors every morning.","fact":"2010 年吉尼斯世界纪录认定它是全世界日发行量最大的报纸；日本第一支职业棒球队、今天的读卖巨人队，也是它办起来的。","fact_en":"In 2010 Guinness World Records named it the daily newspaper with the highest circulation in the world — and it founded Japan's first professional baseball team, today's Yomiuri Giants.","src":"Wikipedia：The Yomiuri Shimbun","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Yomiuri_Shimbun","say":{"en":"Does your family still get the newspaper delivered?","zh":"你家还订报纸送到家吗？"}},"周刊少年Jump":{"what":"集英社出的少年漫画周刊，1968 年创刊，每周一出。","what_en":"Shueisha's weekly boys' manga magazine, founded in 1968 and out every Monday.","fame":"《龙珠》《灌篮高手》《海贼王》《火影忍者》都在它上面连载过；「友情、努力、胜利」是它出名的三个关键词。","fame_en":"Dragon Ball, Slam Dunk, One Piece and Naruto all ran in its pages; “friendship, effort, victory” are its famous watchwords.","fact":"1995 年的新年号卖了 653 万册，是它发行量的最高纪录。","fact_en":"Its 1995 New Year's issue sold 6.53 million copies — its all-time circulation record.","src":"Wikipedia：Weekly Shōnen Jump","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weekly_Sh%C5%8Dnen_Jump","say":{"en":"Has the new Jump come out? I need to know what happens next!","zh":"新一期 Jump 出了吗？我想知道接下来怎么样了！"}},"印度时报":{"what":"印度的英文日报，总部在孟买。","what_en":"An Indian English-language daily, based in Mumbai.","fame":"是全世界发行量最大的英文日报之一；印度很多家庭早上一边喝奶茶一边看它。","fame_en":"One of the world's biggest-circulation English dailies — many Indian families read it over morning chai.","fact":"它 1838 年 11 月 3 日出第一期，那时叫《孟买时报与商业日报》。","fact_en":"Its first edition came out on 3 November 1838 as The Bombay Times and Journal of Commerce.","src":"Wikipedia：The Times of India","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Times_of_India","say":{"en":"Can I have the Times of India and a cutting chai?","zh":"请给我一份《印度时报》和一杯小杯奶茶。"}},"澳大利亚广播公司":{"what":"澳大利亚的公共广播机构，1932 年成立，总部在悉尼。","what_en":"Australia's public broadcaster, founded in 1932, headquartered in Sydney.","fame":"全国新闻、偏远地区的电台和儿童节目都靠它；风靡全世界的动画《布鲁伊一家》就是在它的儿童频道首播的。","fame_en":"It runs national news, radio for remote areas and children's TV — and the globally loved cartoon Bluey premiered on its kids' channel.","fact":"《布鲁伊一家》2018 年 10 月 1 日在 ABC Kids 首播，2019 年拿了国际艾美奖儿童奖，2024 年又拿了皮博迪奖。","fact_en":"Bluey premiered on ABC Kids on 1 October 2018, won an International Emmy Kids Award in 2019 and a Peabody Award in 2024.","src":"Wikipedia：Bluey (TV series)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bluey_(TV_series)","say":{"en":"My kids watch Bluey on ABC every morning.","zh":"我家孩子每天早上在 ABC 看《布鲁伊一家》。"}},"新华社":{"what":"中国的国家通讯社，总部在北京，在全世界有一百多个分社。","what_en":"China's state news agency, based in Beijing, with more than a hundred bureaus around the world.","fame":"中国的很多重要新闻都是「据新华社报道」，国内外媒体都转它的稿子；它也用多种外语对外发稿。","fame_en":"Much of China's important news comes “according to Xinhua”, and media at home and abroad carry its reports; it also files in many foreign languages.","fact":"它的前身是 1931 年在江西瑞金成立的「红色中华通讯社」，1937 年改叫新华社。","fact_en":"It began in 1931 in Ruijin, Jiangxi, as the Red China News Agency, and was renamed Xinhua in 1937.","src":"Wikipedia：Xinhua News Agency","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xinhua_News_Agency","say":{"en":"The news came from Xinhua this morning.","zh":"这条新闻是今天早上新华社发的。"}},"中央电视台":{"what":"中国的国家电视台，总部在北京，有几十个频道。","what_en":"China's national TV broadcaster, based in Beijing, with dozens of channels.","fame":"除夕夜的春节联欢晚会几十年来是很多中国家庭的固定节目；晚上七点的《新闻联播》也几乎人人知道。","fame_en":"Its New Year's Eve Spring Festival Gala has been a fixture in Chinese homes for decades, and nearly everyone knows the 7 pm evening news.","fact":"它的总部大楼由雷姆·库哈斯和奥雷·舍人的事务所 OMA 设计，2012 年完工，北京人给它起了个外号叫「大裤衩」。","fact_en":"Its headquarters, designed by Rem Koolhaas and Ole Scheeren of OMA, was finished in 2012 — locals nicknamed it “big pants”.","src":"Wikipedia：CCTV Headquarters","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CCTV_Headquarters","say":{"en":"Are you watching the Spring Festival Gala this year?","zh":"今年春晚你看吗？"}},"人民日报":{"what":"中国共产党中央委员会的机关报，1948 年创刊，在北京。","what_en":"The official newspaper of the Central Committee of the Chinese Communist Party, founded in 1948, based in Beijing.","fame":"它的社论被看作官方的态度，国内外很多人读它来了解中国的政策方向；街头和单位的阅报栏里常能看到它。","fame_en":"Its editorials are read as the official line, so people at home and abroad read it to understand China's policy direction; it's often posted on public newspaper boards.","fact":"报头上「人民日报」四个字是毛泽东亲笔题写的。","fact_en":"The four characters of its masthead were handwritten by Mao Zedong.","src":"Wikipedia：People's Daily","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People%27s_Daily","say":{"en":"Is today's paper up on the board yet?","zh":"今天的报纸贴到阅报栏上了吗？"}},"申报":{"what":"1872 年在上海创刊的中文报纸，一直办到 1949 年。","what_en":"A Chinese-language newspaper founded in Shanghai in 1872 that ran until 1949.","fame":"中国近代历史最长、影响最大的报纸之一，七十多年里记下了晚清到民国的上海和中国，现在是研究那段历史的重要材料。","fame_en":"One of modern China's longest-running and most influential papers; over 77 years it recorded Shanghai and China from the late Qing to the Republic, and is now a key source for historians.","fact":"它是英国商人美查（Ernest Major）1872 年 4 月 30 日创办的，最后一期出在 1949 年 5 月 27 日，就是上海解放那天。","fact_en":"It was founded on 30 April 1872 by British merchant Ernest Major, and its last issue came out on 27 May 1949 — the day Shanghai was taken by the Communists.","src":"Wikipedia：Shen Bao","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shen_Bao","say":{"en":"Old copies of Shen Bao show what Shanghai was like a century ago.","zh":"老《申报》能看到一百年前的上海是什么样子。"}},"读者":{"what":"在甘肃兰州创办的文摘杂志，选登各种好文章。","what_en":"A digest magazine from Lanzhou, Gansu, reprinting good writing from everywhere.","fame":"八九十年代起很多中国学生和家庭都订它，书报亭里总有一本；曾是中国发行量最大的期刊之一。","fame_en":"From the 1980s many Chinese students and families subscribed, and every newsstand had a copy; it was once among China's best-selling periodicals.","fact":"它 1981 年 3 月创刊时叫《读者文摘》，因为跟美国的《读者文摘》（Reader's Digest）重名，1993 年改名叫《读者》。","fact_en":"It launched in March 1981 as Duzhe Wenzhai — literally “Reader's Digest” — and because of the clash with the American magazine, renamed itself Duzhe in 1993.","src":"Wikipedia：Duzhe","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Duzhe","say":{"en":"I used to read Duzhe every month in high school.","zh":"我高中时每个月都看《读者》。"}},"TVB":{"what":"香港电视广播有限公司，1967 年开台，香港最大的免费电视台。","what_en":"Television Broadcasts Limited, launched in 1967 — Hong Kong's biggest free-to-air TV station.","fame":"它拍的港剧和综艺陪了几代粤语观众，《上海滩》《神雕侠侣》这些剧捧红了周润发、刘德华等很多明星。","fame_en":"Its dramas and variety shows have kept generations of Cantonese viewers company; series like The Bund and The Return of the Condor Heroes made stars of Chow Yun-fat and Andy Lau.","fact":"1980 年周润发主演的《上海滩》在整个亚洲都火，后来还被拍成了好几个电视和电影版本。","fact_en":"The Bund (1980), starring Chow Yun-fat, was a hit across Asia and inspired several later TV and film adaptations.","src":"Wikipedia：TVB","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TVB","say":{"en":"Which TVB drama did you grow up with?","zh":"你是看哪部 TVB 剧长大的？"}},"半岛电视台":{"what":"卡塔尔多哈的新闻电视台，1996 年开播阿拉伯语频道，后来又开了英语频道。","what_en":"A news broadcaster based in Doha, Qatar, which launched its Arabic channel in 1996 and later an English one.","fame":"它让阿拉伯世界有了自己的国际新闻台，很多中东的大事是在它的镜头里被世界看到的；英语频道的非洲、中东报道也很多。","fame_en":"It gave the Arab world its own international news channel — many big Middle East stories reached the world through its cameras — and its English channel covers Africa and the Middle East in depth.","fact":"半岛英语频道 2006 年 11 月 15 日开播，卡塔尔政府为它投了大约 10 亿美元。","fact_en":"Al Jazeera English launched on 15 November 2006, with an investment of roughly $1 billion from the Qatari government.","src":"Wikipedia：Al Jazeera English","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Al_Jazeera_English","say":{"en":"Al Jazeera has a reporter right there on the ground.","zh":"半岛电视台有记者就在现场。"}},"丰田汽车城":{"what":"爱知县的一座工业城市，丰田汽车的总部和好几座工厂都在这里，城市名字就叫「丰田」。","what_en":"An industrial city in Aichi where Toyota has its headquarters and several factories — the city is literally named Toyota.","fame":"全世界的工厂都学过丰田的「准时化」：零件刚好在要用的时候送到，不囤货、不浪费。你可能听过的「精益生产」「看板」，都是从这里传出去的。","fame_en":"Factories everywhere have copied Toyota's 'just-in-time' system: parts arrive exactly when they are needed, with no piles of stock and no waste. 'Lean production' and 'kanban' both spread from here.","fact":"这座城市原来叫「举母市」，因为这家公司太重要，1959 年 1 月 1 日改名叫丰田市。第二年它还和美国的汽车城底特律结成了姐妹城市。","fact_en":"The city used to be called Koromo. Because the company mattered so much, it was renamed Toyota on 1 January 1959 — and the next year it became a sister city of Detroit.","src":"Wikipedia · Toyota, Aichi","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toyota,_Aichi","say":{"en":"Is there a factory tour we can book in English?","zh":"有没有英文的工厂参观可以预约？"}},"工业机器人":{"what":"在工厂里焊接、喷漆、搬零件的机械手臂。山梨县富士山脚下有全世界最有名的机器人工厂之一。","what_en":"Robot arms that weld, paint and move parts in factories. One of the world's best-known robot makers has its works at the foot of Mt Fuji in Yamanashi.","fame":"你开的车、用的手机，很多是机器人一起装出来的。日本每年新装的工业机器人数量排世界第二，只比中国少；造机器人的本事也是世界顶尖。","fame_en":"The car you drive and the phone you use were probably put together partly by robots. Japan installs more industrial robots each year than any country except China, and is a top robot maker.","fact":"国际机器人联合会（IFR）说：2023 年日本工厂里有 43.5 万台机器人在干活；全世界生产的工业机器人里，约 38% 是日本造的，其中近八成出口。","fact_en":"The International Federation of Robotics says 435,299 industrial robots were working in Japan's factories in 2023, and Japan made about 38% of the world's robots — exporting nearly 80% of them.","src":"IFR · World Robotics 2024 (Japan)","url":"https://ifr.org/downloads/press2018/2024-SEP-24_IFR_press_release_World_Robotics_2024_-_Japan.pdf","say":{"en":"How many people does it take to look after these robots?","zh":"这些机器人要几个人来照看？"}},"蔚山造船":{"what":"韩国东南海边的蔚山，有世界最大的造船厂之一（HD 现代重工），巨型油轮、集装箱船、天然气船在这里下水。","what_en":"Ulsan, on Korea's south-east coast, has one of the world's largest shipyards (HD Hyundai Heavy Industries), where giant tankers, container ships and gas carriers are launched.","fame":"海上运你网购包裹的集装箱船，很多就是韩国造的。韩国和中国、日本一起，是世界上造船最多的国家。","fame_en":"Many of the container ships carrying your online orders were built in Korea, which — with China and Japan — builds most of the world's ships.","fact":"1972 年现代的创始人郑周永建厂时手里连船厂都没有：他先拿到英国顾问的推荐信，向巴克莱银行借了 4300 万美元，还得先找到愿意买船的客户。第一艘船「大西洋男爵号」1974 年下水。","fact_en":"When Hyundai's founder Chung Ju-yung started in 1972 he didn't even have a shipyard yet: with a British consultant's letter he won a US$43m loan from Barclays — on condition he first found a buyer. The first ship, Atlantic Baron, was launched in 1974.","src":"Wikipedia · HD Hyundai Heavy Industries","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HD_Hyundai_Heavy_Industries","say":{"en":"How long does it take to build one of these ships?","zh":"造一艘这样的船要多久？"}},"韩国半导体":{"what":"京畿道的平泽、器兴、华城和利川，有三星和 SK 海力士的大型芯片厂，主要做存储芯片。","what_en":"Gyeonggi province — Pyeongtaek, Giheung, Hwaseong, Icheon — is home to Samsung and SK hynix's huge chip plants, mostly making memory chips.","fame":"你手机里存照片的芯片、电脑里的内存条，很可能是这里做的。三星是世界最大的存储芯片厂商，现在 AI 用的高带宽内存也让这里更忙。","fame_en":"The chip storing your photos and the memory in your laptop may well come from here. Samsung is the world's biggest memory-chip maker, and AI's demand for high-bandwidth memory has made these fabs even busier.","fact":"三星平泽园区大约 290 万平方米，2022 年开工的第三条线（P3）是三星盖过最大的芯片厂，里面装着荷兰 ASML 的极紫外光刻机。","fact_en":"Samsung's Pyeongtaek campus covers about 2.9 million m². Its third line, P3, which started production in 2022, is the biggest chip plant Samsung has ever built, fitted with ASML's EUV lithography machines.","src":"The Korea Times (2022)","url":"https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/amp/business/tech-science/20220907/samsung-starts-operation-of-mega-chip-manufacturing-line-in-korea","say":{"en":"Do you work at the fab? What's a normal shift like?","zh":"你在芯片厂上班吗？平时一个班是什么样的？"}},"班加罗尔软件":{"what":"印度南部的班加罗尔，有几千家软件公司和外包中心，被叫作「印度硅谷」。","what_en":"Bengaluru in southern India, with thousands of software firms and outsourcing centres, is known as 'India's Silicon Valley'.","fame":"你打给银行的客服、你用的 App 后台，可能就在班加罗尔有人在写、在维护。Infosys、Wipro 这些大公司的总部也在这里。","fame_en":"The bank helpline you call or the back end of an app you use may well be written and run from Bengaluru, home to giants such as Infosys and Wipro.","fact":"Infosys 1981 年创办时的启动资金，是创始人的太太苏达·穆尔蒂省下的 1 万卢比——她手里一共有 10250 卢比，剩下的 250 留着应急。","fact_en":"Infosys started in 1981 with 10,000 rupees from founder's wife Sudha Murty. She had 10,250 rupees in total — and kept the other 250 aside for emergencies.","src":"Business Today (2024)","url":"https://www.businesstoday.in/latest/corporate/story/only-investment-i-have-done-is-rs-10000-sudha-murty-says-took-a-little-bit-of-risk-on-narayana-murthy-421600-2024-03-15","say":{"en":"Which tech park are you in? I'll book a cab.","zh":"你在哪个科技园？我叫个车过去。"}},"苏拉特钻石切割":{"what":"古吉拉特邦的苏拉特，是世界钻石切割打磨的中心，几十万工人在这里把钻石原石磨成首饰上的样子。","what_en":"Surat in Gujarat is the world's diamond-cutting centre, where hundreds of thousands of workers turn rough stones into the gems you see in jewellery.","fame":"全世界的钻石，大约十颗里有九颗在苏拉特切过、磨过。原石从非洲、俄罗斯来，磨好再卖到安特卫普、纽约、香港。","fame_en":"About nine out of ten of the world's diamonds are cut and polished in Surat: rough stones arrive from Africa and Russia, and leave for Antwerp, New York and Hong Kong.","fact":"2023 年苏拉特钻石交易所建成，楼面面积超过 66 万平方米，超过美国五角大楼，成了世界上最大的办公楼。","fact_en":"In 2023 the Surat Diamond Bourse opened with more floor space than the Pentagon, becoming the world's largest office building.","src":"Business Standard (2023)","url":"https://www.business-standard.com/india-news/surat-bourse-pips-pentagon-as-the-world-s-largest-office-building-123071801079_1.html","say":{"en":"Is this natural or lab-grown? Does it come with a certificate?","zh":"这是天然的还是实验室培育的？有证书吗？"}},"泰国大米":{"what":"泰国中部平原和东北部种的大米，最有名的是茉莉香米（Hom Mali），煮出来有一股清香。","what_en":"Rice from Thailand's central plain and north-east, above all Hom Mali jasmine rice, which smells fragrant when cooked.","fame":"泰国是世界上出口大米最多的国家之一，你在超市买到的「泰国香米」大多来自东北部。泰国人见面常问「吃饭了吗」，饭就是米饭。","fame_en":"Thailand is one of the world's biggest rice exporters, and most 'Thai fragrant rice' in your supermarket comes from the north-east. Thais greet each other with 'Have you eaten rice yet?'","fact":"泰国茉莉香米 105 号在 2017 年澳门的世界大米大会上又被评为「世界最好吃的大米」，九年里第五次；可是 2022 年这个称号给了柬埔寨的 Phka Rumduol。","fact_en":"Thai Hom Mali 105 was named the World's Best Rice again at the 2017 conference in Macau — its fifth win in nine years — but in 2022 the title went to Cambodia's Phka Rumduol.","src":"Wikipedia · Jasmine rice","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jasmine_rice","say":{"en":"Is this new-crop jasmine rice? How much for a five-kilo bag?","zh":"这是新米吗？五公斤一袋多少钱？"}},"东方底特律":{"what":"曼谷东南的罗勇府一带是泰国的汽车工业区，日本、美国和中国车企都在这里设厂，被叫作「东方底特律」。","what_en":"Rayong province, south-east of Bangkok, is Thailand's car-making belt, with Japanese, American and Chinese plants — the 'Detroit of the East'.","fame":"泰国是东南亚最大的汽车生产国，皮卡尤其多：你在澳洲、中东看到的很多皮卡都是泰国造的。最近几年中国电动车厂也一家家搬来。","fame_en":"Thailand is South-East Asia's biggest car producer, especially of pickups — many you see in Australia and the Middle East are Thai-made. Lately Chinese EV makers have been arriving one after another.","fact":"2024 年 7 月 4 日，比亚迪在罗勇的工厂开工，这是它在东南亚的第一座厂，一年能造 15 万辆车；开工那天，比亚迪第 800 万辆新能源车正好在这条线上下线。","fact_en":"On 4 July 2024 BYD opened its Rayong plant — its first in South-East Asia, able to build 150,000 cars a year. Its 8 millionth new-energy vehicle rolled off this line on opening day.","src":"Fortune (2024)","url":"https://www.fortune.com/asia/2024/07/04/china-byd-southeast-asia-inaugurates-first-ev-plant-thailand","say":{"en":"Is this model made here in Thailand or imported?","zh":"这款车是泰国本地造的还是进口的？"}},"马来西亚棕榈油":{"what":"从油棕果里榨出来的植物油。马来西亚和印度尼西亚种着全世界大部分的油棕。","what_en":"Vegetable oil pressed from the fruit of the oil palm. Malaysia and Indonesia grow most of the world's oil palms.","fame":"饼干、方便面、巧克力、洗发水、肥皂里常常有它：便宜、耐放、产量高。可是为了种油棕砍掉雨林，也让红毛猩猩没了家，所以很多品牌开始用认证的「可持续棕榈油」。","fame_en":"It's in biscuits, instant noodles, chocolate, shampoo and soap: cheap, long-lasting and high-yielding. But clearing rainforest for plantations has cost orangutans their homes, so many brands now use certified 'sustainable' palm oil.","fact":"常听人说「超市里一半的东西有棕榈油」。2025 年一项研究查了三家西方连锁超市：配料表直接写棕榈油的只有 8%，算上可能来自棕榈的植物油成分，最多也就 33%。","fact_en":"People often say half of all supermarket products contain palm oil. A 2025 study of three Western supermarket chains found only 8% list it directly — and even counting oils that may come from palm, at most 33%.","src":"OFI Magazine (2025)","url":"https://www.ofimagazine.com/news/new-study-finds-palm-oil-not-in-50-of-supermarket-products","say":{"en":"Does this contain palm oil? I can't find it on the label.","zh":"这个里面有棕榈油吗？配料表上我没找到。"}},"苏拉威西镍矿":{"what":"印度尼西亚苏拉威西岛有大型镍矿和冶炼厂。镍是不锈钢和电动车电池的重要原料。","what_en":"Sulawesi in Indonesia has big nickel mines and smelters. Nickel goes into stainless steel and electric-car batteries.","fame":"你家的不锈钢锅、电动车里的电池，都可能用到印尼的镍。印尼镍储量世界第一，这几年电动车越火，这里的矿和冶炼厂就越多。","fame_en":"Your stainless-steel pan and an EV battery may both contain Indonesian nickel. Indonesia has the world's largest reserves, and the EV boom has brought more and more mines and smelters.","fact":"美国地质调查局说：2023 年全世界开采的镍矿，54% 来自印度尼西亚；2020 年 1 月 1 日起印尼禁止出口镍原矿，要求在国内冶炼，镍铁出口从 2020 年的 50 亿美元涨到 2023 年的 150 亿美元。","fact_en":"The US Geological Survey says Indonesia mined 54% of the world's nickel ore in 2023. It banned raw-ore exports from 1 January 2020 to force smelting at home, and ferronickel exports rose from $5bn in 2020 to $15bn in 2023.","src":"USGS · Minerals Yearbook 2023 (Indonesia)","url":"https://pubs.usgs.gov/myb/vol3/2023/myb3-2023-indonesia.pdf","say":{"en":"Are they hiring drivers at the smelter? What are the shifts like?","zh":"冶炼厂招司机吗？班是怎么排的？"}},"新加坡港":{"what":"新加坡南边海岸的集装箱码头群，马六甲海峡上来往的船很多都在这里停靠、换船。","what_en":"Singapore's container terminals on its southern coast, where ships passing through the Strait of Malacca stop and swap cargo.","fame":"它是世界上最忙的港口之一，也是最大的「中转站」：集装箱在这里从一条船吊到另一条船，再开往欧洲、非洲或美洲。你网购的东西可能在这里换过船。","fame_en":"It is one of the world's busiest ports and its biggest transhipment hub: boxes are lifted from one ship to another here, then sail on to Europe, Africa or the Americas. Your online order may have changed ships here.","fact":"2024 年新加坡港吞吐了 4112 万个标准箱，第一次超过 4000 万，创了纪录；其中大约九成是中转箱，并不在新加坡上岸。","fact_en":"In 2024 Singapore handled a record 41.12 million TEUs, passing 40 million for the first time — and about 90% of them were transhipment boxes that never left the port.","src":"Maritime and Port Authority of Singapore (2025)","url":"https://mpa.gov.sg/media-centre/details/strong-growth-momentum-for-maritime-singapore","say":{"en":"How long will the transhipment take? Is my container on the next vessel?","zh":"中转要多久？我的柜子能上下一班船吗？"}},"西伯利亚天然气":{"what":"俄罗斯西西伯利亚和东西伯利亚的大气田，用长长的管道把天然气送到欧洲和中国。","what_en":"The vast gas fields of western and eastern Siberia, whose long pipelines carry gas to Europe and China.","fame":"很多欧洲家庭以前做饭、取暖用的就是西伯利亚的气；2022 年以后欧洲大量减少进口，俄罗斯把更多的气转向中国。","fame_en":"Many European homes used to cook and heat with Siberian gas. After 2022 Europe cut its imports sharply, and Russia turned more of its gas towards China.","fact":"通往中国的「西伯利亚力量」管道 2019 年 12 月 2 日开始供气，按 30 年合同每年最多送 380 亿立方米。","fact_en":"The Power of Siberia pipeline to China started delivering gas on 2 December 2019, under a 30-year contract for up to 38 billion cubic metres a year.","src":"Wikipedia · Power of Siberia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Power_of_Siberia","say":{"en":"Is our heating on gas or electric? How much is the bill in winter?","zh":"我们的暖气是烧气的还是用电的？冬天一个月多少钱？"}},"皮尔巴拉铁矿":{"what":"西澳大利亚北部红土地上的巨型露天铁矿，矿石用火车拉到黑德兰港装船。","what_en":"Giant open-pit iron mines on the red earth of northern Western Australia, whose ore goes by train to Port Hedland for shipping.","fame":"澳大利亚是世界最大的铁矿石出口国，大部分运去中国炼钢。你住的楼、开的车里的钢，很可能有一部分来自皮尔巴拉。","fame_en":"Australia is the world's largest iron-ore exporter, mostly to China's steel mills. The steel in your building or car may partly come from the Pilbara.","fact":"2001 年 6 月 21 日，这里的一列运矿火车创了世界纪录：682 节车厢、7.3 公里长、近 10 万吨重，八台机车拉着跑了 275 公里。","fact_en":"On 21 June 2001 an ore train here set world records: 682 wagons, 7.3 km long and almost 100,000 tonnes, hauled 275 km by eight locomotives.","src":"Wikipedia · Mount Newman railway line","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Newman_railway_line","say":{"en":"Is it fly-in fly-out? How many weeks on and off?","zh":"是飞进飞出的轮班吗？上几周、休几周？"}},"格林布什锂矿":{"what":"西澳大利亚西南部小镇格林布什的硬岩锂矿，是世界上最大、品位最高的锂矿之一。","what_en":"The hard-rock lithium mine at Greenbushes in south-west Western Australia, one of the largest and richest in the world.","fame":"手机、笔记本和电动车的锂电池都离不开锂。澳大利亚是世界最大的锂矿产地，格林布什的锂精矿很多运到中国加工。","fame_en":"Lithium batteries in phones, laptops and EVs all need lithium. Australia mines more of it than anyone, and much of Greenbushes' concentrate is processed in China.","fact":"这里最早挖的不是锂，是锡：1886 年发现锡矿，1888 年建镇，从那时起几乎一直在开采；锂是 1983 年才开始产的。","fact_en":"It wasn't lithium they first dug here but tin: found in 1886, the town was founded in 1888 and has been mined almost ever since — lithium only started in 1983.","src":"Wikipedia · Greenbushes, Western Australia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greenbushes,_Western_Australia","say":{"en":"What happens to the ore after it leaves the mine?","zh":"矿石运出去以后会被做成什么？"}},"澳洲美利奴羊毛":{"what":"美利奴羊的毛，又细又软，可以做贴身穿的毛衣、袜子和运动内衣。澳大利亚是最大产地。","what_en":"Wool from merino sheep — fine and soft enough for jumpers, socks and base layers worn next to the skin. Australia is the biggest producer.","fame":"世界上做高档衣服用的细羊毛，大部分来自澳大利亚。现在很多户外和跑步品牌也用美利奴做内衣，因为透气、不容易有味道。","fame_en":"Most of the fine wool used for quality clothing comes from Australia. Outdoor and running brands now use merino for base layers because it breathes and doesn't hold smells.","fact":"2015 年，堪培拉郊外找到一只五六年没剪过毛的美利奴羊「克里斯」，剪下 41.1 公斤羊毛，创了吉尼斯世界纪录；那团羊毛现在在澳大利亚国家博物馆。","fact_en":"In 2015 a merino called Chris, found near Canberra after years without shearing, yielded a 41.1 kg fleece — a Guinness world record. The fleece is now in the National Museum of Australia.","src":"National Museum of Australia","url":"https://www.nma.gov.au/explore/collection/highlights/world-record-sheep-fleece","say":{"en":"Is this 100% merino? Can I put it in the washing machine?","zh":"这是百分之百美利奴吗？能机洗吗？"}},"怀卡托乳业":{"what":"新西兰北岛的怀卡托，绿草地上到处是奶牛，是新西兰乳业的中心。","what_en":"Waikato, on New Zealand's North Island, is green pasture full of dairy cows — the heart of the country's dairy industry.","fame":"新西兰的奶牛一年大部分时间在草地上吃草。新西兰是世界上最大的乳制品出口国之一，很多中国家长买的进口奶粉、超市里的黄油都来自这里。","fame_en":"New Zealand cows graze outdoors most of the year. The country is one of the world's biggest dairy exporters — much of the imported milk powder Chinese parents buy, and the butter on supermarket shelves, comes from here.","fact":"新西兰最大的乳企恒天然（Fonterra）是 2001 年由农民合作社合并成的，它在新西兰收的奶约 95% 都出口，占全世界乳制品出口的三成左右。","fact_en":"Fonterra, New Zealand's biggest dairy company, was formed by merging farmer co-operatives in 2001. It exports about 95% of what it makes in New Zealand — around 30% of world dairy exports.","src":"Wikipedia · Fonterra","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fonterra","say":{"en":"Is this milk powder made in New Zealand or just packed there?","zh":"这个奶粉是新西兰产的，还是只在那边包装？"}},"蒂普基猕猴桃":{"what":"新西兰北岛丰盛湾的小镇蒂普基，四周都是猕猴桃果园，号称「世界猕猴桃之都」。","what_en":"Te Puke, a town in the Bay of Plenty on New Zealand's North Island, surrounded by kiwifruit orchards — the self-styled 'Kiwifruit Capital of the World'.","fame":"超市里贴着 Zespri 标签的奇异果很多从这里来。猕猴桃原产中国长江一带，二十世纪初才被带到新西兰。","fame_en":"Many of the Zespri kiwifruit in your supermarket come from here. The fruit is native to China's Yangtze valley and only reached New Zealand in the early 1900s.","fact":"它以前在英语里叫「中国醋栗」。1959 年，新西兰出口商 Turners & Growers 听了美国客户的建议，改用「kiwifruit」这个名字卖到美国。","fact_en":"In English it used to be called the 'Chinese gooseberry'. In 1959 the New Zealand exporter Turners & Growers, on advice from a US customer, started selling it as 'kiwifruit'.","src":"Wikipedia · Kiwifruit","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiwifruit","say":{"en":"Are these gold or green kiwis? Which ones are sweeter?","zh":"这是金果还是绿果？哪种更甜？"}},"奥尤陶勒盖铜矿":{"what":"蒙古南部戈壁滩上的大型铜金矿，由力拓公司和蒙古政府合办。","what_en":"A giant copper-and-gold mine in the Gobi desert of southern Mongolia, run by Rio Tinto with the Mongolian government.","fame":"铜是电线、电动车和风力发电机里少不了的金属。这个矿的产出是蒙古最重要的出口之一，对一个三百多万人的国家意义很大。","fame_en":"Copper is essential for wires, EVs and wind turbines. This mine's output is one of Mongolia's biggest exports — a big deal for a country of just over three million people.","fact":"2023 年 3 月，它的地下矿正式开始出矿，在戈壁地下 1.3 公里深处挖矿石；这个地下工程投了 70 多亿美元。","fact_en":"In March 2023 its underground mine began production, digging ore 1.3 km beneath the Gobi — a project that cost over US$7 billion.","src":"Mining Weekly (2023)","url":"https://www.miningweekly.com/article/underground-production-starts-at-oyu-tolgoi-2023-03-13","say":{"en":"How deep does the lift go? How long is the ride down?","zh":"升降机下到多深？下去要多久？"}},"柬埔寨制衣":{"what":"柬埔寨金边周边几百家服装、鞋子和箱包工厂，工人大多是年轻女性。","what_en":"Hundreds of garment, shoe and bag factories around Phnom Penh, staffed mostly by young women.","fame":"你衣柜里的 T 恤、运动鞋，标签上写「Made in Cambodia」的越来越多。服装、鞋和箱包是柬埔寨最大的出口商品，支撑着几十万个家庭。","fame_en":"More and more T-shirts and trainers in your wardrobe say 'Made in Cambodia'. Garments, shoes and travel goods are its largest exports, supporting hundreds of thousands of families.","fact":"柬埔寨商业部说：2024 年服装、纺织品、鞋子和旅行用品一共出口 139.2 亿美元，比前一年多 23%，其中衣服就有 97.9 亿美元。","fact_en":"Cambodia's Ministry of Commerce says it exported US$13.92 billion of garments, textiles, footwear and travel goods in 2024, up 23% — $9.79 billion of it clothes.","src":"Vietstock (Xinhua, 2025)","url":"https://en.vietstock.vn/2025/01/cambodia8217s-exports-of-garments-textiles-shoes-travel-goods-hit-nearly-14-bln-in-2024-114-598331.htm","say":{"en":"What's the minimum order, and how long is the lead time?","zh":"起订量是多少？交货期多久？"}},"东南亚蓄电池":{"what":"老挝在湄公河和它的支流上建了几十座水电站，把电卖给泰国、越南等邻国，被叫作「东南亚的蓄电池」。","what_en":"Laos has built dozens of hydropower dams on the Mekong and its tributaries and sells the power to Thailand, Vietnam and other neighbours — the 'battery of South-East Asia'.","fame":"曼谷晚上亮着的灯，有一部分用的是老挝的水电。卖电是老挝最重要的收入之一；可是水坝也改变了河里的鱼和下游农民的生活。","fame_en":"Some of Bangkok's lights at night run on Lao hydropower. Electricity is one of Laos's biggest earners — but the dams have also changed the river's fish and the lives of farmers downstream.","fact":"世界银行估计，2023 年老挝发的电约三分之二卖到了国外；可在首都万象，停电仍然是家常便饭。","fact_en":"The World Bank estimates Laos exported about two-thirds of the electricity it generated in 2023 — yet in the capital Vientiane, power cuts are still common.","src":"AFP via Macau Business (2026)","url":"https://macaubusiness.com/lights-out-in-laos-as-electricity-exports-surge/","say":{"en":"Is there a power cut today? When will it come back?","zh":"今天停电吗？什么时候来电？"}},"帕敢翡翠":{"what":"缅甸北部克钦邦的帕敢，是世界上最大的翡翠产地，山被一层层挖开找玉石。","what_en":"Hpakant in Kachin State, northern Myanmar, is the world's biggest source of jadeite — whole hillsides are dug away in search of stones.","fame":"中国人爱戴的翡翠手镯、吊坠，好的料子大多来自这里，再经云南瑞丽、广东平洲加工售卖。可是挖矿也带来塌方、毒品和地方武装的问题。","fame_en":"The best jade for the bangles and pendants so loved in China mostly comes from here, then is cut and sold in Ruili (Yunnan) and Pingzhou (Guangdong). But mining has also brought landslides, drugs and armed conflict.","fact":"国际组织「全球见证」2015 年的报告估算：仅 2014 年一年，缅甸翡翠的产值就可能高达 310 亿美元，相当于缅甸官方 GDP 的近一半，但大部分钱没进国库。","fact_en":"A 2015 Global Witness report estimated Myanmar's jade output in 2014 alone may have been worth up to US$31 billion — nearly half the country's official GDP — yet most of it never reached the state.","src":"Global Witness (2015)","url":"https://globalwitness.org/en/press-releases/myanmar-approaches-historic-election-new-report-reveals-secret-jade-trade-worth-us31-billion","say":{"en":"Is this natural A-grade jade? Can I see the certificate?","zh":"这是天然 A 货吗？能看看证书吗？"}},"菲律宾椰子":{"what":"菲律宾吕宋岛南部的比科尔和棉兰老岛一带，到处是椰子林，椰子是很多农村家庭的主要收入。","what_en":"Bicol in southern Luzon and much of Mindanao are covered in coconut groves; coconuts are the main income of many rural families.","fame":"你喝的椰子水、吃的椰子片、用的椰子油，很可能来自菲律宾。菲律宾是世界第二大椰子生产国，只比印尼少，三百多万农民靠它生活。","fame_en":"The coconut water you drink, the dried coconut you snack on and the coconut oil you cook with may well be Filipino. The Philippines is the world's second-largest coconut producer after Indonesia, supporting around three million farmers.","fact":"很多椰子树太老了，产量越来越低。2024 年马科斯总统提出：到 2028 年要新种一亿棵椰子树。","fact_en":"Many of the trees are old and yields keep falling. In 2024 President Marcos set a goal of planting 100 million new coconut trees by 2028.","src":"ABS-CBN News (2024)","url":"https://www.abs-cbn.com/news/2024/8/9/philippine-coconut-authority-to-mount-national-coconut-planting-program-with-target-1725","say":{"en":"One buko, please — can you open it so I can drink from it?","zh":"来一个椰青，帮我开个口直接喝吧。"}},"夏尔巴向导":{"what":"住在尼泊尔珠峰脚下昆布地区的夏尔巴人，很多人做登山向导和背夫；南池巴扎是去珠峰大本营路上最大的村子。","what_en":"The Sherpa people of the Khumbu region below Everest, many of whom work as mountain guides and porters; Namche Bazaar is the biggest village on the trail to Everest Base Camp.","fame":"没有夏尔巴向导，几乎没有外国人能登上珠峰：他们修路、架梯、背氧气，也最常遇到危险。登山和徒步旅游是尼泊尔很重要的收入。","fame_en":"Without Sherpa guides almost no foreigner would reach the top of Everest: they fix the ropes and ladders, carry the oxygen — and face the most danger. Climbing and trekking are a vital income for Nepal.","fact":"夏尔巴向导卡米·丽塔 2025 年 5 月 27 日第 31 次登顶珠峰，2026 年 5 月 17 日又登了第 32 次，一直刷新自己的世界纪录。","fact_en":"Sherpa guide Kami Rita reached the top of Everest for the 31st time on 27 May 2025 — and a 32nd time on 17 May 2026, breaking his own world record again.","src":"Wikipedia · Kami Rita","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kami_Rita","say":{"en":"How many days do we need to get used to the altitude?","zh":"我们要几天来适应高原？"}},"锡兰肉桂":{"what":"斯里兰卡南部（加勒一带）出产的真肉桂，是用肉桂树的内层薄皮一层层卷成的细卷。","what_en":"True cinnamon from southern Sri Lanka around Galle, made from thin layers of inner bark rolled into delicate quills.","fame":"超市里的「肉桂粉」很多其实是印尼、越南的桂皮；锡兰肉桂颜色浅、味道更细，世界上的真肉桂大多来自斯里兰卡。剥皮的手艺要学很多年。","fame_en":"Much supermarket 'cinnamon' is really cassia from Indonesia or Vietnam. Ceylon cinnamon is paler and more delicate, and most true cinnamon comes from Sri Lanka. Peeling the bark takes years to learn.","fact":"2022 年欧盟把「锡兰肉桂」登记为受保护的地理标志，这是斯里兰卡第一个拿到地理标志的产品。","fact_en":"In 2022 the EU registered 'Ceylon Cinnamon' as a Protected Geographical Indication — the first product from Sri Lanka ever to get GI status.","src":"Sri Lanka Export Development Board","url":"https://www.srilankabusiness.com/news/sri-lanka-achieves-its-first-ever-gi-certification-with-ceylon-cinnamon.html","say":{"en":"Is this real Ceylon cinnamon or cassia?","zh":"这是真的锡兰肉桂，还是桂皮？"}},"一杆一钩钓鱼":{"what":"马尔代夫渔民的传统捕鱼法：撒水和小鱼把鲣鱼群引过来，站在船尾用鱼竿一条一条往上钓。","what_en":"The Maldivian way of fishing: spray water and live bait to draw a school of skipjack tuna, then haul them up one by one with poles from the back of the boat.","fame":"一次只钓一条，不会像大拖网那样误捕海龟、鲨鱼。超市里贴着「pole and line」的金枪鱼罐头，就是这样钓上来的；渔业是马尔代夫除了旅游以外最重要的产业。","fame_en":"One fish at a time means no turtles or sharks caught by mistake, unlike big nets. Tins of tuna labelled 'pole and line' are caught this way; after tourism, fishing is the Maldives' most important industry.","fact":"2012 年马尔代夫的一杆一钩鲣鱼成了印度洋第一个拿到 MSC 可持续认证的金枪鱼渔业；现在每年有 5 万多吨认证鲣鱼卖到欧洲和北美。","fact_en":"In 2012 Maldivian pole-and-line skipjack became the first Indian Ocean tuna fishery certified by the MSC; today over 50,000 tonnes of certified skipjack go to Europe and North America each year.","src":"Marine Stewardship Council","url":"https://www.msc.org/fisheries-stories/maldives-skipjack-tuna","say":{"en":"Was this tuna caught today? Can you grill it for us?","zh":"这条金枪鱼是今天钓的吗？能帮我们烤一下吗？"}},"锡亚尔科特足球":{"what":"巴基斯坦旁遮普省的锡亚尔科特，几千家作坊和工厂做足球和体育用品，很多球还是手工缝的。","what_en":"Sialkot in Pakistan's Punjab, where thousands of workshops and factories make footballs and sporting goods — many balls still stitched by hand.","fame":"你踢过的足球，很可能是锡亚尔科特做的：这座城市给很多大品牌代工，也做世界杯用球；不少球还是工人一针一针手缝的。","fame_en":"The football you've kicked may well have been made in Sialkot, which makes balls for many big brands — including World Cup balls. Many are still stitched by hand, panel by panel.","fact":"城里的 Forward Sports 给阿迪达斯做过 2014 年世界杯用球 Brazuca 和 2018 年的 Telstar 18；2026 年世界杯的比赛用球 Trionda 也报道是它做的。","fact_en":"Sialkot's Forward Sports made adidas's Brazuca for the 2014 World Cup and Telstar 18 for 2018, and was reported to make Trionda, the official ball of the 2026 World Cup.","src":"Wikipedia · Forward Sports","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forward_Sports","say":{"en":"Is this ball hand-stitched or thermo-bonded?","zh":"这个球是手缝的还是热粘合的？"}},"穆龙套金矿":{"what":"乌兹别克斯坦克孜勒库姆沙漠里的巨型露天金矿，由国营的纳沃伊矿冶公司经营。","what_en":"A gigantic open-pit gold mine in Uzbekistan's Kyzylkum desert, run by the state-owned Navoi Mining and Metallurgical Company.","fame":"它是世界上产金最多的矿之一，黄金是乌兹别克斯坦最重要的出口商品之一。金价涨的时候，这个国家的收入也跟着涨。","fame_en":"It is one of the world's most productive gold mines, and gold is one of Uzbekistan's biggest exports — when the gold price rises, so does the country's income.","fact":"这个金矿 1958 年发现，1967 年开始露天开采；矿坑长约 3.5 公里、宽 2.5 公里，2012 年已挖到 560 米深。","fact_en":"Discovered in 1958 and mined in the open since 1967, the pit is about 3.5 km by 2.5 km and was already 560 m deep by 2012.","src":"Wikipedia · Muruntau gold deposit","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muruntau_gold_deposit","say":{"en":"What's the gold price per gram today?","zh":"今天金价一克多少？"}},"劳托卡糖城":{"what":"斐济主岛西部的港口城市劳托卡，四周是甘蔗田，城里有一座大糖厂，所以叫「糖城」。","what_en":"Lautoka, a port city on the west of Fiji's main island, ringed by sugar-cane fields with a big sugar mill in town — hence 'Sugar City'.","fame":"糖曾经是斐济最重要的出口。很多种甘蔗的家庭是一百多年前从印度来的契约劳工的后代，所以斐济有很大的印度裔社区。","fame_en":"Sugar was once Fiji's most important export. Many cane-growing families descend from indentured labourers brought from India over a century ago, which is why Fiji has a large Indo-Fijian community.","fact":"劳托卡糖厂 1903 年建成，是澳大利亚的殖民地制糖公司（CSR）在斐济建的糖厂之一；CSR 在斐济经营了近百年，1973 年才退出。","fact_en":"Lautoka's mill was built in 1903 by Australia's Colonial Sugar Refining Company (CSR), which ran Fiji's sugar industry for nearly a century before pulling out in 1973.","src":"Wikipedia · Colonial Sugar Refining Company (Fiji)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colonial_Sugar_Refining_Company_(Fiji)","say":{"en":"When is the cane-crushing season? Can we see the mill?","zh":"榨季是什么时候？能去看看糖厂吗？"}},"巴新天然气":{"what":"巴布亚新几内亚高地的天然气，用管道送到首都莫尔兹比港附近，冷却成液化天然气装船出口。","what_en":"Gas from Papua New Guinea's highlands, piped to near the capital Port Moresby and chilled into liquefied natural gas for export.","fame":"液化天然气是巴新最大的出口商品，主要卖给日本、中国等亚洲国家发电、做饭。对一个很多地方还没通路的国家，这是很大一笔收入。","fame_en":"LNG is Papua New Guinea's largest export, sold mainly to Japan, China and other Asian buyers for power and cooking — a huge income for a country where many places still have no roads.","fact":"巴新液化天然气项目的第一船货 2014 年 5 月由「Spirit of Hela」号运出，送给东京电力公司，比计划提前。","fact_en":"The PNG LNG project's first cargo left in May 2014 on the tanker Spirit of Hela, bound for Tokyo Electric Power — ahead of schedule.","src":"ITOCHU (2014)","url":"https://www.itochu.co.jp/en/news/press/2014/140526.html","say":{"en":"Where does our gas come from? Is it piped or shipped as LNG?","zh":"我们用的气是从哪儿来的？管道来的还是 LNG 船运的？"}},"帕劳潜水":{"what":"西太平洋岛国帕劳，周围是珊瑚礁、蓝洞和鲨鱼，是世界有名的潜水地。","what_en":"Palau, a Pacific island nation of coral reefs, blue holes and sharks, is one of the world's famous dive destinations.","fame":"潜水和旅游是帕劳最重要的产业：蓝角、德国水道这些潜点和能浮潜的水母湖，是很多潜水的人一辈子想去一次的地方。","fame_en":"Diving and tourism are Palau's main industries: dive sites like Blue Corner and German Channel, and snorkelling in Jellyfish Lake, are on many divers' bucket lists.","fact":"2017 年 12 月起，所有入境帕劳的游客都要在护照里盖的「帕劳誓言」上签名，向帕劳的孩子保证爱护这里的环境——帕劳是第一个把环保承诺写进入境规定的国家。","fact_en":"Since December 2017 every visitor to Palau must sign the 'Palau Pledge' stamped into their passport, promising the islands' children to protect the environment — the first country to make an eco-pledge part of entry rules.","src":"National Geographic","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/travel/article/passport-stamp-ecotourism-pledge","say":{"en":"Is the reef-safe sunscreen required here? Where can I buy it?","zh":"这里规定要用不伤珊瑚的防晒霜吗？哪儿能买？"}},"华强北电子":{"what":"深圳福田区华强北路一带的电子市场，一栋栋大楼里挤满了卖芯片、屏幕、手机配件的小柜台。","what_en":"The electronics markets along Huaqiang North Road in Shenzhen's Futian district — building after building packed with tiny stalls selling chips, screens and phone parts.","fame":"想做一个硬件小发明，在这里一天就能把零件配齐；全世界的创客、小厂老板都来这里找货。很多人第一台手机的配件，就是从华强北发出去的。","fame_en":"Want to build a gadget? You can find every part here in a day; makers and small manufacturers come from all over the world. Countless phone accessories began their journey here.","fact":"它的起点是 1979 年：广东把三家军工电子厂从粤北山区搬到深圳，其中就有后来给这条路起了名字的「华强」。","fact_en":"It began in 1979, when Guangdong moved three military electronics factories from its mountainous north to Shenzhen — one of them the Huaqiang factory that gave the road its name.","src":"Sixth Tone","url":"https://www.sixthtone.com/news/1018763","say":{"en":"Can you do a better price if I buy fifty?","zh":"我要五十个，能便宜点吗？"}},"东莞世界工厂":{"what":"珠江口东岸的东莞，有成千上万家工厂，做鞋子、玩具、家具和电子产品，被叫作「世界工厂」。","what_en":"Dongguan, on the east bank of the Pearl River estuary, has tens of thousands of factories making shoes, toys, furniture and electronics — the 'world's factory'.","fame":"你脚上的运动鞋、孩子的玩具、手机里的零件，很可能有一样是东莞做的。几十年来，几百万外地年轻人到这里打工。","fame_en":"Your trainers, your child's toys or a part inside your phone may well have come from Dongguan, where millions of young migrants have come to work over the decades.","fact":"2021 年东莞的 GDP 第一次超过 1 万亿元，比前一年增长 8.2%，成了中国第 24 座「万亿城市」。","fact_en":"In 2021 Dongguan's GDP passed 1 trillion yuan for the first time, up 8.2%, making it China's 24th 'trillion-yuan city'.","src":"China Daily HK (2022)","url":"https://chinadailyhk.com/article/257231","say":{"en":"Can we visit the production line before we place the order?","zh":"下单之前能去看看生产线吗？"}},"义乌小商品":{"what":"浙江义乌的国际商贸城，七万多个摊位，卖从发卡、袜子到圣诞装饰的几乎所有小东西。","what_en":"Yiwu International Trade City in Zhejiang — 75,000 stalls selling almost every small thing, from hair clips and socks to Christmas decorations.","fame":"全世界很多一元店、节日用品店的货都从义乌批发；欧美的圣诞装饰大部分是这里做的。中东、非洲、拉美的商人常年住在义乌进货。","fame_en":"Many of the world's pound shops and party stores stock up in Yiwu, and most Western Christmas decorations are made here. Traders from the Middle East, Africa and Latin America live in Yiwu to buy.","fact":"2016 年美国大选前，义乌商人发现特朗普旗帜、帽子的订单远远多过希拉里的，后来真是特朗普赢了——从此常有人看「义乌指数」猜美国大选，不过它只是个趣闻，不算预测。","fact_en":"Before the 2016 US election, Yiwu sellers noticed orders for Trump flags and hats far outnumbered Clinton's — and Trump won. Since then people joke about a 'Yiwu index' for US elections, though it's a fun fact, not a forecast.","src":"China2West","url":"https://www.china2west.com/why-chinese-manufacturers-are-an-unwitting-predictor-of-us-elections/","say":{"en":"What's the minimum order for this design? Can you ship it to Rotterdam?","zh":"这个款起订量多少？能发到鹿特丹吗？"}},"洋山深水港":{"what":"上海东南外海小洋山岛上的集装箱码头，靠 32.5 公里长的东海大桥连到浦东，是上海港的核心港区。","what_en":"The container terminals on Xiaoyangshan island off south-east Shanghai, linked to Pudong by the 32.5 km Donghai Bridge — the heart of the Port of Shanghai.","fame":"上海港是世界上最忙的集装箱港。洋山四期是全自动化码头：桥吊、运箱车都由电脑控制，码头上几乎看不到人。你网购的进口货，很多是从这里上岸的。","fame_en":"Shanghai is the world's busiest container port. Yangshan Phase IV is fully automated — cranes and box carriers run by computer, with hardly a person on the quay. Many imported goods you order land here.","fact":"2024 年 12 月 22 日，上海港当年处理的集装箱第一次超过 5000 万标准箱，是世界上第一个做到的港口。","fact_en":"On 22 December 2024 the Port of Shanghai handled its 50 millionth TEU of the year — the first port in the world ever to do so.","src":"The Maritime Executive (2024)","url":"https://maritime-executive.com/article/shanghai-exceeds-50-million-teu-for-the-first-time","say":{"en":"Which terminal does our container arrive at — Yangshan or Waigaoqiao?","zh":"我们的柜子到洋山还是外高桥？"}},"陆家嘴金融区":{"what":"上海浦东黄浦江边的陆家嘴，东方明珠、上海中心和一片银行、证券公司的大楼都在这里。","what_en":"Lujiazui in Pudong, on the Huangpu River, home to the Oriental Pearl Tower, the Shanghai Tower and a forest of bank and brokerage towers.","fame":"它是中国的金融中心之一，上海证券交易所也在浦东。三十多年前这里还是农田和仓库，现在是来上海必拍的天际线。","fame_en":"It is one of China's financial centres, with the Shanghai Stock Exchange in Pudong. Just over thirty years ago it was farmland and warehouses; now it's the skyline every visitor photographs.","fact":"上海证券交易所 1990 年 12 月 19 日开业时，不在陆家嘴，而是在浦西一家老饭店——浦江饭店的舞厅里；1997 年才搬进浦东自己的大楼。","fact_en":"When the Shanghai Stock Exchange opened on 19 December 1990, it wasn't in Lujiazui but in the ballroom of an old hotel in Puxi, the Pujiang (once the Astor House); it moved to its own Pudong tower in 1997.","src":"The China Project (2022)","url":"https://thechinaproject.com/2022/12/21/something-old-something-new-the-1990-re-opening-of-shanghais-stock-exchange/","say":{"en":"Which exit is closest to the Shanghai Tower?","zh":"去上海中心从哪个出口最近？"}},"大庆油田":{"what":"黑龙江西部的大庆油田，是中国最大的油田之一，几十年里给全国供了大量石油。","what_en":"The Daqing oilfield in western Heilongjiang, one of China's largest, which has supplied a huge share of the country's oil for decades.","fame":"大庆让中国在 1960 年代基本摆脱了「靠进口石油」。「铁人」王进喜带着 1205 钻井队跳进泥浆池压井的故事，很多中国人小时候都听过。","fame_en":"Daqing largely ended China's reliance on imported oil in the 1960s. The story of 'Iron Man' Wang Jinxi and Drilling Team 1205 jumping into a mud pit to save a well is one most Chinese children grow up hearing.","fact":"1959 年 9 月 26 日第一口井喷油，正好在国庆十周年前四天，所以这片油田取名「大庆」——「大庆祝」的意思。","fact_en":"The first well struck oil on 26 September 1959, four days before the People's Republic's tenth anniversary — so the field was named Daqing, 'great celebration'.","src":"Wikipedia · Daqing Oil Field","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daqing_Oil_Field","say":{"en":"Is the oilfield museum open today? Is there a guide?","zh":"油田博物馆今天开吗？有讲解吗？"}},"山西煤炭":{"what":"山西被叫作「煤海」，地下是大片的煤田，运煤的火车和卡车一年到头不停。","what_en":"Shanxi is called the 'sea of coal' — vast coalfields lie beneath it, and coal trains and trucks run all year.","fame":"中国一半以上的电还是烧煤发的，你家里的灯、工厂里的机器，都可能用着山西的煤。山西也在想办法转型：太阳能、文旅、新材料。","fame_en":"Over half of China's electricity still comes from coal, so the lights in your home may run on Shanxi coal. The province is also trying to change — solar, tourism, new materials.","fact":"山西和内蒙古轮流当「产煤第一」：山西 2020—2023 年连续四年第一，2023 年产了 13.78 亿吨；2024 年内蒙古以 12.97 亿吨反超山西的 12.69 亿吨。","fact_en":"Shanxi and Inner Mongolia take turns as China's top coal producer: Shanxi led for four years from 2020 to 2023, producing 1.378 billion tonnes in 2023, but in 2024 Inner Mongolia's 1.297 billion overtook Shanxi's 1.269 billion.","src":"第一财经 Yicai (2025)","url":"https://www.yicai.com/news/102933389.html","say":{"en":"How long does the train take from Taiyuan to Datong?","zh":"太原到大同的火车要多久？"}},"包头稀土":{"what":"内蒙古包头北边的白云鄂博，有世界上最大的稀土矿，包头因此被叫作「稀土之都」。","what_en":"Bayan Obo, north of Baotou in Inner Mongolia, holds the world's largest rare-earth deposit — which is why Baotou is called the 'rare-earth capital'.","fame":"稀土能做出很强的磁铁，手机振动马达、耳机、电动车电机、风力发电机都离不开它。中国在稀土开采和加工上占全球很大份额，所以它常出现在贸易新闻里。","fame_en":"Rare earths make super-strong magnets for phone vibration motors, earbuds, EV motors and wind turbines. China dominates mining and processing, so they keep showing up in trade news.","fact":"白云鄂博 1927 年被发现时，人们以为它只是个铁矿；1936 年才在里面找到稀土矿物，1950 年代又发现了铌。","fact_en":"When Bayan Obo was discovered in 1927 it was thought to be just an iron deposit; rare-earth minerals were only found there in 1936, and niobium in the 1950s.","src":"Wikipedia · Bayan Obo Mining District","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayan_Obo_Mining_District","say":{"en":"What are rare earths actually used for in a phone?","zh":"手机里到底哪里用到了稀土？"}},"宁德电池":{"what":"福建东北部的宁德，是动力电池公司宁德时代（CATL）的总部，城里有一座座电池工厂。","what_en":"Ningde in north-east Fujian is home to battery maker CATL, whose factories now fill the city.","fame":"全世界很多电动汽车——包括不少欧美品牌——装的是宁德时代的电池。一个原来不太有名的海边城市，因为一家电池公司出了名。","fame_en":"Many of the world's electric cars, including plenty of Western brands, run on CATL batteries. A little-known coastal city became famous because of one battery company.","fact":"宁德时代 2011 年才成立，到 2024 年已经占了全球电动车电池装车量的 37.9%，比第二名比亚迪的 17.2% 多一倍还多。","fact_en":"CATL was only founded in 2011, yet in 2024 it supplied 37.9% of the world's EV batteries installed — more than twice runner-up BYD's 17.2%.","src":"CnEVPost (SNE Research, 2025)","url":"https://cnevpost.com/2025/02/11/global-ev-battery-market-share-2024/","say":{"en":"How many kilometres does this battery get on one charge?","zh":"这块电池充一次电能跑多少公里？"}},"合肥新能源汽车":{"what":"安徽省会合肥，这几年聚集了蔚来、比亚迪、大众等多家电动汽车工厂，成了新的「汽车城」。","what_en":"Hefei, capital of Anhui, has drawn EV plants from NIO, BYD, Volkswagen and others in recent years, becoming a new 'car city'.","fame":"合肥是「政府投资带产业」的有名例子：先投钱引来车企，再把电池、芯片、零件厂一起拉来。很多中国电动车就是在这里下线的。","fame_en":"Hefei is a famous case of a city government investing to build an industry: first bringing in carmakers, then the battery, chip and parts suppliers. Many Chinese EVs roll off lines here.","fact":"2020 年初蔚来差点没钱了，合肥的国资背景投资方投了 70 亿元，救下了这家公司；那一年蔚来股价涨了十倍。","fact_en":"In early 2020, when NIO was close to running out of cash, Hefei government-backed investors put in 7 billion yuan and saved it; NIO's share price rose tenfold that year.","src":"CnEVPost (2022)","url":"https://cnevpost.com/2022/04/28/new-report-reveals-decision-making-process-behind-hefeis-investment-in-nio/","say":{"en":"Can I book a test drive this weekend?","zh":"这周末能预约试驾吗？"}},"寿光蔬菜":{"what":"山东寿光的大片蔬菜大棚，冬天也能种黄瓜、西红柿、辣椒，被叫作「中国蔬菜之乡」。","what_en":"Shouguang in Shandong, with mile after mile of vegetable greenhouses growing cucumbers, tomatoes and peppers even in winter — 'China's vegetable capital'.","fame":"北方人冬天能吃上新鲜黄瓜、西红柿，很大程度要谢谢寿光的大棚。这里的蔬菜批发市场把菜发往全国，种棚的技术也教到了全国各地。","fame_en":"Northern Chinese can eat fresh cucumbers and tomatoes in winter largely thanks to Shouguang's greenhouses. Its wholesale market ships vegetables nationwide, and its growers have taught their methods all over China.","fact":"1989 年，三元朱村的党支部书记王乐义带着 16 名党员砍掉 36 亩快成熟的玉米，建起 17 个冬暖式大棚，掀起了寿光的「菜篮子革命」。","fact_en":"In 1989 Wang Leyi, Party secretary of Sanyuanzhu village, led 16 members to cut down 36 mu of nearly ripe maize and build 17 winter-warm greenhouses — starting Shouguang's 'vegetable-basket revolution'.","src":"国家发展改革委（2018）","url":"https://www.ndrc.gov.cn/fggz/nyncjj/xczx/201812/t20181227_1111593.html","say":{"en":"Are these greenhouse tomatoes? Where were they grown?","zh":"这是大棚西红柿吗？哪里产的？"}},"新竹芯片":{"what":"台湾新竹科学园区，台积电和很多芯片公司的总部、工厂都在这里。","what_en":"Hsinchu Science Park in Taiwan, home to TSMC and many other chip companies' headquarters and fabs.","fame":"你手机、电脑、游戏机里最强的那颗芯片，很可能是在台湾造的。台积电只替别人造芯片，不自己设计，英伟达、苹果、高通都是它的客户。","fame_en":"The most powerful chip in your phone, laptop or console was probably made in Taiwan. TSMC only manufactures chips for others rather than designing its own — Nvidia, Apple and Qualcomm are all customers.","fact":"台积电 1987 年 2 月 21 日在新竹创立，现在全世界芯片代工市场大约七成是它的。","fact_en":"TSMC was founded in Hsinchu on 21 February 1987; today it holds about 70% of the world's contract chip-making market.","src":"Wikipedia · TSMC","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TSMC","say":{"en":"Is it easy to get from Hsinchu High Speed Rail station to the science park?","zh":"从新竹高铁站去科学园区方便吗？"}},"日元":{"what":"日本的货币，没有小数：最小是 1 日元硬币，最大是 1 万日元纸币。","what_en":"Japan's currency, with no decimals: from the 1-yen coin up to the 10,000-yen note.","fame":"日本人还挺爱用现金，很多小店、拉面店的券卖机只收现金和硬币。1 日元硬币是铝做的，只有 1 克重，轻得能浮在水面上。","fame_en":"Japanese people still use a lot of cash — many small shops and ramen ticket machines take only notes and coins. The aluminium 1-yen coin weighs just one gram, light enough to float on water.","fact":"2024 年 7 月 3 日，日本发行了 20 年来第一套新钞：1 万日元上换成了「日本资本主义之父」涩泽荣一，钞票上还有转动会变的 3D 全息图。","fact_en":"On 3 July 2024 Japan issued its first new banknotes in 20 years: the 10,000-yen note now shows Shibusawa Eiichi, the 'father of Japanese capitalism', with a 3D hologram that turns as you tilt it.","src":"AP via ClickOnDetroit (2024)","url":"https://www.clickondetroit.com/business/2024/07/03/japan-issues-new-yen-banknotes-packed-with-3d-hologram-technology-to-fight-counterfeiting/","say":{"en":"Can I pay by card, or is it cash only?","zh":"可以刷卡吗？还是只收现金？"}},"韩元":{"what":"韩国的货币，纸币有 1000、5000、1 万和 5 万韩元四种。","what_en":"South Korea's currency, with notes of 1,000, 5,000, 10,000 and 50,000 won.","fame":"5 万韩元上是朝鲜时代的女画家、书法家申师任堂；5000 韩元上是她的儿子、学者李珥。母子俩都在钞票上，世界上很少见。","fame_en":"The 50,000-won note shows Shin Saimdang, a Joseon-era painter and calligrapher; the 5,000-won note shows her son, the scholar Yi I — a mother and son both on banknotes, which is rare anywhere.","fact":"5 万韩元纸币 2009 年 6 月才第一次发行，申师任堂因此成为第一位出现在韩国钞票上的女性。","fact_en":"The 50,000-won note was first issued only in June 2009, making Shin Saimdang the first woman ever on a South Korean banknote.","src":"Wikipedia · Shin Saimdang","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shin_Saimdang","say":{"en":"Is there a tax refund if I spend over 30,000 won?","zh":"满三万韩元能退税吗？"}},"卢比":{"what":"印度的货币。纸币上除了印地语和英语，背面还用十几种印度语言写着面额。","what_en":"India's currency. Besides Hindi and English, the back of each note gives the value in over a dozen Indian languages.","fame":"₹ 这个符号 2010 年才定下来。现在很多印度人几乎不用现金：街边菜摊也挂着二维码，用手机 UPI 扫一扫就付了。","fame_en":"The ₹ symbol was only adopted in 2010. Many Indians now barely use cash: even street vegetable stalls have a QR code for UPI phone payments.","fact":"2016 年 11 月 8 日晚上，政府突然宣布 500 和 1000 卢比纸币作废，这两种钞票占当时流通现金的约 86%，全国银行门口排起长队。","fact_en":"On the evening of 8 November 2016 the government suddenly scrapped the 500- and 1,000-rupee notes — about 86% of the cash in circulation — and queues formed outside banks across India.","src":"Wikipedia · 2016 Indian banknote demonetisation","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2016_Indian_banknote_demonetisation","say":{"en":"Can I pay by UPI, or do you need cash?","zh":"可以用 UPI 付吗？还是要现金？"}},"泰铢":{"what":"泰国的货币，1 铢 = 100 萨当，纸币有 20、50、100、500 和 1000 铢。","what_en":"Thailand's currency: 1 baht = 100 satang, with notes of 20, 50, 100, 500 and 1,000 baht.","fame":"泰铢每张纸币正面都是泰国国王的像，背面是历代国王。泰国人很尊重王室，钞票掉在地上千万别用脚去踩。","fame_en":"Every Thai banknote shows the king on the front and earlier kings on the back. Thais deeply respect the monarchy — never stop a dropped note with your foot.","fact":"现在用的是 2018 年开始发行的第 17 套，印的是拉玛十世；2022 年 20 铢改成了塑料钞，2025 年 50 和 100 铢也有了塑料版。","fact_en":"The current Series 17, issued from 2018, shows King Rama X; the 20-baht note switched to polymer in 2022, and 50- and 100-baht polymer notes followed in 2025.","src":"Bank of Thailand","url":"https://www.bot.or.th/en/our-roles/banknotes/History-and-Series-of-Banknote-And-Commemorative/banknotes-series/banknote-series17.html","say":{"en":"How much is one plate? Not too spicy, please.","zh":"一盘多少钱？不要太辣。"}},"越南盾":{"what":"越南的货币，面额很大：一碗河粉要四五万盾，最大的纸币是 50 万盾。","what_en":"Vietnam's currency, with big numbers: a bowl of phở costs 40,000–50,000 dong, and the largest note is 500,000.","fame":"因为零多，刚到越南的人常常算错账，一不小心就把 50 万当成 5 万给出去。所有纸币上都是胡志明的像，颜色差不多，要看清数字。","fame_en":"With all those zeros, newcomers often mix up 500,000 and 50,000 notes. Every note shows Ho Chi Minh, and some colours are similar — check the numbers.","fact":"越南从 2003 年开始把 1 万盾以上的纸币换成塑料钞，比很多大国都早，钞票掉进水里也不怕。","fact_en":"From 2003 Vietnam replaced all notes of 10,000 dong and up with polymer — earlier than many big economies — so they survive a dunk in water.","src":"Wikipedia · Vietnamese đồng","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vietnamese_%C4%91%E1%BB%93ng","say":{"en":"Sorry, is this fifty thousand or five hundred thousand?","zh":"不好意思，这张是五万还是五十万？"}},"新加坡元":{"what":"新加坡的货币，纸币是塑料做的，正面都是首任总统尤索夫·伊萨克。","what_en":"Singapore's currency; its polymer notes all show the first president, Yusof Ishak.","fame":"背面画的是教育、体育、艺术、政府等主题，像一本小小的国家介绍。在小贩中心付钱，现金和扫码都很常见。","fame_en":"The backs show themes like education, sport, arts and government — a little guide to the nation. At hawker centres both cash and QR payments are common.","fact":"因为 1967 年签的货币互换协议，新加坡元和文莱元一直 1 比 1 等值：在两个国家里，两种钱都能直接用，换钱也不收手续费。","fact_en":"Thanks to an agreement signed in 1967, the Singapore and Brunei dollars have stayed at par: each is accepted in the other country, and swapping them is free.","src":"Monetary Authority of Singapore","url":"https://www.mas.gov.sg/currency/brunei-singapore-currency-interchangeability-agreement","say":{"en":"Can I pay with PayNow, or cash only?","zh":"能用 PayNow 付吗？还是只收现金？"}},"澳元":{"what":"澳大利亚的货币，纸币是彩色塑料做的，中间有一块透明的小窗。","what_en":"Australia's currency: colourful polymer notes with a clear window in the middle.","fame":"1988 年澳大利亚发行了世界上第一张塑料钞票，放进洗衣机也不会坏。这种技术后来被很多国家采用。","fame_en":"In 1988 Australia issued the world's first polymer banknote — it survives the washing machine — and many countries later adopted the technology.","fact":"2023 年澳洲储备银行决定：5 澳元上的伊丽莎白二世像不换成查尔斯国王，而是换成纪念原住民文化和历史的新图案。","fact_en":"In 2023 the Reserve Bank of Australia decided the Queen on the $5 note won't be replaced by King Charles, but by a new design honouring First Nations culture and history.","src":"Time Out Australia","url":"https://www.timeout.com/australia/news/australias-new-5-note-will-feature-a-first-nations-design-instead-of-king-charles-and-you-can-submit-theme-ideas-030524","say":{"en":"Is there a surcharge if I pay by card?","zh":"刷卡要加手续费吗？"}},"新西兰元":{"what":"新西兰的货币，纸币是塑料的，背面画着新西兰特有的鸟和风景。","what_en":"New Zealand's currency; its polymer notes show native birds and landscapes on the back.","fame":"5 元纸币上是 1953 年和夏尔巴人丹增一起第一次登上珠峰的埃德蒙·希拉里，背面是黄眼企鹅。新西兰人叫自己的钱「kiwi」，因为 1 元硬币上有几维鸟。","fame_en":"The $5 note shows Edmund Hillary, who first climbed Everest with Tenzing Norgay in 1953, with a yellow-eyed penguin on the back. New Zealanders call their dollar the 'kiwi', after the bird on the $1 coin.","fact":"希拉里从 1992 年起就印在 5 元钞上，是除了君主以外唯一一个活着的时候就上了新西兰钞票的人。","fact_en":"Hillary has been on the $5 note since 1992 — the only living person apart from monarchs ever to appear on a New Zealand banknote during their lifetime.","src":"Wikipedia · New Zealand five-dollar note","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Zealand_five-dollar_note","say":{"en":"What's the exchange rate from Aussie to Kiwi dollars today?","zh":"今天澳元换纽币是多少？"}},"雅浦石币":{"what":"密克罗尼西亚雅浦岛上的「石头钱」：中间有洞的大石轮，小的像盘子，大的比人还高。","what_en":"The stone money of Yap in Micronesia: big stone discs with a hole in the middle, from plate-sized to taller than a person.","fame":"石币太重搬不动，换了主人也放在原地，大家心里记得「这块现在是谁的」。经济学家常拿它解释：钱其实是大家共同记住的一本账。","fame_en":"The stones are too heavy to move, so they stay put when ownership changes — everyone simply remembers who owns which. Economists love it as proof that money is really a shared ledger.","fact":"雅浦岛上没有石灰岩，这些石头是人们划独木舟到 400 公里外的帕劳采好，再用木筏拖回来的；越难运回来的石头越值钱。","fact_en":"Yap has no limestone of its own: the stones were quarried in Palau, 400 km away, and towed home on rafts behind canoes — the harder the journey, the more a stone was worth.","src":"Wikipedia · Rai stones","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rai_stones","say":{"en":"Who owns this stone? Can visitors take a photo?","zh":"这块石币是谁家的？游客能拍照吗？"}},"人民币":{"what":"中国的货币，单位是元、角、分，1 元 = 10 角 = 100 分；口语里常说「块」和「毛」。","what_en":"China's currency: 1 yuan = 10 jiao = 100 fen; in speech people say 'kuai' and 'mao'.","fame":"现在大部分纸币正面是毛泽东像，背面是长城、桂林山水、布达拉宫这些风景。不过在城里，大家更常用手机扫码付钱，现金反而少见。","fame_en":"The notes show Mao Zedong on the front and scenery like the Great Wall, Guilin and the Potala Palace on the back. In cities, though, most people pay by scanning QR codes, and cash is getting rare.","fact":"2020 年 10 月深圳试点数字人民币：抽签发出 5 万个 200 元的数字红包，近 200 万人报名，最后有 47573 人领到并花掉了 876 万元。","fact_en":"In October 2020 Shenzhen piloted the digital yuan with a lottery of 50,000 red packets of 200 yuan; nearly two million people applied, and 47,573 winners spent 8.76 million yuan.","src":"Shenzhen Government Online (2020)","url":"https://www.sz.gov.cn/en_szgov/news/notices/content/post_8187721.html","say":{"en":"Can I pay with cash? I don't have WeChat Pay yet.","zh":"可以付现金吗？我还没开通微信支付。"}},"港元":{"what":"香港的货币。纸币由汇丰、渣打和中银香港三家银行发行，10 元纸币由香港政府发行。","what_en":"Hong Kong's currency. Notes are issued by three banks — HSBC, Standard Chartered and Bank of China (Hong Kong) — and the $10 note by the government.","fame":"所以同一面额有好几种图案，第一次见的人常以为拿到了假钞。在香港坐地铁、买奶茶，「八达通」卡一拍就行。","fame_en":"So the same value comes in several designs, and first-timers often think they've been handed fakes. For the MTR or a milk tea, just tap an Octopus card.","fact":"1983 年港币大跌、人心慌慌，香港在那年 10 月 17 日起把港币和美元挂钩，定在 7.8 港元换 1 美元，一直维持到今天。","fact_en":"After the Hong Kong dollar slumped amid a 1983 confidence crisis, Hong Kong pegged it to the US dollar at 7.8 from 17 October that year — a link that still holds today.","src":"Hong Kong Monetary Authority","url":"https://www.hkma.gov.hk/eng/key-functions/money/history-of-hong-kongs-exchange-rate-system/","say":{"en":"Can I top up my Octopus card here?","zh":"这里能给八达通充值吗？"}},"澳门元":{"what":"澳门的货币，俗称「澳门币」，1 澳门元 = 100 仙。","what_en":"Macau's currency, the pataca: 1 pataca = 100 avos.","fame":"澳门元和港元挂钩，在澳门港币几乎处处能用，但澳门币带回香港基本花不出去——所以找零最好要港币，或者离开前花完。","fame_en":"The pataca is pegged to the HK dollar, which is accepted almost everywhere in Macau — but patacas are hard to spend back in Hong Kong, so ask for change in HK dollars or spend them before you leave.","fact":"1906 年起，葡萄牙的大西洋银行就在发行澳门元纸币；1995 年 10 月 16 日中国银行也开始发行，现在两家各占流通量的一半左右。","fact_en":"Portugal's Banco Nacional Ultramarino has issued pataca notes since 1906; Bank of China joined on 16 October 1995, and the two now each account for about half the notes in circulation.","src":"Bank of China Macau","url":"https://www.boc.cn/mo/en/aboutus/ab4/200912/t20091210_935793.html","say":{"en":"Can I pay in Hong Kong dollars? Will you give change in patacas?","zh":"能付港币吗？找零给澳门币吗？"}},"新台币":{"what":"台湾的货币，常用的纸币是 100、500 和 1000 元，口语里说「块」。","what_en":"Taiwan's currency; the everyday notes are 100, 500 and 1,000 dollars, and people say 'kuai'.","fame":"千元纸币背面画着台湾最高的玉山和帝雉。在台湾，夜市小吃、手摇饮料很多只收现金，带点零钱很方便；搭捷运、买便利店的东西用悠游卡就行。","fame_en":"The NT$1,000 note shows Yushan, Taiwan's highest peak, and the Mikado pheasant on the back. Night-market snacks and bubble-tea shops are often cash only, so small notes help; an EasyCard covers the MRT and convenience stores.","fact":"其实还有 200 元和 2000 元纸币，可几乎没人用，连同 5 角和 20 元硬币一起，被列为「很少使用」的面额。","fact_en":"There are also NT$200 and NT$2,000 notes, but they are so rarely used that — along with the 50-cent and $20 coins — they're listed as 'rarely used' denominations.","src":"Wikipedia · New Taiwan dollar","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Taiwan_dollar","say":{"en":"Half sugar, less ice, please. Can I pay by EasyCard?","zh":"半糖少冰，可以用悠游卡付吗？"}},"贝壳钱":{"what":"三千多年前商朝人用来当钱的海贝，河南安阳的殷墟出土了大量这样的贝壳。","what_en":"The cowrie shells used as money by the Shang people over 3,000 years ago; huge numbers have been dug up at Yinxu in Anyang, Henan.","fame":"海贝来自遥远的南方海边，所以很珍贵。中国字里跟钱有关的「财、货、贵、买、贫」都带「贝」字旁，就是那时候留下来的痕迹。","fame_en":"Cowries came from distant southern seas, which made them precious. That's why Chinese characters about money — 财 wealth, 货 goods, 贵 expensive, 买 buy, 贫 poor — all contain 贝, 'shell'.","fact":"殷墟的妇好墓是唯一一座没被盗过、又能和甲骨文对上的商代王室墓，里面除了 1928 件随葬品，还有约 6800 枚海贝钱。","fact_en":"The tomb of Fu Hao at Yinxu, the only unlooted Shang royal tomb that matches oracle-bone records, held 1,928 grave goods — and about 6,800 cowrie shells.","src":"Henan Provincial Government (2023)","url":"https://english.henan.gov.cn/2023/10-30/2838629.html","say":{"en":"Is the Fu Hao tomb open to visitors? Where can I see the shells?","zh":"妇好墓能参观吗？贝壳钱在哪儿能看到？"}},"交子":{"what":"北宋时成都商人发明的纸币「交子」，被认为是世界上最早的纸币。","what_en":"Jiaozi, the paper money invented by Chengdu merchants in the Northern Song, considered the world's first paper currency.","fame":"四川当时用铁钱，又重又不值钱，做大一点的买卖要背很重的一大袋，商人就用纸票代替。纸币比欧洲早了六百多年。","fame_en":"Sichuan then used iron coins, heavy and low in value — any sizeable deal meant hauling a heavy sack — so merchants switched to paper notes, more than six centuries before Europe.","fact":"一开始交子是私人商号发的，好几家商号倒闭后，宋朝政府在 1023 年设立「交子务」把发行收归官办，1024 年发行了第一批官方交子。","fact_en":"At first jiaozi were issued by private firms; after several went bankrupt, the Song government set up a Jiaozi Bureau in 1023 to take over, issuing the first official notes in 1024.","src":"Wikipedia · Jiaozi (currency)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jiaozi_(currency)","say":{"en":"Is there a museum in Chengdu about jiaozi?","zh":"成都有讲交子的博物馆吗？"}},"鹿特丹港":{"what":"欧洲最大的港口，在荷兰鹿特丹，莱茵河和马斯河在这里流进北海。","what_en":"Europe's biggest port, in Rotterdam in the Netherlands, where the Rhine and the Maas flow into the North Sea.","fame":"你在欧洲超市里买到的很多东西——从中国来的衣服、手机，从巴西来的咖啡——都是先在这里下船，再坐驳船、火车、卡车沿着莱茵河运到德国、瑞士、整个欧洲。港区沿河伸出四十多公里，很多码头的吊车已经是自动的。","fame_en":"A lot of what you find in European shops — clothes and phones from China, coffee from Brazil — is unloaded here first, then carried by barge, train and truck up the Rhine to Germany, Switzerland and the rest of Europe. The port stretches more than 40 km along the river, and many of its cranes are already automated.","fact":"从 1962 年到 2004 年，鹿特丹一直是全世界货物吞吐量最大的港口，整整 40 多年；2004 年才被新加坡超过，后来又被上海和其他中国大港超过。现在它仍是亚洲以外最大的海港。","fact_en":"From 1962 until 2004 Rotterdam was the busiest port in the world by cargo tonnage — for over 40 years. Singapore overtook it in 2004, followed by Shanghai and other big Chinese ports; it is still the largest seaport outside Asia.","src":"Wikipedia · Port of Rotterdam","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Port_of_Rotterdam","say":{"en":"Is there a boat tour that goes round the port?","zh":"有没有绕港口一圈的游船？"}},"阿尔斯梅尔花卉拍卖":{"what":"荷兰阿尔斯梅尔的花卉拍卖市场，全世界最大的花卉拍卖，属于种花人的合作社 Royal FloraHolland。","what_en":"The flower auction in Aalsmeer, the Netherlands — the biggest flower auction in the world, run by the growers' cooperative Royal FloraHolland.","fame":"从肯尼亚、哥伦比亚、厄瓜多尔、以色列来的玫瑰和郁金香，先在这里卖掉，再连夜用卡车、飞机送到欧洲各地的花店。它用「荷兰式拍卖」：价格从高往低降，谁先按下就归谁，几秒钟就成交一批。","fame_en":"Roses and tulips from Kenya, Colombia, Ecuador and Israel are sold here first, then trucked or flown overnight to florists all over Europe. It uses the 'Dutch auction': the price starts high and drops, and the first buyer to press the button gets the lot — a deal takes seconds.","fact":"拍卖楼本身就大得吓人：占地大约 99.9 万平方米，是世界上占地面积最大的建筑之一，差不多 140 个足球场那么大，里面一排排运花的小推车像火车一样开来开去。","fact_en":"The auction building itself is huge: about 999,000 square metres, one of the largest buildings in the world by floor area — roughly 140 football pitches — with long trains of flower trolleys rolling around inside.","src":"Wikipedia · Aalsmeer Flower Auction","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aalsmeer_Flower_Auction","say":{"en":"What time do the auctions start in the morning?","zh":"早上几点开始拍卖？"}},"光刻机":{"what":"造芯片用的机器，用光把电路「印」到硅片上；最先进的 EUV 光刻机几乎都来自荷兰埃因霍温旁边费尔德霍芬的 ASML 公司。","what_en":"The machine that 'prints' circuits onto silicon wafers with light; the most advanced EUV machines come almost entirely from ASML in Veldhoven, next to Eindhoven in the Netherlands.","fame":"你手机里、电脑里最新的芯片，台积电、三星、英特尔都得用 ASML 的 EUV 机器才造得出来。全世界只有这一家能造，所以它成了各国新闻里常说的「卡脖子」设备，出口要经过荷兰政府批准。","fame_en":"The newest chips in your phone and laptop can only be made by TSMC, Samsung or Intel using ASML's EUV machines. Only this one company can build them, which is why they keep appearing in the news as a strategic bottleneck, and exports need Dutch government approval.","fact":"一台 EUV 光刻机重约 180 吨，要三架波音 747 才能运走；最畅销的型号一台约 2 亿美元。2023 年 12 月，第一台更新一代的 High-NA EUV 送到了英特尔，每台大约 3.7 亿美元。","fact_en":"One EUV machine weighs about 180 tonnes and needs three Boeing 747s to transport; the best-selling model costs up to $200 million. In December 2023 the first next-generation High-NA EUV system was shipped to Intel, at roughly $370 million each.","src":"Wikipedia · ASML Holding","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASML_Holding","say":{"en":"Is there a visitor centre where you can learn how the machines work?","zh":"有没有能了解这些机器怎么工作的参观中心？"}},"沃尔夫斯堡":{"what":"德国下萨克森州的一座城，大众汽车的总部和最大的工厂就在这里。","what_en":"A city in Lower Saxony, Germany, home to Volkswagen's headquarters and its biggest factory.","fame":"高尔夫、途观这些车都是从这里的工厂开出来的。城市本身就是为了这座工厂建的；工厂旁边的「汽车城」Autostadt 有两座玻璃塔，很多德国人专门来这里提新车，看着自己的车从塔里送下来。","fame_en":"Golfs and Tiguans roll out of the plant here. The town itself was built for the factory; next door, the Autostadt has two glass car towers, and many Germans come here to collect their new car and watch it being brought down from the tower.","fact":"大众最「畅销」的零件不是车，而是一根香肠：工厂自己做的咖喱香肠，零件编号 199 398 500 A，从 1973 年做到现在，2023 年做了 833 万根，很多年比卖出去的车还多。","fact_en":"VW's best-selling 'part' is a sausage: the currywurst made in its own factory butchery, part number 199 398 500 A. Made since 1973, it reached 8.33 million in 2023 — in many years more than the number of cars sold.","src":"Wikipedia · Volkswagen currywurst","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volkswagen_currywurst","say":{"en":"I'm here to pick up my new car — where's the customer centre?","zh":"我来提新车——客户中心在哪儿？"}},"鲁尔工业区":{"what":"德国西部埃森、多特蒙德、波鸿一带，曾是欧洲最大的煤矿和钢铁基地。","what_en":"The area around Essen, Dortmund and Bochum in western Germany, once Europe's biggest coal and steel region.","fame":"二战后德国的「经济奇迹」很大一部分靠这里的煤和钢。煤矿关了以后，旧厂房没拆，变成了博物馆、音乐厅、攀岩场和公园；埃森的关税同盟煤矿 2001 年进了世界遗产，被叫作「世界上最美的煤矿」。","fame_en":"Much of West Germany's post-war 'economic miracle' ran on coal and steel from here. When the mines closed, the old buildings were kept and turned into museums, concert halls, climbing walls and parks; Zollverein in Essen became a World Heritage Site in 2001.","fact":"2018 年 12 月 21 日，德国最后一座硬煤矿——博特罗普的 Prosper-Haniel 关门。矿工从井下带上来最后一块煤，交到总统施泰因迈尔手里，他说：这不只是一块煤，这是历史。","fact_en":"On 21 December 2018 Germany's last hard-coal mine, Prosper-Haniel in Bottrop, closed. Miners brought up the last lump of coal from underground and handed it to President Steinmeier, who said it was 'more than a piece of coal — this is history'.","src":"The Local · Germany shutters last black coal mine (2018)","url":"https://www.thelocal.de/20181221/with-final-goodbye-germany-to-shutter-last-black-coal-mine","say":{"en":"Can we go up to the top of the old coal washery?","zh":"我们能上到旧洗煤厂的顶上吗？"}},"法兰克福金融":{"what":"德国法兰克福，欧洲中央银行和法兰克福证券交易所都在这里，美因河边高楼林立，外号「美因哈顿」。","what_en":"Frankfurt, Germany — home of the European Central Bank and the Frankfurt Stock Exchange, with a cluster of towers along the Main, nicknamed 'Mainhattan'.","fame":"欧元区二十多个国家用的钱，利率由这里的欧洲央行定——它一加息，西班牙人的房贷、意大利人的存款都跟着变。德国最大的几家银行总部也在这里。","fame_en":"Interest rates for the euro, used by more than 20 countries, are set here at the ECB — when it raises rates, mortgages in Spain and savings in Italy change too. Germany's biggest banks also have their headquarters here.","fact":"欧洲央行 2015 年搬进的新总部，一半是一座 1928 年建的老菜市场：法兰克福的批发市场大厅 Großmarkthalle 被修好保留下来，现在是访客区、员工食堂和新闻发布厅，旁边才是 185 米高的玻璃双塔。","fact_en":"The ECB's new headquarters, opened in 2015, is half an old food market: Frankfurt's 1928 wholesale market hall, the Großmarkthalle, was restored and now holds the visitor area, staff canteen and press rooms, next to the new 185-metre glass towers.","src":"ECB · Official inauguration of new premises (2015)","url":"https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/pr/date/2015/html/pr150318.en.html","say":{"en":"Which station is closest to the ECB building?","zh":"离欧洲央行大楼最近的是哪个站？"}},"图卢兹航空城":{"what":"法国南部的图卢兹，空中客车总部和总装线所在地，被叫作欧洲的航空航天之都。","what_en":"Toulouse in southern France, where Airbus has its headquarters and assembly lines — Europe's aerospace capital.","fame":"你坐过的 A320、A350，很多是在这里装好、试飞，再交给航空公司的。机翼、机身在英国、德国、西班牙做好，再运到这里拼起来；城里还有法国航天局的中心和航空航天博物馆。","fame_en":"Many of the A320s and A350s you've flown on were assembled and test-flown here before delivery. Wings and fuselage sections are made in the UK, Germany and Spain, then brought here to be put together; the city also has a French space agency centre and an aerospace museum.","fact":"运这些大零件的是一架长得像白鲸的飞机：BelugaXL。2018 年 7 月 19 日它在图卢兹第一次试飞，机身上画着笑眯眯的鲸鱼眼睛和嘴，是员工投票选出来的涂装。","fact_en":"The big parts travel in a plane that looks like a beluga whale: the BelugaXL. It made its first flight in Toulouse on 19 July 2018, painted with a smiling whale face that Airbus employees voted for.","src":"Airbus · First BelugaXL completes maiden flight (2018)","url":"https://www.airbus.com/en/newsroom/press-releases/2018-07-first-belugaxl-successfully-completes-maiden-flight","say":{"en":"Do I need to book the Airbus factory tour in advance?","zh":"空客工厂参观要提前预约吗？"}},"伦敦金融城":{"what":"伦敦最老的那一小块城区，只有大约一平方英里，所以叫 the Square Mile；英格兰银行、劳合社和很多银行都在这里。","what_en":"The oldest part of London, only about one square mile — hence 'the Square Mile' — home to the Bank of England, Lloyd's and many banks.","fame":"全世界外汇交易、保险、国际贷款有很大一块在这里做。白天五十多万人来上班，到了周末街上空空的；圣保罗大教堂和「小黄瓜」大楼就挨在一起。它还有自己的「市长」：金融城的 Lord Mayor 和管整个伦敦的 Mayor of London 是两个人。","fame_en":"A huge share of the world's currency trading, insurance and international lending happens here. More than half a million people come to work on weekdays, and at weekends the streets are almost empty; St Paul's Cathedral sits right next to the 'Gherkin'. It even has its own mayor: the Lord Mayor of the City is a different person from the Mayor of London.","fact":"这里选举不只居民能投票，公司按员工人数也能登记选民。2013 年 3 月登记的「公司票」有 12,479 张，居民票只有 6,504 张——公司的声音比住在这里的人还大。","fact_en":"In City elections it isn't only residents who vote — businesses register voters too, based on their staff. In March 2013 there were 12,479 business votes and just 6,504 residential votes registered: businesses outvote the people who live there.","src":"Wikipedia · City of London Corporation elections","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/City_of_London_Corporation_elections","say":{"en":"Are there any good places for lunch near Bank station?","zh":"Bank 站附近有好吃的午饭地方吗？"}},"北海油气":{"what":"挪威外海北海里的石油和天然气田，靠一座座海上钻井平台开采。","what_en":"The oil and gas fields in the North Sea off Norway, worked from offshore platforms.","fame":"1969 年发现大油田以前，挪威是靠打鱼和航运的普通国家；后来油气让它成了世界上最富的国家之一。挪威人没有把钱花光，而是存进一个全民的基金，买全世界的股票。","fame_en":"Before the big oil discovery in 1969, Norway was a modest country of fishing and shipping; oil and gas made it one of the richest countries in the world. Instead of spending it all, Norway put the money into a fund for everyone that invests in shares around the world.","fact":"这个石油基金（全球政府养老基金）在 2017 年 9 月 19 日第一次超过 1 万亿美元，平均下来每个挪威人约有 19 万美元。它只能每年花掉一小部分，其余留给以后的挪威人。","fact_en":"This oil fund (the Government Pension Fund Global) passed $1 trillion for the first time on 19 September 2017 — roughly $190,000 for every Norwegian. Only a small slice can be spent each year; the rest is kept for future generations.","src":"The Barents Observer · Norway's oil fund reaches $1 trillion (2017)","url":"https://thebarentsobserver.com/en/life-and-public/2017/09/norways-oil-fund-reaches-1-trillion","say":{"en":"How long is each shift on the platform?","zh":"在平台上一班要上多久？"}},"巴塞尔制药":{"what":"瑞士的小城巴塞尔，罗氏和诺华两家世界级药厂的总部都在这里。","what_en":"Basel, a small Swiss city that is home to two of the world's biggest drug companies, Roche and Novartis.","fame":"你在药店买过的不少药、医院里用的抗癌药和检测试剂，背后都有这两家。城市不到二十万人，却是全世界生命科学最集中的地方之一；莱茵河边罗氏的两座白色高楼是瑞士最高的建筑。","fame_en":"Many medicines you've bought at a pharmacy, plus cancer drugs and hospital tests, come from these two companies. The city has fewer than 200,000 people but is one of the world's densest life-science hubs; Roche's two white towers by the Rhine are the tallest buildings in Switzerland.","fact":"LSD 就是在巴塞尔的药厂里被意外发现的：1938 年山德士（后来并入诺华）的化学家阿尔伯特·霍夫曼本想做一种呼吸循环兴奋剂；1943 年 4 月 19 日他亲自试药后骑车回家——战时巴塞尔不让开车——这一天后来被叫作「自行车日」。","fact_en":"LSD was discovered by accident in a Basel drug lab: in 1938 Sandoz chemist Albert Hofmann (Sandoz later became part of Novartis) was looking for a circulatory stimulant. On 19 April 1943 he tested it on himself and rode home by bicycle — cars were restricted in wartime Basel — a day now called 'Bicycle Day'.","src":"Wikipedia · Albert Hofmann","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albert_Hofmann","say":{"en":"Is the Novartis Campus open to visitors?","zh":"诺华园区可以参观吗？"}},"都柏林科技":{"what":"爱尔兰都柏林大运河码头一带，谷歌、Meta、领英、TikTok 等很多科技公司的欧洲总部挤在这里，外号「硅码头」Silicon Docks。","what_en":"The Grand Canal Dock area of Dublin, Ireland, where Google, Meta, LinkedIn, TikTok and many other tech firms have their European headquarters — nicknamed 'Silicon Docks'.","fame":"你在欧洲用谷歌、Facebook、Instagram，合同上的公司常常是「爱尔兰有限公司」。吸引它们的是英语环境、欧盟成员身份和低公司税（多年来 12.5%）；欧盟的隐私罚款也多半由爱尔兰的数据保护机构来开。","fame_en":"If you use Google, Facebook or Instagram in Europe, your contract is often with an Irish company. They came for the English-speaking workforce, EU membership and a low corporate tax rate (12.5% for many years); that's also why many EU privacy fines are issued by Ireland's data regulator.","fact":"2015 年爱尔兰的 GDP 一下子「增长」了 26.3%，因为苹果等跨国公司把知识产权搬到了爱尔兰的子公司——老百姓的工资和消费并没有涨那么多。经济学家克鲁格曼笑称这是「小矮妖经济学」（leprechaun economics）。","fact_en":"In 2015 Ireland's GDP 'grew' by 26.3%, because Apple and other multinationals moved intellectual property into Irish subsidiaries — ordinary wages and spending didn't rise anywhere near that much. Economist Paul Krugman called it 'leprechaun economics'.","src":"Wikipedia · Leprechaun economics","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leprechaun_economics","say":{"en":"Is the Grand Canal Dock area far from Trinity College?","zh":"大运河码头那边离圣三一学院远吗？"}},"哈恩橄榄油":{"what":"西班牙安达卢西亚的哈恩省，满山满谷都是橄榄树，是西班牙橄榄油最大的产地。","what_en":"The province of Jaén in Andalusia, Spain, covered in olive trees from hill to hill — Spain's biggest olive-oil region.","fame":"西班牙是世界第一的橄榄油生产国，而哈恩一个省就占了西班牙差不多一半。开车穿过去，几个小时窗外都是一排排整齐的橄榄树，被叫作「橄榄树的海」。冬天收橄榄的季节，镇上的榨油坊会开到半夜。","fame_en":"Spain is the world's top olive-oil producer, and Jaén alone makes close to half of Spain's oil. Drive through and for hours you see nothing but neat rows of olive trees — a 'sea of olives'. In the winter harvest, village mills run late into the night.","fact":"哈恩省大约有 6600 万棵橄榄树，种在 55 万公顷地上；全世界的橄榄油，大约每五瓶就有一瓶来自这一个省。","fact_en":"Jaén province has around 66 million olive trees on about 550,000 hectares; roughly one in every five bottles of the world's olive oil comes from this single province.","src":"Wikipedia · Province of Jaén (Spain)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Province_of_Ja%C3%A9n_(Spain)","say":{"en":"Can we taste the new oil from this year's harvest?","zh":"能尝一下今年新榨的油吗？"}},"安特卫普钻石":{"what":"比利时安特卫普火车站旁边的钻石区，几条街上全是钻石交易所、切割工坊和珠宝店。","what_en":"The diamond district next to Antwerp's central station in Belgium — a few streets packed with diamond exchanges, cutting workshops and jewellers.","fame":"世界上大部分没切过的毛坯钻石，都要经过安特卫普买卖、分级。这里几百年来就是钻石切割的中心；很多交易靠握手和一句 mazal（祝好运）成交，几百万的生意不签合同。","fame_en":"Most of the world's rough diamonds pass through Antwerp to be traded and graded. It has been a diamond-cutting centre for centuries; many deals are still sealed with a handshake and the word 'mazal' (good luck), with millions changing hands without a contract.","fact":"2003 年 2 月，这里发生了「世纪大盗案」：一个假扮宝石商、在钻石中心租了办公室的意大利人 Notarbartolo 带人打开了地下金库，偷走价值至少 1 亿美元的钻石。他被判 10 年，可那批钻石到现在都没找回来。","fact_en":"In February 2003 came the 'heist of the century': Leonardo Notarbartolo, an Italian who had posed as a gem dealer and rented an office in the Antwerp Diamond Centre, led a team into its underground vault and stole diamonds worth at least $100 million. He got ten years, but the stones have never been found.","src":"Guinness World Records · Largest diamond heist","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/112164-largest-diamond-heist","say":{"en":"Could you show me the certificate for this stone?","zh":"能给我看一下这颗钻石的证书吗？"}},"葡萄牙软木":{"what":"葡萄牙南部阿连特茹的栓皮栎树林，树皮剥下来就是软木，做酒瓶塞、地板、鞋垫。","what_en":"The cork-oak forests of the Alentejo in southern Portugal; the bark, once stripped, becomes cork for wine stoppers, floors and shoe soles.","fame":"世界上一半以上的软木来自葡萄牙。剥树皮不会砍树，树皮过几年会自己长回来，所以一棵树能剥两百年；葡萄牙法律保护栓皮栎，没有许可连一棵都不能砍。","fame_en":"More than half the world's cork comes from Portugal. Stripping the bark doesn't kill the tree — it grows back — so one tree can be harvested for 200 years; Portuguese law protects cork oaks, and you need permission to cut down even one.","fact":"一棵栓皮栎要每 9 年才能剥一次。剥完以后，工人会在树干上用白漆写一个数字——剥皮那一年的最后一位数，比如写着 8 的树，下一次就要等到 2027 年。","fact_en":"A cork oak can only be stripped every nine years. Afterwards workers paint a single white number on the trunk — the last digit of the harvest year — so a tree marked 8 won't be stripped again until 2027.","src":"Wine Anorak · The cork harvest in Portugal","url":"https://www.wineanorak.com/wineblog/?p=21035","say":{"en":"Is this bag really made of cork?","zh":"这个包真的是软木做的吗？"}},"施华洛世奇水晶":{"what":"奥地利蒂罗尔瓦滕斯小镇的施华洛世奇，做人造水晶首饰、摆件和镶在衣服上的水晶钻。","what_en":"Swarovski, from the small town of Wattens in Tyrol, Austria, making cut-crystal jewellery, figurines and crystals for clothes.","fame":"1895 年波希米亚来的丹尼尔·施华洛世奇在这个山谷里开厂，用自己发明的切割机磨出闪闪的玻璃水晶。现在从机场免税店的天鹅项链，到舞台服装、芭蕾舞裙上的亮片，很多都是它家的水晶。","fame_en":"In 1895 Daniel Swarovski, who came from Bohemia, set up a factory in this valley, using a cutting machine he had invented to make sparkling crystal glass. Today its crystals are everywhere from airport swan necklaces to stage costumes and ballet tutus.","fact":"1995 年公司 100 岁时，请奥地利艺术家安德烈·海勒在工厂旁边建了「施华洛世奇水晶世界」：入口是一个嘴里吐水的绿色草皮巨人头，里面是一间间「奇幻屋」。2011 年它有 68 万游客，是奥地利排第八的旅游景点。","fact_en":"For the company's 100th birthday in 1995, Austrian artist André Heller built Swarovski Crystal Worlds next to the factory: you enter through a grass-covered Giant's head spouting water into a series of 'Chambers of Wonder'. In 2011 it drew 680,000 visitors, ranking eighth among Austria's tourist attractions.","src":"Wikipedia · Swarovski Kristallwelten","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swarovski_Kristallwelten","say":{"en":"Is there a shuttle bus from Innsbruck to Crystal Worlds?","zh":"从因斯布鲁克有去水晶世界的班车吗？"}},"波希米亚玻璃":{"what":"捷克北部亚布洛内茨一带的玻璃和人造首饰：玻璃珠、仿宝石、水晶吊灯。","what_en":"Glass and costume jewellery from around Jablonec in northern Czechia: glass beads, imitation gems and crystal chandeliers.","fame":"波希米亚玻璃几百年来以透亮、刻花漂亮闻名。亚布洛内茨的作坊做的玻璃珠、纽扣、手镯卖到世界各地；19 世纪这座小城被叫作世界人造首饰的中心，现在还有玻璃珠和首饰博物馆。","fame_en":"Bohemian glass has been famous for centuries for its clarity and fine cutting. Jablonec workshops sent beads, buttons and bangles all over the world; in the 19th century the town was called the world centre of costume jewellery, and it still has a museum of glass and jewellery.","fact":"今天的捷克水晶大厂 Preciosa 是「合」出来的：1945 年亚布洛内茨附近 7 家主要的水晶厂和 18 家小厂被合并，1948 年 4 月 10 日正式成立 Preciosa。现在它做的水晶吊灯挂在世界各地的剧院和酒店里。","fact_en":"Today's big Czech crystal maker Preciosa was born from a merger: in 1945 the seven main crystal factories and 18 small firms around Jablonec were combined, and Preciosa was officially founded on 10 April 1948. Its chandeliers now hang in theatres and hotels around the world.","src":"Wikipedia · Preciosa (corporation)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Preciosa_(corporation)","say":{"en":"Are these beads handmade here in Jablonec?","zh":"这些珠子是在亚布洛内茨这里手工做的吗？"}},"格但斯克琥珀":{"what":"波兰波罗的海边的格但斯克，自称「世界琥珀之都」；琥珀是几千万年前的松树树脂变成的化石。","what_en":"Gdańsk on Poland's Baltic coast calls itself the 'world capital of amber' — fossilised tree resin tens of millions of years old.","fame":"波罗的海的琥珀被冲上海滩，格但斯克的工匠从中世纪起就在这里雕琥珀。老城的玛丽亚街整条都是琥珀店，还有琥珀博物馆；有的琥珀里能看到几千万年前被粘住的小虫子。","fame_en":"Baltic amber washes up on the beaches, and Gdańsk craftsmen have carved it since the Middle Ages. Mariacka Street in the old town is lined with amber shops, and there's an amber museum; some pieces still hold insects trapped tens of millions of years ago.","fact":"俄罗斯著名的「琥珀屋」就有格但斯克（当时叫但泽）工匠的手艺：18 世纪初普鲁士请了丹麦宫廷工匠沃尔夫拉姆，和但泽的琥珀师傅 Schacht、Turau 一起做。二战时琥珀屋被纳粹拆走，从此下落不明；1979 年开始复制，2003 年才在叶卡捷琳娜宫重新装好。","fact_en":"Russia's famous Amber Room carries Gdańsk (then Danzig) craftsmanship: in the early 1700s Prussia had it made by the Danish court craftsman Gottfried Wolfram with Danzig amber masters Ernst Schacht and Gottfried Turau. The Nazis took the panels in WWII and they were never seen again; a replica begun in 1979 was finally installed in the Catherine Palace in 2003.","src":"Wikipedia · Amber Room","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amber_Room","say":{"en":"How can I tell if this amber is real?","zh":"怎么看这块琥珀是不是真的？"}},"希腊船队":{"what":"希腊船东的商船队——油轮、散货船、集装箱船，很多以雅典旁边的比雷埃夫斯港为家。","what_en":"The merchant fleet of Greek shipowners — tankers, bulk carriers and container ships, many based around Piraeus next to Athens.","fame":"希腊人口才一千万左右，船东却掌握着世界上最大的商船队之一。你加的油、做面包的小麦、电厂烧的煤，很可能有一段路是坐希腊人的船。航运家族和船员的故事，是希腊人日常聊天的一部分。","fame_en":"Greece has only about ten million people, yet its shipowners control one of the largest merchant fleets in the world. The fuel in your car, the wheat in your bread and the coal in power stations may well travel part of the way on a Greek-owned ship.","fact":"比雷埃夫斯港本身现在由中国公司管：2016 年 8 月，中远海运花 2.8 亿欧元买下比雷埃夫斯港务局 51% 的股份，2021 年又增加 16%。它成了中国「一带一路」进入欧洲的一个大门。","fact_en":"Piraeus port itself is now run by a Chinese company: in August 2016 COSCO Shipping bought 51% of the Piraeus Port Authority for €280 million, adding another 16% in 2021. It has become a major gateway into Europe for China's Belt and Road.","src":"To Vima · Cosco acquires 51% of the Piraeus Port Authority (2016)","url":"https://www.tovima.gr/2016/08/10/international/cosco-acquires-51-shares-of-the-piraeus-port-authority/","say":{"en":"Which gate does the ferry to Aegina leave from?","zh":"去埃伊纳岛的渡轮从哪个口出发？"}},"冰岛地热电站":{"what":"冰岛雷克雅未克东边的亨吉德火山一带，有冰岛最大的地热电站 Hellisheiði，用地下热水和蒸汽发电、给首都供暖。","what_en":"The Hengill volcanic area east of Reykjavík, home to Hellisheiði, Iceland's largest geothermal power plant, making electricity and heating the capital with underground hot water and steam.","fame":"冰岛差不多所有电都来自地热和水电，九成左右的家用地热水取暖；冬天人行道下面铺着热水管，雪自己就化了。露天温泉、热水泳池是冰岛人每天社交的地方。","fame_en":"Nearly all of Iceland's electricity comes from geothermal and hydropower, and about nine in ten homes are heated with geothermal water; some pavements have hot pipes underneath so the snow melts by itself. Outdoor hot pools are where Icelanders socialise every day.","fact":"2021 年 9 月，瑞士公司 Climeworks 在这座电站旁边开了直接空气碳捕集厂 Orca：用地热电把空气里的二氧化碳吸出来，存到冰岛的玄武岩里，让它慢慢变成石头，设计能力每年 4000 吨。","fact_en":"In September 2021 the Swiss firm Climeworks opened Orca next to this plant, a direct-air-capture facility that uses geothermal power to pull CO2 out of the air and store it in Iceland's basalt, where it mineralises into rock; it is designed for up to 4,000 tonnes a year.","src":"Wikipedia · Climeworks","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Climeworks","say":{"en":"Does the geothermal exhibition have guided tours in English?","zh":"地热展览馆有英语讲解吗？"}},"休斯敦能源":{"what":"美国得克萨斯州的休斯敦，石油天然气公司的大本营，号称「世界能源之都」；NASA 的约翰逊航天中心也在这里。","what_en":"Houston, Texas — base of the oil and gas industry, the self-styled 'Energy Capital of the World', and home to NASA's Johnson Space Center.","fame":"美国很多大能源公司的总部或大办公室在这里，墨西哥湾沿岸一排排炼油厂、化工厂让美国成了石油出口大国。宇航员在太空里说 Houston, we have a problem，喊的就是这里的任务控制中心。","fame_en":"Many big US energy companies have headquarters or major offices here, and the refineries and chemical plants along the Gulf Coast helped make the US a major oil exporter. When astronauts say 'Houston, we have a problem', they're calling Mission Control here.","fact":"很多人以为人类在月球上说的第一个词是 Houston——阿姆斯特朗那句「休斯敦，这里是静海基地，鹰已着陆」。其实在这之前，奥尔德林先说了 contact light（触地灯亮），阿姆斯特朗接着说 shutdown（关发动机）；美国事实核查网站 PolitiFact 专门辟过这个谣。","fact_en":"Many people think 'Houston' was the first word spoken on the Moon — from Armstrong's 'Houston, Tranquility Base here. The Eagle has landed.' In fact Aldrin said 'contact light' first, then Armstrong said 'shutdown'; PolitiFact has debunked the myth.","src":"PolitiFact · Rick Perry says first word spoken on the moon was \"Houston\"","url":"https://www.politifact.com/factchecks/2011/jan/22/rick-perry/rick-perry-says-first-word-spoken-moon-was-houston/","say":{"en":"How long does it take to get to Space Center Houston from downtown?","zh":"从市中心到休斯敦航天中心要多久？"}},"波音工厂":{"what":"美国华盛顿州埃弗里特的波音工厂，宽体客机在这里组装。","what_en":"Boeing's factory in Everett, Washington, where its wide-body jets are assembled.","fame":"它是按体积算世界上最大的建筑之一，1967 年专门为造 747 盖的，里面大到能同时装好几架大飞机。777、767 都从这里出厂；工厂旁边有对游客开放的参观行程。","fame_en":"By volume it is one of the largest buildings in the world, built in 1967 specially for the 747 and big enough to hold several jumbo jets at once. 777s and 767s roll out of here too, and there's a public tour next door.","fact":"2023 年 1 月 31 日，最后一架波音 747 在这里交给了货运公司 Atlas Air。「空中女王」1970 年投入使用，一共造了 1574 架，从此停产。","fact_en":"On 31 January 2023 the very last Boeing 747 was handed over here to cargo airline Atlas Air. The 'Queen of the Skies', in service since 1970, ended production after 1,574 were built.","src":"AVweb · Last Boeing 747 delivered (2023)","url":"https://avweb.com/aviation-news/last-boeing-747-delivered","say":{"en":"How long is the factory tour, and can I take photos inside?","zh":"工厂参观多长时间？里面能拍照吗？"}},"艾伯塔油砂":{"what":"加拿大艾伯塔省北部阿萨巴斯卡一带的油砂：沙子里裹着又黏又稠的沥青，加工后变成石油。","what_en":"The oil sands around Athabasca in northern Alberta, Canada: sand soaked in thick, sticky bitumen that is processed into oil.","fame":"加拿大的石油储量排在世界前几位，绝大部分就在油砂里，也让加拿大成了美国最大的石油供应国。开采要挖露天大矿或往地下注蒸汽，耗能大，所以也是环保争议最多的地方之一。","fame_en":"Canada has some of the largest oil reserves in the world, mostly in these sands, and it is the biggest supplier of oil to the US. Getting it out means huge open-pit mines or injecting steam underground, which uses a lot of energy and makes it one of the most debated places on climate.","fact":"2024 年 5 月，扩建的 Trans Mountain 输油管开始运行，把艾伯塔的油送到太平洋边的温哥华，运量从每天 30 万桶涨到约 89 万桶，可以装船卖到亚洲。工程最后花了 340 亿加元，是最初预算的六倍多。","fact_en":"In May 2024 the expanded Trans Mountain pipeline started running, carrying Alberta oil to the Pacific near Vancouver and lifting capacity from 300,000 to about 890,000 barrels a day, so it can be shipped to Asia. It ended up costing C$34 billion — more than six times the original estimate.","src":"gCaptain · Trans Mountain expansion starts commercial operations (2024)","url":"https://gcaptain.com/trudeaus-25-billion-trans-mountain-expansion-starts-commercial-operations/","say":{"en":"Is it a fly-in, fly-out job, or do you live in Fort McMurray?","zh":"是飞进飞出轮班的工作，还是住在麦克默里堡？"}},"加拿大木材":{"what":"加拿大不列颠哥伦比亚省的大森林和锯木厂，出产盖房子用的软木木材。","what_en":"The great forests and sawmills of British Columbia, Canada, producing softwood lumber for building houses.","fame":"北美很多木头房子的龙骨、地板来自这里的云杉、松树和冷杉；加拿大是世界上最大的木材出口国之一，BC 省是其中最大的一块，小镇的日子常常跟着锯木厂走。","fame_en":"The frames and floors of many North American wooden houses come from spruce, pine and fir grown here; Canada is one of the world's biggest lumber exporters, BC the largest part of it, and small towns often rise and fall with their sawmill.","fact":"美加两国为木材吵架已经吵了四十多年：1982 年美国木材商第一次说加拿大政府给伐木的收费太低、等于补贴，从那以后大的回合已经打了四次；2006 年签的《软木木材协议》管了七到九年，到期后又吵了起来，到现在还没完。","fact_en":"The US and Canada have been fighting over lumber for over 40 years: in 1982 US producers first argued that Canada's low timber fees amounted to a subsidy, and there have been four major rounds since. The 2006 Softwood Lumber Agreement held for seven to nine years; after it expired the fight resumed and still isn't over.","src":"Wikipedia · Canada–United States softwood lumber dispute","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canada%E2%80%93United_States_softwood_lumber_dispute","say":{"en":"Is this wood from a certified sustainable forest?","zh":"这木头来自有认证的可持续森林吗？"}},"蒙特雷制造":{"what":"墨西哥北部新莱昂州的蒙特雷，离美国边境两三个小时车程的工业大城。","what_en":"Monterrey in Nuevo León, northern Mexico — a big industrial city a couple of hours' drive from the US border.","fame":"墨西哥的钢铁、水泥、啤酒大公司很多起家在这里；现在汽车零件、家电、电脑服务器在这里造好，用卡车直接开进美国。公司把工厂从亚洲搬近美国的「近岸外包」，蒙特雷是最热的地方之一。","fame_en":"Many of Mexico's big steel, cement and beer companies started here; today car parts, appliances and servers made here go straight into the US by truck. As companies move factories from Asia closer to the US — 'nearshoring' — Monterrey is one of the hottest spots.","fact":"城中心的 Fundidora 公园原来是一座钢厂：1900 年成立的蒙特雷钢铁厂，1986 年倒闭时还有约 7000 名工人。厂房没拆，2001 年变成公园，3 号高炉成了钢铁博物馆 Horno3。","fact_en":"Fundidora Park in the city centre used to be a steelworks: the Monterrey Foundry, founded in 1900, still had about 7,000 workers when it closed in 1986. The plant was kept and opened as a park in 2001; Blast Furnace No. 3 is now the Horno3 steel museum.","src":"Wikipedia · Fundidora Park","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fundidora_Park","say":{"en":"Which industrial park is your plant in?","zh":"你们的工厂在哪个工业园？"}},"巴西大豆":{"what":"巴西中西部马托格罗索州一望无际的大豆田，巴西是世界上最大的大豆生产和出口国。","what_en":"The endless soybean fields of Mato Grosso in central-western Brazil — Brazil is the world's biggest soybean producer and exporter.","fame":"中国人吃的豆油、喂猪喂鸡的豆粕，很多来自巴西的大豆。马托格罗索几十年前还是草原和森林，现在一个州的大豆产量比很多国家还多；收获季节，卡车排着长队开往港口。","fame_en":"Much of the soybean oil in Chinese kitchens and the soy meal fed to pigs and chickens comes from Brazilian beans. A few decades ago Mato Grosso was savanna and forest; now this one state grows more soy than most countries, and at harvest trucks queue all the way to the ports.","fact":"普渡大学的统计：2024 年巴西收的大豆差不多一半（48%）卖到了中国，美国只有 23%。2025 年 6 到 8 月，美国对中国的大豆出口几乎是零；那年 8 月中国进口大豆创了纪录，却没有一船来自美国。","fact_en":"Purdue University figures show that in 2024 almost half (48%) of Brazil's soybean crop went to China, against 23% of the US crop. In June–August 2025 US soybean shipments to China were effectively zero; that August China imported a record amount, with not one shipment from the US.","src":"Purdue University · U.S. soybean harvest and Brazil export record (2025)","url":"https://ag.purdue.edu/commercialag/home/resource/2025/09/u-s-soybean-harvest-starts-with-no-sign-of-chinese-buying-as-brazil-sets-export-record/","say":{"en":"When does the soybean harvest start here?","zh":"这里大豆什么时候开始收？"}},"卡拉雅斯铁矿":{"what":"巴西北部帕拉州亚马孙森林边上的卡拉雅斯铁矿，属于巴西矿业公司淡水河谷（Vale），是世界最大的铁矿之一。","what_en":"The Carajás iron mine in Pará, northern Brazil, on the edge of the Amazon — run by Vale and one of the largest iron mines in the world.","fame":"这里的铁矿石含铁量特别高，运到中国、欧洲炼成钢，再变成汽车、桥梁、你家的锅。矿石从矿山坐专门的铁路运到大西洋边的圣路易斯港装船。","fame_en":"The ore here is unusually rich in iron; shipped to China and Europe it becomes steel for cars, bridges and your cooking pots. It travels by a dedicated railway to the port of São Luís on the Atlantic.","fact":"运矿的火车一列有 330 节车厢，长约 3 公里，是世界上最长的常规列车之一；卡拉雅斯铁路全长约 890 公里。","fact_en":"The ore trains have 330 wagons and run about 3 km long — among the longest regular trains in the world — on the roughly 890 km Carajás Railway.","src":"Wikipedia · Longest trains","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Longest_trains","say":{"en":"How many wagons does one train pull?","zh":"一列火车拉多少节车厢？"}},"巴西甘蔗乙醇":{"what":"巴西圣保罗州的甘蔗田和酒精厂，用甘蔗发酵做成乙醇，直接给汽车当燃料。","what_en":"The sugarcane fields and distilleries of São Paulo state, Brazil, where cane is fermented into ethanol and used directly as car fuel.","fame":"在巴西加油站，你会看到两个价格：gasolina（汽油）和 etanol（乙醇）。大部分新车都是「双燃料」的，两种随便加，司机算一下哪个划算就加哪个。这是 1970 年代石油危机后巴西政府推的「国家酒精计划」留下来的。","fame_en":"At a Brazilian petrol station you see two prices: gasolina and etanol. Most new cars are 'flex', taking either in any mix, so drivers just work out which is cheaper. It's a legacy of the national alcohol programme Brazil launched after the 1970s oil crisis.","fact":"第一辆双燃料车是 2003 年 3 月 24 日上市的大众 Gol 1.6 Total Flex；才过了一年，巴西所有车厂都推出了这种车。到 2018 年 3 月，巴西已经登记了 3050 万辆双燃料小汽车和轻型卡车。","fact_en":"The first flex-fuel car was the Volkswagen Gol 1.6 Total Flex, launched on 24 March 2003; within a year every carmaker in Brazil offered one. By March 2018 Brazil had 30.5 million flex-fuel cars and light trucks registered.","src":"Wikipedia · Flexible-fuel vehicles in Brazil","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flexible-fuel_vehicles_in_Brazil","say":{"en":"Fill it up with ethanol, please.","zh":"请加满乙醇。"}},"锂三角":{"what":"智利、阿根廷、玻利维亚交界的高原盐湖区，盐水下面藏着全世界一大半的锂；智利的阿塔卡马盐湖是其中产量最大的。","what_en":"The high salt flats where Chile, Argentina and Bolivia meet, holding a large share of the world's lithium in their brines; Chile's Salar de Atacama is the biggest producer.","fame":"你手机、电动车里的锂电池，锂很可能来自这里。人们把盐湖下的卤水抽到一片片蓝绿色的晒池里，靠沙漠的太阳把水晒干，剩下锂。缺水的沙漠里抽卤水，也让当地原住民社区很担心。","fame_en":"The lithium in your phone and electric-car battery may well come from here. Brine is pumped from under the salt into turquoise evaporation ponds, and the desert sun dries out the water, leaving lithium behind. Pumping brine in such a dry place worries local Indigenous communities.","fact":"2024 年智利国营铜业公司 Codelco 和锂业公司 SQM 签了合同：从 2025 年起成立一家新公司经营阿塔卡马盐湖，由 Codelco 控股，一直到 2060 年，2031 年起由 Codelco 负责管理——这是智利总统博里奇要加强国家对锂控制的一步。","fact_en":"In 2024 Chile's state copper company Codelco and lithium producer SQM signed a deal to run the Salar de Atacama through a new joint company from 2025 to 2060, with Codelco holding the majority and running management from 2031 — part of President Boric's push for more state control over lithium.","src":"MINING.COM · Codelco and SQM agree on final lithium deal (2024)","url":"https://www.mining.com/codelco-and-sqm-agree-on-final-lithium-deal/","say":{"en":"Can we see the evaporation ponds from the road?","zh":"从路上能看到那些晒池吗？"}},"哥伦比亚鲜花":{"what":"哥伦比亚首都波哥大周围高原上的鲜花温室，种玫瑰、康乃馨，主要卖到美国。","what_en":"The flower greenhouses on the high plain around Bogotá, Colombia, growing roses and carnations mostly for the US.","fame":"哥伦比亚是世界第二大鲜花出口国，仅次于荷兰。美国情人节、母亲节的花束很多来自这里：花在早上剪下，当天晚上就坐货机飞到迈阿密。","fame_en":"Colombia is the world's second-largest flower exporter after the Netherlands. Many US Valentine's and Mother's Day bouquets come from here: cut in the morning, they're on a cargo plane to Miami that night.","fact":"这一行是从一份学生作业开始的：1967 年美国科罗拉多州立大学的园艺研究生 David Cheever 写了一篇课程论文，说波哥大气候四季像春天、离迈阿密只有三小时航程，最适合种花出口。后来他真的去波哥大开了花场 Floramérica。","fact_en":"The industry began with a student paper: in 1967 David Cheever, a horticulture grad student at Colorado State University, wrote a term paper arguing that Bogotá — spring-like all year and three hours' flight from Miami — was perfect for growing export flowers. He then went and founded the farm Floramérica there.","src":"Smithsonian Magazine · The Secrets Behind Your Flowers","url":"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/travel/the-secrets-behind-your-flowers-53128/","say":{"en":"Are these roses from Colombia? How long do they last?","zh":"这些玫瑰是哥伦比亚的吗？能放多久？"}},"奥里诺科石油带":{"what":"委内瑞拉奥里诺科河北岸的一大片地下石油带，里面是又重又稠的超重原油。","what_en":"A huge belt of underground oil along the north bank of the Orinoco River in Venezuela, full of extra-heavy crude.","fame":"因为这片油带，委内瑞拉宣布的探明石油储量是世界第一。但超重油很难开采和提炼，要掺稀释剂才能运走，再加上管理和制裁的问题，委内瑞拉的产量远远赶不上储量。","fame_en":"Because of this belt, Venezuela claims the largest proven oil reserves in the world. But extra-heavy oil is hard to extract and refine and must be mixed with diluents to move, and with mismanagement and sanctions, production lags far behind the reserves.","fact":"按官方数字，委内瑞拉 2023 年的探明储量约 3030 亿桶，是美国的五倍多；可它从石油出口里挣的钱，跟沙特、美国比起来少得多。","fact_en":"Officially, Venezuela's proven reserves were about 303 billion barrels in 2023 — more than five times those of the US — yet it earns far less from oil exports than Saudi Arabia or the United States.","src":"Al Jazeera · Venezuela has the world's most oil: why doesn't it earn more? (2025)","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2025/9/4/venezuela-has-the-worlds-most-oil-why-doesnt-it-earn-more-from-exports","say":{"en":"Why is petrol so cheap here?","zh":"这里的汽油为什么这么便宜？"}},"古巴蔗糖":{"what":"古巴的甘蔗田和糖厂，古巴曾经是世界上最大的蔗糖出口国之一。","what_en":"Cuba's sugarcane fields and mills — Cuba was once one of the world's biggest sugar exporters.","fame":"几百年里，糖是古巴最重要的产业：殖民时代的甘蔗种植园、后来卖给苏联的糖、朗姆酒和小镇上冒烟的糖厂，都是古巴历史的一部分。","fame_en":"For centuries sugar was Cuba's most important industry: colonial plantations, sugar sold to the Soviet Union, rum, and the smoking mill in every small town are all part of Cuban history.","fact":"这个「世界糖罐」现在快空了：1980 年代古巴一年能产 700 多万吨糖，2022 年只有约 48 万吨；2023 年半岛电视台报道，古巴正走向一百多年来最差的一季收成，甚至要进口糖。","fact_en":"The 'world's sugar bowl' is nearly empty: in the 1980s Cuba made over 7 million tonnes of sugar a year, but only about 480,000 in 2022; in 2023 Al Jazeera reported Cuba was heading for its worst harvest in more than a century, and even importing sugar.","src":"Al Jazeera · How Cuba's sugar industry has been ground into dust (2023)","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2023/5/12/how-cubas-sugar-industry-has-been-ground-into-dust","say":{"en":"Can I try a glass of fresh guarapo?","zh":"能来一杯鲜榨甘蔗汁（guarapo）吗？"}},"牙买加铝土矿":{"what":"牙买加中部曼彻斯特、圣安一带红色的铝土矿，是炼氧化铝和铝的原料。","what_en":"The red bauxite of Manchester and St Ann in central Jamaica, the raw material for alumina and aluminium.","fame":"你喝饮料的铝罐、窗框、飞机的铝，最早都是这种红土。牙买加的山坡上能看到被挖开的红色土地和氧化铝厂，铝土矿和旅游、侨汇一起，是这个岛国最重要的收入之一。","fame_en":"The aluminium in your drink can, window frames and planes started as red earth like this. On Jamaica's hillsides you can see red open pits and alumina plants; bauxite, along with tourism and money sent home, is one of the island's key sources of income.","fact":"牙买加 1952 年运出第一船铝土矿；才过了五年，1957 年就成了世界最大的铝土矿生产国，一年产大约 500 万吨。","fact_en":"Jamaica shipped its first bauxite in 1952; just five years later, in 1957, it was the world's leading bauxite producer, at around five million tonnes a year.","src":"The Gleaner · The rise and evolution of the bauxite industry (2024)","url":"https://jamaica-gleaner.com/article/art-leisure/20241103/rise-and-evolution-bauxite-industry","say":{"en":"Why is the soil here so red?","zh":"这里的土为什么这么红？"}},"科隆自由贸易区":{"what":"巴拿马运河大西洋口的科隆自由贸易区，一大片免税的仓库和批发店。","what_en":"The Colón Free Trade Zone at the Atlantic end of the Panama Canal — a big area of duty-free warehouses and wholesalers.","fame":"从中国、日本、美国来的手机、衣服、家电、香水，在这里免税存放、拆包、再分装，卖给整个拉丁美洲的批发商。很多拉美小店里的货，就是老板飞到科隆来挑的。","fame_en":"Phones, clothes, appliances and perfume from China, Japan and the US are stored here duty-free, repacked and sold on to wholesalers across Latin America. Many small shops in the region stock goods their owners flew to Colón to pick.","fact":"它是 1948 年 6 月 17 日根据巴拿马第 18 号法令成立的，是美洲最大的自由港，世界上仅次于香港。","fact_en":"It was created by Panama's Decree Law No. 18 on 17 June 1948 and is the largest free port in the Americas — second in the world only to Hong Kong.","src":"Wikipedia · Colón Free Trade Zone","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Col%C3%B3n_Free_Trade_Zone","say":{"en":"Do you sell wholesale only, or can I buy a single box?","zh":"你们只做批发吗，还是可以只买一箱？"}},"哥斯达黎加菠萝":{"what":"哥斯达黎加加勒比海一侧利蒙省一带的菠萝种植园，哥斯达黎加是世界上最大的菠萝出口国。","what_en":"The pineapple plantations of Limón and the Caribbean side of Costa Rica — the world's biggest pineapple exporter.","fame":"欧洲、美国超市里那种金黄、很甜的菠萝，大多来自哥斯达黎加。菠萝一年四季都能收，但种植园用农药多、占地大，也常被环保组织批评。","fame_en":"The golden, very sweet pineapples in European and US supermarkets mostly come from Costa Rica. They can be harvested all year, but the plantations' heavy pesticide use and land clearing are often criticised by environmental groups.","fact":"这种甜菠萝叫 MD-2，是夏威夷菠萝研究所培育出来的。研究所 1987 年解散后，德尔蒙把这个品种带到哥斯达黎加的种植园试种，发现特别合适，1996 年以「Gold Extra Sweet」的名字上市——北美人吃鲜菠萝越来越多，很大程度就是因为它。","fact_en":"The sweet variety is MD-2, bred at Hawaii's Pineapple Research Institute. When the institute closed in 1987, Del Monte took it to its Costa Rican plantations, found it thrived there, and launched it in 1996 as 'Gold Extra Sweet' — much of North America's growing appetite for fresh pineapple is down to it.","src":"Edward Willett · Perfecting the pineapple","url":"https://edwardwillett.com/?p=625","say":{"en":"How can I tell if a pineapple is ripe?","zh":"怎么看菠萝熟没熟？"}},"潘帕斯牛肉":{"what":"阿根廷潘帕斯大草原上放养的牛和它们的牛肉。","what_en":"The cattle raised on Argentina's Pampas grasslands, and their beef.","fame":"阿根廷人周末的烤肉 asado 就靠它：一大家人围着烤架，从中午吃到下午。潘帕斯的牛很多在草原上吃草长大，阿根廷牛肉卖到中国、欧洲、以色列，牛仔 gaucho 也是阿根廷的象征。","fame_en":"It's the heart of the Argentine weekend asado: the whole family round the grill from lunch into the afternoon. Many Pampas cattle are grass-fed, the beef is exported to China, Europe and Israel, and the gaucho cowboy is a national symbol.","fact":"阿根廷牛肉能卖到大西洋对岸，要感谢一艘「冰箱船」：1876 年法国工程师夏尔·泰利耶买下一条旧货船，装上自己设计的制冷机，改名「Frigorifique」，第一次把冷藏的肉从阿根廷和乌拉圭运到了法国。","fact_en":"Argentine beef could cross the Atlantic thanks to a 'fridge ship': in 1876 French engineer Charles Tellier bought an old cargo ship, fitted it with refrigeration machinery of his own design, renamed it Le Frigorifique, and for the first time carried refrigerated meat from Argentina and Uruguay to France.","src":"Wikipedia · Charles Tellier","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_Tellier","say":{"en":"Could I have the bife de chorizo, medium-rare please?","zh":"请给我一份西冷牛排（bife de chorizo），三分熟。"}},"安塔米纳铜矿":{"what":"秘鲁安卡什省安第斯山上海拔四千多米的安塔米纳矿，出产铜和锌，是世界上最大的铜矿之一。","what_en":"The Antamina mine high in the Andes of Ancash, Peru, over 4,000 metres up, producing copper and zinc — one of the world's biggest copper mines.","fame":"家里的电线、电动车电机、手机里都有铜。秘鲁是世界第二大产铜国，安塔米纳一座矿就占了秘鲁很大一块产量；必和必拓、嘉能可等几家大矿业公司一起持有它。","fame_en":"Copper is in your home wiring, electric-car motors and phone. Peru is the world's second-biggest copper producer, and Antamina alone makes a large share; it is jointly owned by BHP, Glencore and other mining majors.","fact":"矿石磨成精矿以后，不用卡车运，而是混上水，从海拔约 4100 米的矿山顺着一条约 302 公里长的地下管道「流」到太平洋边的瓦尔梅港，一路下降四千多米。","fact_en":"After the ore is ground into concentrate it isn't trucked out — it's mixed with water and flows through a buried pipeline about 302 km long from the mine at roughly 4,100 metres down to the port of Huarmey on the Pacific.","src":"Canadian Mining Journal · Antamina blows your mind","url":"https://canadianminingjournal.com/featured-article/antamina-blows-your-mind","say":{"en":"Do I need time to get used to the altitude before the site visit?","zh":"参观矿区前需要先适应一下海拔吗？"}},"乌尤尼锂资源":{"what":"玻利维亚波托西省的乌尤尼盐沼——世界上最大的盐滩，下面的盐水里藏着巨量的锂。","what_en":"The Salar de Uyuni in Potosí, Bolivia — the world's largest salt flat, with huge amounts of lithium in the brine beneath it.","fame":"游客来这里拍「天空之镜」，雨季水面把天倒映成一片。玻利维亚的锂资源估计是世界最多的之一，但盐水里镁多、海拔高，几十年来一直没能大规模开采。","fame_en":"Tourists come for the 'mirror of the sky' photos when rain turns the flat into a giant reflection. Bolivia's lithium resources are among the largest in the world, but high magnesium and altitude have kept large-scale production out of reach for decades.","fact":"2023 年 1 月，玻利维亚选了以中国宁德时代（CATL）为首的财团，在乌尤尼和奥鲁罗的盐湖建两座锂厂，每座每年最多产 2.5 万吨电池级碳酸锂，第一期投资超过 10 亿美元——玻利维亚等了几十年，想终于把锂变成产业。","fact_en":"In January 2023 Bolivia picked a consortium led by China's CATL to build two lithium plants on the Uyuni and Oruro salt flats, each able to make up to 25,000 tonnes of battery-grade lithium carbonate a year, with over $1 billion in the first stage — a long-awaited bid to finally turn its lithium into an industry.","src":"Mining Weekly · Bolivia taps Chinese battery giant CATL (2023)","url":"https://www.miningweekly.com/article/bolivia-selects-chinese-battery-giant-catl-for-lithium-mining-tie-up-2023-01-20","say":{"en":"Does the tour include sunset on the salt flat?","zh":"这个团包括在盐滩上看日落吗？"}},"乌拉圭牛肉":{"what":"乌拉圭的草原牧场和牛肉，牛比人多。","what_en":"Uruguay's grassland ranches and beef — a country with more cattle than people.","fame":"乌拉圭只有大约 340 万人，却养着 1100 多万头牛，平均每人三头多。牛基本在草原上放养，牛肉是乌拉圭最重要的出口，卖到中国、欧洲、美国；烤肉 asado 在这里和阿根廷一样是国民活动。","fame_en":"Uruguay has about 3.4 million people but more than 11 million cattle — over three per person. They're mostly raised on open grassland, beef is the country's top export to China, Europe and the US, and the asado is as much a national ritual as in Argentina.","fact":"乌拉圭议会 2006 年立法，从当年 9 月起每头新生的牛都要戴两个耳标——一个看得见的、一个电子芯片——政府给牧民免费提供，所以一块牛排可以查到那头牛在哪个牧场出生、去过哪里。","fact_en":"Uruguay's parliament passed a law in 2006: from that September every newborn calf must wear two ear tags — one visual and one electronic chip — provided free by the government, so a steak can be traced back to the ranch where the animal was born and everywhere it went.","src":"World Bank Blogs · Knowing your steak's origin","url":"https://blogs.worldbank.org/en/voices/knowing-your-steak-s-origin-and-impact-environment-it-s-possible","say":{"en":"Is this beef grass-fed or grain-fed?","zh":"这牛肉是吃草的还是吃谷物的？"}},"好时巧克力小镇":{"what":"美国宾夕法尼亚州的好时镇，是巧克力商米尔顿·好时围着自己的工厂建起来的小镇。","what_en":"Hershey, Pennsylvania — a town Milton Hershey built around his chocolate factory.","fame":"好时的 Kisses 水滴巧克力、巧克力棒在美国几乎人人吃过。小镇的主街叫「巧克力大道」，路灯做成了 Kisses 的样子，一盏包着锡纸、一盏没包；游客可以去好时巧克力世界坐小火车看巧克力怎么做。","fame_en":"Almost every American has eaten Hershey's Kisses and bars. The main street is Chocolate Avenue, where the street lamps are shaped like Kisses — alternating wrapped and unwrapped — and visitors can ride through Hershey's Chocolate World to see how chocolate is made.","fact":"这家上市公司其实被一所寄宿学校「管着」：没有孩子的好时夫妇把大部分财产留给了他们办的米尔顿·好时学校，学校的信托只持有少数股份，却握着大多数投票权。2016 年有人想收购好时，这层关系就是最大的难关之一。","fact_en":"This listed company is effectively controlled by a boarding school: the childless Hersheys left most of their fortune to the Milton Hershey School they founded, and the school's trust holds a minority of shares but most of the voting power — one of the biggest hurdles when a takeover was attempted in 2016.","src":"Wikipedia · The Hershey Company","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Hershey_Company","say":{"en":"Is the chocolate tour ride free?","zh":"那个巧克力参观小火车是免费的吗？"}},"加拿大面包篮":{"what":"加拿大萨斯喀彻温省一望无际的大草原农田，种小麦、油菜、豆子，被叫作加拿大的「面包篮」。","what_en":"The endless prairie farmland of Saskatchewan, Canada, growing wheat, canola and pulses — known as Canada's 'breadbasket'.","fame":"加拿大是世界上重要的小麦出口国，硬质小麦做的意大利面、面包很多用加拿大麦子。夏天开车穿过萨省，一边是金黄的麦田，一边是一片片亮黄色的油菜花，路边立着高高的粮仓。","fame_en":"Canada is a major wheat exporter, and much of the world's pasta and bread uses Canadian wheat. Drive through Saskatchewan in summer and you see golden wheat on one side, bright yellow canola on the other, and tall grain elevators by the road.","fact":"那些黄花叫 canola（芥花），名字是 Can（加拿大）加 ola（油）拼起来的，也为了避开「油菜」英文 rape 不好听的联想。1970 年代初，曼尼托巴大学的科学家把油菜培育成低芥酸的新品种，实验就是在萨斯卡通的加拿大国家研究委员会实验室里做的。","fact_en":"The yellow crop is canola — a blend of 'Can' for Canada and '-ola' for oil, which also avoids the unfortunate associations of 'rapeseed'. University of Manitoba scientists bred this low-erucic-acid variety in the early 1970s, with the lab work done at the National Research Council in Saskatoon.","src":"Wikipedia · Canola","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canola","say":{"en":"Is this wheat or canola in that field?","zh":"那块地里种的是小麦还是油菜？"}},"沙特石油":{"what":"沙特阿拉伯东部省的油田，其中加瓦尔油田是世界上最大的陆上油田，由国营的沙特阿美公司开采。","what_en":"The oil fields of Saudi Arabia's Eastern Province — including Ghawar, the largest onshore oil field in the world — run by state-owned Saudi Aramco.","fame":"沙特是世界上最大的石油出口国之一，全世界的油价常常跟着它增产、减产走。达兰、宰赫兰一带是 1930 年代第一次打出油的地方，现在沙特阿美的总部还在这里。","fame_en":"Saudi Arabia is one of the world's biggest oil exporters, and global prices often move when it raises or cuts output. Dhahran is where oil was first struck in the 1930s, and Aramco's headquarters is still there.","fact":"2019 年 12 月，沙特阿美只卖了 1.5% 的股份上市，就募集了 256 亿美元，超过阿里巴巴 2014 年的纪录，成了史上最大的 IPO；按发行价算，公司市值约 1.7 万亿美元，比当时的苹果还高。","fact_en":"In December 2019 Saudi Aramco floated just 1.5% of its shares and raised $25.6 billion, beating Alibaba's 2014 record as the biggest IPO ever; at the offer price the company was worth about $1.7 trillion — more than Apple at the time.","src":"Fortune · Saudi Aramco biggest IPO in history (2019)","url":"https://fortune.com/2019/12/05/saudi-aramco-biggest-ipo-in-history/","say":{"en":"Is it possible to visit the oil museum in Dhahran?","zh":"宰赫兰的石油博物馆可以参观吗？"}},"迪拜杰贝阿里港":{"what":"迪拜西南边的杰贝阿里港，中东最大的港口，由迪拜环球港务（DP World）经营。","what_en":"Jebel Ali Port, southwest of Dubai — the biggest port in the Middle East, run by DP World.","fame":"从中国、印度运来的货在这里卸下，再装小船或卡车分到海湾国家、伊朗、东非。旁边的杰贝阿里自由区有几千家公司，外国人可以百分之百自己持股，这让迪拜成了中东的「转口仓库」。","fame_en":"Goods from China and India are unloaded here and sent on by smaller ships or trucks to the Gulf, Iran and East Africa. The neighbouring Jebel Ali Free Zone has thousands of companies that foreigners can own 100%, which made Dubai the Middle East's re-export warehouse.","fact":"这个港是在沙漠海边挖出来的人工港，1979 年 2 月 26 日英国女王伊丽莎白二世乘王室游艇「不列颠尼亚号」开进港里宣布启用，当时它是世界上最大的人工港。","fact_en":"It is a man-made harbour dug out of the desert coast, opened on 26 February 1979 when Queen Elizabeth II sailed in aboard the royal yacht Britannia; at the time it was the largest man-made harbour in the world.","src":"Gulf News · Jebel Ali Port completes 40 years (2019)","url":"https://gulfnews.com/uae/history-of-the-uae-jebel-ali-port-completes-40-years-1.1575795157308","say":{"en":"How long does customs clearance usually take at Jebel Ali?","zh":"杰贝阿里港清关一般要多久？"}},"约翰内斯堡金矿":{"what":"南非约翰内斯堡一带威特沃特斯兰德的金矿，这座城市就是因为金矿而建的。","what_en":"The Witwatersrand gold mines around Johannesburg, South Africa — the city exists because of them.","fame":"1886 年在这里发现金矿以后，几年之间荒原上冒出一座大城，世界上开采出来的黄金有很大一部分来自这片地下。城里到处能看到黄色的老矿渣山，还有在旧矿井上建的主题公园 Gold Reef City 和种族隔离博物馆。","fame_en":"After gold was found here in 1886, a big city sprang up on empty veld within a few years, and a huge share of all the gold ever mined has come from beneath it. Yellow mine dumps still dot the city, and the Gold Reef City theme park and the Apartheid Museum stand on old mine land.","fact":"附近的 Mponeng 金矿是世界上从地面算最深的矿，深度超过 4 公里。那么深的地方岩石有 66°C，矿里要把冰浆送下去，才能把坑道里的空气降到 30°C 以下。","fact_en":"The nearby Mponeng gold mine is the deepest mine in the world from ground level, reaching more than 4 km down. The rock face there is 66 °C, so ice slurry is pumped underground to cool the tunnel air below 30 °C.","src":"Wikipedia · Mponeng Gold Mine","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mponeng_Gold_Mine","say":{"en":"Can we go down the old mine shaft at Gold Reef City?","zh":"在 Gold Reef City 能下到老矿井里吗？"}},"尼日尔三角洲石油":{"what":"尼日利亚南部尼日尔河入海口的三角洲，河汊、红树林下面是尼日利亚的大油田。","what_en":"The Niger Delta in southern Nigeria, where the river meets the sea — creeks and mangroves sitting on top of the country's big oil fields.","fame":"石油是尼日利亚最主要的出口，政府收入很大一块靠它。可三角洲的很多村子几十年来饱受漏油和天然气燃烧污染，渔民打不到鱼，这里也是石油和环境、公平问题最常被讨论的地方之一。","fame_en":"Oil is Nigeria's main export and a big part of government revenue. Yet many delta villages have suffered decades of spills and gas flaring that ruined fishing, making it one of the most-discussed places for oil, environment and fairness.","fact":"尼日利亚第一个商业油田是 1956 年 1 月 15 日在三角洲的小村奥洛伊比里发现的；1958 年 2 月第一船原油从哈科特港运走。如今那里的油早就采完了，村子却还是很穷。","fact_en":"Nigeria's first commercial oil was struck on 15 January 1956 at the small delta village of Oloibiri; the first crude left Port Harcourt in February 1958. The oil there has long run out, but the village is still poor.","src":"Wikipedia · Oloibiri Oilfield","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oloibiri_Oilfield","say":{"en":"Is it safe to take a boat through the creeks?","zh":"坐船穿过那些河汊安全吗？"}},"赞比亚铜带":{"what":"赞比亚北部的铜带省，基特韦、钦戈拉一带的大铜矿。","what_en":"Zambia's Copperbelt Province in the north — the big copper mines around Kitwe and Chingola.","fame":"铜是做电线、电机、电动车必不可少的金属。赞比亚是非洲最大的产铜国之一，铜占它出口收入的七成左右，所以全世界的铜价一涨一跌，赞比亚的汇率和工作机会都跟着动。","fame_en":"Copper is essential for wires, motors and electric cars. Zambia is one of Africa's biggest copper producers, and copper is about 70% of its export earnings, so when world copper prices move, Zambia's currency and jobs move with them.","fact":"2024 年赞比亚遇上严重的旱灾，可铜产量反而涨了 12%，从 2023 年的约 73 万吨涨到约 82 万吨。","fact_en":"Despite a severe drought in 2024, Zambia's copper output rose 12%, from about 732,000 tonnes in 2023 to around 820,000 tonnes.","src":"Daba Finance · Zambia's copper output rises 12% in 2024 despite drought","url":"https://dabafinance.com/en/news/zambias-copper-output-rises-12pc-in-2024-despite-drought","say":{"en":"How many shifts do the miners work a day?","zh":"矿工一天分几班？"}},"博茨瓦纳钻石":{"what":"博茨瓦纳的钻石矿，其中朱瓦能矿是世界上按价值算最富的钻石矿之一。","what_en":"Botswana's diamond mines — Jwaneng among the richest in the world by value.","fame":"1966 年独立时博茨瓦纳是世界上最穷的国家之一；第二年就发现了钻石。政府和戴比尔斯各占一半成立 Debswana 公司，把钻石钱用在学校、医院和道路上，博茨瓦纳因此成了中等收入国家，常被当作「资源没有变成诅咒」的例子。","fame_en":"At independence in 1966 Botswana was one of the poorest countries on earth; diamonds were found the next year. The government and De Beers formed Debswana as 50–50 partners and spent the money on schools, clinics and roads, turning Botswana into a middle-income country — often cited as proof that resources need not be a curse.","fact":"2024 年 8 月，加拿大公司 Lucara 在博茨瓦纳的 Karowe 矿用 X 光设备找到一颗 2492 克拉的钻石，是一百多年来发现的最大钻石，仅次于 1905 年南非的 3106 克拉「库里南」。","fact_en":"In August 2024 the Canadian miner Lucara used X-ray technology at Botswana's Karowe mine to recover a 2,492-carat diamond — the biggest found in over a century, second only to South Africa's 3,106-carat Cullinan of 1905.","src":"NPR · Biggest diamond in over a century found in Botswana (2024)","url":"https://www.npr.org/2024/08/23/g-s1-19243/biggest-diamond-in-over-a-century-is-found-in-botswana-a-whopping-2-492-carats","say":{"en":"Does this stone come with a Botswana certificate of origin?","zh":"这颗钻石有博茨瓦纳的产地证明吗？"}},"加纳黄金":{"what":"加纳的金矿，阿散蒂地区的奥布阿西是最古老、最有名的一座。","what_en":"Ghana's gold mines, with Obuasi in the Ashanti region the oldest and most famous.","fame":"加纳殖民时代的名字就叫「黄金海岸」，阿散蒂王国的金凳子是国家的象征。现在黄金是加纳最大的出口商品；大公司开大矿，也有很多小规模、没执照的淘金 galamsey，把河水弄得很浑，是加纳人常吵的话题。","fame_en":"Ghana's colonial name was the Gold Coast, and the Golden Stool of the Ashanti kingdom is a national symbol. Gold is now Ghana's biggest export; alongside big company mines there's widespread small-scale illegal mining, galamsey, which muddies rivers and is hotly debated.","fact":"2019 年加纳超过南非，成了非洲第一大产金国，那一年产了 142.4 吨黄金。南非因为矿越挖越深、成本太高，产量一直在往下掉。","fact_en":"In 2019 Ghana overtook South Africa to become Africa's biggest gold producer, mining 142.4 tonnes that year, as South Africa's ever-deeper, costlier mines kept declining.","src":"Wikipedia · Mining industry of Ghana","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mining_industry_of_Ghana","say":{"en":"Is this gold jewellery 18 or 22 carat?","zh":"这件金首饰是 18K 还是 22K 的？"}},"摩洛哥磷矿":{"what":"摩洛哥中部胡里卜盖的磷矿，属于国营的 OCP 集团；磷是做化肥的原料。","what_en":"The phosphate mines of Khouribga in central Morocco, run by the state-owned OCP Group; phosphate is the raw material for fertiliser.","fame":"世界上大约七成的磷矿储量在摩洛哥。你吃的米、面、蔬菜，种的时候很可能施过含磷的化肥，所以 OCP 是全世界粮食生产背后很重要的一家公司。","fame_en":"Around 70% of the world's phosphate reserves are in Morocco. The rice, wheat and vegetables you eat were probably grown with phosphate fertiliser, which makes OCP an important company behind the world's food supply.","fact":"以前磷矿石要先晒干再用火车运到海边。2014 年 10 月 2 日，一条约 187 公里长的「矿浆管道」启用：矿石混上水，从胡里卜盖直接流到大西洋边的乔尔夫莱斯法尔工厂，运量从每年 1800 万吨提到 3800 万吨，每年还能省下约 300 万立方米的水。","fact_en":"Phosphate rock used to be dried and sent to the coast by train. On 2 October 2014 a 187 km slurry pipeline opened: the ore, mixed with water, flows straight from Khouribga to the Jorf Lasfar plant on the Atlantic, raising capacity from 18 to 38 million tonnes a year and saving about 3 million cubic metres of water annually.","src":"Le Matin · Slurry pipeline Khouribga (2014)","url":"https://lematin.ma/express/2014/grace-au-projet-du-slurry-pipeline_l-infrastructure-industrielle-de-khouribga-renforcee-en-2014/214694.html","say":{"en":"How is phosphate turned into fertiliser?","zh":"磷矿是怎么做成化肥的？"}},"奈瓦沙鲜花":{"what":"肯尼亚奈瓦沙湖边的一片片大温室，种玫瑰出口欧洲。","what_en":"The greenhouses around Lake Naivasha in Kenya, growing roses for Europe.","fame":"奈瓦沙在赤道附近，海拔又高，白天暖、夜里凉，玫瑰长得慢、花头结实。早上剪的花当天就从内罗毕坐货机走，第二天出现在荷兰拍卖场和欧洲超市里。花卉是肯尼亚最大的农产品出口之一，养活了几十万人。","fame_en":"Naivasha is near the equator but high up, with warm days and cool nights, so roses grow slowly and sturdily. Flowers cut in the morning fly out of Nairobi that day and are in Dutch auctions and European supermarkets the next. Flowers are one of Kenya's biggest farm exports, supporting hundreds of thousands of people.","fact":"欧盟进口的玫瑰里，大约 38% 来自肯尼亚；肯尼亚的 127 家左右的花场，差不多一半挤在奈瓦沙湖周围——种花用水太多，湖的水位和污染也一直让人担心。","fact_en":"About 38% of the roses imported into the EU come from Kenya, and roughly half of Kenya's 127 or so flower farms are clustered around Lake Naivasha — raising long-standing worries about the lake's water levels and pollution.","src":"CNN · Kenya's flower industry (2015)","url":"https://edition.cnn.com/2015/03/16/africa/kenya-flower-industry","say":{"en":"Are these roses Fairtrade certified?","zh":"这些玫瑰有公平贸易认证吗？"}},"尼罗河长绒棉":{"what":"埃及尼罗河三角洲种的长绒棉，纤维特别长、特别细。","what_en":"The extra-long-staple cotton grown in Egypt's Nile Delta, with especially long, fine fibres.","fame":"纤维越长，纺出来的线越细越结实，做成的床单和衬衫又软又亮，所以「埃及棉」在酒店床品和高档衬衫上是一个卖点。十九世纪美国内战时棉花断供，埃及棉开始大量出口到英国纺织厂。","fame_en":"The longer the fibre, the finer and stronger the yarn, so sheets and shirts are softer and glossier — that's why 'Egyptian cotton' is a selling point for hotel bedding and good shirts. When the American Civil War cut off cotton supplies in the 1860s, Egyptian cotton began flowing to British mills.","fact":"标签上写的「埃及棉」不一定是真的。2016 年美国零售商 Target 调查发现，印度供应商 Welspun 卖给它的「100% 埃及棉」床单用的是别的棉花，于是跟它解约，并给 2014 年 8 月到 2016 年 7 月间买过的顾客全额退款。","fact_en":"'Egyptian cotton' on a label isn't always real. In 2016 the US retailer Target found that '100% Egyptian cotton' sheets from Indian supplier Welspun used other cotton; it dropped the supplier and refunded customers who had bought them between August 2014 and July 2016.","src":"Home Textiles Today · Target terminates major sheet supplier over labeling (2016)","url":"https://www.hometextilestoday.com/industry-news/target-terminates-major-sheet-supplier-over-labeling","say":{"en":"Is this really Egyptian cotton? What's the thread count?","zh":"这真的是埃及棉吗？支数是多少？"}},"死海钾肥":{"what":"约旦死海南边的一大片蒸发池，从死海的盐水里提取钾肥，主要由阿拉伯钾肥公司生产。","what_en":"The huge evaporation ponds at the southern end of the Dead Sea in Jordan, where potash fertiliser is extracted from the brine, mainly by the Arab Potash Company.","fame":"钾是植物生长的三大养分之一，约旦的钾肥卖到印度、中国和世界各地，是约旦最重要的出口之一。死海对岸的以色列也在做同样的事，两边的蒸发池从空中看像一块块蓝绿色的拼图。","fame_en":"Potassium is one of the three main plant nutrients, and Jordan's potash goes to India, China and beyond — one of the country's top exports. Israel does the same on the other shore, and from the air the ponds on both sides look like turquoise jigsaw pieces.","fact":"死海本身正在变小：1930 年它的水面有 1050 平方公里，现在只剩约 605 平方公里，少了四成多。引红海水来补的「红海—死海输水工程」也已经取消了。","fact_en":"The Dead Sea itself is shrinking fast: its surface was 1,050 km² in 1930 and is now about 605 km², down by more than 40%. A plan to top it up with water from the Red Sea, the Red Sea–Dead Sea Water Conveyance, has been scrapped.","src":"Wikipedia · Dead Sea","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dead_Sea","say":{"en":"Can you really float in the Dead Sea without trying?","zh":"在死海里真的不用使劲就能浮起来吗？"}},"伊朗开心果":{"what":"伊朗东南部克尔曼省拉夫桑詹一带的开心果园，伊朗开心果以前是世界上最有名的。","what_en":"The pistachio orchards around Rafsanjan in Kerman province, southeastern Iran — for a long time the world's most famous pistachios.","fame":"在伊朗，开心果是过年（诺鲁孜节）待客、去别人家做客必带的零食，拉夫桑詹整片沙漠边上都是开心果树。伊朗开心果壳开得大、味道浓，长期和美国加州争世界第一。","fame_en":"In Iran pistachios are the must-have snack for Nowruz guests and visits, and around Rafsanjan the edge of the desert is covered in pistachio trees. Iranian nuts, with wide-open shells and rich flavour, have long competed with California for the top spot.","fact":"2012 年美国第一次超过伊朗，成了世界最大的开心果生产和出口国。主要原因是伊朗缺水：伊朗约七成开心果产自克尔曼省，那里连年干旱、地下水越抽越少，再加上制裁，伊朗的产量一路下滑。","fact_en":"In 2012 the US overtook Iran for the first time as the world's largest pistachio producer and exporter. The main reason is water: about 70% of Iran's pistachios come from Kerman province, where years of drought and falling groundwater — plus sanctions — have dragged output down.","src":"Al-Monitor · Iran's pistachio industry (2016)","url":"https://app.al-monitor.com/originals/2016/12/iran-pistachio-industry-production-sanctions-kerman-us.html","say":{"en":"Are these pistachios roasted and salted, or raw?","zh":"这些开心果是烤过加盐的，还是生的？"}},"埃塞俄比亚航空":{"what":"埃塞俄比亚的国家航空公司，总部和枢纽在首都亚的斯亚贝巴，非洲规模最大的航空公司之一。","what_en":"Ethiopia's national airline, based at its hub in Addis Ababa — one of the biggest airlines in Africa.","fame":"从中国、欧洲去非洲很多国家，最方便的往往是在亚的斯亚贝巴转机；它把非洲几十个城市连在一起，也大量运输非洲的鲜花、蔬菜到欧洲和中东。它是少数长期赚钱的非洲国有航空公司。它 1945 年成立时和美国环球航空（TWA）签了管理合同，早年的飞行员和机务都是 TWA 的人。","fame_en":"Flying from China or Europe to much of Africa often means changing planes in Addis Ababa; the airline links dozens of African cities and carries a lot of African flowers and vegetables to Europe and the Middle East. It's one of the few African state airlines that has stayed profitable. When it was founded in 1945 it signed a management contract with TWA, whose staff flew and maintained its early planes.","fact":"2012 年 8 月，它接到了非洲第一架波音 787 梦想客机——除了日本的航空公司，它是全世界第一家接收 787 的。","fact_en":"In August 2012 it received Africa's first Boeing 787 Dreamliner — the first airline in the world outside Japan to take delivery of one.","src":"Ethiopian Airlines · Dream comes true: Ethiopian's first Dreamliner lands in Addis Ababa (2012)","url":"https://corporate.ethiopianairlines.com/Press-release-open-page/dream-comes-true-ethiopian-1st-dreamliner-lands-in-addis-ababa---16-august-2012","say":{"en":"How long is my layover in Addis, and do I need a transit visa?","zh":"我在亚的斯亚贝巴转机要等多久？需要过境签证吗？"}},"无人机送血":{"what":"卢旺达用固定翼无人机给偏远医院送血和药，由美国公司 Zipline 运营，第一个基地在穆汉加。","what_en":"Rwanda's fixed-wing drones that fly blood and medicines to remote hospitals, run by the US company Zipline from its first base in Muhanga.","fame":"卢旺达被叫作「千丘之国」，山路弯弯，开车送一袋急用的血可能要好几个小时。现在医院发一条短信下单，无人机几十分钟就飞到，用小降落伞把血包扔下来——尤其能救产后大出血的妈妈。","fame_en":"Rwanda is the 'land of a thousand hills', and driving an urgent bag of blood along winding roads can take hours. Now a clinic orders by text message and a drone arrives within minutes, dropping the blood by little parachute — saving especially mothers bleeding after childbirth.","fact":"2016 年 10 月 14 日，卢旺达总统卡加梅在穆汉加宣布启用这项服务，这是世界上第一个全国性的无人机送货服务。一开始只有 15 架无人机，先送血，再慢慢加上药品和疫苗。","fact_en":"On 14 October 2016 President Paul Kagame launched the service in Muhanga — the world's first national drone delivery service. It started with 15 drones, carrying blood first and later adding medicines and vaccines.","src":"Gavi · Rwanda launches world's first national drone delivery service (2016)","url":"https://www.gavi.org/news/media-room/rwanda-launches-worlds-first-national-drone-delivery-service-powered-zipline","say":{"en":"How long does a delivery flight usually take?","zh":"一趟送货一般要飞多久？"}},"海上钻石":{"what":"纳米比亚南部海岸吕德里茨一带：钻石被河水冲进大西洋，人们用船从海底的沙砾里把它吸上来。","what_en":"The southern coast of Namibia around Lüderitz, where diamonds washed into the Atlantic by rivers are sucked up from the seabed by ships.","fame":"几千万年里，奥兰治河把内陆的钻石冲到海里，海浪又把它们留在海床的沙砾里。现在纳米比亚的钻石很大一部分来自海上：专门的采矿船在海上工作，把海底的沙子抽上来筛钻石，成色好的钻石特别多。","fame_en":"Over millions of years the Orange River carried diamonds from inland into the sea, and the waves left them in seabed gravels. Today much of Namibia's diamond output comes from the ocean: specialised mining ships pump up seabed sand and sieve out the stones, many of them gem quality.","fact":"这里的钻石热是 1908 年 4 月 14 日开始的：铁路工人扎卡赖亚斯·莱瓦拉在吕德里茨附近的沙子里捡到一颗钻石，交给了德国工头。殖民政府随即把一大片海岸划成「禁区」（Sperrgebiet），旁边兴起的矿镇科尔曼斯科普后来被废弃，房子里灌满了沙子，成了有名的鬼城。","fact_en":"The diamond rush began on 14 April 1908, when railway worker Zacharias Lewala picked up a diamond in the sand near Lüderitz and gave it to his German supervisor. The colonial government soon fenced off a vast coastal 'forbidden zone', the Sperrgebiet, and the mining town of Kolmanskop that sprang up nearby was later abandoned — now a famous ghost town with sand-filled houses.","src":"Wikipedia · Zacharias Lewala","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zacharias_Lewala","say":{"en":"Do I need a permit to visit Kolmanskop?","zh":"去科尔曼斯科普要许可证吗？"}},"斯法克斯橄榄油":{"what":"突尼斯第二大城市斯法克斯周围的大片橄榄林，突尼斯是世界上最大的橄榄油出口国之一。","what_en":"The vast olive groves around Sfax, Tunisia's second city — Tunisia is one of the world's biggest olive-oil exporters.","fame":"斯法克斯一带干旱少雨，橄榄树一排排种得很稀，一眼望不到头。突尼斯产的橄榄油大部分出口，很多先卖到意大利、西班牙，再装进别人的瓶子里；现在越来越多突尼斯公司自己装瓶出口，打出自己的牌子。","fame_en":"Around Sfax the land is dry and the olive trees are planted far apart in rows that run to the horizon. Most Tunisian olive oil is exported, much of it first to Italy and Spain to end up in their bottles; more Tunisian firms now bottle and brand their own oil.","fact":"按突尼斯驻巴西大使馆的说法，突尼斯有大约 1.07 亿棵橄榄树，种在 200 万公顷土地上；2024/25 年雨水回来了，预计产 34 万吨橄榄油，其中 30 万吨出口。","fact_en":"According to Tunisia's embassy in Brazil, the country has about 107 million olive trees on 2 million hectares; with the rains back in 2024/25, it expected to make 340,000 tonnes of olive oil, 300,000 of them for export.","src":"ANBA · Tunisia boosts global olive oil production","url":"https://anba.com.br/en/tunisia-boosts-global-olive-oil-production/","say":{"en":"Can I buy a bottle straight from the mill?","zh":"能直接在油坊买一瓶吗？"}},"比基塔锂矿":{"what":"津巴布韦马斯温戈省的比基塔锂矿，津巴布韦最大的锂矿。","what_en":"The Bikita lithium mine in Masvingo province — Zimbabwe's largest.","fame":"电动车和手机电池离不开锂，津巴布韦是非洲锂资源最多的国家，近几年中国公司在这里买下了好几座锂矿。比基塔已经开采了几十年，现在的矿石主要卖给电池产业链。","fame_en":"Electric-car and phone batteries need lithium, and Zimbabwe has Africa's largest lithium resources; in recent years Chinese companies have bought several mines here. Bikita has been mined for decades, and its ore now goes mainly to the battery industry.","fact":"2022 年 12 月，津巴布韦宣布立即禁止出口没加工的锂矿石，想让外国公司在本国加工、多留下一些钱。比基塔是全国锂储量最大的矿，约有 1080 万吨锂矿石，在首都哈拉雷以南 308 公里。","fact_en":"In December 2022 Zimbabwe banned exports of unprocessed lithium ore with immediate effect, to make foreign companies process it at home and keep more of the value. Bikita, 308 km south of Harare, holds the country's largest lithium reserves — about 10.8 million tonnes of ore.","src":"Mining Index · Why Zim has banned the export of raw lithium (2022)","url":"https://www.miningindex.co.zw/2022/12/23/why-zim-has-banned-the-export-of-raw-lithium/","say":{"en":"How many people from the local area work at the mine?","zh":"矿上有多少本地人在工作？"}},"乌干达咖啡":{"what":"乌干达的咖啡，以罗布斯塔为主，咖啡是乌干达最重要的出口商品。","what_en":"Uganda's coffee, mostly robusta — the country's most important export.","fame":"你喝的速溶咖啡、意式浓缩里的「油脂」，很多来自罗布斯塔豆。乌干达的咖啡大多是小农户种的，常常在香蕉树下面种；东边埃尔贡山上也种阿拉比卡。","fame_en":"Much of the instant coffee you drink and the crema on espresso comes from robusta beans. Most Ugandan coffee is grown by smallholder families, often grown under banana trees, with arabica on the slopes of Mount Elgon in the east.","fact":"乌干达是罗布斯塔咖啡的老家之一：坎帕拉一带的森林和维多利亚湖北岸至今还长着野生的罗布斯塔。1999 到 2002 年，有人试过把这种野生咖啡做成高档品牌卖。","fact_en":"Uganda is one of robusta's original homes: wild robusta still grows in the forests around Kampala and along the Lake Victoria Crescent. From 1999 to 2002 there was an attempt to sell this wild coffee as a premium brand.","src":"Wikipedia · Coffee production in Uganda","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee_production_in_Uganda","say":{"en":"Is this blend arabica, robusta, or both?","zh":"这款拼配是阿拉比卡、罗布斯塔，还是都有？"}},"拉斯拉凡天然气":{"what":"卡塔尔北部海边的拉斯拉凡工业城，把海底的天然气冷却成液体（LNG），装上大船运往世界各地。","what_en":"Ras Laffan Industrial City on Qatar's northern coast, where gas from under the sea is chilled into liquid (LNG) and loaded onto ships for the world.","fame":"天然气冷到零下 162°C 会变成液体，体积缩小约 600 倍，就能用船运。卡塔尔靠这一招成了世界上最大的液化天然气出口国之一，日本、韩国、中国、欧洲很多人家里做饭、取暖用的气，就有卡塔尔的。这些气来自卡塔尔外海的北方气田，它和伊朗的南帕尔斯气田连在一起，被海上的国界分成两半。","fame_en":"Chill natural gas to −162 °C and it turns liquid, shrinking about 600 times, so it can travel by ship. That made Qatar one of the world's biggest LNG exporters, and gas for cooking and heating in Japan, Korea, China and Europe often comes from here. The gas comes from Qatar's offshore North Field, which continues under the border as Iran's South Pars.","fact":"北方气田 1971 年就发现了，是世界上最大的天然气田，海上面积约 6000 平方公里；可直到 1996 年拉斯拉凡工业城才启用，开始建把这些气变成 LNG 的工厂。","fact_en":"The North Field was found back in 1971 and is the world's biggest gas field, covering about 6,000 km² offshore — but it was only in 1996 that Ras Laffan Industrial City was commissioned to build plants turning that gas into LNG.","src":"Wikipedia · Ras Laffan Industrial City","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ras_Laffan_Industrial_City","say":{"en":"Do I need a special pass to enter the industrial city?","zh":"进工业城需要专门的通行证吗？"}},"相声":{"what":"两个人站着说笑话的中国传统表演：一个逗，一个捧，靠说、学、逗、唱让台下笑。","what_en":"A traditional Chinese comedy act where two people stand and talk: one tells the jokes, the other plays along, using talking, imitating, teasing and singing.","fame":"在天津，相声不是只在电视上看的东西：茶馆里花几十块钱、一壶茶，就能听一下午，台上台下离得很近，演员会接观众的话。","fame_en":"In Tianjin crosstalk is not just something on TV: for a few dozen yuan and a pot of tea you can spend an afternoon in a teahouse, close enough that the performers answer back to the crowd.","fact":"相声有三个公认的发源地：北京的天桥、天津的劝业场，还有南京的夫子庙。","fact_en":"Crosstalk has three recognised birthplaces: Tianqiao in Beijing, Quanyechang in Tianjin and Fuzimiao in Nanjing.","src":"Visit Beijing：Xiangsheng","url":"https://english.visitbeijing.com.cn/article/4HVcjFGuuUr","say":{"en":"I only got half the jokes, but I laughed anyway!","zh":"笑话我只听懂一半，但还是笑了！"}},"云冈石窟":{"what":"山西大同城外武周山上的一排石窟，一千五百多年前的北魏凿的，里面是大大小小的佛像。","what_en":"A row of caves cut into a cliff outside Datong, Shanxi, carved more than 1,500 years ago in the Northern Wei dynasty and filled with Buddha statues large and small.","fame":"五万多尊造像挤在一公里长的山崖上，最大的佛坐着就有十几米高；它和敦煌、龙门并称中国三大石窟，是世界文化遗产。","fame_en":"More than 50,000 figures crowd a cliff about a kilometre long, the largest seated Buddha over ten metres tall. With Dunhuang and Longmen it is one of China's three great cave sites, and a World Heritage Site.","fact":"第 12 窟有一个 1:1 的 3D 打印「分身」：2020 年在杭州浙江大学第一次展出，拆成小块能装车运走，2025 年又去上海展过。","fact_en":"Cave 12 has a 1:1 3D-printed twin: it was first shown at Zhejiang University in Hangzhou in 2020, comes apart into blocks that fit on trucks, and went on show in Shanghai in 2025.","src":"China Daily：Yungang Grottoes debut 3D-printed cave replica","url":"https://govt.chinadaily.com.cn/s/202006/22/WS5ef017af498ed1e2f34073c8/yungang-grottoes-debut-3d-printed-cave-replica.html","say":{"en":"Which cave has the big seated Buddha?","zh":"那尊大坐佛在第几窟？"}},"南京路":{"what":"上海最有名的购物街，从外滩一直通到人民广场、静安寺，东段是步行街。","what_en":"Shanghai's most famous shopping street, running from the Bund to People's Square and Jing'an Temple; the eastern part is a pedestrian street.","fame":"一百多年来这里一直是上海最热闹的地方：老字号、百货大楼、霓虹招牌挨在一起，晚上人多到走不动，被叫作「中华商业第一街」。","fame_en":"For over a century it has been the busiest place in Shanghai: old brands, department stores and neon signs side by side, so packed at night you can barely move. It is called China's number one shopping street.","fact":"步行街本来走不到外滩：2020 年 9 月往东接上了 500 米，现在可以一路从人民广场走到黄浦江边。","fact_en":"The pedestrian street used to stop short of the Bund: in September 2020 a 500-metre eastern extension opened, so you can now walk all the way from People's Square to the river.","src":"China Daily：Famous commercial street of Shanghai stretches to the Bund","url":"https://www.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202009/14/WS5f5ec2eea310f55b25a82424.html","say":{"en":"Is the Bund this way, straight down the street?","zh":"外滩是不是顺着这条街一直走？"}},"上海迪士尼":{"what":"上海浦东的迪士尼乐园，2016 年开门，是中国大陆第一座迪士尼。","what_en":"The Disney park in Pudong, Shanghai, opened in 2016 — the first Disneyland in mainland China.","fame":"城堡是所有迪士尼里最高最大的一座；园里有中国才有的花园和十二生肖，过年还有专门的新春活动。","fame_en":"Its castle is the tallest and largest in any Disney park, and there are things you only find here, like a garden of the twelve Chinese zodiac animals and special Lunar New Year shows.","fact":"全世界第一个「疯狂动物城」主题园区就在这里，2023 年 12 月 20 日开放，是园里的第八个园区。","fact_en":"The world's first Zootopia land is here: it opened on 20 December 2023 as the park's eighth themed area.","src":"Shanghai government：Zootopia-themed attraction opens in Shanghai Disney Resort","url":"https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-ScenicSpots/20231225/34d96a5057fb4118a208d39fac4c1280.html","say":{"en":"How long is the wait for this ride?","zh":"这个项目要排多久？"}},"秦淮河":{"what":"流过南京城南的一条河，夫子庙一带两岸是老房子、灯笼和画舫。","what_en":"A river through the south of Nanjing; around the Confucius Temple (Fuzimiao) its banks are lined with old houses, lanterns and painted boats.","fame":"「十里秦淮」从六朝起就是南京最热闹的地方，很多古诗写的就是这里；现在晚上坐画舫看两岸的灯，是来南京必做的事。","fame_en":"The 'ten-li Qinhuai' has been Nanjing's liveliest place since the Six Dynasties, and many classical poems were written about it. Taking a painted boat past the lights at night is a must in Nanjing.","fact":"每年春节到元宵，夫子庙都办秦淮灯会；2008 年「秦淮灯彩」进了第二批国家级非物质文化遗产名录。","fact_en":"Every year from Spring Festival to the Lantern Festival, Fuzimiao holds the Qinhuai Lantern Fair; in 2008 Qinhuai lantern-making joined China's second national list of intangible cultural heritage.","src":"Wikipedia：Qinhuai lantern","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qinhuai_lantern","say":{"en":"Where do we buy tickets for the boat?","zh":"坐船在哪儿买票？"}},"文房四宝":{"what":"中国人写毛笔字、画国画用的四样东西：笔、墨、纸、砚。","what_en":"The four things you need for Chinese calligraphy and ink painting: brush, ink, paper and inkstone.","fame":"安徽宣城一带最有名：宣纸、徽墨、宣笔都出在这里，还有附近的歙砚；书法家和画家认这些名字，就像厨师认刀。","fame_en":"The area around Xuancheng in Anhui is the most famous: Xuan paper, Hui ink and Xuan brushes all come from here, with She inkstones nearby. Calligraphers trust these names the way chefs trust a knife.","fact":"宣纸 2009 年进了联合国非遗名录：纯手工要过一百多道工序，从原料到成纸要两年多。","fact_en":"Xuan paper joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list in 2009: made by hand, it goes through more than a hundred steps and takes over two years from raw material to sheet.","src":"UNESCO：Traditional craftsmanship of Xuan paper","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/traditional-craftsmanship-of-xuan-paper-00201","say":{"en":"Which paper is good for a beginner?","zh":"初学的话用哪种纸好？"}},"清明上河图":{"what":"北宋画家张择端画的一幅长卷，画的是都城汴京（今天的开封）清明时节的街景。","what_en":"A long scroll by the Northern Song painter Zhang Zeduan, showing street life in the capital Bianjing (today's Kaifeng) around the Qingming festival.","fame":"五米多长的画里有八百多个人，挑担的、算命的、开酒楼的、船差点撞桥的，每个人都在做事——像一千年前的街拍。现在收在北京故宫。","fame_en":"Over five metres long, it holds more than 800 people — porters, fortune tellers, innkeepers, a boat about to hit a bridge — all busy doing something, like street photography from a thousand years ago. It is kept in the Palace Museum in Beijing.","fact":"它很少拿出来：2015 年故宫全卷展出，周末排队要六个小时左右，有人通宵排，最后几天故宫开到了半夜。","fact_en":"It is rarely shown: when the Palace Museum unrolled the whole scroll in 2015, weekend queues were about six hours, some people waited overnight, and in the last days the hall stayed open past midnight.","src":"China Daily：Museum crowds wait six hours to see ancient scroll","url":"https://covid-19.chinadaily.com.cn/usa/2015-09/14/content_21852398.htm","say":{"en":"Is the real scroll on display right now?","zh":"现在展的是真迹吗？"}},"大足石刻":{"what":"重庆大足山崖上的一大片唐宋石刻，最有名的在宝顶山和北山。","what_en":"A large group of Tang and Song dynasty rock carvings on the cliffs of Dazu, Chongqing, the best known at Baodingshan and Beishan.","fame":"和别的石窟比，它特别「接地气」：除了佛像，还刻了养鸡的女人、喝醉的人、父母养孩子的辛苦，像一本刻在石头上的生活课。镇馆的是金光闪闪的千手观音。","fame_en":"Compared with other cave sites it is very down-to-earth: besides Buddhas there are carvings of a woman feeding chickens, a drunk man, parents struggling to raise children — a lesson about life carved in stone. The star is the golden Thousand-hand Guanyin.","fact":"千手观音其实没有一千只手：2008 到 2015 年大修时一只一只数过，是 830 只；前后花了约 6000 万元。","fact_en":"The Thousand-hand Guanyin does not have a thousand hands: during the 2008–2015 restoration they were counted one by one — 830. The work cost about 60 million yuan.","src":"The Tribune (Xinhua)：China restores 800-year-old Buddha statue with 1,000 hands","url":"https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/archive/world/china-restores-800-year-old-buddha-statue-with-1-000-hands-93314","say":{"en":"Can I take photos inside?","zh":"里面可以拍照吗？"}},"三星堆":{"what":"四川广汉的一处古蜀国遗址，挖出了三四千年前的青铜面具、神树和金器。","what_en":"An ancient Shu site in Guanghan, Sichuan, where bronze masks, bronze trees and gold pieces three to four thousand years old were dug up.","fame":"这里的东西跟中原的青铜器完全不像：眼睛凸出来的大面具、近四米高的青铜神树，到现在大家还在猜它们是谁做的、拿来干什么。","fame_en":"Nothing here looks like bronzes from central China: huge masks with eyes popping out, a bronze tree nearly four metres tall — people are still guessing who made them and what they were for.","fact":"1986 年挖出两个祭祀坑后，旁边又找到六个新坑，2021 年 3 月公布：出土五百多件，其中有半张金面具，约 280 克。","fact_en":"After two sacrificial pits were found in 1986, six more were found next to them; in March 2021 archaeologists announced over 500 finds, including half of a gold mask weighing about 280 grams.","src":"China Daily：New findings unveiled at legendary Sanxingdui Ruins","url":"https://govt.chinadaily.com.cn/s/202103/22/WS6057f828498e7a02c6f6a078/new-findings-unveiled-at-legendary-sanxingdui-ruins.html","say":{"en":"Do they know what these masks were used for?","zh":"知道这些面具是干什么用的吗？"}},"水上木偶戏":{"what":"越南北部的一种木偶戏：舞台是一池水，木偶在水面上跳舞、捕鱼、划龙舟。","what_en":"A puppet show from northern Vietnam where the stage is a pool of water and the puppets dance, fish and race boats on its surface.","fame":"演员站在齐腰深的水里，藏在竹帘后面，用水下的长竿操纵木偶；旁边一支乐队现场唱和打鼓。在河内还剑湖边的升龙水上木偶剧院每天都能看。","fame_en":"The puppeteers stand waist-deep in water behind a bamboo screen, moving the puppets with long poles under the surface, while a band sings and drums live. You can see it every day at the Thang Long theatre by Hoan Kiem Lake in Hanoi.","fact":"最早的记录是 1121 年的一块石碑，在越南河南省的龙队山寺（Long Đọi Sơn），写的是为李仁宗皇帝过生日演的一场水上木偶戏。","fact_en":"The oldest record is a stone stele from 1121 at Long Doi Son pagoda in Ha Nam province, describing a water puppet show for the birthday of Emperor Ly Nhan Tong.","src":"Vietnam National Puppetry Theatre：History of Water Puppetry","url":"https://nhahatmuaroivietnam.vn/en/node/998","say":{"en":"Two tickets for the six o'clock show, please.","zh":"两张六点那场的票，谢谢。"}},"阿普萨拉舞":{"what":"柬埔寨的宫廷古典舞，跳的是吴哥窟墙上刻着的仙女阿普萨拉。","what_en":"Cambodia's classical court dance, bringing to life the apsara — the heavenly dancers carved on the walls of Angkor Wat.","fame":"舞者动作很慢，手指向后弯成花瓣的样子，每个手势都有意思；吴哥的浮雕上刻了上千个这样的仙女。在暹粒晚上的剧场和餐厅都能看到演出。","fame_en":"The dancers move slowly, bending their fingers back like petals, and every gesture means something; Angkor's walls show well over a thousand of these figures. In Siem Reap you can watch shows in theatres and restaurants in the evening.","fact":"这门舞差点失传：红色高棉时期，几乎所有老一辈舞者和乐师都没了，1979 年后靠活下来的少数人一点点教回来；2003 年它被联合国列为非物质遗产代表作。","fact_en":"The dance nearly vanished: under the Khmer Rouge almost all the master dancers and musicians were lost, and after 1979 the few survivors rebuilt it step by step. In 2003 UNESCO proclaimed it a masterpiece of intangible heritage.","src":"UNESCO：Royal ballet of Cambodia","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/royal-ballet-of-cambodia-00060","say":{"en":"What does this hand gesture mean?","zh":"这个手势是什么意思？"}},"老挝芦笙":{"what":"老挝的「笙」（khaen）：一排长长短短的竹管，每根里有一片金属簧片，嘴吹着就能奏出和声。","what_en":"The khaen of Laos: a set of bamboo pipes of different lengths, each with a metal reed, that plays chords when you blow into it.","fame":"在老挝，婚礼、寺庙节日、村里聚会都少不了它；吹的人一边吹一边唱，大家跟着跳南旺舞。它被叫作老挝的国乐器。","fame_en":"In Laos there is no wedding, temple festival or village party without it; players blow and sing at the same time while everyone dances the lam vong. It is called the national instrument of Laos.","fact":"2017 年 12 月，「老挝人的芦笙音乐」进了联合国人类非物质文化遗产代表作名录。","fact_en":"In December 2017, 'Khaen music of the Lao people' was added to UNESCO's list of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity.","src":"UNESCO：Khaen music of the Lao people","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/khaen-music-of-the-lao-people-01296","say":{"en":"Is it hard to learn to play?","zh":"这个难学吗？"}},"卡车艺术":{"what":"巴基斯坦人把大卡车从头到尾画满花、鸟、诗句和风景，再挂上铃铛和链子。","what_en":"In Pakistan, lorries are painted from front to back with flowers, birds, poems and landscapes, then hung with bells and chains.","fame":"司机会把一年的收入花在给卡车「打扮」上，卡车就像他的家和名片；卡拉奇有上百家画卡车的作坊，一家人一起干。现在这种花纹也印到了杯子、包和墙上。","fame_en":"Drivers spend serious money decorating their trucks, which are their home and their business card. Karachi has hundreds of workshops where whole families paint them, and the style now turns up on mugs, bags and walls.","fact":"2002 年美国史密森民俗节上，巴基斯坦画师带去了一辆画满花纹的卡车；这辆 1976 年的贝德福德后来进了史密森的永久馆藏。","fact_en":"At the 2002 Smithsonian Folklife Festival, Pakistani truck artists brought along a fully painted truck; that 1976 Bedford is now in the Smithsonian's permanent collection.","src":"AramcoWorld：Masterpieces to Go: The Trucks of Pakistan","url":"https://archive.aramcoworld.com/issue/200502/masterpieces.to.go.the.trucks.of.pakistan.htm","say":{"en":"How long does it take to paint a whole truck?","zh":"画一整辆车要多久？"}},"帕劳承诺":{"what":"太平洋岛国帕劳给游客的一个「誓言」：入境时在护照上盖一个章，你要签名答应保护这里的自然。","what_en":"A pledge Palau asks visitors to make: on arrival a stamp goes in your passport, and you sign it, promising to protect the islands' nature.","fame":"帕劳只有一万多人，却每年迎来很多潜水和看珊瑚的游客；这句誓言是写给帕劳的孩子们的，提醒游客：别踩珊瑚、别喂鱼、别带走贝壳。","fame_en":"Palau has only around 18,000 people but receives many divers and coral lovers each year. The pledge is addressed to Palau's children and reminds visitors: don't step on coral, don't feed the fish, don't take shells.","fact":"2017 年 12 月起实行，帕劳因此成了第一个要求游客一入境就签环保誓言的国家。","fact_en":"It began in December 2017, making Palau the first country to require visitors to sign an eco-pledge on arrival.","src":"National Geographic：Palau's passport pledge","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/travel/destinations/oceania/palau/passport-stamp-ecotourism-pledge/","say":{"en":"Do I sign the pledge here, next to the stamp?","zh":"誓言是在这里签吗，章的旁边？"}},"恐龙博物馆":{"what":"日本福井县胜山市的县立恐龙博物馆，一个银色的大蛋形建筑，里面站着几十具恐龙骨架。","what_en":"The Fukui Prefectural Dinosaur Museum in Katsuyama, Japan — a big silver egg-shaped building with dozens of dinosaur skeletons inside.","fame":"它常被叫作世界三大恐龙博物馆之一（另外两个在加拿大和中国）；里面有会动会叫的霸王龙模型，附近还有真的化石发掘现场可以去参观。","fame_en":"It is often called one of the world's three great dinosaur museums, alongside ones in Canada and China. Inside there is a roaring, moving T. rex, and a real excavation site nearby that you can visit.","fact":"好几种日本新恐龙是在福井找到、用福井命名的：福井盗龙、福井龙、胜山越龙（Koshisaurus katsuyama）、福井猎龙……2023 年又多了一种 Tyrannomimus fukuiensis。","fact_en":"Several new Japanese dinosaurs were found in Fukui and named after it — Fukuiraptor, Fukuisaurus, Koshisaurus katsuyama, Fukuivenator — and in 2023 Tyrannomimus fukuiensis joined them.","src":"Wikipedia：Fukui Prefectural Dinosaur Museum","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fukui_Prefectural_Dinosaur_Museum","say":{"en":"Which one is the Fukuiraptor?","zh":"哪一具是福井盗龙？"}},"桃太郎":{"what":"日本最有名的民间故事：从河里漂来的大桃子里生出一个男孩，带着狗、猴子和野鸡去鬼岛打鬼。","what_en":"Japan's best-known folk tale: a boy born from a giant peach floating down a river sets out with a dog, a monkey and a pheasant to defeat the ogres of Ogre Island.","fame":"冈山说自己是桃太郎的故乡：冈山站前就站着桃太郎的铜像，当地特产吉备团子就是故事里他分给伙伴的点心，冈山也真的盛产白桃。","fame_en":"Okayama claims to be Momotaro's home: his bronze statue stands outside Okayama Station, the local sweet kibi dango is the snack he shares with his friends, and Okayama really is famous for white peaches.","fact":"江户时代有些版本里，桃太郎不是从桃子里蹦出来的：老夫妻吃了桃子变年轻，后来才生下了他——学者把这种叫「回春型」。","fact_en":"In some Edo-period versions Momotaro does not jump out of the peach: the old couple eat it, become young again and then have him — scholars call this the 'rejuvenation' type.","src":"Wikipedia：Momotarō","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Momotar%C5%8D","say":{"en":"Is this where I buy the kibi dango?","zh":"吉备团子是在这里买吗？"}},"有田烧":{"what":"日本佐贺县有田町烧的瓷器，白底上画蓝花或红金色的花纹。","what_en":"Porcelain made in Arita, Saga Prefecture, Japan — white with blue designs, or with red and gold patterns.","fame":"它是日本最早的瓷器之一，十七世纪就从附近的伊万里港坐荷兰船卖到欧洲，欧洲宫廷抢着买，所以在欧洲也叫「伊万里」。现在每年黄金周的陶器市有上百万人来逛。","fame_en":"It is among Japan's first porcelain; in the 1600s it sailed to Europe on Dutch ships from nearby Imari port and European courts competed to buy it, which is why Europeans also call it 'Imari'. Every Golden Week its pottery fair draws around a million visitors.","fact":"2016 年有田过了「瓷器 400 年」——从 1616 年朝鲜陶工李参平在泉山找到瓷石算起；不过也有历史学家怀疑这个故事。","fact_en":"In 2016 Arita celebrated 400 years of porcelain, counted from 1616 when the Korean potter Yi Sam-pyeong is said to have found porcelain stone at Izumiyama — though some historians doubt the story.","src":"Wikipedia：Yi Sam-pyeong","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yi_Sam-pyeong","say":{"en":"Is this dish safe for the microwave?","zh":"这个盘子能放微波炉吗？"}},"东京迪士尼":{"what":"千叶县浦安市的东京迪士尼乐园，1983 年开门，是美国以外第一座迪士尼。","what_en":"Tokyo Disneyland in Urayasu, Chiba, opened in 1983 — the first Disney park outside the United States.","fame":"它是全世界最热门的乐园之一；旁边还有一座只有日本才有的东京迪士尼海洋。日本人去迪士尼很讲究：穿成一套、戴同款发箍，排队等游行一坐就是一小时。","fame_en":"It is one of the busiest theme parks in the world, and next door is Tokyo DisneySea, found only in Japan. Japanese visitors take it seriously: matching outfits, matching ears, and sitting for an hour to save a spot for the parade.","fact":"它其实不是迪士尼公司开的：老板是日本的东方乐园公司，向迪士尼买授权，迪士尼一股都没有。","fact_en":"It is not actually run by Disney: it belongs to Japan's Oriental Land Company, which licenses the name and characters; Disney owns no share of it.","src":"Wikipedia：Tokyo Disneyland","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Disneyland","say":{"en":"Where's a good spot to watch the parade?","zh":"在哪儿看游行比较好？"}},"婆罗多舞":{"what":"印度南部泰米尔纳德邦的古典舞：脚下踏着节奏，手势、眼神和表情一起讲神话故事。","what_en":"A classical dance from Tamil Nadu in southern India: the feet beat out rhythm while hand gestures, eyes and facial expressions tell stories from mythology.","fame":"它是印度最有名的古典舞之一，女孩常从小学好几年，第一次正式独舞（arangetram）像毕业典礼一样隆重；每年 12 月金奈的音乐舞蹈季，几乎天天有演出。","fame_en":"It is one of India's best-known classical dances; girls often study for years, and their first full solo, the arangetram, is as big as a graduation. During Chennai's music and dance season every December there are shows almost every day.","fact":"它以前叫「萨迪尔」，主要是寺庙里的舞女跳；1935 年 Rukmini Devi 公开登台，1936 年在金奈办了舞蹈学院 Kalakshetra，改了很多规矩，它才走上大舞台。","fact_en":"It used to be called sadir and was danced mainly by temple dancers; Rukmini Devi performed it in public in 1935 and founded the Kalakshetra academy in Chennai in 1936, changing many conventions and bringing it to the big stage.","src":"Sahapedia：Rukmini Devi Arundale (1904–86)","url":"https://www.sahapedia.org/rukmini-devi-arundale-1904%E2%80%9386","say":{"en":"Is there a performance tonight during the festival?","zh":"节日期间今晚有演出吗？"}},"葛饰北斋":{"what":"江户时代的日本浮世绘画家（1760–1849），最有名的作品是《神奈川冲浪里》。","what_en":"A Japanese ukiyo-e artist of the Edo period (1760–1849), best known for 'The Great Wave off Kanagawa'.","fame":"那幅巨浪的版画印了很多张，现在全世界的博物馆、T 恤、手机壳上都有；他一生画了三万多幅，改了很多次名字，搬了几十次家，七十多岁才画出这幅浪。","fame_en":"The Great Wave was printed many times and is now everywhere — museums worldwide, T-shirts, phone cases. He made over 30,000 works in his life, changed his name many times, moved house dozens of times, and was past seventy when he made the wave.","fact":"2024 年 7 月 3 日起，日本新版一千日元钞票的背面就是《神奈川冲浪里》。","fact_en":"Since 3 July 2024 the back of Japan's new 1,000-yen note shows 'The Great Wave off Kanagawa'.","src":"日本财务省：Issuance of Bank of Japan Note in New Form","url":"https://www.mof.go.jp/english/policy/currency/banknotes/20231212.html","say":{"en":"Can you break this into thousand-yen notes?","zh":"能帮我换成一千日元的吗？"}},"印尼蜡染":{"what":"印尼的 batik：用小铜壶（canting）把热蜂蜡画在布上，再染色，蜡盖住的地方就留下花纹。","what_en":"Indonesian batik: hot wax is drawn onto cloth with a small copper pen called a canting, then the cloth is dyed, and the waxed parts stay as the pattern.","fame":"在印尼，batik 是日常也是正装：上班、婚礼、开会都穿。日惹和梭罗是爪哇蜡染的老家，不同的花纹以前代表不同的身份和场合，手画的一块布要做好几个星期。","fame_en":"In Indonesia batik is both everyday wear and formal dress — for the office, weddings and official meetings. Yogyakarta and Solo are the home of Javanese batik; different patterns once marked different ranks and occasions, and one hand-drawn piece can take weeks.","fact":"2009 年 10 月 2 日联合国把印尼蜡染列入非遗名录，印尼就把这一天定为「全国蜡染日」，这天很多人穿 batik 上班上学。","fact_en":"UNESCO listed Indonesian batik as intangible heritage on 2 October 2009, and Indonesia made that date National Batik Day — many people wear batik to work and school on it.","src":"Wikipedia：Batik Day","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Batik_Day","say":{"en":"Is this hand-drawn or stamped?","zh":"这块是手画的还是印的？"}},"吉普尼":{"what":"菲律宾满街跑的彩色小公交，车身长、后面开门，车头像美军吉普，全身画满图案、挂着装饰。","what_en":"The brightly painted minibuses of the Philippines: long bodies, an open back door, a nose like an army jeep, and covered in paintings and ornaments.","fame":"二战后美军留下很多吉普车，菲律宾人把它们加长改成公交，慢慢成了国家的标志；坐车时乘客把钱一个个往前传给司机，喊一声「Para po!」就下车。","fame_en":"After the Second World War the US military left many jeeps behind, and Filipinos stretched them into buses; they slowly became a national symbol. Passengers pass their fare forward hand to hand to the driver and shout 'Para po!' to get off.","fact":"这几年政府在推公共交通「现代化」，要求老吉普尼加入合作社、以后换成更环保的新车；第一步「合并」的截止期延了好几次，到了 2024 年 4 月底。","fact_en":"In recent years the government has pushed a public transport 'modernisation' plan requiring old jeepney operators to join cooperatives and later switch to cleaner vehicles; the deadline for the first step, consolidation, was extended several times, to the end of April 2024.","src":"Philstar：Unconsolidated jeepneys given '15-day leeway' after consolidation deadline","url":"https://www.philstar.com/headlines/2024/04/30/2351543/unconsolidated-jeepneys-given-15-day-leeway-after-consolidation-deadline","say":{"en":"Para po! I'll get off at the corner.","zh":"司机，我在路口下！"}},"宝莱坞":{"what":"以孟买为中心的印地语电影业，名字是孟买旧称 Bombay 加 Hollywood 拼起来的。","what_en":"The Hindi-language film industry centred on Mumbai; its name blends Bombay, the city's old name, with Hollywood.","fame":"宝莱坞电影一部常有三个小时，中间有歌有舞、有中场休息；大明星在印度像神一样，沙鲁克·汗的家门口每到生日都挤满粉丝。不过印度电影不只有宝莱坞，泰卢固语、泰米尔语电影也很大。","fame_en":"A Bollywood film is often three hours long, with songs, dances and an interval. Big stars are treated almost like gods — fans crowd outside Shah Rukh Khan's house every birthday. But Indian cinema is more than Bollywood: Telugu and Tamil films are huge too.","fact":"印度第一部长故事片《哈里什昌德拉国王》1913 年在孟买上映，是 Dadasaheb Phalke 拍的；当时找不到女演员，王后是男人演的。","fact_en":"India's first full-length feature film, 'Raja Harishchandra', was released in Bombay in 1913, made by Dadasaheb Phalke; he could not find an actress, so the queen was played by a man.","src":"Wikipedia：Raja Harishchandra","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raja_Harishchandra","say":{"en":"Is there an interval in this movie?","zh":"这部电影中间有休息吗？"}},"原住民艺术":{"what":"澳大利亚原住民的绘画，最有名的是用彩色小圆点一点点画出来的「点画」，画的是祖先的梦幻故事和土地。","what_en":"Art by Aboriginal Australians, best known for 'dot painting', built up from thousands of coloured dots that tell Dreaming stories of ancestors and the land.","fame":"每幅画里的符号像地图：圆圈可能是水洞或营地，弯弯的线是走过的路；很多故事只属于某个家族，画家只画自己有权讲的那部分。在爱丽丝泉的画廊和艺术中心能看到画家本人。","fame_en":"The symbols in each painting work like a map — circles can be waterholes or camps, curved lines the paths travelled. Many stories belong to particular families, and artists paint only what they have the right to tell. In Alice Springs you can meet artists at galleries and art centres.","fact":"画在画布上的点画其实很新：1971 年，爱丽丝泉附近帕普尼亚（Papunya）的几位长老在学校墙上画了一幅「蜜蚁」壁画，才带出了后来的帕普尼亚·图拉画派。","fact_en":"Dot painting on canvas is surprisingly recent: in 1971 elders at Papunya, near Alice Springs, painted a Honey Ant mural on the school wall, which sparked the Papunya Tula art movement.","src":"Wikipedia：Papunya Tula","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Papunya_Tula","say":{"en":"Can you tell me the story behind this painting?","zh":"能跟我讲讲这幅画背后的故事吗？"}},"霍比特人村":{"what":"新西兰北岛玛塔玛塔农场里的电影场景，就是《指环王》和《霍比特人》里的夏尔，一个个圆门小洞屋嵌在草坡上。","what_en":"The film set on a farm near Matamata on New Zealand's North Island — the Shire from 'The Lord of the Rings' and 'The Hobbit', with round-doored hobbit holes set into grassy hills.","fame":"导演彼得·杰克逊从飞机上看中了这片绵羊牧场；现在只能跟导游团进去，走完洞屋、池塘和绿龙酒馆，最后在酒馆喝一杯这里特酿的姜汁啤酒。","fame_en":"Director Peter Jackson spotted this sheep farm from the air. Today you can only visit on a guided tour, past the hobbit holes and the pond to the Green Dragon Inn, where the tour ends with a drink brewed for the set.","fact":"第一次拍《指环王》时造的 39 个洞屋是临时的，拍完大部分拆掉了；2009 年为拍《霍比特人》才用耐久的材料重建成现在的 44 个。","fact_en":"The 39 hobbit holes built for 'The Lord of the Rings' were temporary and mostly torn down afterwards; in 2009 the set was rebuilt with permanent materials for 'The Hobbit', giving today's 44.","src":"Hobbiton Movie Set：Our Story","url":"https://www.hobbitontours.com/en/our-story/","say":{"en":"Can we go inside any of the hobbit holes?","zh":"有哪个洞屋可以进去吗？"}},"墨尔本电车":{"what":"墨尔本满城跑的有轨电车，绿白相间的新车和老式木头电车一起在街上开。","what_en":"The trams that run all over Melbourne — modern green-and-white ones and old wooden ones share the streets.","fame":"电车是墨尔本人上班、上学的日常；市中心还有一条免费的老式环城电车，车上会报沿途的景点。注意看路口的「钩形转弯」：汽车右转要先开到最左边等。","fame_en":"Trams are how Melbourne gets to work and school, and in the city centre a free heritage City Circle tram announces the sights. Watch for the 'hook turn' at some junctions: cars turning right must first pull over to the far left and wait.","fact":"2015 年 1 月 1 日起，市中心成了「免费电车区」，在区里上下车不用刷卡；墨尔本的电车网约 250 公里，是世界上最大的城市电车网。","fact_en":"Since 1 January 2015 the city centre has been a Free Tram Zone, where you ride without tapping a card; Melbourne's network, about 250 km, is the largest urban tram network in the world.","src":"Wikipedia：Yarra Trams","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yarra_Trams","say":{"en":"Is this stop still inside the free zone?","zh":"这一站还在免费区里吗？"}},"毛利纹面":{"what":"新西兰毛利人的传统面部纹样（tā moko），男人多纹在整张脸上，女人纹在下巴和嘴唇（moko kauae）。","what_en":"The traditional facial markings of New Zealand's Māori (tā moko): men often wear them across the face, women on the chin and lips (moko kauae).","fame":"每道纹都有意思：祖先是谁、来自哪个部落、自己的身份。殖民时期它一度几乎消失，这几十年越来越多毛利人重新纹上，当作对自己文化的骄傲。在罗托鲁瓦的毛利文化村能听人讲它。","fame_en":"Every line means something: your ancestors, your tribe, your own standing. It almost disappeared under colonial rule, but in recent decades more and more Māori have taken it up again with pride. In Rotorua's Māori cultural villages you can hear people explain it.","fact":"2021 年 12 月，记者 Oriini Kaipara 主播新西兰黄金时段新闻，成了第一个下巴带 moko kauae 播报黄金时段新闻的人。","fact_en":"In December 2021 journalist Oriini Kaipara presented New Zealand's prime-time news, becoming the first person with a moko kauae to anchor a prime-time bulletin.","src":"Wikipedia：Oriini Kaipara","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oriini_Kaipara","say":{"en":"Is it okay to ask about the meaning of someone's moko?","zh":"可以问别人的纹面是什么意思吗？"}},"国际日期变更线":{"what":"斐济塔韦乌尼岛上，东经和西经 180 度那条经线正好穿过，岛上有个标牌，一脚在「今天」、一脚在「昨天」。","what_en":"On Taveuni in Fiji the 180° meridian runs right across the island, and a marker lets you stand with one foot in 'today' and one in 'yesterday'.","fame":"国际日期变更线大致沿着 180 度经线走，过了线日历就要加一天或减一天；能站在陆地上跨这条线的地方很少，塔韦乌尼的瓦伊耶沃（Waiyevo）就是一个，游客专门来拍照。","fame_en":"The International Date Line roughly follows the 180° meridian, and crossing it moves the calendar a day forward or back. There are very few places where you can straddle it on land; Waiyevo on Taveuni is one, and visitors come just for the photo.","fact":"其实在塔韦乌尼跨过去，日期并不会变：日期变更线在这里往东拐了个弯，绕开整个斐济，让全国都在同一天；180 度经线和日期变更线不是同一条线。","fact_en":"In fact your date does not change when you step across on Taveuni: the date line bends east here to go around all of Fiji, keeping the country on one date. The 180° meridian and the date line are not the same line.","src":"Wikipedia：Taveuni","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taveuni","say":{"en":"Can you take a photo of me standing on the line?","zh":"能帮我拍一张站在线上的照片吗？"}},"八百多种语言":{"what":"巴布亚新几内亚：一个大约一千万人的国家，说着大约 840 种语言，是世界上语言最多的国家。","what_en":"Papua New Guinea: a country of about ten million people speaking around 840 languages — more than any other country in the world.","fame":"高山和密林把村子隔开，几千年里各说各的话，有的语言只有几百人会说。大家之间靠 Tok Pisin（一种以英语为基础的混合语）沟通，「谢谢」就是 tenkyu。","fame_en":"Mountains and rainforest kept villages apart for thousands of years, so each kept its own tongue — some spoken by only a few hundred people. People talk across groups in Tok Pisin, an English-based creole, where 'thank you' is 'tenkyu'.","fact":"2015 年，巴布亚新几内亚手语成了这个国家的官方语言之一，跟 Tok Pisin、Hiri Motu 和英语并列。","fact_en":"In 2015 Papua New Guinean Sign Language became one of the country's official languages, alongside Tok Pisin, Hiri Motu and English.","src":"Wikipedia：Papua New Guinean Sign Language","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Papua_New_Guinean_Sign_Language","say":{"en":"How do you say 'thank you' in your language?","zh":"用你们的话「谢谢」怎么说？"}},"博茨瓦纳篮编":{"what":"博茨瓦纳西北部奥卡万戈三角洲一带的妇女用棕榈叶编的篮子，用树根、树皮染成深浅不同的棕色。","what_en":"Baskets woven from palm leaves by women around the Okavango Delta in north-west Botswana, dyed shades of brown with roots and bark.","fame":"一只大篮子要编好几个星期，编得密到能装水和谷子；花纹有名字，比如「长颈鹿的眼泪」「燕子飞过」，在马翁和哈博罗内的手工店都能买到。","fame_en":"A big basket takes weeks and is woven tight enough to hold water and grain. The patterns have names like 'tears of the giraffe' and 'flight of the swallow', and you can buy them in craft shops in Maun and Gaborone.","fact":"编篮子最出名的埃查（Etsha）一带的村子，是 1969 年从安哥拉战乱里逃过来的姆布库舒人建的，一共 13 个村子，名字就叫埃查 1 号到埃查 13 号。","fact_en":"The best-known basket villages, at Etsha, were founded by Hambukushu refugees who fled the war in Angola in 1969 — thirteen villages, named simply Etsha 1 to Etsha 13.","src":"Wikipedia：Etsha","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Etsha","say":{"en":"Who made this basket — is her name on the tag?","zh":"这只篮子是谁编的？标签上有她的名字吗？"}},"绍纳石雕":{"what":"津巴布韦的石雕：雕刻家用整块蛇纹石、皂石雕出人、动物和家庭，线条又圆又光。","what_en":"Stone sculpture from Zimbabwe: carvers shape whole blocks of serpentine and soapstone into people, animals and families with smooth, rounded lines.","fame":"从 20 世纪中叶起它就被欧美博物馆收藏，被很多人看作非洲最重要的现代雕塑之一；哈拉雷附近有露天雕塑园和雕刻村，能看到雕刻家现场干活。","fame_en":"Since the mid-20th century it has been collected by museums in Europe and America and is seen by many as one of Africa's most important modern sculpture movements. Near Harare there are open-air sculpture parks and carving villages where you can watch artists at work.","fact":"它出名靠的是 1972 年的两场大展：伦敦 ICA 画廊的《罗得西亚绍纳雕塑》和纽约现代艺术博物馆的展览，评论界一片叫好，世界才开始认真看它。","fact_en":"Its breakthrough came with two big shows in 1972 — 'Shona Sculptures of Rhodesia' at the ICA in London and an exhibition at the Museum of Modern Art in New York — which won huge critical acclaim.","src":"The Postcolonial Web：History of Shona sculpture","url":"https://postcolonialweb.org/zimbabwe/art/sculptors/history.html","say":{"en":"Is this carved from a single stone?","zh":"这是一整块石头雕的吗？"}},"树皮布":{"what":"乌干达布干达人用无花果树（mutuba）的树皮捶打成的布，颜色像土和铁锈。","what_en":"Cloth made by the Baganda people of Uganda by beating the bark of the mutuba fig tree; it is the colour of earth and rust.","fame":"以前它是国王和族长穿的，现在婚礼、葬礼、加冕还用得上；这是一种比织布还古老的做布办法。","fame_en":"It was once worn by kings and chiefs and is still used at weddings, funerals and coronations — a way of making cloth older than weaving itself.","fact":"2005 年联合国把「乌干达树皮布制作」宣布为人类非物质遗产代表作，2008 年正式列入名录；要在雨季剥皮，再用不同的木槌捶很久。","fact_en":"UNESCO proclaimed barkcloth making in Uganda a masterpiece of intangible heritage in 2005 and inscribed it on its list in 2008; the bark is stripped in the rainy season and beaten for a long time with different wooden mallets.","src":"UNESCO：Barkcloth making in Uganda","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/barkcloth-making-in-uganda-00139","say":{"en":"Is this barkcloth made by hand?","zh":"这块树皮布是手工捶的吗？"}},"Safari 是什么":{"what":"Safari 在斯瓦希里语里就是「旅行」，现在英语里专指坐越野车去草原看野生动物。","what_en":"In Swahili 'safari' simply means 'journey'; in English it now means riding out in a 4x4 to watch wild animals.","fame":"肯尼亚是 safari 的老家：从内罗毕出发可以去马赛马拉看角马大迁徙，内罗毕城边上还有一个国家公园，能拍到长颈鹿背后是摩天楼。在肯尼亚说 safari，很可能就是「出远门」，不一定看动物。","fame_en":"Kenya is safari country: from Nairobi you can go to the Maasai Mara for the wildebeest migration, and Nairobi even has a national park on its edge where giraffes stand in front of skyscrapers. In Kenya, 'safari' can still just mean a trip, animals or not.","fact":"这个词其实是从阿拉伯语 safar（旅行）进的斯瓦希里语；英语里 1860 年左右才开始当外来词用。","fact_en":"The word came into Swahili from Arabic safar, 'journey'; English began using it as a foreign word around 1860.","src":"Etymonline：safari","url":"https://www.etymonline.com/word/safari","say":{"en":"How early do we leave for the game drive?","zh":"看动物的车几点出发？"}},"波斯地毯":{"what":"伊朗手工打结的羊毛或丝绸地毯，伊斯法罕、大不里士、卡尚各有自己的花样。","what_en":"Hand-knotted wool or silk carpets from Iran; Isfahan, Tabriz and Kashan each have their own designs.","fame":"一张好地毯一平方米有几十万到上百万个结，织工一个个手打，大的要织一两年；在伊朗家里，地毯是嫁妆、是传家宝，也是存钱的方法。伊斯法罕伊玛目广场边的巴扎里就有很多老店。","fame_en":"A fine carpet can have hundreds of thousands to over a million knots per square metre, each tied by hand, and a large one can take a year or two. In Iranian homes a carpet is a dowry, an heirloom and a way to save money. The bazaar around Isfahan's Naqsh-e Jahan Square is full of old shops.","fact":"世界上最老的打结地毯不在伊朗：1949 年在西伯利亚阿尔泰山一座冻住的古墓里挖出来，约公元前 5–4 世纪，叫帕兹里克地毯，现在在圣彼得堡冬宫；它是不是波斯织的，学者还在争。","fact_en":"The oldest known knotted carpet was not found in Iran: it came out of a frozen tomb in Siberia's Altai mountains in 1949, dates from about the 5th–4th century BC, is called the Pazyryk carpet and is now in the Hermitage in St Petersburg — scholars still argue about whether it was woven in Persia.","src":"Wikipedia：Pazyryk carpet","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pazyryk_carpet","say":{"en":"How many knots per square metre does this one have?","zh":"这块每平方米有多少个结？"}},"图坦卡蒙面具":{"what":"古埃及少年法老图坦卡蒙下葬时戴的金面具，约十公斤黄金，镶着青金石和彩色玻璃。","what_en":"The gold mask placed on the boy pharaoh Tutankhamun at his burial — about ten kilograms of gold inlaid with lapis lazuli and coloured glass.","fame":"1922 年英国考古学家卡特在帝王谷找到了几乎没被盗过的图坦卡蒙墓，这张面具成了古埃及最有名的形象，比金字塔还常出现在书和海报上。","fame_en":"In 1922 the British archaeologist Howard Carter found Tutankhamun's almost untouched tomb in the Valley of the Kings, and the mask became the most famous image of ancient Egypt — on more books and posters than the pyramids.","fact":"它在开罗解放广场的埃及博物馆放了将近一百年；2025 年 11 月金字塔旁边的大埃及博物馆开门，图坦卡蒙的随葬品第一次全部放在一起展出，金面具就在大厅正中间。","fact_en":"It spent nearly a century in the Egyptian Museum on Tahrir Square; when the Grand Egyptian Museum beside the pyramids opened in November 2025, Tutankhamun's treasures were shown all together for the first time, with the gold mask at the centre of the hall.","src":"eNCA (Reuters)：King Tut's collection displayed for first time at Egypt's grand museum","url":"https://www.enca.com/lifestyle/king-tuts-collection-displayed-first-time-egypts-grand-museum","say":{"en":"Which way to the Tutankhamun galleries?","zh":"图坦卡蒙展厅往哪边走？"}},"菲斯皮革染坊":{"what":"摩洛哥菲斯老城里的露天皮革染坊，最有名的是舒阿拉（Chouara），几百个石头染池像一块大调色盘。","what_en":"The open-air leather tanneries in the old city of Fez, Morocco — the best known is Chouara, where hundreds of stone vats look like a giant paint palette.","fame":"工人站在池子里，用几百年不变的办法给皮子去毛、染色；颜色来自罂粟、薄荷、靛蓝等植物。游客从周围皮具店的阳台往下看，店家会递一枝薄荷让你闻着挡臭味。","fame_en":"Workers stand in the vats, cleaning and dyeing hides by methods unchanged for centuries, with colours from plants like poppy, mint and indigo. Visitors look down from the balconies of the leather shops around it, and the shopkeepers hand you a sprig of mint to hold against the smell.","fact":"皮子染色前，要先在石灰和鸽子粪混成的池子里泡好几天到两个星期，让皮子变软——那股味道就是这么来的。","fact_en":"Before dyeing, the hides soak for days — up to two weeks — in vats of lime and pigeon droppings to soften them; that is where the smell comes from.","src":"Le360：Inside Fez's Chouara Tannery","url":"https://en.le360.ma/culture/inside-fezs-chouara-tannery-how-moroccos-centuries-old-leather-craft-survives_5IIQOZO25JFMTIU5P5SLEZ7TV4/","say":{"en":"Can I just look from the terrace without buying?","zh":"我能只在阳台上看看，不买东西吗？"}},"非洲鼓":{"what":"西非的手鼓，用整块木头挖空做鼓身、蒙上羊皮；在加纳，婚礼、葬礼、节日、酋长出巡都要打鼓。","what_en":"Hand drums of West Africa, carved from a single piece of wood and covered with goatskin; in Ghana there are drums at weddings, funerals, festivals and chiefs' processions.","fame":"加纳的鼓不只是打节奏，很多是一套：大鼓、小鼓、铃一起配合，鼓手和跳舞的人会互相「对话」。在阿克拉的海边和文化中心常能看到鼓乐团。","fame_en":"Ghanaian drums do more than keep time: they often play as a set — big drums, small drums and bells together — and drummers and dancers 'talk' to each other. You can often see drum groups on Accra's beaches and at its cultural centres.","fact":"阿散蒂人的「会说话的鼓」阿通潘（atumpan）是成对打的，一高一低，模仿阿坎语的声调，能「说」出酋长的称号和谚语。","fact_en":"The Ashanti 'talking drums', the atumpan, are played as a high-and-low pair that copies the tones of the Akan language, so they can 'speak' a chief's titles and proverbs.","src":"Ghana News Agency：Talking drums in contemporary Ghana: The Atumpan in focus","url":"https://gna.org.gh/2023/03/talking-drums-in-contemporary-ghana-the-atumpan-in-focus/","say":{"en":"Can you show me a simple rhythm to start?","zh":"能教我一个简单的节奏入门吗？"}},"诺莱坞":{"what":"尼日利亚的电影业，主要在拉各斯，名字是 Nigeria 加 Hollywood 拼起来的。","what_en":"Nigeria's film industry, based mainly in Lagos; the name blends Nigeria with Hollywood.","fame":"诺莱坞电影成本低、拍得快，讲的是家庭、钱、宗教和城市生活，非洲各地的人都看；现在很多诺莱坞片子上了 Netflix 和 YouTube，一下传到全世界。","fame_en":"Nollywood films are cheap and fast to make and tell stories about family, money, faith and city life that people all over Africa watch. Many are now on Netflix and YouTube, reaching the whole world.","fact":"大家常把 1992 年直接发行录像带的电影《Living in Bondage》当作诺莱坞爆发的开始；到 2000 年代中期，按每年拍的电影数量，它成了世界第二大电影业。","fact_en":"The 1992 direct-to-video film 'Living in Bondage' is often seen as the start of Nollywood's boom, and by the mid-2000s it had become the world's second-largest film industry by number of films made each year.","src":"Wikipedia：Cinema of Nigeria","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cinema_of_Nigeria","say":{"en":"Is there a good Nollywood film you'd recommend?","zh":"有没有好看的诺莱坞电影推荐？"}},"汗哈利利市场":{"what":"开罗伊斯兰老城里的一个大集市，小巷里卖香料、铜灯、水烟壶、银器和纪念品。","what_en":"A great bazaar in Islamic Cairo where narrow lanes sell spices, brass lamps, shisha pipes, silver and souvenirs.","fame":"这里六百多年来一直是开罗的买卖中心；逛累了去老咖啡馆 El Fishawy 坐坐，喝一杯薄荷茶。砍价是规矩，店主会先请你喝茶。","fame_en":"For more than six centuries it has been Cairo's trading heart. When you are tired, sit at the old El Fishawy café with a mint tea. Bargaining is expected, and shopkeepers will offer you tea first.","fact":"它的名字来自一个人：14 世纪末马穆鲁克时期的官员 Jaharkas al-Khalili 在这里建了一座商队客栈（khan），约在 1382 到 1389 年间。","fact_en":"It is named after a man: in the late 14th century the Mamluk official Jaharkas al-Khalili built a caravanserai (khan) here, sometime between 1382 and 1389.","src":"Wikipedia：Khan el-Khalili","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khan_el-Khalili","say":{"en":"That's too much — can you do a better price?","zh":"太贵了，能便宜点吗？"}},"猫女神巴斯特":{"what":"古埃及的猫头女神巴斯特，管家、生育和欢乐；她的大神庙在尼罗河三角洲的布巴斯提斯。","what_en":"Bastet, the cat-headed goddess of ancient Egypt, who protected the home, childbirth and joy; her great temple stood at Bubastis in the Nile Delta.","fame":"古埃及人很爱猫：猫抓老鼠、护粮仓，家里的猫死了全家会剃眉毛表示哀悼；人们给巴斯特献上几十万只猫木乃伊。现在去埃及的博物馆，常能看到一排排包着布的猫。","fame_en":"Ancient Egyptians loved cats, which kept mice away from the grain; when a family cat died, the household might shave their eyebrows in mourning. Hundreds of thousands of cat mummies were offered to Bastet, and in Egyptian museums today you can see rows of them wrapped in linen.","fact":"1888 年埃及农民在贝尼哈桑附近挖出一大片猫墓地，约 18 万只、19.5 吨猫木乃伊被运到英国利物浦，1890 年 2 月拍卖后磨成了肥料。","fact_en":"In 1888 an Egyptian farmer dug up a huge cat cemetery near Beni Hasan; an estimated 180,000 cat mummies, weighing 19.5 tons, were shipped to Liverpool, auctioned in February 1890 and sold as fertiliser.","src":"National Museums Liverpool：Mummified cat","url":"https://www.liverpoolmuseums.org.uk/artifact/mummified-cat-11","say":{"en":"Are these all cat mummies in this case?","zh":"这个柜子里全是猫木乃伊吗？"}},"电影《卡萨布兰卡》":{"what":"1942 年的美国黑白电影，亨弗莱·鲍嘉和英格丽·褒曼主演，故事发生在二战时摩洛哥卡萨布兰卡的一家酒吧里。","what_en":"A 1942 American black-and-white film starring Humphrey Bogart and Ingrid Bergman, set in a bar in wartime Casablanca, Morocco.","fame":"它拿了奥斯卡最佳影片，常被选进「史上最伟大电影」的前几名；很多人知道卡萨布兰卡这座城，就是因为这部电影，到了城里先找「里克咖啡馆」。","fame_en":"It won the Oscar for Best Picture and often makes lists of the greatest films ever made. Many people know the city of Casablanca only through this film, and the first thing they look for there is Rick's Café.","fact":"整部电影都是在加州华纳兄弟的片场拍的，没有一个镜头在卡萨布兰卡；城里那家「里克咖啡馆」是 2004 年一位美国前外交官 Kathy Kriger 照着电影布景开的。","fact_en":"The whole film was shot at Warner Bros. studios in California, with not a single scene in Casablanca; the Rick's Café in the city was opened in 2004 by a former American diplomat, Kathy Kriger, modelled on the film set.","src":"Wikipedia：Rick's Café Casablanca","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rick%27s_Caf%C3%A9_Casablanca","say":{"en":"Does the pianist really play 'As Time Goes By' here?","zh":"这里的钢琴师真的会弹《时光流逝》吗？"}},"露西化石":{"what":"1974 年在埃塞俄比亚阿法尔地区哈达尔挖到的一具南方古猿骨架，约 320 万年前，保存了大约 40%。","what_en":"A skeleton of Australopithecus afarensis found at Hadar in Ethiopia's Afar region in 1974 — about 3.2 million years old and about 40% complete.","fame":"它证明了人类的祖先先学会直立走路，脑子才慢慢变大；名字来自发现那晚营地里一直在放的披头士歌曲《Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds》，埃塞俄比亚人叫她 Dinkinesh，意思是「你真了不起」。","fame_en":"It showed that our ancestors walked upright long before their brains grew large. She was named after the Beatles song 'Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds', played at the camp that night; Ethiopians call her Dinkinesh, 'you are marvellous'.","fact":"在亚的斯亚贝巴国家博物馆展出的大多是复制品，真骨头锁在恒温恒湿的库房里；2025 年 8 月她第一次去欧洲，在布拉格的捷克国家博物馆展了约两个月。","fact_en":"What you usually see in the National Museum in Addis Ababa is a replica; the real bones are kept in a climate-controlled vault. In August 2025 she travelled to Europe for the first time, for about two months at the Czech National Museum in Prague.","src":"PBS NewsHour：Ethiopian fossil Lucy leaves for her first exhibition in Europe","url":"https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/ethiopian-fossil-lucy-leaves-for-her-first-exhibition-in-europe","say":{"en":"Is this the real Lucy or a replica?","zh":"这是真的露西还是复制品？"}},"Hakuna Matata":{"what":"斯瓦希里语「没问题、别担心」，东非人日常就这么说，就像中文的「没事儿」。","what_en":"Swahili for 'no worries, no problem' — something people in East Africa say every day, like 'it's fine'.","fame":"1994 年迪士尼动画《狮子王》里狐獴丁满和疣猪彭彭唱了这句话，一下全世界都知道了；到了坦桑尼亚、肯尼亚，导游和服务员也爱跟游客说它，当地人日常更常说 hakuna shida 或 poa。","fame_en":"Disney's 1994 film 'The Lion King' made it famous worldwide through the meerkat Timon and warthog Pumbaa. Guides and waiters in Tanzania and Kenya love saying it to tourists, though locals in everyday talk often say 'hakuna shida' or 'poa'.","fact":"迪士尼在 1994 年《狮子王》上映前后就申请了这句话的商标；2018 年 12 月有人在网上请愿，要迪士尼放弃这个商标，很快就有超过 13 万人签名。","fact_en":"Disney filed to trademark the phrase around the 1994 release of 'The Lion King'; in December 2018 an online petition asking Disney to give it up quickly passed 130,000 signatures.","src":"CNBC：Disney accused over trademark of Lion King phrase 'Hakuna Matata'","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2018/12/21/disney-accused-over-trademark-of-lion-king-phrase-hakuna-matata.html","say":{"en":"Hakuna matata — no problem, I'll wait.","zh":"Hakuna matata——没事，我等一下。"}},"电影《马达加斯加》":{"what":"2005 年梦工厂的动画片：纽约动物园的狮子、斑马、长颈鹿和河马流落到马达加斯加岛上。","what_en":"A 2005 DreamWorks animated film in which a lion, zebra, giraffe and hippo from a New York zoo end up stranded on Madagascar.","fame":"电影里最抢镜的是狐猴国王朱利安和他的「I Like to Move It」；很多孩子就是从这部片子知道马达加斯加这个岛的。不过真的马达加斯加岛上没有野生的狮子、斑马和长颈鹿。","fame_en":"The scene-stealer is the lemur King Julien and his 'I Like to Move It' — many children first heard of Madagascar from this film. But the real island has no wild lions, zebras or giraffes.","fact":"狐猴只生活在马达加斯加；2020 年世界自然保护联盟的评估说，现存约 107 种狐猴里，103 种受到灭绝威胁，其中 33 种是极危，差不多三分之一。","fact_en":"Lemurs live only on Madagascar; a 2020 IUCN assessment found that 103 of the roughly 107 surviving lemur species are threatened with extinction, 33 of them — almost a third — critically endangered.","src":"IUCN：Almost a third of lemurs now Critically Endangered","url":"https://www.iucn.org/news/eastern-and-southern-africa/202007/almost-a-third-lemurs-now-critically-endangered-iucn-red-list","say":{"en":"Are there lemurs in this park?","zh":"这个公园里有狐猴吗？"}},"Afrobeats":{"what":"从尼日利亚、加纳唱红的流行曲风，把非洲鼓点和流行、嘻哈、舞曲混在一起；Burna Boy、Wizkid、Davido 都是代表。","what_en":"A pop style that took off from Nigeria and Ghana, blending African rhythms with pop, hip-hop and dance music; Burna Boy, Wizkid and Davido are among its stars.","fame":"这几年它从拉各斯唱到伦敦、纽约，歌在 Spotify、TikTok 上被全世界跟着跳；Wizkid 和 Drake 合作的《One Dance》、Rema 的《Calm Down》都上过很多国家的排行榜。注意 Afrobeats 和 1970 年代 Fela Kuti 的 Afrobeat 不是一回事。","fame_en":"In recent years it has spread from Lagos to London and New York, with songs danced to worldwide on Spotify and TikTok; Wizkid's collaboration with Drake on 'One Dance' and Rema's 'Calm Down' charted in many countries. Note that Afrobeats is different from Fela Kuti's 1970s Afrobeat.","fact":"2024 年格莱美第一次设「最佳非洲音乐表演」奖，第一个拿奖的是南非歌手 Tyla 的《Water》，同组还有 Burna Boy、Davido、Asake 和 Olamide。","fact_en":"In 2024 the Grammys added a Best African Music Performance award for the first time; the first winner was South African singer Tyla with 'Water', beating nominees including Burna Boy, Davido, and Asake with Olamide.","src":"CBS News：Tyla wins first Best African Music Performance award for \"Water\"","url":"https://www.cbsnews.com/news/tyla-water-first-best-african-music-performance-award-2024-grammys/","say":{"en":"Who's your favourite Afrobeats artist right now?","zh":"你现在最喜欢哪个 Afrobeats 歌手？"}},"贝宁青铜器":{"what":"古代贝宁王国（在今天的尼日利亚贝宁城）宫廷里的青铜和象牙雕塑、浮雕牌，有国王、武士和宫廷生活。","what_en":"Bronze and ivory sculptures and plaques from the court of the old Kingdom of Benin, in today's Benin City, Nigeria, showing kings, warriors and palace life.","fame":"它们是非洲最精美的金属艺术之一，用失蜡法铸造，几百块浮雕牌原来钉在王宫的柱子上，像一部宫廷历史书。现在大部分散在欧美的博物馆里。","fame_en":"They are among Africa's finest metalwork, cast by the lost-wax method; hundreds of plaques once covered the palace pillars like a history of the court. Today most of them are scattered across museums in Europe and America.","fact":"1897 年英军攻入贝宁城，把几千件青铜器抢走；2022 年德国把馆藏一千多件的所有权交还给尼日利亚，12 月第一批 20 件送回了阿布贾。","fact_en":"In 1897 British troops stormed Benin City and carried off thousands of bronzes; in 2022 Germany transferred ownership of more than a thousand pieces in its museums to Nigeria, and in December the first 20 were returned to Abuja.","src":"Federal Foreign Office (Germany)：Baerbock in Nigeria","url":"https://www.auswaertiges-amt.de/en/aussenpolitik/laenderinformationen/nigeria-node/baerbock-nigeria-2569892","say":{"en":"Where were these bronzes originally kept?","zh":"这些青铜器原来放在哪儿？"}},"肯特布":{"what":"加纳阿散蒂人和埃维人手工织的彩色条纹布，一条条窄布织好再拼成一大块。","what_en":"Colourful striped cloth hand-woven by Ghana's Asante and Ewe peoples — narrow strips woven separately, then sewn into a large piece.","fame":"以前只有国王和贵族能穿，现在毕业典礼、婚礼、国庆都穿；每种颜色和花纹都有名字和意思，比如金色是财富，绿色是丰收。库马西附近的邦维尔村是有名的织布村。","fame_en":"Once only kings and nobles wore it; now it appears at graduations, weddings and national celebrations. Every colour and pattern has a name and meaning — gold for wealth, green for harvest. Bonwire village near Kumasi is famous for its weavers.","fact":"2024 年 12 月，加纳的肯特布被列入联合国人类非物质文化遗产代表作名录。","fact_en":"In December 2024 Ghana's kente cloth was added to UNESCO's Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity.","src":"UNESCO：Kente textile","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/02130","say":{"en":"What does this pattern mean?","zh":"这个花纹是什么意思？"}},"奇幻棺材":{"what":"加纳首都阿克拉的木匠做的「特别形状」棺材：鱼、飞机、可乐瓶、手机、辣椒，形状说的是逝者生前的职业或爱好。","what_en":"Coffins made by carpenters in Accra, Ghana, in special shapes — fish, planes, cola bottles, phones, chilli peppers — showing the dead person's job or passion.","fame":"在加人（Ga）的葬礼上，人们相信生命会在另一个世界继续，所以要风风光光地送：渔民睡进鱼形棺材，司机睡进汽车。这些棺材现在也进了世界各地的美术馆。","fame_en":"At Ga funerals people believe life continues in another world, so the dead are sent off in style: a fisherman in a fish, a driver in a car. These coffins are now shown in art museums around the world.","fact":"它们在当地叫「谚语盒子」（abebuu adekai），一般认为是阿克拉泰希区的木匠 Seth Kane Kwei 在 1950 年代开始做的；1989 年在巴黎的《大地魔术师》展上展出后出了名。","fact_en":"Locally they are called 'proverb boxes' (abebuu adekai); they are usually credited to Seth Kane Kwei, a carpenter in Teshie, Accra, who began making them in the 1950s, and they became famous after the 1989 'Magiciens de la Terre' exhibition in Paris.","src":"Wikipedia：Fantasy coffin","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fantasy_coffin","say":{"en":"How long does it take to make one coffin?","zh":"做一口这样的棺材要多久？"}},"星球大战取景地":{"what":"突尼斯南部沙漠里的几个拍摄地，《星球大战》里卢克·天行者的家乡「塔图因星球」就在这里拍。","what_en":"Filming locations in the desert of southern Tunisia, where Luke Skywalker's home planet Tatooine was shot for 'Star Wars'.","fame":"马特马塔的柏柏尔人住在地下的「坑屋」里：在平地挖一个大圆坑，四周的墙里再挖房间，冬暖夏凉；1976 年剧组看中了这种房子，拿来当卢克的家。附近沙漠里还留着「莫斯·埃斯帕」的布景。","fame_en":"In Matmata the Berbers live in underground 'pit houses': a big round pit dug into flat ground with rooms carved into its walls, warm in winter and cool in summer. In 1976 the film crew chose one as Luke's home, and the Mos Espa set still stands in the desert nearby.","fact":"卢克家里的那几场戏是在马特马塔的西迪·德里斯酒店拍的，它现在还在营业，游客可以住在「卢克的家」里；《星球大战：克隆人的进攻》也回这里拍过。","fact_en":"The scenes inside Luke's home were shot at the Hotel Sidi Driss in Matmata, which still takes guests, so you can sleep in 'Luke's house'; 'Attack of the Clones' returned to film there too.","src":"Atlas Obscura（Slate）：Hotel Sidi Driss, Star Wars' Lars Homestead","url":"https://www.slate.com/blogs/atlas_obscura/2014/06/27/hotel_sidi_driss_star_wars_lars_homestead.html","say":{"en":"Can we stay overnight in the Star Wars room?","zh":"能在《星球大战》那个房间住一晚吗？"}},"瑞士近卫队":{"what":"梵蒂冈的卫兵，全部是瑞士人，负责保护教宗。","what_en":"The Vatican's guards — all Swiss citizens — whose job is to protect the Pope.","fame":"世界上最小、也最老的军队之一，1506 年成立；蓝红黄条纹的制服和长戟，是游客在圣彼得大教堂门口最想拍的画面。","fame_en":"One of the world's smallest and oldest armies, founded in 1506; their blue, red and yellow striped uniforms and halberds are what every visitor wants to photograph at St Peter's.","fact":"新兵每年 5 月 6 日宣誓，日子不是随便挑的：1527 年这一天罗马被洗劫，189 名近卫队员里有 147 人战死，掩护教宗克雷芒七世逃进圣天使堡。","fact_en":"New recruits are sworn in every 6 May for a reason: on that day in 1527, during the Sack of Rome, 147 of the 189 guards died covering Pope Clement VII's escape to Castel Sant'Angelo.","src":"Wikipedia · Sack of Rome (1527)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sack_of_Rome_(1527)","say":{"en":"Can I take a photo with the guards, or is that not allowed?","zh":"可以跟卫兵合影吗，还是不让拍？"}},"冰岛精灵":{"what":"冰岛民间传说里住在石头和熔岩里的「隐藏的人」（huldufólk）。","what_en":"The 'hidden people' (huldufólk) of Icelandic folklore, said to live in rocks and lava fields.","fame":"很多冰岛人说「我不一定信，但也不会说没有」；修路盖房碰到传说中的精灵石，有时真的会绕开或者小心搬走。","fame_en":"Many Icelanders say 'I don't necessarily believe, but I won't say they don't exist' — and roads and houses sometimes really do go around, or carefully move, rocks said to be elf homes.","fact":"雷克雅未克旁边的加尔加熔岩区修路时，一块传说是「精灵教堂」的 70 吨大石头 Ófeigskirkja 引起抗议；2015 年道路管理局把它整块挪到路边、放在相似的岩石旁边。","fact_en":"When a road was built through the Gálgahraun lava field near Reykjavík, a 70-tonne rock said to be an elf church, Ófeigskirkja, sparked protests; in 2015 the Road Administration moved it whole to the roadside, next to similar rocks.","src":"Iceland Monitor (mbl.is)，2015 年 3 月","url":"https://icelandmonitor.mbl.is/news/news/2015/03/18/elves_make_compromise_with_road_administration","say":{"en":"Is that rock really an elf house? Do people here still believe in them?","zh":"那块石头真是精灵的家吗？这儿的人还信吗？"}},"莫奈花园":{"what":"法国吉维尼村里莫奈自己设计的花园和睡莲池，他在这里住了四十多年。","what_en":"The garden and water-lily pond Monet designed himself in the village of Giverny, where he lived for over forty years.","fame":"《睡莲》系列两百多幅画的「原景」就在这里：日本桥、柳树和满池睡莲都还在，春夏去能看到画里的颜色。","fame_en":"It's the real scene behind his 200-plus Water Lilies paintings: the Japanese bridge, the willows and the pond full of lilies are all still there, in the same colours from spring to autumn.","fact":"睡莲池是莫奈 1893 年买下铁路对面的地、引了一条小溪的水挖出来的；村里人担心他种的外国水草污染河水，他写信给省里才拿到许可。","fact_en":"Monet dug the pond himself after buying land across the railway in 1893 and diverting a stream; villagers feared his exotic plants would pollute the water, and he had to write to the prefecture to get permission.","src":"Fondation Claude Monet · Water lily pond","url":"https://claudemonetgiverny.fr/en/decouvrir/water-lily-pond/","say":{"en":"Which way to the Japanese bridge, please?","zh":"请问日本桥往哪边走？"}},"法朵":{"what":"葡萄牙里斯本的传统民歌，一个人唱，配葡萄牙吉他，调子很忧伤。","what_en":"Lisbon's traditional song: one singer with a Portuguese guitar, usually slow and full of longing.","fame":"它唱的是葡萄牙人说的 saudade——想念远方的人或回不去的日子；晚上在阿尔法玛老城的小酒馆里听，灯一暗大家就安静下来。","fame_en":"It's about what Portuguese call saudade — longing for someone far away or a time that's gone; in the little taverns of Alfama the lights go down and the whole room goes quiet.","fact":"2011 年 11 月，法朵被联合国教科文组织列入人类非物质文化遗产代表作名录。","fact_en":"In November 2011, UNESCO added fado to its Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity.","src":"UNESCO 非物质文化遗产 · Fado","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/fado-urban-popular-song-of-portugal-00563","say":{"en":"Is there a fado show tonight? Do we need to book a table?","zh":"今晚有法朵演出吗？要订位吗？"}},"葡萄牙瓷砖":{"what":"葡萄牙的彩绘瓷砖 azulejo，最常见的是蓝白色，贴在教堂、车站和老房子的外墙上。","what_en":"Portugal's painted tiles, azulejos — most often blue and white — covering churches, stations and old house fronts.","fame":"五百多年来一直在用，整面墙能讲一个故事；里斯本走在街上随便一抬头就是一面花砖墙，是这座城市的颜色。","fame_en":"Used for over 500 years, a whole wall can tell a story; in Lisbon you just look up and there's a tiled façade — they're the colour of the city.","fact":"老瓷砖常被偷去卖，2007 年葡萄牙警察博物馆发起「SOS Azulejo」；从 2013 年起，在里斯本没有市政府批准拆掉有瓷砖的外墙是违法的。","fact_en":"Old tiles were often stolen and sold, so in 2007 Portugal's police museum started 'SOS Azulejo'; since 2013 it has been illegal in Lisbon to demolish a tiled façade without city permission.","src":"European Heritage Awards · SOS Azulejo Project","url":"https://www.europeanheritageawards.eu/winners/sos-azulejo-project/","say":{"en":"Are these tiles new or antique? Where were they made?","zh":"这些瓷砖是新的还是老的？在哪儿做的？"}},"格林童话":{"what":"德国格林兄弟 19 世纪收集整理的民间故事集，有《小红帽》《白雪公主》《灰姑娘》。","what_en":"The folk tales collected by the German Brothers Grimm in the 1800s — Little Red Riding Hood, Snow White, Cinderella and more.","fame":"两百多个故事被翻译成一百多种语言，几乎每个国家的孩子都听过；卡塞尔是兄弟俩工作多年的城市，有格林兄弟博物馆 GRIMMWELT。","fame_en":"Over 200 tales translated into more than 100 languages — children almost everywhere know them; Kassel, where the brothers worked for years, has the GRIMMWELT museum.","fact":"1812 年第一版里，想害死白雪公主的王后是她的亲妈；到 1819 年第二版才改成「后妈」。","fact_en":"In the first edition of 1812, the queen who wants Snow White dead is her own mother; she only became a stepmother in the second edition of 1819.","src":"Wikipedia · Evil Queen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evil_Queen","say":{"en":"Which Grimm story did you grow up with?","zh":"你小时候听的是哪个格林童话？"}},"阿姆斯特丹运河":{"what":"阿姆斯特丹老城一圈一圈的运河，17 世纪挖的，两边是窄窄的老房子。","what_en":"The rings of canals around Amsterdam's old town, dug in the 1600s and lined with narrow old houses.","fame":"2010 年列入世界遗产；坐船、骑车沿着河走就是阿姆斯特丹最日常的样子——这里的自行车比人还多。","fame_en":"A World Heritage Site since 2010; boating or cycling along the canals is everyday Amsterdam — a city with more bikes than people.","fact":"每年从运河里捞上来 1.2 万到 1.5 万辆自行车，市里的水务公司 Waternet 有专门的吊船「钓自行车」。","fact_en":"Between 12,000 and 15,000 bikes are pulled out of the canals every year; the city's water company Waternet runs a special crane boat for 'bike fishing'.","src":"Guinness World Records","url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/637317-most-bicycles-recovered-from-waterways-city","say":{"en":"Where can I rent a bike for the day?","zh":"哪里能租一天自行车？"}},"维也纳金色大厅":{"what":"维也纳音乐协会大楼里的大音乐厅，墙上和天花板都是金色的。","what_en":"The great concert hall of Vienna's Musikverein, with golden walls and ceiling.","fame":"维也纳爱乐乐团的家，被认为是世界上声音最好的音乐厅之一；每年 1 月 1 日的新年音乐会在这里演出，全世界几十个国家电视直播。","fame_en":"Home of the Vienna Philharmonic and often called one of the best-sounding halls in the world; the New Year's Concert on 1 January is broadcast live to dozens of countries.","fact":"2026 年的新年音乐会由加拿大指挥家亚尼克·涅杰-瑟甘第一次执棒；乐团说选他是想多和年轻一代的指挥合作。","fact_en":"The 2026 New Year's Concert was conducted for the first time by Canada's Yannick Nézet-Séguin; the orchestra said it wanted to work more with a younger generation of conductors.","src":"Vienna Philharmonic 官网","url":"https://www.wienerphilharmoniker.at/en/newyearsconcert/newyearsconcert2026","say":{"en":"Are there any standing tickets left for tonight?","zh":"今晚还有站票吗？"}},"克里特迷宫":{"what":"希腊神话里关着牛头人身怪物米诺陶洛斯的迷宫，原型被认为是克里特岛上的克诺索斯王宫。","what_en":"The labyrinth of Greek myth that held the Minotaur — often linked to the palace of Knossos on Crete.","fame":"克诺索斯是欧洲最早的文明之一米诺斯文明的中心，三千多年前的王宫房间多、走廊绕，难怪后人说它是「迷宫」。","fame_en":"Knossos was the heart of the Minoan civilisation, one of Europe's earliest; its 3,500-year-old palace has so many rooms and winding corridors that it's easy to see why it became 'the labyrinth'.","fact":"2025 年 7 月，克诺索斯和克里特岛另外几处米诺斯王宫一起，以「米诺斯王宫中心」列入联合国世界遗产。","fact_en":"In July 2025, Knossos and other Minoan palaces on Crete were inscribed together on the UNESCO World Heritage List as the 'Minoan Palatial Centres'.","src":"Greek Reporter，2025 年 7 月","url":"https://greekreporter.com/2025/07/13/unesco-minoan-palaces-greece-world-heritage-list/","say":{"en":"How long does it take to walk around Knossos?","zh":"克诺索斯逛一圈要多久？"}},"俄罗斯套娃":{"what":"俄罗斯的木头娃娃，打开一个里面还有一个小的，一层套一层。","what_en":"Russia's wooden nesting dolls — open one and there's a smaller one inside, again and again.","fame":"它是俄罗斯最有名的纪念品；莫斯科附近的谢尔吉耶夫镇是传统的套娃产地，到今天还有人手工车木、手绘。","fame_en":"Russia's best-known souvenir; Sergiev Posad near Moscow is a traditional home of the craft, where dolls are still turned and painted by hand.","fact":"第一套套娃一般认为是 1890 年代由车工兹维兹多奇金和画家马柳京做的，最大的娃娃抱着一只公鸡；1900 年在巴黎世博会上拿了铜奖。","fact_en":"The first set is usually credited to woodturner Vasily Zvyozdochkin and painter Sergey Malyutin in the 1890s — the biggest doll holds a rooster — and it won a bronze medal at the 1900 Paris World's Fair.","src":"Wikipedia · Matryoshka doll","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matryoshka_doll","say":{"en":"How many dolls are inside this one?","zh":"这个里面一共有几个？"}},"冬宫":{"what":"圣彼得堡的冬宫，沙皇以前的宫殿，现在是艾尔米塔什博物馆的主楼。","what_en":"The Winter Palace in St Petersburg, the tsars' old home and now the main building of the Hermitage Museum.","fame":"艾尔米塔什是世界上最大的博物馆之一，收藏三百多万件，从达·芬奇到伦勃朗都有；绿白相间的宫殿本身就是景点。","fame_en":"The Hermitage is one of the world's largest museums, with over three million objects from Leonardo to Rembrandt; the green-and-white palace is a sight in itself.","fact":"博物馆地下室住着几十只猫，专门抓老鼠，还有一位负责它们的「新闻秘书」；2020 年一位法国医生在遗嘱里给它们留了一笔钱。","fact_en":"Dozens of cats live in the basement to keep mice away, with their own 'press secretary'; in 2020 a French doctor left them money in his will.","src":"Wikipedia · Hermitage cats","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hermitage_cats","say":{"en":"Where's the entrance for people with online tickets?","zh":"网上买了票的从哪个门进？"}},"维京海盗":{"what":"大约一千年前从挪威、瑞典、丹麦出海的北欧人，会抢劫，也会做生意、开拓新地方。","what_en":"Norse seafarers from Norway, Sweden and Denmark around a thousand years ago — raiders, but also traders and settlers.","fame":"他们的长船能出远海也能开进河里，最远到过北美；今天的电视剧、游戏和北欧人的名字里到处有维京的影子。","fame_en":"Their longships could cross oceans and sail up rivers, reaching as far as North America; Viking echoes are everywhere in today's TV, games and Nordic names.","fact":"奥斯陆的维京船博物馆已经关门，三艘一千多年前的维京船正在搬进新馆，计划 2027 年以「维京时代博物馆」重新开放。","fact_en":"Oslo's Viking Ship Museum is closed; its three thousand-year-old ships are going into a new building, planned to reopen in 2027 as the Museum of the Viking Age.","src":"奥斯陆大学文化历史博物馆","url":"https://www.khm.uio.no/english/visit-us/viking-ship-museum/","say":{"en":"Where can I see Viking objects in Oslo right now?","zh":"现在在奥斯陆哪里能看到维京的东西？"}},"诺贝尔奖":{"what":"按瑞典人诺贝尔的遗嘱设立的奖，每年颁给物理、化学、医学、文学、和平方面做出大贡献的人。","what_en":"The prizes set up by the will of Swede Alfred Nobel, given each year for physics, chemistry, medicine, literature and peace.","fame":"世界上最有名的奖；每年 12 月 10 日（诺贝尔去世的日子）在斯德哥尔摩音乐厅颁奖，晚上在市政厅办宴会。","fame_en":"The world's best-known prize; it's handed out every 10 December — the day Nobel died — at the Stockholm Concert Hall, followed by a banquet in City Hall.","fact":"和平奖不在斯德哥尔摩发，而是同一天在挪威奥斯陆颁；这是诺贝尔遗嘱里写好的，他写遗嘱时瑞典和挪威还是联合王国。","fact_en":"The Peace Prize isn't given in Stockholm but in Oslo, Norway, on the same day — Nobel's will said so, written when Sweden and Norway were still in a union.","src":"The Oslo Book","url":"https://theoslobook.no/2016/08/21/nobel-peace-prize-oslo/","say":{"en":"Who do you think will win the Nobel this year?","zh":"你觉得今年诺贝尔奖会给谁？"}},"ABBA乐队":{"what":"瑞典流行乐队，两男两女，七十年代红遍世界。","what_en":"The Swedish pop group — two men, two women — who took over the world in the 1970s.","fame":"1974 年拿下欧洲歌唱大赛冠军，后来《Dancing Queen》《Mamma Mia》家喻户晓；斯德哥尔摩有 ABBA 博物馆，音乐剧和电影《妈妈咪呀！》也是用他们的歌。","fame_en":"They won Eurovision in 1974, then 'Dancing Queen' and 'Mamma Mia' became household songs; Stockholm has ABBA The Museum, and the musical and film Mamma Mia! are built on their music.","fact":"2022 年 5 月起，伦敦专门盖的 ABBA Arena 里，四个人以 1979 年样子的数字「分身」开演唱会；到 2026 年 4 月已经来了四百多万观众，演出延长到 2027 年。","fact_en":"Since May 2022, digital avatars of the four, as they looked in 1979, have been performing in a purpose-built ABBA Arena in London; by April 2026 over four million people had seen it, and the run is extended into 2027.","src":"Wikipedia · ABBA Voyage","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ABBA_Voyage","say":{"en":"I can't stop singing 'Dancing Queen' — have you seen ABBA Voyage?","zh":"我脑子里一直是《Dancing Queen》——你看过 ABBA Voyage 吗？"}},"彩绘牛车":{"what":"哥斯达黎加的传统牛车，木头车身和车轮上画满了彩色的花纹和星星。","what_en":"Costa Rica's traditional oxcarts, their wooden bodies and wheels painted with bright patterns and stars.","fame":"19 世纪牛车把中央谷地的咖啡运到太平洋港口，一趟要走十几天；今天萨尔奇小镇还有作坊手工做、手工画，节日游行里一定有它。","fame_en":"In the 1800s oxcarts carried coffee from the Central Valley to the Pacific ports, a trip of ten days or more; workshops in the town of Sarchí still build and paint them by hand, and no parade is complete without one.","fact":"1988 年它被定为哥斯达黎加的「国家劳动象征」；赶牛车的传统 2005 年被教科文组织宣布为非遗杰作，2008 年列入人类非物质文化遗产代表作名录。","fact_en":"In 1988 it became Costa Rica's national symbol of work; its oxcart traditions were proclaimed a UNESCO Masterpiece in 2005 and placed on the Representative List of Intangible Heritage in 2008.","src":"UNESCO 非物质文化遗产","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/oxherding-and-oxcart-traditions-in-costa-rica-00103","say":{"en":"Can I watch the artists paint? How long does one wheel take?","zh":"能看师傅画吗？画一个车轮要多久？"}},"萨摩亚纹身":{"what":"萨摩亚传统的纹身 tatau，男人的从腰一直纹到膝盖，女人的在大腿上。","what_en":"Samoa's traditional tattoo, tatau — for men from the waist to the knees, for women on the thighs.","fame":"用骨头和龟壳做的梳子一下一下敲进皮肤，要好几天；在萨摩亚它代表成年、责任和对家族的承诺，不是装饰。","fame_en":"It's tapped into the skin with combs of bone and turtle shell over several days; in Samoa it means adulthood, responsibility and commitment to family — not decoration.","fact":"英语的 tattoo 来自波利尼西亚语的 tatau；1769 年库克船长第一次环球航行时在塔希提记下了这个词，这是它第一次出现在英语里。","fact_en":"English 'tattoo' comes from the Polynesian word tatau; Captain Cook wrote it down in Tahiti in 1769 on his first voyage — its first known appearance in English.","src":"Wordorigins.org · tattoo","url":"https://www.wordorigins.org/big-list-entries/tattoo","say":{"en":"Is it OK to ask about the meaning of your tatau?","zh":"可以问问你的纹身是什么意思吗？"}},"迪士尼乐园":{"what":"加州阿纳海姆的迪士尼乐园，华特·迪士尼亲自盖的第一座迪士尼主题乐园。","what_en":"Disneyland in Anaheim, California — the first Disney theme park, built by Walt Disney himself.","fame":"1955 年 7 月 17 日开园，后来全世界的迪士尼乐园都照它的样子盖；2024 年接待约 1700 万人次，全世界排第二。","fame_en":"It opened on 17 July 1955 and every Disney park since has followed its model; with about 17 million visits in 2024 it was the world's second most-visited theme park.","fact":"睡美人城堡的吊桥是真的能升降的，可到现在只放下来过两次：1955 年开园那天，和 1983 年新幻想世界开幕。","fact_en":"Sleeping Beauty Castle's drawbridge really works — but it has only been lowered twice: on opening day in 1955, and for the new Fantasyland in 1983.","src":"Islands.com","url":"https://www.islands.com/1984297/disneyland-drawbridge-sleeping-beauty-castle-works","say":{"en":"What time is the fireworks show tonight?","zh":"今晚烟花几点开始？"}},"罗斯威尔外星人":{"what":"美国新墨西哥州的小镇罗斯威尔，1947 年传说有飞碟坠毁在附近，从此成了「外星人小镇」。","what_en":"Roswell, New Mexico, the small town where a 'flying saucer' was said to have crashed nearby in 1947 — and has been 'alien town' ever since.","fame":"街灯是外星人头的样子，有 UFO 博物馆，每年夏天办 UFO 节；它是全世界 UFO 迷必去的地方。","fame_en":"Its streetlights have alien heads, there's a UFO museum and a summer UFO festival — it's the place every UFO fan has to visit.","fact":"1994 年美国空军发布报告说，当年捡到的碎片来自一个绝密的高空气球项目「莫古尔计划」，用来侦测苏联核试验，没有任何外星人。","fact_en":"In 1994 the US Air Force reported that the debris came from Project Mogul, a top-secret high-altitude balloon programme to detect Soviet nuclear tests — no aliens involved.","src":"美国空军 · The Roswell Report","url":"https://www.af.mil/The-Roswell-Report/","say":{"en":"Do you actually believe something landed here?","zh":"你真的相信有东西在这儿着陆过吗？"}},"摇滚名人堂":{"what":"俄亥俄州克利夫兰湖边的摇滚乐博物馆，玻璃金字塔是贝聿铭设计的。","what_en":"The rock music museum on Cleveland's lakefront, in a glass pyramid designed by I. M. Pei.","fame":"1995 年开馆，收着猫王、披头士、皇后乐队等人的乐器和演出服；每年选出入堂的音乐人，是音乐圈的大新闻。","fame_en":"Opened in 1995, it holds instruments and stage clothes from Elvis, the Beatles, Queen and more; each year's inductees are big music news.","fact":"为什么在克利夫兰？电台 DJ 艾伦·弗里德在这里把「rock and roll」这个说法推广开，1952 年 3 月他办的「月亮狗加冕舞会」被认为是第一场大型摇滚演唱会；1986 年克利夫兰争取了一年才拿到名人堂。","fact_en":"Why Cleveland? DJ Alan Freed popularised the term 'rock and roll' on radio here, and his Moondog Coronation Ball in March 1952 is often called the first major rock concert; the city lobbied for a year before winning the Hall in 1986.","src":"Encyclopedia of Cleveland History（凯斯西储大学）","url":"https://case.edu/ech/articles/r/rock-and-roll-hall-fame-and-museum","say":{"en":"Who do you think should get in this year?","zh":"你觉得今年谁该入选？"}},"迪士尼世界":{"what":"佛罗里达奥兰多的华特迪士尼世界度假区，有四个主题乐园、两个水上乐园和很多酒店。","what_en":"Walt Disney World near Orlando, Florida: four theme parks, two water parks and dozens of hotels.","fame":"里面的魔法王国是世界上游客最多的主题乐园，2024 年接待约 1780 万人次，二十多年一直排第一。","fame_en":"Its Magic Kingdom is the world's most-visited theme park — about 17.8 million visits in 2024 — and has been number one for over 25 years.","fact":"华特·迪士尼 1966 年去世，没等到它开园；1971 年 10 月 1 日开园时，哥哥罗伊坚持把名字从「迪士尼世界」改成「华特迪士尼世界」来纪念弟弟，两个多月后罗伊也去世了。","fact_en":"Walt Disney died in 1966, before it opened; when it opened on 1 October 1971, his brother Roy insisted on 'Walt Disney World' instead of 'Disney World' in his memory — and Roy died just weeks later.","src":"Wikipedia · Walt Disney World","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walt_Disney_World","say":{"en":"Which park should we do first if we only have two days?","zh":"只有两天的话，先去哪个园？"}},"史密森尼博物馆":{"what":"美国华盛顿的史密森尼学会，一共十几座博物馆和一座国家动物园。","what_en":"The Smithsonian Institution in Washington, D.C. — around twenty museums plus the National Zoo.","fame":"全部免费；国家航空航天博物馆有莱特兄弟的飞机和阿波罗 11 号指挥舱，自然历史博物馆有恐龙和希望钻石。","fame_en":"Every one is free; the Air and Space Museum has the Wright Flyer and the Apollo 11 command module, and Natural History has dinosaurs and the Hope Diamond.","fact":"出钱建它的詹姆斯·史密森是英国科学家，一辈子没去过美国，也没跟美国人通过信；他 1829 年去世，遗嘱里把钱留给美国，至今没人知道为什么。","fact_en":"Its founder, British scientist James Smithson, never visited the US and seems never to have written to anyone there; when he died in 1829 he left his fortune to the United States — and nobody knows why.","src":"Smithsonian 官网 · James Smithson","url":"https://si.edu/newsdesk/factsheets/james-smithson-biographical-information","say":{"en":"Which museum has the space shuttle — is it here on the Mall?","zh":"航天飞机在哪个馆？在国家广场这边吗？"}},"耶鲁大学":{"what":"美国康涅狄格州纽黑文的大学，1701 年创办，常春藤盟校之一。","what_en":"The university in New Haven, Connecticut, founded in 1701 — one of the Ivy League.","fame":"出过好几位美国总统和很多诺贝尔奖得主；哥特式的老楼和住宿学院制度让校园像一座城堡。","fame_en":"It has produced several US presidents and many Nobel laureates; its Gothic buildings and residential colleges make the campus feel like a castle town.","fact":"「耶鲁」这个名字来自商人伊莱休·耶鲁：1718 年他捐了九包货物卖钱、417 本书和一幅英王乔治一世的画像，学校就改名叫耶鲁学院。","fact_en":"The name comes from merchant Elihu Yale: in 1718 he gave nine bales of goods to sell, 417 books and a portrait of King George I — and the school was renamed Yale College.","src":"Yale University · Traditions & History","url":"https://www.yale.edu/about-yale/traditions-history","say":{"en":"Is the campus open to visitors? Is there a free tour?","zh":"校园对游客开放吗？有免费的导览吗？"}},"绿山墙的安妮":{"what":"加拿大作家蒙哥马利 1908 年的小说，写红头发的孤儿安妮在爱德华王子岛的绿屋子里长大。","what_en":"L. M. Montgomery's 1908 novel about red-haired orphan Anne growing up in a green-roofed farmhouse on Prince Edward Island.","fame":"一百多年来被翻译成几十种语言；岛上卡文迪什的「绿山墙」农舍现在是国家历史遗址，夏天很多读者专程来看。","fame_en":"Translated into dozens of languages over a century; the Green Gables farmhouse in Cavendish is now a national historic site, and readers come every summer.","fact":"它在日本特别红：1952 年村冈花子的日译本《红发安妮》出版，后来进了学校课本；2014 年 NHK 还把她翻译这本书的故事拍成了晨间剧。","fact_en":"It's hugely popular in Japan: Hanako Muraoka's translation 'Red-Haired Anne' came out in 1952 and entered school reading; in 2014 NHK made a morning drama about her translating it.","src":"Tourism PEI · Anne of Green Gables in Japan","url":"https://tourismpei.com/media/story-ideas/anne-of-green-gables/anne-of-green-gables-in-japan","say":{"en":"Is this the real house from the book?","zh":"这就是书里那座房子吗？"}},"新奥尔良爵士乐":{"what":"二十世纪初在美国新奥尔良诞生的音乐，融合了非洲节奏、布鲁斯和军乐队铜管。","what_en":"The music born in New Orleans in the early 1900s, mixing African rhythms, blues and brass-band marching music.","fame":"路易斯·阿姆斯特朗就出生在这里；今天法语区的 Frenchmen Street 每晚都有现场爵士，街头还会遇到铜管乐队游行。","fame_en":"Louis Armstrong was born here; today Frenchmen Street has live jazz every night, and you can still run into brass bands parading down the street.","fact":"新奥尔良的机场叫「路易斯·阿姆斯特朗新奥尔良国际机场」：2001 年为了纪念他诞辰一百年改的名字。","fact_en":"New Orleans' airport is Louis Armstrong New Orleans International — renamed in 2001 for the 100th anniversary of his birth.","src":"Wikipedia · Louis Armstrong New Orleans International Airport","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis_Armstrong_New_Orleans_International_Airport","say":{"en":"Is there a cover charge, or do we just buy a drink?","zh":"要付入场费吗，还是点杯饮料就行？"}},"乡村音乐":{"what":"美国南方乡村来的流行音乐，吉他、小提琴，唱生活、家乡和心碎。","what_en":"America's music from the rural South — guitars and fiddles, songs about everyday life, home and heartbreak.","fame":"田纳西州纳什维尔是它的中心，叫「音乐之城」：百老汇大街一排酒吧从中午就有现场演出，唱片公司和录音棚也都在这儿。","fame_en":"Nashville, Tennessee, is its capital — 'Music City': the honky-tonks on Broadway have live music from noon, and the labels and studios are all here.","fact":"纳什维尔的《大奥普里》1925 年 11 月 28 日第一次在电台播出，是世界上播得最久的电台节目；2025 年办了一百周年。","fact_en":"Nashville's Grand Ole Opry first went on air on 28 November 1925 and is the world's longest-running radio show; it celebrated 100 years in 2025.","src":"Country Music Hall of Fame","url":"https://countrymusichalloffame.org/press/releases/country-music-hall-of-fame-and-museum-to-commemorate-100-years-of-the-grand-old-opry-with-exhibition-the-grandest-stage-the-opry-at-100","say":{"en":"I'm not really into country, but this band is great live.","zh":"我平时不怎么听乡村，但这个乐队现场真好听。"}},"哈瓦那老爷车":{"what":"古巴首都哈瓦那街上跑的上世纪五十年代美国老汽车，颜色鲜艳，很多当出租车。","what_en":"The 1950s American cars still running on the streets of Havana — brightly painted, many working as taxis.","fame":"1959 年革命后美国禁运，新车进不来，古巴人只好把老车一修再修；今天坐敞篷老爷车绕城一圈是游客最想做的事。","fame_en":"After the 1959 revolution and the US embargo, new cars couldn't come in, so Cubans kept fixing the old ones; a ride round the city in an open-top classic is what every visitor wants.","fact":"革命后几十年，古巴人只能自由买卖 1959 年以前的老车（当地叫 almendrones）；直到 2011 年才第一次允许老百姓自由买卖各个年份的汽车。","fact_en":"For decades after the revolution, Cubans could freely trade only pre-1959 cars (locally called almendrones); only in 2011 were ordinary people allowed to buy and sell cars of any year.","src":"VOA News，2011 年 9 月","url":"https://blogs.voanews.com/breaking-news/2011/09/28/cuba-eases-ban-on-car-sales","say":{"en":"How much for one hour around the city in this car?","zh":"坐这辆车绕城一小时多少钱？"}},"加勒比海盗":{"what":"十七、十八世纪在加勒比海抢商船的海盗，比如黑胡子。","what_en":"The pirates who raided ships in the Caribbean in the 1600s and 1700s — Blackbeard and the rest.","fame":"那时运金银的西班牙船队从这片海经过，海盗、私掠船和殖民者混在一起；后来的小说、电影把他们变成了骷髅旗和藏宝图的故事。","fame_en":"Spanish fleets carrying silver and gold sailed through these waters, among pirates, privateers and colonists; novels and films later turned them into skull flags and treasure maps.","fact":"牙买加的皇家港当年是海盗的大本营，被叫作「世界上最邪恶的城市」；1692 年 6 月 7 日一场大地震，城市三分之二沉进了海里，今天是水下考古遗址。","fact_en":"Port Royal in Jamaica was a pirate base nicknamed 'the wickedest city on Earth'; on 7 June 1692 an earthquake sank about two-thirds of it into the sea — it's now an underwater archaeological site.","src":"National Geographic","url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/history/history-magazine/article/how-the-wickedest-city-on-earth-was-sunk-by-an-earthquake","say":{"en":"Is there a boat trip to the old pirate town?","zh":"有去老海盗城的船吗？"}},"纳斯卡线条":{"what":"秘鲁南部沙漠地面上刻出的巨大图案和直线，有蜂鸟、猴子、蜘蛛。","what_en":"Giant figures and lines scratched into the desert floor of southern Peru — a hummingbird, a monkey, a spider.","fame":"两千多年前的纳斯卡人做的，有的图案几百米长，只有坐小飞机从天上看才能看全；1994 年列入世界遗产。","fame_en":"Made by the Nazca people around 2,000 years ago, some figures are hundreds of metres long and can only be seen whole from a small plane; a World Heritage Site since 1994.","fact":"2024 年日本山形大学和 IBM 用 AI 看无人机照片，半年里新找到 303 个图案，让已知的图案几乎翻了一倍。","fact_en":"In 2024, Japan's Yamagata University and IBM used AI on drone images to find 303 new figures in six months — nearly doubling the number known.","src":"Andina（秘鲁通讯社），2024 年 9 月","url":"https://andina.pe/ingles/noticia-perus-nazca-lines-303-new-geoglyphs-discovered-with-help-of-ai-1001507.aspx","say":{"en":"How long is the flight over the lines? Is it bumpy?","zh":"看线条的飞机要飞多久？会很颠吗？"}},"波萨诺瓦":{"what":"五十年代末从巴西里约热内卢出来的音乐，桑巴的节奏加爵士和声，唱得很轻。","what_en":"Music born in Rio de Janeiro in the late 1950s: samba rhythm with jazz harmony, sung softly.","fame":"《伊帕内玛女孩》是世界上被翻唱最多的歌之一，1965 年英语版拿了格莱美年度唱片；今天咖啡馆里放的背景音乐很多就是它。","fame_en":"'The Girl from Ipanema' is one of the most-recorded songs ever, and its English version won the 1965 Grammy for Record of the Year; a lot of café background music today is bossa nova.","fact":"这首歌是汤姆·若宾和维尼修斯 1962 年在伊帕内玛海滩附近的 Veloso 酒吧写的，灵感是天天路过去海边的少女埃洛伊莎；后来酒吧干脆改名叫「伊帕内玛女孩」。","fact_en":"Tom Jobim and Vinicius de Moraes wrote it in 1962 at the Veloso bar near Ipanema beach, inspired by Heloísa, a girl who walked past on her way to the sea; the bar later renamed itself 'Garota de Ipanema'.","src":"Wikipedia · The Girl from Ipanema","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Girl_from_Ipanema","say":{"en":"This is so relaxing — is it bossa nova?","zh":"好放松啊——这是波萨诺瓦吗？"}},"帕丁顿熊":{"what":"英国作家迈克尔·邦德笔下的小熊，戴红帽子、穿蓝色粗呢大衣，从秘鲁偷渡到伦敦。","what_en":"Michael Bond's little bear in a red hat and blue duffel coat, who stows away from Peru to London.","fame":"1958 年第一本书出版，他在伦敦帕丁顿车站被一家人收养，所以叫帕丁顿；爱吃橘子酱三明治，电影三部曲让全世界都认识了他。","fame_en":"In the first book (1958) a family finds him at London's Paddington Station and names him after it; he loves marmalade sandwiches, and the films made him famous worldwide.","fact":"邦德一开始写的是小熊来自「最黑暗的非洲」，经纪人提醒他非洲没有熊，他才改成了有眼镜熊的秘鲁；2024 年的第三部电影《帕丁顿熊 3》就讲他回秘鲁。","fact_en":"Bond first had the bear coming from 'darkest Africa'; his agent pointed out there are no bears in Africa, so he switched to Peru, home of the spectacled bear — and the 2024 film Paddington in Peru takes him back there.","src":"Wikipedia · Paddington Bear","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paddington_Bear","say":{"en":"Have you seen the new Paddington? I cried a bit, not gonna lie.","zh":"你看了新的帕丁顿吗？说实话我有点哭了。"}},"黄金博物馆":{"what":"哥伦比亚首都波哥大的黄金博物馆，由哥伦比亚央行管理。","what_en":"Bogotá's Gold Museum, run by Colombia's central bank.","fame":"收藏三万多件前哥伦布时期的金器，是世界上同类收藏最大的；最后一个展厅灯一暗一亮，满屋子的金子闪起来，游客都会「哇」一声。","fame_en":"Its 30,000-plus pre-Columbian gold pieces make it the largest collection of its kind; in the last room the lights dim and come up on walls of gold, and everyone goes 'wow'.","fact":"镇馆之宝「穆伊斯卡金筏」1969 年在波哥大附近的帕斯卡被农民发现：小小的金筏上站着首领和随从，正是「黄金国（El Dorado）」传说里首领全身涂金、坐筏子到瓜塔维塔湖献祭的场景。","fact_en":"Its star piece, the Muisca Raft, was found by farmers near Pasca in 1969: a tiny gold raft with a chief and attendants — the very ritual behind the El Dorado legend, where a gold-covered chief sails onto Lake Guatavita to make offerings.","src":"Wikipedia · Muisca raft","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muisca_raft","say":{"en":"Is there a free day, or a discount for students?","zh":"有免费日吗？学生有优惠吗？"}},"选美王国":{"what":"委内瑞拉是选美大国，「委内瑞拉小姐」比赛在国内是全民大事。","what_en":"Venezuela is a beauty-pageant powerhouse; the Miss Venezuela contest is a national event.","fame":"委内瑞拉拿过 7 次环球小姐，选手在专门的选美学校训练走台、说话、上镜；比赛直播的晚上很多家庭一起守在电视前。","fame_en":"Venezuela has won Miss Universe seven times; contestants train at dedicated pageant schools in walking, speaking and posing, and families gather round the TV on the night.","fact":"2013 年委内瑞拉的加芙列拉·伊斯勒在莫斯科拿下环球小姐，是这个国家第七顶后冠，次数在历史上排第二，只比美国少。","fact_en":"In 2013, Venezuela's Gabriela Isler won Miss Universe in Moscow — the country's seventh crown, the second-most in the pageant's history after the United States.","src":"Wikipedia · Miss Universe 2013","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miss_Universe_2013","say":{"en":"Are you watching Miss Venezuela tonight?","zh":"今晚你看委内瑞拉小姐吗？"}},"梵蒂冈邮票":{"what":"世界上最小的国家梵蒂冈自己发行的邮票。","what_en":"The postage stamps issued by Vatican City, the world's smallest country.","fame":"梵蒂冈有自己的邮局，游客在圣彼得广场旁边买张明信片、贴梵蒂冈邮票寄出去，是很受欢迎的纪念；邮票题材是教宗、宗教节日和艺术品，收藏的人很多。","fame_en":"The Vatican runs its own post office; buying a postcard by St Peter's Square and sending it with a Vatican stamp is a favourite souvenir, and its stamps — popes, feast days, artworks — are widely collected.","fact":"1929 年 2 月《拉特兰条约》让梵蒂冈成了独立国家，同年 8 月 1 日它发行了第一套邮票，一共 15 枚，上面是当时的教宗庇护十一世。","fact_en":"The Lateran Treaty made Vatican City independent in February 1929; on 1 August that year it issued its first set of 15 stamps, showing the reigning Pope Pius XI.","src":"Smithsonian National Postal Museum","url":"https://postalmuseum.si.edu/exhibition/international-philately-europe-southern-europe/vatican-city","say":{"en":"One stamp for a postcard to China, please.","zh":"寄一张明信片到中国，要一张邮票。"}},"欧元":{"what":"欧盟二十多个国家共用的货币，欧洲央行在德国法兰克福。","what_en":"The currency shared by twenty-odd EU countries, managed by the European Central Bank in Frankfurt.","fame":"2002 年纸币硬币开始流通，从此在这些国家之间旅行不用换钱；纸币上的门窗和桥都是虚构的，代表不同的建筑时代，不偏向任何一个国家。","fame_en":"Notes and coins arrived in 2002, so travellers between these countries no longer change money; the windows, doors and bridges on the notes are invented, showing architectural eras without favouring any country.","fact":"荷兰设计师罗宾·斯塔姆觉得好玩，2011 到 2013 年在家乡斯派克尼瑟真的把七张钞票背面的七座桥都造了出来，颜色也照着钞票刷。","fact_en":"Dutch designer Robin Stam thought it would be fun to make them real: between 2011 and 2013 his hometown of Spijkenisse built all seven bridges from the backs of the notes, painted in the banknote colours.","src":"Dezeen，2013 年 6 月","url":"https://www.dezeen.com/2013/06/05/the-bridges-of-europe-robin-stam-copied-from-euro-banknotes-/","say":{"en":"Can I pay by card, or is it cash only?","zh":"能刷卡吗，还是只收现金？"}},"英镑":{"what":"英国的货币，符号是 £，由英格兰银行发行。","what_en":"The UK's currency, symbol £, issued by the Bank of England.","fame":"它是世界上还在用的最古老的货币之一；现在的塑料钞票背面印着丘吉尔、简·奥斯汀、画家透纳和计算机科学家图灵。","fame_en":"It's one of the oldest currencies still in use; today's plastic notes carry Churchill, Jane Austen, the painter Turner and computer scientist Alan Turing on the back.","fact":"2024 年 6 月 5 日，印着国王查尔斯三世头像的钞票第一次流通；印女王的旧钞照样能用，新钞只在替换旧钞时才慢慢多起来。","fact_en":"Banknotes with King Charles III's portrait first entered circulation on 5 June 2024; notes with the Queen are still legal tender, and the new ones only replace worn notes gradually.","src":"Bank of England，2024 年 6 月","url":"https://www.bankofengland.co.uk/news/2024/june/king-charles-iii-banknotes-enter-circulation","say":{"en":"Do you take cards? I don't have any cash on me.","zh":"能刷卡吗？我身上没现金。"}},"卢布":{"what":"俄罗斯的货币，1 卢布 = 100 戈比。","what_en":"Russia's currency: 1 rouble = 100 kopecks.","fame":"它有好几百年历史，彼得大帝 1704 年就让它变成了十进制，是世界上最早这样做的货币之一；今天纸币上印的是各个城市的风景。","fame_en":"It's centuries old, and Peter the Great made it decimal in 1704 — one of the first currencies to do so; today's notes show views of Russian cities.","fact":"卢布的符号 ₽ 是 2013 年 12 月才正式定下来的：俄罗斯央行在网上让大家从五个方案里投票，这个带一横的 Р 拿了约六成的票。","fact_en":"The rouble sign ₽ only became official in December 2013: the central bank put five designs to a public online vote, and this crossed Р won about 60 per cent.","src":"Wikipedia · Ruble sign","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ruble_sign","say":{"en":"What's the exchange rate for roubles today?","zh":"今天卢布的汇率是多少？"}},"瑞士法郎":{"what":"瑞士的货币，符号 CHF，由瑞士国家银行发行，列支敦士登也用。","what_en":"Switzerland's currency, CHF, issued by the Swiss National Bank and also used in Liechtenstein.","fame":"它被看作世界上最稳的货币之一，经济一乱很多人就买瑞郎；瑞士纸币是竖着设计的，防伪技术很复杂，还拿过国际钞票设计奖。","fame_en":"It's seen as one of the world's safest currencies — when markets panic, people buy francs; Swiss notes are designed vertically, packed with security features, and have won international banknote awards.","fact":"2016 到 2019 年发行的第九套钞票第一次一个人像都没有：每张都画着一只手和一个地球，分别讲瑞士的组织能力、创造力、人道传统、语言多样等主题。","fact_en":"The ninth series, issued 2016–2019, is the first with no portraits at all: every note shows a hand and a globe, each illustrating a Swiss theme such as organisation, creativity, humanitarian tradition or many languages.","src":"Swissinfo","url":"https://www.swissinfo.ch/eng/business/new-money_swiss-national-bank-unveils-latest-chf50-note/42071040","say":{"en":"Can I pay in euros, or only Swiss francs?","zh":"能付欧元吗，还是只收瑞士法郎？"}},"土耳其里拉":{"what":"土耳其的货币，符号 ₺，1 里拉 = 100 库鲁什。","what_en":"Turkey's currency, symbol ₺: 1 lira = 100 kuruş.","fame":"每张纸币正面都是土耳其共和国的国父穆斯塔法·凯末尔·阿塔图尔克；在伊斯坦布尔的大巴扎，换钱、砍价是游客每天都要做的事。","fame_en":"Every banknote carries Mustafa Kemal Atatürk, founder of the Turkish Republic; changing money and haggling in Istanbul's Grand Bazaar are part of every visitor's day.","fact":"因为长年通货膨胀，土耳其 2005 年 1 月 1 日把里拉去掉了六个零：100 万旧里拉换 1 新里拉；2009 年才把「新」字去掉。","fact_en":"After decades of inflation, Turkey knocked six zeros off the lira on 1 January 2005 — one million old lira became one new lira — and dropped the word 'new' in 2009.","src":"Wikipedia · Revaluation of the Turkish lira","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Revaluation_of_the_Turkish_lira","say":{"en":"What's your best price if I pay in lira?","zh":"付里拉的话，最低多少钱？"}},"最早的硬币":{"what":"两千六百多年前，小亚细亚的吕底亚王国（首都萨第斯，在今天土耳其西部）铸造的硬币，被认为是世界上最早的硬币。","what_en":"Coins struck over 2,600 years ago by the kingdom of Lydia, whose capital Sardis lies in today's western Turkey — usually called the world's first coins.","fame":"在这之前做买卖要称金银，有了印着图案、重量固定的硬币，数一数就能付钱；后来希腊、波斯都学了它，今天口袋里的硬币都是它的后代。","fame_en":"Before them, gold and silver had to be weighed for every deal; coins with a fixed weight and a stamped design could simply be counted — Greece and Persia copied the idea, and every coin in your pocket descends from them.","fact":"最早的吕底亚硬币不是纯金，是金银天然合金「琥珀金」做的，上面是一个吼叫的狮子头；后来传说中的富豪国王克罗伊斯改成了纯金币和纯银币，图案是面对面的狮子和公牛。","fact_en":"The earliest Lydian coins weren't pure gold but electrum, a natural gold-silver alloy, stamped with a roaring lion's head; the legendary rich king Croesus later switched to separate pure gold and silver coins showing a lion facing a bull.","src":"Wikipedia · Croeseid","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Croeseid","say":{"en":"Is that a real Lydian coin, or a copy?","zh":"那是真的吕底亚硬币，还是复制品？"}},"格查尔":{"what":"危地马拉的货币，名字就是国鸟格查尔鸟（凤尾绿咬鹃）。","what_en":"Guatemala's currency, named after the national bird, the resplendent quetzal.","fame":"格查尔鸟有长长的绿色尾羽，古代玛雅人把它的羽毛看得比金子还贵重；今天它出现在国旗、国徽和硬币上，是危地马拉人最骄傲的符号。","fame_en":"The quetzal's long green tail feathers were prized by the ancient Maya above gold; today the bird is on the flag, the coat of arms and the coins — Guatemala's proudest symbol.","fact":"格查尔是 1925 年奥雷利亚纳总统任内开始用的，替换了原来的比索，60 比索换 1 格查尔；1 格查尔纸币上至今印着奥雷利亚纳的头像。","fact_en":"The quetzal was introduced in 1925 under President José María Orellana, replacing the peso at 60 pesos to 1 quetzal — and his face is still on the one-quetzal note.","src":"Wikipedia · Guatemalan quetzal","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guatemalan_quetzal","say":{"en":"How many quetzales is this in dollars?","zh":"这个合多少美元？"}},"塔拉":{"what":"萨摩亚的货币，1 塔拉 = 100 色尼（sene）。","what_en":"Samoa's currency: 1 tala = 100 sene.","fame":"tala 和 sene 其实就是英语 dollar 和 cent 的萨摩亚语读法；纸币上印着萨摩亚的风景、传统和动物，游客在阿皮亚的市场里买东西就用它。","fame_en":"'Tala' and 'sene' are simply the Samoan way of saying 'dollar' and 'cent'; the notes show Samoan scenes, traditions and wildlife, and it's what you spend at the markets in Apia.","fact":"2023 年 12 月，萨摩亚中央银行把 5、10、20 塔拉换成了塑料钞票，图案不变，但更耐用、更难伪造；2025 年 50 和 100 塔拉也出了塑料版。","fact_en":"In December 2023 the Central Bank of Samoa moved its 5, 10 and 20 tala notes to polymer — same designs, but tougher and harder to fake; polymer 50s and 100s followed in 2025.","src":"Samoa Observer，2023 年 12 月；Central Bank of Samoa，2025 年 12 月","url":"https://www.samoaobserver.ws/category/samoa/107142","say":{"en":"Can I pay in tala here, or do you take Australian dollars?","zh":"这里能付塔拉吗，还是收澳元？"}},"潘加":{"what":"汤加的货币，1 潘加 = 100 塞尼特（seniti）。","what_en":"Tonga's currency: 1 paʻanga = 100 seniti.","fame":"汤加是太平洋上从没被正式殖民过的王国，纸币正面印着汤加国王；在努库阿洛法的市场和教堂附近，人们用它买椰子、芋头和手编的草席。","fame_en":"Tonga is the Pacific kingdom that was never formally colonised, and its notes carry the King; at the markets of Nukuʻalofa people use it to buy coconuts, taro and woven mats.","fact":"「pa'anga」本来是汤加的一种藤本植物（榼藤）的种子的名字；这种货币 1967 年 4 月 3 日开始用，1 英镑换 2 潘加。","fact_en":"'Paʻanga' was originally the Tongan name for the seed of a vine (the box bean); the currency was introduced on 3 April 1967, at 2 paʻanga to the pound.","src":"Wikipedia · Tongan paʻanga","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tongan_pa%CA%BBanga","say":{"en":"How much is this mat in pa'anga?","zh":"这张草席多少潘加？"}},"美元":{"what":"美国的货币，也是世界上用得最广的货币。","what_en":"The US dollar — America's currency and the most widely used money in the world.","fame":"国际贸易、石油、各国外汇储备大多用美元算；1 美元纸币背面有一座没封顶的金字塔，顶上一只眼睛，那是美国国徽的背面图案。","fame_en":"Most international trade, oil and central-bank reserves are counted in dollars; the back of the $1 bill shows an unfinished pyramid with an eye above it — the reverse of the Great Seal of the United States.","fact":"2025 年 11 月 12 日，费城造币厂敲出了最后一枚流通用的一美分硬币：一枚成本涨到将近 3.7 美分，美国停产一分钱，但手里的一分钱照样能用。","fact_en":"On 12 November 2025, the Philadelphia Mint struck the last penny for circulation: each cost nearly 3.7 cents to make, so production stopped — though pennies are still legal tender.","src":"Coin World，2025 年 11 月","url":"https://www.coinworld.com/news/us-coins/final-cent-for-circulation-struck-at-philadelphia-mint","say":{"en":"Do you take cash? Keep the change.","zh":"收现金吗？零钱不用找了。"}},"加元":{"what":"加拿大的货币，1 元硬币上有一只潜鸟（loon），所以大家叫它「Loonie」。","what_en":"Canada's dollar — the one-dollar coin shows a loon, so everyone calls it the 'Loonie'.","fame":"1996 年出的 2 元硬币上是北极熊，顺着叫成「Toonie」；新闻里说「加元涨了」，加拿大人也直接说「the loonie is up」。","fame_en":"The $2 coin from 1996 has a polar bear and got the name 'Toonie'; even the news says 'the loonie is up' when the Canadian dollar rises.","fact":"1 元硬币原本要用划独木舟的旅行者图案，可 1986 年刻好的母模在从渥太华寄往温尼伯造币厂的路上丢了，怕被人拿去造假，才临时换成了潜鸟。","fact_en":"The coin was meant to show a canoeing voyageur, but in 1986 the master dies were lost in transit from Ottawa to the Winnipeg mint; fearing counterfeits, the government switched to a loon.","src":"Radio Canada International，2016 年 6 月","url":"https://www.rcinet.ca/en/2016/06/30/history-june-301987-introducing-the-loonie/","say":{"en":"Sorry, I only have a toonie — is that OK?","zh":"不好意思，我只有一个两元硬币，可以吗？"}},"墨西哥比索":{"what":"墨西哥的货币，符号也是 $，1 比索 = 100 分（centavos）。","what_en":"Mexico's currency, also written $: 1 peso = 100 centavos.","fame":"「$」这个符号最早是用来写西班牙银元和比索的，后来美元借走了它；在墨西哥看到「$50」说的是 50 比索，不是美元。","fame_en":"The '$' sign was first used for Spanish silver dollars and pesos before the US dollar borrowed it — in Mexico, '$50' means 50 pesos, not dollars.","fact":"西班牙银元（墨西哥铸的「八里亚尔」）在美国一直是合法货币，直到 1857 年才被国会取消；美元最早就是照它的价值定的。","fact_en":"Spanish silver dollars — many minted in Mexico as 'pieces of eight' — were legal tender in the United States until Congress ended it in 1857; the US dollar itself was first set equal to them.","src":"Wikipedia · Spanish dollar","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spanish_dollar","say":{"en":"Is that price in pesos or dollars?","zh":"这个价格是比索还是美元？"}},"巴西雷亚尔":{"what":"巴西的货币，符号 R$，1994 年开始用。","what_en":"Brazil's currency, R$, in use since 1994.","fame":"它是「雷亚尔计划」的一部分，结束了巴西几十年的恶性通货膨胀；每种纸币背面都是一种巴西动物：海龟、白鹭、金刚鹦鹉、金狮狨、美洲豹、石斑鱼。","fame_en":"It came with the Plano Real that ended decades of hyperinflation; each note has a Brazilian animal on the back — sea turtle, egret, macaw, golden lion tamarin, jaguar, grouper.","fact":"2020 年巴西新出了 200 雷亚尔，背面是鬃狼（lobo-guará）：央行调查大家希望上钞票的濒危动物，它排第三；新钞一出就被网友做成了各种表情包。","fact_en":"In 2020 Brazil added a 200-real note with the maned wolf (lobo-guará) on the back — it came third in a central-bank survey of endangered animals people wanted on notes, and became an instant meme.","src":"Poder360，2020 年 9 月","url":"https://www.poder360.com.br/economia/nota-de-r-200-com-lobo-guara-comeca-a-circular-veja-fotos/","say":{"en":"Can I pay with Pix, or do you need cash?","zh":"能用 Pix 付吗，还是要现金？"}},"阿里亚里":{"what":"马达加斯加的货币，1 阿里亚里 = 5 伊莱姆比拉加（iraimbilanja）。","what_en":"Madagascar's currency: 1 ariary = 5 iraimbilanja.","fame":"世界上绝大多数货币都是一百进位，阿里亚里却是五进位；在塔那那利佛的市场买香草、水果，价钱常常是几千阿里亚里。","fame_en":"Almost every currency in the world divides by 100, but the ariary divides by five; at markets in Antananarivo, vanilla or fruit usually costs a few thousand ariary.","fact":"它和毛里塔尼亚的乌吉亚是世界上仅有的两种还在用的非十进制货币；不过伊莱姆比拉加实际上已经几乎买不到东西，硬币也很少见了。","fact_en":"It and Mauritania's ouguiya are the only two non-decimal currencies still in use — though the iraimbilanja is now worth so little that its coins have almost disappeared.","src":"Wikipedia · Malagasy ariary","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malagasy_ariary","say":{"en":"How much is a bag of vanilla in ariary?","zh":"一袋香草多少阿里亚里？"}},"西非法郎":{"what":"西非八个国家共用的货币（马里、塞内加尔、科特迪瓦、布基纳法索、贝宁、多哥、尼日尔、几内亚比绍），由西非国家中央银行发行。","what_en":"The currency shared by eight West African countries — Mali, Senegal, Côte d'Ivoire, Burkina Faso, Benin, Togo, Niger and Guinea-Bissau — issued by the BCEAO.","fame":"它和欧元是固定汇率，从达喀尔到巴马科不用换钱；但它是殖民时代留下来的货币，要不要改、怎么改，一直是西非人争论的话题。","fame_en":"It's pegged to the euro, so you can travel from Dakar to Bamako without changing money — but as a colonial-era currency, whether and how to reform it is a constant debate in West Africa.","fact":"2019 年 12 月，这些国家宣布要改革西非法郎：改名叫「eco」，并减少法国在这种货币里的角色；不过到今天，钱包里的钞票上印的还是「franc CFA」。","fact_en":"In December 2019 these countries announced a reform: the CFA franc would be renamed the 'eco' and France's role reduced — yet the notes in people's wallets still say 'franc CFA'.","src":"Wikipedia · West African CFA franc","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_African_CFA_franc","say":{"en":"Can I pay in CFA here, or only in cedis?","zh":"这儿能付西非法郎吗，还是只收塞地？"}},"南非兰特":{"what":"南非的货币，符号 R，名字来自约翰内斯堡的金矿山脉 Witwatersrand（简称 Rand）。","what_en":"South Africa's currency, R — named after the Witwatersrand ('the Rand'), the gold-bearing ridge around Johannesburg.","fame":"纸币正面是曼德拉，背面是非洲「五大兽」：狮子、豹、大象、犀牛、水牛，一张钞票就像一次 Safari。","fame_en":"The notes show Nelson Mandela on the front and Africa's 'Big Five' on the back — lion, leopard, elephant, rhino and buffalo — like a safari in your wallet.","fact":"2023 年 5 月，南非储备银行发行了升级版钞票：曼德拉还在正面，背面的五大兽改画成了一家子（大的带着小的），防伪也加强了。","fact_en":"In May 2023 the Reserve Bank issued upgraded notes: Mandela stays on the front, but the Big Five on the back are now drawn as families, adults with their young, with stronger security features.","src":"SAnews（南非政府新闻）","url":"https://www.sanews.gov.za/south-africa/new-banknotes-and-coins-go-circulation-today","say":{"en":"Do you take cards, or should I draw some rand?","zh":"能刷卡吗，还是我得取点兰特？"}},"埃及镑":{"what":"埃及的货币，1 镑 = 100 皮阿斯特（piastre）。","what_en":"Egypt's currency: 1 pound = 100 piastres.","fame":"纸币一面是阿拉伯文和清真寺，另一面是英文和法老时代的神庙、雕像，一张钞票上就是埃及的两段历史。","fame_en":"Each note has Arabic and a mosque on one side, English and pharaonic temples or statues on the other — two eras of Egypt on one note.","fact":"2022 年 7 月，埃及发行了第一张塑料钞票——10 镑，一面是新行政首都的大清真寺，另一面是女法老哈特谢普苏特；2023 年 20 镑也出了塑料版。","fact_en":"In July 2022 Egypt issued its first polymer note, the 10-pound — the new administrative capital's great mosque on one side, the female pharaoh Hatshepsut on the other; a polymer 20 followed in 2023.","src":"Egypt Independent，2022 年 7 月","url":"https://egyptindependent.com/photos-egypt-releases-first-polymer-banknotes/","say":{"en":"Can you break a 200-pound note? I need small change for tips.","zh":"能帮我换开 200 镑吗？我要零钱给小费。"}},"肯尼亚先令":{"what":"肯尼亚的货币，1 先令 = 100 分。","what_en":"Kenya's currency: 1 shilling = 100 cents.","fame":"在肯尼亚，很多人买菜、坐小巴、交学费都不掏现金，而是用手机钱包 M-Pesa 转先令；路边小店门口常挂着绿色的 M-Pesa 牌子。","fame_en":"In Kenya, many people pay for groceries, matatu rides and school fees not in cash but by sending shillings on M-Pesa, the mobile wallet; green M-Pesa signs hang outside little shops everywhere.","fact":"M-Pesa 是 2007 年 3 月 6 日由 Safaricom 推出的，那时很多国家还没有手机支付；到 2016 年底，它在肯尼亚等几个国家已经有将近 2950 万活跃用户。","fact_en":"Safaricom launched M-Pesa on 6 March 2007, long before mobile payments reached most countries; by the end of 2016 it had almost 29.5 million active customers across Kenya and several other countries.","src":"FAO e-Agriculture · 10 years of M-Pesa","url":"https://www.fao.org/e-agriculture/fr/node/13212","say":{"en":"Can I pay by M-Pesa? What's your till number?","zh":"能用 M-Pesa 付吗？你的收款号是多少？"}},"春节":{"what":"农历新年，中国人一年里最大的节日：贴春联、吃年夜饭、给红包、守岁，前后要热闹半个月。","what_en":"Lunar New Year — the biggest holiday of the Chinese year: couplets on the door, a big reunion dinner, red envelopes, staying up past midnight, and about two weeks of celebrating.","fame":"每年春节前后几亿人回家过年，被叫作「地球上最大的人口迁徙」。东南亚、韩国、越南，还有伦敦、旧金山的唐人街也都在过。","fame_en":"Hundreds of millions of people travel home around it — often called the largest human migration on Earth. It's also celebrated across Southeast Asia, Korea, Vietnam and in Chinatowns from London to San Francisco.","fact":"2024 年 12 月 4 日，联合国教科文组织在巴拉圭亚松森开会，把「春节——中国人庆祝传统新年的社会实践」列进了人类非物质文化遗产名录。","fact_en":"On 4 December 2024, at a UNESCO meeting in Asunción, Paraguay, \"Spring Festival, social practices of the Chinese people in celebration of traditional new year\" was added to the list of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity.","src":"UNESCO 非物质文化遗产","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/02126","say":{"en":"Happy New Year! Are you going home for the holiday?","zh":"新年快乐！你过年回家吗？"}},"中秋节":{"what":"农历八月十五，月亮最圆的那天，家里人一起吃饭、赏月、吃月饼。","what_en":"The 15th day of the 8th lunar month, when the moon is fullest — families eat together, look at the moon and share mooncakes.","fame":"它是「团圆」的节日，在外地的人这天最想家；嫦娥奔月、玉兔捣药的故事中国小孩都听过。每年公司送月饼、亲戚换月饼礼盒也是一大景。","fame_en":"It's the festival of reunion — the day people far from home miss it most. Every Chinese child knows the story of Chang'e flying to the moon with the jade rabbit, and swapping gift boxes of mooncakes is a whole season of its own.","fact":"中秋虽然过了上千年，在中国大陆成为放假的法定节日却是 2008 年才开始的——那年中秋正好是星期天，第一次放了三天假。","fact_en":"The festival is over a thousand years old, but it only became a public holiday in mainland China in 2008 — that year it fell on a Sunday, and people got their first three-day break for it.","src":"中国驻美国大使馆（2008 年新华社报道）","url":"https://us.china-embassy.gov.cn/eng/ywzn/lsyw/oca/200809/t20080916_4904537.htm","say":{"en":"Happy Mid-Autumn! Which mooncake filling do you like?","zh":"中秋快乐！你喜欢什么馅的月饼？"}},"端午龙舟":{"what":"农历五月初五的端午节，大家赛龙舟、吃粽子，纪念投江的诗人屈原。","what_en":"The Dragon Boat Festival on the 5th day of the 5th lunar month — people race dragon boats and eat zongzi in memory of the poet Qu Yuan, who drowned himself in a river.","fame":"湖南汨罗江就是传说里屈原投江的地方，这里的龙舟赛特别有名。现在从香港、新加坡到多伦多、伦敦，都有人划龙舟比赛。","fame_en":"The Miluo River in Hunan is where Qu Yuan is said to have drowned, so its races are famous. Today dragon boat races run everywhere from Hong Kong and Singapore to Toronto and London.","fact":"2009 年端午节被列进联合国教科文组织的人类非物质文化遗产名录，是中国第一个进这个名录的节日。","fact_en":"In 2009 the Dragon Boat Festival was added to UNESCO's Intangible Cultural Heritage list — the first Chinese festival ever to make it.","src":"Wikipedia：Dragon Boat Festival","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Boat_Festival","say":{"en":"Sweet or salty zongzi — which do you eat?","zh":"你吃甜粽子还是咸粽子？"}},"那达慕大会":{"what":"蒙古族夏天的大聚会，比摔跤、赛马、射箭这「男儿三艺」，草原上搭满帐篷。","what_en":"The big summer gathering of the Mongolian people — wrestling, horse racing and archery, the \"three manly games\", with tents all over the grassland.","fame":"内蒙古和蒙古国都过那达慕，几百年来是草原上最热闹的日子；赛马的骑手常常是几岁的孩子，一跑就是十几公里。","fame_en":"It's held in both Inner Mongolia and Mongolia and has been the liveliest time on the steppe for centuries; the jockeys in the horse races are often young children riding over ten kilometres.","fact":"蒙古式摔跤没有体重级别：瘦小的选手也可能碰上比自己重几十公斤的对手。内蒙古的搏克规矩更严——除了脚，身上任何地方先着地就算输。","fact_en":"Mongolian wrestling has no weight classes — a slight wrestler can draw an opponent dozens of kilos heavier. Inner Mongolia's version is even stricter: if any part of you other than your feet touches the ground, you lose.","src":"New World Encyclopedia：Mongolian wrestling","url":"https://www.newworldencyclopedia.org/entry/Mongolian_wrestling","say":{"en":"Who do you think will win the wrestling?","zh":"你觉得摔跤谁会赢？"}},"哈尔滨冰雪大世界":{"what":"哈尔滨冬天才有的冰雪乐园：用松花江上切下来的冰块盖城堡、滑梯，晚上里面亮起彩灯。","what_en":"Harbin's winter-only theme park: castles and slides built from ice blocks cut from the Songhua River, lit up in colour at night.","fame":"零下二十几度还排长队的地方。2023 年冬天「南方小土豆」们涌进哈尔滨，让冰雪大世界一下子成了全国最火的冬天旅行地。","fame_en":"People queue here at minus twenty-something. In winter 2023, crowds of southern Chinese tourists poured into Harbin and made it the hottest winter trip in the country.","fact":"2025 年 12 月 17 日开园的第 27 届冰雪大世界占地约 120 万平方米，用了约 40 万立方米的冰和雪，两项都是历届最多。","fact_en":"The 27th edition, which opened on 17 December 2025, covered about 1.2 million square metres and used around 400,000 cubic metres of ice and snow — both records for the park.","src":"新华社（AAP 转发）","url":"https://www.aap.com.au/aapreleases/cision20251217ae49708","say":{"en":"It's freezing! Where can I warm up for a bit?","zh":"太冷了！哪里能暖和一下？"}},"妈祖":{"what":"保佑出海平安的海上女神，福建湄洲岛是她的老家，有她最早的庙。","what_en":"The sea goddess who keeps sailors safe; Meizhou Island in Fujian is her home and has her oldest temple.","fame":"跟着福建、广东的渔民和商人，妈祖庙开到了台湾、东南亚、日本，甚至旧金山。每年她生日前后，台湾的妈祖绕境要走好几天，几十万人跟着走。","fame_en":"Fujian and Guangdong fishermen and traders carried her temples to Taiwan, Southeast Asia, Japan, even San Francisco. Around her birthday, Taiwan's Mazu pilgrimages last for days with hundreds of thousands walking along.","fact":"妈祖原本是一个真人：传说她叫林默娘，960 年生在湄洲岛，987 年就去世了，才二十多岁。2009 年「妈祖信俗」进了联合国非遗名录。","fact_en":"Mazu was believed to be a real person — Lin Moniang, born on Meizhou Island in 960, who died in 987 still in her twenties. \"Mazu belief and customs\" joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list in 2009.","src":"Wikipedia：Mazu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mazu","say":{"en":"Is this temple for Mazu? Can I go inside?","zh":"这座庙供的是妈祖吗？我可以进去吗？"}},"潍坊风筝":{"what":"山东潍坊，号称「世界风筝都」，每年四月办国际风筝节，天上飞满龙、蜈蚣和各种怪风筝。","what_en":"Weifang in Shandong calls itself the \"World Kite Capital\" — every April its international kite festival fills the sky with dragons, centipedes and all sorts of strange kites.","fame":"潍坊做风筝有几百年的手艺，一条龙头蜈蚣风筝能长到几百米；现在全世界很多风筝也是潍坊工厂做的。","fame_en":"Weifang has centuries of kite-making craft — a dragon-headed centipede kite can stretch for hundreds of metres — and many of the world's kites are now made in its factories.","fact":"潍坊国际风筝会是 1984 年开始办的；1988 年 4 月 1 日，风筝会的主席团一致通过，把潍坊定为「风筝都」。","fact_en":"The Weifang International Kite Festival began in 1984; on 1 April 1988 the festival's presidium voted unanimously to name Weifang the \"Kite Capital\".","src":"Wikipedia：Weifang International Kite Festival","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weifang_International_Kite_Festival","say":{"en":"How long is that kite? It's huge!","zh":"那个风筝有多长？好大！"}},"醒狮":{"what":"广东的南狮：两个人钻进一头大狮子里，跟着锣鼓又跳又眨眼，过年、开张都要请来舞一舞。","what_en":"The southern lion of Guangdong: two people inside one big lion that leaps and blinks to the drums — booked for New Year and every shop opening.","fame":"佛山是南狮的大本营，也是黄飞鸿的家乡。现在马来西亚、新加坡的狮队常常在国际比赛里拿冠军，梅花桩上的高桩醒狮跳得让人捏一把汗。","fame_en":"Foshan is the heartland of the southern lion and hometown of Wong Fei-hung. Today Malaysian and Singaporean teams often win world titles, leaping across tall poles in nail-biting routines.","fact":"「采青」时狮子要把挂着红包的生菜「吃」下去再吐出来撒给大家——因为「生菜」听起来像「生财」。这种习俗明朝就在广东出现了。","fact_en":"In \"plucking the greens\", the lion \"eats\" a lettuce hung with a red envelope and spits the leaves out to the crowd — because lettuce, shengcai, sounds like \"making money\". The custom dates back to the Ming dynasty in Guangdong.","src":"广东醒狮（中国官方英文网站）","url":"https://en.by.gov.cn/2022-05/25/c_756744.htm","say":{"en":"The lion dance is starting — let's go and watch!","zh":"舞狮开始了，我们去看吧！"}},"三月三歌节":{"what":"农历三月初三，广西壮族的大节：对山歌、抛绣球、吃五颜六色的糯米饭。","what_en":"The 3rd day of the 3rd lunar month — the big festival of Guangxi's Zhuang people: singing folk songs back and forth, tossing embroidered balls and eating five-coloured sticky rice.","fame":"以前年轻人在三月三对歌找对象；现在南宁的歌节热闹得像音乐节，螺蛳粉摊和民族服装一样多。","fame_en":"Young people used to find partners by trading songs on this day; today Nanning's song festival feels like a music festival, with as many snail-noodle stalls as ethnic costumes.","fact":"从 2014 年起，广西政府给三月三放两天法定假，为的是保住这个有大约 1300 年历史的节日习俗。","fact_en":"Since 2014 the Guangxi government has made Sanyuesan a two-day official holiday, hoping to help preserve a festive custom about 1,300 years old.","src":"China Daily（新华社）","url":"https://regional.chinadaily.com.cn/guangxi/2019-04/08/c_353255.htm","say":{"en":"What are the five colours of the sticky rice made from?","zh":"五色糯米饭的颜色是用什么做的？"}},"苗族银饰":{"what":"苗族姑娘节日里戴的银冠、银角、项圈和银衣，走起路来叮当响。","what_en":"The silver crowns, horns, neck rings and silver-covered jackets that Miao girls wear on festival days — they jingle as they walk.","fame":"贵州雷山、西江一带是苗族银饰的中心。银饰是一家人的财富，也是嫁妆，一套盛装银饰常常是爸妈攒好多年给女儿打的。","fame_en":"Leishan and Xijiang in Guizhou are the heart of Miao silverwork. The silver is family wealth and dowry — a full set is often something parents save for years to have made for their daughter.","fact":"2006 年苗族银饰进了国家级非遗名录。可便宜的机器银饰很快占了全国市场，很多手艺人只好放下老手艺；雷山麻料村的银匠们后来靠手工银饰重新把生意做了起来。","fact_en":"Miao silver jewellery became national intangible heritage in 2006. But cheap machine-made trinkets soon took over the market and many craftsmen gave up the old techniques; silversmiths in Maliao village, Leishan, later rebuilt their trade on handmade pieces.","src":"China Daily","url":"https://global.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202005/28/WS5ecf1670a310a8b2411590c8.html","say":{"en":"Is this handmade? How heavy is it?","zh":"这是手工打的吗？有多重？"}},"泼水节":{"what":"云南西双版纳傣族的新年，大约在每年四月中，大家拿水盆水枪互相泼，泼得越湿祝福越多。","what_en":"The Dai New Year in Xishuangbanna, Yunnan, around mid-April — everyone soaks each other with bowls and water guns, and the wetter you get the more blessings you receive.","fame":"它和泰国的宋干节、缅甸、老挝的新年是同一个时候、同一类节日；景洪的泼水广场每年挤满从全国来的游客。","fame_en":"It's the same season and the same kind of festival as Thailand's Songkran and the New Years of Myanmar and Laos; Jinghong's splashing square fills with tourists from all over China.","fact":"泼水节一般过三天：第一天其实是在澜沧江上赛龙舟、放傣族的「高升」土火箭，第二天才是大家互相泼水，第三天是新年，穿上新衣去佛寺。","fact_en":"The festival usually lasts three days: the first is actually for dragon boat races on the Lancang (Mekong) River and launching Dai bamboo rockets, the second for splashing, and the third is New Year's Day, when people dress up and visit the temple.","src":"Wikipedia：Water-Sprinkling Festival","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Water-Sprinkling_Festival","say":{"en":"Can you splash me gently? My phone is in my pocket!","zh":"轻点泼！我手机在口袋里！"}},"特纳卡":{"what":"缅甸人把黄香楝一类的树皮在石板上磨成淡黄色的糊，涂在脸颊上，防晒又凉快。","what_en":"In Myanmar people grind the bark of the thanaka tree on a stone slab into a pale yellow paste and dab it on their cheeks — sunscreen that also keeps you cool.","fame":"走在仰光街上，女人、小孩、不少男人脸上都有两块黄圈、树叶形状的花纹，这是外国人对缅甸的第一印象。","fame_en":"Walk down a street in Yangon and you'll see women, children and plenty of men with yellow circles or leaf patterns on their cheeks — most visitors' first image of Myanmar.","fact":"好的特纳卡要用长了至少 35 年的树才算成熟；蒲甘一座佛塔的壁画里就画着脸上涂特纳卡的女人，说明 11 世纪就有人这么用了。","fact_en":"A thanaka tree must be at least 35 years old before it's mature enough for good-quality cuttings — and a Bagan-era temple mural shows a woman wearing it, so it was in use by the 11th century.","src":"Wikipedia：Thanaka","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thanaka","say":{"en":"Could you show me how to put thanaka on?","zh":"可以教我怎么涂特纳卡吗？"}},"小贩中心":{"what":"新加坡家门口的大食堂：几十个小摊围着一片桌子，鸡饭、叻沙、炒粿条，几块钱一盘。","what_en":"Singapore's neighbourhood food courts: dozens of stalls around shared tables — chicken rice, laksa, fried kway teow — a few dollars a plate.","fame":"新加坡人一天三顿都可能在这儿吃，从部长到出租车司机坐同一张桌子。2020 年「小贩文化」进了联合国非遗名录。","fame_en":"Singaporeans might eat all three meals here, with ministers and taxi drivers at the same tables. In 2020 hawker culture was added to UNESCO's intangible heritage list.","fact":"2016 年米其林第一次出新加坡指南，卖酱油鸡饭的「了凡」小摊拿到一颗星，一盘才两新元出头，被叫作「全世界最便宜的米其林一星」；2021 年这颗星被摘掉了。","fact_en":"When Michelin published its first Singapore guide in 2016, the Hawker Chan soy-sauce-chicken stall won a star with dishes at about S$2 — \"the world's cheapest Michelin-starred meal\". It lost the star in 2021.","src":"South China Morning Post","url":"https://www.scmp.com/lifestyle/food-drink/article/3226800/when-i-lost-star-i-didnt-give-how-singapore-chef-behind-hawker-chan-once-worlds-cheapest-michelin","say":{"en":"Is this seat taken? Can I sit here?","zh":"这个位子有人吗？我可以坐吗？"}},"月亮风筝":{"what":"马来西亚吉兰丹的大风筝，下半截像一弯月亮，上面画满花草图案。","what_en":"A big kite from Kelantan, Malaysia — its lower half is shaped like a crescent moon and it's covered in floral patterns.","fame":"它是马来西亚的国家象征之一，1989 年版 50 仙硬币的背面就印着它；吉兰丹的村子里至今还有人自己扎、自己画，拿去放风筝比赛。","fame_en":"It's one of Malaysia's national symbols — it's on the back of the 1989-series 50-sen coin — and in Kelantan villages people still build and paint their own to fly in kite contests.","fact":"月亮风筝是马来西亚传统风筝里最大的一种，常见的宽 2.5 米、长 3.5 米，图案要画得够大、颜色够亮，飞高了地上才看得清。","fact_en":"The wau bulan is the largest of Malaysia's traditional kites — typically 2.5 metres wide and 3.5 metres long — with big, strong-coloured patterns so they can still be seen when it flies high.","src":"Wikipedia：Wau bulan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wau_bulan","say":{"en":"Did you make this kite yourself?","zh":"这个风筝是你自己做的吗？"}},"康提佛牙节":{"what":"斯里兰卡康提每年七八月的夜间大游行：盛装的大象驮着佛牙舍利的盒子，前后是火舞、鞭舞和鼓队。","what_en":"Kandy's night-time procession every July–August: a decorated elephant carries the casket of the Buddha's Tooth Relic, surrounded by fire dancers, whip-crackers and drummers.","fame":"佛牙寺里供着佛陀的牙齿舍利，是斯里兰卡最神圣的地方；游行一连走十来个晚上，一晚比一晚长，最后一晚最隆重。","fame_en":"The Temple of the Tooth holds the relic of the Buddha's tooth — Sri Lanka's holiest site. The parade runs for about ten nights, growing longer each night, with the grandest on the last.","fact":"2025 年 4 月，佛牙舍利 16 年来第一次公开给人瞻仰，前后十天；最多的时候约 40 万人在康提排队，政府只好停开加开的火车，劝大家先别来。","fact_en":"In April 2025 the Tooth Relic went on public view for the first time in 16 years, for about ten days. At the peak some 400,000 people were queuing in Kandy, and authorities suspended extra trains and asked people to stay away.","src":"Ada Derana（斯里兰卡新闻）","url":"https://www.adaderana.lk/news/107767/siri-dalada-vandanawa-over-400000-devotees-in-kandy-as-organizers-make-another-request","say":{"en":"Where's a good spot to watch the Perahera tonight?","zh":"今晚在哪儿看游行比较好？"}},"波杜贝鲁鼓舞":{"what":"马尔代夫的大鼓歌舞：二十来个人，三个鼓手加一个领唱，节奏从慢到快，最后跳得像着了魔。","what_en":"The Maldives' big-drum music and dance: about twenty performers, three drummers and a lead singer, the beat building from slow to frantic.","fame":"马尔代夫人干完一天活就围着唱；现在度假岛的晚上、国庆和婚礼都少不了它，马尔代夫人说这叫「把岛都震起来」。","fame_en":"Maldivians traditionally sang it after a hard day's work; today it fills resort evenings, national days and weddings — locals call it \"vibrating the island\".","fact":"老的波杜贝鲁歌词很多是「听不懂的」：里面混着马尔代夫话、邻近地方的话和一些非洲词，可能是印度洋上的水手带来的。鼓是用椰子树干做的。","fact_en":"Old boduberu lyrics are often meaningless — a mix of Dhivehi, neighbouring languages and some African words, probably brought by Indian Ocean sailors. The drums are made from coconut tree trunks.","src":"Wikipedia：Boduberu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boduberu","say":{"en":"That drumming is amazing — can anyone join the dance?","zh":"鼓打得太棒了，谁都可以一起跳吗？"}},"雅浦竹棍舞":{"what":"密克罗尼西亚雅浦岛的竹棍舞：一排舞者手拿竹棍互相敲，边唱边跳，讲的是村里的故事。","what_en":"The stick dance of Yap, Micronesia: a line of dancers strike bamboo sticks against each other while chanting — each dance tells a village story.","fame":"每年 3 月 1 日的雅浦日，各村排练好几个月的舞一起上场；雅浦还以巨大的石头钱币出名，节日里也会摆出来给人看。","fame_en":"On Yap Day, every 1 March, villages perform dances they've rehearsed for months; Yap is also famous for its giant stone money, which is put on display for the festival.","fact":"雅浦日是 1968 年雅浦议会设立的，为的是保住雅浦文化；选 3 月 1 日是因为那时是旱季，被认为是一年里「最舒服」的时候。","fact_en":"Yap Day was created by the Yap Islands Congress in 1968 to preserve Yapese culture; 1 March was chosen because it falls in the dry season, considered the \"most pleasant\" time of year.","src":"Wikipedia：Yap Day","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yap_Day","say":{"en":"Which village is dancing next?","zh":"下一个跳舞的是哪个村？"}},"睡魔祭":{"what":"青森每年 8 月 2 日到 7 日的夏祭：几十台巨大的武士、神怪灯笼花车在晚上游行，前后跟着跳舞的人。","what_en":"Aomori's summer festival, every 2–7 August: dozens of giant lantern floats of warriors and spirits parade at night, with dancers leaping around them.","fame":"一台睡魔灯笼有好几米高，用纸和铁丝糊成，里面点灯，由专门的「睡魔师」设计一整年；它是日本东北最有名的夏祭之一。","fame_en":"Each float is several metres tall, made of paper over wire and lit from inside, designed over a whole year by specialist nebuta artists — one of the most famous summer festivals in Japan's northeast.","fact":"跟着花车跳的「跳人」（haneto）谁都可以当：只要穿上正式的跳人衣服就能加入。城里从百货店到和服店都能租，浴衣加腰带大约 5000 日元起，店里还会帮你穿。","fact_en":"Anyone wearing the proper costume can join in as a haneto dancer. Shops all over town, from department stores to kimono shops, rent them — a yukata and obi from about ¥5,000 — and they'll help you put it on.","src":"日本国土交通省 观光厅多语言解说","url":"https://www.mlit.go.jp/tagengo-db/R1-01056.html","say":{"en":"Where can I rent a haneto costume?","zh":"在哪儿能租到跳人（haneto）的服装？"}},"阿波舞":{"what":"德岛每年 8 月 12 日到 15 日的盂兰盆舞：一队队「连」跟着三味线和鼓，举着手、踮着脚在街上跳。","what_en":"Tokushima's Obon dance festival, every 12–15 August: troupes called ren dance through the streets with raised hands and quick steps to shamisen and drums.","fame":"它是日本最大的舞蹈节，号称每年一百多万人来看。那句「跳的是傻瓜，看的也是傻瓜，都是傻瓜，不跳就亏了」就是从阿波舞来的。","fame_en":"It's Japan's biggest dance festival, said to draw over a million visitors a year — and it's the source of the famous chant: \"The dancers are fools, the watchers are fools; if we're all fools, why not dance?\"","fact":"一般说这种舞有四百年历史，可「阿波舞」（阿波踊り）这个名字其实很新，是到了昭和年代（1926 年以后）才叫开的。","fact_en":"The dance is usually said to be about 400 years old, but the name \"Awa Odori\" itself is new — it only came into use in the Shōwa era, after 1926.","src":"Wikipedia：Awa Dance Festival","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Awa_Dance_Festival","say":{"en":"Can visitors join in, or is it only for the teams?","zh":"游客也能一起跳吗，还是只有舞队能跳？"}},"普什卡骆驼节":{"what":"印度拉贾斯坦小城普什卡每年秋天的大集市：几万头骆驼和牛马来买卖，还有骆驼比赛和选美。","what_en":"The big autumn fair in the small Rajasthani town of Pushkar: tens of thousands of camels, cattle and horses are traded, with camel races and beauty contests.","fame":"它是世界上最大的骆驼集市之一；集市最后一天正赶上印度教的满月节，朝圣的人到普什卡圣湖里沐浴，沙漠里一下子挤满了人。","fame_en":"It's one of the world's largest camel fairs, and it ends on the full moon of Kartik, when Hindu pilgrims bathe in Pushkar's holy lake and the desert suddenly fills with people.","fact":"集市上的比赛很特别：除了骆驼赛跑、骆驼游行，还有「比胡子」大赛，和打破陶罐的 Matka Tod 比赛。","fact_en":"The fair's contests are unusual: besides camel races and parades, there are moustache competitions and Matka Tod, a pot-breaking game.","src":"Outlook Traveller","url":"https://www.outlooktraveller.com/explore/culture/all-about-pushkar-fair","say":{"en":"How much is a camel ride around the fair?","zh":"骑骆驼绕集市一圈多少钱？"}},"犀鸟节":{"what":"印度东北那加兰邦每年 12 月 1 日到 10 日的节日：十几个那加部落穿上传统服装，在科希马附近的村子里唱歌、跳舞、比赛。","what_en":"Held every 1–10 December in Nagaland, northeast India: more than a dozen Naga tribes in traditional dress sing, dance and compete at a heritage village near Kohima.","fame":"它被叫作「节日中的节日」，一次能看到所有那加部落的歌舞、手工和吃的；节日名字来自犀鸟，几乎每个部落的民间故事里都有它。","fame_en":"It's called the \"festival of festivals\" — all the Naga tribes' songs, crafts and food in one place. It's named after the hornbill, which appears in the folklore of almost every tribe.","fact":"犀鸟节其实很年轻：2000 年 12 月才办了第一届，由那加兰邦的旅游厅和艺术文化厅主办，现在每年 12 月第一周举行。","fact_en":"The Hornbill Festival is actually young: the first one was held in December 2000, organised by Nagaland's tourism and art & culture departments, and it now runs every year in the first week of December.","src":"Wikipedia：Hornbill Festival","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hornbill_Festival","say":{"en":"Which tribe is performing now?","zh":"现在表演的是哪个部落？"}},"蒙古包":{"what":"蒙古游牧人的圆形帐篷：木头架子外面裹上毛毡，几个小时就能拆了搬走、再搭起来。","what_en":"The round tent of Mongolian herders: a wooden frame wrapped in felt that can be taken down, moved and put up again in a few hours.","fame":"它冬暖夏凉，中间一个炉子就够一家人过冬；门一般朝南。2013 年蒙古包的制作手艺进了联合国非遗名录。","fame_en":"It's warm in winter and cool in summer — one stove in the middle heats a family through the cold — and the door usually faces south. The craft of making it joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list in 2013.","fact":"蒙古包不只在草原上：首都乌兰巴托约六成的人住在「蒙古包区」，不过其中真正住在蒙古包里的大约四成多，其他人住在同一片区的砖房、木房里。","fact_en":"Gers aren't just on the steppe: around 60% of Ulaanbaatar's people live in \"ger districts\" — though only about 43% of them actually live in gers; the rest live in brick or wooden houses in the same areas.","src":"Wikipedia：Ger district","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ger_district","say":{"en":"May I come in? Which side should I sit on?","zh":"我可以进来吗？我该坐哪边？"}},"水灯节":{"what":"泰国每年 11 月满月夜的节日：大家把香蕉叶做的花灯点上蜡烛放进河里，清迈的人还一起放孔明灯。","what_en":"Thailand's festival on the full moon of November: people float banana-leaf baskets with candles on the river, and in Chiang Mai they also release sky lanterns together.","fame":"清迈的「天灯节」（Yi Peng）跟水灯节同时过，几千盏灯一起升空的照片传遍全世界，让清迈的酒店那几天特别难订。","fame_en":"Chiang Mai's Yi Peng lantern festival falls at the same time, and photos of thousands of lanterns rising together have gone round the world — making hotels there hard to book that week.","fact":"因为怕孔明灯撞上飞机，清迈机场每年这几天都要调整晚上的航班：2025 年天灯节影响了 161 个航班，其中 65 个直接取消。","fact_en":"Because lanterns could hit planes, Chiang Mai airport reshuffles its evening flights every year: in 2025 the Yi Peng festival affected 161 flights, 65 of them cancelled outright.","src":"Khaosod English","url":"https://www.khaosodenglish.com/tourism/2025/11/01/chiang-mai-airport-adjusts-flights-for-yi-peng-festival/","say":{"en":"Where are we allowed to release lanterns?","zh":"在哪儿可以放孔明灯？"}},"恒河":{"what":"印度教心中最神圣的河。在瓦拉纳西，河边一级级台阶上有人沐浴、有人火葬，每晚还有点灯祭河的仪式（Ganga Aarti）。","what_en":"Hinduism's holiest river. In Varanasi its stepped banks host bathers and cremations, and every evening priests hold the Ganga Aarti, a ceremony of fire and lamps.","fame":"很多印度人一辈子都想来瓦拉纳西的恒河边一次；晚上坐小船看达沙什瓦梅朵码头上的点灯仪式，是来印度的人最难忘的画面之一。","fame_en":"Many Indians hope to come to the Ganges at Varanasi at least once in their lives; watching the evening aarti at Dashashwamedh Ghat from a little boat is one of the most unforgettable sights in India.","fact":"恒河里住着一种几乎看不见东西的淡水豚——恒河豚，它靠回声在浑水里找鱼。印度政府已经把它定为国家水生动物。","fact_en":"The Ganges is home to a nearly blind freshwater dolphin that finds fish in the murky water by echolocation — the Ganges river dolphin, which India has made its National Aquatic Animal.","src":"Wikipedia：Ganges river dolphin","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ganges_river_dolphin","say":{"en":"How much for a boat to watch the aarti tonight?","zh":"今晚坐船看点灯仪式要多少钱？"}},"排灯节":{"what":"印度最大的节日，一般在 10 月底或 11 月：家家点小油灯、挂彩灯、放烟花、送甜点，庆祝光明战胜黑暗。","what_en":"India's biggest festival, usually in late October or November: every home lights clay lamps and fairy lights, sets off fireworks and shares sweets — light winning over darkness.","fame":"排灯节前大家大扫除、买新衣服、买金子，是全年买东西最多的时候；伦敦的莱斯特、新加坡的小印度、多伦多也都会点灯过节。","fame_en":"Before Diwali people clean their homes and buy new clothes and gold — it's the biggest shopping season of the year. Leicester, Singapore's Little India and Toronto all light up for it too.","fact":"2025 年 12 月 10 日，联合国教科文组织在新德里的红堡开会，把排灯节（Deepavali）列进了人类非遗名录。这是印度第一次主办这个会，排灯节是印度第 16 个进名录的项目。","fact_en":"On 10 December 2025, at a UNESCO meeting held in Delhi's Red Fort, Deepavali was added to the Intangible Cultural Heritage list — the first time India hosted the session, and India's 16th entry.","src":"All India Radio News","url":"https://www.newsonair.gov.in/unesco-adds-deepavali-to-intangible-cultural-heritage-list","say":{"en":"Happy Diwali! These sweets are for you.","zh":"排灯节快乐！这些甜点是给你的。"}},"悉尼跨年烟花":{"what":"每年 12 月 31 日，悉尼港大桥和歌剧院一带放两场烟花：晚上 9 点一场给小孩看，午夜一场迎新年。","what_en":"Every 31 December, Sydney fires two shows over the Harbour Bridge and Opera House: a 9pm one for families and the big one at midnight.","fame":"悉尼是最早过新年的大城市之一，全世界的电视台都转播这一场；每年一百多万人一大早就去港口边占位子。","fame_en":"Sydney is one of the first big cities to see in the new year, so TV channels around the world broadcast it, and more than a million people stake out harbour-side spots from early morning.","fact":"迎接 2025 年的那场烟花，按计划光是港湾大桥上就要打出 3 万个焰火效果，全场靠约 2.3 万个点火信号同步。","fact_en":"For the show that welcomed 2025, the plan was for 30,000 effects to be fired from the Harbour Bridge alone, with around 23,000 pyrotechnic cues synchronising every firing site.","src":"City of Sydney 新闻稿","url":"https://news.cityofsydney.nsw.gov.au/media-releases/sydney-set-for-a-super-sized-spectacular","say":{"en":"What time should we get there to find a good spot?","zh":"我们几点到才能占到好位置？"}},"毛利哈卡舞":{"what":"新西兰毛利人的传统舞：拍胸、跺脚、瞪眼、吐舌头，一起大声喊，以前是出征前跳，现在婚礼、葬礼、毕业也跳。","what_en":"The traditional dance of New Zealand's Māori: chest-slapping, stamping, wide eyes and tongues out, chanting together — once performed before battle, now at weddings, funerals and graduations too.","fame":"全世界认识它，是因为新西兰橄榄球队「全黑队」每场比赛前都跳；罗托鲁瓦的毛利村子晚上也会给客人表演。","fame_en":"The world knows it because the All Blacks rugby team performs one before every match; Māori villages in Rotorua also perform for visitors in the evenings.","fact":"全黑队最常跳的那支《Ka Mate》是 19 世纪的 Ngāti Toa 部落酋长 Te Rauparaha 编的。2014 年新西兰专门立了一部《Ka Mate 哈卡署名法》，正式承认他是作者、Ngāti Toa 是这支舞的守护者。","fact_en":"The All Blacks' best-known haka, Ka Mate, was composed by the 19th-century Ngāti Toa chief Te Rauparaha. In 2014 New Zealand passed the Haka Ka Mate Attribution Act, formally recognising him as composer and Ngāti Toa as the haka's guardians.","src":"WIPO Lex：Haka Ka Mate Attribution Act 2014","url":"https://www.wipo.int/wipolex/en/legislation/details/22821","say":{"en":"What do the words of the haka mean?","zh":"哈卡里喊的是什么意思？"}},"火上行走":{"what":"斐济贝卡岛的传统：男人们光着脚，一步步走过烧得发烫的石头坑。","what_en":"A tradition from Beqa Island, Fiji: men walk barefoot, step by step, across a pit of red-hot stones.","fame":"斐济人叫它 vilavilairevo，以前只在岛上的仪式里做，现在苏瓦和度假酒店也会表演给客人看，是斐济最有名的文化表演之一。","fame_en":"Fijians call it vilavilairevo. It was once only part of island rituals; now it's also performed for visitors in Suva and resorts — one of Fiji's best-known cultural shows.","fact":"贝卡岛的老故事说，走火的本领是一种叫 kalou rere 的精灵送给 Sawau 人的；故事里，Sawau 的 Tuiqalita 去 Namoliwai 河上游抓鳗鱼，抓到的却是精灵。几百年来，这份本领一直只留在 Sawau 这一带的村子里。","fact_en":"Beqa's old stories say the gift of firewalking came to the Sawau people from spirits called kalou rere — in the tale, Tuiqalita went up the Namoliwai River to catch an eel and caught a spirit instead. For centuries the gift has stayed only in the Sawau villages.","src":"Fiji Times","url":"https://www.fijitimes.com.fj/beqa-islands-unique-firewalking-gift/","say":{"en":"Doesn't it hurt? How do you prepare?","zh":"不疼吗？你们是怎么准备的？"}},"Bula衬衫":{"what":"斐济人穿的印花衬衫，大朵热带花和传统花纹，「Bula」是斐济话的「你好」。","what_en":"The printed shirts Fijians wear, with big tropical flowers and traditional patterns — \"Bula\" is Fijian for \"hello\".","fame":"在斐济它就是正装：公务员、银行职员、议员都穿，开会、上班、婚礼都行；很多公司还有自己花色的 Bula 衫当制服。","fame_en":"In Fiji it counts as formal wear — civil servants, bank staff and MPs wear it to work, meetings and weddings, and many companies have their own patterns as uniforms.","fact":"2018 年，美国佛罗里达商人 Ross Kashtan 开了一串叫「Bula」的酒吧、咖啡店，还在美国把「Bula」注册成了商标，很多斐济人觉得被冒犯了，斐济政府说要去争。","fact_en":"In 2018 Florida businessman Ross Kashtan, who runs a chain of \"Bula\" bars and cafés, registered \"Bula\" as a US trademark. Many Fijians were offended, and the Fijian government said it would fight it.","src":"Goodmans LLP（知识产权博客）","url":"https://www.goodmans.ca/insights/post/goodmans-ip-blog/bula-us-trademark-of-fiji-greeting-being-criticized","say":{"en":"Bula! Do you have this shirt in a medium?","zh":"你好！这件衬衫有中号吗？"}},"戈罗卡歌舞节":{"what":"巴布亚新几内亚高地小城戈罗卡每年九月的大会：上百个部落戴着羽毛、涂着彩绘，一起唱歌跳舞。","what_en":"Held every September in the highland town of Goroka, Papua New Guinea: over a hundred groups in feathers and body paint sing and dance together.","fame":"它是巴新最有名的文化节，跟 9 月 16 日的国庆差不多同一周；很多部落平时住在只能走路进去的山里，只有这几天聚到一起。","fame_en":"It's PNG's best-known cultural show, held in the same week as Independence Day on 16 September; many groups live in mountains reachable only on foot and come together only for these days.","fact":"戈罗卡节 1956 年由澳大利亚的巡逻官员（kiap）发起，第一届就来了大约一万名当地人；2026 年 9 月 18 日到 20 日办了 70 周年。","fact_en":"The Goroka Show was started in 1956 by Australian patrol officers (kiaps), and around 10,000 local people came to the first one; its 70th anniversary show was held on 18–20 September 2026.","src":"Wikipedia：Goroka Show","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goroka_Show","say":{"en":"May I take a photo with you?","zh":"我可以跟你拍张照吗？"}},"阿萨罗泥人":{"what":"巴新东高地阿萨罗的部落男人：全身涂白泥，戴着又大又丑的泥面具，慢慢走，像幽灵。","what_en":"Men of the Asaro area in PNG's Eastern Highlands: bodies smeared with white clay, wearing huge, grotesque mud masks, moving slowly like ghosts.","fame":"传说以前部落被敌人追，逃进阿萨罗河，爬上来时浑身是泥，敌人以为见了鬼就跑了。现在泥人是巴新最出名的形象之一。","fame_en":"Legend says the tribe once fled enemies into the Asaro River and climbed out covered in mud; the enemies thought they were ghosts and ran. Today the mudmen are one of PNG's most famous images.","fact":"泥面具其实不是很古老的传统：这身装扮是 1957 年为一场文化展做出来的，后来才成了这一带甚至整个巴新的标志。另一个部落叫这些面具 holosa，意思是「鬼」，阿萨罗人也就这么叫了。","fact_en":"The mud masks aren't an ancient tradition: the costume was created for a cultural show in 1957 and only later became a symbol of the area and of PNG. Another tribe named the masks holosa — \"ghost\" — and the Asaro adopted the name.","src":"Wikipedia：Asaro Mudmen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asaro_Mudmen","say":{"en":"How long does it take to make one mask?","zh":"做一个面具要多久？"}},"塞皮克河":{"what":"巴新北边一条长长的大河，两岸的村子靠独木舟来往，男人在高高的精灵屋里雕木头。","what_en":"A long river in northern PNG where villages travel by dugout canoe and men carve wood in tall spirit houses.","fame":"塞皮克河的木雕、面具在世界各大博物馆里都有；这里的人把鳄鱼当成祖先，很多故事都刻在木头上。","fame_en":"Sepik carvings and masks are in museums around the world; people here see the crocodile as an ancestor and carve its stories into wood.","fact":"东塞皮克的 Chambri 部落，男孩成年时要在身上割出一排排疤痕，样子像鳄鱼的鳞——他们相信自己是鳄鱼的后代：神话里，鳄鱼从塞皮克河爬上岸，后来变成了人。","fact_en":"Among the Chambri of East Sepik, boys becoming men have their skin cut and scarred to look like crocodile scales — they believe they descend from crocodiles, which in their myth crawled out of the Sepik and became human.","src":"The National（巴新报纸）","url":"https://www.thenational.com.pg/?p=72893","say":{"en":"Who carved this? What story does it tell?","zh":"这是谁雕的？讲的是什么故事？"}},"陆地跳":{"what":"瓦努阿图彭特科斯特岛的仪式：男人脚踝绑着藤蔓，从二三十米高的木塔上头朝下跳下去。","what_en":"A ritual on Pentecost Island, Vanuatu: men with vines tied to their ankles dive head-first from wooden towers twenty to thirty metres high.","fame":"当地人叫它 Naghol，跳得好，今年的山药就收得好；它被看作现代蹦极的「老祖宗」，每年都有游客专门坐小飞机去看。","fame_en":"Locals call it Naghol — a good dive means a good yam harvest. It's seen as the ancestor of modern bungee jumping, and visitors fly in on small planes every year to watch.","fact":"陆地跳选在旱季，因为那时最适合搭塔、藤蔓也最有弹性。彭特科斯特岛的人觉得蹦极是「偷」了他们的传统，在瓦努阿图总检察长支持下，还说要向蹦极公司讨版税。","fact_en":"Land diving takes place in the dry season, when towers are easiest to build and the vines most elastic. Pentecost islanders see bungee jumping as their stolen tradition, and with the backing of Vanuatu's attorney-general they declared they would seek royalties from bungee companies.","src":"Wikipedia：Land diving","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Land_diving","say":{"en":"How high is the tower? Is it safe to stand here?","zh":"这座塔有多高？站在这里安全吗？"}},"旋转舞":{"what":"土耳其苏菲派梅夫拉维教团的「塞玛」仪式：穿白色长裙的人一只手朝天、一只手朝地，一直转，像在冥想。","what_en":"The Sema of Turkey's Mevlevi Sufi order: dancers in long white skirts turn and turn, one palm up to the sky and one down to the earth, as a form of meditation.","fame":"教团是诗人鲁米的追随者在科尼亚建的；鲁米的诗今天在美国也卖得很好。2008 年塞玛仪式进了联合国非遗名录。","fame_en":"The order was founded in Konya by followers of the poet Rumi, whose poems still sell well in America today. The Sema ceremony joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list in 2008.","fact":"鲁米 1273 年去世后，他的追随者建立了梅夫拉维教团；他们不把鲁米的忌日叫忌日，而叫「婚礼之夜」（Şeb-i Arus）——跟神结合的日子。科尼亚每年 12 月都为此办纪念活动，最后以塞玛仪式收尾。","fact_en":"After Rumi died in 1273, his followers founded the Mevlevi Order. They don't call the anniversary of his death a death at all but a \"wedding night\" (Şeb-i Arus) — his union with God. Konya holds commemorations every December, ending with the Sema ceremony.","src":"Anadolu Agency","url":"https://www.aa.com.tr/en/culture/turkey-commemorates-13th-century-poet-mevlana-rumi/1676551","say":{"en":"Can I take photos during the ceremony?","zh":"仪式进行时可以拍照吗？"}},"法国国庆日":{"what":"每年 7 月 14 日，纪念 1789 年攻占巴士底狱：上午香榭丽舍大道阅兵，晚上埃菲尔铁塔下放烟花。","what_en":"Every 14 July France marks the 1789 storming of the Bastille: a military parade down the Champs-Élysées in the morning, fireworks at the Eiffel Tower at night.","fame":"法国人叫它「Le 14 Juillet」，不叫巴士底日。前一两天晚上还有消防站开门办舞会（bal des pompiers），谁都能进去跳舞。","fame_en":"The French call it \"le 14 juillet\", not Bastille Day. On the night or two before, fire stations throw open their doors for firemen's balls (bals des pompiers) where anyone can dance.","fact":"香榭丽舍的阅兵从 1880 年起几乎每年都在 7 月 14 日上午举行，是世界上最老的定期阅兵之一；有些年份还会请外国部队一起走。","fact_en":"The Champs-Élysées parade has been held on the morning of 14 July almost every year since 1880 — one of the oldest regular military parades in the world, and some years foreign troops are invited to march too.","src":"Wikipedia：Bastille Day military parade","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bastille_Day_military_parade","say":{"en":"Where's the best place to watch the fireworks tonight?","zh":"今晚在哪儿看烟花最好？"}},"斯特拉斯堡圣诞市集":{"what":"法国阿尔萨斯的斯特拉斯堡，每年 11 月底到 12 月底，全城十几处摆满木头小屋，卖热红酒、姜饼和圣诞装饰。","what_en":"From late November to late December, Strasbourg in Alsace fills a dozen squares with wooden stalls selling mulled wine, gingerbread and Christmas decorations.","fame":"斯特拉斯堡自称「圣诞之都」，克莱贝尔广场上每年立一棵约 30 米高的大圣诞树；每年冬天几百万游客挤进这座小城。","fame_en":"Strasbourg calls itself the \"Capital of Christmas\"; a Christmas tree around 30 metres tall goes up on Place Kléber every year, and millions of visitors squeeze into the small city each winter.","fact":"这个市集 1570 年就有了，是法国最老的圣诞市集。它在大教堂前、城堡广场、克莱贝尔广场之间搬过好几次家，1871 年才定在现在的布罗伊广场。","fact_en":"The market dates back to 1570, making it France's oldest Christmas market. It moved between the cathedral square, Place du Château and Place Kléber before settling on Place Broglie in 1871.","src":"斯特拉斯堡市政府","url":"https://noel.strasbourg.eu/en/w/place-christkindelsmarik","say":{"en":"Two mulled wines, please. Do I pay a deposit for the cup?","zh":"两杯热红酒。杯子要押金吗？"}},"圣帕特里克节":{"what":"每年 3 月 17 日，爱尔兰的守护圣人节：大家穿绿衣服、戴三叶草，城里有大游行，酒吧里挤满人。","what_en":"Every 17 March, Ireland's patron saint's day: people wear green and shamrocks, cities hold big parades and the pubs are packed.","fame":"它可能是世界上被过得最多的国家节日：纽约、波士顿、悉尼都有大游行，芝加哥还把整条河染成绿色。都柏林的节庆一连好几天。","fame_en":"It may be the most widely celebrated national day on Earth — big parades in New York, Boston and Sydney, and Chicago dyes its whole river green. Dublin's festival runs for several days.","fact":"圣帕特里克本人其实不是爱尔兰人：他出生在罗马统治下的不列颠，16 岁被爱尔兰海盗抓走，在爱尔兰当了几年放羊的奴隶，逃回家后又回来传教。","fact_en":"Saint Patrick wasn't Irish: he was born in Roman Britain, kidnapped by Irish raiders at 16 and spent years as a slave herding animals in Ireland — then escaped home, and later came back as a missionary.","src":"Wikipedia：Saint Patrick","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saint_Patrick","say":{"en":"Happy St Patrick's Day! Where's the parade starting?","zh":"圣帕特里克节快乐！游行从哪儿开始？"}},"威尼斯狂欢节":{"what":"每年二月前后，威尼斯人和游客戴上华丽的面具、穿上十八世纪的服装，在运河和广场间游荡、拍照、参加舞会。","what_en":"Around February each year, Venetians and visitors put on ornate masks and eighteenth-century costumes to wander the canals and squares, pose for photos and go to balls.","fame":"戴上面具就看不出你是贵族还是仆人——这是几百年前威尼斯狂欢节最迷人的地方。现在开幕的「天使之飞」，会有人从圣马可钟楼上吊着钢索飞到广场中间。","fame_en":"Behind a mask no one could tell a noble from a servant — that was the old carnival's magic. Today it opens with the \"Flight of the Angel\", when someone glides on a wire from the St Mark's bell tower into the square.","fact":"1797 年威尼斯共和国灭亡后，狂欢节和戴面具都被禁了，一停就是将近两百年；直到 1979 年，威尼斯市政府和民间团体才把它重新办起来。","fact_en":"After the Venetian Republic fell in 1797, the carnival and mask-wearing were banned for almost two centuries; it was only revived in 1979 by the city and local associations.","src":"Wikipedia：Carnival of Venice","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnival_of_Venice","say":{"en":"Is this mask handmade? Can I try it on?","zh":"这个面具是手工做的吗？我能试戴一下吗？"}},"奔牛节":{"what":"西班牙潘普洛纳每年 7 月 6 日到 14 日的圣费尔明节；7 月 7 日起每天早上 8 点，人们穿白衣、系红巾，在公牛前面狂奔到斗牛场。","what_en":"Pamplona's San Fermín festival, 6–14 July; from the 7th, at 8am every morning, runners in white with red scarves race ahead of the bulls to the bullring.","fame":"海明威 1926 年的小说《太阳照常升起》让全世界知道了它。每年都有人受伤，也有人反对，因为牛最后会在斗牛场里被斗死。","fame_en":"Hemingway's 1926 novel The Sun Also Rises made it world-famous. People get hurt every year, and there's real opposition too, because the bulls are killed in the ring afterwards.","fact":"整条奔牛路线只有 875 米，穿过老城四条窄街；从第一声火箭响到结束，平均只要 2 分 30 秒。","fact_en":"The whole route is just 875 metres through four narrow old-town streets, and from the first rocket to the end takes on average two minutes and thirty seconds.","src":"Wikipedia：Running of the bulls","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Running_of_the_bulls","say":{"en":"I'm not running — where can I watch safely?","zh":"我不跑——在哪儿看比较安全？"}},"荷兰风车":{"what":"阿姆斯特丹北边的赞斯堡（Zaanse Schans）：一排老风车立在河边，旁边是木鞋作坊和奶酪店。","what_en":"Zaanse Schans, just north of Amsterdam: a row of old windmills on the riverbank, next to clog workshops and cheese shops.","fame":"荷兰有四分之一的土地低于海平面，以前靠风车把水抽走才有了田地。赞斯堡的风车有的还在磨颜料、榨油，是坐车半小时就能看到的「明信片荷兰」。","fame_en":"About a quarter of the Netherlands lies below sea level, and windmills once pumped the water out to make farmland. Some Zaanse Schans mills still grind pigments and press oil — postcard Holland half an hour from Amsterdam.","fact":"这个小村子游客太多，赞丹市决定收门票；原定 2026 年 4 月开始，后来推迟到 2027 年 4 月，赞丹和沃默兰本地居民照样免费，村子也不许围起栅栏。","fact_en":"The village gets so many tourists that Zaanstad decided to charge an entrance ticket. It was due to start in April 2026 but has been pushed back to April 2027; residents of Zaanstad and Wormerland stay free, and no physical fence may go up around it.","src":"Rodi（赞丹本地新闻）","url":"https://www.rodi.nl/zaanstad/gemeentenieuws/480185/gemeente-zaanstad-stelt-entreeticket-zaanse-schans-jaar-uit","say":{"en":"Can we go inside this windmill? How much is it?","zh":"这座风车能进去吗？多少钱？"}},"圣诞老人村":{"what":"芬兰罗瓦涅米城外、正好在北极圈线上的圣诞老人村：能见圣诞老人、跨过北极圈的线、坐驯鹿雪橇。","what_en":"Santa Claus Village, just outside Rovaniemi in Finland, right on the Arctic Circle: meet Santa, step across the Arctic Circle line, ride a reindeer sleigh.","fame":"芬兰说圣诞老人住在拉普兰的耳朵山上，这里是他「上班」的地方，一年 365 天都开。冬天的罗瓦涅米航班和酒店常常被全世界的家庭订满。","fame_en":"Finland says Santa lives on Korvatunturi fell in Lapland, and this is where he \"works\" — open 365 days a year. In winter, Rovaniemi's flights and hotels fill with families from all over the world.","fact":"村里的圣诞老人总邮局每年收到将近 50 万封信；从这里寄出的每一张明信片，都会被手工盖上一个专门的北极圈邮戳。","fact_en":"Santa Claus' Main Post Office in the village receives nearly half a million letters a year, and every card sent from it is hand-stamped with its own special Arctic Circle postmark.","src":"Posti（芬兰邮政）","url":"https://www.posti.fi/en/latest-news-at-posti/20210917_joulupukin_paaposti_avataan_taas_en","say":{"en":"I'd like to send this postcard with the Arctic Circle stamp.","zh":"这张明信片我想盖北极圈的邮戳寄出去。"}},"芬兰桑拿":{"what":"芬兰人的蒸汽浴：在木头小屋里往热石头上浇水，蒸到全身冒汗，再跳进湖里或雪里。","what_en":"The Finnish steam bath: throw water on hot stones in a wooden room, sweat it out, then jump into a lake or the snow.","fame":"在芬兰，桑拿不是奢侈品：公寓楼、公司、甚至议会大楼里都有。赫尔辛基海边还有新式的公共桑拿，下班后去蒸一蒸就像别处去酒吧。","fame_en":"In Finland sauna isn't a luxury: apartment blocks, offices, even Parliament have one. Helsinki's seafront has new public saunas where people go after work the way others go to a pub.","fact":"芬兰 550 万人有大约 330 万个桑拿房。城里的老式公共桑拿 1950 年代以后几乎全关了，这几年才靠私人投资一家家重新建起来。2020 年芬兰桑拿文化进了联合国非遗名录。","fact_en":"Finland has around 3.3 million saunas for 5.5 million people. Traditional public saunas in the cities almost disappeared after the 1950s, and only in recent years have private initiatives built new ones. Finnish sauna culture joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list in 2020.","src":"UNESCO 非物质文化遗产","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/sauna-culture-01596","say":{"en":"Is it okay if I throw more water on the stones?","zh":"我可以再往石头上浇点水吗？"}},"波耶拉节":{"what":"巴拿马小城拉斯塔布拉斯每年 7 月的「国家波耶拉节」：姑娘们穿着手工刺绣的白色大裙子（pollera），头上插满颤动的珠花，上街游行。","what_en":"Every July, the small Panamanian town of Las Tablas holds the National Pollera Festival: women parade in hand-embroidered white skirts (polleras), heads crowned with trembling bead flowers.","fame":"波耶拉是巴拿马的国服，一条好的波耶拉要手工绣好几个月，配上金银首饰能值好几千美元，常常是一家人传下来的。","fame_en":"The pollera is Panama's national dress; a good one takes months of hand embroidery and, with its gold and silver jewellery, can be worth thousands of dollars — often handed down in families.","fact":"国家波耶拉节是 1957 年开始办的，1961 年巴拿马专门立法（第 50 号法），规定每年 7 月 22 日在拉斯塔布拉斯举行。","fact_en":"The National Pollera Festival began in 1957, and in 1961 Panama passed a law (Law 50) fixing it on 22 July every year in Las Tablas.","src":"Libélulas Pedasí（巴拿马当地）","url":"https://libelulaspedasi.com/national-pollera-festival/","say":{"en":"Your pollera is beautiful — how long did it take to make?","zh":"你的波耶拉真漂亮——做了多久？"}},"木屑花毯":{"what":"危地马拉古城安提瓜，复活节前的圣周：一家家人连夜用染色木屑、鲜花和松针在石头街上铺出几十米长的「地毯」。","what_en":"In the old city of Antigua, Guatemala, during Holy Week before Easter, families work through the night laying carpets of dyed sawdust, flowers and pine needles tens of metres long on the cobbled streets.","fame":"花毯铺好没几个小时，抬着耶稣像的游行队伍就从上面踩过去，一铺就毁——这正是它的意思：是献给游行的，不是留着看的。","fame_en":"Hours after a carpet is finished, the procession carrying the statue of Christ walks right over it and it's gone — and that's the point: it's an offering to the procession, not something to keep.","fact":"铺花毯是「危地马拉圣周」的一部分，这整套圣周传统已经进了联合国教科文组织的人类非遗代表作名录。迈阿密附近的科勒尔盖布尔斯博物馆还请安提瓜的手艺人来铺过一张。","fact_en":"Carpet-making is part of Holy Week in Guatemala, which as a whole is on UNESCO's Representative List of Intangible Cultural Heritage — and Antigua artisans have even laid one at the Coral Gables Museum near Miami.","src":"Coral Gables Museum","url":"https://coralgablesmuseum.org/project/alfombra-de-aserrin-a-sawdust-carpet-from-antigua-guatemala-to-coral-gables/","say":{"en":"Can I help? What colour goes here?","zh":"我能帮忙吗？这里铺什么颜色？"}},"汤加草席":{"what":"汤加人系在腰间的编织草席（ta'ovala），上班、去教堂、出席正式场合都要系，等于西装领带。","what_en":"The woven mat (ta'ovala) Tongans tie around the waist for work, church and formal occasions — their equivalent of a suit and tie.","fame":"系什么样的草席，能看出场合和你跟主人家的关系；女人还常系一种叫 kiekie 的流苏腰饰。在汤加，公务员穿草席上班是很平常的事。","fame_en":"Which mat you wear shows the occasion and your relationship to the hosts; women often wear a tasselled waistband called a kiekie. In Tonga, civil servants wearing ta'ovala to work is perfectly normal.","fact":"不同场合系的草席不一样：去葬礼时系的草席可能更旧、更破，甚至不太干净——这不是失礼，而是表示悲伤。","fact_en":"Different occasions call for different mats: one worn to a funeral might be older, torn, or not especially clean — not a lack of respect, but a sign of grief.","src":"Polynesian Cultural Center","url":"https://www.polynesia.com/blog/chief-of-pccs-tongan-village-presented-with-taovala","say":{"en":"Should I wear something special to the funeral?","zh":"去葬礼我应该穿什么特别的吗？"}},"热气球节":{"what":"美国新墨西哥州阿尔伯克基每年十月的热气球节：天刚亮，五百多个热气球一起升空，有的做成猫、蜜蜂、星战人物的样子。","what_en":"Albuquerque's balloon festival every October: at dawn more than 500 balloons rise together, some shaped like cats, bees and Star Wars characters.","fame":"它是世界上最大的热气球节；阿尔伯克基的「箱子效应」——低空风往一个方向、高空风往反方向——让气球能飞出去再飘回来。","fame_en":"It's the largest balloon festival in the world, helped by the \"Albuquerque Box\" — low winds blowing one way and higher winds the other — which lets balloons drift out and float back.","fact":"第一届是 1972 年 4 月 8 日，为了庆祝当地 KOB 电台 50 岁生日办的，地点是一个购物中心的停车场：只有 13 个热气球，却来了 2 万人看。","fact_en":"The first one, on 8 April 1972, was held to celebrate local radio station KOB's 50th birthday — in a shopping-mall car park, with just 13 balloons and 20,000 spectators.","src":"Wikipedia：Albuquerque International Balloon Fiesta","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albuquerque_International_Balloon_Fiesta","say":{"en":"What time do the balloons go up tomorrow morning?","zh":"明天早上热气球几点升空？"}},"新奥尔良狂欢节":{"what":"新奥尔良每年二三月的「Mardi Gras」：一个个「krewe」社团开着花车游行，车上的人往下扔彩色珠串，路边的人抢着接。","what_en":"New Orleans' Mardi Gras each February or March: clubs called krewes parade on floats and throw strings of coloured beads to the crowds reaching up on the street.","fame":"它是美国最出名的狂欢节，节前好几周每天都有游行；国王蛋糕、紫绿金三色，还有爵士乐队，整座城都在过节。","fame_en":"It's America's most famous carnival, with parades every day for weeks beforehand — king cake, the purple, green and gold colours, and brass bands all over town.","fact":"历史最长的黑人狂欢社团 Zulu 扔的不是珠串，而是手绘的椰子。后来有人被砸伤、打官司，路易斯安那州 1988 年专门通过一部「椰子法」，让社团不用为椰子造成的伤负责，这个传统才保住。","fact_en":"The historic Black krewe Zulu hands out hand-painted coconuts, not just beads. After injuries and lawsuits, Louisiana passed a \"Coconut Bill\" in 1988 freeing the club from liability, which saved the tradition.","src":"Wikipedia：Zulu Social Aid & Pleasure Club","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zulu_Social_Aid_%26_Pleasure_Club","say":{"en":"Throw me something, mister!","zh":"这边这边！扔一个给我！"}},"时代广场跨年":{"what":"每年 12 月 31 日晚上，纽约时代广场一栋楼顶上的水晶球在最后 60 秒慢慢落下，下面上百万人一起倒数。","what_en":"Every 31 December, a crystal ball slowly drops from a rooftop in Times Square over the final 60 seconds while a million people below count down together.","fame":"很多美国人在电视上看它跨年；去现场的人下午就得进围栏，一站十个小时，不能出来上厕所。","fame_en":"Much of America sees the year out watching it on TV; people who go in person enter the pens by afternoon and stand for ten hours with no bathroom breaks.","fact":"迎接 2026 年用的是时代广场 1907 年开始跨年以来的第九个球「星座球」：直径约 3.8 米、重 12,350 磅（约 5.6 吨），上面有整整 5280 块水晶，比上一代多一倍。","fact_en":"The 2026 ball, the Constellation Ball, is the ninth since Times Square's New Year's Eve began in 1907: 12.5 feet across, 12,350 pounds, covered in exactly 5,280 Waterford crystals — double its predecessor.","src":"Time Out New York","url":"https://www.timeout.com/newyork/news/first-look-the-2026-new-years-eve-ball-is-bigger-and-more-beautiful-than-ever-112425","say":{"en":"Ten, nine, eight… Happy New Year!","zh":"十、九、八……新年快乐！"}},"卡尔加里牛仔节":{"what":"加拿大卡尔加里每年七月的十天牛仔节：骑野马、套小牛、马车赛跑，全城的人都戴牛仔帽、穿牛仔靴。","what_en":"Calgary's ten-day Stampede every July: bronc riding, calf roping and chuckwagon races, while the whole city wears cowboy hats and boots.","fame":"它号称「地球上最棒的户外表演」。这十天里银行、公司都在门口办免费的煎饼早餐，上班穿牛仔服也没人说你。","fame_en":"It bills itself as \"the Greatest Outdoor Show on Earth\". For ten days banks and businesses serve free pancake breakfasts outside, and nobody minds if you wear western gear to work.","fact":"2024 年的牛仔节来了 1,477,953 人次，破了 2012 年百年庆典时的纪录；2025 年的 1,470,288 人次排第二。","fact_en":"The 2024 Stampede drew 1,477,953 visits, beating the record set at its 2012 centennial; 2025 came second with 1,470,288.","src":"Curiocity","url":"https://curiocity.com/calgary-stampede-attendance-records/","say":{"en":"Where's the free pancake breakfast this morning?","zh":"今天早上哪儿有免费的煎饼早餐？"}},"夏威夷":{"what":"夏威夷的草裙舞（hula）：手的每个动作都在讲故事——风、海浪、花、神话里的人，配着吟唱或者尤克里里。","what_en":"Hawaiian hula: every hand movement tells part of a story — wind, waves, flowers, figures from legend — to chanting or the ukulele.","fame":"夏威夷也是冲浪和尤克里里的故乡。草裙舞在日本特别流行，日本学草裙舞的人多得惊人，每年还专门去夏威夷参加比赛。","fame_en":"Hawaii is also the home of surfing and the ukulele. Hula is hugely popular in Japan, where a remarkable number of people study it and travel to Hawaii for competitions.","fact":"1830 年，信了基督教的王后卡阿胡马努下令禁止公开跳草裙舞，它只能私下传了几十年；直到国王卡拉卡瓦（1874–1891 在位）才让它重新回到公开场合，他也因此被叫作「快乐君主」。","fact_en":"In 1830 Queen Kaʻahumanu, a Christian convert, banned public hula, and for decades it survived only in private. King Kalākaua (reigned 1874–1891) brought it back into public life — one reason he was called the \"Merrie Monarch\".","src":"Wikipedia：Kaʻahumanu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ka%CA%BBahumanu","say":{"en":"What does this hand movement mean?","zh":"这个手势是什么意思？"}},"因纽特雪屋":{"what":"因纽特人用切好的雪块一圈圈往上垒成的圆顶屋，冬天打猎时在冰原上住。","what_en":"The dome that Inuit build from blocks of snow stacked in a spiral, used for shelter on the ice during winter hunting trips.","fame":"雪是很好的隔热材料，雪屋里点一盏油灯、有几个人的体温，就比外面暖和得多；入口低、在下面，冷空气进不来。","fame_en":"Snow is a great insulator — with one oil lamp and a few people's body heat, inside is far warmer than out; the low, sunken entrance keeps the cold air out.","fact":"因纽特语里的 iglu 其实就是「房子」，什么材料的都算，雪屋另有专门的词（igluvijaq）；只有英语把 igloo 专门当成「雪屋」。外面零下 45℃ 时，光靠人的体温，雪屋里能有零下 7℃ 到 16℃。","fact_en":"In Inuit languages iglu just means a house of any material — the snow house has its own word, igluvijaq; only English narrowed \"igloo\" to snow. When it's −45°C outside, body heat alone can keep the inside between −7 and 16°C.","src":"Wikipedia：Igloo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Igloo","say":{"en":"How long does it take to build one?","zh":"搭一个要多长时间？"}},"亡灵节":{"what":"墨西哥 11 月 1 日、2 日的节日：家家摆祭坛，放上照片、万寿菊、糖做的骷髅和亲人爱吃的东西，迎接去世的家人回来看看。","what_en":"Mexico's festival on 1–2 November: families build altars with photos, marigolds, sugar skulls and the loved one's favourite foods to welcome the dead home for a visit.","fame":"它不是悲伤的节日，而是热热闹闹地想念：墓地里有人唱歌、野餐。瓦哈卡的庆祝特别有名；皮克斯的电影《寻梦环游记》让全世界认识了它。","fame_en":"It isn't a sad holiday but a lively act of remembering — people sing and picnic in cemeteries. Oaxaca's celebrations are especially famous, and Pixar's Coco introduced it to the world.","fact":"墨西哥城的亡灵节大游行是 2016 年才有的：2015 年的 007 电影《幽灵党》开场拍了一场墨西哥城的骷髅游行，其实是编的；游客看完都想来看，墨西哥城干脆第二年真办了一场，后来年年办。","fact_en":"Mexico City's big Day of the Dead parade only started in 2016: the 2015 Bond film Spectre opened with a skeleton parade there that didn't exist. Visitors wanted to see it, so the city held a real one the next year — and every year since.","src":"Halloween Daily News","url":"https://halloweendailynews.com/2016/11/james-bond-spectre-day-dead-parade","say":{"en":"Who is the altar for? Can you tell me about them?","zh":"这个祭坛是给谁的？能跟我讲讲 TA 吗？"}},"桑巴狂欢节":{"what":"里约热内卢每年二三月的狂欢节：几十所「桑巴学校」带着巨大的花车和几千名舞者，在桑巴大道上一所接一所地游行比赛。","what_en":"Rio's carnival each February or March: dozens of samba schools, each with giant floats and thousands of dancers, parade and compete one after another down the Sambadrome.","fame":"每所桑巴学校都来自一个社区，准备一整年；比赛结果公布那天，输赢能让整个街区哭或者笑。街上还有几百个免费的街头狂欢（bloco）。","fame_en":"Each samba school comes from a neighbourhood and prepares for a whole year; on results day a win or loss can make a whole district cry or celebrate. Hundreds of free street parties (blocos) fill the city too.","fact":"桑巴学校游行的桑巴大道（Sambódromo）是建筑师奥斯卡·尼迈耶设计的，1984 年启用，2012 年改建，现在能坐下约 9 万人；每年狂欢节前，整条游行大道都要重新刷成灰色。","fact_en":"The Sambadrome where the schools parade was designed by architect Oscar Niemeyer, opened in 1984 and rebuilt in 2012; it now holds about 90,000 people, and the parade avenue is repainted grey before every carnival.","src":"Wikipedia：Sambadrome Marquês de Sapucaí","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sambadrome_Marqu%C3%AAs_de_Sapuca%C3%AD","say":{"en":"Which samba school do you support?","zh":"你支持哪所桑巴学校？"}},"太阳节":{"what":"秘鲁库斯科每年 6 月 24 日的太阳节（Inti Raymi）：几百名演员穿上印加服装，在城外的萨克塞瓦曼古城墙下重现祭太阳神的仪式。","what_en":"Cusco's Festival of the Sun on 24 June: hundreds of performers in Inca dress re-enact the ceremony for the sun god beneath the ancient walls of Sacsayhuamán.","fame":"它在南半球的冬至前后，是印加帝国最重要的节日；现在是南美最大的节庆之一，库斯科那一周酒店爆满。","fame_en":"Held around the southern winter solstice, it was the Inca Empire's most important festival; today it's one of South America's biggest, and Cusco's hotels are full that week.","fact":"有记载的、印加皇帝亲自在场的最后一次太阳节是 1535 年，之后西班牙殖民者和神父把它禁了；今天看到的版本是 1944 年由 Faustino Espinoza Navarro 带着原住民演员，照着古代编年史重新排演出来的。","fact_en":"The last Inti Raymi held in the Inca emperor's presence was in 1535; after that Spanish colonists and priests banned it. Today's version was reconstructed in 1944 by Faustino Espinoza Navarro with Indigenous actors, based on old chronicles.","src":"Wikipedia：Inti Raymi","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inti_Raymi","say":{"en":"Do we need tickets for the ceremony at Sacsayhuamán?","zh":"萨克塞瓦曼的仪式需要买票吗？"}},"麦德林花节":{"what":"哥伦比亚麦德林每年八月的花节：最出名的是「背花人」（silleteros）游行，花农把用鲜花扎成的大花架背在背上走过全城。","what_en":"Medellín's Flower Festival every August, best known for the silleteros parade, where flower growers carry huge flower arrangements on their backs through the city.","fame":"背花人大多来自城外山上的圣埃伦娜，以前他们就是这样背着花架下山进城卖花的。麦德林气候一年四季像春天，被叫作「永春之城」。","fame_en":"Most silleteros come from Santa Elena in the hills above the city, where growers once carried flowers down to market exactly like this. Medellín's year-round mild weather earned it the name \"City of Eternal Spring\".","fact":"背花人游行从 1957 年开始正式办，当初是为了帮城外山上（尤其是圣埃伦娜）的花农把花卖出去。","fact_en":"The silleteros parade has been held officially since 1957, started to boost the market for flowers grown by farmers in the hills around the city, especially Santa Elena.","src":"麦德林市政府","url":"https://www.medellin.gov.co/es/sala-de-prensa/noticias/historia-de-los-silleteros-origenes-tradicion-y-evolucion/","say":{"en":"How heavy is that flower frame on your back?","zh":"你背上的花架有多重？"}},"巴兰基亚狂欢节":{"what":"哥伦比亚加勒比海边城市巴兰基亚在大斋期前的四天狂欢：花车、库姆比亚舞、面具和满街的玉米粉大战。","what_en":"The four days of carnival before Lent in Barranquilla, on Colombia's Caribbean coast: floats, cumbia dancing, masks and flour fights in the streets.","fame":"它是南美仅次于里约的第二大狂欢节，2003 年被联合国教科文组织评为人类口头和非物质遗产代表作。夏奇拉就是巴兰基亚人。","fame_en":"It's South America's second-biggest carnival after Rio, proclaimed a UNESCO Masterpiece of the Oral and Intangible Heritage of Humanity in 2003 — and Shakira is from Barranquilla.","fact":"狂欢节最后一天，大家要给一个叫 Joselito Carnaval 的角色办「葬礼」，假装哭着送他走，意思是狂欢结束了。开场的「花之战」大游行 1903 年就有了，当时是为了庆祝千日战争结束。","fact_en":"On the last day, everyone holds a \"funeral\" for a character called Joselito Carnaval, mourning him in mock grief to mark the end of the party. The opening Battle of Flowers parade dates to 1903, when it celebrated the end of the Thousand Days' War.","src":"Wikipedia：Barranquilla Carnival","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barranquilla_Carnival","say":{"en":"Where's the Battle of Flowers parade passing?","zh":"花之战游行从哪儿经过？"}},"奥塔瓦洛市集":{"what":"厄瓜多尔安第斯山里的奥塔瓦洛，「斗篷广场」上天天有手工艺摊，星期六整个市中心都变成市集：毛毯、披肩、挂毯、吊床。","what_en":"In Otavalo, high in Ecuador's Andes, the Plaza de los Ponchos has craft stalls every day, and on Saturdays half the town centre becomes a market: blankets, ponchos, tapestries, hammocks.","fame":"它是南美最出名的原住民市集之一。卖东西的大多是奥塔瓦洛人，说克丘亚语，男人留长辫、戴毡帽，女人穿白衬衫戴金色珠链。","fame_en":"It's one of South America's best-known Indigenous markets. Most sellers are Otavalo people who speak Kichwa — men with long braids and felt hats, women in white blouses with gold bead necklaces.","fact":"奥塔瓦洛人从印加之前就以织布和经商出名；现在奥塔瓦洛商人和乐手在全世界六大洲三十多个国家生活、工作，欧洲很多城市的街头都能碰到他们。","fact_en":"The Otavalo have been known as weavers and traders since before the Incas; today Otavalo merchants and musicians live and work in more than thirty countries on six continents.","src":"University of Texas Press：Andean Entrepreneurs","url":"https://utpress.utexas.edu/9780292752597/andean-entrepreneurs/","say":{"en":"Is this alpaca wool? Can you do a better price if I take two?","zh":"这是羊驼毛吗？买两条能便宜点吗？"}},"奥鲁罗狂欢节":{"what":"玻利维亚高原矿城奥鲁罗的狂欢节：上千名戴着魔鬼面具、穿着亮片服装的舞者，跳着「魔鬼舞」（Diablada）游行一整天。","what_en":"The carnival of the Bolivian highland mining town of Oruro: thousands of dancers in devil masks and sequinned costumes perform the Diablada in an all-day procession.","fame":"它是安第斯山原住民传统和天主教结合的节日，2001 年被联合国教科文组织列为人类口头和非物质遗产代表作；很多舞者一跳就是一辈子。","fame_en":"It blends Andean Indigenous traditions with Catholicism and was proclaimed a UNESCO masterpiece of intangible heritage in 2001; many dancers keep taking part their whole lives.","fact":"狂欢节献给「矿井圣母」（Virgen del Socavón），她是保护矿工的守护神——奥鲁罗是座老矿城。大游行走到最后，舞者们要跪下来，求圣母保佑。","fact_en":"The carnival is dedicated to the Virgen del Socavón — the Virgin of the Mineshaft, protector of miners in this old mining town. At the end of the procession, the dancers kneel to ask for her blessing.","src":"Atlas Obscura","url":"https://www.atlasobscura.com/articles/carnaval-de-oruro-bolivia","say":{"en":"How heavy is your devil mask?","zh":"你的魔鬼面具有多重？"}},"阿联酋猎鹰":{"what":"猎鹰是阿联酋的国家象征：以前沙漠里的人驯鹰打猎，现在养鹰、比赛、看鹰展是很多阿联酋人的爱好。","what_en":"The falcon is the UAE's national symbol: desert people once trained falcons to hunt, and today raising, racing and showing them is a passion for many Emiratis.","fame":"阿布扎比有专门的猎鹰医院，给鹰看病、剪指甲、修羽毛，游客也能参观。一只好鹰能卖到很贵，比赛奖品可能是一辆车。","fame_en":"Abu Dhabi has a dedicated falcon hospital that treats birds, trims talons and repairs feathers — and visitors can tour it. A good falcon can sell for a fortune, and race prizes can include cars.","fact":"在阿联酋，猎鹰有自己的护照：为了防走私，政府从 2002 年开始给鹰发护照，有效期三年；到 2013 年已经发了约 2.8 万本。阿提哈德航空还允许猎鹰坐在客舱里。","fact_en":"In the UAE falcons have their own passports: to stop smuggling, the government began issuing them in 2002, valid for three years — about 28,000 by 2013. Etihad even lets falcons fly in the cabin.","src":"CNN Travel","url":"https://edition.cnn.com/travel/article/falcons-planes-middle-east","say":{"en":"Can I hold the falcon? Do I need a glove?","zh":"我能托一下猎鹰吗？要戴手套吗？"}},"阿尔达剑舞":{"what":"沙特阿拉伯纳季德地区的剑舞（Ardah）：男人们排成两排，随着大鼓和诗人吟诵的诗句，一起挥剑、晃动身体。","what_en":"The Ardah sword dance of Saudi Arabia's Najd: men stand in two facing rows, swaying and raising swords to big drums and lines of poetry chanted by a poet.","fame":"它是沙特最有代表性的传统表演，婚礼、节日、国庆都跳；外国元首来访时，沙特常常用阿尔达来欢迎。2015 年它进了联合国非遗名录。","fame_en":"It's Saudi Arabia's signature traditional performance, danced at weddings, holidays and the national day; visiting heads of state are often welcomed with an Ardah. It joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list in 2015.","fact":"阿尔达原本只在部落男人出征前跳；现在用在庆典和外交场合——2017 年美国总统特朗普访问利雅得时，就在穆拉巴宫跟沙特人一起跳过。","fact_en":"The Ardah was originally danced only by tribesmen before going to war; now it's for celebrations and diplomacy — in 2017 U.S. President Donald Trump joined in at the Murabba Palace in Riyadh.","src":"Wikipedia：Ardah","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ardah","say":{"en":"Is it okay to film the dance?","zh":"可以拍这个舞吗？"}},"瓦迪拉姆贝都因":{"what":"约旦南部的红色沙漠瓦迪拉姆：贝都因人在这里放骆驼、开吉普车带游客，晚上在帐篷营地里请你喝茶、吃地坑里烤的肉（zarb）。","what_en":"Wadi Rum, the red desert of southern Jordan: Bedouin herd camels and drive visitors in jeeps, then serve tea and zarb — meat slow-cooked in a pit under the sand — at their tent camps.","fame":"《阿拉伯的劳伦斯》让它出名；这里的红沙、巨石和星空，在很多人眼里就是「另一个星球」。","fame_en":"Lawrence of Arabia made it famous; its red sand, towering rocks and starry nights look like another planet to most visitors.","fact":"它真的经常演「另一个星球」：电影《火星救援》（2015）里的火星沙漠就是在瓦迪拉姆拍的，《沙丘》（2021）也在这一带取景。","fact_en":"It really does keep playing other planets: the Martian desert scenes in The Martian (2015) were shot in Wadi Rum, and Dune (2021) was filmed in and around it too.","src":"Far Out Magazine","url":"https://faroutmagazine.co.uk/wadi-rum-jordan-filming-location/","say":{"en":"How long does the zarb take to cook?","zh":"地坑烤肉要烤多久？"}},"英托雷舞":{"what":"卢旺达的「英雄之舞」（Intore）：男舞者头戴长长的白色草须，手拿长矛和盾牌，跺脚、跳跃，女人们拍手唱歌。","what_en":"Rwanda's \"dance of heroes\" (Intore): male dancers in long white grass-fibre headdresses leap and stamp with spears and shields while women clap and sing.","fame":"它是卢旺达最有代表性的表演，国家庆典、婚礼、欢迎客人都跳；舞者一甩头，长长的白色草须像狮子的鬃毛一样飞起来。","fame_en":"It's Rwanda's signature performance — at national ceremonies, weddings and welcomes; when the dancers toss their heads, the long white fibres fly like a lion's mane.","fact":"以前跳英托雷的人要被挑进宫廷里的「Itorero」去训练，学的不只是跳舞，还有价值观、口才和治理之道。2024 年英托雷舞进了联合国非遗名录。","fact_en":"Intore dancers were once chosen to train at the royal court's Itorero, learning not just dance but values, public speaking and governance. In 2024 Intore joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list.","src":"UNESCO 非物质文化遗产","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/intore-02129","say":{"en":"That was amazing! How long have you been dancing?","zh":"太精彩了！你跳了多少年了？"}},"库姆博卡仪式":{"what":"赞比亚西部洛兹人的仪式：雨季赞比西河洪水漫上平原时，国王（Litunga）坐上一艘大船，几百个人划桨，把王宫从平原搬到高地上。","what_en":"A ceremony of the Lozi people in western Zambia: when the Zambezi floods the plain in the rainy season, the king (Litunga) boards a great barge and hundreds of paddlers move the royal court from the plain to higher ground.","fame":"王船 Nalikwanda 上画着黑白条纹，顶上有一头大黑象；从 Lealui 划到 Limulunga 要大半天，鼓声一路不停，岸边站满了人。","fame_en":"The royal barge Nalikwanda is painted in black and white stripes with a great black elephant on top; the trip from Lealui to Limulunga takes most of a day, with drums beating all the way and crowds lining the banks.","fact":"库姆博卡不是每年都办——要看洪水够不够大。2019 年赞比西河水位太低，洛兹王室就宣布取消了当年的仪式。","fact_en":"Kuomboka doesn't happen every year — it depends on the flood. In 2019 the Zambezi's water was too low, so the Lozi royal establishment cancelled that year's ceremony.","src":"Lusaka Times","url":"https://www.lusakatimes.com/2019/03/24/low-water-levels-knocks-out-this-years-kuomboka-ceremony/","say":{"en":"When is Kuomboka this year? Is the water high enough?","zh":"今年的库姆博卡是哪天？水够大吗？"}},"辛巴族":{"what":"纳米比亚西北部的半游牧民族辛巴人：女人把红土和黄油调成的红膏（otjize）涂满全身和发辫，皮肤和头发都是红色的。","what_en":"The semi-nomadic Himba of northwest Namibia: women cover their skin and braids in otjize, a paste of butterfat and red ochre, so both glow red.","fame":"红膏防晒、防虫，也是辛巴人眼里的美；发型能看出一个人的年龄和婚姻状况。奥普沃一带的村子可以在当地向导带领下拜访。","fame_en":"Otjize protects from sun and insects and is the Himba ideal of beauty; hairstyles show a person's age and marital status. Villages around Opuwo can be visited with a local guide.","fact":"那里缺水，辛巴女人每天用烟来「洗澡」：烧香草和树脂，让烟熏过全身，用来清洁、除味、当香水。","fact_en":"Water is scarce, so Himba women \"bathe\" in smoke every day — burning aromatic herbs and resins and letting the smoke wash over them as cleanser, deodorant and perfume.","src":"Wikipedia：Himba people","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Himba_people","say":{"en":"May I take a photo? Is it okay with you?","zh":"我可以拍张照吗？你介意吗？"}},"马赛人跳跃舞":{"what":"肯尼亚和坦桑尼亚马赛人的跳跃舞（adumu）：年轻战士围成一圈唱歌，一两个人走进中间，身体挺直往上跳，比谁跳得高。","what_en":"The jumping dance (adumu) of the Maasai in Kenya and Tanzania: young warriors chant in a circle while one or two step into the middle and leap straight up, competing to jump highest.","fame":"红色格子披巾、长矛和直上直下的跳跃，是很多人对马赛人的第一印象；跳得高的人很受姑娘欢迎。","fame_en":"Red checked shukas, spears and straight-up leaps are most people's first image of the Maasai — and the best jumpers get the most attention from the girls.","fact":"跳跃舞原本是 Eunoto 仪式的一部分：年轻战士（moran）离开家，在战士营里一起生活最长可达十年，然后通过这场仪式成为成年战士。","fact_en":"The adumu is traditionally part of Eunoto, the ceremony in which young warriors (moran) become senior warriors — after living together in a warriors' camp away from home for up to ten years.","src":"G Adventures","url":"https://www.gadventures.com/blog/story-behind-maasai-jumping-dance/","say":{"en":"How high can you jump? Can I try?","zh":"你能跳多高？我能试试吗？"}},"13个月的日历":{"what":"埃塞俄比亚用自己的历法：一年 13 个月，12 个月每月 30 天，最后一个月只有 5 天（闰年 6 天）。","what_en":"Ethiopia uses its own calendar: 13 months — twelve of 30 days and a last month of just 5 days (6 in a leap year).","fame":"埃塞俄比亚的年份比公历晚七八年，所以那里的人说「我们比世界年轻」；旅游局还用过「13 个月的阳光」当口号。","fame_en":"Ethiopian years run seven or eight behind the Gregorian calendar, so people joke that Ethiopia is younger than the world; the tourist board has used \"13 months of sunshine\" as a slogan.","fact":"埃塞俄比亚的新年在公历 9 月 11 日（闰年前一年是 9 月 12 日）：2025 年 9 月 11 日，埃塞俄比亚才刚刚迎来 2018 年。","fact_en":"Ethiopian New Year falls on 11 September (12 September before a leap year): on 11 September 2025, Ethiopia welcomed the year 2018.","src":"The Star（肯尼亚）","url":"https://www.the-star.co.ke/news/2025-09-11-why-ethiopia-is-celebrating-new-year-2018-today","say":{"en":"What's the date today in the Ethiopian calendar?","zh":"按埃塞俄比亚历，今天是几月几号？"}},"杜尔巴节":{"what":"尼日利亚北部卡诺在开斋节和宰牲节的骑马大游行：穿着华丽长袍、骑着盛装马匹的骑手们向埃米尔（当地传统首领）致敬。","what_en":"The great horseback procession in Kano, northern Nigeria, at Eid al-Fitr and Eid al-Adha: riders in splendid robes on decorated horses pay homage to the Emir, the traditional ruler.","fame":"它源自几百年前各贵族家族的骑兵队；最精彩的是最后的冲锋致敬，骑手们一队队飞奔到埃米尔面前，突然勒马、举剑。","fame_en":"It grew out of the cavalry regiments noble households kept centuries ago; the climax is the charge, when riders gallop up to the Emir in waves, rein in sharply and raise their swords.","fact":"2024 年「卡诺杜尔巴」进了联合国非遗名录。它一年办两次，开斋节和宰牲节各一次，大约一万名骑马的人，加上步行的男男女女。","fact_en":"In 2024 \"Durbar in Kano\" joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list. It happens twice a year, at Eid al-Fitr and Eid al-Kabir, with about 10,000 men on horseback plus men and women on foot.","src":"UNESCO 非物质文化遗产","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/durbar-in-kano-01895","say":{"en":"Eid Mubarak! Where's the best place to watch the durbar?","zh":"开斋节快乐！在哪儿看杜尔巴最好？"}},"乒乓球":{"what":"中国的“国球”：一张桌子、一个小白球，公园里、小区里、学校里到处都有球台。","what_en":"China's 'national ball game': a table, a little white ball, and tables everywhere — in parks, housing estates and schools.","fame":"中国队在奥运会上几乎包揽了乒乓球金牌；在中国，很多人小时候都在水泥球台上打过，周末公园里排队等台子的老人和孩子是常见的画面。","fame_en":"China wins almost every Olympic table tennis gold. Most Chinese people played on a concrete table as kids, and at weekends you see old people and children queuing for a table in the park.","fact":"2024 年巴黎奥运会，乒乓球一共 5 块金牌全被中国拿走；最后一块是女子团体决赛 3 比 0 赢日本，这也是中国在奥运历史上的第 300 块金牌。","fact_en":"At Paris 2024 China won all five table tennis golds. The last one, a 3–0 win over Japan in the women's team final, was also China's 300th Olympic gold medal ever.","src":"Wikipedia：Table tennis at the 2024 Summer Olympics","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Table_tennis_at_the_2024_Summer_Olympics","say":{"en":"Fancy a game? Loser buys the drinks.","zh":"来一局吗？输了的请喝水。"}},"鸟巢":{"what":"北京国家体育场，2008 年北京奥运会的主体育场，外面是一圈交叉的钢架，看起来像一个大鸟窝。","what_en":"Beijing's National Stadium, the main stadium of the 2008 Olympics, wrapped in criss-crossing steel that looks like a giant bird's nest.","fame":"2008 年奥运会的开幕式、田径比赛都在这里；现在平时开演唱会、办足球赛，冬天还会改成冰雪乐园，晚上亮灯的时候很多人专门来拍照。","fame_en":"The 2008 opening ceremony and athletics were held here. Today it hosts concerts and football, turns into a snow park in winter, and people come at night just to photograph it lit up.","fact":"2022 年北京冬奥会的开幕式又在鸟巢举行——它成了世界上唯一一座既办过夏季奥运会、又办过冬季奥运会开幕式的体育场。","fact_en":"The 2022 Winter Olympics opened at the Bird's Nest too, making it the only stadium in the world to host the opening ceremonies of both a Summer and a Winter Games.","src":"Wikipedia：Beijing National Stadium","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beijing_National_Stadium","say":{"en":"Which gate is closest to the subway?","zh":"哪个门离地铁最近？"}},"姚明":{"kind":"person","what":"上海出生的篮球运动员，身高 2.26 米，在 NBA 休斯敦火箭队打了九个赛季。","what_en":"A basketball player from Shanghai, 2.26 m tall, who spent nine seasons with the Houston Rockets in the NBA.","fame":"2002 年他是 NBA 选秀的状元，八次入选全明星；他让很多中国人开始半夜起来看 NBA，也让美国人认识了中国球员。2016 年进了篮球名人堂，是第一个进名人堂的中国人。","fame_en":"He was the No. 1 pick in the 2002 NBA draft and an eight-time All-Star. He got millions of Chinese fans watching the NBA in the middle of the night, and in 2016 became the first Chinese player in the Basketball Hall of Fame.","fact":"退役后他当了中国篮协主席；2024 年 10 月他主动辞职，说国家队这几年的成绩“没有达到预期”。","fact_en":"After retiring he became president of the Chinese Basketball Association. In October 2024 he resigned, saying the national team's results in recent years had not met expectations.","src":"NBA.com，2024","url":"https://www.nba.com/news/yao-ming-steps-down-as-head-of-chinese-national-league","say":{"en":"Yao was so tall the hoop looked small.","zh":"姚明高得篮筐都显得小了。"}},"苏超":{"what":"江苏省城市足球联赛：2025 年江苏 13 个城市各出一支业余球队，城市对城市地踢。","what_en":"The Jiangsu city football league: in 2025 each of Jiangsu's 13 cities sent an amateur team to play city against city.","fame":"球员大多是上班族、学生和老师，但城市之间互相开玩笑（“比赛第一，友谊第十四”），让这个业余联赛成了全国话题，看台上动不动坐满几万人。","fame_en":"Most players have day jobs — office workers, students, teachers — but the cities' friendly trash talk turned an amateur league into a national talking point, with tens of thousands in the stands.","fact":"第一届苏超决赛 2025 年 11 月 1 日在南京奥体中心踢，泰州和南通 90 分钟 0 比 0，点球 4 比 3，“黑马”泰州拿了冠军；现场来了 6 万 2 千多人，刷新了中国业余比赛的观众纪录。","fact_en":"The first Su Chao final, on 1 November 2025 at Nanjing Olympic Sports Centre, ended 0–0 after 90 minutes; underdogs Taizhou beat Nantong 4–3 on penalties in front of more than 62,000 fans, a record for amateur football in China.","src":"新华网，2025","url":"https://www.news.cn/sports/20251102/278ae9c409d34bcfa293cb566faf681d/c.html","say":{"en":"Which city are you supporting tonight?","zh":"今晚你支持哪个城市？"}},"村超":{"what":"贵州榕江的“乡村足球超级联赛”：村里人自己组队踢，球员是厨师、老师、农民和学生。","what_en":"The 'Village Super League' in Rongjiang, Guizhou: villagers form their own teams — cooks, teachers, farmers and students.","fame":"2023 年在网上火遍全国：比赛不收门票，中场休息有侗族大歌、苗族芦笙舞，看台上坐满了人，很多游客专门坐车来看一场。","fame_en":"It went viral across China in 2023: free tickets, Dong choirs and Miao lusheng dancers at half-time, packed stands, and tourists travelling just to see a match.","fact":"第一届村超是 2023 年 1 月开始的，最早只有三宝侗寨的 8 支村队；奖品不是奖金，而是本地的农产品——到 2024 年参赛的队已经变成 62 支。","fact_en":"The first season began in January 2023 with just eight village teams in Sanbao Dong village. The prizes aren't cash but local farm produce — and by 2024 there were 62 teams.","src":"Wikipedia：Village Super League","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Village_Super_League","say":{"en":"What a goal! That was beautiful!","zh":"这个球进得太漂亮了！"}},"村BA":{"what":"贵州台江县台盘村的乡村篮球赛：苗族“六月六”吃新节时，全村人围着球场看球。","what_en":"The village basketball games of Taipan, Taijiang county, Guizhou, played during the Miao 'Sixth of June' new-rice festival with the whole village courtside.","fame":"2022 年在网上火了，网友学着 NBA 叫它“村 BA”：球员是村民，看台是山坡和屋顶，奖品可能是一头牛或几只羊，气氛比职业比赛还热闹。","fame_en":"It went viral in 2022 and fans nicknamed it 'Village BA' after the NBA. Players are villagers, the stands are hillsides and rooftops, prizes can be a cow or a few sheep, and the atmosphere beats many pro games.","fact":"后来村 BA 变成了全国比赛：2023 年 10 月第一届全国“和美乡村篮球大赛”总决赛就在台盘村打，冠军是广东中山沙溪队，决赛 84 比 78 逆转了东莞大朗队。","fact_en":"It has since become a national event: the first national village basketball finals were held in Taipan in October 2023, won by Shaxi from Zhongshan, Guangdong, who came back to beat Dalang 84–78.","src":"中国新闻网，2023","url":"https://www.chinanews.com.cn/ty/2023/10-25/10100582.shtml","say":{"en":"Come on! One more basket!","zh":"加油！再进一个！"}},"澳门格兰披治":{"what":"澳门格兰披治大赛车：每年十一月在澳门街道上围起来的东望洋赛道上比赛。","what_en":"The Macau Grand Prix, raced every November on the Guia Circuit, a track made of Macau's own city streets.","fame":"赛道窄、弯急、两边就是护栏，被认为是世界上最难开的街道赛之一；塞纳、舒马赫都在这里赢过，很多车手是在澳门出名后去了 F1。","fame_en":"Narrow, twisty and lined with barriers, it's one of the hardest street circuits in the world. Senna and Schumacher both won here, and many drivers made their name in Macau before Formula One.","fact":"1954 年它最早想办的其实是一场在澳门街上的“寻宝游戏”，后来有人说这条路线正好可以比赛车，才变成了大赛车；1983 年第一次用 F3 赛车比，冠军就是还没进 F1 的塞纳。","fact_en":"In 1954 it was first planned as a treasure hunt around Macau's streets, until someone suggested the route would make a good race track. In 1983, the first year with Formula Three cars, the winner was a pre-F1 Ayrton Senna.","src":"Wikipedia：Macau Grand Prix","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macau_Grand_Prix","say":{"en":"Where's the best corner to watch from?","zh":"在哪个弯道看最好？"}},"叼羊":{"what":"中亚草原上的马背比赛，哈萨克语叫 kokpar：两队骑手抢一只羊（现在常用假羊），把它扔进对方的球门。","what_en":"A horseback game of the Central Asian steppe, called kokpar in Kazakh: two teams of riders fight over a goat carcass (often a dummy today) and throw it into a goal.","fame":"它比马球野得多，人和马挤在一起抢；在哈萨克斯坦，节日、婚礼和纳吾肉孜节常有叼羊，现在全国 14 个州都有职业队。","fame_en":"It's far rougher than polo, with horses and riders crammed together in a scrum. In Kazakhstan it's played at holidays, weddings and Nauryz, and all 14 regions now have professional teams.","fact":"2024 年世界游牧民族运动会在阿斯塔纳举行，叼羊决赛哈萨克斯坦对吉尔吉斯斯坦，哈萨克斯坦 5 比 4 拿了金牌；吉尔吉斯斯坦则在另一种规则的“kok-boru”里赢了。","fact_en":"At the 2024 World Nomad Games in Astana, Kazakhstan beat Kyrgyzstan 5–4 in the kokpar final — while Kyrgyzstan won the separate 'kok-boru' version of the game.","src":"The Times of Central Asia，2024","url":"https://timesca.com/a-bone-of-contention-kazakhstan-and-kyrgyzstan-at-loggerheads-following-world-nomad-games-kokpar-final/","say":{"en":"Is it safe to stand this close?","zh":"站这么近安全吗？"}},"熊野古道":{"what":"日本和歌山县纪伊半岛山里的一组朝圣路，通往熊野的三座大神社。","what_en":"A network of pilgrimage trails through the mountains of the Kii Peninsula in Wakayama, leading to the three grand shrines of Kumano.","fame":"一千多年来，从天皇到农民都走过这些石板山路；2004 年列入世界遗产。现在走的人住在山里的民宿、泡温泉，一天走几个小时。","fame_en":"For over a thousand years everyone from emperors to farmers walked these stone-paved paths, and they became World Heritage in 2004. Today walkers stay in mountain inns, soak in hot springs and hike a few hours a day.","fact":"熊野古道和西班牙的圣地亚哥朝圣之路是“姐妹路”：两条都走完的人可以登记成“双朝圣者”（Dual Pilgrim），2015 年起开始登记。","fact_en":"The Kumano Kodō is twinned with Spain's Camino de Santiago: people who walk both can register as a 'Dual Pilgrim', a scheme that started in 2015.","src":"田边市熊野旅游局","url":"https://www.tb-kumano.jp/en/?p=234","say":{"en":"Where can I get my stamp book stamped?","zh":"在哪里可以盖朝圣章？"}},"跆拳道":{"what":"韩国的国技：以踢腿为主的格斗运动，穿白色道服、系不同颜色的腰带。","what_en":"Korea's national martial art: a combat sport built on kicks, practised in a white uniform with coloured belts.","fame":"2000 年悉尼奥运会起成为正式比赛项目；世界各地的小孩下课去道馆学跆拳道，韩国首尔的国技院（Kukkiwon）是全世界考段位的总部。","fame_en":"It's been an Olympic sport since Sydney 2000. Kids all over the world go to a dojang after school, and Kukkiwon in Seoul is the world headquarters for black-belt grading.","fact":"国际跆拳道联合会以前叫 World Taekwondo Federation，缩写是 WTF——2017 年它改名成 World Taekwondo，说这个缩写在网上“有了负面的意思”。","fact_en":"The sport's world body used to be the World Taekwondo Federation — WTF. In 2017 it renamed itself World Taekwondo, saying the acronym had picked up 'negative connotations' online.","src":"Wikipedia：World Taekwondo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Taekwondo","say":{"en":"What colour belt are you?","zh":"你是什么颜色的带？"}},"泰拳":{"what":"泰国的格斗运动，被叫作“八肢艺术”：拳、肘、膝、腿都能打。","what_en":"Thailand's combat sport, called 'the art of eight limbs': fists, elbows, knees and shins are all weapons.","fame":"在曼谷的拉差达慕和伦披尼拳馆每周都有比赛，赛前拳手跳一段祭拜师傅的舞（wai khru），旁边有乐队伴奏；世界各地的人专门来泰国的训练营学。","fame_en":"Bangkok's Rajadamnern and Lumpinee stadiums hold fights every week. Before each bout fighters perform the wai khru dance to honour their teacher, with a live band playing, and people fly in from around the world to train at Thai camps.","fact":"泰拳的国际联合会（IFMA）2016 年拿到国际奥委会的临时承认，2021 年东京奥运会期间正式获得完全承认——离进奥运又近了一步，但现在还不是奥运比赛项目。","fact_en":"The International Federation of Muaythai (IFMA) got provisional IOC recognition in 2016 and full recognition in 2021 during the Tokyo Games — a step closer to the Olympics, though it isn't an Olympic event yet.","src":"IFMA 官网","url":"https://muaythai.sport/organisation/about-us/","say":{"en":"How much is a ringside ticket tonight?","zh":"今晚拳台边的票多少钱？"}},"板球":{"what":"用球拍击球、跑垒得分的球类运动，两队各 11 人；在印度，它几乎是全民的爱好。","what_en":"A bat-and-ball game of two teams of eleven, scoring runs between wickets — in India, close to a national obsession.","fame":"孟买的街上、空地上到处是打板球的孩子；印度超级联赛（IPL）的比赛场场爆满，大赛时整个国家都停下来看。","fame_en":"Every street and open patch of Mumbai has kids playing cricket. Indian Premier League matches sell out, and when India play a big match the whole country stops to watch.","fact":"2023 年 10 月国际奥委会在孟买开会，决定板球进入 2028 年洛杉矶奥运会——这是它 1900 年巴黎奥运会之后第一次回到奥运。","fact_en":"In October 2023, at a session held in Mumbai, the IOC voted cricket into the Los Angeles 2028 Olympics — its first appearance since Paris 1900.","src":"Al Jazeera，2023","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2023/10/9/cricket-among-five-sports-to-get-los-angeles-2028-olympics-nod","say":{"en":"What's the score? Is India batting?","zh":"比分多少？现在是印度在击球吗？"}},"瑜伽":{"what":"起源于古代印度的身心练习：体式、呼吸和冥想。瑞诗凯诗在恒河边，被叫作“世界瑜伽之都”。","what_en":"An ancient Indian practice of postures, breathing and meditation. Rishikesh, on the Ganges, calls itself the 'Yoga Capital of the World'.","fame":"1968 年披头士来瑞诗凯诗的修行院住过，让这里在西方出了名；现在镇上满是瑜伽学校，每年三月办国际瑜伽节。","fame_en":"The Beatles stayed at an ashram in Rishikesh in 1968 and made it famous in the West. Today the town is full of yoga schools and hosts an International Yoga Festival every March.","fact":"每年 6 月 21 日是联合国定的“国际瑜伽日”：2014 年印度总理莫迪在联合国大会上提议，选这一天是因为它是北半球白天最长的一天；第一次过是 2015 年。","fact_en":"21 June is the UN's International Day of Yoga. India's Prime Minister Modi proposed it at the UN General Assembly in 2014, choosing the longest day of the year in the northern hemisphere; it was first marked in 2015.","src":"Wikipedia：International Day of Yoga","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Day_of_Yoga","say":{"en":"Is this class OK for beginners?","zh":"这节课初学者能上吗？"}},"黄金海岸冲浪":{"what":"澳大利亚昆士兰的黄金海岸，一长串沙滩，是世界有名的冲浪地。","what_en":"Queensland's Gold Coast, a long chain of beaches and one of the world's famous surf spots.","fame":"Snapper Rocks、Kirra、Burleigh 的浪又长又整齐，世界冲浪职业巡回赛常在这里比赛；早上六点海里已经全是冲浪板。","fame_en":"The waves at Snapper Rocks, Kirra and Burleigh peel long and clean, the world pro surfing tour often holds events here, and by 6 a.m. the water is full of boards.","fact":"2016 年 3 月，从 Burleigh 到 Snapper Rocks 大约 16 公里的海岸被正式命名为全世界第 8 个“世界冲浪保护区”，这里的浪点受到保护。","fact_en":"In March 2016 about 16 km of coast from Burleigh to Snapper Rocks was officially dedicated as the world's eighth World Surfing Reserve, protecting its breaks.","src":"昆士兰州政府","url":"https://www.qld.gov.au/environment/parks/queenslands-world-surfing-reserves","say":{"en":"Is it too big for beginners today?","zh":"今天的浪对新手来说太大了吗？"}},"澳网公开赛":{"what":"澳大利亚网球公开赛：每年一月在墨尔本公园打，是四大满贯里每年第一个。","what_en":"The Australian Open, played every January at Melbourne Park — the first of tennis's four Grand Slams each year.","fame":"一月是南半球的盛夏，球场边常常三四十度；蓝色的硬地、夜场和热闹的看台让它被叫作“快乐的大满贯”。","fame_en":"January is high summer down south, often 35–40°C courtside. Blue hard courts, night sessions and lively crowds earned it the nickname 'the happy Slam'.","fact":"2024 年澳网第一次从星期天开打、变成 15 天的比赛——原因之一是 2023 年有一场比赛一直打到凌晨 4 点 05 分才结束。","fact_en":"In 2024 the Australian Open started on a Sunday for the first time, becoming a 15-day event — partly because a 2023 match had finished at 4:05 a.m.","src":"Tennis Australia，2023","url":"https://tennis.com.au/news/2023/10/02/sunday-start-a-major-change-for-australian-open-2024","say":{"en":"Do you have tickets for the night session?","zh":"你有夜场的票吗？"}},"全黑队":{"what":"新西兰国家橄榄球队，一身黑色球衣，叫 All Blacks。","what_en":"New Zealand's national rugby union team, dressed head to toe in black — the All Blacks.","fame":"它是世界上赢球率最高的球队之一，拿过三次橄榄球世界杯（1987、2011、2015）；每场比赛前全队面对对手跳毛利战舞哈卡（haka）。","fame_en":"One of the most successful teams in any sport, they've won the Rugby World Cup three times (1987, 2011, 2015), and before every match they face their opponents with a Māori haka.","fact":"他们最常跳的哈卡叫《Ka Mate》，是毛利酋长 Te Rauparaha 大约 1820 年编的；2014 年新西兰专门通过一部法律，规定商业使用时要注明它是 Te Rauparaha 作的。","fact_en":"Their best-known haka, 'Ka Mate', was composed around 1820 by the Māori chief Te Rauparaha. In 2014 New Zealand passed a law requiring commercial uses to credit him as its composer.","src":"新西兰法律数据库：Haka Ka Mate Attribution Act 2014","url":"https://www.legislation.govt.nz/act/public/2014/18/en/latest/","say":{"en":"Shh, the haka's starting!","zh":"嘘，哈卡开始了！"}},"皇后镇蹦极":{"what":"新西兰皇后镇附近的卡瓦劳大桥蹦极：从 43 米高的桥上跳向河面。","what_en":"The bungy jump off the Kawarau Bridge near Queenstown, New Zealand: a 43-metre leap towards the river.","fame":"它是世界上第一个商业蹦极点；从这里开始，皇后镇成了“极限运动之都”，跳伞、喷射快艇都来了。","fame_en":"It was the world's first commercial bungy site, and it turned Queenstown into the 'adventure capital of the world', followed by skydiving and jet boats.","fact":"创始人 AJ Hackett 1987 年偷偷从埃菲尔铁塔上蹦极，被法国警察抓了，新闻传遍全世界；第二年 1988 年 11 月卡瓦劳大桥蹦极开业，第一天就有 28 个人跳。","fact_en":"Founder AJ Hackett secretly bungy-jumped off the Eiffel Tower in 1987 and was arrested — the footage went round the world. In November 1988 the Kawarau Bridge site opened, and 28 people jumped on day one.","src":"NZHistory（新西兰文化遗产部）","url":"https://nzhistory.govt.nz/page/aj-hackett-bungy-jumps-eiffel-tower","say":{"en":"Do I get to touch the water?","zh":"跳下去能碰到水吗？"}},"墨尔本板球场":{"what":"墨尔本板球场（MCG），能坐将近十万人，是澳大利亚最大的体育场。","what_en":"The Melbourne Cricket Ground (MCG), holding nearly 100,000 people — Australia's biggest stadium.","fame":"夏天打板球，冬天打澳式足球（AFL）；每年 12 月 26 日的“节礼日板球赛”和九月的 AFL 总决赛，是墨尔本人一年里最重要的两天。","fame_en":"Cricket in summer, Aussie rules football (AFL) in winter. The Boxing Day Test on 26 December and the AFL Grand Final in September are two of the biggest days in Melbourne's year.","fact":"这里的体育比赛观众纪录是 1970 年 VFL（现在的 AFL）总决赛卡尔顿对科林伍德：121,696 人，到现在都没被打破。","fact_en":"Its sporting attendance record is still the 1970 VFL (now AFL) Grand Final, Carlton v Collingwood: 121,696 people.","src":"Wikipedia：1970 VFL grand final","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1970_VFL_grand_final","say":{"en":"Which team do you barrack for?","zh":"你支持哪个队？（澳洲人说 barrack for）"}},"七人制橄榄球":{"what":"每队 7 个人、每半场 7 分钟的橄榄球；在斐济，它几乎是全国的骄傲。","what_en":"Rugby with seven players a side and seven-minute halves — in Fiji, close to a national religion.","fame":"斐济人个子高、速度快、传球像变魔术，小岛国在 2016 年里约和 2020 年东京奥运会连拿两块男子七人制金牌。","fame_en":"Fijian players are big, fast and pass like magicians; the island nation won men's sevens gold at both Rio 2016 and Tokyo 2020.","fact":"2016 年那块金牌是斐济第一块奥运奖牌（任何项目、任何颜色）；第二年斐济央行专门发行了一张 7 元钞票，上面印着这支球队。","fact_en":"The 2016 gold was Fiji's first Olympic medal of any colour in any event. The next year Fiji's central bank issued a special $7 banknote showing the team.","src":"Sports Illustrated（美联社），2017","url":"https://www.si.com/olympics/2017/04/21/ap-oly-rgu-fiji-sevens-banknote","say":{"en":"Look at that pass — Fiji magic!","zh":"看那个传球，斐济人太神了！"}},"科科达小道":{"what":"巴布亚新几内亚的一条山路徒步线，96 公里，穿过雨林、泥路和高山，一般要走 8 到 10 天。","what_en":"A 96-km trek across Papua New Guinea's mountains, through rainforest, mud and ridges — usually eight to ten days.","fame":"1942 年二战时，澳大利亚士兵在这条小路上挡住了日军；现在每年有很多澳大利亚人来走，当作一次纪念，也是对体力的考验。","fame_en":"In 1942 Australian soldiers held back the Japanese army along this track. Today many Australians walk it as a pilgrimage of remembrance and a test of endurance.","fact":"当年帮澳军背物资、抬伤员的巴布亚当地人被叫作“Fuzzy Wuzzy Angels”，这个名字来自 1942 年一位澳大利亚工兵写的诗；最后一位还在世的老人 2017 年去世。","fact_en":"The Papuans who carried supplies and stretchered wounded Australians became known as the 'Fuzzy Wuzzy Angels', a name from a 1942 poem by an Australian sapper. The last known survivor died in 2017.","src":"Wikipedia：Fuzzy Wuzzy Angels","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fuzzy_Wuzzy_Angels","say":{"en":"How many hours to the next village?","zh":"到下一个村子还要走几个小时？"}},"环法自行车赛":{"what":"环法自行车赛：每年七月，车手用三个星期骑大约 3500 公里，翻过阿尔卑斯山和比利牛斯山。","what_en":"The Tour de France: every July riders cover about 3,500 km in three weeks, over the Alps and the Pyrenees.","fame":"1903 年开始，是世界上最有名的自行车赛；路边看比赛不要钱，法国人带着野餐在山路边等一整天，只为看车队飞过去几秒钟。","fame_en":"First held in 1903, it's the world's most famous bike race. Watching is free, and French families picnic all day on mountain roads to see the riders flash past for a few seconds.","fact":"2024 年环法第一次没在巴黎结束——因为巴黎要办奥运会，最后一站改在尼斯，是一场个人计时赛；上一次终点不在巴黎还是 1905 年以前。","fact_en":"In 2024 the Tour finished outside Paris for the first time since 1905 — because of the Paris Olympics, the final stage was a time trial in Nice.","src":"The Local France，2022","url":"https://www.thelocal.fr/20221201/olympics-mean-no-paris-finish-for-2024-tour-de-france","say":{"en":"What time does the race come through here?","zh":"车队几点经过这里？"}},"温布尔登":{"what":"温布尔登网球锦标赛：每年夏天在伦敦西南的全英草地网球俱乐部打，世界最古老的网球赛。","what_en":"The Wimbledon Championships, played every summer at the All England Club in south-west London — the oldest tennis tournament in the world.","fame":"它是四大满贯里唯一的草地比赛，选手必须几乎全穿白色；观众排队一整夜买票，边看边吃草莓配奶油。","fame_en":"It's the only Grand Slam on grass, players must wear almost all white, fans queue overnight for tickets, and everyone eats strawberries and cream.","fact":"2025 年温网第一次没有了人工司线员，18 块场地全部用电子系统判球出界——这是 147 年来的头一回。","fact_en":"In 2025 Wimbledon dropped human line judges for the first time in 147 years, using electronic line calling on all 18 courts.","src":"Al Jazeera，2024","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2024/10/9/wimbledon-to-replace-tennis-line-judges-with-electronic-system-from-2025","say":{"en":"Is it worth joining the Queue?","zh":"去排那个大队值得吗？"}},"巴萨足球":{"what":"巴塞罗那足球俱乐部（巴萨），主场诺坎普，是加泰罗尼亚人的骄傲。","what_en":"FC Barcelona (Barça), whose home is Camp Nou — a source of Catalan pride.","fame":"俱乐部的口号是“不只是一家俱乐部”（Més que un club）；梅西在这里踢了 17 年，现在的年轻球星亚马尔也是巴萨青训出来的。","fame_en":"Its motto is 'More than a club' (Més que un club). Messi played here for 17 years, and today's young star Lamine Yamal also came through Barça's academy.","fact":"诺坎普从 2023 年开始大翻修，巴萨借蒙锥克山的奥林匹克体育场踢了两年多；2025 年 11 月 22 日终于回家，4 比 0 赢毕尔巴鄂竞技，当天只开放了 4 万 5 千多个座位，全修好以后能坐 10 万 5 千人。","fact_en":"Camp Nou closed for a huge rebuild in 2023 and Barça played at the Montjuïc Olympic stadium for over two years. They finally came home on 22 November 2025, beating Athletic Club 4–0 with just over 45,000 seats open; finished, it will hold 105,000.","src":"Wikipedia：Camp Nou","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Camp_Nou","say":{"en":"Visca el Barça! Where are our seats?","zh":"巴萨万岁！我们的座位在哪？"}},"奥林匹亚":{"what":"希腊伯罗奔尼撒半岛上的古代遗址，古代奥运会就在这里举行，前后一千多年。","what_en":"An ancient site in Greece's Peloponnese where the ancient Olympic Games were held for more than a thousand years.","fame":"今天还能看到古代的体育场跑道、宙斯神庙和赫拉神庙的遗迹；每一届现代奥运会的圣火都是在这里点燃的。","fame_en":"You can still walk the ancient stadium track and see the ruins of the temples of Zeus and Hera — and the flame for every modern Olympics is lit here.","fact":"点圣火不用打火机：扮成女祭司的演员在赫拉神庙前用一面凹面镜把太阳光聚起来点火。这个仪式和火炬传递是 1936 年柏林奥运会才开始的，当年的镜子是德国蔡司做的。","fact_en":"No lighter is used: an actress playing a high priestess focuses the sun's rays with a concave mirror in front of the Temple of Hera. The ritual and the torch relay only began with the 1936 Berlin Games, using a mirror made by Zeiss.","src":"Wikipedia：1936 Summer Olympics torch relay","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1936_Summer_Olympics_torch_relay","say":{"en":"Can we run on the ancient track?","zh":"我们可以在古代跑道上跑一跑吗？"}},"盐湖城冬奥会":{"what":"美国犹他州的盐湖城：2002 年办过冬奥会，2034 年还要再办一次。","what_en":"Salt Lake City, Utah, which hosted the 2002 Winter Olympics and will host them again in 2034.","fame":"城外一小时车程就是能滑雪的大山（帕克城、雪鸟），2002 年的跳台、雪车道和速滑馆到现在还在用，运动员平时就在这里训练。","fame_en":"Ski mountains like Park City and Snowbird are an hour away, and the 2002 ski jumps, bobsled track and speed-skating oval are still used for training today.","fact":"盐湖城申办 2002 年冬奥会时爆出了“送礼丑闻”：1998 年被揭出申办团队给国际奥委会委员送礼送钱，好几个委员被开除，国际奥委会还因此改了规矩，比如不让委员再随便去申办城市访问。","fact_en":"Salt Lake's 2002 bid caused a scandal: in 1998 it emerged that the bid team had showered IOC members with gifts. Several members were expelled and the IOC changed its rules, including banning members from visiting bid cities.","src":"Wikipedia：2002 Winter Olympic bid scandal","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2002_Winter_Olympic_bid_scandal","say":{"en":"Can we visit the old Olympic ski jumps?","zh":"我们能去看看当年奥运会的跳台吗？"}},"达拉斯牛仔队":{"what":"达拉斯牛仔队：美式橄榄球（NFL）球队，主场在得克萨斯州阿灵顿的 AT&T 体育场。","what_en":"The Dallas Cowboys, an NFL team that plays at AT&T Stadium in Arlington, Texas.","fame":"它拿过五次超级碗，全美到处都有它的球迷，也到处有讨厌它的人；福布斯连续多年把它评为全世界最值钱的运动队。","fame_en":"Five-time Super Bowl champions, with fans — and haters — all over the country; Forbes has ranked it the world's most valuable sports team for years.","fact":"“美国之队”这个外号是 1978 赛季结束后 NFL Films 的剪辑师 Bob Ryan 给他们的赛季集锦片起的名字；当时牛仔队刚输了超级碗，这名字却一直用到今天。","fact_en":"The nickname 'America's Team' came from NFL Films editor Bob Ryan, who used it to title the Cowboys' highlight film after the 1978 season — a season they ended by losing the Super Bowl. The name stuck anyway.","src":"Wikipedia：Dallas Cowboys","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dallas_Cowboys","say":{"en":"Are you a Cowboys fan or a Cowboys hater?","zh":"你是牛仔队的粉丝，还是黑粉？"}},"印第安纳波利斯500":{"what":"印第安纳波利斯 500 英里大赛：每年五月底在印第安纳波利斯赛车场开 200 圈、共 500 英里。","what_en":"The Indianapolis 500: every late May, 200 laps and 500 miles around the Indianapolis Motor Speedway.","fame":"1911 年第一次比赛，是世界上最老、最有名的赛车比赛之一；赛车时速超过 350 公里，现场能坐三十多万人，是全世界单日观众最多的体育比赛。","fame_en":"First run in 1911, it's one of the oldest and most famous car races. Cars top 350 km/h and the speedway holds over 300,000 people — the biggest single-day sporting crowd in the world.","fact":"冠军喝牛奶的习惯来自 1936 年：冠军 Louis Meyer 热得受不了，要了一瓶他从小爱喝的酪乳（buttermilk），被拍了下来；乳业公司看到照片后，就开始给每个冠军送牛奶。现在车手赛前可以选全脂、2% 还是脱脂。","fact_en":"The winner's milk began in 1936, when champion Louis Meyer, hot and thirsty, asked for a bottle of the buttermilk he'd loved since childhood and was photographed drinking it. A dairy executive saw the picture and milk has been handed to winners ever since — drivers now pick whole, 2% or fat-free in advance.","src":"印第安纳波利斯赛车场官网","url":"https://www.indianapolismotorspeedway.com/history/where-tradition-never-stops/milk","say":{"en":"Which turn has the best view?","zh":"哪个弯道看得最清楚？"}},"肯塔基赛马":{"what":"肯塔基德比：每年五月第一个星期六，在路易斯维尔的丘吉尔唐斯赛马场，三岁的纯种马跑大约两分钟。","what_en":"The Kentucky Derby: on the first Saturday of May at Churchill Downs in Louisville, three-year-old thoroughbreds race for about two minutes.","fame":"它是美国“三冠王”系列的第一场；看台上的女士戴着夸张的大帽子，大家喝薄荷朱利普（Mint Julep），赢的马会披上一大条红玫瑰花毯。","fame_en":"It's the first leg of the US Triple Crown. Women wear huge hats, everyone drinks Mint Juleps, and the winning horse is draped in a blanket of red roses.","fact":"它被叫作“为玫瑰而跑”（Run for the Roses）：这个说法是纽约体育专栏作家 Bill Corum 1925 年开始用的；而玫瑰的传统更早——1883 年一位纽约名流在赛后的派对上给女士们送玫瑰，赛马场的创办人看到后才把玫瑰定成了比赛的花。","fact_en":"It's called 'the Run for the Roses' — a phrase New York columnist Bill Corum started using in 1925. The roses go back further: in 1883 a New York socialite handed roses to ladies at a post-Derby party, which gave the track's founder the idea of making the rose the race's flower.","src":"Wikipedia：Kentucky Derby","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kentucky_Derby","say":{"en":"Who are you betting on?","zh":"你押哪匹马？"}},"艾迪塔罗德雪橇赛":{"what":"艾迪塔罗德狗拉雪橇赛：每年三月从阿拉斯加的安克雷奇出发，跑到西海岸的诺姆，大约 1600 多公里。","what_en":"The Iditarod sled dog race: every March from Anchorage, Alaska, to Nome on the west coast — around 1,600 km.","fame":"一个人带着十几只雪橇犬，在零下几十度的荒野里跑一到两个星期，路上只有检查站；阿拉斯加人说它是“最后的伟大比赛”（The Last Great Race）。","fame_en":"One musher and a team of a dozen-plus dogs cross frozen wilderness for one to two weeks, with only checkpoints along the way. Alaskans call it 'The Last Great Race'.","fact":"这条路纪念的是 1925 年的“血清接力”：诺姆爆发白喉，二十几支狗队接力把药送了过去。最出名的是跑最后一段的 Balto，纽约中央公园还有它的铜像；可很多人说真正的英雄是跑了最长、最危险一段的 Togo。","fact_en":"The race remembers the 1925 'serum run', when relays of dog teams carried diphtheria antitoxin to Nome. Balto, who ran the last leg, got a statue in New York's Central Park — but many say the real hero was Togo, who ran the longest and most dangerous stretch.","src":"Wikipedia：1925 serum run to Nome","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1925_serum_run_to_Nome","say":{"en":"Can I meet the dogs before the start?","zh":"出发前我能看看这些狗吗？"}},"超级碗":{"what":"超级碗：美国职业橄榄球联盟（NFL）每年二月的总决赛。","what_en":"The Super Bowl, the NFL's championship game every February.","fame":"它几乎是美国的节日：朋友聚在家里吃鸡翅、看比赛；半场秀请最红的歌手，广告 30 秒要好几百万美元，很多人说自己是来看广告的。","fame_en":"It's practically a national holiday: friends gather for wings and the game, the half-time show books the biggest stars, and 30-second ads cost millions — some people say they only watch for the ads.","fact":"2025 年第 59 届超级碗（老鹰对酋长）平均有 1 亿 2770 万美国观众，是美国电视史上收视最高的一次；2026 年第 60 届是 1 亿 2560 万，排第二。","fact_en":"Super Bowl LIX in 2025 (Eagles v Chiefs) averaged 127.7 million US viewers, the most-watched broadcast in American TV history; Super Bowl LX in 2026 drew 125.6 million, the second most.","src":"Nielsen，2025","url":"https://www.nielsen.com/news-center/2025/super-bowl-lix-makes-tv-history-with-over-127-million-viewers/","say":{"en":"Are you watching for the game or the half-time show?","zh":"你是来看比赛的，还是看半场秀的？"}},"冰球":{"what":"冰上曲棍球：穿冰鞋、拿球杆，把一个小黑饼（冰球）打进对方球门；在加拿大，它是冬天的国民运动。","what_en":"Ice hockey: on skates with sticks, shooting a small black puck into the other team's net — Canada's national winter sport.","fame":"冬天湖面和河面一结冰，加拿大的孩子就在户外冰场上打；首都渥太华的里多运河冬天会变成一条将近 8 公里的溜冰道。NHL 的冠军奖杯“斯坦利杯”，也是当年住在渥太华的加拿大总督斯坦利勋爵捐的。","fame_en":"Once lakes and rivers freeze, Canadian kids play on outdoor rinks; in Ottawa the Rideau Canal becomes a skateway almost 8 km long. The NHL's Stanley Cup was donated by Lord Stanley, Canada's Governor General, who lived in Ottawa.","fact":"有记录的第一场室内冰球比赛是 1875 年 3 月 3 日在蒙特利尔的维多利亚溜冰场打的：两队各 9 个人，组织者是 James Creighton，当天早上还在报纸上登了预告。","fact_en":"The first recorded indoor ice hockey game was played on 3 March 1875 at the Victoria Skating Rink in Montreal — nine players a side, organised by James Creighton, who advertised it in that morning's newspaper.","src":"Wikipedia：First indoor ice hockey game","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_indoor_ice_hockey_game","say":{"en":"Want to skate on the canal after work?","zh":"下班后去运河上溜冰吗？"}},"博尔特":{"kind":"person","what":"牙买加短跑运动员尤塞恩·博尔特，外号“闪电”，100 米和 200 米的世界纪录保持者。","what_en":"Jamaican sprinter Usain Bolt, 'Lightning Bolt', world-record holder in the 100 m and 200 m.","fame":"他在 2008、2012、2016 三届奥运会上都拿了 100 米和 200 米金牌；冲线前会放松地回头看，赢了以后摆出那个“射闪电”的姿势，全世界的小孩都学。","fame_en":"He won the 100 m and 200 m at three Olympics in a row (2008, 2012, 2016). He'd ease up and glance around before the line, and after winning struck his 'lightning bolt' pose — copied by kids all over the world.","fact":"2009 年他在柏林世锦赛跑出 9 秒 58 和 19 秒 19 两项世界纪录；比赛结束时柏林市长送了他一块将近 3 吨重的柏林墙，上面画着他在跑道上奔跑的样子，后来运回了牙买加。","fact_en":"At the 2009 World Championships in Berlin he ran world records of 9.58 and 19.19. At the end of the meet Berlin's mayor gave him a nearly three-tonne piece of the Berlin Wall painted with a picture of him running, which was shipped home to Jamaica.","src":"Sowetan Live，2009","url":"https://www.sowetanlive.co.za/news/2009-08-25-berlin-wall-gift-for-bolt/","say":{"en":"9.58 — can you imagine running that fast?","zh":"9 秒 58——你能想象跑那么快吗？"}},"卡波耶拉":{"what":"卡波耶拉：巴西的一种武术，又像舞蹈又像游戏，两个人在一圈人中间，跟着弓形琴（berimbau）的节奏又踢又翻。","what_en":"Capoeira, Brazil's martial art that's part dance, part game: two players kick and cartwheel inside a circle of people, to the rhythm of the berimbau.","fame":"它是被带到巴西的非洲奴隶创造的，在萨尔瓦多的广场和老城区天天能看到；现在全世界很多城市都有卡波耶拉学校。","fame_en":"It was created by enslaved Africans in Brazil and you can see it every day in Salvador's squares and old town; today there are capoeira schools all over the world.","fact":"1890 年巴西曾经把卡波耶拉列为犯罪、明令禁止；直到 1930 年代大师 Mestre Bimba 在萨尔瓦多开了学校，它才慢慢被当作正经运动。2014 年，“卡波耶拉圈”（roda）被列入联合国教科文组织的人类非物质文化遗产。","fact_en":"In 1890 Brazil made capoeira a crime. Only in the 1930s, after Mestre Bimba opened a school in Salvador, did it start to be accepted as a sport — and in 2014 the capoeira circle (roda) was added to UNESCO's intangible heritage list.","src":"Wikipedia：Capoeira","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capoeira","say":{"en":"Can I join the roda, or just watch?","zh":"我能进圈一起玩，还是只能看？"}},"马拉卡纳球场":{"what":"里约热内卢的马拉卡纳球场，巴西足球的“圣殿”。","what_en":"Rio de Janeiro's Maracanã stadium, the temple of Brazilian football.","fame":"它办过 1950 年和 2014 年两届世界杯决赛，还有 2016 年奥运会的开幕式；里约本地的弗拉门戈和弗卢米嫩塞两支球队的“Fla-Flu”德比也在这里踢。","fame_en":"It hosted the 1950 and 2014 World Cup finals and the 2016 Olympic opening ceremony, and Rio's own 'Fla-Flu' derby between Flamengo and Fluminense is played here.","fact":"1950 年巴西在这里 1 比 2 输给乌拉圭（官方观众 173,850 人），被叫作“马拉卡纳之殇”。输球那天巴西穿的是白色球衣，后来被认为“不吉利、不够爱国”；1953 年一家报纸办设计比赛，19 岁的 Aldyr Schlee 设计的黄绿蓝球衣中选，就是今天的“小黄衫”。","fact_en":"In 1950 Brazil lost 2–1 to Uruguay here in front of an official 173,850 — the 'Maracanazo'. They'd worn white, which was then blamed as unlucky and unpatriotic; in 1953 a newspaper contest picked 19-year-old Aldyr Schlee's yellow, green and blue design — today's famous canary shirt.","src":"巴西足球博物馆（Museu do Futebol）","url":"https://museudofutebol.org.br/en/exposicoes/the-history-of-the-canarinho-shirt-how-the-yellow-gold-came-to-dress-brazil/","say":{"en":"Which end do the Flamengo fans sit at?","zh":"弗拉门戈的球迷坐在哪一边？"}},"印加古道":{"what":"秘鲁库斯科附近的印加古道：徒步大约四天，翻过高山垭口、穿过云雾森林，最后从太阳门走进马丘比丘。","what_en":"The Inca Trail near Cusco, Peru: about four days on foot over high passes and through cloud forest, arriving at Machu Picchu through the Sun Gate.","fame":"路上有一路的印加遗址，最高点“死女人垭口”海拔 4215 米；第四天清早从太阳门看到马丘比丘，是很多人一辈子记得的画面。","fame_en":"Inca ruins line the way, the highest point, Dead Woman's Pass, is 4,215 m, and seeing Machu Picchu from the Sun Gate at dawn on day four is a memory people keep for life.","fact":"为了保护古道，秘鲁规定每天最多只能有 500 人上路，其中真正徒步的游客只有大约 200 个，其余是向导和背夫；旺季的名额几个月前就被抢光。","fact_en":"To protect it, Peru allows no more than 500 people a day on the trail — only about 200 of them hikers, the rest guides and porters — so high-season permits sell out months ahead.","src":"Wikipedia：Inca Trail to Machu Picchu","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inca_Trail_to_Machu_Picchu","say":{"en":"How many hours to the next campsite?","zh":"到下一个营地还要几个小时？"}},"丘利塔摔角":{"what":"玻利维亚埃尔阿尔托的女子摔角：女摔角手穿着安第斯原住民妇女传统的蓬蓬裙（pollera）、披肩，戴圆顶礼帽上台。","what_en":"Women's wrestling in El Alto, Bolivia: the wrestlers fight in the traditional pollera skirts, shawls and bowler hats of Andean indigenous women.","fame":"“丘利塔”原来是被看不起的称呼，现在她们穿着同样的衣服在擂台上飞踢、摔对手，一边是表演一边是骄傲；周末演出时本地家庭和外国游客坐满场边。","fame_en":"'Cholita' was once a put-down; now women in the same clothes fly off the ropes and slam opponents — part show, part pride. Weekend shows fill up with local families and foreign tourists.","fact":"她们最早是男摔角联盟“Titanes del Ring”为了多卖票请上台的；2011 年 10 月，很多当红的丘利塔摔角手离开了这个由一个男老板管着的联盟，自己去办比赛。","fact_en":"They were first brought into the ring by the men's league Titanes del Ring to sell more tickets. In October 2011 many of the top cholita wrestlers broke away from the league, run by one man, to stage their own shows.","src":"Global Voices，2011","url":"https://globalvoices.org/2011/07/14/bolivia-fighting-cholitas-on-the-spotlight/","say":{"en":"Is it OK to take photos during the fight?","zh":"比赛的时候可以拍照吗？"}},"委内瑞拉棒球":{"what":"在委内瑞拉，最受欢迎的运动不是足球而是棒球；马拉凯的老虎队（Tigres de Aragua）是冠军最多的球队之一。","what_en":"In Venezuela the favourite sport isn't football but baseball; Maracay's Tigres de Aragua are one of the league's most successful clubs.","fame":"每年冬天的委内瑞拉职业棒球联赛场场热闹；这个国家给美国职棒大联盟（MLB）输送了几百位球员，很多孩子从小在街上打棒球，梦想去美国打球。","fame_en":"The winter professional league is packed every season, and Venezuela has sent hundreds of players to Major League Baseball — many kids grow up playing in the street, dreaming of the majors.","fact":"2026 年 3 月的世界棒球经典赛，委内瑞拉在决赛 3 比 2 赢了美国，拿到了这个国家第一次经典赛冠军。","fact_en":"At the World Baseball Classic in March 2026, Venezuela beat the United States 3–2 in the final to win the country's first-ever Classic title.","src":"FOX 32 Chicago，2026","url":"https://www.fox32chicago.com/news/usa-falls-venezuela-2026-world-baseball-classic-final","say":{"en":"Who's pitching tonight?","zh":"今晚谁投球？"}},"第一届世界杯":{"what":"1930 年在乌拉圭首都蒙得维的亚举办的第一届足球世界杯，乌拉圭是东道主也是冠军。","what_en":"The first football World Cup, held in Montevideo, Uruguay, in 1930 — won by the hosts.","fame":"只有 13 支球队参加，欧洲队要坐两个星期的船来；乌拉圭专门为它建了百年纪念体育场（Estadio Centenario），到今天还是国家队的主场。","fame_en":"Only 13 teams took part, and European sides spent two weeks at sea to get there. Uruguay built the Estadio Centenario for it, still the national team's home today.","fact":"决赛乌拉圭对阿根廷，两队吵着都要用自己的球，国际足联只好让上半场用阿根廷的球、下半场用乌拉圭的球——上半场阿根廷 2 比 1 领先，下半场乌拉圭连进三球，4 比 2 赢了。","fact_en":"In the final, Uruguay and Argentina each insisted on using their own ball, so FIFA ruled Argentina's ball for the first half and Uruguay's for the second. Argentina led 2–1 at half-time; with their own ball, Uruguay scored three and won 4–2.","src":"Wikipedia：1930 FIFA World Cup final","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1930_FIFA_World_Cup_final","say":{"en":"Can we visit the football museum inside the stadium?","zh":"我们能去体育场里的足球博物馆看看吗？"}},"卢赛尔体育场":{"what":"卡塔尔卢赛尔的大体育场，2022 年世界杯决赛在这里踢。","what_en":"Lusail Stadium in Qatar, where the 2022 World Cup final was played.","fame":"那场决赛阿根廷和法国 3 比 3，点球 4 比 2，梅西终于拿到世界杯，很多人说是史上最好看的决赛；体育场金色的外墙是英国福斯特建筑事务所设计的。","fame_en":"In that final Argentina and France drew 3–3 and Argentina won 4–2 on penalties, finally giving Messi a World Cup — many call it the greatest final ever. The golden stadium was designed by Foster + Partners.","fact":"决赛当天官方观众是 88,966 人；体育场的造型参考了阿拉伯传统的“法纳尔”灯笼（fanar）和手工雕花的金碗，晚上亮灯时像一只发光的金色容器。","fact_en":"The official attendance at the final was 88,966. The design draws on the traditional Arabic fanar lantern and hand-carved golden bowls, so when lit at night it glows like a golden vessel.","src":"国际足联 FIFA，2018","url":"https://inside.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/qatar2022/media-releases/qatar-unveils-spectacular-design-for-lusail-stadium","say":{"en":"Where were you when Messi lifted the trophy?","zh":"梅西举起奖杯的时候你在哪儿？"}},"肯尼亚长跑":{"what":"肯尼亚西部的高原小镇伊滕，海拔大约 2400 米，被叫作“冠军之乡”。","what_en":"Iten, a highland town in western Kenya at about 2,400 m, known as the 'Home of Champions'.","fame":"进镇的路口有一座红色铁拱门，写着“欢迎来到伊滕，冠军之乡”；天刚亮，红土路上就是一群群跑步的人，世界各地的跑者专门来这里高原训练。","fame_en":"A red metal arch on the road in reads 'Welcome to Iten, Home of Champions'. At dawn the red dirt roads fill with packs of runners, and athletes from around the world come to train at altitude.","fact":"伊滕出这么多冠军，和一位爱尔兰修士有关：Colm O'Connell 1976 年来到镇上的圣帕特里克中学教地理，顺便带学生跑步，一带就是将近 50 年，学生里出了好几个奥运冠军和世界冠军。","fact_en":"Much of Iten's success traces to an Irish brother: Colm O'Connell came to St Patrick's High School in 1976 to teach geography, started coaching running on the side, and kept at it for nearly 50 years, producing Olympic and world champions.","src":"Kilkenny Observer","url":"https://kilkennyobserver.ie/br-colm-oconnell-the-godfather-of-kenyan-running/","say":{"en":"Can I join your morning run? Slowly, please!","zh":"我能跟你们一起晨跑吗？请慢一点！"}},"跳羚队":{"what":"南非国家橄榄球队，绿金色球衣，外号“跳羚”（Springboks）。","what_en":"South Africa's national rugby union team in green and gold, nicknamed the Springboks.","fame":"他们四次拿到橄榄球世界杯（1995、2007、2019、2023），是拿得最多的球队；1995 年曼德拉穿着跳羚队球衣给队长颁奖，成了南非走出种族隔离后最有名的画面之一。","fame_en":"They've won the Rugby World Cup four times (1995, 2007, 2019, 2023), more than anyone. In 1995 Nelson Mandela presented the trophy wearing a Springbok jersey — one of the defining images of post-apartheid South Africa.","fact":"2023 年决赛跳羚队 12 比 11 赢了新西兰全黑队，12 分全是 Handré Pollard 踢进的；队长 Siya Kolisi 是跳羚队第一位黑人队长，也成了历史上第二个连续两次举起世界杯的队长。","fact_en":"In the 2023 final the Springboks beat the All Blacks 12–11, with all 12 points kicked by Handré Pollard. Captain Siya Kolisi, the team's first Black Test captain, became only the second captain ever to lift the trophy twice.","src":"Rugby World Cup 官网，2023","url":"https://www.rugbyworldcup.com/2023/news/888593/nzl-11-12-rsa-south-africa-win-world-cup","say":{"en":"Are you watching the Boks game at the pub?","zh":"你去酒吧看跳羚队的比赛吗？"}},"超级雄鹰":{"what":"尼日利亚国家男子足球队，外号“超级雄鹰”（Super Eagles）。","what_en":"Nigeria's men's national football team, the Super Eagles.","fame":"他们三次拿到非洲杯冠军，出过奥科查、卡努这样的球星；在拉各斯，国家队一比赛，街边的小店和酒吧都挤满了穿绿色球衣看球的人。","fame_en":"Three-time Africa Cup of Nations winners, they gave the world stars like Okocha and Kanu. When they play, Lagos bars and street stalls fill with fans in green.","fact":"1996 年亚特兰大奥运会半决赛，尼日利亚 1 比 3 落后巴西，最后 15 分钟扳平，卡努在加时赛打进金球 4 比 3 绝杀；决赛又 3 比 2 赢了阿根廷，成了第一支拿到奥运足球金牌的非洲球队。","fact_en":"In the 1996 Atlanta Olympic semi-final Nigeria were 3–1 down to Brazil with 15 minutes left, levelled late and won 4–3 with Kanu's golden goal in extra time. They then beat Argentina 3–2 to become the first African team to win Olympic football gold.","src":"Planet Football","url":"https://www.planetfootball.com/nostalgia/atlanta-olympics-96-nigerias-mesmerising-dream-team-stunned-the-sport","say":{"en":"Where's the best place to watch the Super Eagles tonight?","zh":"今晚去哪儿看超级雄鹰的比赛最好？"}},"指南针":{"what":"一根磁针，总是指着南北，让人在看不见路的时候也知道方向。","what_en":"A magnetised needle that always points north–south, so you know your direction even when you can't see the way.","fame":"中国古代四大发明之一。最早的「司南」用天然磁石做；到了宋朝，磁针被用在海船上，阴天也能认方向，后来传到阿拉伯和欧洲，远洋航行才有了底气。","fame_en":"It's one of ancient China's Four Great Inventions. The earliest 'sinan' used natural lodestone; by the Song dynasty magnetic needles were guiding ships even on cloudy days, and the idea later spread to the Arab world and Europe, giving long ocean voyages their confidence.","fact":"最早清楚写下航海用指南针的，是北宋沈括 1088 年前后写的《梦溪笔谈》；他还记下磁针「常微偏东，不全南也」——指的不是正南，而是稍微偏一点，这就是今天说的「磁偏角」。","fact_en":"The first clear description of the compass used for navigation is in Shen Kuo's Dream Pool Essays, written around 1088 in the Song dynasty. He also noted the needle 'always points slightly east, not due south' — what we now call magnetic declination.","src":"Wikipedia · Compass","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Compass","say":{"en":"Which hall has the ancient compass?","zh":"古代指南针在哪个展厅？"}},"火药":{"what":"硝石、硫磺和木炭混在一起的黑色粉末，一点火就猛烈燃烧。","what_en":"A black powder of saltpetre, sulphur and charcoal that burns violently the moment it's lit.","fame":"四大发明之一，据说是炼丹师想炼长生药时偶然弄出来的。宋朝已经用在打仗上，也做成了爆竹和烟花；后来经丝绸之路传到中东和欧洲，改变了世界的战争方式。今天过年放的烟花，用的还是这个原理。","fame_en":"One of the Four Great Inventions, said to have been stumbled on by alchemists looking for an elixir of life. By the Song dynasty it was used in war and in firecrackers and fireworks; it later travelled along the Silk Road to the Middle East and Europe and changed how the world fought. New Year fireworks still work the same way.","fact":"现在能看到的最早的火药配方，写在 1044 年北宋编的军事书《武经总要》里；不过 1044 年的原版早就没了，留到今天最早的版本是明朝 1510 年左右的。","fact_en":"The earliest surviving gunpowder formula is in the Wujing Zongyao, a Song military manual compiled in 1044 — but the 1044 edition is lost; the oldest copy we have dates from around 1510, in the Ming dynasty.","src":"Wikipedia · History of gunpowder","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_gunpowder","say":{"en":"Where can we watch the fireworks tonight?","zh":"今晚在哪儿能看烟花？"}},"造纸术":{"what":"把树皮、麻、破布泡烂捣成浆，再捞成薄薄一层晒干，就成了纸。","what_en":"Soak bark, hemp and rags, pound them into pulp, scoop up a thin layer and dry it — and you have paper.","fame":"东汉的蔡伦（湖南耒阳人）在公元 105 年把改进的造纸方法报给皇帝，用便宜的材料造出好用的纸，从此写字不必再用沉重的竹简和昂贵的丝帛。造纸术后来传到朝鲜、日本、阿拉伯和欧洲。耒阳现在还有蔡伦纪念园。","fame_en":"In 105 AD Cai Lun, from Leiyang in Hunan, reported his improved papermaking method to the emperor: good paper from cheap materials, so people no longer had to write on heavy bamboo strips or costly silk. The craft later spread to Korea, Japan, the Arab world and Europe. Leiyang still has a Cai Lun memorial park.","fact":"纸其实比蔡伦还早：1986 年在甘肃天水放马滩的一座西汉墓里，出土了一小片画着地图的纸，大约是公元前 179—前 141 年的东西，比蔡伦早了两百多年。所以蔡伦更像是「把纸做好、做便宜」的人。","fact_en":"Paper is older than Cai Lun: in 1986 a tiny fragment of paper with a map drawn on it was found in a Western Han tomb at Fangmatan, Gansu, dated to about 179–141 BC — over 200 years before him. Cai Lun is better seen as the man who made paper good and cheap.","src":"Wikipedia · History of paper","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_paper","say":{"en":"Can I try making a sheet of paper myself?","zh":"我可以自己试着做一张纸吗？"}},"晋商票号":{"what":"清朝山西商人开的汇兑铺子：在这里交银子、拿一张汇票，到另一个城市的分号就能取钱。","what_en":"Remittance houses run by Shanxi merchants in the Qing dynasty: pay in silver here, take a draft, and collect the money at a branch in another city.","fame":"以前做生意要押着银子走镖，又慢又危险。平遥的「日升昌」把这件事变成了一张纸，分号开到全国很多城市，平遥因此被叫作「清代的华尔街」。今天日升昌旧址是票号博物馆，平遥古城 1997 年进了世界遗产。","fame_en":"Traders used to move silver under armed escort — slow and dangerous. Rishengchang in Pingyao turned that into a piece of paper, with branches in cities all over China, which earned Pingyao the nickname 'Wall Street of the Qing'. The old Rishengchang building is now a museum, and Pingyao's old town became a World Heritage Site in 1997.","fact":"日升昌原来是一家卖颜料的铺子「西裕成」。老板发现帮人异地汇钱的生意比卖颜料还受欢迎，1823 年左右干脆不卖颜料了，改成专门汇兑的票号。","fact_en":"Rishengchang started out as a dye shop, Xiyuecheng. Its owner found that sending money between cities was more popular than selling dye, so around 1823 he gave up dye altogether and turned the shop into a dedicated remittance house.","src":"Wikipedia · Rishengchang","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rishengchang","say":{"en":"Is this where China's first draft bank started?","zh":"这里就是中国第一家票号吗？"}},"丝绸":{"what":"用蚕吐的丝织成的布，又轻又滑，有光泽。","what_en":"Cloth woven from silkworm thread — light, smooth and shiny.","fame":"中国人几千年前就开始养蚕缫丝，丝绸曾是运到西方最贵的货之一，那条贸易路线后来就叫「丝绸之路」。杭州自古是丝绸之府，西湖边的中国丝绸博物馆免费参观；「中国蚕桑丝织技艺」2009 年进了联合国人类非遗名录。","fame_en":"Chinese people have raised silkworms and reeled silk for thousands of years; silk was one of the most expensive goods carried west, and the trade route was later named after it. Hangzhou has long been a silk city — the China National Silk Museum by West Lake is free — and Chinese sericulture and silk craftsmanship joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list in 2009.","fact":"「丝绸之路」这个名字不是古人起的：是德国地理学家李希霍芬在 1877 年用德语 Seidenstraße 叫开的，古代走这条路的商人自己并不这么叫。","fact_en":"The name 'Silk Road' isn't ancient: it was popularised in 1877 by the German geographer Ferdinand von Richthofen as 'Seidenstraße'. The merchants who actually travelled it never called it that.","src":"Wikipedia · Silk Road","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silk_Road","say":{"en":"Is this pure silk? Can I touch it?","zh":"这是真丝的吗？我能摸一下吗？"}},"深圳无人机":{"what":"会自己悬停、能拍照的小飞机，用手机就能操控。","what_en":"Small flying cameras that hover on their own and are controlled from your phone.","fame":"世界上卖得最多的消费级无人机，很多来自深圳。大疆 2006 年在这里起步；深圳周边几小时车程就能买齐电机、电池、芯片这些零件，做硬件特别快，所以这里被叫作「硬件硅谷」。","fame_en":"Many of the world's best-selling consumer drones come from Shenzhen. DJI started here in 2006, and because motors, batteries and chips can all be sourced within a few hours' drive, hardware gets built fast — hence the nickname 'Silicon Valley of hardware'.","fact":"大疆创始人汪滔还在香港科技大学读书时，就在宿舍里做飞行控制器的原型，先卖给大学和公司，赚了钱才在 2006 年搬到深圳，雇了几个人开始干。","fact_en":"DJI founder Frank Wang built his first flight-controller prototypes in his dorm room at the Hong Kong University of Science and Technology, sold them to universities and companies, and used the money to move to Shenzhen and hire a small team in 2006.","src":"Wikipedia · DJI","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DJI","say":{"en":"Do I need to register this drone before I fly it?","zh":"这台无人机飞之前要先登记吗？"}},"中国天眼":{"what":"贵州平塘山里的一口「大锅」——直径 500 米的射电望远镜，用来听宇宙里的无线电信号。","what_en":"A giant 'dish' in the hills of Pingtang, Guizhou — a 500-metre radio telescope that listens to radio signals from space.","fame":"全名 FAST，2016 年建成，是世界上最大的单口径射电望远镜，铺在一个天然的喀斯特洼坑里。它能听到非常微弱的信号，专门找脉冲星这类遥远的天体。附近有观景台，进核心区前要把手机存起来，免得电磁干扰。","fame_en":"Its full name is FAST. Completed in 2016, it's the world's largest single-dish radio telescope, set into a natural karst hollow. It can pick up extremely faint signals and hunts for distant objects like pulsars. There's a viewing platform nearby, and you have to hand in your phone before entering the core area to avoid radio interference.","fact":"到 2024 年 11 月，天眼发现的脉冲星已经超过 1000 颗，比同一时期国外所有望远镜发现的加起来还多。","fact_en":"By November 2024, FAST had discovered more than 1,000 pulsars — more than all foreign telescopes combined over the same period.","src":"中国政府网 · FAST discovers over 1,000 pulsars","url":"https://english.www.gov.cn/news/202411/27/content_WS67465db5c6d0868f4e8ed70f.html","say":{"en":"Do I need to leave my phone here before going to the viewing platform?","zh":"去观景台之前要把手机存在这里吗？"}},"新干线":{"what":"日本的高速铁路，车头长长的，时速两三百公里。","what_en":"Japan's high-speed railway — long-nosed trains running at 200–300 km/h.","fame":"东海道新干线 1964 年通车，是世界上第一条高速铁路，从东京到大阪只要两个多小时。车次密、准点，开了几十年没有发生过撞车、出轨造成乘客死亡的事故，成了全世界高铁的样板。","fame_en":"The Tokaido Shinkansen opened in 1964 as the world's first high-speed railway; Tokyo to Osaka takes just over two hours. Frequent, punctual, and decades without a passenger death from a collision or derailment, it became the model for high-speed rail everywhere.","fact":"它是 1964 年 10 月 1 日开通的，离东京奥运会开幕（10 月 10 日）只差 9 天，正好赶在全世界来看之前。","fact_en":"It opened on 1 October 1964 — just nine days before the Tokyo Olympics began on 10 October, right in time for the world to see it.","src":"Wikipedia · Shinkansen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shinkansen","say":{"en":"Is this the right platform for the Nozomi to Kyoto?","zh":"去京都的希望号是在这个站台吗？"}},"拜科努尔航天中心":{"what":"哈萨克斯坦草原上的航天发射场，俄罗斯的火箭和宇航员从这里飞上太空。","what_en":"A launch site on the steppe of Kazakhstan, where Russian rockets and cosmonauts head into space.","fame":"1957 年第一颗人造卫星、1961 年加加林第一次载人飞行，都是从这里出发的。苏联解体后它在哈萨克斯坦境内，俄罗斯付租金使用，租约签到 2050 年；去国际空间站的联盟号飞船至今还从这里发射。","fame_en":"The first artificial satellite in 1957 and Yuri Gagarin's first human spaceflight in 1961 both launched from here. Since the Soviet Union broke up it has been in Kazakhstan, leased by Russia until 2050, and Soyuz crews still fly to the International Space Station from here.","fact":"加加林当年起飞的那个发射台（「加加林发射台」）2019 年 9 月送走了最后一次发射，之后退役；2023 年俄哈两国宣布要把它并入拜科努尔的博物馆。","fact_en":"The pad Gagarin launched from, known as Gagarin's Start, saw its last launch in September 2019 and was retired; in 2023 Russia and Kazakhstan announced plans to make it part of the Baikonur museum complex.","src":"Wikipedia · Gagarin's Start","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gagarin%27s_Start","say":{"en":"Can visitors watch a launch from here?","zh":"游客能在这儿看火箭发射吗？"}},"克罗地亚领带":{"what":"系在衬衫领口的一条布带，它的起源跟克罗地亚有关。","what_en":"The strip of cloth tied at a shirt collar — and its origins lead back to Croatia.","fame":"17 世纪克罗地亚士兵在法国打仗，脖子上系着围巾，法国人觉得好看就学了起来，叫它 cravate（「克罗地亚的」）。今天萨格勒布有专卖领带的老店，克罗地亚人很自豪地把领带当成国家名片。","fame_en":"In the 17th century Croatian soldiers fighting in France wore scarves knotted at the neck; the French liked the look, copied it and called it 'cravate' — 'Croatian'. Zagreb still has shops devoted to ties, and Croatians proudly treat the necktie as a national calling card.","fact":"克罗地亚从 2008 年起把每年 10 月 18 日定为「领带日」；在萨格勒布，这天常有穿老式军装的「领带团」在广场上办仪式。","fact_en":"Since 2008 Croatia has marked 18 October as Cravat Day; in Zagreb the Cravat Regiment, in historic uniforms, often holds a ceremony in the square that day.","src":"Croatian Parliament · Cravat Day","url":"https://www.sabor.hr/en/press/news/cravat-day-celebrated-saint-marks-square","say":{"en":"Could you show me how to tie a Windsor knot?","zh":"能教我打温莎结吗？"}},"路易威登":{"what":"法国的奢侈品牌 Louis Vuitton，常见的是印着 LV 字母花纹的包和箱子。","what_en":"Louis Vuitton, the French luxury brand best known for bags and trunks covered in the LV pattern.","fame":"1854 年路易·威登在巴黎开了做旅行箱的店。他的箱子平顶、能叠起来放进火车和船舱，在坐船旅行的年代很受欢迎，后来一步步做成了世界上最出名的奢侈品牌之一。香榭丽舍大街的旗舰店门口常常排队。","fame_en":"In 1854 Louis Vuitton opened a trunk-making shop in Paris. His flat-topped trunks could be stacked in trains and ship cabins, perfect for the age of steamship travel, and the business grew step by step into one of the best-known luxury brands. There's often a queue outside the Champs-Élysées store.","fact":"那些格子和字母花纹，一开始是为了防仿冒：1888 年先出了棋盘格 Damier，还是被人抄，1896 年儿子乔治又设计了 LV 字母花纹 Monogram。","fact_en":"The checks and letters started as anti-copying measures: the Damier checkerboard came out in 1888, and when people copied that too, Louis's son Georges launched the LV Monogram canvas in 1896.","src":"Wikipedia · Louis Vuitton","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis_Vuitton","say":{"en":"Can I just look around, or do I need to queue?","zh":"我只是看看，也要排队吗？"}},"格拉斯香水":{"what":"法国南部山城格拉斯，几百年来种花、提炼香精、调香水的地方。","what_en":"Grasse, a hill town in southern France that has grown flowers, extracted scents and blended perfume for centuries.","fame":"格拉斯原来做皮手套，皮革有味道，就用花香来熏，后来干脆专门做香水，被叫作「世界香水之都」。这里种茉莉和五月玫瑰，很多大牌香水用的花和调香师都和格拉斯有关；城里的国际香水博物馆和老香水厂都能参观。","fame_en":"Grasse used to make leather gloves, scented with flowers to hide the smell of the leather; eventually it switched to perfume and became the 'perfume capital of the world'. It grows jasmine and May rose used by famous perfume houses, and you can visit the International Perfume Museum and old perfume factories.","fact":"2018 年，「格拉斯地区与香水有关的技艺」——种香料植物、处理天然原料、调配香水——一起进了联合国教科文组织的人类非物质文化遗产名录。","fact_en":"In 2018 'the skills related to perfume in Pays de Grasse' — growing perfume plants, processing natural raw materials and composing perfume — were added to UNESCO's list of the Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity.","src":"UNESCO · Skills related to perfume in Pays de Grasse","url":"https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/the-skills-related-to-perfume-in-pays-de-grasse-the-cultivation-of-perfume-plants-the-knowledge-and-processing-of-natural-raw-materials-and-the-art-of-perfume-composition-01207","say":{"en":"Is there a workshop where I can make my own perfume?","zh":"这里有能自己调香水的课吗？"}},"米兰时装周":{"what":"每年在米兰举办几次的时装周，各个品牌在这里发布下一季的衣服。","what_en":"Milan Fashion Week, held several times a year, where brands show their next season's clothes.","fame":"它和巴黎、伦敦、纽约并称四大时装周。普拉达、阿玛尼、范思哲这些品牌都从米兰起家；秀场之外，买手、明星、摄影师挤满全城，那一周米兰整座城像一个大秀场。","fame_en":"It's one of the 'Big Four' fashion weeks with Paris, London and New York. Prada, Armani and Versace all grew up in Milan, and beyond the shows the whole city fills with buyers, celebrities and photographers — for that week Milan itself is the runway.","fact":"意大利的第一场高级时装秀其实不在米兰，而在佛罗伦萨：1951 年 2 月 12 日，乔瓦尼·巴蒂斯塔·乔治尼在自己家里办了一场秀，只请来 6 位美国买手，意大利时装就这样走向了世界。","fact_en":"Italy's first high-fashion show wasn't in Milan but in Florence: on 12 February 1951 Giovanni Battista Giorgini held a show at his home for just six American buyers — and Italian fashion went global from there.","src":"Wikipedia · Giovanni Battista Giorgini","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giovanni_Battista_Giorgini","say":{"en":"Do I need an invitation to get into this show?","zh":"这场秀要邀请函才能进吗？"}},"法拉利":{"what":"意大利的跑车品牌和 F1 车队，标志是一匹跃起的黑马，车常是红色的。","what_en":"Ferrari, the Italian sports-car maker and Formula 1 team — a prancing black horse on the badge, usually a red car.","fame":"恩佐·法拉利 1947 年在马拉内罗造出第一辆挂自己名字的车。法拉利拿过的 F1 车队冠军比谁都多；在意大利，车迷被叫作 tifosi，法拉利一赢，全国都高兴。马拉内罗有法拉利博物馆，能看老赛车。","fame_en":"Enzo Ferrari built the first car bearing his name in Maranello in 1947. Ferrari has won more F1 constructors' titles than any other team; Italian fans are called the tifosi, and when Ferrari wins the whole country celebrates. The Ferrari Museum in Maranello shows old race cars.","fact":"从 1950 年 F1 世界锦标赛开始到现在，法拉利是唯一一支每个赛季都参加了的车队。","fact_en":"Since the Formula 1 World Championship began in 1950, Ferrari is the only team to have competed in every single season.","src":"Wikipedia · Grand Prix racing history of Scuderia Ferrari","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Prix_racing_history_of_Scuderia_Ferrari","say":{"en":"Who's on pole for Sunday's race?","zh":"周日比赛谁排杆位？"}},"小提琴":{"what":"意大利北部小城克雷莫纳，几百年来做小提琴的地方。","what_en":"Cremona, a small city in northern Italy that has made violins for centuries.","fame":"17、18 世纪，阿马蒂、斯特拉迪瓦里、瓜奈里几家制琴师都在克雷莫纳。斯特拉迪瓦里的琴现在只剩几百把，好的一把能卖到上千万美元。今天城里还有很多制琴作坊，克雷莫纳的传统制琴技艺 2012 年进了联合国非遗名录，小提琴博物馆里能听到老琴演奏。","fame_en":"In the 17th and 18th centuries the Amati, Stradivari and Guarneri families all made instruments in Cremona. Only a few hundred Stradivari instruments survive, and a fine one can sell for over ten million dollars. The city still has many workshops, its traditional violin craftsmanship joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list in 2012, and the Museo del Violino plays the old instruments for visitors.","fact":"2019 年 1 月起大约五个星期，克雷莫纳为了给博物馆里的斯特拉迪瓦里等名琴做录音，封了礼堂附近的街，市长请居民尽量别出声，连穿高跟鞋走石板路都被劝免。","fact_en":"For about five weeks from January 2019, Cremona closed the streets around its concert hall so Stradivari and other great instruments could be recorded; the mayor asked residents to keep quiet, even discouraging high heels on the cobblestones.","src":"Classic FM","url":"https://www.classicfm.com/discover-music/instruments/violin/city-keeping-quiet-to-save-stradivarius","say":{"en":"Can I watch a violin maker at work?","zh":"我能看看制琴师干活吗？"}},"德国汽车":{"what":"奔驰、保时捷这些德国汽车，斯图加特是它们的总部所在。","what_en":"German cars like Mercedes-Benz and Porsche — both have their headquarters in Stuttgart.","fame":"1886 年卡尔·本茨为他的三轮「奔驰专利汽车」申请了专利，这被看成第一辆真正的汽车；同一时期戴姆勒在斯图加特附近也造出了汽车。今天奔驰和保时捷的总部、博物馆都在斯图加特，周围有大大小小的零件厂。","fame_en":"In 1886 Karl Benz patented his three-wheeled Benz Patent-Motorwagen, seen as the first true car; around the same time Gottlieb Daimler was building cars near Stuttgart. Today Mercedes-Benz and Porsche both have their headquarters and museums in Stuttgart, surrounded by parts suppliers big and small.","fact":"第一次开汽车出远门的是一位女性：1888 年 8 月 5 日，本茨的妻子贝尔塔没告诉丈夫，带着两个儿子从曼海姆开了约 105 公里到普福尔茨海姆娘家，一路上自己解决了好几个毛病，还想出了刹车片。","fact_en":"The first long-distance car trip was made by a woman: on 5 August 1888 Bertha Benz, without telling her husband, drove her two sons about 105 km from Mannheim to her mother's home in Pforzheim, fixing problems along the way and inventing brake lining.","src":"Wikipedia · Bertha Benz","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bertha_Benz","say":{"en":"How do I get to the Mercedes-Benz Museum from the station?","zh":"从车站怎么去奔驰博物馆？"}},"古腾堡印刷机":{"what":"15 世纪德国美因茨人古腾堡做出来的金属活字印刷机，一个字母一个字母排好，就能一页页快速印书。","what_en":"The metal movable-type press made by Johannes Gutenberg of Mainz in the 15th century: set the letters one by one, then print page after page.","fame":"在那之前，欧洲的书多靠手抄，又贵又慢。古腾堡大约 1450 年把金属活字、油性墨水和压印机组合在一起，书一下子便宜了，知识传得更快，宗教改革和科学革命都和它有关。美因茨的古腾堡博物馆有现场印刷演示。","fame_en":"Before him, European books were mostly copied by hand — slow and expensive. Around 1450 Gutenberg combined metal type, oil-based ink and a press; books became cheap, knowledge spread faster, and the Reformation and the Scientific Revolution both owe something to it. The Gutenberg Museum in Mainz gives live printing demonstrations.","fact":"古腾堡印的《圣经》当年印了大约 158 或 180 部，今天还存世 49 部（至少大部分保存下来），其中完整的只有 21 部。","fact_en":"Gutenberg printed roughly 158 or 180 copies of his Bible; 49 survive at least in substantial part, and only 21 are complete.","src":"Wikipedia · Gutenberg Bible","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gutenberg_Bible","say":{"en":"Can I try printing a page on the old press?","zh":"我能在老印刷机上试印一页吗？"}},"瑞士手表":{"what":"瑞士做的手表，特别是靠齿轮和发条走的机械表。","what_en":"Swiss-made watches — especially mechanical ones that run on gears and springs.","fame":"16 世纪宗教改革时，日内瓦不鼓励戴首饰，不少金匠就转去做表。后来从日内瓦到汝拉山谷一带出现了几百家表厂，很多高档表牌都在这里；钟表小镇拉绍德封和力洛克 2009 年进了世界遗产。","fame_en":"During the 16th-century Reformation Geneva frowned on jewellery, so many goldsmiths turned to watchmaking. Hundreds of workshops grew up from Geneva through the Jura valleys, home to many top watch brands, and the watch towns of La Chaux-de-Fonds and Le Locle became a World Heritage Site in 2009.","fact":"2020 年 12 月，瑞士和法国一起申报的「机械钟表制作工艺与艺术机械」进了联合国人类非遗名录，范围从日内瓦一直延伸到汝拉山区。","fact_en":"In December 2020 the 'craftsmanship of mechanical watchmaking and art mechanics', nominated jointly by Switzerland and France, joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list, covering the arc from Geneva through the Jura mountains.","src":"Swiss Federal Office of Culture","url":"https://www.bak.admin.ch/en/craftsmanship-of-mechanical-watchmaking-and-art-mechanics","say":{"en":"Could you adjust the strap for me?","zh":"能帮我把表带调一下吗？"}},"瑞士军刀":{"what":"红色刀柄的折叠小刀，里面藏着刀片、剪刀、开瓶器、螺丝刀等好几样工具。","what_en":"A red-handled folding knife that hides a blade, scissors, a bottle opener, a screwdriver and more.","fame":"1891 年瑞士军队给士兵配了一种能开罐头、拆步枪的折叠刀，施维茨州伊巴赫的卡尔·埃尔斯纳（后来的 Victorinox）开始自己生产，工具越加越多。今天它是瑞士最出名的纪念品之一，很多人旅行、露营都带一把（坐飞机要托运）。","fame_en":"In 1891 the Swiss army issued soldiers a folding knife that could open tins and strip down a rifle, and Karl Elsener in Ibach, canton Schwyz — later Victorinox — began making them, adding more and more tools. Today it's one of Switzerland's best-known souvenirs, packed for trips and camping (in checked luggage if you fly).","fact":"「瑞士军刀」这个英文名是二战后美国士兵叫开的——德语原名 Offiziersmesser（军官刀）对他们来说太难念了。","fact_en":"The English name 'Swiss Army knife' was used by American soldiers after World War II instead of the German 'Offiziersmesser' (officer's knife), which they found hard to say.","src":"Wikipedia · Swiss Army knife","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swiss_Army_knife","say":{"en":"Can you engrave a name on this knife?","zh":"能在这把刀上刻名字吗？"}},"魔方":{"what":"一个六面各有颜色的立方体，转乱以后要把每一面拼回同一种颜色。","what_en":"A cube with a different colour on each face; scramble it, then twist every face back to one colour.","fame":"1974 年匈牙利建筑学教授鲁比克做出来，本来是想让学生明白三维空间里的东西怎么动。1980 年前后风靡全世界，卖了几亿个；现在还有专门的「速拧」比赛，高手几秒钟就能还原。","fame_en":"Hungarian architecture professor Ernő Rubik made it in 1974 to help students understand movement in three dimensions. It swept the world around 1980 and has sold hundreds of millions; today there are speedcubing competitions where the best solve it in a few seconds.","fact":"鲁比克自己做出第一个木头魔方后，打乱了却不知道怎么复原，花了大约一个月才第一次拼回来。","fact_en":"After building his first wooden prototype, Rubik scrambled it and didn't know how to restore it — it took him about a month to solve it for the first time.","src":"Wikipedia · Ernő Rubik","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ern%C5%91_Rubik","say":{"en":"How fast can you solve it?","zh":"你几秒能拼好？"}},"宜家":{"what":"瑞典的家居品牌 IKEA，卖平板包装、自己回家组装的家具。","what_en":"IKEA, the Swedish home-furnishing brand that sells flat-packed furniture you put together yourself.","fame":"1943 年 17 岁的英格瓦·坎普拉德在瑞典南部斯莫兰创立了它。把家具拆成平板装进纸箱，运输便宜，价钱也就低了，很多人第一次自己布置家都会去逛。第一家宜家商场在斯莫兰的阿尔姆霍特，现在那栋楼是宜家博物馆。","fame_en":"Ingvar Kamprad founded it in Småland, southern Sweden, in 1943, aged 17. Flat-packing furniture made shipping cheap and kept prices low, so lots of people furnish their first home there. The first IKEA store, in Älmhult in Småland, is now the IKEA Museum.","fact":"宜家出了 70 年的纸质目录 2020 年底停印了；在 2016 年最多的时候，一年印了 2 亿本，有 32 种语言。","fact_en":"IKEA's printed catalogue ended in late 2020 after 70 years; at its peak in 2016, 200 million copies were distributed in 32 languages.","src":"Wikipedia · IKEA Catalogue","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IKEA_Catalogue","say":{"en":"Where do I pick up this item in the warehouse?","zh":"这个东西去仓库哪儿拿？"}},"乐高":{"what":"丹麦的积木玩具，一块块塑料积木可以拼成几乎任何东西。","what_en":"LEGO, the Danish toy bricks that click together into almost anything.","fame":"1932 年木匠奥勒·克里斯蒂安森在丹麦比隆开始做木头玩具，名字 LEGO 来自丹麦语 leg godt（好好玩）。塑料积木一代代都能拼在一起，大人小孩都玩；比隆有乐高乐园和「乐高之家」。","fame_en":"Carpenter Ole Kirk Christiansen began making wooden toys in Billund, Denmark, in 1932; the name comes from the Danish 'leg godt', 'play well'. Bricks from every generation fit together, so children and adults both play; Billund has LEGOLAND and LEGO House.","fact":"现代乐高积木的设计 1958 年 1 月 28 日在丹麦申请了专利。1958 年做的积木，今天还能和新买的扣在一起。","fact_en":"The modern LEGO brick design was filed for a patent in Denmark on 28 January 1958 — and bricks made in 1958 still click onto ones made today.","src":"Wikipedia · Lego","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lego","say":{"en":"Is this set suitable for a five-year-old?","zh":"这套适合五岁的孩子吗？"}},"诺基亚":{"what":"芬兰公司诺基亚，很多人的第一部手机就是它。","what_en":"Nokia, the Finnish company that made many people's first mobile phone.","fame":"1865 年它从坦佩雷附近的一家纸浆厂起家，后来做过橡胶靴、电缆，九十年代到二〇〇〇年代成了世界最大的手机厂商，「诺基亚 3310 摔不坏」到现在还有人开玩笑。智能手机来了以后，它把手机业务卖给了微软。","fame_en":"It began in 1865 as a pulp mill near Tampere, later made rubber boots and cables, and in the 1990s and 2000s became the world's biggest phone maker — people still joke that a Nokia 3310 can't be broken. When smartphones arrived it sold its phone business to Microsoft.","fact":"今天的诺基亚公司主要做通信网络设备；店里卖的诺基亚手机，从 2016 年起是另一家芬兰公司 HMD 拿品牌授权生产的。","fact_en":"Today Nokia mainly makes telecom network equipment; Nokia-branded phones in shops have been made since 2016 by another Finnish company, HMD, under a brand licence.","src":"Wikipedia · Nokia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nokia","say":{"en":"Do you still sell simple phones with buttons?","zh":"你们还卖带按键的简单手机吗？"}},"莱特兄弟":{"what":"美国的威尔伯和奥维尔·莱特兄弟，造出了第一架能载人、能操控的动力飞机。","what_en":"Wilbur and Orville Wright, the American brothers who built the first powered, controllable aeroplane to carry a person.","fame":"他们原来是开自行车店的。1903 年 12 月 17 日，在北卡罗来纳海边的基蒂霍克附近，奥维尔驾机飞了 12 秒、大约 37 米，人类第一次实现了有动力、能操控的飞行。那里现在是莱特兄弟国家纪念地。","fame_en":"They ran a bicycle shop. On 17 December 1903, near Kitty Hawk on the North Carolina coast, Orville flew for 12 seconds and about 37 metres — the first powered, controlled human flight. The spot is now the Wright Brothers National Memorial.","fact":"2021 年 NASA 的「机智号」直升机第一次在火星上飞行时，机身上带着一小块 1903 年莱特飞机机翼上的布——第一次动力飞行的一部分，又在另一颗星球上飞了一次。","fact_en":"When NASA's Ingenuity helicopter made its first flight on Mars in 2021, it carried a small swatch of fabric from the 1903 Wright Flyer's wing — a piece of the first powered flight, flying again on another planet.","src":"Space.com","url":"https://www.space.com/ingenuity-mars-helicopter-wright-flyer-fabric","say":{"en":"Is this where the first flight took off?","zh":"第一次飞行就是从这里起飞的吗？"}},"可口可乐":{"what":"全世界都能买到的可乐，深色、带气、很甜。","what_en":"Coca-Cola, the dark, fizzy, sweet drink you can buy almost anywhere.","fame":"1886 年亚特兰大的药剂师约翰·彭伯顿调出了这种糖浆，兑上苏打水在药店里卖。后来瓶子、红白招牌和广告走遍全世界，现在两百多个国家和地区都买得到。亚特兰大有「可口可乐世界」博物馆，能尝各国的口味。","fame_en":"In 1886 Atlanta pharmacist John Pemberton created the syrup, which was mixed with soda water and sold at a pharmacy. Its bottle, red-and-white signs and adverts later went worldwide, and it's now sold in more than 200 countries and territories. Atlanta's World of Coca-Cola museum lets you taste flavours from around the world.","fact":"第一年生意很冷清：一天只卖出大约 9 杯。名字和那条花体字商标，都是公司的会计弗兰克·罗宾逊想的——他觉得两个大写 C 放在广告里会很好看。","fact_en":"The first year was slow: about nine drinks a day. The name and the flowing script logo came from the company's bookkeeper, Frank Robinson, who thought the two Cs would look good in adverts.","src":"The Coca-Cola Company · 1880s history","url":"https://www.coca-cola.com/bd/en/about-us/history/1880-decade","say":{"en":"Can I get a Coke with no ice, please?","zh":"请给我一杯可乐，不要冰。"}},"肯尼迪航天中心":{"what":"美国佛罗里达东海岸的 NASA 发射场，阿波罗飞船、航天飞机都从这里升空。","what_en":"NASA's launch site on Florida's east coast, where Apollo missions and the Space Shuttle lifted off.","fame":"1969 年阿波罗 11 号从这里出发，把阿姆斯特朗他们送上月球。今天游客中心能看真的土星五号火箭和亚特兰蒂斯号航天飞机，运气好还能在附近海滩看商业火箭发射。","fame_en":"Apollo 11 left from here in 1969 to take Armstrong and his crewmates to the Moon. Today the visitor complex shows a real Saturn V rocket and the Space Shuttle Atlantis, and with luck you can watch a commercial launch from a nearby beach.","fact":"园区里的巨型厂房「垂直装配大楼」侧面画着一面美国国旗，是 1976 年为美国建国 200 周年画上去的，大约 64 米高，当时是世界上最大的国旗。","fact_en":"The giant Vehicle Assembly Building has an American flag painted on its side, added in 1976 for the US Bicentennial; about 64 metres tall, it was then the largest flag in the world.","src":"Wikipedia · Vehicle Assembly Building","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vehicle_Assembly_Building","say":{"en":"What time is the next bus tour to the launch pads?","zh":"下一班去发射台的大巴参观几点出发？"}},"底特律汽车城":{"what":"美国密歇根州的底特律，福特、通用、克莱斯勒的老家，外号「汽车城」Motor City。","what_en":"Detroit, Michigan — home of Ford, GM and Chrysler, nicknamed the Motor City.","fame":"20 世纪初，亨利·福特在这里用流水线造 T 型车，车价一下子降到普通工人也买得起，美国从此进入汽车时代。底特律附近的亨利·福特博物馆能看老车和流水线。","fame_en":"In the early 20th century Henry Ford built the Model T here on an assembly line, bringing the price down to what ordinary workers could afford and putting America on wheels. The Henry Ford museum near Detroit shows old cars and the assembly line.","fact":"1913 年 10 月，福特在底特律北边的高地公园工厂开始用移动流水线，装一辆 T 型车的时间从 728 分钟（十二个多小时）缩到了 93 分钟。","fact_en":"In October 1913 Ford started a moving assembly line at its Highland Park plant just north of central Detroit, cutting the time to build a Model T from 728 minutes — over 12 hours — to 93.","src":"Wikipedia · Highland Park Ford Plant","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highland_Park_Ford_Plant","say":{"en":"Is the factory tour open to visitors this week?","zh":"这周工厂对游客开放参观吗？"}},"星巴克":{"what":"美国的连锁咖啡店 Starbucks，标志是绿色的双尾美人鱼。","what_en":"Starbucks, the American coffee chain with the green two-tailed siren logo.","fame":"1971 年三个朋友在西雅图开店，最早只卖咖啡豆，不卖现煮咖啡。后来霍华德·舒尔茨把意大利咖啡馆的样子带回来，做成能坐下来待着的「第三空间」，开遍了全世界。西雅图派克市场旁的那家老店门口常年排队。","fame_en":"Three friends opened it in Seattle in 1971, selling only coffee beans, not brewed coffee. Later Howard Schultz brought back the Italian café idea — a 'third place' to sit and stay — and it spread worldwide. The old store by Pike Place Market always has a queue.","fact":"派克市场那家被叫作「第一家星巴克」，其实不是最早的：1971 年的第一家店在附近的西大道 2000 号，开了五年，那栋楼要拆了，才搬到现在的派克街 1912 号。","fact_en":"The Pike Place store is called the 'Original Starbucks', but it wasn't the first: the 1971 shop was nearby at 2000 Western Avenue for five years, and moved to 1912 Pike Place only when that building was demolished.","src":"Wikipedia · Original Starbucks","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Original_Starbucks","say":{"en":"Can I get a tall latte with oat milk?","zh":"请给我一杯中杯燕麦奶拿铁。"}},"大溪地黑珍珠":{"what":"法属波利尼西亚（大溪地一带）的黑蝶贝养出来的珍珠，颜色从灰黑到孔雀绿。","what_en":"Pearls grown in black-lip oysters in French Polynesia, around Tahiti, ranging from grey-black to peacock green.","fame":"大多数珍珠是白色的，这种珍珠天生是深色的，还泛着绿、紫、蓝的光，所以特别出名。它们主要养在土阿莫土群岛等珊瑚环礁的潟湖里，在帕皮提的珍珠博物馆和市场都能看到。","fame_en":"Most pearls are white; these are naturally dark, with green, purple or blue overtones, which makes them special. They're farmed mainly in the lagoons of coral atolls such as the Tuamotus, and you can see them at the pearl museum and market in Papeete.","fact":"黑珍珠是法属波利尼西亚最大的出口商品，占这里每年出口额的一半以上。","fact_en":"Tahitian pearls are French Polynesia's largest export, making up more than half of its annual exports.","src":"Wikipedia · Tahitian pearl","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tahitian_pearl","say":{"en":"Is this a Tahitian pearl? Does it come with a certificate?","zh":"这是大溪地黑珍珠吗？有证书吗？"}},"智利铜矿":{"what":"智利北部沙漠里的大铜矿，卡拉马旁边的丘基卡马塔是最出名的一座。","what_en":"The great copper mines of northern Chile's desert — Chuquicamata, next to Calama, is the most famous.","fame":"智利是世界上产铜最多的国家，2024 年大约占全世界铜矿产量的四分之一。电线、手机、电动车、充电桩都离不开铜，所以铜价一动，智利经济就跟着动。丘基卡马塔露天矿挖了一百多年，坑长好几公里、深好几百米。","fame_en":"Chile is the world's biggest copper producer, with about a quarter of global mine output in 2024. Wires, phones, electric cars and chargers all need copper, so when the copper price moves, Chile's economy moves with it. Chuquicamata's open pit has been dug for over a century — kilometres long and hundreds of metres deep.","fact":"丘基卡马塔的露天矿越挖越深、越来越贵；2019 年 4 月起，它开始从新挖的地下矿里出矿，一步步从露天矿变成地下矿。","fact_en":"Chuquicamata's open pit kept getting deeper and costlier; in April 2019 it began extracting ore from a new underground mine, starting its transition from open pit to underground operation.","src":"Wikipedia · Chuquicamata","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chuquicamata","say":{"en":"Is the mine open for guided tours today?","zh":"今天矿区有导览参观吗？"}},"祖母绿":{"what":"一种绿色的宝石，属于绿柱石；最出名的产自哥伦比亚博亚卡省的木佐一带。","what_en":"A green gemstone, a kind of beryl; the most famous come from around Muzo in Boyacá, Colombia.","fame":"哥伦比亚的祖母绿颜色浓、绿得透亮，几百年前西班牙人就把它运到欧洲和印度。今天世界上很多高档祖母绿还是来自哥伦比亚，首都波哥大有祖母绿博物馆和宝石商聚集的街区。","fame_en":"Colombian emeralds are deep and glowing green; centuries ago the Spanish shipped them to Europe and India. Many of the world's finest emeralds still come from Colombia, and Bogotá has an emerald museum and a district full of gem dealers.","fact":"哥伦比亚木佐等矿里偶尔会挖出一种「达碧兹祖母绿」（trapiche）：里面有六道黑线从中心放射出去，像车轮，名字来自西班牙语里榨甘蔗用的磨盘。","fact_en":"Mines such as Muzo occasionally yield 'trapiche' emeralds, with six dark spokes radiating from the centre like a wheel — named after the Spanish word for a sugar-cane mill.","src":"Wikipedia · Trapiche emerald","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trapiche_emerald","say":{"en":"Is this stone natural, or has it been treated?","zh":"这块石头是天然的，还是处理过的？"}},"巴拿马草帽":{"what":"用托奎拉草（一种棕榈叶纤维）手工编的浅色草帽，透气、能卷起来。","what_en":"A light hat hand-woven from toquilla palm fibre — breathable and rollable.","fame":"它其实产自厄瓜多尔，昆卡和蒙特克里斯蒂是最有名的产地。19 世纪很多帽子先运到巴拿马再卖到世界各地，修巴拿马运河的工人也戴，名字就这么叫错了。最细的一顶要织好几个月。","fame_en":"It actually comes from Ecuador — Cuenca and Montecristi are the famous centres. In the 19th century many hats were shipped through Panama before being sold around the world, and canal workers wore them, so the wrong name stuck. The finest take months to weave.","fact":"1906 年美国总统西奥多·罗斯福去视察巴拿马运河工地，被拍到戴着这种草帽，它一下子就火了；2012 年，「厄瓜多尔传统托奎拉草帽编织」进了联合国人类非遗名录。","fact_en":"In 1906 US President Theodore Roosevelt was photographed wearing one while visiting the Panama Canal works, and the hat took off; in 2012 the traditional weaving of the Ecuadorian toquilla straw hat joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list.","src":"Wikipedia · Panama hat","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Panama_hat","say":{"en":"Can this hat be rolled up for travelling?","zh":"这顶帽子能卷起来带着旅行吗？"}},"厄瓜多尔玫瑰":{"what":"厄瓜多尔安第斯高原上种的玫瑰，花头大、花茎又长又直。","what_en":"Roses grown on Ecuador's Andean highlands — big heads on long, straight stems.","fame":"卡扬贝一带就在赤道上，海拔两三千米，白天阳光直射、夜里凉，玫瑰长得慢，花头大、颜色鲜，花茎能长得很长。花从基多机场空运到美国、欧洲、俄罗斯和中国，情人节前是一年最忙的时候。","fame_en":"Cayambe sits right on the equator at 2,000–3,000 metres: strong overhead sun by day, cool nights, so roses grow slowly with large heads, bright colours and long stems. They're flown from Quito airport to the US, Europe, Russia and China, and the weeks before Valentine's Day are the busiest of the year.","fact":"2025 年情人节季，从基多机场运出去的鲜花有 28,779 吨，用了 534 个货运航班，是这个机场有史以来最多的一次。","fact_en":"In the 2025 Valentine's season, 28,779 tonnes of flowers left Quito airport on 534 cargo flights — the airport's biggest season ever.","src":"Primicias（厄瓜多尔）","url":"https://www.primicias.ec/economia/exportaciones-flores-ecuador-san-valentin-quito-89440","say":{"en":"Could I have a dozen red roses, please?","zh":"请给我一打红玫瑰。"}},"钻石":{"what":"南非金伯利的「大洞」——一个人工挖出来的巨大钻石矿坑。","what_en":"Kimberley's 'Big Hole' in South Africa — a vast diamond pit dug by people.","fame":"1871 年人们在金伯利的一座小山包上找到钻石，成千上万的人涌来挖，山包被挖成了一个大洞。南非的钻石业，包括后来的戴比尔斯公司，都是从这里开始的。现在大洞旁边有博物馆，能站在观景台往下看。","fame_en":"In 1871 diamonds were found on a small hill at Kimberley; thousands rushed in to dig, and the hill became a hole. South Africa's diamond industry — including what became De Beers — began here. Today there's a museum beside it and a platform where you can look down.","fact":"从 1871 年 7 月到 1914 年，前后多达 5 万名矿工只用镐和铲子挖这个洞，一共挖出大约 2,722 公斤钻石；它常被说成世界上最深的人工手挖矿坑，不过这个名号还有别的矿在争。","fact_en":"From July 1871 to 1914 up to 50,000 miners dug it with picks and shovels, taking out about 2,722 kg of diamonds; it's often called the deepest hand-dug hole on Earth, though another mine contests the title.","src":"Wikipedia · Big Hole","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Hole","say":{"en":"How deep is the Big Hole?","zh":"这个大洞有多深？"}},"莎草纸":{"what":"古埃及人把纸莎草的茎切成薄片、压在一起做成的书写材料。","what_en":"The writing material ancient Egyptians made by slicing papyrus stems and pressing them together.","fame":"几千年里，埃及的公文、账本、文学都写在莎草纸上，后来希腊人、罗马人也用。英语的 paper 就来自 papyrus。在开罗的埃及博物馆能看到古代莎草纸，街上的店里也卖现做的。","fame_en":"For thousands of years Egypt's records, accounts and literature were written on papyrus, later used by Greeks and Romans too; the English word 'paper' comes from 'papyrus'. You can see ancient papyri at the Egyptian Museum in Cairo, and shops sell freshly made sheets.","fact":"目前知道最古老的、写了字的莎草纸，是 2013 年在红海边的瓦迪贾尔夫挖出来的《梅勒日记》：一个叫梅勒的官员记的工作日志，写的是用船把石灰岩运去修胡夫大金字塔，距今大约 4500 年。","fact_en":"The oldest known inscribed papyri are the 'Diary of Merer', dug up in 2013 at Wadi al-Jarf on the Red Sea: an official named Merer's logbook of shipping limestone for Khufu's Great Pyramid, about 4,500 years ago.","src":"Wikipedia · Diary of Merer","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diary_of_Merer","say":{"en":"Is this real papyrus or banana leaf?","zh":"这是真的莎草纸，还是香蕉叶做的？"}},"阿甘油":{"what":"摩洛哥西南部阿甘树果仁榨的油，能吃，也用来护肤护发。","what_en":"Oil pressed from the kernels of the argan tree in south-west Morocco — eaten, and used on skin and hair.","fame":"阿甘树几乎只长在摩洛哥西南部，耐旱，养活了当地的山羊和很多柏柏尔人家庭。传统做法是妇女合作社手工砸果核、磨仁、压油，很费工夫，所以价钱高，被叫作「液体黄金」。在阿加迪尔、索维拉附近能参观合作社。","fame_en":"The argan tree grows almost only in south-west Morocco; it survives drought and supports local goats and many Amazigh (Berber) families. Traditionally women's cooperatives crack the nuts, grind the kernels and press the oil by hand — slow work, hence the price and the nickname 'liquid gold'. You can visit cooperatives near Agadir and Essaouira.","fact":"2014 年，「阿甘树相关的做法和知识」进了联合国人类非遗名录；联合国大会后来又把每年 5 月 10 日定为「国际阿甘树日」，2021 年起开始过。","fact_en":"In 2014 the practices and know-how around the argan tree joined UNESCO's intangible heritage list, and the UN General Assembly later made 10 May the International Day of Argania, first marked in 2021.","src":"Wikipedia · International Day of Argania","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Day_of_Argania","say":{"en":"Is this oil for cooking or for skin?","zh":"这瓶油是吃的，还是擦皮肤的？"}},"坦桑石":{"what":"一种蓝紫色的宝石，只在坦桑尼亚乞力马扎罗山附近的梅雷拉尼山区开采。","what_en":"A blue-violet gemstone mined only in the Mererani hills near Mount Kilimanjaro, Tanzania.","fame":"它 1967 年才被发现，第二年美国珠宝商蒂芙尼给它起名「坦桑石」推向市场，很快成了热门宝石。全世界只有这一小片产地，挖完就没了，所以格外受关注。","fame_en":"It was only discovered in 1967; the next year Tiffany & Co. named it 'tanzanite' and launched it, and it quickly became popular. All of it comes from one small area, and once that's mined out there will be no more — which is why people watch it so closely.","fact":"2020 年 6 月，坦桑尼亚的小矿主萨尼纽·莱泽尔挖到两块特别大的坦桑石，最大的一块约 9.27 公斤，卖给政府得了三百多万美元，一夜成了富翁。","fact_en":"In June 2020 small-scale Tanzanian miner Saniniu Laizer found two huge tanzanite stones, the larger about 9.27 kg, and sold them to the government for over 3 million US dollars — a millionaire overnight.","src":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/7107529/miner-tanzanite-found-millionaire/","say":{"en":"Where was this stone mined? Can I see the certificate?","zh":"这颗石头是哪儿挖的？我能看看证书吗？"}}};
const STK_NPC = {"大本钟":[{"npc":"precious","t":"早上 7:05","en":"Night shift done. Big Ben was striking seven as I crossed the bridge — best sound after a long night.","zh":"夜班下了。我过桥的时候大本钟正好敲七下——熬了一整夜，这是最好听的声音。"},{"npc":"fatima_ag","t":"周六","en":"Every new student asks me if they can live near Big Ben. I always say: visit it, don't rent next to it!","zh":"每个新来的留学生都问我能不能住大本钟旁边。我总说：来看看可以，住旁边就算了！"}],"伦敦眼":[{"npc":"fatima_ag","t":"周日","en":"When my clients' parents visit, the London Eye is always day one. I wait at the bottom with the coffee.","zh":"客户的爸妈来伦敦，第一天总是坐伦敦眼。我在下面拿着咖啡等他们。"}],"大英博物馆":[{"npc":"precious","t":"休息日","en":"Rainy day off, so I went to see the mummies again. It's free, it's warm, and I always find something new.","zh":"下雨的休息日，我又去看了一次木乃伊。不要钱、暖和，每次都能发现新东西。"}],"炸鱼薯条":[{"npc":"beth_gp","t":"周五晚上","en":"Friday is chippy night in our house. Mushy peas for me, extra vinegar for my husband.","zh":"我们家周五晚上吃炸鱼薯条。我要豌豆泥，我老公要多加醋。"}],"坎登市场":[{"npc":"ngozi","t":"周六下午","en":"Found a denim jacket for twenty quid after ten minutes of haggling. My mum would be proud.","zh":"砍了十分钟价，二十镑买到一件牛仔外套。我妈知道了会夸我。"}],"伦敦塔桥":[{"npc":"ngozi","t":"傍晚","en":"The bridge opened just as I was walking across. I had to wait ten minutes — so I took about fifty photos.","zh":"我走到一半，桥正好要升起来，等了十分钟——于是拍了大概五十张照片。"}],"威斯敏斯特教堂":[{"npc":"precious","t":"周日下午","en":"I'm not religious, but I go to evensong sometimes. Forty minutes of singing in that place — it calms me down.","zh":"我不信教，但有时会去听晚祷。在那儿听四十分钟唱诗，心会静下来。"}],"比萨斜塔":[{"npc":"sara","t":"上午","en":"Yes, I did the 'holding it up' photo. Everyone does. Then I found a great pizza place two streets away.","zh":"对，我也拍了「扶住斜塔」的照片，人人都拍。然后在两条街外找到一家很棒的披萨店。"}],"大卫像":[{"npc":"lin","t":"周三","en":"I booked the Accademia online and still queued twenty minutes. Worth it — he's much bigger than I thought.","zh":"我在网上订了学院美术馆，还是排了二十分钟。值——他比我想象的大多了。"}],"托斯卡纳葡萄酒":[{"npc":"sara","t":"周末","en":"We cycled between two wineries near Greve. Two glasses each — and a very slow ride home.","zh":"我们在格雷韦附近两家酒庄之间骑车。每人两杯——回去骑得特别慢。"}],"达·芬奇":[{"npc":"lin","t":"上课那天","en":"Our art history teacher spent a whole class on one drawing of his. I finally get why people call him a genius.","zh":"美术史老师花一整节课讲他的一张素描。我终于明白为什么大家说他是天才。"}],"伽利略":[{"npc":"paolo","t":"周日","en":"I took my son to the Galileo Museum in Florence. He laughed at the finger, then stayed an hour at the telescopes.","zh":"我带儿子去佛罗伦萨的伽利略博物馆。他先笑那根手指，然后在望远镜前待了一个小时。"}],"罗马斗兽场":[{"npc":"lucia_it","t":"周日下午","en":"After Sunday lunch we walk it off past the Colosseum. Tourists queue for hours — we just say ciao to it.","zh":"周日午饭吃撑了，我们就绕着斗兽场散步。游客排几个小时队，我们只是跟它说声 ciao。"}],"梵蒂冈":[{"npc":"paolo","t":"早上 8 点","en":"Go to St Peter's at eight, before the tour groups. Cover your shoulders — they really do check.","zh":"早上八点去圣彼得大教堂，赶在旅行团前面。肩膀要遮住——他们真的会查。"}],"万里长城":[{"npc":"bj_laozhou","t":"周末","en":"When I was young I cycled to Badaling. Now young people go to Mutianyu — fewer people, better views, they say.","zh":"我年轻时骑车去过八达岭，现在年轻人都去慕田峪，说人少、风景好。"}],"大熊猫":[{"npc":"cd_luo","t":"早上 8 点","en":"Pandas are most lively in the morning — eating bamboo and rolling around. People who come at noon only see them sleeping.","zh":"熊猫早上最精神，一边吃竹子一边打滚。中午来的人只能看它们睡觉。"}],"珠穆朗玛峰":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"去年四月","en":"I only went to base camp on the Tibet side. Even there I needed two days to stop feeling dizzy.","zh":"我只到了西藏那边的大本营。就这样也缓了两天才不头晕。"}],"故宫":[{"npc":"bj_xiaoyu","t":"周二上午","en":"Monday it's closed, so Tuesday morning is always busy. Come at 8:30 and start from the west side — fewer people.","zh":"周一闭馆，所以周二上午人特别多。八点半来，从西边开始逛，人少一点。"}],"北京烤鸭":[{"npc":"bj_zhao","t":"过年","en":"At New Year the whole family has roast duck. My grandson loves rolling his own pancakes — what a mess.","zh":"过年一家人吃顿烤鸭，孙子就爱自己卷，卷得乱七八糟。"}],"京剧":[{"npc":"bj_liu","t":"周末","en":"After I retired I started singing Peking opera. My voice isn't great, but singing with other amateurs makes me so happy.","zh":"我退休以后学唱京剧，嗓子不好，但跟着票友们唱，特别开心。"}],"东方明珠":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"晚上","en":"When classmates visit, I take them to the Bund to see the Pearl Tower light up — better than going up it.","zh":"外地同学来，我都带他们到外滩看东方明珠亮灯，比上去看还好看。"}],"外滩":[{"npc":"lt_zhangyeye","t":"清早","en":"I do tai chi on the Bund every morning, before the tourists arrive — just boats on the river.","zh":"我每天早上在外滩打太极，那时候游客还没来，江上只有船。"}],"小笼包":[{"npc":"lt_wangayi","t":"早上 6 点","en":"We start wrapping xiaolongbao at dawn. First bite, make a little hole — don't burn your mouth.","zh":"我们店的小笼一早就要包，客人第一口记得先咬个小口，别烫着。"}],"富士山":[{"npc":"lt_kimura","t":"晴天早上","en":"On clear mornings you can see Fuji right from the station platform.","zh":"天气好的早上，站台上就能看到富士山。"}],"寿司":[{"npc":"lt_kenta","t":"加班后","en":"Late night, conveyor-belt sushi near the office. Ten plates, no talking, then the last train home.","zh":"加完班，在公司附近吃回转寿司。十盘，一句话不说，然后赶末班车。"}],"东京塔":[{"npc":"lt_sakura","t":"放学后","en":"Tokyo Tower appears in so many manga. When I finally saw it lit up orange, I drew it that same night.","zh":"好多漫画里都有东京塔。我第一次看到它亮橙色灯的时候，当天晚上就把它画了下来。"}],"宫崎骏":[{"npc":"lt_riko","t":"周末","en":"I've watched Totoro maybe thirty times. The Ghibli Museum tickets sell out fast — book a month ahead.","zh":"《龙猫》我大概看了三十遍。吉卜力美术馆的票卖得很快——提前一个月订。"}],"伏见稻荷大社":[{"npc":"lt_hatsune","t":"每年正月","en":"I go every New Year to pray for the shop. If you climb past the halfway point, the crowds disappear.","zh":"我每年正月都去，为花店祈福。爬过一半，人就少多了。"}],"章鱼烧":[{"npc":"yuki","t":"小时候","en":"I grew up in Osaka — every family has a takoyaki pan. Making them at home with friends is the real fun.","zh":"我在大阪长大——家家都有章鱼烧锅。跟朋友在家自己做，才是真的好玩。"}],"神户牛肉":[{"npc":"lt_nakamura","t":"特别的日子","en":"A customer brought me to Kobe for real Kobe beef once. Small portion, big price, and I still remember it.","zh":"有位客人带我去神户吃过一次正宗神户牛。分量小、价格高，到现在还记得那个味道。"}],"景福宫":[{"npc":"emma","t":"周六","en":"I rented a hanbok for the first time — free entry, and the guards even smiled for a photo with me.","zh":"我第一次租了韩服——进宫免费，连守门将都笑着跟我合了影。"}],"K-pop":[{"npc":"lt_daiki","t":"练团的时候","en":"Our band covers a K-pop song every concert. The crowd always sings louder than us.","zh":"我们乐队每次演出都翻一首 K-pop。台下唱得永远比我们还大声。"}],"埃菲尔铁塔":[{"npc":"claire","t":"晚上 9 点","en":"I've lived in Paris twelve years and only been up twice. But at 9 p.m., when it sparkles, I still stop and look.","zh":"我在巴黎住了十二年，只上去过两次。可晚上九点它闪起来的时候，我还是会停下来看。"}],"卢浮宫":[{"npc":"thomas_fr","t":"周五晚上","en":"On Friday evenings it's open late and much quieter. I skip the Mona Lisa and go see the Egyptian rooms.","zh":"周五晚上开得晚，人也少得多。我跳过《蒙娜丽莎》，去看埃及馆。"}],"凡尔赛宫":[{"npc":"nadia","t":"公司团建","en":"Our team day out was at Versailles. The Hall of Mirrors was packed, so we had a picnic in the gardens instead.","zh":"我们公司团建去了凡尔赛。镜厅挤满了人，我们就去花园野餐了。"}],"法棍面包":[{"npc":"claire","t":"下班路上","en":"I buy a baguette on the way home and eat the end before I reach my door. Every single day.","zh":"我下班路上买一根法棍，还没到家就把头那一截吃掉了。天天如此。"}],"圣家堂":[{"npc":"carlos","t":"第一次来","en":"I'm from Valencia and I'd seen photos all my life. Standing inside with the colored light — I didn't expect to feel so small.","zh":"我是巴伦西亚人，从小看照片。真站在里面，彩色的光照下来——没想到自己会觉得那么小。"}],"马德里皇宫":[{"npc":"pilar","t":"周三傍晚","en":"I take every exchange student to the palace gardens at sunset. Then tapas, of course.","zh":"每个交换生我都带去皇宫花园看日落。然后当然是去吃 tapas。"}],"新天鹅堡":[{"npc":"huber","t":"秋天","en":"My husband and I went every autumn. Take the bus up, but walk down through the forest — it's quieter.","zh":"我和丈夫以前每年秋天都去。上山坐车，下山走林间小路——安静多了。"}],"吴哥窟":[{"npc":"emma","t":"寒假","en":"Got up at 4 a.m. for the sunrise. A hundred people around me, and still everyone went quiet when the sun came up.","zh":"早上四点起来看日出。身边一百来个人，太阳出来的时候，大家还是都安静了。"}],"泰姬陵":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"出差顺路","en":"A work trip to Delhi, so I took the early train to Agra. Arrive at opening time — the marble is pink at dawn.","zh":"去德里出差，顺便坐早班火车去阿格拉。开门就进——清早的大理石是粉色的。"}],"卡帕多奇亚热气球":[{"npc":"fang","t":"清早","en":"My balloon flight was cancelled for wind and only went up the next day. Leave a spare day!","zh":"气球那天因为风大取消了，第二天才飞上去。提醒大家多留一天！"}],"哈利法塔":[{"npc":"wang","t":"出差","en":"At a meeting in Dubai I went up to level 124 at night. The traffic looked like toys — my colleague kept calculating what the building was worth.","zh":"在迪拜开会，晚上上了 124 层。脚下的车流像玩具，同事一直在算这楼值多少钱。"}],"帕特农神庙":[{"npc":"lin","t":"暑假","en":"Climbing the Acropolis at noon in August was a mistake. Go early, bring water, wear a hat.","zh":"八月中午爬卫城是个错误。早点去，带水，戴帽子。"}],"圣瓦西里大教堂":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"冬天","en":"Red Square in the snow at night — the domes looked like sweets. My photos don't do it justice.","zh":"夜里下雪的红场——那些圆顶像糖果一样。我的照片拍不出那种感觉。"}],"北极光":[{"npc":"anna_se","t":"冬夜","en":"Growing up in Sweden, my dad would wake us up when the lights were out. We'd stand in the snow in pyjamas.","zh":"在瑞典长大，有极光的晚上爸爸会把我们叫醒。我们穿着睡衣站在雪地里看。"}],"金字塔":[{"npc":"sara","t":"下午","en":"The camel men are very persuasive. I said no three times and still ended up on a camel.","zh":"牵骆驼的人特别会说。我拒绝了三次，最后还是骑上了骆驼。"}],"撒哈拉沙漠":[{"npc":"fang","t":"夜里","en":"A night in a desert camp — cold enough for a down jacket, but more stars than seemed real.","zh":"在沙漠营地过夜，晚上冷得要穿羽绒服，但星星多到不像真的。"}],"塞伦盖蒂狮子":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"早上","en":"Our guide stopped the jeep and whispered: 'Look left.' Three lions asleep, ten metres away. Nobody breathed.","zh":"向导停下车，小声说：「看左边。」三头狮子在十米外睡觉。车上没人敢出气。"}],"自由女神像":[{"npc":"jess","t":"小时候","en":"Born in New York and I only went up when I was twelve, on a school trip. Book the crown tickets early!","zh":"我生在纽约，十二岁学校组织才第一次上去。王冠层的票要早点订！"}],"好莱坞":[{"npc":"tony","t":"下班","en":"I drive past the Hollywood Sign on my way home. Tourists stop right in the road for photos — please don't!","zh":"我下班开车经过好莱坞招牌。游客直接停在马路中间拍照——千万别这样！"}],"枫糖浆":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"周末早上","en":"Pancakes with maple syrup every Sunday. My parents never had it in Pakistan — now my dad puts it on everything.","zh":"每个周日早上吃松饼配枫糖浆。我爸妈在巴基斯坦从没吃过——现在我爸什么都要淋一点。"}],"奇琴伊察":[{"npc":"emma","t":"春分那天","en":"I went on the spring equinox to see the serpent shadow. Thousands of people — and everyone clapped.","zh":"我春分那天去看蛇影。几千人——大家都鼓掌了。"}],"马丘比丘":[{"npc":"sara","t":"第四天","en":"Four days on the Inca Trail, and then the clouds opened. I cried a little, I'm not ashamed.","zh":"走了四天印加古道，云突然散开了。我哭了一下，不丢人。"}],"里约基督像":[{"npc":"fang","t":"阴天","en":"On the day I went up it was all fog. I waited forty minutes, it cleared for five — snap fast!","zh":"上山那天全是雾，什么都看不见。等了四十分钟，雾散开五分钟，赶紧拍！"}],"亚马逊雨林":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"雨季","en":"Three nights in a lodge near Manaus. No signal, a pink river dolphin, and the loudest night I've ever heard.","zh":"在马瑙斯附近的木屋住了三晚。没信号，看到一只粉红河豚，还有我听过最吵的夜晚。"}],"悉尼歌剧院":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"周五晚上","en":"I take my greyhound Pepper for a walk around the harbour after work. The Opera House glows at sunset.","zh":"下班后我带灰猎犬 Pepper 绕港口散步。日落时歌剧院会发光。"}],"袋鼠":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"放假","en":"Drive out of Melbourne at dusk and you'll see them by the road. Slow down — they jump out of nowhere.","zh":"黄昏开车出墨尔本，路边就能看到它们。开慢点——它们会突然跳出来。"}],"爱迪生":[{"npc":"marco_ny","t":"周末","en":"Took the train to Edison's lab in New Jersey. Seeing his messy desk made me feel better about mine.","zh":"坐火车去新泽西看了爱迪生的实验室。看到他乱糟糟的桌子，我对自己的桌子放心多了。"}],"谷爱凌":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"冬奥会那年","en":"2022 年冬奥会她比赛那天，宿舍里所有人都挤在一台电脑前看，赢了大家一起尖叫。","zh":"The day she competed at the 2022 Winter Olympics, my whole dorm crowded round one laptop — we all screamed when she won."}],"孔子":[{"npc":"lt_zhangyeye","t":"国庆假期","en":"Took my wife to the Temple of Confucius in Qufu. I taught the Analects for forty years, and this was my first time standing at his front door. I sent my old students a photo: 'Friends from afar — isn't that a joy?'","zh":"带老伴去曲阜孔庙。教了四十年《论语》，第一次站在他老人家家门口。给老学生们发了张照片：「有朋自远方来，不亦乐乎。」"}],"泰山":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"五一假期","en":"Started climbing from the Red Gate at 11 pm and reached the top around 4. Rented a big padded coat to wait for the sunrise — too cloudy, no sun. But the whole way up was full of students just like me.","zh":"晚上十一点从红门开始爬，凌晨四点到山顶，租了件军大衣等日出。结果云太厚，没看到太阳，但一路上全是跟我一样的大学生。"}],"孙子兵法":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"周一早上","en":"Our trainer quoted 'know your enemy and know yourself' in a negotiation workshop. Later Wang Lei gave me a Chinese–English copy. It sits on my desk now — I read two pages before tough meetings.","zh":"公司的谈判培训课上，讲师引用了「知己知彼」。后来王蕾送了我一本中英对照的，现在就放在我桌上，开难开的会之前翻两页。"}],"王羲之":[{"npc":"bj_xiaoyu","t":"五一假期","en":"Went to the Orchid Pavilion in Shaoxing. People were writing on the stone slabs with brushes dipped in water — the characters vanish in a minute. I tried one '之'. Very wobbly.","zh":"五一去了绍兴兰亭。院子里有人拿毛笔蘸清水在石板上写字，一会儿就干了。我也写了一个「之」字，歪歪扭扭的。"}],"甲骨文":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"秋季学期","en":"Took my class from Xi'an to Anyang to see Yinxu. Everyone copied their surname in oracle-bone script. The student named Ma was happiest — his character really looks like a horse.","zh":"带学生从西安去安阳看殷墟，让每个人照着甲骨文写自己的姓。姓马的那个学生最开心——他的字真的像一匹马。"}],"老子":[{"npc":"emma","t":"寒假","en":"On a trip to Quanzhou I climbed Qingyuan Mountain and found a huge stone Laozi, sitting and smiling. I had the Tao Te Ching in French on my phone and read one line in front of him: 'A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step.' Very true after that climb.","zh":"寒假去泉州，在清源山上看到一座好大的老子石像，坐着在笑。我手机里有法语版的《道德经》，在他面前读了一句「千里之行，始于足下」——刚爬完山，特别有感觉。"}],"太极拳":[{"npc":"bj_liu","t":"每天早上","en":"After dancing at the Temple of Heaven, the tai chi group is right next to us. This year I joined them. I only remember half of the 24 forms so far — the teacher says don't hurry, slow is right.","zh":"天坛跳完舞，旁边就是打太极的队伍。今年我也跟着学了，二十四式才记住一半。老师说别急，慢就是对的。"}],"少林寺":[{"npc":"chen","t":"十一月","en":"Took my students to a tournament in Zhengzhou and stopped at Mount Song on the way. The ginkgo by the bell tower had turned all yellow, with a queue for photos. Kids from the kung fu schools were out running drills — up much earlier than my students.","zh":"带学员去郑州打比赛，顺路上了嵩山。钟楼前那棵银杏全黄了，好多人排队拍照。路边武校的孩子在跑操，比我的学员起得早多了。"}],"龙门石窟":[{"npc":"xa_ajie","t":"周末","en":"Took the train from Xi'an to Luoyang and got to Longmen in the evening. Standing under the great Vairocana Buddha I felt like an ant. Back on the city wall I told my bike-tour guests: next stop, Luoyang!","zh":"从西安坐火车去洛阳，傍晚到龙门。站在卢舍那大佛脚下，人小得像蚂蚁。回来跟骑城墙的客人说：下一站去洛阳！"}],"嘉峪关":[{"npc":"emma","t":"暑假","en":"Took the night train to Jiayuguan. The Gobi sun at noon in July is fierce, and the walls are the colour of earth. I spent ten minutes looking for the 'leftover brick' — in the end the guide pointed it out.","zh":"坐夜车到嘉峪关。七月的戈壁中午晒得厉害，城墙是黄土的颜色。我在城楼上找那块「定城砖」找了十分钟，最后是导游指给我的。"}],"敦煌莫高窟":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"暑假","en":"Booked the Mogao tickets online a month ahead for my wife and me. No photos inside the caves — but when the guide's torch lit up the wall, the flying apsaras looked like they were moving.","zh":"暑假带爱人去敦煌，门票提前一个月就在网上约好了。洞里不让拍照，讲解员手电筒一照，墙上的飞天好像在动。"}],"喀什古城":[{"npc":"fang","t":"十月","en":"Filming food in Kashgar. The old town only really wakes up around ten. The baker slaps dough onto the wall of the clay oven and a few minutes later it's out, too hot to hold. I bought three and ate one on the spot.","zh":"来喀什拍美食，老城上午十点才慢慢醒过来。馕坑边的师傅把面饼往炉壁上一贴，几分钟就出来，烫手。我一口气买了三个，一个当场就吃了。"}],"西湖":[{"npc":"wang","t":"周六早上","en":"Early train from Shanghai to Hangzhou — on the Su Causeway by seven. Not many people yet, just runners one after another. Rode a shared bike from south to north, and bought a box of Longjing before heading home.","zh":"周六一早坐高铁从上海到杭州，七点就到了苏堤。人还不多，只有一个接一个晨跑的人。我骑共享单车从南骑到北，回上海前买了一盒龙井。"}],"龙井茶":[{"npc":"cd_zhang","t":"上个月","en":"We Chengdu folks drink jasmine tea in a lidded bowl. My son brought back a tin of Longjing from Hangzhou. I poured boiling water on it like always — he said use water around 80 degrees. He was right, it tasted sweeter.","zh":"我们成都人喝惯了盖碗花茶。儿子从杭州带回一罐龙井，我照老习惯用滚水冲，他说要八十度左右的水——果然喝起来更清甜。"}],"苏州园林":[{"npc":"lt_qianlao","t":"周三","en":"Took the train to the Humble Administrator's Garden, and my old engineer habit kicked in: counting the lattice windows. Not one pattern on that wall repeats. My wife says I came to look at walls, not flowers.","zh":"坐火车去拙政园，我这个工程师的老毛病又犯了：数窗花。一面墙上的漏窗，花样没有一个重样的。老伴说我是来看墙的，不是来看花的。"}],"昆曲":[{"npc":"cd_akun","t":"出差的晚上","en":"I sing Sichuan opera. On a work trip to Suzhou I went to hear The Peony Pavilion. They stretch one word over many beats — so much slower than us. Afterwards I told my colleagues: slow is the hard part.","zh":"我是唱川剧的，去苏州出差专门听了一场昆曲《牡丹亭》。他们一个字能唱好多拍，比我们川剧慢多了。散场我跟同行说：慢，才难。"}],"景德镇瓷器":[{"npc":"lt_xiaoyun","t":"周末","en":"Went to Jingdezhen to hunt for cups for my guesthouse. The weekend market at Taoxichuan is all young potters selling their own work. I picked twenty cups, no two alike — guests can choose their own.","zh":"为民宿去景德镇淘杯子。陶溪川的周末市集全是年轻人自己做的瓷。我挑了二十个杯子，个个不一样，客人可以自己选。"}],"屈原":[{"npc":"lt_wangayi","t":"端午前一周","en":"The week before Duanwu we sell zongzi next to the xiaolongbao. I wrap pork ones, Lao Zhou wraps red-bean ones, and every year we argue about sweet versus savoury.","zh":"端午前一个礼拜，店里除了小笼还卖粽子。我包鲜肉的，老周包豆沙的，每年都为甜的好还是咸的好吵一回。"}],"李白":[{"npc":"cd_he","t":"中秋前","en":"Took the train to Jiangyou to visit the Li Bai Memorial Hall. A group of schoolkids at the gate were reciting 'Quiet Night Thought' and got stuck halfway — I whispered the next line.","zh":"中秋前坐火车去江油看李白纪念馆。门口一群小学生在背《静夜思》，背到一半忘词了，我在旁边小声提了一句。"}],"苏轼":[{"npc":"cd_laoluo","t":"晚饭时间","en":"We have Dongpo pork knuckle on the menu, a Meishan dish. Guests ask: 'Could Su Dongpo really cook?' I say: I stew it for three hours — if he tasted it, he'd write a poem.","zh":"店里有道东坡肘子，眉山来的菜。客人常问：苏东坡真的会做菜？我说：反正这道菜我炖三个钟头，他老人家要是吃到，肯定要写首诗。"}],"天坛":[{"npc":"bj_liu","t":"每天早上","en":"Six-thirty, east gate, our dance group is already in rows. After an hour of dancing I go straight to the market — the vegetables are freshest then.","zh":"早上六点半，东门进去，我们舞蹈队已经排好队了。跳一个钟头，出来直接去菜市场，那时候菜最新鲜。"}],"公园象棋":[{"npc":"bj_zhao","t":"下午","en":"I play two games in the park every afternoon. The ones watching behind me talk more than I do — 'move the horse, move the horse!' — I pretend I can't hear.","zh":"每天下午在公园杀两盘。后头看的比我话还多，「跳马！跳马呀！」——我就装没听见。"}],"胡同":[{"npc":"bj_laozhou","t":"一早","en":"My stall's at the hutong mouth. Morning is flat tyres and loose chains; by afternoon it's mostly neighbours sitting on my stool for a chat.","zh":"我的修车摊就在胡同口。一早都是补胎、紧链子的，到下午啊，多半是街坊坐我小板凳上聊天。"}],"老舍":[{"npc":"bj_xiaoyu","t":"周末晚上","en":"I finally got tickets for Teahouse at the Capital Theatre. Three acts, and the whole audience laughs at the old Beijing sayings — my grandma's way of talking.","zh":"终于抢到首都剧场的《茶馆》了。三幕看下来，一听到老北京那些话全场都笑——跟我奶奶说话一模一样。"}],"西安城墙":[{"npc":"xa_ajie","t":"周六早上","en":"Started at the South Gate with a group of tourists at eight. One lap takes us about two hours with photo stops — the bumpy bricks are the best workout.","zh":"八点从南门带一队游客上去，一圈加拍照差不多两个钟头。那砖地颠得很，比健身房还练人。"}],"秦始皇":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"上课的时候","en":"Every year my students ask: why don't we just open his tomb? I tell them — once it's opened you can't close it again. Better to wait for better technology.","zh":"每年都有学生问：为啥不把秦始皇陵打开？我说，开了就再也关不上了，等技术更好再说。"}],"兵马俑":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"假期","en":"I live in Lintong, ten minutes from Pit 1. When relatives visit I take them — I've been maybe thirty times, and each time I find a face I hadn't noticed.","zh":"我住临潼，到一号坑十分钟。亲戚来了我就带他们去，去了三十来回了，每回都能发现一张以前没注意的脸。"}],"大雁塔":[{"npc":"xa_ma","t":"夏天晚上","en":"After closing the shop on summer nights, I take my grandson to the north square for the fountain. He runs through the spray and comes home soaked.","zh":"夏天晚上关了店，带孙子去北广场看喷泉。娃在水雾里头跑，回来浑身湿透。"}],"秦腔":[{"npc":"xa_zhang","t":"傍晚","en":"Every evening by the wall, an old friend plays the huqin and I take the first verse. Passers-by stop and film us — I sing even louder then.","zh":"每天傍晚在城墙根，老伙计拉胡琴，我起头先吼一段。过路的停下来拿手机拍，我就吼得更来劲了。"}],"羊肉泡馍":[{"npc":"xa_ma","t":"每天中午","en":"First-timers break the bread way too big. I tell them: smaller, like soybeans — then it soaks up the soup. Regulars like Old Zhang just sit and tear while they chat.","zh":"头一回来的人馍掰得太大。我就说：再碎点，跟黄豆差不多，才吃得进汤。张大爷那样的老顾客，坐下边谝边掰。"}],"杜甫":[{"npc":"cd_he","t":"每天早上","en":"I walk round the cottage every morning and recite one poem by the creek. On rainy days it's always 'Good rain knows its season' — it fits too well.","zh":"每天早上去草堂走一圈，在溪边背一首。下雨天就背「好雨知时节」，太应景了。"}],"麻将":[{"npc":"cd_zhang","t":"每天下午","en":"Afternoons at the teahouse: a cup of jasmine tea and four of us at the table. We play small stakes — it's about the chat, not the money. Well, mostly.","zh":"下午就在茶馆，一杯茉莉花茶，凑一桌。打得小，主要是摆龙门阵，不是为了钱——嗯，基本上。"}],"麻婆豆腐":[{"npc":"cd_laoluo","t":"晚饭的时候","en":"Half my tables order mapo tofu. Foreigners always ask for 'less spicy'; I cut the chilli but never the Sichuan pepper — without the numbing it isn't mapo.","zh":"一半的桌子都要点麻婆豆腐。外国客人总说「少辣」，辣椒我可以少放，花椒不能少——不麻就不是麻婆豆腐了。"}],"川剧变脸":[{"npc":"cd_akun","t":"演出后","en":"Tonight I changed nine faces. A kid in the front row grabbed his dad's arm every time. After the show I go to Lao Luo's place for a late bowl.","zh":"今晚变了九张脸，前排一个小娃每变一次就抓他爸爸的手。演完去老罗店里吃碗夜宵。"}],"上海早饭":[{"npc":"lt_laojin","t":"早上七点","en":"By seven the queue's out the door. Four in a portion, crispy bottom — bite a little hole first and sip the juice, or you'll burn your mouth.","zh":"七点钟门口就排长队了。四只一客，底脆——先咬个小口吸汤，不然烫嘴。"}],"上海弄堂":[{"npc":"lt_wangayi","t":"下午","en":"After the lunch rush I bring my little stool to the lane mouth and chat with the neighbours. Who's back from Shenzhen, whose grandson passed the exam — we know it all first.","zh":"中午忙完，我搬只小板凳到弄堂口跟邻居嘎讪胡。啥人从深圳回来了、啥人家孙子考上了，阿拉最先晓得。"}],"City Walk":[{"npc":"lt_xiaoyun","t":"周末下午","en":"Guests at my guesthouse keep asking for a City Walk route. I send them down Wukang Road to the Wukang Mansion — then tell them to turn off into the side lanes.","zh":"民宿的客人总问我要 City Walk 路线。我让他们沿着武康路走到武康大楼——然后叫他们拐进旁边的小弄堂。"}],"夜校":[{"npc":"lt_xiaoli","t":"周三晚上","en":"I signed up for a night-school coffee class — it sold out in seconds. Tonight was latte art. My heart came out looking like a potato.","zh":"报了夜校的咖啡课，几秒就抢光了。今晚学拉花，我拉的爱心像个土豆。"}],"堂吉诃德":[{"npc":"abuela","t":"周日上午","en":"Every exchange student who stays with us gets the same walk from me: Plaza de España, Don Quixote on his skinny horse and Sancho next to him. Then churros.","zh":"每个住我们家的交换生，我都带去走同一段路：西班牙广场，看骑瘦马的堂吉诃德和旁边的桑丘。看完去吃油条。"}],"伊比利亚火腿":[{"npc":"pilar","t":"十二月","en":"Every December a whole leg goes on the stand in my kitchen. Álvaro slices it badly, I slice it well — that's our Christmas.","zh":"每年十二月，厨房的架子上都会夹上一整条火腿。阿尔瓦罗切得乱七八糟，我切得好——这就是我们家的圣诞。"}],"皇家马德里":[{"npc":"alvaro","t":"周六晚上","en":"Big match night: we watch in a bar near the Bernabéu because tickets are crazy expensive. When Madrid scores, the whole street shakes.","zh":"大比赛的晚上，我们在伯纳乌旁边的酒吧看，因为票贵疯了。皇马一进球，整条街都在晃。"},{"npc":"paco","t":"第二天早上","en":"After a big win the fans party at Cibeles all night. Next morning they come to my kiosk with no voice left, still singing.","zh":"大胜之后，球迷在西贝莱斯广场闹一整夜。第二天早上来我摊上，嗓子都哑了，还在唱。"}],"阿尔罕布拉宫":[{"npc":"hannah_es","t":"周末","en":"Took the night bus to Granada with two classmates. We watched the Alhambra turn pink at sunset from the Mirador de San Nicolás — everyone went quiet.","zh":"跟两个同学坐夜车去了格拉纳达。在圣尼古拉斯观景台看阿尔罕布拉宫在夕阳里变成粉色——所有人都安静了。"}],"弗拉明戈":[{"npc":"pilar","t":"周五晚上","en":"For every exchange student I book one small tablao, not the big tourist show. When the dancer starts stamping, they always grab my arm.","zh":"每个交换生来，我都订一家小小的弗拉明戈酒馆，不去游客多的大场子。舞者一跺脚，他们总会抓住我的胳膊。"}],"西班牙海鲜饭":[{"npc":"carlos","t":"周日中午","en":"My friends here call any yellow rice 'paella'. Back in Valencia my grandpa cooks it over orange-tree wood, with rabbit — and nobody touches the pan before he says so.","zh":"这儿的朋友把什么黄米饭都叫 paella。在巴伦西亚，我爷爷用橘子树的柴火煮，放兔肉——他不发话，谁都不准碰锅。"}],"番茄节":[{"npc":"carlos","t":"八月最后一个星期三","en":"Did La Tomatina once with my cousins. Tip: wear clothes you'll throw away, and goggles. I found tomato in my ear two days later.","zh":"跟表哥表姐去过一次番茄节。建议：穿准备扔掉的衣服，戴护目镜。两天后我耳朵里还掏出了番茄。"}],"特奥蒂瓦坎":[{"npc":"diego","t":"周日早上","en":"Took my little sister to Teotihuacan on the Sunday bus. We got there at opening time, before the heat and the crowds — she walked the whole Avenue of the Dead.","zh":"周日坐大巴带妹妹去了特奥蒂瓦坎。一开门就到，赶在太热、人多之前——她把整条亡者大道都走完了。"}],"塔可":[{"npc":"rosa","t":"早上五点","en":"Up at five to press the tortillas. My regulars know: if you come after one o'clock, the pork is gone.","zh":"早上五点起来压玉米饼。老顾客都知道：一点以后来，猪肉就卖完了。"},{"npc":"diego","t":"晚上十一点","en":"After my last delivery I stop at the al pastor stand by the metro. The guy flicks a slice of pineapple off the top with his knife — right onto my taco.","zh":"送完最后一单，我在地铁站边的牧师塔可摊停一下。老板一刀把顶上的菠萝削下一片——正好落在我的塔可上。"}],"弗里达":[{"npc":"valeria","t":"周六","en":"Tourists in my studio always ask for 'Frida earrings'. I tell them: just be brave with colour — she was.","zh":"来我工作室的游客总要「弗里达耳环」。我说：颜色大胆一点就行——她就是这样。"}],"墨西哥摔角":[{"npc":"diego","t":"周二晚上","en":"Took my sister to Arena México. She bought a mask outside and screamed louder than anyone for the bad guys.","zh":"带妹妹去了墨西哥竞技场。她在门口买了个面具，给「坏人」喊得比谁都响。"}],"流浪乐队":[{"npc":"rosa","t":"周日下午","en":"My brother turned fifty, so we paid a mariachi to sing 'Las Mañanitas' under his window. He cried, of course.","zh":"我哥哥五十岁生日，我们请了马里亚奇在他窗下唱《Las Mañanitas》。他当然哭了。"}],"秘鲁酸橘汁腌鱼":[{"npc":"fang","t":"中午十二点","en":"In Lima, lots of cevicherías only open for lunch. The man next to me drank the leftover 'tiger's milk' in one go, so I did too. Sour, spicy, wide awake.","zh":"在利马，很多 ceviche 店只开中午。旁边的大叔把剩下的「虎奶」一口喝了，我也照做——又酸又辣，一下子醒了。"}],"库斯科古城":[{"npc":"emma","t":"第一天","en":"First day in Cusco I tried to walk up to San Blas and had to stop every twenty steps — 3,400 metres is no joke. The hotel gave me coca tea.","zh":"在库斯科第一天，我想走上圣布拉斯区，结果每走二十步就得停一下——3400 米可不是开玩笑。酒店给了我一杯古柯茶。"}],"羊驼":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"出差","en":"Visited a mill in Arequipa for a client. They sort the fibre by hand, by colour and fineness — dozens of shades of natural brown.","zh":"为了一个客户去了阿雷基帕的一家毛纺厂。他们用手按颜色和粗细分毛——光是天然的棕色就有几十种。"}],"秘鲁土豆":[{"npc":"sara","t":"早上逛市场","en":"At the market in Huancayo a woman had potatoes in twenty colours. She laughed when I asked which one was 'the normal one'.","zh":"在万卡约的市场，一个大姐摆着二十种颜色的土豆。我问哪个是「普通的」，她笑了。"}],"阿根廷探戈":[{"npc":"marcela","t":"周四晚上","en":"Thursday nights my husband and I go to a milonga in our neighbourhood. We're not good, but after twenty years in the shop, it's our one hour with no price tags to change.","zh":"每周四晚上，我和老公去附近的 milonga 跳舞。跳得不好，可开了二十年店，这是唯一一个小时不用想换价签。"}],"博卡区":[{"npc":"emma","t":"下午","en":"Caminito: every wall a different colour. I took two hundred photos and danced exactly zero tangos.","zh":"Caminito 小街：每面墙一个颜色。我拍了两百张照片，探戈一步都没跳。"}],"马拉多纳":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"2020 年 11 月","en":"There's a Diego mural on half the corners of this city. The week he died, every one of them had flowers and candles under it — I wrote about nothing else.","zh":"这座城一半的街角都有迭戈的壁画。他去世那一周，每一幅底下都摆满了花和蜡烛——那一周我什么别的都没写。"}],"博尔赫斯":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"周日下午","en":"My Sunday ritual: a coffee at Café Tortoni and one Borges story. They're short, but I always need a second coffee to understand them.","zh":"我周日的习惯：在托尔托尼咖啡馆喝杯咖啡，读一篇博尔赫斯。很短，可我每次都得再要一杯咖啡才看得懂。"}],"可颂":[{"npc":"pierre","t":"凌晨 5 点","en":"I fold the butter into the dough the night before. At five I take the first tray out — the neighbours know it by the smell.","zh":"黄油前一晚就折进面团里了。早上五点第一盘出炉，邻居们闻味道就知道。"}],"巴黎圣母院":[{"npc":"claire","t":"周日上午","en":"I watched the spire burn from my office window in 2019. Last Sunday I finally went back inside — it's so bright now, I barely recognised it.","zh":"2019 年我在办公室窗口看着尖塔烧起来。上周日我终于又进去了——里面亮得我差点认不出来。"}],"居里夫人":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"去巴黎开会那天","en":"Whenever I'm in Paris for a conference, I sneak off to the Curie Museum. Her little lab makes my problems feel very small.","zh":"每次去巴黎开会，我都会偷偷溜去居里博物馆。看看她那间小实验室，我那点烦恼就不算什么了。"}],"凯旋门":[{"npc":"nadia","t":"7 月 14 日","en":"On Bastille Day I take my niece to watch the parade come down from the Arc. Then we go home — the crowds are too much for me.","zh":"国庆节我带侄女去看从凯旋门下来的阅兵。看完就回家，人太多了，我受不了。"}],"小王子":[{"npc":"emma","t":"回里昂过暑假","en":"Every time I fly home, I land at Lyon–Saint-Exupéry — the airport is named after him. My grandmother read me the book when I was six.","zh":"每次回家，我都降落在里昂圣埃克苏佩里机场——机场就是用他的名字命名的。我六岁时外婆给我读过这本书。"}],"普罗旺斯薰衣草":[{"npc":"emma","t":"七月初","en":"Every July my family drove south from Lyon. We'd stop by the lavender fields, and I'd fall asleep in the car smelling it.","zh":"每年七月我家从里昂开车往南走，会在薰衣草田边停一下。我在车上闻着那个味道就睡着了。"}],"马赛鱼汤":[{"npc":"sara","t":"周五晚上","en":"In Rome we have our own fish soups, so I came to Marseille ready to judge. Then the waiter carved the fish at our table… I was won over.","zh":"罗马也有自己的鱼汤，所以我来马赛是带着挑剔来的。结果服务员在桌边把鱼一切……我就服了。"}],"戛纳电影节":[{"npc":"emma","t":"五月，晚上","en":"I didn't have a badge for the red carpet, so my friends and I watched a free film on the beach screen instead. Honestly, better.","zh":"我没有走红毯的证件，就和朋友去海滩上看了一场免费的露天电影。说实话，更好。"}],"尼斯海滨":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"出差的早上 7 点","en":"I had a client meeting in Nice at ten, so I walked the promenade at seven and sat in one of the blue chairs. Best start to a work day.","zh":"十点在尼斯见客户，我七点先去海边大道走了一圈，在一把蓝椅子上坐了会儿。最好的上班开头。"}],"丁丁历险记":[{"npc":"claire","t":"布鲁塞尔出差","en":"Hergé's clean lines are still how I teach my designers: say it with as few lines as you can. In Brussels I once rode the metro to Stockel just to see the Tintin walls.","zh":"我现在还用埃尔热那种干净的线条教我的设计师：能少一笔就少一笔。在布鲁塞尔，我专门坐地铁到 Stockel 站去看满墙的丁丁。"}],"比利时巧克力":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"从布鲁塞尔回来那天","en":"After every project meeting in Brussels I bring a box of pralines back to the office. It's the only time everyone says yes in the same meeting.","zh":"每次在布鲁塞尔开完项目会，我都带一盒夹心巧克力回办公室。那是全组唯一一次大家一起说「好」。"}],"红十字会":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"周六下午","en":"When friends visit Geneva, I take them to the Red Cross Museum. The room of prisoner-of-war index cards always goes quiet.","zh":"朋友来日内瓦，我会带他们去红十字博物馆。走到放满战俘卡片的那间屋子，大家都不说话了。"}],"奶酪火锅":[{"npc":"fang","t":"冬天的晚上","en":"In Shanghai we'd call this a hotpot — but only cheese! I dropped my bread in the pot twice and everyone laughed.","zh":"在上海我们会叫它火锅——可锅里只有奶酪！我把面包掉进锅里两次，大家都笑了。"}],"魁北克老城":[{"npc":"thomas_fr","t":"休假时","en":"In Old Quebec everyone speaks French, but they told me my Paris accent sounds 'very fancy'. I've never felt so posh ordering a coffee.","zh":"魁北克老城人人说法语，可他们说我的巴黎口音「好高级」。我点杯咖啡从来没觉得自己这么体面过。"}],"魁北克冬季狂欢节":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"二月的周末","en":"I took the train up from Toronto for the carnival. Minus twenty, three layers, and I still stayed out for the night parade.","zh":"我从多伦多坐火车上来看狂欢节。零下二十度，穿了三层，我还是在外面看完了夜里的游行。"}],"普丁薯条":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"下班后","en":"We have poutine in Toronto too, but my Montreal cousin says it doesn't count unless the curds squeak.","zh":"多伦多也有普丁，可我蒙特利尔的表姐说，奶酪粒不吱吱响的都不算。"}],"太阳马戏团":[{"npc":"claire","t":"团队活动那晚","en":"I took my whole team to a Cirque du Soleil show for our year-end night. No speeches, no slides — just two hours of 'wow'.","zh":"年底团建，我带全组去看了一场太阳马戏团。没有讲话，没有幻灯片——就两个小时的「哇」。"}],"戈雷岛":[{"npc":"emma","t":"在达喀尔的那个夏天","en":"On Gorée I stood at the Door of No Return and couldn't say anything. The ferry back was the quietest boat ride of my life.","zh":"在戈雷岛，我站在「不归之门」前，什么话都说不出来。回去的那班船，是我坐过最安静的船。"}],"塞内加尔鱼饭":[{"npc":"fang","t":"中午","en":"The family put one big platter on the floor and gave me the best piece of fish. I went straight for the crispy rice at the bottom — they approved.","zh":"一家人在地上放了一大盘，把最好的那块鱼给了我。我直接去挖锅底的焦饭——他们说我懂行。"}],"塞内加尔摔跤":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"在达喀尔出差的晚上","en":"My client in Dakar took me to watch laamb on a big screen in a café. The dancing before the fight took longer than the fight.","zh":"达喀尔的客户带我去咖啡馆看大屏幕上的摔跤。开打前的跳舞比打的时间还长。"}],"粉红湖":[{"npc":"thomas_fr","t":"度假时","en":"We went at midday when the sun was strongest, and it really was pink. The salt workers were already coming out — they'd started at dawn.","zh":"我们中午太阳最大的时候去的，湖真的是粉的。采盐的人已经上岸了——他们天一亮就下水了。"}],"彩色渔船":[{"npc":"sara","t":"傍晚","en":"I came for the fish market and stayed for the boats. One had 'Maman' painted on it, another had Ronaldo — I took fifty photos.","zh":"我是来逛鱼市的，结果看船看得走不动。一条船上写着「妈妈」，另一条画着C 罗——我拍了五十张。"}],"涩谷十字路口":[{"npc":"yui_pet","t":"下班路上","en":"My shop is five minutes from the crossing. After work I wait at the lights with a bag of cat food, surrounded by tourists filming.","zh":"我的店离十字路口五分钟。下班我拎着一袋猫粮等红绿灯，旁边全是拍视频的游客。"}],"秋叶原":[{"npc":"lt_kenta","t":"发工资那天","en":"Payday means Akiba. I tell myself I'm just looking at old game consoles, then I go home with three.","zh":"发工资就去秋叶原。我跟自己说只是看看旧游戏机，结果抱了三台回家。"},{"npc":"lt_sakura","t":"周末","en":"I go to Akiba to look at manga covers — I study how the artists draw eyes. Then I buy one book with my pocket money.","zh":"我去秋叶原看漫画封面，研究画家怎么画眼睛。然后用零花钱买一本。"}],"相扑":[{"npc":"lt_tanaka","t":"大赛期间的傍晚","en":"During a tournament I keep the radio on behind the counter. Regulars come in just to ask me who won the last bout.","zh":"大赛那几天我在收银台后面开着收音机。老客人进来就为了问我最后一场谁赢了。"}],"金阁寺":[{"npc":"lt_riko","t":"秋天出差","en":"I went to sketch Kinkaku-ji for a magazine. The gold is too bright for my pencil — in the end I drew the reflection in the pond.","zh":"我去京都给杂志画金阁寺。金色太亮，铅笔画不出来——最后我画了池子里的倒影。"}],"宇治抹茶":[{"npc":"lt_aya","t":"进货的时候","en":"My matcha supplier from Uji raised the price again. I still keep the matcha latte on the menu — I just make it a little smaller.","zh":"宇治的抹茶供应商又涨价了。抹茶拿铁我还是留在菜单上，只是杯子小了一点。"}],"任天堂":[{"npc":"lt_kenta","t":"深夜","en":"Nintendo started with playing cards in Kyoto. I tell myself that every night I open my three-year-old indie game.","zh":"任天堂当年也是从京都的纸牌开始的。我每天晚上打开那个做了三年的独立游戏，都这样安慰自己。"},{"npc":"lt_daiki","t":"放学后","en":"The band practises at my friend's house, but half the time we end up playing Mario Kart instead.","zh":"乐队在朋友家排练，结果一半时间都在打马里奥赛车。"}],"艺伎":[{"npc":"lt_nakamura","t":"深夜关店后","en":"When I worked in Ginza, I sometimes made drinks for geisha after their banquets. They were the sharpest listeners in the room.","zh":"以前在银座的时候，有时给宴席散场的艺伎调酒。她们是全场最会听人说话的人。"}],"奈良小鹿":[{"npc":"yuki","t":"小学春游","en":"Every Osaka kid goes to Nara on a school trip. A deer ate my worksheet, and my teacher actually believed me.","zh":"大阪的小孩春游都去奈良。有一次鹿把我的作业纸吃了，老师居然相信了。"}],"姬路城":[{"npc":"lt_kimura","t":"休息日","en":"On my day off I took the shinkansen to Himeji. The castle was white and spotless, like a perfectly ironed uniform.","zh":"休息日我坐新干线去了姬路。城堡白得一尘不染，像一件熨得笔挺的制服。"}],"广岛和平纪念公园":[{"npc":"lt_hatsune","t":"每年八月","en":"Every August I fold a thousand paper cranes with the neighbourhood children and send them to Hiroshima.","zh":"每年八月我和街上的孩子们一起折一千只纸鹤，寄去广岛。"}],"宫岛鸟居":[{"npc":"yuki","t":"带 Daniel 去的那次","en":"I took Daniel to Miyajima. He wanted to walk to the torii, but we came at high tide — so we just ate grilled oysters and waited.","zh":"我带 Daniel 去宫岛。他想走到鸟居下面，可我们去的时候正好涨潮——只好吃着烤牡蛎等。"}],"博多拉面":[{"npc":"lt_sato","t":"打烊后","en":"My tonkotsu is from my grandfather, but every time I go to Fukuoka I order a kaedama and think: they're doing something right.","zh":"我的豚骨汤是爷爷传下来的，可每次去福冈我都会加一份替玉，心想：人家确实有一套。"}],"熊本熊":[{"npc":"lt_daiki","t":"上学路上","en":"There's a Kumamon keychain on my school bag, between my band badges. My grandma gave it to me. Don't laugh.","zh":"我书包上的乐队徽章中间挂着一个熊本熊钥匙扣。奶奶给的。别笑。"}],"樱花":[{"npc":"lt_hatsune","t":"三月底","en":"Customers always want cherry branches for the shop window in late March. I tell them: enjoy the real trees first — they won't wait.","zh":"三月底客人总想要樱花枝摆在橱窗里。我跟他们说：先去看真的树吧，它们不等人。"},{"npc":"lt_nakamura","t":"花见季","en":"In hanami season my bar is empty until ten. Then everyone comes in cold from the park, wanting something warm.","zh":"赏花季我的店十点前都没人。然后大家从公园冻着回来，想喝点热的。"}],"地狱谷雪猴":[{"npc":"lt_yuki","t":"一月的登山回来","en":"After hiking in Nagano I stopped at the monkey park. I was freezing; the monkeys were in the hot spring. I was jealous.","zh":"在长野爬完山顺路去看猴子。我冻得发抖，猴子泡在温泉里。我好羡慕。"}],"白川乡":[{"npc":"sato","t":"客人问起的时候","en":"Foreign clients sometimes ask if they can rent an old thatched house like in Shirakawa-go. I tell them: visit, yes — but heating it in winter is another story.","zh":"外国客人有时问能不能租白川乡那样的茅草老房子。我说：去看看可以——冬天要把它烧暖可是另一回事。"}],"白金汉宫":[{"npc":"precious","t":"早上 8 点","en":"I cut through Green Park after my night shift. Some mornings the band is marching to the palace — I'm too tired to stop, but I hum along.","zh":"夜班下了，我穿过格林公园回家。有的早上正碰上乐队往王宫走——我累得不想停，但会跟着哼两句。"}],"英式下午茶":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"周日下午","en":"Took Mum for afternoon tea for her birthday. We argued for ten minutes about jam first or cream first on the scones.","zh":"妈妈生日，我请她吃下午茶。我们为司康饼先抹果酱还是先抹奶油吵了十分钟。"}],"福尔摩斯":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"周四","en":"Someone always asks for 'the first Sherlock book'. I hand them A Study in Scarlet and tell them it's short enough for the train.","zh":"总有人来问「第一本福尔摩斯是哪本」。我把《血字的研究》递过去，告诉他们坐火车就能读完。"}],"巨石阵":[{"npc":"lin","t":"周六","en":"Day trip from London with my classmates. The stones were smaller than I imagined, but the wind was way stronger!","zh":"跟同学从伦敦来一日游。石头比我想象的小，风可比我想象的大多了！"}],"牛津大学":[{"npc":"lin","t":"周日","en":"Walked past the round library everyone photographs. A student cycled by in a black gown, like something out of a film.","zh":"走过那座人人都拍的圆形图书馆。一个学生穿着黑袍骑车经过，像电影里的画面。"}],"莎士比亚":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"周三晚上","en":"Stood in the yard at the Globe for three hours. My feet hurt, but the actors talked right to us — better than any seat.","zh":"在环球剧场的站票区站了三个小时。脚疼，可演员就对着我们说台词——比坐着还好。"}],"牛顿":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"周六上午","en":"A boy asked me if the apple really hit Newton on the head. I said probably not — then sold him a book about gravity.","zh":"一个小男孩问我苹果是不是真的砸到了牛顿的头。我说大概没有——然后卖给他一本讲引力的书。"}],"达尔文":[{"npc":"precious","t":"下雨的休息日","en":"At the Natural History Museum I always say hello to Darwin's statue on the stairs. He looks like he's watching all the school groups.","zh":"去自然历史博物馆，我总会跟楼梯上的达尔文雕像打个招呼。他好像在看着来参观的一群群小学生。"}],"披头士乐队":[{"npc":"ngozi","t":"周五","en":"I played Here Comes the Sun at the end of class. Half my students knew all the words — their parents' music, apparently.","zh":"下课前我放了《Here Comes the Sun》。一半学生都会唱——说是爸妈常听的。"}],"曼彻斯特足球":[{"npc":"beth_gp","t":"德比日","en":"Derby day at the surgery: the phones go quiet at kick-off. Then on Monday half the patients are hoarse.","zh":"德比日的诊所：一开球电话就安静了。到了周一，一半病人嗓子都喊哑了。"}],"哈利·波特":[{"npc":"emma","t":"周六上午","en":"Queued 40 minutes at King's Cross for the Platform 9¾ photo. The staff even flick your scarf so it looks like you're running!","zh":"在国王十字车站排了 40 分钟拍 9¾ 站台。工作人员还帮你甩起围巾，看起来像在冲进墙里！"}],"苏格兰风笛":[{"npc":"emma","t":"傍晚","en":"In Edinburgh you hear a piper before you see him. I followed the sound up the Royal Mile and found him by the cathedral.","zh":"在爱丁堡，先听见风笛，再看见吹风笛的人。我顺着声音走上皇家英里大道，在大教堂旁边找到了他。"}],"高地牛":[{"npc":"lin","t":"高地一日游","en":"Our coach stopped by a field and a Highland cow walked right up to the fence. I couldn't see her eyes at all under that fringe.","zh":"大巴在一片草地边停下，一头高地牛直接走到了栅栏前。刘海太长，我完全看不到它的眼睛。"}],"苏格兰威士忌":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"周五晚上","en":"My friend ordered a smoky Islay whisky for me. First sip tasted like a campfire. Second sip, I kind of got it.","zh":"朋友给我点了一杯艾雷岛的烟熏威士忌。第一口像在喝篝火，第二口，好像有点懂了。"}],"尼斯湖水怪":[{"npc":"emma","t":"下雨的下午","en":"Took the boat out on Loch Ness. No Nessie — just rain, grey water and a castle on the shore. Still bought the fridge magnet.","zh":"坐船游了尼斯湖。没看到水怪——只有雨、灰色的湖水和岸边一座城堡。冰箱贴还是买了。"}],"纽约贝果":[{"npc":"marco_ny","t":"早上 7:40","en":"Our shop doesn't make bagels, but I grab one from the place next door every morning before my shift. Everything bagel, scallion cream cheese — every single day.","zh":"我们店不做贝果，但我每天上班前都去隔壁那家买一个。全料贝果，葱香奶酪——天天都是这个。"},{"npc":"jess","t":"周日上午","en":"Sunday rule in my apartment: whoever wakes up first goes for bagels. The line is always out the door and nobody minds.","zh":"我们家周日的规矩：谁先起床谁去买贝果。队总是排到门外，可是没人在乎。"}],"华尔街铜牛":[{"npc":"marcus_bank","t":"午休","en":"I walk past the bull on my lunch break. The tourists rub it for luck — I tell my clients the real luck is paying your card off in full.","zh":"我午休时走过铜牛。游客摸它求好运——我跟客户说，真正的好运是每个月把信用卡全额还清。"}],"中央公园":[{"npc":"jess","t":"周六早上","en":"Six-mile loop in Central Park before brunch. No cars on the drive since 2018 — it's just runners, bikes and the odd horse carriage.","zh":"早午饭前在中央公园跑一圈十公里。2018 年以后环路上没有车了——只有跑步的、骑车的，偶尔一辆马车。"},{"npc":"patel","t":"下班后","en":"I tell my older patients: a slow walk around the Reservoir counts. Tonight I took my own advice.","zh":"我总跟老年病人说：绕着中央公园的水库慢慢走一圈也算运动。今晚我自己也照做了。"}],"百老汇":[{"npc":"tony","t":"周五晚上","en":"Took the whole creative team to a Broadway show after we won the pitch. Half of them cried at the finale, and I'm not saying which half I was in.","zh":"比稿赢了，我带整个创意团队去看百老汇。散场时一半人哭了——我不说我在哪一半。"},{"npc":"jay_comedy","t":"周三","en":"I enter the Broadway lottery every week. Lost again — so I did my five minutes at the open mic instead. Same street, smaller stage.","zh":"我每周都抽百老汇的彩票。又没中——那就去开放麦讲我的五分钟。同一条街，舞台小一点。"}],"波士顿倾茶事件":[{"npc":"emma","t":"春假","en":"Spring break in Boston! At the Tea Party museum they let you throw a (fake) chest of tea into the harbour. As someone who lives in Shanghai now, it felt very wrong.","zh":"春假来了波士顿！倾茶博物馆让你亲手把一箱（假）茶扔进港口。我现在住在上海，扔的时候总觉得很不对劲。"}],"哈佛大学":[{"npc":"patel","t":"开会那周","en":"Up in Boston for a geriatrics conference at the medical school. Walked through Harvard Yard at dawn — no tourists, just squirrels and one very tired student.","zh":"来波士顿参加医学院的老年医学会议。天刚亮走过哈佛老院子——没有游客，只有松鼠和一个特别困的学生。"}],"波士顿马拉松":[{"npc":"jess","t":"四月","en":"Missed my BQ by 41 seconds. Again. So this year I'm on Boylston Street with a sign that says 'Run faster than me!'","zh":"又差 41 秒没达标。所以今年我站在博伊尔斯顿街，举着牌子：「跑得比我快！」"}],"感恩节火鸡":[{"npc":"davies","t":"感恩节","en":"First Thanksgiving with Mom's new carer around. Mom still insisted on making the gravy herself — some things you don't hand over.","zh":"妈妈请了护工以后的第一个感恩节。肉汁她还是坚持自己做——有些事是不交给别人的。"}],"万圣节":[{"npc":"tony","t":"10 月 31 日","en":"Office costume contest today. The interns came as our three biggest clients. I gave them first prize and a talk about career risk.","zh":"今天公司万圣节装扮比赛。实习生扮成了我们最大的三个客户。我给了他们一等奖，外加一场「职业风险」谈话。"},{"npc":"andre","t":"万圣节晚上","en":"Took my niece trick-or-treating in Brooklyn. She went as me — hoodie, three pairs of sneakers around her neck.","zh":"带外甥女在布鲁克林讨糖。她扮成了我——连帽衫，脖子上挂三双球鞋。"}],"芝加哥“豆子”":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"出差那周","en":"Client meeting in Chicago, so I walked to the Bean at 7 a.m. Saw my own reflection holding a laptop bag and thought: yes, that's a project manager.","zh":"来芝加哥见客户，早上七点走去看豆子。看见镜子里的自己拎着电脑包，心想：嗯，这就是项目经理。"}],"圣路易斯拱门":[{"npc":"emma","t":"暑假自驾","en":"Road trip day 6: St. Louis. The tram pod to the top of the Arch fits five people and zero personal space. Worth it.","zh":"自驾第六天：圣路易斯。去拱门顶上的小胶囊能坐五个人，零私人空间。但值得。"}],"玉米带":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"九月","en":"Visited a farm-machinery customer in Iowa. Drove two hours and saw nothing but corn. The farmer checked our software on his phone from the combine.","zh":"去艾奥瓦拜访一家农机客户。开了两个小时，除了玉米什么都没看见。农场主坐在收割机上用手机看我们的软件。"}],"一英里高的城市":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"周末","en":"Flew to Denver for a friend's wedding. Climbed the Capitol steps and got out of breath — the air, not my fitness. That's my story.","zh":"飞去丹佛参加朋友婚礼。爬了议会大厦的台阶就喘——是空气的问题，不是我体力不行。我就这么说。"}],"拱门国家公园":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"五一长周末","en":"Hiked to Delicate Arch for sunset. Three miles, one water bottle, four hundred strangers all whispering 'wow' at the same time.","zh":"日落时爬去精致拱门。来回三英里，一瓶水，四百个陌生人同时小声说「哇」。"}],"拉斯维加斯":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"周六","en":"Drove four hours from LA to Vegas for my brother's birthday. Filled up in Baker on the way — gas is always cheaper before the desert.","zh":"从洛杉矶开四小时车去拉斯维加斯给我哥过生日。路上在贝克加满油——进沙漠前的油总是便宜些。"},{"npc":"jonas","t":"一月","en":"CES week: 30,000 steps a day and I still didn't see half the halls. At night the Sphere was showing a giant eyeball. Very relaxing.","zh":"CES 那一周：每天三万步，展馆还是没看完一半。晚上 Sphere 上放着一只巨大的眼珠子。非常放松。"}],"金门大桥":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"周日早上","en":"Biked across the Golden Gate to Sausalito. Couldn't see the towers at all — Karl the Fog was having a big day.","zh":"骑车过金门大桥去索萨利托。桥塔一点都看不见——旧金山的大雾今天特别来劲。"}],"叮当车":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"下班","en":"Took the cable car home for once instead of a robotaxi. Slower, louder, and the gripman knew everyone's name. Kind of perfect.","zh":"难得没叫无人出租车，坐叮当车回家。更慢、更吵，司机认识车上每个人。还挺完美。"}],"恶魔岛":[{"npc":"emma","t":"暑假","en":"Did the Alcatraz night tour. The audio guide is narrated by old guards and prisoners — I kept turning around in the dark cell block.","zh":"参加了恶魔岛的夜游。语音导览是以前的狱警和犯人讲的——在黑漆漆的牢房里我一直忍不住回头看。"}],"硅谷":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"工作日","en":"Design review in Mountain View today. Everyone in the room wore the same grey hoodie. I was the one in a yellow jacket.","zh":"今天去山景城做设计评审。屋里每个人都穿一样的灰色连帽衫，就我穿了件黄夹克。"},{"npc":"jonas","t":"出差","en":"Our partner's office in Palo Alto has a kombucha tap and nap pods. Back in Munich we have a coffee machine that sometimes works.","zh":"我们合作方在帕洛阿尔托的办公室有康普茶龙头和睡眠舱。我们慕尼黑那边只有一台偶尔能用的咖啡机。"}],"乔布斯":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"周六","en":"Drove past the Jobs garage in Los Altos. It's just a normal house on a quiet street — which is kind of the whole point.","zh":"开车经过洛斯阿尔托斯乔布斯家的车库。就是安静小街上一栋普通房子——这其实正是重点。"}],"YouTube":[{"npc":"jay_comedy","t":"周二凌晨","en":"Posted my open-mic set on YouTube. 212 views — 200 are my mom, but the 12 strangers laughed in the comments.","zh":"把开放麦的段子发到了 YouTube。212 次播放——200 次是我妈，但那 12 个陌生人在评论里笑了。"}],"爱因斯坦":[{"npc":"lin","t":"物理课","en":"I wrote E=mc² on my physics homework and my teacher asked me to explain it. I couldn't.","zh":"我在物理作业上写了 E=mc²，老师让我解释一下。我解释不出来。"}],"梵高":[{"npc":"claire","t":"团建","en":"I took my team to the Van Gogh Museum in Amsterdam. Nobody talked for the first twenty minutes.","zh":"我带团队去了阿姆斯特丹的梵高博物馆。头二十分钟，没有一个人说话。"}],"李小龙":[{"npc":"xa_ajie","t":"在家","en":"My dad still does the Bruce Lee 'wataa!' every time he opens a jar.","zh":"我爸到现在每次开罐子都要来一声李小龙的「啊哒！」"}],"平遥古城":[{"npc":"xa_ajie","t":"国庆假期","en":"Took the train from Xi'an to Pingyao with my roommates. We rented bikes on the city wall at sunset — it's smaller than Xi'an's, so we did the whole loop twice.","zh":"国庆跟室友从西安坐火车来平遥。傍晚在城墙上租自行车，比西安的城墙小，我们一圈骑了两遍。"}],"呼伦贝尔草原":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"七月年假","en":"First time on a horse. The guide kept saying 'relax', but I held on the whole hour. At night there were so many stars I forgot to take photos.","zh":"第一次骑马，向导一直说「放松」，我还是抓了一个小时。晚上星星多到我忘了拍照。"}],"黄山":[{"npc":"lt_qianlao","t":"凌晨四点半","en":"Got up at four in the guesthouse on the mountain and joined the crowd with torches. The clouds rolled in right below us — worth every step on my old knees.","zh":"四点在山上的宾馆起床，跟着打手电的人群往上走。云海就在脚下翻过来，我这双老膝盖走得值。"}],"张家界":[{"npc":"emma","t":"五一假期","en":"Zhou dared me to walk on the glass bridge. I did it — looking at the stone pillars, not my feet. Then three days of noodles with chilli for every meal.","zh":"周晓激我去走玻璃桥。我走了——眼睛看石柱，不看脚下。然后三天每顿都是辣椒拌粉。"}],"桂林山水":[{"npc":"fang","t":"清明前后","en":"Bamboo raft down the river in the rain, then straight to a rice noodle shop in Yangshuo. I asked the owner for extra pickled bamboo — locals know what's good.","zh":"下着小雨坐竹筏漂下去，上岸直奔阳朔的米粉店。我跟老板要多加酸笋——本地人才知道好吃在哪儿。"}],"三亚海滩":[{"npc":"wang","t":"春节","en":"Flew down from Shanghai to escape the cold. My phone kept buzzing with work, so I answered emails on a beach chair at Yalong Bay. Still better than the office.","zh":"从上海飞过来躲冷。手机一直在响工作群，我就在亚龙湾的沙滩椅上回邮件。总比在办公室强。"}],"九寨沟":[{"npc":"cd_he","t":"十月中","en":"Went with my old colleagues in October. Five Flower Lake was every colour at once — I wrote three pages in my notebook and still couldn't describe it.","zh":"十月跟老同事一起去的。五花海一湖水好几个颜色，我在本子上写了三页，还是写不出来。"}],"丽江古城":[{"npc":"lt_xiaoyun","t":"去年冬天","en":"Stayed a week in a Naxi courtyard guesthouse to see how they run it. The owner's mum still washes vegetables in the canal every morning, upstream from where tourists wash hands.","zh":"住了一周纳西小院客栈，想看看人家怎么经营。房东的妈妈每天早上还在水渠里洗菜——在游客洗手的上游。"}],"布达拉宫":[{"npc":"cd_luo","t":"八月","en":"Took the train up from Chengdu. The first two days I just walked slowly behind the pilgrims around the palace — the altitude doesn't let you hurry.","zh":"从成都坐火车上来。头两天我就慢慢跟在转经的人后面绕着宫走——海拔高，想快也快不了。"}],"维多利亚港":[{"npc":"amara","t":"转机停留的晚上","en":"Twenty-hour layover in Hong Kong. Crew tradition: Star Ferry at night, then dumplings in Tsim Sha Tsui. The ride costs less than a coffee.","zh":"在香港停 20 个小时。机组的老规矩：晚上坐天星小轮，然后去尖沙咀吃饺子。船票比一杯咖啡还便宜。"}],"台北101":[{"npc":"mei","t":"跨年夜","en":"Closed the drink shop early and squeezed into the crowd with my classmates. 300 seconds of fireworks, then two hours to get on the MRT home.","zh":"饮料店提早关门，跟同学挤进人群。烟火放了 300 秒，然后排了两个小时才挤上捷运回家。"}],"北海道滑雪":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"寒假","en":"Took my winter break in Niseko. Fell over in the powder about twenty times, but it's like falling into a pillow. Soup curry after — that's the real reason I go.","zh":"寒假去了二世古。在粉雪里摔了大概二十次，可是像摔进枕头里。滑完吃汤咖喱——这才是我去的真正原因。"}],"撒马尔罕":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"复活节假期","en":"I teach the Silk Road every year, so I finally went. Sat on Registan Square until the tiles turned gold at sunset. My students will hear about it for months.","zh":"我每年都教丝绸之路，这次终于来了。在雷吉斯坦广场坐到日落，看瓷砖变成金色。学生们要听我讲好几个月了。"}],"西伯利亚铁路":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"退休第一年的夏天","en":"Four nights to Irkutsk in a second-class compartment. The conductor brought tea in glass holders, and my cabin mates taught me card games without a word of English.","zh":"坐二等卧铺四个晚上到伊尔库茨克。列车员用带金属杯托的玻璃杯送茶，同包厢的人一句英语没说，就教会了我打牌。"}],"贝加尔湖":[{"npc":"aino","t":"二月","en":"I thought I knew ice — I run a sauna in Helsinki. But Baikal ice is clear like glass, with cracks deep inside that boom at night.","zh":"我在赫尔辛基管桑拿，以为自己很懂冰。可贝加尔湖的冰透明得像玻璃，裂缝在很深的地方，晚上会砰砰响。"}],"堪察加火山":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"八月","en":"After I retired I promised myself one wild trip. Saw Klyuchevskaya smoking from the helicopter, and a bear fishing below us. My old colleagues say I talk about nothing else now.","zh":"退休时答应自己来一趟野的。从直升机上看到克柳切夫火山在冒烟，下面还有一头熊在抓鱼。老同事们说我现在三句不离这个。"}],"蓝色清真寺":[{"npc":"emre","t":"中午","en":"My exchange booth is ten minutes from the mosque. When the noon call to prayer starts, the tourists come out — and half of them walk straight to me to change euros.","zh":"我的换钱亭离清真寺走路十分钟。中午宣礼声一响，游客就被请出来——一半人直接走到我这儿换欧元。"}],"圣米歇尔山":[{"npc":"gerard","t":"八月的一个下午","en":"I took my three grandsons in August. We stood on the bridge and watched the sea come in all around the mount — the boys forgot their phones for ten whole minutes.","zh":"八月我带三个孙子去了。我们站在桥上看海水一圈圈围住那座山——孩子们足足十分钟没看手机。"}],"威尼斯贡多拉":[{"npc":"lin","t":"周末","en":"A real gondola ride was too expensive for a student, so I took the traghetto — a gondola that just crosses the Grand Canal. The locals stood the whole way. I sat down.","zh":"正经坐一趟贡多拉对学生太贵，我就坐了 traghetto——一种只横穿大运河的贡多拉渡船。本地人一路站着，我坐下了。"}],"勃兰登堡门":[{"npc":"becker","t":"周日上午","en":"When I started at Siemens, the Gate stood behind the Wall and I could only look at it from the west. Now I walk through it on Sunday mornings, and it still feels a little strange.","zh":"我刚进西门子的时候，这座门在墙那边，我只能从西边远远看着。现在周日上午我从门里走过去，还是觉得有点不真实。"},{"npc":"katrin","t":"12 月 31 日","en":"My first New Year's Eve in Berlin I went to the big party at the Gate — never again, too crowded! Now I watch it on TV with friends and only go out for the fireworks.","zh":"我在柏林的第一个跨年夜去了门前的大派对——再也不去了，人太多！现在我和朋友在家看电视直播，零点才出门看烟花。"}],"郁金香":[{"npc":"sanne","t":"周六上午","en":"Every Saturday I cycle home from the market with a bunch of tulips on my handlebars. They're so cheap here that nobody thinks it's romantic — my vase is just never empty in spring.","zh":"每个周六我从市场骑车回家，车把上挂一把郁金香。这里便宜到没人觉得浪漫——春天我家的花瓶就从来没空过。"},{"npc":"chen_nl","t":"四月的一个周六","en":"Sanne took me cycling past the tulip fields near Lisse. I still can't ride in the rain, but luckily it was sunny. I took three hundred photos and sent them all to my mum.","zh":"Sanne 带我骑车去利瑟附近看郁金香花田。我还是不会在雨里骑，好在那天出太阳。我拍了三百张照片，全发给了我妈。"}],"马特洪峰":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"周六一早","en":"I take the early train from Geneva to Zermatt — almost four hours. If the peak is hiding in the clouds, I drink hot chocolate and wait. Physicists are good at waiting.","zh":"我坐早班火车从日内瓦去采尔马特，差不多四个小时。山尖要是躲在云里，我就喝杯热可可等着。搞物理的人最会等了。"}],"圣托里尼":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"七月","en":"Every July I take the ferry from Piraeus with a bag of books I never open. In Oia I don't fight for a sunset spot — I watch the people watching the sunset. It's more interesting.","zh":"每年七月我从比雷埃夫斯坐船过去，带一包从来不翻的书。在伊亚我不抢看日落的位置——我看那些看日落的人，更有意思。"}],"挪威峡湾":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"六月","en":"I live in Bergen, so the fjords are my back garden. Last summer I took a quiet battery boat through the Nærøyfjord — no engine noise, just waterfalls. I filled three pages of my notebook.","zh":"我住卑尔根，峡湾就是我家后院。去年夏天我坐一艘安静的电池船穿过纳柔依峡湾——没有发动机声，只有瀑布声。我的笔记本写满了三页。"}],"冰岛火山":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"晚上睡觉前","en":"I'm saving 2,000 yuan a month for Iceland. Someone on Xiaohongshu said you could see the lava from the airport bus — since then I've watched the volcano livestream every night.","zh":"我每个月存两千块，就为了去冰岛。小红书上有人说从机场大巴上就能看到熔岩——从那以后我每晚睡前都看火山直播。"}],"芬兰千湖":[{"npc":"aino","t":"七月的周末","en":"All winter I watch customers run from the sauna into the icy sea. In July it's my turn: our family cottage is on a lake, and I go from the sauna straight into the water. No ice needed.","zh":"整个冬天我看着客人从桑拿房跑进冰海里。七月轮到我了：我们家的小木屋在湖边，我蒸完桑拿直接下水——不用破冰。"}],"麦加":[{"npc":"amara","t":"朝觐季","en":"In Hajj season our flights to Jeddah are full of pilgrims, many already dressed in white. When we get close, the cabin starts saying 'Labbaik' together — I get goosebumps every time.","zh":"朝觐季我们飞吉达的航班坐满了朝觐的人，很多人上飞机时已经穿好了白衣。快到的时候，整个机舱一起念「Labbaik」——我每次都起鸡皮疙瘩。"}],"佩特拉古城":[{"npc":"noor","t":"春天的周末","en":"When friends visit me in Amman, I drive them three hours south to Petra. I've seen the Treasury maybe ten times, and I still slow down at the end of the Siq.","zh":"朋友来安曼找我，我就开三个小时车往南带他们去佩特拉。「宝库」我大概看了十次，走到西克尽头时还是会不自觉放慢脚步。"}],"尼罗河":[{"npc":"ahmed","t":"暑假","en":"When we visit family in Cairo, my kids beg for a felucca ride at sunset. No engine, just the wind — it's the only quiet hour in Cairo.","zh":"我们回开罗看亲戚，孩子们总吵着要坐傍晚的三角帆船。没有发动机，只有风——那是开罗唯一安静的一小时。"}],"乞力马扎罗山":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"一月的清晨","en":"Kilimanjaro is in Tanzania, but the best view is from Amboseli in Kenya. We waited at dawn, the clouds opened for ten minutes, elephants walked past — and then it was gone.","zh":"乞力马扎罗在坦桑尼亚，可最好看的角度在肯尼亚的安博塞利。我们天没亮就等着，云散开了十分钟，大象从前面走过——然后山又不见了。"}],"维多利亚瀑布":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"四月的长周末","en":"I flew to Livingstone for a long weekend and thought renting a raincoat was a tourist trick. Ten minutes on the bridge and I was soaked to the bone — and laughing like a child.","zh":"我趁长周末飞去利文斯顿，以为租雨衣是骗游客的。在桥上待了十分钟，我从头湿到脚——笑得像个小孩。"}],"红沙丘":[{"npc":"nomvula","t":"学校放假","en":"We drove up from Cape Town in the school holidays — two long days in the car with three kids. They climbed Dune 45 at sunrise, and the sand was still cold under their feet.","zh":"学校放假，我们从开普敦开车上去——三个孩子在车里坐了整整两天。日出时他们爬上 45 号沙丘，脚下的沙子还是凉的。"}],"苏伊士运河":[{"npc":"daan","t":"2021 年 3 月","en":"When the Ever Given got stuck in March 2021, I knew our cranes would go crazy a couple of weeks later. They did — the ships all arrived at once, and I worked double shifts.","zh":"2021 年 3 月长赐号卡在运河里，我就知道过两周我们的吊车要忙疯了。果然——船一下子全到了，我连上了好几个双班。"}],"东非大裂谷":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"周日","en":"On the way to Naivasha we always stop at the viewpoint on the escarpment. The whole valley opens up below you — and the souvenir sellers there know me by name now.","zh":"去奈瓦沙的路上，我们每次都在悬崖边的观景台停一下。整条山谷一下子在脚下铺开——那儿卖纪念品的人现在都叫得出我的名字了。"}],"黄石公园":[{"npc":"jake","t":"暑假","en":"My brother and I finally did the road trip from Milwaukee we'd talked about since we were kids. Two days of driving, then a bison walked past the car window and neither of us said a word.","zh":"我和我哥终于开车从密尔沃基去了，这趟路我们从小就在说。开了两天，结果一头野牛从车窗外走过，我俩谁都没吭声。"}],"大峡谷":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"休息日清早","en":"Seven hours from LA if you don't stop. I got there before sunrise, stood at the edge with a gas-station coffee, and forgot to drink it.","zh":"从洛杉矶开过去不停车也要七个钟头。我日出前到的，端着一杯加油站咖啡站在边上，结果忘了喝。"},{"npc":"zoe","t":"春假","en":"Tried to film a cute video for my followers. Wind took my hat straight into the canyon. That clip got more views than anything I've posted.","zh":"本来想给粉丝拍个好看的视频，风把我的帽子直接吹进了峡谷。这段的播放量比我发过的任何东西都高。"}],"尼亚加拉瀑布":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"周末","en":"Every time relatives visit from Pakistan, we drive them to Niagara. I've been maybe fifteen times, and I still put the poncho on and still get soaked.","zh":"每次有亲戚从巴基斯坦来，我们都开车带他们去尼亚加拉。我大概去了十五次了，还是会穿上雨衣，还是会被淋透。"}],"班夫国家公园":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"九月长周末","en":"Flew to Calgary on Friday, took the first shuttle up to Moraine Lake on Saturday. No laptop. Honestly the best product decision I made all year.","zh":"周五飞到卡尔加里，周六坐第一班车上梦莲湖。没带电脑。说真的，这是我今年做得最好的一个「产品决定」。"}],"格陵兰冰盖":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"退休那年夏天","en":"I taught glaciers from a textbook for thirty years. The summer I retired I took the ship up Greenland's west coast and watched icebergs from the ice sheet drift out of the fjord at Ilulissat.","zh":"我照着课本教了三十年冰川。退休那年夏天，我坐船沿着格陵兰西海岸往北，在伊卢利萨特看从冰盖上断下来的冰山慢慢漂出峡湾。"}],"五大湖":[{"npc":"jake","t":"七月傍晚","en":"Lake Michigan is our beach. After a Brewers game we sometimes walk down to the lakefront — the water's freezing until about July, and people jump in anyway.","zh":"密歇根湖就是我们的海滩。看完酿酒人队的球，我们有时候走到湖边——水要到七月左右才不那么冰，大家还是照样往下跳。"}],"密西西比河":[{"npc":"sarah","t":"出差那周","en":"Had a dental-tech conference in New Orleans. Skipped one afternoon session to sit on the levee and watch the barges go by. Best meeting of the week.","zh":"在新奥尔良开一个牙科软件的会。我翘掉一个下午的分会，坐在河堤上看驳船一条条开过去。那是一周里最好的「会」。"}],"巴拿马运河":[{"npc":"chenjian","t":"2023 年秋天","en":"Some of our Christmas orders for the US East Coast go through Panama. In 2023 the canal limited ships, and I spent weeks on the phone explaining to customers why their Santas were late.","zh":"我们发往美国东海岸的圣诞货，有一部分走巴拿马运河。2023 年运河限船，我花了好几个星期打电话跟客户解释，为什么他们的圣诞老人迟到了。"}],"天使瀑布":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"地理课上","en":"Every year I show my students a photo of Angel Falls and ask them how to get there. Someone always says 'by car'. Then we look at the map together — no roads.","zh":"每年我都给学生看天使瀑布的照片，问他们怎么去。总有人说「开车」。然后我们一起看地图——根本没有路。"}],"伊瓜苏瀑布":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"去年冬天","en":"I took my daughter for a long weekend and meant to write a travel piece. I came back with a soaked notebook. At the Devil's Throat you can't hear yourself think — I just stopped taking notes.","zh":"我带女儿去过个长周末，本来想写篇游记，结果带回来一本湿透的笔记本。在魔鬼咽喉那儿什么都听不见——我干脆不记了。"}],"莫雷诺冰川":[{"npc":"marcela","t":"结婚那年","en":"We went to El Calafate on our honeymoon, twenty-something years ago. We waited an hour for the ice to fall. My husband still says it was the most romantic hour of his life.","zh":"二十多年前我们去卡拉法特度蜜月，在栈道上等了一个小时，等冰掉下来。我先生到现在还说，那是他这辈子最浪漫的一个小时。"}],"阿塔卡马星空":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"休假的夜里","en":"I study particles, not planets, but I joined a stargazing tour in San Pedro anyway. When I saw Saturn's rings in the telescope, I made the same face the kids make at CERN.","zh":"我研究粒子，不研究星星，但还是在圣佩德罗报了个观星团。从望远镜里看到土星环的时候，我的表情跟来 CERN 参观的小朋友一模一样。"}],"复活节岛石像":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"退休第一年","en":"I delivered letters in Okinawa for forty-two years. When I retired, I flew halfway around the world to see the moai and sat at Tongariki at sunrise for two hours. Nobody was waiting for their post.","zh":"我在冲绳送了四十二年信。退休后飞了大半个地球去看摩艾石像，在汤加里基坐着看日出，一坐两个小时。没有人在等我送信。"}],"乌尤尼盐沼":[{"npc":"bia","t":"转行前的那个间隔年","en":"Before I switched careers I backpacked through Bolivia. At Uyuni our guide made us do the silly perspective photos for an hour. I still use one as my laptop wallpaper.","zh":"转行之前，我背包走了一趟玻利维亚。在乌尤尼，导游让我们拍了一个小时的傻傻的错位照。到现在我电脑桌面还是其中一张。"}],"新加坡鱼尾狮":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"下班路上","en":"Some evenings I walk past the Merlion on my way home. Tourists always ask me to take their photo — after the airport, I'm used to helping people, so I always say yes.","zh":"有时候下班我会从鱼尾狮旁边走回家。游客总请我帮忙拍照——在机场帮人帮惯了，我每次都答应。"},{"npc":"weijie","t":"带客户的晚上","en":"When school clients fly in, I take them to see the Merlion and then to a hawker centre. The Merlion takes five minutes. Dinner takes three hours.","zh":"有学校的客户飞来，我都先带他们看鱼尾狮，再去小贩中心。鱼尾狮看五分钟，吃饭吃三个小时。"}],"巴厘岛":[{"npc":"mia","t":"考完期末","en":"Flights from Melbourne were cheap after exams, so four of us went to Bali. I paid the tourist levy online before we flew — my friend didn't and queued at the airport.","zh":"考完期末，从墨尔本飞巴厘岛的机票很便宜，我们四个人就去了。我出发前在网上交了旅游税——我朋友没交，在机场排了队。"}],"马尔代夫":[{"npc":"amara","t":"马累过夜航班","en":"On Malé layovers the crew hotel is near the airport, but the water is the same colour as the honeymoon photos. I just sit by it and call my mum in Lagos.","zh":"在马累过夜的时候，机组酒店就在机场附近，可是海水跟蜜月照片里一样蓝。我就坐在水边，给拉各斯的妈妈打电话。"}],"大堡礁":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"年假","en":"I surf in Sydney all year, but snorkelling off Cairns was something else. A turtle swam right under me and I forgot to breathe through the snorkel.","zh":"我在悉尼一年到头冲浪，但在凯恩斯外海浮潜完全不一样。一只海龟从我正下方游过去，我忘了用呼吸管呼吸。"}],"乌鲁鲁":[{"npc":"josh_cafe","t":"冬天的早上","en":"We did the base walk with an Anangu guide. She asked us not to photograph some parts of the rock, so we just listened. I came home and didn't post a single photo of those bits.","zh":"我们跟着一位阿南古讲解员走了环岩步道。她请我们有几段岩石不要拍，我们就只是听。回家后，那几段我一张也没发。"}],"狗不理包子":[{"npc":"bj_zhao","t":"国庆节","en":"My son drove me to Tianjin for the holiday and insisted on the famous bun shop. Good buns, but I told him the little shop by our lane in Beijing is cheaper.","zh":"国庆儿子开车带我去天津，非要去吃那家老字号包子。包子是好吃，可我跟他说，我们胡同口那家便宜多了。"}],"刀削面":[{"npc":"xa_ajie","t":"周日晚上","en":"After a day guiding people round the wall, I go to the Shanxi noodle place by campus. I like standing at the window watching the chef shave noodles into the pot.","zh":"在城墙上带了一天人，晚上去学校门口那家山西刀削面。我喜欢站在窗口看师傅把面削进锅里。"}],"阳澄湖大闸蟹":[{"npc":"fang","t":"十月的周末","en":"Filmed my aunt eating a hairy crab today — forty minutes for one crab, and the shell came out spotless. My own plate looked like a crime scene.","zh":"今天拍我阿姨吃大闸蟹：一只蟹吃了四十分钟，壳剥得干干净净。我自己那盘像打过仗一样。"}],"武夷山大红袍":[{"npc":"cd_zhang","t":"下午打完麻将","en":"I usually drink jasmine tea at the teahouse, but today the owner brought out a pot of Da Hong Pao from Fujian. Tiny cups — I had about twenty.","zh":"我在茶馆平时喝花茶，今天老板拿出一壶福建的大红袍，杯子小得很，我一口气喝了二十来杯。"}],"青岛啤酒":[{"npc":"emma","t":"周五晚上","en":"In Lyon we drink wine; here my classmates order Tsingtao with every barbecue. Tonight they taught me to say 'gan bei' — but I only take small sips.","zh":"在里昂我们喝葡萄酒；在这儿同学吃烧烤都点青岛啤酒。今晚他们教我说「干杯」——不过我只喝一小口。"}],"广州早茶":[{"npc":"chenjie","t":"周日早上","en":"Sunday is the only day I don't go to the factory at 6:30. I take my mum to the teahouse — har gow, chicken feet, a pot of pu'er — and we sit until eleven.","zh":"一个星期只有周日不用六点半到厂。我带我妈去饮早茶，虾饺、凤爪、一壶普洱，一坐坐到十一点。"}],"螺蛳粉":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"考试周的半夜","en":"Cooked a packet of luosifen in the dorm at midnight. The whole corridor knew — my roommate opened every window, then asked for a bite.","zh":"半夜在宿舍煮了一包螺蛳粉，整条走廊都知道了。室友把窗户全打开，然后问我能不能尝一口。"}],"重庆火锅":[{"npc":"cd_akun","t":"演出完的夜里","en":"After the show we went to a Chongqing hot pot place — midnight and still a queue. I count 'seven up, eight down' for the tripe out loud, my friends laugh at me.","zh":"演出完去吃重庆火锅，半夜还在排队。我涮毛肚的时候大声数「七上八下」，朋友都笑我。"},{"npc":"cd_laoluo","t":"店里休息那天","en":"Chengdu hot pot or Chongqing hot pot? My customers argue about it every week. On my day off I just go and eat both.","zh":"成都火锅好还是重庆火锅好？店里客人每个星期都在吵。我休息的时候干脆两家都去吃。"}],"茅台酒":[{"npc":"wang","t":"年底的客户饭局","en":"At the year-end client dinner the boss opened a bottle of Moutai. Everyone toasted round the table — I said I was driving and toasted with tea.","zh":"年底请客户吃饭，老板开了一瓶茅台，一桌人挨个敬酒。我说我开车，用茶代酒。"}],"普洱茶":[{"npc":"cd_he","t":"每天下午","en":"A former student sent me a pu'er cake from Yunnan. I break off a little piece each afternoon and drink it while reading poems by the window.","zh":"以前的学生从云南给我寄了一饼普洱。我每天下午撬一小块，坐在窗边一边喝一边读诗。"}],"兰州牛肉面":[{"npc":"bj_xiaoyu","t":"加班的中午","en":"There's a beef noodle shop downstairs from the publishing house. The owner remembers me: 'thin noodles, no coriander, extra chilli'. Ready in three minutes.","zh":"出版社楼下有家牛肉面，老板记得我：「二细，不要香菜，多放辣子」。三分钟就端上来。"}],"吐鲁番葡萄":[{"npc":"xa_ma","t":"开店前","en":"The dried-fruit stall next to my shop sells green Turpan raisins. Before we open I grab a handful — first-time customers always ask what they are.","zh":"我店隔壁的干果铺卖吐鲁番的绿葡萄干。开店前我抓一把吃，第一次来的客人总问这是什么。"}],"大盘鸡":[{"npc":"xa_zhang","t":"唱完秦腔","en":"After singing by the city wall, five of us old men share one big-plate chicken. When the chicken's gone we mix the noodles into the sauce — that's the best part.","zh":"在城墙根唱完秦腔，我们五个老伙计合吃一盘大盘鸡。鸡吃完了，把皮带面拌进汤汁里，那才是最香的。"}],"珍珠奶茶":[{"npc":"mei","t":"晚上打工","en":"I shake a few hundred cups of pearl milk tea every shift. Most popular order? 'Half sugar, less ice.' I've switched to half sugar myself too.","zh":"我一个晚班要摇几百杯珍珠奶茶。点最多的是「半糖少冰」。我自己现在也改喝半糖了。"},{"npc":"ajie","t":"周六下午","en":"A new Taiwanese tea shop opened in Jing'an — queued forty minutes. Worth it? The pearls were good. Next week I'm not queuing.","zh":"静安新开了一家台湾奶茶店，排了四十分钟。值不值？珍珠是真好吃。下个星期我不排了。"}],"韩国泡菜":[{"npc":"minjun","t":"周五下班后","en":"Kimchi stew after work is my comfort food. My check-up said my blood pressure is a bit high, so now I ask for one refill of kimchi, not three. Aigoo.","zh":"下班来一锅泡菜汤，是我最放松的时候。体检说我血压有点高，所以现在泡菜只续一次，不续三次了。哎一古。"}],"全州拌饭":[{"npc":"jiho","t":"周六","en":"Our running crew took the KTX to Jeonju and did an easy 5K around the hanok village. Afterwards thirty of us ate stone-pot bibimbap — no fried chicken that day!","zh":"我们跑团坐 KTX 去了全州，绕着韩屋村慢跑了五公里。跑完三十个人一起吃石锅拌饭——那天没吃炸鸡！"}],"冬阴功汤":[{"npc":"somchai","t":"晚上出摊时","en":"I sell pad thai, not tom yum, but every night the lady at the next stall sends me a small bowl. Tourists always ask, 'Spicy?' I say, 'Little bit… Thai little bit.'","zh":"我卖的是炒河粉，不卖冬阴功，可隔壁摊的大姐每晚都给我端一小碗。游客老问「辣吗？」我说：「一点点……泰国的一点点。」"}],"越南河粉":[{"npc":"mai","t":"出差那天早上","en":"On a work trip to Hanoi I had phở at 6am on a tiny plastic stool. In Saigon I always add heaps of sauce — my Hanoi friend said, 'Taste first!' haha 🍜","zh":"去河内出差，早上六点坐在小塑料凳上吃河粉。在西贡我总要加一大堆酱——河内朋友说：「先尝一口！」哈哈 🍜"}],"印度咖喱":[{"npc":"priyanka","t":"周日下了舞蹈课","en":"After my Sunday dance class I go to a small place near my flat for a South Indian meal on a banana leaf — sambar, rasam, two veg curries and refills of rice. Basically my weekly reward.","zh":"周日下了舞蹈课，我去家附近的小馆子吃芭蕉叶上的南印度套餐——桑巴汤、拉桑汤、两样蔬菜咖喱，米饭随便添。基本上就是我每周的奖励。"}],"大吉岭红茶":[{"npc":"patel","t":"值长班的时候","en":"Every time I visit family in India, my aunt packs me a tin of Darjeeling. On long shifts I make a cup in the staff room — no milk, no sugar, ten quiet minutes.","zh":"每次回印度看家人，姑姑都给我塞一罐大吉岭。值长班的时候我在休息室泡一杯——不加奶、不加糖，安静十分钟。"}],"锡兰红茶":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"年假","en":"On my leave I took the slow train up to Nuwara Eliya — cold enough for a jacket! At the tea factory they gave us a cup with no milk, and I finally tasted the tea we pour every day in the airport lounge.","zh":"年假我坐慢火车上了努沃勒埃利耶——冷得要穿外套！茶厂给我们倒了一杯不加奶的，我终于尝到了机场休息室里天天倒的那种茶本来的味道。"}],"阿萨姆红茶":[{"npc":"rohan","t":"值完夜班的早上","en":"After a night of on-call alerts I go down to the tea stall at 7am. Strong Assam boiled with milk and ginger, no? Basically that's my real incident fix.","zh":"半夜被告警叫醒一晚上，早上七点我下楼去茶摊。浓浓的阿萨姆茶和牛奶、姜一起煮，懂吧？基本上这才是我真正的「故障修复」。"}],"比里亚尼":[{"npc":"amara","t":"周五飞回来以后","en":"My Pakistani neighbour in Dubai cooks biryani every Friday and always sends a plate across. Honestly, after a long-haul flight it's the first thing I want, my dear.","zh":"我在迪拜的巴基斯坦邻居每周五都做比里亚尼，总给我端一盘过来。说真的，飞完长途，我第一个想吃的就是它，亲爱的。"}],"菲律宾烤乳猪":[{"npc":"bea","t":"外婆八十岁生日","en":"For my lola's 80th birthday we ordered a whole lechon from Cebu — it came on the morning flight! My cousins fought over the crispy skin while I filmed it for my followers.","zh":"外婆八十岁生日，我们从宿务订了一整只烤乳猪——坐早班飞机来的！表兄妹抢那层脆皮，我在旁边拍给粉丝看。"}],"越光米":[{"npc":"tanaka","t":"秋天买米的时候","en":"Every autumn I buy a 5-kilo bag of new rice from Niigata. When Daniel moved in, I told him: wash it three times and let it soak for thirty minutes. Now he cooks better rice than my son.","zh":"每年秋天我都买一袋五公斤的新潟新米。Daniel 刚搬来时我教他：淘三遍，泡三十分钟。现在他煮的饭比我儿子煮的还好。"}],"赞岐乌冬":[{"npc":"kenji","t":"放假那天","en":"I took the bus from Osaka to Takamatsu just for udon. Three shops before noon, and each bowl was cheaper than a coffee. Full stomach, happy wallet — maybe a perfect day.","zh":"我专门从大阪坐巴士去高松吃乌冬。中午前吃了三家，每碗都比一杯咖啡便宜。肚子饱了，钱包也没事——也许是完美的一天。"}],"墨尔本咖啡":[{"npc":"mia","t":"周六早上七点","en":"Saturday shift starts at 7. By 7:15 I've made twenty flat whites and I know half the orders before people say them. Heaps of regulars, no worries 😂","zh":"周六的班七点开始。七点一刻我已经做了二十杯澳白，一半的人还没开口我就知道他们要什么。熟客超多，没问题 😂"}],"巴罗萨谷葡萄酒":[{"npc":"josh_cafe","t":"店里的年度出游","en":"For our café's end-of-year trip we flew to Adelaide and did the Barossa. I was the driver, so I sipped and spat at every cellar door — then bought a bakery pie in Tanunda instead.","zh":"咖啡馆年底出游，我们飞到阿德莱德去了巴罗萨。我当司机，每家品酒室都只抿一口吐掉——最后在塔南达的面包店买了个肉派安慰自己。"}],"麦卢卡蜂蜜":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"夜班","en":"We keep manuka honey dressings in the ED, and the doctors decide when to use them. Patients sometimes ask if they can eat it — I say it's honey, just sterile and very expensive!","zh":"我们急诊室备着麦卢卡蜂蜜敷料，什么时候用由医生决定。病人有时问能不能吃——我说那就是蜂蜜，只不过是消过毒的、特别贵的蜂蜜！"}],"马尔堡长相思":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"周五晚上","en":"Friday in Soho: five of us, two bottles of Marlborough Sauvignon Blanc, and guess who's splitting the bill on her phone. It's always the cheapest 'nice' wine on the list.","zh":"周五晚上在苏豪：五个人，两瓶马尔堡长相思，猜猜是谁拿手机算账。它总是酒单上最便宜的「好酒」。"}],"卡瓦仪式":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"大学放假","en":"On my uni break I stayed in a village on Viti Levu. We brought kava root as a gift, sat on the mat, and I asked for 'low tide' — my tongue still went numb!","zh":"大学放假我住在维提岛的一个村子里。我们带了卡瓦根当礼物，坐在草席上，我只要了「低潮」半碗——舌头还是麻了！"}],"土耳其烤肉":[{"npc":"emre","t":"中午 12 点半","en":"Lunch is always the same: a döner from the shop two doors down. I eat it at the counter between customers.","zh":"午饭永远一样：隔两家店的烤肉夹饼。在柜台后面吃，客人来了就放下。"},{"npc":"tobias_sim","t":"晚上 10 点下班","en":"After a late shift at the shop, a döner on the way to the U-Bahn. Every Berliner has their own favourite stand.","zh":"店里上完晚班，去地铁的路上买一个烤肉夹饼。每个柏林人都有自己最爱的那一家。"}],"卡门贝尔奶酪":[{"npc":"thomas_fr","t":"周五晚上","en":"Friday dinner at home: half a baguette and a Camembert left out of the fridge since the afternoon. That's the whole plan.","zh":"周五在家吃晚饭：半根法棍，一块下午就从冰箱拿出来的卡门贝尔。计划就这么多。"}],"香槟":[{"npc":"claire","t":"项目交付那天下午 5 点","en":"When the team ships a big project, I open one bottle at five — not at nine at night. Then everyone goes home.","zh":"团队做完一个大项目，我下午五点开一瓶——不是晚上九点。喝完大家就回家。"}],"波尔多红酒":[{"npc":"gerard","t":"去年夏天","en":"For my retirement my wife and I visited a château near Bordeaux. The cellar was cold, the guide was proud, and I bought six bottles.","zh":"退休那年夏天，我和太太去了波尔多附近一个酒庄。酒窖很冷，讲解的人很骄傲，我买了六瓶。"}],"法式蜗牛":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"第一个在巴黎的圣诞节","en":"My first Christmas in Paris, a colleague's family served escargots. I was scared, but honestly it tastes mostly of garlic butter.","zh":"在巴黎的第一个圣诞节，同事家里端上了蜗牛。我有点怕，但说实话，吃起来主要是蒜香黄油的味道。"}],"健力士黑啤":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"周五晚上","en":"At our Friday pub in Soho, someone always orders a Guinness and we all wait for it to settle. Then I open my phone and split the bill.","zh":"周五在苏豪区的小酒馆，总有人点一杯健力士，大家等它沉下来。然后我打开手机算账。"}],"意大利面":[{"npc":"lucia_it","t":"周日中午","en":"Sunday lunch, always pasta first. Marco takes a pot of ragù home with him, and he brings the empty pot back next week.","zh":"周日午饭，第一道永远是面。Marco 走的时候带一锅肉酱回去，下周把空锅拿回来。"},{"npc":"nonna_carla","t":"周日早上","en":"My ragù starts cooking at eight on Sunday. The grandchildren abroad watch on video and ask why it takes so long.","zh":"我的肉酱周日早上八点就上火了。在国外的孙子们视频看着，问我为什么要煮那么久。"}],"葡式蛋挞":[{"npc":"rui","t":"早上 8 点","en":"Every morning I buy pastéis de nata warm from the bakery for my guests' breakfast. If I'm late, they're gone.","zh":"每天早上去面包店买刚出炉的蛋挞，给客人当早饭。去晚了就没了。"}],"波特酒":[{"npc":"tiago","t":"上个周末","en":"Took the train up to Porto with my girlfriend. We crossed the river to the port lodges, and for one afternoon I didn't think about my app.","zh":"上周末跟女朋友坐火车去了波尔图。过河去对岸的老酒窖，整整一个下午没想我的 App。"}],"慕尼黑啤酒节":[{"npc":"lisa","t":"九月底的夜班","en":"Wiesn weeks are the busiest on my ward. I go once with friends, in my dirndl — and work nights the rest of the time.","zh":"啤酒节那两周是我们病房最忙的时候。我跟朋友穿上长裙去一次，其余时间都在上夜班。"},{"npc":"huber","t":"开幕那个周六","en":"I don't go into the tents any more. I watch the opening parade from the street, then go home where it's quiet.","zh":"我已经不进帐篷了。在街边看开幕游行，然后回家，家里安静。"}],"椒盐卷饼":[{"npc":"maier","t":"早上 7 点","en":"Twenty years, same bakery, same order: one Breze with butter. Then I check the bins before anyone else is up.","zh":"二十年了，同一家面包店，同样一句：一个抹黄油的卷饼。然后趁大家还没起床去检查垃圾桶。"}],"德国香肠":[{"npc":"becker","t":"周六中午","en":"After the flea market I have a currywurst at the stand by the station. Ohne Darm — without skin, the way I've always had it.","zh":"逛完跳蚤市场，在车站边的小摊吃一份咖喱香肠。不带肠衣——我一直这么吃。"}],"华夫饼":[{"npc":"carlos","t":"一个周六","en":"Took the train from Amsterdam to Brussels with Chen. We argued for ten minutes about which waffle to get, then got both.","zh":"跟 Chen 从阿姆斯特丹坐火车去布鲁塞尔。为了买哪种华夫饼争了十分钟，最后两种都买了。"}],"比尔森啤酒":[{"npc":"lukas","t":"搬家前最后一个周末","en":"Before moving to Munich, my friends took me to our Czech pub in Berlin. The waiter kept bringing Pilsner until I put a coaster on my glass.","zh":"搬去慕尼黑前，朋友们带我去常去的那家捷克酒馆。服务员一直上比尔森，直到我把杯垫盖在杯子上。"}],"鱼子酱":[{"npc":"camille","t":"时装周的一场派对","en":"At a launch party during fashion week they served caviar on blini. I had one — I prefer the flea market with my daughter on Sunday.","zh":"时装周的一场发布派对上了鱼子酱配小薄饼。我吃了一个——还是更喜欢周日带女儿逛旧货市场。"}],"挪威三文鱼":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"一个下雨的早上","en":"In Bergen I buy salmon at the fish market by the harbour. In my notebook, Bergen smells of rain and smoked fish.","zh":"在卑尔根，我去港口边的鱼市买三文鱼。我的笔记本里写着：卑尔根是雨和烟熏鱼的味道。"}],"藏红花":[{"npc":"pilar","t":"周日中午","en":"On Sundays I make paella for my exchange student. The saffron is in a tiny box in the cupboard — I count every thread.","zh":"周日给交换生做海鲜饭。藏红花装在柜子里一个小盒子里——每一根我都数着用。"}],"伊斯特拉松露":[{"npc":"maja","t":"去年秋天的假期","en":"Erik and I spent a week in Istria last autumn. We had pasta with truffle in a hill town, and I wrote down how much it cost.","zh":"去年秋天和 Erik 在伊斯特拉待了一周。在一个山城吃了松露面，我把价钱记下来了。"}],"阿拉伯椰枣":[{"npc":"amara","t":"斋月的傍晚","en":"When I'm in Dubai during Ramadan, my flatmate leaves a bowl of dates by the door. At sunset I eat one before I even take off my uniform.","zh":"斋月在迪拜的时候，室友会在门口放一碗椰枣。太阳一落山，我连制服都没脱就先吃一颗。"}],"摩洛哥塔吉锅":[{"npc":"sara","t":"晚上 8 点","en":"In Marrakech I just pointed at the busiest stall and sat down. The lid came off, steam everywhere — I ate the whole thing with bread and forgot to take a photo.","zh":"在马拉喀什，我就指了指人最多的那个摊子坐下。盖子一掀，满脸都是热气——我用面包把一锅都吃光了，忘了拍照。"}],"埃塞俄比亚咖啡":[{"npc":"josh_cafe","t":"周一早上","en":"Monday I taste the new beans before we open. This week's Ethiopian smells like jasmine — I keep handing little cups to the staff so they can describe it to customers.","zh":"周一开门前我先试新豆子。这周的埃塞俄比亚豆闻起来像茉莉花——我一直塞小杯给店员，让他们能跟客人说清楚。"}],"桑给巴尔香料":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"旅行第三天","en":"On the spice farm the guide cracked open a nutmeg and the red web inside surprised me. I bought cloves for my Christmas baking back in Bergen.","zh":"在香料农场，导游剥开一颗肉豆蔻，里面那层红色的网让我吃了一惊。我买了丁香，带回卑尔根圣诞节烤饼干用。"}],"加纳可可":[{"npc":"kwame","t":"周末回家","en":"My uncle has a small cocoa farm outside Kumasi. When I visit, I help him dry the beans on the mats — then I go back to Accra and make beats all night.","zh":"我舅舅在库马西外面有一小块可可园。回去的时候我帮他把豆子摊在席子上晒——然后回阿克拉做一整晚的音乐。"},{"npc":"kofi","t":"周六下午","en":"My mum still sends Ghanaian chocolate in every parcel from Accra. I keep it in the shop drawer and give a piece to the kids after their haircut.","zh":"我妈从阿克拉寄包裹，每次都塞加纳巧克力。我放在店里抽屉，小孩剪完头发就给一块。"}],"英吉拉":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"周五晚上","en":"On Fridays my team goes to an Ethiopian place in Kilimani. We share one big injera tray, and nobody touches their phone because both hands are busy.","zh":"周五我们组会去基利马尼一家埃塞俄比亚馆子。大家分一大盘英吉拉，谁都不看手机——手都忙着呢。"}],"肯尼亚红茶":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"上午 10 点","en":"At ten the lady next door brings chai in a flask, and we drink it between M-Pesa customers. If she's late, the whole street notices.","zh":"十点钟隔壁大姐会提一壶奶茶来，我们在两个 M-Pesa 客人之间喝一口。她要是晚了，整条街都知道。"}],"路易波士茶":[{"npc":"nomvula","t":"夜班中间","en":"On night shifts I drink rooibos, not coffee, so I can still sleep in the morning. Sometimes a family sits with me in the kitchen and we share the pot.","zh":"上夜班我喝路易波士，不喝咖啡，这样早上还能睡着。有时病人的家属会跟我坐在小厨房，一起喝一壶。"}],"德班兔子咖喱":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"出差那天中午","en":"Every time I have a case in Durban, my colleague drags me to the same takeaway for a quarter bunny. I always forget how hot it is — and always order it again.","zh":"每次去德班办案，同事都拉我去同一家外卖店吃四分之一的兔子咖喱。我每次都忘了它有多辣——下次还是点它。"}],"阿拉伯咖啡":[{"npc":"noor","t":"周五家里聚会","en":"At my grandmother's on Fridays, my uncle pours the coffee and I'm the one who passes the cups. I've learned to shake mine after two — otherwise he never stops.","zh":"周五在奶奶家，舅舅倒咖啡，我负责递杯子。我学会了喝两杯就晃杯子——不然他一直倒。"}],"曼萨夫":[{"npc":"omar_de","t":"回安曼过节","en":"In Munich I can't find proper jameed, so when I fly home for Eid, the first thing my mum makes is mansaf. My little nephews race to stand next to me at the tray.","zh":"在慕尼黑买不到正宗的干酸奶，所以开斋节飞回家，我妈做的第一顿就是曼萨夫。小外甥们抢着站在我旁边围着大盘子。"}],"卢旺达咖啡":[{"npc":"mia","t":"周六早班","en":"Josh put a Rwandan coffee on filter this month. A customer asked me if it was tea — it's that fruity. Now I tell everyone to try it black first.","zh":"Josh 这个月把卢旺达豆放进了手冲单。有个客人问我这是不是茶——就是那么果香。现在我都劝大家先喝不加奶的。"}],"缅因龙虾":[{"npc":"jess","t":"八月的一个周六","en":"We drove up to Maine for a long weekend and ate a lobster roll every single day. The shack by the harbor had paper plates, picnic tables and seagulls watching our fries.","zh":"我们开车去缅因过了个长周末，天天吃一个龙虾卷。港口边那家小店用纸盘子、野餐桌，海鸥一直盯着我们的薯条。"}],"芝加哥深盘披萨":[{"npc":"min_ny","t":"出差那天晚上","en":"My first business trip to Chicago, and Tony said I had to try deep dish. We waited 45 minutes for it. I ate one slice with a knife and fork and could not move.","zh":"第一次去芝加哥出差，Tony 说一定要吃深盘披萨。等了 45 分钟才上来。我用刀叉吃了一块，就再也动不了了。"}],"汉堡":[{"npc":"jay_comedy","t":"演出完，半夜一点","en":"After my set I always end up at the same diner on Bleecker. Cheeseburger, fries, and I rewrite the jokes that died on the back of the receipt.","zh":"演出完我总是去布利克街那家小馆。芝士汉堡、薯条，然后在小票背面改今晚没人笑的段子。"}],"德州烤肉":[{"npc":"sarah","t":"周六早上 9:30","en":"Every few months I take a young founder to wait in a barbecue line. Two hours in the sun, a cooler of drinks — you'd be surprised how honest people get before the brisket comes.","zh":"我每隔几个月就带一个年轻创业者去排烤肉的队。太阳底下两个小时、一箱冷饮——在牛胸肉上桌之前，人会变得特别坦白。"}],"玉米的故乡":[{"npc":"rosa","t":"早上五点","en":"My day starts with the masa. Five kilos of dough, pressed one by one — by seven the first customers come for tacos on their way to work.","zh":"我一天从玉米面团开始。五公斤面团，一个一个压成饼——七点就有人上班路上来买塔可了。"}],"龙舌兰酒":[{"npc":"valeria","t":"周日下午","en":"A client from Madrid wanted to see where tequila comes from, so we went to Tequila town. The fields really are blue. I came home with a bottle and agave-shaped earring ideas.","zh":"一个马德里的顾客想看龙舌兰酒的老家，我们就去了特基拉镇。那些田真的是蓝色的。我带回来一瓶酒，还有龙舌兰形状耳环的点子。"}],"牛油果":[{"npc":"diego","t":"晚上九点送单","en":"Half my delivery orders tonight had extra guac. My mom says restaurant guacamole is too smooth — hers is chunky, with a lot of lime.","zh":"今晚一半的外卖单都加了牛油果酱。我妈说餐馆的太细了——她做的是一块一块的，放很多青柠。"}],"哥伦比亚咖啡":[{"npc":"marco_ny","t":"早班","en":"Our house espresso is Colombian, from Huila. When a customer asks why it tastes like caramel, I get way too excited and start talking about mountains.","zh":"我们店的意式浓缩用的是哥伦比亚慧兰的豆子。客人一问为什么有焦糖味，我就太兴奋，开始讲山。"}],"巴西咖啡":[{"npc":"bia","t":"下午三点","en":"In my old marketing job, cafezinho was a meeting. Now I'm a developer and it's still a meeting — we stand by the thermos, argue about bugs, and go back to our desks.","zh":"我以前做市场营销时，小咖啡就是开会。现在当了程序员还是开会——大家站在保温壶旁边吵 bug，吵完回座位。"}],"巴西烤肉":[{"npc":"ana","t":"周日中午","en":"In Berlin I found a Brazilian butcher who cuts picanha properly. Sunday I grilled it on the balcony with just coarse salt, and for an hour I was back at my uncle's in São Paulo.","zh":"我在柏林找到一家巴西肉铺，picanha 切得很地道。周日在阳台上只撒粗盐烤，那一个小时我好像回到了圣保罗舅舅家。"}],"马黛茶":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"截稿前一小时","en":"In our newsroom the mate goes round the culture desk like a deadline. Whoever is writing the slowest has to refill the thermos.","zh":"我们报社的文化版，马黛茶跟截稿时间一样一圈圈传。谁写得最慢，谁去续热水。"}],"阿根廷烤肉":[{"npc":"marcela","t":"周日中午","en":"Our Sunday asado is smaller than it used to be — more chorizo, less steak. But my husband still stands at the grill for three hours, and the kids still clap for him.","zh":"我们家周日的烤肉比以前小了——香肠多，牛排少。可我丈夫还是在炉子边站三个小时，孩子们还是给他鼓掌。"}],"智利红酒":[{"npc":"jess","t":"周五晚上","en":"I'm hosting dinner and my budget is fifteen dollars a bottle. The guy at the wine shop handed me a Chilean Carménère and said, 'Trust me.' He was right.","zh":"我请朋友吃晚饭，每瓶预算十五美元。酒铺的人递给我一瓶智利佳美娜，说「相信我」。他说对了。"}],"门多萨红酒":[{"npc":"tony","t":"跟客户吃晚饭","en":"Steak dinner with a client, and I always order the Mendoza Malbec. It's a safe choice that still sounds like you know what you're doing.","zh":"跟客户吃牛排，我总是点门多萨的马尔贝克。不会出错，听起来还像很懂行。"}],"厄瓜多尔香蕉":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"午休","en":"Lunch break routine: one banana from the stand outside the branch. The man there knows I like them still a little green.","zh":"午休老规矩：在银行门口的水果摊买一根香蕉。摊主知道我喜欢稍微带点绿的。"}],"藜麦":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"拍视频那天","en":"I filmed 'what I eat in a day' and three people commented that quinoa is boring. Okay, but it's cheap, it keeps for days, and I'm a student.","zh":"我拍了「我一天吃什么」，三个人留言说藜麦好无聊。好吧，可它便宜、能放好几天，而且我是学生。"}],"安提瓜咖啡":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"周六上午","en":"My Saturday café in Toronto had a Guatemalan Antigua on pour-over. I don't know much about coffee, but the bag had three volcanoes on it, so I bought it.","zh":"我周六常去的多伦多咖啡店在做危地马拉安提瓜手冲。我不太懂咖啡，可袋子上画着三座火山，我就买了。"}],"纳帕谷葡萄酒":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"周六","en":"Friends visited, so we did Napa. I was the designated driver — I tasted, I spat, and I watched everyone else get very poetic about tannins.","zh":"朋友来玩，我们去了纳帕。我是负责开车的——尝一口、吐掉，看着别人对着单宁越说越像诗人。"}],"爱达荷土豆":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"开车路过","en":"Drove a buddy's truck up to Boise once. Every second plate said 'Famous Potatoes', so at the diner I ordered the biggest baked potato they had. Fair enough — it was famous.","zh":"有一次帮朋友把卡车开到博伊西。路上每隔一辆车牌就写着「著名的土豆」，所以到了小餐馆我点了最大的烤土豆。没毛病——确实著名。"}],"威斯康星奶酪":[{"npc":"jake","t":"比赛日停车场","en":"Tailgate menu, same every year: brats on the grill, a bag of fresh curds from the dairy on Highway 41, and Dad's old cheesehead on my head.","zh":"停车场烧烤，年年一样：烤德式香肠，一袋 41 号公路边奶场的新鲜奶酪豆，头上戴着我爸那顶旧奶酪帽。"}],"肯德基":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"十二月中","en":"Growing up in Ohio, KFC was road-trip food. In Osaka my wife pre-orders a Christmas bucket in November, and my daughter thinks Santa and the Colonel are friends.","zh":"我在俄亥俄长大，肯德基是长途开车时吃的。在大阪，我太太十一月就预订圣诞节的全家桶，女儿以为圣诞老人和上校是好朋友。"}],"佛罗里达橙子":[{"npc":"maria_sw","t":"收到快递那天","en":"My parents retired to Orlando, and every winter they mail me a box of oranges. This year the box was smaller, and my dad wrote on it: 'Greening. Sorry.'","zh":"我爸妈退休搬去了奥兰多，每年冬天给我寄一箱橙子。今年的箱子小了一号，我爸在上面写：「黄龙病。抱歉。」"}],"切萨皮克蓝蟹":[{"npc":"marcus_bank","t":"七月的周六","en":"My first crab feast was at a client's place outside Annapolis. Twenty minutes of hammering for a spoonful of meat — and I've never had more fun at a work event.","zh":"我第一次吃螃蟹聚会，是在安纳波利斯郊外一个客户家里。敲二十分钟才吃到一勺肉——可这是我参加过最开心的工作活动。"}],"长颈鹿":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"星期天下午","en":"On Sundays I sometimes take my son to the Giraffe Centre in Lang'ata. He holds out a pellet and screams every time that long purple tongue comes down.","zh":"星期天我有时带儿子去朗加塔的长颈鹿中心。他举着一颗饲料，每次那条紫色的长舌头伸下来，他都要尖叫一声。"}],"角马大迁徙":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"八月的一个上午","en":"We waited by the Mara River for three hours in the heat. Then one wildebeest jumped, and suddenly thousands followed. I forgot to film it — I was just shouting.","zh":"我们在马拉河边顶着太阳等了三个小时。然后一只角马跳下去，突然几千只都跟着跳。我忘了拍——光顾着喊了。"}],"山地大猩猩":[{"npc":"amara","t":"飞基加利的那次休息","en":"I had a three-day layover in Kigali, so I finally spent the money on a gorilla permit. After two hours climbing in the mud, a silverback walked past close enough to touch. I didn't breathe for the whole hour.","zh":"在基加利有三天休息，我终于狠心买了大猩猩许可证。在泥里爬了两个小时，一只银背从我身边走过，近得伸手就能碰到。那一个小时我都不敢喘气。"}],"奥卡万戈大象":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"复活节长周末","en":"Our poler stopped the mokoro and just whispered, 'wait.' An elephant crossed the channel ten metres in front of us. I've never been so quiet in my life — and I'm a lawyer.","zh":"撑船的人把独木舟停下，只小声说了一句「等一下」。一头大象在我们前面十米过了水道。我这辈子没这么安静过——我可是律师。"}],"克鲁格犀牛":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"学校放假的时候","en":"We drive up from Joburg every school holiday. My niece keeps a list of the Big Five on her phone. Rhino is still missing — this year she's sure.","zh":"每次学校放假，我们都从约堡开车上去。我外甥女在手机上记着「五大兽」清单，犀牛那一格还空着——她说今年一定能看到。"}],"好望角企鹅":[{"npc":"nomvula","t":"休息日的早上","en":"On my day off I drive to Boulders before the tour buses arrive. The penguins bray like donkeys — after a week of night shifts, it's the best sound in the world.","zh":"休息的那天我趁旅游大巴还没到，开车去博尔德斯。企鹅叫起来像驴——上完一周夜班，那是世界上最好听的声音。"}],"狐猴":[{"npc":"helene","t":"七月假期的清晨","en":"Our guide in Andasibe woke us at six. Then the indri started — a sound like a whale song in the trees. I've been trying to describe it to my customers at the pharmacy all week.","zh":"安达西贝的向导六点就把我们叫醒。然后大狐猴开始叫——树上传来的声音像鲸鱼唱歌。这一周我在药房一直想跟客人形容那个声音。"}],"狮尾狒":[{"npc":"amara","t":"飞完亚的斯亚贝巴之后的休假","en":"I had four days off after an Addis flight, so I took the bus north to the Simien. Two hundred geladas were just sitting there pulling grass, completely ignoring me. Very relaxing crew.","zh":"飞完亚的斯亚贝巴有四天假，我就坐大巴往北去了塞米恩山。两百只狮尾狒坐在那儿拔草，完全不理我。很松弛的一群「同事」。"}],"纳库鲁湖火烈鸟":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"周末带孩子出门","en":"When I was in primary school, the whole lake was pink. I took my son last month and told him the same story — he counted maybe a few hundred. He thinks I'm exaggerating.","zh":"我上小学的时候，整个湖都是粉色的。上个月带儿子去，跟他讲了同样的话——他数了大概几百只，觉得我在吹牛。"}],"安博塞利大象":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"长周末的清晨","en":"Kilimanjaro hides in the clouds most of the day. We got up at five for twenty clear minutes — elephants walking in front of the snow. My phone lock screen hasn't changed since.","zh":"乞力马扎罗一天大部分时间都躲在云里。我们五点起床，换来了二十分钟的晴天——大象从雪山前面走过。之后我的手机锁屏就再没换过。"}],"内罗毕斑马":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"上班路上","en":"On the Expressway in the morning you can look down and see zebras grazing, with our office towers in the background. Then I sit down and look at loan spreadsheets all day.","zh":"早上走高架快速路，往下一看就是在吃草的斑马，背后是我们公司那几栋楼。然后我坐下来，盯一整天贷款表格。"}],"贡贝黑猩猩":[{"npc":"sam","t":"上动物行为课的时候","en":"Our animal behaviour lecturer played the old Gombe footage of a chimp fishing for termites. Nobody in the room touched their laptop for ten minutes. That never happens.","zh":"我们动物行为课的老师放了贡贝的老录像：一只黑猩猩在钓白蚁。整个教室十分钟没人碰电脑。这可从来没发生过。"}],"奥茨胡恩鸵鸟":[{"npc":"nomvula","t":"沿 62 号公路自驾的那个周末","en":"We drove Route 62 to Oudtshoorn. At the farm an ostrich grabbed the pellets from my hand so hard it felt like a pinch. My sister laughed so much she couldn't hold the camera.","zh":"我们沿 62 号公路开到奥茨胡恩。在农场里，一只鸵鸟从我手里抢饲料，啄得跟掐了一下似的。我妹妹笑得连相机都拿不稳。"}],"变色龙":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"周四门诊","en":"We had a panther chameleon in the clinic today — a lovely bright green one. The owner said it went dark brown in the car on the way. Stress, poor thing. It was green again by the time we finished.","zh":"今天诊所来了一只七彩变色龙，亮绿色的，特别漂亮。主人说在来的车上它变成了深褐色——是紧张，小可怜。等我们看完，它又变回绿色了。"}],"圣玛丽岛座头鲸":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"八月的一个上午","en":"In Norway I've seen whales in the cold fjords. In Sainte-Marie a mother and calf surfaced beside our little boat in warm water — and I cried a bit. At my age you're allowed.","zh":"在挪威我在冰冷的峡湾里看过鲸鱼。在圣玛丽岛，一对鲸妈妈和小鲸在暖暖的海里从我们小船旁边浮上来——我哭了一下。到我这个年纪，可以哭。"}],"马岛獴":[{"npc":"helene","t":"在基林迪的第二天","en":"A fossa walked right through our camp at lunch, looking for scraps. Everyone froze with their forks in the air. The guide just said, 'Ah, he comes every day.'","zh":"午饭的时候，一只马岛獴直接从我们营地穿过去找剩饭。大家举着叉子都不敢动。向导只说了一句：「哦，它天天来。」"}],"莫莱大象":[{"npc":"kwame","t":"放假回北边的时候","en":"The bus from Accra to Mole takes forever. But you sit at the lodge pool and three elephants are bathing in the waterhole right below. I recorded their splashing for a beat.","zh":"从阿克拉坐大巴去莫莱要坐好久。可是你坐在旅馆泳池边，下面水塘里就有三头大象在洗澡。我把它们泼水的声音录下来做了个节拍。"}],"埃托沙盐沼":[{"npc":"tomo","t":"休年假的那两周","en":"After a year of night shifts I sat at the floodlit waterhole in Okaukuejo till midnight. Two black rhinos came to drink. Total silence, twenty strangers — better than any sleep app.","zh":"上了一年夜班，我在奥考奎约营地亮着灯的水塘边坐到半夜。两头黑犀牛来喝水。二十个陌生人一点声音都没有——比什么助眠 App 都管用。"}],"赛骆驼":[{"npc":"amara","t":"冬天一个休息日的早上","en":"My flatmate took me to the camel races at seven in the morning. The robots on their backs look like little drills with whips. The owners in the cars were louder than any passengers I've had.","zh":"室友早上七点带我去看赛骆驼。骆驼背上的机器人像装了鞭子的小电钻。车里那些主人喊得比我遇到过的任何乘客都大声。"}],"阿拉伯马":[{"npc":"noor","t":"周五去亲戚家","en":"My uncle keeps two Arabian mares on his farm outside Amman. On Fridays the kids feed them dates, and they follow you around the yard like big, elegant dogs.","zh":"我叔叔在安曼郊外的农场养了两匹阿拉伯母马。每到周五，孩子们拿椰枣喂它们，它们就在院子里跟着你走，像两只又大又优雅的狗。"}],"阿拉伯羚羊":[{"npc":"omar_de","t":"回安曼探亲的时候","en":"When I go home to Amman, I took my nephews to Shaumari. They thought the oryx were horses with antennas. In Munich nobody believes me that we have these.","zh":"回安曼探亲时，我带侄子们去了沙乌马里。他们以为那些羚羊是长了天线的马。在慕尼黑说我们那儿有这种动物，没人信。"}],"卡塔尔大羚羊":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"早班值机","en":"From my check-in counter I can see the Doha flight parked outside, with that oryx on the tail. A passenger once asked me if it was a goat. I said, 'Please don't say that on board.'","zh":"从我值机柜台能看到停在外面飞多哈的那架飞机，尾巴上就是那只羚羊。有个乘客问我那是不是山羊。我说：「上了飞机可千万别这么说。」"}],"尼罗鳄":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"尼罗河游船的第三天","en":"On our Nile cruise we stopped at Kom Ombo. My students will laugh, but the crocodile mummies made me think about Plato's cave for an hour. Gods made of real animals — very strange.","zh":"坐尼罗河游船那次，我们在康翁布停了一站。我的学生肯定会笑我，但那些鳄鱼木乃伊让我想了一个小时柏拉图的洞穴。用真动物做的神——很奇怪。"}],"树上的山羊":[{"npc":"pablo","t":"复活节自驾","en":"Driving to Essaouira we stopped at a tree full of goats. A herder came over at once and asked for a few dirhams for photos. Fair enough — those goats work harder than my students.","zh":"开车去索维拉的路上，我们在一棵站满山羊的树前停下。马上有个放羊人走过来，拍照要几个迪拉姆。也合理——这些羊比我的学生还勤快。"}],"卢安瓜河马":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"休假的第一晚","en":"First night in Luangwa I thought someone was snoring in the next tent. It was a hippo, eating grass two metres from my head. Seven years as a vet nurse and I didn't sleep at all.","zh":"到卢安瓜第一晚，我以为隔壁帐篷有人打呼。结果是一头河马，在离我脑袋两米的地方吃草。做了七年兽医护士，那一晚我完全没睡着。"}],"沙漠大象":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"地理课上","en":"I show my students the map of the Gourma elephants' loop and ask them to guess why it's a circle. Someone always says 'they're lost'. Then we talk about water.","zh":"我给学生看古尔马大象绕圈的地图，让他们猜为什么是一个圈。总有人说「它们迷路了」。然后我们就开始讲水。"}],"朱贾鹈鹕":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"一月的一个早上","en":"Some of the birds I watch in Norway in summer spend their winter in Djoudj. So I flew south to visit them. The pelicans fished in a line, like a team — very Norwegian, actually.","zh":"我夏天在挪威看的一些鸟，冬天就在朱贾过。所以我飞到南边去看它们。鹈鹕排成一排一起捕鱼，像一个团队——其实挺挪威的。"}],"克罗斯河大猩猩":[{"npc":"tunde","t":"去卡拉巴尔参加婚礼的那周","en":"I went to a wedding in Calabar and stayed two extra days for the forest. The ranger told us honestly: 'You'll see nests, not gorillas.' We saw nests. Still worth the mosquitoes.","zh":"我去卡拉巴尔参加婚礼，多留了两天去森林。护林员很老实地跟我们说：「你们会看到窝，看不到大猩猩。」我们真的只看到了窝。被蚊子咬也值。"}],"杜兹骆驼":[{"npc":"gerard","t":"十二月底","en":"My first winter of retirement I took the train-and-ferry way to Tunisia, then a bus to Douz for the Sahara festival. Forty years fixing trains, and the camels were faster than most of them.","zh":"退休后的第一个冬天，我坐火车再转渡轮去了突尼斯，又坐大巴到杜兹看撒哈拉节。修了四十年火车，那些骆驼跑得比大多数火车都快。"}],"万基大象":[{"npc":"precious","t":"小时候的暑假","en":"When I was little, my uncle drove us to Hwange every August. We sat on the platform by the waterhole, and the elephants came one family at a time. On night shifts in London I still think of that quiet.","zh":"我小时候，每年八月叔叔都开车带我们去万基。我们坐在水塘边的看台上，大象一家一家地来。在伦敦上夜班的时候，我还会想起那份安静。"}],"爬树狮":[{"npc":"tomo","t":"去乌干达开会顺路","en":"After a medical conference in Kampala I drove to Ishasha. A lioness was asleep on a fig branch with one paw hanging down, exactly like my brother on the sofa after Sunday lunch.","zh":"在坎帕拉开完医学会议，我开车去了伊沙沙。一头母狮在无花果树枝上睡觉，一只爪子垂下来——跟我哥周日午饭后躺沙发的样子一模一样。"}],"非洲豹":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"休假的第四天","en":"Our guide stopped under a sausage tree and just pointed up. A leopard, a tail, and half a gazelle in the branches. I'd planned this trip in a spreadsheet — the leopard was not in it.","zh":"向导在一棵吊灯树下停车，只往上指了指。一只豹子、一条尾巴，树枝上还挂着半只瞪羚。这趟旅行我是用表格做的计划——豹子不在表里。"}],"猎豹":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"为报社写旅行稿那次","en":"I went to the Mara to write a travel piece. A cheetah jumped onto the car in front of us and sat there for ten minutes like a hood ornament. My editor said it sounded made up. I have photos.","zh":"我去马赛马拉写旅行稿。一只猎豹跳上我们前面那辆车，在车顶坐了十分钟，像个车标。编辑说听起来像编的。我有照片。"}],"非洲水牛":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"暑假回美国之前","en":"We drove down into the Ngorongoro Crater at dawn. A wall of buffalo just stared at our car — two hundred faces, no expression. Worse than my class on a Monday morning.","zh":"天刚亮我们开车下到恩戈罗恩戈罗火山口。一整排水牛就那么盯着我们的车——两百张脸，没有表情。比我周一早上的班还可怕。"}],"黑犀牛":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"去纳纽基的周末","en":"We spent a weekend near Nanyuki and did a drive in Ol Pejeta. A black rhino stood in the bushes, ears turning like radar. The ranger told us its name like it was his cousin.","zh":"我们在纳纽基附近过了个周末，去奥佩杰塔开车看动物。一头黑犀牛站在灌木里，耳朵像雷达一样转。护林员说出它的名字时，像在介绍自己的表弟。"}],"马拉河河马":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"写完猎豹那篇稿子的第二天","en":"At the hippo pool by the Mara River, the ranger kept saying, 'Not closer.' They yawned at us like we were boring. And the smell — nobody puts the smell in a travel piece.","zh":"在马拉河边的河马池，护林员一直说「别再往前了」。河马冲我们打哈欠，好像嫌我们无聊。还有那个味道——没有哪篇旅行稿会写那个味道。"}],"火烈鸟湖":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"看完塞伦盖蒂回去的路上","en":"The road to Natron shook the car so badly my laptop bag opened. Then the lake: red water, pink birds, a volcano. I didn't open the laptop for the rest of the week.","zh":"去纳特龙湖的路颠得我电脑包都开了。然后就看到了湖：红色的水、粉色的鸟、一座火山。那一周剩下的时间，我都没打开电脑。"}],"大沼泽鳄鱼":[{"npc":"marcus_bank","t":"去迈阿密的长周末","en":"Long weekend in Miami, and my friends dragged me onto an airboat. The guide cut the engine, pointed at the grass and said 'don't put your hand out.' I kept both hands on my phone after that.","zh":"去迈阿密过长周末，朋友硬拉我坐气垫船。向导把发动机一关，指着草丛说「别把手伸出去」。后来我两只手一直抓着手机。"}],"美洲野牛":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"小时候的暑假","en":"When I was nine my dad drove us from Ohio to Yellowstone. A bison stopped right in front of our car for twenty minutes. Dad just turned the engine off and said, 'Well, he lives here, we don't.'","zh":"我九岁那年，爸爸从俄亥俄开车带我们去黄石。一头野牛停在我们车前面二十分钟不走。爸爸把火一熄，说：「人家住这儿，我们不住。」"}],"阿拉斯加棕熊":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"七月","en":"I came up the Inside Passage by ferry and then a floatplane to Brooks Camp. A ranger made us wait twenty minutes on the path because a bear was napping on it. Best twenty minutes of my trip.","zh":"我坐渡轮走内湾航道上来，再坐水上飞机到布鲁克斯营地。护林员让我们在小路上等了二十分钟，因为有头熊在路上睡午觉。那是我这趟最好的二十分钟。"}],"北极熊":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"十一月","en":"Took my first Canadian winter seriously: flew to Winnipeg, then up to Churchill. A bear walked right under the tundra buggy and sniffed the tyres. My brother back in Bangalore didn't believe the video was real.","zh":"我决定认真过第一个加拿大冬天：飞到温尼伯，再往北到丘吉尔。一头北极熊就从冻原车底下走过，还闻了闻轮胎。班加罗尔的弟弟不相信视频是真的。"}],"驼鹿":[{"npc":"jake","t":"九月钓鱼","en":"Every September Dad and I drive up past Lake Superior into Ontario to fish. This year a cow moose and her calf walked out into the lake twenty metres from our boat. Dad didn't even reach for the rod.","zh":"每年九月我和爸爸都开车绕过苏必利尔湖去安大略钓鱼。今年一头母驼鹿带着小鹿走进湖里，离我们的船二十米。爸爸连鱼竿都没去拿。"}],"帝王蝶":[{"npc":"valeria","t":"二月的周末","en":"Left Mexico City at 5 a.m. for El Rosario. The guide told us to whisper, which felt silly until the sun hit the trees and they all took off at once. I've made earrings in that orange ever since.","zh":"早上五点从墨西哥城出发去埃尔罗萨里奥。向导叫我们小声说话，我还觉得好笑，直到太阳照到树上，蝴蝶一下全飞起来。从那以后我做了好多那种橙色的耳环。"}],"树懒":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"春假","en":"Spent forty minutes staring at one tree in Manuel Antonio. The sloth moved one arm. ONE arm. Got 80k views. My friends who went to the beach got zero.","zh":"在曼努埃尔安东尼奥盯着一棵树看了四十分钟。树懒动了一下胳膊，就一下。视频有八万播放。去海滩的朋友一个播放都没有。"}],"加拉帕戈斯象龟":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"去年圣诞假期","en":"Flew home to Brazil for Christmas and added a week in the Galápagos. On a farm in Santa Cruz a tortoise walked across the path and hissed at me for blocking it. Fair enough.","zh":"圣诞节回巴西，顺便在加拉帕戈斯待了一周。在圣克鲁斯岛的农场，一只象龟从小路上爬过去，嫌我挡路冲我嘶了一声。说得也对。"}],"亚马逊粉海豚":[{"npc":"ana","t":"搬去柏林前","en":"Before I moved to Berlin I finally saw the Amazon from inside my own country. A pink dolphin came up right next to the boat and breathed out — it sounded like someone sighing. My Berlin flatmates think I made it up.","zh":"搬去柏林之前，我终于在自己的国家看了一次亚马逊。一头粉海豚就在船边冒出来呼了口气，像有人在叹气。柏林的室友以为我编的。"}],"潘塔纳尔美洲豹":[{"npc":"bia","t":"七月的旱季","en":"Took a week off from coding and flew to Cuiabá with two friends. On the third morning a jaguar was just lying on the riverbank like a house cat. I forgot I had a camera.","zh":"请了一周假不写代码，和两个朋友飞到库亚巴。第三天早上，一只美洲豹像家猫一样躺在河岸上。我都忘了自己有相机。"}],"巴塔哥尼亚企鹅":[{"npc":"freya","t":"二月徒步","en":"Before the Torres del Paine trek we took the boat out of Punta Arenas to Isla Magdalena. A penguin was standing in the middle of the path and twenty adults just waited politely behind it. Very Danish, actually.","zh":"去百内国家公园徒步之前，我们从蓬塔阿雷纳斯坐船去了马格达莱纳岛。一只企鹅站在小路中间，二十个大人在后面客客气气地等。其实挺像丹麦人的。"}],"南极帝企鹅":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"一月","en":"I sailed from Ushuaia to the Peninsula, across the Drake Passage — two days of being seasick. We saw thousands of gentoos, but no emperors. The expedition leader said they live much farther south, and I wrote that down in my notebook too.","zh":"我从乌斯怀亚出发穿过德雷克海峡去南极半岛，晕了两天船。看到了几千只巴布亚企鹅，一只帝企鹅都没有。领队说它们住得更南，这句我也记进本子里了。"}],"伊基托斯雨林":[{"npc":"tom","t":"二十年前的间隔年","en":"On my gap year I took a cargo boat down to Iquitos — three days in a hammock, eating rice and plantains. When we arrived I asked where the bus station was. Everyone laughed.","zh":"间隔年那年，我坐货船顺河到伊基托斯，在吊床上躺了三天，天天吃米饭和大蕉。到了以后我问汽车站在哪，所有人都笑了。"}],"蓝脚鲣鸟":[{"npc":"amara","t":"两班飞之间","en":"Had four days off after a Guayaquil flight, so I hopped over to the Galápagos. On North Seymour a booby was doing its blue-foot dance on the trail and wouldn't let us pass. Best delay I've ever had.","zh":"飞完瓜亚基尔有四天假，我就跳去了加拉帕戈斯。北西摩岛上一只鲣鸟在步道上跳蓝脚舞，不让我们过。这是我遇过最好的延误。"}],"海鬣蜥":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"去年圣诞假期","en":"Snorkelling off Isabela, I looked down and an iguana was chewing seaweed on a rock like a tiny black cow. Then it swam past my mask. I screamed into my snorkel.","zh":"在伊莎贝拉岛浮潜，往下一看，一只鬣蜥像一头小黑牛一样在石头上啃海藻。然后它从我面罩前游过去。我对着呼吸管尖叫了。"}],"红湖":[{"npc":"ines","t":"暑假","en":"At 4,300 m I had the worst headache of my life. Our driver handed me coca tea, and as a pharmacy student I had questions, but I drank it. Then the flamingos lifted off the red water and I forgot about my head.","zh":"在海拔四千三百米，我头疼得这辈子最厉害。司机递给我一杯古柯茶，作为药学学生我有很多疑问，但还是喝了。然后火烈鸟从红色的湖面上飞起来，我就忘了头疼。"}],"奥里诺科鳄":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"地理课上","en":"I teach the Orinoco to my Year 10s every spring. This year I showed a photo of the crocodile and asked them to guess how many are left. They guessed a million. The real answer made the room go quiet.","zh":"每年春天我都给十年级讲奥里诺科河。今年我放了一张这种鳄鱼的照片，让他们猜还剩多少只。他们猜一百万。我说出答案后，教室一下安静了。"}],"汤加座头鲸":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"休年假","en":"Took my leave in August and went to Vava'u. Floating in the water, I could hear the male singing through my chest. Back on night shift the next week, the ER felt very loud.","zh":"八月休年假去了瓦瓦乌。漂在水里时，雄鲸的歌声是从胸口传进来的。下一周回去上夜班，急诊室显得特别吵。"}],"吸蜜蜂鸟":[{"npc":"carlos","t":"回瓦伦西亚之前","en":"My grandparents had cousins in Cuba, so I finally went. In a garden near Playa Larga an old man pointed at what I thought was a bee. It was the bird. He laughed at me for a full minute.","zh":"我爷爷奶奶在古巴有亲戚，我终于去了一趟。在大沙滩附近一个院子里，一位老爷爷指着我以为是蜜蜂的东西。那就是这只鸟。他笑了我整整一分钟。"}],"博士鸟":[{"npc":"tony","t":"冬天的假期","en":"Escaped a New York January to the Blue Mountains. At breakfast a doctor bird hovered at the feeder two feet from my coffee. Twenty years in advertising and I've never seen a better tail.","zh":"躲开纽约的一月去了蓝山。吃早饭时，一只博士鸟停在离我咖啡半米的喂食器边。做了二十年广告，我没见过比这更好看的尾巴。"}],"巴拿马金蛙":[{"npc":"sarah","t":"周六带孩子","en":"Took the kids to the Houston Zoo on Saturday. My youngest found the golden frogs and wouldn't leave. When I read the sign about none being left in the wild, she asked if we could take one home to Panama.","zh":"周六带孩子去了休斯敦动物园。小女儿找到了金蛙就不肯走。我念了牌子上说野外一只都没有了，她问我们能不能带一只回巴拿马。"}],"格查尔鸟":[{"npc":"alvaro","t":"做田野调查的时候","en":"Spent two weeks in Alta Verapaz for my thesis. On the last morning the guide stopped, pointed up, and there it was, tail hanging down like a green ribbon. I paid for my coffee with a quetzal note that afternoon and felt very smug.","zh":"为写论文在上韦拉帕斯待了两周。最后一天早上，向导停下来往上一指，它就在那儿，尾巴像一条绿丝带垂下来。那天下午我用一张格查尔纸币买咖啡，觉得自己特别得意。"}],"南露脊鲸":[{"npc":"marcela","t":"冬假","en":"We closed the shop for a week in September and drove to Puerto Pirámides — first family holiday in years. A mother whale stayed next to the boat so long my husband stopped taking photos and just held my hand.","zh":"九月关店一周，开车去了皮拉米德斯港，好几年来第一次全家出游。一头鲸鱼妈妈在船边待了好久，我丈夫不拍照了，就握着我的手。"}],"鸟类王国":[{"npc":"tom_walker","t":"十月的假期","en":"On Hampstead Heath I'm happy if I see a woodpecker. In Minca I saw forty species before breakfast, and my guide was disappointed it wasn't fifty. I've been very quiet about the woodpecker since.","zh":"在汉普斯特德荒野，看到一只啄木鸟我就很开心。在明卡，早饭前我就看到了四十种鸟，向导还嫌没到五十种。从那以后我再也不好意思提啄木鸟了。"}],"美洲鸵":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"带女儿过周末","en":"Took the ferry to Colonia with my daughter and then a bus inland. She shouted 'ostriches!' out of the window. I told her they're rheas, and she Googled it to prove me wrong. She couldn't.","zh":"带女儿坐渡轮到科洛尼亚，又坐车往内陆走。她冲着窗外喊「鸵鸟！」我说那是美洲鸵，她上网查想证明我错了，没成功。"}],"齿鸽":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"去年的假期","en":"On Savai'i our guide played a recording of the manumea and we sat in the forest for an hour. We heard plenty of pigeons, none of them the right one. He said his grandfather used to see them. I think about that a lot.","zh":"在萨瓦伊岛，向导放了一段齿鸽的叫声，我们在林子里坐了一个小时。听到好多鸽子叫，没有一只是它。他说他爷爷那时候常见到。我常常想起这句话。"}],"圣地亚哥动物园":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"休息日","en":"Drove my nephews down from LA on my day off. We queued forty minutes for the pandas and Xin Bao slept through the whole thing. The boys still say it was the best part.","zh":"休息日开车带两个外甥从洛杉矶南下。看熊猫排了四十分钟队，鑫宝从头睡到尾。两个小家伙到现在还说那是最好玩的部分。"}],"加拿大雁":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"午休","en":"Ate lunch by the lake at Toronto Island and a goose marched up and hissed at my samosa. I backed off. My dad, who has lived here thirty years, says you never win against the geese.","zh":"在多伦多岛湖边吃午饭，一只大雁走过来冲我的咖喱角嘶叫。我退开了。在这儿住了三十年的爸爸说，跟大雁斗你永远赢不了。"}],"拉布拉多":[{"npc":"tom_walker","t":"早上遛狗","en":"Biscuit the Labrador ate half a sandwich off a bench on the Heath this morning before I could blink. The owner said he'd already had breakfast. They always say that.","zh":"今天早上在荒野公园，拉布拉多 Biscuit 一眨眼就把长椅上半个三明治吃了。主人说它已经吃过早饭了。主人们总这么说。"}],"吉娃娃":[{"npc":"diego","t":"送外卖的晚上","en":"My little sister's Chihuahua, Frida, barks at my scooter every night like I'm a stranger. Then she sleeps on my helmet. Mom says she's protecting the family. From me, apparently.","zh":"我妹妹的吉娃娃 Frida 每天晚上都冲我的电动车叫，好像我是陌生人。然后它就睡在我的头盔上。妈妈说它在保护全家。看来是防着我。"}],"布偶猫":[{"npc":"yui_pet","t":"下班回家","en":"My two Ragdolls wait at the door every evening like dogs. When I pick up Mochi she just goes floppy and stares at the ceiling. Customers at the shop never believe me until I show them the video.","zh":"我家两只布偶猫每天晚上像狗一样在门口等我。我一抱起麻糬，它就全身软掉，盯着天花板。店里的客人都不信，直到我给他们看视频。"}],"美国短毛猫":[{"npc":"maria_sw","t":"周日早上","en":"After a long week at the hospital, Sunday is me, my coffee and Tigre on the windowsill. He doesn't need me to talk. Twenty years of social work and he's the best listener I know.","zh":"医院忙了一周，周日就是我、一杯咖啡和窗台上的 Tigre。它不需要我说话。做了二十年社工，它是我认识的最会听的。"}],"缅因猫":[{"npc":"jess","t":"周末在家","en":"My Maine Coon, Waffles, takes up half my bed in a New York apartment that's already too small. My landlord asked if I'd got a dog. I said no. He did not look convinced.","zh":"我的缅因猫 Waffles 占了我半张床，而纽约这间公寓本来就太小了。房东问我是不是养了狗。我说没有。他看起来不太信。"}],"加菲猫（异国短毛猫）":[{"npc":"zhou_vet","t":"门诊","en":"Today three flat-faced cats came in, all for teary eyes and one for snoring. Their owners say 'but he's so cute.' He is. Wipe his eyes every day, and keep him cool in summer.","zh":"今天来了三只扁脸猫，都是眼睛流泪，还有一只打呼噜。主人都说「可是它好可爱」。是很可爱。每天给它擦眼睛，夏天别让它热着。"}],"无毛猫":[{"npc":"sam","t":"期末周","en":"My roommate's Sphynx, Dobby, sleeps under my blanket every night during exams because my room is warmer. Bath day is every Sunday. Neither of us enjoys it.","zh":"期末周，室友的无毛猫多比每天晚上都钻进我的被子，因为我房间更暖。每周日是洗澡日，我们俩都不喜欢。"}],"孟加拉豹猫":[{"npc":"andre","t":"下班后","en":"Got home from a midnight sneaker drop and my Bengal, Nike, had pushed every box off the shelf. Then he jumped in the shower with me. Sixty pairs of shoes, and he's the thing I have to keep safe from.","zh":"半夜卖完新款球鞋回家，我的孟加拉豹猫 Nike 把架子上的鞋盒全推下来了。然后它跳进淋浴间陪我洗澡。六十双球鞋，最要防的是它。"}],"东北虎":[{"npc":"bj_xiaoyu","t":"寒假","en":"Took the overnight train to Harbin for the ice festival and squeezed in the Siberian Tiger Park. The tigers just lay in the snow like it was nothing — I had three pairs of socks on.","zh":"寒假坐夜车去哈尔滨看冰雪节，顺路去了东北虎林园。老虎趴在雪地里跟没事一样，我穿了三双袜子还冻脚。"}],"神农架金丝猴":[{"npc":"cd_luo","t":"五一假期","en":"Everyone at the panda base told me to go see the golden monkeys, so I drove up to Shennongjia. In the morning fog the forest was full of them — blue faces, gold coats, babies hanging on everywhere.","zh":"熊猫基地的同事都让我去看金丝猴，五一开车上了神农架。早上起雾，林子里全是蓝脸金毛的猴子，小猴子挂得到处都是。"}],"亚洲象":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"毕业旅行","en":"Graduation trip to Xishuangbanna. We waited two hours on the walkway at Wild Elephant Valley, and right before closing a mum and her calf came out to the river.","zh":"毕业旅行去了西双版纳，在野象谷的空中走廊上等了两个小时，快关门的时候一头母象带着小象出来到河边。"}],"牦牛":[{"npc":"cd_laoluo","t":"国庆","en":"Drove out to Ganzi to buy yak meat for the restaurant. Ten minutes stuck on the road behind a herd — they don't care about your horn at all.","zh":"国庆开车去甘孜给店里进牦牛肉，路上被一群牦牛堵了十分钟，按喇叭它们根本不理你。"}],"藏羚羊":[{"npc":"xa_ajie","t":"暑假","en":"Took the Qinghai–Tibet train to Lhasa. Somewhere after Golmud the whole carriage rushed to one side — a few antelope were running beside the tracks.","zh":"暑假坐青藏铁路去拉萨，过了格尔木以后整节车厢的人都挤到一边窗户，几只藏羚羊在铁轨旁边跑。"}],"泰国大象":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"学期假","en":"Booked a half-day at a sanctuary outside Chiang Mai — no riding, just feeding and walking with them. The baby kept stealing bananas from my bag.","zh":"学期假去了清迈郊外的大象保护营，半天，不骑，只喂和一起散步。小象一直从我包里偷香蕉。"}],"科莫多巨蜥":[{"npc":"budi","t":"开斋节长假","en":"Took my family on a boat trip from Labuan Bajo to Rinca. The ranger made us stay five metres back — the dragon just lay there and flicked its tongue at us.","zh":"开斋节长假带家里人从纳闽巴霍坐船去林卡岛，护林员让我们站在五米外，巨蜥就趴着冲我们吐舌头。"}],"红毛猩猩":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"退休后的旅行","en":"Flew to Sandakan to see Sepilok. At the 10 o'clock feeding a young one came swinging down the rope, grabbed two bananas and went straight back up.","zh":"退休后去山打根看西必洛，十点喂食的时候一只小猩猩顺着绳子荡下来，抓了两根香蕉就回树上了。"}],"孟加拉虎":[{"npc":"priya","t":"圣诞假","en":"Two days on a boat in the Sundarbans out of Kolkata. No tiger — just fresh pug marks on the mud bank. Our guide said that's how most people see one.","zh":"圣诞假从加尔各答去孙德尔本斯坐了两天船，没看到老虎，只在泥滩上看到新鲜的脚印。导游说大部分人都是这样「看到」老虎的。"}],"珍岛犬":[{"npc":"jiwoo","t":"中秋回老家","en":"Back at my grandparents' for Chuseok. Their Jindo still remembers me after a year — won't let my cousins near the gate, but sits on my feet.","zh":"中秋回爷爷奶奶家，他们家的珍岛犬一年没见还认得我，不让表弟靠近大门，却一直趴在我脚上。"}],"普氏野马":[{"npc":"lena","t":"夏天休假","en":"Took a week off and went to Hustai from Ulaanbaatar. The ranger drove us to a ridge at sunset and a whole harem was grazing below — the stallion kept circling them.","zh":"夏天休了一周，从乌兰巴托去胡斯坦。傍晚护林员开车带我们上了山梁，下面一整群野马在吃草，公马一直绕着马群转。"}],"中南大羚":[{"npc":"mai","t":"去河内出差","en":"Went hiking at Pu Mat on the way back from Hanoi. The ranger showed us a poster of the saola and laughed — he's worked there twenty years and never seen one.","zh":"去河内出差回来顺路去普马国家公园走了走。护林员指着中南大羚的海报笑说，他在这儿干了二十年，一次都没见过。"}],"湄公河江豚":[{"npc":"emma","t":"春假背包旅行","en":"Spring break backpacking in Cambodia. At Kampi the boatman turned off the engine and we just sat there — then three of them came up right next to us.","zh":"春假在柬埔寨背包旅行，在 Kampi 船夫关了马达，我们就静静坐着，然后有三头就在船边冒出来。"}],"万象之国":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"泼水节前","en":"Took the bus up to Sayaboury before Songkran. At the Elephant Conservation Center a mahout let me watch the vet check an old elephant's feet — longer than any spa treatment.","zh":"泼水节前坐车去了沙耶武里，大象保护中心的象夫让我看兽医给一头老象检查脚，比做一次足疗还久。"}],"缅甸猫":[{"npc":"zhou_vet","t":"周六门诊","en":"A Burmese came in for its jabs today. The owner said it cries at the door every evening until she's home — and it purred the whole time on my table.","zh":"周六门诊来了一只缅甸猫打疫苗。主人说它每天傍晚在门口哭到她回家，在我诊台上倒是一直呼噜。"}],"夜间动物园":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"下夜班前的休息日","en":"Took my cousins from Malaysia on a day off. No flash allowed, so the kids just stared into the dark — then a tapir walked right up to the tram.","zh":"休息日带马来西亚来的表弟妹去。不让开闪光灯，小孩们就盯着黑漆漆一片看，结果一只马来貘直接走到游园车旁边。"}],"犀鸟":[{"npc":"weijie","t":"去古晋出差","en":"Squeezed in a morning at a park outside Kuching after a school visit. Heard it before I saw it — a pair flew over and the wings sounded like a helicopter.","zh":"去古晋给国际学校做演示，挤出一个早上去郊外的公园。先听到才看到：一对犀鸟飞过去，翅膀声像直升机。"}],"眼镜猴":[{"npc":"bea","t":"拍视频的周末","en":"Filmed a short at the tarsier sanctuary in Corella. Whisper-only rules — I did the whole voiceover later because I couldn't say a word on the trail.","zh":"周末去科雷亚的眼镜猴保护区拍短视频。规定只能小声，步道上一句话都不能说，旁白都是回去补录的。"}],"独角犀":[{"npc":"rohan","t":"排灯节假期","en":"Diwali break in Nepal. On the canoe in Chitwan a rhino was standing in the water ten metres away — the guide told us to stop talking and just float.","zh":"排灯节放假去了尼泊尔，在奇特旺坐独木舟，十米外一头犀牛站在水里，向导让我们别说话、就这么漂过去。"}],"米瑞莎蓝鲸":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"寒假","en":"Up at 5:30 for the boat out of Mirissa. Three hours of nothing, half the deck seasick, then a blow like a fountain — and that huge blue back just kept going.","zh":"寒假在米瑞莎，五点半起来坐船，三个小时什么都没有，半船人晕船，然后远处像喷泉一样喷水——那条蓝色的背一直滑过去，长得没完。"}],"鲸鲨":[{"npc":"amara","t":"马尔代夫过夜航班","en":"Had a two-day layover in Malé, so a few of the crew took a boat to South Ari. The guide shouted 'jump!' and there it was under me — bigger than our minibus.","zh":"在马累有两天的过夜，几个同事坐船去了南阿里。向导喊「跳！」，它就在我身子下面——比我们的小巴还大。"}],"捻角山羊":[{"npc":"maggie","t":"秋天的徒步团","en":"Joined a walking group up to Chitral Gol. Never got close — the guide set up his scope and there they were on the cliff, horns like corkscrews.","zh":"秋天跟徒步团去了吉德拉尔国家公园。根本靠不近，向导架好望远镜，它们就在悬崖上，角像开瓶器。"}],"布哈拉马鹿":[{"npc":"hans","t":"退休前的长假","en":"On my Silk Road trip I took a detour from Nukus to the tugay forest. Strange to see thick woods in the middle of the desert — a stag was standing at the edge, totally still.","zh":"丝绸之路旅行时，从努库斯绕路去了河岸林。沙漠中间一片密林，很奇怪；一头公鹿站在林子边上，一动不动。"}],"哈萨克猎鹰人":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"来哈萨克斯坦采访","en":"On assignment in Almaty I went to the falcon centre in the hills. When the eagle landed on the trainer's arm I felt the wind from its wings two metres away.","zh":"来阿拉木图采访，去了山上的猎鹰中心。金雕落到驯鹰人手臂上那一下，我站在两米外都感到了翅膀扇过来的风。"}],"卡齐兰加独角犀":[{"npc":"priyanka","t":"冬天回家顺路","en":"Visiting a friend in Guwahati, so we drove to Kaziranga for the morning jeep. I stopped counting at twelve rhinos — one was standing right on the road.","zh":"冬天去古瓦哈蒂看朋友，顺便开车去卡齐兰加坐早上的吉普车。数到十二头犀牛就不数了，有一头就站在路中间。"}],"坎哈老虎":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"回印度探亲","en":"Back in India for my cousin's wedding, so we added three days in Kanha. No tiger on the first two drives — just herds of barasingha in the meadow. The third morning, a tigress crossed in front of the jeep.","zh":"回印度参加表妹婚礼，顺便去坎哈三天。头两趟没看到老虎，只有草地上一群群巴拉辛格鹿；第三天早上，一头母老虎从吉普车前面走过。"}],"考拉":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"去昆士兰看姐姐的周末","en":"Visited my sister in Brisbane and we stopped at a koala hospital on the way. One had just had surgery and was asleep hugging a fluffy toy. Same as half my patients, honestly.","zh":"去布里斯班看我姐，路上顺道去了一家考拉医院。有一只刚做完手术，抱着个毛绒玩具睡着了。说实话，跟我诊所里一半的病号一样。"}],"卡卡杜鳄鱼":[{"npc":"josh_cafe","t":"冬天休假","en":"Took a week off in July and flew up to Kakadu. On the Yellow Water cruise a croc slid off the bank about two metres from the boat. Back in Melbourne I'm still telling every customer.","zh":"七月请了一周假飞去卡卡杜。坐黄水湿地的游船，一条鳄鱼从岸上滑进水里，离船也就两米。回到墨尔本，我见一个客人讲一次。"}],"短尾矮袋鼠":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"春假","en":"Spent twenty minutes lying on the path at Rottnest for the perfect quokka selfie. It walked right up to my phone. Did not touch it — there are signs everywhere.","zh":"在罗特尼斯岛的小路上趴了二十分钟，就为了拍一张完美的短尾矮袋鼠自拍。它自己走到我手机跟前来了。我没摸它，到处都是牌子。"}],"鲨鱼湾海豚":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"学校放复活节假","en":"I've shown my class photos of the sponge-carrying dolphins for years. In Shark Bay I finally stood in the water at Monkey Mia at 8 am and watched them come in. Now the slide has my own photo.","zh":"我给学生放「戴海绵的海豚」的照片放了好多年。在鲨鱼湾，我终于早上八点站在猴子米亚的水里，看着它们游过来。现在那页课件换成我自己拍的了。"}],"鸸鹋":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"放暑假开车回家","en":"Driving back to my parents' farm, I had to stop for six emus crossing the highway. They took their time. Dad just said, 'You know they won the war, right?'","zh":"开车回爸妈的农场，公路上有六只鸸鹋过马路，我只能停车等。它们慢悠悠地走。我爸就说了一句：「你知道那场仗是它们赢了吧？」"}],"塔斯马尼亚恶魔":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"去塔斯马尼亚徒步","en":"At the sanctuary feeding, two devils fought over one wallaby leg and the noise was unbelievable. My grandson hid behind me, then asked to watch again.","zh":"保护区喂食的时候，两只袋獾抢一条小袋鼠腿，那叫声真是没法形容。我外孙躲在我身后，然后又要求再看一遍。"}],"几维鸟":[{"npc":"emma","t":"寒假去新西兰","en":"In the kiwi house it took ten minutes for my eyes to adjust, and then — there it was, poking its beak into the ground. No flash allowed, so I have zero photos and one great memory.","zh":"进了几维鸟馆，眼睛适应了十分钟，然后就看见它了，正把嘴往土里戳。不准用闪光灯，所以我一张照片都没有，只有一段特别好的记忆。"}],"新西兰绵羊":[{"npc":"poppy","t":"去新西兰进货","en":"Went to a sheep station near Christchurch to see where real wool jumpers start. Watched a shearer do one in about a minute, and now I can't charge less than forty quid for a knit.","zh":"去基督城附近的牧场，看真正的羊毛衫是从哪儿开始的。看一个剪毛工一分钟左右剪完一只，现在我的毛衣卖四十镑以下都不好意思了。"}],"天堂鸟":[{"npc":"bea","t":"去戈罗卡拍视频","en":"Flew from Manila to film the Goroka Show. A dancer told me the plumes on his headdress came from his grandfather. My video got more questions about feathers than anything I've ever posted.","zh":"从马尼拉飞过去拍戈罗卡歌舞节。一个跳舞的人跟我说，他头饰上的羽毛是他爷爷传下来的。这条视频底下问羽毛的评论，比我发过的任何一条都多。"}],"菲利普岛小企鹅":[{"npc":"mia","t":"周六晚上","en":"Drove down to Phillip Island with my flatmates after my café shift. Freezing wind, no phones allowed, and then a little line of penguins popped out of the waves. Totally worth the 90-minute drive.","zh":"下了咖啡馆的班，和室友开车去菲利普岛。风冷得要命，不许拿手机，然后一小队企鹅从浪里钻出来了。开一个半小时车，值了。"}],"袋熊":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"放假去雪山","en":"Drove to the Snowy Mountains after a run of night shifts. Had to brake for a wombat crossing the road at dusk — it didn't even look at me. Very ER-patient energy.","zh":"连上了几个夜班后开车去雪山。傍晚一只袋熊横穿马路，我只能急刹车——它看都没看我一眼。很有急诊室病人的气质。"}],"斐济鬣蜥":[{"npc":"amara","t":"在楠迪过夜","en":"Had a 30-hour layover in Nadi and went to an eco-park. The keeper put a crested iguana on a branch next to me and it slowly turned darker. Apparently that's it saying 'too close'.","zh":"在楠迪有 30 个小时的过夜休息，去了一个生态公园。饲养员把一只冠鬣蜥放在我旁边的树枝上，它慢慢变暗了。据说那是在说「你靠太近了」。"}],"树袋鼠":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"休息日去动物园","en":"Spent my day off at the zoo staring at a tree kangaroo for half an hour. It finally hopped down one branch, looked at me, and went back to sleep. I felt very seen.","zh":"休息日去动物园，盯着一只树袋鼠看了半个小时。它终于往下跳了一根树枝，看了我一眼，又回去睡了。我觉得被它看透了。"}],"椰子蟹":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"退休后第一次远行","en":"On Santo our guide found a coconut crab under a palm with his torch. He told us to keep our fingers away. We have them on some islands back home in Okinawa too, but I'd never seen one this big.","zh":"在桑托岛，向导拿手电在一棵椰子树下找到一只椰子蟹，叫我们手指头离远点。我们冲绳有的岛上也有，可这么大的我还是第一次见。"}],"帕劳鲨鱼保护区":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"年假","en":"Saved my annual leave for a dive week in Palau. At Blue Corner we hooked onto the reef in the current and the grey sharks just cruised by, totally unbothered. Back at check-in on Monday, I still felt like I was floating.","zh":"攒着年假去帕劳潜了一周水。在蓝角，我们顶着海流把钩子挂在礁石上，灰礁鲨就从面前慢悠悠游过去，完全不理我们。周一回到值机柜台，我还觉得自己在飘。"}],"雅浦蝠鲼":[{"npc":"weijie","t":"国庆长周末","en":"Flew to Yap for a long weekend of diving. Knelt by the cleaning station for forty minutes and a manta wider than my car hovered right over us. Didn't think about sales targets once.","zh":"国庆长周末飞去雅浦潜水。在清洁站边上跪了四十分钟，一只比我的车还宽的蝠鲼就停在我们头顶。这期间我一次都没想起销售指标。"}],"袋鼠岛":[{"npc":"sarah","t":"公司开完会后多留几天","en":"After a conference in Adelaide I took the ferry over to Kangaroo Island. On the Seal Bay walk a sea lion pup flopped down a few metres from us. The ranger whispered the whole time, so we did too.","zh":"在阿德莱德开完会，我坐渡轮去了袋鼠岛。海豹湾的步道上，一只小海狮扑通一下躺在离我们几米的地方。护林员一直小声说话，我们也跟着小声。"}],"秋田犬":[{"npc":"yui_pet","t":"下班路上","en":"I meet friends at the Hachikō statue every week, and there's always a queue of tourists for photos. Today a real Akita came into the shop — the owner said he only lets family brush him.","zh":"我每周都在八公像那儿等朋友，那里永远排着拍照的游客。今天店里来了一只真的秋田犬——主人说它只让家里人给它梳毛。"}],"美丽海水族馆":[{"npc":"yuki","t":"带爸妈去冲绳","en":"Took my parents to Churaumi and we just sat in front of the big tank for an hour. When Jinta swam past, my mum stopped talking mid-sentence. That never happens.","zh":"带爸妈去美丽海水族馆，我们就坐在大水槽前面待了一个小时。鲸鲨游过去的时候，我妈话说到一半停住了。这可从来没有过。"}],"吉尔亚洲狮":[{"npc":"priya","t":"排灯节假期","en":"We booked the 6 am jeep in Gir and saw nothing for two hours. Then a lioness walked out right in front of us with two cubs. Our driver switched off the engine and nobody breathed.","zh":"我们在吉尔订了早上六点的吉普车，前两个小时什么都没看到。然后一头母狮带着两只小狮子从我们面前走了出来。司机关了引擎，谁都不敢出气。"}],"柴犬":[{"npc":"aoi","t":"周日开店前","en":"The Shiba from the house next door sits outside my shop every morning but won't let anyone pet him. Customers think he's my shop dog. I've stopped correcting them.","zh":"隔壁家的柴犬每天早上都坐在我店门口，可谁都不让摸。客人都以为是我店里的狗。我已经懒得解释了。"}],"哈士奇":[{"npc":"aino","t":"圣诞前的假","en":"Took the night train from Helsinki up to Lapland for a husky ride. The dogs screamed with excitement before the start, then went totally silent once they were running. I want that kind of focus.","zh":"从赫尔辛基坐夜车去拉普兰坐哈士奇雪橇。出发前狗狗们激动得一直叫，一跑起来就完全安静了。我也想有那种专注。"}],"中华田园犬":[{"npc":"bj_laozhou","t":"胡同里的下午","en":"Our hutong dog Da Huang naps by my bike stall every afternoon. Nobody really owns him — everyone feeds him. When a stranger walks in, he barks twice, then goes back to sleep.","zh":"我们胡同的大黄每天下午都在我修车摊边上睡觉。说不上是谁家的，谁都喂它。生人进胡同，它叫两声，接着睡。"}],"暹罗猫":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"复习考试的晚上","en":"My Siamese, Mali, sits on my notes and talks at me every time I study. Tonight she argued for ten minutes straight. I think she won.","zh":"我的暹罗猫 Mali 每次我复习都坐在我的笔记上冲我说话。今晚她连着跟我吵了十分钟。我觉得是她赢了。"}],"橘猫":[{"npc":"zhou_vet","t":"下班回家","en":"Dabing, my three-legged orange cat, has started meowing for dinner at 5 pm sharp. I tell clients not to overfeed their cats. At home, I am losing this argument.","zh":"我家三条腿的橘猫大饼，现在下午五点整就开始叫着要饭。我天天跟客人说别把猫喂太胖。在家里，这场仗我快输了。"}],"狸花猫":[{"npc":"cd_zhang","t":"茶馆里摆龙门阵","en":"The tabby at our teahouse picks one regular a day and sleeps on their lap. Today it was me. I didn't dare stand up for two hours, so I ordered another pot of tea.","zh":"我们茶馆那只狸花猫，每天挑一个老茶客，睡在人家腿上。今天挑的是我。我两个钟头不敢起身，只好又泡了一壶茶。"}],"斑点狗":[{"npc":"tom_walker","t":"早上 7 点，海德公园","en":"One of my regulars is a Dalmatian called Pepper. She needs twice the running of the others — by the end she's still bouncing and I'm the one who's tired.","zh":"我常遛的狗里有一只斑点狗叫 Pepper。她要跑的量是别的狗的两倍——遛完了她还在蹦，累的是我。"}],"安哥拉猫":[{"npc":"emre","t":"上午 10 点，开店的时候","en":"A white cat with odd eyes sleeps on my counter every morning. Customers think she's mine — she isn't, she belongs to the whole street.","zh":"每天早上有只鸳鸯眼的白猫睡在我柜台上。客人以为是我养的——不是，她是整条街的。"}],"波斯猫":[{"npc":"zhou_vet","t":"周三下午，门诊","en":"Three Persians today, all for the same thing: tear stains and noisy breathing. When you choose one, pick a face that isn't too flat.","zh":"今天来了三只波斯猫，都是一样的问题：泪痕和呼吸有声音。挑的时候，别选脸太扁的。"}],"高卢雄鸡":[{"npc":"pierre","t":"周六晚上，比赛日","en":"On match nights I put a little rooster in the bakery window. If France wins, the first croissant tomorrow is free — I've only lost money twice.","zh":"有比赛的晚上，我在面包店橱窗里放一只小公鸡。法国赢了，第二天第一个可颂免费——我只亏过两次。"}],"康尼马拉小马":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"八月，休假","en":"My holiday this year was a week in Clifden. I went for the bookshops and ended up spending a whole day at the pony show, holding someone's coffee.","zh":"今年休假在克利夫登待了一周。本来是去逛书店，结果在小马展上待了一整天，帮人拿着咖啡。"}],"罗马母狼":[{"npc":"chiara","t":"周四上午，带学生参观","en":"I take my class to see the wolf every year. The kids always ask the same thing: 'Did she really have milk for both of them?'","zh":"我每年带班上的孩子去看母狼。孩子们每次都问同一个问题：「她真的有够两个人喝的奶吗？」"},{"npc":"paolo","t":"周日下午，看球","en":"Forty years driving buses in Rome and the wolf was on my Roma scarf every Sunday. My grandson has the same scarf now.","zh":"在罗马开了四十年公交，每个周日我的罗马队围巾上都有这只狼。现在我孙子也有一条一样的。"}],"西斯廷海鸥":[{"npc":"lucia_it","t":"2013 年 3 月的一个晚上","en":"I watched the chimney on TV for an hour, and all I saw was that seagull. My husband said: 'Maybe he's voting too.'","zh":"我在电视上盯着烟囱看了一个小时，只看到那只海鸥。我老公说：「说不定它也在投票。」"}],"伊比利亚猞猁":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"周二上午，地理课","en":"Every year I show my class the lynx numbers: 62 adults in 2001, over 2,000 lynx now. It's the one piece of good news in my syllabus.","zh":"我每年都给学生看猞猁的数字：2001 年只有 62 只成年的，现在两千多只。这是我课本里唯一的好消息。"}],"葡萄牙水犬":[{"npc":"rui","t":"九月，休息日","en":"I went down to Olhão on my day off. At the harbour a curly black dog jumped off a boat and swam back with a rope — the fishermen didn't even look up.","zh":"休息日去了奥良。港口有只黑色卷毛狗从船上跳下去，叼着一根绳子游回来——渔民们头都没抬。"}],"德国牧羊犬":[{"npc":"huber","t":"早上 6 点半，伊萨尔河边","en":"Ajax and I walk by the Isar every morning, rain or snow. He's eleven now — slower, but he still won't let me skip a day.","zh":"我和 Ajax 每天早上都在伊萨尔河边走，下雨下雪都一样。他十一岁了——走得慢了，但还是一天都不让我偷懒。"}],"荷斯坦奶牛":[{"npc":"sanne","t":"周日，骑车出城","en":"Twenty minutes by bike out of Amsterdam and it's all black-and-white cows. My international classmates always stop to take the same photo.","zh":"从阿姆斯特丹骑车二十分钟出城，满眼都是黑白花奶牛。我的国际同学每次都停下来拍同一张照片。"}],"比利时挽马":[{"npc":"gerard","t":"九月的一个周日，乡下集市","en":"There's a fair near the Belgian border where they still show the big horses. I stood next to one and my head reached its shoulder.","zh":"比利时边境附近有个集市，现在还在展大马。我站在一匹旁边，头才到它的肩膀。"}],"圣伯纳犬":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"七月，周末徒步","en":"We hiked up to the Great St Bernard Pass and the dogs were out for their walk. One leaned on my leg and nearly knocked me over.","zh":"我们徒步上了大圣伯纳德山口，正好碰上狗出来散步。有一只靠在我腿上，差点把我压倒。"}],"利皮扎马":[{"npc":"felix","t":"四月，学校旅行","en":"School trip to Vienna. I thought watching horses train would be boring — then one did a jump with all four legs off the ground and the whole class went quiet.","zh":"学校去维也纳旅行。我以为看马训练会很无聊——结果一匹马四条腿全离地跳了起来，全班一下子安静了。"}],"圣诞鲤鱼":[{"npc":"hans","t":"平安夜","en":"My grandmother was from Bohemia, so we still have carp on Christmas Eve. When I was a boy it lived in our bathtub for two days and I gave it a name — big mistake.","zh":"我外婆是波希米亚人，所以我们家平安夜还吃鲤鱼。我小时候它在我们家浴缸里住了两天，我还给它起了名字——大错特错。"}],"欧洲野牛":[{"npc":"lena","t":"五月，长周末","en":"I left my laptop in Berlin for three days in Białowieża. On the last morning a bison crossed the path ten metres ahead — no notification has ever felt that important.","zh":"我把电脑留在柏林，在比亚沃维耶扎待了三天。最后一个早上，一头野牛在我前面十米横穿过小路——没有哪条消息通知让我觉得这么重要过。"}],"卷毛猪":[{"npc":"tom","t":"周五，进货","en":"Our farm supplier has a few woolly Mangalica pigs now. Too rich for school dinners, but I bought some for my own Sunday roast.","zh":"我们的农场供货商现在养了几头卷毛猪。学校午饭用太油了，但我自己买了一点，周日烤着吃。"}],"赞特海龟":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"七月，暑假","en":"Every summer on Zakynthos I tell my students the same rule: off the beach by sunset, no umbrellas near the little wooden frames. Philosophy can wait; turtles can't.","zh":"每年暑假在扎金索斯，我都跟学生说同一条规矩：太阳下山前离开海滩，别在小木框旁边插伞。哲学可以等，海龟不能等。"}],"俄罗斯棕熊":[{"npc":"aino","t":"十月，周末去东部森林","en":"The brown bear is Finland's national animal too. Last autumn I sat in a hide near the eastern border all night and saw three — I didn't dare breathe.","zh":"棕熊也是芬兰的国兽。去年秋天我在东边边境附近的观察小屋里坐了一整夜，看到三只——大气都不敢出。"}],"驯鹿":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"二月，北上旅行","en":"I took my old geography class notes to Finnmark and finally saw a Sámi herd moving across the snow. Forty years of teaching it, and I'd never seen it myself.","zh":"我带着以前的地理课笔记去了芬马克，终于看到萨米人的驯鹿群在雪地上走过。这个讲了四十年，我自己从没亲眼看过。"}],"瑞典驼鹿":[{"npc":"maja","t":"八月，回乡下的路上","en":"Driving to my parents' summer house we stopped for a moose standing in the middle of the road. It looked at us for a full minute, then walked off like it owned the place.","zh":"开车去我爸妈的夏天小屋，路中间站着一头驼鹿，我们只好停下。它盯着我们看了整整一分钟，然后像主人一样慢慢走开了。"}],"丹麦猪":[{"npc":"elin","t":"周六，过桥去哥本哈根","en":"We take the kids over the bridge to Copenhagen for the day. They don't care about the castles — they care about the roast pork sandwich with the crispy bits.","zh":"我们带孩子过桥去哥本哈根玩一天。他们不在乎城堡——他们在乎的是那个带脆皮的烤猪肉三明治。"}],"环斑海豹":[{"npc":"aino","t":"三月，周末","en":"Last March I went to Saimaa with the snowdrift volunteers. We shovelled all day, and in May they told us a pup was born in ours.","zh":"去年三月我跟着堆雪堆的志愿者去了塞马湖。我们铲了一整天的雪，五月他们告诉我们，有只小海豹在我们堆的那个里出生了。"}],"海鹦":[{"npc":"maggie","t":"六月，周三","en":"I took the bus to Bempton Cliffs with my binoculars. Thousands of seabirds, and I waited two hours for one puffin — worth it.","zh":"我带着望远镜坐车去了本普顿悬崖。成千上万只海鸟，我等了两个小时才看到一只海鹦——值了。"}],"金毛":[{"npc":"tom_walker","t":"下午 3 点，汉普斯特德荒野","en":"Rule one of walking a golden: never go near the pond unless you've got a towel. Biscuit has never once walked past water.","zh":"遛金毛第一条规矩：没带毛巾就别靠近池塘。Biscuit 从来没有一次是从水边走过去的。"}],"柯基":[{"npc":"poppy","t":"周日，红砖巷市集","en":"The stall next to mine has a corgi called Duchess. Tourists stop for her, then buy my jackets — I should pay her a commission.","zh":"我隔壁摊有只柯基叫 Duchess。游客停下来是为了看她，然后顺手买了我的夹克——我该给她分成。"}],"泰迪（贵宾）":[{"npc":"zhou_vet","t":"周六上午","en":"Half the dogs in my waiting room on Saturdays are Teddies. Owners always ask if the cut is a breed — I tell them it's a haircut, not a dog.","zh":"周六候诊室里一半的狗是泰迪。主人老问泰迪是不是一个品种——我说那是个发型，不是一种狗。"},{"npc":"yui_pet","t":"下午 4 点，店里","en":"Toy poodles are our best-selling customers — I mean their owners are. Today I sold three tiny raincoats.","zh":"玩具贵宾是我们店最大的客户——我是说它们的主人。今天卖了三件小雨衣。"}],"边境牧羊犬":[{"npc":"ngozi","t":"六月，学校旅行","en":"We took Year 8 to a farm and watched a border collie bring in sixty sheep with just whistles. Best behaviour I've seen from my class all year — they were stunned.","zh":"我们带八年级去农场，看一只边牧只靠口哨就把六十只羊赶了回来。这是我班上一整年最安静的时候——孩子们都看呆了。"}],"法国斗牛犬":[{"npc":"lea","t":"下午 2 点，玛黑区的店里","en":"Our shop dog is a Frenchie called Gaston. In August he refuses to leave the cool tiles by the door, so customers have to step over him.","zh":"我们店的狗是只法斗，叫 Gaston。八月他死活不肯离开门口凉快的瓷砖，客人只好从他身上跨过去。"}],"比格犬":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"周一早上，墨尔本机场","en":"Flew back from uni break and a beagle in a little green coat sat down right next to my bag. Forgot the banana. Very embarrassing, very cute.","zh":"放假回来下飞机，一只穿绿色小背心的比格在我包旁边一屁股坐下。我忘了包里有根香蕉。很尴尬，也很可爱。"}],"博美":[{"npc":"yui_pet","t":"晚上 7 点，快关门","en":"A Pomeranian came in today wearing a lion-mane hat for a photo. She barked at our biggest customer, a Shiba, and the Shiba backed away.","zh":"今天来了一只戴狮子鬃毛帽拍照的博美。她冲着店里最大的客人——一只柴犬——叫，柴犬居然往后退了。"}],"英国短毛猫":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"晚上 9 点，加完班","en":"My British Blue, Earl Grey, has one rule: dinner at seven. When I'm late from the office he sits facing the wall to tell me off.","zh":"我家英短蓝猫叫伯爵茶，只有一条规矩：七点开饭。我加班晚回来，他就脸朝墙坐着，算是骂我。"}],"苏格兰折耳猫":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"周四下午，诊所","en":"A family brought in a Scottish Fold that didn't want to jump anymore. Sweet cat. I had to explain the folded ears and the sore legs are the same gene.","zh":"一家人带来一只不愿意再跳的折耳猫。很乖的猫。我得跟他们解释，折下来的耳朵和疼的腿是同一个基因造成的。"}],"俄罗斯蓝猫":[{"npc":"johan","t":"周五晚上，家里请客","en":"We had colleagues over for dinner and our Russian Blue spent the whole evening under the bed. The moment the door closed, she came out and sat on my laptop.","zh":"我们请同事来家里吃饭，我家俄罗斯蓝猫一整晚都躲在床底下。门一关，她就出来坐到了我的电脑上。"}],"C罗":[{"npc":"rui","t":"早餐时","en":"Every football fan who stays with me asks the same thing: where did Ronaldo start? I send them to Sporting's stadium — he played there as a teenager.","zh":"来住的球迷每个都问同一个问题：C罗是从哪儿开始踢的？我就让他们去葡萄牙体育的球场——他十几岁时在那儿踢球。"}],"埃及艳后":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"上课时","en":"I asked my class what language Cleopatra spoke. They all said Egyptian. Greek, I told them — so she's partly ours.","zh":"我问学生埃及艳后说什么语言，全班都说埃及语。我说是希腊语——所以她也算半个我们的人。"}],"弗雷迪·墨丘利":[{"npc":"poppy","t":"周日摆摊","en":"Someone asked for 'a Freddie jacket' today — yellow, buckles, Wembley '86. I didn't have one, but I sold her white jeans instead.","zh":"今天有人来要「弗雷迪那件夹克」——黄色、带扣子、86 年温布利那件。我没有，但卖了她一条白牛仔裤。"}],"曼德拉":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"周末","en":"I take visiting friends to Vilakazi Street in Soweto. Mandela's little house is there — it's smaller than most people expect.","zh":"朋友来了我就带去索韦托的维拉卡兹街。曼德拉的小房子就在那儿——比大多数人想的小。"},{"npc":"nomvula","t":"休息日","en":"I finally took the ferry to Robben Island. The guide was a former prisoner. Nobody on the boat back said a word.","zh":"我终于坐船去了罗本岛。讲解员以前就在那里坐过牢。回来的船上没人说话。"}],"阿贝贝·比基拉":[{"npc":"chiara","t":"下班路上","en":"I ride past the Arch of Constantine every evening. My dad says the 1960 marathon finished right there, at night, with torches.","zh":"我每天傍晚骑车经过君士坦丁凯旋门。我爸说 1960 年的马拉松就在那儿结束，晚上，点着火把。"}],"珍·古道尔":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"休息日","en":"On my day off I watched the chimps at Taronga for an hour. One was poking a stick into a hole, just like in the old Jane Goodall films.","zh":"休息日我在塔龙加动物园看了一小时黑猩猩。有一只拿根小棍往洞里戳，跟珍·古道尔老纪录片里一模一样。"}],"费拉·库蒂":[{"npc":"tolu","t":"周四晚上","en":"Thursday night at the New Afrika Shrine. The band played till late. Every producer in Lagos has been here at least once.","zh":"周四晚上在 New Afrika Shrine。乐队一直演到很晚。拉各斯做音乐的人，每个都至少来过一次。"}],"阿契贝":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"读书会","en":"This month's book club was Things Fall Apart. Two people had read it at school and said it hit completely differently now.","zh":"这个月读书会读《瓦解》。有两个人上学时读过，说现在再读感觉完全不一样。"}],"恩克鲁玛":[{"npc":"kwame","t":"独立日","en":"On 6 March my whole family goes out in red, gold and green. My grandpa still does Nkrumah's 'free forever' line in his deep voice.","zh":"3 月 6 日全家穿红黄绿出门。我爷爷到现在还会用低沉的嗓音学恩克鲁玛那句「永远自由」。"}],"曼萨·穆萨":[{"npc":"oliver","t":"上班时","en":"I pitched a 'richest people in history' piece. My editor said: start with Mansa Musa — then spend a paragraph explaining why nobody can put a number on it.","zh":"我报了个「史上最有钱的人」的选题。编辑说：从曼萨·穆萨开始——然后花一段解释为什么谁也算不出他到底有多少钱。"}],"基普乔格":[{"npc":"jiho","t":"周三夜跑","en":"Before our Wednesday run I played the Vienna 1:59 finish on my phone. Thirty people, all suddenly running faster.","zh":"周三夜跑前我用手机放了维也纳 1:59 冲线那段。三十个人，一下子全跑快了。"}],"萨拉赫":[{"npc":"ahmed","t":"休息日","en":"I took my nephew to Anfield for his birthday. He wore a Salah shirt three sizes too big and sang the whole match.","zh":"我带外甥去安菲尔德过生日。他穿着大了三号的萨拉赫球衣，唱了整整一场。"}],"刘慈欣":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"周四读书会","en":"Our book club picked The Three-Body Problem after the Netflix show. Half of them loved it, half got lost in the physics — best argument we've had all year.","zh":"Netflix 剧出来后，我们读书会选了《三体》。一半人爱死了，一半人被物理绕晕了——今年吵得最热闹的一次。"}],"成龙":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"周五晚场","en":"We ran a Jackie Chan night. Nobody left when the credits started — everyone stayed for the bloopers.","zh":"我们办了一场成龙之夜。片尾字幕一出来没人走——大家都等着看 NG 花絮。"}],"郎朗":[{"npc":"maggie","t":"周日下午","en":"My granddaughter finally sat down at the old piano after I showed her Lang Lang playing. She lasted twenty minutes — a record, dear.","zh":"我给孙女看了郎朗弹琴，她终于在家里那台旧钢琴前坐下了。坚持了二十分钟——破纪录了呢。"}],"屠呦呦":[{"npc":"ahmed","t":"病房早班","en":"Had a patient back from a trip with malaria this week. The treatment we gave her starts with artemisinin — I always think of Tu Youyou when I check that box.","zh":"这周有个旅行回来得了疟疾的病人。我们给她用的药是以青蒿素为基础的——每次核对这个药，我都会想到屠呦呦。"}],"袁隆平":[{"npc":"cd_laoluo","t":"收档的时候","en":"In my kitchen the rule is: rice doesn't go in the bin. My apprentices groan, but I tell them — think of Grandpa Yuan.","zh":"我厨房的规矩：米饭不能倒。徒弟们嫌我啰嗦，我就说——想想袁爷爷。"}],"莫言":[{"npc":"cd_he","t":"退休前最后一学期","en":"I used to read a page of Red Sorghum aloud in class. The kids giggled at the wild parts, then went very quiet.","zh":"我以前在课上念一页《红高粱》。孩子们读到野的地方先是笑，后来都安静了。"}],"杨利伟":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"2003 年 10 月","en":"We wheeled a TV into the classroom to watch Shenzhou 5. Now I tell my students he said he couldn't see the Great Wall — they never believe me.","zh":"那年我们把电视推进教室看神舟五号。现在我跟学生说他在太空没看到长城——他们都不信。"}],"世宗大王":[{"npc":"minjun","t":"午休","en":"I walk past King Sejong's statue at Gwanghwamun every lunch break. Foreign tourists always ask me who he is — I say, 'the guy who made our alphabet'.","zh":"我每天午休都路过光化门的世宗大王像。外国游客总问我他是谁——我说：「给我们造字的人。」"}],"成吉思汗铜像":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"九月去蒙古","en":"We took the lift up and walked out onto the horse's head. The wind on the steppe nearly took my hat — you can see for miles.","zh":"我们坐电梯上去，走到马头上。草原的风差点把我帽子吹走——一眼能看好几公里。"}],"甘地":[{"npc":"priya","t":"10 月 2 日","en":"Gandhi Jayanti — office closed, so I finally did the long walk I keep promising myself. Seemed appropriate.","zh":"甘地诞辰日，公司放假，我终于去走了那条一直说要走的长路。感觉挺应景的。"}],"泰戈尔":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"七月去西湖","en":"Every July the lotus on West Lake is out and someone on my feed posts 'Let life be beautiful like summer flowers'. Half my class wrote it in our graduation yearbooks too.","zh":"每年七月西湖荷花开，朋友圈总有人发「生如夏花之绚烂」。我们毕业那年，同学录上也有一半人写这句。"}],"佛陀":[{"npc":"somchai","t":"清早出摊","en":"Before I light my stove the monks come down the street for alms. I give rice first, then start cooking for customers.","zh":"我点火之前，僧人会沿街来化缘。我先给他们一碗饭，再开始给客人炒。"}],"门捷列夫":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"带参观的时候","en":"A kid on my tour asked which element is named after a person. I said 'Mendelevium — 101!' and he wrote it on his hand.","zh":"参观团里一个小孩问哪个元素是用人名起的。我说「钔，101 号！」他马上写在了手上。"}],"埃德蒙·希拉里":[{"npc":"amara","t":"加德满都休息日","en":"Flew a tiny plane into Lukla — the airport is named after Tenzing and Hillary. The runway is so short everyone clapped when we stopped.","zh":"坐小飞机飞进卢克拉——那个机场就是以丹增和希拉里命名的。跑道短得吓人，一停稳全机都鼓掌了。"}],"伊本·西拿":[{"npc":"tomo","t":"医学院第一课","en":"My first anatomy lecturer opened with a page of Avicenna's Canon and said, 'This was your textbook for 500 years. Be humble.'","zh":"我们第一节解剖课，老师放了一页伊本·西拿的《医典》，说：「这本书当了五百年的医学课本。谦虚点。」"}],"大谷翔平":[{"npc":"kenji","t":"工作日上午","en":"Dodgers games start around eleven in the morning in Osaka. I put Ohtani on my second screen and pretend it's a meeting.","zh":"道奇的比赛在大阪大概上午十一点开打。我把大谷放在副屏上，假装在开会。"}],"羽生结弦":[{"npc":"aiko","t":"回仙台过年","en":"Back in Sendai my aunt took me skating at the rink where Hanyu trained as a kid. I lasted ten minutes and held the wall the whole time.","zh":"回仙台过年，姑姑带我去羽生小时候练滑冰的那个冰场。我撑了十分钟，一直扶着墙。"}],"孙兴慜":[{"npc":"kofi","t":"周六理发店","en":"Since Sonny moved to LA, my Spurs customers just sit in the chair and sigh. One asked for 'the Sonny cut' to cheer himself up.","zh":"孙兴慜去洛杉矶以后，来理发的热刺球迷坐下就叹气。有个客人说要剪「孙兴慜头」给自己打打气。"}],"科利":[{"npc":"rohan","t":"IPL 比赛夜","en":"When Kohli comes out to bat, nobody on our team answers Slack. Even the on-call engineer has the score open.","zh":"科利一上场打，我们组没人回 Slack。连值班的工程师都开着比分。"}],"坂本龙马":[{"npc":"tanaka","t":"秋天去京都","en":"My late husband loved Ryōma dramas, so I visited his grave on the hill in Higashiyama. Someone had left a little bottle of sake there.","zh":"我去世的老伴最爱看龙马的剧，所以我去了东山坡上他的墓。有人在那儿放了一小瓶清酒。"}],"曹雪芹":[{"npc":"bj_xiaoyu","t":"周末","en":"I took a friend to Prince Gong's Mansion. People say its garden might be the model for the one in Dream of the Red Chamber — nobody can prove it, but we argued about it over tea.","zh":"周末带朋友去了恭王府。有人说这里的花园可能是《红楼梦》里大观园的原型——谁也证明不了，我们俩喝着茶争了半天。"}],"关羽":[{"npc":"aqiang","t":"早上开档","en":"My counter is one metre wide, but there's still room for a little Guan Gong on the top shelf. I light a stick of incense before I open.","zh":"我的柜台才一米宽，最上面一格还是摆了个小关公。每天开档前先上一炷香。"}],"武则天":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"带学生去乾陵","en":"Every year I take my students to Qianling. They always ask why her huge stone tablet has nothing written on it — I tell them to come up with their own answer.","zh":"每年我都带学生去乾陵。他们总问她那块大石碑上为什么一个字也没有——我让他们自己想一个答案。"}],"成吉思汗":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"暑假","en":"Last summer our class went to Ordos. At the Genghis Khan Mausoleum the guide said it's a memorial — nobody knows where he's really buried.","zh":"去年暑假我们班去了鄂尔多斯。在成吉思汗陵，讲解员说这里是纪念的地方——他真正埋在哪儿，到现在没人知道。"}],"张爱玲":[{"npc":"lt_xiaoyun","t":"下午","en":"Some guests at my B&B come to Shanghai just to stand outside the Changde Apartment, where Eileen Chang lived. I draw them a little map and lend them her books.","zh":"我民宿里有的客人来上海，就是为了去常德公寓楼下站一站——张爱玲住过那儿。我给他们画张小地图，再借本她的书。"}],"鲁迅":[{"npc":"lt_zhangyeye","t":"星期天","en":"I taught 'My Old Home' for forty years. Now on Sundays I take the metro to Lu Xun Park and sit near his tomb for a while.","zh":"《故乡》我教了四十年。现在星期天坐地铁去鲁迅公园，在他的墓旁边坐一会儿。"}],"孙中山":[{"npc":"chenjie","t":"厂里年会","en":"Our factory's annual dinner was near the Sun Yat-sen Memorial Hall. My son pointed out the blue roof tiles — I'd driven past for twenty years and never looked up.","zh":"厂里年会在中山纪念堂附近。儿子指给我看屋顶的蓝瓦——我开车路过二十年，从来没抬头看过。"}],"郑和":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"休息日","en":"On my day off I took the bus to Malacca and found the Cheng Ho Cultural Museum in an old shophouse. Six hundred years ago his fleet stopped right here.","zh":"休息日我坐大巴去了马六甲，在一排老店屋里找到了郑和文化馆。六百年前他的船队就在这儿停过。"}],"杨贵妃":[{"npc":"xa_ajie","t":"周末带人出城","en":"When I take tourists out to Huaqing Palace under Mount Li, everyone asks where she bathed. Then they ask me where to buy lychees in Xi'an.","zh":"我带游客出城去骊山脚下的华清宫，每个人都问她当年在哪儿泡温泉。问完就问我西安哪儿能买到荔枝。"}],"周杰伦":[{"npc":"mei","t":"放假","en":"I took the MRT to Tamsui to see Tamkang High School, where Jay studied and filmed Secret. Half the people there were humming his songs.","zh":"放假我坐捷运去淡水看淡江中学——周杰伦在那里念书，也在那里拍了《不能说的秘密》。一半的人都在哼他的歌。"}],"苏炳添":[{"npc":"wei","t":"周末","en":"On Sundays I take my daughter to Shenzhen Bay Park. She races me along the seafront and shouts 'Su Bingtian!' every time she wins.","zh":"周末我带女儿去深圳湾公园。她在海边跟我赛跑，每次赢了都喊「苏炳添！」"}],"全红婵":[{"npc":"lt_meimei","t":"那天晚上","en":"When she won in Tokyo the whole street crowded into our tea shop to watch the replay. Everyone kept asking: where did the splash go?","zh":"她在东京夺冠那天，整条街的人都挤到我们奶茶店看回放。大家一直在问：水花去哪儿了？"}],"郑钦文":[{"npc":"chen","t":"周末上课","en":"After Paris, half the kids in my class asked me to teach them a two-handed backhand 'like Zheng Qinwen'.","zh":"巴黎奥运会以后，我班上一半的小孩都要我教他们「郑钦文那样」的双手反拍。"}],"李娜":[{"npc":"wang","t":"大学宿舍","en":"I watched her 2011 French Open final in my university dorm. Ten of us squeezed around one laptop and screamed so loud the dorm auntie came up.","zh":"2011 年她的法网决赛，我是在大学宿舍看的。十个人挤着一台笔记本，叫得太大声，宿管阿姨都上楼来了。"}],"马龙":[{"npc":"lt_qianlao","t":"傍晚","en":"Every evening I play ping-pong at the stone tables in the park. I'm seventy — the young ones copy Ma Long's serve, and I still beat them with my old chop.","zh":"我每天傍晚去公园的水泥台打乒乓球。我七十了——年轻人学马龙那样发球，我还是用老一套的削球赢他们。"}],"孙颖莎":[{"npc":"lt_xiaoli","t":"夜班","en":"My little cousin joined her school table tennis team after Paris. She has a Sun Yingsha poster above her bed and sends me videos of her serves.","zh":"巴黎奥运会以后，我表妹进了学校乒乓球队。她床头贴着孙颖莎的海报，天天给我发她发球的视频。"}],"刘翔":[{"npc":"lt_laochen","t":"2004 年那天早上","en":"The morning after Athens, I'd sold every newspaper by seven. People bought two — one to read, one to keep.","zh":"雅典那次第二天早上，七点不到我的报纸就卖光了。好多人买两份——一份看，一份留着。"}],"潘展乐":[{"npc":"emma","t":"游泳馆","en":"After Paris, the pool I go to in Shanghai was suddenly full of kids doing freestyle sprints. Everyone wants to be Pan Zhanle.","zh":"巴黎奥运会以后，我在上海常去的游泳馆突然全是练自由泳冲刺的小孩。人人都想当潘展乐。"}],"张艺谋":[{"npc":"bj_liu","t":"2008 年 8 月 8 日","en":"On 8 August 2008 our whole building watched the opening ceremony together in the courtyard. I still think of those drummers when I dance at the Temple of Heaven.","zh":"2008 年 8 月 8 日，我们整栋楼的人在院子里一起看开幕式。现在我在天坛跳舞，还会想起那些击缶的人。"}],"饺子导演":[{"npc":"cd_luo","t":"春节","en":"His studio is here in Chengdu, so people in our cinema clapped when the credits rolled. I took my niece to see Ne Zha 2 twice.","zh":"他的工作室就在成都，片尾字幕出来时，我们影厅里的人都鼓掌了。《哪吒2》我带侄女看了两遍。"}],"维克多·雨果":[{"npc":"margaux","t":"周日下午","en":"Tourists always ask me where Victor Hugo lived. I point across the square — his flat is on Place des Vosges, and it's free to go in.","zh":"游客总问我雨果住在哪儿。我就指指广场对面——他的家就在孚日广场上，进去不要钱。"}],"可可·香奈儿":[{"npc":"camille","t":"上班路上","en":"I walk past the Rue Cambon shop every morning. There's always someone taking a photo of the door.","zh":"我每天早上都从康朋街那家店门口走过。门口永远有人在拍门。"}],"齐达内":[{"npc":"mateo","t":"训练后","en":"Coach made us practise the Zidane roulette today. Half of us fell over.","zh":"今天教练让我们练齐达内的马赛回旋。一半人摔倒了。"}],"拿破仑":[{"npc":"thomas_fr","t":"周六","en":"Took my cousins to Les Invalides. They were more impressed by the size of his tomb than by anything he did.","zh":"带表弟表妹去了荣军院。他们对他的坟有多大，比对他干过的事印象深多了。"}],"马可·波罗":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"历史课","en":"I tell my students the Silk Road started right here in Xi'an. Then someone always asks: did Marco Polo really come?","zh":"我跟学生说，丝绸之路就是从西安这儿出发的。然后总有人问：马可·波罗真的来过吗？"}],"达利":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"学校旅行","en":"Took my class to the Dalí museum in Figueres. The kids loved the room where the furniture turns into a face.","zh":"带班上学生去了菲格雷斯的达利博物馆。孩子们最喜欢那间家具摆成一张脸的屋子。"}],"毕加索":[{"npc":"pablo","t":"周日上午","en":"With my students, I always end the Reina Sofía visit at Guernica. Nobody talks for a minute.","zh":"带学生去索菲亚王后艺术中心，我总把《格尔尼卡》放在最后。每次大家都会安静一分钟。"}],"大航海时代":[{"npc":"rui","t":"早上","en":"I send every guest to Belém: the monument, the tower — and pastéis de nata on the way back.","zh":"我让每个客人都去贝伦：看纪念碑、看塔，回来路上再吃个蛋挞。"}],"贝多芬":[{"npc":"lt_hatsune","t":"十二月","en":"Every December I sing the Ninth with my choir. 'Freude!' — at my age, in German!","zh":"每年十二月我都跟合唱团唱《第九》。「Freude！」——我这把年纪，还唱德语呢！"}],"巴赫":[{"npc":"hans","t":"周四晚上","en":"Our church choir is rehearsing the St Matthew Passion for Easter. Three hours, and my voice is gone.","zh":"我们教堂合唱团在为复活节排《马太受难曲》。三个小时，嗓子都哑了。"}],"歌德":[{"npc":"becker","t":"周末","en":"I still have the Faust I read at school, full of my notes. My grandson thinks I was a very serious boy.","zh":"我上学时读的那本《浮士德》还在，里面写满了笔记。我孙子觉得我小时候是个特别严肃的孩子。"}],"伦勃朗":[{"npc":"chen_nl","t":"下课后","en":"With my student museum card I go to see The Night Watch whenever I'm stuck on code. It's weirdly calming.","zh":"有了学生博物馆卡，代码卡住的时候我就去看《夜巡》。奇怪，看完心就静了。"}],"安妮日记":[{"npc":"sanne","t":"骑车路上","en":"I cycle past the Anne Frank House every day. The queue for tickets online sells out weeks ahead.","zh":"我每天骑车经过安妮之家。网上的票提前好几个星期就卖光了。"}],"莫扎特":[{"npc":"amara","t":"转机休息","en":"Layover in Salzburg: bought Mozartkugeln for the whole crew. They melted in my bag.","zh":"在萨尔茨堡转机休息，给整个机组买了莫扎特巧克力球。结果在包里化了。"}],"茜茜公主":[{"npc":"hannah_es","t":"圣诞节","en":"In Germany the old Sissi films are on TV every Christmas. My mum watches all three, every year.","zh":"在德国，每年圣诞电视上都放那几部老的茜茜电影。我妈每年三部全看。"}],"卡夫卡":[{"npc":"katrin","t":"在办公室","en":"Filling in my third form to get a form. Honestly, Kafka would have loved German admin.","zh":"为了拿一张表，我在填第三张表。说真的，卡夫卡要是看到德国的手续一定很喜欢。"}],"肖邦":[{"npc":"bj_xiaoyu","t":"晚上","en":"Stayed up watching the Chopin Competition livestream from Warsaw. The pianists are younger than me!","zh":"熬夜看华沙肖邦钢琴比赛的直播。那些钢琴家比我还小！"}],"哥白尼":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"假期","en":"On holiday in Poland I went to Frombork to see where Copernicus is buried. As a physicist it felt like visiting family.","zh":"在波兰度假时我去了弗龙堡，看哥白尼葬在哪儿。作为物理学家，感觉像去看家人。"}],"苏格拉底":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"周五","en":"I take my class to the Ancient Agora and ask them questions until they get annoyed. That's the lesson.","zh":"我带学生去古市集，一直问他们问题，问到他们烦。这就是那一课。"}],"加加林":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"4 月 12 日","en":"Our office does a Yuri's Night party every April 12. Space snacks, bad rocket costumes.","zh":"我们公司每年 4 月 12 号都开「尤里之夜」派对。太空零食，很烂的火箭服装。"}],"托尔斯泰":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"读书会","en":"Our book club is reading Anna Karenina, eighty pages a week. Half of them are only here for the cake.","zh":"我们读书会在读《安娜·卡列尼娜》，一周八十页。一半人其实是来吃蛋糕的。"}],"柴可夫斯基":[{"npc":"jess","t":"十二月","en":"My office does The Nutcracker every December. This year I finally stayed awake for the whole thing.","zh":"我们公司每年十二月都去看《胡桃夹子》。今年我终于从头到尾没睡着。"}],"普希金":[{"npc":"ngozi","t":"上课","en":"I told my class that Russia's greatest poet had an African great-grandfather. The whole room went 'Wait, what?'","zh":"我跟学生说，俄国最伟大的诗人有个非洲曾外祖父。全班都「等等，什么？」"}],"安徒生":[{"npc":"elin","t":"周末","en":"We crossed the bridge to Copenhagen to see the Little Mermaid. My kids said, 'That's it?'","zh":"我们过桥去哥本哈根看小美人鱼。我家孩子说：「就这？」"}],"李斯特":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"刷视频时","en":"Just learned fans in the 1840s kept Liszt's coffee dregs in little bottles. Okay, we're not that bad.","zh":"刚知道 1840 年代的粉丝把李斯特喝剩的咖啡渣装在小瓶子里。好吧，我们还没那么疯。"}],"特斯拉":[{"npc":"tobias_sim","t":"店里","en":"A customer asked if Tesla was a real person. I showed him a photo of Nikola Tesla. He thought it was Elon Musk's grandad.","zh":"有个顾客问特斯拉是不是真有这个人。我给他看了尼古拉·特斯拉的照片。他以为是马斯克的爷爷。"}],"贝克汉姆":[{"npc":"kofi","t":"周六","en":"A dad came in with a photo of Beckham's 2002 mohawk and asked for it — for himself, not his son.","zh":"有个爸爸拿着贝克汉姆 2002 年莫西干头的照片进来，要剪这个——给他自己剪，不是给儿子。"}],"汉密尔顿":[{"npc":"paolo","t":"周日","en":"Forty years I've watched Ferrari. Seeing Hamilton win in red — I cried on the sofa.","zh":"我看法拉利看了四十年。看到汉密尔顿开着红车赢了——我在沙发上哭了。"}],"艾德·希兰":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"演唱会后","en":"Saw him at Wembley — one man, one guitar, ninety thousand people singing. My voice is gone.","zh":"在温布利看了他——一个人一把吉他，九万人一起唱。我嗓子哑了。"}],"阿黛尔":[{"npc":"lisa","t":"夜班前","en":"Got tickets for Adele in Munich! I swapped three night shifts for it.","zh":"抢到阿黛尔慕尼黑演唱会的票了！为了这个我换了三个夜班。"}],"姆巴佩":[{"npc":"alvaro","t":"周末","en":"My dad's had a Bernabéu season ticket for thirty years. Now he only talks about Mbappé.","zh":"我爸有三十年伯纳乌的季票。现在他嘴里只有姆巴佩。"}],"纳达尔":[{"npc":"paco","t":"比赛那天","en":"When Nadal played his last match, half the street watched on the little TV in my kiosk.","zh":"纳达尔打最后一场比赛那天，半条街的人挤在我彩票亭的小电视前看。"}],"费德勒":[{"npc":"oliver","t":"夏天","en":"I queued all night in Wimbledon Park once, just to see Federer play. Totally worth it.","zh":"我有一次在温布尔登公园排了一整夜的队，就为了看费德勒打球。值。"}],"林肯":[{"npc":"marcus_bank","t":"周五下午","en":"A tourist asked me today who's on the five-dollar bill. Lincoln, I said — and the Lincoln Memorial is on the back. She flipped it over and laughed.","zh":"今天有个游客问我五美元上是谁。我说林肯——背面就是林肯纪念堂。她把钱翻过来一看就笑了。"}],"马丁·路德·金":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"出差回来","en":"Had a free afternoon at a conference in Atlanta, so I walked to Ebenezer Baptist Church on Auburn Avenue. Sat in the pews for a long time.","zh":"在亚特兰大开会空出一个下午，我走到奥本大道上的埃比尼泽浸信会教堂，在长椅上坐了很久。"}],"罗莎·帕克斯":[{"npc":"jake","t":"春游那天","en":"Took my eighth graders to the Henry Ford Museum near Detroit. The Rosa Parks bus was the only thing that made all of them go quiet.","zh":"带八年级学生去了底特律旁边的亨利·福特博物馆。全场只有罗莎·帕克斯那辆公交车能让他们一下子都安静下来。"}],"海明威":[{"npc":"jess","t":"度假回来","en":"Took a taxi out to Finca Vigía outside Havana. You can't go inside — you peek through the open windows at his books and typewriter.","zh":"在哈瓦那打车去了郊外的瞭望庄园。不能进屋，只能从开着的窗户往里看他的书和打字机。"}],"马尔克斯":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"周日下午","en":"My daughter binged the Netflix series, so now she's finally reading my old copy of Cien años de soledad. The pages are falling out.","zh":"女儿一口气看完了 Netflix 的剧，现在终于开始读我那本旧的《百年孤独》了。书页都快散了。"}],"聂鲁达":[{"npc":"pablo","t":"语言交换活动后","en":"I walked my group past the Casa de las Flores in Argüelles — Neruda lived there in the 1930s. Then everyone read one line of his out loud.","zh":"我带大家路过阿圭列斯区的花之家——聂鲁达三十年代住过那儿。然后每人大声念了他的一句诗。"}],"米斯特拉尔":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"旅行途中","en":"Came to the Elqui Valley for the stars, and stopped in Montegrande at the little school-house where Gabriela Mistral lived as a girl. Tiny desks, huge mountains.","zh":"来埃尔基山谷是为了看星星，路上在蒙特格兰德停了一下，看了米斯特拉尔小时候住过的乡村小学。课桌小小的，山大大的。"}],"玻利瓦尔":[{"npc":"diego","t":"下课后","en":"My Venezuelan classmate says every town back home has a Plaza Bolívar. In economics we learn about the other bolívar — the currency that lost so many zeros.","zh":"委内瑞拉同学说，他们那儿每个镇都有一个玻利瓦尔广场。我们经济课学的是另一个「玻利瓦尔」——去掉了好多个零的那种钱。"}],"马克·吐温":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"放暑假回美国","en":"Drove my wife and daughter down to Hannibal, Missouri. My daughter tried to paint the Tom Sawyer fence — I had to explain the story in Japanese.","zh":"开车带太太和女儿去了密苏里的汉尼拔。女儿想去刷汤姆·索亚那道白篱笆——我只好用日语把故事讲了一遍。"}],"华特·迪士尼":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"周六晚上","en":"Annual pass finally paid for itself. Filmed the castle at night for my channel — 40 seconds of video, three hours of crowds.","zh":"年卡终于回本了。晚上给频道拍了城堡——视频 40 秒，人挤了三个小时。"}],"猫王":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"夜班快下班时","en":"A guy filled up here on his way to Memphis — he was driving all the way to Graceland. I told him my dad played Elvis tapes on every road trip.","zh":"有个人在我这儿加油，说要一路开到孟菲斯去看雅园。我跟他说，我爸以前每次开长途都放猫王的磁带。"}],"迈克尔·杰克逊":[{"npc":"tony","t":"周五下班后","en":"I took the new interns up to Harlem to see the Apollo. Before Michael Jackson was famous, he was just a kid on that stage — that's the pitch I want them to remember.","zh":"我带新来的实习生去哈莱姆看阿波罗剧院。迈克尔·杰克逊出名之前，也只是那个台上的一个小孩——我想让他们记住的就是这一点。"}],"玛丽莲·梦露":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"周日晚场前","en":"We're showing Some Like It Hot tonight for her centenary. I thought only old people would come, but half the queue is students like me.","zh":"今晚为了她诞辰一百年放《热情似火》。我以为只有老人会来，结果排队的一半是跟我一样的学生。"}],"鲍勃·马利":[{"npc":"kofi","t":"周六下午","en":"A regular came back from Kingston and showed me photos of the Bob Marley Museum while I cut his hair. Same songs we play in the shop every Saturday.","zh":"一个老顾客从金斯敦回来，我给他剪头的时候他给我看鲍勃·马利博物馆的照片。都是我们店里每个周六放的那些歌。"}],"夏奇拉":[{"npc":"valeria","t":"演唱会那周","en":"Shakira played the Estadio GNP again and again this year. I made little hoop earrings for the fans — sold out before the first show.","zh":"夏奇拉今年在 GNP 体育场开了一场又一场。我给歌迷做了一批小圆圈耳环，第一场还没开就卖完了。"}],"泰勒·斯威夫特":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"周一早上","en":"Our whole office went to Wembley for the Eras Tour. I'm the one who organised the group tickets — and I'm still chasing two people for the money.","zh":"我们整个办公室一起去温布利看了 Eras 巡演。团票是我组织的——到现在还有两个人没把钱转给我。"}],"碧昂丝":[{"npc":"sarah","t":"六月底的周末","en":"I drove from Austin to Houston for her hometown show at NRG. Took the whole weekend off — first time since I started the company.","zh":"我从奥斯汀开车去休斯敦，看她在 NRG 体育场的家乡场。整个周末都没工作——开公司以来还是第一次。"}],"贾斯汀·比伯":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"周日一日游","en":"We drove to Stratford for a play and walked past the Avon Theatre steps. My niece made me take a photo — apparently that's where Bieber used to busk.","zh":"我们开车去斯特拉特福看戏，路过雅芳剧院门口的台阶。我侄女非要我拍张照——听说比伯以前就在那儿卖唱。"}],"MrBeast":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"午休时","en":"Lunch with a friend at YouTube's San Bruno office, and all we talked about was MrBeast thumbnails. Big face, one object, almost no words — I design like that now.","zh":"去圣布鲁诺的 YouTube 办公室找朋友吃午饭，聊的全是 MrBeast 的封面图。大脸、一个东西、几乎不放字——我现在做设计也这样了。"}],"迈克尔·乔丹":[{"npc":"andre","t":"周六店里最忙的时候","en":"A new Jordan 1 colourway dropped this morning and the line went round the block. Some of these kids weren't born when he retired.","zh":"今天早上新出了一款 Jordan 1 配色，排队排到街角。这里面有些孩子，乔丹退役的时候还没出生呢。"}],"贝利":[{"npc":"bia","t":"周日下午","en":"Took my nephew to the Football Museum under the Pacaembu stands. He ran straight to the Pelé part and wouldn't leave.","zh":"带外甥去了帕卡恩布球场看台下面的足球博物馆。他直接跑到讲贝利的那块，怎么都不肯走。"}],"塞纳":[{"npc":"ana","t":"跟柏林同事聊天时","en":"My dad still talks about watching Senna win at Interlagos in '91. In São Paulo, every family has a Senna story.","zh":"我爸到现在还会说 91 年看塞纳在因特拉格斯赢的那场。在圣保罗，每家都有一个关于塞纳的故事。"}],"梅西":[{"npc":"mateo","t":"周日看完球回家","en":"Went to watch Newell's at the Marcelo Bielsa today. Every kid around me knew Messi started in their youth teams.","zh":"今天去马塞洛·贝尔萨球场看纽维尔老男孩。我旁边每个小孩都知道，梅西是从他们的青训出来的。"}],"勒布朗·詹姆斯":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"晚上跟老家视频时","en":"My brother in Ohio still has his 2016 Cavs shirt framed. He says that night he hugged strangers in the street.","zh":"我在俄亥俄的哥哥还把 2016 年骑士队的球衣裱起来挂着。他说那天晚上他在街上跟陌生人拥抱。"}],"斯蒂芬·库里":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"下班坐车回家","en":"Asked the robotaxi to drop me near Chase Center and the whole street was blue and gold. Curry game night.","zh":"让无人车把我放在大通中心附近，整条街都是蓝色和金色。今晚有库里的比赛。"}],"西蒙·拜尔斯":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"和室友看重播时","en":"We watched Simone's vault on replay like ten times. My roommate tried a cartwheel after and nearly hit the TV.","zh":"我们把 Simone 的跳马重播看了大概十遍。我室友看完想翻个侧手翻，差点撞到电视。"}],"菲尔普斯":[{"npc":"jake","t":"体育课后","en":"Took my class to the city pool today. One boy asked how many laps Phelps swam a day. I said, \"More than you want to know.\"","zh":"今天带学生去市里的游泳池。有个男孩问菲尔普斯一天游多少圈，我说：「比你想知道的还多。」"}],"小威廉姆斯":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"晚班快结束时","en":"A dad came in with two girls holding rackets, on their way to the public courts. I told them, \"That's how the Williams sisters started.\"","zh":"一个爸爸带着两个拿球拍的女孩进店，说要去公共球场。我跟她们说：「威廉姆斯姐妹就是这么开始的。」"}],"内马尔":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"周末路过王子公园球场","en":"Walked past the Parc des Princes and still saw a kid in a Neymar PSG shirt. My Brazilian heart was happy.","zh":"路过王子公园球场，还看到一个小孩穿着内马尔的巴黎球衣。我这颗巴西心挺开心的。"}],"颐和园":[{"npc":"bj_liu","t":"周三早上","en":"Our dance group meets by the east gate at seven. After dancing I walk the Long Corridor once — slowly, the paintings change every few steps.","zh":"我们舞蹈队早上七点在东宫门集合。跳完我总要走一趟长廊——慢慢走，走几步画就不一样了。"}],"天安门":[{"npc":"bj_zhao","t":"国庆早上","en":"My grandson wanted to see the flag-raising, so we got in line at three a.m. I brought a folding stool and hot tea. He fell asleep five minutes before it started.","zh":"孙子要看升旗，我们凌晨三点就去排队。我带了马扎和一壶热茶。他在升旗前五分钟睡着了。"}],"避暑山庄":[{"npc":"bj_laozhou","t":"夏天周末","en":"Every summer my old army mates and I drive to Chengde to get out of the Beijing heat. We sit by the lake, play cards, and argue about which emperor had it best.","zh":"每年夏天我跟几个老战友开车去承德躲北京的热。坐在湖边打牌，争哪个皇帝最会享福。"}],"赵州桥":[{"npc":"lt_qianlao","t":"十一假期","en":"I finally saw it in person. I stood under the small arches for ages working out the load path. My wife says I spent more time under the bridge than on it.","zh":"终于亲眼看到了。我在小拱下面站了半天，算它的受力。老伴说我在桥下待的时间比在桥上还长。"}],"悬空寺":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"秋天的旅行","en":"I teach my students about erosion and cliffs — this one I had to see. The walkways are so narrow two people can't pass. I held the rail the whole way.","zh":"我给学生讲侵蚀和悬崖，这个地方一定要来看。走廊窄到两个人错不开身，我一路都抓着栏杆。"}],"应县木塔":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"暑假","en":"I've shown photos of this pagoda in class for twenty years. Standing under it, I just kept counting the brackets. My students will hear about it all term.","zh":"这座塔的照片我在课上放了二十年。真站到下面，我一直在数斗拱。学生们这学期有得听了。"}],"五台山":[{"npc":"lt_zhangyeye","t":"秋天","en":"I went with my old colleagues from school. The mountain air is cold even in September — I wore the jumper my wife packed and didn't complain once.","zh":"跟学校的老同事一起去的。九月山上已经很冷了——我穿上了老伴给我塞的毛衣，一句都没抱怨。"}],"晋祠":[{"npc":"cd_he","t":"春天","en":"I'd read about the Song maids for years. One of them has her mouth half open like she's about to talk back. I stood there smiling like a fool.","zh":"宋代侍女像我读了好多年。有一尊嘴半张着，像要顶嘴。我站在那儿傻笑了半天。"}],"乔家大院":[{"npc":"wang","t":"出差顺路","en":"I work in finance, so I came for the old draft banks. The ledgers on display are neater than some spreadsheets I get at work.","zh":"我做金融的，专门来看票号。展出的旧账本比我工作里收到的有些表格还整齐。"}],"沈阳故宫":[{"npc":"bj_xiaoyu","t":"冬天的周末","en":"As a Forbidden City guide I had to see the 'other' palace. It's small enough to walk in two hours, and the tent-shaped hall is nothing like Beijing.","zh":"我在故宫做讲解，一定要来看看「另一座」皇宫。两个小时就能走完，那座像帐篷的大殿跟北京完全不一样。"}],"上海中心大厦":[{"npc":"lt_xiaoma","t":"工作日中午","en":"I deliver lunch to offices up there. Going up takes less than a minute; getting through security takes ten. Customers on floor 90 always tip a bit more.","zh":"我常给楼上的公司送午饭。电梯上去不到一分钟，过安检要十分钟。九十层的客人小费总给得多一点。"}],"豫园":[{"npc":"fang","t":"周末早上","en":"Tip: come before nine, eat soup dumplings first, then walk the garden while the tour groups are still at breakfast.","zh":"小窍门：九点前来，先吃小笼，再逛园子——那时旅行团还在吃早饭。"}],"周庄水乡":[{"npc":"lt_xiaoyun","t":"淡季的周二","en":"I went to see how guesthouses here survive the quiet season. One owner cooks for her guests herself; I stayed two nights just for her braised pork knuckle.","zh":"想看看这里的民宿淡季怎么活。有个老板娘亲自给客人做饭，我为了她的红烧蹄髈多住了一晚。"}],"中山陵":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"周末","en":"Took the train from Shanghai with classmates for a weekend in Nanjing. We counted the steps on the way up and all got different numbers.","zh":"跟同学从上海坐高铁来南京过周末。爬台阶时我们一起数，结果每个人数的都不一样。"}],"乌镇":[{"npc":"linxiao","t":"秋天","en":"I came for a client's event during the internet conference. At night I skipped the dinner and took a boat through the West zone instead — best decision of the trip.","zh":"互联网大会期间来给客户办活动。晚上我没去饭局，去西栅坐了船——这趟最对的决定。"}],"普陀山":[{"npc":"lt_axiang","t":"农历二月十九","en":"Every year I take my mum to Putuo for Guanyin's birthday. We get the first boat, and I still bargain with the incense sellers — habit.","zh":"每年观音生日我都陪我妈去普陀。坐头班船，跟卖香的我照样砍价——职业病。"}],"宏村":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"清明假期","en":"I went in the rain. The art students under their umbrellas were sketching the pond, and I just sat and watched them draw for an hour.","zh":"下雨天去的。美院学生打着伞画月沼，我就坐着看他们画了一个小时。"}],"福建土楼":[{"npc":"lt_meimei","t":"国庆假期","en":"Stayed one night in a tulou guesthouse! The auntie downstairs made us peanut tea, and I could hear everyone's TV across the courtyard. So noisy, so cosy.","zh":"在土楼民宿住了一晚！楼下阿姨给我们煮花生汤，整个天井都听得到各家的电视。好吵，也好暖。"}],"鼓浪屿":[{"npc":"zhou_vet","t":"年假","en":"Half the cats on Gulangyu seem to be fed by cafés. I couldn't stop checking whether they'd been neutered — yes, most had a clipped ear.","zh":"鼓浪屿的猫一半像是咖啡店养的。我忍不住看它们有没有绝育——大部分耳朵都剪了个小口。"}],"滕王阁":[{"npc":"ajie","t":"周末","en":"Flew to Nanchang for a work thing and stayed Sunday. Recited the one line I remember from school on the top floor — the guide finished it for me.","zh":"来南昌出差，多留了个周日。在顶楼背了句上学时记得的——导游帮我把后半句接上了。"}],"黄鹤楼":[{"npc":"emma","t":"春天","en":"I took the metro under the Yangtze to get here — under the river! Then on the top floor a granny recited the poem for me and made me repeat it.","zh":"我坐地铁从长江底下过来的——江底下！到了顶楼，一位奶奶给我背那首诗，还让我跟着念。"}],"三峡大坝":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"秋天的游轮上","en":"Our cruise went through the locks at night. Five steps down, very slowly. I stayed on deck with a blanket — a geography teacher can't sleep through that.","zh":"游轮晚上过船闸，五级一级级往下降，很慢。我裹着毯子在甲板上看——地理老师怎么能睡过去。"}],"凤凰古城":[{"npc":"chen","t":"冬天淡季","en":"I came in winter when it's quiet. Morning jog along the Tuo River, the locals washing clothes on the stone steps — not a bar open yet.","zh":"冬天淡季来的，人少。早上沿着沱江跑步，本地人在石阶上洗衣服，酒吧一家都还没开。"}],"岳阳楼":[{"npc":"lt_laochen","t":"去看亲戚","en":"My nephew lives in Yueyang. We climbed the tower, then he took me for fried fish by the lake. The radio in the tea stall was playing local opera, not my Shanghai pingtan.","zh":"侄子住在岳阳。登完楼他带我去湖边吃炸鱼。茶摊收音机放的是花鼓戏，不是我们上海的评弹。"}],"广州塔":[{"npc":"chenjie","t":"客户来的时候","en":"Whenever buyers fly in, I take them on the river cruise to see the tower lit up. Deals go better after that — I'm serious.","zh":"每次有采购商来，我都带他们坐珠江夜游看塔亮灯。看完谈生意都顺一点——真的。"}],"洪崖洞":[{"npc":"cd_akun","t":"演出间隙","en":"Our troupe performed in Chongqing for a week. After the show, still in half my make-up, I went to Hongyadong for midnight noodles. Nobody even looked twice.","zh":"我们剧团在重庆演了一周。演完我脸上妆还没卸干净就去洪崖洞吃夜宵小面，居然没人多看一眼。"}],"乐山大佛":[{"npc":"cd_zhang","t":"周末","en":"Took the bus with my mahjong friends. We queued an hour for the stairs, then spent the rest of the day eating tofu pudding and bobo chicken in town.","zh":"跟麻将搭子坐大巴去的。排了一小时栈道，剩下一天都在城里吃豆腐脑和钵钵鸡。"}],"都江堰":[{"npc":"cd_laoluo","t":"休息日","en":"I drive out to Dujiangyan on my day off for the cold river fish. The chef there and I argue every time about how much pepper is too much.","zh":"休息日我开车去都江堰吃冷水鱼。那儿的师傅跟我每次都要争花椒放多少才算多。"}],"西夏王陵":[{"npc":"xa_ma","t":"回老家过年","en":"My cousins live in Yinchuan. They took me to the tombs in the wind — sand in my teeth, but standing by those huge mounds made my shop feel very small.","zh":"表兄弟住在银川，大风天带我去了王陵。牙里都是沙，可站在那么大的土堆边，觉得我的馆子好小。"}],"大三巴牌坊":[{"npc":"aqiang","t":"周日","en":"From Shenzhen it's an hour to Macau now. I took a photo at the ruins for my mum, then ate a pork chop bun and went back for the evening shift.","zh":"现在从深圳过去澳门一个小时。在大三巴给我妈拍了张照，吃了个猪扒包就回去上晚班了。"}],"澳门大三巴":[{"npc":"amara","t":"转机的下午","en":"A long layover in Hong Kong, so I took the ferry to Macau. Climbed the steps, ate three egg tarts on the way down, and made the flight with ten minutes to spare.","zh":"在香港转机时间长，我坐船去了澳门。爬完台阶，下来路上吃了三个蛋挞，赶上飞机只剩十分钟。"}],"壶口瀑布":[{"npc":"xa_zhang","t":"夏天","en":"We went with my opera group. Standing by the falls, old Liu started singing a Qinqiang line — you couldn't hear a word, the water was louder than him.","zh":"跟秦腔队的老伙计一起去的。站在瀑布边，老刘吼了一嗓子秦腔——一个字都听不见，水比他还响。"}],"长白山天池":[{"npc":"minjun","t":"夏天休假","en":"Lots of Koreans come to see the lake from the Chinese side. We climbed the stairs in fog, and just as we reached the top the clouds opened for two minutes.","zh":"很多韩国人会从中国这边上山看天池。我们在雾里爬台阶，刚到顶上云就散开了两分钟。"}],"吉林雾凇":[{"npc":"aino","t":"一月","en":"Minus 25 and the river was steaming like my sauna. By morning every branch was white. I'm Finnish and even I said wow.","zh":"零下 25 度，江面冒的气像我们桑拿房。第二天早上每根树枝都是白的。我是芬兰人，都忍不住叫了一声。"}],"漠河北极村":[{"npc":"lt_xiaoli","t":"春节假期","en":"I wanted to see the coldest place in China. My phone died in ten minutes, so I kept it inside my jacket and the boss of the guesthouse lent me felt boots.","zh":"想看看中国最冷的地方。手机十分钟就冻关机了，我只好揣在怀里，民宿老板借了我一双毡靴。"}],"庐山":[{"npc":"lt_wangayi","t":"夏天","en":"I saw Romance on Lushan when I was nineteen. Forty years later I watched it again in that little cinema on the mountain — the seats are new, the film isn't.","zh":"我十九岁看的《庐山恋》。四十年后在山上那家小电影院又看了一遍——椅子换新了，片子还是老的。"}],"趵突泉":[{"npc":"lt_laozhou","t":"去济南看朋友","en":"My old friend from the state restaurant days lives in Jinan. He took me to fill a bottle at the spring and made me tea with it. Smoother water than ours, I admit.","zh":"国营饭店时候的老同事住在济南。他带我去打泉水，回去用它泡茶。比我们那儿的水顺，我承认。"}],"洛阳牡丹":[{"npc":"lt_hatsune","t":"四月","en":"I've sold peonies in my shop for fifty years and finally came to Luoyang. Whole streets of them! I took photos of every colour for my customers.","zh":"我店里卖了五十年牡丹，终于来了洛阳。整条街都是！每种颜色我都拍了，回去给客人看。"}],"龙脊梯田":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"国庆假期","en":"A Yao auntie carried my wife's suitcase up the hill in a basket on her back — faster than I could walk with nothing.","zh":"一位瑶族阿姨用背篓把我太太的箱子背上山——比我空手走得还快。"}],"峨眉山":[{"npc":"cd_luo","t":"冬天","en":"A monkey grabbed my friend's bag of sunflower seeds before we even reached the temple. I work with pandas — they are much better behaved.","zh":"还没走到寺庙，一只猴子就把朋友的瓜子抢走了。我是照顾熊猫的——熊猫可乖多了。"}],"黄果树瀑布":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"暑假","en":"Filmed a video behind the waterfall for my channel. Lesson learned: the rain poncho is not optional. My camera survived; my hair did not.","zh":"在瀑布后面给我的频道拍了条视频。教训：雨衣不是可选项。相机活下来了，我的头发没有。"}],"洱海":[{"npc":"wei","t":"远程办公的一个月","en":"I worked from a guesthouse by the lake for a month. Morning calls with the factory in Shenzhen, then an e-bike ride round the lake before lunch.","zh":"在湖边客栈远程办公了一个月。早上跟深圳工厂开会，午饭前骑电动车绕湖一段。"}],"香格里拉":[{"npc":"kenji","t":"夏天","en":"I'm a remote worker so I brought my laptop. Big mistake on day one — altitude headache. On day three I finally walked up to Songzanlin without stopping.","zh":"我远程上班，带着电脑来的。第一天就错了——高原头疼。第三天才终于一口气走到松赞林寺。"}],"石林":[{"npc":"lin","t":"回国过暑假","en":"My family took me to the Stone Forest when I was little. This summer I took my Italian flatmate — she kept saying it looked like the Dolomites shrunk down.","zh":"小时候家里带我来过石林。今年暑假我带意大利室友来，她一直说像缩小版的多洛米蒂山。"}],"纳木错":[{"npc":"linhao","t":"暑假回国","en":"Back from France for the summer, I joined friends driving to Namtso. I walked too fast by the lake and had to sit down. The water was so blue I forgot I was out of breath.","zh":"从法国回来过暑假，跟朋友开车去纳木错。我在湖边走太快，只好坐下。湖水蓝得我都忘了喘不上气。"}],"华山":[{"npc":"xa_ajie","t":"毕业那年夏天","en":"Our dorm climbed Huashan overnight before graduation. Started at 11 p.m. with torches, reached the East Peak at five, and all fell asleep waiting for the sun.","zh":"毕业前我们宿舍夜爬华山。晚上十一点打着手电出发，五点到东峰，等日出的时候全睡着了。"}],"鸣沙山月牙泉":[{"npc":"priya","t":"十月的假期","en":"My first desert! I rode a camel named, apparently, 'Little Black'. Sliding down the dune I got sand in places I didn't know I had.","zh":"第一次去沙漠！我骑的骆驼据说叫「小黑」。滑沙下来，沙子钻进了我都不知道的地方。"}],"七彩丹霞":[{"npc":"minji","t":"拍摄间隙","en":"We shot a magazine story here at sunset. The hills did the styling for me — I just dressed the model in white and stepped back.","zh":"在这儿拍了一组杂志的日落大片。山已经帮我做好造型了——我只给模特穿了白衣服就退到一边。"}],"青海湖":[{"npc":"jiho","t":"夏天","en":"Our running club went to cycle round the lake instead of running. At 3,200 metres I was slower than the yaks. Totally worth it for the rapeseed fields.","zh":"我们跑团去骑车环湖，不跑步了。海拔三千二，我比牦牛还慢。可为了那片油菜花，值。"}],"茶卡盐湖":[{"npc":"bea","t":"七月","en":"I filmed the 'mirror' shot everyone wants. Then I spent ten minutes picking up plastic people had left on the salt — I put that in the video too.","zh":"我拍了大家都想要的「天空之镜」镜头。然后花了十分钟捡别人丢在盐上的塑料——这段我也剪进视频了。"}],"天山天池":[{"npc":"chenjian","t":"出差的周末","en":"I was in Ürümqi for a trade fair and a client drove me up on Sunday. Cold enough for a jacket in July — and the lake was quieter than any meeting room.","zh":"去乌鲁木齐参加展会，周日客户开车带我上山。七月要穿外套——湖边比哪个会议室都安静。"}],"喀纳斯湖":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"九月","en":"I came for the autumn colours and stayed in a Tuvan log cabin at Hemu. The owner's grandmother made me milk tea every morning. No monster sighted.","zh":"我来看秋色，住在禾木图瓦人的木屋。房东奶奶每天早上给我煮奶茶。湖怪没看到。"}],"日月潭":[{"npc":"mei","t":"寒假","en":"My friends and I biked part of the lakeside path and then took the boat back because our legs gave up. Tea eggs at the pier are a must.","zh":"我跟朋友骑了一段环湖步道，腿不行了就坐船回来。码头的茶叶蛋一定要吃。"}],"阿里山":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"年假","en":"Flew from Singapore just to ride the reopened train. Fog the whole way up, but at four a.m. on Zhushan the clouds turned pink. Worth every hour of lost sleep.","zh":"专程从新加坡飞来坐重新通车的小火车。上山一路都是雾，凌晨四点在祝山，云海变成粉色。少睡的觉都值了。"}],"内蒙古草原":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"工厂参观的那周","en":"I visited a dairy plant near Hohhot for work. On the last day they took us out to the grassland — I'd never seen so many cows and so few fences.","zh":"出差去呼和浩特参观一家乳品厂。最后一天他们带我们去草原——从没见过这么多牛、这么少的栅栏。"}],"冰糖葫芦":[{"npc":"bj_liu","t":"腊月庙会","en":"At the temple fair I bought my granddaughter a hawthorn skewer. She asked for strawberry instead — I still prefer the sour old kind.","zh":"庙会上给孙女买了一串糖葫芦，她非要草莓的。我还是喜欢老山楂那个酸劲儿。"}],"铜锅涮肉":[{"npc":"bj_laozhou","t":"立冬那天","en":"First cold day of the year, the whole lane went for copper-pot lamb. I always fix my bike first, then come for the second round.","zh":"立冬那天胡同里的人一起去涮肉。我每回先修完车，再赶第二轮。"}],"老陈醋":[{"npc":"fang","t":"去山西拍美食的那周","en":"Filming in Qingxu, the shop owner let me taste vinegar aged five years. It wasn't sharp at all — almost like dark fruit.","zh":"在清徐拍视频，老板让我尝了一口放了五年的醋，一点不冲，有点像深色的果子。"}],"汾酒":[{"npc":"bj_zhao","t":"过年","en":"My old workmate sends me a bottle of Fenjiu every Spring Festival. We each drink one small cup and talk about the factory days.","zh":"老同事每年过年给我送一瓶汾酒，我们一人就喝一小杯，聊聊当年厂里的事。"}],"马奶酒":[{"npc":"xa_ajie","t":"暑假去草原","en":"On the grassland trip a herder's family gave us a bowl of mare's milk. Sour and fizzy — I finished it so I wouldn't be rude.","zh":"暑假去草原，牧民家端来一碗马奶酒，又酸又有点冒泡。我还是喝完了，怕不礼貌。"}],"锅包肉":[{"npc":"emma","t":"一月去哈尔滨","en":"Minus twenty outside, and we warmed up with a huge plate of guobaorou. Sweet, sour, crunchy — I ordered a second one.","zh":"外面零下二十度，我们靠一大盘锅包肉暖过来。又甜又酸又脆，我又点了一盘。"}],"生煎包":[{"npc":"lt_laochen","t":"早上开报刊亭前","en":"Every morning before opening the kiosk, four shengjian and a soup. Thirty years, and I still burn my tongue sometimes.","zh":"每天早上开报刊亭前，四个生煎一碗汤。吃了三十年，有时候还是会烫到舌头。"}],"本帮菜馆":[{"npc":"fang","t":"带 Emma 去吃饭","en":"I took Emma for proper Shanghainese food. She thought the shrimp were too sweet — then ate the whole plate.","zh":"带 Emma 去吃本帮菜。她说油爆虾太甜了——然后一个人吃完了一盘。"}],"安福路brunch":[{"npc":"linxiao","t":"周六上午","en":"Saturday brunch on Anfu Road is half work for me — I count which café the new brands are posting about.","zh":"周六在安福路吃早午餐，对我来说一半是上班：看新品牌都在哪家店拍照。"}],"黄河路美食街":[{"npc":"ajie","t":"周五下班后","en":"After Blossoms aired, my mum dragged me to Huanghe Road to queue for dinner. She said it looked just like the nineties.","zh":"《繁花》播完，我妈拉我去黄河路排队吃饭，她说跟九十年代一模一样。"}],"淄博烧烤":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"2023 年五一","en":"My classmates and I took the barbecue train to Zibo. We grilled, rolled, ate — and the stall owner gave us free drinks for coming so far.","zh":"五一跟同学坐「烧烤专列」去淄博，自己烤、自己卷，老板说我们来得远，送了饮料。"}],"盐水鸭":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"国庆去南京","en":"My Nanjing friend said I couldn't leave without salted duck. We bought half a duck and ate it on the hotel balcony.","zh":"南京的朋友说不吃盐水鸭不许走。我们买了半只，在酒店阳台上吃完了。"}],"扬州炒饭":[{"npc":"cd_laoluo","t":"店里收工后","en":"After closing, I make fried rice from the leftover rice for the staff. Day-old rice is the secret — fresh rice turns to mush.","zh":"收工后我用剩米饭给伙计们炒饭。隔夜饭才炒得散，新饭一炒就糊。"}],"东坡肉":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"周末请外地同学吃饭","en":"When classmates visit Hangzhou, I always order Dongpo pork. One square each — nobody ever wants to share theirs.","zh":"外地同学来杭州，我一定点东坡肉。一人一块，谁都不肯分给别人。"}],"绍兴黄酒":[{"npc":"wang","t":"秋天吃大闸蟹","en":"At our team's crab dinner, the boss warmed a jug of Shaoxing wine. It's the only time I drink at work dinners.","zh":"秋天部门聚餐吃大闸蟹，领导温了一壶黄酒。这是我唯一会在饭局上喝的酒。"}],"佛跳墙":[{"npc":"mei","t":"除夕","en":"Every New Year's Eve my grandma orders a jar of Buddha Jumps Over the Wall. We kids just fight over the quail eggs.","zh":"每年除夕阿嬷都会订一坛佛跳墙，我们小孩只抢里面的鹌鹑蛋。"}],"胡辣汤":[{"npc":"xa_ajie","t":"坐火车路过郑州","en":"Changing trains in Zhengzhou at 7 a.m., I followed the queue to a hulatang stall. The pepper woke me up better than coffee.","zh":"早上七点在郑州换车，跟着排队的人喝了一碗胡辣汤，胡椒比咖啡还提神。"}],"热干面":[{"npc":"fang","t":"去武汉拍过早","en":"Filming breakfast in Wuhan, I saw people eating hot dry noodles while walking to the bus. I tried it and dropped sesame paste on my shirt.","zh":"去武汉拍「过早」，看到大家边走边吃热干面去赶公交。我也试了，麻酱滴了一衣服。"}],"剁椒鱼头":[{"npc":"cd_laoluo","t":"去长沙学菜","en":"Our Sichuan heat is numbing; Hunan heat is sour and fresh. I copied the fish head idea for my shop — customers love the leftover sauce with noodles.","zh":"川菜的辣是麻，湘菜的辣是酸鲜。我学了剁椒鱼头回来，客人最爱拿剩下的汤汁拌面。"}],"潮汕牛肉火锅":[{"npc":"chenjie","t":"跟客户吃饭","en":"I take my clients for Chaoshan beef hot pot. I count the seconds for them — eight for diaolong — and they think I'm a pro.","zh":"带客户吃潮汕牛肉火锅，我帮他们数秒，吊龙涮八秒，他们都以为我是行家。"}],"文昌鸡":[{"npc":"aqiang","t":"春节带家里人去海南","en":"On our Hainan trip, my son ate three bowls of chicken-fat rice and barely touched the chicken. My wife and I finished the bird.","zh":"春节带全家去海南，儿子光吃鸡油饭就吃了三碗，鸡都是我跟老婆吃完的。"}],"过桥米线":[{"npc":"cd_luo","t":"去昆明开志愿者交流会","en":"At the Kunming meet-up, nobody told me the soup was that hot under the oil. I learned fast — put the meat in first.","zh":"去昆明开志愿者交流会，没人告诉我那层油底下的汤那么烫。我很快学会了：先放肉。"}],"鲜花饼":[{"npc":"bj_xiaoyu","t":"从云南旅行回来","en":"I brought back three boxes of flower cakes for the other volunteers. They were gone before lunch.","zh":"从云南带回三盒鲜花饼给讲解志愿者们，中午还没到就分完了。"}],"酥油茶":[{"npc":"cd_he","t":"退休后去拉萨","en":"In Lhasa a family invited me in for butter tea. Every time I took a sip, the grandmother filled it up again.","zh":"退休后去拉萨，一户人家请我喝酥油茶。我每喝一口，阿妈就给我添满。"}],"肉夹馍":[{"npc":"xa_zhang","t":"早上唱完秦腔","en":"After singing opera in the park, I get a roujiamo from the same stall. The owner knows — extra juice, no green pepper.","zh":"早上在公园唱完秦腔，去老摊子买个肉夹馍。老板都知道：多浇汁，不要青椒。"}],"宁夏枸杞":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"上课的时候","en":"My students laugh at the goji in my thermos. I tell them: wait until you've taught for twenty years.","zh":"学生笑我保温杯里泡枸杞。我说：等你们教二十年书就懂了。"}],"哈密瓜":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"夏天宿舍里","en":"In summer our dorm buys one Hami melon and splits it four ways. Whoever cuts it gets the last pick.","zh":"夏天宿舍四个人合买一个哈密瓜，谁切瓜谁最后挑。"}],"菠萝包":[{"npc":"amara","t":"在香港转机","en":"On a Hong Kong layover I always find a cha chaan teng for a bo lo yau. The butter melting into the warm bun — worth the jet lag.","zh":"在香港转机，我总会找家茶餐厅吃个菠萝油。冻黄油在热面包里化开，倒时差都值了。"}],"士林夜市":[{"npc":"mei","t":"期末考完","en":"After exams we went to Shilin and shared one giant fried chicken between three. Then I went back to work at the drink shop.","zh":"期末考完跟同学去士林，三个人分一块大鸡排。吃完我又回饮料店上班了。"}],"山西老陈醋":[{"npc":"xa_ma","t":"店里进货","en":"I buy vinegar from Qingxu for the shop. Customers say my pickled garlic tastes better — it's the vinegar.","zh":"店里的醋我从清徐进。客人说我的糖蒜好吃——其实是醋好。"}],"蒙古包子":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"出差去乌兰巴托","en":"On a work trip to Ulaanbaatar, a colleague's mother made buuz for us. I tried to fold one — mine fell apart in the steamer.","zh":"去乌兰巴托出差，同事的妈妈给我们做包子。我试着包了一个，进锅就散了。"}],"阿莫克鱼":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"去金边玩","en":"In Phnom Penh I ordered amok to compare it with my mum's hor mok. Hers is spicier, theirs is creamier. Don't tell her.","zh":"去金边点了阿莫克鱼，想跟我妈做的 hor mok 比一比。她的更辣，这个更绵。别告诉她。"}],"老挝糯米饭":[{"npc":"somchai","t":"午饭","en":"My office lunch is still a little basket of sticky rice from the Lao stall downstairs. Hands only — the young staff laugh at me.","zh":"我中午还是去楼下老挝小摊买一小篮糯米饭，只用手吃。年轻同事都笑我。"}],"鱼汤米线":[{"npc":"amara","t":"在仰光过夜","en":"On a Yangon layover I had mohinga at 6 a.m. on a plastic stool. The best breakfast of the whole month.","zh":"在仰光过夜，早上六点坐在塑料小板凳上吃了一碗鱼汤米线，这个月最好吃的早饭。"}],"尼泊尔馍馍":[{"npc":"kavya","t":"去尼泊尔徒步前","en":"Before our trek, we ate momos in Kathmandu three nights in a row. Jhol momo was my favourite.","zh":"去徒步前在加德满都连吃了三晚 momo，我最爱泡在汤里的那种。"}],"马尔代夫金枪鱼咖喱":[{"npc":"priyanka","t":"在马累转船","en":"Waiting for the ferry in Malé, I tried tuna curry with roshi at a tea shop. Much cheaper than the resort, and tastier.","zh":"在马累等船时，在小茶馆吃了金枪鱼咖喱配薄饼。比度假村便宜多了，也更好吃。"}],"别什巴尔马克":[{"npc":"emre","t":"朋友的婚礼","en":"At my Kazakh friend's wedding, they served beshbarmak on giant plates. I asked for a fork — everyone else used their hands.","zh":"去哈萨克朋友的婚礼，别什巴尔马克装在大盘子里。我要了把叉子，别人都是用手。"}],"拉普拉普":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"年假去瓦努阿图","en":"On holiday in Vanuatu, a village family let me help wrap laplap in banana leaves. Mine was the messiest parcel.","zh":"年假去瓦努阿图，村里一家人让我帮着用香蕉叶包 laplap，我包的那个最乱。"}],"帕劳芋头":[{"npc":"haruto","t":"去帕劳潜水","en":"After a dive day in Palau, the guide's family served boiled taro. Plain, filling, and perfect after six hours in the sea.","zh":"在帕劳潜了一天水，导游家里给我们煮了芋头。没什么味道，但很顶饱，在海里泡了六小时后刚刚好。"}],"面包果":[{"npc":"bea","t":"拍家乡食物的视频","en":"We have breadfruit in the Philippines too — I made a video comparing ours with Pohnpei's. The comments had a big debate.","zh":"菲律宾也有面包果，我拍了个视频跟波纳佩的比一比，评论区吵翻了。"}],"阿德莱德中央市场":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"去阿德莱德看朋友","en":"Visiting a mate in Adelaide, we spent Saturday morning at the Central Market. I ate more free cheese samples than I should have.","zh":"去阿德莱德看朋友，周六早上在中央市场逛了一上午。我试吃的奶酪比该吃的多多了。"}],"山形樱桃":[{"npc":"tanaka","t":"六月","en":"Every June my sister in Yamagata sends a box of Satonishiki. I share them with the neighbours, three each.","zh":"每年六月，山形的妹妹都给我寄一盒佐藤锦。我分给邻居，一家三颗。"}],"札幌拉面":[{"npc":"kenji","t":"冬天出差去札幌","en":"On a winter work trip to Sapporo, I had miso ramen with butter in a tiny alley shop. My glasses fogged up completely.","zh":"冬天去札幌出差，在小巷里吃了一碗加黄油的味噌拉面，眼镜全起雾了。"}],"韩式烤肉":[{"npc":"minjun","t":"周五会食","en":"Friday team dinner was pork belly again. My boss grills, I cut, and the new guy pours the soju.","zh":"周五会食又是烤五花肉。部长烤，我剪，新来的倒烧酒。"}],"芒果糯米饭":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"四月芒果季","en":"In April I buy mango sticky rice from the same cart near my office. The aunty gives me extra beans because I come every day.","zh":"四月芒果季，我每天都去公司楼下那辆推车买芒果糯米饭。阿姨说我天天来，多给我撒豆子。"}],"越南法棍":[{"npc":"seoyeon","t":"去胡志明市度假","en":"In Ho Chi Minh City I had bánh mì for breakfast every day. I asked for no coriander once — the seller looked so sad I took it back.","zh":"去胡志明市度假，每天早上都吃法棍。有一次我说不要香菜，老板一脸失望，我又说要了。"}],"越南滴漏咖啡":[{"npc":"mai","t":"写代码之前","en":"Before our team starts coding, we sit outside and wait for the phin to drip. It takes five minutes — that's our meeting.","zh":"我们团队开工写代码前，先坐在外面等滴漏咖啡滴完。要五分钟——那就是我们的晨会。"}],"海南鸡饭":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"午休","en":"My lunch is chicken rice at least twice a week. Same stall, same uncle, same extra chilli.","zh":"我一周至少吃两次鸡饭。同一个摊，同一个 uncle，同样多加辣椒。"}],"榴莲":[{"npc":"weijie","t":"周末去槟城","en":"We drove to Penang for durian on the weekend. My kids ate Black Thorn at the roadside stall; I paid and held the tissues.","zh":"周末开车去槟城吃榴莲，孩子们在路边摊吃黑刺，我负责付钱和递纸巾。"}],"印尼炒饭":[{"npc":"budi","t":"晚上收工","en":"After my last delivery, I stop at the nasi goreng cart near my house. The owner hears my bike and starts cooking.","zh":"晚上送完最后一单，我在家附近的炒饭推车停一下。老板一听见我的摩托声就开始炒了。"}],"印度奶茶":[{"npc":"rohan","t":"在德里出差","en":"On a Delhi work trip, our client took us to a chai stall outside their office. Four cups each before lunch.","zh":"去德里出差，客户带我们去他们公司门口的奶茶摊。午饭前每人喝了四杯。"}],"中亚抓饭":[{"npc":"noor","t":"去塔什干开会","en":"In Tashkent I went to the Plov Centre at noon. By one o'clock the cauldron was empty — glad I didn't sleep in.","zh":"去塔什干开会，中午去了抓饭中心。一点钟大锅就空了——幸好我没睡懒觉。"}],"维吉麦":[{"npc":"mia","t":"早上上课前","en":"Vegemite toast before my 9 a.m. class. My exchange-student flatmate tried it — I warned her, just a scrape!","zh":"早上九点课前吃维吉麦吐司。交换生室友也试了，我提醒过她：薄薄一层就好！"}],"澳洲肉派":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"看完球赛","en":"After the footy, a pie from the servo on the way home. My dog gets the crust.","zh":"看完橄榄球，回家路上在加油站买个肉派。皮边留给我的狗。"}],"帕夫洛娃":[{"npc":"tom","t":"学校学期末","en":"For the end-of-term lunch I made pavlova for the whole school. Two hundred servings — the meringue nearly broke me.","zh":"学期末给全校做午饭甜点，做了帕夫洛娃，两百份。打蛋白差点把我累垮。"}],"洛沃地灶":[{"npc":"amara","t":"在斐济过夜","en":"On a Fiji layover, the hotel had a lovo night. I watched them dig up the food — the taro was smoky and soft.","zh":"在斐济过夜，酒店办了 lovo 晚宴。我看着他们把食物挖出来，芋头烟熏味的，很软。"}],"高地咖啡":[{"npc":"josh_cafe","t":"店里换新豆","en":"This month our café has a PNG highlands coffee. I tell customers it tastes a bit like red apple — most of them agree.","zh":"这个月店里换了巴新高地的豆子。我跟客人说有点像红苹果，大多数人都同意。"}],"恰林大峡谷":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"九月","en":"I came to Almaty on the overnight train and took a minibus out to Charyn. The Valley of Castles was the colour of my grandmother's terracotta pots. At the river I sat with my notebook and wrote: smells of dust and warm stone.","zh":"我坐夜车到阿拉木图，再搭小巴去恰林。城堡谷的颜色像我外婆的陶土花盆。走到河边我坐下来，在本子上写：闻起来是尘土和晒热的石头。"}],"澳洲粉红湖":[{"npc":"amara","t":"珀斯过夜的那几天","en":"Two days off in Perth, so I flew down to Esperance and took a little plane over Middle Island. I've seen a lot of oceans from a cockpit window, but never a pink lake next to one. The whole plane went quiet.","zh":"在珀斯有两天休息，我飞到埃斯佩兰斯，坐小飞机去看中岛。我从飞机窗口看过很多海，可从没见过海边上一个粉红色的湖。整架飞机都安静了。"}],"摇篮山":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"年假","en":"After a run of night shifts I flew to Tasmania and did the Dove Lake loop at sunrise. Two wombats were eating grass by the track and didn't care about me at all. Best sleep I've had all year that night.","zh":"连上了几周夜班，我飞去塔斯马尼亚，日出时绕鸽子湖走了一圈。两只袋熊在步道边吃草，完全不理我。那天晚上是我今年睡得最好的一觉。"}],"富良野薰衣草":[{"npc":"lt_riko","t":"七月","en":"A magazine sent me to Furano to draw the lavender. The rows go uphill like lines on a notebook. I used up my whole purple pencil and had to buy a new one at the gift shop.","zh":"杂志派我去富良野画薰衣草。一行一行往山坡上排，像笔记本上的横线。我把紫色铅笔整支用完了，只好在纪念品店再买一支。"}],"松岛":[{"npc":"aiko","t":"回仙台过年","en":"My aunt took me on the Matsushima boat. I brought my film camera to shoot the islands, but half the roll ended up being seagulls grabbing shrimp crackers right next to my face.","zh":"姑姑带我去坐松岛的游船。我带了胶片相机想拍小岛，结果半卷都是海鸥在我脸旁边抢虾条。"}],"草津温泉":[{"npc":"lt_kenta","t":"连休","en":"I finally took a long weekend and went to Kusatsu. The whole town smells like eggs and it's great. I watched the yumomi show twice and then slept eleven hours. No laptop.","zh":"我终于请了个连休去了草津。整个镇子都是鸡蛋味，我很喜欢。汤揉表演看了两遍，然后睡了十一个小时。没带电脑。"}],"立山黑部雪墙":[{"npc":"lt_aya","t":"四月底","en":"Our mountain club went to see the snow walls before the hiking season. Seventeen metres, the sign said. I stood at the bottom with my coffee and felt very, very small.","zh":"登山社在登山季开始前去看雪墙。牌子上写十七米。我端着咖啡站在下面，觉得自己好小好小。"}],"琵琶湖":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"秋天的周末","en":"A teacher friend and I tried cycling the north part of Lake Biwa. My legs gave up after 60 km and we took the train back with the bikes. My wife said: you know our tap water comes from that lake, right?","zh":"我和一个老师朋友去骑琵琶湖北边那一段。骑了 60 公里腿就不行了，最后带着车坐电车回来。我太太说：你知道我们家的自来水就是从那个湖来的吧？"}],"鸟取沙丘":[{"npc":"kenji","t":"周末","en":"I took the bus to Tottori just to walk up the big dune. It's harder than the gym. At the top my watch said I'd hit my step goal, so I rewarded myself with a sand-roasted coffee.","zh":"我坐巴士去鸟取，就为了爬那座大沙丘。比健身房还累。爬到顶上手表说今天步数够了，我就奖励自己一杯沙子烘的咖啡。"}],"道后温泉":[{"npc":"tanaka","t":"秋天","en":"My old classmates and I went to Dōgo for the first time since it reopened. We bathed, put on the yukata and had tea upstairs like proper ladies. Then we talked so long the staff had to remind us of the time.","zh":"跟老同学们去了重新开门后的道后温泉。泡完换上浴衣，在楼上喝茶，像正经的太太们。结果聊得太久，工作人员来提醒我们时间到了。"}],"别府温泉":[{"npc":"lt_daiki","t":"暑假","en":"Our band played a small live house in Ōita, so the next morning we did the Beppu hells. The Sea Hell is so blue it looks fake. Our drummer bought five steamed eggs and ate them all on the bus.","zh":"我们乐队在大分一家小 live house 演出，第二天早上去逛了别府的地狱。海地狱蓝得像假的。我们鼓手买了五个蒸鸡蛋，在巴士上全吃了。"}],"高千穗峡":[{"npc":"lt_hatsune","t":"春天","en":"I finally rowed under Manai Falls. My arms were useless, so my husband rowed and I just looked up. The moss on the cliffs was a green I want to find in a flower one day.","zh":"我终于划船到了真名井瀑布下面。我手没劲，我先生划，我就一直抬头看。悬崖上青苔的那种绿，我希望哪天能在一朵花里找到。"}],"樱岛火山":[{"npc":"lt_kimura","t":"退休前的旅行","en":"Took the Sakurajima ferry with a cup of udon from the onboard stand, like the locals do. At the footbath an old man told me he sweeps ash off his roof every week. He said it like he was talking about the weather.","zh":"我坐樱岛渡轮，跟本地人一样在船上的小摊买了一碗乌冬。在足汤那里，一位老先生说他每周都要扫屋顶上的火山灰。说得就跟聊天气一样。"}],"果阿海滩":[{"npc":"priya","t":"长周末","en":"Five of us from college finally did the Goa trip we'd planned for three years. We picked the quiet south, ate fish curry rice every day and nobody opened a laptop. Okay, I checked one dashboard.","zh":"我们五个大学同学终于去了计划了三年的果阿。选了安静的南边，天天吃鱼咖喱饭，谁都没开电脑。好吧，我看了一个报表。"}],"树根活桥":[{"npc":"rohan","t":"冬天","en":"I walked down to the double-decker root bridge in Nongriat. My legs were shaking on the way back up. A Khasi kid carrying a sack of rice ran past me — barefoot, smiling.","zh":"我走到农里亚特的双层根桥。往回爬的时候腿一直在抖。一个背着一袋米的卡西族小孩光着脚从我身边跑过去，还在笑。"}],"干城章嘉峰":[{"npc":"patel","t":"回印度探亲","en":"My aunt dragged us up Tiger Hill at four in the morning. Freezing, crowded, everyone holding tea. Then Kangchenjunga turned pink and the whole crowd went silent at once.","zh":"姑姑凌晨四点拉我们上老虎山。又冷又挤，人人手里一杯茶。然后干城章嘉峰变成粉红色，所有人一下子都安静了。"}],"奇特拉科特瀑布":[{"npc":"kavya","t":"雨季","en":"I was in Bastar to test our app with farmers, and they insisted I see Chitrakote in the rain. Brown water, 300 metres wide, so loud I couldn't hear my phone. One farmer said: this is why we check your forecast.","zh":"我去巴斯塔尔找农民测试我们的 App，他们非要我雨季去看奇特拉科特瀑布。土黄色的水，三百米宽，响得我连手机都听不见。一位农民说：这就是我们为什么要看你的天气预报。"}],"洛克塔克浮岛":[{"npc":"priyanka","t":"冬天","en":"After Guwahati I flew on to Imphal to see Loktak. A fisherman paddled us between the phumdis — he steps from one to another like they're stones in a garden. I didn't dare try.","zh":"从古瓦哈蒂我又飞到因帕尔去看洛克塔克湖。一个渔民划船带我们在浮岛之间转，他从一个浮岛跨到另一个，像踩花园里的石头一样。我可不敢。"}],"冲绳":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"十月底","en":"I still remember waking up to Shuri Castle on fire on the news. Next month the main hall opens again. My wife and I already booked — we want to go on a quiet weekday morning.","zh":"我还记得那天早上醒来，新闻里是首里城在烧。下个月正殿重新开放了。我和老伴已经预约好，想挑一个安静的平日早上去。"}],"釜山海云台":[{"npc":"jiho","t":"秋天","en":"Our running crew took the KTX to Busan and ran from Haeundae along the old railway path. After 10 km we rode the sky capsule back like tired grandpas. Best cool-down ever.","zh":"我们跑团坐 KTX 去釜山，从海云台沿着老铁路的步道跑。跑完十公里，像累坏的老爷爷一样坐天空胶囊回去。最好的放松运动。"}],"济州岛":[{"npc":"minjun","t":"暑假","en":"Family trip to Jeju. Near Seongsan, a group of haenyeo came out of the water in their black suits, and my mum bought abalone straight from them. My kid asked how long they can hold their breath. I couldn't even do 30 seconds in the pool.","zh":"带家里人去济州。在城山附近，一群穿黑色潜水服的海女从水里上来，我妈直接跟她们买了鲍鱼。孩子问她们能憋气多久。我在泳池里连 30 秒都撑不住。"}],"戈壁恐龙蛋":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"八月","en":"From Ulaanbaatar it was two days in a Russian van to the Flaming Cliffs. At sunset the rock really glows. In my notebook I wrote: smells of hot sand and the driver's mutton dumplings.","zh":"从乌兰巴托坐俄式面包车颠了两天才到火焰崖。日落时石头真的在发光。我在本子上写：闻起来是热沙子和司机的羊肉包子。"}],"普吉岛":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"学期假","en":"Everyone goes to Phuket for the beach. I went for the food. Three bowls of Hokkien noodles in Phuket Old Town in one afternoon, then a shophouse café full of old toys. Perfect day.","zh":"大家去普吉是为了海滩，我是为了吃。一个下午在普吉老城吃了三碗福建面，然后去了一家摆满老玩具的骑楼咖啡馆。完美的一天。"}],"下龙湾":[{"npc":"mai","t":"公司团建","en":"Our tiny startup splurged on one night on a Ha Long boat. I promised no laptops. At 6 a.m. I was on deck doing tai chi with a cook and a grandma from Hanoi, and that's when I got our next app idea.","zh":"我们小公司咬牙订了下龙湾一晚的船。我保证不带电脑。早上六点在甲板上跟厨师和一位河内来的奶奶打太极，下一个 App 的点子就是那时候冒出来的。"}],"巧克力山":[{"npc":"bea","t":"夏天","en":"I went to Bohol to film an English lesson in front of the Chocolate Hills. The wind kept blowing my notes away, so the script became: How do you say 'my notes flew away'?","zh":"我去薄荷岛，想在巧克力山前拍一集英语课。风一直把我的稿子吹跑，最后那集的内容就变成了：「我的稿子飞走了」英语怎么说？"}],"长滩岛":[{"npc":"grace","t":"回菲律宾探亲","en":"Ten years in New York and I'd never taken my parents to Boracay. This year we finally went. The beach is cleaner than I remember from college, and my dad fell asleep on the sand at four in the afternoon.","zh":"在纽约十年，我从没带爸妈去过长滩岛。今年终于去了。海滩比我大学时记得的干净多了，我爸下午四点就在沙滩上睡着了。"}],"喀拉拉回水":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"回印度过年","en":"Took my parents on a Kerala houseboat for their anniversary. No Wi-Fi for 20 hours. The cook made fish curry in a tiny kitchen, and my dad told me stories I'd never heard before.","zh":"带爸妈坐喀拉拉的船屋过结婚纪念日。二十个小时没网。厨师在小小的厨房里做鱼咖喱，我爸讲了好多我从没听过的故事。"}],"乔戈里峰":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"健身房里","en":"A guy from my climbing gym just got back from the K2 base camp trek in Pakistan. Three weeks, no shower. He showed me one photo of K2 at dawn and I've been looking at flights ever since.","zh":"我攀岩馆的一个朋友刚从巴基斯坦徒步 K2 大本营回来。三周没洗澡。他给我看了一张 K2 日出的照片，我就一直在看机票。"}],"邦迪海滩":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"冬天的星期天","en":"My mate swims at Bondi Icebergs every winter Sunday, so I joined him once. The water was 16 degrees and a wave came over the wall right onto my head. He laughed. I went back for a hot chocolate.","zh":"我朋友每个冬天的星期天都去邦迪冰山泳池游泳，我跟着去了一次。水只有 16 度，一个浪从池边翻进来直接拍在我头上。他在笑。我回去喝热巧克力了。"}],"蓝山":[{"npc":"mia","t":"去悉尼玩","en":"Did a TikTok at the Three Sisters lookout with about forty other people doing the same thing. Then I walked ten minutes down a trail and it was just me and the birds. That part I didn't film.","zh":"在三姐妹岩观景台拍 TikTok，旁边大概四十个人也在拍。然后我顺着步道往下走了十分钟，只剩我和鸟。那一段我没拍。"}],"十二门徒岩":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"大学放假","en":"Drove the Great Ocean Road with my dad in his old ute. At the Twelve Apostles he counted out loud and got to seven. He said: back in my day there were nine. He's not wrong.","zh":"跟我爸开他那辆老皮卡走大洋路。在十二门徒岩他大声数，数到七。他说：我年轻的时候有九根。他没说错。"}],"萤火虫洞":[{"npc":"aiko","t":"第一次出国","en":"I brought my film camera all the way to Waitomo, and of course photos aren't allowed in the glowworm cave. Honestly, good. I just lay back in the boat and looked. No roll of film could hold that.","zh":"我把胶片相机一路带到怀托摩，结果萤火虫洞里当然不许拍。说真的，挺好。我就躺在船上看。哪卷胶片也装不下那个。"}],"米尔福德峡湾":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"三月","en":"As a Norwegian I came to Milford Sound ready to be unimpressed. Then it rained, and three hundred waterfalls appeared on the cliffs at once. I wrote in my notebook: fine, they win this one.","zh":"作为挪威人，我去米尔福德峡湾时本来做好了「不过如此」的准备。结果下雨了，悬崖上一下子冒出三百条瀑布。我在本子上写：好吧，这一局他们赢了。"}],"斐济":[{"npc":"amara","t":"楠迪过夜","en":"On a layover in Nadi our driver took us to his village. They gave me a bowl of kava and my lips went numb. Then everyone crowded round one small TV for the rugby sevens — louder than any stadium I've been to.","zh":"在楠迪过夜，司机带我们去了他的村子。他们给我一碗卡瓦，喝完嘴唇都麻了。然后全村挤在一台小电视前看七人橄榄球——比我去过的任何球场都吵。"}],"白天堂海滩":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"年假","en":"Sailed out to Whitehaven with three nurse friends. The sand squeaks when you walk on it, and it was cool on my feet even at noon. We spent the whole day reminding each other to put on sunscreen. Occupational habit.","zh":"跟三个护士朋友坐帆船去白天堂海滩。沙子踩上去吱吱响，中午也不烫脚。我们一整天都在互相提醒涂防晒。职业病。"}],"邦格尔邦格尔":[{"npc":"josh_cafe","t":"七月","en":"Saved up all year for a helicopter flight over the Bungle Bungles. Eighteen minutes. The domes look like giant stripy beehives. Back at the café I told the team, and now one of the baristas is saving up too.","zh":"攒了一年钱，坐直升机飞了一趟邦格尔邦格尔。十八分钟。那些圆顶像一个个巨大的条纹蜂窝。回到咖啡馆跟大家一讲，现在有个咖啡师也开始攒钱了。"}],"汤加里罗火山":[{"npc":"poppy","t":"去新西兰进货","en":"I did the Tongariro Alpine Crossing in a 1970s wool jumper from my stall. Everyone else was in hi-tech jackets. At the Emerald Lakes a hiker asked where I got it. I gave her my card.","zh":"我穿着摊上一件七十年代的羊毛衫走了汤加里罗高山穿越。别人都穿高科技冲锋衣。在翡翠湖边一个徒步的人问我在哪儿买的。我给了她一张名片。"}],"福克斯冰川":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"第一次出国","en":"I saved for a year and finally took the helicopter onto Fox Glacier. Ten minutes in the air, twenty minutes standing on blue ice. I looked down and could see the rainforest right next to it. My Xiaohongshu post got 3,000 likes.","zh":"我存了一年钱，终于坐直升机上了福克斯冰川。飞十分钟，在蓝色的冰上站了二十分钟。往下看，雨林就在旁边。我的小红书发了一篇，三千个赞。"}],"软珊瑚之都":[{"npc":"weijie","t":"年假","en":"Flew to Taveuni just for the Rainbow Reef. The current pushed us along the Great White Wall and I forgot to breathe properly. On land I stood on the 180° line and sent my school clients a photo: one foot in tomorrow.","zh":"专门飞去塔韦乌尼潜彩虹礁。水流推着我们沿大白墙漂，我都忘了好好呼吸。上了岸站在 180 度线上，给学校客户发了张照片：一只脚已经在明天了。"}],"马马努卡群岛":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"女儿出生前","en":"Before our daughter was born, Yuki and I took a boat from Nadi to the Mamanuca islands. The guide pointed at Monuriki and said: the real Cast Away island. Yuki had never seen the movie. We watched it that night on my phone.","zh":"女儿出生前，我和 Yuki 从楠迪坐船去了马马努卡群岛。导游指着莫努里基说：这才是真的《荒岛余生》岛。Yuki 没看过那部电影。那天晚上我们用手机看了。"}],"拉包尔火山":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"坐船环游太平洋","en":"Our ship anchored in Rabaul's caldera at dawn. Tavurvur was puffing grey smoke and the old town was still half buried. A woman at the market sold me megapode eggs dug from hot sand. Smell: sulphur and frangipani.","zh":"我们的船清晨停进拉包尔的火山口海湾。塔乌鲁尔在冒灰烟，老城还有一半埋在灰里。市场上一位大姐卖给我从热沙里挖出来的冢雉蛋。气味：硫磺和鸡蛋花。"}],"金贝湾珊瑚":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"年假","en":"Two weeks diving in Kimbe Bay. On one dive a pod of dolphins came past and I forgot every fish name I'd learnt. My boss asked what I did on holiday. I said: counted coral, lost count.","zh":"在金贝湾潜了两周水。有一潜一群海豚游过去，我把学过的鱼名全忘了。老板问我假期干嘛了。我说：数珊瑚，数不过来。"}],"亚苏尔火山":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"退休旅行","en":"After Santo we flew to Tanna for Mount Yasur. At dusk we stood on the rim and every few minutes it went BOOM. I've felt typhoons all my life in Okinawa, but nothing shook my chest like that.","zh":"从桑托岛又飞去塔纳岛看亚苏尔火山。傍晚站在火山口边，每隔几分钟「轰」一下。在冲绳一辈子经历过多少台风，可从没有什么像那样震得我胸口发颤。"}],"水母湖":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"假期","en":"Before the drought my cousin swam in Jellyfish Lake and never stopped talking about it. This year I finally went. Fewer jellyfish than in her photos, but still enough that I laughed into my snorkel.","zh":"旱灾之前我表姐在水母湖游过，一直念叨。今年我终于去了。水母没有她照片里多，可还是多到我在呼吸管里笑出来。"}],"塔斯马尼亚":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"假期","en":"Took the ferry from Melbourne to Tasmania with my car. Ten hours across Bass Strait. At Salamanca Market I tried apple cider, oysters and a scallop pie, then remembered I'm a poor student.","zh":"从墨尔本带着车坐渡轮去塔斯马尼亚，过巴斯海峡要十个小时。在萨拉曼卡市集尝了苹果酒、生蚝和扇贝派，然后想起来自己是个穷学生。"}],"生命之树塔":[{"npc":"emre","t":"一月 · 出差","en":"Flew to Astana for a currency conference — minus 25 outside. Up in the golden ball I could read half the signs below: Kazakh is a cousin of Turkish.","zh":"飞阿斯塔纳开一个外汇的会，外面零下 25 度。在金球里往下看，招牌我能看懂一半——哈萨克语和土耳其语是亲戚。"}],"南马都尔":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"退休后的第一次长途","en":"Paddled a kayak into Nan Madol at high tide with a local guide. The basalt walls are taller than they look in photos — and the mangroves really are everywhere.","zh":"涨潮的时候跟当地向导划皮划艇进南马都尔。玄武岩墙比照片里高多了，红树林也真的到处都是。"}],"日光东照宫":[{"npc":"lt_kenta","t":"周六一早","en":"Took the Tobu train from Asakusa at 7. Everyone crowds around the three monkeys; I spent longer looking for the sleeping cat over the gate.","zh":"早上 7 点从浅草坐东武线过来。大家都围着那三只猴子拍，我倒是花了更久去找门上那只睡猫。"}],"兼六园":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"十二月 · 寒假","en":"Took the Thunderbird up to Kanazawa just to see the snow ropes on the pines. Snowed all morning, and the garden went completely quiet.","zh":"放寒假坐雷鸟号特急去金泽，就为了看松树上的雪吊。下了一上午雪，整个园子安静得不得了。"}],"伊势神宫":[{"npc":"tanaka","t":"新年第一次参拜","en":"My husband and I take the Kintetsu train to Ise every January. Outer Shrine first, then the Inner Shrine, then Akafuku with hot tea. Forty years now.","zh":"我和老伴每年一月坐近铁去伊势。先拜外宫，再拜内宫，然后吃赤福配热茶。已经四十年了。"}],"出云大社":[{"npc":"kenji","t":"远程上班的一个周五","en":"Worked from a café in Izumo on Friday and went to the shrine after. Here you clap four times, not two — I clapped twice out of habit and the lady next to me smiled.","zh":"周五在出云的咖啡馆远程上班，下班去了大社。这里要拍四下手，不是两下——我习惯性拍了两下，旁边的阿姨笑了。"}],"军舰岛":[{"npc":"kazuo","t":"秋天 · 跟老同事","en":"Booked the boat from Nagasaki twice; the first time the waves were too high to land. The second time we walked past the old apartment blocks in silence.","zh":"从长崎订了两次船，第一次浪太大没法上岛。第二次走过那些旧公寓楼的时候，大家都没说话。"}],"镰仓大佛":[{"npc":"lt_riko","t":"工作日下午","en":"Took my sketchbook to Kamakura. Paid the extra fee to go inside the Buddha — you can see where the bronze pieces were joined. Drew it from behind for once.","zh":"带着速写本去了镰仓。多付了一点钱钻进大佛里面，能看到青铜一块块接起来的地方。这次我从背后画它。"}],"阿姆利则金庙":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"回印度过节","en":"Took my parents to the Golden Temple. We sat on the floor for langar — dal, roti, kheer — and then I volunteered an hour washing steel plates.","zh":"带爸妈去金庙。我们在地上坐着吃 langar——豆子、薄饼、米布丁——然后我去当了一个小时志愿者洗钢盘子。"}],"迈索尔宫":[{"npc":"rohan","t":"周日晚上","en":"Drove three hours from Bangalore with friends just to see the palace lights at 7. When all the bulbs came on at once, the whole crowd went 'ohhh'.","zh":"周日跟朋友从班加罗尔开三个小时车，就为了看 7 点的宫殿亮灯。灯一下子全亮的时候，整个广场的人都「哇」了一声。"}],"查尔米纳塔":[{"npc":"priya","t":"周末去海得拉巴","en":"Bought bangles for my cousin's wedding at Laad Bazaar — bargained in Hindi, paid in UPI. Then Irani chai and Osmania biscuits facing the Charminar.","zh":"在拉德集市给表妹婚礼买手镯，用印地语砍价，用手机 UPI 付钱。然后对着查尔米纳塔喝伊朗奶茶、吃奥斯曼尼亚饼干。"}],"米纳克希神庙":[{"npc":"priyanka","t":"排灯节假期","en":"Went with my grandmother to Madurai. She knew exactly which queue to join; I just kept looking up at the towers and walking into people.","zh":"排灯节陪奶奶去马杜赖。她清楚该排哪一队，我一直抬头看门塔，老撞到人。"}],"科纳克太阳神庙":[{"npc":"kavya","t":"冬天 · 早上十点","en":"I build weather apps, so of course I tested the sundial wheel. A guide read it with his finger on the shadow — 10:05. My phone said 10:12.","zh":"我做天气 App 的，当然要试试日晷轮子。向导用手指着影子读时间：10 点 05 分。我手机上是 10 点 12 分。"}],"菩提伽耶":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"寒假 · 跟妈妈","en":"Came with my mum on a Thai pilgrimage group. She cried under the Bodhi tree. Lots of Thai, Tibetan and Sri Lankan pilgrims sitting side by side.","zh":"寒假跟妈妈参加泰国的朝圣团来的。妈妈在菩提树下哭了。泰国、藏族、斯里兰卡的朝圣者并排坐着。"}],"卡久拉霍神庙":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"暑假旅行","en":"Spent a whole morning at the western group. My students will ask about 'those' carvings; I'll tell them to count the musicians and elephants first.","zh":"在西区神庙待了一整个上午。学生们肯定会问「那些」雕刻，我打算先让他们数数有多少乐师和大象。"}],"西姆拉玩具火车":[{"npc":"patel","t":"暑假回印度","en":"Rode the toy train to Shimla with my kids. They counted tunnels until they fell asleep around number 40. Chai at Barog station saved the trip.","zh":"暑假带孩子坐玩具火车上西姆拉。他们一路数隧道，数到 40 个左右就睡着了。在巴罗格站喝的那杯奶茶救了我。"}],"德里红堡":[{"npc":"amara","t":"德里过夜航班","en":"24-hour layover in Delhi. Walked from Chandni Chowk to the Red Fort in the heat, then stayed for the evening sound-and-light show.","zh":"在德里停 24 小时。顶着大太阳从月光集市走到红堡，又留下来看了晚上的声光表演。"}],"本地治里法式小镇":[{"npc":"claire","t":"年假 · 二月","en":"Pondicherry was strange and lovely: a baguette for breakfast, rue Suffren on the street sign, then idli for lunch. The police caps are exactly like old French ones.","zh":"本地治里又奇怪又可爱：早饭吃法棍，路牌写着 rue Suffren，午饭吃蒸米糕。警察的帽子跟以前法国的一模一样。"}],"曼谷大皇宫":[{"npc":"dr_nok","t":"周日 · 带表妹","en":"My cousin came from Chiang Mai, so I took her to the Grand Palace. She wore shorts — we bought a sarong at the gate for 200 baht.","zh":"表妹从清迈来，我带她去大皇宫。她穿了短裤，只好在门口花 200 泰铢买了一条纱笼。"}],"会安古镇":[{"npc":"mai","t":"国庆假期","en":"Took the night train from Saigon to Da Nang with my co-founders, then a Grab to Hoi An. We floated lanterns on the river and talked about anything except our app.","zh":"国庆跟两个合伙人坐夜车从西贡到岘港，再打车到会安。在河上放了灯，聊了所有事，就是不聊我们的 App。"}],"琅勃拉邦":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"年假","en":"Took the Laos–China train from Kunming. Got up at 5:30 for the morning alms; I just watched quietly from across the street.","zh":"从昆明坐中老铁路过来。早上 5 点半起来看布施，我只在马路对面安静地看。"}],"蒲甘万塔":[{"npc":"bea","t":"2019 年 12 月","en":"Filmed a sunrise over Bagan for my channel — my favourite video ever. The balloon pilots all waved at each other in the sky.","zh":"给频道拍了一段蒲甘日出，到现在还是我最喜欢的一条。热气球的驾驶员在天上互相招手。"}],"滨海湾花园":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"下早班以后","en":"After my early shift at Changi I sometimes lie on the ground under the Supertrees for the 7:45 show. Free, and the best way to stop thinking about check-in queues.","zh":"樟宜早班下班后，我有时躺在超级树下等 7 点 45 分的灯光秀。免费，而且最能让我不再想值机排队的事。"}],"双子塔":[{"npc":"weijie","t":"出差 · 晚上","en":"Business trip to KL to sell to an international school. Afterwards I sat in KLCC Park and watched the fountain with the towers lit up behind.","zh":"去吉隆坡给一所国际学校推销软件。谈完坐在 KLCC 公园，看双子塔亮着灯、喷泉在前面跳。"}],"婆罗浮屠":[{"npc":"budi","t":"开斋节假期","en":"Drove the family from Jakarta to Yogyakarta. To climb Borobudur we all had to wear the woven upanat sandals — my son said they feel like walking on a mat.","zh":"开斋节开车带全家从雅加达去日惹。爬婆罗浮屠的时候每个人都要穿那种编的 upanat 拖鞋，儿子说像踩在草席上。"}],"粉红城斋浦尔":[{"npc":"camille","t":"采购出差","en":"In Jaipur to buy block-print cotton for the shop. Watched a printer stamp the same flower 300 times without a single smudge.","zh":"来斋浦尔给店里采购手工印花棉布。看一位师傅把同一朵花盖了 300 下，一点都没糊。"}],"加德满都":[{"npc":"lena","t":"徒步出发前一天","en":"Day before my trek, so I wandered Durbar Square. Cranes still everywhere from the 2015 quake repairs, but the rebuilt wooden pavilion smells of new timber.","zh":"徒步出发前一天在杜巴广场逛。2015 年地震后的修复还没完，到处是吊车，不过重建的木亭子闻起来全是新木头的味道。"}],"狮子岩":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"退休后的旅行","en":"Started climbing at 7 a.m. to beat the heat. At the lion's paws my knees complained, but the top was worth every step.","zh":"早上 7 点就开始爬，避开太阳。到狮爪那儿膝盖已经在抗议了，不过上到顶，每一步都值。"}],"悉尼海港大桥":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"下夜班的早上","en":"After a night shift I ride my bike over the Harbour Bridge home. At 7:30 a.m. the Opera House is pink and I'm too tired to care about traffic.","zh":"下了夜班骑车过海港大桥回家。早上 7 点半歌剧院是粉红色的，我累得已经顾不上堵车了。"}],"堪培拉国会大厦":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"带妈妈去堪培拉","en":"Drove Mum down to Canberra for her birthday. We watched Question Time from the gallery — louder than our clinic waiting room on a Monday.","zh":"妈妈生日，开车带她去堪培拉。在旁听席看了质询时间——比我们诊所周一的候诊室还吵。"}],"天空塔":[{"npc":"mia","t":"假期去奥克兰","en":"Visited my cousin in Auckland. Watched someone do the SkyJump from the observation deck; I stuck to standing on the glass floor, which was scary enough.","zh":"去奥克兰看表姐。在观景台看别人玩 SkyJump 跳下去；我只敢站在玻璃地板上，已经够吓人了。"}],"沙漠玫瑰博物馆":[{"npc":"amara","t":"多哈中转","en":"Eight-hour layover in Doha, so I took the metro to the National Museum. Inside, the curved walls made me feel like I was walking inside a sand dune.","zh":"在多哈中转八个小时，坐地铁去了国家博物馆。里面的墙都是弯的，感觉像在沙丘里走路。"}],"耶路撒冷老城":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"复活节前","en":"Walked through all four quarters in one morning. Bells, the call to prayer and Hebrew songs overlapped in the same alley — I stood still for a while just listening.","zh":"一个上午走遍了四个区。钟声、宣礼声和希伯来语的歌在同一条巷子里重叠，我站着听了好一会儿。"}],"波斯波利斯":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"春天 · 伊朗之旅","en":"Our guide pointed out the Stanley graffiti on the Gate of All Nations. I told my old students for thirty years not to write on monuments; here was a famous man who did.","zh":"向导指给我们看万国之门上斯坦利刻的字。我教了三十年书，一直让学生别在古迹上乱写，这儿就有个名人干了。"}],"狮身人面像":[{"npc":"omar_de","t":"跟朋友去开罗","en":"Flew from Munich to Cairo with two friends. Every camel guide had an opinion about who took the Sphinx's nose — none of them said Napoleon.","zh":"跟两个朋友从慕尼黑飞开罗。每个牵骆驼的都有一套说法，讲狮身人面像的鼻子是谁弄掉的——没一个说是拿破仑。"}],"阿布辛贝神庙":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"十月 · 太阳节","en":"Got up at 3 a.m. in Aswan for the convoy to Abu Simbel on 22 October. When the sun hit the statues inside, the whole crowd went quiet. I'm using it in my next lesson on dams.","zh":"10 月 22 日凌晨 3 点在阿斯旺起床跟车队去阿布辛贝。太阳照到里面神像的那一刻，所有人都安静了。下节讲水坝的课我就用这个。"}],"拉利贝拉岩石教堂":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"埃塞俄比亚圣诞节（1 月 7 日）","en":"Flew from Nairobi to Lalibela for Genna, Ethiopian Christmas. Thousands of pilgrims in white shawls stood on the rock edges above the churches, singing all night.","zh":"从内罗毕飞到拉利贝拉过埃塞俄比亚圣诞节。几千个披着白披肩的朝圣者站在教堂上方的岩石边上，唱了一整夜。"}],"杰内泥土清真寺":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"地理课上","en":"Every spring I show my class photos of Djenné's replastering day — a whole town climbing one building. Then I ask them who would fix our school's roof like that.","zh":"每年春天我都给学生看杰内抹泥节的照片——一整座城的人爬一栋楼。然后问他们，谁愿意这样给咱们学校修屋顶。"}],"帝王谷":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"尼罗河游船","en":"Read Howard Carter's diaries before the trip. Standing in front of Tutankhamun's actual face in the tomb felt nothing like reading about him in the shop.","zh":"出发前读了霍华德·卡特的日记。真站在墓里图坦卡蒙的脸前面，跟在书店里读他完全是两回事。"}],"哈桑二世清真寺":[{"npc":"gerard","t":"退休后的第一次火车旅行","en":"Took the train from Marrakech to Casablanca. On the guided tour they opened the roof — it slides back so you see the sky. The sea was crashing right under the windows.","zh":"从马拉喀什坐火车到卡萨布兰卡。导览的时候他们把屋顶打开了——会往两边滑开，能直接看到天。窗户下面就是拍岸的海浪。"}],"阿伊特本哈杜":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"毕业旅行","en":"Film student pilgrimage: stood on the spot from Gladiator. The man selling scarves at the top told me which Game of Thrones actor bought one from him.","zh":"电影专业学生的朝圣：站在《角斗士》拍过的那个位置。山顶卖围巾的大叔告诉我，《权力的游戏》哪个演员在他这儿买过一条。"}],"马约尔花园":[{"npc":"lea","t":"去马拉喀什看展","en":"Booked the 9 a.m. slot to avoid crowds, then crossed the street to the YSL museum. That blue is even louder in real life — I bought a postcard to match a shop window to it.","zh":"订了早上 9 点的时段避开人多，看完过马路去了圣罗兰博物馆。那种蓝真人看更扎眼，我买了张明信片，回去照着它搭橱窗。"}],"阿克苏姆方尖碑":[{"npc":"ngozi","t":"历史课备课","en":"I teach the Aksum obelisk in my lesson on returning museum objects. My Year 10s couldn't believe Italy flew a 24-metre stone back in three pieces.","zh":"我在讲「文物归还」那节课里用阿克苏姆方尖碑。十年级的学生不敢相信意大利把 24 米的石碑切成三段飞了回去。"}],"贡德尔城堡":[{"npc":"amara","t":"一月 · 换班去看主显节","en":"Swapped shifts to see Timkat in Gondar. When the bath filled, young men climbed the old fig trees and jumped in — I got soaked just standing close.","zh":"换了班去贡德尔看主显节。浴池灌满水以后，年轻人爬上老无花果树往下跳，我站得近一点就被溅透了。"}],"拉穆古城":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"年假","en":"First real holiday in years — I left the M-Pesa shop with my cousin and came to Lamu. No cars, just donkeys and dhows. My phone barely rang.","zh":"好几年来第一次真正休假，把 M-Pesa 小店交给表妹，来了拉穆。没有车，只有驴和帆船。手机几乎没响。"}],"桑给巴尔石头城":[{"npc":"carlos","t":"跟朋友的假期","en":"Big Queen fan, so I found the house where Freddie Mercury was born. Then got lost for an hour among carved doors and ended up at the Forodhani night market.","zh":"我是皇后乐队的铁粉，所以去找了弗雷迪·墨丘利出生的那栋房子。后来在雕花门之间迷路一个小时，最后走到了福罗达尼夜市。"}],"彩虹房子":[{"npc":"nomvula","t":"周日下午","en":"On Sundays I buy koeksisters from an auntie in Bo-Kaap. She always asks the tourists to please not sit on her front steps for photos.","zh":"周日我去波卡普找一位阿姨买 koeksister 甜甜圈。她总是请游客别坐在她家门口台阶上拍照。"}],"罗本岛":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"带外甥去","en":"Took my nephew to Robben Island. Our guide had been a prisoner in the cell block; when he showed us where they slept, my nephew stopped asking for his phone.","zh":"带外甥去罗本岛。我们的讲解员以前就关在这个监区里；他给我们看当年睡觉的地方时，外甥再也不要手机了。"}],"女王宫":[{"npc":"nadia","t":"马达加斯加度假","en":"Holiday in Madagascar, where French got me through the taxis. Walked up to the Rova at sunset — the whole city of red-brick houses glowing below.","zh":"在马达加斯加度假，靠法语搞定了出租车。傍晚走上女王宫，下面整座红砖房子的城都在发光。"}],"奥孙神林":[{"npc":"tolu","t":"八月 · 奥孙节","en":"Drove from Lagos to Osogbo for the festival and recorded the talking drums by the river. Some of it will end up in my next beat.","zh":"八月开车从拉各斯去奥绍博过奥孙节，在河边录了说话鼓。有一部分会用进我下一首歌的节奏里。"}],"海岸角城堡":[{"npc":"jess","t":"2019 年秋天 · 去加纳旅行","en":"Joined a group trip to Ghana. In the male dungeon our guide asked us to stand in silence for a minute. Walking out through the Door of No Return, I saw the fishing boats right outside.","zh":"跟团去加纳。在男性地牢里，导游请我们安静站一分钟。从「不归门」走出去，门外就是渔船。"}],"独立广场":[{"npc":"kwame","t":"3 月 6 日 · 独立日","en":"Every 6 March I go to Black Star Square to watch the parade with my cousins. The school bands are the best part — I sampled their drums for a track once.","zh":"每年 3 月 6 日我都跟表兄弟去黑星广场看阅兵。最好看的是学校乐队——有一次我还把他们的鼓采样做进了一首歌。"}],"大津巴布韦遗址":[{"npc":"precious","t":"回津巴布韦探亲","en":"Took my mum to Great Zimbabwe — she'd never been, even though it's on our money and our flag. She touched the wall and said, 'Our people built this without cement.'","zh":"回津巴布韦探亲，带妈妈去了大津巴布韦。它印在我们的钱上、国旗上，可她从来没去过。她摸着墙说：「我们的祖先没用水泥就盖起来了。」"}],"辛特拉佩纳宫":[{"npc":"rui","t":"周二早上","en":"Half my guests ask about Sintra at breakfast. I tell them: take the early train and go up to Pena before the tour buses.","zh":"我一半的客人吃早饭时都问辛特拉。我跟他们说：坐早班火车，赶在旅游大巴之前上山去佩纳宫。"}],"布鲁日运河":[{"npc":"carlos","t":"周六下午","en":"Day trip from Amsterdam with Sanne and Chen. We took the canal boat — the guide made the same joke in three languages.","zh":"跟 Sanne 和 Chen 从阿姆斯特丹来一日游。坐了运河船，导游用三种语言讲了同一个笑话。"}],"冰旅馆":[{"npc":"maja","t":"二月的一个晚上","en":"As an architect I had to see it once. Building something you know will melt in spring — that's oddly freeing.","zh":"作为建筑师，我总得来看一次。盖一个明知道春天就会化掉的东西——反倒让人很放松。"}],"哥本哈根新港":[{"npc":"elin","t":"周日下午","en":"From Malmö it's just one train over the bridge. The kids eat ice cream on the quay and I finally sit still for ten minutes.","zh":"从马尔默过桥坐一趟火车就到。孩子们在岸边吃冰淇淋，我终于能坐着不动十分钟。"}],"特洛伊木马":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"暑假","en":"I teach the Iliad every year, so I finally came to see Troy. My students will laugh — the horse in town is from a Hollywood film.","zh":"我每年都教《伊利亚特》，终于来看特洛伊了。学生们会笑我的——城里那匹木马是好莱坞电影里的。"}],"卢瓦尔河城堡":[{"npc":"gerard","t":"退休后的第一个春天","en":"Forty years fixing trains, now I'm riding a bike between castles. On Chambord's staircase I waved at my wife on the other flight.","zh":"修了四十年火车，现在骑自行车一座城堡一座城堡地逛。在香波堡的楼梯上，我隔着另一道楼梯跟老婆挥手。"}],"许愿池":[{"npc":"chiara","t":"早上 7 点","en":"Born in Rome and I still walk past Trevi on my way to school — it's the only time of day you can actually see the water.","zh":"土生土长的罗马人，上班还是会绕过许愿池——一天里只有这个时候能真的看见水。"}],"庞贝古城":[{"npc":"nonna_carla","t":"周日带孙子","en":"I brought the grandchildren to Pompeii. The little one only wanted to see the bakery with the old ovens.","zh":"带孙子们去了庞贝。最小的那个只想看那家有老烤炉的面包店。"}],"米兰大教堂":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"米兰设计周","en":"Came for Design Week, but I escaped to the Duomo roof for an hour. All that marble lace — better than half the booths.","zh":"来米兰是为了设计周，但我溜去大教堂屋顶待了一个小时。满眼大理石花边——比一半的展位都好看。"}],"五渔村":[{"npc":"giulia","t":"回意大利休假","en":"Back home on holiday, I finally walked the Via dell'Amore with my baby in a carrier. Booked the slot two days before.","zh":"回意大利休假，终于背着宝宝走了一趟爱之路。提前两天约的时段。"}],"柏林墙":[{"npc":"becker","t":"11 月 9 日","en":"Every 9 November I walk along Bernauer Strasse. My grandchildren can't imagine a wall across the street.","zh":"每年 11 月 9 日我都去贝尔瑙尔街走一走。我的孙子们想象不出街中间有一道墙。"}],"科隆大教堂":[{"npc":"ana","t":"周五晚上","en":"Changed trains in Cologne and the cathedral was right outside the station door. I missed my connection on purpose.","zh":"在科隆换车，一出站门大教堂就在眼前。我故意错过了下一班车。"}],"哈尔施塔特":[{"npc":"huber","t":"十一月的周二","en":"I go in November, when the buses are gone. The lake is grey and quiet, and I can finally hear the church bell.","zh":"我挑十一月去，大巴都走了。湖是灰的，很安静，终于能听见教堂的钟声。"}],"美泉宫":[{"npc":"lisa","t":"下夜班后的周末","en":"Weekend in Vienna after a week of night shifts. I skipped the palace rooms and just walked up to the Gloriette with coffee.","zh":"上完一周夜班，周末去了维也纳。宫殿里面没看，端着咖啡一路走到山上的凯旋门。"}],"布拉格城堡":[{"npc":"tobias_sim","t":"周六早上","en":"Took the night bus from Berlin to Prague. At the castle gate the guards didn't blink once — I tried.","zh":"坐夜班大巴从柏林到布拉格。城堡门口的卫兵一下都没眨眼——我试过逗他。"}],"查理大桥":[{"npc":"lukas","t":"清晨 6 点","en":"Before I moved to Munich I did one last trip to Prague. Charles Bridge at 6 am, just me, a jogger and a photographer.","zh":"搬去慕尼黑前最后一趟去布拉格。早上 6 点的查理大桥，只有我、一个跑步的人和一个摄影师。"}],"布拉格天文钟":[{"npc":"katrin","t":"中午 12 点","en":"Waited fifteen minutes for the clock, the show took forty seconds. Still — I clapped like everyone else.","zh":"等了十五分钟，表演四十秒就完了。不过——我还是跟大家一起鼓了掌。"}],"克拉科夫老城":[{"npc":"felix","t":"毕业班修学旅行","en":"Our class trip ended in the main square. At midnight the trumpet stopped mid-note and our teacher told us the arrow story.","zh":"毕业班旅行最后一晚在大广场。半夜号声突然断了，老师给我们讲了那支箭的故事。"}],"布达佩斯国会大厦":[{"npc":"jana_ber","t":"晚上 9 点的船上","en":"Took the night boat on the Danube. When the parliament lit up, the whole deck went quiet for a second.","zh":"坐了多瑙河夜游船。国会大厦灯一亮，整条甲板安静了一秒。"}],"杜布罗夫尼克":[{"npc":"amara","t":"一次 30 小时的停留","en":"Layover in Dubrovnik. I walked the walls at 8 am before the cruise crowds, then slept on the beach until pickup.","zh":"在杜布罗夫尼克停留。早上 8 点赶在邮轮人潮前走了城墙，然后在海滩睡到接机。"}],"舍夫沙万蓝城":[{"npc":"noor","t":"远程上班的一周","en":"Worked remotely from Chefchaouen for a week. The Wi-Fi was slow, but every coffee break looked like a mood board.","zh":"在舍夫沙万远程上了一周班。网很慢，但每次喝咖啡休息，看到的都像一张配色板。"}],"蓝色小镇":[{"npc":"thomas_fr","t":"傍晚","en":"I tried to name every blue I saw for a colour project. Gave up at thirty and just watched the sunset from the mosque.","zh":"为了一个配色项目，我想把看到的每种蓝都起个名字。数到三十放弃了，干脆在清真寺那儿看日落。"}],"蓝白小镇":[{"npc":"claire","t":"下午 4 点","en":"Our studio is doing a Mediterranean campaign, so I came to Sidi Bou Said for references. Ended up drinking three mint teas.","zh":"工作室在做一个地中海主题的项目，我来西迪布赛义德找参考。结果喝了三杯薄荷茶。"}],"迦太基遗址":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"复活节假期","en":"I teach my students about Carthage every year. Standing at the Antonine Baths, I took notes for next term like a student.","zh":"我每年都给学生讲迦太基。站在安东尼浴场，我像个学生一样给下学期记笔记。"}],"杰姆斗兽场":[{"npc":"linhao","t":"春假","en":"Came with two classmates from Lyon. There were almost no tourists — we had the whole arena to ourselves for ten minutes.","zh":"跟两个里昂的同学一起来的。几乎没游客——整个斗兽场有十分钟只属于我们。"}],"棉花堡":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"年假","en":"On leave from the airport, I finally travelled myself. Barefoot on the white terraces — warmer than I thought.","zh":"从机场请了年假，终于轮到我自己出门。光脚走在白色梯田上——比想的暖和。"}],"勃朗峰":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"周日","en":"From Geneva it's an hour to Chamonix. After a week of particle data, I take the cable car up just to stare at the white.","zh":"从日内瓦到霞慕尼一个小时。看了一周的粒子数据，我坐缆车上去，就为了盯着那片白发呆。"}],"莫赫悬崖":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"复活节周末","en":"Easter weekend in Clare with friends. The wind at Moher nearly took my hat. In our group budget sheet I added a line: 'almost lost — one hat'.","zh":"复活节跟朋友去了克莱尔。莫赫悬崖的风差点把我帽子吹走。我在大家的记账表里加了一行：「差点丢了——帽子一顶」。"}],"阿马尔菲海岸":[{"npc":"camille","t":"八月","en":"Every August I take the ferry from Amalfi to Positano — after one summer on that coast bus, never again.","zh":"每年八月我都坐渡轮从阿马尔菲去波西塔诺——坐过一个夏天的海边大巴，再也不坐了。"}],"埃特纳火山":[{"npc":"paolo","t":"退休后的旅行","en":"Forty years driving Rome's buses, and the hardest road I've seen is up Etna. I let someone else drive this time.","zh":"在罗马开了四十年公交，我见过最难开的路是上埃特纳的那条。这回我让别人开。"}],"少女峰":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"七月","en":"I taught glaciers for thirty years. Standing above the Aletsch, I saw how much it has shrunk since my first visit.","zh":"我教了三十年冰川。站在阿莱奇冰川上方，看到它比我第一次来时缩了多少。"}],"十六湖":[{"npc":"hannah_es","t":"暑假回家的路上","en":"My grandpa loved the Winnetou films, so I sent him a video of the waterfalls where they shot them. He called me straight away.","zh":"我爷爷超爱温内图电影，我在当年拍电影的瀑布边给他拍了段视频。他马上打电话过来。"}],"奥林匹斯山":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"九月","en":"I tell my students the gods lived up here. This year I finally climbed it — no gods, just very tired legs.","zh":"我跟学生说众神住在山上。今年我终于爬上去了——没见到神，只有两条累坏的腿。"}],"蓝湖温泉":[{"npc":"sam","t":"飞欧洲中转","en":"Stopover in Iceland on the way to Europe. Two hours in the lagoon with mud on my face — best jet-lag cure so far.","zh":"去欧洲在冰岛中转。在蓝湖泡了两个小时，脸上抹着泥——目前最好的倒时差办法。"}],"郁金香与风车":[{"npc":"chen_nl","t":"四月的周六","en":"Rented bikes with classmates and rode out to the bulb fields. So many rows of colour — and so many tourists in them.","zh":"跟同学租了自行车骑到花田。一排排的颜色——还有一排排站在里面拍照的游客。"}],"梵蒂冈红酒":[{"npc":"paolo","t":"周日午饭","en":"My cousin works at the Vatican and brings wine from the shop inside. At Sunday lunch we toast him first.","zh":"我表弟在梵蒂冈上班，会从里面的超市带红酒出来。周日午饭我们先敬他一杯。"}],"芬兰咖啡":[{"npc":"aino","t":"中午下班","en":"After my morning shift at the sauna, coffee and a cinnamon bun at the old café on Bulevardi. That's cup number four today — normal in Finland.","zh":"桑拿房早班下来，去 Bulevardi 街上的老咖啡馆喝咖啡吃肉桂卷。这是今天第四杯了——在芬兰很正常。"}],"冰岛酸奶":[{"npc":"giulia","t":"喂完奶的早上","en":"On parental leave in Stockholm, skyr with berries is my breakfast every day. My Italian mother says it's 'just cheese'.","zh":"在斯德哥尔摩休产假，每天早饭都是 skyr 加莓果。我意大利的妈妈说那「就是奶酪嘛」。"}],"哈里萨辣酱":[{"npc":"ines","t":"周六的市场","en":"At the Lyon market there's a Tunisian stall with homemade harissa. My flatmate puts it on everything, even eggs.","zh":"里昂的市场有个突尼斯小摊卖自家做的哈里萨。我室友什么都要抹，连鸡蛋都不放过。"}],"土耳其软糖":[{"npc":"amara","t":"伊斯坦布尔转机","en":"Every Istanbul layover I buy a box of lokum for my mum. The rose ones never survive the flight home.","zh":"每次在伊斯坦布尔转机都给我妈买一盒软糖。玫瑰味的从来撑不到落地。"}],"土耳其咖啡":[{"npc":"emre","t":"下午 3 点","en":"When a regular changes a big amount, I make us both a Turkish coffee. We talk while the grounds settle.","zh":"老客人来换一大笔钱，我就煮两杯土耳其咖啡。等咖啡渣沉下去的时候聊聊天。"}],"马卡龙":[{"npc":"pierre","t":"周五下午","en":"We don't make macarons — that's a different job. But my customers bring them to my shop to eat with my coffee.","zh":"我们店不做马卡龙——那是另一门手艺。不过客人会拿着它来我店里配咖啡吃。"}],"意式浓缩咖啡":[{"npc":"marco_it","t":"早上 8 点 15 分","en":"Espresso at the bar on the way to the bank, one euro twenty, thirty seconds. Then I'm a different person.","zh":"去银行的路上在吧台喝一杯浓缩，一块二，三十秒。然后我就变了个人。"}],"那不勒斯披萨":[{"npc":"nonna_carla","t":"周六晚上","en":"Saturday night the whole family goes for pizza. Each child gets their own — nobody shares a pizza in Naples.","zh":"周六晚上全家去吃披萨。每个孩子一人一张——在那不勒斯没人分着吃一张披萨。"}],"提拉米苏":[{"npc":"chiara","t":"生日聚会","en":"My tiramisù recipe is my grandmother's. My students' parents ask for it at every school party.","zh":"我的提拉米苏是奶奶的方子。学生家长每次学校聚会都来要。"}],"帕玛森奶酪":[{"npc":"lucia_it","t":"周三去市场","en":"I buy a piece of 24-month every week. Forty years doing accounts, and cheese is the only thing I never haggle over.","zh":"我每周买一块熟成 24 个月的。做了四十年账，奶酪是我唯一从来不讲价的东西。"}],"西班牙桑格利亚":[{"npc":"alvaro","t":"夏天的晚上","en":"Our exchange student ordered sangria at the bar. I ordered a tinto de verano — that's what we actually drink.","zh":"家里的交换生在酒吧点了桑格利亚。我点了一杯夏日红酒——我们平时其实喝这个。"}],"黑森林蛋糕":[{"npc":"sabine","t":"周日下午 3 点","en":"Sunday Kaffee und Kuchen at my mother's. She makes the Black Forest cake, and Felix still picks off the cherries.","zh":"周日下午在我妈家喝咖啡吃蛋糕。她做黑森林蛋糕，Felix 到现在还会把樱桃挑出来。"}],"纽伦堡姜饼":[{"npc":"thomas_de","t":"十二月","en":"Every December I order a tin of Elisen Lebkuchen from Nuremberg. My family eats them; I check the nut percentage on the label.","zh":"每年十二月我都从纽伦堡订一盒 Elisen 姜饼。家人负责吃，我负责看标签上的坚果比例。"}],"高达奶酪":[{"npc":"sanne","t":"早饭","en":"Bread with old Gouda, sliced paper-thin with the cheese slicer. Chen still cuts it in thick chunks — we're working on it.","zh":"面包配老高达，用奶酪刨刮得纸一样薄。Chen 还是切成厚厚的块——我们正在纠正他。"}],"比利时啤酒":[{"npc":"daan","t":"周五下班后","en":"From Rotterdam to Antwerp is under an hour. Friday after a shift I go for one Trappist — always in its own glass.","zh":"从鹿特丹到安特卫普不到一小时。周五下班我去喝一杯修道院啤酒——一定要用它自己的杯子。"}],"萨赫蛋糕":[{"npc":"hans","t":"银婚纪念日","en":"For our silver wedding we went to Vienna. My wife wanted Sacher, I wanted Demel, so we had both and argued happily.","zh":"银婚纪念日去了维也纳。老婆要吃萨赫，我要吃 Demel，干脆两家都吃了，开开心心地吵了一下午。"}],"波兰饺子":[{"npc":"freya","t":"午休","en":"There's a Polish pierogi place near our office in Berlin. Half the team goes every Thursday — ruskie for everyone.","zh":"我们柏林办公室旁边有家波兰饺子馆。半个团队每周四都去——每人一份土豆奶酪馅的。"}],"匈牙利牛肉汤":[{"npc":"lena","t":"布达佩斯出差","en":"After a client meeting in Budapest I had a real gulyás. It's a soup! In Berlin I always thought it was a stew.","zh":"在布达佩斯见完客户，喝到了正宗的 gulyás。原来是汤！在柏林我一直以为是炖肉。"}],"希腊沙拉":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"八月的晚上","en":"Summer evenings at the taverna: one horiatiki in the middle, everyone's bread in the oil. No lettuce, of course.","zh":"夏天晚上的小酒馆：中间一大盘乡村沙拉，大家的面包都伸进去蘸油。当然没有生菜。"}],"俄罗斯大列巴":[{"npc":"fang","t":"逛超市","en":"A Shanghai supermarket had a Harbin corner — dalieba next to red sausage. I bought both for my video and finished the sausage first.","zh":"上海一家超市有个哈尔滨专柜，大列巴挨着红肠。为了拍视频两样都买了，红肠先吃完了。"}],"瑞典肉丸":[{"npc":"erik_se","t":"周三晚饭","en":"Meatballs are the one dinner I can cook without looking at my phone. Maja says the lingonberry jam is doing all the work.","zh":"肉丸是我唯一不用看手机就能做的晚饭。Maja 说全靠越橘酱撑着。"}],"丹麦曲奇":[{"npc":"maggie","t":"下雨的下午","en":"My blue tin has held needles and thread since 1987. My granddaughter opened it hoping for biscuits — poor dear.","zh":"我的蓝铁盒从 1987 年起就装针线。孙女打开时还以为是饼干——可怜的孩子。"}],"法国红酒":[{"npc":"helene","t":"周五晚上","en":"Friday after closing the pharmacy, a glass of Bordeaux with my neighbour. Nothing fancy — the supermarket one is fine.","zh":"周五药房关门后，跟邻居喝一杯波尔多。不讲究——超市买的就挺好。"}],"意式冰淇淋":[{"npc":"lin","t":"晚饭后散步","en":"My Roman flatmates taught me: avoid the shops with gelato piled like mountains. Now I'm the strict one.","zh":"罗马室友教我：别去冰淇淋堆成小山的店。现在我比他们还挑。"}],"基伍湖":[{"npc":"tunde","t":"去基加利开完会的周末","en":"After a fintech conference in Kigali, I took the bus to Rubavu. I meant to answer emails by the lake. I ate grilled tilapia and watched the boats instead.","zh":"在基加利开完金融科技的会，我坐大巴去了鲁巴武。本来想在湖边回邮件，结果吃了烤罗非鱼，看了一下午的船。"}],"马卡迪卡迪盐沼":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"休年假的时候","en":"Seven years of patching up dogs in Newtown, and finally I saw zebras on the Makgadikgadi. Hundreds of them, walking in a line across the pan. I just stood there with my mouth open.","zh":"在纽敦给狗看了七年病，终于在马卡迪卡迪看到了斑马。几百只排成一行走过盐沼，我就站在那儿，嘴都合不上。"}],"死海":[{"npc":"noor","t":"周五","en":"Friday trip from Amman to the Dead Sea: forty-five minutes down the hill, and my ears pop. I float, I read one page of my book, then I get salt in a tiny cut and I'm out.","zh":"周五从安曼去死海：往山下开四十五分钟，耳朵都会响。我漂在水上看了一页书，然后盐水碰到一个小伤口，我就上来了。"}],"桌山":[{"npc":"nomvula","t":"周日早上，教堂前","en":"Some Sundays I walk up Platteklip Gorge before church. It's hard on the knees, so I take the cable car down. The floor turns slowly and the whole city goes round.","zh":"有些周日去教堂前，我先从 Platteklip 峡谷走上桌山。下山膝盖受不了，就坐缆车。地板慢慢转，整座城在眼前转一圈。"}],"猴面包树":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"暑假","en":"I showed my class a photo of the Baobab Avenue for years. This summer I finally stood there at sunset. The trees are bigger than any photo — I forgot to take one myself.","zh":"我给学生看猴面包树大道的照片看了好多年，今年暑假终于在日落时站到了那儿。树比照片大多了——我自己都忘了拍。"}],"红海潜水":[{"npc":"omar_de","t":"秋天休假","en":"Half my office in Munich goes to Sharm in October, so I went too. My first dive, I forgot to breathe slowly and used half my air looking at one clownfish.","zh":"慕尼黑办公室一半的人十月都去沙姆沙伊赫，我也去了。第一次下水忘了慢慢呼吸，盯着一条小丑鱼就用掉了半瓶气。"}],"梅尔祖卡沙丘":[{"npc":"hannah_es","t":"交换学期的长周末","en":"Long weekend from Madrid: plane, bus, then a camel to the camp in Merzouga. At night it was so quiet I could hear the sand moving. My host family's grandma made me promise to send photos.","zh":"从马德里出发的长周末：飞机、大巴，再骑骆驼进梅尔祖卡的营地。晚上安静得能听见沙子在动。寄宿家庭的外婆让我保证一定发照片给她。"}],"达纳基尔洼地":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"旅行笔记本上的一页","en":"Danakil, page 41 of my notebook: 'Too hot to write.' That's all I wrote. The salt workers were cutting blocks with axes while I could barely hold my pen.","zh":"达纳基尔，我笔记本第 41 页：「太热，写不了。」就这一句。盐工们拿着斧头在砍盐砖，我连笔都快握不住。"}],"青尼罗河瀑布":[{"npc":"amara","t":"在亚的斯亚贝巴转机多停的两天","en":"I had two days off in Addis, so I flew up to Bahir Dar to see the Blue Nile Falls. It was February — the falls were a bit thin. The boy selling scarves said, 'Come back in August!'","zh":"在亚的斯亚贝巴多停两天，我就飞去巴赫达尔看青尼罗河瀑布。那是二月，水有点少。卖围巾的小男孩说：「八月再来！」"}],"马赛马拉热气球":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"爸妈结婚纪念日","en":"For my parents' anniversary I booked them a balloon over the Mara. I built a spreadsheet to save for it. My dad still talks about the elephants he saw from above.","zh":"爸妈结婚纪念日，我给他们订了马赛马拉的热气球。为了攒这笔钱，我还专门做了一张表格。我爸到现在还在讲他从天上看到的大象。"}],"恩戈罗恩戈罗火山口":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"店里关门三天的时候","en":"I closed my M-Pesa shop for three days — first time in two years — and went to Ngorongoro with my sister. We saw a rhino very far away. My sister says it was a rock. It was a rhino.","zh":"两年来第一次把 M-Pesa 小店关了三天，跟妹妹去了恩戈罗恩戈罗。我们远远看到一头犀牛。妹妹说那是块石头。那就是犀牛。"}],"龙山":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"长周末","en":"After a long case, I drive four hours from Joburg to the Drakensberg and walk until my phone has no signal. The San paintings in the caves make my work feel very small, in a good way.","zh":"打完一个拖了很久的官司，我从约翰内斯堡开四个小时去龙山，一直走到手机没信号。山洞里桑人的画让我觉得自己的工作很小——是好的那种小。"}],"黥基石林":[{"npc":"maja","t":"去马达加斯加的旅行","en":"As an architect, I thought I knew what 'sharp' looked like. Then I crossed the hanging bridge at the Tsingy. No building I've ever drawn is that wild.","zh":"当建筑师这么多年，我以为自己知道「尖」长什么样。直到我走过黥基石林的吊桥。我画过的房子没有一栋这么野。"}],"诺西贝香水岛":[{"npc":"ines","t":"暑假","en":"At the pharmacy I sell ylang-ylang oil in tiny bottles. In Nosy Be I saw the flowers and the old copper still. Honestly, the smell in the air is stronger than anything in our shop 😅","zh":"我在药妆店卖小瓶的依兰精油。到了诺西贝才看到花和老铜蒸馏锅。说实话，空气里的味道比我们店里任何一瓶都浓 😅"}],"祖玛岩":[{"npc":"tolu","t":"去阿布贾演出的路上","en":"Every time we drive up for a show in Abuja, someone in the van shouts 'Zuma!' and we all look for the face in the rock. My drummer says it looks like me when I'm mixing a track.","zh":"每次开车去阿布贾演出，车里总有人喊一声「祖玛！」，大家就一起找岩石上的那张脸。我的鼓手说那张脸像我混音时的样子。"}],"卡库姆吊桥":[{"npc":"kwame","t":"中学春游的回忆","en":"Our school trip to Kakum: my friend Kojo held the rope with both hands and walked like a robot the whole way. Now he's a pilot. I still remind him.","zh":"中学去卡库姆春游：我朋友 Kojo 两只手死死抓着绳子，一路像机器人一样走。现在他当了飞行员。我还常拿这事提醒他。"}],"沃尔特湖":[{"npc":"kofi","t":"回加纳过圣诞","en":"When I go home to Ghana for Christmas, my uncle takes us on the boat at Akosombo. He tells the same story every year: his village is under the lake now.","zh":"回加纳过圣诞时，舅舅会带我们去阿科松博坐船。他每年都讲同一个故事：他的老村子现在在湖底下。"}],"尼罗河源头":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"旅行笔记本","en":"I taught the source of the Nile for thirty years with a map and a pointer. In Jinja I sat in a little boat on the exact spot and wrote one line: 'It just starts, quietly.'","zh":"我拿着地图和教鞭讲了三十年尼罗河源头。在金贾坐着小船停在那个点上，我只写了一句：「它就这么安安静静地开始了。」"}],"骷髅海岸":[{"npc":"daan","t":"去纳米比亚度假","en":"Fifteen years of moving containers in Rotterdam, and I went on holiday to look at ships that never made it to port. The fog came in at noon. I understood the sailors a bit better.","zh":"在鹿特丹搬了十五年集装箱，度假却跑去看那些没能进港的船。中午雾一下子涌上来，我好像更懂那些水手了。"}],"恩希玛":[{"npc":"tom","t":"学校的世界美食周","en":"For world food week, a Zambian mum came into our school kitchen and taught us nshima. Three hundred kids, one huge pot, and my arms ached for two days. The kids asked for it again.","zh":"学校办世界美食周，一位赞比亚妈妈来食堂教我们做恩希玛。三百个孩子、一口大锅，我的胳膊酸了两天。孩子们还要再吃一次。"}],"塞斯瓦":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"同事的婚礼","en":"At my colleague's wedding in Gaborone, the uncles pounded the seswaa in a big iron pot for hours. Only salt, they said, nothing else. I had three plates.","zh":"同事在哈博罗内办婚礼，几个叔叔在大铁锅边捣了几个小时的塞斯瓦。他们说只放盐，别的都不放。我吃了三盘。"}],"纳米比亚啤酒":[{"npc":"hans","t":"下班后的小酒馆","en":"A customer back from Namibia brought me a bottle of Windhoek Lager. I read the label twice: brewed by the German purity law. In Africa! My pub in Hamburg doesn't even sell it.","zh":"一位从纳米比亚回来的客户给我带了一瓶 Windhoek。我把标签看了两遍：按德国纯净法酿的。在非洲！我在汉堡常去的酒馆都没得卖。"}],"马里花生炖菜":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"工作日午饭","en":"There's a tiny Malian canteen near our studio in Paris. I order the mafé every Thursday. In Brazil we also put peanuts in everything, so it feels like home.","zh":"我们巴黎工作室旁边有一家很小的马里食堂，我每周四都点花生炖菜。在巴西我们也什么都放花生，所以吃起来像家里。"}],"萨杂":[{"npc":"precious","t":"夜班后的早上","en":"After a night shift in London, I want sadza. My mum in Harare still makes it with millet sometimes — she says that's how her grandmother did it.","zh":"在伦敦上完夜班，我只想吃萨杂。我妈在哈拉雷有时还用小米做——她说她外婆就是这么做的。"}],"马托基":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"去坎帕拉出差","en":"On a work trip to Kampala, my colleague's mum served matooke wrapped in banana leaves with groundnut sauce. I told her Kenyans eat it too. She said, 'Not like this.'","zh":"去坎帕拉出差，同事的妈妈端上用香蕉叶包着蒸的马托基，配花生酱。我说肯尼亚人也吃。她说：「不是这样吃的。」"}],"马赫布斯":[{"npc":"amara","t":"多哈的转机夜","en":"On a Doha layover, a Qatari colleague invited the crew to her mum's for chicken machboos. I found a black dried lime in my rice and thought it was a mistake. It's the best part.","zh":"在多哈转机过夜，一位卡塔尔同事请机组去她妈妈家吃鸡肉马赫布斯。我在饭里吃到一颗黑黑的干柠檬，还以为放错了。其实那是最好吃的部分。"}],"南非葡萄酒":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"开普敦出差的周六","en":"When I have a case in Cape Town, I stay one more day and drive to Stellenbosch. I'm not an expert — I just ask, 'Which one is the Pinotage?' and look at the mountains.","zh":"在开普敦有案子的时候，我会多留一天开车去斯泰伦博斯。我不懂酒——就问一句「哪个是 Pinotage？」然后看山。"}],"马达加斯加香草":[{"npc":"pierre","t":"早上五点的面包房","en":"I put real Madagascar vanilla in my custard for the flan. When the price jumped, I almost switched to essence. My regulars noticed in one day, so I switched back.","zh":"我做布丁挞的奶油只用真正的马达加斯加香草。香草涨价时我差点换成香精，老顾客一天就吃出来了，我又换了回去。"}],"乔洛夫饭":[{"npc":"adaeze","t":"工作室的周五","en":"Every Friday someone brings jollof to the studio. Last week a client from Accra said hers was better. My tailors stopped sewing. It was a very serious meeting.","zh":"每周五工作室都有人带乔洛夫饭来。上周一位从阿克拉来的客人说她家的更好吃。我的裁缝们全停下了手里的活。那是一场很严肃的会议。"}],"库沙利":[{"npc":"ahmed","t":"回开罗看奶奶","en":"When I visit my grandmother in Cairo, the first thing I do is get koshari from the shop near her flat. As a pharmacist I know it's a lot of carbs. I don't care.","zh":"回开罗看奶奶，我第一件事就是去她家楼下的店买一碗库沙利。当药剂师的我知道这碳水太多了。我不在乎。"}],"摩洛哥薄荷茶":[{"npc":"linhao","t":"同学家的周末","en":"My Moroccan classmate in Lyon invited me home. His dad poured mint tea from really high and didn't spill a drop. I tried once and the table needed cleaning.","zh":"里昂的摩洛哥同学请我去他家。他爸爸把茶壶举得老高往下倒，一滴都没洒。我试了一次，桌子得擦了。"}],"库斯库斯":[{"npc":"gerard","t":"周五和老同事聚餐","en":"Every first Friday of the month, the old railway lads meet at a Moroccan place in Lille for couscous. Forty years of strikes and repairs, and we still argue about merguez or lamb.","zh":"每个月第一个周五，铁路上的老伙计们在里尔一家摩洛哥饭馆吃库斯库斯。罢工、修车四十年，我们还在吵到底加羊肉肠还是羊肉。"}],"乌伽黎":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"晚上关店后","en":"After closing the shop, I make ugali and sukuma wiki for the kids. In 2022 everyone in the queue at my shop was talking about the unga price. People remember those things.","zh":"晚上关了店，我给孩子们做乌伽黎和羽衣甘蓝。2022 年在我店里排队的人都在聊玉米面的价钱。这种事大家都记得。"}],"博博提":[{"npc":"nomvula","t":"周日做完礼拜","en":"After church on Sunday I make bobotie, the way a patient's daughter taught me years ago. Yellow rice, chutney on the side. My kids fight over the corner pieces.","zh":"周日做完礼拜我做博博提，是好多年前一位病人的女儿教我的。配黄米饭，旁边放酸辣酱。孩子们抢着吃边角那几块。"}],"罗马扎瓦":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"马达加斯加旅行","en":"In a little hotely in Antananarivo I ordered romazava. Halfway through, my tongue went numb and I panicked. The owner laughed: 'That's the brèdes mafana — it's working.'","zh":"在塔那那利佛一家小饭馆点了罗马扎瓦。吃到一半舌头突然麻了，我吓了一跳。老板笑着说：「那是 brèdes mafana，在起作用呢。」"}],"苏亚烤肉":[{"npc":"tomo","t":"连上四个夜班后","en":"After four night shifts, my treat is suya from the place near Peckham. My mum says London suya is too polite. She's right, but at 8 a.m. I'm not complaining.","zh":"连上四个夜班后，我奖励自己去佩卡姆附近那家买苏亚。我妈说伦敦的苏亚太「客气」了。她说得对，可早上八点我也不挑。"}],"富富":[{"npc":"kwame","t":"周日家里的院子","en":"Sunday at home in Accra: my aunt turns the fufu, I pound. If I miss the rhythm, she shouts. My little cousin wants to buy a fufu machine. My aunt says over her dead body.","zh":"阿克拉家里的周日：姑姑翻面团，我举杵捣。节奏一乱，她就喊。小表弟想买一台捣富富机，姑姑说除非她不在了。"}],"圣莫尼卡码头":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"周六傍晚","en":"Shot three clips on the pier for a client today. Golden hour lasted about twenty minutes, then a seagull stole someone's churro right in my frame.","zh":"今天在码头给客户拍了三条视频。黄金时间只有二十分钟左右，然后一只海鸥当着我的镜头抢走了别人的吉拿棒。"}],"太空针塔":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"十月的一个周末","en":"Flew up to Seattle for the weekend. Paid to go up the Space Needle and it rained the whole time — still stood on the glass floor until my legs felt weird.","zh":"周末飞去西雅图。花钱上了太空针塔，结果一直在下雨——我还是在玻璃地板上站到腿都发软。"}],"胡佛水坝":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"一个周日","en":"Drove my cousins to Vegas and stopped at the dam on the way. You can see the white ring on the rocks where the water used to be. Hot as an oven up there.","zh":"开车送表弟表妹去拉斯维加斯，路上在大坝停了一下。石头上那圈白印子，就是以前水到的地方。上面热得跟烤箱一样。"}],"阿拉莫":[{"npc":"sarah","t":"春假的一个周四","en":"Drove my sister down from Austin to see the Alamo. It's much smaller than she expected — everyone says that. Then we had tacos on the River Walk.","zh":"从奥斯汀开车带我妹妹去看阿拉莫。比她想象的小多了——每个人都这么说。然后我们去河滨步道吃了塔可。"}],"弗农山庄":[{"npc":"maria_sw","t":"国庆节长周末","en":"Took the train down to D.C. with my niece and spent a day at Mount Vernon. She liked the kitchen and the gardens more than the mansion.","zh":"跟侄女坐火车去华盛顿，在弗农山庄待了一天。她最喜欢厨房和花园，大宅倒没那么感兴趣。"}],"国会山":[{"npc":"sam","t":"7 月 1 日国庆日","en":"Took the bus to Ottawa with friends for Canada Day. Packed lawn, red T-shirts everywhere, and fireworks over the river at ten.","zh":"国庆日和朋友坐大巴去渥太华。草坪上挤满了人，到处是红 T 恤，十点河上放烟花。"}],"佩姬湾灯塔":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"八月的假期","en":"Flew to Halifax to visit my aunt and she drove us to Peggy's Cove. Windy, foggy, beautiful. We stayed on the new deck — the rocks looked way too slippery.","zh":"飞去哈利法克斯看姑姑，她开车带我们去佩姬湾。风大、有雾、很美。我们待在新的观景台上——那些石头看着太滑了。"}],"育空淘金热":[{"npc":"jake","t":"去年七月","en":"Took the summer road trip I'd always talked about, all the way to Dawson City. Tried panning for gold for an hour — found three tiny flakes and a sunburn.","zh":"终于去了一直念叨的夏天自驾，一路开到道森城。试着淘了一小时金——淘到三片小金屑，外加晒伤。"}],"布查特花园":[{"npc":"grace","t":"五月的一个周六","en":"Took the ferry from Vancouver to Victoria just for the gardens. Tulips everywhere. My mom made me take forty photos of her in the Sunken Garden.","zh":"从温哥华坐渡轮去维多利亚，就为了看这座花园。到处是郁金香。我妈让我在下沉花园给她拍了四十张照片。"}],"帝国大厦":[{"npc":"min_ny","t":"周三加班到很晚","en":"From our office window I can see the top of the Empire State. Tonight it's orange and green, and I still don't know what for. I've lived here two years and never gone up.","zh":"从办公室窗口能看到帝国大厦的顶。今晚是橙色加绿色，我也不知道为了什么。在这儿住了两年，还没上去过。"}],"自由钟":[{"npc":"jess","t":"一个周末","en":"Day trip to Philly with my brother. The Liberty Bell line moved fast — five minutes with the crack, then cheesesteaks. Very efficient tourism.","zh":"和我哥一日游去费城。看自由钟的队走得很快——看那道裂缝五分钟，然后去吃芝士牛排。非常高效的旅游。"}],"白宫":[{"npc":"tony","t":"出差的一个晚上","en":"Pitch meeting in D.C. ran late, so I walked past the White House at night. Fences everywhere, a few tourists, one guy with a sign. Smaller than on TV.","zh":"在华盛顿的提案会开到很晚，晚上走路经过白宫。到处是围栏，几个游客，一个人举着牌子。比电视上看着小。"}],"拉什莫尔山":[{"npc":"davies","t":"小时候的暑假","en":"My parents drove us all the way to South Dakota when I was ten. I remember being disappointed the faces didn't have bodies. My mom still has the photo.","zh":"我十岁那年，爸妈开车一路带我们去南达科他。我记得当时很失望，那几张脸下面没有身子。那张照片我妈到现在还留着。"}],"CN塔":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"每天下班","en":"I see the CN Tower every evening walking to Union Station. When my parents visited from India, we ate in the revolving restaurant — Dad watched the view, not his food.","zh":"每天傍晚走去联合车站都能看到 CN 塔。我爸妈从印度来看我的时候，我们在旋转餐厅吃饭——我爸一直看风景，菜都忘了吃。"}],"蒂卡尔":[{"npc":"valeria","t":"去年十二月","en":"Got up at 4 a.m. for the sunrise tour at Tikal. Fog, no sun at all — but the howler monkeys were so loud I thought it was a jaguar.","zh":"在蒂卡尔凌晨四点起来去看日出。全是雾，一点太阳都没有——可吼猴叫得太响，我还以为是美洲豹。"}],"赤道纪念碑":[{"npc":"hannah_es","t":"去年夏天","en":"Did a summer course in Quito and of course went to the equator. Took the classic photo on the yellow line. Then our guide said the real one is 240 metres that way.","zh":"去年夏天在基多上课，当然去了赤道。在黄线上拍了标准照。然后导游说，真的赤道在那边 240 米。"}],"卡塔赫纳":[{"npc":"diego","t":"寒假","en":"Went to Cartagena with friends from uni. We walked the old wall at sunset and bought fruit cups from a palenquera in a bright dress. Too hot to sleep.","zh":"寒假和大学同学去了卡塔赫纳。日落时在老城墙上走了一圈，跟一位穿鲜艳裙子的水果阿姨买了水果杯。热得睡不着。"}],"巴西利亚":[{"npc":"bia","t":"出差的一周","en":"Spent a week in Brasília for work. Everything is huge and far apart — you need a car for everything. But the cathedral inside is beautiful, all blue light.","zh":"出差在巴西利亚待了一周。什么都很大、隔得很远——干什么都得开车。不过大教堂里面很美，全是蓝色的光。"}],"世界尽头乌斯怀亚":[{"npc":"mateo_taxi","t":"冬天的假期","en":"Flew down to Ushuaia from Buenos Aires — three and a half hours and still in Argentina. Got the 'fin del mundo' stamp in my passport at the post office, like every tourist.","zh":"从布宜诺斯艾利斯飞去乌斯怀亚——三个半小时，还在阿根廷。和每个游客一样，在邮局给护照盖了「世界尽头」的章。"}],"面包山缆车":[{"npc":"ana","t":"回巴西过圣诞","en":"Back home for Christmas, I took my German boyfriend up Sugarloaf at sunset. He couldn't stop saying 'wahnsinn'. Then we ate pastel on the beach.","zh":"回巴西过圣诞，傍晚带德国男朋友坐缆车上面包山。他一直说「wahnsinn（太疯狂了）」。然后我们去海边吃了 pastel。"}],"瓦尔帕莱索":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"去年秋天","en":"Spent a long weekend in Valparaíso for a journalism festival. Took the old ascensor up the hill twice just for fun — it creaks like my grandmother's lift.","zh":"去瓦尔帕莱索参加一个新闻节，待了个长周末。为了好玩坐了两次老升降缆车上山——它吱吱响得跟我外婆家的电梯一样。"}],"圣地亚哥":[{"npc":"marcela","t":"出差","en":"Had meetings with a supplier in Santiago. From the hotel window I could see the Andes covered in snow behind the office towers. Buenos Aires has nothing like that.","zh":"去圣地亚哥跟供应商开会。从酒店窗口就能看到写字楼后面白雪覆盖的安第斯山。布宜诺斯艾利斯可没有这样的景。"}],"盐教堂":[{"npc":"pablo","t":"暑假","en":"Visited friends in Bogotá and they took me to the Salt Cathedral. You walk down and down in the dark. I licked a wall — yes, it's really salt.","zh":"去波哥大看朋友，他们带我去了盐教堂。在黑暗里一直往下走。我舔了一下墙——没错，真的是盐。"}],"失落之城":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"去年八月","en":"Four days of mud, rivers and mosquitoes to reach Ciudad Perdida. On the last morning we sat on the terraces in the clouds and nobody said a word.","zh":"泥巴、河、蚊子，走了四天才到失落之城。最后一天早上，我们坐在云里的石台上，谁都没说话。"}],"基多老城":[{"npc":"hannah_es","t":"上课的周末","en":"After class in Quito I'd just wander the old town. Every corner has a church. The altitude got me though — two flights of stairs and I'm out of breath.","zh":"在基多下了课我就在老城里瞎逛。每个街角都有座教堂。可是高原反应把我打败了——爬两层楼梯就喘。"}],"拉巴斯缆车":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"去玻利维亚出差","en":"In La Paz the cable car is the bus. I rode the red line up to El Alto with people going to work, a lady with a sack of potatoes, and a view you'd pay for elsewhere.","zh":"在拉巴斯，缆车就是公交车。我坐红线上埃尔阿尔托，旁边是去上班的人、一位扛着一袋土豆的阿姨，还有在别处要花钱才能看到的风景。"}],"波托西银山":[{"npc":"marcela","t":"去玻利维亚看矿","en":"Went into a mine at Cerro Rico with a guide. We brought coca leaves and drinks for the miners. Low, hot, dusty tunnels — I've worked with metal all my life and never seen it like that.","zh":"跟着向导进了富山的一个矿洞。我们给矿工带了古柯叶和饮料。坑道又低又热又全是灰——我干了一辈子金属的活，从没见过这样的。"}],"埃斯特角之手":[{"npc":"mateo","t":"一月的假期","en":"Crossed the river to Punta del Este with my friends in January. Queue of twenty people to take a photo with the fingers. We did it anyway.","zh":"一月跟朋友过河去了埃斯特角。二十个人排队跟那几根手指拍照。我们还是排了。"}],"桑科乔汤":[{"npc":"maria_sw","t":"一个下雨的周日","en":"My Panamanian neighbour brought over sancocho when I had a cold. She swears by it. The green leaf in it is culantro, not cilantro — she corrected me twice.","zh":"我感冒的时候，巴拿马邻居给我送来一锅桑科乔。她说这个最管用。里面那片绿叶子是刺芫荽，不是香菜——她纠正了我两次。"}],"加洛平托":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"春假","en":"Spring break in Costa Rica. Gallo pinto every single morning with eggs and plantain. By day four I was putting Lizano sauce on everything.","zh":"春假去哥斯达黎加。每天早上都吃加洛平托配鸡蛋和炸大蕉。到第四天我什么都要加 Lizano 酱了。"}],"奇维多":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"夏天在乌拉圭","en":"Every summer in Uruguay I order one chivito and regret it halfway. It's a whole meal in a bun, with an egg on top.","zh":"每年夏天在乌拉圭我都点一个奇维多，吃到一半就后悔。一个面包里就是一整顿饭，上面还有个煎蛋。"}],"萨摩亚石灶":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"一个周日","en":"A Samoan colleague invited me for Sunday lunch after church. Her dad and brothers had been cooking the umu since six. The palusami was the best thing I've eaten all year.","zh":"一个萨摩亚同事请我周日做完礼拜去吃午饭。她爸爸和哥哥们从六点就开始弄石灶了。那个 palusami 是我今年吃过最好吃的东西。"}],"汤加烤乳猪":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"去年的年假","en":"Flew to Nuku'alofa for a colleague's family wedding. In the morning I walked past the white Royal Palace by the sea; by evening the tables were covered in roast pigs, and the dancing went on until two.","zh":"年假飞去努库阿洛法，参加同事家里的婚礼。早上我沿着海边走过白色的王宫；到了晚上，桌上摆满了烤乳猪，跳舞一直跳到凌晨两点。"}],"路易斯安那小龙虾":[{"npc":"sarah","t":"四月的一个周末","en":"Drove to Lafayette for a crawfish boil at a friend's place. Newspaper on the table, five pounds each, spicy corn. My fingers smelled of it for two days.","zh":"开车去拉法叶特，在朋友家吃煮小龙虾。桌上铺报纸，每人五磅，还有辣玉米。我的手指头两天都是那个味儿。"}],"费城芝士牛排":[{"npc":"jess","t":"去费城那天","en":"Stood between Pat's and Geno's for five minutes deciding. Got one from each. My brother says Pat's, I say Geno's, we'll never agree.","zh":"站在 Pat's 和 Geno's 中间犹豫了五分钟。干脆每家买了一个。我哥说 Pat's 好，我说 Geno's 好，我们永远不会达成一致。"}],"冰酒":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"一月","en":"Went to the Niagara icewine festival with friends in January. Minus twelve, ice bars outside, little glasses of icewine. A customer at the bank told me about it.","zh":"一月和朋友去尼亚加拉的冰酒节。零下十二度，外面有冰做的吧台，小杯小杯的冰酒。是银行一位客人告诉我的。"}],"莫吉托":[{"npc":"valeria","t":"去哈瓦那的那周","en":"Of course I squeezed into La Bodeguita del Medio for a mojito. Crowded, loud, walls covered in signatures. Honestly the one in my hotel was better.","zh":"当然挤进了 La Bodeguita del Medio 喝莫吉托。人多、吵，墙上全是签名。说实话，酒店里那杯更好喝。"}],"蓝山咖啡":[{"npc":"marco_ny","t":"店里上新那天","en":"We got a small barrel of Jamaica Blue Mountain at the café. A cup costs three times our house coffee. Half the customers ask why; the other half order two.","zh":"店里进了一小桶牙买加蓝山。一杯是我们招牌咖啡的三倍价钱。一半客人问为什么这么贵，另一半直接点两杯。"}],"巴西莓":[{"npc":"bia","t":"去贝伦出差","en":"In Belém they eat açaí with fried fish and farinha, no sugar. I almost ordered granola like in São Paulo and got a look from the lady.","zh":"在贝伦，大家吃 açaí 配炸鱼和木薯粉，不加糖。我差点像在圣保罗那样要格兰诺拉，被老板娘看了一眼。"}],"黑豆炖肉":[{"npc":"ana","t":"周六中午","en":"Made feijoada in Berlin for my colleagues. Took me all morning and three shops to find the right sausages. Everyone needed a nap afterwards.","zh":"在柏林给同事做黑豆炖肉。花了一上午，跑了三家店才找到对的香肠。吃完大家都得睡个午觉。"}],"恩潘纳达":[{"npc":"mateo","t":"看球的晚上","en":"Big match tonight, so we ordered two dozen empanadas. The usual fight: carne cortada a cuchillo or ground beef. I always lose.","zh":"今晚有大比赛，所以我们订了两打恩潘纳达。老规矩又吵起来：手切牛肉还是绞肉。我每次都输。"}],"皮斯科酸":[{"npc":"pablo","t":"语言交换之夜","en":"A Peruvian student brought pisco to our language exchange and made pisco sours for everyone. Then a Chilean guy said it was Chilean. Best conversation practice ever.","zh":"一个秘鲁学生带了皮斯科来语言交换活动，给大家调皮斯科酸。然后一个智利人说这是智利的。史上最好的口语练习。"}],"智利车厘子":[{"npc":"lt_axiang","t":"过年前一个月","en":"Chilean cherries are in. Customers ask 'how many J?' before they ask the price. This year they're cheaper, so people buy two boxes for the New Year.","zh":"智利车厘子到货了。客人先问「几个 J」，再问价钱。今年便宜，过年大家都买两箱。"}],"阿雷帕":[{"npc":"lucia","t":"值完夜班","en":"A Colombian nurse on my ward makes arepas for the night shift. Plain, with butter and white cheese. Nothing fancy, but at 4 a.m. it's perfect.","zh":"我们病房一位哥伦比亚护士给夜班的人做阿雷帕。原味的，抹黄油、配白奶酪。不花哨，可凌晨四点吃正好。"}],"萨尔特尼亚":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"在拉巴斯的早上","en":"My Bolivian colleague warned me: hold the salteña upright and bite the top. I didn't listen. Juice all over my shirt before a client meeting.","zh":"玻利维亚同事提醒我：萨尔特尼亚要竖着拿，从上面咬。我没听。见客户之前汁流了一衬衫。"}],"委内瑞拉可可":[{"npc":"pierre","t":"一个周二早上","en":"For Easter I make one chocolate tart with Venezuelan cacao. Customers ask why it's more expensive. I let them taste — then they don't ask.","zh":"复活节我会用委内瑞拉可可做一款巧克力挞。客人问为什么更贵。我让他们尝一口——然后就不问了。"}],"委内瑞拉阿雷帕":[{"npc":"andre","t":"午休","en":"There's a Venezuelan arepa spot two blocks from the store. I get the reina pepiada every time. The owner keeps telling me to try pabellón. Maybe next week.","zh":"店两个路口外有家委内瑞拉阿雷帕店。我每次都点 reina pepiada。老板一直让我试试 pabellón。下周吧。"}],"比尼亚莱斯山谷":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"去年复活节假期","en":"I've shown my students photos of karst hills for years, but riding a horse between the mogotes was something else. The farmer gave me a cigar he'd rolled that morning — I don't even smoke, but I kept it.","zh":"我给学生看喀斯特小山的照片看了好多年，真骑着马在这些圆山中间走，完全是另一回事。烟农送了我一支他当天早上卷的雪茄——我都不抽烟，但我留着了。"}],"邓斯河瀑布":[{"npc":"grace","t":"休假的第三天","en":"Three nurses from my unit, holding hands up a waterfall, screaming every time the water hit us. After ten years of night shifts, that was the best I'd felt in ages.","zh":"我们病房三个护士，手拉手往瀑布上爬，每次被水冲到都尖叫。上了十年夜班，好久没这么开心了。"}],"阿雷纳尔火山":[{"npc":"sam","t":"春假","en":"We went in the rainy season, so the volcano hid in the clouds for two days. On the last morning it suddenly came out while I was sitting in a hot spring — the whole pool went quiet.","zh":"我们是雨季去的，火山在云里躲了两天。最后一天早上我正泡在温泉里，它突然露出来了——整个池子的人都安静了。"}],"汤加喷水孔":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"去年七月的假期","en":"We timed it for a windy afternoon and weren't disappointed — the whole coastline went off like it was breathing. My girlfriend got completely soaked trying to get the perfect photo.","zh":"我们特地挑了个起风的下午去，没白去——整条海岸像在呼吸一样一起喷。我女朋友为了拍一张完美的照片，被浇得浑身湿透。"}],"死亡谷":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"2024 年 2 月的一个休息日","en":"Twenty years of driving past that desert, and I'd never seen water in Badwater. When customers told me people were kayaking there, I drove four hours on my day off just to look.","zh":"我在那片沙漠边上开了二十年车，从没见过恶水盆地里有水。听客人说有人在那儿划皮划艇，我休息那天开了四个小时，就为了去看一眼。"}],"雷尼尔山":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"去西雅图出差的周末","en":"Every morning of the conference the mountain was 'out', and every Seattle colleague said so like it was big news. On Saturday I finally drove to Paradise — now I get it.","zh":"开会那几天每天早上山都「出来了」，西雅图的同事每次都像宣布大新闻一样说一遍。周六我终于开车去了「天堂」——现在我懂了。"}],"火山口湖":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"暑假自驾去俄勒冈","en":"I filmed the lake for my channel and every comment said 'that's filtered'. It's not! I literally didn't touch the colour.","zh":"我给频道拍了这个湖，每条评论都说「加滤镜了吧」。真没有！颜色我一点都没调。"}],"阿斯彭滑雪":[{"npc":"sarah","t":"公司融资之后的那个冬天","en":"First real holiday since starting the company. I spent most of it on the beginner slope, and a ski instructor older than my dad kept overtaking me.","zh":"创业以来第一次真正的休假。我大半时间都在初级道上，一个比我爸年纪还大的滑雪教练一直从我旁边超过去。"}],"马蹄湾":[{"npc":"min_ny","t":"来美国后的第一次自驾","en":"I saw this bend on Instagram before I even moved to New York. In real life the edge has no railing — my legs were shaking and I took the photo lying down.","zh":"我还没搬来纽约就在 Instagram 上看过这个弯。真到了那儿，悬崖边没有栏杆——我腿一直在抖，照片是趴着拍的。"}],"冰川国家公园":[{"npc":"jake","t":"七月的暑假","en":"I teach my kids about glaciers every year with a photo from this park. This summer I stood in front of the real one and it was so much smaller than in my slides.","zh":"我每年都用这个公园的一张照片给学生讲冰川。今年夏天站到真冰川前面，它比我幻灯片里的小太多了。"}],"龙卷风走廊":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"退休后的第一个五月","en":"I taught about supercells for thirty years and had never seen one. Our chase van drove eight hours across Kansas — we saw one tornado, far away, for ninety seconds. Worth every kilometre.","zh":"我教了三十年超级单体雷暴，自己一次都没见过。我们的追风车在堪萨斯开了八个小时——远远看到一个龙卷风，九十秒。每一公里都值。"}],"万湖之州":[{"npc":"jake","t":"去明尼苏达朋友家的小木屋","en":"As a Wisconsin guy I'm obliged to say we have more lakes. Then my buddy's family took me out on the ice to fish in January and I stopped arguing — it was too cold to talk.","zh":"作为威斯康星人，我必须说我们的湖更多。后来一月份朋友一家带我去冰上钓鱼，我就不争了——冷得说不出话。"}],"阿肯色钻石坑":[{"npc":"maria_sw","t":"带侄子侄女的暑假","en":"The kids were sure they'd find a giant diamond. Four hours of mud later we found a lot of nice rocks and one very happy dog. They want to go back next year.","zh":"孩子们确信自己会挖到一颗大钻石。在泥里翻了四个小时，我们找到了好多漂亮的石头，还有一只特别开心的狗。他们说明年还要去。"}],"基韦斯特":[{"npc":"marco_ny","t":"二月请了一周假","en":"New York was minus ten, Key West was twenty-seven. I got my Cuban coffee at a little window, watched the sunset at Mallory Square with a thousand strangers, and a chicken stole a piece of my sandwich.","zh":"纽约零下十度，基韦斯特二十七度。我在一个小窗口买了杯古巴咖啡，跟上千个陌生人一起在马洛里广场看日落，还被一只鸡抢走了一块三明治。"}],"新英格兰秋叶":[{"npc":"jess","t":"十月中旬的一个长周末","en":"I write ads for a living, so a whole weekend of roads with zero billboards felt like a spa. We stopped at every farm stand for cider donuts.","zh":"我是靠写广告吃饭的，所以一整个周末开在一块广告牌都没有的路上，感觉像去做了个水疗。我们每路过一个农场小摊都停下来买苹果酒甜甜圈。"}],"迪纳利山":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"退休后第一次长途旅行","en":"Everyone told me only one visitor in three actually sees the summit. On the train the clouds opened for about ten minutes — the whole carriage stood up and nobody spoke.","zh":"大家都跟我说，三个游客里只有一个能真看到山顶。在火车上，云散开了大概十分钟——整节车厢的人都站起来了，没人说话。"}],"威基基海滩":[{"npc":"kenji","t":"在檀香山远程上班的一周","en":"Meetings with Osaka started at 3pm Hawaii time, so I had my mornings free. I fell off the board about forty times, then caught one tiny wave and decided I'm a surfer now.","zh":"跟大阪开会是夏威夷时间下午三点，所以我上午都空着。我从板上摔下来大概四十次，然后抓到一个小小的浪，就觉得自己是冲浪的人了。"}],"芬迪湾潮汐":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"八月开车去沿海三省","en":"At 10am we walked on the sea floor between those giant rocks. At 4pm I came back and the same spot was under water with kayaks floating over it. My brain still can't accept it.","zh":"上午十点我们在那些大石头中间走海底，下午四点再回来，同一个地方已经被水淹了，上面漂着皮划艇。我脑子到现在还没转过来。"}],"冰山巷":[{"npc":"tony","t":"六月请了几天假","en":"I've pitched a hundred ads with icebergs in them and never seen a real one. The boat went close to one the size of our office building, and I spent the whole time trying to describe the colour.","zh":"我做过一百个带冰山的广告提案，却从没见过真的。船开近一座跟我们办公楼一样大的冰山，我一路都在想那个颜色要怎么形容。"}],"耶洛奈夫极光":[{"npc":"yuki","t":"去年二月和 Daniel 一起","en":"My grandmother always said seeing the aurora is lucky. We waited three nights in the cold, and on the last night the sky turned green and moved like a curtain. I called her the next morning.","zh":"我奶奶一直说看到极光会有好运。我们在冷风里等了三个晚上，最后一晚天空变绿，像窗帘一样飘。第二天早上我就给她打了电话。"}],"迈阿密海滩":[{"npc":"andre","t":"十二月 Art Basel 那个周末","en":"Half the sneaker people I know were in Miami that weekend. I spent more time photographing the lifeguard towers than the art — the pink one is my phone wallpaper now.","zh":"我认识的球鞋圈的人那个周末一半都在迈阿密。我拍救生员小塔楼的时间比看艺术展还多——那座粉色的现在是我的手机壁纸。"}],"纪念碑谷":[{"npc":"bia","t":"在美国开完会后的自驾","en":"I stopped on the road where Forrest Gump stops running, like everyone else. Then our Navajo guide told us the names of each rock in his language, and that was the part I didn't expect.","zh":"我跟所有人一样，在阿甘停下来不跑的那条路上停了车。后来纳瓦霍导游用他的语言告诉我们每块石头的名字，这是我没想到的。"}],"优胜美地":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"二月的一个周末","en":"I drove four hours and stood in the cold with two thousand people for ten minutes of orange light on Horsetail Fall. Then the sun went down and everyone clapped, like at a concert.","zh":"我开了四个小时，跟两千个人一起在冷风里站着，就为了看马尾瀑布上十分钟的橙色光。太阳一落，大家都鼓掌，像看完一场演唱会。"}],"红杉林":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"去加州写一篇旅行稿","en":"I came to write about the tallest tree and found out you're not allowed to go near it anymore. So I wrote about the people who got it closed instead. My editor liked that better.","zh":"我本来是来写世界最高的那棵树的，结果发现已经不让靠近了。于是我改写那些让它被封起来的人。编辑反而更喜欢。"}],"夏威夷火山":[{"npc":"jay_comedy","t":"冬天去大岛休假","en":"The ranger said the fountains might start 'sometime tonight, or Thursday'. We waited in the car with snacks for five hours. When it went off I forgot every joke I know.","zh":"巡护员说喷泉「可能今晚开始，也可能星期四」。我们带着零食在车里等了五个小时。它喷起来的时候，我脑子里所有段子都忘光了。"}],"温哥华斯坦利公园":[{"npc":"sam","t":"暑假去温哥华找高中同学","en":"We rented bikes and did the whole seawall. My friend kept stopping to say 'okay, THIS is the best view', about every three minutes.","zh":"我们租了自行车，骑了整圈海堤。我朋友每过三分钟就停下来说一次「好，这里才是最好看的」。"}],"坎昆":[{"npc":"diego","t":"考完期末的假期","en":"I've lived in Mexico City my whole life and had never seen the Caribbean. I saved up from delivery tips for months — the water really is that colour.","zh":"我在墨西哥城住了一辈子，从没见过加勒比海。我攒了好几个月送外卖的小费——海水真的就是那个颜色。"}],"彩虹山":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"回南美探亲时绕路去的","en":"I'm a designer, so I came for the colours. At 5,000 metres I mostly thought about breathing. The colours were real though — I matched three of them to my Pantone app.","zh":"我是做设计的，所以是冲着颜色去的。到了五千米，我脑子里基本只剩呼吸。不过颜色是真的——我用 Pantone 软件对出了其中三种。"}],"的的喀喀湖":[{"npc":"amara","t":"飞利马的一次长休","en":"Our host on the floating island let me walk around in my socks — the reeds felt like a soft mattress. She said this year they had to go much farther to cut new ones.","zh":"浮岛上的房东让我穿着袜子在岛上走——芦苇踩上去像软软的床垫。她说今年要去远得多的地方才割得到新芦苇。"}],"百内国家公园":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"七十岁生日那年","en":"I've walked in Norwegian wind all my life, but the wind on the W Trek pushed me to my knees twice. At sunrise the towers went red and I cried a little — I'll blame the wind for that too.","zh":"我在挪威的风里走了一辈子，可 W 线的风两次把我吹得跪下来。日出时三根塔变红，我哭了一点——这个也算在风头上吧。"}],"科帕卡巴纳海滩":[{"npc":"bia","t":"2025 年 5 月从圣保罗坐夜车去的","en":"Two million people on one beach and I still found my three friends, because we all wore the same ridiculous hats. I was back at my laptop on Monday with no voice.","zh":"两百万人在一个海滩上，我还是找到了我那三个朋友，因为我们都戴了一样可笑的帽子。星期一我回到电脑前，嗓子完全哑了。"}],"阿空加瓜山":[{"npc":"marcela","t":"去门多萨看表妹","en":"I'm not climbing anything, I sell nails and screws. But we drove to the viewpoint and my cousin pointed at the white peak and said 'that's the roof of the Americas'. I bought a postcard for the shop.","zh":"我不爬山，我是卖钉子螺丝的。不过我们开车到了观景台，表妹指着那座白色的山顶说「那是美洲的屋顶」。我买了张明信片挂在店里。"}],"月亮谷":[{"npc":"valeria","t":"去智利进货的那趟","en":"I went looking for stones for my jewellery and ended up sitting on the big dune until it got dark. I didn't buy anything — I just took a hundred photos of the colours to use in my next collection.","zh":"我本来是去找做首饰的石头，结果坐在大沙丘上一直到天黑。什么都没买——只拍了一百张颜色的照片，下一批首饰要用。"}],"塔蒂奥间歇泉":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"寒假的南美旅行","en":"Alarm at 3:45, minus twelve degrees, and my phone died from the cold after two photos. The video I did get is the most-viewed thing on my channel.","zh":"闹钟三点四十五，零下十二度，手机拍了两张就冻没电了。最后拍到的那段视频，是我频道里播放最多的。"}],"彩虹河":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"去哥伦比亚写一篇报道","en":"The guide made us wash off our sunscreen before going near the water. I complained, then I saw the red and understood why. My article was mostly about him.","zh":"导游让我们先把防晒霜洗掉才能靠近河。我抱怨了几句，后来看到那片红色就明白了。我的文章后来大半都在写他。"}],"钦博拉索山":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"去厄瓜多尔交流的暑假","en":"I've told my students for years that this is the point closest to the stars. Standing at the refuge at 4,800 metres, I couldn't even finish the sentence without stopping to breathe.","zh":"我跟学生说了好多年，这里是离星星最近的地方。站在 4800 米的避难所，我连这句话都得停下来喘口气才说得完。"}],"科托帕希火山":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"在基多转机多留的两天","en":"We rode mountain bikes down from the car park and I braked the whole way. Wild horses just watched us like we were the strange ones.","zh":"我们从停车场骑山地车往下冲，我一路都在刹车。野马就站在那儿看着我们，好像我们才是奇怪的那个。"}],"太阳岛":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"南美之旅的最后一站","en":"No cars, no motorbikes, just donkeys and very steep steps. At my age I counted every one of the Inca stairs. A little girl selling bread passed me three times.","zh":"没有汽车，没有摩托，只有驴和特别陡的台阶。我这把年纪，印加台阶一级一级数着爬。一个卖面包的小姑娘从我身边经过了三次。"}],"恐龙脚印墙":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"在玻利维亚背包旅行时","en":"I work with animals every day, but standing under footprints from something the size of a bus was humbling. My nephew made me send him a photo of every single track.","zh":"我天天跟动物打交道，可站在一只公交车那么大的动物留下的脚印下面，还是觉得自己好小。我外甥让我每个脚印都拍一张发给他。"}],"罗赖马山":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"读书会选了《失落的世界》以后","en":"Our book club read The Lost World and I said, half joking, that someone should go. Six days of mud later I was on top, in the rain, and I've never felt more like a character in a novel.","zh":"读书会读完《失落的世界》，我半开玩笑说总得有人去一趟。在泥里走了六天，我站在了山顶，淋着雨，从来没觉得自己这么像小说里的人。"}],"马拉开波湖闪电":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"在哥伦比亚出差后的周末","en":"There was no thunder at all, just the whole sky flashing white for hours. I'm a product manager — my first thought was 'who's running this and why is there no off switch?'","zh":"一点雷声都没有，就是整片天空一闪一闪白了好几个小时。我是做产品经理的——第一个念头是「这是谁在运营？为什么没有关闭按钮？」"}],"洛斯罗克斯群岛":[{"npc":"marco_it","t":"跟大学同学的夏天","en":"The guesthouse we stayed in on Gran Roque was run by an Italian couple, so I ordered pasta on a Caribbean island and it was excellent. The boatman left us alone on a cay with an umbrella until five.","zh":"我们在格兰罗克住的民宿是一对意大利夫妻开的，所以我在加勒比的小岛上点了意大利面，居然很好吃。船夫把我们和一把伞留在一个小岛上，五点才来接。"}],"萨摩亚海沟泳池":[{"npc":"mia","t":"大学放假跟朋友去萨摩亚","en":"The ladder down looks worse than it is. In the water you really feel the ocean pulling — I held the rope the whole time and pretended I was relaxed for the photos.","zh":"往下的梯子看着比实际吓人。到了水里真能感觉到海在拉你——我全程抓着绳子，拍照时假装很放松。"}],"《装扮好了》":[{"npc":"omar_de","t":"圣诞前一个周末","en":"Lisa took me to the Christmas market in Salzburg. Her Austrian cousins couldn't stop talking about Aufputzt is' — I understood maybe half the dialect jokes.","zh":"Lisa 带我去萨尔茨堡逛圣诞市集。她的奥地利表姐妹一直在聊《装扮好了》——那些方言笑话我大概只听懂一半。"}],"《曼尼图的独木舟》":[{"npc":"lukas","t":"周五晚上","en":"My aunt in Vienna sent me a voice message from the cinema. All I could hear was the whole room laughing — no idea what the joke was.","zh":"维也纳的姑姑在电影院里给我发了条语音。我只听见整个影厅在笑——完全不知道笑的是哪句。"}],"《伊甸之东》":[{"npc":"hannah_es","t":"周日晚上","en":"My mum back in Germany is already on episode five of East of Eden. I'm stuck on two — Pilar's family always has the news on at dinner.","zh":"我德国的妈妈《伊甸之东》都看到第五集了。我还卡在第二集——Pilar 家吃晚饭时总开着新闻。"}],"JJ":[{"npc":"katrin","t":"去维也纳出差的晚上","en":"I queued for a standing ticket at the Staatsoper after work. Half the queue were young people who'd discovered opera through JJ.","zh":"下班后我去国家歌剧院排站票。排队的一半是年轻人，都是因为 JJ 才开始听歌剧的。"}],"《星际宝贝史迪奇》·比利时":[{"npc":"thomas_fr","t":"周六下午","en":"Took the train to Brussels for my niece's birthday. She made all of us do the Stitch face in the cinema queue.","zh":"坐火车去布鲁塞尔给外甥女过生日。她让我们排队进影厅时全都学 Stitch 的鬼脸。"}],"《伊甸之东》·比利时":[{"npc":"katrin","t":"周三晚上","en":"Our design team has a 'no spoilers' rule for East of Eden now. Someone put a sticky note on the coffee machine.","zh":"我们设计组现在对《伊甸之东》有「不许剧透」的规矩。有人在咖啡机上贴了张便利贴。"}],"安杰尔":[{"npc":"ines","t":"期末复习的深夜","en":"Angèle is my revision playlist. My Belgian flatmate sings every word, I just hum and pretend I'm studying.","zh":"Angèle 是我的复习歌单。比利时室友每个字都会唱，我只会哼，假装在看书。"}],"《女英雄》":[{"npc":"precious","t":"夜班后的早上","en":"A colleague made me watch Heldin. The bit where she runs between three call bells — that's my Tuesday. I cried on the bus home.","zh":"同事非要我看《女英雄》。她在三个呼叫铃之间来回跑那段——就是我的周二。回家的公交上我哭了。"}],"《星际宝贝史迪奇》·瑞士":[{"npc":"freya","t":"去苏黎世出差的周日","en":"It rained all Sunday in Zurich, so I went to the cinema alone. I was the only adult there without a child — and I laughed the loudest.","zh":"苏黎世下了一整个周日的雨，我一个人去看电影。全场只有我一个大人没带小孩——还笑得最大声。"}],"《伊甸之东》·瑞士":[{"npc":"poppy","t":"周一收摊后","en":"Since East of Eden came out, three people have asked me for 1910s farm dresses. I had to dig through my whole storage unit.","zh":"《伊甸之东》上线后，有三个人来问我要 1910 年代的农场连衣裙。我把整个仓库翻了一遍。"}],"赫希特乐队":[{"npc":"lukas","t":"周四晚上","en":"A Swiss guy at my new job in Munich played me Hecht at lunch. Now Mon Amour is stuck in my head, and I still can't pronounce half of it.","zh":"慕尼黑新公司一个瑞士同事午饭时给我放了 Hecht。现在《Mon Amour》在我脑子里循环，可我一半的词还是不会念。"}],"《浪潮》":[{"npc":"oliver","t":"周日晚上","en":"Watched Waves for our newsroom film club. Reporters holding a live mic while tanks roll in — it made my inflation explainer feel very small.","zh":"编辑部电影俱乐部一起看了《浪潮》。坦克开进来时记者还拿着话筒直播——我写的通胀解读一下子显得好渺小。"}],"《我的世界大电影》·捷克":[{"npc":"tobias_sim","t":"在布拉格过周末","en":"We went to a cinema near Wenceslas Square. Teenagers screamed every time a creeper showed up — I've never heard a cinema that loud.","zh":"我们去了瓦茨拉夫广场附近的电影院。每次苦力怕出来，青少年就尖叫——我从没听过这么吵的电影院。"}],"《伊甸之东》·捷克":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"读书会那个周四","en":"We'd picked East of Eden for book club months ago. Then the series came out and suddenly twelve people turned up instead of six — most hadn't finished the book.","zh":"读书会几个月前就选了《伊甸之东》。剧一出来，平时来六个人，那天来了十二个——大多数书都没读完。"}],"埃娃·法尔娜":[{"npc":"jana_ber","t":"去布拉格的周末","en":"My Polish neighbour dragged me to Ewa Farna in Prague. She sang one song in Czech, the next in Polish — the crowd switched languages with her.","zh":"波兰邻居拉我去布拉格看 Ewa Farna。她一首唱捷克语，下一首唱波兰语——台下的人跟着她换语言。"}],"《曼尼图的独木舟》·德国":[{"npc":"becker","t":"周二下午场","en":"I saw the first one in 2001 with my son. This time he took me — and quoted every line before the actors said it.","zh":"2001 年我带儿子看第一部。这次换他带我去——演员还没开口，他就把台词先说出来了。"}],"《伊甸之东》·德国":[{"npc":"lena","t":"孩子睡了以后","en":"Two episodes after the kids were asleep, then I lay awake googling 'timshel'. Bad idea on a school night.","zh":"孩子睡了我看了两集，然后躺在床上搜「timshel」到半夜。第二天还要上学呢，真不该。"}],"希琳·大卫":[{"npc":"ana","t":"周六早上去跳蚤市场","en":"Gut genug came on at the Mauerpark flea market and three strangers next to me started singing. I only knew 'gut genug', so I sang that loudly.","zh":"在 Mauerpark 跳蚤市场放起了《Gut genug》，旁边三个陌生人跟着唱。我只会「gut genug」这一句，就大声唱这一句。"}],"《格子忍者3》":[{"npc":"freya","t":"回哥本哈根的周末","en":"My nephew made me watch Ternet Ninja 3 at Palads. He laughed at the rude jokes, I laughed at the Copenhagen ones. Everyone wins.","zh":"外甥拉我去 Palads 影院看《格子忍者3》。他笑那些粗鲁的笑话，我笑那些哥本哈根的梗。大家都开心。"}],"《一见钟情就结婚（丹麦版）》":[{"npc":"freya","t":"周四晚上视频通话","en":"My Danish friends still have a group chat just for Gift ved første blik. Every Thursday it's 200 messages about one couple.","zh":"我的丹麦朋友们还有个专门聊《一见钟情就结婚》的群。每周四，为了一对夫妻刷两百条。"}],"克里斯托弗":[{"npc":"camille","t":"哥本哈根时装周的晚上","en":"After the shows in Copenhagen, our taxi driver played Christopher the whole way to the hotel and sang the Danish one to us. Best concert of the week.","zh":"哥本哈根看完秀，出租车司机一路放 Christopher，还给我们唱那首丹麦语的。这是我这周听过最好的演唱会。"}],"《特伦特总统》":[{"npc":"alvaro","t":"周五晚上","en":"Took two exchange students to Torrente on Gran Vía. They didn't get half the jokes, but they laughed every time the whole cinema did.","zh":"带两个交换生在格兰大道看《特伦特》。笑点他们一半没懂，可全场一笑他们就跟着笑。"}],"《星际宝贝》":[{"npc":"lucia","t":"夜班后的休息日","en":"My day off after three nights, and my nephew wanted Lilo y Stitch. I fell asleep for ten minutes and he says I missed the best part.","zh":"连上三个夜班后的休息日，外甥要看《星际宝贝》。我睡着了十分钟，他说我错过了最好看的一段。"}],"《蚁丘》":[{"npc":"abuela","t":"晚饭后","en":"El hormiguero is my after-dinner show. Hannah laughs at the ants before she understands what they say — that's how you know they're good.","zh":"《蚁丘》是我饭后看的节目。Hannah 还没听懂蚂蚁说什么就先笑了——这说明它们演得好。"}],"克韦多":[{"npc":"pablo","t":"周二语言交换","en":"Someone asked for La Graciosa at language exchange and the English half learned more Spanish in three minutes than all evening.","zh":"语言交换时有人点了《La Graciosa》，说英语的那一半在三分钟里学到的西班牙语比一整晚都多。"}],"《一百升萨赫蒂》":[{"npc":"aino","t":"桑拿房下班后","en":"An old man at the sauna said 100 litraa sahtia is exactly like his village. Then he spent twenty minutes explaining how his grandmother brewed it.","zh":"桑拿房里一个老爷爷说《一百升萨赫蒂》跟他村里一模一样。然后他花了二十分钟讲他奶奶当年怎么酿。"}],"《我的世界大电影》·芬兰":[{"npc":"omar_de","t":"去赫尔辛基出差的晚上","en":"I watched Minecraft in Helsinki with Finnish subtitles and English sound. Half the audience were dads who clearly played more than their kids.","zh":"我在赫尔辛基看的《我的世界》，英语原声配芬兰语字幕。一半观众是爸爸，看得出他们玩得比孩子还多。"}],"《只是生活》":[{"npc":"aino","t":"周五晚上","en":"Friday is Vain elämää night. My sister and I bet on who will cry first — usually it's me, not the singers.","zh":"周五是看《只是生活》的晚上。我和妹妹打赌谁先哭——通常是我，不是那些歌手。"}],"伊萨克·艾略特":[{"npc":"aino","t":"夏天的海边桑拿","en":"A group of girls came out of the sauna singing Kaiken varalta and jumped into the sea on the last note. Perfect timing.","zh":"一群女孩唱着《Kaiken varalta》从桑拿房出来，最后一个音正好跳进海里。时机完美。"}],"《多一点点爱》":[{"npc":"pierre","t":"周一关店日","en":"My wife made me go on our day off. I laughed, then I cried, then I laughed again. Customers talked about it at the counter for weeks.","zh":"关店那天太太拉我去看。我笑了，又哭了，然后又笑了。好几个星期，客人在柜台前都在聊这部片。"}],"《疯狂动物城2》":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"周日下午","en":"I went to Zootopie 2 to practise French with something easy. Turns out a fast-talking fox is not easy at all.","zh":"我去看《疯狂动物城2》，想用简单的东西练法语。结果说话飞快的狐狸一点也不简单。"}],"《国家宪兵干预队》":[{"npc":"thomas_fr","t":"周六晚上","en":"I told myself one episode of GIGN. It's six episodes. You can guess what happened to my Saturday night.","zh":"我跟自己说只看一集《GIGN》。一共六集。你猜我的周六晚上怎么样了。"}],"迪西兹与西奥多拉":[{"npc":"lea","t":"周六店里最忙的时候","en":"Melodrama has been on our shop playlist since September. A customer asked me to turn it off once — two others asked me to turn it up.","zh":"《Melodrama》从九月起就在我们店的歌单里。有个客人让我关掉——另外两个让我开大声。"}],"《BJ单身日记：为男孩痴狂》":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"周五下班","en":"Our whole office went to Bridget Jones on Valentine's week. My boss still has the original diary book on her desk.","zh":"情人节那周我们全办公室去看《BJ单身日记》。我老板桌上还放着最早那本日记小说。"}],"《我的世界大电影》·英国":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"复活节周末","en":"Minecraft weekend in Leicester Square: I swept up more popcorn after the chicken jockey bit than after the whole of Christmas.","zh":"莱斯特广场的《我的世界》周末：「鸡骑士」那段之后我扫的爆米花，比整个圣诞节还多。"}],"《叛徒》":[{"npc":"ahmed","t":"周五晚上","en":"Friday night is Traitors night at home. My daughters vote out whoever looks nervous, and I'm always the first one banished.","zh":"周五晚上是我家的《叛徒》之夜。我两个女儿谁看起来紧张就投谁，每次第一个被赶走的都是我。"}],"萨姆·芬德与奥利维亚·迪恩":[{"npc":"kofi","t":"周六下午","en":"Rein Me In comes on the radio in my shop about four times a day. My oldest customer, 80 years old, now hums it during his trim.","zh":"《Rein Me In》在我店里的收音机一天大概放四遍。我最老的客人八十岁了，现在剪头时也哼它。"}],"《卡波迪斯特里亚斯》":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"寒假前最后一周","en":"Half my students saw Kapodistrias over Christmas. In class they argued about which scenes were real history — the best philosophy lesson I had all year.","zh":"我一半的学生圣诞节去看了《卡波迪斯特里亚斯》。上课时他们争论哪些是真的历史——这是我一年里最好的一堂哲学课。"}],"《深水之下》":[{"npc":"tomo","t":"连上四个夜班之后","en":"After four nights on the wards I watched all of Below in one go. Probably not the most relaxing choice.","zh":"病房连上四个夜班后，我一口气看完了《深水之下》。大概不是最放松的选择。"}],"莱特":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"带学生去塞萨洛尼基的春季旅行","en":"On our school trip to Thessaloniki, the students played Light on the bus the whole way. When we reached Aristotelous Square one of them shouted, 'This is his city, miss!'","zh":"带学生去塞萨洛尼基春游，大巴上他们一路放 Light。到了亚里士多德广场，有个学生喊：「老师，这是他的城市！」"}],"《婚礼》":[{"npc":"hans","t":"午休","en":"My colleague from Zagreb watched Svadba with both her grandmothers — one Croatian, one Serbian. She says they laughed at different jokes.","zh":"我那个萨格勒布来的同事和她两个奶奶一起看了《婚礼》——一个是克罗地亚人，一个是塞尔维亚人。她说两个人笑的地方不一样。"}],"《我的世界大电影》·克罗地亚":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"周六早场","en":"Saturday morning Minecraft screening: half the room were dads in creeper T-shirts. Loudest crowd I sold tickets to all year.","zh":"周六早场的《我的世界》：一半观众是穿苦力怕 T 恤的爸爸。这是我今年卖票遇到的最吵的一场。"}],"《伊甸之东》·克罗地亚":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"周四读书会","en":"Our book club picked East of Eden this month because of the Netflix show. First time in years everyone actually finished the book.","zh":"因为 Netflix 那部剧，我们读书会这个月选了《伊甸之东》。好几年来第一次，大家真的都把书读完了。"}],"雅科夫·约齐诺维奇":[{"npc":"amara","t":"萨格勒布过夜","en":"Overnight in Zagreb. The taxi driver had Jakov Jozinović on the radio all the way into town — said his daughter has his poster on her wall.","zh":"在萨格勒布过一夜。出租车司机一路放 Jakov Jozinović 的歌，说他女儿墙上就贴着 Jakov 的海报。"}],"《没有你我怎么活》":[{"npc":"lena","t":"又去布达佩斯出差","en":"Back in Budapest for work. My client asked if I'd seen the Demjén film, then hummed the songs in the taxi all the way to the meeting.","zh":"又去布达佩斯出差。客户问我看没看德米安那部电影，然后在去开会的出租车上一路哼那些歌。"}],"《蜘蛛侠：崭新之日》":[{"npc":"sam","t":"首映夜","en":"Opening-night Spider-Man with my roommates. I study psychology, so of course we argued about Peter's choices all the way home.","zh":"跟室友去看蜘蛛侠首映。我学心理学的，所以一路上当然都在争 Peter 做得对不对。"}],"《伊甸之东》·匈牙利":[{"npc":"maggie","t":"周日晚上","en":"I taught East of Eden to sixth-formers for years. Now my granddaughter rings me after every episode to ask what happens to Cathy.","zh":"我教了好多年高中生读《伊甸之东》。现在孙女每看完一集就打电话问我，凯茜后来怎么样了。"}],"德什":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"实验室的茶水间","en":"Our Hungarian colleague played Desh in the lab kitchen and told us the name means \"ten\" — his old football shirt number.","zh":"我们的匈牙利同事在实验室茶水间放 Desh 的歌，还告诉我们这名字是「十」的意思——他以前球衣的号码。"}],"《膝盖骨》":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"周五晚上的电影","en":"My Irish flatmate dragged us to Kneecap. Half of it is in Irish with subtitles, and we still laughed the whole way through.","zh":"爱尔兰室友硬拉我们去看《膝盖骨》。一半是爱尔兰语配字幕，可我们从头笑到尾。"}],"《迈克尔》":[{"npc":"jake","t":"开车去芝加哥的路上","en":"After seeing Michael, we stopped in Gary on the way to Chicago and drove past the Jacksons' old house. It's tiny for such a big family.","zh":"看完《迈克尔》，去芝加哥的路上我们在加里停了一下，开车经过杰克逊家的老房子。那么一大家子，房子好小。"}],"《与星共舞（爱尔兰版）》":[{"npc":"beth_gp","t":"周日晚上","en":"My sister in Cork texts me all through Dancing with the Stars on Sunday nights. She votes; I just judge the dresses.","zh":"我在科克的姐姐每个周日晚上看《与星共舞》，一边看一边给我发短信。她负责投票，我负责点评裙子。"}],"翠鸟乐队":[{"npc":"tom","t":"早上切菜的时候","en":"Our new kitchen assistant is from Limerick and plays Kingfishr on repeat while we chop veg. Now the whole kitchen hums along.","zh":"厨房新来的帮手是利默里克人，切菜时一直循环放 Kingfishr。现在整个厨房都跟着哼。"}],"《触碰》":[{"npc":"kazuo","t":"讲解完的下午","en":"A visitor from Reykjavík told me about Touch — part of it is about a family from Hiroshima. I've written the title down to watch it.","zh":"一位从雷克雅未克来的参观者跟我说起《触碰》——里面有一部分讲的是从广岛出去的一家人。我把片名记下来了，想去看。"}],"《我的世界大电影》·冰岛":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"下班后","en":"My cousin in New Zealand says they filmed the Minecraft movie in Huntly. He drove past the set and thought it was a real American town.","zh":"我在新西兰的表哥说《我的世界》电影是在亨特利拍的。他开车经过片场，还以为是真的美国小镇。"}],"《伊甸之东》·冰岛":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"下雨的秋夜","en":"I read East of Eden at twenty. Now I'm watching it on dark, rainy Bergen evenings, with tea and a blanket.","zh":"我二十岁读的《伊甸之东》。现在卑尔根秋天的晚上又黑又下雨，我裹着毯子、喝着茶看这部剧。"}],"FM95BLÖ":[{"npc":"aino","t":"周五晚上的桑拿","en":"A group of Icelanders in the sauna tonight kept singing City Of Joy. They said it's from a Friday radio show back home.","zh":"今晚桑拿房里有一群冰岛人一直在唱《City Of Joy》。他们说这是家乡一个周五电台节目里的歌。"}],"《一路顺风》":[{"npc":"chiara","t":"圣诞节第二天","en":"The whole family went to the new Zalone film on the 26th. My nonna laughed louder than the kids.","zh":"圣诞节第二天全家一起去看扎洛内的新片。我奶奶笑得比小孩还大声。"}],"《真男人》":[{"npc":"marco_it","t":"周日晚上在沙发上","en":"My flatmate made me watch Maschi veri. I laughed for an hour, then realised I'm a bit like one of them.","zh":"室友非拉我看《真男人》。我笑了一个小时，然后发现自己有点像里面的某个人。"}],"杰奥利尔":[{"npc":"nonna_carla","t":"孙子出门前","en":"My grandson queued for Geolier tickets at the Maradona. I don't understand rap, but he sings in our Neapolitan, so I listen.","zh":"孙子为了 Geolier 在马拉多纳球场的票排了好久的队。说唱我听不懂，可他唱的是我们那不勒斯话，所以我也听。"}],"《情人男孩：情绪关闭》":[{"npc":"daan","t":"周六晚场","en":"Took my teenage son to Loverboy. Heavy film. We talked about it the whole tram ride home.","zh":"带十几岁的儿子去看《情人男孩》。片子很沉重，坐电车回家一路都在聊。"}],"《我的世界大电影》·荷兰":[{"npc":"chen_nl","t":"下课以后","en":"Saw the Minecraft movie at Tuschinski — the most beautiful cinema I've ever been to, showing the most blocky film ever.","zh":"在 Tuschinski 看了《我的世界》——我去过的最漂亮的电影院，放的是最方块的电影。"}],"《爱情盲选：荷兰篇》":[{"npc":"sanne","t":"周三晚上","en":"New Love is Blind episodes drop and our group chat explodes. Half of my friends are already planning their own pod dates.","zh":"《爱情盲选》一出新集，我们的群聊就炸了。一半朋友已经在想自己隔着墙约会会怎样。"}],"苏珊与弗雷克":[{"npc":"carlos","t":"周五在酒吧","en":"Suzan & Freek came on in the bar and every Dutch person sang along. I just clapped and pretended I knew the words.","zh":"酒吧里放到 Suzan & Freek，所有荷兰人都跟着唱。我只能拍手，假装自己会。"}],"《如果没人上钩》":[{"npc":"erik_se","t":"带外甥女看电影","en":"Took my niece to the Norwegian mouse film — here in Sweden it's called Om ingen går i fällan. Mice versus humans, and she cheered for the mice.","zh":"带外甥女去看那部挪威老鼠电影——在瑞典叫 Om ingen går i fällan。老鼠对人类，她一直给老鼠加油。"}],"《舞动奇迹（挪威版）》":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"周六晚上","en":"Saturday nights in autumn are for Skal vi danse. I vote every week, and I'm usually wrong.","zh":"秋天的周六晚上就是看《Skal vi danse》。我每周都投票，通常都猜错。"}],"ULD":[{"npc":"elin","t":"去丹麦听民谣节","en":"At a folk festival in Denmark, three Norwegian women with a piano and an accordion — ULD — made the whole tent go quiet.","zh":"在丹麦的一个民谣节上，三个挪威女生，一架钢琴一架手风琴——ULD——让整个帐篷都安静下来了。"}],"《克莱克斯学院》":[{"npc":"freya","t":"午休时","en":"My Polish colleague took her daughter to see Kleks twice. Now she says every pen in the office is a magic pen.","zh":"波兰同事带女儿看了两遍《克莱克斯学院》。现在她说办公室里每支笔都是魔法笔。"}],"《我的世界大电影》·波兰":[{"npc":"ren","t":"周五夜场","en":"Saw the Minecraft movie in Shinjuku with a bunch of gamers. Every time a game joke came up, the whole row cheered.","zh":"在新宿跟一群玩游戏的人看《我的世界》。每次出现游戏梗，整排都在欢呼。"}],"《玩偶》":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"写稿的晚上","en":"The Doll is in Netflix's top ten here in Buenos Aires too. I'm reading Prus in Spanish so I can write about it.","zh":"《玩偶》在布宜诺斯艾利斯的 Netflix 也进了前十。我在读普鲁斯的西班牙语译本，好写篇稿子。"}],"男人之歌2026乐团":[{"npc":"hannah_es","t":"早上做早饭时","en":"My Polish flatmate in Madrid plays Nareszcie every morning. She says it's the song everyone sings at the end of a big summer tour back home.","zh":"我在马德里的波兰室友每天早上都放《Nareszcie》。她说这是家乡一个夏天大巡演每场最后大家一起唱的歌。"}],"《子弹与饼干：再来一件事》":[{"npc":"rui","t":"早餐时","en":"A guest from up north laughed telling me about Balas & Bolinhos — grown men moving back in with their parents. \"That's half my friends,\" he said.","zh":"一位从北边来的客人笑着跟我讲《子弹与饼干》——一群大男人搬回爸妈家住。他说：「我一半朋友就是这样。」"}],"《星际宝贝》·葡萄牙":[{"npc":"tiago","t":"周日下午","en":"Took my nephew to Lilo & Stitch, dubbed in Portuguese. Now he calls me Stitch whenever I'm grumpy before coffee.","zh":"带侄子去看了葡语配音的《星际宝贝》。现在我早上没喝咖啡脾气不好，他就叫我史迪奇。"}],"希科·达蒂娜":[{"npc":"rui","t":"八月的晚上","en":"Guests from Viana do Castelo played Chico da Tina in the courtyard — rap with an accordion. By midnight my neighbours were dancing too.","zh":"从维亚纳堡来的客人在院子里放 Chico da Tina——带手风琴的说唱。到半夜，连邻居都跟着跳起来了。"}],"《最后的旅程》":[{"npc":"maja","t":"周日晚上","en":"Watched Den sista resan with my dad. We both cried, then argued about where we'd drive if we ever did a trip like that.","zh":"跟爸爸一起看了《最后的旅程》。我们俩都哭了，然后争了半天，要是我们也来一趟，该开去哪儿。"}],"《我的世界大电影》·瑞典":[{"npc":"johan","t":"公司团建","en":"Half our game studio went to the Minecraft movie together. Making games in Stockholm, it felt a bit like cheering for the home team.","zh":"我们游戏公司一半人一起去看了《我的世界》。在斯德哥尔摩做游戏的人看这部，有点像给主队加油。"}],"《瑞典歌唱大赛》":[{"npc":"giulia","t":"三月的周六","en":"My first Mello in Sweden: the neighbours threw a party with scorecards and snacks. In Italy we have Sanremo, so I felt right at home.","zh":"在瑞典看的第一场 Mello：邻居开派对，有打分表、有零食。我们意大利有圣雷莫，所以我一点都不陌生。"}],"维克多·莱克塞尔":[{"npc":"anna_se","t":"开车送女儿","en":"My daughter has Victor Leksell tickets for Avicii Arena. I'm officially the driver. Unofficially, I know all the songs too.","zh":"女儿抢到了 Victor Leksell 在 Avicii 体育馆的票。我名义上是司机，其实每首歌我也都会唱。"}],"《并肩》":[{"npc":"emre","t":"关店以后","en":"Took my father to Yan Yana. Haluk Bilginer made the whole cinema laugh and cry. Dad talked about it at the shop all week.","zh":"带爸爸去看了《并肩》。哈鲁克·比尔吉内尔让整个电影院又笑又哭。爸爸在店里讲了一整个星期。"}],"《并肩》·土耳其":[{"npc":"omar_de","t":"周末","en":"My neighbour Mehmet saw Yan Yana with his parents in Istanbul, then made me watch the French Intouchables so we could compare.","zh":"邻居 Mehmet 在伊斯坦布尔跟爸妈看了《并肩》，回来非拉我看法国的《触不可及》，好跟他比一比。"}],"《墓地》":[{"npc":"noor","t":"深夜","en":"Started Mezarlık with subtitles \"just for one episode\". It's 2 am and I'm on episode five.","zh":"开始看《墓地》时说「就看一集」。现在凌晨两点，我在看第五集。"}],"布洛克3":[{"npc":"kwame","t":"上完制作课","en":"We studied Turkish rap in production class today. BLOK3 was Spotify's most-streamed artist in Turkey last year — those beats are huge.","zh":"今天制作课研究了土耳其说唱。BLOK3 去年是土耳其 Spotify 听得最多的歌手——那些鼓点太猛了。"}],"《有点不一样：燃起来吧！》":[{"npc":"budi","t":"周五晚上收工后","en":"Me and three ojol drivers went to the late show of Agak Laen 2. We laughed so loud the people in front turned around, bro.","zh":"我跟三个网约摩托车司机去看了《Agak Laen 2》的夜场。我们笑得太大声，前排的人都回头了，兄弟。"}],"《大块头》":[{"npc":"budi","t":"周日下午","en":"Took my daughter to see Jumbo. She is five, she cried at the end, then asked for a Don T-shirt. Insyaallah next month.","zh":"带女儿去看了《Jumbo》。她五岁，看到最后哭了，然后就要一件 Don 的 T 恤。下个月吧，insyaallah。"}],"《Doctor X：白色黑手党时代》":[{"npc":"budi","t":"晚上回到家","en":"My wife watches Doctor X every Saturday after selling her fried bananas. I just hear the hospital noises from the kitchen.","zh":"我老婆每周六卖完炸香蕉就看《Doctor X》。我在厨房只听得见医院里的声音。"}],"埃瑙":[{"npc":"aiko","t":"唱片店打烊前","en":"A customer from Jakarta asked if we have eńau on vinyl. We don't, so we listened to Sesi Potret on my phone behind the counter.","zh":"一个从雅加达来的客人问我们有没有 eńau 的黑胶。没有，我们就在柜台后面用我手机听了《Sesi Potret》。"}],"《杜兰达尔2：复仇》":[{"npc":"rohan","t":"周六晚上","en":"Finally watched Dhurandhar 2 after my on-call week. Three hours, and my phone stayed silent the whole time — a miracle.","zh":"值完一周班终于去看了《杜兰达尔2》。三个小时，我手机居然一次都没响——奇迹。"}],"《杜兰达尔》":[{"npc":"kavya","t":"下班后","en":"Our whole team went to Dhurandhar on Friday. I told them no laptops — they still argued about our app during the interval.","zh":"周五我们整个团队去看了《杜兰达尔》。我说不准带电脑，结果中场休息他们还在争我们的 App。"}],"《印度大卡皮尔秀 第5季》":[{"npc":"priyanka","t":"周六晚饭后","en":"My parents only agree on one show: Kapil. Saturday dinner, the TV goes on, and nobody checks their phone for an hour.","zh":"我爸妈只在一个节目上意见一致：卡皮尔。周六晚饭一开电视，一个小时谁都不看手机。"}],"阿努夫·贾因":[{"npc":"priya","t":"雨天晚上","en":"Bangalore rain, roommates both home, Arz Kiya Hai on the speaker for the fifth time. Nobody complained.","zh":"班加罗尔下雨，两个室友都在家，音箱里第五遍放《Arz Kiya Hai》。没人抱怨。"}],"《鬼灭之刃：无限城篇 第一章 猗窝座再袭》":[{"npc":"ren","t":"周末从秋叶原回来","en":"Saw Infinity Castle twice with my friends. Second time I watched the backgrounds, not the fight. Yabai.","zh":"跟朋友看了两遍《无限城篇》。第二遍我盯着背景看，没看打斗。やばい。"}],"《爱之里 第三季》":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"下午喝茶的时候","en":"Last season they were here in Okinawa. Now they are near Mount Fuji. My moai friends watch it and say, maybe we are not too old.","zh":"上一季他们就在冲绳。这季去了富士山那边。我模合的老朋友们看着说：也许我们还不算太老。"}],"Mrs. GREEN APPLE（绿苹果夫人）":[{"npc":"aiko","t":"唱片店里","en":"Teenagers come in asking for Mrs. GREEN APPLE records every week. I like 2000s music, but okay, maybe they are good.","zh":"每周都有中学生进来问 Mrs. GREEN APPLE 的唱片。我喜欢 2000 年代的歌，不过好吧，也许他们确实不错。"}],"《传统》":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"周四下课后","en":"A classmate from Almaty showed me the Dästür trailer on her laptop in the library. I watched it with the sound off and still jumped.","zh":"一个从阿拉木图来的同学在图书馆用笔记本给我看《传统》的预告片。我关着声音看都被吓了一跳。"}],"萨德拉丁":[{"npc":"amara","t":"阿拉木图过夜的时候","en":"Layover in Almaty, the taxi driver played Sadraddin the whole way to the hotel. I didn't understand a word, but I asked him the name twice.","zh":"在阿拉木图过夜，出租车司机一路放 Sadraddin 到酒店。我一个词都听不懂，但问了他两次歌手名字。"}],"梵达":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"下课路上","en":"My Cambodian classmate made me listen to VannDa on the BTS. Now 'Time to Rise' is my alarm, sorry roommates.","zh":"我的柬埔寨同学在轻轨上让我听 VannDa。现在《Time to Rise》是我的闹钟，对不起了室友。"}],"《与王同住的男人》":[{"npc":"jiwoo_drama","t":"周日晚上写剧评","en":"Saw it for the second time with my mom. She knew the history and still cried more than me. Writing a no-spoiler review now.","zh":"跟妈妈去看了第二遍。她明明知道历史，还哭得比我厉害。现在在写不剧透的影评。"}],"《疯狂动物城2》·韩国":[{"npc":"seoyeon","t":"周日回妈妈家吃饭前","en":"Took my mom to Zootopia 2 before our weekly dinner. She said Nick is like my dad when he was young. I didn't ask more.","zh":"每周回家吃饭前，带妈妈去看了《疯狂动物城2》。她说尼克很像我爸年轻的时候。我没敢多问。"}],"《Doctor X：白色黑手党时代》·韩国":[{"npc":"minjun","t":"周六晚上一个人在家","en":"Watching Doctor X with ramyeon. The doctor on screen would definitely tell me to eat less salt. Aigoo.","zh":"边吃拉面边看《Doctor X》。剧里那个医生肯定会叫我少吃盐。哎咕。"}],"瑞森（RESCENE）":[{"npc":"daeun","t":"演唱会前一天","en":"My fan-site friends laughed at me for loving RESCENE in 2024. Now they all want to trade photocards with me.","zh":"2024 年我喜欢 RESCENE，粉丝站的朋友都笑我。现在她们全都来找我换小卡。"}],"婷拉":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"周末在商场排队时","en":"Eurovision Asia is coming to Bangkok and my Lao friend keeps sending me Thinla's BAE. I think I'm voting for Laos.","zh":"亚洲欧洲歌唱大赛要来曼谷了，我的老挝朋友一直给我发 Thinla 的《BAE》。我大概要投老挝了。"}],"《正义之战2》":[{"npc":"kavya","t":"周五晚上","en":"A Sri Lankan friend in Colombo says Dharmayuddhaya 2 is better than the Malayalam original. I said that's a dangerous thing to say in India.","zh":"科伦坡的一个朋友说《正义之战2》比马拉雅拉姆语原版还好。我说这话在印度可不能乱说。"}],"《疑心：谁都别信》":[{"npc":"priyanka","t":"周日下午","en":"I finished Shaque in one go and called my cousin in Colombo — she guessed the twist two episodes before me.","zh":"我一口气看完《Shaque》，给科伦坡的表妹打电话——她比我早两集就猜到了反转。"}],"《疑心：谁都别信》·马尔代夫":[{"npc":"amara","t":"马累过夜后","en":"Night stop in Malé, the hotel staff were all talking about Shaque at breakfast. I downloaded it for the flight back to Dubai.","zh":"在马累过夜，早饭时酒店员工都在聊《Shaque》。我下载了，留着飞回迪拜的路上看。"}],"《血兄弟：火龙》":[{"npc":"weijie","t":"吉隆坡出差的晚上","en":"After a school visit in KL, the IT manager took me to see Blood Brothers. Two hours of fighting, then we talked about Wi-Fi again, lah.","zh":"在吉隆坡拜访完学校，IT 主任带我去看了《血兄弟》。打了两个小时，然后我们又接着聊 Wi-Fi 啦。"}],"《库德拉1968：高级议会》":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"值完早班","en":"My Malaysian colleague at check-in watched all four episodes of Kudrat 1968 on her break. Now she's angry the ending is in a movie.","zh":"值机柜台的马来西亚同事利用休息时间看完了《库德拉1968》全部 4 集。现在她很生气结局要去电影院才能看。"}],"达扬·努尔费扎":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"值机柜台","en":"A Malaysian family checking in for Kuching were humming Lelaki Teragung in the queue. The auntie said Dayang is from Sarawak, like them.","zh":"一家去古晋的马来西亚人排队值机时在哼《Lelaki Teragung》。阿姨说 Dayang 跟他们一样是沙捞越人。"}],"《普尔纳·巴哈杜尔的萨朗吉琴》":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"周五晚上电影课","en":"Our film society screened Purna Bahadur Ko Sarangi with subtitles. The Nepali students sang along to the sarangi scenes.","zh":"我们电影社带字幕放了《普尔纳·巴哈杜尔的萨朗吉琴》。尼泊尔同学在拉萨朗吉的那几场跟着一起唱。"}],"《帕兰》":[{"npc":"priyanka","t":"周日跳完舞","en":"My dance teacher is from Kathmandu. She said Paran made her call her father the same night.","zh":"我的舞蹈老师是加德满都人。她说看完《Paran》当天晚上就给爸爸打了电话。"}],"普拉尚特·希瓦科蒂":[{"npc":"amara","t":"迪拜机组宿舍","en":"Our Nepali cleaner hums Nyauli Banaima every morning. I finally asked for the name and now it's on my playlist.","zh":"宿舍的尼泊尔清洁工每天早上都在哼《Nyauli Banaima》。我终于问了歌名，现在它在我的歌单里了。"}],"《火烧小镇》":[{"npc":"amara","t":"开斋节休息日","en":"Eid in Dubai, my Pakistani crewmates booked a whole row for Aag Lagay Basti Mein. I laughed when they laughed.","zh":"在迪拜过开斋节，我的巴基斯坦同事订了一整排看《火烧小镇》。他们笑，我就跟着笑。"}],"《萨达尔吉3》":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"周六晚场","en":"We had a full house of Punjabi families for Sardaar Ji 3. The popcorn machine almost gave up.","zh":"《萨达尔吉3》那场坐满了旁遮普家庭。爆米花机差点罢工。"}],"《医生儿媳》":[{"npc":"amara","t":"飞完长途","en":"My Pakistani roommate watched Dr Bahu with her mum on video call every week, Karachi and Dubai, same episode, same time.","zh":"我的巴基斯坦室友每周都和她妈妈视频一起看《医生儿媳》——卡拉奇和迪拜，同一集，同一时间。"}],"阿卜杜勒·哈南":[{"npc":"amara","t":"飞伦敦的前一晚","en":"My Pakistani crewmates found out Abdul Hannan plays London the night we land. Three of them already swapped shifts.","zh":"我的巴基斯坦同事发现 Abdul Hannan 在伦敦的演出正好是我们落地那天晚上。已经有三个人去换班了。"}],"《你好，再爱一次》":[{"npc":"bea","t":"剪完视频的深夜","en":"I made a one-minute video on 'long-distance relationship' phrases using Hello, Love, Again as the example. My comments are all crying emojis, guys.","zh":"我拿《你好，再爱一次》当例子，做了一条一分钟的「异地恋」英语表达视频。评论区全是哭脸，大家。"}],"《招魂：最终仪式》":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"周五夜场","en":"Horror nights are always our busiest. For The Conjuring, half the queue bought tickets in pairs — nobody wanted to go alone.","zh":"恐怖片之夜永远是我们最忙的时候。《招魂》那场，排队的人一半都是两两买票——没人想一个人看。"}],"《Doctor X：白色黑手党时代》·菲律宾":[{"npc":"bea","t":"晚上剪视频前","en":"My followers keep asking for 'hospital English' since Doctor X started. So this week's video: 'scalpel', 'consent form', 'I never fail'.","zh":"《Doctor X》开播后，粉丝一直让我讲「医院英语」。所以这周的视频是：scalpel（手术刀）、consent form（同意书），还有 I never fail。"}],"《切布拉什卡2》":[{"npc":"aqiang","t":"下午柜台不忙的时候","en":"A Russian customer bought earphones for his son and showed me a Cheburashka 2 video on his phone. Big ears, very cute. I gave him a small discount.","zh":"一个俄罗斯客人给儿子买耳机，用手机给我看《切布拉什卡2》的片段。大耳朵，很可爱。我给他便宜了一点。"}],"《绿野仙踪：黄砖路》":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"电影史课后","en":"Our lecturer showed us how Russia retold The Wizard of Oz as The Wizard of the Emerald City. Then we watched the new trailer — same yellow brick road.","zh":"老师给我们讲俄罗斯怎么把《绿野仙踪》改写成《绿宝石城的魔法师》。然后我们看了新片预告——还是那条黄砖路。"}],"《铃兰》":[{"npc":"emre","t":"换汇店午休","en":"Two Russian girls waiting to change rubles were singing a song from Landyshi. I didn't know it, so they played it for me. Now I know it.","zh":"两个等着换卢布的俄罗斯姑娘在唱《铃兰》里的歌。我没听过，她们就放给我听。现在我会了。"}],"阿蒂克与阿斯蒂":[{"npc":"emre","t":"晚上关店前","en":"Russian tourists asked me to play Artik & Asti on the shop speaker. Better than the exchange-rate news, they said. I agree.","zh":"俄罗斯游客让我用店里的音箱放 Artik & Asti。他们说比听汇率新闻强。我同意。"}],"《钱不够用3》":[{"npc":"weijie","t":"农历新年假期","en":"Took my parents to Money No Enough 3 during Chinese New Year. My father laughed at every money joke, then complained about the price of bak kwa.","zh":"农历新年带爸妈去看《钱不够用3》。我爸每个跟钱有关的笑话都笑，看完又开始抱怨肉干的价钱。"}],"《疯狂动物城2》·新加坡":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"值完班回家","en":"Every family flying out for the December holidays had a Judy or Nick toy in their hand luggage. I counted eleven before lunch.","zh":"十二月放假出去玩的家庭，手提行李里都有一只朱迪或尼克公仔。午饭前我数到了十一个。"}],"《Doctor X：白色黑手党时代》·新加坡":[{"npc":"weijie","t":"去学校开会的地铁上","en":"Half the MRT carriage was watching Doctor X on their phones this morning. I stayed on my sales slides, but I wanted to look, lah.","zh":"今天早上地铁车厢里一半人在用手机看《Doctor X》。我还是看我的销售幻灯片，不过真的很想瞄一眼啦。"}],"蕾吉娜·宋":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"值机柜台","en":"A group of girls flying to Manila were singing 'the cutest pair' in the queue. When I said Regina Song is from Singapore, they screamed.","zh":"一群飞马尼拉的女生排队时在唱《the cutest pair》。我说 Regina Song 是新加坡人，她们尖叫了。"}],"《死亡低语2》":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"凌晨排完盲盒后","en":"Watched Tee Yod 2 with my roommates, then had to queue for blind boxes at 5 a.m. Every whisper in the dark mall made me jump.","zh":"跟室友看完《死亡低语2》，凌晨五点又去排盲盒。黑乎乎的商场里一有人小声说话我就跳起来。"}],"《阿凡达：火与烬》":[{"npc":"somchai","t":"收摊以后","en":"After closing my stall at midnight I went to the late Avatar show with my son. Three hours! Next morning my pad thai was very slow.","zh":"半夜收了摊，跟儿子去看《阿凡达》的夜场。三个小时！第二天早上我炒河粉慢得很。"}],"《地狱厨房泰国版 第3季》":[{"npc":"somchai","t":"午后备料时","en":"My grandson watches Hell's Kitchen and asks why I never shout like the chefs. I tell him — twenty-five years on the street, you save your voice.","zh":"我孙子看《地狱厨房》，问我为什么从来不像那些主厨那样吼。我跟他说——在街头干了二十五年，嗓子得省着用。"}],"GAVIN:D":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"下课后的咖啡店","en":"The café near my uni plays GAVIN:D all afternoon. I switch between English and Thai in my head like he does.","zh":"学校附近的咖啡店一下午都在放 GAVIN:D。我脑子里也跟着他在英语和泰语之间切换。"}],"《帖木儿》":[{"npc":"emre","t":"晚上看完新闻","en":"A tour guide from Samarkand changed money here and told me to watch Amir Temur. 'Our history, Hollywood style,' he said.","zh":"一个撒马尔罕来的导游在我这儿换钱，叫我去看《帖木儿》。他说：「我们的历史，好莱坞的拍法。」"}],"《蜘蛛侠：崭新之日》·乌兹别克斯坦":[{"npc":"amara","t":"塔什干过夜","en":"Night stop in Tashkent, the crew went to see Spider-Man. We picked the Russian dub by mistake and laughed at the wrong moments.","zh":"在塔什干过夜，机组一起去看《蜘蛛侠》。我们不小心选了俄语配音场，笑的地方全不对。"}],"法鲁赫·法泽尔":[{"npc":"emre","t":"下午店里没人时","en":"Uzbek students change their money here every month. One of them taught me the chorus of Farruh Fazel's 'Bor' — I only know that one word.","zh":"乌兹别克留学生每个月都来我这儿换钱。其中一个教我唱 Farruh Fazel《Bor》的副歌——我只会那一个词。"}],"《红雨》":[{"npc":"mai","t":"周日没写代码","en":"Went to Mưa đỏ with my parents — first time in years we did something together that wasn't about my startup. My dad held my hand at the end.","zh":"跟爸妈去看了《红雨》——好几年来我们第一次一起做跟我创业无关的事。最后我爸握住了我的手。"}],"《星河Say Hi》":[{"npc":"mai","t":"晚上当完客服","en":"Our app users kept sending messages with Tinh Hà Say Hi songs as their speaking practice. Fine — I added the lyrics to our word list. Haha.","zh":"我们 App 的用户一直拿《星河Say Hi》的歌来练口语。好吧——我把歌里的词加进了词表。哈哈。"}],"Hngle":[{"npc":"mai","t":"咖啡馆写代码","en":"The café where I code played 'Tìm Em' four times this morning. I don't mind — my bugs got fixed faster.","zh":"我写代码的咖啡馆今天上午放了四遍《Tìm Em》。我不介意——我的 bug 修得更快了。"}],"《哪吒之魔童闹海》":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"寒假回上海","en":"Saw Ne Zha 2 at the Grand Cinema with my roommates over New Year. On the way out, a little kid behind us was copying Ne Zha's most famous line.","zh":"过年跟室友去大光明看《哪吒2》，散场时后排一个小朋友在学哪吒最有名的那句台词。"}],"《九门》":[{"npc":"fang","t":"周末探店回来","en":"After spicy crayfish in Changsha I binged three episodes of The Nine Gates at the hotel. The old Changsha on screen looks nothing like the street I walked down that afternoon.","zh":"在长沙吃完口味虾，回酒店一口气补了三集《九门》。剧里的长沙老街，跟我下午逛的那条一点都不像了。"}],"周杰伦·中国":[{"npc":"emma","t":"下雨的周末","en":"It rained all day in Shanghai and my roommate played Jay Chou's new song 'It Rained That Day'. My Chinese listening isn't there yet, but for the first time I understood the title.","zh":"上海下了一整天雨，室友放周杰伦的新歌《那天下雨了》。我中文听力还不够，但第一次听懂了歌名。"}],"《阿根廷人》":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"周四晚上","en":"Went to the Gaumont on Thursday night. The older people laughed at one sketch, the students at another. We argued about it all the way to the bus stop.","zh":"周四晚上去高蒙电影院看的。老人们笑一段，学生们笑另一段。散场后我们一路吵到公交站。"}],"《星际宝贝史迪奇》":[{"npc":"mateo_taxi","t":"周六下午","en":"Three kids in my cab today, all wearing blue Stitch ears, all singing in the back seat. Their mum just looked at me and shrugged.","zh":"今天车上坐了三个小孩，都戴着蓝色的史迪奇耳朵，在后座一路唱。他们妈妈看看我，耸了耸肩。"}],"《美杜莎 第二季》":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"周日晚上","en":"I'm writing a column on why Argentines love Colombian thrillers. I took my laptop to the Tortoni — and watched three episodes of Medusa instead of writing.","zh":"我在写一篇专栏：为什么阿根廷人爱看哥伦比亚悬疑剧。我抱着电脑去了托尔托尼咖啡馆——结果没写几个字，先看了三集《美杜莎》。"}],"瓦伊拉乐队":[{"npc":"marcela","t":"一月的晚上","en":"Closed the shop for a week and went to Cosquín. At a peña a young guy picked up a guitar and started La Noche Sin Ti, and the whole table joined in — me too.","zh":"店关了一个星期，去了科斯金。在一个佩尼亚里，一个小伙子拿起吉他弹《La Noche Sin Ti》，整张桌子的人都跟着唱，我也唱了。"}],"《神鹰之女》":[{"npc":"pablo","t":"三月","en":"Took the train to Málaga for the film festival and saw La hija cóndor. My first whole film in Quechua. At the end nobody moved for a minute.","zh":"坐火车去马拉加电影节，看了《神鹰之女》。第一次看一整部克丘亚语的电影。放完以后，一分钟没人起身。"}],"《侏罗纪世界：重生》":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"下雨的下午","en":"Rainy afternoon in La Paz, and at 3,600 metres I had no breath left for more hills. So: dinosaurs, Spanish dub, a big bag of popcorn.","zh":"拉巴斯下雨的下午，海拔 3600 米，我再也爬不动坡了。于是：恐龙、西语配音、一大袋爆米花。"}],"《深海之下（暂无通行中译）》":[{"npc":"sam","t":"周末晚上","en":"My roommate is from Newfoundland, so watching Below with him was half horror, half him shouting 'nobody talks like that!' We still finished all six episodes in one night.","zh":"我室友是纽芬兰人，跟他一起看《深海之下》，一半是恐怖片，一半是他在喊「我们才不这么说话！」结果我们一晚上还是把 6 集看完了。"}],"路易斯·维加":[{"npc":"rosa","t":"周五晚上","en":"A customer asked me to turn up the radio at my taco stand — Bailando Conmigo. 'Ah, Mexican music!' I said. He laughed: 'No, señora, he's from Bolivia.'","zh":"有个客人让我把塔可摊的收音机开大一点——是《Bailando Conmigo》。我说「啊，墨西哥歌！」他笑了：「不是啦太太，他是玻利维亚人。」"}],"《我仍在此》":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"周日下午","en":"My mum in Curitiba saw it twice and made me promise to watch it in Paris. Found it in a tiny cinema on rue Champollion, then called her straight after.","zh":"我妈在库里蒂巴看了两遍，非让我答应在巴黎也去看。我在尚波利翁街一家小电影院找到了，一出来就给她打电话。"}],"《星际宝贝史迪奇》·巴西":[{"npc":"bia","t":"周六下午","en":"Took my niece to the cinema at the shopping centre. Half the audience were adults in Stitch T-shirts. I may also have bought the Stitch popcorn bucket.","zh":"带外甥女去商场的电影院。观众里一半是穿史迪奇 T 恤的大人。我嘛……也顺手买了史迪奇爆米花桶。"}],"《有爱就有守护》":[{"npc":"ana","t":"早饭时间","en":"Nine p.m. in Brazil is two in the morning in Berlin, so I watch Quem Ama Cuida with my breakfast. If I fall a day behind, my mum sends voice notes.","zh":"巴西晚上九点是柏林凌晨两点，所以我早饭时看《有爱就有守护》。要是落下一天，我妈就发语音给我讲。"}],"泽·内托与克里斯蒂亚诺":[{"npc":"bia","t":"八月","en":"Went to Barretos with my cousins. From the back we couldn't see the stage at all, but thirty thousand people were singing every word, so it didn't matter.","zh":"跟表哥表姐去了巴雷图斯牛仔节。站在后面根本看不见舞台，可是几万人每个字都在唱，看不见也没关系。"}],"《我们的姑嫂们》":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"出差的晚上","en":"Work trip to Montreal. A colleague dragged me to see Nos belles-sœurs at a little neighbourhood cinema. I understood half the jokes and laughed at all of them.","zh":"去蒙特利尔出差，同事硬拉我去街区小影院看《我们的姑嫂们》。笑话我听懂一半，可每个都跟着笑了。"}],"《我的世界大电影》":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"周六","en":"Took my little brother to the Scotiabank Theatre. He spent two hours explaining Minecraft rules to me. I still don't know what a creeper wants.","zh":"带弟弟去丰业银行影院看的。他花了两个小时给我讲《我的世界》的规则。我到现在也不知道苦力怕到底想干嘛。"}],"《伊甸之东》·加拿大":[{"npc":"sam","t":"周三晚上","en":"Watched episode two and went straight to Robarts to borrow the novel. Cathy is even scarier on paper.","zh":"看完第二集，我直接去罗巴茨图书馆借了原著。纸上的凯茜更吓人。"}],"德雷克":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"周一早上","en":"My Uber driver played Janice STFU three times between the airport and downtown. Toronto is very proud of its Drake.","zh":"从机场到市中心，网约车司机把《Janice STFU》放了三遍。多伦多人真的很为德雷克骄傲。"}],"《星际宝贝史迪奇》·智利":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"周日","en":"Costanera Center on a Sunday: a queue of children in blue ears all the way down to the escalators. I went up to the viewing deck instead.","zh":"周日的科斯塔内拉中心：戴蓝耳朵的小孩排队一直排到扶梯。我改主意去楼顶观景台了。"}],"《重聚》":[{"npc":"pablo","t":"周二晚上","en":"A Chilean student at my Tuesday exchange spent twenty minutes explaining Reunión de superados to me. I learned more Chilean slang than in a whole year of teaching.","zh":"周二语言交换上，一个智利学生花二十分钟给我讲《重聚》。我学到的智利俚语，比教一年书还多。"}],"克里斯MJ":[{"npc":"hannah_es","t":"周六凌晨","en":"3 a.m. in a club off Gran Vía: the DJ played Una Noche en Medellín and my Chilean classmate screamed 'he's ours!' over the whole dance floor.","zh":"凌晨三点，格兰大道边上的夜店，DJ 放了《Una Noche en Medellín》，我的智利同学冲着整个舞池喊：「他是我们智利的！」"}],"《星际宝贝史迪奇》·哥伦比亚":[{"npc":"valeria","t":"周四","en":"Twelve orders for Stitch earrings this week, eight of them from Colombia. I've never painted so much blue in my life.","zh":"这周接了十二单史迪奇耳环，八单来自哥伦比亚。我这辈子没涂过这么多蓝色。"}],"《美杜莎》":[{"npc":"diego","t":"送外卖的间隙","en":"Watched Medusa on my phone between deliveries. Now I want to see the Barranquilla riverfront — and try talking like a costeño.","zh":"送外卖的空档用手机看《美杜莎》。现在我想去巴兰基亚的河边走走，再学学海边人（costeño）的口音。"}],"布莱斯德":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"旅行的第三天","en":"Comuna 13 tour in Medellín: our guide danced on the outdoor escalators to a Blessd song and made all of us film it. Best TikTok of my trip.","zh":"在麦德林逛 13 区，导游在露天扶梯上跟着布莱斯德的歌跳舞，还让我们全都拍下来。这是我这趟旅行最好的一条 TikTok。"}],"《燃烧身体的记忆》":[{"npc":"lena","t":"二月的晚上","en":"Berlinale week, so I left work early for a Costa Rican film at the Zoo Palast. Three grandmothers talking honestly about their lives. The whole hall voted with their hearts.","zh":"柏林电影节那周，我提早下班去动物园宫电影院看了一部哥斯达黎加电影。三位奶奶说起自己的一辈子，说得很坦白。整个影厅投票时都是凭心投的。"}],"《并非陌生人》":[{"npc":"emre","t":"周一上午","en":"A tourist at my exchange counter asked if I'd seen Not a Stranger — she was from Costa Rica. A Turkish show, and I heard about it from Central America first!","zh":"一个来换钱的游客问我看没看《并非陌生人》——她是哥斯达黎加人。一部土耳其剧，我居然是从中美洲的客人那儿先听说的！"}],"多里安·安皮耶":[{"npc":"hannah_es","t":"周五下午","en":"My classmate from San José played me Dorian Ampie on the way to class and said, 'This is what Costa Rica sounds like right now.' Now it's stuck in my head.","zh":"去上课的路上，来自圣何塞的同学给我放多里安·安皮耶，说「这就是现在哥斯达黎加的声音」。现在我脑子里一直在放。"}],"《滨海大道》":[{"npc":"jess","t":"傍晚","en":"Sat on the Malecón wall at sunset like everyone in Havana does. A guy next to me said there's a new film named after this exact wall. I looked it up that night.","zh":"日落时我跟哈瓦那人一样坐在滨海大道的海堤上。旁边一个人说，有部新电影就是用这道墙命名的。我当晚就去查了。"}],"《驯龙高手》":[{"npc":"amara","t":"飞基多的航班上","en":"Long flight to Quito, and half the cabin was watching How to Train Your Dragon on the seat screens. During landing a little boy asked me if Ecuador has dragons.","zh":"飞基多的长途航班上，半个机舱都在用座位屏幕看《驯龙高手》。降落的时候，一个小男孩问我厄瓜多尔有没有龙。"}],"《美杜莎 第二季》·厄瓜多尔":[{"npc":"jiwoo_drama","t":"下班的地铁上","en":"Reviewing Latin American thrillers for my blog this month. Medusa season 2 on the subway home — I nearly missed my stop twice.","zh":"这个月我在博客上写拉美悬疑剧。下班地铁上看《美杜莎》第二季，两次差点坐过站。"}],"宗布里尔":[{"npc":"tolu","t":"深夜的录音室","en":"Checking the Spotify global chart at 2 a.m. in the studio, and there's an Ecuadorian track called Vitamina between all the big names. Love seeing the coast-to-coast sound travel.","zh":"凌晨两点在录音室看 Spotify 全球榜，大牌中间夹着一首厄瓜多尔的《Vitamina》。看到海边的声音一路传到全世界，真开心。"}],"《丽塔》":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"写稿的下午","en":"Writing my yearly piece on Latin America's Oscar entries. Rita is the one I keep thinking about — I watched it again before my deadline.","zh":"在写每年一篇的「拉美各国送奥斯卡的片子」。《丽塔》是我一直放不下的那部——截稿前我又看了一遍。"}],"《并非陌生人》·危地马拉":[{"npc":"mei","t":"晚上下班","en":"My Guatemalan language partner told me to watch Not a Stranger. Now I look at every babysitter on the Taipei MRT a little suspiciously.","zh":"我的危地马拉语伴叫我去看《并非陌生人》。现在我在台北捷运上看到带小孩的保姆，都会多看两眼。"}],"里卡多·阿霍纳":[{"npc":"marcela","t":"周六晚上","en":"My husband and I finally got Arjona tickets at the Movistar Arena — the eleventh show they added! Twenty years of his songs playing in the shop, and now we saw him live.","zh":"我和老公终于抢到了 Movistar Arena 的阿霍纳门票——是加开的第十一场！他的歌在我店里放了二十年，这回总算看到真人了。"}],"《炖豌豆》":[{"npc":"andre","t":"周日","en":"My neighbour's auntie in Kingston sent a video of the queue for Stew Peas — round the block. Half of Flatbush is waiting for it to come to New York.","zh":"邻居在金斯敦的姨妈发来一段视频：排队看《炖豌豆》的人绕了一整个街区。弗拉特布什一半的人都在等它来纽约。"}],"《不同的世界》":[{"npc":"min_ny","t":"周五晚上","en":"Jess said I can't understand American college life without A Different World. Two episodes in, and I'm already looking up Atlanta's Black colleges.","zh":"Jess 说不看《不同的世界》就不懂美国的大学生活。看了两集，我已经在查亚特兰大的黑人大学了。"}],"斯基帕":[{"npc":"kofi","t":"周六的理发店","en":"Saturday in the shop, my Jamaican customer took over the speaker and played WYFL four times. By the third time the kids waiting were all rapping along.","zh":"周六店里，一个牙买加客人抢了音箱，把《WYFL》放了四遍。放到第三遍，排队的小孩们都跟着唱起来了。"}],"《婚礼礼物台》":[{"npc":"valeria","t":"周六中午","en":"My cousin got married in Coyoacán and put my earrings on her gift registry — for the bridesmaids. After watching Mesa de regalos I was very nervous something would go wrong. Nothing did!","zh":"我表妹在科约阿坎结婚，把我做的耳环放进了礼物登记单，送给伴娘们。看过《婚礼礼物台》以后，我一直担心会出乌龙。结果什么事都没有！"}],"《星际宝贝史迪奇》·墨西哥":[{"npc":"rosa","t":"周日下午","en":"Closed the taco stand early and took my two kids to the cinema at Galerías. They came out wanting a dog that looks like Stitch. I said: we have a cat.","zh":"塔可摊早收了一会儿，带两个孩子去加莱里亚斯商场看电影。出来就吵着要养一只长得像史迪奇的狗。我说：家里有猫了。"}],"《体能之巅：百人挑战 墨西哥版》":[{"npc":"jake","t":"体育课后","en":"Showed my PE class a clip from Physical 100: México. Now every kid wants to try the hanging challenge. We lasted forty seconds, all of us.","zh":"体育课上给学生放了一段《体能之巅：百人挑战 墨西哥版》。现在每个孩子都想试吊杠挑战。结果我们全班都只撑了四十秒。"}],"纳塔纳埃尔·卡诺":[{"npc":"diego","t":"演唱会那晚","en":"Delivered six orders to people queuing outside the Estadio GNP for Natanael Cano. Nobody wanted to lose their place, so I came to them.","zh":"给 GNP 体育场外排队看纳塔纳埃尔·卡诺的人送了六单外卖。谁都不想丢了位置，只好我送过去。"}],"《亲爱的热带》":[{"npc":"maria_sw","t":"下夜班以后","en":"Saw Querido trópico at the IFC Center after a long shift. A carer and an old woman with dementia — that's half my job. I cried quietly in the dark.","zh":"上完长班去 IFC 影院看了《亲爱的热带》。一个护工和一位失智的老太太——这就是我一半的工作。我在黑暗里悄悄哭了。"}],"《并非陌生人》·巴拿马":[{"npc":"grace","t":"下夜班的地铁上","en":"My Panamanian co-worker got the whole night shift watching Not a Stranger. I watched episode four on the subway home and missed my stop.","zh":"我的巴拿马同事把整个夜班的人都拉进了《并非陌生人》。下班地铁上我看第四集，坐过了站。"}],"博萨":[{"npc":"amara","t":"巴拿马城的中转夜","en":"Layover in Panama City. On a rooftop in Casco Antiguo the bartender turned up orióN and said 'our Boza' with the biggest smile.","zh":"在巴拿马城中转。老城区的一个屋顶酒吧里，酒保把《orióN》开大声，笑着说「这是我们的博萨」。"}],"《查文德万塔尔：世纪营救》":[{"npc":"kazuo","t":"周三","en":"A Peruvian visitor at the museum told me about the Chavín de Huántar film. In 1997 I watched the Lima hostage news every night on Japanese TV. Strange to see it become a film.","zh":"纪念馆里一位秘鲁访客跟我说起《查文德万塔尔》这部电影。1997 年，我每天晚上都在日本电视上看利马人质事件的新闻。没想到它拍成了电影。"}],"《迈克尔》·秘鲁":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"夜班","en":"A family from Lima stopped at my gas station at midnight asking the way to Michael Jackson's star on the Walk of Fame. They'd seen the movie twice back home.","zh":"半夜一家利马来的游客到我加油站问路，要去星光大道上迈克尔·杰克逊的星。他们在秘鲁已经看了两遍电影。"}],"《别有洞天》":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"利马的晚上","en":"On a Lima minibus the conductor kept shouting 'al fondo hay sitio!' That evening my host family turned on a TV show with exactly that name. Everyone laughed at my face.","zh":"在利马坐小巴，售票员一直喊「后面还有位子！」当晚房东一家打开电视，正好是一部同名的剧。看到我一脸惊讶，全家都笑了。"}],"五人组":[{"npc":"mateo_taxi","t":"周五晚上","en":"A Peruvian couple in my cab asked for Grupo 5. By the end of the ride the three of us were singing Amor de mis amores, windows down.","zh":"一对秘鲁夫妻上车，点名要听五人组。下车前，我们三个摇下车窗一起唱《Amor de mis amores》。"}],"《驯龙高手》·乌拉圭":[{"npc":"marcela","t":"长周末","en":"Took the ferry to Montevideo with my nephews for the long weekend. It rained, so: dragons at the cinema, then chivito sandwiches on the Rambla.","zh":"长周末带外甥们坐船去蒙得维的亚。下雨了，于是：先去电影院看龙，再去海滨大道吃奇维多三明治。"}],"《老大哥：黄金一代》":[{"npc":"mateo_taxi","t":"周一","en":"Every passenger this week had an opinion on Gran Hermano. A lady from Montevideo told me they argue about it more than we do.","zh":"这周每个乘客都对《老大哥》有话说。一位蒙得维的亚来的太太说，她们那边吵得比我们还凶。"}],"《蜘蛛侠：崭新之日》·美国":[{"npc":"tony","t":"周日","en":"Took my son to see Brand New Day in Queens — where else would you watch Spider-Man? Afterwards he made me take his photo at the Unisphere.","zh":"带儿子在皇后区看了《蜘蛛侠：崭新之日》——蜘蛛侠还能在哪儿看？出来以后他非要我在地球仪雕塑前给他拍照。"}],"《我的世界大电影》·美国":[{"npc":"jake","t":"周五晚上","en":"Took a group of my students to the Oriental Theatre. When the chicken jockey came on, the whole row shouted. I may have shouted too.","zh":"带几个学生去东方剧院看。「骑鸡僵尸」一出来，我们整排都喊了。我嘛……可能也喊了。"}],"《不同的世界》·美国":[{"npc":"jess","t":"周四晚上","en":"My mom watched the original every week. We watched the new premiere together on FaceTime and both sang the theme song. Now she wants to visit the colleges in Atlanta.","zh":"我妈当年每周都看老版。新版首播那晚，我们开着 FaceTime 一起看，一起唱主题曲。现在她想去亚特兰大看看那几所大学。"}],"泰勒·斯威夫特·美国":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"堵车的傍晚","en":"Stuck on the 405 for an hour with Patient Zero on repeat. Honestly the best hour of traffic I've ever had.","zh":"在 405 高速上堵了一个小时，一直单曲循环《Patient Zero》。说真的，这是我堵得最开心的一次。"}],"《侏罗纪世界：重生》·委内瑞拉":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"周末一日游","en":"Day trip to Khao Phanom Bencha in Krabi. Our guide pointed at the waterfall and said, 'Dinosaurs were here — in the movie.' Everybody took the same photo.","zh":"周末去甲米的帕农本查国家公园一日游。导游指着瀑布说：「恐龙来过这儿——在电影里。」大家都拍了同一张照片。"}],"《美杜莎 第二季》·委内瑞拉":[{"npc":"ana","t":"去上班的路上","en":"My Venezuelan flatmate and I watch one episode of Medusa a day on the S-Bahn. She corrects the actors' Caribbean accents out loud. People stare.","zh":"我和委内瑞拉室友每天在城铁上看一集《美杜莎》。她会大声纠正演员的加勒比口音，旁边的人都看我们。"}],"丹尼·奥欣":[{"npc":"pablo","t":"周二晚上","en":"At our Tuesday exchange the Venezuelan barman put on Me Rehúso, and half the bar — Venezuelans who now live in Madrid — sang the whole song together.","zh":"周二的语言交换上，委内瑞拉酒保放了《Me Rehúso》，半个酒吧——住在马德里的委内瑞拉人——一起唱完了整首歌。"}],"《七犬》":[{"npc":"noor","t":"周五晚上","en":"Went to see 7Dogs at a mall cinema in Amman. The whole row cheered at every car chase — I barely heard the dialogue.","zh":"周五晚上在安曼商场的电影院看了《七犬》。每场飙车整排人都在欢呼，我几乎没听清对白。"}],"《锡科锡科》":[{"npc":"amara","t":"落地开罗以后","en":"Landed in Cairo and my Egyptian crewmate was still laughing about Siko Siko. She made me promise to watch it on the flight home.","zh":"落地开罗，埃及同事还在笑《锡科锡科》。她非让我答应回程航班上看一遍。"}],"《阿里·克莱》":[{"npc":"noor","t":"斋月的晚上","en":"Ramadan nights at my mum's: iftar, tea, then everyone goes quiet for Ali Clay. Nobody is allowed to check their phone.","zh":"斋月晚上在我妈家：开斋饭、喝茶，然后大家安静下来看《阿里·克莱》。谁也不许看手机。"}],"哈穆·穆尔希迪":[{"npc":"noor","t":"在开罗出差","en":"Work trip to Cairo. On Talaat Harb Street every second taxi was blasting Hamo El Morshedy — the drums are so busy you feel it in your chest.","zh":"去开罗出差。塔拉特·哈尔布街上，差不多每两辆出租车就有一辆在放哈穆·穆尔希迪，鼓点密得胸口都在震。"}],"泰迪·阿夫罗":[{"npc":"amara","t":"在亚的斯亚贝巴转机","en":"Layover in Addis. The taxi driver played Teddy Afro's new album the whole way and sang every chorus. I asked for the name and he looked shocked I didn't know.","zh":"在亚的斯亚贝巴转机。出租车司机一路放泰迪·阿夫罗的新专辑，每段副歌都跟着唱。我问歌手是谁，他一脸「你居然不知道」。"}],"《七十三十》":[{"npc":"amara","t":"德黑兰过夜的晚上","en":"Night stop in Tehran. There was a queue outside the cinema for Seventy Thirty — my colleague says everyone in Iran has seen it twice.","zh":"在德黑兰过夜。电影院门口排着队看《七十三十》，同事说伊朗人人都看过两遍。"}],"《戴眼镜的男人》":[{"npc":"emre","t":"店里不忙的下午","en":"Two Iranian tourists changing money at my shop kept talking about Afshari's new film. They showed me the trailer — even without Persian I laughed.","zh":"两个伊朗游客在我店里换钱，一直聊阿夫沙里的新片。他们给我看了预告片，我不懂波斯语也笑了。"}],"《侏罗纪世界：重生》·肯尼亚":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"星期六下午","en":"Took the kids to see Jurassic World at the mall. My youngest hid behind the popcorn for half the film and still says it was the best day ever.","zh":"星期六带孩子去商场看《侏罗纪世界》。小的那个半场都躲在爆米花后面，还说这是最开心的一天。"}],"《伊甸园之东》":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"下班以后","en":"I said one episode of East of Eden after work. It's now 1 a.m. and I have a model to check at nine.","zh":"下班说好只看一集《伊甸园之东》。现在凌晨一点了，我九点还要检查一个模型。"}],"亚瓦·塔吉里":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"下午四点","en":"Four o'clock: chai on the stove at my kiosk, and the radio plays Chai ya saa kumi. Customers start singing before I can pour.","zh":"下午四点，我的小店里煮着茶，收音机正好放《Chai ya saa kumi》。我还没倒茶，客人已经开始跟着唱了。"}],"《幕后》":[{"npc":"adaeze","t":"圣诞假期","en":"Went to the mall cinema with my sisters to see Behind the Scenes. We laughed, then went very quiet — Ronke carrying the whole family felt too familiar.","zh":"圣诞假期和姐妹们去商场的电影院看《幕后》。先是笑，后来都不说话了——罗恩克一个人扛起全家，太眼熟了。"}],"《普通人》":[{"npc":"tunde","t":"堵在路上的时候","en":"Stuck on the Third Mainland Bridge for an hour, so I finished Ordinary People on my phone. My team chat has three different theories about the ending.","zh":"在第三大陆桥上堵了一个小时，我用手机看完了《普通人》。我们团队群里对结局有三种猜法。"}],"阿萨克":[{"npc":"tolu","t":"去录音室路上","en":"Crossing the Lekki Link Bridge to the studio with Jogodo on the radio — third time this morning. Every artist I meet now wants a beat like that.","zh":"开车过莱基大桥去录音室，电台又放《Jogodo》，今天早上第三遍了。现在每个来找我的歌手都想要那样的节拍。"}],"阿里基巴、姆博索":[{"npc":"amara","t":"在达累斯萨拉姆过夜","en":"Night stop in Dar es Salaam. Bhuju was playing from a shop, a bajaji and a phone on the same street. I've added it to my crew playlist.","zh":"在达累斯萨拉姆过夜。同一条街上，小店、三轮车和路人的手机里都在放《Bhuju》。我把它加进了机组歌单。"}],"约书亚·巴拉卡":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"去坎帕拉出差","en":"Work trip to Kampala. My colleague there turned up Wrong Places in the car and said, 'Uganda's number one, not Lagos!'","zh":"去坎帕拉出差。那边的同事在车上把《Wrong Places》开大声，说：「这是乌干达的第一名，不是拉各斯的！」"}],"《我的天，玛蕾莉兹！》":[{"npc":"nomvula","t":"值完班","en":"My Afrikaans colleague shouted the Marelize line when I spilled tea today. Now I have to watch the film to get the joke.","zh":"今天我把茶洒了，说南非荷兰语的同事立刻喊了那句「玛蕾莉兹」。看来我得去看这部电影才能懂这个梗。"}],"《鬼灭之刃：无限城篇》":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"周日下午","en":"My nephew begged me to take him to Demon Slayer at Sandton. I understood nothing and still cried at the end.","zh":"侄子求我带他去桑顿看《鬼灭之刃》。我什么都没看懂，最后还是哭了。"}],"《血之遗产 第二季》":[{"npc":"nomvula","t":"回老家看妈妈","en":"Visiting my mum in KwaZulu-Natal, between the cane fields. Every night we watch Blood Legacy and she says, 'That's exactly how a family business goes wrong.'","zh":"回夸祖鲁-纳塔尔看妈妈，家附近全是甘蔗地。每天晚上我们一起看《血之遗产》，她总说：「家族生意就是这样搞砸的。」"}],"特曼·艾克斯普雷斯、梅洛与斯利兹":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"周六下午","en":"Saturday on Vilakazi Street in Soweto: street dancers, braai smoke, and someone's speaker playing Remember. The whole street knew when to shout.","zh":"周六在索韦托的维拉卡齐街：街头舞者、烤肉的烟，有人的音箱在放《Remember》。整条街都知道该在哪儿一起喊。"}],"纽约客":[{"npc":"jess","t":"上班路上","en":"I read the New Yorker cartoons first, every week, on the subway. Then I pretend I'll read the 8,000-word piece later.","zh":"每周我都在地铁上先看《纽约客》的漫画，然后假装待会儿会读那篇八千字的长文。"}],"纽约时报":[{"npc":"tony","t":"早上通勤","en":"Our whole office does Wordle before the morning meeting. Whoever takes six guesses buys the coffee.","zh":"我们全办公室开晨会前都玩 Wordle，谁要猜六次谁请咖啡。"}],"时代周刊":[{"npc":"marco_ny","t":"早上开店前","en":"Picked up TIME at the corner newsstand for the café counter. By noon half my regulars were arguing about who should be Person of the Year.","zh":"早上在街角报摊买了本《时代》放在吧台上。到中午，一半老顾客都在争谁该当年度人物。"}],"华尔街日报":[{"npc":"marcus_bank","t":"早上七点","en":"First thing every morning: coffee and the Journal's markets page before my clients start calling.","zh":"每天早上第一件事：咖啡加《华尔街日报》的市场版，然后客户的电话就来了。"}],"Vogue":[{"npc":"andre","t":"九月的一天","en":"The September Vogue landed and three customers came in asking for the sneakers on page 212.","zh":"九月刊《Vogue》一出来，就有三个客人进店问第 212 页上那双球鞋。"}],"芝麻街":[{"npc":"grace","t":"休息日","en":"Walked my niece past the studios in Queens where Sesame Street is made. She waved at every door in case Elmo was inside.","zh":"休息日带侄女路过皇后区的摄影棚，《芝麻街》就在那儿拍。她对着每扇门挥手，怕艾摩在里面。"}],"华盛顿邮报":[{"npc":"davies","t":"去华盛顿的周末","en":"Took the train to D.C. and walked past the Watergate. My dad still talks about reading the Post's stories when he was my age.","zh":"周末坐火车去华盛顿，路过了水门大厦。我爸现在还会说起他像我这么大时读《华盛顿邮报》那些报道。"}],"国家地理":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"去华盛顿旅行","en":"In Washington I finally visited the National Geographic Society. Back home I have forty years of yellow spines — I used them in every geography class I taught.","zh":"在华盛顿终于去了国家地理学会。家里有四十年的《国家地理》，一排黄色书脊，我教地理的每一堂课都用过它们。"}],"CNN":[{"npc":"sarah","t":"去亚特兰大开会","en":"In Atlanta for a dental-tech conference and walked past the old CNN Center. Funny to think 24-hour news started right here.","zh":"去亚特兰大参加牙科软件的会，路过了以前的 CNN 中心。想想 24 小时新闻就是在这儿开始的，挺奇妙的。"}],"奈飞":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"周末开车","en":"Drove down to Los Gatos and passed Netflix's headquarters. Then I remembered the red DVD envelope still in my drawer — I never returned that film from 2009.","zh":"周末开车去洛斯加托斯，路过 Netflix 总部。突然想起抽屉里还有个红色 DVD 信封，2009 年那张碟一直没还。"}],"加拿大广播公司":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"下班路上","en":"Walked past the CBC building on Front Street after work. I listen to their radio every morning, so it felt like passing a friend's house.","zh":"下班走过前街上的 CBC 大楼。我每天早上都听它的电台，路过就像路过朋友家。"}],"环球电视网":[{"npc":"bia","t":"去里约玩","en":"In Rio for the weekend, and my grandma made me take a photo at the Globo gate. At her house the novela is sacred — no coding, no phone.","zh":"周末去里约，奶奶非让我在 Globo 大门口拍张照。在她家，诺维拉是神圣的：不许写代码，不许看手机。"}],"墨西哥电视剧":[{"npc":"rosa","t":"摊子不忙的时候","en":"Between customers I watch my telenovela on my phone. My regulars ask me what happened before they order.","zh":"没客人的时候我在手机上看电视剧。老顾客点单前先问我昨天演到哪了。"}],"BBC":[{"npc":"precious","t":"上夜班前","en":"Walked past Broadcasting House before my night shift. In the staff room I keep BBC radio on low — the 1 a.m. shipping forecast is strangely calming.","zh":"上夜班前路过 BBC 广播大楼。我在休息室把 BBC 电台开得小小的，凌晨一点的航运天气预报出奇地让人安心。"}],"经济学人":[{"npc":"oliver","t":"周四晚上","en":"Walked across Smithson Plaza on St James's — it used to be the Economist's home. Thursday night the new issue lands and I check whether they agree with my piece this week.","zh":"走过圣詹姆斯街的史密森广场——这儿以前是《经济学人》的大楼。周四晚上新一期出来，我看看他们跟我这周写的那篇是不是一个看法。"}],"卫报":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"书店打烊后","en":"After closing the shop I walked up to Kings Place, where the Guardian is. Half our book club found their next read in its reviews.","zh":"书店打烊后我走到《卫报》所在的国王广场。我们读书会一半人的下一本书都是在它的书评里找到的。"}],"金融时报":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"午饭时间","en":"Lunch near St Paul's, past Bracken House where the FT lives. A man outside was reading a pink FT so wide I learned the gold price without trying.","zh":"在圣保罗教堂附近吃午饭，路过《金融时报》所在的布雷肯大楼。门口有人把粉红色的报纸摊得好大，我不想看也知道了金价。"}],"路透社":[{"npc":"ahmed","t":"午休","en":"Lunch break in Canary Wharf, scrolling Reuters alerts. Everything's breaking somewhere.","zh":"在金丝雀码头午休，刷路透社的快讯。世界上总有地方在发生大事。"}],"法新社":[{"npc":"claire","t":"去开会的路上","en":"Walked past the AFP building on Place de la Bourse on my way to a client. Half the news photos in our mood boards come from there.","zh":"去见客户的路上经过交易所广场的法新社大楼。我们情绪板上一半的新闻照片都是从那儿来的。"}],"世界报":[{"npc":"pierre","t":"下午收摊","en":"In the afternoon, after the last baguettes, I buy Le Monde at the kiosk. It's tomorrow's date — I like reading the future.","zh":"下午最后一批法棍卖完，我去报亭买《世界报》。上面印的是明天的日期，我喜欢读「未来」。"}],"明镜周刊":[{"npc":"hans","t":"周六散步","en":"Saturday walk through HafenCity, past the Spiegel building, with this week's issue under my arm. The long investigation will make me angry all weekend.","zh":"周六在港口新城散步，路过明镜大楼，胳膊下夹着这周的杂志。那篇长调查够我气一整个周末。"}],"德国之声":[{"npc":"omar_de","t":"去波恩玩","en":"Day trip to Bonn and I walked past Deutsche Welle's headquarters. My very first German words came from their free course, years before I moved here.","zh":"去波恩玩，路过德国之声的总部。搬来德国好几年前，我最早学的几句德语就是从他们的免费课来的。"}],"意大利广播电视":[{"npc":"chiara","t":"二月放学后","en":"Walked past RAI's headquarters on Viale Mazzini during Sanremo week. My whole class had spent the morning arguing about last night's songs.","zh":"圣雷莫那一周，放学路过马志尼大道的 RAI 总部。我们班一上午都在争昨晚谁唱得好。"}],"国家报":[{"npc":"pilar","t":"星期天早上","en":"Sunday morning: El País from the kiosk, churros with Abuela, and an argument about the opinion page.","zh":"星期天早上：报亭买的《国家报》、和妈妈一起吃吉事果，再为评论版吵一架。"}],"塔斯社":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"在报社","en":"Writing about a Russian ballet tour, I had to check the official statement from TASS. Then call three people to find the real story.","zh":"写一篇俄罗斯芭蕾舞团巡演的稿子，我得先查塔斯社的官方说法，再打三个电话找真正的故事。"}],"NHK":[{"npc":"tanaka","t":"除夕夜","en":"New Year's Eve: soba, the heater on, and Kōhaku live from NHK Hall like every year. My wife decides who wins before the votes.","zh":"除夕夜：荞麦面、开着暖气，像每年一样看 NHK 礼堂直播的《红白歌会》。没投票之前我太太就已经定好谁赢了。"}],"读卖新闻":[{"npc":"ito","t":"清晨上班","en":"At 5 a.m. on my way to the station I pass the delivery bikes loaded with Yomiuri. The city's still asleep but the news is already moving.","zh":"早上五点去车站上班，路上碰到装满《读卖新闻》的送报摩托。城市还在睡，新闻已经在路上了。"}],"周刊少年Jump":[{"npc":"haruto","t":"星期一下班","en":"Monday is Jump day. After work I pick it up in Jimbocho and read the first chapter standing outside the shop.","zh":"星期一是 Jump 日。下班后我在神保町买一本，站在店门口就把第一话看完了。"}],"印度时报":[{"npc":"priya","t":"去孟买出差","en":"On a work trip to Mumbai I passed the old Times of India building. My dad has read that paper every morning of my life.","zh":"去孟买出差，路过《印度时报》的老楼。从我记事起，我爸每天早上都在看这份报纸。"}],"澳大利亚广播公司":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"诊所里","en":"A little girl brought her blue heeler to the clinic and named it Bluey. Third one this month.","zh":"一个小女孩带着她的蓝色牧牛犬来诊所，名字叫 Bluey。这个月第三只了。"}],"新华社":[{"npc":"bj_laozhou","t":"早上遛弯","en":"Walking past the Xinhua building near Xuanwumen in the morning — I've been looking at those rooftop antennas for decades.","zh":"遛弯路过宣武门那边的新华社大楼，楼顶的天线我看了几十年。"}],"中央电视台":[{"npc":"bj_liu","t":"除夕前一天","en":"Tomorrow is New Year's Eve. I've printed out the Spring Festival Gala programme so I can tick off every act.","zh":"明天就是除夕了，我已经把春晚的节目单打印出来，到时候一个一个对着看。"}],"人民日报":[{"npc":"bj_zhao","t":"下午遛弯","en":"Walking along Jintai West Road, I passed the south gate of the People's Daily. On the way home I stopped at the newspaper board to read today's paper.","zh":"遛弯走到金台西路，路过人民日报社的南门。回家路上在阅报栏前又站着看了一会儿当天的报纸。"}],"申报":[{"npc":"fang","t":"周末逛街","en":"Wandering down Hankou Road, I saw the old Shen Bao building still standing, with a restaurant downstairs. My grandpa says he read Shen Bao as a kid.","zh":"逛到汉口路，看见老申报馆的大楼还在，楼下是家餐厅。我外公说他小时候看过《申报》。"}],"读者":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"去兰州开会","en":"At a meeting in Lanzhou, standing on the Zhongshan Bridge over the Yellow River, I remembered reading Duzhe until the pages curled — it's made in this city.","zh":"去兰州开会，站在中山桥上看黄河，想起我上学时每期《读者》都翻到卷了边，它就是这座城市办的。"}],"TVB":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"在香港转机","en":"Long layover in Hong Kong, so I took the bus out to Tseung Kwan O just to see TVB City. My mum and I can still sing the drama theme songs in Cantonese.","zh":"在香港转机等很久，我专门坐巴士去将军澳看了一眼电视广播城。我和妈妈到现在还能用粤语唱那些剧的主题曲。"}],"半岛电视台":[{"npc":"amara","t":"在多哈过夜","en":"Night stop in Doha. A friend who works at Al Jazeera English showed me the newsroom — a wall of screens, a dozen languages in the air.","zh":"在多哈过夜。在半岛英语台工作的朋友带我看了新闻编辑室：一整面墙的屏幕，耳边是十几种语言。"}],"丰田汽车城":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"暑假的一个周六","en":"I took my daughter to Toyota City to see the robots on the assembly line. She waved at every car that went by.","zh":"周六带女儿去丰田市看装配线上的机器人。每过去一辆车，她都挥手打招呼。"}],"工业机器人":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"出差的一天","en":"I'm used to welding robots in German car plants. Visiting a factory near Mt Fuji, I learned a lot of those arms were made in Japan in the first place.","zh":"在德国车厂见惯了焊接机械臂。去富士山脚下一家工厂参观，才知道那些机械臂很多本来就是日本造的。"}],"蔚山造船":[{"npc":"minjun","t":"出差回首尔的 KTX 上","en":"Business trip to Ulsan. From the hotel window the cranes looked taller than the buildings. I ate too much salty soup again, though.","zh":"去蔚山出差。从酒店窗户看出去，船厂的吊车比楼还高。不过我又喝了太咸的汤。"}],"韩国半导体":[{"npc":"jiwoo","t":"周六一早","en":"Took the bus down to Pyeongtaek to see a uni friend who works night shifts at the chip fab. She says the clean suit is fine — you just can't scratch your nose for hours.","zh":"坐大巴去平泽看大学同学，她在芯片厂上夜班。她说无尘服还好，就是好几个小时不能挠鼻子。"}],"班加罗尔软件":[{"npc":"rohan","t":"下班堵在外环路上","en":"Ninety minutes for 14 km in Bengaluru traffic tonight. Good thing my on-call laptop was in the bag — I fixed an alert from the back of the cab.","zh":"今晚在班加罗尔堵车，14 公里走了九十分钟。还好值班电脑在包里，我坐在出租车后座修好了一个告警。"}],"苏拉特钻石切割":[{"npc":"priya","t":"排灯节回家","en":"My cousin polishes diamonds in Surat. He sent a photo of a stone smaller than a grain of rice — I still sent him money for Diwali sweets by UPI.","zh":"表哥在苏拉特磨钻石。他发来一张照片，那颗钻石比米粒还小——排灯节我还是用 UPI 给他转了买甜点的钱。"}],"泰国大米":[{"npc":"somchai","t":"早上进货","en":"New-crop Hom Mali came in today. It's softer, so I use a bit less water — customers never notice, but I do.","zh":"今天新米到了。新米软，我少放一点水——客人吃不出来，我自己知道。"}],"东方底特律":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"周末回罗勇看爸妈","en":"Drove home to Rayong with Dad. Every second car on the motorway is a pickup, and now there are electric ones with Chinese names too.","zh":"周末和爸爸开车回罗勇。高速上每两辆就有一辆皮卡，现在还多了好多中国牌子的电动车。"}],"马来西亚棕榈油":[{"npc":"weijie","t":"开车去吉隆坡的路上","en":"Driving to a school in Kuala Lumpur, it's oil palms on both sides for an hour. My kids in the back counted lorries full of red fruit.","zh":"开车去吉隆坡一所学校，两边连着一个小时都是油棕。孩子们在后座数装满红色棕果的卡车。"}],"苏拉威西镍矿":[{"npc":"budi","t":"午饭时间","en":"A new rider in our WhatsApp group just came back from Sulawesi. He drove trucks at a nickel smelter — good money, he says, but the dust was everywhere.","zh":"我们 WhatsApp 群里新来的骑手刚从苏拉威西回来。他在镍冶炼厂开过卡车——他说钱多，就是到处是灰。"}],"新加坡港":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"下了早班","en":"Before landing I always look out of the window at the ships waiting off the coast — dozens of them, lined up like taxis at the airport.","zh":"飞机落地前我总会看窗外海上排队的船——几十艘，像机场门口排队的出租车。"}],"西伯利亚天然气":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"十一月的晚上","en":"Our gas bill in Munich came in. After 2022 I learned to set the heating to 19 degrees and wear a jumper — my grandmother would be proud.","zh":"慕尼黑的燃气账单来了。2022 年以后我学会了把暖气调到 19 度、穿件毛衣——我奶奶会为我骄傲的。"}],"皮尔巴拉铁矿":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"暑假找实习","en":"A classmate got a summer job at a Pilbara mine — two weeks on, one week off. I'm still scanning groceries in Melbourne.","zh":"同学找到了皮尔巴拉矿上的暑期工，上两周休一周。我还在墨尔本的超市扫码收银。"}],"格林布什锂矿":[{"npc":"mia","t":"打工间隙","en":"Someone at the café asked why phone batteries cost so much. I said 'lithium' like an expert — then googled it on my break.","zh":"咖啡馆有人问为什么手机电池那么贵。我像专家一样说「因为锂」——然后休息时偷偷去搜了一下。"}],"澳洲美利奴羊毛":[{"npc":"minji","t":"拍摄前一天","en":"For tomorrow's shoot I picked a thin merino knit — it looks soft on camera and the model won't sweat under the lights.","zh":"明天的拍摄我挑了一件薄的美利奴针织衫——上镜看着软，模特在灯底下也不会出汗。"}],"怀卡托乳业":[{"npc":"fang","t":"去新西兰拍视频","en":"Drove through Waikato to film a dairy farm. More cows than people on every hill — the café in town served the thickest milkshake of my life.","zh":"开车经过怀卡托去拍奶牛场。每座山坡上牛都比人多——镇上的咖啡馆给了我这辈子最浓的一杯奶昔。"}],"蒂普基猕猴桃":[{"npc":"cd_he","t":"早上逛完草堂买水果","en":"Bought kiwis on the way home from the park. I told the stall owner they're really our own 'mihoutao' from Sichuan hills — she said, 'Then why are they so expensive?'","zh":"散步回来买了猕猴桃。我跟摊主说这其实就是我们四川山里的猕猴桃，她说：「那为啥这么贵？」"}],"奥尤陶勒盖铜矿":[{"npc":"jonas","t":"在乌兰巴托机场转机","en":"Flew via Ulaanbaatar for a project. The man next to me worked at the Gobi copper mine — two weeks underground, then home to his kids.","zh":"做项目从乌兰巴托转机。邻座的人在戈壁那座铜矿上班——井下干两周，然后回家看孩子。"}],"柬埔寨制衣":[{"npc":"chenjie","t":"去金边看厂","en":"Visited a partner factory in Phnom Penh, then an old ikat workshop where a woman tied every thread by hand. Our machines can't do that.","zh":"去金边看合作的工厂，顺路看了一家老 ikat 作坊，一位阿姨每根线都是手扎的。我们的机器做不到。"}],"东南亚蓄电池":[{"npc":"mai","t":"下午在咖啡馆写代码","en":"The café's power flickered twice this afternoon. The owner laughed: 'Maybe Laos is busy today.' I saved my code every five minutes.","zh":"下午咖啡馆的灯闪了两次。老板笑着说：「可能今天老挝那边忙。」我每五分钟存一次代码。"}],"帕敢翡翠":[{"npc":"cd_zhang","t":"茶馆打完麻将","en":"Somebody at the table showed off her new jade bangle. I'm a retired accountant — first thing I asked was 'Where's the certificate?'","zh":"牌桌上有人显摆新买的翡翠镯子。我退休前是会计，第一句就问：「证书呢？」"}],"菲律宾椰子":[{"npc":"bea","t":"拍完视频的傍晚","en":"Filmed today's 'one-minute English' clip with a fresh buko in my hand. Half the comments asked where I bought the coconut.","zh":"今天拍「一分钟英语」时手里拿着一个椰青。一半评论都在问椰子在哪儿买的。"}],"夏尔巴向导":[{"npc":"jiho","t":"徒步第三天","en":"Rest day in Namche. Our guide Pemba carries twice my bag and still waits for me on every hill. I've stopped telling people I'm a runner.","zh":"在南池休整一天。我们的向导 Pemba 背着比我重一倍的包，每个坡还在等我。我不敢再跟人说我是跑步的了。"}],"锡兰肉桂":[{"npc":"sara","t":"周日做甜点","en":"Made apple cake with the Ceylon cinnamon a friend brought back from Galle. Softer, almost citrusy — I'm not going back to the jar from the supermarket.","zh":"周日用朋友从加勒带回来的锡兰肉桂做了苹果蛋糕。味道更柔，还有点柑橘香——超市那罐我不想再用了。"}],"一杆一钩钓鱼":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"早上在菜园","en":"My grandson sent a video from the Maldives — men pulling tuna up one by one with poles. My father fished like that off Okinawa when I was small.","zh":"孙子从马尔代夫发来视频：渔民用竿子一条一条把金枪鱼拉上来。我小时候，父亲在冲绳也是这么钓鱼的。"}],"锡亚尔科特足球":[{"npc":"mateo","t":"周六踢完球","en":"Our Saturday ball split open after two years. I looked at the label for the first time — 'Made in Sialkot'. Bought another one from there.","zh":"周六的球用了两年终于裂了。我第一次看了标签——「锡亚尔科特制造」。又买了一个那儿做的。"}],"穆龙套金矿":[{"npc":"bj_liu","t":"早上跳完广场舞","en":"After morning dance the ladies all talked about the gold price again. I bought one tiny gold bean for my granddaughter — that's my whole investment plan.","zh":"早上跳完舞，老姐妹们又聊金价。我给孙女买了一颗小金豆——这就是我全部的理财计划。"}],"劳托卡糖城":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"休假回来","en":"Back from a week in Fiji. Driving past Lautoka, the whole town smelled faintly of burnt sugar. Nobody got stung by anything — a real holiday.","zh":"在斐济玩了一周回来。开车经过劳托卡，整座城都有一股淡淡的焦糖味。这次没人被什么蛰——真正的假期。"}],"巴新天然气":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"晚上交电费","en":"Paid the winter electricity bill and my wife explained Japan imports almost all its gas by ship. Our heater suddenly felt very far-travelled.","zh":"交冬天的电费时，太太跟我说日本的天然气几乎都是船运进口的。我们家的暖气突然显得很「见过世面」。"}],"帕劳潜水":[{"npc":"mei","t":"寒假","en":"A classmate dived in Palau over winter break. She showed me the pledge she signed in her passport — honestly cuter than any stamp I've got.","zh":"同学寒假去帕劳潜水，给我看她护照里签的那份誓言——说实话比我所有的印章都可爱。"}],"华强北电子":[{"npc":"aqiang","t":"收摊前","en":"A Russian customer and I bargained on the calculator for ten minutes. He won — but he bought the good charger, not the cheap one.","zh":"一个俄罗斯客人跟我在计算器上砍了十分钟价。他赢了——不过他买的是好充电器，不是便宜那种。"}],"东莞世界工厂":[{"npc":"wei","t":"周六","en":"Checked the new feeder lids at our assembly partner in Dongguan, then took my daughter to Keyuan garden nearby. She liked the goldfish more than my product.","zh":"在东莞的组装厂看了新喂食器的盖子，然后带女儿去附近的可园。她对金鱼比对我的产品感兴趣。"}],"义乌小商品":[{"npc":"chenjian","t":"八月最忙的时候","en":"It's 35 degrees outside and our warehouse is full of Santa hats for Europe. My son asked if Christmas is in summer for us. For us — yes.","zh":"外面 35 度，仓库里堆满了发往欧洲的圣诞帽。儿子问我们的圣诞节是不是在夏天。对我们来说——是的。"}],"洋山深水港":[{"npc":"lt_qianlao","t":"周末跟老伙计出游","en":"Took the bus across the Donghai Bridge with my old workmates. At the automated quay we stood and watched the cranes for an hour — not one driver in sight.","zh":"周末跟老同事坐大巴过东海大桥。在自动化码头看吊车看了一个钟头——一个司机都没看到。"}],"陆家嘴金融区":[{"npc":"wang","t":"加班到九点","en":"Worked late on the new mobile-banking screens. From the 30th floor the Bund lights went off at ten — that's how I know it's time to go home.","zh":"加班改手机银行的新页面。从 30 楼看出去，外滩的灯十点一关，我就知道该回家了。"}],"大庆油田":[{"npc":"bj_zhao","t":"天坛下完棋","en":"An old chess partner of mine drilled wells in Daqing in the sixties. He still can't stand cold weather — says he used it all up there.","zh":"我有个棋友六十年代在大庆打过井。到现在他还怕冷，说那几年把这辈子的冷都受完了。"}],"山西煤炭":[{"npc":"xa_zhang","t":"秦腔唱完","en":"I sang with a man from Datong today. He said his father was a coal miner and that's why he sings so loud — 'you had to shout over the machines.'","zh":"今天跟一个大同来的老哥一起唱秦腔。他说他爹是挖煤的，所以他嗓门大——「机器太响，不喊听不见」。"}],"包头稀土":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"写作业的晚上","en":"Writing a news assignment on rare earths. I took my earbuds apart for 'research' — found a magnet the size of a grain of rice, and now they don't work.","zh":"写一篇关于稀土的新闻作业。我为了「做调查」把耳机拆了——找到一颗米粒大的磁铁，然后耳机就坏了。"}],"宁德电池":[{"npc":"lt_xiaoma","t":"换电池的空档","en":"Swapping my e-bike battery at the corner station. The guy next to me said his car battery and mine came from the same town in Fujian.","zh":"在路口换电站换电瓶。旁边的大哥说，他车里的电池和我的电瓶是福建同一个地方出的。"}],"合肥新能源汽车":[{"npc":"lt_xiaoma","t":"过年回安徽","en":"Back home in Anhui for New Year, my cousin showed me round the car plant where he works in Hefei. Back in Shanghai I'm still on my e-bike.","zh":"过年回安徽，表哥带我去他在合肥上班的汽车厂转了一圈。回到上海，我还是骑我的电瓶车。"}],"寿光蔬菜":[{"npc":"lt_axiang","t":"凌晨进货","en":"My nephew grows greenhouse vegetables in Shouguang and sent a photo of the town — taller buildings than ours! In winter half the cucumbers on my stall come from there.","zh":"侄子在寿光种大棚，发来一张寿光城里的照片——楼比我们这儿还高！冬天我摊上一半的黄瓜都是那儿来的。"}],"新竹芯片":[{"npc":"mei","t":"毕业季","en":"My cousin got a job at a fab in Hsinchu. Free shuttle, free dinner — but she says she now dreams in English acronyms.","zh":"表姐在新竹的芯片厂找到工作。有免费交通车、免费晚饭——不过她说现在做梦都是英文缩写。"}],"日元":[{"npc":"lt_tanaka","t":"夜班收银","en":"A tourist paid for one onigiri with a brand-new 10,000-yen note. I gave him a whole handful of change back, and he looked at the coins like they were sweets.","zh":"一个游客拿崭新的一万日元买一个饭团。我找了他一大把零钱，他看着那堆硬币像在看糖果。"}],"韩元":[{"npc":"sooah","t":"明洞下午","en":"A Chinese tourist asked whose face was on the 50,000-won note. I said 'a painter, and her son is on the 5,000' — she took a photo of both.","zh":"一个中国游客问五万韩元上是谁。我说是一位画家，她儿子在五千韩元上——她把两张都拍了下来。"}],"卢比":[{"npc":"priya","t":"回孟买看外婆","en":"At Crawford Market with my grandmother: she counted out rupee notes, I scanned the fruit seller's UPI code. He took both happily.","zh":"陪外婆逛克劳福德市场：她一张张数卢比，我扫水果摊的 UPI 码。摊主两样都收得很开心。"}],"泰铢":[{"npc":"somchai","t":"晚上出摊","en":"A tourist gave me a 1,000-baht note for a 60-baht plate. I laughed and ran to three stalls to find change — we all know each other on Yaowarat.","zh":"一个游客拿一千铢买一盘 60 铢的河粉。我笑着跑了三个摊找零钱——耀华力路上大家都认识。"}],"越南盾":[{"npc":"mai","t":"去河内出差","en":"In Hanoi's Dong Xuan market I paid for a scarf with a 500,000 note instead of 50,000. The lady laughed and gave it back — then sold me a second scarf.","zh":"在河内同春市场买围巾，把五十万当成五万给了。阿姨笑着还给我——然后又卖了我第二条围巾。"}],"新加坡元":[{"npc":"weijie","t":"周末带孩子","en":"At the hawker centre my son paid for his own chicken rice with a two-dollar note. He was so proud he forgot to eat the cucumber.","zh":"在小贩中心，儿子自己用两块钱纸币买了鸡饭。他太骄傲了，连黄瓜都忘了吃。"}],"澳元":[{"npc":"josh_cafe","t":"带店员去堪培拉","en":"Took two of our student baristas to Canberra. In front of Parliament House I pulled out a $5 note — the building's right there on the back.","zh":"带店里两个留学生咖啡师去堪培拉。在国会大厦前我掏出一张 5 澳元——背面就是这栋楼。"}],"新西兰元":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"冲浪旅行","en":"On a surf trip I stopped in Wellington and found the Reserve Bank has a little money museum. Learned more about the $5 note than about the waves.","zh":"冲浪旅行路过惠灵顿，发现新西兰储备银行有个小小的货币博物馆。关于 5 元钞票学到的，比关于海浪的还多。"}],"雅浦石币":[{"npc":"wang","t":"给新同事培训","en":"Explained ledgers to the new hires with Yap's stone money: nobody moves the stone, everyone just updates who owns it. They finally got it.","zh":"给新同事讲账本，用的是雅浦石币：谁也不搬石头，大家只是记住它归谁。他们终于听懂了。"}],"人民币":[{"npc":"lt_xiaoli","t":"夜班","en":"An old man paid for milk with a 100-yuan note tonight. I had to look in three drawers for change — nobody pays cash any more.","zh":"今晚一位老爷爷拿一百块买牛奶。我翻了三个抽屉才找开——现在没人用现金了。"}],"港元":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"去香港交流","en":"On my exchange trip to Hong Kong I got three different 100-dollar notes in one day. I spent ten minutes checking they were real before buying an egg tart.","zh":"去香港交流，一天里收到三种不同的一百港币。我检查了十分钟是不是真钱，才敢去买蛋挞。"}],"澳门元":[{"npc":"fang","t":"去澳门拍美食","en":"Filmed egg tarts in Macau all day. Came home with forty patacas in coins — they're now in a jar next to my Shanghai bus card.","zh":"在澳门拍了一天蛋挞。回来口袋里剩四十澳门币的硬币——现在放在罐子里，挨着我的上海交通卡。"}],"新台币":[{"npc":"mei","t":"饮料店晚班","en":"A customer paid with a 2,000-dollar note tonight. My manager came out from the back just to look at it.","zh":"今晚有个客人拿两千块的钞票付钱。店长特地从后面走出来看了一眼。"}],"贝壳钱":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"带学生去安阳","en":"After our class trip to Yinxu, I asked students to find every character with 贝 in their textbook. One boy found 贵 and said, 'So money's been a problem since the Shang.'","zh":"带学生去安阳殷墟回来，让他们在课本里找带「贝」的字。一个男生找到「贵」字说：「原来从商朝开始钱就是个问题。」"}],"交子":[{"npc":"cd_he","t":"带孙子逛宽窄巷子","en":"Walking through Kuanzhai Alley I told my grandson Chengdu invented paper money. He scanned a QR code and bought an ice cream.","zh":"带孙子逛宽窄巷子，跟他说纸币是成都发明的。他扫了个码，买了一支冰淇淋。"}],"鹿特丹港":[{"npc":"daan","t":"凌晨四点","en":"Night shift again. From up in my crane the container ships look like Lego, and at sunrise the whole Maasvlakte turns orange.","zh":"又是夜班。从我的吊车上看，集装箱船像乐高；太阳出来时，整个马斯平原都变成橙色。"}],"阿尔斯梅尔花卉拍卖":[{"npc":"sanne","t":"周六早上七点","en":"I took Chen to the flower auction viewing gallery. He couldn't believe how fast the trolleys move — and how early the Dutch start work.","zh":"我带 Chen 去花卉拍卖的参观走廊。他不敢相信那些花车跑得那么快——也不敢相信荷兰人那么早就上班。"}],"光刻机":[{"npc":"chen_nl","t":"周四下午","en":"Our class visited the Brainport area near Eindhoven. Half my classmates now want an internship at ASML.","zh":"我们班去埃因霍温附近的 Brainport 参观了。现在一半同学都想去 ASML 实习。"}],"沃尔夫斯堡":[{"npc":"wagner","t":"周三","en":"I took this year's apprentices on a trip to Wolfsburg. They loved the car towers, but honestly they talked more about the currywurst.","zh":"我带今年的学徒去了沃尔夫斯堡。他们很喜欢那两座汽车塔，不过说实话，他们聊得更多的是咖喱香肠。"}],"鲁尔工业区":[{"npc":"hans","t":"周日","en":"My grandfather was a miner in Essen. Last Sunday I walked round Zollverein with my grandchildren and showed them where he used to clock in.","zh":"我爷爷以前是埃森的矿工。上周日我带孙子孙女在关税同盟煤矿走了一圈，告诉他们爷爷以前在哪儿打卡上班。"}],"法兰克福金融":[{"npc":"hans","t":"周二晚上","en":"Forty years at the bank counter, and the customers still ask me the same thing: 'What will the ECB do next?' As if I knew!","zh":"在银行柜台干了四十年，客户还是问我同一句：「欧洲央行下一步要干嘛？」好像我知道似的！"}],"图卢兹航空城":[{"npc":"amara","t":"转机那天","en":"Our new A350 was delivered from Toulouse. The crew who went to collect it said the hangar was so clean you could eat off the floor.","zh":"我们公司的新 A350 是从图卢兹提回来的。去接机的同事说，那个机库干净得能在地上吃饭。"}],"伦敦金融城":[{"npc":"oliver","t":"周五中午","en":"I grabbed a sandwich outside the Bank of England between two interviews. On Fridays half the City is already in the pub by four.","zh":"两个采访之间，我在英格兰银行门口随便买了个三明治。周五下午四点，金融城一半的人已经在酒吧了。"}],"北海油气":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"冬天的一个下午","en":"From my window in Bergen I can see the supply ships heading out to the platforms. My neighbour works two weeks on, four weeks off.","zh":"从我在卑尔根家的窗户能看到补给船开往钻井平台。我的邻居在平台上干两周，休四周。"}],"巴塞尔制药":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"周末","en":"Basel is only three hours from Geneva by train. I went to see a friend who works at Roche, and we swam down the Rhine with those fish-shaped dry bags.","zh":"从日内瓦坐火车到巴塞尔才三个小时。我去看在罗氏上班的朋友，我们抱着那种鱼形的防水袋顺着莱茵河游下去。"}],"都柏林科技":[{"npc":"freya","t":"出差那周","en":"I flew to Dublin for a growth conference at one of the big tech offices. Free lunch, rain all day, and every second person was from somewhere else.","zh":"我飞去都柏林，在一家大科技公司的办公室参加增长大会。午饭免费，下了一整天雨，一半的人都是从别的国家来的。"}],"哈恩橄榄油":[{"npc":"abuela","t":"周日中午","en":"I only buy oil from Jaén, in the big five-litre tin. My daughter says the little bottles are prettier. Pretty doesn't fry an egg.","zh":"我只买哈恩的油，五升的大铁桶。我女儿说小瓶的好看。好看又不能煎鸡蛋。"}],"安特卫普钻石":[{"npc":"camille","t":"周二","en":"I took the Thalys to Antwerp to look at a young jeweller's work. The streets by the station are full of guards and very quiet men with briefcases.","zh":"我坐大力士高铁去安特卫普看一位年轻珠宝设计师的作品。车站旁边那几条街全是保安，还有很多提着公文包、一句话都不说的人。"}],"葡萄牙软木":[{"npc":"rui","t":"周五晚上","en":"Guests always buy the cork wallets in the shop downstairs. I tell them the tree is fine — it gets its bark back in nine years.","zh":"客人总爱在楼下的店里买软木钱包。我跟他们说，树没事，九年后树皮就长回来了。"}],"施华洛世奇水晶":[{"npc":"huber","t":"暑假","en":"I took my class on a day trip from Munich to Wattens years ago. The children ran straight into the giant's mouth. I still have a little crystal hedgehog from that day.","zh":"很多年前我带班上的孩子从慕尼黑去瓦滕斯一日游。孩子们一下车就冲进了巨人的嘴里。那天买的小水晶刺猬我现在还留着。"}],"波希米亚玻璃":[{"npc":"katrin","t":"周末","en":"We drove from Berlin to northern Bohemia for the weekend. I came back with a bag of old glass buttons for my design studio — the team loved them.","zh":"周末我们从柏林开车去了波希米亚北部。我带回一袋老玻璃纽扣给设计室，同事们都很喜欢。"}],"格但斯克琥珀":[{"npc":"poppy","t":"周六市集","en":"Someone brought me a 1950s amber brooch from Gdańsk. I did the salt-water test before pricing it — real amber floats.","zh":"有人拿来一枚 1950 年代格但斯克的琥珀胸针。我定价之前先做了盐水测试——真琥珀会浮起来。"}],"希腊船队":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"周五下午","en":"Half my students have an uncle on a ship somewhere. When we read Homer, they say the Odyssey is just a very long shipping delay.","zh":"我班上一半学生都有个叔叔在某条船上。我们读荷马的时候，他们说《奥德赛》不过是一次特别长的船期延误。"}],"冰岛地热电站":[{"npc":"aino","t":"冬天","en":"I went to Iceland to see how they run their pools. Locals soak in the hot pot and talk for an hour — it's like our sauna, just outdoors and with snow.","zh":"我去冰岛看他们怎么经营温泉泳池。本地人泡在热水池里一聊就是一小时——跟我们的桑拿一样，只是在露天、还下着雪。"}],"休斯敦能源":[{"npc":"sarah","t":"周六","en":"We drove down from Austin to Space Center Houston with my nephew. He spent an hour in the Mission Control replica shouting 'Houston, we have a problem!'","zh":"我们带侄子从奥斯汀开车去了休斯敦航天中心。他在任务控制中心的复制品里待了一小时，一直喊「休斯敦，我们有麻烦了！」"}],"波音工厂":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"早班","en":"Every time a 747 freighter parks near my counter, the older staff come out to look. Now there won't be any new ones.","zh":"每次有 747 货机停在我柜台附近，老员工都会出来看一眼。以后再也不会有新的了。"}],"艾伯塔油砂":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"周日晚饭","en":"My cousin does two weeks on, one week off up near Fort McMurray. He flies back to Toronto just to sleep in a quiet room.","zh":"我表哥在麦克默里堡那边干两周、休一周。他飞回多伦多，就为了在一个安静的房间里睡觉。"}],"加拿大木材":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"周六","en":"We're redoing our deck this summer. I checked the lumber prices at the hardware store and nearly dropped my coffee.","zh":"我们今年夏天要重新做后院平台。我在建材店看了一下木头的价格，差点把咖啡掉地上。"}],"蒙特雷制造":[{"npc":"diego","t":"周末","en":"My cousin moved to Monterrey for a job at a car-parts plant. He sent me a photo from Parque Fundidora — a concert right under the old blast furnace.","zh":"我表哥去蒙特雷一家汽车零件厂上班了。他给我发了一张 Fundidora 公园的照片——就在老高炉底下开演唱会。"}],"巴西大豆":[{"npc":"fang","t":"早上","en":"I was making soy milk this morning and read the bag: 'origin: Brazil'. My beans travel further than I do.","zh":"今天早上做豆浆，看了一眼袋子：「产地：巴西」。我的豆子比我出门还远。"}],"卡拉雅斯铁矿":[{"npc":"daan","t":"周一","en":"A big ore carrier from Brazil came in today. It takes days to unload — the iron ore goes on by barge to the steelworks in Germany.","zh":"今天进来一条从巴西来的大矿砂船。卸完要好几天——铁矿石再用驳船运到德国的钢厂。"}],"巴西甘蔗乙醇":[{"npc":"bia","t":"下班路上","en":"Rule of thumb at the pump: if ethanol is less than 70% of the petrol price, fill up with ethanol. My dad still checks it with a calculator.","zh":"加油站的老规矩：乙醇价格不到汽油的 70%，就加乙醇。我爸到现在还拿计算器算。"}],"锂三角":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"出差回来","en":"I came back from the salt flats with a sunburn and a notebook full of quotes. The local communities' question is simple: where does our water go?","zh":"我从盐湖回来，晒伤了，本子上记满了采访。当地社区的问题很简单：我们的水去哪儿了？"}],"哥伦比亚鲜花":[{"npc":"jess","t":"情人节前一天","en":"The bodega on my corner had buckets of roses. I asked where they're from — 'Colombia, via Miami,' the guy said, like it was obvious.","zh":"我家街角小店摆了好几桶玫瑰。我问是哪儿来的——老板说「哥伦比亚，经过迈阿密」，好像这是常识。"}],"奥里诺科石油带":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"夜班","en":"Customers always ask me why gas prices jump. I tell them: I just change the numbers on the sign, man.","zh":"顾客老问我油价为什么又涨了。我跟他们说：兄弟，我只是换牌子上的数字。"}],"古巴蔗糖":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"地理课上","en":"Today my students compared old maps of Cuba's sugar mills with satellite photos. Half the mills have just disappeared.","zh":"今天学生们把古巴糖厂的老地图和卫星照片对比了一下。一半的糖厂都不见了。"}],"牙买加铝土矿":[{"npc":"marcela","t":"店里","en":"A customer asked if my aluminium ladders were 'local'. I said the factory is local — the red dirt probably came from somewhere like Jamaica.","zh":"有个顾客问我的铝梯子是不是「本地货」。我说工厂是本地的——那红土大概是从牙买加那种地方来的。"}],"科隆自由贸易区":[{"npc":"chenjian","t":"九月","en":"Our Christmas stock for Latin America goes to Colón first. A buyer from Bogotá flies in, picks the boxes, and they're in his shop by November.","zh":"我们卖到拉美的圣诞货先运到科隆。波哥大的买家飞过来挑货，十一月就上了他店里的货架。"}],"哥斯达黎加菠萝":[{"npc":"tom","t":"周三午饭","en":"Pineapple day at school! I cut twenty of them this morning. The kids always ask if it grew on a tree. Nope — it grows out of the ground.","zh":"今天学校吃菠萝！我早上切了二十个。孩子们总问它是不是长在树上的。不是——是从地里长出来的。"}],"潘帕斯牛肉":[{"npc":"paco","t":"周六晚上","en":"There's an Argentine grill two streets from my kiosk. The owner says the secret is just salt and patience. I can't afford to go every week.","zh":"我彩票亭隔两条街有家阿根廷烤肉馆。老板说秘诀就是盐和耐心。我可没钱每周都去。"}],"安塔米纳铜矿":[{"npc":"oliver","t":"周一早上","en":"I'm writing about copper prices again. My editor wants a 'human angle', so I'm interviewing an engineer who worked at a mine over 4,000 metres up in Peru.","zh":"我又在写铜价了。编辑想要「人的故事」，所以我在采访一位在秘鲁四千多米高的矿上干过的工程师。"}],"乌尤尼锂资源":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"旅行回来","en":"At 70 I finally saw Uyuni. Our guide pointed at the white horizon and said: 'Under there is the future of your electric car.'","zh":"我七十岁终于去了乌尤尼。导游指着白茫茫的地平线说：「下面就是你们电动车的未来。」"}],"乌拉圭牛肉":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"周末","en":"I took the ferry to Montevideo for a story. At the market they told me exactly which ranch my steak came from — very Uruguayan.","zh":"我坐渡轮去蒙得维的亚采访。市场里的人直接告诉我，我吃的牛排来自哪个牧场——很乌拉圭。"}],"好时巧克力小镇":[{"npc":"jake","t":"暑假","en":"We did a road trip to Hershey with the kids. The whole town smells like chocolate, and my son tried to unwrap a street lamp.","zh":"我们带孩子开车去了好时镇。整座城都是巧克力味，我儿子还想去「剥」一盏路灯。"}],"加拿大面包篮":[{"npc":"sam","t":"暑假","en":"I took the train across the prairies. For a whole day it was just wheat, sky and the odd grain elevator. Weirdly relaxing.","zh":"我坐火车穿过大草原。一整天窗外只有麦子、天空和偶尔一座粮仓。奇怪地让人放松。"}],"沙特石油":[{"npc":"amara","t":"飞达曼的航班","en":"Flying into Dammam at night, you see the gas flares glowing in the desert. Passengers always ask me what they are.","zh":"夜里飞进达曼，能看到沙漠里燃烧的火炬。乘客总问我那是什么。"}],"迪拜杰贝阿里港":[{"npc":"amara","t":"休息日","en":"When we take off from Dubai towards the west, I look down at Jebel Ali — rows and rows of containers, like a colourful carpet.","zh":"我们从迪拜往西起飞时，我会往下看杰贝阿里——一排又一排的集装箱，像一块彩色地毯。"}],"约翰内斯堡金矿":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"周日下午","en":"I drive past the old mine dumps every day on the M1. My clients' grandfathers worked underground there — some of my cases still start with that history.","zh":"我每天在 M1 公路上开车经过那些老矿渣山。我好些当事人的爷爷曾在下面的矿里干活——我手上有些案子，到现在还是从那段历史开始的。"}],"尼日尔三角洲石油":[{"npc":"tunde","t":"出差那周","en":"I flew to Port Harcourt to meet market traders who want our payment app. Everyone there has an opinion about oil — and none of them work for an oil company.","zh":"我飞去哈科特港，见想用我们收款 App 的菜市场商贩。那里每个人对石油都有一肚子话——可没有一个在石油公司上班。"}],"赞比亚铜带":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"周四","en":"Our loan model has a copper-price column now. When copper drops, our Zambian borrowers start paying late a month later — you can see it in the data.","zh":"我们的贷款模型里现在有一栏铜价。铜价一跌，一个月后我们在赞比亚的借款人就开始晚还款——数据里看得清清楚楚。"}],"博茨瓦纳钻石":[{"npc":"nomvula","t":"休假","en":"I spent my leave in Botswana. In Gaborone a nurse told me her training was paid for by 'diamond money'. She said it like a joke, but she meant it.","zh":"我休假去了博茨瓦纳。在哈博罗内，一位护士告诉我她的培训费是「钻石钱」付的。她像开玩笑一样说，但她是认真的。"}],"加纳黄金":[{"npc":"kwame","t":"周末","en":"My aunt bought me a small gold ring for graduation at a shop in Kumasi. The seller weighed it in front of us and quoted the price by the gram.","zh":"毕业时我姑姑在库马西的店里给我买了一枚小金戒指。老板当着我们的面称重，按克报价。"}],"摩洛哥磷矿":[{"npc":"kavya","t":"晚上","en":"Farmers who use our weather app keep asking one thing besides rain: will fertiliser prices go up again? Half the answer is in Morocco.","zh":"用我们天气 App 的农民，除了问下不下雨，还老问一件事：化肥会不会又涨价？一半的答案在摩洛哥。"}],"奈瓦沙鲜花":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"二月","en":"Before Valentine's, flower farm workers from Naivasha send money home through my M-Pesa shop all week. That's when I know the roses have gone to Europe.","zh":"情人节前那一周，奈瓦沙花场的工人天天来我的 M-Pesa 店往家里汇钱。这时候我就知道，玫瑰已经运到欧洲去了。"}],"尼罗河长绒棉":[{"npc":"chenjie","t":"下午","en":"A client asked for 'Egyptian cotton' shirts at a cheap price. I told her: real long-staple costs what it costs. If it's cheap, ask for the test report.","zh":"有个客户要便宜的「埃及棉」衬衫。我跟她说：真的长绒棉就是那个价。便宜的，你就要检测报告。"}],"死海钾肥":[{"npc":"noor","t":"周五","en":"We drove down to the Dead Sea for the weekend. My dad pointed at a beach sign from his childhood — the water is now far below it.","zh":"周末我们开车去死海。我爸指着一块他小时候就有的海滩牌子——现在水面已经在它下面很远了。"}],"伊朗开心果":[{"npc":"emre","t":"傍晚","en":"Iranian customers change money at my shop and always bring me a bag of pistachios from home. They say ours from Antep are good too — but not as good.","zh":"伊朗客人来我店里换钱，总带一袋家乡的开心果给我。他们说我们安泰普的也不错——但没他们的好。"}],"埃塞俄比亚航空":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"夜班","en":"The Addis flight is always full of traders with huge suitcases going home to Lagos or Nairobi. I've learned to say 'Selam' at check-in.","zh":"去亚的斯亚贝巴的航班总是坐满了拖着大箱子回拉各斯、内罗毕的生意人。我在值机柜台学会了说「Selam」。"}],"无人机送血":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"周末","en":"In Kigali for a workshop, I heard a buzzing overhead — a Zipline drone heading for the hills. My colleague didn't even look up. Normal for them.","zh":"我去基加利参加培训，听到头顶嗡嗡响——一架 Zipline 无人机正往山里飞。我同事连头都没抬。对他们来说太平常了。"}],"海上钻石":[{"npc":"margaux","t":"下午","en":"Someone showed me photos of Kolmanskop — rooms full of sand up to the windows. I painted one from memory today. Tourists kept asking if it was a dream.","zh":"有人给我看了科尔曼斯科普的照片——房间里的沙子一直堆到窗口。今天我凭记忆画了一张。游客一直问我画的是不是梦。"}],"斯法克斯橄榄油":[{"npc":"nonna_carla","t":"周日","en":"My grandson read the small print on the olive oil bottle: 'oils of EU and non-EU origin'. Non-EU means Tunisia, I told him. Good oil — I've cooked with it for years.","zh":"我孙子念瓶子上的小字：「欧盟及非欧盟来源的油」。我跟他说，非欧盟就是突尼斯。好油——我拿它做饭好多年了。"}],"比基塔锂矿":[{"npc":"wei","t":"周二","en":"Our pet feeders run on lithium batteries. When the battery price jumped, my supplier blamed 'Africa lithium policy'. Now I actually read about Zimbabwe.","zh":"我们的宠物喂食器用锂电池。电池一涨价，供应商就说是「非洲锂政策」。现在我真的会去看津巴布韦的新闻了。"}],"乌干达咖啡":[{"npc":"josh_cafe","t":"早上","en":"We put a Ugandan coffee on as our filter of the week. A customer said 'robusta? isn't that the cheap stuff?' — then ordered a second cup.","zh":"我们这周的手冲用乌干达咖啡。有个客人说「罗布斯塔？不是便宜货吗？」——然后又点了第二杯。"}],"拉斯拉凡天然气":[{"npc":"hans","t":"冬天的晚上","en":"In the winter of 2022 every customer at my counter wanted to talk about their gas bill. The news was all about LNG tankers — some from Qatar.","zh":"2022 年冬天，来我柜台的每个客人都想聊他们的燃气账单。新闻里全是 LNG 运输船——有的就是从卡塔尔来的。"}],"相声":[{"npc":"bj_laozhou","t":"周六下午","en":"Took the fast train to Tianjin just for crosstalk. Twenty yuan, a pot of jasmine tea, and the guy on stage teased me for my Beijing accent.","zh":"坐高铁去天津就为听一场相声。二十块钱一壶茉莉花茶，台上那位还拿我的北京口音逗了一句。"}],"云冈石窟":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"暑假 · 带学生","en":"Took my history class from Xi'an to Datong this summer. The kids went quiet in front of the big Buddha — then asked how they carved it without falling off.","zh":"暑假带历史课的学生从西安去大同。孩子们在大佛前面一下安静了，然后问：凿的时候怎么不掉下去？"}],"南京路":[{"npc":"fang","t":"周五晚上","en":"Filmed my uncle buying the same pork floss he's bought on Nanjing Road for forty years. The shop has neon now; the queue is exactly the same.","zh":"拍我舅舅在南京路买肉松，他在这家买了四十年。店门口换成了霓虹灯，排的队还是一模一样。"}],"上海迪士尼":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"工作日请假","en":"Took a day off and came on a Tuesday on purpose. Zootopia still had a 90-minute queue — I bought the Judy ears anyway.","zh":"特意请了周二的假来。疯狂动物城还是要排 90 分钟——兔子朱迪的发箍我还是买了。"}],"秦淮河":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"元宵节","en":"Came to Nanjing for the lantern fair with my roommate. We spent an hour choosing a rabbit lantern and then couldn't fit it on the train.","zh":"和室友来南京看灯会，花了一个小时挑兔子灯，结果高铁上放不下。"}],"文房四宝":[{"npc":"cd_he","t":"冬天的早上","en":"My grandson asked for 'real' paper for his calligraphy class, so we bought a pack of Xuan paper. He wrote one character and was too scared to waste another sheet.","zh":"孙子说书法课要用「真的」纸，我们就买了一刀宣纸。他写了一个字，就舍不得再用第二张了。"}],"清明上河图":[{"npc":"bj_xiaoyu","t":"周末 · 讲解志愿者","en":"Visitors always ask me where the real scroll is. I tell them it's resting — paper needs a holiday too — and show them the boat about to crash into the bridge.","zh":"游客总问我真迹在哪。我说它在休息——纸也要放假——然后指给他们看那条快撞上桥的船。"}],"大足石刻":[{"npc":"cd_laoluo","t":"店休那天","en":"Closed the restaurant for a day and drove to Dazu. My favourite carving isn't the Guanyin — it's the woman feeding chickens. She looks like my mum.","zh":"店休一天开车去大足。我最喜欢的不是千手观音，是那个喂鸡的女人，长得像我妈。"}],"三星堆":[{"npc":"cd_luo","t":"周日","en":"Forty minutes from Chengdu and it feels like another planet. I bought a mask-shaped ice cream; the eyes melted first.","zh":"离成都四十分钟，像到了另一个星球。买了一个面具形状的雪糕，眼睛先化了。"}],"水上木偶戏":[{"npc":"mai","t":"周末 · 去河内","en":"Flew from Saigon to Hanoi with my co-founders. Front row was a mistake — the dragon splashed us all, and my notebook still smells like the lake.","zh":"和合伙人从西贡飞河内。坐第一排是个错误——龙一甩尾巴我们全湿了，我的本子到现在还有湖水味。"}],"阿普萨拉舞":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"期中考完","en":"Took the bus from Bangkok to Siem Reap after exams. At the dinner show I tried bending my fingers back like the dancers — they're trained from age six, I'm trained on my phone.","zh":"考完试坐大巴从曼谷去暹粒。看晚餐演出时我也试着把手指往后弯——人家六岁就开始练，我只练过刷手机。"}],"老挝芦笙":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"退休后第一次旅行","en":"First trip since I retired from the post office: Vientiane. An old man at the night market let me try his khaen. I got one note out and the whole stall clapped.","zh":"从邮局退休后第一次出门，去了万象。夜市里一位老人让我试吹他的芦笙。我只吹出一个音，整个摊子都给我鼓掌。"}],"卡车艺术":[{"npc":"noor","t":"设计灵感","en":"I keep a folder of Pakistani truck art for work. Every time a client says 'make it pop', I open it and remember what colour really means.","zh":"我电脑里有个文件夹专门存巴基斯坦卡车画。每次客户说「再鲜艳一点」，我就打开看看，提醒自己什么才叫颜色。"}],"帕劳承诺":[{"npc":"grace","t":"年假","en":"Stopped in Palau on my way home to Manila. Signing a promise in my own passport felt more serious than any hospital consent form I've ever witnessed.","zh":"回马尼拉的路上在帕劳停了几天。在自己的护照上签一个承诺，比我在医院见过的任何知情同意书都郑重。"}],"恐龙博物馆":[{"npc":"kenji","t":"连休","en":"Took the train from Osaka for a long weekend. I spent forty minutes brushing one tiny rock and found nothing. Best forty minutes of the month.","zh":"连休从大阪坐电车过去。我对着一小块石头刷了四十分钟，什么也没找到。这个月最开心的四十分钟。"}],"桃太郎":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"春假","en":"I teach Momotaro to my Osaka kids every year, so I finally visited Okayama. Bought kibi dango for the whole class — now they want me to bring a dog, a monkey and a pheasant too.","zh":"每年都给大阪的小学生讲桃太郎，这次终于去了冈山。给全班买了吉备团子——现在他们要我把狗、猴子和野鸡也带来。"}],"有田烧":[{"npc":"tanaka","t":"黄金周","en":"Went to the Arita pottery fair again. I promised my husband I'd buy nothing — came home with six rice bowls. They were on sale, so it doesn't count.","zh":"又去了有田陶器市。答应老公什么都不买——结果带回六个饭碗。打折的，不算。"}],"东京迪士尼":[{"npc":"yuki","t":"结婚纪念日","en":"Wedding anniversary at Tokyo Disneyland. Daniel wanted the rides; I wanted a good parade spot. We sat on a plastic sheet for fifty minutes — very romantic.","zh":"结婚纪念日去了东京迪士尼。Daniel 想玩项目，我想占个看游行的好位置。我们在塑料布上坐了五十分钟——很浪漫。"}],"婆罗多舞":[{"npc":"priyanka","t":"十二月","en":"Flew from Bangalore to Chennai for my cousin's arangetram. Three hours on stage, two outfit changes, and her teacher cried more than her mum.","zh":"从班加罗尔飞金奈看表妹的第一次独舞。台上三个小时，换了两次衣服，她老师比她妈妈哭得还厉害。"}],"葛饰北斋":[{"npc":"aiko","t":"收银台","en":"A tourist paid at our record shop and stared at the change: 'Is that the Great Wave?' Yes — you now carry Hokusai in your wallet.","zh":"一个游客在我们唱片店付钱，盯着找的零钱：「这是那个大浪吗？」对——你钱包里现在装着北斋。"}],"印尼蜡染":[{"npc":"budi","t":"10 月 2 日","en":"National Batik Day: half my passengers today were in batik, so I wore my dad's old shirt under my jacket. One lady asked where I bought it — it's older than me.","zh":"全国蜡染日，今天一半的乘客穿着 batik，我就在外套里面穿了我爸的旧衬衫。一位阿姨问我在哪儿买的——它比我年纪还大。"}],"吉普尼":[{"npc":"bea","t":"拍视频那天","en":"Filmed a 'how to ride a jeepney' video. The hardest part to explain to foreigners: you pass strangers' coins to the driver and nobody ever steals one.","zh":"拍了一条「怎么坐吉普尼」的视频。最难跟外国人解释的是：你要帮陌生人把硬币传给司机，而且从来没人会私吞。"}],"宝莱坞":[{"npc":"rohan","t":"周五晚上","en":"Friday night first show with the office gang. Three hours, an interval for samosas, and the whole cinema whistling when the hero walked in. You don't watch Bollywood, you join it.","zh":"周五晚上和同事看首映。三个小时，中场休息吃咸角，男主角一出场全场吹口哨。宝莱坞不是用来看的，是用来一起参与的。"}],"原住民艺术":[{"npc":"mia","t":"冬季学期假","en":"Flew from Melbourne to Alice Springs for a uni trip. At the art centre I asked what a painting meant and the artist said, 'That part's not mine to tell.' Best answer I've heard all year.","zh":"跟学校从墨尔本飞到爱丽丝泉。在艺术中心我问一幅画是什么意思，画家说：「那部分不该由我来讲。」这是我今年听过最好的回答。"}],"霍比特人村":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"读研前的间隔年","en":"I've seen the films eleven times, so I cried at Bag End. Then the guide said most doors open onto nothing — just a wall of dirt. Film magic, my favourite kind of lie.","zh":"电影我看了十一遍，所以到袋底洞就哭了。然后导游说大部分门后面什么都没有，就是一堵土墙。电影魔法，我最爱的那种谎言。"}],"墨尔本电车":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"下夜班","en":"Finished my shift at ten and caught the 86 home. A tourist asked me if the tram was free — only in the city, mate, and we're two stops past it.","zh":"十点下班坐 86 路回家。一个游客问我电车是不是免费的——只有市中心免费，我们已经过了两站了。"}],"毛利纹面":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"休假","en":"Hopped over to Rotorua for a week off. At the hāngī dinner our host explained her moko kauae line by line — her grandmother's tribe, her own children. I'd never heard a face read like a family tree.","zh":"休假飞去罗托鲁瓦待了一周。吃地窑餐时，女主人一道一道给我们讲她下巴上的纹：她外婆的部落、她自己的孩子。我第一次听人把一张脸读成一本家谱。"}],"国际日期变更线":[{"npc":"amara","t":"两班之间","en":"Crew rest in Fiji, so a few of us took the little plane to Taveuni. I jumped back and forth over the 180° sign — still Tuesday on both sides. Jet lag is the only time travel I get.","zh":"在斐济轮休，几个同事坐小飞机去了塔韦乌尼。我在 180 度的牌子两边跳来跳去——两边都还是星期二。时差才是我唯一的时间旅行。"}],"八百多种语言":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"地理课","en":"Asked my class to guess how many languages Papua New Guinea has. Highest guess was fifty. When I said 840, a boy said, 'Then how do they order lunch?'","zh":"让学生猜巴布亚新几内亚有多少种语言，最高猜五十。我说 840，一个男生问：「那他们怎么点午饭？」"}],"博茨瓦纳篮编":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"出差顺路","en":"A case took me to Maun, and on the last day I bought one basket. The tag had the weaver's name, so I wrote to thank her. My office now has its first piece of art.","zh":"因为一个案子去了马翁，最后一天买了一只篮子。标签上写着编的人的名字，我就写信谢了她。我们办公室终于有了第一件艺术品。"}],"绍纳石雕":[{"npc":"maja","t":"去哈拉雷开会","en":"Architecture conference in Harare. In the National Gallery garden I wanted to stroke every stone figure — the guard smiled and pointed at the 'please don't touch' sign.","zh":"去哈拉雷开建筑会议。在国家画廊的院子里，每一件石雕我都想摸一摸——保安笑着指了指「请勿触摸」的牌子。"}],"树皮布":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"去坎帕拉开会","en":"Work conference in Kampala. A colleague took me to watch barkcloth being beaten — thud, thud, thud for an hour. Afterwards my risk models felt like a very quiet job.","zh":"去坎帕拉开会。同事带我看人捶树皮布——咚、咚、咚，一个小时。之后我觉得我做的风控模型是很安静的工作。"}],"Safari 是什么":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"周日","en":"A tourist asked me where to book a safari. My cousin answered, 'Safari njema!' — have a good trip. For us it's just the word for going anywhere, even to the market.","zh":"一个游客问我在哪儿订 safari。我表哥回他：「Safari njema！」——一路顺风。对我们来说，这个词就是出门，去菜市场也算。"}],"波斯地毯":[{"npc":"emre","t":"大巴扎","en":"The carpet seller next door brought an Isfahan silk rug in to get my exchange rate. Took him an hour to unroll it for the customer, ten seconds to say the price.","zh":"隔壁卖地毯的拿着一块伊斯法罕丝毯来问我今天的汇率。他给客人摊开花了一个小时，报价只用了十秒。"}],"图坦卡蒙面具":[{"npc":"omar_de","t":"冬天休假","en":"Flew Munich–Cairo for the new museum. The queue for the mask was long, but standing in front of it, everyone whispered — like it might hear us.","zh":"从慕尼黑飞开罗去看新博物馆。看面具要排很久，但站到它前面，大家都小声说话——好像它能听见。"}],"菲斯皮革染坊":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"长周末","en":"Long weekend in Fez for colour research. The shop guy gave me mint for the smell and I forgot to use it — I was too busy matching the vats to Pantone codes.","zh":"长周末去菲斯找配色灵感。店里的人给了我一枝薄荷挡味，我忘了用——一直忙着把染池的颜色对成潘通色号。"}],"非洲鼓":[{"npc":"kwame","t":"录音那天","en":"Sampled my grandfather's atumpan for a new beat. He listened to the track and said the drum was saying something rude in the second verse. Re-recording tomorrow.","zh":"给新曲子采样了爷爷的阿通潘鼓。他听完说第二段里鼓在「说」一句不礼貌的话。明天重录。"}],"诺莱坞":[{"npc":"tunde","t":"周六晚上","en":"My mum watches two Nollywood films a night. When I pitched my app to investors, she said, 'Tell it like a Nollywood film — a betrayal, a wedding, then money.' It worked.","zh":"我妈一晚上看两部诺莱坞电影。我去跟投资人讲 App 之前她说：「照诺莱坞电影讲——先有人背叛，再办婚礼，最后有钱。」还真管用。"}],"汗哈利利市场":[{"npc":"ahmed","t":"年假","en":"Bought a brass lamp at Khan el-Khalili after two teas and twenty minutes of bargaining. Got it home to London and realised it doesn't fit any of my plugs.","zh":"在汗哈利利喝了两杯茶、砍了二十分钟价，买了一盏铜灯。带回伦敦才发现插头一个都插不上。"}],"猫女神巴斯特":[{"npc":"zhou_vet","t":"去开罗旅行","en":"In the museum I stood in front of the cat mummies far too long. My husband said, 'You're doing a check-up, aren't you?' I was — the ears were in very good shape.","zh":"在博物馆里，我在猫木乃伊前面站了太久。我老公说：「你是不是在给它们体检？」是的——耳朵保存得很好。"}],"电影《卡萨布兰卡》":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"写影评","en":"Writing a piece on classic films and finally visited Rick's Café. The pianist played the song before I even asked. Every journalist must order the same thing.","zh":"写一篇老电影的稿子，终于去了里克咖啡馆。我还没开口，钢琴师就弹起了那首歌。看来每个记者都点同一首。"}],"露西化石":[{"npc":"lena","t":"周末去布拉格","en":"Took the train from Berlin to Prague because Lucy was in town. She's tiny — about a metre tall. Our whole species started with someone shorter than my desk.","zh":"因为露西来了，从柏林坐火车去布拉格。她好小，大概一米高。我们整个人类，是从一个比我桌子还矮的人开始的。"}],"Hakuna Matata":[{"npc":"jess","t":"客户会议","en":"A client wanted 'Hakuna Matata' on a T-shirt campaign. Legal said check the trademark first. Turns out 'no worries' can come with a lot of worries.","zh":"客户想在 T 恤广告上印「Hakuna Matata」。法务说先查商标。原来「别担心」也能带来很多担心。"}],"电影《马达加斯加》":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"宿舍电影夜","en":"Rewatched Madagascar for movie night and then went down a rabbit hole about real lemurs. Posted 'King Julien is endangered' — my most-viewed post this month.","zh":"宿舍电影夜重看了《马达加斯加》，然后查了一晚上真的狐猴。发了一条「朱利安国王是濒危动物」——这个月我看的人最多的一条。"}],"Afrobeats":[{"npc":"tolu","t":"录音棚","en":"Producing in Lagos, my phone buzzes every week with someone in Seoul or São Paulo asking for 'that Lagos sound'. I tell them: come to a party in Surulere first.","zh":"在拉各斯做音乐，每周手机都会响，首尔、圣保罗的人来要「拉各斯那种声音」。我跟他们说：先来苏鲁勒雷参加一次派对。"}],"贝宁青铜器":[{"npc":"ngozi","t":"带学生参观","en":"Took my Year 9s to see the Benin plaques in London. One girl asked, 'Miss, if it was taken, why is it still here?' We spent the whole bus ride home on that question.","zh":"带九年级的学生去伦敦看贝宁浮雕牌。一个女生问：「老师，既然是抢来的，为什么还在这里？」回去的大巴上我们一路都在讨论这个问题。"}],"肯特布":[{"npc":"adaeze","t":"找面料","en":"Visited Bonwire on a fabric trip from Lagos. A weaver told me the name of every strip on his loom — I'd brought a notebook for prices and filled it with stories instead.","zh":"从拉各斯出来找面料，去了邦维尔。一位织工把织机上每一条布的名字都讲给我听——我带本子是来记价格的，结果记满了故事。"}],"奇幻棺材":[{"npc":"nomvula","t":"会议间隙","en":"At a palliative care conference in Accra, a colleague took me to a coffin workshop. A fish, a sneaker, an aeroplane. I've sat with so many families — none of them ever laughed at a coffin before.","zh":"在阿克拉开临终关怀的会，同事带我去了一家棺材作坊：一条鱼、一只球鞋、一架飞机。我陪过那么多家庭，从没见过谁对着棺材笑。"}],"星球大战取景地":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"假期","en":"Flew to Tunisia for a Star Wars trip. Slept in Luke's house — the walls are cool, the Wi-Fi is not. Felt very far from my robotaxi.","zh":"飞去突尼斯做一趟《星球大战》之旅。住在卢克的家里——墙很凉快，Wi-Fi 不太行。离我每天坐的无人驾驶出租车好远。"}],"瑞士近卫队":[{"npc":"chiara","t":"周日早上","en":"Took my class to St Peter's Square. The kids were more excited about the Swiss Guards' stripes than the basilica!","zh":"带班上的孩子去了圣彼得广场。比起大教堂，他们对瑞士卫兵的条纹制服兴奋多了！"}],"冰岛精灵":[{"npc":"maja","t":"出差回来","en":"Back from a work trip to Reykjavík. A local engineer told me, half joking, that they always check with the 'hidden people' before moving a big rock.","zh":"从雷克雅未克出差回来。当地一个工程师半开玩笑地说，挪大石头之前他们总要先「问问隐藏的人」。"}],"莫奈花园":[{"npc":"claire","t":"五月的周六","en":"Took the train to Vernon and cycled to Giverny. Crowded, but the lily pond at 9am was worth it.","zh":"坐火车到韦尔农，骑车去了吉维尼。人很多，但早上九点的睡莲池值得。"}],"法朵":[{"npc":"rui","t":"周五晚上","en":"My guests always ask where to hear fado. I send them to a tiny place two streets away — no microphones, just a guitar.","zh":"住我这儿的客人总问哪里能听法朵。我让他们去隔两条街的一家小店——没有麦克风，只有一把吉他。"}],"葡萄牙瓷砖":[{"npc":"tiago","t":"午饭后散步","en":"I walk past the same blue-and-white tiled wall every day. I put its pattern in my app's loading screen.","zh":"我每天都走过同一面蓝白瓷砖墙，后来把它的花纹放进了我 App 的加载页。"}],"格林童话":[{"npc":"sabine","t":"周三课上","en":"Read 'Hansel and Gretel' to my class today. Half of them were scared, the other half wanted to build a gingerbread house.","zh":"今天给班上读了《汉塞尔与格莱特》。一半孩子吓到了，另一半想做个姜饼屋。"}],"阿姆斯特丹运河":[{"npc":"sanne","t":"下班路上","en":"Cycled home along the Prinsengracht. Someone's bike was being fished out of the canal again.","zh":"沿着王子运河骑车回家，又看到有人的自行车被从河里捞上来。"}],"维也纳金色大厅":[{"npc":"huber","t":"1 月 1 日中午","en":"Every New Year's Day I watch the concert from Vienna on TV. And yes, I clap along to the Radetzky March in my living room.","zh":"每年元旦我都在电视上看维也纳的新年音乐会。没错，我会在客厅里跟着《拉德茨基进行曲》拍手。"}],"克里特迷宫":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"暑假","en":"Visited Knossos with my students. We talked about the Minotaur, but they mostly wanted shade and ice cream.","zh":"带学生去了克诺索斯。我们聊米诺陶洛斯，但他们最想要的是树荫和冰淇淋。"}],"俄罗斯套娃":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"周末","en":"Found a vintage matryoshka at a flea market. Seven dolls inside — the smallest is the size of a grain of rice.","zh":"在跳蚤市场淘到一个老套娃，里面有七个，最小的跟米粒一样大。"}],"冬宫":[{"npc":"aino","t":"以前的冬天","en":"Years ago I took the train from Helsinki to St Petersburg just for the Hermitage. One day was not nearly enough.","zh":"很多年前我专门从赫尔辛基坐火车去圣彼得堡看艾尔米塔什，一天根本不够。"}],"维京海盗":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"周日","en":"Bergen was a Viking-age trading town. I still show my grandchildren the old harbour and tell them the stories.","zh":"卑尔根以前是维京时代的商港。我现在还会带孙子孙女去老港口，给他们讲那些故事。"}],"诺贝尔奖":[{"npc":"anna_se","t":"12 月 10 日晚上","en":"Every year on 10 December half my office watches the Nobel banquet on TV — mostly to judge the dresses.","zh":"每年 12 月 10 日，我们办公室一半的人都在看诺贝尔晚宴直播——主要是为了看礼服。"}],"ABBA乐队":[{"npc":"giulia","t":"周六下午","en":"Finally went to ABBA The Museum with my Swedish mother-in-law. She knew every single song.","zh":"终于跟我的瑞典婆婆去了 ABBA 博物馆。每首歌她都会唱。"}],"彩绘牛车":[{"npc":"amara","t":"转机的空档","en":"Had a layover in San José and took a bus to Sarchí. I watched a man paint a whole wheel freehand — not one line was crooked.","zh":"在圣何塞转机，坐车去了萨尔奇。看一个师傅徒手画完一整个车轮，一条线都没歪。"}],"萨摩亚纹身":[{"npc":"mia","t":"咖啡馆午休","en":"My coworker is Samoan and showed me her malu tattoo. She said it took days and her whole family came to support her.","zh":"我同事是萨摩亚人，给我看了她的 malu 纹身。她说纹了好几天，全家人都来陪她。"}],"迪士尼乐园":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"周二","en":"Went to Disneyland on a weekday for a video. Still a 70-minute line for Space Mountain.","zh":"工作日去迪士尼拍视频，太空山还是排了 70 分钟。"}],"罗斯威尔外星人":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"公路旅行","en":"Drove through Roswell on a road trip. Even the McDonald's looks like a flying saucer. Bought an alien keychain for my niece.","zh":"公路旅行路过罗斯威尔，连麦当劳都像个飞碟。给侄女买了个外星人钥匙扣。"}],"摇滚名人堂":[{"npc":"jake","t":"春假","en":"Drove to Cleveland with two other teachers. Spent an hour just looking at guitars.","zh":"跟另外两个老师开车去了克利夫兰，光看吉他就看了一小时。"}],"迪士尼世界":[{"npc":"grace","t":"休假","en":"Took my nieces to Disney World. 25,000 steps a day — harder than a night shift.","zh":"带侄女们去了迪士尼世界，一天走两万五千步，比上夜班还累。"}],"史密森尼博物馆":[{"npc":"jess","t":"周末","en":"Took the train to D.C. for the weekend. All the museums are free — I did three in one day.","zh":"周末坐火车去了华盛顿。博物馆全免费，我一天逛了三个。"}],"耶鲁大学":[{"npc":"tony","t":"周六","en":"Drove up to New Haven for a talk at Yale, then went to a famous pizza place nearby.","zh":"开车去纽黑文在耶鲁听了个讲座，然后去附近一家有名的披萨店。"}],"绿山墙的安妮":[{"npc":"aisha_bank","t":"夏天","en":"Finally visited Green Gables. A Japanese tour group next to me knew the book better than I did.","zh":"终于去了绿山墙。旁边一个日本旅行团比我还熟这本书。"}],"新奥尔良爵士乐":[{"npc":"andre","t":"休假","en":"First night in New Orleans: walked down Frenchmen Street and a brass band just started playing on the corner.","zh":"到新奥尔良第一晚，走在 Frenchmen Street 上，街角一支铜管乐队突然就开始演奏了。"}],"乡村音乐":[{"npc":"sarah","t":"出差","en":"Business trip to Nashville. Live music in every bar on Broadway at 2pm on a Tuesday.","zh":"去纳什维尔出差，周二下午两点，百老汇大街每家酒吧都有现场。"}],"哈瓦那老爷车":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"采访途中","en":"In Havana for a story. My taxi was a 1956 Chevrolet held together with parts from three other cars.","zh":"在哈瓦那采访。我坐的出租车是 1956 年的雪佛兰，零件来自另外三辆车。"}],"加勒比海盗":[{"npc":"holly_cine","t":"放映前","en":"We're showing a pirate movie this week. I tell customers the real Port Royal sank in an earthquake — they never believe me.","zh":"我们这周在放海盗电影。我跟观众说真的皇家港在地震里沉了，他们都不信。"}],"纳斯卡线条":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"暑假","en":"Finally flew over the Nazca lines. The hummingbird is real — I'd shown it to students for 15 years.","zh":"终于飞过了纳斯卡线条。那只蜂鸟是真的——我给学生看了十五年照片。"}],"波萨诺瓦":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"周日早上","en":"Bossa nova on a Sunday morning in Paris makes me miss Brazil. My grandma used to play it while cooking.","zh":"在巴黎的周日早上放波萨诺瓦，我就想巴西。奶奶以前做饭时总放。"}],"帕丁顿熊":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"周六上午","en":"Paddington books still sell out every Christmas. A little boy asked me if Peru is near Paddington Station.","zh":"帕丁顿的书每年圣诞节还是卖光。一个小男孩问我秘鲁是不是在帕丁顿车站旁边。"}],"黄金博物馆":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"毕业旅行","en":"Went to the Gold Museum in Bogotá on my graduation trip. The tiny gold raft is smaller than my phone!","zh":"毕业旅行去了波哥大的黄金博物馆。那只小金筏比我的手机还小！"}],"选美王国":[{"npc":"minji","t":"收工后","en":"A Venezuelan model I styled told me she practised walking in heels for two years before her first pageant.","zh":"我给一个委内瑞拉模特做造型，她说第一次参加选美前，练了两年穿高跟鞋走路。"}],"梵蒂冈邮票":[{"npc":"lucia_it","t":"周三上午","en":"I still buy every new Vatican stamp set at the post office by St Peter's. My album is almost full.","zh":"每套新的梵蒂冈邮票我还是会去圣彼得广场旁边的邮局买，集邮册快满了。"}],"欧元":[{"npc":"hans","t":"柜台前","en":"I remember January 2002 at the bank — everyone bringing in their old marks. Some people cried a little.","zh":"我记得 2002 年 1 月在银行，大家都拿旧马克来换。有的人还有点舍不得哭了。"}],"英镑":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"月底","en":"I'm the one who splits the bill in our group. Nobody has cash anymore — it's all bank transfers now.","zh":"我是朋友里算账的那个。现在没人带现金了，全是银行转账。"}],"卢布":[{"npc":"emre","t":"上午开门","en":"Russian tourists still come to my exchange shop. Every week the rouble rate on my board changes.","zh":"还是有俄罗斯游客来我的换汇店。我牌子上的卢布汇率每周都在变。"}],"瑞士法郎":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"周五下班","en":"Lunch in Geneva costs 25 francs, so on Saturdays I sometimes shop across the border in France.","zh":"在日内瓦吃个午饭要 25 法郎，所以周六我有时去法国那边买东西。"}],"土耳其里拉":[{"npc":"emre","t":"午后","en":"Tourists ask why old lira notes in my drawer have so many zeros. I keep one to show them.","zh":"游客问我抽屉里的旧里拉怎么有那么多零。我特意留了一张给他们看。"}],"最早的硬币":[{"npc":"oliver","t":"午休","en":"Spent my lunch break in the British Museum's money gallery. The first coins are tiny — like a fingernail with a lion on it.","zh":"午休去了大英博物馆的钱币馆。最早的硬币小小的，像指甲盖上印了一只狮子。"}],"格查尔":[{"npc":"valeria","t":"进货回来","en":"Bought fabric in Guatemala for my jewellery. Every coin I got as change had a quetzal bird on it.","zh":"去危地马拉给我的首饰买布料，找回来的每个硬币上都有一只格查尔鸟。"}],"塔拉":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"收银时","en":"A customer paid me with a Samoan tala note by mistake. We both laughed — she'd just got back from visiting her grandma in Apia.","zh":"有个顾客不小心递给我一张萨摩亚塔拉。我们都笑了——她刚从阿皮亚看完外婆回来。"}],"潘加":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"周末","en":"A Tongan family brought their dog in and paid in cash — a pa'anga note was mixed in with their dollars. They let me keep it as a souvenir.","zh":"一家汤加人带狗来看病，付现金时澳元里夹着一张潘加，他们让我留着当纪念。"}],"美元":[{"npc":"marcus_bank","t":"周一上午","en":"Customers keep bringing in jars of pennies since the Mint stopped making them. We still take them, just roll them first, please!","zh":"造币厂不做一分钱以后，客人一罐一罐地拿来存。我们照收，不过麻烦先卷好！"}],"加元":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"早上买咖啡","en":"Coffee was $2.25 and I paid with a toonie and a quarter. My American coworker still can't keep 'loonie' and 'toonie' straight.","zh":"咖啡 2.25 加元，我付了一个两元硬币加一个 25 分。我的美国同事到现在还分不清 loonie 和 toonie。"}],"墨西哥比索":[{"npc":"diego","t":"送外卖时","en":"Tourists see '$80' on our taco menu and panic. I always say: relax, that's pesos.","zh":"游客看到塔可菜单上写「$80」就慌了。我总是说：别紧张，是比索。"}],"巴西雷亚尔":[{"npc":"bia","t":"周六市集","en":"Haven't touched cash in months — even the guy selling coconuts at the beach takes Pix.","zh":"好几个月没碰过现金了，连海滩上卖椰子的大叔都收 Pix。"}],"阿里亚里":[{"npc":"nomvula","t":"假期","en":"In Madagascar I changed 100 dollars and got a thick pile of ariary. I felt like a millionaire for a day.","zh":"在马达加斯加换了 100 美元，拿到厚厚一沓阿里亚里，当了一天「百万富翁」。"}],"西非法郎":[{"npc":"kwame","t":"演出后","en":"Played a show in Lomé last month. Had to change my cedis to CFA at the border — Ghana uses its own money.","zh":"上个月去洛美演出，在边境把塞地换成了西非法郎——加纳用自己的钱。"}],"南非兰特":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"周五","en":"My niece collects the new notes because she likes the baby animals on the back.","zh":"我侄女在收集新钞，因为她喜欢背面的动物宝宝。"}],"埃及镑":[{"npc":"amara","t":"开罗过夜","en":"Overnight in Cairo. The plastic 10-pound notes are great — they survived my coffee spill.","zh":"在开罗过夜。塑料的 10 镑很好，咖啡洒上去都没事。"}],"肯尼亚先令":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"早上开店","en":"First customer of the day sent 500 shillings to her mum in the village. Takes ten seconds.","zh":"今天第一个客人给村里的妈妈转了 500 先令，十秒钟就好。"}],"春节":[{"npc":"bj_liu","t":"腊月二十八上午","en":"Every year the neighbours bring me red paper and I write couplets for the whole building. My hand isn't as steady as it was, but nobody's let me retire yet.","zh":"每年邻居们都拿红纸来，我给整栋楼写春联。手没以前稳了，可谁也不让我退休。"}],"中秋节":[{"npc":"mei","t":"中秋节晚上","en":"In Taipei, Mid-Autumn means barbecue on the pavement outside our building. The moon is up there somewhere, but honestly we're all looking at the grill.","zh":"在台北，中秋就是在楼下人行道上烤肉。月亮在天上某个地方，可说实话大家都盯着烤架。"}],"端午龙舟":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"端午节前一天","en":"I read Qu Yuan's poem with my class before the holiday. Then the real debate started: sweet zongzi or salty? Half the class nearly stopped talking to the other half.","zh":"放假前我带学生读了屈原的诗。然后真正的辩论开始了：粽子吃甜的还是咸的？全班差点分成两派不说话。"}],"那达慕大会":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"七月，坐火车经过","en":"I took the train north from Beijing and stopped in Hohhot for Naadam. I sat on the grass for two hours watching one wrestling match — nobody seemed in a hurry, so neither was I.","zh":"我从北京坐火车往北，在呼和浩特下车看那达慕。我在草地上坐了两个小时，就看一场摔跤——谁都不着急，我也就不急了。"}],"哈尔滨冰雪大世界":[{"npc":"emma","t":"寒假","en":"My phone died after ten minutes in the cold, so I have almost no photos of the ice castles. I do have a very clear memory of the frozen pear I ate afterwards.","zh":"手机在冷风里撑了十分钟就关机了，所以冰城堡我几乎没拍到照片。倒是出来以后吃的冻梨，我记得特别清楚。"}],"妈祖":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"星期天早上","en":"My grandma takes me to Thian Hock Keng on Telok Ayer Street — it was built for Mazu by sailors who arrived safely. She still lights a joss stick before anyone in the family flies.","zh":"奶奶带我去直落亚逸街的天福宫——那是平安上岸的水手们为妈祖建的。家里谁要坐飞机，她还是会先去上一炷香。"}],"潍坊风筝":[{"npc":"chenjian","t":"四月出差","en":"A buyer from Germany wanted kites, so I took him to the Weifang festival. He looked up at a centipede kite a hundred metres long and placed his order before lunch.","zh":"一个德国客户想要风筝，我就带他去了潍坊风筝节。他抬头看了一眼一百多米长的蜈蚣风筝，午饭前就下了单。"}],"醒狮":[{"npc":"aqiang","t":"正月初八开工那天","en":"Every year on the first working day, the market hires a lion dance troupe. The lion goes stall by stall, and I hang a lettuce with a red envelope over my counter — good luck isn't free.","zh":"每年开工第一天，市场都请狮队。狮子一个档口一个档口地采青，我在柜台上挂一棵带红包的生菜——好运也不是白来的。"}],"三月三歌节":[{"npc":"fang","t":"三月三那天","en":"In Nanning a grandmother gave me a bag of five-coloured sticky rice and explained every colour — purple, red, yellow — all from plants. I filmed it all and forgot to eat.","zh":"在南宁，一位奶奶给了我一袋五色糯米饭，一种颜色一种颜色地讲——紫的、红的、黄的，都是植物染的。我光顾着拍，忘了吃。"}],"苗族银饰":[{"npc":"camille","t":"去贵州找灵感那次","en":"In a village near Leishan I watched a silversmith hammer one tiny flower for twenty minutes. I've bought from a lot of workshops, but I didn't dare bargain there.","zh":"在雷山附近的一个村子，我看一个银匠敲一朵小银花敲了二十分钟。我在很多作坊买过东西，可在那儿我不敢还价。"}],"泼水节":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"四月的假期","en":"I went to Jinghong with my roommates and bought a plastic phone pouch at the station. It lasted about four minutes. I came back soaked and very happy.","zh":"我跟室友去了景洪，在车站买了个塑料手机袋。它撑了大概四分钟。我回来浑身湿透，但特别开心。"}],"特纳卡":[{"npc":"amara","t":"在仰光过夜那次","en":"On a layover in Yangon, the lady at the market painted thanaka on my cheeks with her finger. It smelled like sandalwood, and the crew didn't recognise me at breakfast.","zh":"在仰光过夜那次，市场里的阿姨用手指在我脸上画了特纳卡。闻起来像檀香，第二天早饭时机组的同事都没认出我。"}],"小贩中心":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"上班前的午饭","en":"Before my shift I eat at the hawker centre near my flat. I put a packet of tissues on the table to chope my seat — nobody touches it, that's just how it works here.","zh":"上班前我在家附近的小贩中心吃饭。我放一包纸巾在桌上占位子——没人会动它，这儿就是这样。"}],"月亮风筝":[{"npc":"weijie","t":"去柔佛出差的周末","en":"After a school visit in Johor, a teacher took me to a field where an old man was flying a wau bulan bigger than my car. It hummed in the wind like a motorbike.","zh":"在柔佛拜访完一所学校，一位老师带我去了一片空地，有个老人在放一只比我的车还大的月亮风筝。它在风里嗡嗡响，像摩托车。"}],"康提佛牙节":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"八月的晚上","en":"I took the slow train up from Colombo, through tea hills, just to see the Perahera. When the elephant with the casket passed, the whole street went silent.","zh":"我从科伦坡坐慢车上山，穿过一片片茶园，就为了看佛牙节游行。驮着舍利盒的大象经过时，整条街一下子安静了。"}],"波杜贝鲁鼓舞":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"马尔代夫度假的最后一晚","en":"I planned to film the boduberu show for my followers, but the drummers pulled me in to dance. The video is just my feet and a lot of shouting.","zh":"我本来想给粉丝拍鼓舞表演，结果鼓手们把我拉进去一起跳。视频里只有我的脚和一片叫喊声。"}],"雅浦竹棍舞":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"地理课上","en":"When I teach about money, I show my class the stone discs of Yap and a video of the Yap Day stick dance. They always ask if they can pay their canteen bill with a rock.","zh":"讲到「钱」的时候，我给学生看雅浦岛的石头钱和雅浦日的竹棍舞视频。他们每次都问能不能用石头付食堂的账。"}],"睡魔祭":[{"npc":"daniel","t":"八月的暑假","en":"Yuki and I took the night bus to Aomori and rented haneto costumes for the evening. I jumped and shouted \"Rassera!\" for an hour. My calves still remember it.","zh":"我和 Yuki 坐夜车去了青森，晚上租了跳人的衣服。我跳着喊「Rassera!」喊了一个小时。我的小腿到现在还记得。"}],"阿波舞":[{"npc":"kenji","t":"盂兰盆假期","en":"My colleagues dragged me to Tokushima. I said I'd only watch, but a ren leader waved me in, so I danced for three songs. I think it was my most social day of the year.","zh":"同事硬拉我去了德岛。我说只看不跳，可一个舞队的领队朝我招手，我就跳了三首。我觉得那是我今年社交最多的一天。"}],"普什卡骆驼节":[{"npc":"priya","t":"排灯节后的长假","en":"I went to Pushkar with two friends and we spent a whole morning watching a camel beauty contest. The winner had better jewellery than I do.","zh":"我和两个朋友去了普什卡，花了一整个上午看骆驼选美。冠军戴的首饰比我的还漂亮。"}],"犀鸟节":[{"npc":"kavya","t":"十二月出差","en":"I was in Kohima to talk to farmers about our weather app, and they took me to the Hornbill Festival in the evening. One grandmother asked why my app can't predict the rain her knees can.","zh":"我去科希马跟农民聊我们的天气 App，晚上他们带我去了犀鸟节。一位奶奶问我，为什么我的 App 预报不出她膝盖能感觉到的雨。"}],"蒙古包":[{"npc":"noor","t":"去乌兰巴托开会的周末","en":"After the conference I stayed two nights in a ger camp outside Ulaanbaatar. As an ex-architect I kept counting the roof poles. The host just laughed and put more dung in the stove.","zh":"开完会，我在乌兰巴托城外的蒙古包营住了两晚。当过建筑师的我一直在数屋顶的木杆。主人只是笑，又往炉子里添了些牛粪。"}],"水灯节":[{"npc":"ploy","t":"十一月的满月夜","en":"My friends and I took the train to Chiang Mai for Yi Peng. We made our krathong from banana leaves at the hostel — mine looked terrible, but it floated.","zh":"我和朋友坐火车去清迈过天灯节。我们在青旅用香蕉叶自己做水灯——我的丑得要命，可它浮起来了。"}],"恒河":[{"npc":"rohan","t":"带爸妈出门的那一周","en":"My parents had wanted to see Varanasi for thirty years, so I finally took them. At the evening aarti my father didn't say a word. Then he asked if I'd eaten.","zh":"我爸妈想去瓦拉纳西想了三十年，我终于带他们去了。晚上的点灯仪式，我爸一句话也没说。然后他问我吃饭了没有。"}],"排灯节":[{"npc":"priyanka","t":"排灯节晚上","en":"Every Diwali my mum and I put rows of diyas along the balcony. Then my phone explodes with sweet-box photos from every relative in the family group.","zh":"每年排灯节，我和妈妈在阳台上摆一排排小油灯。然后家族群里每个亲戚都发甜点盒的照片，我手机都要炸了。"}],"悉尼跨年烟花":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"12 月 31 日晚上","en":"New Year's Eve is our busiest night at the clinic — dogs bolt at the first bang. Every year I tell owners: keep them inside, close the curtains, put the telly on.","zh":"跨年夜是我们诊所最忙的一晚——第一声炮响狗就跑了。每年我都跟主人说：关在家里、拉上窗帘、把电视打开。"}],"毛利哈卡舞":[{"npc":"jake","t":"体育课上","en":"I showed my students an All Blacks haka before a game. Then I made them try it. The eighth graders were terrifying. The teachers next door came to check if we were okay.","zh":"我给学生看了全黑队赛前的哈卡，然后让他们自己试。八年级那帮孩子吓死人了。隔壁的老师都跑过来看我们是不是出事了。"}],"火上行走":[{"npc":"zoe","t":"斐济拍视频那周","en":"I watched the firewalkers at a resort in Fiji and honestly forgot to film the first walk. One of them told me they don't eat coconut before a walk — I didn't ask why, I just nodded.","zh":"我在斐济一家度假村看走火，说实话第一轮我都忘了拍。其中一个人告诉我，走火前他们不吃椰子——我没敢问为什么，只是点头。"}],"Bula衬衫":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"寒假去斐济","en":"My mum made the whole family buy matching Bula shirts at the market in Suva. In the photos we look like a very small, very loud band.","zh":"我妈在苏瓦的市场让全家买了一样的 Bula 衫。照片里我们看起来像一支很小、很吵的乐队。"}],"戈罗卡歌舞节":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"攒了三年假的九月","en":"I'd taught PNG on the map for twenty years, so I finally went to the Goroka Show. A man in a bird-of-paradise headdress asked me where Barcelona was. I drew him a map in the dust.","zh":"我在地图上教巴布亚新几内亚教了二十年，终于去了一趟戈罗卡节。一个戴着天堂鸟头饰的男人问我巴塞罗那在哪儿。我在土上给他画了张地图。"}],"阿萨罗泥人":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"去巴新看朋友那次","en":"My friend from nursing school lives in Goroka now. She took me to see the mudmen — they moved so slowly and silently that the kids next to me hid behind their dad.","zh":"我护校的朋友现在住在戈罗卡。她带我去看泥人——他们走得又慢又安静，我旁边的小孩都躲到了爸爸身后。"}],"塞皮克河":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"坐船走塞皮克河的那一周","en":"I spent a week on a little boat on the Sepik, stopping at villages with spirit houses. No trains, no roads — just canoes. I didn't miss my phone once.","zh":"我在塞皮克河的小船上待了一周，一路停靠有精灵屋的村子。没有火车、没有公路，只有独木舟。我一次都没想过手机。"}],"陆地跳":[{"npc":"mia","t":"去昆斯敦玩了蹦极之后","en":"I did a bungee jump in Queenstown and felt very brave — then I read about the land divers of Pentecost, who use vines and wooden towers. I felt a lot less brave.","zh":"我在昆斯敦蹦了一次极，觉得自己特别勇敢——后来看到彭特科斯特岛的陆地跳，人家用的是藤蔓和木头塔。我就没那么勇敢了。"}],"旋转舞":[{"npc":"emre","t":"十二月","en":"Every December I close the shop for two days and take my mother to Konya for Şeb-i Arus. She cries every year. I pretend I don't, but I do too.","zh":"每年十二月我关店两天，带妈妈去科尼亚看「婚礼之夜」。她每年都哭。我假装不哭，其实也哭。"}],"法国国庆日":[{"npc":"pierre","t":"7 月 13 日晚上","en":"On the 13th I close the bakery early and walk to the fire station on our street for the bal des pompiers. The firemen dance with everyone's grandmothers. Then I'm back at the oven by four.","zh":"13 号晚上我早点关店，走到我们街上的消防站去参加消防员舞会。消防员跟每家的奶奶跳舞。然后我凌晨四点又回到烤炉前。"}],"斯特拉斯堡圣诞市集":[{"npc":"gerard","t":"十二月的一个周六","en":"I took the train from Lille to Strasbourg with my wife — forty years of fixing trains, so now I just ride them. We kept the mulled-wine cups. My wife says that's the real souvenir.","zh":"我和老婆从里尔坐火车去斯特拉斯堡——修了四十年火车，现在只管坐。热红酒的杯子我们留下了。老婆说那才是真正的纪念品。"}],"圣帕特里克节":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"三月的长周末","en":"I went to Dublin for St Patrick's with three friends and did the group's spreadsheet as usual. Every pint went in. By evening nobody wanted to see the total.","zh":"我和三个朋友去都柏林过圣帕特里克节，照例由我记账。每一杯啤酒都记进去了。到晚上谁都不想看总数。"}],"威尼斯狂欢节":[{"npc":"lucia_it","t":"结婚纪念日","en":"Paolo and I went to Venice for our anniversary and bought two masks on a little bridge. He wore his all day and kept bowing to strangers. Forty years, and he still makes me laugh.","zh":"我和 Paolo 去威尼斯过结婚纪念日，在一座小桥上买了两个面具。他戴了一整天，一直对陌生人鞠躬。四十年了，他还是能把我逗笑。"}],"奔牛节":[{"npc":"pablo","t":"七月的早上","en":"My students always ask if I've run with the bulls. No — I watch it on TV at 8am with coffee, like most Spaniards. It's over before my toast is.","zh":"学生们总问我跑过奔牛没有。没有——我跟大多数西班牙人一样，早上八点端着咖啡看电视直播。我的吐司还没吃完它就结束了。"}],"荷兰风车":[{"npc":"daan","t":"表弟来玩的周日","en":"My cousins from Spain wanted \"real Holland\", so I drove them to Zaanse Schans. I work with cranes all week — honestly, standing inside a windmill that still works impressed me too.","zh":"西班牙来的表弟表妹想看「真正的荷兰」，我就开车带他们去了赞斯堡。我一周都在跟起重机打交道——说实话，站在一座还在转的风车里，我也被震住了。"}],"圣诞老人村":[{"npc":"elin","t":"十二月初","en":"We took the night train up to Rovaniemi so the kids could meet Santa. My son asked him in Swedish where the reindeer sleep. Santa answered in Swedish. My son still talks about it.","zh":"我们坐夜车去了罗瓦涅米，让孩子们见圣诞老人。我儿子用瑞典语问他驯鹿睡在哪儿。圣诞老人用瑞典语回答了。我儿子到现在还在说这件事。"}],"芬兰桑拿":[{"npc":"aino","t":"零下十五度的晚上","en":"Tonight it's minus fifteen, and the hole in the sea ice is open. Tourists stand at the edge for five minutes deciding. The grandmothers just walk straight in.","zh":"今晚零下十五度，海冰上的洞开着。游客们站在边上犹豫五分钟。老奶奶们直接就走进去了。"}],"波耶拉节":[{"npc":"valeria","t":"去巴拿马找材料那次","en":"I went to a craft fair in Panama to look at pollera jewellery — the gold chains and the little trembling hair flowers. One artisan let me hold a tembleque. I didn't buy it. I couldn't afford it.","zh":"我去巴拿马的一个手工艺市集看波耶拉的首饰——金链子和头上颤巍巍的小花。一位手艺人让我拿了一下珠花。我没买。我买不起。"}],"木屑花毯":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"圣周的凌晨三点","en":"In Antigua our neighbours let me help with their carpet. I filled one stencil with purple sawdust for an hour. At ten the procession walked over it. I almost cried, they just smiled.","zh":"在安提瓜，邻居让我帮他们铺花毯。我花了一个小时往一个模板里填紫色木屑。十点游行队伍从上面走过去了。我差点哭，他们只是笑了笑。"}],"汤加草席":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"夜班交接的时候","en":"One of our nurses came to night shift still wearing her ta'ovala — she'd come straight from her uncle's funeral. She said the old mat had been her grandmother's. We just let her sit for ten minutes first.","zh":"我们有位护士来上夜班时还系着草席——她刚从叔叔的葬礼直接过来。她说那条旧草席是她奶奶的。我们让她先坐了十分钟。"}],"热气球节":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"十月的一个清晨","en":"I drove eleven hours from LA to Albuquerque. At six in the morning I was standing in a field with coffee, and five hundred balloons went up in front of me. Best drive I've done in twenty years.","zh":"我从洛杉矶开了十一个小时到阿尔伯克基。早上六点我端着咖啡站在草地上，五百个热气球在我面前升了起来。这是我二十年来开得最值的一趟车。"}],"新奥尔良狂欢节":[{"npc":"jess","t":"二月请了年假","en":"I took Min to New Orleans for Mardi Gras. She caught three necklaces in the first five minutes and then got very competitive. I've never seen her elbow anyone before.","zh":"我带 Min 去新奥尔良过狂欢节。她头五分钟就接到三串珠子，然后就变得特别好胜。我从没见她用胳膊肘挤过别人。"}],"时代广场跨年":[{"npc":"marco_ny","t":"12 月 31 日下午","en":"On New Year's Eve tourists come into the café at noon to use the bathroom before they go into the pens. I sell a lot of coffee and give out a lot of advice: don't drink the coffee.","zh":"跨年那天中午，游客们进围栏之前都来咖啡店上厕所。我卖出好多咖啡，也送出好多建议：别喝咖啡。"}],"卡尔加里牛仔节":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"七月出差","en":"Our team had an offsite in Calgary during the Stampede. By the second day the whole engineering team was wearing cowboy hats to meetings. Nobody explained why. Nobody needed to.","zh":"牛仔节期间我们团队在卡尔加里开外地会。到第二天，整个工程团队开会都戴着牛仔帽。没人解释为什么，也不需要解释。"}],"夏威夷":[{"npc":"hiroshi","t":"星期四下午","en":"The community centre in Naha has a hula class for retirees. I only went to drive my neighbour, but the teacher made me join. Now my hands tell stories my feet can't keep up with.","zh":"那霸的社区中心有个给退休老人的草裙舞班。我本来只是开车送邻居去，老师硬拉我一起跳。现在我的手会讲故事了，脚还跟不上。"}],"因纽特雪屋":[{"npc":"elin","t":"下大雪的周末","en":"After a big snowfall the kids and I tried to build an igloo in the garden. It came out more like a snow cave. We put a thermometer inside anyway — it really was warmer than outside.","zh":"下了场大雪，我和孩子们想在院子里搭个雪屋。最后搭成了更像雪洞的东西。我们还是在里面放了温度计——真的比外面暖和。"}],"亡灵节":[{"npc":"rosa","t":"11 月 1 日晚上","en":"I put my mother's photo on the altar with marigolds and her favourite pan de muerto. The kids add their own things now — my son left her a football sticker. She would have laughed.","zh":"我把妈妈的照片放在祭坛上，摆上万寿菊和她最爱的亡灵面包。现在孩子们也会放自己的东西——我儿子给她留了一张足球贴纸。她一定会笑的。"}],"桑巴狂欢节":[{"npc":"bia","t":"狂欢节假期","en":"I took the bus from São Paulo to Rio and danced in a street bloco until my phone died. I'm from São Paulo, so officially I'm supposed to say our carnival is better. Don't tell anyone.","zh":"我从圣保罗坐大巴去里约，在街头狂欢里跳到手机没电。我是圣保罗人，按理说应该说我们的狂欢节更好。别告诉别人。"}],"太阳节":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"六月","en":"I came to Cusco by train from Puno, ten hours over the altiplano, just in time for Inti Raymi. Up at Sacsayhuamán I was so out of breath from the altitude that I simply sat and watched.","zh":"我从普诺坐了十个小时的火车穿过高原，正好赶上库斯科的太阳节。到了萨克塞瓦曼，我被高原反应弄得喘不上气，干脆坐下来静静看。"}],"麦德林花节":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"八月，跟女儿去玩","en":"My daughter and I watched the silleteros parade in Medellín. An old man walked past with a flower frame bigger than him and winked at her. She posted it before I could even write a note.","zh":"我和女儿在麦德林看背花人游行。一位老人背着比他还大的花架走过来，朝她眨了眨眼。我还没来得及记笔记，她已经发到网上了。"}],"巴兰基亚狂欢节":[{"npc":"diego","t":"去表姐家过狂欢节","en":"My cousin in Barranquilla lent me a Marimonda costume — the one with the long trunk. I couldn't see anything, so I just followed the music. Best flour fight of my life.","zh":"巴兰基亚的表姐借给我一套马里蒙达的衣服——就是长鼻子那个。我什么都看不见，只能跟着音乐走。这辈子最好玩的一场面粉大战。"}],"奥塔瓦洛市集":[{"npc":"poppy","t":"星期天的红砖巷","en":"Two stalls down from mine at Brick Lane there's an Otavalo guy who sells ponchos. He told me his uncle sells in Amsterdam and his cousin in Tokyo. His family has more branches than a bank.","zh":"红砖巷离我两个摊位，有个奥塔瓦洛人卖斗篷。他说他叔叔在阿姆斯特丹卖，表哥在东京卖。他们家的分店比银行还多。"}],"奥鲁罗狂欢节":[{"npc":"marcela","t":"二月的星期天","en":"The Bolivian families in my neighbourhood in Buenos Aires rehearse the Diablada in the park every weekend before carnival. The kids wear little devil masks and buy screws from my shop for the costumes.","zh":"我们布宜诺斯艾利斯这片的玻利维亚家庭，狂欢节前每个周末都在公园排练魔鬼舞。小孩戴着小魔鬼面具，还来我店里买做服装用的螺丝。"}],"阿联酋猎鹰":[{"npc":"amara","t":"飞往利雅得的航班上","en":"Today I had three falcons in business class, each with its own passport and a little hood. They were the quietest passengers on the plane. Better than some humans, honestly.","zh":"今天我的公务舱里有三只猎鹰，每只都有自己的护照，戴着小头罩。它们是全机最安静的乘客。说实话，比有些人强。"}],"阿尔达剑舞":[{"npc":"amara","t":"在利雅得过夜那次","en":"On a Riyadh layover a colleague took me to a festival where men were dancing the Ardah. The drum was so loud I felt it in my chest. I was the only one filming — everyone else was singing along.","zh":"在利雅得过夜时，同事带我去了一个节日，男人们在跳阿尔达剑舞。鼓声大得我胸口都在震。只有我在拍，其他人都在跟着唱。"}],"瓦迪拉姆贝都因":[{"npc":"noor","t":"周末，从安曼开车过去","en":"I drive down from Amman to Wadi Rum when I need to stop looking at screens. Our Bedouin host dug the zarb out of the sand at sunset. I've designed a lot of interfaces — none as good as that moment.","zh":"想离开屏幕的时候，我就从安曼开车去瓦迪拉姆。日落时，贝都因主人从沙子里挖出地坑烤肉。我设计过很多界面——没有一个比得上那一刻。"}],"英托雷舞":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"在基加利开会那周","en":"At the conference dinner in Kigali, Intore dancers came in and the whole room of bankers stopped checking their phones. I've never seen that happen at a banking event.","zh":"在基加利的会议晚宴上，英托雷舞者一进场，满屋子银行家都不看手机了。在银行业的活动上，我从没见过这种事。"}],"库姆博卡仪式":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"四月的长假","en":"A Zambian colleague from a human rights conference invited me to Limulunga for Kuomboka. When the Nalikwanda came in, thousands of people were singing. I forgot I'd ever been tired.","zh":"一位在人权会议上认识的赞比亚同行请我去利穆伦加看库姆博卡。王船靠岸时，几千人在唱歌。我完全忘了自己累过。"}],"辛巴族":[{"npc":"ines","t":"上药妆课的时候","en":"In our cosmetics module the lecturer showed us otjize — butterfat and ochre, used by Himba women as sunscreen and insect repellent. Half the class wanted to know its SPF. Nobody has measured it, apparently.","zh":"化妆品课上老师给我们看了辛巴女人用的红膏——黄油加赭石，当防晒和驱虫用。半个班都想知道它的防晒指数。好像还没人测过。"}],"马赛人跳跃舞":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"学校放假的星期六","en":"I took my son to Bomas of Kenya to see the dances. When the Maasai dancers started jumping, he jumped too, right there in his seat. He was asleep in the matatu home.","zh":"我带儿子去肯尼亚博马斯文化村看舞蹈。马赛舞者一开始跳，他也在座位上跟着跳。回家的小巴上他就睡着了。"}],"13个月的日历":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"值机柜台","en":"A passenger from Addis showed me a document with a birth year that looked seven years off. I nearly called my supervisor — then remembered the Ethiopian calendar. He was very patient with me.","zh":"一位从亚的斯亚贝巴来的旅客给我看证件，出生年份好像差了七年。我差点叫主管——然后想起了埃塞俄比亚历。他对我特别耐心。"}],"杜尔巴节":[{"npc":"tunde","t":"去卡诺见用户那次","en":"Some of our app's market traders are in Kano, and one invited me to watch the Sallah durbar. The horses were dressed better than I was. I took notes for our next product launch.","zh":"我们 App 的一些菜市场商贩在卡诺，其中一位请我去看开斋节的杜尔巴。马穿得都比我体面。我还记了笔记，留着下次产品发布用。"}],"乒乓球":[{"npc":"bj_zhao","t":"早上下完棋","en":"After chess I walk past the ping-pong tables. The eight-year-olds there could beat me with their eyes closed.","zh":"下完棋我从乒乓球台边上走过。那几个八岁的小孩，闭着眼都能赢我。"}],"鸟巢":[{"npc":"bj_xiaoyu","t":"周六晚上","en":"Went to a concert at the Bird's Nest last night. Getting out took longer than the encore — the subway queue went round the stadium.","zh":"昨晚去鸟巢听演唱会。散场比返场还长——地铁的队绕了体育场一圈。"}],"姚明":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"周末","en":"My dad took me to watch the Shanghai Sharks. He pointed at the court and said, 'Yao Ming started right here, as a teenager.'","zh":"我爸带我去看上海大鲨鱼的比赛。他指着球场说：“姚明十几岁就是在这儿开始打的。”"}],"苏超":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"周六下午","en":"Took the high-speed train from Hangzhou to Nanjing just to watch a Su Chao match. Everyone around me was shouting about whose city has the best food.","zh":"从杭州坐高铁去南京，就为了看一场苏超。我周围的人一直在喊哪个城市的东西更好吃。"}],"村超":[{"npc":"xa_ajie","t":"暑假","en":"I went to Rongjiang in the summer holidays. At half-time a whole village choir walked onto the pitch and sang — I forgot to take a video.","zh":"暑假我去了榕江。中场休息的时候，一整个村的合唱队走进球场唱歌——我都忘了录视频。"}],"村BA":[{"npc":"emma","t":"国庆假期","en":"My Chinese classmate took me to a village basketball game in Guizhou. People were watching from the rooftops! The prize was a cow.","zh":"中国同学带我去贵州看了一场村里的篮球赛。有人坐在屋顶上看！奖品是一头牛。"}],"澳门格兰披治":[{"npc":"aqiang","t":"十一月的周末","en":"Every November I close the stall for a day and go to Macau for the Grand Prix. You can hear the cars from the ferry.","zh":"每年十一月我都关一天摊子，去澳门看大赛车。在船上就能听见车的声音。"}],"叼羊":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"去年夏天旅行","en":"I saw kokpar outside Almaty last summer. I teach geography, but nothing in a textbook prepared me for thirty horses in one scrum.","zh":"去年夏天我在阿拉木图城外看了一场叼羊。我是教地理的，可课本里没有哪一页让我准备好看三十匹马挤成一团。"}],"熊野古道":[{"npc":"lt_yuki","t":"三连休","en":"I spent my long weekend on the Kumano Kodō. Three days of stone steps, then an onsen every evening — my legs were very grateful.","zh":"三连休我去走了熊野古道。三天的石阶，每天晚上泡温泉——腿特别感谢我。"}],"跆拳道":[{"npc":"minjun","t":"下班后","en":"My nephew just got his yellow belt. He kicked the door frame to show me and then cried. Very proud, very sore.","zh":"我侄子刚拿到黄带。他踢门框给我看，然后哭了。很骄傲，也很疼。"}],"泰拳":[{"npc":"somchai","t":"收摊以后","en":"Thursday nights I watch the fights on the little TV at my stall. The tourists stop to watch with me, and then they order more noodles.","zh":"星期四晚上我在摊子上的小电视里看泰拳。游客会停下来跟我一起看，然后再多点一份面。"}],"板球":[{"npc":"priya","t":"周日早上","en":"Sunday mornings the lane behind our flat turns into a cricket pitch. If the ball goes into a window, the batter is out — house rules.","zh":"周日早上，我们楼后面的小巷就变成板球场。球打进谁家窗户，击球的人就出局——这是我们这儿的规矩。"}],"瑜伽":[{"npc":"priyanka","t":"休假","en":"I did a week of yoga in Rishikesh. The 6 a.m. class by the Ganges was beautiful. The monkeys stealing bananas, less so.","zh":"我在瑞诗凯诗上了一周瑜伽。早上六点在恒河边的课很美。偷香蕉的猴子就没那么美了。"}],"黄金海岸冲浪":[{"npc":"chloe_er","t":"休假","en":"After a run of night shifts I drove up to the Gold Coast. I spent more time falling off the board than standing on it. Still the best week of my year.","zh":"上完一轮夜班，我开车去了黄金海岸。我从板上掉下来的时间比站在上面多，但还是今年最好的一周。"}],"澳网公开赛":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"一月","en":"I bought a ground pass for the Australian Open. Forty degrees, but I found a shady spot on an outside court and watched five matches.","zh":"我买了澳网的场地通票。四十度，不过我在外场找到一块阴凉，看了五场。"}],"全黑队":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"去惠灵顿看球","en":"Flew to Wellington to watch the Wallabies play the All Blacks. When the haka started, the whole stadium went quiet — even us Aussies.","zh":"飞去惠灵顿看澳洲对全黑队。哈卡一开始，整个体育场都安静了——连我们澳洲人也是。"}],"皇后镇蹦极":[{"npc":"amara","t":"转机休息","en":"I had two days off in Queenstown and did the Kawarau bungy. I fly for a living, but I screamed the whole way down.","zh":"我在皇后镇有两天休息，就去跳了卡瓦劳大桥的蹦极。我天天在天上飞，可那一下我从头喊到尾。"}],"墨尔本板球场":[{"npc":"josh_cafe","t":"节礼日","en":"Boxing Day I close the café and head to the MCG. Leftover Christmas ham sandwiches in the bag, cricket all day.","zh":"节礼日我关了咖啡馆，去墨尔本板球场。包里装着圣诞节剩的火腿三明治，看一整天板球。"}],"七人制橄榄球":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"值机柜台","en":"Checked in the Fiji sevens team for the Singapore tournament. They were so polite — and then they sang a hymn in the queue.","zh":"给来新加坡比赛的斐济七人制橄榄球队办值机。他们特别有礼貌——然后在排队的时候唱起了圣歌。"}],"科科达小道":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"去年","en":"I walked Kokoda with my dad last year, for his grandfather. Nine days of mud. We barely talked, and it was perfect.","zh":"去年我陪我爸走了科科达小道，为了他的爷爷。九天的泥路。我们几乎没说话，但特别好。"}],"环法自行车赛":[{"npc":"gerard","t":"七月","en":"When the Tour comes through the north, I get to the roadside at nine with a folding chair. The riders pass at four. Worth every minute.","zh":"环法经过北部的时候，我九点就带着折叠椅到路边。车手四点才过来。每一分钟都值。"}],"温布尔登":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"六月底","en":"I joined the Queue at 5 a.m. with a flask of tea and a novel. Got a ground pass by eleven — and a bowl of strawberries, obviously.","zh":"早上五点我带着一壶茶和一本小说去排温网的大队。十一点拿到了场地票——当然还有一碗草莓。"}],"巴萨足球":[{"npc":"jordi","t":"周日晚上","en":"First match back at Camp Nou with my son. Half the stadium was still a building site, but we both cried when the anthem played.","zh":"回诺坎普的第一场，我带儿子去了。体育场一半还是工地，可是队歌一响，我们俩都哭了。"}],"奥林匹亚":[{"npc":"eleni","t":"学校旅行","en":"I took my class to Olympia. They raced each other on the ancient track, barefoot, and then argued about who really won.","zh":"我带班上的学生去了奥林匹亚。他们光着脚在古代跑道上赛跑，然后吵谁才是真正的第一。"}],"盐湖城冬奥会":[{"npc":"alex_sf","t":"滑雪假期","en":"Skied near Park City and stopped at the old Olympic ski jumps. Standing at the bottom, I couldn't believe people fly off those.","zh":"在帕克城附近滑雪，顺路去看了当年奥运会的跳台。站在下面，我不敢相信真有人从那上面飞出去。"}],"达拉斯牛仔队":[{"npc":"sarah","t":"周日","en":"I drove up from Austin for a Cowboys game. The screen above the field is so big I mostly watched that instead of the players.","zh":"我从奥斯汀开车上来看牛仔队。球场上方的大屏幕太大了，我大部分时间都在看屏幕，没看球员。"}],"印第安纳波利斯500":[{"npc":"jake","t":"阵亡将士纪念日周末","en":"Drove down from Milwaukee for the Indy 500. The noise at the start goes right through your chest. I still had a sunburn a week later.","zh":"从密尔沃基开车去看印第 500。起跑那一下的声音直接穿过胸口。一周以后我的晒伤还没好。"}],"肯塔基赛马":[{"npc":"jess","t":"五月第一个星期六","en":"I went to the Derby for a friend's birthday. I spent more on the hat than on the bets — and the race was over before I found my seat.","zh":"为了朋友的生日去看了肯塔基德比。帽子花的钱比下注还多——我还没找到座位，比赛就跑完了。"}],"艾迪塔罗德雪橇赛":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"三月","en":"I flew to Anchorage for the Iditarod start. The dogs were screaming to go — so excited they could hardly stand still.","zh":"我飞到安克雷奇看艾迪塔罗德出发。那些狗一直叫着要跑——兴奋得站都站不住。"}],"超级碗":[{"npc":"tony","t":"超级碗周日","en":"Super Bowl Sunday is work for me — the whole office watches the ads and scores them. The game is background noise.","zh":"超级碗那天对我来说是上班——整个办公室一起看广告、给广告打分。比赛只是背景音。"}],"冰球":[{"npc":"sam","t":"二月","en":"Took the bus to Ottawa to skate the Rideau Canal. Beavertail in one hand, falling over every ten metres.","zh":"坐大巴去渥太华，在里多运河上溜冰。一手拿着海狸尾巴饼，每十米摔一跤。"}],"博尔特":[{"npc":"lukas","t":"跟同事聊天","en":"I was in the Olympiastadion in Berlin in 2009 when Bolt ran. It was over before I'd lifted my camera.","zh":"2009 年博尔特跑的时候我就在柏林奥林匹克体育场。我相机还没举起来，比赛就结束了。"}],"卡波耶拉":[{"npc":"bia","t":"去萨尔瓦多旅行","en":"In Salvador I stopped to watch a capoeira roda in the square. They pulled me in. I lasted about twenty seconds.","zh":"在萨尔瓦多，我停下来看广场上的卡波耶拉圈。他们把我拉了进去。我撑了大概二十秒。"}],"马拉卡纳球场":[{"npc":"sofia_fr","t":"回巴西过年","en":"Every time I go home to Brazil my uncle takes me to the Maracanã. He still talks about 1950 like it happened last week.","zh":"我每次回巴西，舅舅都带我去马拉卡纳。他说起 1950 年那场球，就像上个星期刚发生的。"}],"印加古道":[{"npc":"sanne","t":"毕业旅行","en":"Day two of the Inca Trail: Dead Woman's Pass. I stopped every twenty steps. The porters ran past me carrying our tents.","zh":"印加古道第二天：死女人垭口。我每走二十步就停一下。背夫扛着我们的帐篷从我身边跑过去。"}],"丘利塔摔角":[{"npc":"carmen","t":"采访旅行","en":"I covered a Sunday show in El Alto for the paper. A grandmother in the front row was shouting louder than anyone in the ring.","zh":"我为报社去埃尔阿尔托报道星期天的摔角。前排一位奶奶喊得比台上的人还响。"}],"委内瑞拉棒球":[{"npc":"jake","t":"三月的晚上","en":"Watched the Classic final at a bar with my Venezuelan neighbour. He showed me photos of his home stadium in Maracay — and I didn't cheer for the USA much.","zh":"跟委内瑞拉邻居在酒吧看经典赛决赛。他给我看他老家马拉凯球场的照片——我也没怎么给美国加油。"}],"第一届世界杯":[{"npc":"mateo_taxi","t":"休息日","en":"I took the ferry to Montevideo and visited the Centenario. As a Boca fan I hate to admit it — it's a beautiful old stadium.","zh":"我坐船去蒙得维的亚看了百年纪念体育场。作为博卡的球迷，我很不想承认——那是个很美的老球场。"}],"卢赛尔体育场":[{"npc":"amara","t":"2022 年 12 月","en":"In December 2022 every flight I worked into Doha was full of Argentina shirts. The singing started at boarding.","zh":"2022 年 12 月，我飞进多哈的每一班飞机上都是阿根廷球衣。从登机就开始唱。"}],"肯尼亚长跑":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"长周末","en":"I went to Iten for a long weekend and tried a morning run. A group of schoolgirls passed me — chatting — while I could barely breathe.","zh":"长周末我去伊滕试着晨跑。一群女学生边聊天边从我身边超过去，我都快喘不上气了。"}],"跳羚队":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"周六下午","en":"Drove up to Pretoria for a Springboks test with my brothers. Braai in the car park first, rugby second — that's the order.","zh":"和我哥哥们开车去比勒陀利亚看跳羚队。先在停车场烧烤，再看橄榄球——顺序就是这样。"}],"超级雄鹰":[{"npc":"tolu","t":"比赛晚上","en":"When the Super Eagles play, I stop the session in the studio. Everyone crowds round the phone, and the neighbours shout before we see the goal.","zh":"超级雄鹰一比赛，我就停下录音。大家挤在手机前面，邻居总比我们先喊出“进了”。"}],"指南针":[{"npc":"xa_wang","t":"周四下午","en":"In class today I floated a magnetised needle on a leaf in a bowl of water. The kids watched it turn south and went completely quiet.","zh":"今天上课我把一根磁针放在水碗里的叶子上，学生们看它慢慢转向南边，一下子全安静了。"}],"火药":[{"npc":"bj_zhao","t":"大年三十晚上","en":"We can't set off firecrackers in my part of Beijing any more. On New Year's Eve I just listen to the bangs far away and think of the old days in the hutong.","zh":"我们这片现在不让放鞭炮了。大年三十我就听着远处的响声，想起以前在胡同里放炮的日子。"}],"造纸术":[{"npc":"cd_he","t":"周日上午","en":"I still practise calligraphy every Sunday. Good xuan paper soaks up the ink just right — on cheap paper the strokes go blurry.","zh":"我每个周日还在练毛笔字。好的宣纸吸墨刚刚好，便宜的纸一写字就洇开了。"}],"晋商票号":[{"npc":"emma","t":"国庆假期","en":"Over the October holiday I took the train to Pingyao. At Rishengchang the guide showed us the old drafts with secret marks against forgery — basically banking security, 200 years ago.","zh":"国庆假期我坐火车去了平遥。在日升昌，讲解员给我们看了带防伪暗记的旧汇票——差不多就是两百年前的银行安全系统。"}],"丝绸":[{"npc":"xiaoyu","t":"周六下午","en":"Mum wanted a silk scarf for her birthday, so I went to the silk market. The shop lady rubbed two scarves together and told me to listen — real silk makes a soft rustling sound.","zh":"妈妈生日想要一条真丝围巾，我就去了丝绸市场。老板娘搓了搓两条围巾让我听——真丝会有一点沙沙的声音。"}],"深圳无人机":[{"npc":"aqiang","t":"周三下午","en":"A customer from Brazil spent twenty minutes choosing propellers at my stall today. In Huaqiangbei you can fix almost any drone in one afternoon.","zh":"今天一个巴西客人在我摊上挑螺旋桨挑了二十分钟。在华强北，差不多什么无人机一个下午都能修好。"}],"中国天眼":[{"npc":"zhou","t":"暑假","en":"On our school trip to Guizhou we had to lock our phones away before seeing FAST. No photos — so I just stood there and looked for a long time.","zh":"暑假学校组织去贵州，看天眼之前手机都得存起来。没法拍照，我就站在那儿看了很久。"}],"新干线":[{"npc":"ito","t":"周一早上","en":"At 7 a.m. a Shinkansen leaves Tokyo Station every few minutes. The cleaning crew turns a whole train around in about seven minutes — I still like watching them bow.","zh":"早上七点，东京站几分钟就开出一班新干线。清洁队大约七分钟就把一整列车打扫好——我到现在还爱看他们鞠躬。"}],"拜科努尔航天中心":[{"npc":"felix","t":"周五上午","en":"In physics we watched a Soyuz launch from Baikonur on the big screen. Our teacher paused at lift-off to ask how much fuel it burns — we just wanted to see it fly.","zh":"物理课上我们在大屏幕上看了一次从拜科努尔发射的联盟号。老师在起飞那一刻按了暂停问它烧多少燃料——我们只想看它飞起来。"}],"克罗地亚领带":[{"npc":"marco_it","t":"周一早上","en":"I wear a tie to the bank every day. My dad taught me the knot when I was eighteen — I still do it in front of the mirror the same way.","zh":"我每天系领带去银行上班。十八岁时爸爸教我打的结，我到现在还是对着镜子用同一种方法。"}],"路易威登":[{"npc":"camille","t":"周四下午","en":"Our shop is a ten-minute walk from the big luxury stores. On Saturdays the queues outside them are longer than the one at our corner bakery.","zh":"我们店离那些大奢侈品店走路十分钟。每到周六，它们门口的队比我们街角面包店的还长。"}],"格拉斯香水":[{"npc":"claire","t":"八月度假","en":"On holiday near Nice we drove up to Grasse to see the jasmine fields. I came home with a tiny bottle I mixed myself — it smells a bit like my grandmother's garden.","zh":"八月在尼斯附近度假，我们开车上山去格拉斯看茉莉花田。我带回来一小瓶自己调的香水，闻起来有点像外婆的花园。"}],"米兰时装周":[{"npc":"minji","t":"二月下旬","en":"I flew to Milan with an idol group for Fashion Week. I spent more time steaming clothes in the hotel than watching the shows.","zh":"时装周我跟一个偶像团体飞去了米兰。我在酒店里熨衣服的时间比看秀的时间还多。"}],"法拉利":[{"npc":"paolo","t":"周日下午","en":"Sunday afternoons are for F1. I watch with my old bus-driver friends at the bar — when a red car is in front, nobody orders anything, we're too nervous.","zh":"周日下午就是看 F1 的时间。我和以前开公交的老朋友在酒吧一起看——红色的车跑在前面时，谁也不点东西，太紧张了。"}],"小提琴":[{"npc":"lucia_it","t":"周六上午","en":"My grandson started violin lessons this year. I took him to Cremona to see the workshops — now he says his violin is 'almost a Stradivari'.","zh":"我孙子今年开始学小提琴。我带他去克雷莫纳看制琴作坊，现在他说自己的琴「差不多是斯特拉迪瓦里」了。"}],"德国汽车":[{"npc":"wagner","t":"周二上午","en":"This week I showed our new apprentices how a brake pad is made. Half of them want to work on electric cars — the other half just want a Porsche one day.","zh":"这周我带新来的学徒看刹车片怎么做。一半人想做电动车，另一半只想有一天开上保时捷。"}],"古腾堡印刷机":[{"npc":"ella_pub","t":"周三下午","en":"Today I checked the proofs of a novel for the third time and still found a typo. Gutenberg had to set every letter by hand — I've stopped complaining.","zh":"今天我第三遍看一本小说的校样，还是找到了一个错字。古腾堡每个字母都得用手排——我不抱怨了。"}],"瑞士手表":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"周六上午","en":"Walking down Geneva's Rue du Rhône, I always stop at a watchmaker's window. My physicist friends argue about whether a mechanical watch is 'accurate enough' — it is, for coffee breaks.","zh":"走在日内瓦的罗讷街上，我总会停在一家钟表店的橱窗前。我的物理学家朋友们老争论机械表「够不够准」——喝咖啡够准了。"}],"瑞士军刀":[{"npc":"becker","t":"周日上午","en":"I've carried the same pocket knife for forty years. Last week it fixed my tenant's wobbly door handle in two minutes.","zh":"同一把小刀我带了四十年。上周两分钟就把我租客那个晃荡的门把手修好了。"}],"魔方":[{"npc":"ren","t":"周五晚上","en":"Between rounds at the game centre, a kid next to me solved a Rubik's cube in under twenty seconds. I've been stuck on the last layer for a week.","zh":"游戏厅两局之间，旁边一个小孩不到二十秒就把魔方拼好了。我卡在最后一层已经一个星期了。"}],"宜家":[{"npc":"elin","t":"周六上午","en":"Saturday at IKEA in Malmö with two kids: they bounce on every bed, and I end up buying candles I didn't need.","zh":"周六带两个孩子去马尔默的宜家：他们每张床都要跳一跳，我最后又买了一堆不需要的蜡烛。"}],"乐高":[{"npc":"erik_se","t":"周日晚上","en":"Our baby isn't born yet, but I've already bought a LEGO set 'for the baby'. Maja says we both know who's going to build it.","zh":"宝宝还没出生，我已经「给宝宝」买了一套乐高。Maja 说，我们都知道最后是谁拼。"}],"诺基亚":[{"npc":"aino","t":"周三晚上","en":"People leave their phones in the lockers before the sauna. Last week someone's old Nokia rang inside a locker, and the ringtone made everyone laugh.","zh":"大家进桑拿前把手机放在柜子里。上周有人柜子里的老诺基亚响了，那个铃声让所有人都笑了。"}],"莱特兄弟":[{"npc":"amara","t":"落地以后","en":"Every time we take off from Dubai with four hundred people on board, I think about those 12 seconds in 1903. My job exists because two bike mechanics didn't give up.","zh":"每次带着四百个人从迪拜起飞，我都会想起 1903 年那 12 秒。我的工作存在，是因为两个修自行车的人没有放弃。"}],"可口可乐":[{"npc":"luis_la","t":"周二中午","en":"Truckers come in, fill up, grab a cold Coke from the fridge and a bag of chips. Twenty years, same order.","zh":"卡车司机进来加满油，从冰柜拿一瓶冰可乐、一包薯片。二十年了，还是一样。"}],"肯尼迪航天中心":[{"npc":"jake","t":"春假","en":"Took my kids to Kennedy Space Center over spring break. Standing under the Saturn V, my son forgot to ask for snacks for a whole hour — that's a record.","zh":"春假带孩子去了肯尼迪航天中心。站在土星五号下面，我儿子整整一个小时忘了要零食——这是纪录。"}],"底特律汽车城":[{"npc":"omar_de","t":"出差那周","en":"On a work trip to Detroit, a colleague drove me past the old Highland Park plant. Every engineer I know talks about the assembly line — and there it was, a quiet brick building.","zh":"去底特律出差，同事开车带我经过高地公园老工厂。我认识的工程师都会说起流水线——而它就在那儿，一栋安安静静的砖楼。"}],"星巴克":[{"npc":"marco_ny","t":"周一早上","en":"Half my regulars walk past two big chains to get here. I know their names and their orders — that's the whole trick.","zh":"我一半的熟客要走过两家大连锁店才到我这儿。我记得他们的名字和点什么——秘诀就这些。"}],"大溪地黑珍珠":[{"npc":"valeria","t":"周三晚上","en":"A customer asked me for earrings with Tahitian pearls. I looked up the price of one good pearl and decided to stick to silver for now.","zh":"有个客人想要大溪地黑珍珠耳环。我查了一颗好珍珠的价钱，决定还是先做银饰。"}],"智利铜矿":[{"npc":"oliver","t":"周四下午","en":"My editor wants a piece on copper prices by six. It seems every electric-car story ends up in a Chilean desert.","zh":"编辑要我六点前交一篇铜价的稿子。好像每个电动车的故事，最后都会写到智利的沙漠里。"}],"祖母绿":[{"npc":"nonna_carla","t":"周日午饭后","en":"My engagement ring has a tiny emerald. My husband saved for a year to buy it — I show it to every grandchild who asks.","zh":"我的订婚戒指上有一颗小小的祖母绿。我丈夫攒了一年钱才买到——哪个孙子问，我就给哪个看。"}],"巴拿马草帽":[{"npc":"poppy","t":"周日早上","en":"Someone tried on an old Panama hat at my stall and asked if it came from Panama. I said, 'Ecuador' — and sold it with the story.","zh":"有人在我摊上试戴一顶旧巴拿马草帽，问是不是巴拿马产的。我说「厄瓜多尔」——然后连故事一起卖了。"}],"厄瓜多尔玫瑰":[{"npc":"sanne","t":"二月十三号","en":"The day before Valentine's I cycled past the flower stalls on the Singel. The seller said his longest roses came from Ecuador, not the Netherlands.","zh":"情人节前一天我骑车经过辛格运河边的花摊。老板说他最长的玫瑰来自厄瓜多尔，不是荷兰。"}],"钻石":[{"npc":"thandi","t":"周末","en":"Driving back from a case in Kimberley, I stopped at the Big Hole. Standing at the edge, I kept thinking about the miners who dug it by hand — and who got rich from it.","zh":"去金伯利办完案子开车回来，我在大洞停了一下。站在边上，我一直在想那些用手挖它的矿工——还有是谁靠它发了财。"}],"莎草纸":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"周四读书会","en":"At book club we read a novel set in ancient Egypt. Someone brought a papyrus bookmark from Cairo, and we passed it round like treasure.","zh":"读书会这周读一本写古埃及的小说。有人带来一张从开罗买的莎草纸书签，大家像传宝贝一样传着看。"}],"阿甘油":[{"npc":"ines","t":"周五下午","en":"A customer asked if argan oil would 'cure' her dry hair. I said it can help, but it's an oil, not magic — and showed her the cheaper bottle.","zh":"有个客人问阿甘油能不能「治好」干头发。我说有帮助，但它就是油，不是魔法——然后给她看了便宜一点的那瓶。"}],"坦桑石":[{"npc":"amina_data","t":"周五晚上","en":"My cousin came back from climbing Kilimanjaro with a tiny tanzanite ring. I couldn't help working out what she paid per gram — I'm a data analyst.","zh":"我表妹爬完乞力马扎罗山回来，带了一枚小小的坦桑石戒指。我忍不住算了算她每克花了多少钱——我是数据分析师，没办法。"}],"墨西哥人爱喝可乐":[{"npc":"diego","t":"晚上送外卖的间隙","en":"Every corner shop has a fridge full of glass bottles. You drink it there and give the bottle back.","zh":"每个街角小店都有一冰柜玻璃瓶。在店门口喝完，把瓶子还给老板。"}],"瑞士人爱吃巧克力":[{"npc":"anna_cern","t":"周末去苏黎世","en":"Every visitor to CERN asks me which chocolate to bring home. I tell them: buy the plain supermarket bar, it's what we actually eat.","zh":"来 CERN 参观的人都问我该带什么巧克力回去。我说：买超市里最普通的那板，我们自己吃的就是那个。"}],"日本自动售货机":[{"npc":"ito","t":"东京站，冬天的早班","en":"In winter, the hot cans are on the bottom row with a red label. Hold one in your pocket — it's a hand warmer.","zh":"冬天热的罐子在最下面一排，标签是红色的。买一罐揣兜里，就是暖手宝。"}],"冰岛人人出书？":[{"npc":"harriet","t":"读书会上","en":"Our book club did Icelandic crime novels last winter. Half the members now want to go to Reykjavík in December.","zh":"我们读书会去年冬天读冰岛的推理小说，现在一半人都想十二月去雷克雅未克。"}],"自行车比人多":[{"npc":"chen_nl","t":"刚到阿姆斯特丹的第一周","en":"I have two bikes: a nice one at home and an old one at the station. Nobody steals the old one.","zh":"我有两辆车：家里一辆好的，车站一辆旧的。旧的没人偷。"}],"袋鼠比人多":[{"npc":"ben_vet","t":"诊所里","en":"Every week someone brings in a joey whose mum was hit by a car. We pass them on to the wildlife carers.","zh":"每个星期都有人抱来一只小袋鼠，妈妈被车撞了。我们再把它交给野生动物志愿者。"}],"羊比人多":[{"npc":"liam_au","t":"去新西兰过暑假","en":"My cousin shears sheep in Canterbury every summer. He says a good shearer does over two hundred a day.","zh":"我表哥每年夏天在坎特伯雷剪羊毛。他说厉害的剪毛工一天能剪两百多只。"}],"啤酒冠军":[{"npc":"lukas","t":"跟朋友去布拉格过周末","en":"In Prague the waiter just keeps bringing beer until you put your coaster on top of the glass.","zh":"在布拉格，服务员会一直给你上啤酒，直到你把杯垫盖在杯子上。"}],"湖的国家":[{"npc":"arjun","t":"长周末","en":"Every long weekend, half of Toronto drives north to a lake. The traffic on Friday afternoon is unbelievable.","zh":"每个长周末，半个多伦多都往北开去湖边。周五下午的堵车你都不敢信。"}],"咖啡冠军之谜":[{"npc":"aino","t":"桑拿房门口","en":"After the sauna everybody wants coffee, not beer. We keep a big pot going all evening.","zh":"蒸完桑拿大家要的是咖啡，不是啤酒。我们一整晚都煮着一大壶。"}],"大迁徙有多少只":[{"npc":"wanjiru","t":"八月的周末","en":"In August my cousins drive to the Mara to watch the crossing. They come back with a thousand photos of the same river.","zh":"八月我表哥表姐开车去马赛马拉看过河，回来带着同一条河的一千张照片。"}],"伦敦一辈子的咖啡钱":[{"npc":"oliver","t":"写完一篇稿子","en":"I worked out my coffee spending for an article. I stopped buying them for a week, then started again.","zh":"我为了写稿算过自己的咖啡钱。停了一个星期，然后又开始买了。"}],"巨无霸指数":[{"npc":"mei","t":"店里不忙的时候","en":"Here we call it a \"Da Mai Ke\". A friend in Zurich sent me the price — I thought it was a typo.","zh":"我们这里叫「大麦克」。苏黎世的朋友把价钱传给我，我还以为她打错了。"}],"哈利法塔有多高":[{"npc":"amara","t":"飞完长途回到迪拜","en":"When we land at night, passengers always ask which light is the Burj. I tell them: the one that doesn't stop.","zh":"夜里降落的时候，乘客总问哪一盏灯是哈利法塔。我说：一直往上没有尽头的那一串。"}],"俄罗斯有多大":[{"npc":"ingrid","t":"退休前的最后一堂地理课","en":"I used to start every year with a map of Russia. Eleven time zones — the students never believed me.","zh":"我每年第一堂课都先放一张俄罗斯地图。十一个时区，学生们从来都不信。"}],"撒哈拉有多大":[{"npc":"amara","t":"飞开罗的航班上","en":"On the Cairo flight you can look down for two hours and see nothing but sand and rock.","zh":"飞开罗的时候，往下看两个小时，全是沙子和石头。"}],"梵蒂冈有多小":[{"npc":"chiara","t":"带学生去春游","en":"My pupils love that they can walk from Italy into another country in one step. Then they ask for ice cream.","zh":"我的学生最喜欢一步从意大利走进另一个国家。然后就要冰淇淋。"}],"新加坡和北京":[{"npc":"weijie","t":"出差去北京","en":"On my first trip to Beijing I took a taxi across town for an hour and a half. In Singapore that gets you to Malaysia.","zh":"我第一次去北京，打车穿城坐了一个半小时。在新加坡，这都开到马来西亚了。"}],"长城有多长":[{"npc":"bj_xiaoyu","t":"周末去慕田峪","en":"Foreign visitors always ask if you can see the Wall from space. I tell them: you can't, but you can see it from the cable car.","zh":"外国游客总问从太空能不能看到长城。我说看不到，但坐缆车能看到。"}],"蓝鲸有多长":[{"npc":"mia","t":"去海边看鲸鱼","en":"We waited three hours on the boat and saw one blow. Everyone screamed like it was a concert.","zh":"我们在船上等了三个小时，只看到一次喷水。大家尖叫得像在听演唱会。"}],"飞机和珠峰":[{"npc":"weiling","t":"值机柜台","en":"Passengers to Kathmandu always ask for a window seat on the right. I tell them it depends on the route that day.","zh":"飞加德满都的乘客都要右边靠窗。我说要看当天的航线。"}],"上海地铁有多长":[{"npc":"ajie","t":"周末去逛新店","en":"Every year there's a new line near some shop I want to visit. I just follow the new stations.","zh":"每年都会有一条新线开到我想去的店附近。我就跟着新站去逛。"}]};
